अकल्प|अकल्पः
अकल्प अ-कल्प, अस्, आ, अम्, not subject to<BR>rules, uncontrolled; incomparable; unable, weak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0001-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अकल्पित|अकल्पितः
