अक्षौहिणी
अक्षौहिणी अक्षौहिणी, f. an army consisting<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0004-a" target="_blank">Page0004-a+ 70</a>]<BR>of ten anīkinīs, or 21, 870 elephants, 21, 870 chariots,<BR>65, 610 horse, and 109, 350 foot. (The anīkinī con-<BR>sists of 27 vāhinīs; and 27 being the cube, अक्ष,<BR>of 3, it is probable that अक्षौहिणी is a compound<BR>from अक्ष and वाहिनी.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0003-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

