अतिक्रम|अतिक्रमः
अति-क्रम, अस्, m. act of passing or overstepping;<BR>lapse (of time); overcoming, surpassing, conquering;<BR>excess, imposition, transgression, violation; neglect;<BR>determined onset.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0013-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिक्रमण|अतिक्रमणं
