अधिक्षिपद्-अब्ज-नेत्र, अस्, आ, or ई, अम्, having<BR>eyes which eclipse the lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिक्षिप्त|अधिक्षिप्तः
