अधिगत
अधि-गत, अस्, आ, अम्, found, obtained, acquired;<BR>gone, over, studied, learnt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिगन्तव्य|अधिगंतव्य
