अधिनी अधि-नी, cl. 1. P. -नयति, -नेतुम्,<BR>to lead away from (with abl.); to raise above the<BR>ordinary measure, enhance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

