अधिनृत् अधि-नृत्, cl. 4. P. -नृत्यति,<BR>-नर्तितुम्, to dance upon (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिप|अधिपः
अधिप अधि-प, अस्, m. a ruler, commander,<BR>regent, king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिपति|अधिपतिः
अधि-पति, इस्, m. same as अधि-प, (in medic.)<BR>a particular part of the head, where a wound proves<BR>instantly fatal.<BR>—अधिपति-वती, f., Ved., N. given to<BR>certain female divinities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिपत्नी
अधि-पत्नी, f. a female sovereign or ruler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिपा
अधि-पा, आस्, m., Ved. a ruler, king, sovereign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिपथम्
अधिपथम् अधि-पथम्, ind. over or across<BR>a road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिपांशुल
अधिपांशुल अधि-पांशुल, अस्, आ, अम्, become<BR>dusty from above; dusty. Also अधि-पांसुल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिपुरुष|अधिपुरुषः
अधिपुरुष अधि-पुरुष, अस्, m. the su-<BR>preme spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिपू
अधिपू अधि-पू, cl. 9. P., Ved. -पुनाति,<BR>-पवितुम्, to besprinkle, to sprinkle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिपूतभृतम्
अधिपूतभृतम् अधि-पूत-भृतम्, ind., Ved.<BR>over the (vessel) full of purified Soma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिपेषण|अधिपेषणं
अधिपेषण अधि-पेषण, अस्, आ, अम्, serving<BR>to pound or grind upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिप्रजम्
अधिप्रजम् अधि-प्रजम्, ind. on the subject<BR>of procreation as a means of preserving the world (a<BR>chapter in the Upaniṣads).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिप्रष्टियुग|अधिप्रष्टियुगं|अधिप्रष्टियुगः
अधिप्रष्टियुग अधि-प्रष्टि-युग, अम्, n. yoke<BR>laid upon the प्रष्टि or foremost of three horses,<BR>used on certain sacrificial occasions, to which a fourth<BR>horse could be attached; (अस्), m. the fourth horse<BR>thus attached (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिबाध्
अधिबाध् अधि-बाध्, cl. 1. A. -बाधते,<BR>-धितुम्, to vex, annoy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिब्रू
अधिब्रू अधि-ब्रू, cl. 2. P. -ब्रवीति, -वक्तुम्,<BR>to give orders to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिभुज्
अधिभुज् अधि-भुज्, cl. 7. A. -भुङ्क्ते,<BR>-भोक्तुम्, to enjoy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिभू
अधिभू अधि-भू, ऊस्, m. (rt. भू with अधि),<BR>a master, a superior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिभूत|अधिभूतं
अधि-भूत, अम्, n. the spiritual or fine substratum<BR>of material or gross objects; the all-penetrating in-<BR>fluence of the supreme spirit; the supreme spirit<BR>himself; nature.<BR>—अधि-भूतम्, ind. on the subject<BR>of material objects (a chapter in the Upainṣads).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिभौतिक
अधि-भौतिक (better आधिभौतिक, q. v.), अस्,<BR>ई, अम्, natural (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिभोजन|अधिभोजनं
अधिभोजन अधि-भोजन, अम्, n. an addi-<BR>tional gift.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिमन्थ|अधिमंथः|अधिमन्थः
अधिमन्थ अधि-मन्थ or अधी-मन्थ, अस्,<BR>m. (churning of the eyes), severe ophthalmia.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0021-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिमन्थन|अधिमंथनं
अधि-मन्थन, अम्, n., Ved. friction for pro-<BR>ducing fire; (अस्, आ, अम्), suitable for such friction<BR>(as wood).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिमन्थित|अधिमंथित
अधि-मन्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, suffering from oph-<BR>thalmia.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिमांस|अधिमांसः
अधिमांस अधि-मांस or अधि-मांसक, अस्,<BR>m. proud flesh or cancer, especially in the eyes or<BR>the back part of the gums.<BR>—अधिमांसार्मन् (˚स-<BR>अर्˚), अ, n. ophthalmic disease produced by proud<BR>flesh or cancer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिमात्र
अधिमात्र अधि-मात्र, अस्, आ, अम्, past or<BR>above measure, excessive; (अम्), ind. on the subject<BR>of prosody.<BR>—अधिमात्र-कारुणिक, अस्, m. (ex-<BR>ceedingly merciful), N. of a Mahā-brāhmaṇa among<BR>the Buddhists.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिमास|अधिमासः
अधिमास अधि-मास, अस्, m. an intercalary<BR>month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिमुक्ति|अधिमुक्तिः
अधिमुक्ति अधि-मुक्ति, इस्, f. (with Buddhists)<BR>intuition (?); implicit faith (?).<BR>—अधिमुक्ति-सार,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, wholly given to intuition or to implicit<BR>faith (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिमुक्तिक
