अधिमुह्य|अधिमुह्यः
अधिमुह्य अधि-मुह्य, अस्, m., N. of Śākya-<BR>muni in one of his thirty-four former births.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधियज्ञ|अधियज्ञः
अधियज्ञ अधि-यज्ञ, अस्, m. the chief or<BR>principal sacrifice; influence or agency affecting a<BR>sacrifice; (अस्, आ, अम्), relating to a sacrifice; (अम्),<BR>ind. on the subject of sacrifices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधियत्
अधियत् अधि-यत्, cl. 1. A., Ved. -यतते,<BR>-तितुम्, to fasten, fix, stick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधियम्
अधियम् अधि-यम्, cl. 1. P. -यच्छति,<BR>-यन्तुम्, to give, present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिया
अधिया अधि-या, cl. 2. P. -याति, -तुम्, to<BR>escape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधियाङ्ग|अधियांग
