अधिरज्जु
अधिरज्जु अधि-रज्जु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. carrying<BR>a rope, fastening, fettering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिरथ|अधिरथः
अधिरथ अधि-रथ, अस्, आ, अम्, being upon<BR>or over a car; (अस्), m. a charioteer; N. of a<BR>charioteer who was a prince of Aṅga and Karṇa's<BR>foster-father; (अम्), n. a cart-load.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिरथि
अधि-रथि, इस्, m. (various reading for उद-रथि),<BR>the sun (?); the sea (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिरथ्यम्
अधि-रथ्यम्, ind. on the high road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिराज्
