अधिरोपित
अधि-रोपित, अस्, आ, अम्, raised, placed above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिरोह|अधिरोहः
