अधिवाक|अधिवाकः
अधि-वाक, अस्, m., Ved. advocacy, protection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवप्
अधिवप् अधि-वप्, cl. 1. A., Ved. -वपते,<BR>-वप्तुम्, to put on; to shatter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवस्
अधिवस् 1. अधि-वस्, cl. 1. P. -वसति,<BR>-वस्तुम्, to inhabit; to settle or perch upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवास|अधिवासः
1. अधि-वास, अस्, m. an inhabitant, a neighbour;<BR>one who dwells above; a habitation, abode, settle-<BR>ment, site; sitting before a person's house without<BR>taking food till he ceases to oppose or refuse a demand,<BR>commonly called ‘sitting in dharṇā;’ pertinacity; (for<BR>2. 3. अधि-वास, see below.)<BR>—अधिवास-भूमि, इस्,<BR>f. a dwelling-place, settlement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवासन|अधिवासनं
1. अधि-वासन, अम्, n. act of causing the divinity<BR>to take up its abode in an image; sitting in dharṇā<BR>[cf. s. v. अधि-वास above]. (For 2. अधि-वासन,<BR>see below.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवासिन्
अधि-वासिन्, ई, इनी, इ, inhabiting, settled in.<BR>—अधिवासि-ता, f. settled residence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अध्युषित
अध्य्-उषित, see s. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवस्
अधिवस् 2. अधि-वस्, cl. 2. A. -वस्ते,<BR>-वसितुम्, to put on or over (as clothes &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवस्त्र
अधि-वस्त्र, अस्, आ, अम्, clothed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवास|अधिवासः
2. अधि-वास or अधी-वास, अस्, m. an upper gar-<BR>ment, mantle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवासित
1. अधि-वासित, अस्, आ, अम्, invested with, clothed<BR>with; see also s. v. अधि-वास् below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवाज्य
अधिवाज्य अधि-वाज्य, अम्, n., N. of a<BR>country; correctly अधि-राज्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवास्
अधिवास् अधि-वास्, cl. 10. P. -वासयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to scent, perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवास|अधिवासः
3. अधि-वास, अस्, m. application of perfumes or<BR>fragrant cosmetics. (For. 1. 2. अधि-वास, see above.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवासन|अधिवासनं
2. अधि-वासन, अम्, n. application of perfumes,<BR>&c.; touching a vessel containing fragrant objects, that<BR>have been presented to an idol, as a ceremony; pre-<BR>liminary purification of the image.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवासित
2. अधि-वासित, अस्, आ, अम्, scented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवाहन|अधिवाहनं
अधिवाहन अधि-वाहन, अस्, m., N. of a<BR>man, said to be a son of Aṅga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिविकर्तन|अधिविकर्तनं|अधिविकर्त्तन
अधिविकर्तन अधि-वि-कर्तन, अम्, n. the<BR>act of cutting off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिविक्रम्
अधिविक्रम् अधि-वि-क्रम्, cl. 1. A. -क्रमते,<BR>-मितुम्, to step forth towards or for some one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिविद्
अधिविद् अधि-विद्, cl. 6. P. -विन्दति,<BR>-वेदितुम्, to obtain; to marry in addition to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिविन्ना
अधि-विन्ना, f. a wife whose husband has married<BR>again; a neglected or superseded wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवेत्तव्या
अधि-वेत्तव्या or अधि-वेदनीया or अधि-वेद्या,<BR>f. a wife in addition to whom it is proper to marry<BR>another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवेत्तृ
अधि-वेत्तृ, ता, m. a husband who marries an<BR>additional wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवेदन|अधिवेदनं
अधि-वेदन, अम्, n. marrying an additional wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिविद्यम्
अधिविद्यम् अधि-विद्यम्, ind. on the sub-<BR>ject of science (a chapter in the Upaniṣads).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिवेदम्
अधिवेदम् अधि-वेदम्, ind. concerning the<BR>Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिशी
अधिशी अधि-शी, cl. 2. A. -शेते, -शयितुम्,<BR>to lie down upon, to lie upon, to sleep upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिशयन
अधि-शयन, अस्, आ, अम्, lying on, sleeping on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिशयित
अधि-शयित, अस्, आ, अम्, recumbent upon; used<BR>for lying or sleeping upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिश्रि
अधिश्रि अधि-श्रि, cl. 1. P. -श्रयति, -यितुम्,<BR>Ved. -श्रयितवै, to ascend; to put on fire, make hot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिश्रय|अधिश्रयः
अधि-श्रय, अस्, m. a receptacle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिश्रयण|अधिश्रयणं
अधि-श्रयण, अम्, n. act or ceremony of putting<BR>(a kettle) on the fire; (ई), f. a fire-place, oven.<BR>—अधि-श्रयणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, relating to or con-<BR>nected with the Adhi-śrayaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिश्रित
अधि-श्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, put on the fire (as a pot).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिषवण|अधिषवणं
अधिषवण अधि-षवण, अम्, n. (fr. rt. सु<BR>with अधि), Ved. hand-press for extracting and strain-<BR>ing the Soma juice; (अस्, आ, अम्), used for extracting<BR>and straining the Soma juice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिष्ठा
अधिष्ठा अधि-ष्ठा (अधि-स्था), cl. 1. P. or<BR>poet. A. -तिष्ठति, -ते, -ष्ठातुम्, to stand upon,<BR>depend; to inhabit, abide; to be, stand; to super-<BR>intend, govern; to step over or across; to overcome;<BR>to ascend, mount.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिष्ठातृ
अधि-ष्ठातृ, ता, त्री, तृ, superintending, presid-<BR>ing, governing, tutelary; (आ), m. a ruler; especially<BR>the supreme ruler, or Providence personified and<BR>identified with one or another of the Hindū gods;<BR>a chief; a protector.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिष्ठान|अधिष्ठानं
अधि-ष्ठान, अम्, n. standing by, being at hand,<BR>approach; standing or resting upon; a basis, base;<BR>a wheel (as the basis of a car); a position, site, re-<BR>sidence, abode, seat; a settlement, town; government,<BR>authority, power, dominion; a precedent, rule; a<BR>benediction.<BR>—अधिष्ठान-शरीर, अम्, n. (in<BR>Sāṅkhya phil.) a body which forms the medium<BR>between the subtle and the gross body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0022-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

