अनपर
अनपर अन्-अपर, अस्, आ, अम्, without an-<BR>other; having no follower; sole (as an epithet of<BR>Brahma).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपराद्ध
अनपराद्ध अन्-अपराद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, having<BR>sustained no injury; (अम्), ind. without injury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपराध|अनपराधः
