अनपराधिन्
अनपराधिन्, ई, इनी, इ, innocent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपलाषुक
अनपलाषुक अन्-अपलाषुक, अस्, आ, अम्, not<BR>thirsty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपवाचन
अनपवाचन अन्-अपवाचन, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved.<BR>impossible to be talked away or wished away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपवृज्य
अनपवृज्य अन्-अपवृज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved.<BR>clear of objects that should be shunned as impure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपव्ययत्|अनपव्ययन्त्
