अनपसरण
अन्-अपसरण, अम्, n. absence of an outlet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपस्पृश्
अनपस्पृश् अन्-अपस्पृश्, क्, क्, क्, Ved. not<BR>refusing, not obstinate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपस्फुर्
