अनपहृत
अनपहृत अन्-अपहृत, अस्, आ, अम्, not carried<BR>off, not stolen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपाकरण
अनपाकरण अन्-अपाकरण, अम्, n. or अन्-<BR>अपाकर्मन्, अ, n. (in law) non-payment, non-<BR>delivery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपाय|अनपायः
अनपाय अन्-अपाय, अस्, आ, अम्, free from<BR>loss, undiminished; not passing away, imperishable;<BR>(अस्), m. freedom from loss or from wear and tear;<BR>permanence, imperishable nature; epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपायिन्
