अनपावृत्
अनपावृत् अन्-अपावृत्, ind., Ved. not turned<BR>away, unremittingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपाश्रय
