अनपेक्ष|अनपेक्षं
अनपेक्ष अन्-अपेक्ष, अस्, आ, अम्, regardless,<BR>careless; indifferent; impartial; irrespective; irrele-<BR>vant; (आ), f. disregard, carelessness, indifference; (अम्),<BR>ind. without regard to; regardlessly, carelessly, acci-<BR>dentally.<BR>—अनपेक्ष-त्व, अम्, n. disregard; irrele-<BR>vance; irrespectiveness; (-त्वात्), from having no refer-<BR>ence to, since (it) has no reference to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपेक्षित
