अनपेक्षिन्
अन्-अपेक्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ, regardless, careless; in-<BR>different, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपेक्ष्य
अन्-अपेक्ष्य, ind. disregarding, irrespective of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपेत
अनपेत अन्-अपेत, अस्, आ, अम्, not gone off,<BR>not past; not separated, faithful to, possessed of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनप्त
अनप्त अन्-अप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. not watery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनप्नस्
अनप्नस् अन्-अप्नस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, Ved. destitute<BR>of means (?), merit (?), shape (?), [cf. Lat. inops.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनप्सरस्
