अनभिभूत
अनभिभूत अन्-अभिभूत, अस्, आ, अम्, not<BR>overcome, unsurpassed; not beset, unobstructed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिमत
अनभिमत अन्-अभिमत, अस्, आ, अम्, not to<BR>one's mind, disliked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0026-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिम्लात
