अनवायम्
अनवायम् अन्-अवायम्, ind., Ved. uninter-<BR>ruptedly, unyieldingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0027-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

