अनश्वर|अनश्वरं
अनश्वर अ-नश्वर, अस्, ई, अम्, imperishable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0027-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनष्ट
अ-नष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, undestroyed, unimpaired.<BR>—अनष्ट-पशु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. having his cattle<BR>unimpaired.<BR>—अनष्ट-वेदस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, Ved.<BR>having his property unimpaired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0027-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनस्
अनस् अनस्, अस्, n. (said to be fr. rt. अन्),<BR>a cart; a mother; birth; offspring, living creature;<BR>boiled rice.<BR>—अनस्-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. yoked to<BR>a cart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0027-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनडुह्
