अनालम्बन
अन्-आलम्बन, अस्, आ, अम्, unsupported; desponding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनालम्बी
