अनालोच्य
अन्-आलोच्य, ind. not having considered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0029-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनावया
