अनास्थान
अन्-आस्थान, अस्, आ, अम्, having or yielding no<BR>basis or fulcrum; without a fixed seat or site.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0029-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनास्वाद|अनास्वादः
