अनास्वादित
अन्-आस्वादित, अस्, आ, अम्, untasted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0029-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनाहत|अनाहतं|अनाहतः
अनाहत अन्-आहत, अस्, आ, अम्, unbeaten,<BR>unwounded, intact; new and unbleached (as cloth);<BR>produced otherwise than by beating; not multiplied;<BR>(अस्), m. the fourth of the mystical चक्रस् or circles<BR>of the body.<BR>—अनाहत-नाद, अस्, m. a sound pro-<BR>duced otherwise than by beating; the sound ॐ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0029-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनाहार|अनाहारः
