अनाहार्य|अनाहार्य्य
अन्-आहार्य, अस्, आ, अम्, not to be seized or taken,<BR>not producible; not to be eaten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0029-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

