अनाहूत|अनाहूतः
अनाहूत अन्-आहूत, अस्, आ, अम्, uncalled,<BR>uninvited.<BR>—अनाहूतोपजल्पिन् (˚त-उप्˚), ई, m. an<BR>uncalled-for boaster.<BR>—अनाहूतोपविष्ट (˚त-उप्˚),<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, seated as an uninvited guest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0029-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनाह्लाद
