अनिङ्ग्य|अनिंग्य
अनिङ्ग्य अन्-इङ्ग्य, अस्, आ, अम्, not divisible;<BR>a word not divisible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिच्छ
