अनिजक
अनिजक अ-निजक, अस्, आ, अम्, not one's<BR>own, belonging to another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनित
अनित अनित, अस्, आ, अम् (etym. doubtful),<BR>destitute. of.<BR>—अनित-भा, f., Ved. not endowed with<BR>splendor, N. of a river (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनित्य|अनित्यः
अनित्य अ-नित्य, अस्, आ, अम्, not everlasting,<BR>transient; occasional, incidental; irregular, unusual;<BR>unstable; uncertain; (अम्), ind. occasionally.<BR>—अनि-<BR>त्य-कर्मन्, अ, n. or अनित्य-क्रिया, f. an occasional<BR>act of worship, sacrifice for a special purpose.<BR>—अनि-<BR>त्य-ता, f. or अनित्य-त्व, अम्, n. transient or limited<BR>existence.<BR>—अनित्य-दत्त or अनित्य-दत्तक or अनि-<BR>त्य-दत्रिम, अस्, m. a son surrendered by his parents<BR>to another for temporary or preliminary adoption.<BR>—अनित्य-प्रत्यवेक्षा, f. (Buddhist) consciousness<BR>that all is passing away.<BR>—अनित्य-भाव, अस्, m.<BR>transitoriness.<BR>—अनित्य-सम, अस्, आ, m. f. sophism,<BR>consisting in generalizing what is exceptional (as perish-<BR>ableness).<BR>—अनित्य-सम-प्रकरण, अम्, n. a sec-<BR>tion in the Nyāya discussing that sophism.<BR>—अनित्य-<BR>समास, अस्, m. a compound, the sense of which may<BR>be equally expressed by resolving it into its constituent<BR>parts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिदान
अनिदान अ-निदान, अस्, आ, अम्, causeless,<BR>groundless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिद्र
अनिद्र अ-निद्र, अस्, आ, अम्, sleepless, awake;<BR>(आ), f. sleeplessness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिद्रित
अ-निद्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, not asleep, awake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिधृष्ट
