अनिपुण|अनिपुणः
अनिपुण अ-निपुण, अस्, आ, अम्, unskilled,<BR>not clever or conversant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिबद्ध
अनिबद्ध अ-निबद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, not tied<BR>down, not bound, unattached, incoherent, uncon-<BR>nected.<BR>—अनिबद्ध-प्रलापिन्, ई, इनी, इ, chattering<BR>incoherently, talking at random.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिबाध|अनिबाधः
