अनिभृत
अनिभृत अ-निभृत, अस्, आ, अम्, not private,<BR>not reserved, immodest, bold, public.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिभृष्ट
अनिभृष्ट अ-निभृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved.<BR>unabated; unimpaired; undefeated.<BR>—अनिभृष्ट-<BR>तवि हि, इस्, m., Ved. having unabated power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिभ्य
अनिभ्य अन्-इभ्य, अस्, आ, अम्, not wealthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिमन्
अनिमन् अनिमन्, आ, m. a mote. See अणिमन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिमन्त्रित
अनिमन्त्रित अ-निमन्त्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, un-<BR>invited.<BR>—अ-निमन्त्रित-भोजिन्, ई, इनी, इ, eating<BR>without being invited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिमान
अनिमान अ-निमान, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. un-<BR>bounded, immense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिमित्त
अनिमित्त अ-निमित्त, अस्, आ, अम्, having no<BR>adequate occasion, causeless, groundless; (अम्), n. absence<BR>of an adequate cause or occasion, groundlessness.<BR>—अनि-<BR>मित्त-तस्, ind. groundlessly.<BR>—अ-निमित्त-निराकृत,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, groundlessly rejected.<BR>—अनिमित्त-लिङ्ग-<BR>नाश, अस्, m. (unaccountable loss of distinct vision);<BR>N. of an ophthalmic disease, ending in total blindness,<BR>perhaps amaurosis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिमिष्
अनिमिष् अ-निमिष्, f., Ved. absence of<BR>winking (only used in acc. and inst. cases).<BR>—अनि-<BR>मिषम् or<BR>—अनिमिषा or अनिमेषम्, ind., Ved.<BR>without winking, i. e. vigilantly or incessantly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिमिष|अनिमिषं|अनिमिषः
अ-निमिष or अ-निमेष, अस्, आ, अम्, not wink-<BR>ing, looking steadily, vigilant; open as eyes or flowers;<BR>(अस्), m. not winking; a god; a fish.<BR>—अनिमिषाक्ष<BR>(˚ष-अक्˚), अस्, ई, m. f. one whose eyes are fixed.<BR>—अनिमिषाचार्य (˚ष-आच्˚), अस्, m., N. of Vṛhas-<BR>pati.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिमिषीय
अनिमिषीय, अस्, आ, अम्, relating to those who do<BR>not wink (i. e. to the gods).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनियत|अनियतं
अनियत अ-नियत, अस्, आ, अम्, not regulated,<BR>uncontrolled, not fixed, uncertain, unrestricted, irregu-<BR>lar, casual.<BR>—अ-नियत-पुंस्का, f. a woman irregu-<BR>lar or unchaste in conduct.<BR>—अनियत-वृत्ति, इस्, इस्,<BR>इ, having no fixed or regular employment or income.<BR>—अनियताङ्क (˚त-अङ्˚), अस्, m. (in arithm.) an<BR>indeterminate digit.<BR>—अ-नियतात्मन् (˚त-आत्˚), आ,<BR>m. one whose self or spirit is not regulated or under<BR>proper control.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनियम|अनियमः
अ-नियम, अस्, m. absence of control or rule or<BR>fixed order or obligation, unsettledness; indecorous or<BR>improper conduct; uncertainty, doubt; (अस्, आ, अम्),<BR>having no rule, irregular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनियमित
अ-नियमित, अस्, आ, अम्, having no rule or law;<BR>irregular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनियुक्त|अनियुक्तः
अनियुक्त अ-नियुक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, not ap-<BR>pointed, not authoritative; (अस्), m. an assessor at a<BR>court who has not been formally appointed and is not<BR>entitled to vote.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनियोगिन्
अ-नियोगिन्, ई, इनी, इ, not attached or clinging to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0030-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिर
