अनिषेद्ध्र
अ-निषेद्ध्र, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. unimpeded, un-<BR>checked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0031-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिषु
