अनिष्कृत
अनिष्कृत अ-निष्कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, not done<BR>with, unfinished, not settled.<BR>—अनिष्कृतैनस् (˚त-<BR>एन्˚), आस्, आस्, अस्, having one's guilt not settled, i. e.<BR>unexpiated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0031-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिष्ट|अनिष्टः
अनिष्ट 1. अन्-इष्ट, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. इष्), un-<BR>wished, undesirable, disadvantageous, disagreeable, un-<BR>favourable; bad, wrong, evil, unlucky, ominous; (आ),<BR>f. a plant, Sida Alba; (अम्), n. evil, detriment, disad-<BR>vantage, calamity, crime.<BR>—अनिष्ट-ग्रह, अस्, m. an<BR>evil planet.<BR>—अनिष्ट-दुष्ट-धी, ईस्, ईस्, इ, having an<BR>evil and corrupt mind.<BR>—अनिष्ट-प्रसङ्ग, अस्, m.<BR>connection with a wrong object or a wrong argument<BR>or a wrong rule.<BR>—अनिष्ट-फल, अम्, n. evil result.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0031-b" target="_blank">Page0031-b+ 71</a>]<BR>—अनिष्ट-शङ्का, f. foreboding or fear of evil or<BR>misfortune.<BR>—अनिष्ट-सूचक, अस्, इका, अम्, forebod-<BR>ing evil, ominous.<BR>—अनिष्ट-हेतु, उस्, m. an evil<BR>omen.<BR>—अन्-इष्टापादन (˚ट-आप्˚), अम्, n. not ob-<BR>taining what is desired or (fr. अनिष्ट and आपादन)<BR>obtaining what is not desired.<BR>—अन्-इष्टाप्ति (˚ट-आप्˚),<BR>इस्, f. = preceding.<BR>—अनिष्टाशंसिन् (˚ट-आश्˚), ई, इनी,<BR>इ, indicating or boding evil.<BR>—अनिष्टोत्प्रेक्षण<BR>(˚ट-उत्˚), अम्, n. expectation of evil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0031-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिष्ट|अनिष्टः
अनिष्ट 2. अन्-इष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, (rt. यज्), not<BR>offered in sacrifice, not honoured with a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0031-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिष्टिन्
