अनिष्टृत
अनिष्टृत अ-निष्टृत, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. un-<BR>hurt, unchecked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0031-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिष्ठा
अनिष्ठा अ-निष्ठा, f. unsteadfastness, un-<BR>steadiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0031-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिष्ठुर
अनिष्ठुर अ-निष्ठुर, अस्, आ, अम्, not harsh,<BR>not scurrilous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0031-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिष्णात|अनिष्णातः
अनिष्णात अ-निष्णात, अस्, आ, अम्, unskilled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0031-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिष्पत्ति|अनिष्पत्तिः
अनिष्पत्ति अ-निष्पत्ति, इस्, f. non-accom-<BR>plishment, incompletion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0031-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनिष्पन्न|अनिष्पन्नः
