अनुकूल|अनुकूलः
अनुकूल अनु-कूल, अस्, आ, अम्, following the<BR>bank (कूल), slope or declivity, according to the current,<BR>favourable, agreeable; conformable to; friendly, kind,<BR>well-disposed; (अस्), m. a faithful or kind and obliging<BR>husband; (आ), f. Croton Polyandrum; N. of a metre;<BR>(अम्), n. favour, kindness (often in an ironical sense).<BR>—अनुकूल-ता, f. concord, good-will, favour, con-<BR>formity, consent; prosperity.<BR>—अनुकूल-नायक, अस्,<BR>m. a kind husband or lover.<BR>—अनुकूल-वायु, उस्,<BR>m. a favourable wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0032-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

