अनुद्र
अनुद्र अन्-उद्र, अस्, आ, अम्, waterless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुद्रु
अनुद्रु अनु-द्रु, cl. 1. P. -द्रवति, -द्रोतुम्,<BR>to run after, follow; accompany; to pursue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुद्रुत|अनुद्रुतं
अनु-द्रुत, अस्, आ, अम्, followed, pursued; (अम्),<BR>n. a measure of time in music, half a Druta, or one-<BR>fourth of a Mātrā or of the time taken to articulate a<BR>short vowel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुद्वाह|अनुद्वाहः
अनुद्वाह अन्-उद्वाह, अस्, m. non-marriage,<BR>celibacy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुद्विग्न
अनुद्विग्न अन्-उद्विग्न, अस्, आ, अम्, free from<BR>apprehension or perplexity, easy in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुद्वेग|अनुद्वेगः
