अनुधा
अनुधा अनु-धा, cl. 3. P. -दधाति, -धातुम्,<BR>to welcome, receive kindly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुधाव्
अनुधाव् 1. अनु-धाव्, cl. 1. P. -धावति,<BR>-वितुम्, to run after, to run up to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुधावत्
