अनुधावन|अनुधावनं
2. अनु-धावन, अम्, n. cleansing, purification.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुध्यै
अनुध्यै अनु-ध्यै, cl. 1. P. -ध्यायति,<BR>-ध्यातुम्, to consider attentively, to think of, to<BR>muse, to be anxious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुध्यान
अनु-ध्यान, अम्, n. meditation, religious con-<BR>templation, solicitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुध्यायिन्
अनु-ध्यायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, contemplating, meditating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनद्
अनुनद् अनु-नद्, cl. 1. P. -नदति, -दितुम्,<BR>to sound towards, (with acc.): Caus. P. -नादयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to make resonant or musical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनाद|अनुनादः
अनु-नाद, अस्, m. sound, vibration, reverberation,<BR>echo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनादित
