अनुनादिन्
अनु-नादिन्, ई, इनी, इ, resounding, echoing, resonant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनम्
