अनुनासिक
अनुनासिक अनु-नासिक, अस्, आ, अम्, nasal,<BR>uttered through the nose (as one of the five nasal<BR>consonants, or a vowel, or the three semivowels, य्,<BR>व्, ल्, under certain circumstances; in the case of<BR>vowels and semivowels, the mark ँ is used to denote<BR>this nasalization); the nasal mark ँ; (अम्), n. a nasal<BR>twang.<BR>—अनुनासिक-त्व, अम्, n. nasality.<BR>—अनुना-<BR>सिक-लोप, अस्, m. dropping of a nasal sound or letter.<BR>—अनुनासिकात्व (˚क-आत्˚), अम्, n. nasal pronuncia-<BR>tion of आ.<BR>—अनुनासिकादि (˚क-आदि), इस्, m. a com-<BR>pound letter commencing with a nasal.<BR>—अनुना-<BR>सिकान्त (˚क-अन्˚), अस्, m. a radical ending in a nasal.<BR>—अनुनासिकोपध (˚क-उप्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, having a<BR>nasal penultimate; succeeding a syllable with a nasal<BR>sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनिक्रम्
अनुनिक्रम् अनु-नि-क्रम्, cl. 1. P. -क्रामति,<BR>-क्रमितुम्, to follow in the steps.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनिक्ष्
अनुनिक्ष् अनु-निक्ष्, cl. 1. P., Ved. -निक्षति,<BR>-क्षितुम्, to pierce along.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनितुद्
अनुनितुद् अनु-नि-तुद्, cl. 6. P. -तुदति,<BR>-तोत्तुम्, to wound with a stab, to goad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनिपद्
अनुनिपद् अनु-नि-पद्, cl. 4. A. -पद्यते,<BR>-पत्तुम्, to lie down by the side of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनिर्जहान
अनुनिर्जहान अनु-निर्-जहान, अस्, आ, अम् (rt.<BR>हा), proceeding out of (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनिर्दह्
अनुनिर्दह् अनु-निर्-दह्, cl. 1. P. -दहति,<BR>-दग्धुम्, to burn down in succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनिर्देश|अनुनिर्देशः
अनुनिर्देश अनु-निर्देश, अस्, m. description<BR>or relation following a previous model.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनिर्वाप|अनुनिर्वापः
अनुनिर्वाप अनु-निर्वाप, अस्, m. subsequent<BR>libation (with clarified butter).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनिर्वाप्या
अनु-निर्वाप्या, f. ceremony connected with this<BR>subsequent libation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनी
अनुनी अनु-नी, cl. 1. P. -नयति, -नेतुम्,<BR>to bring near, to lead after; to persuade, induce, win<BR>over, conciliate, to coax, pacify, supplicate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनय|अनुनयः
अनु-नय, अस्, m. conciliation, salutation, courtesy,<BR>civility, showing respect or adoration to a guest or a<BR>deity; humble entreaty or supplication, reverential<BR>deportment; regulation of conduct, discipline, tuition;<BR>(अस्, आ, अम्), conciliatory, kind; (अम्), ind. fitly,<BR>becomingly.<BR>—अनुनय-प्रतिघ-प्रहाण, अम्,<BR>n. (with Buddhists) abandoning the obstacles to<BR>conciliatory behaviour.<BR>—अनुनयामन्त्रण (˚य-<BR>आम्˚), अम्, n. conciliatory address.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनयमान
अनु-नयमान, अस्, आ, अम्, conciliating, honour-<BR>ing, showing respect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनयिन्
अनु-नयिन्, ई, इनी, इ, courteous, humble, suppli-<BR>cating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनायक
अनु-नायक, अस्, इका, अम्, submissive, humble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनायिका
अनु-नायिका, f. a female character, subordinate to<BR>a नायिका or leading female character in a drama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनिनीषु
अनु-निनीषु, उस्, उस्, उ, desirous of conciliating<BR>or gratifying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनीत
अनु-नीत, अस्, आ, अम्, trained, disciplined, obtained,<BR>acquired, taught, respected; pleased, pacified, appeased,<BR>humbly entreated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनीति|अनुनीतिः
अनु-नीति, इस्, f. conciliation, courtesy, supplication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनेय
अनु-नेय, अस्, आ, अम्, easily conciliated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनु
अनुनु अनु-नु or -नू, cl. 6. and cl. 2. P., Ved.<BR>-नुवति or -नौति, -नवितुम् or -नुवितुम्, to praise<BR>again and again: Intens. -नोनवीति, to cheer after.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुनृत्
अनुनृत् अनु-नृत्, cl. 4. P. -नृत्यति, -नर्तितुम्,<BR>to dance after (with acc.); to dance before (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुन्नत
अनुन्नत अन्-उन्नत, अस्, आ, अम्, not elevated,<BR>not lifted up.<BR>—अनुन्नत-गात्र, अस्, आ, अम्, (with<BR>Buddhists) having limbs that are not too stout, pro-<BR>minent or protuberant.<BR>—अनुन्नतानत (˚त-आन्˚),<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, not raised nor lowered, level.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

