अनुपद्
2. अनु-पद्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. coming to pass; or (त्), f.<BR>food (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपद|अनुपदं|अनुपदः
अनु-पद, अस्, आ, अम्, following closely; (अस्), m.,<BR>N. of a man or tribe; (अम्), n. a chorus, burden of<BR>a song or words sung again after regular intervals;<BR>(अम्), ind. step by step, word for word; on the heels<BR>of, close behind or after.<BR>—अनुपद-सूत्र, अम्,<BR>n. title of a commentary explaining the text (of a<BR>Brāhmaṇa) word for word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

