अन्-उपलक्ष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, not to be traced.<BR>—अनुपलक्ष्य-वर्त्मन्, आ, आ, अ, having ways<BR>(or a way) that cannot be traced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुपलब्ध
