अनु-ब्राह्मणिक (or perhaps more correctly आनु-<BR>ब्राह्मणिक), अस्, or अनु-ब्राह्मणिन्, ई, m. a<BR>knower of an अनु-ब्राह्मण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुब्रू
अनुब्रू अनु-ब्रू, cl. 2. P. -ब्रवीति, -वक्तुम्,<BR>to pronounce, utter, vow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभाष्
अनुभाष् अनु-भाष्, cl. 1. A. -भाषते,<BR>-षितुम्, to pronounce clearly, to confess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभाषण|अनुभाषणं
अनु-भाषण, अम्, n. repeating what has been<BR>said; repeating a proposition in order to refute it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभास|अनुभासः
अनुभास अनु-भास, अस्, m. a species of<BR>crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभिद्
अनुभिद् अनु-भिद्, cl. 7. P. -भिनत्ति,<BR>-भेत्तुम्, to split, break.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभित्ति
अनु-भित्ति, ind. along a cleft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभुज्
अनुभुज् अनु-भुज्, cl. 7. A. -भुङ्क्ते, -भोक्-<BR>तुम्, to suffer the due consequence of one's actions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभोग|अनुभोगः
अनु-भोग, अस्, m. (in law) enjoyment, a grant of<BR>hereditary land in return for service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभू
अनुभू अनु-भू, cl. 1. P. -भवति, -वितुम्,<BR>to be after, to notice, perceive, understand; to expe-<BR>rience, to attempt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभव|अनुभवः
अनु-भव, अस्, m. perception, apprehension, fru-<BR>ition; understanding; impression on the mind not<BR>derived from memory; experience, knowledge derived<BR>from personal observation or experiment; result, con-<BR>sequence.<BR>—अनुभव-सिद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, established<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">Page0037-b+ 75</a>]<BR>by experience or perception.<BR>—अनुभवारूढ (˚व-<BR>आर्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, subjected to trial or experiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभाव|अनुभावः
अनु-भाव, अस्, m. a sign or indication of a feeling<BR>(भाव) by look or gesture; dignity, authority, con-<BR>sequence; firm opinion, ascertainment, good resolu-<BR>tion, belief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभावक
अनु-भावक, अस्, इका, अम्, causing to apprehend,<BR>making to understand.<BR>—अनुभावक-ता, f. under-<BR>standing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभावन|अनुभावनं
अनु-भावन, अम्, n. the act of indicating feelings<BR>by sign or gesture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभाविन्
अनु-भाविन्, ई, इनी, इ, perceiving, knowing, an<BR>eye-witness; showing signs of feeling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभू
अनु-भू, ऊस्, ऊस्, उ, perceiving, understanding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभूत
अनु-भूत, अस्, आ, अम्, perceived, understood,<BR>judged, experienced, apprehended; resulted, followed<BR>as a consequence; that has experienced, tasted, tried<BR>or enjoyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभूति|अनुभूतिः
अनु-भूति, इस्, f. perception, apprehension; know-<BR>ledge from any source but memory; (in phil.) know-<BR>ledge from four sources, viz. perception by the senses,<BR>inference, comparison, and verbal knowledge; dignity,<BR>consequence.<BR>—अनुभूति-प्रकाश, अस्, m. title of a<BR>metric paraphrase of the twelve principal Upaniṣads,<BR>by Vidyāraṇya-muni.<BR>—अनुभूति-स्वरूपाचार्य<BR>(˚प-आच्˚), अस्, m., N. of the author of the grammar<BR>Sārasvatī-prakriyā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभूय
अनु-भूय, ind. having perceived, having experi-<BR>enced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभूयमान
अनु-भूयमान, अस्, आ, अम्, under trial, under<BR>enjoyment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभृ
अनुभृ अनु-भृ, cl. 1. P., Ved. -भरति,<BR>-भर्तुम्, to praise conformably (?), to commit to,<BR>throw into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभर्तृ
अनु-भर्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, Ved. praising conformably,<BR>imitating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभ्राज्
अनुभ्राज् अनु-भ्राज्, cl. 1. P. -भ्राजति,<BR>-जितुम्, to illuminate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुभ्रातृ
अनुभ्रातृ अनु-भ्रातृ, ता, m. a younger<BR>brother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमद्
अनुमद् अनु-मद्, cl. 1. P., Ved. -मदति,<BR>-दितुम्, to rejoice over, to gladden, to praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमत्त
अनु-मत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, intoxicated (with joy,<BR>&c.); recovered from intoxication (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमाद्य
अनु-माद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be praised in succession,<BR>to be granted with acclamation or praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमध्यमम्
अनुमध्यमम् अनु-मध्यमम्, ind. next<BR>oldest to the middle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमन्
अनुमन् अनु-मन्, cl. 4. A. -मन्यते, -मन्-<BR>तुम्, to approve, assent to, permit, grant: Caus. P.<BR>-मानयति, -यितुम्, to ask for permission, to honour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमत|अनुमतः
अनु-मत, अस्, आ, अम्, approved, assented to, per-<BR>mitted, allowed; agreeable, pleasant; loved, beloved;<BR>concurred with, being of one opinion; (अम्), n. con-<BR>sent, permission, approbation. अनुमते, loc. c. with<BR>consent of.<BR>—अनुमत-कर्म-कारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, doing<BR>what is allowed, acting according to an agreement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमति|अनुमतिः
अनु-मति, इस्, f. assent, permission, approbation;<BR>the fifteenth day of the moon's age, on which it<BR>rises one digit less than full, when the gods or manes<BR>receive oblations with favour; the former personified<BR>as a goddess and worshipped especially in the Rājasūya<BR>sacrifice; oblation made to this goddess.<BR>—अनुमति-<BR>पत्त्र, अम्, n. (in law) a deed expressing assent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमनन|अनुमननं
अनु-मनन, अम्, n. assenting; independance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमन्तृ|अनुमंतृ
अनु-मन्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, consenting to, permitting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमन्यमान
अनु-मन्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, minding, assenting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमन्त्र्|अनुमंत्र्
अनुमन्त्र् अनु-मन्त्र्, cl. 10. A. (P. ?) -मन्त्र्-<BR>अयते, -ति, -यितुम्, to accompany with or consecrate<BR>by magic formulas; to dismiss with a blessing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमन्त्रण|अनुमंत्रण|अनुमंत्रणं
अनु-मन्त्रण, अम्, n. consecration by hymns<BR>and prayers.<BR>—अनुमन्त्रण-मन्त्र, अस्, m. a<BR>hymn used in consecrating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमन्त्रित
अनु-मन्त्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, so consecrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमरण|अनुमरणं
अनुमरण अनु-मरण. See अनु-मृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमरु|अनुमरुः
अनुमरु अनु-मरु, उस्, m. a country next<BR>to a desert.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमा
अनुमा 1. अनु-मा, cl. 3. A. -मिमीते, -मातुम्,<BR>to infer, conclude, guess, conjecture; to reconcile, to<BR>equal: Pass. -मीयते, to be inferred or supposed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमा
2. अनु-मा, f. inference, a conclusion from given<BR>premises.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमान|अनुमानं
अनु-मान, अम्, n. the act of inferring or drawing<BR>a conclusion from given premises; inference, consi-<BR>deration, reflection; guess, conjecture; one of the<BR>means of obtaining knowledge (प्रमाण) according<BR>to the Sāṅkhya or Nyāya systems, but not according<BR>to the Vedānta.<BR>—अनुमान-खण्ड, अम्, n., N.<BR>of a work on inference, by Cintāmaṇi.<BR>—अनुमान-<BR>प्रकाश, अस्, m. a similar work by Rucidatta.<BR>—अनुमान-मणि-दीधिति, इस्, f. a similar work by<BR>Raghunātha.<BR>—अनुमानोक्ति (˚न-उक्˚), इस्, f. rea-<BR>soning, logic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमापक
अनु-मापक, अस्, इका, अम्, causing an inference,<BR>as an effect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमित
अनु-मित, अस्, आ, अम्, inferred, conjectured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमिति|अनुमितिः
अनु-मिति, इस्, f. inference, conclusion from given<BR>premises.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमिमान
अनु-मिमान, अस्, आ, अम्, concluding, inferring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमीयमान
अनु-मीयमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being inferred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमेय
अनु-मेय, अस्, आ, अम्, inferable, to be inferred,<BR>proved or conjectured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमाद्य
अनुमाद्य अनु-माद्य. See under अनु-मद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमाषम्
अनुमाषम् अनु-माषम्, ind. like a kidney<BR>bean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमास|अनुमासं|अनुमासः
अनुमास अनु-मास, अस्, m. the following<BR>month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमुद्
अनुमुद् अनु-मुद्, cl. 1. A. -मोदते, -दितुम्,<BR>to join in rejoicing, to sympathize with, to rejoice; to<BR>allow with pleasure, to express approval, applaud, permit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमोद|अनुमोदः
अनु-मोद, अस्, m. a subsequent pleasure, the feel-<BR>ing of pleasure from sympathy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमोदक
अनु-मोदक, अस्, इका, अम्, assenting, showing<BR>sympathetic joy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमोदन|अनुमोदनं
अनु-मोदन, अम्, n. pleasing, causing pleasure,<BR>applauding; assent, acceptance; sympathetic joy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमोदित|अनुमोदितं
अनु-मोदित, अस्, आ, अम्, pleased, delighted, ap-<BR>plauded; agreeable, acceptable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमुह्
अनुमुह् अनु-मुह्, cl. 4. P. -मुह्यति, -मोग्-<BR>धुम् or -मोढुम्, to feel distressed at, to be trou-<BR>bled about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमृ
अनुमृ अनु-मृ, cl. 6. A. -म्रियते, -मर्तुम्,<BR>to follow in death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमरण|अनुमरणं
अनु-मरण, अम्, n. following in death; post-<BR>cremation of a widow whose husband's corpse is not<BR>on the spot, and with part of whose dress she there-<BR>fore ascends the pile; this is prohibited to Brāhman<BR>women: it is often synonymous with the opposite<BR>term सह-मरण, con-cremation or burning with<BR>the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमरिष्यत्
अनु-मरिष्यत्, अन्, अती or अन्ती, अत्, about to follow<BR>in death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमृता
अनु-मृता, f. the woman who burns with a part<BR>of her husband's dress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमृग्यदाशु
अनुमृग्यदाशु अनुमृग्य-दाशु, उस्, m. (rt.<BR>मृग् and दा), granting all that is sought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमृज्
अनुमृज् अनु-मृज्, cl. 2. P. -मार्ष्टि, -मार्जि-<BR>तुम् or -मार्ष्टुम्, to purify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमृश्
अनुमृश् अनु-मृश्, cl. 6. P. -मृशति, -मर्-<BR>ष्टुम् or -म्रष्टुम्, to consider, think of, reflect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुमर्शम्
अनु-मर्शम्, ind. having repeatedly considered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुम्लोचा
अनुम्लोचा अनु-म्लोचा or अनु-म्लोचन्ती, f.,<BR>N. of an Apsaras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयजुस्
अनुयजुस् अनु-यजुस्, ind. (rt. यज्), accord-<BR>ing to the Yajur-veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयाग
अनु-याग, अस्, m. a subsequent or after-sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयाज|अनुयाजः
अनु-याज, अस्, m. a secondary or final sacrifice or<BR>offering.<BR>—अनुयाज-प्रसव, अस्, m. permission to<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">Page0038-a+ 75</a>]<BR>perform an Anuyāja.<BR>—अनुयाज-प्रैष, आस्, m. pl.<BR>the formulas belonging to the Anuyāja.<BR>—अनुयाज-<BR>वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having secondary sacrifices.<BR>—अनु-<BR>याजानुमन्त्रण (˚ज-अन्˚), अम्, n. reciting those<BR>formulas.<BR>—अनुयाजार्थ (˚ज-अर्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, be-<BR>longing to or used at an Anuyāja.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयम्
अनुयम् अनु-यम्, cl. 1. P., Ved. -यच्छति,<BR>-यन्तुम्, to covet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयवम्
अनुयवम् अनु-यवम्, ind. like barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुया
अनुया 1. अनु-या, cl. 2. P. -याति, -तुम्, to<BR>follow, attend; to take (off) seriatim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुया
2. अनु-या, आस्, आस्, अम्, following; (आस्), f., Ved. food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयत
अनु-यत, अस्, आ, अम्, followed, pursued, practised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयातव्य
अनु-यातव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be followed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयातृ
अनु-यातृ, ता, m. a follower, companion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयात्र|अनुयात्रं
अनु-यात्र, अम्, आ, n. f. retinue, attendance, that<BR>which is required for a journey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयात्रिक|अनुयात्रिकः
अनु-यात्रिक, अस्, आ, अम्, following as attendant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयान|अनुयानं
अनु-यान, अम्, n. going after, following.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयायिन्
अनु-यायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, going after; a follower, a<BR>dependant or attendant; following, consequent upon.<BR>—अनुयायि-ता, f. or अनुयायि-त्व, अम्, n. the state<BR>of being a follower, succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयुज्
अनुयुज् अनु-युज्, cl. 7. A. -युङ्क्ते, -योक्तुम्,<BR>to examine, question, put upon trial; to order; en-<BR>join; to select (a husband).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयुक्त|अनुयुक्तः
अनु-युक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, ordered, enjoined; asked,<BR>inquired; examined, questioned, reprehended, cen-<BR>sured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयुक्तिन्
अनु-युक्तिन्, ई, m. one who has enjoined, ex-<BR>amined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयुगम्
अनु-युगम्, ind. according to the Yugas or four<BR>ages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयोक्तृ
अनु-योक्तृ, ता, m. an examiner, inquirer, teacher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयोग|अनुयोगः
अनु-योग, अस्, m. a question, examination, asking,<BR>solicitation; censure, reproof; religious meditation,<BR>spiritual union.<BR>—अनुयोग-कृत्, त्, m. an Ācārya or<BR>spiritual teacher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयोगिन्
अनु-योगिन्, ई, इनी, इ, what combines or unites;<BR>connected or combined with, situated in or on, ques-<BR>tioning, examining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयोजन|अनुयोजनं
अनु-योजन, अम्, n. question, questioning, ex-<BR>amining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयोज्य|अनुयोज्यं|अनुयोज्यः
अनु-योज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be examined or ques-<BR>tioned; to be enjoined or ordered; censurable; a<BR>servant, agent, delegate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुयूपम्
अनुयूपम् अनु-यूपम्, ind. along the Yūpa<BR>or sacrificial post.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरक्ष्
अनुरक्ष् अनु-रक्ष्, cl. 1. P. -रक्षति,<BR>-षितुम्, to preserve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरक्षण
अनु-रक्षण, अम्, n. the act of preserving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरज्जु
अनुरज्जु अनु-रज्जु, ind. along the rope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरञ्ज्|अनुरंज्
अनुरञ्ज् अनु-रञ्ज्, cl. 4. A. -रज्यते, -रङ्क्-<BR>तुम्, to be attached or devoted; P. -रज्यति, to<BR>blush, be deeply affected: Caus. P. -रञ्जयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to win, conciliate, gratify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरक्त|अनुरक्तः
अनु-रक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, fond of, attached or devoted<BR>to, pleased; beloved.<BR>—अनुरक्त-प्रज, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>beloved by his subjects.<BR>—अनुरक्त-लोक, अस्, m. a<BR>person to whom every one is attached.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरक्ति|अनुरक्तिः
अनु-रक्ति, इस्, f. affection, attachment, love, de-<BR>votion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरञ्जक|अनुरंजक
अनु-रञ्जक, अस्, इका, अम्, attaching, conciliating,<BR>causing affection, gratifying, pleasing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरञ्जन|अनुरंजनं|अनुरञ्जनं
अनु-रञ्जन, अम्, n. attachment, the act of attach-<BR>ing or conciliating affection, love; pleasing, giving<BR>delight to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरञ्जित|अनुरंजित
अनु-रञ्जित, अस्, आ, अम्, conciliated, inspired with<BR>affection, pleased, delighted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुराग|अनुरागः
अनु-राग, अस्, m. attachment, affection, love, pas-<BR>sion, goodwill.<BR>—अनुराग-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, affec-<BR>tionate, attached, in love with.<BR>—अनुरागेङ्गित (˚ग-<BR>इङ्ग्˚), अम्, n. gesture expressive of passion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरागिन्
अनु-रागिन्, ई, इणी, इ, impassioned, attached, ena-<BR>moured, causing love; (इणी), f. personification of a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">Page0038-b+ 70</a>]<BR>musical note.<BR>—अनुरागि-ता, f. the state of being in<BR>love with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरणन|अनुरणनं
अनुरणन अनु-रणन, अम्, n. sounding<BR>conformably to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरत|अनुरतः
अनुरत अनु-रत, अस्, आ, अम्, fond of, at-<BR>tached, devoted to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरति|अनुरतिः
अनु-रति, इस्, f. love, affection; attachment, good-<BR>will.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरथ
अनुरथ अनु-रथ, अस्, m., N. of a son of<BR>Kuruvatsa and father of Puruhotra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरथ्या
अनु-रथ्या, f. a path along the margin of a road;<BR>a side road, the margin of a street.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरस|अनुरसः
अनुरस अनु-रस, अस्, m. (in poetry) a sub-<BR>ordinate feeling or passion; (in medic.) a secondary<BR>flavour, as a little sweetness in a sour fruit, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरहस
अनुरहस अनु-रहस, अस्, आ, अम्, solitary,<BR>private; (अम्), ind. in secret, apart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरात्रम्
अनुरात्रम् अनु-रात्रम्, ind. every night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुराद्ध
अनुराद्ध अनु-राद्ध, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. राध्),<BR>effected, accomplished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुराध|अनुराधः
अनु-राध, अस्, आ, अम्, causing welfare; see अनू-<BR>राध; born under the asterism Anurādhā; (आ), f.<BR>the seventeenth of the twenty-eight Nakṣatras or<BR>lunar mansion, a constellation described as a row<BR>of oblation.<BR>—अनुराध-ग्राम, अस्, m. or अनु-<BR>राध-पुर, अम्, n. the ancient capital of Ceylon<BR>founded by a man named Anurādha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरी
अनुरी अनु-री, cl. 4. A. -रीयते, -रेतुम्, to<BR>flow after.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरु
अनुरु अन्-उरु, उस्, उस् or वी, उ, not great,<BR>not large.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरुच्
अनुरुच् अनु-रुच्, Caus. P. -रोचयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to choose, prefer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरुद्
अनुरुद् अनु-रुद्, cl. 2. P. -रोदिति, -तुम्, to<BR>lament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरुध्
अनुरुध् 1. अनु-रुध्, cl. 7. P. -रुणद्धि,<BR>-रोद्धुम्, to retain, keep back; cl. 4. A. -रुध्यते<BR>or poet. P. -रुध्यति, to love, to be fond of or to<BR>spare; to coax, soothe, entreat (especially in Ben-<BR>gālī).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरुद्ध
अनु-रुद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, checked, restrained, op-<BR>posed; soothed, coaxed, pacified; (अस्), m., N. of a<BR>cousin of Śākya-muni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरुध्
2. अनु-रुध्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. loving, adhering to,<BR>favouring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरोध|अनुरोधः
अनु-रोध, अस्, m. or अनु-रोधन, अम्, n.<BR>obliging another or fulfilling his wishes; obligingness,<BR>compliance, gratification, satisfaction, conformity, con-<BR>sideration, respect; reference or bearing of a rule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरोधक
अनु-रोधक, अस्, इका, अम्, or अनु-रोधिन्, ई,<BR>इनी, इ, complying with, compliant, obliging, conform-<BR>ing to, having respect or regard to.<BR>—अनुरोधि-ता,<BR>f. the state of being so.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरुहा
अनुरुहा अनु-रुहा, f., N. of a grass<BR>(Cyperus Pertenius).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरूप|अनुरूपः
अनुरूप अनु-रूप, अस्, आ, अम्, following the<BR>form, conformable, corresponding, like, resembling;<BR>fit, suitable; adapted to, agreeable to, according to;<BR>(अस्), m. the Antistrophe which has the same metre<BR>as the Stotriya or Strophe (understand प्रगाथ or<BR>तृच); the second of three verses recited together;<BR>(अम्), n. conformity, suitability. अनुरूपम् or अनु-<BR>रूपेण or अनुरूपतस्, ind. conformably, agree-<BR>ably to, according.<BR>—अनुरूप-चेष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>endeavouring to act becomingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुरेवती
अनुरेवती अनु-रेवती, f., N. of a plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलग्न
अनुलग्न अनु-लग्न, अस्, आ, अम्, attached to;<BR>followed; intent on, pursuing after.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुला
अनुला अनुला, f., N. of a female Arhat or<BR>Buddhist saint; also of a queen of Ceylon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलाप|अनुलापः
अनुलाप अनु-लाप, अस्, m. (rt. लप्), repeti-<BR>tion of what has been said, tautology.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलास|अनुलासः
अनुलास अनु-लास, अस्, m. or अनु-लास्य, अस्,<BR>m. a peacock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलिप्
अनुलिप् अनु-लिप्, cl. 6. P. -लिम्पति, -लेप्तुम्,<BR>to anoint, besmear; cl. 6. A. -लिम्पते, to anoint one's<BR>self (previous to or after bathing); to bathe: Caus.<BR>-लेपयति, -यितुम्, to get one anointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलिप्त
अनु-लिप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, smeared, anointed.<BR>—अनु-<BR>लिप्ताङ्ग (˚त-अङ्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, having the limbs<BR>anointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलेप|अनुलेपः
अनु-लेप, अस्, m. unction, anointing, smearing,<BR>bedaubing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलेपक
अनु-लेपक, अस्, इका, अम्, or अनु-लेपिन्, ई, इनी, इ,<BR>anointing the body with unguents, who or what anoints.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलेपन|अनुलेपनं
अनु-लेपन, अम्, n. anointing the body; unguent<BR>so used; oily or emollient application.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलुभ्
अनुलुभ् अनु-लुभ्, Caus. -लोभयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to entice; to go astray (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलोम|अनुलोमः
अनुलोम अनु-लोम, अस्, आ, अम्, in a natural<BR>direction, in regular order, regular, successive, with<BR>the hair (लोमन्) or grain (opposed to प्रति-लोम);<BR>(आ), f. a woman of a lower caste than that of the<BR>man's with whom she is connected; (आस्), pl. mixed<BR>castes.<BR>—अनुलोम-कल्प, अस्, m. the thirty-fourth of<BR>the Pariśiṣṭas belonging to the Atharva-veda.<BR>—अनु-<BR>लोम-कृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, ploughed in the regular<BR>direction (with the grain).<BR>—अनुलोम-ज, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>produced or born in due gradation; applied especially<BR>to the mixed tribes; or offspring of a mother inferior<BR>in caste to the father, as the Mūrdhāvasikta of a<BR>Brāhman father and Kṣatriyā mother, and so on<BR>with the Ambaṣṭha, Niṣāda or Pāraśava, Māhiṣya,<BR>Ugra, Karaṇa.<BR>—अनुलोम-परिणीता, f. married in<BR>regular gradation.<BR>—अनुलोमाय (˚म-अय), अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, having fortune favourable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलोमन|अनुलोमनं
अनु-लोमन, अम्, n. due regulation, sending or<BR>putting in the right direction; (in medicine) carrying<BR>off by the right channels, purging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुलोमय
अनु-लोमय, nom. P. अनु-लोमयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>stroke or rub with the hair or the grain, to go with<BR>the grain, to send in the right direction or carrying<BR>off by the right channels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुल्बण
अनुल्बण अन्-उल्बण or अन्-उल्वण, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>not excessive, not prominent, smooth (?), free from<BR>disturbing circumstances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवंश|अनुवंशः
अनुवंश अनु-वंश, अस्, m. a genealogical<BR>list or table; (अम्), ind. according to race or family,<BR>a new family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवंश्य
अनुवंश्य, अस्, आ, अम्, relating to a genealogical<BR>list or table.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवक्र
अनुवक्र अनु-वक्र, अस्, आ, अम्, somewhat<BR>crooked or oblique.<BR>—अनुवक्र-ग, अस्, आ, अम्, having<BR>a somewhat oblique course (as a planet, &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवच्
अनुवच् अनु-वच्, cl. 2. P. -वक्ति, -तुम्, to<BR>repeat, reiterate, recited, speak after, reply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवक्तव्य
अनु-वक्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be repeated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवक्तृ
अनु-वक्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, speaking after, repeating,<BR>replying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवचन|अनुवचनं
अनु-वचन, अम्, n. or अनु-वाच्, क्, f. speaking<BR>after, repetition, reciting, reading; lecture; a chapter,<BR>a section; recitation of certain texts (मन्त्र) in<BR>consequence of and in connection or conformity with<BR>injunctions (प्रैष) spoken by other priests.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवचनीय
अनु-वचनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, referring to the अनु-<BR>वचन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवाक|अनुवाकः
अनु-वाक, अस्, m. saying after, reciting, repeating,<BR>reading; a chapter of the Vedas, a subdivision or<BR>section; a compilation from the Ṛg or Yajur-vedas.<BR>—अनुवाक-सङ्ख्या, the fourth of the eighteen<BR>Pariśiṣṭas of the Yajur-veda.<BR>—अनुवाकानुक्र-<BR>मणी (˚क-अन्˚), f. a work referring to the Ṛg-veda,<BR>attributed to Śaunaka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवाक्या
अनु-वाक्या, f. the verse to be recited by the Hotṛ<BR>priest, in which the god is invoked to partake of the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">Page0039-a+ 71</a>]<BR>offering intended for him.<BR>—अनुवाक्य-वत् or अनु-<BR>वाक्या-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, furnished or accompanied with<BR>an Anuvākyā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवाचन|अनुवाचनं
अनु-वाचन, अम्, n. the act of causing to recite;<BR>the recitation of mantras or passages of the Ṛg-veda<BR>by the Hotṛ in obedience to the injunction (प्रैष)<BR>of the Adhvaryu priest.<BR>—अनुवाचन-प्रैष, अस्,<BR>m. an injunction to recite as above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवाचित
अनु-वाचित, अस्, आ, अम्, before-mentioned, before-<BR>named.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूक्त
अनूक्त, &c. See s. v., p. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवत्सर|अनुवत्सरं|अनुवत्सरः
अनुवत्सर अनु-वत्सर, अस्, m. a year; (in<BR>astronomy) the fifth of five cycles of twelve years in<BR>the Vṛhaspati cycle.<BR>—अनु-वतरम्, ind. every<BR>year, yearly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवद्
अनुवद् अनु-वद्, cl. 1. P. -वदति (with<BR>acc.), or A. -वदते, -दितुम् (with gen.), to imitate<BR>in speaking, to mock, to repeat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवाद|अनुवादः
अनु-वाद, अस्, m. saying after or again, repeating<BR>by way of explanation, explanatory repetition or reiter-<BR>ation with corroboration or illustration, explanatory<BR>reference to anything already said, translation; any<BR>portion of the Brāhmaṇas which comments on, ex-<BR>plains or illustrates an injunction (विधि) previously<BR>propounded, and which does not itself propound rules<BR>(such a passage is sometimes called अनुवाद-व-<BR>चन); confirmation; report, rumour, ओन् दित्; slan-<BR>der, reviling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवादक
अनु-वादक, अस्, इका, अम्, or अनु-वादिन्, ई, इनी,<BR>इ, repeating with comment and explanation, corrobora-<BR>tive, concurrent, conformable, in harmony with. The<BR>masculine of the last is also the name of any one of<BR>the three notes of the gamut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवाद्य
अनु-वाद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be explained by an<BR>Anuvāda, to be made the subject of one; (अम्), n.<BR>the subject of a predicate.<BR>—अनुवाद्य-त्व, अम्, n.<BR>the state of requiring to be explained by an Anu-<BR>vāda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनूदित
अनूदित. See. s. v., p. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवनम्
अनुवनम् अनु-वनम्, ind. along side of<BR>the wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवर्ण्
अनुवर्ण् अनु-वर्ण्, cl. 10. P. -वर्णयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to mention, describe, recount.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवर्तन|अनुवर्तनं|अनुवर्त्तन|अनुवर्त्तनं
अनुवर्तन, अनुवर्तिन्, &c. See अनु-वृत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवश|अनुवशः
अनुवश अनु-वश, अस्, m. obedience to the<BR>will of another; (अस्, आ, अम्), obedient to the will of<BR>another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवषट्कार
अनुवषट्कार अनु-वषट्कार, अस्, m. or अनु-<BR>वषट्कृत, अम्, n. a secondary exclamation of<BR>वषट्, on making an oblation to a deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवस्
अनुवस् अनु-वस्, cl. 1. P. -वसति, -वस्तुम्,<BR>to dwell near to; to inhabit along with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवासिन्
अनु-वासिन्, ई, इनी, इ, residing, resident.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवसित
अनुवसित 1. अनु-वसित, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. वस्,<BR>to put on), dressed up, wrapped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवसित
अनुवसित 2. अनु-व-सित, अस्, आ, अम्, (for अन्व्-<BR>अव-सित, rt. सि), fastened to, bound to, attached.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवह|अनुवहः
