अनुव्यम् अनु-व्यम्, ind. (rt. वी with अनु),<BR>Ved. behind, after, following.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्यवगा
अनुव्यवगा अनु-व्य्-अव-गा (-वि-अव-गा), cl.<BR>3. P. -जिगाति, -गातुम्, to come between successively<BR>or in succession to another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्यवे
अनुव्यवे अनु-व्य्-अवे (-वि-अव-इ), cl. 2. P.<BR>-अवैति, -तुम्, to follow in intervening or coming<BR>between.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्यश्
अनुव्यश् अनु-व्य्-अश् (-वि-अश्), cl. 3. A. -व्यश्-<BR>नुते, -शितुम्, to overtake, reach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्याख्या
अनुव्याख्या अनु-व्य्-आ-ख्या (-वि-आ-ख्या), cl.<BR>2. P. -ख्याति, -तुम्, to explain further.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्याख्यान|अनुव्याख्यानं
अनु-व्याख्यान, अम्, n. that portion of a Brāh-<BR>maṇa which explains or illustrates difficult Sūtras,<BR>texts, or obscure statements occurring in another<BR>position.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्याहरण|अनुव्याहरणं
अनुव्याहरण अनु-व्याहरण (-वि-आ-हरण),<BR>अम्, n. or अनु-व्याहार, अस्, m. cursing, execration;<BR>repeating, repeated utterance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0039-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्याहारिन्
अनु-व्याहारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, execrating, cursing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्युच्चर्
अनुव्युच्चर् अनु-व्य्-उच्-चर् (-वि-उद्-चर्), cl. 1.<BR>P. -चरति, -रितुम्, to follow in going forth or step-<BR>ping forward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्यूह्
अनुव्यूह् अनु-व्य्-ऊह् (-वि-ऊह्), cl. 1. P. -व्य्-<BR>ऊहति, -हितुम्, to distribute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्रज्
अनुव्रज् अनु-व्रज्, cl. 1. P. -व्रजति or<BR>poet. A. -व्रजते, -जितुम्, to follow, especially a de-<BR>parting guest, as a mark of respect; to visit seriatim;<BR>to obey, do homage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्रजन|अनुव्रजनं
अनु-व्रजन, अम्, n. or अनु-व्रज्या, f. following<BR>as above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्राज्य
अनु-व्राज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be followed, as by the<BR>relatives of a dead person to the cemetery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुव्रत|अनुव्रतः
अनुव्रत अनु-व्रत, अस्, आ, अम्, devoted to,<BR>faithful to, ardently attached to; (अस्), m. a particular<BR>kind of Jaina devotee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशक्
अनुशक् अनु-शक्, Desid. Caus. P. -शिक्ष-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to teach, instruct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशिक्षिन्
अनु-शिक्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ, exercising one's self in,<BR>practising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशतिक
अनुशतिक अनु-शतिक, अस्, आ, अम्, accom-<BR>panied with or bought for a hundred (the derivative<BR>आनुशातिक has Vṛddhi in both members).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशय|अनुशयः
अनुशय अनु-शय, &c. See under अनु-शी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशर|अनुशरः
अनुशर अनु-शर, अस्, m. (rt. शॄ with अनु),<BR>a Rākṣaa, a sort of demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशस्त्र|अनुशस्त्रं
अनुशस्त्र अनु-शस्त्र, अम्, n. anything used<BR>in place of a regular surgical instrument, as a finger-<BR>nail or bambu; any subsidiary weapon or instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशास्
अनुशास् अनु-शास्, cl. 2. P. or poet. A.<BR>-शास्ति, -ते, -सितुम्, to rule, govern; to order; to<BR>teach, direct, advise, address; to punish, chastise,<BR>correct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशासक
अनु-शासक, अस्, इका, अम्, or अनु-शासिन्, ई, इनी, इ,<BR>or अनु-शास्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who governs, instructs,<BR>directs or punishes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशासत्
अनु-शासत्, त्, ती, त्, instructing, ruling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशासन|अनुशासनं
अनु-शासन, अम्, n. instruction, direction, com-<BR>mand, giving rules, order, precept, law.<BR>—अनुशासन-<BR>पर, अस्, आ, अम्, obedient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशासनीय
अनु-शासनीय or अनु-शास्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be<BR>instructed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशासित
अनु-शासित, अस्, आ, अम्, directed, governed, defined<BR>by rule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशासितृ
अनु-शासितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, ruling, governing, com-<BR>manding, directing, a ruler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशिष्ट
अनु-शिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, taught, revealed; adjudged,<BR>done conformably to law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशिष्टि|अनुशिष्टिः
अनु-शिष्टि, इस्, f. instruction, teaching, ordering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशिष्य
अनु-शिष्य, ind. part. having ruled or ordered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशिक्षिन्
अनुशिक्षिन् अनु-शिक्षिन्. See अनु-शक्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशिख
अनुशिख अनु-शिख, अस्, m., N. of a serpent<BR>which at a certain sacrifice officiated as Potṛ priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशिवम्
अनुशिवम् अनु-शिवम्, ind. after Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशिशु|अनुशिशुः
अनुशिशु अनु-शिशु, उस्, f. (an animal) fol-<BR>lowed by its young (as by a foal, &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशी
अनुशी अनु-शी, cl. 2. A. -शेते, -शयितुम्, to<BR>sleep or spend the night with, to lie along or close, to<BR>adhere closely to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशय|अनुशयः
अनु-शय, अस्, m. close connection as with a con-<BR>sequence, close attachment to any object; (in phil.)<BR>the consequence itself, the evil result of an act which<BR>clings to it and causes the soul after enjoying the<BR>temporary freedom from transmigration, which is the<BR>reward of its good deeds, to enter other bodies;<BR>repentance, regret; hatred; ancient or intense enmity;<BR>(ई), f. a disease of the feet, a boil or abscess on the<BR>upper part; also one on the head.<BR>—अनुशय-वत्,<BR>आन्, अती, अत्; see अनु-शयिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशयान
अनु-शयान, अस्, आ, अम्, repenting, regretting;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">Page0040-b+ 74</a>]<BR>(आ), f. a particular kind of heroine or female cha-<BR>racter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशयितव्य
अनु-शयितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be regretted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशयिन्
अनु-शयिन्, ई, इनी, इ, having the consequence of<BR>an act, connected as with a consequence; devotedly<BR>attached to, faithful; repentant, penitent, regretful,<BR>sorry for; hating deeply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशायिन्
अनु-शायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, adhering to, lying along or<BR>upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशीलन|अनुशीलनं
अनुशीलन अनु-शीलन, अम्, n. constant<BR>study or pursuit (of a science, &c.), repeated and<BR>devoted service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशीलित
अनु-शीलित, अस्, आ, अम्, studied carefully, attended to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशुच्
अनुशुच् अनु-शुच्, cl. 1. P. -शोचति, -चितुम्,<BR>to mourn over, regret, bewail: Caus. P. -शोचयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to mourn over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशुचिका
अनु-शुचिका, f. any ceremony enjoined by the Ve-<BR>das?. (This word, given by Wilson, is very doubtful.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशोक|अनुशोकः
अनु-शोक, अस्, m. sorrow, repentance, regret.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशोचक
अनु-शोचक, अस्, इका, अम्, grieving, one who<BR>repents; occasioning repentance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशोचन|अनुशोचनं
अनु-शोचन, अम्, n. sorrow, repentance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशोचित
अनु-शोचित, अस्, आ, अम्, regretted, repented of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशोचिन्
अनु-शोचिन्, ई, इनी, इ, penitent, regretful, sorrowful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुशोभिन्
अनुशोभिन् अनु-शोभिन्, ई, इनी, इ, shining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुश्रु
अनुश्रु अनु-श्रु, cl. 5. P. -शृणोति, -श्रोतुम्,<BR>to hear repeatedly, especially from a sacred authority:<BR>Desid. A. -शुश्रूषते, to obey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुश्रव|अनुश्रवः
अनु-श्रव, अस्, m., Vedic tradition (acquired by<BR>repeated hearing).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुश्रुत
अनु-श्रुत, अस्, आ, अम्, handed down by Vedic<BR>tradition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषञ्ज्|अनुषंज्
अनुषञ्ज् अनु-षञ्ज् (-सञ्ज्), cl. 1. A. or Pass.<BR>-षज्जते, -षज्यते, -षङ्क्तुम्, to cling to, adhere,<BR>be attached to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषक्
अनु-षक् or अनु-षट्, ind. in continuous or close<BR>order; one after the other [cf. आनु-षक्].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषक्त
अनु-षक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, closely connected with,<BR>supplied from something preceding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषङ्ग|अनुषंग|अनुषंगः|अनुषङ्गः
अनु-षङ्ग, अस्, m. close adherence, connection,<BR>association, conjunction, coalition, commixture; con-<BR>nection of word with word, or effect with causes;<BR>necessary consequence, the connection of a subsequent<BR>with a previous act; the nasals connected with certain<BR>roots ending in consonants (such as तृम्फ्); tender-<BR>ness, compassion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषङ्गिक|अनुषंगिक
अनु-षङ्गिक, अस्, ई, अम्, consequent, following<BR>as a necessary result; connected with, adhering to,<BR>inherent, concomitant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषङ्गिन्|अनुषंगिन्
अनु-षङ्गिन्, ई, इणी, इ, addicted or attached to;<BR>connected with; common, prevailing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषञ्जन|अनुषंजनं
अनु-षञ्जन, अम्, n. connection with what<BR>follows, concord; grammatical relation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषञ्जनीय
अनु-षञ्जनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be connected,<BR>supplied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषण्ड
अनुषण्ड अनुषण्ड, अस् or अम् (?), m. or<BR>n. (?), N. of a place or country (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषिच्
अनुषिच् अनु-षिच्. See अनु-सिच्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषिक्त
अनु-षिक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, re-watered or sprinkled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषेक|अनुषेकः
अनु-षेक, अस्, m. or अनु-षेचन, अम्, n. re-<BR>watering or sprinkling over again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषिध्
अनुषिध् अनु-षिध् (-सिध्), Ved., Intens.<BR>-सेषिधीति, to bring back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्टुति|अनुष्टुतिः
अनुष्टुति अनु-ष्टुति, इस्, f. (rt. स्तु), praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्टुभ्
अनुष्टुभ् 1. अनु-ष्टुभ् (-स्तुभ्), cl. 1. P.,<BR>Ved. -ष्टोभति, -भितुम्, to praise after, to follow<BR>in praising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्टुभ्
2. अनु-ष्टुभ्, प्. f. following in praise or invocation;<BR>speech; Sarasvatī; a kind of metre consisting of four<BR>Pādas or quarter-verses of eight syllables each (so<BR>called because it अनुष्टोभति follows with its praise<BR>the Gāyatrī, which consists of three Pādas); in later<BR>metrical systems, the Anuṣṭubh constitutes a whole<BR>class of metres, consisting of four times eight syllables.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">Page0040-c+ 73</a>]<BR>—अनुष्टुब्-गर्भा, f. a metre in the Vedas of the<BR>class Uṣṇih.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्टोभन
अनु-ष्टोभन, अम्, n. praising after.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ट्र
अनुष्ट्र अन्-उष्ट्र, अस्, m. no camel, i. e. a<BR>bad camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ठा
अनुष्ठा अनु-ष्ठा (-स्था), cl. 1. P. -तिष्ठति,<BR>-ष्ठातुम्, to stand near or by, to follow out, to<BR>carry out, attend to, perform, do, practise; to govern,<BR>rule, superintend; to appoint: Pass. -ष्ठीयते, to<BR>be done, to be followed: Desid. -तिष्ठासति, to be<BR>desirous of doing, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुतिष्ठमान
अनु-तिष्ठमान, अस्, आ, अम्, following, per-<BR>forming, attending to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ठ
अनु-ष्ठ, अस्, आ, अम्, standing after, i. e. in<BR>succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ठातव्य
अनु-ष्ठातव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be done or ac-<BR>complished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ठातृ
अनु-ष्ठातृ, ता, m. the undertaker of any work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ठान|अनुष्ठानं
अनु-ष्ठान, अम्, n. commencing, undertaking;<BR>doing or engaging in any work, performance, religious<BR>practice; acting in conformity to; (ई), f. performance,<BR>action.<BR>—अनुष्ठान-क्रम, अस्, m. the order of<BR>performing religious ceremonies.<BR>—अनुष्ठान-श-<BR>रीर, अम्, n. (in Sāṅkhya phil.) a body presumed<BR>to be intermediate between the लिङ्ग-शरीर or<BR>सूक्ष्म-शरीर and the स्थूल-शरीर.<BR>—अनु-<BR>ष्ठान-स्मारक, अस्, इका, अम्, reminding of re-<BR>ligious ceremonies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ठापक
अनु-ष्ठापक, अस्, इका, अम्, causing to perform.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ठापन|अनुष्ठापनं
अनु-ष्ठापन, अम्, n. the causing to perform<BR>an act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ठायिन्
अनु-ष्ठायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, doing, performing an<BR>act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ठि|अनुष्ठिः
अनु-ष्ठि, इस्, f., Ved. proper order, succession;<BR>only used in inst. अनु-ष्ठ्या.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ठित
अनु-ष्ठित, अस्, आ, अम्, done, practised; effected,<BR>executed, accomplished; followed, observed; done<BR>conformably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ठु|अनुष्ठुः
अनु-ष्ठु, उस्, f., Ved. proper order, succession;<BR>only used in inst. अनु-ष्ठुया; (उ), ind. in proper<BR>order, in regular succession, properly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ठेय
अनु-ष्ठेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be effected, done or<BR>accomplished; to be observed; to be proved or es-<BR>tablished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्ण|अनुष्णं|अनुष्णः
अनुष्ण अन्-उष्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, not hot, cold,<BR>chilly, apathetic; lazy, sluggish; (अम्), n. a blue<BR>lotus, Nymphæa Cærulea; (आ), f., N. of a river.<BR>—अनुष्ण-गु, उस्, m. (having cold rays), the moon.<BR>—अनुष्ण-वल्लिका, f., N. of a plant, Nīla-dūrbā.<BR>—अनुष्णाशीत (˚ण-अश्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, neither hot<BR>nor cold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्णक
अन्-उष्णक, अस्, आ, अम्, not hot, cold, chilly, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्यन्द|अनुष्यंदः|अनुष्यन्दः
अनुष्यन्द अनु-ष्यन्द, अस्, m. (rt. स्यन्द्),<BR>a hind-wheel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुष्वध
अनुष्वध अनु-ष्वध, अस्, आ, अम्, accom-<BR>panied by food; (अम्), ind. according to food, through<BR>food; after food; after every sacrifice; according to<BR>one's will, voluntary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसंया
अनुसंया अनु-सं-या, cl. 2. P. -याति, -तुम्,<BR>to advance against seriatim, attack one after the other.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसंरक्त
अनुसंरक्त अनु-संरक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, attached<BR>or devoted to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसंवत्सरम्
अनुसंवत्सरम् अनु-संवत्सरम्, ind. year<BR>after year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसंविचर्
अनुसंविचर् अनु-सं-वि-चर्, cl. 1. P. -चर्-<BR>अति, -रितुम्, or Ved. -रध्यै, -रितवे, -रसे, to visit<BR>successively, make the round of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसंविश्
अनुसंविश् अनु-सं-विश्, cl. 6. P. -विशति,<BR>-वेष्टुम्, to follow in retiring for sleep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसंसर्पम्
अनुसंसर्पम्, अनु-संसर्पम्, ind. at each<BR>occasion of approaching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसंसृ
अनुसंसृ अनु-सं-सृ, Caus. P. -सारयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to dismiss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0040-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसंस्मृ
अनुसंस्मृ अनु-सं-स्मृ, cl. 1. P. -स्मरति,<BR>-स्मर्तुम्, to remember, to long for (the dead or<BR>absent).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसंहितम्
अनुसंहितम् अनु-संहितम्, ind. according<BR>to the Saṃhitā text.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसङ्कल्|अनुसंकल्
अनुसङ्कल् अनु-सङ्-कल् (-सम्-कल्), cl. 10. P.<BR>-कालयति, -यितुम्, to follow in driving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसङ्क्रम्|अनुसंक्रम्
अनुसङ्क्रम् अनु-सङ्-क्रम् (-सम्-क्रम्), cl. 1.<BR>P. -क्रामति, -क्रमितुम्, to walk or go up to,<BR>to reach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसङ्ख्या|अनुसंख्या
अनुसङ्ख्या अनु-सङ्-ख्या (-सम्-ख्या), Caus.<BR>P., Ved. -ख्यापयति, -यितुम्, to show, to cause<BR>one to observe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसङ्ग्रह्|अनुसंग्रह्
अनुसङ्ग्रह् अनु-सङ्-ग्रह् (-सम्-ग्रह्), cl. 9.<BR>P. -गृह्णाति, -ग्रहीतुम्, to oblige, favour; to salute<BR>one by laying hold of the feet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसञ्चर्|अनुसंचर्
अनुसञ्चर् अनु-सञ्-चर् (-सम्-चर्), cl. 1. P.<BR>-चरति, -रितुम्, Ved. -रध्यै, -रितवे, -रसे, to<BR>walk along side, to follow, join; to visit; to pursue,<BR>seek after; to penetrate, traverse, cross; to become<BR>assimilated: Caus. P. -चारयति, -यितुम्, to join,<BR>become identified or assimilated with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसञ्चरणम्|अनुसंचरणम्
अनु-सञ्चरणम्, ind. at each occasion of coming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसञ्चिन्त्|अनुसंचिन्त्
अनुसञ्चिन्त् अनु-सञ्-चिन्त् (-सम्-चिन्त्), cl. 10.<BR>P. -चिन्तयति, -यितुम्, to meditate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसञ्ज्वर्|अनुसंज्वर्
अनुसञ्ज्वर् अनु-सञ्-ज्वर् (-सम्-ज्वर्), cl. 1.<BR>P. -ज्वरति, -रितुम्, to take after (another) in feeling<BR>distressed, to be troubled, become envious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसन्तन्|अनुसंतन्
अनुसन्तन् अनु-सन्-तन् (-सम्-तन्), cl. 8. P.<BR>-तनोति, -नितुम्, to overspread, diffuse, extend every-<BR>where, to join on, continue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसन्तॄ|अनुसंतॄ
अनुसन्तॄ अनु-सन्-तॄ (-सम्-तॄ), cl. 1. P.<BR>-तरति, -रीतुम्, Ved. -तरध्यै, to follow to the<BR>end.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसन्दह्|अनुसंदह्
अनुसन्दह् अनु-सन्-दह् (-सम्-दह्), cl. 1. P.<BR>-दहति, -दग्धुम्, to burn up along the whole<BR>length.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसन्दिश्|अनुसंदिश्
अनुसन्दिश् अनु-सन्-दिश् (-सम्-दिश्), cl. 6. P.<BR>-दिशति, -देष्टुम्, to assign, to make over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसन्दृश्|अनुसंदृश्
अनुसन्दृश् अनु-सन्-दृश् (-सम्-दृश्), cl. 1.<BR>P. -पश्यति, -द्रष्टुम्, to consider successively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसन्धा|अनुसंधा
अनुसन्धा अनु-सन्-धा (-सम्-धा), cl. 3. P.<BR>A. -दधाति, -धत्ते, -धातुम्, to explore, ascertain,<BR>inspect, plan, arrange, calm, compose, set in order,<BR>aim at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसन्धातव्य|अनुसंधातव्य
अनु-सन्धातव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be explored, to<BR>be investigated, to be looked after, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसन्धान|अनुसंधान|अनुसंधानं|अनुसन्धानं
अनु-सन्धान, अम्, n. investigation, inquiry,<BR>searching into, close inspection, setting in order, ar-<BR>ranging, planning, aiming at, plan, scheme, congruous<BR>or suitable connection; (in the Vaiśeṣika phil.) the<BR>fourth step in a syllogism, i. e. the application.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसन्धानिन्|अनुसंधानिन्
अनु-सन्धानिन् or अनु-सन्धायिन्, ई, इनी, इ,<BR>investigating, searching, skilful at concerting plans<BR>or continuing schemes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसन्धेय|अनुसंधेय
अनु-सन्धेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be investigated,<BR>worthy of inquiry or scrutiny, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसन्ध्यम्|अनुसंध्यम्
अनुसन्ध्यम् अनु-सन्ध्यम्, ind. evening<BR>after evening, every twilight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसमय|अनुसमयः
अनुसमय अनु-समय. See under अनु-<BR>सम्-इ next col.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसमश्
अनुसमश् अनु-सम्-अश्, cl. 5. A. -अश्नुते,<BR>अशितुम् or -अष्टुम्, to overtake, reach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसमस्
अनुसमस् अनु-सम्-अस्, cl. 4. P. -अस्यति,<BR>-सितुम्, to add further.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसमाचर्
