अनुसमाधा
अनुसमाधा अनु-सम्-आ-धा, cl. 3. P. A.<BR>-दधाति, -धत्ते, -धातुम्, to cilm, compose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसमाप्
अनुसमाप् अनु-सम्-आप्, Caus. P. -आपयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to complete or accomplish further or sub-<BR>sequently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसमापन|अनुसमापनं
अनु-समापन, अम्, n. regular completion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसमि
अनुसमि अनु-सम्-इ, cl. 2. P. -एति, -तुम्, to<BR>visit conjointly or successively; to join in following<BR>or being guided by; to join, become assimilated<BR>with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसमय|अनुसमयः
अनु-समय, अस्, m. regular connection (as of<BR>words).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

