अनुसमीक्ष् अनु-सम्-ईक्ष्, cl. 1. A. -ईक्षते,<BR>-क्षितुम्, to keep in view, have in view.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसमुद्रम्
अनुसमुद्रम् अनु-समुद्रम्, ind. along the<BR>sea.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

