अनुसम्प्राप्त|अनुसंप्राप्त
अनु-सम्प्राप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, arrived, come.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसम्बद्ध|अनुसंबद्ध
अनुसम्बद्ध अनु-सम्बद्ध, अस्, आ, अम् (rt.<BR>बन्ध्), connected with, accompanied by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसवनम्
अनुसवनम् अनु-सवनम्, ind., Ved. at every<BR>sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसातम्
अनुसातम् अनु-सातम्, ind. according to<BR>delight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसाम
अनुसाम अनु-साम, अस्, आ, अम्, conciliated,<BR>appeased, friendly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसायम्
अनुसायम् अनु-सायम्, ind. evening after<BR>evening, every evening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसार|अनुसारः
