अनुसिच्
अनुसिच् अनु-सिच्, cl. 6. P. -सिञ्चति, -सेक्तुम्,<BR>to water or sprinkle consecutively; (better spelt अनु-<BR>षिच्, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसीतम्
अनुसीतम् अनु-सीतम्, ind. along the furrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

