अनुसीरम् अनु-सीरम्, ind. along the plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

