अनुसूचन|अनुसूचनं
अनु-सूचन, अम्, n. pointing out, indication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसूपम्
अनुसूपम् अनु-सूपम्, ind. in every con-<BR>diment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसृ
