अनुसर|अनुसरः
अनु-सर, अस्, m. a companion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसरण|अनुसरणं
अनु-सरण, अम्, n. following, going after; con-<BR>formity to, consequence of; custom, habit, usage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसार|अनुसारः
अनु-सार, अस्, m. going after, following; custom,<BR>usage; nature, natural state or condition of anything;<BR>prevalence, currency; received or established authority,<BR>especially of codes of law; conformity to usage; con-<BR>sequence, result.<BR>—अनुसार-तस् or अनुसारेण, ind.<BR>conformably to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसारक
