अनुसार्यक|अनुसार्यकं
अनु-सार्यक, अम्, n. a fragrant substance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसृत
अनु-सृत, अस्, आ, अम्, followed, conformed to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसृति|अनुसृतिः
अनु-सृति, इस्, f. going after, following, conforming<BR>to; N. of a woman (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसृप्
अनुसृप् अनु-सृप्, cl. 1. P. -सर्पति, -सर्प्-<BR>तुम् or -स्रप्तुम्, to glide after or towards, to ap-<BR>proach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसर्प|अनुसर्पः
अनु-सर्प, अस्, m. a serpent-like being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसृष्ट
अनुसृष्ट अनु-सृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, (rt. सृज्),<BR>Ved. created in succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसेव्
अनुसेव् अनु-सेव्, cl. 1. A. -सेवते, -वितुम्,<BR>to practise, observe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

