अनुसैन्य|अनुसैन्यं
अनुसैन्य अनु-सैन्य, अम्, n. the rear of an<BR>army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसोमम्
अनुसोमम् अनु-सोमम्, ind. near the Soma,<BR>as with the Soma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्कन्दम्
अनुस्कन्दम् अनु-स्कन्दम्, ind. having gone<BR>into in succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्तरण|अनुस्तरणं
