अनुस्मृत
अनु-स्मृत, अस्, आ, अम्, remembered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्मृति|अनुस्मृतिः
अनु-स्मृति, इस्, f. cherished recollection, recalling<BR>some idea to the exclusion of all others.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0041-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्यूत
