अपक्ष
अपक्ष अ-पक्ष, अस्, आ, अम्, without wings;<BR>not on the same side or party; adverse, opposed to.<BR>—अपक्ष-ता, f. opposition, hostility.<BR>—अ-पक्ष-<BR>पात, अस्, m. impartiality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपक्षि
