अपटी
अपटी अपटी, f. a screen or wall of cloth,<BR>especially the कनात् or screen surrounding a tent.<BR>—अपटी-क्षेप or अपटा-क्षेप, अस्, m. tossing<BR>aside the curtain; अपटी-क्षेपेण, with a toss of<BR>the curtain, precipitate entrance on the stage, indi-<BR>cating hurry and agitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपटु|अपटुः
