अपत्रपिष्णु|अपत्रपिष्णुः
अप-त्रपिष्णु, उस्, उस्, उ, bashful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपत्रस्
अपत्रस् अप-त्रस्, cl. 1. 4. P. -त्रसति, -स्यति,<BR>-सितुम्, to be deterred, to be afraid of, to flee from<BR>in terror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपत्रस्त
अप-त्रस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, (with abl.) afraid of, flee-<BR>ing or retiring from in terror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपथ|अपथं|अपथः
अपथ अ-पथ, अम्, n. not a way, absence<BR>of a road, pathless state, irregularity, deviation;<BR>heresy, heterodoxy; the vulva; (अस्, आ, अम्,), path-<BR>less, roadless; (आ), f., N. of various plants.<BR>—अपथ-<BR>गामिन्, ई, इनी, इ, going by a wrong road, pursuing<BR>bad practices, heretical.<BR>—अपथ-प्रपन्न, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, out of place, in the wrong place, misapplied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपथिन्
अ-पथिन्, -न्थास्, m. absence of road, pathless<BR>state.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपथ्य|अपथ्यं
अ-पथ्य, अस्, आ, अम्, unfit; unsuitable; incon-<BR>sistent; (in medic.) unwholesome as food or drink<BR>in particular complaints.<BR>—अपथ्य-निमित्त, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, caused by unfit food or drink.<BR>—अपथ्य-भुज्,<BR>क्, क्, क्, eating what is forbidden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपद्
अपद् अ-पद्, त्, त्, त्, or आत्, आत् or अदी, आत्,<BR>Ved. footless, having no feet; going on a road which<BR>does not exist or is unknown (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपद|अपदः
अ-पद, अस्, आ, अम्, footless; having no office;<BR>(अस्), m. a reptile; (अम्), n. no place, no abode;<BR>the wrong place or time; ether.<BR>—अ-पद-रुहा<BR>or अ-पद-रोहिणी, f., N. of a parasitical plant, Epi-<BR>dendron Tesselloides.<BR>—अ-पद-स्थ, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>out of office.<BR>—अ-पदान्तर (˚द-अन्˚), अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, not separated by a foot, adjoining, contiguous;<BR>(अम्), n. proximity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदक्षिणम्
