अपदश
अपदश अप-दश, अस्, आ, अम्, (any number)<BR>off ten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदस्
अपदस् अप-दस्, cl. 4. P., Ved. -दस्यति,<BR>-सितुम्, to fail, i. e. become dry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदह्
अपदह् अप-दह्, cl. 1. P. -दहति, -दग्धुम्,<BR>to burn up, to burn out so as to drive out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदान|अपदानं
अपदान अप-दान or अप-दानक, अम्, n.<BR>(rt. दै), correct or pure conduct, approved occupa-<BR>tion; a great or noble work; work well or com-<BR>pletely done (for अवदान, q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदार्थ|अपदार्थः
