अपदेश|अपदेशः
अप-देश, अस्, m. turning away, refusal; pretence,<BR>feint, pretext, disguise, contrivance; the second step<BR>in a syllogism, according to the Vaiśeṣikas, i. e. the<BR>statement of the reason, adducing a reason or cause;<BR>a butt or mark; place, quarter; fame, reputation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदेशिन्
