अपदेश्य
अप-देश्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be shown, to be stated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपदॄ
