अपधाव्
अपधाव् अप-धाव्, cl. 1. P. -धावति,<BR>-वितुम्, to depart (from a previous statement), pre-<BR>varicate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपधूम
अपधूम अप-धूम, अस्, आ, अम्, free from<BR>smoke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपधृ
अपधृ अप-धृ, Caus. P. -धारयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to carry off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपध्मा
अपध्मा अप-ध्मा, cl. 1. P. -धमति, -ध्मा-<BR>तुम्, to blow away or off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपध्यै
अपध्यै अप-ध्यै, cl. 1. P. -ध्यायति, -ध्या-<BR>तुम्, to have a bad opinion of, to curse mentally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपध्यान|अपध्यानं
अप-ध्यान, अम्, n. evil thoughts, wickedness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपध्वंस्
अपध्वंस् अप-ध्वंस्, cl. 1. P., better A.,<BR>-ध्वंसति, -ते, -सितुम्, to scold, revile, repel; to<BR>fall away, be degraded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपध्वंस|अपध्वंसः
अप-ध्वंस, अस्, m. falling away, degradation,<BR>disgrace; concealment.<BR>—अपध्वंस-ज, अस्, m. a<BR>man of a mixed or impure caste (whose father be-<BR>longs to a lower caste than his mother's).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपध्वंसिन्
अप-ध्वंसिन्, ई, इनी, इ, causing to fall, destroy-<BR>ing, abolishing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपध्वस्त|अपध्वस्तः
अप-ध्वस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, reviled, cursed; aban-<BR>doned, pounded or pounded badly; (अस्), m. a vile<BR>wretch lost to all sense of right.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपध्वान्त|अपध्वांत
अपध्वान्त अप-ध्वान्त, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. ध्वन्),<BR>sounding wrong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपनत
अपनत अप-नत, अस्, आ, अम्, bulging out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

