अपनिद्र
अपनिद्र अप-निद्र, अस्, आ, अम्, sleepless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपनिर्वाण
अपनिर्वाण अप-निर्वाण, अस्, आ, अम्, not yet<BR>extinct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपनी
अपनी अप-नी, cl. 1. P. -नयति, -नेतुम्, to<BR>lead away or off; to rob, steal, take or drag away;<BR>to remove, frighten away; to put off or away (as<BR>garments, ornaments, or fetters); to extract, take<BR>from; to deny; to except, exclude from a rule: Desid.<BR>-निनीषति, to wish to remove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

