अप-नय, अस्, m. leading away, taking away;<BR>bad policy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपनयन|अपनयनं
