अपनीत
अप-नीत, अस्, आ, अम्, taken away, removed; paid,<BR>discharged; led away from, contradictory; badly<BR>executed, spoiled; (अम्), n. imprudent or bad be-<BR>haviour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपनेतृ
अप-नेतृ, ता, m. a remover, taking away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपनुद्
अपनुद् अप-नुद्, cl. 6. P. A. -नुदति, -ते,<BR>-नोत्तुम्, to remove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

