अपनुद
अप-नुद, अस्, आ, अम्, removing, driving away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपनुनुत्सु
