अपनोद्य
अप-नोद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be removed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपन्नगृह
