अपपात्र
अपपात्र अप-पात्र, अस्, आ, अम्, using se-<BR>parate vessels (from which no one else will eat); of<BR>low caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

