अपपॄ
अपपॄ अप-पॄ, cl. 3. P., Ved. -पिपर्ति, to<BR>take away, remove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपप्रजाता
अपप्रजाता अप-प्रजाता, f. a female that<BR>has had a miscarriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपप्रदान|अपप्रदानं
अपप्रदान अप-प्रदान, अम्, n. a bribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपप्रे
अपप्रे अप-प्रे (-प्र-इ), cl. 2. P. -प्रैति, -तुम्,<BR>to go away, to withdraw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपप्रोषित|अपप्रोषितं
