अपबर्हिस्
अपबर्हिस् अप-बर्हिस्, इस्, इस्, इस्, not having<BR>the portion constituting the Barhis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपबाध्
अपबाध् अप-बाध्, cl. 1. A. -बाधते,<BR>-धितुम्, to drive away, repel, remove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपबाहुक|अपबाहुकः
अपबाहुक अप-बाहुक, अस्, m. a bad arm,<BR>stiffness in the arm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपभय
अपभय अप-भय, अस्, आ, अम्, or अप-भी,<BR>ईस्, ईस्, इ, fearless, undaunted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0050-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपभरणी
