अपर्वक
अ-पर्वक, अस्, इका, अम्, jointless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपल|अपलं
