अपलप् अप-लप्, cl. 1. P. or poet. A.<BR>-लपति, -ते, -पितुम्, to explain away, to deny, re-<BR>fuse, conceal; to detract from slander; Caus. A.<BR>-लापयते, -यितुम्, to outwit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपलपन|अपलपनं
अप-लपन, अम्, n. or अप-लाप, अस्, m. denial<BR>or concealment of knowledge, evasion, turning off<BR>the truth, detraction; concealing, hiding; affection,<BR>regard; (in medic.) the part between the shoulder<BR>and the ribs.<BR>—अपलाप-दण्ड, अस्, m. (in law) a<BR>fine laid on one who denies his conviction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपलपित
अप-लपित, अस्, आ, अम्, denied, concealed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपलापिन्
अप-लापिन्. ई, इनी, इ, one who denies, evades;<BR>concealing (with the object in the gen. case).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपलाल
अपलाल अ-पलाल, अस्, m., N. of a Rakṣas<BR>or of a Nāga (‘not fond of flesh?’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपलाश
अपलाश अ-पलाश, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. leafless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपलाषिका
अपलाषिका अप-लाषिका or अप-लासिका, f.<BR>thirst.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपलाषिन्
अप-लाषिन्, ई, इनी, इ, or अप-लाषुक, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, thirsty; free from desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपलित
अपलित अ-पलित, अस्, आ, अम्, not grey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपलुप्
अपलुप् अप-लुप्, used in the acc. case<BR>अप-लुपम् as Ved. inf. of the verb अप-लुप्, to<BR>cut off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपल्यूलनकृत
अपल्यूलनकृत अ-पल्यूलन-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>not cleaned by cleansing substances. Some read<BR>पल्पूलन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवक्तृ
अपवक्तृ अप-वक्तृ, ता, m., Ved. speaking<BR>away, i. e. warning off, averting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवाचन|अपवाचनं
अप-वाचन, अम्, n. the act of speaking away or<BR>warning off, removing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवद्
अपवद् अप-वद्, cl. 1. P. A. -वदति, -ते,<BR>-दितुम्, to revile, abuse; (A. only) to disown, deny,<BR>contradict: Caus. -वादयति, -यितुम्, to oppose as<BR>unadvisable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवदमान
अप-वदमान, अस्, आ, अम्, (with dat.) reviling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवदितृ
अप-वदितृ. See अप-वक्तृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवाद|अपवादः
अप-वाद, अस्, m. evil speaking, reviling, blam-<BR>ing (with the gen.); denial, refutation, contradiction;<BR>a special rule setting aside a general one; exception<BR>(opposed to उत्सर्ग); order, command.<BR>—अपवाद-<BR>प्रत्यय, अस्, m. an exceptional affix.<BR>—अपवाद-<BR>स्थल, अम्, n. case for a special rule or exception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवादक
अप-वादक, अस्, इका, अम्, or अप-वादिन्, ई, इनी,<BR>इ, reviling, blaming, defaming; opposing, objecting<BR>to; excepting, excluding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवादित
अप-वादित, अस्, आ, अम्, blamed, censured; opposed,<BR>objected to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवाद्य
अप-वाद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be censured; to be<BR>excepted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवध्
अपवध् अप-वध् (defective in most of its<BR>tenses, see वध्), to repel, avert.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवन|अपवनं
अपवन 1. अ-पवन, अस्, आ, अम्, without air,<BR>sheltered from wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवन|अपवनं
अपवन 2. अप-वन, अम्, n. a grove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवरक|अपवरकः
अपवरक अप-वरक, अप-वरण, अप-<BR>वारण. See अप-वृ below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्ग|अपवर्गः
अपवर्ग अप-वर्ग, अप-वर्जित. See अप-<BR>वृजि below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्त|अपवर्तः|अपवर्त्त
अपवर्त अप-वर्त, &c. See under अप-वृत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवह्
अपवह् अप-वह्, cl. 1. P. -वहति, -वोढुम्,<BR>to carry off; to deduct: Caus. P. -वाहयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to have (something) carried off or taken away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवाह|अपवाहः
अप-वाह, अस्, m. or अप-वाहङ, अम्, n. de-<BR>duction, subtraction (of fractions); N. of a metre;<BR>N. of a people.<BR>.अप-वाह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be carried away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपोढ
अपोढ. See s. v., p. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवाद|अपवादः
अपवाद अप-वाद, &c. See अप-वद् above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवास|अपवासः
अपवास अप-वास, अस्, m. (rt. वस्), Ved. dis-<BR>appearace, going away, vanishing; N. of a plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपविक्षत
अपविक्षत अप-विक्षत, अस्, आ, अम्, un-<BR>wounded; unviolated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपविघ्न
अपविघ्न अप-विघ्न, अस्, आ, अम्, unob-<BR>structed, unimpeded; (अम्), ind. free from obstruc-<BR>tion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवित्र|अपवित्रं
अपवित्र अ-पवित्र, अस्, आ, अम्, impure, un-<BR>clean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपविद्ध|अपविद्धः
अपविद्ध अप-विद्ध and अप-वेध. See<BR>अप-व्यध्, p. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपविष
अपविष अप-विष, अस्, आ, अम्, free from<BR>poison; (आ), f. a species of grass, Kyllingia Mono-<BR>cephala.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपविष्णु
अपविष्णु अप-विष्णु, ind. except or with-<BR>out Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवीण
अपवीण अप-वीण, अस्, आ, अम्, having a bad<BR>or no lute; (आ), f. a bad lute; (अम्), ind. without<BR>a lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवीरवत्|अपवीरवन्त्
अपवीरवत् अ-पवीर-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved.<BR>not armed with a lance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवृ
अपवृ अप-वृ, cl. 5. P. -वृणोति, -वरितुम्,<BR>रीतुम्, to open, uncover, exhibit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवरक|अपवरकः
अप-वरक, अस्, m. an inner apartment, the lying-<BR>in chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवरण|अपवरणं
अप-वरण, अम्, n. covering, screening; gar-<BR>ment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवारण|अपवारणं
अप-वारण, अम्, n. covering, concealment, dis-<BR>appearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवारित|अपवारितं
अप-वारित, अस्, आ, अम्, covered, concealed, dis-<BR>appeared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवारितक
अप-वारितक, अम्, n. concealed, secret manner;<BR>अपवारितकेन, (in theatrical language) apart, aside<BR>(speaking so that only the addressed person may<BR>hear; opposed to प्रकाशम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवार्य|अपवार्य्य
अप-वार्य, ind. apart, aside; having concealed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवृत
अप-वृत, अस्, आ, अम्, uncovered, opened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवृति|अपवृतिः
अप-वृति, इस्, f. uncovering; concealing (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवृज्
अपवृज् अप-वृज्, Caus. P. -वर्जयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to quit, get rid of, to pay, to fulfil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्ग|अपवर्गः
अप-वर्ग, अस्, m. completion, end (e. g. पञ्चा-<BR>पवर्ग, coming to an end in five days); exception<BR>(to a rule); gift, donation; the emancipation of the<BR>soul from the body and exemption from further<BR>transmigration; final beatitude.<BR>—अपवर्ग-द, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, conferring final beatitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्जन|अपवर्जनं|अपवर्ज्जन|अपवर्ज्जनं
अप-वर्जन, अम्, n. abandoning, abandonment;<BR>gift or donation, making good a promise, discharging<BR>a debt or obligation; final emancipation or beati-<BR>tude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्जनीय
अप-वर्जनीय, or अप-वृज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be<BR>abandoned, to be avoided.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्जित|अपवर्ज्जित
अप-वर्जित, अस्, आ, अम्, abandoned, quitted, got<BR>rid of, given or cast away; made good as a promise,<BR>discharged as a debt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0052-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्ज्य
अप-वर्ज्य, ind. excepting, except.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवृक्त
अप-वृक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, finished, completed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवृक्ति|अपवृक्तिः
अप-वृक्ति, इस्, f. fulfilment, completion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवृत्
अपवृत् अप-वृत्, cl. 1. A. -वर्तते, -तितुम्,<BR>to turn away, depart; to turn back, to come to an<BR>end.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्त|अपवर्तः|अपवर्त्त
अप-वर्त, अस्, m. taking away; (in arithmetic<BR>or algebra) reduction to a common measure; the<BR>divisor, which is applied to both or either of the<BR>quantities of an equation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्तक|अपवर्तकः
अप-वर्तक, अस्, m. a common measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्तन|अपवर्तनं|अपवर्त्तन
अप-वर्तन, अम्, n. taking away; removal;<BR>transferring from one place to another; abbreviation,<BR>abridging; reduction of a fraction to its lowest terms;<BR>division without remainder; divisor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवर्तित
अप-वर्तित, अस्, आ, अम्, taken away; removed;<BR>divided by a common measure without remainder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवृत्त
अप-वृत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, reversed, inverted, over-<BR>turned; ended; (अम्), n. ecliptic (in astronomy).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवृत्ति|अपवृत्तिः
अप-वृत्ति, इस्, f. end.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपव्यध्
अपव्यध् अप-व्यध्, cl. 4. P. -विध्यति,<BR>-व्यद्धुम्, to pierce badly, to throw away, to<BR>neglect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपविद्ध|अपविद्धः
अप-विद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, pierced; thrown away, re-<BR>jected, dismissed, removed.<BR>—अपविद्ध-पुत्र, अस्,<BR>m. a son rejected by his natural parents and adopted<BR>by a stranger; one of the twelve objects of filiation in<BR>law.<BR>—अपविद्ध-लोक, अस्, आ, अम्, dead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपवेध|अपवेधः
अप-वेध, अस्, m. piercing anything in the wrong<BR>direction or manner (spoiling a jewel by so piercing<BR>it).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपव्यय|अपव्ययः
अपव्यय अप-व्यय, अस्, m. (rt. इ with अप<BR>and वि), prodigality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपव्ययत्
अप-व्ययत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, going away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपव्ययमान
अप-व्ययमान, अस्, आ, अम्, squandering; deny-<BR>ing a debt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपव्ययिन्
अप-व्ययिन्, ई, इनी, इ, squandering, wasting, pro-<BR>digal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपव्यादा
अपव्यादा अप-व्य्-आ-दा (-वि-आ-दा), cl. 3. P.<BR>-ददाति, -दातुम्, to open.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपव्रत
अपव्रत अप-व्रत, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. dis-<BR>obedient, unfaithful; not performing holy acts, irre-<BR>ligious; perverse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपशकुन|अपशकुनं
अपशकुन अप-शकुन, अम्, n. a bad omen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपशङ्क|अपशंक
अपशङ्क अप-शङ्क, अस्, आ, अम्, fearless,<BR>having no fear or hesitation; (अम्), ind. fearlessly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपशद|अपशदः
अपशद अप-शद or अप-सद, अस्, m. a<BR>low man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपशब्द|अपशब्दः
अपशब्द अप-शब्द, अस्, m. common or<BR>vulgar speech; a bad word; any form of language<BR>not Sanskrit^1; ungrammatical language. See अप-<BR>भ्रंश.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20180314. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/Cologne/issues/215. note: Not a Sanskrit word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपशम|अपशमः
अपशम अप-शम, अस्, m. cessation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपशिरस्
अपशिरस् अप-शिरस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, or अप-शिर्-<BR>ष, अस्, आ, अम्, or अप-शीर्षन्, आ, आ, अ, headless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपशु|अपशुः
अपशु अ-पशु, उस्, m. not cattle; (उस्, उस्, उ),<BR>deprived of cattle, poor.<BR>—अ-पशु-हन्, हा, घ्नी, ह,<BR>not killing cattle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपशुच्
अपशुच् 1. अप-शुच्, Intens. P., Ved. -शो-<BR>शोक्ति, to disappear, vanish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपशुच्
2. अप-शुच्, क्, m. (without sorrow), the soul.<BR>अप — शोक, अस्, आ, अम्, sorrowless; (अस्), m. a tree,<BR>Jonesia Aśoka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपश्चादघ्वन्
अपश्चादघ्वन् अ-पश्चा-दघ्वन् or अ-पश्चाद्-<BR>दघ्वन्, आ, m., Ved. not staying behind; not<BR>coming short of, not being a loser.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपश्चिम
अपश्चिम अ-पश्चिम, अस्, आ, अम्, not having<BR>another in the rear, last; having no end.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपश्य
अपश्य अ-पश्य, अस्, आ, अम् Ved., or अ-पश्यत्,<BR>-अन्, अन्ती, अत्, not seeing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपश्यना
अ-पश्यना, f. not seeing (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपश्रय|अपश्रयः
अपश्रय अप-श्रय, अस्, m., Ved. a bolster;<BR>see उप-श्रय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपश्री
अपश्री अप-श्री, ईस्, इ, deprived of beauty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपश्वास|अपश्वासः
अपश्वास अप-श्वास, अस्, m. one of the five<BR>vital airs; see अपान.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपष्ठ|अपष्ठं
अपष्ठ अप-ष्ठ, अम्, n. (rt. स्था), the end<BR>or point of the hook for driving an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपष्ठु|अपष्ठुः
अप-ष्ठु, उस्, उस्, उ, contrary, opposite; per-<BR>verse; left; (उ), ind. contrary, perversely, badly;<BR>well, properly; handsomely; (उस्), m. time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपष्ठुर|अपष्ठुरं
अप-ष्ठुर or अप-ष्ठुल, अस्, आ, अम्, oppo-<BR>site, contrary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्
अपस् अपस्, अस्, n. (fr. obs. rt. अप्), Ved.<BR>work, action; sacred act, sacrificial act; water; (आस्),<BR>m. f. (असस्), m. f. pl., Ved. active, skilful in any art:<BR>अपसस्, f. pl., is a name of the hands and fingers<BR>which are busy in kindling the sacred fire and in<BR>performing the sacrifices; also a name of the three<BR>goddesses of sacred speech, or of the three divinities,<BR>fire, wind, and sun; also of the active or running<BR>waters [cf. Lat. opus].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्तम
अपस्-तम, अस्, आ, अम् (superl.), Ved. most active<BR>or rapid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्य
1. अपस्य, अस्, आ, अम्, active, fit for an act, running<BR>away; watery; (आ), f. a kind of brick (twenty are<BR>used in building the sacrificial altar); activity; water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्य
2. अपस्य, nom. P. अपस्यति, to be active.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्यु
अपस्यु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. active.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसद|अपसदः
अपसद अप-सद, अस्, m. the children of<BR>six degrading connections, viz. of a Brāhman with<BR>the women of the three lower classes, of a Kṣatriya<BR>with women of the two lower, and of a Vaiśya with<BR>one of the Sūdra; a low man; an outcast (in this<BR>sense generally as last member of a comp., e. g.<BR>ब्राह्मणापसद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसमम्
अपसमम् अप-समम्, ind. last year (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसर्जन|अपसर्जनं|अपसर्ज्जन|अपसर्ज्जनं
अपसर्जन अप-सर्जन, अम्, n. (rt. सृज्),<BR>abandonment; gift or donation; final emancipation<BR>of the soul [cf. अप-वृज्].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसलवि
अपसलवि अप-सलवि, ind., Ved. to the<BR>left (opposed to प्र-सलवि); the space between the<BR>thumb and the forefinger (sacred to the Manes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसव्य|अपसव्यं|अपसव्यः
अपसव्य अप-सव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, or अप-<BR>सव्यक, अस्, इका, अम्, not on the left side, right;<BR>opposite, contrary; (अम्), ind. to the right; the<BR>same as अप-सलवि.<BR>—अपसव्यं कृ = प्रदक्-<BR>षिणं कृ, to circumambulate a person keeping<BR>the right side towards him; to put the sacred cord<BR>on the right shoulder.<BR>—अपसव्य-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>having the sacred thread worn on the right shoulder,<BR>(as during a Śrāddha, &c.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसिद्धान्त|अपसिद्धांतः|अपसिद्धान्तः
अपसिद्धान्त अप-सिद्धान्त, अस्, m. (rt. 1.<BR>सिध्), an erroneous conclusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसिध्
अपसिध् अप-सिध्, cl. 1. P. -सेधति, -सेद्-<BR>धुम्, -सेधितुम्, to ward off, remove, drive away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसृ
अपसृ अप-सृ, cl. 1. P. -सरति, -सर्तुम्, to<BR>walk off, go away: Caus. -सारयति, -यितुम्, to make<BR>or let one go away, to remove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसर|अपसरः
अप-सर, अस्, m. excuse, apology.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसरण|अपसरणं
अप-सरण, अम्, n. going away. retreating;<BR>egress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसार|अपसारः
अप-सार, अस्, m. going out; egress, passage for<BR>going forth; escape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसारण|अपसारणं
अप-सारण, अम्, n. removing to a distance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसारित
अप-सारित, अस्, आ, अम्, removed, put away,<BR>thrown aside.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसृप्
अपसृप् अप-सृप्, cl. 1. P. -सर्पति, -सर्प्-<BR>तुम्, -स्रप्तुम्, to glide or move off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसर्प|अपसर्पः
अप-सर्प or अप-सर्पक, अस्, m. a secret emis-<BR>sary or agent, spy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसर्पण|अपसर्पणं
अप-सर्पण, अम्, n. going back, retreating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपसृप्ति|अपसृप्तिः
अप-सृप्ति, इस्, f. going away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्कम्भ|अपस्कंभः|अपस्कम्भः
अपस्कम्भ अप-स्कम्भ, अस्, m. Ved. fasten-<BR>ing, making firm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्कर|अपस्करः
अपस्कर अप-स्कर, अस्, m. any part of a<BR>carriage, a wheel, &c.; fæces; anus; vulva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्कार|अपस्कारः
अप-स्कार, अस्, m. the root or under part of the<BR>knee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्खल|अपस्खलः
अपस्खल अप-स्खल, अस्, m. leaping off,<BR>jumping off; outside of a threshing floor (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्तम
अपस्तम अपस्-तम. See under अपस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्तम्भ|अपस्तंभः|अपस्तम्भः
अपस्तम्भ अप-स्तम्भ, अस्, m. a vessel in<BR>the side of the breast containing vital air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्तम्भिनी
अप-स्तम्भिनी, f., N. of a plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्नात|अपस्नातः
अपस्नात अप-स्नात, अस्, आ, अम्, bathed or<BR>bathing after death or mourning, or upon the death of<BR>a connection, preparatory to other ceremonies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्नान|अपस्नानं
अप-स्नान, अम्, n. funeral bathing, upon the<BR>death of a connection, after mourning, &c.; impure<BR>bathing, or bathing in water in which a person has<BR>previously washed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्पति|अपस्पतिः
अपस्पति अपस्-पति, इस्, m., N. of a son of<BR>Uttānapāda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्पृश्
अपस्पृश् 1. अप-स्पृश्, cl. 6. P. -स्पृशति,<BR>-स्पर्ष्टुम्, -स्प्रष्टुम्, to touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्पर्श
अप-स्पर्श, अस्, आ, अम्, having no touch, insen-<BR>sible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्पृश्
2. अप-स्पृश्, क्, क्, क्, Ved. not letting one's self<BR>be touched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्पृश्
अपस्पृश् 3. अ-पस्पृश्, क्, क्, क्, Ved. not<BR>touching, not hurting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्फिग
अपस्फिग अप-स्फिग, अस्, आ, अम्, one who<BR>has badly formed buttocks; (अम्), ind. except the<BR>buttocks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्फुर्
अपस्फुर् अप-स्फुर्, ऊस्, ऊस्, ऊस्, or अप-<BR>स्फुर, अस्, आ, अम्, or अप-स्फुरत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्<BR>Ved. bounding or bursting forth, swelling, increasing.<BR>According to native authorities, both अप-स्फुर<BR>and अप-स्फुरत् may mean ‘injured.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्मार|अपस्मारः
अपस्मार अप-स्मार, अस्, m. or अप-स्मृति,<BR>इस्, f. forgetfulness; epilepsy, falling sickness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्मारिन्
अप-स्मारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, epileptic, convulsed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्मृति|अपस्मृतिः
अप-स्मृति, इस्, इस्, इ, forgetful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्य
अपस्य अपस्य, अपस्यु. See under अपस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपस्वर|अपस्वरः
अपस्वर अप-स्वर, अस्, m. an unmusical<BR>note or sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहन्
अपहन् अप-हन्, cl. 2. P. -हन्ति, -तुम्, to<BR>beat off, ward off, repel, destroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपह
अप-ह, अस्, आ, अम्, keeping back, repelling, re-<BR>moving, destroying (e. g. शोकापह, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>removing sorrow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहत
अप-हत, अस्, आ, अम्, destroyed, warded off, killed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहति|अपहतिः
अप-हति, इस्, f. removing, destroying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहनन|अपहननं
अप-हनन, अम्, n. or अप-घात (q. v.), ward-<BR>ing off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहन्तृ
अप-हन्तृ, ता, m. beating off, destroying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपघातिन्
अप-घातिन्, अप-जिघांसु. See s. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहल
अपहल अप-हल, अस्, आ, अम्, having a bad<BR>plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहस्
अपहस् अप-हस्, cl. 1. P. -हसति, -सितुम्,<BR>to deride: Caus. P. -हासयति, -यितुम्, to deride,<BR>ridicule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहसित|अपहसितं
अप-हसित, अम्, n. or अप-हास, अस्, m. silly or<BR>causeless laughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहास्य
अप-हास्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be laughed at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहस्त|अपहस्तः
अपहस्त अप-हस्त, अम्, n. taking or throw-<BR>ing away or off; stealing, plundering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहस्तय
अप-हस्तय, nom. P. अप-हस्तयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to throw away, lose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहस्तित
अप-हस्तित, अस्, आ, अम्, thrown away, lost, parted<BR>with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहा
अपहा 1. अप-हा, cl. 3. A. -जिहीते, -हातुम्,<BR>to go off, come to an end.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0053-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहा
अपहा 2. अप-हा, cl. 3. P. -जहाति, -हातुम्,<BR>to leave, abandon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहान|अपहानं
अप-हान, अस्, आ, अम् (or fr. 1. अप-हा?), leaving,<BR>abandoning; also written अप-हायन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहानि|अपहानिः
अप-हानि, इस्, f. leaving; leaving off, abandonment,<BR>stopping, vanishing; exception, exclusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहाय
अप-हाय, ind. leaving out of view, excepting,<BR>except, besides.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहिङ्कार|अपहिंकार
अपहिङ्कार अप-हिङ्-कार, अस्, आ, अम्, without<BR>the syllable हिम्, which is pronounced in singing the<BR>Sāma verses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहृ
अपहृ अप-हृ, cl. 1. P. A. (?) -हरति, -ते,<BR>-हर्तुम्, to snatch away, carry off, plunder; to re-<BR>move, to throw away: Caus. -हारयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to have (anything) carried off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहरण|अपहरणं
अप-हरण, अम्, n. taking away, carrying off;<BR>stealing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहरणीय
अप-हरणीय or अप-हर्तव्य or अप-हार्य,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, to be taken away, carried off, stolen, &c.;<BR>to be taken back or resumed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहर्तृ|अपहर्त्तृ
अप-हर्तृ, ता, m. (with gen. or acc.) taking<BR>away; expiating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहार|अपहारः
अप-हार, अस्, m. taking away, stealing; spending<BR>another person's property; secreting, concealment;<BR>e. g. आत्मापहारं कृ, to conceal one's real cha-<BR>racter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहारक|अपहारकः
अप-हारक, अस्, इका, अम्, or अप-हारिन्, ई, इणी,<BR>इ, one who takes away, seizes, steals, &c.; a plun-<BR>derer, a thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहारण
अप-हारण, अम्, n. causing to take away, spoiling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहृत
अप-हृत, अस्, आ, अम्, taken away, carried off,<BR>stolen, &c.; taken back, resumed.<BR>—अपहृत-वि-<BR>ज्ञान, अस्, आ, अम्, bereft of sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपहेला
अपहेला अप-हेला, f. disrespect, contempt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपह्नु
अपह्नु अप-ह्नु, cl. 2. A. -ह्नुते, -ह्नोतुम्,<BR>to conceal, disguise; to refuse, deny, disown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपह्नव|अपह्नवः
अप-ह्नव, अस्, m. concealment of knowledge;<BR>denial of or turning off of the truth; dissimulation;<BR>appeasing, satisfying; affection, love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपह्नुत
अप-ह्नुत, अस्, आ, अम्, concealed, denied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपह्नुति|अपह्नुतिः
अप-ह्नुति, इस्, f. denial, concealment of know-<BR>ledge; a figure of rhetoric, applying a description or<BR>simile to other than its obvious application.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपह्नुवान
अप-ह्नुवान, अस्, आ, अम्, concealing, denying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपह्नोतृ
अप-ह्नोतृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who conceals or<BR>denies or disowns.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपह्रास|अपह्रासः
अपह्रास अप-ह्रास, अस्, m. diminishing,<BR>reducing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाक्
अपाक् अपाक्, ind. westward, southward;<BR>see अपाच् next col.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाक|अपाकः
अपाक 1. अपाक, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. अप), situated<BR>aside or behind; distant; coming from a distant<BR>place; incomparable.<BR>—अपाक-चक्षस्, आस्, m., Ved.<BR>looking or shining far; of incomparable brightness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाका
अपाका or अपाकात्, ind., Ved. aside, distant.<BR>—अपा-<BR>के-स्थ, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. standing behind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाक्तात्
अपाक्तात्, ind., Ved. from behind, from the west.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपपाक
अपपाक 2. अ-पाक, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. पच्), im-<BR>mature, raw, unripe, undigested; (अस्), m. immaturity,<BR>indigestion.<BR>—अ-पाक-ज, अस्, आ, अम्, not produced<BR>by cooking or ripening; original; natural.<BR>—अपाक-<BR>शाक, अम्, n. ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाकिन्
अ-पाकिन्, ई, इनी, इ, unripe, undigested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाकृ
अपाकृ अपा-कृ (अप-आ˚), cl. 8. P. A. -करोति,<BR>-कुरुते, -कर्तुम्, or Ved. -कर्तोस्, to remove,<BR>drive away, keep away; to take away; to reject (an<BR>opinion); to cast off, reject; to desist from, to drop;<BR>to free one's self from; to pay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाकरण|अपाकरणं
अपा-करण, अम्, n. driving away, removal; pay-<BR>ment, liquidation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाकरिष्णु
अपा-करिष्णु, उस्, उस्, उ, driving away; excelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाकर्मन्|अपाकर्म्मन्
अपा-कर्मन्, अ, n. payment, liquidation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाकृत
अपा-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, taken away, removed, de-<BR>stroyed, void of; paid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाकृति|अपाकृतिः
अपा-कृति, इस्, f. taking away, removal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाकृष्
अपाकृष् अपा-कृष् (अप-आ˚), cl. 1. 6. P. A.<BR>-कर्षति, -ते, -कृषति, -ते, -कर्ष्टुम्, -क्रष्टुम्,<BR>to turn off or away, to avert.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाकॄ
अपाकॄ अपा-कॄ (अप-आ˚), cl. 6. P. -किरति,<BR>-करितुम्, -रीतुम्, to throw any one off; to abandon<BR>to contemn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाक्रम्
अपाक्रम् अपा-क्रम् (अप-आ˚), cl. 1. P. poet.<BR>A. -क्रामति, -क्रमते, -क्रमितुम्, to retire from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाक्ष|अपाक्षं
अपाक्ष अपाक्ष (अप-अक्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, pre-<BR>sent, perceptible; (अस्, ई, अम्), eyeless, having bad<BR>eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाङ्क्त|अपांक्त
अपाङ्क्त अ-पाङ्क्त or अ-पाङ्क्तेय or अ-<BR>पाङ्क्त्य, अस्, आ, अम्, not in a line or row; not in<BR>the same degree or class, unworthy, inadmissible into<BR>society, ejected from caste, excluded, outcast.<BR>—अ-<BR>पाङ्क्त्योपहत (˚य-उप्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, defiled or<BR>contaminated by the presence of impure or improper<BR>persons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाङ्ग|अपांग|अपाङ्गः
अपाङ्ग अपाङ्ग (अप-अङ्˚) or अपाङ्गक, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, maimed, crippled; wanting or deformed in<BR>some limb; (अस्), m. the outer corner of the eye<BR>(sometimes as last member of a feminine comp. ending<BR>in आ or ई); a sectarial mark or circlet on the forehead;<BR>N. of Kāma, the god of love; a plant, Achyranthes<BR>Aspera.<BR>—अपाङ्ग-दर्शन, अम्, n. a side glance, a<BR>leer, a wink.<BR>—अपाङ्ग-देश, अस्, m. the place round<BR>the outer corner of the eye.<BR>—अपाङ्ग-नेत्र, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, having eyes with beautiful outer angles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाच्
अपाच् अपाच् or अपाञ्च्, ङ्, ची, क् (fr. अञ्च् with<BR>अप), going or situated backwards, behind; western<BR>(opposed to प्राञ्च्); southern (opposed to उदञ्च्);<BR>(क्), ind. behind, westward, southward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाची
अपाची, f. the south.<BR>—अपाचीतरा (˚ची-इत्˚), f. the<BR>north, i. e. other than the south.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाचीन|अपाचीनं
अपाचीन, अस्, आ, अम्, situated backwards, behind;<BR>western; turned back; southern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाच्य|अपाच्यं
अपाच्य, अस्, आ, अम्, western, southern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाज्
अपाज् अपाज् (अप-अज्), cl. 1. P. अपाजति,<BR>जितुम्, to drive away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाञ्च्|अपांच्
अपाञ्च् अपाञ्च् (अप-अञ्च्), cl. 1. P. A. अपाञ्च्-<BR>अति, -ते, -चितुम्, to push away, to drive away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाटव|अपाटवं
अपाटव अ-पाटव, अम्, n. awkwardness,<BR>inelegance; sickness, disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाठ्य
अपाठ्य अ-पाठ्य, अस्, आ, अम्, illegible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाणिग्रहण
अपाणिग्रहण अ-पाणिग्रहण, अम्, n. ce-<BR>libacy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाणिपाद
अ-पाणि-पाद, अस्, आ, अम्, without hands and feet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपात्र|अपात्रं
अपात्र अ-पात्र, अम्, n. a worthless or<BR>common utensil; an inferior, undeserving or worthless<BR>person, unfit as a recipient, unworthy to receive gifts.<BR>—अ-पात्र-कृत्या, f. or अ-पात्रि-करण, अम्, n.<BR>acting unbecomingly, doing degrading offices (as for<BR>a Brāhman to receive wealth improperly acquired,<BR>to trade, to serve a Śūdra, and to utter an untruth);<BR>excommunication, disqualification.<BR>—अपात्र-दायिन्,<BR>ई, इनी, इ. giving to the undeserving.<BR>—अपात्र-भृत्,<BR>त्, त्, त्, supporting the unworthy, cherishing the un-<BR>deserving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाद्
अपाद् अ-पाद्, footless. See अपद्, p. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाद्य
अ-पाद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, anything (as water) unfit for<BR>the feet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपादा
अपादा अपा-दा (अप-आ˚), cl. 3. A. -दत्ते,<BR>दातुम्, to take off or away, to remove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपादान|अपादानं
अपा-दान, अम्, n. taking away, removal, ablation;<BR>a thing from which another thing is removed; the<BR>sense of the fifth or ablative case.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपादादिभाज्
अपादादिभाज् अ-पादादि-भाज् (˚द-आद्˚), क्,<BR>क्, क्, not standing at the beginning of a Pāda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपादान्तीय
अ-पादान्तीय, अस्, आ, अम्, not standing at the end<BR>of a Pāda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाध्वन्
अपाध्वन् अपाध्वन् (अप-अध्˚), आ, m. a bad<BR>road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपान्
अपान् अपान् (अप-अन्), cl. 2. A. अपानिति,<BR>नितुम्, to breathe out or away, to expire, respire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपान|अपानं|अपानः
अपान, अस्, m. expiration, breathing out (opposed<BR>to प्राण); that of the five vital airs which goes<BR>downwards and out at the anus; (अम्), n. the anus;<BR>ventris crepitus.<BR>—अपान-दा, आस्, m. Ved. giving<BR>the vital air Apāna.<BR>—अपन-द्वार, अम्, n. the<BR>anus.<BR>—अपान-पवन, अस्, m. the vital air Apāna.<BR>—अपान-पा, आस्, m., Ved. protecting the Apāna.<BR>—अपान-भृत्, त्, f. cherishing the vital air, a sacri-<BR>ficial brick.<BR>—अपान-वायु, उस्, m. the air Apāna;<BR>ventris crepitus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपानुद्
अपानुद् अपा-नुद् (अप-आ˚), cl. 6. P. A.<BR>-नुदति, -ते, -नोत्तुम्, to remove, repel, repudiate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपानृत
अपानृत अपानृत (˚प-अन्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, free<BR>from falsehood, true.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपान्नपात्|अपांनपात्
अपान्नपात् अपान्-नपात् or अपं-नपात्, &c.<BR>See under अप्, p. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाप|अपापः
अपाप अ-पाप, अस्, आ, अम्, or अ-पापिन्, ई, इनी, इ,<BR>sinless, virtuous, pure.<BR>—अ-पाप-काशिन्, ई, इनी, इ, not<BR>ill-looking; not revealing evil.<BR>—अ-पाप-कृत्, त्, त्, त्,<BR>not committing sin.<BR>—अ-पाप-वस्यस, अम्, n., Ved.<BR>non-increase of evil; health, prosperity.<BR>—अ-पाप-<BR>विद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, not afflicted with evil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाम्
अपाम् अपाम्. See under अप्, p. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपामार्ग|अपामार्गः
अपामार्ग अपा-मार्ग, अस्, m. (rt. मृज्), N.<BR>of a plant (Achyranthes Aspera), employed very often<BR>in incantations, in medicine, in washing linen, and in<BR>sacrifices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपामार्जन|अपामार्जनं
अपा-मार्जन, अम्, n. cleansing, keeping back,<BR>removing (of diseases and other evils).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपामृत्यु
अपामृत्यु अपा-मृत्यु, उस्, m. sudden death;<BR>see अप-मृत्यु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाय|अपायः
अपाय अपाय. See under अपे.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपार्
अपार् अपार् (अप-ऋ), cl. 5. P. अपार्णोति,<BR>अपार्तुम्, -रितुम् or -रीतुम् (?), to remove; to open.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपार|अपारं|अपारः
अपार 1. अपार, अम्, n. the opposite bank<BR>of a river; the same as पार, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपार|अपारं|अपारः
अपार 2. अ-पार, अम्, n. (in the Sāṅkhya)<BR>a bad shore, i. e. a kind of mental indifference or ac-<BR>quiescence (तुष्टि); it may also mean the reverse of<BR>पार or of पारपार, i. e. the reverse of mental ac-<BR>quiescence; (अस्, आ, अम्), shoreless, unbounded, bound-<BR>less, interminable; an epithet of heaven and earth;<BR>out of reach; inexhaustible.<BR>—अ-पारपार, अम्, n.<BR>non-acquiescence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपारक
अ-पारक, अस्, इका, अम्, or अ-पारयत्, अन्, अन्ती,<BR>अत्, incompetent, impotent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपारणीय
अ-पारणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, out of reach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपारमार्थिक
अपारमार्थिक अ-पारमार्थिक, अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>not concerned about the highest truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपार्छ्
अपार्छ् अपार्छ् (अप-ऋछ्), cl. 6. P. अपार्च्छ्-<BR>अति, -छितुम्, to go away, retire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपार्जित
अपार्जित अपार्जित, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. ऋज् with<BR>अप), flung away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपार्ण
अपार्ण अपार्ण, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. अर्द्), distant,<BR>far.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपार्थ
अपार्थ अपार्थ (अप-अर्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, or<BR>अपार्थक, अस्, इका, अम्, without any object, useless,<BR>unprofitable; unmeaning; (अम्), n. incoherent argu-<BR>ment.<BR>—अपार्थ-करण, अम्, n. a false plea in a<BR>lawsuit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाल
अपाल अ-पाल or अ-पालन or अ-पालित, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, unguarded, unprotected, undefended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपालङ्क|अपालंकः|अपालङ्कः
अपालङ्क अपालङ्क, अस्, m., N. of a plant,<BR>Cassia Fistula.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपालम्ब|अपालंबः|अपालम्बः
अपालम्ब अपा-लम्ब, अस्, m., Ved. the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">Page0055-a+ 72</a>]<BR>hinder part of a carriage; mechanism to stop a<BR>carriage (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपालि
अपालि अपालि (अप-अलि˚), इस्, इस्, इ, free from<BR>अलि or bees, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपावृ
अपावृ अपा-वृ (अप-आ˚), cl. 5. P., Ved.<BR>-वृणोति, -वरितुम्, -रीतुम्, to open; to cover; (in the<BR>first sense अपावृ is said to be for अप-वृ, the final<BR>of अप being lengthened.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपावृत|अपावृतं
अपा-वृत, अस्, आ, अम्, open, laid open; covered,<BR>concealed, enclosed; unrestrained, self-willed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपावृति|अपावृतिः
अपा-वृति, इस्, f. or अपा-वरण, अम्, n. laying<BR>open, enclosing, surrounding; covering, concealing,<BR>screening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपावृत्
अपावृत् अपा-वृत् (अप-आ˚), cl. 1. A. -वर्तते,<BR>-तितुम्, to turn away, to return, to abstain from, to<BR>come to nought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपावर्तन|अपावर्तनं|अपावर्त्तन
अपा-वर्तन, अम्, n. turning away or from; re-<BR>treat, returning; repulse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपावृत्
अपा-वृत्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. returning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपावृत्त|अपावृत्तं
अपा-वृत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, (with abl.) turned away<BR>from; averted; abstaining from, rejecting, despising;<BR>reversed, repelled; (अम्), n. the rolling on the ground<BR>(of a horse).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपावृत्ति|अपावृत्तिः
अपा-वृत्ति, इस्, f. retreat, returning; repulse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाश्या
अपाश्या अ-पाश्या, f. no great number of<BR>noose or fetters (i. e. a few).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाश्रय|अपाश्रयः
अपाश्रय 1. अपाश्रय (˚अप-आश्˚), अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>helpless, destitute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाश्रि
अपाश्रि 1. अपा-श्रि (अप-आ˚), cl. 1. P. -श्र-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to resort to; to use, practice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाश्रय|अपाश्रयः
2. अपा-श्रय, अस्, m. refuge, recourse, the person<BR>or thing to which recourse is had for refuge; an awn-<BR>ing spread over a court or yard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाश्रित
अपा-श्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, resting on; resorting to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाष्टि|अपाष्टिः
अपाष्टि अपाष्टि, इस्, f., Ved. the heel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाष्ठ|अपाष्ठः
अपाष्ठ अपा-ष्ठ, अस्, m., Ved. barb of an<BR>arrow; (अम्), n. what remains of the Soma plant<BR>after it has been pressed out.<BR>—अपाष्ठ-वत्, आन्,<BR>अती, अत्, Ved. having barbs; (वत्), ind. like the re-<BR>mainder of the Soma plant (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपास्
अपास् अपास् (अप-अस्), cl. 4. P. अपास्यति,<BR>सितुम्, to fling away, throw, away or off, to discard;<BR>to scare, drive away; leave behind, leave in a deserted<BR>condition; to desert, to take no notice of, disregard;<BR>reject.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपासन|अपासनं
अपासन, अम्, n. throwing away; quitting, fore-<BR>going, discarding; killing, slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपासित
अपासित, अस्, आ, अम्, thrown or cut down, injured,<BR>destroyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपास्त|अपास्तं
अपास्त, अस्, आ, अम्, thrown off, set aside; driven<BR>away, expelled; abandoned, discarded; disregarded,<BR>contemned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपास्य
अपास्य, ind. having thrown away or discarded,<BR>having left, having disregarded, having excepted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपास्यत्
अपास्यत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, discarding, throwing off, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपासङ्ग|अपासंग|अपासंगः|अपासङ्गः
अपासङ्ग अपा-सङ्ग, अस्, m. (rt. सञ्ज्), a<BR>quiver; also उपासङ्ग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपासरण|अपासरणं
अपासरण अपा-सरण, अम्, n. (rt. सृ), de-<BR>parting, departure, removal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपासृत
अपा-सृत, अस्, आ, अम्, gone, departed, gone away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपासि
अपासि अपासि (अप-असि), इस्, इस्, इ, having a<BR>bad or no sword.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपासु
अपासु अपासु (अप-असु), उस्, उस्, उ, lifeless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाहा
अपाहा अपा-हा (अप-आ˚), cl. 3. P. -जहाति,<BR>हातुम्, to leave, omit, reject.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाहाय
अपा-हाय, ind. excepting; except.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपि
अपि अपि, or sometimes पि (as a particle or<BR>preposition prefixed to verbs and nouns), expresses<BR>placing near or over, uniting to, annexing, reaching<BR>to, proximity, &c. [cf. Gr. ἐπί Zend api; Germ.<BR>and Eng. prefix be]; in later Sanskrit its places seems<BR>frequently supplied by अभि.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">Page0055-b+ 71</a>]<BR>(As a separable adv.) and, also moreover, besides,<BR>assuredly, surely; अपि अपि or अपि-च, as well as; न<BR>वापि or न अपिवा or न नचापि, neither, nor; चापि,<BR>(and at the beginning of a sentence) अपि-च, moreover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपि
अपि is often used to express emphasis, in the sense<BR>of even, also, very; e. g. अन्यद् अपि, also another,<BR>something more; अद्यापि, this very day, even now;<BR>तथापि, even thus, notwithstanding; यद्य् अपि,<BR>even if, although; यद्यपि तथापि, although,<BR>nevertheless; न कदाचिद् अपि, never at any time:<BR>sometimes in the sense of but, only, at least, e. g.<BR>मुहूर्तम् अपि, only a moment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपि
अपि may be affixed to an interrogative to make it<BR>indefinite. e. g. को ऽपि, any one; कुत्रापि, anywhere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपि
अपि imparts to numerals the notion of totality, e. g.<BR>चतुर्णाम् अपि वर्णानाम्, of all the four castes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपि
अपि may be interrogative at the beginning of a<BR>sentence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपि
अपि may strengthen the original force of the po-<BR>tential. or may soften the imperative, like the English<BR>‘be pleased to;’ sometimes it is a mere expletive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपि
अपि तु, but, but yet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपित्व|अपित्वं
अपि-त्व, अम्, n., Ved. having part, share.<BR>—अपि-<BR>त्विन्, ई, इनी, इ, Ved. having part, sharing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिनाम
अपि-नाम, perhaps, in all probability.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिकक्ष|अपिकक्षः
अपिकक्ष अपि-कक्ष, अस्, m., Ved. the re-<BR>gion of the arm-pits and shoulder-blades, especially in<BR>animals; N. of a man; (आस्), m. pl. the descendants<BR>of this man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिकक्ष्य
अपि-कक्ष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. connected with<BR>the region of the arm-pits, or that which binds to the<BR>कक्ष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिकर्ण|अपिकर्णं
अपिकर्ण अपि-कर्ण, अम्, n., Ved. the region<BR>of the ears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिकृत्
अपिकृत् अपि-कृत्, cl. 6. P. -कृन्तति, -कर्-<BR>तितुम्, to cut off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिक्षि
अपिक्षि अपि-क्षि, Caus. -क्षापयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to annihilate, to make away with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिगम्
अपिगम् अपि-गम्, cl. 1. P. -गच्छति, -गन्-<BR>तुम्, to go into, enter, approach, join; to approach<BR>a woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिगत
अपि-गत, अस्, आ, अम्, gone into, entered, come<BR>near, approached, joined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिगा
अपिगा अपि-गा, cl. 3. P. -जिगाति, -गातुम्, to<BR>enter, get into, mingle with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिगीर्ण|अपिगीर्णं
अपिगीर्ण अपि-गीर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, praised,<BR>celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिग्रह्
अपिग्रह् अपि-ग्रह्, cl. 9. P. A. -गृह्णाति,<BR>-णीते, -ग्रहीतुम्, to receive; to stop; to close (the<BR>mouth, nose, &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिगृह्य
अपि-गृह्य Ved., or अपि-ग्राह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to<BR>be received.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिघस्
अपिघस् अपि-घस्, cl. 1. P. -घसति, -घस्-<BR>तुम्, to eat off or away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिच्छिल|अपिच्छिलः
अपिच्छिल अ-पिच्छिल, अस्, आ, अम्, clear, free<BR>from sediment or soil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिज|अपिजः
अपिज अपि-ज, अस्, m. born after, born<BR>again; epithet of several divinities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिण्ड
अपिण्ड अ-पिण्ड, अस्, आ, अम्, without funeral<BR>cakes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपित्
अपित् 1. अ-पित्, त्, त्, त् (rt. पि), Ved. not<BR>swelling, dry; waterless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपित्
अपित् 2. अ-पित्, त्, त्, त्, (in gram.) not<BR>having the इत् or Anu-bandha प्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपितृ
अपितृ अ-पितृ, ता, m. not a father.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपितृक
अ-पितृक, अस्, आ, अम्, not ancestral or paternal,<BR>uninherited; fatherless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपित्र्य
अ-पित्र्य, अस्, आ, अम्, uninherited, not ancestral or<BR>paternal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिदह्
अपिदह् अपि-दह्, cl. 1. P., Ved. -दहति,<BR>-दग्धुम्, to singe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिदृभ्
