अपिदो
अपिदो अपि-दो, cl. 4. P., Ved. -द्यति, -दातुम्,<BR>to cut off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिधा
अपिधा अपि-धा, cl. 3. P. A. -दधाति,<BR>-धत्ते, -धातुम्, to put to, shut, close, cover, con-<BR>ceal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिधान|अपिधानं
अपि-धान or पि-धान, अम्, n. covering, con-<BR>cealment; a cover, a lid, a cloth for covering.<BR>—अपि-<BR>धान-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. having a cover; con-<BR>cealed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिधि|अपिधिः
अपि-धि, इस्, m. concealment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिहित
अपि-हित or पि-हित, अस्, आ, अम्, shut, covered,<BR>concealed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिनह्
