अपिनी
अपिनी अपि-नी, cl. 1. P. -नयति, -नेतुम्,<BR>to lead towards or to, bring to a state or condition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिपद्
अपिपद् अपि-पद्, cl. 4. A. -पद्यते, -पत्तुम्,<BR>to go in, enter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिपास
अपिपास अ-पिपास, अस्, आ, अम्, free from<BR>thirst; satisfied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिपृच्
अपिपृच् अपि-पृच्, cl. 7. P. A., Ved. -पृणक्ति,<BR>पृङ्क्ते, -पर्चितुम्, to mix with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिप्राण
अपिप्राण अपि-प्राण, अस्, ई, अम्, Ved. breath-<BR>ing upon, vivifying, animating (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिबद्ध
अपिबद्ध अपि-बद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, fastened;<BR>connected with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिभाग
अपिभाग अपि-भाग, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. having<BR>part in, sharing in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिमृष्
