अपिवृ
अपिवृ अपि-वृ, cl. 5. P. -वृणोति, -वरितुम्,<BR>रीतुम्, to conceal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिवृत
अपि-वृत, अस्, आ, अम्, concealed, covered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिव्रत
अपिव्रत अपि-व्रत, अस्, m. sharing in the<BR>same religious acts, related by blood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिशर्वर|अपिशर्व्वर
अपिशर्वर अपि-शर्वर, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. con-<BR>tiguous to the night; being at the beginning or end<BR>of the night; (अम्), n. evening-time or morning-<BR>time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिशल|अपिशलः
