अपिशस्
अपिशस् अपि-शस्, f. (only used in abl.),<BR>Ved. slitting, ripping up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिशुन
अपिशुन अ-पिशुन, अस्, आ, अम्, unmalicious,<BR>upright, honest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिष्टुत
अपिष्टुत अपि-ष्टुत, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. स्तु),<BR>praised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिसिच्
अपिसिच् अपि-सिच्, cl. 6. P. -सिञ्चति, -सेक्तुम्,<BR>to sprinkle with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिहित
अपिहित अपि-हित. See अपि-धा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपी
अपी अपी (अपि-इ), cl. 2. P. अप्य्-एति, -तुम्,<BR>to go in or near, to enter into or upon; to come near,<BR>approach; to partake, have a share in; to suffer; to<BR>join; to pour out (as a river); to dissolve; to enter<BR>the other world, to die.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपियत्
अपि-यत्, अन्, अती, अत्, coming near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपीत|अपीतः
1. अपीत, अस्, आ, अम्, gone into, entered, approached.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपीति|अपीतिः
अपीति, इस्, f., Ved. entering into, encountering, join-<BR>ing battle, junction; dissolving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्यय|अप्ययः
अप्य्-अय, coming near, union. See s. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0055-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपीच्य
