अपीडन
अपीडन अ-पीडन, अम्, n. or अ-पीडा, f.<BR>not giving pain, gentleness, kindness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपीडयत्|अपीडयन्त्
अ-पीडयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, without distressing, not<BR>paining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपीत|अपीतः
