अपीत्वा
अ-पीत्वा, ind. not having drank, without drinking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपीनस|अपीनसं|अपीनसः
