अपीव्य|अपीव्यं
अपीव्य अपीव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, very handsome,<BR>most excellent (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुंस्
अपुंस् अ-पुंस्, -पुमान्, m. not a man, a<BR>eunuch.<BR>—अपुंस्-त्व, अम्, n. the state of a eunuch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुंस्का
अ-पुंस्का, f. without a husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुच्छ
अपुच्छ अ-पुच्छ, अस्, आ, अम्, tailless; (आ),<BR>f. the tree Dalbergia Śiśu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुण्य
अपुण्य अ-पुण्य, अस्, आ, अम्, unclean, im-<BR>pure, wicked, bad.<BR>—अपुण्य-कृत्, त्, त्, त्, acting<BR>wickedly, wicked, bad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुत्र|अपुत्रः
