अपुत्रता
—अपुत्र-ता, f. sonlessness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुत्रिका
अ-पुत्रिका, f. the daughter of a sonless father, who<BR>herself has no male offspring; (अस्), m. the father of<BR>such a daughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुनर्
अपुनर् अ-पुनर्, ind. not again, once for<BR>ever.<BR>—अ-पुनः-प्राप्य, अस्, आ, अम्, irrecoverable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुनरन्वय
—अ-पुनर्-अन्वय, अस्, आ, अम्, not returning, dead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुनरावृत्ति|अपुनरावृत्तिः
—अ-पुनर्-आवृत्ति, इस्, f. final exemption from life<BR>or transmigration.<BR>—अ-पुनर्-दीयमान, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>not being given back.<BR>—अ-पुनर्-भव, अस्, m. not<BR>being again; exemption of the soul from further<BR>transmigration, final beatitude.<BR>—अ-पुनर्-भाव,<BR>अस्, m. not being born again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुराण
अपुराण अ-पुराण, अस्, आ, अम्, or अ-पुरातन,<BR>अस्, ई, अम्, not old, modern, new.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुरुष
अपुरुष अ-पुरुष, अस्, आ, अम्, unmanly.<BR>—अ-पुरुषार्थ (˚ष-अर्˚) अस्, m. a rite which<BR>is not for the benefit of the sacrificer; not the chief<BR>object of the soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुरोनुवाक्यक
