अपुरोरुक्क
अ-पुरोरुक्क, अस्, आ, अम्, without a Puroruc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुष्कल
अपुष्कल अ-पुष्कल, अस्, आ, अम्, not emi-<BR>nent; mean, low.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुष्ट
अपुष्ट अ-पुष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, unnourished,<BR>lean; soft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुष्प|अपुष्पः
अपुष्प अ-पुष्प, अस्, आ, अम्, not flowering;<BR>(अस्), m. the glomerous fig tree.<BR>—अ-पुष्प-फल<BR>or अ-पुष्प-फल-द, अस्, आ, अम्, bearing fruits<BR>without flowering; having neither flowers nor fruits;<BR>(अस्), m. the jack tree, Artocarpus Integrifolia, the<BR>glomerous fig-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपुस्
अपुस् अपुस्, उस्, n., Ved. shape; the same<BR>as वपुस्, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूजक
अपूजक अ-पूजक, अस्, इका, अम्, irreverent,<BR>irreligious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूजा
अ-पूजा, f. irreverence, disrespect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूजित
अ-पूजित, अस्, आ, अम्, not reverenced or worshipped,<BR>contemned, disregarded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूज्य
अ-पूज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, not to be worshipped or<BR>revered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूत
अपूत अ-पूत, अस्, आ, अम्, impure; not having<BR>received the invocatory rite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूप|अपूपः
अपूप अपूप, अस्, m. cake of flour, meal, &c.;<BR>a sort of bread; wheat; honey-comb (?).<BR>—अपूप-<BR>नाभि, इस्, m., Ved. having a navel which consists of<BR>or is decorated with cake.<BR>—अपूप-मय, अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>consisting of cake.<BR>—अपूप-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, accom-<BR>panied with cake.<BR>—अपूपापिहित (˚प-अप्˚), अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, covered with cake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूपीय
अपूपीय, अस्, आ, अम्, belonging to cake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूप्य|अपूप्यः
अपूप्य, अम्, n. flour, meal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूरणी
अपूरणी अपूरणी f. the silk cotton tree,<BR>Bombax Heptaphyllum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूरुष
अपूरुष अ-पूरुष, अस्, आ, अम्, lifeless, in-<BR>animate; soulless; unpeopled.<BR>—अ-पूरुष-घ्न, अस्,<BR>m., Ved. not killing men.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूर्ण
अपूर्ण अ-पूर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, not full or entire,<BR>imperfect, incomplete, deficient; (अम्), n. an incom-<BR>plete number, a fraction.<BR>—अपूर्ण-काल, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>premature; (अस्), m. incomplete time.<BR>—अपूर्ण-<BR>काल-ज, अस्, आ, अम्, born before the proper time, abor-<BR>tive.<BR>—अपूर्ण-ता, f. incompleteness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूर्यमाण|अपूर्य्यमाण
अ-पूर्यमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, not being full, incomplete.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूर्व|अपूर्वः|अपूर्व्व|अपूर्व्वं
अपूर्व अ-पूर्व, अस्, आ, अम्, unpreceded, un-<BR>precedented; not having existed before, quite new;<BR>unparalleled, incomparable, wonderful, extraordinary;<BR>not first; (in Pāṇini) preceded by अ or आ; (अम्),<BR>n. the remote or unforeseen consequence of an act,<BR>as heaven of religious rites; a consequence not im-<BR>mediately preceded by its cause.<BR>—अपूर्व-कर्मन्,<BR>अ, n. a religious rite or sacrifice, the power of which<BR>on the future is not before seen.<BR>—अपूर्व-ता, f. or<BR>अपूर्व-त्व, अम्, n. the being unpreceded, not hav-<BR>ing existed before, incomparableness, &c.<BR>—अ-पूर्व-<BR>पति, इस्, f. one who has had no husband before.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूर्ववत्|अपूर्व्ववत्
—अपूर्व-वत्, ind. singularly, unlike anything else.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूर्वेण
—अ-पूर्वेण, ind. never before.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूर्वीय
अ-पूर्वीय, अस्, आ, अम्, referring to the remote or<BR>unforeseen consequence of an act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपूर्व्य|अपूर्व्व्य
अ-पूर्व्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. unpreceded, first;<BR>having nothing similar before one's self, incompar-<BR>able, unheard of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपृक्त|अपृक्तः
अपृक्त अ-पृक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, unmixed, un-<BR>combined; (अस्), m. (in Pāṇini) a word or an affix<BR>consisting of a single letter, i. e. of one not combined<BR>with another; (in the Prātiśākhyas) the preposition<BR>आ and the particle उ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपृणत्|अपृणन्त्
अपृणत् अ-पृणत्, अ, अती, अत्, Ved. not fill-<BR>ing, not propitiating by gifts; stingy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपृथक्
अपृथक् अ-पृथक्, ind. not separately,<BR>with, together with, collectively.<BR>—अपृथग्-धर्म-<BR>सील, अस्, आ, अम्, of the same religion.<BR>—अपृथग्-<BR>धी, ईस्, ईस्, इ, regarding God in all things.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपृष्ट
अपृष्ट अ-पृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, unasked, unad-<BR>dressed, not spoken to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपे
अपे अपे (अप-इ), cl. 2. P., cl. 1. A. अपैति,<BR>अपायते. अपैतुम्, to go away, withdraw, retire, run<BR>away, escape, vanish; to be wanting, to be omitted;<BR>to start.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपाय|अपायः
अपाय, अस्, m. going away, departure; destruction,<BR>death, annihilation; injury, detriment, loss; misfor-<BR>tune, evil, ill, calamity, danger; end (of a word).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपायिन्
अपायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, going away, departing, vanish-<BR>ing, perishable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेत
अपेत, अस्, आ, अम्, escaped, departed, gone; having<BR>retired from, free from (with abl. or as last mamber<BR>of a comp.).<BR>—अपेत-भी, ईस्, ईस्, इ, one whose fear<BR>is gone.<BR>—अपेत-राक्षसी, f., N. of a plant, Ocimum<BR>Sanctum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेय|अपेयं
अपेय, अस्, आ, अम्, removed (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेहि
अपेहि. See s. v. next col.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेक्ष्
अपेक्ष् अपेक्ष् (अप-ईक्ष्), cl. I. A. अपे-<BR>क्षते, -षितुम्, to look away, to look round, to<BR>look about for something; to have some design; to<BR>have regard to, to respect; to look for, wait for,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">Page0056-c+ 70</a>]<BR>except, hope; to require, to have an eye to; with<BR>न, not to like.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेक्षण|अपेक्षणं
अपेक्षण, अम्, n. or अपेक्षा, f. looking round<BR>or about; (with the object either in loc. or as the<BR>preceding member of a compound) consideration,<BR>reference, regard; connection of cause with effect or<BR>of individual with species; expectation, hope, desire,<BR>need, requirement.<BR>—अपेक्षया, with reference to.<BR>—अपेक्षा-बुद्धि, इस्, f. a mental process in the<BR>vaiśeṣika philosophy, the faculty of arranging and<BR>methodising; clearness of understanding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेक्षणीय|अपेक्षणीयं
अपेक्षणीय or अपेक्षितव्य or अपेक्ष्य, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, to be considered or regarded, to be looked for<BR>or expected, to be wished, desired, or required; desirable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेक्षित
अपेक्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, considered, regarded, refer-<BR>red to, looked for, expected; wished, hoped, required;<BR>(अम्), n. consideration, reference, regard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेक्षिन्
अपेक्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ, (with the object in gen. or as<BR>the preceding member of a compound) considering,<BR>respecting, regarding, looking to; looking for, expect-<BR>ing, hoping, requiring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेक्ष्य
अपेक्ष्य, ind. having considered, having regard<BR>to, with regard or reference to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेज्
अपेज् अपेज् (अप-एज्), cl. 1. A. अपेजते, -जितुम्,<BR>to remove, drive away. (See Gram. 784. a)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेन्द्र
