अपेय|अपेयं
अपेय अ-पेय, अस्, आ, अम्, unfit for drinking,<BR>undrinkable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेशल
अपेशल अ-पेशल, अस्, आ, अम्, not clever, in-<BR>expert.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेशल
अपेशस् अ-पेशस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, Ved. formless,<BR>shapeless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेष्
अपेष् 1. अपेष् (अप-इष्), cl. 4. A. अपेष्यते,<BR>षितुम्, to strive after, aspire to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेष्
अपेष् 2. अपेष् (अप-ईष्), cl. 1. A. अपेषते,<BR>षितुम्, to withdraw from, to retire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपेहि
अपेहि अपेहि (imperative of rt. इ with अप),<BR>at the beginning of several compounds, means exclud-<BR>ing, expelling, denying admission; e. g. अपेहि-प्र-<BR>कसा, f. a. ceremony where people are not admitted.<BR>—अपेहि-बाणिजा, f. a. ceremony from which merchants<BR>are excluded.<BR>—अपेहि-वाता, f., N. of a plant useful<BR>in expelling wind (Pœderia).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपैशुन
अपैशुन अ-पैशुन, अम्, n. integrity, honesty,<BR>uprightness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपोगण्ड|अपोगंडः|अपोगण्डः
अपोगण्ड अ-पोगण्ड, अस्, आ, अम्, not under<BR>sixteen years of age; a child or infant; timid, fearful;<BR>flaccid; having a limb too many or too few.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपोच्छद्
