अपोभ्
अपोभ् अपोभ् (अप-उभ्), cl. 6. P., Ved. अपो-<BR>भति, -ओम्भति, -भितुम्, to bind, fetter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0056-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपोर्णु
अपोर्णु अपोर्णु (अप-ऊर्णु), cl. 2. P. A.<BR>अपोर्णौति, -णोति, -णुते, -णवितुम्, -णुवितुम्, to<BR>uncover, to unveil, to open; A. to uncover one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपोष्
अपोष् अपोष् (अप-उष्), cl. 1. P., Ved.<BR>अपोषति, अपोच्छति, to dispel darkness (said of the<BR>dawn).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपोह्
अपोह् अपोह् (अप-ऊह्), cl. 1. P. A. अपोहति,<BR>-ते, -हितुम्, to strip off, to push away, to frighten<BR>away; to remove, to heal (sickness); A. to keep<BR>away from one's self, to avoid, to give up; (in dis-<BR>putation) to object, to deny, to reason, argue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपोह|अपोहः
अपोह, अस्, m. or अपोहन, अम्, n. pushing away,<BR>removing; removal of doubt by the exercise of the<BR>reasoning faculty; reasoning, arguing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपोहनीय
अपोहनीय or अपोह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be taken<BR>away, or removed, or expiated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपोहित
अपोहित, अस्, आ, अम्, taken away, removed; estab-<BR>lished by reason.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपौरुष
अपौरुष अ-पौरुष, अम्, n. unmanliness,<BR>cowardice; superhuman power; (अस्, आ, अम्), unmanly,<BR>cowardly; superhuman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपौष्कल्य
अपौष्कल्य अ-पौष्कल्य, अम्, n. immaturity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्त|अप्तः
अप्त अप्त, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. obs. rt. अप् for later<BR>आप्), Ved. obtained; watery (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्तस्
अप्तस्, अस्, n. a sacrificial act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्तु|अप्तुः
अप्तु, उस्, m., Ved. busy, active, diligent; the<BR>body; Soma; a sacrificial animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्तुर्
अप्तुर्, ऊस्, m., Ved. active, busy; giving water;<BR>running as water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्तूर्य|अप्तूर्यं
अप्तूर्य, अम्, n., Ved. zeal, activity; the giving<BR>of water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्तोर्याम|अप्तोर्यामः
अप्तोर्-याम, अस्, or अप्तोर्-यामन्, आ, m., Ved.,<BR>N. of a sacrificial ceremony, and of a verse in the<BR>Sāma-veda closing that ceremony [cf. वैराज].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्त्य
अप्त्य, अस्, आ, अम्, active, spacious; watery (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्न|अप्नः
अप्न, अस्, m. or अप्नस्, अस्, n., Ved. possession,<BR>property; work, sacrificial act; progeny; shape [cf.<BR>Lat. ops].<BR>—अप्नह्-स्थ, अस्, m., Ved. superintending<BR>work.<BR>—अप्न-राज्, ट्, m., Ved. possessing property;<BR>illustrious through work.<BR>—अप्नस्-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>Ved. productive, having sacrificial acts or work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्नवान|अप्नवानः
अप्नवान, अस् m., Ved. having progeny; the<BR>arm; N. of a Ṛṣi; poor (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्य
अप्य, अस्, आ, अम्, obtainable, to be reached;<BR>active, belonging to or connected with work or sacri-<BR>ficial acts, watery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्प
अप्प अप्प, अस्, m., N. of an author of a<BR>book on prosody.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्पति|अप्पतिः
अप्पति अप्पति, इस्, m. See under अप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्पदीक्षित
अप्पदीक्षित अप्पदीक्षित or अप्यदीक्षित<BR>or अप्ययदीक्षित, अस्, m., N. of an author of the<BR>sixteenth century.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्पित्त|अप्पित्तं
अप्पित्त अप्-पित्त, अम्, n. fire; see under अप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्यच्
अप्यच् अप्य्-अच्, यङ्, ईची, यक् (rt. अञ्च्),<BR>reaching, gone into, hidden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्यत्यर्ज्
अप्यत्यर्ज् अप्य्-अत्य्-अर्ज् (अपि-अति˚), cl. 1. P.,<BR>Ved. -अर्जति, -जितुम्, to add over and above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्यय|अप्ययः
अप्यय अप्य्-अय, अस्, m. (fr. rt. इ with अपि, see<BR>अपी), approach, meeting, joining; pouring out; enter-<BR>ing, vanishing; junction; (e. g. स्वाप्यय, entering<BR>into one's self, absorption.)<BR>—अपयय-दीक्षित, अस्, m.,<BR>N. of a Drāviḍa saint and writer, the author of various<BR>works, celebrated as a Śaiva, and thought to be an<BR>incarnation of Śiva; (also अप्याय˚ or अप्यै˚, &c.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्ययन|अप्ययनं
अप्य्-अयन, अम्, n. union, joining; copulating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्यर्धम्
अप्यर्धम् अप्य्-अर्धम्, ind., Ved. within<BR>proximity, near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्यस्
अप्यस् अप्य्-अस् (अपि-अस्), cl. 2. P. -अस्ति, (with<BR>loc. or with an adv. of place) to be in anything; to<BR>be closely connected with, to belong to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्युत
अप्युत अप्य्-उत = अपि and उत, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकट|अप्रकटः
अप्रकट अ-प्रकट, अस्, आ, अम्, unmanifested,<BR>unapparent, obscure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकम्प|अप्रकंप
अप्रकम्प अ-प्रकम्प, अस्, आ, अम्, unshaken,<BR>literally and metaphorically; firm, steady; unanswer-<BR>ed, unrefuted.<BR>—अप्रकम्प-ता, f. firmness, stability,<BR>unanswerableness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकर
अप्रकर अ-प्रकर, अस्, आ, अम्, not acting<BR>excellently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकरण|अप्रकरणं
अ-प्रकरण, अम्, n. not the principal topic,<BR>not relevant to the main subject.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकृत|अप्रकृतः
अ-प्रकृत, अस्, आ, अम्, not principal, not relevant<BR>to the main topic under discussion, not chief; occa-<BR>sional or incidental, not natural.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकृति|अप्रकृतिः
अ-प्रकृति, इस्, f. not the inherent or inseparable<BR>property, accidental property or nature; spiritual being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकर्षित
अप्रकर्षित अ-प्रकर्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, not ex-<BR>ceeded, not more than; unsurpassed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकृष्ट|अप्रकृष्टः
अ-प्रकृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, low, vile; (अस्), m.<BR>a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकल्पक
अप्रकल्पक अ-प्रकल्पक, अस्, इका, अम्, not<BR>prescribing as obligatory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकॢप्त
अ-प्रकॢप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, not explicitly enjoined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकाण्ड|अप्रकांड|अप्रकाण्डः
अप्रकाण्ड अ-प्रकाण्ड, अस्, आ, अम्, stemless;<BR>(अस्), m. a bush, a shrub.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकाश|अप्रकाशः
अप्रकाश अ-प्रकाश, अस्, आ, अम्, not shining,<BR>dark; self-illuminated; not visible, hidden, secret;<BR>not manifest or evident; (अम्), ind. in secret; (अस्),<BR>m. indistinctness, secrecy^1, a secret.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Dr. Sampada Savardekar on 20210422. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकाशक
अ-प्रकाशक, अस्, इका, अम्, not rendering bright;<BR>making dark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकाशमान
अ-प्रकाशमान or अ-प्रकाशित, अस्, आ, अम्, not<BR>manifested, undivulged, unrevealed, not evident or<BR>public.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकाश्य
अ-प्रकाश्य, अस्, आ, अम्, not to be manifested or<BR>divulged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रकेत
अप्रकेत अ-प्रकेत, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. indis-<BR>criminate, unrecognizable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रक्षित
अप्रक्षित अ-प्रक्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. un-<BR>diminished, undecayed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रखर|अप्रखरः
अप्रखर अ-प्रखर, अस्, आ, अम्, dull, obtuse;<BR>bland, mild.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रगम
अप्रगम अ-प्रगम, अस्, आ, अम्, going too<BR>fast for others to follow, not to be surpassed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रगल्भ
अप्रगल्भ अ-प्रगल्भ, अस्, आ, अम्, not arro-<BR>gant, modest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रगीत
अप्रगीत अ-प्रगीत, अस्, आ, अम्, not chaunted<BR>aloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रगुण|अप्रगुणः
अप्रगुण अ-प्रगुण, अस्, आ, अम्, confounded,<BR>perplexed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रग्राह
अप्रग्राह अ-प्रग्राह, अस्, आ, अम्, unre-<BR>strained, unbridled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रचङ्कश|अप्रचंकश
अप्रचङ्कश अ-प्रचङ्कश, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved.<BR>without power of seeing; not beautiful (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रचुर
अप्रचुर अ-प्रचुर, अस्, आ, अम्, little, few.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रचेतस्
अप्रचेतस् अ-प्रचेतस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, Ved. de-<BR>ficient in understanding, foolish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रचेतित
अ-प्रचेतित, अस्, आ, अम्, unknown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रचोदित
अप्रचोदित अ-प्रचोदित, अस्, आ, अम्, unde-<BR>sired, not bidden or commanded; undeclared, not<BR>said; unasked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रच्छेद्य
अप्रच्छेद्य अ-प्रच्छेद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, inscru-<BR>table.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रच्युत
अप्रच्युत अ-प्रच्युत, अस्, आ, अम्, unmoved;<BR>(with abl.) not fallen or deviating from, observing,<BR>following.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0057-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रज
