अ-प्रतीति, इस्, f. the state of not being understood;<BR>mistrust, want of confidence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

