अप्रत्यय|अप्रत्ययः
अप्रत्यय अ-प्रत्यय, अस्, m. distrust, dis-<BR>belief, doubt; not an affix; (अस्, आ, अम्), distrustful<BR>(with loc.); having no affix.<BR>—अ-प्रत्यय-स्थ, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, (in gram.) not pertaining to an affix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

