अप्रमायुक
अप्रमायुक अ-प्रमायुक, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. not<BR>dying suddenly (?), immeasurably long (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रमीय
अप्रमीय अ-प्रमीय, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. not to<BR>be killed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रमूर
