अप्रमृष्य
अप्रमृष्य अ-प्रमृष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, not to<BR>be destroyed, indestructible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0058-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रमोद|अप्रमोदं|अप्रमोदः
अप्रमोद अ-प्रमोद, अम्, n. inability to re-<BR>move pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0058-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रयत्न|अप्रयत्नः
