अप्रयाणि|अप्रयाणिः
अप्रयाणि अ-प्रयाणि, इस्, f. not going, not<BR>moving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0058-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रयापणि
