अप्रयुत
अ-प्रयुत, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. unaltered, continual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0058-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रयुत्वन्
