अप्रवर्तक|अप्रवर्त्तक
अप्रवर्तक अ-प्रवर्तक, अस्, इका, अम्, ab-<BR>staining from action, inert; not exciting to action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0058-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रवर्तन|अप्रवर्तनं|अप्रवर्त्तन
अ-प्रवर्तन, अम्, n. the act of refraining from,<BR>not engaging in; not exciting to any action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0058-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रवृत्त
अ-प्रवृत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, not acting, not engaged<BR>in, not commenced, not instigated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0058-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रवृत्ति|अप्रवृत्तिः
