अभिचारित
अभि-चारित, अस्, आ, अम्, enchanted, charmed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0061-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

