अभि-जनितु, उस्, f., Ved. the being born or pro-<BR>duced.<BR>—अभि-जनितोस्, to produce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिजात|अभिजातः
अभि-जात, अस्, आ, अम्, produced all around; born<BR>in consequence of; born, produced; noble, well-born;<BR>obtained by birth, inbred; fit, proper; wise, learned;<BR>handsome; (अम्), n. nativity.<BR>—अभिजात-ता, f. high<BR>birth, nobility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिजाति|अभिजातिः
