अभिजप्
अभिजप् अभि-जप्, cl. 1. P. -जपति, -पितुम्,<BR>to mutter over or whiper to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिजभ्
