अभिजल्प्
अभिजल्प् अभि-जल्प्, cl. 1. P. -जल्पति, -पि-<BR>तुम्, to address, to accompany with remarks; to ad-<BR>vocate, to settle by conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिजि
अभिजि अभि-जि, cl. 1. P. -जयति, -जेतुम्, to<BR>conquer completely, to acquire by conquest: Desid.<BR>-जिगीषति, to try to win, to attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिजय|अभिजयः
