अभिजित्
अभि-जित्, त्, त्, त्, victorious; born under the con-<BR>stellation Abhijit; (त्), m., N. of Viṣṇu; of a Soma<BR>sacrifice, part of the great sacrifice Gavām-ayana;<BR>N. of a son of Punarvasu, or of his father; (त्), f.,<BR>N. of a star (अ Lyræ); one of the Nakṣatras or<BR>lunar mansions; (त्), n. the eighth Muhūrta of the<BR>day; midday.<BR>—अभिजिन्-मुहूर्त, अस्, m. the<BR>eighth Muhūrta, or period comprising twenty-four<BR>minutes before and twenty-four after midday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिजित|अभिजितः
