अभिजिति|अभिजितिः
अभि-जिति, इस्, f., Ved. victory, conquest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

