अभिज्ञ|अभिज्ञः
अभि-ज्ञ, अस्, आ, अम्, knowing, skilful, clever; (with<BR>gen.) one who understands or is conversant with;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-b" target="_blank">Page0062-b+ 69</a>]<BR>(आ), f. remembrance, recollection, recognition; super-<BR>natural science or faculty, of which five are enume-<BR>rated, viz. 1. taking any form at will; 2. hearing<BR>to any distance; 3. seeing to any distance; 4. pene-<BR>trating men's thoughts; 5. knowing their state and<BR>antecedents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

