अभि-दूषित, अस्, आ, अम्, wounded, injured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिदूति
अभिदूति अभि-दूति, ind. to or towards a<BR>female messenger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिदृश्
अभिदृश् अभि-दृश्, cl. 1. P. -पश्यति, -द्र-<BR>ष्टुम्, to look at: Caus. P. -दर्शयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to show, point out; to show one's self, i. e. appear:<BR>Pass. -दृश्यते, to be visible, be in view, appear; to<BR>be considered or thought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिदर्शन|अभिदर्शनं
अभि-दर्शन, अम्, n. seeing; becoming visible,<BR>appearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिद्यु|अभिद्युः
अभिद्यु अभि-द्यु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. directed<BR>to heaven, tending or going to heaven; heavenly,<BR>bright; (उस्), m. a half month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिद्युत्
अभिद्युत् अभि-द्युत्, cl. 1. A. -द्योतते, -ति-<BR>तुम्, to burn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिद्रु
अभिद्रु अभि-द्रु, cl. 1. P. and poet. A.<BR>-द्रवति, -ते, -द्रोतुम्, to run up to or near; to<BR>attack, overrun, infest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिद्रुत्य
अभि-द्रुत्य, अस्, आ, अम्, run towards, attacked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिद्रुत्य
अभि-द्रुत्य, ind. having attacked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिद्रुह्
अभिद्रुह् 1. अभि-द्रुह्, cl. 4. P. -द्रुह्यति,<BR>-द्रोग्धुम्, -द्रोढुम्, to hate, seek to injure or<BR>maliciously assail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिद्रुग्ध
अभि-द्रुग्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, injured, oppressed.<BR>2. अभि-द्रुह्, -ध्रुक्, क्, क्, Ved. seeking to in-<BR>jure, inimical, cunning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिद्रुह्यमाण
अभि-द्रुह्यमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, being injured or<BR>oppressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिद्रोह|अभिद्रोहः
अभि-द्रोह, अस्, m. injuring, hurting, oppression,<BR>cruelty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधन्व्
अभिधन्व् अभि-धन्व्, cl. 1. P. A., Ved.<BR>-धन्वति, -ते, -वितुम्, to come up in haste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधर्म|अभिधर्मः
अभिधर्म अभि-धर्म, अस्, m. the supreme<BR>truth according to the Buddhists, the dogmas of Bud-<BR>dhist philosophy or metaphysics.<BR>—अभिधर्म-कोश,<BR>अस्, m. title of a work on the preceding.<BR>—अभि-<BR>धर्म-पिटक, अस्, m. ‘basket of metaphysics,’ title<BR>of that section of Buddhist writings which contains<BR>the अभि-धर्म.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधर्षण|अभिधर्षणं
अभिधर्षण अभि-धर्षण, अम्, n. (rt. धृष्),<BR>possession by demoniac spirits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधृष्णु
अभि-धृष्णु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. overpowering,<BR>subduing (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधा
अभिधा 1. अभि-धा, cl. 3. P. A. -दधाति,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">Page0063-a+ 76</a>]<BR>-धत्ते, -धातुम्, to set forth, explain, tell, speak to,<BR>address, say, name; A., Ved. to receive; P. (corrup-<BR>tion of अभि-धावति?), to assail: Pass. -धीयते, to<BR>be named or called.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0062-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधा
2. अभि-धा, f. name, appellation; the literal power<BR>or sense of a word; a word, sound; (आस्, आस्), m. f.,<BR>Ved. naming; praised; invoked (?).<BR>—अभिधा-<BR>ध्वंसिन्, ई, इनी, इ, losing one's name.<BR>—अभिधा-<BR>मूल, अस्, आ, अम्, founded on the literal meaning of<BR>a word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधातव्य
अभि-धातव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be told or named,<BR>to be manifested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधान|अभिधानं
अभि-धान, अम्, n. telling, naming, speaking,<BR>speech, manifesting; (अस्, अम्), m. n. a name, title,<BR>appellation, expression, word; a vocabulary, a diction-<BR>ary.<BR>—अभिधान-चिन्तामणि, इस्, m. title of Hema-<BR>candra's vocabulary of synonyms (the jewel that gives<BR>every word that can be imagined).<BR>—अभिधान-<BR>त्व, अम्, n. the state of being used as a name or ex-<BR>pression.<BR>—अभिधान-माला, f. a dictionary.<BR>—अभि-<BR>धान-रत्नमाला, f. title of Halāyudha's vocabulary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधानक|अभिधानकं
अभि-धानक, अम्, n. a sound, a noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधानी
अभि-धानी f., Ved. a halter, a rope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधानीय
अभि-धानीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be named.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधान्य
अभि-धान्य, ind. having said, having called.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधायक
अभि-धायक, अस्, इका, अम्, or अभि-धायिन्, ई,<BR>इनी, इ, naming, expressing, expressive of, denominat-<BR>ing; telling, speaking.<BR>—अभिधायक-त्व, अम्, n.<BR>the state of being expressive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधायम्
अभि-धायम्, ind. expressing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधित्सा
अभि-धित्सा, f. desire of expressing or naming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधेय|अभिधेयं
अभि-धेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be named or mention-<BR>ed; to be expressed, to be spoken of; (अम्), n. sig-<BR>nification, meaning.<BR>—अभिधेय-रहित, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>having no sense or meaning, unmeaning, nonsensical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिहित|अभिहितं
अभि-हित, अभि-हिति. See s. v. below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधाव्
अभिधाव् अभि-धाव्, cl. 1. P. A. -धावति,<BR>-ते, -वितुम्, to run up towards, to rush upon, attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधावक|अभिधावकः
अभि-धावक, अस्, इका, अम्, running up, hasten-<BR>ing towards, assailing; an assailant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधावन|अभिधावनं
अभि-धावन, अम्, n. running up, pursuit, chase,<BR>attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिधृ
अभिधृ अभि-धृ, Caus. P. -धारयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to uphold, maintain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिध्यै
अभिध्यै अभि-ध्यै, cl. 1. P. -ध्यायति,<BR>-ध्यातुम्, to consider, reflect, mediate upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिध्या
अभि-ध्या, f. covering another's property; desire,<BR>wish, longing for in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिध्यान|अभिध्यानं
अभि-ध्यान, अम्, n. desiring, longing for; wish;<BR>meditation, profound thought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिध्यायत्
अभि-ध्यायत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, covering, desiring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिध्यायमान
अभि-ध्यायमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being meditated on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिध्वन्
अभिध्वन् अभि-ध्वन्, cl. 1. P. -ध्वनति,<BR>-नितुम्, to resound, shout.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनक्ष्
अभिनक्ष् अभि-नक्ष्, cl. 1. P. -नक्षति,<BR>-क्षितुम्, to encompass; Ved. to bring, to approach,<BR>come to, arrive at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनद्
अभिनद् अभि-नद्, cl. 1. P. -नदति, -दितुम्,<BR>to sound towards a person (with acc.); to sound,<BR>raise a noise: Caus. -नादयति, -यितुम्, to cause to<BR>sound, fill with noise: Pass. to resound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनद्ध
अभिनद्ध अभि-नद्ध, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. नह्),<BR>bound, tied round, fastened on or upon.<BR>—अभि-<BR>नद्धाक्ष (˚ध-अक्˚), अस्, ई, अम्, blindfold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनन्द्|अभिनंद्
अभिनन्द् अभि-नन्द्, cl. 1. P. A. -नन्दति,<BR>-ते, -दितुम्, to rejoice at, salute, welcome, address,<BR>congratulate; to praise, applaud, approve, respect, care<BR>for; to acknowledge: Caus. -नन्दयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to gladden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनन्द|अभिनंद|अभिनन्दः
अभि-नन्द, अस्, m. rejoicing, delighting; ap-<BR>plauding; wish, desire; N. of a commentator or com-<BR>mentary on the Amara-koṣa; N. of another author;<BR>(आ), f. delight, wish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनन्दन|अभिनंदनं|अभिनन्दनः
अभि-नन्दन, अम्, n. delighting, rejoicing; prais-<BR>ing, applauding, approving; wish, desire; (अस्), m.<BR>the fourth Jaina Arhat of the present Avasarpiṇī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनन्दनीय|अभिनंदनीय
अभि-नन्दनीय or 1. अभि-नन्द्य, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>to be acknowledged or applauded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनन्दित
अभि-नन्दित, अस्, आ, अम्, delighted, made happy,<BR>saluted, applauded, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनन्दिन्|अभिनंदिन्
अभि-नन्दिन्, ई, इनी, इ, rejoicing at, wishing,<BR>desiring, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनन्द्य|अभिनंद्य
2. अभि-नन्द्य, ind. having rejoiced at, having<BR>gladdened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनभ्यम्
अभिनभ्यम् अभि-नभ्यम्, ind., Ved. to-<BR>wards the clouds or heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनम्
अभिनम् अभि-नम्, cl. 1. P. -नमति, -नन्-<BR>तुम्, to bow, bend, curve; to turn towards a person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनत
अभि-नत, अस्, आ, अम्, bent, inclined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनम्र
अभि-नम्र, अस्, आ, अम्, bent, deeply bowed or<BR>curved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनय|अभिनयः
अभिनय अभि-नय. See 1. अभि-नी, p. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनर्द्
अभिनर्द् अभि-नर्द्, cl. 1. P., ep. also A.<BR>-नर्दति, -ते, -दितुम्, to roar towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनव|अभिनवः
अभिनव अभि-नव, अस्, आ, अम्, quite new or<BR>young, very young, fresh; not having experience.<BR>—अभिनव-चन्द्रार्घ-विधि (˚र-अर्˚), इस्, m.<BR>a ceremony performed at the time of the new moon.<BR>—अभिनव-यौवन, अस्, आ, अम्, youthful.<BR>—अभि-<BR>नव-वैयाकरण, अस्, m. one who has just begun<BR>grammar.<BR>—अभिनवोद्भिद् (˚व-उद्˚), त्, m. a new bud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनवीभू
अभिनवी-भू, cl. 1. P. -भवति, -वितुम्, to be-<BR>come new.<BR>—अभिनवी-भूत, अस्, आ, अम्, renewed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनश्
अभिनश् अभि-नश्, cl. 1. P. A., Ved. -नशति,<BR>-ते, -शितुम्, to attain, seize; to assail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनह्
अभिनह् अभि-नह्, cl. 4. P. A. -नह्यति, -ते,<BR>-नद्धुम्, to bind up (as the eyes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनहन|अभिनहनं
अभि-नहन, अम्, n. a bandage (especially over<BR>the eyes.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनासिकाविवरम्
अभिनासिकाविवरम् अभि-नासिकाविवरम्,<BR>ind. to the opening of the nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिःस्तन्
अभिनिःस्तन् अभि-निः-स्तन् (-निर्-स्तन्), cl. 1.<BR>P. -स्तनति, -नितुम्, to sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिष्टान|अभिनिष्टानः
अभि-निष्टान, अस्, m. a sound which dies away;<BR>the Visarga; a letter of the alphabet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिक्रम्
अभिनिक्रम् अभि-नि-क्रम्, cl. 1. P.A., cl. 4.<BR>P. -क्रामति, -क्रमते, -क्राम्यति, -क्रमितुम्, to<BR>tread down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिगद्
अभिनिगद् अभि-नि-गद्, cl. 1. P. -गदति,<BR>-दितुम्, to speak to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिधन|अभिनिधनं
अभिनिधन अभि-निधन, अम्, n., N. of cer-<BR>tain verses of the Sāma-veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिधान|अभिनिधानं
अभिनिधान अभि-निधान, अम्, n. putting<BR>on; an euphonic suppression or weakening (in the<BR>pronunciation of words), especially the suppression of<BR>an initial अ after ए, ओ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिधीयमान
अभि-निधीयमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being suppressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिध्यै
अभिनिध्यै अभि-नि-ध्यै, cl. 1. P. -ध्यायति,<BR>-ध्यातुम्, to investigate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिनी
अभिनिनी अभि-नि-नी, cl. 1. P. A. -नयति,<BR>-ते. -नेतुम्, to pour out (water &c.) upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिनृत्
अभिनिनृत् अभि-नि-नृत्, cl. 4. P., Ved. -नृत्-<BR>यति, -नर्तितुम्, to accomplish step by step, repeat<BR>separately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिपत्
अभिनिपत् अभि-नि-पत्, Caus. P. -पातयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to throw down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिपीड्
अभिनिपीड् अभि-नि-पीड्, cl. 10. P. -पीडयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to press, squeeze, trouble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिपीडित
अभि-निपीडित, अस्, आ, अम्, exceedingly pained,<BR>tormented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिम्लुच्
अभिनिम्लुच् अभि-नि-म्लुच्, cl. 1. P. -म्लोचति,<BR>-चितुम्, to set (as the sun) upon a person (while some<BR>act is being done by him).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनियुक्त
अभिनियुक्त अभि-नियुक्त, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. युज्),<BR>occupied in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिर्गम्
अभिनिर्गम् अभि-निर्-गम्, cl. 1. P. -गच्छति,<BR>-गन्तुम्, to go out, go away from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिर्जित
अभिनिर्जित अभि-निर्जित, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. जि),<BR>conquered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिर्णुद्
अभिनिर्णुद् अभि-निर्-णुद् (-निर्-नुद्), cl. 6.<BR>P. A. -णुदति, -ते, -णोत्तुम्, to drive out, frighten<BR>away, remove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिर्दिश्
अभिनिर्दिश् अभि-निर्-दिश्, cl. 6. P. -दिशति,<BR>-देष्टुम्, to point out, indicate, appoint, characterize.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिर्भर्त्स्
अभिनिर्भर्त्स् अभि-निर्-भर्त्स्, cl. 10. A. or P.<BR>-भर्त्सयते, -ति, -यितुम्, to scold, threaten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिर्मित
अभिनिर्मित अभि-निर्मित, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. मा),<BR>made, created.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिर्मुक्त|अभिनिर्मुक्तः|अभिनिर्म्मुक्त
अभिनिर्मुक्त अभि-निर्मुक्त, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. मुच्),<BR>left, quitted (by the sun when it sets), i.e one asleep<BR>at sunset.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिर्या
अभिनिर्या अभि-निर्-या, cl. 2. P. -याति, -तुम्,<BR>to march out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिर्याण|अभिनिर्याणं|अभिनिर्य्याण
अभि-निर्याण, अम्, n. march of an assailant,<BR>invasion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिर्वृत्त
अभिनिर्वृत्त अभि-निर्वृत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, ac-<BR>complished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिर्वृत्ति|अभिनिर्वृत्तिः
अभि-निर्वृत्ति, इस्, f. accomplishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिवर्त|अभिनिवर्तः|अभिनिवर्त्त
अभिनिवर्त अभि-निवर्त, अस्, m. turning to-<BR>wards; (अम्), ind. having turned towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिविश्
अभिनिविश् अभि-नि-विश्, cl. 1. A. -विशते,<BR>-वेष्टुम्, to enter into possession of; to sit down in<BR>or be settled in, to occupy: Caus. -वेशयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to make one enter into or sit down, apply, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिविष्ट
अभि-निविष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, well versed or profi-<BR>cient in, conversant or familiar with; intent on;<BR>attentive, engrossed; endowed with; determined;<BR>(अम्), n. persevering.<BR>—अभिनिविष्ट-ता, f. state of<BR>being so.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिवेश|अभिनिवेशः
अभि-निवेश, अस्, m. application, perseverance, in-<BR>tentness, study, affection, devotion; determination to<BR>effect a purpose or attain an object; tenacity, adher-<BR>ance; ignorant fear causing death (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिवेशित
अभि-निवेशित, अस्, आ, अम्, made to enter into,<BR>plunged into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिवेशिन्
अभि-निवेशिन्, ई, इनी, इ, intent upon, devoted to,<BR>determined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिशम्
अभिनिशम् अभि-नि-शम्, cl. 4. P. -शाम्यति,<BR>-शमितुम्, or Caus. P. -शामयति, -यितुम्, to ob-<BR>serve, perceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिश्चित
अभिनिश्चित अभि-निश्चित, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. चि),<BR>quite convinced of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिष्कारिन्
अभिनिष्कारिन् अभि-निष्-कारिन्, ई, इणी, इ<BR>(rt. कृ), Ved. intending anything evil against, in-<BR>juring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिष्कृत
अभि-निष्कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, directed against (as<BR>an evil action).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिष्क्रम्
अभिनिष्क्रम् अभि-निष्-क्रम् (-निस्-क्रम्), cl.<BR>1. P. A., cl. 4. P. -क्रामति, -क्रमते, -क्राम्यति,<BR>-क्रमितुम्, to go out or forth, to lead towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिष्क्रमण|अभिनिष्क्रमणं
अभि-निष्क्रमण, अम्, n. going forth; (with<BR>Buddhists) leaving the house in order to become an<BR>anchorite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिष्क्रान्त
अभि-निष्क्रान्त, अस्, आ, अम्, gone out or forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिष्टान|अभिनिष्टानः
अभिनिष्टान अभि-निष्टान. See अभि-निः-<BR>स्तन् last col.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिष्पत्
अभिनिष्पत् अभि-निष्-पत् (-निस्-पत्), cl. 1. P.<BR>-पतति, -तितुम्, to fly away, rush out; to spring<BR>forth, shoot forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिष्पतन|अभिनिष्पतनं
अभि-निष्पतन, अम्, n. issuing, sallying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिष्पद्
अभिनिष्पद् अभि-निष्-पद् (-निस्-पद्), cl. 4.<BR>A. -पद्यते, -पत्तुम्, to come to; to enter into, be-<BR>come (with acc.); to appear: Caus. -पादयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to bring to help to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिष्पत्ति|अभिनिष्पत्तिः
अभि-निष्पत्ति, इस्, f. completion, end, termina-<BR>tion; appearance (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिष्पन्न
अभि-निष्पन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, finished, completed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0064-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनिह्नव|अभिनिह्नवः
अभिनिह्नव अभि-निह्नव, अस्, m. (rt. ह्नु),<BR>denial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0064-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिनी
