अभि-भञ्जत्, अन्, अती, अत्, breaking down, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0065-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

