अभिभा
2. अभि-भा, f., Ved. apparition, phenomenon, in-<BR>auspicious omen; state of being overpowered, calamity;<BR>act of overpowering, superiority.<BR>—अभिभायतन<BR>(˚भा-आय्˚), अम्, n. abode of superiority; N. of the<BR>eight sources of superiority with Buddhists.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0065-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिभार
अभिभार अभि-भार, अस्, आ, अम्, very heavy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0065-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

