1. अभि-शोचयिष्णु, उस्, उस्, उ, tormenting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशोक|अभिशोकः
अभिशोक 2. अभि-शोक, अस्, m. (rt. 2. शुच्),<BR>Ved. ardour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशोच
2. अभि-शोच, अस्, आ, अम्, shining, glowing with<BR>heat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशोचयिष्णु
2. अभि-शोचयिष्णु, उस्, उस्, उ, glowing with heat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशौरि
अभिशौरि अभि-शौरि, ind. towards Śauri<BR>or Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिश्रवण|अभिश्रवणं
अभिश्रवण अभि-श्रवण, अम्, n. (rt. श्रु),<BR>repeating Vedic texts, sitting down to a Śrāddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिश्राव|अभिश्रावः
अभि-श्राव, अस्, m. hearing, becoming renowned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिश्रि
अभिश्रि अभि-श्रि, cl. 1. P. -श्रयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to resort to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिश्री
अभि-श्री, ईस्, ईस्, m.f. (from श्री connected with श्रि),<BR>Ved. joining, connecting one's self with, mixing;<BR>combining, holding together, arranging, putting in<BR>order, united, approaching; having recourse to,<BR>worthy to be had recourse to; respected; shining;<BR>powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिश्रिष्
अभिश्रिष् अभि-श्रिष् or अभि-श्लिष्, ट् (rt.<BR>श्लिष्), Ved. a ligature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिश्लेषण|अभिश्लेषणं
अभि-श्लेषण, अम्, n. a bandage, ligature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिश्वस्
अभिश्वस् अभि-श्वस्, अस्, m., Ved. one who<BR>breathes upon or towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिश्वस|अभिश्वसः
अभि-श्वस, अस्, m., Ved. breathing forth or on,<BR>eructation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिश्वास|अभिश्वासः
अभि-श्वास, अस्, m. breathing upon or towards,<BR>blowing into a flame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषञ्ज्|अभिषंज्
अभिषञ्ज् अभि-षञ्ज् (-सञ्ज्), cl. 1. P. -षजति,<BR>-षङ्क्तुम्, to be in contact with; to revile, curse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषक्त
अभि-षक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, possessed by evil spirits,<BR>humiliated, defeated, reviled, cursed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषङ्ग|अभिषंग|अभिषंगः|अभिषङ्गः
अभि-षङ्ग, अस्, m. or अभि-षञ्जन, अम्, n.<BR>complete contact, union; connection, copulation, as-<BR>sociation, company; embracing; possession by evil<BR>spirits; oath; curse or imprecation; false accusation,<BR>calumny; defeat, blow, shock, sudden affliction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषङ्गज्वर|अभिषङ्गज्वरः
अभिषङ्ग-ज्वर, अस्, m. a fever supposed to be<BR>caused by evil spirits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषव|अभिषवं|अभिषवः
अभिषव अभि-षव. See अभि-षु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषह्
अभिषह् अभि-षह् (-सह्), cl. 1. A. -षहते,<BR>-हितुम् or -षोढुम्, to attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषह्य
अभि-षह्य, ind. violently, by force, insolently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषाच्
अभिषाच् अभि-षाच्, क्, क्, क् (rt. सच्), Ved.<BR>following; honouring, paying attention to, devoted;<BR>defeating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषिच्
अभिषिच् अभि-षिच् (-सिच्), cl. 6. P. A.<BR>-षिञ्चति, -ते, -षेक्तुम्, to sprinkle; to water, wet;<BR>to consecrate, anoint, appoint by consecration; A. to<BR>be consecrated or inaugurated: Desid. -षिषिक्षति,<BR>to be desirous of watering, &c.: Caus. -षेचयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to have (another) consecrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषिक्त
अभि-षिक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, sprinkled; anointed, in-<BR>stalled, inaugurated, enthroned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषिषिक्षत्
अभि-षिषिक्षत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, desiring to in-<BR>augurate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेक|अभिषेकः
अभि-षेक, अस्, m. sprinkling, anointing; inaugu-<BR>rating or consecrating by sprinkling water; inaugu-<BR>ration of a king, royal unction; the water or liquid<BR>used at an inauguration; religious bathing; ablution;<BR>bathing of the divinity to whom worship is offered.<BR>—अभिषेक-शाला, f. the hall of coronation.<BR>—अभि-<BR>षेकार्द्र-शिरस् (˚क-आर्˚), आस्, आस्, अस्, wet on the<BR>head with the royal unction.<BR>—अभि-षेकाह (˚क-<BR>अह्˚), अस्, m. day of inauguration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेक्तृ
अभि-षेक्तृ, ता, m. an anointer, one who inau-<BR>gurates.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेचन|अभिषेचनं
अभि-षेचन, अम्, n. sprinkling; initiation, in-<BR>auguration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेचनीय|अभिषेचनीयः
अभि-षेचनीय or अभि-षेच्य or अभि-षेक्य,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, worthy of inauguration; belonging to in-<BR>auguration; (-नीयस्), m., N. of a sacrificial cere-<BR>mony performed at the inauguration of a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेचित
अभि-षेचित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to be sprinkled,<BR>inaugurated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषु
अभिषु अभि-षु (-सु), cl. 5. P. -षुणोति,<BR>-षोतुम्, to express the Soma juice or any other<BR>juice; to moisten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषव|अभिषवं|अभिषवः
अभि-षव, अस्, m. or अभि-षवण, अम्, n.<BR>pressing out the juice of the Soma plant; distillation;<BR>religious bathing, ablution preparatory to religious<BR>rites; drinking Soma juice, sacrifice; ferment, yeast,<BR>any substance producing vinous fermentation; (अम्),<BR>n. sour gruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषवणी
अभि-षवणी, f. an apparatus for pressing the Soma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषवणीय
अभि-षवणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be expressed as<BR>Soma juice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषावक|अभिषावकः
अभि-षावक, अस्, or अभि-षोतृ, ता, m. the<BR>priest or any one who expresses the Soma juice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषावकीय
अभि-षावकीय, nom. P. -यति, -यितुम्, to long<BR>for such a priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषुत|अभिषुतं
अभि-षुत, अस्, आ, अम्, expressed as Soma juice;<BR>(अम्), n. sour gruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषुक|अभिषुकः
अभिषुक अभि-षुक, अस्, m., N. of a plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेण
अभिषेण अभि-षेण, अस्, m., Ved. approach-<BR>ing as an enemy with an army; directing arrows against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेणन|अभिषेणनं
अभि-षेणन, अम्, n. march to attack or repel<BR>an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषेणय
अभि-षेणय, nom. P. -षेणयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>approach with an army, to march with an army<BR>against the enemy.<BR>—अभि-षिषेणयिषु, उस्, उस्,<BR>उ, desirous of approaching with an army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिषो
अभिषो अभि-षो (-सो), cl. 4. P. -ष्यति,<BR>-षातुम्, to put an end to, to destroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्यत्|अभिष्यन्त्
अभि-ष्यत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, destroying, killing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्टन|अभिष्टनः
अभिष्टन अभि-ष्टन, अस्, m. (rt. स्तन्), Ved.<BR>roaring, bawling, a shout.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्टि|अभिष्टिः
अभिष्टि अभि-ष्टि, इस्, m. (fr. 1. अभ्य्-अस्; ac-<BR>cording to other authorities fr. अभीष् or fr. अभि-ष्ठा,<BR>q. v.), Ved. an assistant, a protector; one who is to be<BR>praised or worshipped (as a protector); one who ap-<BR>proaches in order to assist, one who approaches to<BR>attack; one who assails an enemy, one who overpowers<BR>an enemy, one who approaches in order to obtain; de-<BR>siring, desire; (इस्), f. assistance, protection; favour, help,<BR>worshipping, praising; a sacrifice, a hymn; approach-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-c" target="_blank">Page0068-c+ 67</a>]<BR>ing in order to assist, approaching in general, access.<BR>—अभिष्टि-कृत्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. assisting; granting<BR>desires.<BR>—अभिष्टि-द्युम्न, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. giving<BR>happiness.<BR>—अभिष्टि-पा, आस्, m., Ved. guarding from<BR>enemies, keeping off enemies.<BR>—अभिष्टि-मत्, आन्,<BR>अती, अत्, Ved. desirable, favourable.<BR>—अभिष्टि-शवस्,<BR>आस्, m., Ved. rendering assistance, able to overcome<BR>enemies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्टु
अभिष्टु अभि-ष्टु (-स्तु), cl. 2. P. -ष्टौति,<BR>-ष्टोतुम्, to praise, extol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्टव|अभिष्टवः
अभि-ष्टव, अस्, m. praise, eulogy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्टुत|अभिष्टुतं
अभि-ष्टुत, अस्, आ, अम्, praised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्टुवत्
अभि-ष्टुवत्, अन्, अती, अत्, praising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्ठा
अभिष्ठा अभि-ष्ठा (-स्था), cl. 1. P. -तिष्ठति,<BR>-ष्ठातुम्, to trample upon, destroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्यत्|अभिष्यन्त्
अभिष्यत् अभि-ष्यत्. See under अबि-षो.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्यन्द|अभिष्यंदः|अभिष्यन्दः
अभिष्यन्द अभि-ष्यन्द or अभि-स्यन्द, अस्,<BR>m. (rt. स्यन्द्), oozing or flowing; weakness of or<BR>running at the eyes; great increase or enlargement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0068-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिष्यन्दिन्|अभिष्यंदिन्
