अभिसन्देह अभि-सन्देह, अस्, m. (rt. दिह्), ex-<BR>change; organ of generation. In the last sense also<BR>written अभि-सन्दोह.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0069-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

