अभिसंहित
अभि-संहित, अस्, आ, अम्, agreed, contracted; at-<BR>tached to, interested, following any object eagerly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0069-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसन्ध|अभिसंधः
अभि-सन्ध or अभि-सन्धक, अस्, m. a deceiver,<BR>a calumniator.<BR>2. अभि-सन्धा, f. speech, declaration, promise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

