अभि-सन्धान, अम्, n. speech, deliberate declara-<BR>tion; attachment or interest in any object; special<BR>agreement; cheating, deceiving; making peace or<BR>alliance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिसन्धाय|अभिसंधाय|अभिसंधायः
