अभिसन्धि|अभिसंधि|अभिसंधिः|अभिसन्धिः
अभि-सन्धि, इस्, m. speaking or declaring deliber-<BR>ately, purpose, intention, object, meaning; special<BR>agreement; cheating, deceiving; making peace or<BR>alliance; joint, junction.<BR>—अभिसन्धि-कृत, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, done intentionally or on purpose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

