अभ्यक्त
अभ्य्-अक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, oiled, anointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0071-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

