अभ्यतिक्षर्
अभ्यतिक्षर् अभ्य्-अति-क्षर् (अभि-अति˚), cl. 1.<BR>P. A. -क्षरति, -ते, -रितुम्, Ved. -रध्यै, to flow<BR>over to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0071-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

