अभ्यतीत
अभ्य्-अतीत, अस्, आ, अम्, dead, passed away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0071-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यधिक
