अभ्यध्वम्
अभ्यध्वम् अभ्य्-अध्वम्, ind. towards the<BR>way, on the way; (ए), ind. on the way, near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0071-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यनुज्ञा
