अभ्यनुज्ञात
अभ्य्-अनुज्ञात, अस्, आ, अम्, allowed, permitted,<BR>assented to, dismissed; ordered, commanded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0071-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

