अभ्यन्तर|अभ्यंतर|अभ्यन्तरं
अभ्यन्तर अभ्य्-अन्तर, अस्, आ, अम्, interior,<BR>being inside; initiated in, conversant with; next, nearly<BR>related, intimate; (अम्), n. inner part, interior, in-<BR>side, middle; included space; (अम् or अतस्), ind.<BR>in the interior, inwards.<BR>—अभ्यन्तर-करण, see<BR>अन्तःकरण.<BR>—अभ्यन्तर-कला, f. the secret art<BR>or the art of coquetry.<BR>—अभ्यन्तरायाम (˚र-आय्˚),<BR>अस्, m. curvature of the spine by spasm; emprosthonos.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0071-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यन्तरक|अभ्यंतरकः|अभ्यन्तरकः
