अभ्यम्
अभ्यम् अभ्य्-अम् (अभि-अम्), cl. 1. P., Ved.<BR>-अमति, -मितुम्, to advance violently against, to at-<BR>tack, to pain, hurt; to be angry with; to overcome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0071-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यमन|अभ्यमनं
