अभ्यमिन्
अभ्य्-अमिन्, ई, इनी, इ, attacking, inclined to attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0071-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

