अभ्यर्चत्
अभ्य्-अर्चत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, worshipping, reverencing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0071-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्चन|अभ्यर्चनं|अभ्यर्च्चन
अभ्य्-अर्चन, अम्, n. or अभ्य्-अर्चा, f. worship,<BR>reverence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0071-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

