अभ्यर्थित
अभ्य्-अर्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, asked, invited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0071-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्थिन्
अभ्य्-अर्थिन्, ई, इनी, इ, asking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0071-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्द्
