अभ्याघात|अभ्याघातः
अभ्याघात अभ्य्-आघात, अस्, m. (rt. हन्),<BR>assault, attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्याघातिन्
अभ्य्-आघातिन्, ई, इनी, इ, attacking, assailing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्याचक्ष्
अभ्याचक्ष् अभ्य्-आ-चक्ष् (अभि-आ˚), cl. 2. A.<BR>-चष्टे, -ष्टुम्, to look at; to speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्याचर्
अभ्याचर् अभ्य्-आ-चर् (अभि-आ˚), cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-चरति, -ते, -रितुम्, Ved. -इतवे, -इतवै, -रसे,<BR>-रध्यै, to approach, practice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्याचार|अभ्याचारः
अभ्य्-आचार, अस्, m., Ved. approaching (as an enemy),<BR>disturbing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्याज्
अभ्याज् अभ्य्-आज् (अभि-आ-अज्), cl. 1. P. -आजति,<BR>-जितुम्, to drive near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्याज्ञाय|अभ्याज्ञायः
अभ्याज्ञाय अभ्य्-आज्ञाय, अस्, m. (rt. ज्ञा), Ved.<BR>order, command.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यातन्
अभ्यातन् अभ्य्-आ-तन् (अभि-आ˚), cl. 8. A.,<BR>Ved. -तनुते, -नितुम्, to take aim at, shoot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यातान|अभ्यातानः
अभ्य्-आतान, अस्, m. spreading over; expansion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यातप्
अभ्यातप् अभ्य्-आ-तप् (अभि-आ˚), cl. 1. P.<BR>-तपति, -प्तुम्, to distress, torment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यातॄ
अभ्यातॄ अभ्य्-आ-तॄ (अभि-आ˚), cl. 1. P. -तरति,<BR>-रितुम्, -रीतुम्, to come up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यात्म
अभ्यात्म अभ्य्-आत्म, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. directed<BR>towards one's self; (अम्), ind. towards one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यात्मतरम्
—अभ्यात्म-तरम्, ind. more towards one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यादा
