अभ्यात्त
अभ्य्-आत्त, अस्, आ, अम् (for अभ्य्-आदत्त), obtained;<BR>having gained, encompassing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यादान|अभ्यादानं
अभ्य्-आदान, अम्, n. beginning, commencement;<BR>first beginning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यादिश्
अभ्यादिश् अभ्य्-आ-दिश् (अभि-आ˚), cl. 6. P.<BR>-दिशति, -देष्टुम्, to aim at (in talk), to have in<BR>view.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्याधा
अभ्याधा अभ्य्-आ-धा (अभि-आ˚), cl. 3. P.<BR>-दधाति, -धातुम्, to lay on (fuel, &c.), to add,<BR>apply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्याधान|अभ्याधानं
अभ्य्-आधान, अम्, n. laying or placing on, adding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्याहित
अभ्य्-आहित, अस्, आ, अम्, laid on, put on.<BR>—अभ्या-<BR>हित-पशु, उस्, m. a present usual in some districts of<BR>India.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यानी
अभ्यानी अभ्य्-आ-नी (अभि-आ˚), cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-नयति, -ते, -नेतुम्, to pour into, mix with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यानृत्
अभ्यानृत् अभ्य्-आ-नृत् (अभि-आ˚), cl. 4. P.,<BR>Ved. -नृत्यति, -नर्तितुम्, to dance towards, to<BR>hasten near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यान्त|अभ्यांत
अभ्यान्त अभ्य्-आन्त, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. अम्<BR>with अभि, see अभ्य्-अम्), sick, diseased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्याप्
अभ्याप् अभ्य्-आप् (अभि-आप्), cl. 5. P. -आप्नोति,<BR>-प्तुम्, to reach to, to get, to obtain: Caus. -आप-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to bring to an end: Desid. -ईप्सति, to<BR>strive to reach, to ask for, to desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभीप्सित|अभीप्सितं
अभीप्सित, अस्, आ, अम्, desired, acceptable, dear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यापत्
अभ्यापत् अभ्य्-आ-पत् (अभि-आ˚), cl. 1. P.<BR>-पतति, -तितुम्, to jump on, to hasten near to, rush<BR>towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यापात|अभ्यापातः
अभ्य्-आपात, अस्, m. calamity, misfortune.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यापद्
अभ्यापद् अभ्य्-आ-पद्, cl. 4. A. -पद्यते,<BR>-पत्तुम्, to come to, to approach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यामर्द|अभ्यामर्दः|अभ्यामर्द्द
