अभ्यारोह्य
अभ्य्-आ-रोह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be ascended, to be<BR>gained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

