अभ्यासादन|अभ्यासादनं
अभ्य्-आसादन, अम्, n. striking so as to disable an<BR>enemy, facing an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0072-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

