अभ्य्-उक्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, besprinkled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0073-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्युक्ष्य
अभ्य्-उक्ष्य, ind. having sprinkled over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0073-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्युच्
