अभ्युच्चित
अभ्य्-उच्चित, अस्, आ, अम्, increased, augmented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0073-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

