अभ्युष|अभ्युषः
अभ्युष अभ्य्-उष or अभ्य्-ऊष or अभ्य्-<BR>ओष, अस्, m. (rt. उष्), a kind of cake of grain &c.<BR>half dressed, slightly scorched, or parched so as to be<BR>eaten from the hand; bread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्युषीय
अभ्युषीय or अभ्यूषीय or अभ्युष्य or<BR>अभ्यूष्य or अभ्य्-ओषीय or अभ्य्-ओष्य, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, consisting of, or belonging to, or fit for the above<BR>cake or preparation of parched grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्युषित|अभ्युषितः
