अभ्यूढ
2. अभ्य्-ऊढ, अस्, आ, अम्, reasoned upon, con-<BR>cluded, inferred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यूह|अभ्यूहः
अभ्य्-ऊह, अस्, m. discussion, reasoning, deduction,<BR>inference; supplying an ellipsis; understanding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यूहितव्य
अभ्य्-ऊहितव्य or अभ्य्-ऊह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be<BR>inferred or guessed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0074-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्युह्य
