अमत्रिन्
अमत्रिन्, ई, इणी, इ, Ved. strong, powerful; having<BR>a drinking-vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0074-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमत्सर|अमत्सरः
