अमद
अमद अ-मद, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. मद्), cheerless,<BR>grave, sorrowful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0074-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमत्त
अ-मत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, not inebriated, sober, sane,<BR>not mad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0074-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमधव्य
