अमध्यम
अमध्यम अ-मध्यम, अस्, आ, अम्, non-cen-<BR>tral, not being in the middle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0074-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमध्यस्थ
अमध्यस्थ अ-मध्यस्थ, अस्, आ, अम्, not in-<BR>different.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0074-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमनस्
अमनस् अ-मनस्, अस्, n. not the organ of<BR>desire, non-perception, want of perception; (आस्, आस्,<BR>अस्), = the next.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0074-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमनस्क
अ-मनस्क, अस्, आ, अम्, without the organ of desire,<BR>without perception; without intellect, unconscious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0074-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

