अररु|अररुः
अररु 2. अररु, उस्, उस्, उ (rt. ऋ), Ved. moving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0081-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अररे
