अरर्य
अरर्य अरर्य, nom. P. अरर्यति, -यितुम्, to<BR>work with an awl; to try, put to the proof (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0081-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरलु|अरलुः
