अरुच्
अरुच् अ-रुच्, क्, क्, क्, Ved. having no light,<BR>lightless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

