अरुणी-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, reddened, turned or be-<BR>come red.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

