अरुष|अरुषं|अरुषः
अरुष अरुष, अस्, ई, अम् (said to be fr. rt.<BR>ऋ and connected with अरुण), Ved. red, reddish; the<BR>colour of Agni and his horses; (अस्), m. the red horse of<BR>Agni, flame; the sun, the day; the red storm-cloud;<BR>(ई), f. the dawn; a red horse; flame; N. of the wife<BR>of Bhṛgu and the mother of Aurva.<BR>—अरुष-स्तूप,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. having brilliant masses of flame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

