अरुस्
अरुस् अरुस्, उस्, उस्, उस् (fr. rt. ऋ), wounded,<BR>sore; (उस्), n. a sore or wounded; ind. a joint.<BR>—अरुष्-<BR>कर, अस्, आ, अम्, causing wounds, wounding; (अस्),<BR>m. the plant Semecarpus Anacardium; the nut of<BR>this tree.<BR>—अरुष्-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, wounded.<BR>—अ-<BR>रुः-स्राण, अम्, n., Ved. a kind of medical prepara-<BR>tion for wounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

