अ-रूक्ष्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. soft, tender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरूप|अरूपः
