अरेणु|अरेणुः
अरेणु अ-रेणु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. not dusty,<BR>not touching the dust (of the earth); (उ), n. what is<BR>not dusty, the ether.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

