अवघर्षित
अव-घर्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, rubbed off, scrubbed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

