अवघ्रात
अव-घ्रात, अस्, आ, अम्, smelled, smelled at; kissed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच
अवच अवच, lower. This word is con-<BR>nected with अव as उच्च is with उद्, but only found<BR>in उच्चावच, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

