अवचक्षण
अव-चक्षण, अम्, n. looking down upon?<BR>(Gaṇa to Pāṇini VIII. 1. 27, 57).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवचन
अवचन अ-वचन, अम्, n. absence of asser-<BR>tion, silence, taciturnity; (अस्, आ, अम्), not speaking,<BR>silent.<BR>—अ-वचन-कर, अस्, आ, अम्, not doing what<BR>one is bid, disobedient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

