अवचन्द्रमस|अवचंद्रमसं
अवचन्द्रमस अव-चन्द्रमस, अम्, n., Ved.<BR>the looking down of the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवचर्
अवचर् अव-चर्, cl. 1. P. A. -चरति, -ते,<BR>-रितुम्, Ved. -रितवे or -वै, -रसे, -रध्यै, to<BR>move or come down; to go down towards: Caus.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">Page0089-b+ 74</a>]<BR>-चारयति, -यितुम्, to cause to move or descend<BR>upon; to employ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवचर|अवचरः
अव-चर, अस्, आ, अम्, going or moving down or<BR>in or upon; (अस्), m. place of descent, road, field of<BR>action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवचारण
अव-चारण, अम्, n. employing, application, mode<BR>of proceeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवचार्य|अवचार्य्य
