अवचि
अवचि 1. अव-चि, cl. 3. P., Ved. -चिकेति,<BR>-चेतुम्, to worship, honour, respect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवचि
