अवचय|अवचयः
अव-चय, अस्, m. gathering, especially flowers,<BR>fruits, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवचायिन्
अव-चायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, gathering, picking off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवचित
अव-चित, अस्, आ, अम्, gathered; filled, inhabited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवचूड|अवचूडः
