अवचृत्
अवचृत् अव-चृत्, cl. 6. P. -चृतति, -चर्ति-<BR>तुम्, to let loose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच्छद्
