अवच्छद|अवच्छदः
अव-च्छद, अस्, m. a cover, covering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच्छम्म
अव-च्छम्म, अस्, आ, अम्, covered over, over-<BR>spread, filled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच्छाद्य
अव-च्छाद्य, ind. having covered over; having<BR>obscured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच्छिद्
अवच्छिद् अव-च्छिद् (-छिद्), cl. 7. P. A.<BR>-च्छिनत्ति, -च्छिन्ते, -च्छेत्तुम्, to cut off, detach,<BR>separate, to tear in pieces, break asunder; to excerpt,<BR>distinguish, discriminate; to interrupt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच्छिन्न|अवच्छिन्नं
अव-च्छिन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, cut off, separated, divided,<BR>detached, excerpted; broken; (in logic) predicated,<BR>i. e. separated from everything else by the properties<BR>predicated; bounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच्छेद|अवच्छेदः
अव-च्छेद, अस्, m. anything cut off; part, portion;<BR>separation, distinction; discrimination; distinguish-<BR>ing; boundary, limit; a predicate, the property of<BR>a thing by which it is distinguished from everything<BR>else.<BR>—अवच्छेदावच्छेद (˚द-अव्˚), अस्, m. gene-<BR>ralising, removing distinctions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच्छेदक|अवच्छेदकं|अवच्छेदकः
अव-च्छेदक, अस्, इका, अम्, separating, distin-<BR>guishing, particularising, determining; bounding, se-<BR>parating one thing from another; peculiar; (अस्), m.<BR>that which distinguishes, &c.; a predicate, character-<BR>istic, property; boundary, limit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच्छेदन|अवच्छेदनं
अव-च्छेदन, अम्, n. cutting off; separating, di-<BR>viding; discriminating, distinguishing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच्छेद्य
अव-च्छेद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be cut off, separated, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच्छुरित|अवच्छुरितं|अवछुरित
अवच्छुरित अव-च्छुरित or अव-च्छुरितक,<BR>अम्, n. (fr. rt. छुर्, ‘to split,’ with अव, ‘that which<BR>splits one's sides?’), a horse-laugh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच्छो
अवच्छो अव-च्छो (-छो), cl. 4. P. -च्छ्यति,<BR>-च्छातुम्, to cut off or away, to flay, to skin, to reap.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवच्छात
अव-च्छात, अस्, आ, अम्, cut off, flayed, emaciated<BR>by abstinence; reaped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवजनित
अवजनित अव-जनित, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. जन्),<BR>born, brought forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवजि
अवजि अव-जि, cl. 1. P. -जयति, -जेतुम्, to<BR>spoil (i. e. deprive by conquest), to win; recover;<BR>to ward off; conquer: Desid. -जिगीषति, to wish to<BR>win or recover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवजय|अवजयः
अव-जय, अस्, m. the act of overcoming, victory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवजित
अव-जित, अस्, आ, अम्, conquered; contemned, dis-<BR>regarded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवजुष्ट
अवजुष्ट अव-जुष्ट, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. जुष्),<BR>visited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवज्ञा
अवज्ञा 1. अव-ज्ञा, cl. 9. P. -जानाति, -ज्ञातुम्,<BR>to disesteem, have a low opinion of, despise, treat<BR>with contempt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवज्ञा
2. अव-ज्ञा, f. or अव-ज्ञान, अम्, n. contempt, dis-<BR>esteem, disrepect (with obj. in loc. or gen.).<BR>—अव-<BR>ज्ञोपहत (˚ज्ञा-उप्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, treated with con-<BR>tempt, humiliated, degraded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवज्ञात|अवज्ञातं
अव-ज्ञात, अस्, आ, अम्, despised, disrespected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवज्ञेय
