अवण्ड|अवंड
अवण्ड अ-वण्ड, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. not with-<BR>out a tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

