अवतत
अव-तत, अस्, आ, अम्, overspread, canopied, covered;<BR>loosened.<BR>—अवतत-धन्वन्, आ, m., Ved. whose<BR>bow is unbent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवतति|अवततिः
अव-तति, इस्, f. stretching, extending,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

