अवतप्त
अव-तप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, heated.<BR>—अवतप्ते-न-<BR>कुल-स्थित, अम्, n. an ichneumon's standing on hot<BR>ground (metaphorically said of the inconstancy of<BR>man).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0089-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

