1. अव-दान, अम्, n. a pure or approved occupa-<BR>tion; an act accomplished; a great or glorious act,<BR>achievement; object of a legend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवदान|अवदानं
अवदान 2. अव-दान, अम्, n. See under<BR>अव-दो.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवदान्य
अवदान्य अ-वदान्य, अस्, आ, अम्, niggardly,<BR>stingy [cf. अभ्य्-अवदान्य].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवदावद
अवदावद अ-वदावद, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved.<BR>having no bad reputation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवदिश्
