अवदिह्
अवदिह् अव-दिह्, cl. 2. P. -देग्धि, -धुम्,<BR>to besmear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवदृश्
