अवदॄ
अवदॄ अव-दॄ, cl. 9. P. -दृणाति, -दरितुम्<BR>or -रीतुम्, to split or force open, to rend or tear<BR>asunder: Caus. -दारयति, -यितुम्, to cause to burst,<BR>to rend or split: Pass. -दीर्यते, to be split, to burst.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवदरण|अवदरणं
