अवदारित
अव-दारित, अस्, आ, अम्, torn off or away, rent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवदीर्ण|अवदीर्णं
