अवत्त
अव-त्त, अस्, आ, अम्, cut off, divided.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवत्तिन्
अवत्तिन्, ई, इनी, इ, (after a cardinal num.) dividing<BR>into so many parts; e. g. पञ्चावत्तिन्, dividing into<BR>five parts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवदान|अवदानं
2. अव-दान, अम्, n. cutting or dividing into pieces,<BR>a part, portion; the root of a fragrant grass, see अव-<BR>दाह. (For 1. अव-दान, see under अव-दात.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0090-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवदोह|अवदोहः
