अवधानिन्
अव-धानिन्, ई, इनी, इ, attentive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0090-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवधि|अवधिः
