अवधीरित
अवधीरित, अस्, आ, अम्, disrepected, disregarded,<BR>despised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0090-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवधीरिन्
