अवधारक
अव-धारक, अस्, इका, अम्, determining accurately,<BR>restricting one's self to anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0090-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवधारण|अवधारणं
