अवध्यात
अव-ध्यात, अस्, आ, अम्, spurned, disdained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवध्र
