अवध्वंस|अवध्वंसः
अव-ध्वंस, अस्, m. falling off or from; sprink-<BR>ling; meal, dust; abandoning, quitting; disrespect,<BR>censure, blame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

