अवप्लुत्य
अव-प्लुत्य, ind. having jumped down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवफ|अवफः
अवफ अव-फ, अस्, m. flatulence, wind from<BR>the bowels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवबधा
अवबधा अव-बधा, f. segment of the base<BR>of a triangle [cf. अ-बधा and आ-बाधा].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवबन्ध|अवबंधः
अवबन्ध अव-बन्ध, अस्, m. falling or palsy<BR>of the eyelids, Blepharoptosis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवबाहुक|अवबाहुकः
अवबाहुक अव-बाहुक, अस्, m. spasm in the<BR>arm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवबुध्
अवबुध् अव-बुध्, cl. 4. A. -बुध्यते,<BR>-बोद्धुम्, to awake, become sensible or aware of,<BR>perceive, know: Caus. -बोधयति, -यितुम्, to make<BR>one aware of, inform, explain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवबोध|अवबोधः
अव-बोध, अस्, m. waking, being awake; percep-<BR>tion, knowledge; discrimination, judgment; teaching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवबोधक|अवबोधकः
अव-बोधक, अस्, m. an awakener, a teacher.<BR>—अवबोधक-त्व, अम्, n. instruction, guidance,<BR>explanation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवबोधन|अवबोधनं
अव-बोधन, अम्, n. perception, knowledge, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवब्रव|अवब्रवः
अवब्रव अव-ब्रव, अस्, m. (rt. ब्रू with<BR>अव), ill report, defamation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभञ्ज्|अवभंज्
अवभञ्ज् अव-भञ्ज्, cl. 7. P. -भनक्ति,<BR>-भङ्क्तुम्, to break off, smash.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभज्य
अव-भज्य, ind. having broken off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभञ्जन|अवभंजनं
अव-भञ्जन, अम्, n. breaking off, tearing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभर्त्स्
अवभर्त्स् अव-भर्त्स्, cl. 10. P. (or A. ?)<BR>-भर्त्सयति, -यितुम्, to deter by scolding or<BR>threatening, to menace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभा
अवभा अव-भा, cl. 2. P. -भाति, -तुम्, to<BR>shine downwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभाषण|अवभाषणं
अवभाषण अव-भाषण, अम्, n. speaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभास्
अवभास् अव-भास्, cl. 1. A. -भासते, -सि-<BR>तुम्, to shine forth, become manifest: Caus. -भास-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to illuminate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभास|अवभासः
अव-भास, अस्, m. splendor, lustre, light; appear-<BR>ance, manifestation; space, reach, compass.<BR>—अव-<BR>भास-कर, अस्, m., N. of a divinity.<BR>—अवभास-<BR>प्रभ, आस्, m. pl., N. of a whole class of deities.<BR>—अवभास-प्राप्त, N. of a world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभासक
अव-भासक, अस्, इका, अम्, irradiating, luminous.<BR>—अवभासक-त्व, अम्, n. luminousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभासित
—अवभासित, अस्, आ, अम्, illumined, lighted, radi-<BR>ant; evident, manifest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभासिन्
अव-भासिन्, ई, इनी, इ, shining, bright; (नी), f. the<BR>outer skin or cuticle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभिद्
अवभिद् अव-भिद्, cl. 7. P. -भिनत्ति, -भेत्-<BR>तुम्, to break off, shatter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभिन्न
अव-भिन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, broken off, pierced, di-<BR>vided.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभेदिन्
अव-भेदिन्, ई, इनी, इ, breaking off, shattering,<BR>dividing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभुज्
अवभुज् अव-भुज्, cl. 6. P. -भुजति, -भोक्-<BR>तुम्, to bend down, curve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभुग्न
अव-भुग्न, अस्, आ, अम्, contracted, bent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभृथ|अवभृथः
अवभृथ अव-भृथ, अस्, m. (fr. rt. भृ with<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">Page0092-a+ 74</a>]<BR>अव), carrying off, removing; purification by bathing<BR>of the sacrificer and the sacrificial vessels after a sacri-<BR>fice; the water of purification; a supplementary<BR>sacrifice to atone for defects in a principal and pre-<BR>ceding one.<BR>—अवभृथ-स्नान, अम्, n. bathing<BR>or ablution after a sacrificial ceremony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0091-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभ्र|अवभ्रः
अव-भ्र, अस्, m. abduction, carrying off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवभ्रट|अवभ्रटः
अवभ्रट अव-भ्रट, अस्, आ, अम्, flat-nosed;<BR>(अम्), n. state of having a flat nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवम|अवमं|अवमः
अवम अवम, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. 2. अव), under-<BR>most, inferior, lowest, base; next, intimate; last,<BR>youngest; growing less, decreasing; (अम्), n. a lunar<BR>day exactly coinciding with a solar one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमन्
अवमन् अव-मन्, cl. 4. A. or poet. P.<BR>-मन्यते, -ति, -मन्तुम्, to despise, treat con-<BR>temptuously: Caus. -मानयति, -यितुम्, to despise,<BR>&c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमत|अवमतं
अव-मत, अस्, आ, अम्, despised, disregarded, con-<BR>temned.<BR>—अवमताङ्कुश (˚त-अङ्˚), अस्, m. a restive<BR>elephant that disdains the hook, one in rut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमति|अवमतिः
अव-मति, इस्, m. a master, an owner; (इस्), f.<BR>aversion, dislike; disregard, contempt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमत्य
अव-मत्य, ind. having scorned, despising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमन्तव्य|अवमंतव्य
अव-मन्तव्य or अव-मन्य, अस्, आ, अम्, con-<BR>temptible, to be treated with disrepect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमन्तृ|अवमंतृ
अव-मन्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, despising; contemptuous,<BR>disrespectful; arrogant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमान|अवमानः
अव-मान, अस्, m. disrespect, contempt.<BR>—अव-<BR>मान-ता, f. or अवमान-त्व, अम्, n. dishonour-<BR>ableness, contempt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमानन|अवमाननं
अव-मानन, अम्, आ, n. f. disrespect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमाननीय
अव-माननीय or अव-मान्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be<BR>disrepected, contemptible, despicable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमानित|अवमानितः
अव-मानित, अस्, आ, अम्, disrepected, despised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमानिन्
अव-मानिन्, ई, इनी, इ, contemning, despising, be-<BR>having disrespectfully.<BR>—अवमानि-ता, f. or अव-<BR>मानि-त्व, अम्, n. disrespectfulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमन्थ|अवमंथ|अवमन्थः
अवमन्थ अव-मन्थ or अव-मन्थक, अस्,<BR>m. (rt. मन्थ्), swellings caused by boils or con-<BR>tusions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमर्श|अवमर्शः
अवमर्श अव-मर्श, अस्, m. See अव-मृश्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमर्षण|अवमर्षणं
अवमर्षण अव-मर्षण, अम्, n. (rt. मृष्),<BR>intolerance, impatience; effacing, obliterating, banish-<BR>ing from recollection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमुच्
अवमुच् अव-मुच्, cl. 6. P. -मुञ्चति, -मोक्-<BR>तुम्, to loosen; to let go; to take off (a garment,<BR>&c.); to unharness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमुच्य
अव-मुच्य, ind. having unloosed or unharnessed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमोचन|अवमोचनं
अव-मोचन, अम्, n. letting go, loosening; setting<BR>at liberty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमूत्र्
अवमूत्र् अव-मूत्र्, cl. 10. P. -मूत्रयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to urine upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमूत्रयत्
अव-मूत्रयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, urining upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमूर्धशय|अवमूर्द्धशयः|अवमूर्धशयः
अवमूर्धशय अव-मूर्ध-शय, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>lying with the head hanging down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमृज्
अवमृज् अव-मृज्, cl. 2. P. -मार्ष्टि, -मार्जि-<BR>तुम् or -मार्ष्टुम्, to wipe or rub off, to strip off,<BR>remove; to efface.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमार्जन|अवमार्जनं
अव-मार्जन, अम्, n., Ved. what is stripped or<BR>rubbed off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमृज्य
अव-मृज्य, ind. having stripped, having pulled<BR>off; having wiped away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमृद्
अवमृद् अव-मृद्, cl. 9. P. -मृद्नाति, -मर्दि-<BR>तुम्, to grind down, to reduce by friction (or other-<BR>wise); to crush, to tread down; to rub.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमर्द|अवमर्दः|अवमर्द्द
अव-मर्द, अस्, m. trampling, oppression, driving<BR>one into straits; giving pain; devastation, inflicting<BR>pain or punishment on an enemy by laying his<BR>country waste, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमर्दन
अव-मर्दन, अस्, आ, अम्, treading down, grind-<BR>ing, crushing, oppressing; (अम्), n. rubbing, washing;<BR>oppression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमर्दित
अव-मर्दित, अस्, आ, अम्, ground, rubbed, crushed,<BR>oppressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमृश्
अवमृश् अव-मृश्, cl. 6. P. -मृशति, -मर्ष्-<BR>टुम्, -म्रष्टुम्, to touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमर्श|अवमर्शः
अव-मर्श, अस्, m. touch, contact.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवमृश्य
अव-मृश्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be touched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवय
अवय अवय. See शतावय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयज्
अवयज् अव-यज्, cl. 1. A. -यजते, -यष्टुम्,<BR>to expiate; not to worship, to abandon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयजन|अवयजनं
अव-यजन, अम्, n., Ved. expiating; purification.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयाज्
अव-याज्, आस्, f., Ved. a particular portion of a sacri-<BR>fice; m. a kind of priest. Gram. 176. f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयव|अवयवः
अवयव अव-यव, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 1. यु with<BR>अव), a limb, a member; a part, a portion; a mem-<BR>ber or component part of a logical argument or<BR>syllogism.<BR>—अवयव-शस्, ind. part by part, seve-<BR>rally.<BR>—अवयवार्थ (˚व-अर्˚), अस्, m. the meaning<BR>of the component parts of a word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयविन्
अवयविन्, ई, इनी, इ, limbed, having limbs; having<BR>portions or subdivisions; a whole; (ई), m. a syl-<BR>logism, a logical argument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवया
अवया 1. अव-या, cl. 2. P. A. -याति, -ते, -या-<BR>तुम्, to go down, to give way, desist; to remove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवया
2. अव-या, आस्, आस्, अम्, Ved. giving way, desisting,<BR>ceasing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयातहेळस्
अवयात-हेऌअस्, आस्, m., Ved. one whose anger is<BR>appeased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयातृ
अव-यातृ, ता, m., Ved. turning away; appeasing,<BR>one who appeases.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयान|अवयानं
अव-यान, अम्, n. going down, retreat; appeasing,<BR>expiation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवयुन
अवयुन अ-वयुन, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. not to be<BR>recognized; indistinct, confused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवर|अवरं|अवरः
अवर अवर, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. 2. अव), below,<BR>inferior; low, mean, unimportant, of small value;<BR>posterior, hinder, later, last, younger; western; nearer;<BR>(at the end of a compound signifying quantity) the<BR>least, the lowest degree, lowest value; (आ), f. the<BR>hind thigh of an elephant; a N. of Durgā; (अम्), n.<BR>the hind thigh of an elephant; [with अवर have been<BR>compared Gr. οὐρά, οὖρος, οὖρον, ὅρος, ὄρρος; Lat.<BR>eurus; also the Lat. aver-nus].<BR>—अवर-ज, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, of low birth, inferior; younger, junior; (अस्), m.<BR>a Śūdra; a younger brother; (आ), f. a younger sister.<BR>—अवर-तस्, ind. behind, afterwards, hinder, poste-<BR>rior, downwards.<BR>—अवर-परम्, ind., Ved. one<BR>after another.<BR>—अवर-पुरुष, आस्, m. pl. the de-<BR>scendants.<BR>—अवर-वर्ण, अस्, m. a low or despised<BR>tribe; (अस्, आ, अम्), belonging to a low caste or<BR>tribe; a Śūdra, a man or woman of the fourth tribe.<BR>—अवर-वर्णक or अवर-वर्ण-ज, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>belonging to or born in a low tribe.<BR>—अवर-व्रत,<BR>अस्, m. the sun [cf. अर्ख्-व्रत].<BR>—अवर-शिला<BR>f., N. of a Buddhist monastery.<BR>—अवर-शैल, आस्,<BR>m. pl., N. of a Buddhist school.<BR>—अवरस्-पर, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, Ved. having the last first, or the hindermost<BR>foremost; inverted, confused.<BR>—अवरार्ध (˚र-अर्˚),<BR>अस्, m. the least part, the minimum; the last half;<BR>(अम्), ind. in a certain succession of parts; succes-<BR>sively.<BR>—अवरार्ध-तस्, ind. from below.<BR>—अवरार्-<BR>ध्य, अस्, आ, अम्, being on the lower or nearer side;<BR>beginning from below; belonging to the last half; (अम्),<BR>n. the least or smallest part, the minimum.<BR>—अव-<BR>रावर (˚र-अव्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, lowest, most inferior<BR>of all.<BR>—अवरोक्त (˚र-उक्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, named last.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरस्तात्
अवरस्तात्, ind. behind, hinder, posterior; below,<BR>downwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरीण|अवरीणं
अवरीण, अस्, आ, अम्, degraded, debased; censured,<BR>blamed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरेण
अवरेण, ind. (with acc.) below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवर्य
अवर्य, nom. P. अवर्यति, -यितुम्, to become<BR>lower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरङ्गसाह|अवरङ्गसाहः
अवरङ्गसाह अवरङ्ग-साह, the Saṃskṛt<BR>from of the Muhammedan name Aurungzeb. साह<BR>= the Persian شاه).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरम्
अवरम् अव-रम्, cl. 1. A. -रमते, -रन्तुम्,<BR>to leave off, cease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरत|अवरतः
अव-रत, अस्, आ, अम्, stopped, ceased, desisted from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरति|अवरतिः
अव-रति, इस्, f. stopping, ceasing, cessation, relaxa-<BR>tion, repose, end.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरीयस्
अवरीयस् अ-वरीयस्, आन्, m., N. of a son of<BR>Manu Sāvarṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरुज्
अवरुज् अव-रुज्, cl. 6. P. -रुजति, -रोक्तुम्,<BR>to break off, to break.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरुग्ण
अव-रुग्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, broken off, torn; diseased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरुज्य
अव-रुज्य, ind. having broken off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरुध्
अवरुध् अव-रुध्, cl. 7. P. A. -रुणद्धि,<BR>-रुनधे, -रोधुम्, to obstruct, restrain, hinder,<BR>shut up, besiege; to keep back: Pass. -रुध्यते:<BR>Intens. P. -ररोद्धि, to injure, hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरुद्ध
अव-रुद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, checked, stopped, hin-<BR>dered; shut up or in, enclosed; imprisoned, secluded,<BR>as in the inner apartments.<BR>—अवरुद्ध-देह, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, incarcerated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरुद्धि|अवरुद्धिः
अव-रुद्धि, इस्, f. restraint, besieging; gaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरुध्यमान
अव-रुध्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being enclosed or<BR>surrounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोध|अवरोधः
1. अव-रोध, अस्, m. hindrance, obstruction; re-<BR>straint; an enclosure, confinement, besieging, a siege;<BR>a covering, lid; a fence, a pen; a watchman; the<BR>inner apartments of a palace, the queen's or women's<BR>apartments; a palace; pl. the wives of a king. (For<BR>2. अव-रोध, see below under अव-रुह्.)<BR>—अव-<BR>रोधायन (˚ध-अय्˚), अम्, n. a seraglio.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोधक|अवरोधकः
अव-रोधक, अस्, इका, अम्, obstructive, hindering,<BR>impending; (अस्), m. a guard; (इका), f. a female of<BR>the inner apartments; (अम्), n. a barrier, a fence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोधन|अवरोधनं
1. अव-रोधन, अम्, n. siege, blockade; hinder-<BR>ing, obstructing; obstacle, impediment; a closed or<BR>private place, the innermost part of anything; the<BR>inner or women's apartments in a royal palace. (For<BR>2. अव-रोधन, see below under अव-रुह्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोधिक|अवरोधिकः
अव-रोधिक, अस्, ई, अम्, obstructive, impeding;<BR>(अस्), m. a guard of the queen's apartments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोधिन्
अव-रोधिन्, ई, इनी, इ, obstructing, hindering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरुह्
अवरुह् अव-रुह्, cl. 1. P. -रोहति, -रोढुम्,<BR>to descend, alight, dismount: Caus. -रोपयति or<BR>-रोहयति, -यितुम्, to cause to descend; to bring<BR>down; to lower, lessen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरूढ
अव-रूढ, अस्, आ, अम्, descended, dismounted,<BR>alighted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोध|अवरोधः
2. अव-रोध, अस्, m. (rt. रुध् for रुह्), Ved.<BR>moving down, descending; a shoot sent out by the<BR>root of a plant, a slip (for planting), the pendent<BR>shoots of the Indian fig tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोधन|अवरोधनं
2. अव-रोधन, अम्, n. (rt. रुध् for रुह्), Ved.<BR>descending motion, descending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोपण|अवरोपणं
अव-रोपण, अम्, n. causing to descend; uprrot-<BR>ing; taking away, depriving, diminishing; descend-<BR>ing; setting (as of the sun).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोपित
अव-रोपित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to descend; up-<BR>rooted, deprived of, curtailed, diminished, lost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोप्य
अव-रोप्य, ind. having made to descend; rooting<BR>up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोध|अवरोधः
अव-रोध, अस्, m. descent, passing from or over;<BR>mounting, ascending (?); a shoot sent out by a plant;<BR>a pendent branch, one that strikes fresh root into the<BR>earth, as those of the Indian fig tree; the growth of a<BR>creeping plant or vine; a creeping plant climbing up<BR>to the top of a tree; heaven or Svarga.<BR>—अवरोह-<BR>वत्, आन्, or अवरोह-शायिन्, ई, m. the Indian fig tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोहण|अवरोहणं
अव-रोहण, अम्, n. alighting, descending, dis-<BR>mounting; ascending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोहिका
अव-रोहिका, f., N. of the plant Physalis Flexuosa L.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोहिन्
अव-रोहिन्, ई, इणी, इ, descending, what descends,<BR>what ascends; (ई), m. the Indian fig tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरूप
अवरूप अव-रूप, अस्, आ, अम्, mis-shapen,<BR>deformed; degenerated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोकिन्
अवरोकिन् अव-रोकिन्, ई, इणी, इ (fr. rt. रुच्<BR>with अव), Ved. shining, brilliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवरोचक|अवरोचकः
अव-रोचक, अस्, m. want of appetite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवर्चस्
अवर्चस् अ-वर्चस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, Ved. without<BR>splendor, insignificant in form, mean-looking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0092-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवर्जिवस्
अवर्जिवस् अ-वर्जिवस्, आन्, जुषी, अत्, Ved.<BR>not hindering, not being able to prevent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवर्ण|अवर्णः
अवर्ण अ-वर्ण, अस्, आ or ई, अम्, colourless;<BR>having no marks; bad, low, destitute of good quali-<BR>ties; (अस्), m. blame, censure.<BR>—अवर्ण-वाद, अस्,<BR>m. censure, blame, reproach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवर्तन|अवर्त्तन
