अवलेह|अवलेहः
अव-लेह, अस्, m. or अव-लेहिका, f. licking, lap-<BR>ping; an extract, an electuary, confection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0093-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

