अव-लुण्ठित, अस्, आ, अम्, robbed; rolled on the<BR>ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0093-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

