अवसिक्त
अव-सिक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, sprinkled.<BR>—अवसिक्ताङ्ग<BR>(˚त-अङ्˚), अस्, ई, अम्, having the limbs sprinkled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0094-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

