अवस्कन्द|अवस्कंदः|अवस्कन्दः
अव-स्कन्द, अस्, m. assault, attack, storm; a<BR>camp; descending, bathing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0094-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्कन्दन|अवस्कंदनं|अवस्कन्दनं
अव-स्कन्दन, अम्, n. attacking, assaulting, storm;<BR>refutation; descending; bathing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0094-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्कन्दित|अवस्कंदित
