अवस्थ|अवस्थः
अव-स्थ, अस्, m. membrum virile, see उप-स्थ;<BR>(आ), f. appearance (in a court of justice); stability,<BR>consistence; state, condition, situation, circumstance<BR>of age or position; degree, proportion; the female<BR>organ of generation.<BR>—अवस्था-चतुष्टय, अम्, n.<BR>the four periods or states of human life, viz. child-<BR>hood, youth, manhood, and old age.<BR>—अवस्था-<BR>त्रय, अम्, n. the three states, or waking, dreaming,<BR>and sound sleep.<BR>—अवस्था-द्वय, अम्, n. the two<BR>states of life, viz. happiness and misery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0094-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्थान|अवस्थानं
