अवस्थापन|अवस्थापनं
अव-स्थापन, अम्, n. fixing, settling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0094-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्थापित
अव-स्थापित, अस्, आ, अम्, fixed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0094-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्थाप्य
अव-स्थाप्य, ind. having fixed, placed, set or put.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0094-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्थाय
अव-स्थाय, ind. having stayed or remained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0094-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्थायिन्
अव-स्थायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, staying, residing in; placed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0094-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्थित|अवस्थितः
अव-स्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, standing on or in, remain-<BR>ing, staying, abiding, residing, lasting, remaining firm<BR>or fixed, &c.; firm of purpose, steady; engaged in,<BR>prosecuting, following.<BR>—अवस्थित-मति, इस्, इस्, इ,<BR>of fixed mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0094-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्थिति|अवस्थितिः
अव-स्थिति, इस्, f. abiding; residence; following,<BR>practising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0094-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्पृ
