अवस्पर्तृ
अव-स्पर्तृ, ता, m., Ved. a preserver, saviour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0094-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्य
