अवस्यु
अवस्यु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. desiring favour or assistance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0094-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्रंसन|अवस्रंसनं
अवस्रंसन अव-स्रंसन, अम्, n. falling off<BR>or down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0094-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्वन्
