अवस्वन्य
अव-स्वन्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. roaring, boisterous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0094-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवहन्
