अ-वीर्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. weak, ineffective.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवृक
अवृक अ-वृक, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. not hurting,<BR>inoffensive, true; unendangered, safe; free from one<BR>who obscures; (अम्), n. safety, peace; quiet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवृक्ष
अवृक्ष अ-वृक्ष or अ-वृक्षक, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>treeless; destitute of trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवृजिन
अवृजिन अ-वृजिन, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. not<BR>intriguing, straightforward, sincere, not deserting<BR>(friends), an epithet of the Ādityas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवृत
अवृत अ-वृत, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. unchecked,<BR>unimpeded; unsubdued; unselected; uncovered, un-<BR>protected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवृत्ति|अवृत्तिः
