अवृद्धिक
अवृद्धिक अ-वृद्धिक, अस्, ई, अम् (rt. वृध्),<BR>not augmentative; not bearing interest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवृध
अ-वृध, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. not promoting, not<BR>honouring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवृष्टि|अवृष्टिः
अवृष्टि अ-वृष्टि, इस्, f. want of rain, drought;<BR>famine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवृह
अवृह अ-वृह or अ-बृह, आस्, m. pl. (rt.<BR>वृह्), a class of Buddhist divinities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवृहित
अ-वृहित, अस्, आ, अम्, few, not much or large.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवे
अवे अवे (अव-इ), cl. 2. P. अवैति, -तुम्, to<BR>go away, to move away; to go to (with acc.); to<BR>come down upon, rush upon; to look upon, consider;<BR>perceive, conceive, understand, learn, know: Intens.<BR>or Pass. अवेयते, to beg pardon for, conciliate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेत
अवेत, अस्, आ, अम्, elapsed, past; one who has<BR>gained, obtained, attained; joined with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेक्ष्
अवेक्ष् अवेक्ष् (अव-ईक्ष्), cl. 1. A. अवेक्-<BR>षते, -षितुम्, to look towards, look at, consider;<BR>to perceive, observe, experience; to have in view,<BR>aim at; to have regard to, respect; to expect, hope<BR>for: Caus. अवेक्षयति, -यितुम्, to cause to look at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेक्षण|अवेक्षणं
अवेक्षण, अम्, n. looking towards or at; the<BR>act of considering, attention, observation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेक्षणीय
अवेक्षणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be looked at, to be<BR>respected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेक्षमाण
अवेक्षमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, looking at, inspecting,<BR>examining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेक्षा
अवेक्षा, f. seeing, looking at; observation, care,<BR>regard, attention to (with loc.); agreement, engage-<BR>ment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेक्षित|अवेक्षितं
अवेक्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, looked at, perceived, re-<BR>garded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेक्षिन्
अवेक्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ, observing, seeing, looking at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेक्ष्य
1. अवेक्ष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be regarded, to be re-<BR>spected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेक्ष्य
2. अवेक्ष्य, ind. having beheld, having regarded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेणि
अवेणि अ-वेणि, इस्, इस्, इ, not braided, having<BR>no braid of hair; not commingled (as the waters of<BR>rivers).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेदयान
अवेदयान अ-वेदयान, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. 1. विद्),<BR>not knowing, not ascertaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेदविद्
अ-वेद-विद्, त्, m. a Brāhman who has not studied<BR>the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेदविहित
अ-वेद-विहित, अस्, आ, अम्, not enjoined in the<BR>Vedas, unscriptural.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेद्य|अवेद्यः
1. अ-वेद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, not to be known; un-<BR>ascertainable, secret.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेद्य|अवेद्यः
अवेद्य 2. अ-वेद्य, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. 2. विद्),<BR>not to be married; (अस्), m. a calf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेनत्|अवेनन्त्
अवेनत् अ-वेनत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, Ved. un-<BR>conscious, not perceiving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेन्व्
अवेन्व् अवेन्व् (अव-इन्व्), cl. 1. P., Ved. अवेन्-<BR>वति, -वितुम्, to send away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेल|अवेलः
अवेल अवेल (अव-इला?), अस्, m. denial or<BR>concealment of knowledge; (आ), f. chewed betel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवेष्टि|अवेष्टिः
अवेष्टि अवेष्टि, इस्, f. (fr. rt. यज् with अव),<BR>Ved. appeasing or expiation by sacrifices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवैदिक
अवैदिक अ-वैदिक, अस्, ई, अम्, not Vedic,<BR>not belonging to the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवैध|अवैधं
अवैध अ-वैध, अस्, ई, अम्, irregular, hete-<BR>rodox, contrary or not conformable to rule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवैधव्य
अवैधव्य अ-वैधव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, free from<BR>widowhood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवैरहत्य|अवैरहत्यं
अवैरहत्य अ-वैरहत्य, अम्, n., Ved. the<BR>non-destruction of men, security from slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवोक्षण|अवोक्षणं
अवोक्षण अवोक्षण, अम्, n. (fr. rt. उक्ष्<BR>with अव), Ved. besprinkling, bedewing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवोद|अवोदं|अवोदः
अवोद अवोद, अस्, m. (fr. rt. उद् with अव),<BR>dripping down, sprinkling, moistening; (अस्, आ, अम्),<BR>wet, moist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवोदेव
अवोदेव अवो-देव, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. 2. अवस्,<BR>q. v.), Ved. bringing down the gods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवोह्
अवोह् अवोह् (अव-ऊह्), cl. 1. P. A. अवोहति,<BR>-ते, -हितुम्, to push down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्द
अव्द अव्द, अस्, m. (= अब्द), a cloud; a<BR>year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्य|अव्यः
अव्य अव्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. अवि), Ved. coming<BR>from or belonging to sheep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यक्त|अव्यक्तं|अव्यक्तः
अव्यक्त अ-व्यक्त, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. अञ्ज्), unap-<BR>parent, indistinct, not manifest, not to be discerned, in-<BR>visible, imperceptible, unperceived, undetermined; (in<BR>algebra) unknown as quantity or number; (अस्), m. a<BR>fool; primary matter which has not yet entered into<BR>real existence; N. of Viṣṇu; of Śiva; of Kāma<BR>or Kandarpa; (अम्), n. the supreme being or uni-<BR>versal spirit; (in Sāṅkhya phil.) ‘the undiscrete,’<BR>the primary germ of nature, the primordial element<BR>or productive principle whence all the phenomena of<BR>the material world are developed; the soul; nature,<BR>temperament; (अम्), ind. imperceptibly, indistinctly,<BR>secretly.<BR>—अव्यक्त-क्रिया, f. algebraic calculation;<BR>any act of an indistinct character or aim.<BR>—अव्यक्त-<BR>गति, इस्, इस्, इ, going imperceptibly.<BR>—अव्यक्त-<BR>पद, अस्, आ, अम्, inarticulate.<BR>—अव्यक्त-मूर्ति,<BR>इस्, इस्, इ, whose form is incomprehensible.<BR>—अ-<BR>व्यक्त-राग, अस्, m. dark-red, the colour of the<BR>dawn.<BR>—अव्यक्त-राशि, इस्, f. an unknown number<BR>or indistinct quantity (in algebra).<BR>—अव्यक्त-<BR>लक्षण or अव्यक्त-व्यक्त, अस्, m. epithet of<BR>Śiva, whose qualities are not perceptible.<BR>—अव्य-<BR>क्त-वर्त्मन्, आ, आ, अ, or<BR>—अव्यक्त-मार्ग, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, mysterious in his ways.<BR>—अव्यक्त-वाच्, क्, क्,<BR>क्, speaking indistinctly.<BR>—अव्यक्त-साम्य, अम्, n.<BR>equation of unknown quantities.<BR>—अव्यक्तादि (˚त-<BR>आदि), इस्, इस्, इ, whose beginning is inscrutable.<BR>—अ-<BR>व्यक्तानुकरण (˚त-अन्˚), अम्, n. the imitating of<BR>unarticulated or unmeaning sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यञ्जन|अव्यंजन|अव्यञ्जनः
अ-व्यञ्जन, अस्, आ, अम्, indistinct; plain, not figu-<BR>rative; (अस्), m. an animal without horns, though of<BR>an age to have them.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यग्र
अव्यग्र अ-व्यग्र, अस्, आ, अम्, steady, cool,<BR>deliberate; indifferent, undisturbed; attentive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यङ्ग|अव्यंग|अव्यङ्गः
अव्यङ्ग अ-व्यङ्ग, अस्, आ, अम्, not mutilated,<BR>sound, perfect; not figurative, plain; (आ), f., N. of<BR>the plant Carpopogon Pruriens Roxb. [cf. Zend<BR>aiwyâṃhanem].<BR>—अव्यङ्गाङ्ग (˚ग-अङ्ग), अस्, ई,<BR>अम्, well made, symmetrical, perfect, entire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यचस्
अव्यचस् अ-व्यचस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, Ved. not<BR>spacious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यण्डा|अव्यंडा
अव्यण्डा अव्यण्डा, f. (for अध्य्-अण्डा?), N.<BR>of the plant Carpopogon Pruriens Roxb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यति|अव्यतिः
अव्यति अव्यति, इस्, f. (fr. rt. अव्), Ved. the<BR>act of satiating, satisfaction; desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यतिकीर्ण|अव्यतिकीर्ण्ण
अव्यतिकीर्ण अ-व्यतिकीर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, un-<BR>mixed, unblended, distinct, specific, separate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यथ|अव्यथः
अव्यथ अ-व्यथ, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. व्यथ्), free<BR>from pain; not inflicting pain, merciful; (अस्), m. a<BR>snake; (आ), f., N. of the plant Terminalia Citrina<BR>Roxb., and of the plant Hibiscus Mutabilis L.; Ved.<BR>firmness, steadiness, absence of tremor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यथमान
अ-व्यथमान, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. not moving un-<BR>steadily, not trembling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0098-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अव्यथि|अव्यथिः
