अव्राजिन् अ-व्राजिन्, ई, इनी, इ, not wandering<BR>or travelling as a mendicant (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्
अश् 1. अश्, cl. 5. P. A. (in classical<BR>Sanskrit A. only), अश्नोति, -नुते, आश,<BR>आनंश, आनशे, अशिष्यते or अक्ष्यते, आशिष्ट<BR>and आष्ट, अशितुम्, to reach, come to, arrive at; to<BR>get, gain, obtain; to become master of, to master, to<BR>be able; to pervade, penetrate, pierce through, fill;<BR>to heap, accumulate: Caus. आशयति, आशिशत्: Desid.<BR>अशिशिषते: Intens. अशाश्यते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशन्
अशन्, आ, m., Ved. a missile-stone, or stone for<BR>slinging, stone, rock; a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशन|अशनं|अशनः
1. अशन, अस्, आ, अम्, reaching, reaching across.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशनि|अशनिः
अशनि, इस्, m. f. a missile, especially the thunder-<BR>bolt and flash of lightning; the tip of a missile; N.<BR>of a warrior-tribe.<BR>—अशनि-प्रभ, अस्, m., N. of a<BR>Rākṣasa.<BR>—अशनि-मत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. throwing<BR>the thunderbolt, endowed with it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशित्र|अशित्रः
1. अशित्र, अस्, m. a thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशिन्
अशिन्, ई, इनी, इ, reaching far, enduring; Vedic<BR>superlative अशीतम and अशिष्ठ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्
अश् 2. अश्, cl. 9. P. अश्नाति, आश, अशि-<BR>ष्यति, आशीत्, अशितुम्, to eat, consume; to<BR>taste, enjoy: Caus. आशयति, -यितुम्, to cause to eat,<BR>to give to eat, to feed: Desid. अशिशिषति, to wish to<BR>eat: Intens. अशाश्यते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशन|अशनं|अशनः
2. अशन, अम्, n. eating, feeding; food (often at the<BR>end of compounds, e. g. मूल-फलाशन, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>having roots and fruit for food).<BR>—अशन-कृत्, त्, त्, त्,<BR>Ved. preparing food.<BR>—अशन-पति, इस्, m., Ved. lord<BR>of food.<BR>—अशन-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. possessed<BR>of food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशनाय
अशनाय, nom. P. -यति, -यितुम्, to desire food,<BR>to be hungry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशनाया
अशनाया, f. hunger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशनायित|अशनायितं
अशनायित or अशनायुक, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. hungry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशित|अशितं
अशित, अस्, आ, अम्, eaten, satisfied.<BR>—अशितङ्-गवीन<BR>or आशितङ्-गवीन, अस्, आ, अम्, formerly grazed by<BR>cattle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशितव्य
अशितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be eaten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशितृ
अशितृ, ता, m. eating, an eater.<BR>.2. अशित्र, अम्, n. an oblation of rice, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशित|अशितं
अशित, अस्, आ, अम्, fed, satiated, satiate; given to<BR>eat; (अम्), n. food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशकुन|अशकुनं|अशकुनः
अशकुन अ-शकुन, अम्, n. an inauspicious<BR>omen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशकुम्भी
अशकुम्भी अश-कुम्भी, f., N. of the aquatic<BR>plant Pistia Stratiotes Lin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशक्त|अशक्तं
अशक्त अ-शक्त, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. शक्), unable,<BR>incompetent.<BR>—अशक्त-ता, f. or अशक्त-त्व, अम्, n.<BR>weakness, inability.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशक्ति|अशक्तिः
अ-शक्ति, इस्, f. inability, incapability, weakness,<BR>impotence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशक्य|अशक्यं
अ-शक्य, अस्, आ, अम्, impossible, impracticable;<BR>not to be done.<BR>—अशक्यार्थ (˚य-अर्˚), अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>unavailing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशग
अशग अशग, अस्, m., N. of the author of<BR>the Śāntipurāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशङ्क|अशंक
अशङ्क अ-शङ्क, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. शङ्क्), fear-<BR>less, undaunted; secure, certain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशङ्कित|अशंकित
अ-शङ्कित, अस्, आ, अम्, certain, undoubted; fearless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशठ
अशठ अ-शठ, अस्, आ, अम्, virtuous, sincere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशत्रु|अशत्रुः
अशत्रु अ-शत्रु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. one who has<BR>no adversary; one whom no enemy defies; without<BR>opposition from enemies; (उस्), m. the moon; (उ),<BR>n. condition of having no enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशन|अशनं|अशनः
अशन 3. अशन, अस्, m. = असन, N. of the<BR>tree Terminalia Tomentosa W. and A.<BR>—अशन-<BR>पर्णी or असन-पर्णी, f., N. of a plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशन|अशनं|अशनः
अशन, अशनि। See under 1. अश्, 2. अश्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशपत्|अशपन्त्
अशपत् अ-शपत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, Ved. not curs-<BR>ing, not imprecating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशम्
अशम् अ-शम्, ind. (rt. शम्), Ved. non-wel-<BR>fare, harm, mischief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशम
अ-शम, अस्, m. disquietude, uneasiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशान्त|अशांत
अ-शान्त, अस्, आ, अम्, unappeased, indomitable,<BR>violent, wild; restless, anxious, unresigned; uncon-<BR>secrated, not sacred, irreligious, profane.<BR>—अशान्त-<BR>ता, f. want of tranquillity, passionateness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशान्ति
अ-शान्ति, इस्, f. restlessness, anxiety.<BR>—अशान्ति-कर,<BR>अस्, ई, अम्, causing anxiety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशाम्य
अ-शाम्य, अस्, आ, अम्, unappeasable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशरण
अशरण अ-शरण, अस्, आ, अम्, destitute of<BR>refuge, defenceless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशरीर|अशरीरः
अशरीर अ-शरीर, अस्, आ, अम्, bodiless, in-<BR>corporeal; (अस्), m. a N. of Kāma, the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशरीरिन्
अ-शरीरिन्, ई, इणी, इ, incorporeal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशर्मन्|अशर्म्मन्
अशर्मन् अ-शर्मन्, अ, n. unhappiness, pain,<BR>affliction; (आ, आ, अ), unhappy, afflicted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशस्
अशस् अ-शस्, अस्, अस्, अस् (rt. शस् for संस्),<BR>Ved. not blessing, not wishing well, not praising,<BR>cursing, hating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशस्त
अ-शस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. inexpressible, ineffable,<BR>not esteemed, hated, ill-starred.<BR>—अशस्त-वार, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, Ved. having indescribable treasures; (Sāy.)<BR>who is not asked for wealth, i. e. who grants it of his<BR>own accord.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशस्ति|अशस्तिः
अ-शस्ति, इस्, f., Ved. not wishing well, imprecation,<BR>evil design, curse; a curser, hater.<BR>—अशस्ति-हन्, आ,<BR>घ्नी, अ, Ved. averting imprecations or curses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशस्त्र
अशस्त्र अ-शस्त्र, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. शस्, to hurt),<BR>weaponless, unarmed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशाखा
अशाखा अ-शाखा, f., N. of a grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशारीरिक
अशारीरिक अ-शारीरिक, अस्, ई, अम्, not re-<BR>lating to or endowed with body, incorporeal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशाश्वत
अशाश्वत अ-शाश्वत, अस्, ई, अम्, perishable,<BR>transient, temporary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशासन
अशासन अ-शासन, अम्, n. (rt. शास्), want of<BR>government, anarchy, disorder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशासनीय
अ-शासनीय or अ-शास्य, अस्, आ, अम्, ungovernable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशासित
अ-शासित, अस्, आ, अम्, ungoverned, undisciplined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशास्त्र
अ-शास्त्र, अस्, आ, अम्, unscriptural, not conformable to<BR>sacred authority, heterodox.<BR>—अ-शास्त्र-विहित or अ-<BR>शास्त्र-सिद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, not enjoined by the Śāstras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशास्त्रीय
अ-शास्त्रीय, अस्, आ, अम्, unscriptural, heterodox,<BR>illegal, immoral, irreligious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशिक्षित|अशिक्षितं
अशिक्षित अ-शिक्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, untaught.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशित|अशितं
अशित अशित, अशितव्य, &c. See under 2. अश्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशित्र|अशित्रः
अशित्र अशित्र. See under 1. अश्, 2. अश्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशिथिल
अशिथिल अ-शिथिल, अस्, आ, अम्, not loose,<BR>firm, tight, hard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशिन्
अशिन् अशिन्. See under 1. अश्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशिपद
अशिपद अ-शिपद, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. not<BR>causing the sickness called śipada.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशिमिद
अशिमिद अ-शिमिद, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. not de-<BR>structive like a Śimidā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशिमिविद्विष्
अशिमिविद्विष् अशिमि-विद्विष्, ट्, ट्, ट्, Ved.<BR>epithet of the seven Parjanyas or rain-clouds (perhaps<BR>the true reading may be शिमि-विद्विष्, ‘hater of<BR>the Śimis’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0100-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशिर|अशिरं|अशिरः
अशिर अशिर, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 2. अश्), fire; a<BR>N. of the sun, ‘consumer or devourer;’ N. of a<BR>Rākṣasa or goblin; (आ), f., N. of the wife of this<BR>Rākṣasa; (अम्), n. a diamond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0100-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशिरस्
अशिरस् अ-शिरस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, or अ-शिरस्क,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, headless. [cf. ἀκάρηνος].<BR>—अ-शिरः-स्नान,<BR>अम्, n. bathing the whole body except the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0100-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशिव|अशिवः
