अशुचि|अशुचिः
अशुचि अ-शुचि, इस्, इस्, इ (rt. 2. शुच्), foul,<BR>impure; (इस्), f. impurity, disgrace, degradation.<BR>—अशुचि-ता, f. or अशुचि-त्व, अम्, n. impurity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0100-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशौच|अशौचं
