अशोषणीय
अ-शोषणीय or अ-शोष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, not to be<BR>dried up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0100-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशूद्र
