अशेव
अशेव अ-शेव, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. pernicious,<BR>dangerous, not causing pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0100-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशेष|अशेषं|अशेषः
अशेष अ-शेष, अस्, आ, अम्, without remainder,<BR>entire, perfect, all, whole, every; infinite, endless; (अस्),<BR>m. non-remainder; अशेषम् or अशेषेण or अशेष-<BR>तस्, ind. entirely, wholly.<BR>—अशेष-ता, f. totality.<BR>—अशेष-साम्राज्य, अस्, m. an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0100-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

