असार|असारं|असारः
असार अ-सार, अस्, आ, अम्, sapless; with-<BR>out genuine strength and value; without vigour,<BR>spoiled, unfit, vain, unprofitable; weak, feeble, infirm,<BR>fragile; (अस्), m., N. of the plant Ricinus Communis<BR>or castor-oil tree; (अम्), n. Agallochum.<BR>—असार-ता,<BR>f. saplessness; unfitness, fragility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0105-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असावधान
असावधान अ-सावधान, अस्, आ, अम्, careless,<BR>inadvertent.<BR>—असावधान-ता, f. or असावधान-<BR>त्व, अम्, n. carelessness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0105-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असाहस|असाहसं
