आकल्पम्
आ-कल्पम्, ind. till the end of a kalpa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0111-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

