आकृष्य
आ-कृष्य, ind. having drawn, extracted, pulled or<BR>dragged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकृष्यमाण
आ-कृष्यमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, being drawn or at-<BR>tracted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकॄ
