आकर|आकरः
आ-कर, अस्, m. one who scatters over or fills; ac-<BR>cumulation, collection, plenty, multitude; a mine, a<BR>rich source of anything; best, excellent; N. of a<BR>country; N. of the Mahā-bhāṣya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकरिन्
आकरिन्, ई, इणी, इ, produced in a mine, mineral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकीर्ण|आकीर्णं|आकीर्ण्ण
