आके
आके आके, ind. (fr. rt. अञ्च् with आ), Ved.<BR>hitherward, near, in the neighbourhood.<BR>—आके-निप,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. considering or regarding from a near<BR>place; wise; (Sāy.) falling down near at hand, ad-<BR>vancing near (as rays of light).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकै
