आक्न
आक्न आक्न, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. अच् or अञ्च्), bent,<BR>curved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्रन्द्|आक्रंद्
आक्रन्द् आ-क्रन्द्, cl. 1. P. A. -क्रन्दति, -ते,<BR>-दितुम्, to shout at, roar at; to invoke; to cry with<BR>sorrow, lament, weep: Caus. P. -क्रन्दयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to cause to weep or cry; inspire courage by its sound<BR>(as a drum ?); to shout at, roar at; to cry without<BR>interruption.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आक्रन्द|आक्रंदः|आक्रन्दः
आ-क्रन्द, अस्, m. calling, crying, crying out;<BR>shouting; weeping, sobbing; sound; war-cry; furious<BR>or violent combat; war, battle; violence; a friend;<BR>a brother; a king, a lord; usurper; a king who<BR>prevents an ally from aiding another; (अस्, आ, अम्),<BR>one who checks or restrains.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

