आच्छिद्
आच्छिद् आ-च्छिद् (-छिद्), cl. 7. P. A. -च्छि-<BR>नत्ति, -च्छिन्ते, -च्छेत्तुम्, to tear or cut off; to cut or<BR>break in pieces; to take out of; to draw off; remove;<BR>to cut off, exclude; to snatch away, to tear from, to<BR>rob; to disregard, not to take notice of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छिद्य
आ-च्छिद्य, ind. cutting off; cutting, excluding, dis-<BR>regarding; setting aside, in spite of, notwithstanding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छिन्न
आ-च्छिन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, cut, cut off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छेद|आच्छेदः
आ-च्छेद, अस्, m. cutting, cutting off, excision.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छेदन|आच्छेदनं
आ-च्छेदन, अम्, n. excision, cutting off, exclusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छुक|आच्छुकः
आच्छुक आच्छुक, अस्, m., N. of the plant<BR>Morinda Tinctoria. See आक्षिक and आच्छाक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छुरित|आच्छुरितं|आछुरित
