आच्छृद्
आच्छृद् आ-च्छृद् (-छृद्), cl. 7. P. A. -च्छृ-<BR>णत्ति, -च्छृन्ते, -च्छर्दितुम्, to pour upon, to fill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छो
आच्छो आ-च्छो (-छो), cl. 4. P. -च्छ्यति,<BR>-च्छातुम्, to skin, to flay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्छोदन|आच्छोदनं|आछोदन
आच्छोदन आ-च्छोदन, अम्, n. (rt. छुद् for<BR>चुद् ?), hunting, the chase. See अच्छोटन, आक्षोदन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आच्यु
