आजकार|आजकारः
आजकार आजकार, अस्, m. Śiva's bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजगर
आजगर आजगर, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. अज-गर),<BR>treating of the boa or large serpent; (a chapter in<BR>the Mahā-bhārata.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजगव|आजगवं
