आजनन|आजननं
आ-जनन, अम्, n. birth, origin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजन्म|आजन्मं
आ-जन्म, ind. from birth, since birth.<BR>—आजन्म-<BR>सुरभि-पत्त्र, अस्, m., N. of a plant (the leaves of<BR>which are fragrant from their first appearance).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजाति|आजातिः
आ-जाति, इस्, f. birth, origin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजान|आजानः
आ-जान, अम्, n. birth, descent, species; birth-place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजानि|आजानिः
आ-जानि, इस्, f., Ved. birth, descent; noble birth;<BR>(Sāy.) a mother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजानेय|आजानेयः
आजानेय, अस्, ई, अम्, of noble origin, of good breed<BR>(as a horse), fearless, undaunted; (अस्), m. a well-<BR>bred horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजानेय्य
आजानेय्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. of good breed, well-<BR>bred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजप्
आजप् आ-जप्, cl. 1. P. -जपति, -पितुम्, to<BR>mutter or whisper to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजमीढ
आजमीढ आजमीढ, अस्, m., N. of a king in<BR>the Mahā-bhārata.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजरसम्
आजरसम् आ-जरसम् or आ-जरसाय, ind.,<BR>Ved. till old age.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजवन|आजवनं
