आजाद्य
आजाद्य आजाद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, originating from<BR>the warrior-tribe called Ajādas or a chief of that tribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजान|आजानः
आजान आ-जान, आजानेय. See under आजन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0115-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

