आरोपणीय
आ-रोपणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be made to ascend; to<BR>be raised, placed, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोपित|आरोपितं
आ-रोपित, अस्, आ, अम्, raised, elevated; fixed, placed,<BR>made; strung (as a bow); deposited, intrusted; conse-<BR>crated; accidental, adventitious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोप्य
1. आ-रोप्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be placed or fixed on or in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोप्य
2. आ-रोप्य, ind. having made to ascend, having<BR>caused to mount, having placed upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोप्यमाण
आ-रोप्यमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, being strung, being tried<BR>to be strung.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोह|आरोहः
आ-रोह, अस्, m. one who mounts or ascends, a rider<BR>(on a horse &c.), one who is seated in a carriage;<BR>ascent, rising, creeping up, mounting, riding; haughti-<BR>ness, pride; elevation, elevated place, altitude; a heap,<BR>mountain; a woman's waist, the buttocks; length;<BR>measure; descending (= अव-रोह?); a mine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोहक|आरोहकः
आ-रोहक, अस्, आ, अम्, ascending; rising; raising<BR>up; (अस्), m. a rider; a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोहण|आरोहणं
