आरोहणिक
आरोहणिक, अस्, ई, अम्, relating to ascent or<BR>mounting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोहिन्
