आरू
आरू आरू, ऊस्, ऊस्, उ, of a tawny colour;<BR>(ऊस्), m. tawny (the colour).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरे
आरे आरे, ind. (see 2. आर), Ved. far, far<BR>from (with abl.); near.<BR>—आरे-अघ, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved.<BR>having evil far removed.<BR>—आरे-अवद्य, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>Ved. one from whom blame or insult is far removed.<BR>—आरे-शत्रु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. one whose enemies<BR>are driven far away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरेवत|आरेवतं|आरेवतः
आरेवत आरेवत, अस्, m. a tree, = आरग्-<BR>बध, q. v.; (अम्), n. the fruit of this tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरेहण|आरेहणं
आरेहण आ-रेहण, अम्, n. (fr. rt. रिह् for लिह्<BR>with आ), Ved. licking, kissing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोग्य|आरोग्यं
आरोग्य आरोग्य, अम्, n. (fr. अ-रोग), free-<BR>dom from disease, health.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्कि|आर्किः
आर्कि आर्कि, इस्, m. a son of Arka or the<BR>sun; epithet of the planet Saturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्क्ष|आर्क्षः
आर्क्ष आर्क्ष, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. ऋक्ष), stellar,<BR>regulated by the stars or constellations; (अस्), m. a<BR>son or descendant of Ṛkṣa; epithet of Āśvamedha,<BR>of Śrutarvan, of Saṃvaraṇa.<BR>—आर्क्ष-वर्ष, अस्,<BR>m. a stellar year or revolution of a constellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्क्ष्य
आर्क्ष्य, patronymic of ऋक्ष Pāṇini IV. 1, 105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्क्षोद
आर्क्षोद आर्क्षोद, अस्, ई, अम्, inhabiting the<BR>mountain Ṛkṣoda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्गल|आर्गलः
आर्गल आर्गल, अस्, ई, m. f. a bolt or bar.<BR>See अर्गल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्ग्बध
आर्ग्बध आर्ग्बध, अस्, m. = आरग्-बध, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्घा
आर्घा आर्घा, f. a sort of yellow bee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0128-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्घ्य|आर्घ्यं
