आर्चिक|आर्च्चिक
आर्चिक, अस्, ई, अम्, relating to the Ṛg-veda; (अम्),<BR>n. an epithet of the Sāma-veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0129-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्चत्क
आर्चत्क आर्चत्क, अस्, m. a patronymic of<BR>Śara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0129-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्चाभिन्
आर्चाभिन् आर्चाभिन्, इनस्, m. pl., N. of a<BR>school, founded by a pupil of Vaiśampāyana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0129-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्छ्
