आलिन्द|आलिंद|आलिंदः|आलिन्दः
आलिन्द आलिन्द or आलिन्दक, अस्, m. a terrace<BR>before a house, a raised place or terrace for sleeping<BR>upon. See अलिन्द.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0130-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलिप्
