आलेपन
आ-लेपन, अम्, n. smearing, plastering; liniment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0130-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आली
आली 1. आली, f. See under आलि last col.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0130-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आली
