आलीन
आ-लीन, अस्, आ, अम्, melted, fused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0130-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलीनक|आलीनकं
आलीनक, अम्, n. tin; lead (from its melting easily).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0130-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलीढ|आलीढं
आलीढ आ-लीढ, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. लिह्), eaten,<BR>licked, lapped by the tongue, scraped; (अस्), m., N.<BR>of a man; (अम्), n. an attitude in shooting, the right<BR>knee advanced, the left leg retracted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0130-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आलीढक|आलीढकं
