आवन्तिक|आवंतिक|आवन्तिकः
आवन्तिक आवन्तिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. अवन्ति),<BR>coming from or belonging to Avanti or the district of<BR>Oujein; (आस्), m. pl., N. of a Buddhist school; (आ),<BR>f., N. of the daughter of a Brāhman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवन्त्य|आवंत्य|आवन्त्यः
आवन्त्य, अस्, आ, अम्, coming from or being in the<BR>country Avanti; (अस्), m. a prince or an inhabitant<BR>of Avanti or of Oujein; the offspring of a degraded<BR>Brāhman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवप्
आवप् आ-वप्, cl. 1. P. A. -वपति, -ते, -वप्-<BR>तुम्, to sow, scatter; to pour out; to offer: Caus. P.<BR>-वापयति, -यितुम्, to shave, cut off, trim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवपन|आवपनं
आ-वपन, अम्, n. the act of sowing, throwing,<BR>scattering, placing upon; instilling, inserting; capa-<BR>city, a vessel, a jar, a ewer; sowing seed, weaving;<BR>(ई), f., Ved. a vessel, a jar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवपन्तिक|आवपंतिक
आ-वपन्तिक, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. scattering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवाप|आवापः
आ-वाप, अस्, आ, अम्, scattering, throwing; (अस्), m.<BR>scattering, throwing; sowing seed; casting, directing;<BR>(in pharmacy) throwing additional ingredients into<BR>any compound in course of preparation; mixing, in-<BR>serting; setting out or arranging vessels, jars, &c.;<BR>a kind of drink; a bracelet; a basin for water round<BR>the root of a tree; uneven ground; hostile purpose,<BR>intention of going to war; a vessel; principal oblation<BR>to fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवापक|आवापकः
आवापक, अस्, m. a bracelet of gold, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवापन|आवापनं
