आवापिक
आवापिक, अस्, आ, अम्, additional, inserted, supple-<BR>mentary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवय|आवयः
