आवर्हित|आवर्हितः
आवर्हित आ-वर्हित, अस्, आ, अम्, eradicated,<BR>plucked up by the roots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवलि|आवलिः
