2. आ-वेद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be represented or made<BR>known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेद्यमान
आ-वेद्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being made known,<BR>stated or represented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविदूर्य|आविदूर्यं|आविदूर्य्य
आविदूर्य आविदूर्य, अम्, n. (fr. अ-विदूर),<BR>proximity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविभा
आविभा आ-वि-भा, cl. 2. P., Ved. -भाति,<BR>-तुम्, to kindle on all sides (with dat. of the thing<BR>kindled, Ṛg-veda I. 71, 6).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविर्भाव|आविर्भावः
आविर्भाव आविर्-भाव. See under आविस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविल
आविल आविल, अस्, आ, अम् (said to be fr. rt. विल्<BR>with आ), turbid (as a fluid), foul, not clear.<BR>—आविल-<BR>कन्द, अस्, m., N. of a root.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविलय
आविलय, nom. P. आविलयति, -यितुम्, to make<BR>turbid, to blot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविश्
आविश् आ-विश्, cl. 6. P. -विशति, -वेष्टुम्, to<BR>go towards, approach; to enter; to take possession of;<BR>to arise; Caus. -वेशयति, -यितुम्, to cause to enter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविशत्
आ-विशत्, अन्, अती, or अन्ती, अत्, approaching, entering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविष्ट|आविष्टः
आ-विष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, entered; possessed (by a<BR>demon &c.); possessed, engrossed, filled (by any<BR>sentiment or feeling), intent.<BR>—आविष्ट-लिङ्ग, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, (a noun) which possesses or has the force of<BR>all three genders (or which in every relationship pre-<BR>serves its own gender, e. g. प्रधानम्, उप-<BR>सर्जनम्, &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेश|आवेशः
आ-वेश, अस्, m. joining one's self; entering, entrance,<BR>taking possession of; absorption of the faculties in<BR>one wish or idea, intentness, devotedness to an object;<BR>demoniacal frenzy, possession, &c.; pride, arrogance;<BR>indistinctness of idea, apoplectic or epileptic giddiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेशन|आवेशनं
आ-वेशन, अम्, n. entering, entrance; possession by<BR>devils, &c.; passion, anger, fury; a house in which<BR>work is carried on, a workshop, a manufactory, &c.;<BR>the disk of the sun or moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेशिक|आवेशिकः
आवेशिक, अस्, ई, अम्, own, peculiar; inherent; (अस्,<BR>ई, अम्), m. f. n. a guest, a visitor; (अम्), n. entering<BR>into; hospitable reception, hospitality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविष्
आविष् आ-विष्, cl. 3. P. A., Ved. -वेवेष्टि,<BR>-वेविष्टे, -वेष्टुम्, to pervade, penetrate, visit, go<BR>through.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविस्
आविस् आविस्, ind. (said to be connected<BR>with वहिस् and अव; or, according to others, fr.<BR>आ-विद्: cf. Gr. ἐξ Lat. ex?), before the eyes,<BR>openly, manifestly, evidently; (very often joined to<BR>the roots अस्, भू, and कृ.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविर्भू
आविर्-भू, cl. 1. P. -भवति, -वितुम्, to be or<BR>become apparent or visible, to appear, become mani-<BR>fest, be present before the eyes.<BR>—आविर्-भाव, अस्,<BR>m. manifestation, becoming visible, presence.<BR>—आविर्-<BR>भूत, अस्, आ, अम्, manifest, become visible, appeared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविष्कृ
आविष्-कृ, cl. 8. P. -करोति, -कर्तुम्, to make<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">Page0132-a+ 78</a>]<BR>apparent, reveal, uncover, show.<BR>—आविष्-करण,<BR>अम्, n. or आविष्-कार, अस्, m. making visible, mani-<BR>festation.<BR>—आविष्-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, made visible,<BR>revealed, uncovered, evident, manifest, known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0131-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविष्ट्य
आविष्ट्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. apparent, manifest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविस्तराम्
आविस्-तराम्, ind., Ved. in a more manifest way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवी
आवी 1. आ-वी, cl. 2. P., Ved. -वेति, -तुम्, to<BR>go towards, approach, enter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवी
2. आ-वी, f. the pangs of child-birth. (For आवी, f. of<BR>आव्य, see आव्य next col.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवीत
आ-वीत, अस्, आ, अम्, entered, passed, gone; placed,<BR>hung; (अस्), m. the sacrificial cord worn in a parti-<BR>cular manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवीतिन्
आवीतिन्, ई, m. a Brāhman who wears the sacrificial<BR>cord in a particular manner, especially on the right<BR>shoulder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवुक|आवुकः
आवुक आवुक, अस्, m. a father (in theatrical<BR>language).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृ
आवृ आ-वृ, cl. 5. 9. P. A. -वृणोति, -वृणुते,<BR>वृणाति, -णीते, -वरितुम् or -रीतुम्, to choose, de-<BR>sire; to cover, hide, conceal; fill, surround; to enclose,<BR>comprehend, shut, hem in; to keep off: Caus. P.<BR>-वारयति, -यितुम्, to cover, enclose, ward off, keep<BR>off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवरक
आ-वरक, अस्, आ, अम्, what covers or conceals, a<BR>cover, a veil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवरण|आवरणं
आ-वरण, अस्, आ, अम्, covering, hiding, concealing;<BR>(अम्), n. covering, concealing, hiding; shutting, en-<BR>closing; an obstruction, interruption; a covering, a<BR>garment, cloth; anything that protects, an outer bar<BR>or a fence, a wall; a shield; a bolt, lock; mental<BR>blindness.<BR>—आवरण-शक्ति, इस्, f. the power of illu-<BR>sion, that which veils the real nature of things.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवार|आवारः
आ-वार, enclosing, keeping off, in the words दुर्-<BR>आवार, स्कन्धावार, q. q. v. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवारि|आवारिः
आ-वारि, इस्, m. a shop, a stall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवार्य|आवार्य्य
आ-वार्य, ind. having enclosed, having covered;<BR>concealing; warding off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृत|आवृतः
आ-वृत, अस्, आ, अम्, enclosed, encompassed, sur-<BR>rounded (by a ditch, wall, &c.); covered, screened, con-<BR>cealed; invested, involved; spread, overspread, over-<BR>cast; filled with, abounding with; (अस्), m. a man of<BR>mixed origin, the son of a Brāhman by a woman of<BR>the Ugra caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृति|आवृतिः
आ-वृति, इस्, f. covering, enclosing, hiding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृज्
आवृज् आ-वृज्, cl. 1. A. -वर्जते, -जितुम्, to<BR>bestow, give: Caus. P. -वर्जयति, -यितुम्, to turn<BR>over, incline, bend, pour out, to cause to yield, over-<BR>come.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवर्जित
आ-वर्जित, अस्, आ, अम्, inclined, poured down,<BR>made to flow downwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवर्ज्य
आ-वर्ज्य, ind. turning down slantwise, inclining,<BR>pouring out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृत्
आवृत् 1. आ-वृत्, cl. 1. A. -वर्तते, -तितुम्,<BR>to turn or go towards, to turn round, turn back,<BR>revolve, return: Caus. P. -वर्तयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>cause to turn; to roll; to cause to roll down, shed;<BR>to attract; A. -वर्तयते, to turn round or back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवर्त|आवर्तः|आवर्त्त|आवर्त्तं|आवर्त्तः
आ-वर्त, अस्, m. turning, winding, turning round,<BR>revolving; whirl, gulf, whirlpool; deliberation, revolv-<BR>ing (in the mind); a lock of hair that curls backwards,<BR>especially on a horse; the two depressions of the fore-<BR>head above the eyebrows; a crowded place where<BR>many men live close together; a kind of jewel; N. of<BR>a form of cloud personified; (आ), f., N. of a river;<BR>(अम्), n. a mineral substance, pyrites, marcasite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवर्तक|आवर्तकः|आवर्त्तक
आ-वर्तक, अस्, m. a kind of poisonous insect; N.<BR>of a form of cloud personified; depression above the<BR>frontal ridge or over the eyebrows; whirlpool; revo-<BR>lution; revolution of the mind from the influence of<BR>the senses; a curl of hair; (ई), f., N. of a creeping<BR>plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवर्तन|आवर्तनः|आवर्त्तन|आवर्त्तनं
आ-वर्तन, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. turning round or<BR>towards; revolving; (अम्), n. turning, turning round,<BR>returning; circular motion, gyration, churning, stirring<BR>anything in fusion; melting metals together, alli-<BR>gation; the time when the sun begins to cast shadows<BR>towards the east or when shadows are cast in an<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">Page0132-b+ 74</a>]<BR>opposite direction; repeating, doing over again; study,<BR>practising; (ई), f. a crucible.<BR>—आवर्तन-मणि, इस्,<BR>m. a gem of secondary order, generally known as<BR>Rājāvarta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवर्तनीय|आवर्त्तनीय
आ-वर्तनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be turned round or<BR>whirled; to be reversed; to be repeated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवर्तमान|आवर्त्तमान
आ-वर्तमान, अस्, आ, अम्, going round, revolving;<BR>advancing, proceeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवर्तित|आवर्त्तित
आ-वर्तित, अस्, आ, अम्, turned round, stirred round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवर्तिन्|आवर्त्तिन्
आ-वर्तिन्, ई, इनी, इ, what whirls or turns upon itself;<BR>returning; (ई), m. a horse having curls of hair on<BR>various parts of his body, considered as a lucky<BR>mark; (इनी), f. a whirlpool; N. of the plant Odina<BR>Pinnata.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृत्
2. आ-वृत्, त्, f. turning towards or round, entering;<BR>(Sāy.) causing to turn towards; turn of a path or<BR>way, course, process, direction; progress of an action,<BR>occurrence, a series of actions, order, method.<BR>—आवृत्-<BR>वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. turned or turning towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृत्त|आवृत्तः
आ-वृत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, turned round, stirred, whirled;<BR>reverted, averted; retreated, fled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृत्ति|आवृत्तिः
आ-वृत्ति, इस्, f. turning towards, entering, turning<BR>back or from, reversion, retreat, flight; recurrence to<BR>the same point; repetition; turn of a way, course,<BR>direction; occurrence; revolving, going round; worldly<BR>existence, the revolution of births; use, employment,<BR>application.<BR>—आवृत्ति-दीपक, अम्, n. (in rhetoric)<BR>laying stress upon a word by repeating it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृत्य
आ-वृत्य, ind. having turned, turning towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृध्
आवृध् आ-वृध्, cl. 1. A. -वर्धते, -धितुम्,<BR>to increase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृष्
आवृष् आ-वृष्, cl. 1. P. A., Ved. -वर्षति,<BR>-ते, -षितुम्, to rain, to pour out (a libation).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवृष्टि|आवृष्टिः
आ-वृष्टि, इस्, f. raining, pouring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेग|आवेगः
आवेग आ-वेग, अस्, m. (rt. विज्), hurry, haste<BR>produced by excitement; flurry, agitation; (ई), f. the<BR>plant Convolvolus Argenteus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेणिक
आवेणिक आवेणिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. अ-वेणि), not<BR>connected with anything else; independant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेदक|आवेदकः
