आविद्ध
आ-विद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, cast, thrown, sent; pierced,<BR>wounded; disappointed; crooked; false, fallacious;<BR>stupid, foolish.<BR>—आविद्ध-कर्णी or आविद्ध-कर्-<BR>णिका, f., N. of a plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविध|आविधः
आ-विध, अस्, m. an awl, a drill, a kind of gimlet<BR>worked by a string.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेध्य
आ-वेध्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be pierced, pinned on,<BR>put on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आव्याधिन्
