आशितृ
आशितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, voracious, gluttonous, eating<BR>excessively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशिन्
आशिन्, ई, इनी, इ, eating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशिर|आशिरः
