आशंसा
आ-शंसा, f. wish, desire, hope; speech, declaration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

