आ-शंसिन्, ई, इनी, इ, declaring, announcing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशंसु|आशंसुः
आ-शंसु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing, hoping, desiring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशस्
आ-शस्, अस्, f., Ved. wish, desire, hope; (Say.) praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशा
1. आ-शा, f. wish, desire, hope, expectation, pros-<BR>pect; hope personified as the wife of a Vasu: (for 2.<BR>आशा see next page.)<BR>—आशा-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, lit.<BR>‘made expectation,’ attended with the expectation (of<BR>being gratified) or hope of success.<BR>—आशान्वित (˚शा-<BR>अन्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, having hope.<BR>—आशा-पिशाचिका, f.<BR>fallacious hopes.<BR>—आशा-प्राप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, success-<BR>ful, possessing the object hoped for.<BR>—आशा-बन्ध,<BR>अस्, m. band of hope, confidence, trust, expectation;<BR>a spider's web.<BR>—आशा-भङ्ग, अस्, m. disappointment.<BR>—आशा-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, hoping, having hope, trust-<BR>ing.<BR>—आशा-वह, अस्, m. bringing hope; N. of a son<BR>of heaven; of a Vṛṣṇi.<BR>—आशा-विभिन्न, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, disappointed in expectation.<BR>—आशा-हीन, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, one who has lost all hope, desponding,<BR>despairing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशक्
आशक् आ-शक्, cl. 5. P., Ved. -शक्नोति, -शक्-<BR>तुम्, to render one capable, to make one master<BR>or possessor of: Desid. Ved. -शिक्षति, to render one<BR>master of, impart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशक्त|आशक्तः
आ-शक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, able, powerful, capable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशक्ति|आशक्तिः
आ-शक्ति, इस्, f. power, ability, might.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशिक्षा
आ-शिक्षा, f., Ved. desire of learning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशङ्क्|आशंक्
आशङ्क् आ-शङ्क्, cl. 1. A. -शङ्कते, -कितुम्,<BR>to fear, suspect, doubt, hesitate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशङ्कनीय|आशंकनीय
आ-शङ्कनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be doubted; to be<BR>apprehended; questionable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशङ्कमान
आ-शङ्कमान, अस्, आ, अम्, fearing, apprehending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशङ्का|आशंका
आ-शङ्का, f. fear, apprehension; doubt, uncertainty;<BR>distrust, suspicion.<BR>—आशङ्कान्वित (˚का-अन्˚), अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, apprehensive, doubting, uncertain; afraid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशङ्कित|आशंकित
आ-शङ्कित, अस्, आ, अम्, feared, dreaded; doubted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशङ्किन्|आशंकिन्
आ-शङ्किन्, ई, इनी, इ, fearing, doubting, hesitating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशङ्क्य
आ-शङ्क्य, ind. having suspected, fearing, appre-<BR>hending, doubting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशद्
आशद् आ-शद्, cl. 6. A. -शीयते, -शत्तुम्, to go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशन|आशनः
आशन आशन, अस्, m., N. of the tree<BR>Pentaptera Tomentosa. See 3. अशन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0132-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशय|आशयः
