उच्छाद्य
उच्-छाद्य, ind. having undressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छन्न|उच्छन्नं
उच्छन्न उच्छन्न, अस्, आ, अम् (for उत्-सन्न by<BR>a Prākṛt corruption?), destroyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छादन|उच्छादनं
उच्-छादन, अम्, n. (for उत्-सादन), cleaning or<BR>rubbing the body with perfumes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छल्
उच्छल् उच्-छल् (उद्-शल्), cl. 1. P. A. -छलति,<BR>-ते, -लितुम्, to fly upwards or away, to move onwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छलत्|उच्छलन्त्
उच्-छलत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, flying up or away; going<BR>or moving on or against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छलन|उच्छलनं
उच्-छलन, अम्, n. moving upwards, going on or<BR>against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छालित
उच्-छालित, अस्, आ, अम्, moved, waved, waved<BR>above; gone; shaken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छास्
उच्छास् उच्-छास् (उद्-शास्), cl. 2. P., Ved.<BR>-छास्ति, -सितुम्, to clean or purify thoroughly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छास्त्रवर्तिन्|उच्छास्त्रवर्त्तिन्
