उच्छिख
उच्छिख उच्-छिख, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. उद् + शिखा),<BR>having the flame pointed upwards; flaming, blazing<BR>up; radiant; high-crested; (अस्), m., N. of a Nāga<BR>(‘with erected crest’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छिङ्घन|उच्छिंघनं
उच्छिङ्घन उच्-छिङ्घन, अम्, n. (fr. उद्-शिङ्घ्),<BR>breathing through the nostrils, snuffing, snoring; (the<BR>word is also written उच्छिंहन.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छिद्
उच्छिद् उच्-छिद् (उद्-छिद्), cl. 7. P. A. -छि-<BR>नत्ति, -छिन्ते, -छेत्तुम्, to cut out or off, extirpate,<BR>destroy; to interfere, interrupt, stop: Caus. P.<BR>-छेदयति, -यितुम्, to cause to extirpate or destroy:<BR>Pass. -छिद्यते, to be cut off, stopped, or inter-<BR>rupted; to cease, be deficient, fail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छित्ति|उच्छित्तिः
उच्-छित्ति, इस्, f. extirpation, destroying, destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छिद्य
उच्-छिद्य, ind. having cut off, destroyed, killed, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छिन्न|उच्छिन्नः
उच्-छिन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, cut out or off; destroyed,<BR>killed; abject, vile; (अस्), m. peace obtained by<BR>ceding valuable lands.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छेत्तृ
उच्-छेत्तृ, ता, m. an extirpator, a destroyer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छेद|उच्छेदः
उच्-छेद, अस्, m. cutting off or out; extirpation;<BR>destruction; cutting short, putting an end to; excision.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छेदन|उच्छेदनं
उच्-छेदन, अम्, n. cutting off, extirpating, de-<BR>stroying, destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छेदनीय
उच्-छेदनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be cut off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छेदिन्
उच्-छेदिन्, ई, इनी, इ, destroying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छेद्य
उच्-छेद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be cut off, to be de-<BR>stroyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छिरस्
उच्छिरस् उच्-छिरस् (उद्-शि˚), आस्, आस्, अस्, hav-<BR>ing the head elevated, with upraised head, N. of a<BR>mountain also called Urumuṇḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छिलीन्द्र
उच्छिलीन्द्र उच्-छिलीन्द्र (उद्-शि˚), अम्, n. a<BR>mushroom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छिष्
उच्छिष् उच्-छिष् (उद्-शिष्), cl. 7. P. -छि-<BR>नष्टि, -छेष्टुम्, to leave (as a remainder), to<BR>reject: Pass. -छिष्यते, to be left remaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छिष्ट|उच्छिष्टं
उच्-छिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, left, rejected, stale; having<BR>the remains of food on the mouth or hands, one<BR>who has not washed his hands and mouth and there-<BR>fore is considered impure; (अम्), n. leavings, frag-<BR>ments, remainder (especially of a sacrifice or of food).<BR>—उच्छिष्ट-कल्पना, f. a stale invention.<BR>—उच्-<BR>छिष्ट-गणपति, इस्, m. (opposed to शुद्ध-ग-<BR>णपति), Gaṇeśa as worshipped by the Ucchiṣṭas<BR>or men who leave the remains of food in their mouth<BR>during prayer.<BR>—उच्छिष्ट-ता, f. the being left, state<BR>of being a remnant or remainder.<BR>—उच्छिष्ट-भो-<BR>जन, अम्, n. eating the leavings of another man;<BR>(अस्), m. one who eats another's leavings; the<BR>attendant upon an idol, whose food is the leavings of<BR>offerings.<BR>—उच्छिष्ट-भोजिन्, ई, इनी, इ, or उच्छिष्ट-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">Page0146-c+ 73</a>]<BR>भोक्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, an eater of leavings, a mean<BR>person.<BR>—उच्छिष्ट-मोदन, अम्, n. wax.<BR>—उच्छि-<BR>ष्टान्न (˚ट-अन्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, leavings, offal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छेष|उच्छेषः
उच्-छेष, अस्, m. or उच्-छेषण, अम्, n. rest,<BR>remainder; leavings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छीर्षक|उच्छीर्षकं
उच्छीर्षक उच्-छीर्षक (उद्-शी˚), अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>having the head raised; (अम्), n. a pillow (‘that<BR>which raises the head’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छुष्
उच्छुष् उच्-छुष् (उद्-शुष्), Caus. -छोष-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to dry up, make dry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छुष्क
उच्-छुष्क, अस्, आ, अम्, dry, dried up, withered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छोषण
उच्-छोषण, अस्, आ, अम्, drying up, making dry;<BR>(अम्), n. drying up, parching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छोषुक
उच्-छोषुक, अस्, आ, अम्, drying up, making dry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छुष्म|उच्छुष्मं
उच्छुष्म उच्-छुष्म, अम्, n. or उच्-छुष्मन्,<BR>अ, n. (fr. rt. श्वस् with उद् ?), confusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छूडा
उच्छूडा उच्-छूडा, f. (see the more correct<BR>उच्-चूड), the head of a banner or part above the flag.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छून|उच्छूनं
उच्छून उच्-छून, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. श्वि with<BR>उद्), swollen, turgid; lofty, high; fat, bulky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छृङ्खल|उच्छृंखल|उच्छृङ्खलं
उच्छृङ्खल उच्-छृङ्खल (उद्-शृ˚), अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, unbridled, uncurbed, unrestrained, perverse, self-<BR>willed; irregular, desultory, unmethodical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छोचन|उच्छोचनं
उच्छोचन उच्-छोचन, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. उद्-शुच्),<BR>Ved. burning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छोषण
उच्छोषण उच्-छोषण. See उच्-छुष् above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्रि
उच्छ्रि उच्-छ्रि (उद्-श्रि), cl. 1. P. A. -छ्र-<BR>यति, -ते, -छ्रयितुम्, P. to raise, erect, extol; A.<BR>to rise, be erected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्रय|उच्छ्रयः
उच्-छ्रय, अस्, m. rising, raising, erecting; eleva-<BR>tion of a tree, mountain, &c.; rising of a planet, &c.;<BR>height; growth, increase, intensity; the upright side<BR>of a triangle.<BR>—उच्छ्रयोपेत (˚य-उप्˚), अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>possessing height, high, lofty, elevated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्रयण
उच्-छ्रयण, अम्, n. raising, erecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्राय|उच्छ्रायः
उच्-छ्राय, अस्, m. rising upwards, elevation,<BR>height; growth, increase, intensity; (ई), f. an up-<BR>raised piece of wood, plank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्रायिन्
उच्-छ्रायिन्, ई, इणी, इ, high, raised, lofty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्रित|उच्छ्रितं
उच्-छ्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, raised, lifted up; high, tall;<BR>advancing, increasing, prosperous; born, produced;<BR>increased in size or bulk, grown.<BR>—उच्छ्रित-पाणि,<BR>इस्, इस्, इ, with outstretched hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्रिति|उच्छ्रितिः
उच्-छ्रिति, इस्, f. rising upwards, elevation, increase;<BR>the upright side of a triangle; the upright elevation<BR>or height of a figure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्रेय
उच्-छ्रेय, अस्, आ, अम्, high, lofty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्लक|उच्छ्लकः
उच्छ्लक उच्छ्लक, अस्, m., Ved. a part of the<BR>human body, (used only in du.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्वङ्क|उच्छ्वंकः|उच्छ्वङ्कः
उच्छ्वङ्क उच्छ्वङ्क, अस्, m. (fr. rt. श्वञ्च् with<BR>उद्), Ved. gaping, cleaving open, forming a fissure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्वस्
उच्छ्वस् उच्-छ्वस् (उद्-श्वस्), cl. 2. P. -छ्व-<BR>सिति, -सितुम्, to breathe, take a deep breath, sigh,<BR>pant, respire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्वसत्|उच्छ्वसन्त्
उच्-छ्वसत्, अन्, अती, अत्, breathing hard, panting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्वसन|उच्छ्वसनं
उच्-छ्वसन, अम्, n. breathing, sighing; taking a<BR>deep breath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्वसित|उच्छ्वसितं
उच्-छ्वसित, अस्, आ, अम्, heaving, beating, breathed,<BR>inspired, blown, expanded; blooming, enlivened,<BR>gladdened; (अम्), n. sighing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्वास|उच्छ्वासः
उच्-छ्वास, अस्, m. breath, breathing, deep inspira-<BR>tion; sigh; breathing out, expiring, dying; consolation,<BR>encouragement; division of a book, pause in a narra-<BR>tion; an air-hole.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्वासित
उच्-छ्वासित, अस्, आ, अम्, breathless, out of breath,<BR>much, excessive, loosened, released, desisted from,<BR>disjointed, divided.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छ्वासिन्
उच्-छ्वासिन्, ई, इनी, इ, breathing, inhaling air;<BR>sighing, breathing out, expiring; pausing; rising,<BR>coming forward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उछ्|उच्छ्
उछ् उछ्, cl. 1. 6. P. उच्छति, उच्छाञ्-<BR>चकार, उच्छितुम्, to finish; to bind; to<BR>abandon, transgress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0146-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जन्
उज्जन् उज्-जन् (उद्-जन्), cl. 3. P. -जजन्ति,<BR>-जनितुम्, to beget, produce; cl. 4. A. -जायते, to<BR>be born, originate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जयन
उज्जयन उज्-जयन, &c. See s. v. उज्-जि below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जस्
उज्जस् उज्-जस् (उद्-जस्), Caus. -जासयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to destroy, extirpate (with gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जासन|उज्जासनं
उज्-जासन, अम्, n. killing, slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जानक|उज्जानकः
उज्जानक उज्जानक, अस्, m., N. of a Tīrtha;<BR>also spelt उज्जालक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जि
उज्जि उज्-जि (उद्-जि), cl. 1. P. -जयति, -जेतुम्,<BR>to win, conquer, acquire by conquest; to be victorious:<BR>Caus. -जापयति, -यितुम्, to assist any one to win;<BR>to cause to conquer (with two acc.): Desid. -जिगीषति,<BR>to wish to conquer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जयन
उज्-जयन, अस्, m., N. of a man; (ई), f. Ujjayinī<BR>or Oujein, the Gr. Οζήνη a city so called in Avanti<BR>(Mālava), formerly the capital of Vikramāditya; it<BR>is one of the seven sacred cities of the Hindūs, and<BR>the first meridian of their geographers, from which<BR>they calculate longitude; the modern Oujein is about<BR>a mile south of the ancient city.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जयन्त|उज्जयन्तः
उज्-जयन्त, अस्, m., N. of a mountain in Surāṣṭra<BR>in the west of India, part of the Vindhya range. See<BR>रैवत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जयिनी
उज्-जयिनी, f. the city Oujein. See उज्-जयनी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जिति|उज्जितिः
उज्-जिति, इस्, f., Ved. victory; N. of certain verses in<BR>the Vājasaneyi-Saṃhitā, so called because the words<BR>उदजयत् तम् उज्जेषम् occurs in them.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जेष|उज्जेषः
उज्-जेष, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. victorious.<BR>—उज्जेष-<BR>वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. containing the word उज्जेष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जिहान
उज्जिहान उज्जिहान, N. of a region.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जिहीर्षा
उज्जिहीर्षा उज्-जिहीर्षा, f. (fr. Desid. of rt.<BR>हृ with उद्), wishing to take or seize.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जीव्
उज्जीव् उज्-जीव् (उद्-जीव्), cl. 1. P. -जीवति, -वि-<BR>तुम्, to revive, return to life: Caus. P. -जीवयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to restore to life, animate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जीविन्
उज्-जीविन्, ई, m., N. of a counsellor of Meghavarṇa,<BR>the king of the crows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्जृम्भ्|उज्जृंभ्
उज्जृम्भ् उज्-जृम्भ् (उद्-जृम्भ्), cl. 1. A.,<BR>poet. P. -जृम्भते, -ति, -भितुम्, to gape, to open;<BR>to part asunder; to show one's self, become visible,<BR>come forth, break forth, expand, arise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

