उज्जृम्भण|उज्जृंभण|उज्जृंभणं
उज्-जृम्भण, अम्, n. the act of gaping, opening<BR>the mouth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

