उज्ज्य
उज्ज्य उज्-ज्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. उद् + ज्या), having<BR>the bow-sinew loosened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्ज्वल्
उज्ज्वल् उज्-ज्वल् (उद्-ज्वल्), cl. 1. P., ep. A.<BR>-ज्वलति, -ते, -लितुम्, to blaze up, flame, shine: Caus.<BR>P. -ज्वलयति, -यितुम्, to light up, cause to shine,<BR>illuminate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्ज्वल|उज्ज्वलं|उज्ज्वलः
उज्-ज्वल, अस्, आ, अम्, blazing up, luminous, splendid,<BR>light; burning; clean, clear; lovely, beautiful; blown,<BR>expanded; (अस्), m. love, passion; (अम्), n. gold;<BR>(आ), f. splendor, clearness, brightness; a form of the<BR>Jagatī metre.<BR>—उज्ज्वल-ता, f. or उज्ज्वल-त्व, अम्,<BR>n. splendor, radiance; beauty.<BR>—उज्ज्वल-दत्त, अस्,<BR>m., N. of the author of a commentary on the<BR>Uṇādi-sūtras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्ज्वलन|उज्ज्वलनं
उज्-ज्वलन, अम्, n. burning, shining; fire, gold (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्ज्वलित
उज्-ज्वलित, अस्, आ, अम्, lighted, shining, flaming, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्झ्
उज्झ् उज्झ्, cl. 6. P. उज्झति, उज्झाञ्-च-<BR>कार, उज्झितुम्, &c., to leave, abandon,<BR>quit; to avoid, escape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्झ|उज्झः
उज्झ, अस्, आ, अम्, quitting, forgetting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्झक|उज्झकः
उज्झक, अस्, m. a cloud, a devotee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उज्झन|उज्झनं
