उज्झटित
उज्झटित उज्-झटित, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. झट्),<BR>perplexed, bewildered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उञ्छ्|उंछ्
उञ्छ् उञ्छ्, cl. 1. 6. P. उञ्छति (cl. 1. and<BR>6. differing only in the accent), उञ्छि-<BR>तुम्, to gather, glean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उञ्छ|उञ्छं|उंछः|उञ्छः
उञ्छ, अम्, n. gleaning, gathering grains.<BR>—उञ्छ-<BR>वृत्ति, इस्, इस्, इ, one who lives by gleaning, a gleaner.<BR>—उञ्छ-शिल, अम्, n. gleaning corn or grains.<BR>—उञ्छ-शील, अस्, आ, अम्, one who lives by glean-<BR>ing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उञ्छन|उंछनं|उञ्छनं
उञ्छन, अम्, n. gleaning, gathering grains of<BR>corn in market-places &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उट|उटं|उटः
उट उट, अस्, m. leaves, grass, &c., used in<BR>making huts, thatches, &c.<BR>—उट-ज, अस्, अम्, m. n.<BR>a hut made of leaves, the residence of hermits or<BR>saints; a house in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उठ्
उठ् उठ् or ऊठ्, cl. 1. P. ओठति or ऊठति,<BR>ठितुम्, to strike or knock down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडु|उडुः
उडु उडु, उस्, उ, f. n. a lunar mansion or<BR>constellation in the moon's path; (उ), n. water.<BR>—उडु-प, अस्, अम्, m. n. a raft or float; (अस्), m.<BR>the moon, (the half-moon being formed like a boat.)<BR>—उडु-पति, इस्, m. or उडु-राज्, ट्, m. the moon;<BR>the Soma.<BR>—उडु-पथ, अस्, m. the ether, firma-<BR>ment (the path of the stars).<BR>—उडु-राज्, ट्, m. the<BR>moon.<BR>—उडु-लोमन्, आ, m., N. of a man.<BR>—उडू-<BR>प, अस्, अम्, m. n. a raft, a float; (अस्), m. the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडुम्बर|उडुंबर|उडुम्बरं|उडुंबरः|उडुम्बरः
उडुम्बर उडुम्बर, अस्, m. (in Ved. written<BR>with द्, in Class. generally with ड्), the tree Ficus<BR>Glomerata; a species of leprosy with coppery spots;<BR>the threshold of a house; a eunuch; a kind of worm<BR>supposed to be generated in the blood and to produce<BR>leprosy; (अम्), n. the fruit of the tree Ficus Glo-<BR>merata; copper; a karṣa, a measure of two tolas.<BR>—उडुम्बर-दला or उडुम्बर-पर्णी, f. the<BR>plant Croton Polyandra.<BR>—उडुम्बरा-वती, f., N. of<BR>a river; see also उदुम्बर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्डामर|उड्डामरं
उड्डामर उड्डामर, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. उद्-डा˚ ?),<BR>excellent, respectable, of high rank or consequence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्डी
