उड्डीन|उड्डीनं
उड्-डीन, अस्, आ, अम्, flown up, flying up; (अम्),<BR>n. flying as a bird; flying up, soaring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्डीयन|उड्डीयनं
