उड्डीयमान|उड्डीयमानः
उड्-डीयमान, अस्, आ, अम्, flying up, soaring, one<BR>who flies or soars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्डीश|उड्डीशः
उड्डीश उड्डीश, अस्, m. a work so called,<BR>containing charms and incantations; a N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्र|उड्रः
उड्र उड्र, आस्, m. pl., N. of a people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उण्डुक|उंडुकः|उण्डुकः
उण्डुक उण्डुक, अस्, m. a texture, a net;<BR>a part of the body, the peritoneum ?; (this word is<BR>perhaps connected with उडुप.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0147-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उण्डेरक|उंडेरक|उंडेरकः|उण्डेरकः
