उत्कम्पन|उत्कंपन
उत्-कम्पन, अम्, n. the act of trembling, agitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कम्पिन्|उत्कंपिन्
