उत्कल्
उत्कल् 2. उत्-कल् (उद्-क्˚), cl. 10. P. -काल-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to drive out, expel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कल|उत्कलं|उत्कलः
