उत्कोच|उत्कोचः
उत्-कोच, अस्, m. a bribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कोचक|उत्कोचकः
