उत्कुट|उत्कुटं
उत्-कुट, अम्, n. lying stretched out on the back,<BR>lying with the face upwards, sleeping with the head<BR>erect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कुटक
उत्-कुटक, अस्, आ, अम्, stretched out on the back<BR>with the face upwards, erect.<BR>—उत्कुटक-प्रहान,<BR>अम्, n. avoiding the above position.<BR>—उत्कुटकासन<BR>(˚क-आस्˚), अम्, n. a position like that just described.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कुण|उत्कुणः
उत्कुण उत्-कुण, अस्, m. a bug; a louse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कुल
