उत्कूज|उत्कूजः
उत्-कूज, अस्, m. the singing of the kokila.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कूट|उत्कूटं|उत्कूटः
उत्कूट उत्-कूट, अस्, m. an umbrella or parasol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

