उत्कूर्दन|उत्कूर्दनं
उत्-कूर्दन, अम्, n. jumping up, springing upwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कूल
उत्कूल उत्-कूल, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. being on<BR>an elevation, going up-hill; (अम्), ind. up-hill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कूलित
उत्-कूलित, अस्, आ, अम्, brought to the bank or<BR>shore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कृ
उत्कृ उत्-कृ (उद्-क्˚), cl. 8. A. -कुरुते,<BR>-कर्तुम्, to inform against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

