उत्कृत्य
उत्-कृत्य, ind. having cut off or up, having cut out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कृत्यमान
उत्-कृत्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being cut to pieces,<BR>being cut up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कृष्
उत्कृष् उत्-कृष् (उद्-क्˚), cl. 1. P. sometimes<BR>A. -कर्षति, -ते, -कर्ष्टुम् or -क्रष्टुम्, to draw<BR>or drag or pull up; to raise; to draw or take out,<BR>to extract; to pull or put off; to bend (as a bow);<BR>to tear asunder: Caus. -कर्षयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>elevate, raise, increase: Pass. -कृष्यते, to be<BR>lifted or drawn up, to be raised, to rise, become<BR>powerful, become eminent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कर्ष|उत्कर्षः
उत्-कर्ष, अस्, आ, अम्, superior, eminent; much,<BR>excessive; exaggerated, boastful; attractive; (अस्), m.<BR>pulling upwards, drawing, pulling; elevation, increase,<BR>rising to something better, prosperity; excellence,<BR>eminence; excess, abundance; self-conceit; boasting;<BR>joy, pleasure (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कर्षक
उत्-कर्षक, अस्, इका, अम्, drawing upwards, raising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कर्षण|उत्कर्षणं
उत्-कर्षण, अम्, n. drawing upwards, taking off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कर्षित
उत्-कर्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, drawn upwards, elevated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कृष्ट|उत्कृष्टं
उत्-कृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम् (opposed to अप-कृष्ट<BR>and अव-कृष्ट), drawn up or out; attracted; ex-<BR>tracted; taking a high position; excellent, eminent;<BR>superior, best; much, most, excessive; ज्ञानोत्कृष्ट<BR>(˚न-उत्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, eminent through knowledge.<BR>—उत्कृष्ट-ता, f. or उत्कृष्ट-त्व, अम्, n. ex-<BR>cellence, superiority, eminence.<BR>—उत्कृष्ट-भूम,<BR>अस्, m. a good soil.<BR>—उत्कृष्ट-वेदन, अम्, n.<BR>marrying a man of a higher caste; the best or most<BR>respectable form of marriage (?).<BR>—उत्कृष्टोपाधिता<BR>(˚ट-उप्˚), f. state of high illusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कॄ
