उत्कीर्तन|उत्कीर्तनं|उत्कीर्त्तन
उत्-कीर्तन, अम्, n. crying out, proclaiming; prais-<BR>ing, celebrating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

