उत्क्रान्त|उत्क्रांत
उत्-क्रान्त, अस्, आ, अम्, gone forth or out, gone over<BR>or beyond, passed, surpassed; trespassing, exceeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0148-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्क्रान्ति|उत्क्रांति|उत्क्रांतिः
