उत्तरेद्युस्
उत्तरे-द्युस्, ind. a subsequent day, a day following,<BR>to-morrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तमर्ण|उत्तमर्णः
