उत्तम्भितव्य
उत्-तम्भितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be upheld.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

