उत्ताप|उत्तापः
उत्ताप उत्-ताप. See under उत्-तप्, p. 149.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तार|उत्तारः
