उत्ताल|उत्तालः
उत्ताल उत्-ताल, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. उद् and ताल?),<BR>great, strong; formidable; arduous, difficult; speedy,<BR>swift, best, excellent; elevated, lofty, tall, loud; (अस्),<BR>m. an ape; (अम्), n. a particular number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तिज्
उत्तिज् उत्-तिज् (उद्-त्˚), Caus. P. -तेजयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to excite, stimulate, incite, instigate, urge<BR>on, stir up, animate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तेजक
उत्-तेजक, अस्, आ, अम्, instigating, stimulating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तेजन|उत्तेजनं
उत्-तेजन, अम्, आ, n. f. incitement, instigation, excit-<BR>ing, animating; sending, despatching; urging, driving;<BR>whetting, sharpening, furbishing, polishing; an in-<BR>spiring or exciting speech; an incentive, inducement,<BR>stimulant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तेजित|उत्तेजितं
उत्-तेजित, अस्, आ, अम्, incited, animated, excited,<BR>urged; sent, despatched; whetted, sharpened, fur-<BR>bished, polished; (अम्), n. an incentive, inducement;<BR>sidling, one of a horse's five paces; moderate velocity<BR>in a horse's pace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तु
उत्तु उत्-तु (उद्-तु), cl. 2. P., Ved. -तवीति or<BR>-तौति, -तोतुम् or -तवितुम्, to effect, bring about;<BR>(Sāy.) to increase, prosper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तुङ्ग|उत्तुंग|उत्तुङ्गः
उत्तुङ्ग उत्-तुङ्ग, अस्, आ, अम्, lofty, high, tall,<BR>swollen (as a stream).<BR>—उत्तुङ्ग-ता, f. or उत्तुङ्ग-<BR>त्व, अम्, n. height, loftiness, elevation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तुण्डित|उत्तुंडितं
उत्तुण्डित उत्-तुण्डित, अम्, n. the head of a<BR>thorn &c. which has entered the skin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तुद्
उत्तुद् उत्-तुद् (उद्-त्˚), cl. 6. P. A., Ved.<BR>-तुदति, -ते, -तोत्तुम्, to push up, tear up, stir up,<BR>push open.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तुद
उत्-तुद, अस्, m., Ved. one who stirs up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तुल्
उत्तुल् उत्-तुल् (उद्-त्˚), cl. 10. P. -तोलयति<BR>or -तुलयति, -यितुम्, to raise up (by means of a<BR>counterpoise), to erect, set up; to weigh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तोलन|उत्तोलनं
उत्-तोलन, अम्, n. lifting up, raising, elevating (by<BR>means of a counterpoise or balance).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तोलित
उत्-तोलित, अस्, आ, अम्, raised, lifted up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तुष|उत्तुषः
उत्तुष उत्-तुष, अस्, m. fried grain; (freed<BR>from the husks.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तृद्
उत्तृद् उत्-तृद् (उद्-त्˚), cl. 7. P. A. -तृणत्ति,<BR>तृन्ते, -तर्दितुम्, to split, cut through.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तॄ
उत्तॄ उत्-तॄ (उद्-त्˚), cl. 1. 6. P. -तरति,<BR>-तिरति, -तरितुम् or -रीतुम्, to pass out of (especially<BR>जलात्, the water &c., with abl. c.), to disembark, to<BR>come out of; to escape from (a misfortune, affliction,<BR>&c.); to come down, descend, alight, put up at; to<BR>pass over; to cross (as a river, with acc.), to vanquish;<BR>to give up, leave; to elevate, strengthen, increase:<BR>Caus. -तारयति, -यितुम्, to cause to come out, to<BR>deliver, assist, rescue; to make any one alight, take<BR>down, take off; to cause to pass over, to convey or<BR>transport across, land, disembark; to vomit up: Desid.<BR>-तितीर्षति, to wish to cross.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तर|उत्तरं|उत्तरः
2. उत्-तर, अस्, आ, अम् (for 1. see p. 149, col. 3),<BR>crossing over; to be crossed (in the word दुर्-उत्तर,<BR>difficult to be come out of or escaped from).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरण|उत्तरणं
उत्-तरण, अस्, आ, अम्, coming out of, crossing<BR>over; (अम्), n. coming forth or out of (especially out<BR>of water), landing, disembarking; crossing rivers &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरत्
उत्-तरत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, coming out of (water &c.),<BR>crossing, going over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तरिका
उत्-तरिका, f., N. of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तार|उत्तारः
उत्-तार, अस्, m. transporting over; landing; deli-<BR>vering, rescuing; ejecting, getting rid of; vomiting;<BR>passing away, instability; (अस्, आ, अम्), surpassing<BR>others, excellent, pre-eminent.<BR>—उत्तार-लोचन, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, having the eyes turned up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तारक|उत्तारकः
उत्-तारक, अस्, m. a deliverer, epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तारण|उत्तारणः
उत्-तारण, अस्, आ, अम्, transporting over, bringing<BR>over, rescuing; (अम्), n. the act of landing, delivering,<BR>rescuing, helping to cross over or escape, transportation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तारिन्
उत्-तारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, transporting across; unsteady;<BR>inconstant, changeable, tremulous, sick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तार्य|उत्तार्य्य
उत्-तार्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be made to land, to be<BR>ejected, to be thrown up by vomiting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तितीर्षु
उत्-तितीर्षु, उस्, उस्, उ, about to pass out of (water),<BR>wishing to land.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तीरम्
उत्-तीरम्, ind. on the bank, on land, ashore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तीर्ण|उत्तीर्णं|उत्तीर्ण्ण
उत्-तीर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, landed, crossed, traversed;<BR>rescued, liberated, escaped; released from obligation;<BR>thrown off; one who has completed his studies, ex-<BR>perienced, clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तीर्य
उत्-तीर्य, ind. having crossed, having landed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तेरित|उत्तेरितं
उत्तेरित उत्तेरित, अम्, n. (said to be fr. उत्-<BR>तॄ, but perhaps connected with rt. ईर्), one of the<BR>five paces of a horse in Hindū jockeyship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तोरण
उत्तोरण उत्-तोरण, अस्, आ, अम्, decorated<BR>with raised or upright arches.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0150-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तोलन|उत्तोलनं
उत्तोलन उत्-तोलन. See under उत्-तुल्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्त्यक्त|उत्त्यक्तः
उत्त्यक्त उत्-त्यक्त, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. त्यज् with<BR>उद्), abandoned, left; thrown, tossed; free from<BR>passion or affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्त्याग|उत्त्यागः
उत्-त्याग, अस्, m. abandonment, quitting; throwing,<BR>throwing up; secession from worldly attachments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्त्रस्
उत्त्रस् उत्-त्रस् (उद्-त्˚), Caus. P. -त्रासयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to frighten, alarm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्त्रस्त
उत्-त्रस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, frightened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्त्रास
उत्-त्रास, अस्, m. fear, terror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्त्रिपद
उत्त्रिपद उत्-त्रिपद, अम्, n. an upright tripod.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्था
उत्था उत्-था (उद्-स्था), cl. 1. P. A. -तिष्ठति,<BR>-ते, -थातुम्, to stand up, rise, raise one's self; come<BR>forth, arise, originate from; to rise (from the dead);<BR>to become animated; to be active or brave; to make<BR>efforts, take pains with, to excel: Caus. -थापयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to cause to stand up, raise, set up, erect; to<BR>lift up; to arouse, awaken, raise to life, make alive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्तिष्ठमान
उत्-तिष्ठमान, अस्, आ, अम्, standing up, rising;<BR>increasing, augmenting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थ|उत्थः
उत्-थ, अस्, आ, अम्, (generally at the end of a com-<BR>pound) rising, arising; coming forth, originating,<BR>derived from; standing up; (अस्), m. arising, coming<BR>forth; [cf. Zend usta.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थातृ
उत्-थातृ, ता, m., Ved. one who rises; resolving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थान|उत्थानं
उत्-थान, अम्, n. the act of standing up or rising;<BR>rising (of the moon &c.); resurrection; rising up<BR>to depart; leaving off; starting on a warlike expedi-<BR>tion; rise, origin; effort, exertion; manly exertion,<BR>manhood; evacuating (by stool &c.); an army; joy,<BR>pleasure; a book; a court-yard; a shed where sacri-<BR>fices are offered; a term, a limit; business of a family<BR>or realm, the care of subjects or dependants; reflection;<BR>proximate cause of disease; (अस्, आ, अम्), causing to<BR>arise or originate.<BR>—उत्थान-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, ready<BR>for action.<BR>—उत्थानैकादसी (˚न-एक्˚), f. the eleventh<BR>day in the light or former half of the month Kārttikā,<BR>when Viṣṇu rises from his sleep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थापक|उत्थापकः
उत्-थापक, अस्, आ, अम्, lifting up, causing to get<BR>up, who or what raises &c.; exciting, animating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थापन|उत्थापनं
उत्-थापन, अम्, n. causing to rise or get up;<BR>raising, elevating; causing to leave (a house &c.,<BR>with acc. of the person made to leave); causing to<BR>come forth, bringing forth; exciting, instigating;<BR>bringing about; causing to cease, finishing; (in<BR>mathem.) the finding of the quantity sought, answer<BR>to the question, substitution of a value; (ई), f. a con-<BR>cluding verse (ऋच्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थापित
उत्-थापित, अस्, आ, अम्, raised, lifted up, elevated;<BR>made to get up (from a seat, bed, &c.); aroused,<BR>instigated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थाप्य
1. उत्-थाप्य, ind. having raised or caused to rise,<BR>having roused or instigated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थाप्य
2. उत्-थाप्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be raised; Ved. to be<BR>sent away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थाय
उत्-थाय, ind. having risen (from a seat &c.);<BR>having risen (in rank &c.).<BR>—उत्थायोत्थाय (˚य-<BR>उत्˚), every time one rises (from one's bed).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थायिन्
उत्-थायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, rising, coming forth, becom-<BR>ing visible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थित|उत्थितं
उत्-थित, अस्, आ, अम्, risen or rising (as from a<BR>seat &c.); arisen, born, produced; happened, occur-<BR>ring; endeavouring, striving; advancing, increasing;<BR>high, lofty, eminent; extended; N. of a Pragātha<BR>consisting of ten Pādas.<BR>—उत्थित-ता, f. state of<BR>activity or of readiness to serve others.<BR>—उत्थितान्-<BR>गुलि (˚त-अन्˚), इस्, m. the palm of the hand with<BR>the fingers extended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्थिति|उत्थितिः
उत्-थिति, इस्, f. elevation, rising up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पक्ष्मन्
उत्पक्ष्मन् उत्-पक्ष्मन्, आ, आ, अ, or उत्-<BR>पक्ष्मल, अस्, आ, अम्, with upraised eyelids.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पचिष्णु
