उत्पाट|उत्पाटः
उत्-पाट, अस्, m. pulling up by the roots, destroy-<BR>ing; a disease of the external ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पाटक|उत्पाटकः
