उत्पाटिन्
उत्-पाटिन्, ई, इनी, इ, (often at the end of compounds)<BR>eradicating, extirpating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पाट्य
उत्-पाट्य, ind. having plucked up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पत्
उत्पत् उत्-पत् (उद्-प्˚), cl. 1. P. -पतति, -ति-<BR>तुम्, to fly or jump up, to rise, to be produced, ori-<BR>ginate: Caus. -पातयति, -यितुम्, to cause to fly up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पत|उत्पतः
