उत्पतत्
उत्-पतत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, flying upwards or onwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

