उत्पतित
उत्-पतित, अस्, आ, अम्, springing up, risen, ascended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पतितव्य
उत्-पतितव्य अस्, आ, अम्, to be flown upwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

