उत्पात|उत्पातः
उत्-पात, अस्, m. flying up, a spring, jump; an<BR>unusual or startling event boding calamity, a portent,<BR>prodigy, phenomenon; any public calamity, as an<BR>eclipse, meteor, earthquake.<BR>—उत्पात-वात, अस्, m. a<BR>whirlwind, a hurricane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पातक|उत्पातकः
