उत्पथ|उत्पथः
उत्पथ उत्-पथ, अस्, m. wrong road, bad<BR>way, error, evil; (अम्), ind. astray, on the wrong<BR>road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पद्
उत्पद् उत्-पद् (उद्-प्˚), cl. 4. A. -पद्यते,<BR>-पत्तुम्, to arise, rise, originate, be produced:<BR>Caus. -पादयति, -यितुम्, to produce, beget, gene-<BR>rate, cause, effect; to cause to issue or come forth,<BR>bring forward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पत्ति|उत्पत्तिः
उत्-पत्ति, इस्, f. arising, birth, production, origin;<BR>becoming visible, coming into existence; production<BR>in general, profit, productiveness; producing as an<BR>effect or result, giving rise to or generating as a con-<BR>sequence; resurrection.<BR>—उत्पत्ति-कालीअ, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>taking place at the time of birth.<BR>—उत्पत्ति-प्रयोग,<BR>अस्, m. production by the joint operation of cause and<BR>effect; purport, meaning.<BR>—उत्पत्ति-मत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>produced, born.<BR>—उत्पत्ति-व्यञ्जक, अस्, m. a type<BR>of birth (as investiture); a mark of the twice-born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पन्न|उत्पन्नः
उत्-पन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, risen, gone up; arisen, born,<BR>produced; produced unexpectedly; acquired, gained;<BR>occurred, happened; effected, accomplished; known,<BR>ascertained.<BR>—उत्पन्न-तन्तु, उस्, उस्, उ, having a<BR>line of descendants.<BR>—उत्पन्न-त्व, अम्, n. origin,<BR>production.<BR>—उत्पन्न-भक्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ, living<BR>from hand to mouth.<BR>—उत्पन्न-विनाशिन्, ई, इनी, इ,<BR>perishing as soon as produced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पाद|उत्पादः
उत्-पाद, अस्, m. coming forth, birth, production.<BR>—उत्पाद-पूर्व, अम्, n. title of the first of the<BR>fourteen Pūrvas or older sacred writings of the Jainas.<BR>—उत्-पाद-शयन, see s. v. next col.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पादक|उत्पादकः
उत्-पादक, अस्, आ, अम्, bringing forth, producing,<BR>productive, effective; (अस्), m. a producer, a genera-<BR>tor; a fabulous animal, called Śarabha, with eight<BR>legs; written also उत्पातक; (इका), f. a certain<BR>insect, perhaps the white ant (termes); N. of the<BR>pot-herb Enhydra Hingtsha, also of Basilla Rubra or<BR>Lucida; (अम्), n. origin, cause.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पादन|उत्पादनं
उत्-पादन, अस्, आ, अम्, bringing forth, producing,<BR>productive; (अम्), n. producing, generating, beget-<BR>ting, causing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पादित
उत्-पादित, अस्, आ, अम्, produced, effected; gene-<BR>rated, begotten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पादिन्
उत्-पादिन्, ई, इनी, इ, produced, born; (at the end<BR>of compounds) bringing forth, producing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पाद्य
उत्-पाद्य, ind. having produced; having begotten;<BR>having inspired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पाद्यमान
उत्-पाद्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being produced or<BR>generated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पल|उत्पलं|उत्पलः
उत्पल 1. उत्पल, अम्, n. (fr. rt. पल् for<BR>पट् with उद्, to burst upwards as a blossom?), the<BR>blue lotus, Nymphæa Cærulea, a seed of the Nym-<BR>phæa; the plant Costus Speciosus; any water-lily; a<BR>plant in general; (अस्), m., N. of a man who built a<BR>sanctuary, of an astronomer; N. of a lexicographer;<BR>(आ), f., N. of a river; (ई), f. a kind of cake made<BR>with unwinnowed corn.<BR>—उत्पल-गन्धिक, अम्, n.<BR>a species of sandal of the colour of brass and very<BR>fragrant.<BR>—उत्पल-चक्षुस्, उस्, उस्, उस्, lotus-eyed,<BR>fine-eyed.<BR>—उत्पल-पत्त्र, अम्, n. the leaf of a<BR>Nymphæa; a wound caused by the finger-nail of a<BR>woman; a Tīlaka or mark on the forehead, made<BR>with sandal &c. by the Hindūs; a broad-bladed<BR>knife or lancet.<BR>—उत्पल-पत्त्रक, अम्, n. a broad-<BR>bladed knife or lancet used by surgeons.<BR>—उत्पल-<BR>पुर, अम्, n., N. of a town built by Utpala.<BR>—उत्-<BR>पल-भेद्यक, अस्, m. a kind of bandage.<BR>—उत्पल-<BR>माला, f., N. of a lexicon.<BR>—उत्पल-राज, अस्, m., N.<BR>of a poet.<BR>—उत्पल-वती, f., N. of a river.<BR>—उत्पल-<BR>वर्णा, f., N. of a woman.<BR>—उत्पल-शाक, अस्, m.,<BR>N. of a plant.<BR>—उत्पल-शारिवा, f. the plant Ichno-<BR>carpus Frutescens.<BR>—उत्पलाक्ष (˚ल-अक्˚), अस्, m.,<BR>and उत्पलापीड (˚ल-आप्˚), अस्, m., N. of two princes.<BR>—उत्पलाभ (˚ल-आभ्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, lotus-like, re-<BR>sembling a lotus.<BR>—उत्पला-वन, अम्, n., N. of a<BR>region in Pañcāla.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पलक
उत्पलक, अस्, m., N. of a man; of a king of<BR>the Nāgas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पलिन्
उत्पलिन्, ई, इनी, इ, abounding in lotus flowers;<BR>(इनी), f. an assemblage of lotus flowers; a species of<BR>the Atijagatī metre, the same as Candrikā; N. of a<BR>river; title of a dictionary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

