उत्पल 2. उत्-पल, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. उद् and<BR>पल, flesh), fleshless, emaciated; (अम्), n., N. of<BR>a hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

