उत्पाली
उत्पाली उत्पाली, f. health (etym. doubtful).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पिञ्जर|उत्पिंजर
उत्पिञ्जर उत्-पिञ्जर, अस्, आ, अम्, uncaged,<BR>unconfined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पिञ्जल|उत्पिंजल|उत्पिञ्जलः
उत्-पिञ्जल, अस्, आ, अम् (ल् substituted for र्), out of<BR>order, disordered, excessively confused; uncaged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

