उत्पिष्ट
उत्-पिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, rubbed, ground; (अम्), n.<BR>a disease, a grating of the bones or of the joints upon<BR>each other.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0151-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्पीड्
