उदर्य|उदर्यः|उदर्य्य
उदर्य, अस्, आ, अम्, belonging to the belly; (अम्),<BR>n., Ved. contents of the belly or what forms the<BR>belly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0154-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

