उदर्चिस् उद्-अर्चिस्, इस्, इस्, इस्, shining or blaz-<BR>ing upwards, luminous; (इस्), m. a N. of fire; of<BR>Śiva, of Kandarpa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0154-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

