उद्-अस्य, ind. having cast up, having tossed upwards,<BR>having thrown; having expelled, having scattered;<BR>having made efforts, having taken pains.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

