1. उद्-आस, अस्, m. throwing or directing upwards,<BR>elevation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

