उदायम्
उदायम् उद्-आ-यम्, cl. 1. P. -यच्छति, -यन्-<BR>तुम्, to show, to make known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0154-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदायस
