उदारथि|उदारथिः
उदारथि उद्-आरथि, इस्, इस्, इ (fr. rt. ऋ with<BR>उद्?), Ved. steaming (as a hot dish); (Sāy.) rising,<BR>or enlightening the organs of sense; (इस्), m. an<BR>epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0154-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदावत्सर|उदावत्सरः
