उद्-ग्राह, अस्, m. taking up or away; (in the Prā-<BR>tiśākhyas) the rule of Sandhi which causes the change<BR>of the terminations अः, ए, and ओ, to अ before a follow-<BR>ing vowel; replying in argument; objection.<BR>—उद्-<BR>ग्राह-पदवृत्ति, इस्, f. the Sandhi called Udgrāha<BR>before a long vowel.<BR>—उद्ग्राह-वत्, ind. (in the<BR>Prātiśākhyas) ‘like the Udgrāha,’ a term applied to<BR>that kind of Sandhi by which final अ and आ appear as<BR>अम्म् before ऋ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्ग्राहणिका
उद्ग्राहणिका, f. replying in argument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्ग्राहित|उद्ग्राहितः
उद्-ग्राहित, अस्, आ, अम्, taken away, lifted up; de-<BR>posited, delivered; seized; bound, tied; excellent,<BR>exalted; recalled, remembered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्ग्रीव
उद्ग्रीव उद्-ग्रीव, अस्, आ, अम्, or उद्-ग्रीविन्, ई,<BR>इणी, इ, one who lifts up or raises the neck (in trying<BR>to see anything).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घ|उद्घः
उद्घ उद्-घ, अस्, m. (fr. rt. हन् with उद्),<BR>excellence, happiness; the hollow hand; fire; a model,<BR>a pattern; organic air in the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घन|उद्घनः
उद्-घन, अस्, m. a carpenter's bench, a plank on<BR>which he works.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घात|उद्घातः
उद्-घात, अस्, m. striking, wounding, inflicting a<BR>hurt; a wound, a blow; slipping, tripping; raising,<BR>elevation; a beginning, a thing begun; breathing<BR>through the nostrils as a religious exercise; a club, a<BR>mallet, a weapon; the division of a book, a chapter,<BR>a section.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घातिन्
उद्घातिन्, ई, इनी, इ, uneven, having elevations,<BR>rough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घट्
उद्घट् उद्-घट्, Caus. -घाटयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>open, unlock, unfasten; to peel, shell; to reveal, ex-<BR>pose; to undertake, commence; to rub over, stroke,<BR>tickle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घाट|उद्घाटः
उद्-घाट, अस्, m. a watch or guard-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घाटक|उद्घाटकं|उद्घाटकः
उद्-घाटक, अस्, m. an opener, the instrument or<BR>implement for opening anything, a key; (अम्), n.<BR>the rope and bucket of a well, a leather bucket used<BR>for drawing water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घाटन|उद्घाटनं
उद्-घाटन, अम्, n. opening, unlocking; an<BR>opener, the instrument or means of opening, a key,<BR>&c.; the rope and bucket of a well, a leather bucket<BR>used for drawing water; hoisting, raising, lifting up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घाटनीय
उद्-घाटनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be opened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घाटित|उद्घाटितः
उद्-घाटित, अस्, आ, अम्, opened, manifested; un-<BR>dertaken, commenced; raised, hoisted or lifted up;<BR>done with effort, exerted.<BR>—उद्घाटित-ज्ञ, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, wise, intelligent.<BR>—उद्घाटिताङ्ग (˚त-अङ्˚),<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, naked; intelligent, wise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घाटिन्
उद्-घाटिन्, ई, इनी, इ, opening, commencing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घट्टक|उद्घट्टकः
उद्घट्टक उद्-घट्टक, अस्, m. (fr. rt. घट्ट्<BR>with उद्), a kind of time (in music).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घट्टन|उद्घट्टनं
उद्-घट्टन, अम्, n. kicking of a horse (?);<BR>friction; opening, opening upwards as a lid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घट्टित
उद्-घट्टित, अस्, आ, अम्, opened, unlocked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घस|उद्घसं
उद्घस उद्-घस, अस्, m. (fr. rt. घस्), flesh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

