उद्घुष्ट
उद्-घुष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, sounded out; proclaimed;<BR>(अम्), n. sound, noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्घोष|उद्घोषः
उद्-घोष, अस्, m. announcing or proclaiming<BR>aloud; popular talk, general report.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

