उद्दंश|उद्दंशः
उद्दंश उद्-दंश, अस्, m. (rt. दंश्), a bug;<BR>a mosquito, a gadfly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्दण्ड|उद्दंड|उद्दण्डः
