उद्दाल|उद्दालः
उद्दाल उद्-दाल, अस्, m. (fr. दॄ with उद् ?),<BR>the plant Cordia Myxa or Latifolia; also Paspalum<BR>Frumentaceum.<BR>—उद्दाल-वत्, आन्, m., N. of a Gan-<BR>dharba.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

