उद्दिश्य
उद्-दिश्य, ind. having shown or explained; stipu-<BR>lating for, demanding; aiming at, in the direction of,<BR>with reference to; towards; with regard to, for, for<BR>the sake of, in the name of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्दिष्ट
