उद्दीप|उद्दीपः
उद्-दीप, अस्, m. inflaming, lighting; an inflamer;<BR>animating, who or what animates; (अम्), n. a gummy<BR>and resinous substance, bdellium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्दीपक|उद्दीपकः
उद्-दीपक, अस्, आ, अम्, inflaming, exciting, ren-<BR>dering more intense; lighting, setting alight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0156-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्दीपन|उद्दीपनं
