उद्धृ
उद्धृ 2. उद्-धृ (उद्-हृ), cl. 1. P. A. -ध-<BR>रति, -ते, -धर्तुम्, to draw out, take out, to extri-<BR>cate, deliver; to tear out, pull out, eradicate; to<BR>extend, elevate, raise: Caus. -धारयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to cause to draw out; to raise: Desid. उज्-जिहीर्षति,<BR>to wish to elevate or draw out, to elevate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्धर
