उद्धरण|उद्धरणं
उद्-धरण, अम्, n. the act of drawing out, taking<BR>out, tearing out; taking off (clothes); extricating, de-<BR>livering, rescuing; raising, lifting; eradication; ex-<BR>termination; act of destroying; taking a part or<BR>share; taking from the Gārhapatya fire to supply the<BR>other sacred fires; vomiting, bringing up; vomited<BR>food; final emancipation; (अस्), m., N. of the father<BR>of king Śantanu, the author of a commentary on a<BR>portion of the Mārkaṇḍeya-Purāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0157-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्धरणीय
