उद्धर्तव्य
उद्-धर्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be drawn out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0157-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्धर्तृ|उद्धर्त्तृ
