उद्-यत, अस्, आ, अम्, raised, held up; active, per-<BR>severing, labouring diligently and incessantly; trained,<BR>exercised, disciplined; eager, prepared, ready; (अस्),<BR>m. time (in music); a section, a chapter, the division<BR>of a book.<BR>—उद्यत-कार्मुक, अस्, आ, अम्, with raised<BR>bow.<BR>—उद्यत-गद, अस्, आ, अम्, with uplifted mace.<BR>—उद्यत-शूल, अस्, आ, अम्, with raised spear.<BR>—उद्-<BR>यत-स्रुच्, क्, क्, क्, Ved. raising the ladle to offer a<BR>libation.<BR>—उद्यतायुध (˚त-आय्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, with<BR>uplifted weapon or weapons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0158-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

