उन्-मेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be weighed, what is<BR>weighed; (अम्), n. weight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0159-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मार्ग|उन्मार्गः
उन्मार्ग उन्-मार्ग (उद्-म्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, m. f. n.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0160-a" target="_blank">Page0160-a+ 73</a>]<BR>a wrong road, deviation from the right way, improper<BR>conduct, an evil course, error.<BR>—उन्मार्ग-गत, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, erred, erring, going wrong.<BR>—उन्मार्ग-<BR>गमन, अम्, n. going on a wrong road, following<BR>evil courses.<BR>—उन्मार्ग-गामिन्, ई, इनी, इ, or उन्-<BR>मार्ग-वर्तिन्, ई, इनी, इ, going wrong, erring, follow-<BR>ing evil courses; taking a wrong road.<BR>—उन्मार्ग-<BR>जल-वाहिन्, ई, इनी, इ, carrying its waters on a wrong<BR>way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0159-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मार्गिन्
उन्मार्गिन्, ई, इणी, इ, going astray, finding an outlet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मार्जन|उन्मार्जनं
