उन्मुखर
उन्मुखर उन्-मुखर (उद्-म्˚), अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>loud-sounding, noisy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उन्मुच्
उन्मुच् उन्-मुच्, cl. 6. P. A. -मुञ्चति, -ते,<BR>-मोक्तुम्, to unfasten, pull off; take off (clothes &c.);<BR>to loosen, liberate; to elevate, raise: Caus. P. -मोच-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to loosen, deliver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0160-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

