उपकूलक
उपकूलक, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0160-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपकृ
उपकृ उप-कृ, cl. 5. 8. P. A. -कृणोति, -णुते,<BR>-करोति, -कुरुते, -कर्तुम्, to place or bring near, to<BR>furnish with, provide; to assist, serve; favour, benefit;<BR>to foster, take care of; to serve, render homage to (with<BR>acc.); to undertake, begin, set about anything (with<BR>dat.); to place under, subdue; उप-स्-कृ (स् inserted)<BR>A. to add, supply; to furnish with; to elaborate,<BR>prepare, furnish with anything beautiful, to adorn, or-<BR>nament; to care for, take care of (with acc.); to<BR>furnish badly, deform; corrupt; to bring together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0160-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपकरण|उपकरणं
उप-करण, अम्, n. doing anything for another,<BR>doing a service or favour, helping, assisting; instru-<BR>ment, implement, machine, engine, apparatus, para-<BR>phernalia, as the vessels and offerings at a sacrifice;<BR>anything added over and above, contribution, expedi-<BR>ent, means of subsistence, anything supporting life;<BR>object of art or science, fabricating, composing, &c.;<BR>the insignia of royalty; the attendants of a king.<BR>—उपकरण-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, furnished with means,<BR>instruments or implements, competent to do anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0160-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपकर्तृ|उपकर्त्तृ
उप-कर्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, doing one a favour, assist-<BR>ing, befriending, one who helps or befriends.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0160-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपकार|उपकारः
उप-कार, अस्, m. help, assistance, benefit, service,<BR>favour, use, advantage, (उपकारे वृत्, to be of service<BR>to another); preparation, ornament, garlands sus-<BR>pended at gateways as an embellishment on festivals,<BR>a flower &c.; (ई), f. a royal tent, a palace, a caravan-<BR>sera.<BR>—उपकार-पर, अस्, आ, अम्, beneficent, dili-<BR>gent in doing good.<BR>—उपकारापकारौ (˚र-अप्˚),<BR>m. du. kindness and injury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0160-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपकारक
उप-कारक, अस्, इका, अम्, doing a service or favour,<BR>assisting, protecting, befriending; (इका), f. a protec-<BR>tress, a female assistant; a palace, a caravansera; a<BR>kind of cake.<BR>—उपकारक-त्व, अम्, n. assistance,<BR>protection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0160-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

