उप-कारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, helping, assisting, doing one<BR>a favour, a benefactor; subsidiary, subservient; (often<BR>used in comp., e. g. परोपकारिन्, helping others.)<BR>—उपकारि-ता, f. or उपकारि-त्व, अम्, n. aid, suc-<BR>cour, protection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0160-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपकार्य|उपकार्य्य|उपकार्य्यः
