उपचक्र|उपचक्रः
उपचक्र उप-चक्र, अस्, m. a variety of the<BR>ruddy goose, Cakra or Cakravāka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचतुर
उपचतुर उप-चतुर, आस्, आस्, आणि, pl. almost<BR>four, nearly four.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचय|उपचयः
उपचय उप-चय. See 1. उप-चि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचर्
उपचर् उप-चर्, cl. 1. P. A. -चरति, -ते,<BR>-चरितुम्, Ved. -रितवे, -वै, -रसे, -रध्यै,<BR>to come near, approach, go towards; to approach<BR>with the intention of serving, to assist, serve, attend,<BR>wait on (with acc.); to attend on a patient, to<BR>tend, nurse; to undertake; begin: Pass. -चर्यते,<BR>to be used figuratively or metaphorically, to be applied<BR>figuratively to any one (with loc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचर|उपचरः
उप-चर, अस्, m. approach; attendance, cure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचरण
उप-चरण, अम्, n. going near to, approaching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचरित|उपचरितं
उप-चरित, अस्, आ, अम्, waited on, served, adored.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचर्य|उपचर्य्य
1. उप-चर्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be served or waited on,<BR>to be worshipped; (आ), f. service, attendance; practice<BR>of medicine, physicking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचर्य|उपचर्य्य
2. उप-चर्य, ind. having approached or attended<BR>to; having groomed or tended (horses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचार|उपचारः
उप-चार, अस्, m. approach, service, attendance,<BR>act of civility, obliging or polite behaviour; proceed-<BR>ing, practice; profession, usage; physicking, the prac-<BR>tice of medicine, tending the sick, nursing; behaviour,<BR>conduct; a ceremony, presenting offerings of water,<BR>betel, flowers, &c.; a present, a bribe; solicitation,<BR>request; incomplete act; a figure of speech, pre-<BR>tence, pretext, ellipsis, metaphor (e. g. उपचारात्,<BR>metaphorically); occurrence of स् and ष् in the place<BR>of Visarga in grammar; N. of a Pariśiṣṭa of the<BR>Sāma-veda.<BR>—उपचार-करण, अम्, n. or उपचार-<BR>कर्मन्, अ, n. or उपचार-क्रिया, f. offering presents,<BR>especially of perfumes, flowers, &c.; attention, service.<BR>—उपचार-पर, अस्, आ, अम्, diligent in service,<BR>serving diligently.<BR>—उपचार-परिभ्रष्ट, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, void of civility, destitute of kindness, churlish,<BR>uncourteous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचारिन्
उप-चारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, attending, serving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचार्य|उपचार्यः|उपचार्य्य|उपचार्य्यः
उप-चार्य, अस्, m. practice of medicine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचर्म|उपचर्मं|उपचर्म्म
उपचर्म उप-चर्म or अम्, ind. on the skin,<BR>near the skin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचारु
उपचारु उप-चारु, उस्, m. and उपचारु-मत्,<BR>आन्, m., N. of two Cakravartins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचि
उपचि 1. उप-चि, cl. 5. P. A. -चिनोति, -नुते,<BR>-चेतुम्, to gather together; to heap up, collect, hoard<BR>up, accumulate, increase, strengthen; to cover over<BR>with: Pass. -चीयते, to be heaped together or accu-<BR>mulated, to increase, become strong; to better one's<BR>circumstances, be prosperous; to gain advantage,<BR>succeed, to be covered with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचय|उपचयः
उप-चय, अस्, m. accumulation, increase, growth,<BR>prosperity; quantity, heap; elevation, excess; addi-<BR>tion; the third, sixth, tenth, and eleventh degrees<BR>from the first of a zodiacal sign.<BR>—उपचय-भवन,<BR>अम्, n. (?) according to some, a species of the Daṇ-<BR>ḍaka metre.<BR>—उपचयापचयौ (˚य-अप्˚), m. du.<BR>prosperity and decay, rise and fall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचायिन्
उप-चायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, increasing, being in good<BR>circumstances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचाय्य|उपचाय्यः
उप-चाय्य, अस्, m. a certain sacrificial fire; a place<BR>for holding sacrificial fire, a hearth, an altar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचित्
उप-चित्, त्, f., Ved. a kind of disease, perhaps a<BR>swelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचित|उपचितः
उप-चित, अस्, आ, अम्, collected, gathered together,<BR>heaped up, increased, assembled; thriving, increas-<BR>ing; abundantly furnished with, plastered, smeared;<BR>burnt (?).<BR>—उपचित-रस, अस्, आ, अम्, augmented in<BR>feeling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपचिति|उपचितिः
उप-चिति, इस्, f. accumulation, collection, abundance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

