उपच्छद्
उपच्छद् 2. उप-च्छद् or -च्छन्द् (उप-छद्),<BR>Caus. -च्छन्दयति, -यितुम्, to present any one<BR>(acc.) with anything (inst.); to persuade a person<BR>to do anything; to coax, to seek to seduce a person;<BR>to conciliate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

