उपजगती
उपजगती उप-जगती, f. a variety of the<BR>Triṣṭubh metre, in which three Pādas contain twelve<BR>syllables instead of eleven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजन्
उपजन् उप-जन्, cl. 4. A. -जायते, -जनितुम्,<BR>to be produced in addition, to be born, originate; to<BR>happen, become visible, appear; to be born again;<BR>to exist, be: Caus. -जनयति, -यितुम्, to produce,<BR>cause.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपज
उप-ज, अस्, आ, अम्, being produced in addition,<BR>increasing; (अस्), m., N. of a divine being (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजन|उपजनः
उप-जन, अस्, m. additional production, addition,<BR>increase; appendage; addition of a letter in the forma-<BR>tion of words; letters, syllables or affixes added.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजा
