उपजात
उप-जात, अस्, आ, अम्, produced, engendered, aroused.<BR>—उपजात-कोप or उपजात-क्रोध, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>provoked, excited, moved to anger.<BR>—उपजात-<BR>विश्वास, अस्, आ, अम्, believing, confiding, confident,<BR>trusting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजाति|उपजातिः
