उपजप्
उपजप् उप-जप्, cl. 1. P. -जपति, -जपितुम्,<BR>to whisper into the ears (of another), to bring over<BR>to one's own party by secretly suggesting anything in<BR>the ear, to instigate to rebellion or treachery; to<BR>make mischief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजप्य
