उपजाप|उपजापः
उप-जाप, अस्, m. the act of whispering into the<BR>ears, rousing to rebellion, bringing over to one's own<BR>party; treason, treachery; disunion, separation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजापक
