उपजीव्
उपजीव् उप-जीव्, cl. 1. P. -जीवति, -वितुम्,<BR>to live or exist upon (food), subsist, support one's self<BR>on, be supported by, derive profit from, make use of<BR>(with acc.); to live under, be dependant on, to serve;<BR>to live for a profession, practice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजीव
उप-जीव, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. living on &c. (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजीवक
उप-जीवक, अस्, आ, अम्, living upon, subsisting by<BR>(with inst.); living under, depending upon, subject to,<BR>a dependant; (अम्), n. means of subsistence, act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजीवन|उपजीवनं
उप-जीवन, अम्, n. means of living, subsistence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजीवनीय
उप-जीवनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, granting means of sub-<BR>sistence, affording a livelihood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजीविका
उप-जीविका, f. subsistence, livelihood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजीविन्
उप-जीविन्, ई, इनी, इ, living on, subsisting by (with acc.<BR>or gen.); living in dependance, dependant, subject.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजीव्य|उपजीव्यः
उप-जीव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, that by which one lives,<BR>affording a livelihood; (अम्), n. means of subsistence,<BR>cause.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजोषम्
उपजोषम् उप-जोषम्, ind. (rt. जुष्), ac-<BR>cording to one's desire or pleasure, quietly; an expres-<BR>sion indicative of joy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजोषण|उपजोषणं
उप-जोषण, अम्, n. enjoying, frequenting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपज्ञा
उपज्ञा 1. उप-ज्ञा, cl. 9. A. -जानीते, -ज्ञातुम्,<BR>to ascertain; excogitate, invent, find out, hit upon:<BR>Desid. A., ep. also P. -जिज्ञासते, -ति, to seek to<BR>ascertain or invent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपजिज्ञास्य
उप-जिज्ञास्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. enigmatical, unin-<BR>telligible, mysterious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपज्ञा
2. उप-ज्ञा, f. a knowledge obtained by one's self<BR>and not handed down by tradition, primitive or un-<BR>taught knowledge, invention; commencement of a<BR>thing not previously done; (at the end of a compound<BR>used in neut., e. g. पाणिन्य्-उपज्ञम्, the grammar<BR>invented by Pāṇini.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपज्मन्
उपज्मन् उप-ज्मन्, आ, m., Ved. striding or<BR>stepping upon (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपज्योतिष
उपज्योतिष उप-ज्योतिष, N. of a region.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0162-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपज्रि
