उपतापिन्
उप-तापिन्, ई, इनी, इ, heating, inflaming, exciting,<BR>causing pain; suffering heat or pain, sick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपतारक
उपतारक उप-तारक, अस्, इका, अम् (rt. तॄ),<BR>overflowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपतिष्य|उपतिष्यं
