उपतीरम्
उपतीरम् उप-तीरम्, ind. on the shore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपतुष्
उपतुष् उप-तुष्, Caus. -तोषयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to content, satisfy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपतूलम्
उपतूलम् उप-तूलम्, ind. at the cotton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपतृण्य|उपतृण्यः
