उपत्य
उपत्य उपत्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. उप), situated<BR>under or below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपत्यका
उपत्यका, f. low-land, land at the foot of a hill<BR>or mountain; a forest at the foot of a mountain; a<BR>vale, valley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपदंश्
