उपदंशिन्
उपदंशिन्, ई, इनी, इ, afflicted with the above<BR>disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपदधि
