उपदम्भ्
उपदम्भ् उप-दम्भ्, Caus. P., Ved. -दम्भ-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to lesson, diminish, destroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपदश
उपदश उप-दश, आस्, आस्, आनि, pl. almost ten,<BR>nearly ten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपदस्
उपदस् उप-दस्, cl. 4. P. -दस्यति, -सितुम्,<BR>to fail, be wanting, be extinguished, be exhausted, dry<BR>up; (in Ved. used impersonally with inst. or abl.):<BR>Caus. P. -दासयति, -यितुम्, to cause to fail or cease,<BR>extinguish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपदासुक
उप-दासुक, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. failing, wanting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपदह्
उपदह् उप-दह्, cl. 1. P. -दहति, -दग्धुम्,<BR>to burn, set fire to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपदा
उपदा 1. उप-दा, cl. 3. P. A. -ददाति, -दत्ते,<BR>दातुम्, to give in addition, offer, grant, give; to<BR>add: Ved. cl. 1. A. -ददते, to take upon one's self;<BR>to erect, support.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपदा
