उपदिग्ध
उपदिग्ध उप-दिग्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, (fr. rt. दिह्<BR>with उप), smeared, covered; spotted over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0163-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपदेह|उपदेहः
