उपपाद्य
उप-पाद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be effected, done,<BR>shown or proved; being produced, coming into ex-<BR>istence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0165-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपपद|उपपदं
