उपम
उपम 2. उपम, at the end of compounds.<BR>See under 3. उप-मा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0165-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमद्गु
