उपमन्त्रिन्|उपमंत्रिन्
उप-मन्त्रिन्, ई, इणी, इ, inviting, persuading.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमन्थनी|उपमंथनी
