उपमा
उपमा 2. उप-मा, cl. 2. P., 3 or 4. A. -माति,<BR>-मिमीते, -मायते, -मातुम्, to measure one thing<BR>by another, compare; Ved. to give, grant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमा
3. उप-मा, f. resemblance, equality, similarity; a<BR>resemblance, as a picture, portrait, image, &c.; a<BR>simile; comparison, a particle of comparison; (अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, at the end of a Bahu-vrīhi compound) like, similar<BR>to, resembling (e. g. अमरोपम, resembling an im-<BR>mortal).<BR>—उपमा-द्रव्य, अम्, n. any object used<BR>for a comparison.<BR>—उपमा-रूपक, अम्, n. a figure<BR>in rhetoric combining comparison and metaphor.<BR>—उपमेत (˚मा-इत?), अस्, आ, अम्, compared with?;<BR>(अस्), m., N. of the tree Vatica Robusta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमातृ
1. उप-मातृ, ता, m. an image-maker, a portrait-<BR>painter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमान|उपमानं
उप-मान, अम्, n. comparison, resemblance, ana-<BR>logy; a simile; that with which anything is com-<BR>pared; a particle of comparison; (in the Nyāya<BR>phil.) recognition of likeness, comparison, the third<BR>of the four pramāṇas or means of correct knowledge.<BR>—उपमान-चिन्तामणि, इस्, m. title of a philosophical<BR>work.<BR>—उपमानोपमेय-भाव (˚न-उप्˚), अस्, m.<BR>the connection between the subject of comparison and<BR>the comparison adduced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमित
उप-मित, अस्, आ, अम्, compared, illustrated by<BR>comparison, similar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमिति|उपमितिः
उप-मिति, इस्, f. resemblance, comparison, a like-<BR>ness, a picture, image, &c.; analogy; knowledge of<BR>things derived from analogy or resemblance; infer-<BR>ence, induction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमेय
उप-मेय, अस्, आ, अम्, (with inst. or as last member<BR>of a compound) to be compared, comparable with;<BR>(अम्), n. the subject of a comparison, that which is<BR>compared (opposed to उप-मान, that with which it is<BR>compared).<BR>—उपमेयोपमा (˚य-उप्˚), f. the resem-<BR>blance of any object to that compared with it; reciprocal<BR>comparison, as of the moon to a beautiful face.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमाति|उपमातिः
उपमाति उप-माति, इस्, f. (fr. rt. मन् with उप),<BR>Ved. approaching with a prayer; addressing, address;<BR>(Sāy.) comparison; (इस्), m. approaching in a friendly<BR>way; obliging; one who may be addressed, affable, espe-<BR>cially as an epithet of Agni; (Sāy.) granting wealth.<BR>—उपमाति-वनि, इस्, इस्, इ, Ved. one who receives ad-<BR>dresses in a friendly way; (Sāy.) destroyer of an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमीमांसा
उप-मीमांसा, f., Ved. deliberation, investigation,<BR>consideration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमातृ
उपमातृ 2. उप-मातृ, ता, f. (a second mo-<BR>ther), a wet nurse; a near female relative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमाद|उपमादः
उपमाद उप-माद, अस्, m., Ved. enjoyment,<BR>delight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमारण|उपमारणं
उपमारण उप-मारण, अम्, n. (fr. rt. मृ),<BR>Ved. submerging (in water &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमालिनी
उपमालिनी उप-मालिनी, f. a species of the<BR>Ati-śakvarī metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमास्य
उपमास्य उप-मास्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. occur-<BR>ring every month, monthly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमित्
उपमित् उप-मित्, त्, f., Ved, a prop, a stay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमूलम्
उपमूलम् उप-मूलम्, ind. at the root.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमृद्
