उपयज्
उपयज् उप-यज्, ड्, f., Ved., N. of eleven<BR>additional formulas at a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

