उपयन्तृ|उपयंतृ
उप-यन्तृ, ता, m. a husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयन्त्र|उपयंत्र|उपयंत्रं
उप-यन्त्र, अम्, n. (with उप implying inferi-<BR>ority) a minor surgical instrument or implement; a<BR>secondary application of any kind, as actual cautery,<BR>escharotics, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयम|उपयमः
