उपयाचक|उपयाचकः
उपयाचक उप-याचक, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. याच्),<BR>an asker, solicitor, begging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

