उपयुञ्जान
उप-युञ्जान, अस्, आ, अम्, attaching, taking, appro-<BR>priating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

