उपरत|उपरतः
उप-रत, अस्, आ, अम्, ceased, stopped; dead;<BR>withdrawn or retired from.<BR>—उपरत-कर्मन्, आ,<BR>आ, अ, ceasing from works or from relying on them.<BR>—उपरत-रास, अस्, आ, अम्, ceasing to dance or<BR>play.<BR>—उपरत-विषयाभिलाष (˚य-अभ्˚), अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, ceasing from all desire after worldly things.<BR>—उपरत-स्पृथ, अस्, आ, अम्, void of desire.<BR>—उपरतारि (˚त-अरि), इस्, इस्, इ, having no foe,<BR>being at peace with all.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरति|उपरतिः
