उप-राजम्, ind. near a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरि
उपरि उपरि, ind. (as a separable adverb)<BR>above, upon, on, upwards, towards the upper side of<BR>(opposed to अधस् and नीचा, e. g. उपरि या, to go<BR>upwards; sometimes written with a following word as<BR>if compounded with it, e. g. उपरि-चिह्नित, marked<BR>above); besides, in addition to, further (सहस्रं<BR>शतान्य् उपरि चाष्टौ, 1000 and 800 in addition);<BR>afterwards (e. g. उपरि पयः पिबेत्, he should<BR>drink milk afterwards); उपरि उपरि, higher and<BR>higher; repeatedly, continuously.<BR>(As a separable preposition, with acc., loc., or gen.)<BR>over, above, upon, on, at the head of, on the upper<BR>side of, beyond (e. g. उपरि शैलं गम्, to go over<BR>the mountain; उपरि लङ्कायां सम्प्राप्तः सः,<BR>he arrived over Laṅkā; उपर्य् उपरि सर्वेषाम्<BR>अतिष्ठत्, he stood at the very head of all; आत्मानं<BR>तस्य उपरि क्षिप्त्वा, having thrown himself upon<BR>him); in connection with, with reference to, with<BR>regard to, towards (with gen., e. g. मम उपरि<BR>विकारितः, changed in feeling with regard to me;<BR>पुत्रस्य उपरि क्रुद्धः, enraged towards his<BR>son); after (with abl., e. g. मुहूर्ताद् उपरि, after a<BR>minute); [cf. Zend upara; Goth. ufar; Old Germ.<BR>obar; Mod. Germ. über; Eng. over; Gr. ὑπέρ<BR>Lat. super.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरि
उपरि may also be used at the end of a compound;<BR>e. g. तदुपरि गन्तुम्, to fall upon him, to attack<BR>him.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरि
उपरि often stands at the beginning of a com-<BR>pound, as in the following examples.<BR>—उपरि-गत,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, gone up, ascended.<BR>—उपरि-चर, अस्, m.<BR>epithet of the king Vasu (‘walking in the air’).<BR>—उपरि-चित, अस्, आ, अम्, piled over or above.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">Page0167-a+ 77</a>]<BR>—उपरि-ज, अस्, आ, अम्, growing up, produced<BR>above, elevated, high.<BR>—उपरि-निहित, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>laid over.<BR>—उपरि-पुरुष, अस्, आ, अम्, having a<BR>man above.<BR>—उपरि-प्रुत्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. coming from<BR>above.<BR>—उपरि-बभ्रव, अस्, m., N. of a teacher<BR>of the ritual.<BR>—उपरि-बुध्न, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. raised<BR>above the ground.<BR>—उपरि-भाग, अस्, m. the upper<BR>portion or side.<BR>—उपरि-भाव, अस्, m. the being<BR>above or higher.<BR>—उपरि-भूमि, इस्, f. the ground<BR>above.<BR>—उपरि-भ्रम्, cl. 1. 4. P. -भ्रमति,<BR>-भ्राम्यति, -भ्रमितुम्, to wander over or<BR>above.<BR>—उपरि-मर्त्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. above<BR>men.<BR>—उपरि-शयन, अम्, n., Ved. a place of rest.<BR>—उपरि-श्रेणिक, अस्, आ, अम्, being in the upper se-<BR>ries.<BR>—उपरि-सद्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. sitting or dwelling above.<BR>—उपरि-सद्य, अम्, n., Ved. the act of sitting above.<BR>—उपरि-स्थ, अस्, आ, अम्, staying or being above,<BR>upper.<BR>—उपरि-स्थापन, अम्, n. placing upon or<BR>above.<BR>—उपरि-स्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, standing above,<BR>being above, upper.<BR>—उपरि-स्पृश्, क्, क्, क्, Ved.<BR>raised, elevated.<BR>—उपरीतक (˚रि-इत्˚), अस्, m. a kind<BR>of coitus.<BR>—उपर्य्-आसन, अम्, n. sitting on high.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0166-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरितन
उपरितन, अस्, ई, अम्, upper (opposed to अधस्-<BR>तन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरिष्टात्
उपरिष्टात्, ind. (as an adverb) above, from<BR>above; behind (opposed to पुरस्तात्), further on<BR>(in a book), later; afterwards; (as a preposition)<BR>over, upon, down upon (with acc. and gen.); behind<BR>(with gen.).<BR>—उपरिष्टाज्-ज्योतिष्मती, f., N. of a<BR>Vedic metre consisting of forty-three or forty-four<BR>syllables, the end of which is like the beginning of<BR>the metre Jyotiṣmatī.<BR>—उपरिष्टाज्-ज्योतिस्, इस्, f. a<BR>verse of the Triṣṭubh metre, the last Pāda of which<BR>consists of eight syllables.<BR>—उपरिष्टाद्-बृहती, f.,<BR>N. of a Vedic metre consisting of four Pādas, the<BR>first of which contains twelve, each of the three<BR>others only eight syllables.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरुच्
उपरुच् उप-रुच्, cl. 1. A. -रोचते, -रोचितुम्,<BR>to shine, be brilliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरुध्
उपरुध् उप-रुध्, cl. 7. P. A. -रुणद्धि,<BR>-रुन्धे, -रोद्धुम्, to obstruct, hinder, molest,<BR>trouble, disturb; to prevent; to conceal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरुद्ध|उपरुद्धः
उप-रुद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, obstructed, impeded,<BR>molested, disturbed; covered, spread; protected,<BR>favoured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरुध्य
उप-रुध्य, ind. having kept in check or ob-<BR>structed, having blockaded or hemmed in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरुध्यमान
उप-रुध्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being besieged,<BR>besieged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरोध|उपरोधः
उप-रोध, अस्, m. surrounding, blockading; ob-<BR>struction, impediment, opposition, check, refusal;<BR>trouble, disturbance; binding, tying, taking hold of;<BR>protection, favour.<BR>—उपरोध-कारिन्, ई, इणी, इ,<BR>causing trouble, obstructing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरोधक|उपरोधकं
उप-रोधक, अम्, n. an inner room, a private<BR>apartment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरोधन|उपरोधनं
उप-रोधन, अम्, n. obstruction, impediment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरोधिन्
उप-रोधिन्, ई, इनी, इ, obstructing, impeding;<BR>obstructed, impeded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरुह्
उपरुह् उप-रुह्, cl. 1. P. -रोहति, -रोढुम्,<BR>to ascend, rise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरुह्य
उप-रुह्य, ind. having ascended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरूपक|उपरूपकं
उपरूपक उप-रूपक, अम्, n. a drama of<BR>an inferior class, of which eighteen are enumerated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपल|उपलः
उपल उपल, अस्, m. (connected with उपर,<BR>q. v.), a rock or stone; a precious stone or jewel;<BR>(आ), f. the upper and smaller mill-stone which rests<BR>on the दृषद्; refined or candied sugar; [cf. Gr.<BR>ὤπαλος Lat. opalus.]<BR>—उपल-प्रक्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ,<BR>Ved. arranging stones; (Sāy.) throwing grain on the<BR>mill-stone.<BR>—उपल-भेदिन्, ई, m., N. of a plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलक|उपलकः
उपलक, अस्, m. a stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलक्ष्
उपलक्ष् उप-लक्ष्, cl. 10. P. A. -लक्षयति,<BR>-ते, -यितुम्, to look at, observe, behold; to regard<BR>as, value as; to imply in addition: Pass. -लक्ष्यते,<BR>to be observed &c.; to be likely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलक्षक
उप-लक्षक, अस्, आ, अम्, observing, designating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलक्षण|उपलक्षणं
उप-लक्षण, अम्, n. looking at; observation;<BR>designation; implying something that has not been<BR>expressed, implying something in addition or any ana-<BR>logous object where only one is specified, using a term<BR>in a generic sense, metaphorical or elliptical expression,<BR>synecdoche of a part for the whole, of an individual<BR>for the species or of a quality for that in which it re-<BR>sides; mark.<BR>—उपलक्षण-त्व, अम्, n. the being<BR>implied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलक्षयितव्य
उप-लक्षयितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be observed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलक्षित
उप-लक्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, comprehended, discovered,<BR>included, implied, metaphorically expressed, under-<BR>stood, characterized.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलक्ष्य|उपलक्ष्यः
उप-लक्ष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, inferable; (अस्), m. a<BR>prop, stay, support, asylum; an inference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलधिप्रिय|उपलधिप्रियः
उपलधिप्रिय उपलधिप्रिय, अस्, m. the<BR>Bos grunniens; perhaps a wrong form for बालधि-<BR>प्रिय, ‘valued for its tail.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलभ्
उपलभ् उप-लभ्, cl. 1. A. -लभते, -लब्-<BR>धुम्, to acquire, receive, accept, obtain, find; to<BR>conceive, become pregnant; to perceive, observe,<BR>hear, understand; [cf. Gr. ὑπολαμβάνω]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलब्ध
उप-लब्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, obtained, received; con-<BR>ceived; perceived, understood, known, guessed.<BR>—उपलब्ध-सुख, अस्, आ, अम्, one who has ex-<BR>perienced pleasure.<BR>—उपलब्धार्थ (˚ध-अर्˚),<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, having the meaning understood; (आ), f.<BR>a tale, a true or probable story.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलब्धव्य
उप-लब्धव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be observed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलब्धि|उपलब्धिः
उप-लब्धि, इस्, f. obtaining, acquisition, gain;<BR>observation, perception, knowledge (especially re-<BR>ligious), understanding, mind; a guess; appearance,<BR>perceptibility; [cf. Gr. ὑπόληψις]<BR>—उपलब्धि-<BR>मत्, आन्, अती, अत्, perceptible, intelligible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलभ्य
1. उप-लभ्य, अस्, आ, अम्, obtainable, perceivable,<BR>to be understood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलभ्य
2. उप-लभ्य, ind. having perceived or observed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलभ्यमान
उप-लभ्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being perceived.<BR>—उपलभ्यमान-त्व, अम्, n. the being known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलम्भ|उपलंभ|उपलंभः|उपलम्भः
उप-लम्भ, अस्, m. acquisition; apprehension, con-<BR>ception, comprehension otherwise than from memory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलम्भक|उपलंभक
उप-लम्भक, अस्, आ, अम्, causing to observe,<BR>reminding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलम्भन|उपलंभनं
उप-लम्भन, अम्, n. apprehension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलम्भ्य|उपलम्भ्यः
उप-लम्भ्य, अस्, आ, अम्, obtainable, to be ac-<BR>quired; respectable, commendable, praiseworthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलाभ
उप-लाभ, अस्, m., Ved. seizing or taking hastily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

