उपलिप्सु
उप-लिप्सु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing to obtain or know.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलालिका
उपलालिका उपलालिका, f. thirst, oppres-<BR>sion (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलिङ्ग|उपलिंग|उपलिंगं|उपलिङ्गं
