उपलिप्त
उप-लिप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, anointed, smeared, plastered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलेप|उपलेपः
उप-लेप, अस्, m. smearing, anointing, plastering;<BR>obstruction, the being concealed; becoming deadened<BR>or dull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0167-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलेपन|उपलेपनं
