उपविष्ट|उपविष्टः
उप-विष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, seated, sitting; arrived,<BR>entered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0168-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

