उपवेश्य
उप-वेश्य, ind. having seated or caused to sit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0168-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवेष्टृ
उप-वेष्टृ, टा, ट्री, टृ, he who sits, a sitter,<BR>sitting down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0168-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपविष|उपविषं|उपविषः
