उपसर्प्य
उप-सर्प्य, ind. having approached.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0169-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसेक्तृ
