उपेक्ष्य
उपेक्ष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be regarded or examined;<BR>to be disregarded or neglected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0173-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

