उपेन्द्र|उपेंद्र|उपेंद्रः|उपेन्द्रः
उपेन्द्र उपेन्द्र, अस्, m. (fr. उप-इन्˚), N. of<BR>Viṣṇu or Kṛṣṇa as the younger brother of Indra,<BR>(born subsequently to Indra, especially as son of<BR>Aditi, either as an Āditya or in the Vāmana Avatār);<BR>N. of a king of the Nāgas; (आ), f., N. of a river.<BR>—उपेन्द्र-दत्त, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR>—उपेन्द्र-<BR>बल, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR>—उपेन्द्र-वज्रा, f. a<BR>metre of four lines of eleven syllables each.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0173-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

