औदासीन्य|औदासीन्यं
औदासीन्य औदासीन्य, अम्, n. (fr. उद्-आसीन),<BR>indifference, apathy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0190-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदास्य|औदास्यं
औदास्य, अम्, n. indifference, stoicism, philosophy,<BR>solitariness, loneliness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0190-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदुम्बर|औदुंबर|औदुम्बरः
औदुम्बर औदुम्बर, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उदुम्बर),<BR>coming from the Udumbara tree, made of its wood;<BR>(अस्), m., N. of a region abounding in Udumbara<BR>trees; a form of Yama, the regent of death; (आस्), m.<BR>pl., N. of a people; (ई), f. (scil. शाखा) a branch of<BR>the Udumbara tree; (अम्), n. the wood of the<BR>Udumbara tree or a piece of the wood; the Udum-<BR>bara fruit; a kind of leprosy; copper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0190-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदुम्बरक|औदुंबरकः|औदुम्बरकः
औदुम्बरक, अस्, m. the country inhabited by<BR>the Udumbaras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0190-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदुम्बरायण|औदुम्बरायणः
औदुम्बरायण, अस्, m., N. of a grammarian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0190-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदुम्बरि
औदुम्बरि, इस्, m. a prince of the Udumbaras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0190-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्गात्र|औद्गात्रं
औद्गात्र औद्गात्र, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उद्-गातृ),<BR>relating to the Udgātṛ priest; (अम्), n. the office of<BR>the Udgātṛ priest.<BR>—औद्गात्र-सार-सङ्ग्रह, अस्,<BR>m., N. of a commentary of Rudraskanda on the<BR>Drāhyāyaṇa Sūtras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0190-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्ग्रभण
औद्ग्रभण औद्ग्रभण, अम्, n. (fr. उद्-ग्र-<BR>भण; scil. यजुस्), N. of certain sentence recited<BR>at the Dīkṣā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0190-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्दालक|औद्दालकं
औद्दालक औद्दालक, अम्, n. (fr. उद्दाल or<BR>उद्दालक; scil. मधु), a bitter and acrid sub-<BR>stance like honey, said to be found in the nest of the<BR>white ant; N. of a Tīrtha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0190-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्दालकि
औद्दालकि, इस्, m. an epithet of Śvetaketu, of<BR>Kusuruvinda, and of Āruṇi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0190-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्देशिक
औद्देशिक औद्देशिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उद्-देश),<BR>pointing out, showing, indicative of; enumerating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0190-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्धत्य|औद्धत्यं
औद्धत्य औद्धत्य, अम्, n. (fr. उद्-धत),<BR>arrogance, insolence, overbearing manner, disdain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0190-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्धारिक
