औधस
औधस औधस, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. ऊधस्), being<BR>in the udder, contained in the udder (as milk).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0190-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औधेय
औधेय औधेय, आस्, m. pl., N. of a family;<BR>N. of a school.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औन्नत्य|औन्नत्यं
औन्नत्य औन्नत्य, अम्, n. (fr. उन्-नत),<BR>height.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औन्नेत्र|औन्नेत्रं
औन्नेत्र औन्नेत्र, अम्, n. (fr. उन्-नेतृ), the<BR>office of the Un-netṛ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपकर्णिक|औपकर्ण्णिक
औपकर्णिक औपकर्णिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप +<BR>कर्ण), being near the ears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपकलाप्य
औपकलाप्य औपकलाप्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr.<BR>उप + कलाप), being near the girdle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपकार्य|औपकार्यं
औपकार्य औपकार्य, अम्, n. (fr. उप-कार्या),<BR>a residence; a tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपकुर्वाणक
औपकुर्वाणक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-कुर्वाण,<BR>q. v.), belonging to the Upa-kurvāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपगव|औपगवः
औपगव औपगव, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-गु),<BR>belonging to Upagu; a patronymic from Upagu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपगवक|औपगवकं
औपगवक, अस्, ई, अम्, belonging to the Aupa-<BR>gavas, coming from the Aupagavas; worshipping<BR>Aupagava; (अम्), n. an assemblage of Aupagavas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपग्रस्तिक|औपग्रस्तिकः
औपग्रस्तिक औपग्रस्तिक, अस्, m. (fr. उप-<BR>ग्रस्त) or औपग्रहिक, अस्, m. (fr. उप-ग्रह),<BR>an eclipse, the sun or moon in eclipse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपचारिक
औपचारिक औपचारिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-<BR>चार), metaphorical; figurative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपच्छन्दसिक|औपच्छंदसिकं
औपच्छन्दसिक औपच्छन्दसिक, अम्, n. (fr.<BR>उप + छन्दस्), N. of a metre of two lines, each<BR>containing 16 + 18 syllabic instants or 12 + 13 feet;<BR>see Gram. 970.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपजन्धनि
औपजन्धनि औपजन्धनि, इस्, m. a patro-<BR>nymic, N. of a teacher; also spelt औपचन्धनि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपजानुक
औपजानुक औपजानुक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप +<BR>जानु), being upon or near the knees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपतस्विनि
औपतस्विनि औपतस्विनि, इस्, m. patronymic<BR>of a Rāma mentioned in the Śatapatha-Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपदेशिक
औपदेशिक औपदेशिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-<BR>देश), living by teaching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपद्रविक
औपद्रविक औपद्रविक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-<BR>द्रव), relating to symptoms, treating of them.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपद्रष्ट्र्य|औपद्रष्ट्र्यं
औपद्रष्ट्र्य औपद्रष्ट्र्य, अम्, n. (fr. उप-<BR>द्रष्टृ), Ved. the state of being an eye-witness;<BR>superintendence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपधर्म्य|औपधर्म्यं
औपधर्म्य औपधर्म्य, अम्, n. (fr. उप-<BR>धर्म), false doctrine, heresy; inferior virtue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपधिक|औपधिकः
औपधिक औपधिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-धि),<BR>deceitful, deceptive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपधेनव
औपधेनव औपधेनव, अस्, m. (fr. उप +<BR>धेनु), N. of a physician.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपधेय
औपधेय औपधेय, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-धि),<BR>serving for the part of the wheel of a carriage, called<BR>Upadhi; (अम्), n. the wheel of a carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनायनिक
औपनायनिक औपनायनिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr.<BR>उप-नायन), relating to or serving for the rite of<BR>investiture, belonging to it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनासिक
औपनासिक औपनासिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप +<BR>नासा), being near the nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनिधिक|औपनिधिकं
औपनिधिक औपनिधिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-<BR>निधि), forming a deposit, relating to a deposit, de-<BR>posited; (अम्), n. a deposit, the thing pledged or<BR>deposited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनिषत्क
औपनिषत्क औपनिषत्क, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-<BR>निषद्), living by an Upaniṣad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनिषद|औपनिषदः
औपनिषद, अस्, ई, अम्, contained in or taught<BR>in an Upaniṣad, scriptural, theological; (अस्), m. the<BR>follower of an Upaniṣad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनीविक
औपनीविक औपनीविक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप +<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">Page0191-b+ 69</a>]<BR>नीवि), being near the Nīvi, i. e. a cloth with which<BR>women cover their loins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपपक्ष्य
औपपक्ष्य औपपक्ष्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. उप-<BR>पक्ष), being in the arm-hole.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपपत्तिक
औपपत्तिक औपपत्तिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-<BR>पत्ति), present, ready, at hand, within reach, fit,<BR>proper, answering a purpose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपपातिक
औपपातिक औपपातिक, अस्, ई, अम्, one who<BR>has committed an Upa-pātaka, q. v.; (अम्), n. title<BR>of a Jaina Upāṅga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपपादुक
औपपादुक औपपादुक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-<BR>पादुक), produced by one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपभृत
औपभृत औपभृत, अस्, ई, अम्, belonging to<BR>or being in the ladle called Upa-bhṛt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपमन्यव
औपमन्यव औपमन्यव, अस्, m. a patro-<BR>nymic from Upa-manyu; N. of Mahāśāla Jābāla;<BR>of Prācīnaśāla; of a grammarian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपमिक
औपमिक औपमिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. 3. उप-मा),<BR>serving for or forming a comparison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपम्य|औपम्यं
औपम्य, अम्, n. condition of resemblance or<BR>equality, similitude, comparison; often used in com-<BR>position (e. g. अन्-औपम्य, having no equal, un-<BR>paralleled).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपयज
औपयज औपयज, अस्, ई, अम्, belonging to<BR>the sentences called Upa-yaj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपयिक|औपयिकः
औपयिक औपयिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उपाय),<BR>leading to an object, answering a purpose, proper, fit,<BR>right; (अम्), n. a means, an expedient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपयौगिक
औपयौगिक औपयौगिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-<BR>योग), relating to the employment or application of<BR>(a remedy &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपर
औपर औपर, अस्, m. (fr. उपर), a patro-<BR>nymic of Daṇḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपराजिक
औपराजिक औपराजिक, अस्, आ or ई, अम् (fr.<BR>उप-राज), relating to a viceroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपरिष्ट
औपरिष्ट औपरिष्ट, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-<BR>रिष्टात्), being above, produced above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपरिष्टक
औपरिष्टक, अम्, n. part of the Kāma-sūtra, an<BR>amatory work by Vātsyāyana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपरैधिक|औपरैधिकः
औपरैधिक औपरैधिक, अस्, m. (fr. उपर +<BR>एध ?; scil. दण्ड), a staff made of the wood of the<BR>Pīlu tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपरौधिक
औपरौधिक औपरौधिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-<BR>रोध), proceeding from or relating to kindness or<BR>favour; opposing, impeding, connected with or re-<BR>lating to a check or hindrance; (अस्), m. a staff of the<BR>wood of the Pīlu tree (used in guarding the women's<BR>apartments ?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपल
औपल औपल, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उपल), stony,<BR>of stone; raised from stones (as a tax).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवसथिक
औपवसथिक औपवसथिक, अस्, ई, अम्, or<BR>औपवसथ्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. उप-वसथ), de-<BR>signed for or belonging to the Upa-vasatha; (अम्),<BR>n., N. of a Pariśiṣṭa of the Sāma-veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवस्त|औपवस्तं
