औपवस्त्र|औपवस्त्रं
औपवस्त्र, अम्, n. fasting; food suitable for a<BR>fast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवस्त्रक
औपवस्त्रक, अम्, n. food suitable for a fast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवास
औपवास, अस्, ई, अम्, given during fasting, to be<BR>done during fasting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवासिक
औपवासिक, अस्, ई, अम्, proper for fasting, able to<BR>fast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवास्य|औपवास्यं
औपवास्य, अम्, n. fasting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवाह्य|औपवाह्यः
औपवाह्य औपवाह्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. उप-<BR>वाह), designed for driving in a carriage or for<BR>riding; (a carriage) drawn for pleasure; (अस्), m. a<BR>king's elephant, any royal vehicle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपविन्दवि
औपविन्दवि औपविन्दवि, इस्, m. a patro-<BR>nymic from Upavindu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवेशि
औपवेशि औपवेशि, इस्, m. (fr. उप-वेश),<BR>Ved. a patronymic of Aruṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवेशिक
औपवेशिक, अस्, ई, अम्, living by entire devotion<BR>to any employment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपशिवि|औपशिविः
औपशिवि औपशिवि, इस्, m. a patronymic of<BR>Upaśiva; N. of a grammarian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपश्लेषिक
औपश्लेषिक औपश्लेषिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-<BR>श्लेष), relating to close or immediate contact.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपसङ्क्रमण|औपसंक्रमण
औपसङ्क्रमण औपसङ्क्रमण, अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>anything presented or proper to be done at the<BR>Upa-saṅkramaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपसङ्ख्यानिक|औपसंख्यानिक
औपसङ्ख्यानिक औपसङ्ख्यानिक, अस्, ई, अम्<BR>(fr. उप-सङ्ख्यान), depending on the authority<BR>of any addition or supplement, mentioned in one;<BR>supplementary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपसद|औपसदः
औपसद औपसद, अस्, ई, अम्, an Adhyāya<BR>or Anuvāka in which the word Upasad occurs; (अस्),<BR>m., N. of an Ekāha ceremony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपसर्गिक|औपसर्गिकः
औपसर्गिक औपसर्गिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-<BR>सर्ग), superior to adversity, able to cope with<BR>calamity; portentous; relating to change &c.;<BR>superinduced, produced in addition to (or out of<BR>another disease); connected with a preposition, pre-<BR>positive; (अस्), m. irregular action of the humors of<BR>the body, producing cold sweats &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपसीर्य
औपसीर्य औपसीर्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. उप +<BR>सीर), being near a plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपस्थान
औपस्थान औपस्थान, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-<BR>स्थान), one whose business is to serve, wait on, or<BR>worship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपस्थानिक
औपस्थानिक, अस्, ई, अम्, living by waiting on or<BR>worshipping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपस्थिक
औपस्थिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उप-स्थ), living by<BR>fornication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपस्थ्य|औपस्थ्यं
औपस्थ्य, अम्, n. cohabitation, sexual enjoyment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपस्थूण्य
औपस्थूण्य औपस्थूण्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. उप +<BR>स्थूणा), being near a post.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपस्वस्ती
औपस्वस्ती औपस्वस्ती, f. a patronymic of<BR>a woman.<BR>—औपस्वस्ती-पुत्र, अस्, m., N. of a<BR>teacher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपहस्तिक
औपहस्तिक औपहस्तिक, अस्, ई, अम्, living<BR>by Upa-hasta (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपहारिक
औपहारिक औपहारिक, अम्, n. (fr. उप-<BR>हार), an offering, oblation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपाधिक
औपाधिक औपाधिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उपा-<BR>धि), conditional; pertaining to attributes or pro-<BR>perties, an effect produced, a property or quality<BR>communicated (as colour, taste, &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपाध्यायक
औपाध्यायक औपाध्यायक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr.<BR>उपाध्य्-आय), preceptral, of or relating to a spiritual<BR>teacher, coming from a teacher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपानह्य
औपानह्य औपानह्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. उपा-<BR>नह्), used for making shoes; to be tied or bound<BR>on (as grass, leather, &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपायिक
