औपावि
औपावि औपावि, इस्, m. (fr. उपाव), a patro-<BR>nymic of Jānaśruteya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपासन|औपासनः
औपासन औपासन, अस्, m. (fr. उपासन;<BR>scil. अग्नि), the fire used for domestic worship;<BR>(scil. पिण्ड), a small cake offered to the manes;<BR>(अस्, ई, अम्), performed with the fire called Aupāsana;<BR>connected with or belonging to worship or service,<BR>devotional, holy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपेय
औपेय औपेय, a patronymic from Upeya (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपोदिति
