औरस|औरसः
औरस 1. औरस, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उरस्), be-<BR>longing to or being in the breast; produced from<BR>the breast, i. e. the seat of manly strength, produced<BR>by one's self; legitimate; (अस्, ई), m. f. a legitimate<BR>child, i. e. one by a wife of the same caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0192-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

