कटसी
कटसी, f. a cemetery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0195-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

