कटाकु|कटाकुः
कटाकु कटाकु, उस्, m. a bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0195-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटाक्ष|कटाक्षः
