कठिनी-भूत, अस्, आ, अम्, hardened, indurated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0196-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिल्ल|कठिल्लः
कठिल्ल कठिल्ल, अस्, m. the plant Momordica<BR>Charantia.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0196-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिल्लक|कठिल्लकः
कठिल्लक, अस्, m. the plant Momordica Charan-<BR>tia; Ocymum Sanctum [cf. कठिञ्जर]; Bœrhavia<BR>Diffusa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0196-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठेर|कठेरः
कठेर कठेर, अस्, m. (said to be fr. rt. कठ्),<BR>a needy or distressed man, a pauper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0196-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठेरणि
