करङ्क|करंक|करंकः|करङ्कः
करङ्क करङ्क, अस्, m. the skull, the head;<BR>a cocoa-nut hollowed to form a cup or vessel, a water-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0205-c" target="_blank">Page0205-c+ 72</a>]<BR>pot made from a cocoa-nut, [cf. 1. करक]; a<BR>kind of sugar-cane; any bone of the body.<BR>—क-<BR>रङ्क-शालि, इस्, m. a sort of sugar-cane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0205-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

