कस्
कस् 1. कस्, cl. 1. P. कसति, चकास, कसि-<BR>तुम्, to go, move, approach: Intens.<BR>चनीकसीति, चनीकस्यते; [cf. Hib. cas, cos, ‘a<BR>foot;’ coisighim, ‘to go.’]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0215-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कस्वर
कस्वर, अस्, ई, अम्, going, moving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0215-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कस्
कस् 2. कस्, कस्ते, a various reading for<BR>कंस्, कंस्ते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0215-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कस|कसः
कस कस, अस्, m. = कष, a touchstone;<BR>(आ), f. = कशा, a whip.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0215-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कसना
