कसारस्
कसारस् कसारस्, a kind of bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0215-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कसिपु|कसिपुः
कसिपु कसिपु, उस्, m. food, boiled rice;<BR>[cf. कशिपु.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0215-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कसेरु|कसेरुः
