कस्वर
कस्वर कस्वर. See under rt. 1. कस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0215-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कहय
कहय कहय, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0215-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कहाह|कहाहः
कहाह कहाह, अस्, m. a buffalo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0215-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कहूय
