किक्किश|किक्किशः
किक्किश किक्किश, अस्, m. a kind of worm,<BR>pernicious to the hair, nails, and teeth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0228-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किक्किसाद
