किक्नस
किक्नस किक्नस, अस्, m. particles of ground<BR>corn, bruised grain, groats.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0228-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किखि|किखिः
