किङ्किणीक
किङ्किणीक, अस् or अम्, m. or n. (?), a small bell.<BR>—किङ्किणीकाश्रम (˚क-आश्˚), अस्, m., N. of an<BR>hermitage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0228-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

