किङ्किर|किंकिर|किङ्किरं|किंकिरः|किङ्किरः
किङ्किर किङ्किर, अस्, m. a horse; the Indian<BR>cuckoo, the Kokila or Koil; a large black bee; Kāma-<BR>deva, the god of love; (आ), f. blood; (अम्), n. the<BR>frontal sinus of an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0228-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

