किट्टाल|किट्टालः
किट्टाल, अस्, m. scoria, rust of iron &c.; a copper<BR>vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0229-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किट्टिम
किट्टिम किट्टिम, अम्, n. a kind of liquid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0229-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किण|किणः
किण किण, अस्, m. a corn, a callosity; a<BR>scar; a wart, a mole; an insect found in wood.<BR>—किण-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, callous.<BR>—किणालात (˚ण-<BR>अल्˚), अस्, m. an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0229-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किणि|किणिः
