कित
कित कित, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0229-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कितव|कितवः
कितव कितव, अस्, ई, m. f. (perhaps fr. किम्<BR>तव, ‘what of you ?’ i. e. what is your stake?), a<BR>gamester, a gambler; a cheat, a fraudulent man or<BR>woman; a mad or crazy person; N. of a man; (आस्),<BR>m. pl., N. of a people or race; (अस्), m. thorn-<BR>apple, Datura Metel [cf. धूर्त and उन्-मत्त]; a<BR>kind of perfume, commonly Rocana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0229-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किनाट|किनाटं
किनाट किनाट, अम्, n. the inner bark of a<BR>tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0229-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किन्तनु|किंतनु|किन्तनुः
