कुग्राम|कुग्रामः
कुग्राम कु-ग्राम, अस्, m. (see 1. कु), a petty<BR>village without a Rājā, an Agnihotrin, a physician, a<BR>rich man, or a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुङ्कुण
कुङ्कुण कुङ्कुण, अस् or अम्, m. or n. (?), N.<BR>of a region.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुङ्कुम|कुंकुम|कुंकुमं|कुङ्कुमं
कुङ्कुम कुङ्कुम, अम्, n. saffron, Crocus<BR>Sativus, the plant and the pollen of the flowers; [cf.<BR>Gr. κρόκος; Lat. crocus?].<BR>—कुङ्कुम-ताम्र,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, red, coppery red.<BR>—कुङ्कुम-रेणु, उस्,<BR>f. the dust or pollen of saffron.<BR>—कुङ्कुमाक्त<BR>(˚म-अक्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, dyed or stained with saffron,<BR>orange, yellow.<BR>—कुङ्कुमाङ्क (˚म-अङ्˚), अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, marked with saffron, dyed or stained of an<BR>orange colour.<BR>—कुङ्कुमारुण (˚म-अर्˚), अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, red, ruddy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुङ्गनी
कुङ्गनी कुङ्गनी, f., N. of a plant, = महा-<BR>ज्योतिष्मती.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुच्
कुच् कुच्, cl. 6. 1. P. कुचति, कोचति, चुकोच,<BR>कुचितुम् or कोचितुम्, to sound high, to<BR>utter a shrill cry (as a bird); to polish; to go; to<BR>connect, mix; to bend, make curved or crooked, to<BR>be crooked; to oppose, impede; to mark with lines,<BR>to delineate, write; to contract or be contracted; to<BR>contend (?); [cf. कुञ्च्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुच|कुचः
कुच, अस्, m. (generally du. कुचौ), the female<BR>breast, a teat, a nipple, a pap.<BR>—कुच-कुम्भ, अस्,<BR>m. the female breast.<BR>—कुच-तट, अम्, n. the<BR>female breast.<BR>—कुचतटाग्र (˚ट-अग्˚), अम्, n. a<BR>nipple.<BR>—कुच-फल, अस्, m. the pomegranate (the<BR>fruit being shaped like the female breast).<BR>—कुच-<BR>मुख, अम्, n. a nipple.<BR>—कुचाग्र (˚च-अग्˚),<BR>अम्, n. a nipple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुचित
कुचित, अस्, आ, अम्, closed, contracted; small, little.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुचण्डिका
कुचण्डिका कुचण्डिका, f. a plant, Aletris<BR>Hyacinthoides, = मूर्वा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुचन्दन
कुचन्दन कु-चन्दन, अम्, n. (see 1. कु),<BR>red sanders, Pterocarpus Santalinus; sappan or log-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0232-c" target="_blank">Page0232-c+ 70</a>]<BR>wood, Cæsalpina Sappan [cf. पत्त्राङ्ग]; a legu-<BR>minous plant, Adenanthera Pavonina; saffron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0232-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुचर|कुचरः
