कुचिक|कुचिकः
कुचिक कुचिक, अस्, आ, m. f. a kind of fish,<BR>in shape like an eel, commonly Kuñciya, Unibran-<BR>chapertura Cuchiya, or Muræna Apterygia Synbrache;<BR>the Hindūs affirm that its bite is mortal to cows,<BR>though perfectly harmless to men; (also a various<BR>reading for कुशिक, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0232-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुचीरा
