कुटप|कुटपः
कुटप कुटप, अस्, m. (said to be fr. rt. कुट्),<BR>a measure of grain &c. (= कुडव); a saint, a<BR>divine sage or Muni; a garden or grove near a house<BR>(= निष्कुट); (अम्), n. a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटर|कुटरं|कुटरः
कुटर कुटर, अस्, m. a post round which<BR>the string passes that works the churning-stick [cf.<BR>कुटक and कुठर]; N. of a Nāga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटरु|कुटरुः
कुटरु कुटरु, उस्, m., Ved. a cock; a tent,<BR>a house of cloth or canvas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटरुणा
कुटरुणा कुटरुणा, f. a plant, commonly<BR>Teöri, Ipomœa Turpethum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटल|कुटलं
कुटल कुटल, अम्, n. a roof, a thatch; [cf.<BR>कुटङ्क.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटि|कुटिः
