कुटीर|कुटीरं|कुटीरः
कुटीर कुटीर. See under rt. कुट्, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुङ्गक|कुटुंगकः|कुटुङ्गकः
कुटुङ्गक कुटुङ्गक, अस्, m. an arbour or<BR>bower formed of creeping plants; a creeper winding<BR>round a tree; a thatch, a roof; a hut, a cottage; a<BR>granary, a store-room; [cf. कुटङ्क, कुटङ्गक,<BR>कुडङ्ग.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुनी
कुटुनी कुटुनी, f. a wrong reading for<BR>कुट्टनी, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्ब|कुटुंब|कुटुंबं|कुटुम्बः
कुटुम्ब कुटुम्ब, अम्, n. a household, the<BR>collective members of a household, a family; the care<BR>of a family, house-keeping; the care taken by a<BR>householder for the members of his family, hence<BR>metaphorically care or anxiety about anything; (अस्,<BR>अम्), m. n. name; race; a kinsman, a relation by<BR>descent; a connection, a relation by marriage by the<BR>mother's side; offspring, progeny.<BR>—कुटुम्ब-क-<BR>लह, अस्, अम्, m. n. domestic dissension, family<BR>feud.<BR>—कुटुम्ब-व्यापृत, अस्, m. a provident and<BR>attentive father of a family.<BR>—कुटुम्बार्थम् (˚ब-<BR>अर्˚), ind. for the support or on account of a family.<BR>—कुटुम्बौकस् (˚ब-ओक्˚), अस्, n. apartments &c.<BR>appropriated to the accommodation of relations &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बक|कुटुंबक|कुटुंबकं
कुटुम्बक, अस्, आ, अम्, being of one family;<BR>(अम्), n. a household; the duties and cares of a house-<BR>holder; a family, kindred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बय
कुटुम्बय, nom. A. -यते, to support a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बिक|कुटुंबिक|कुटुंबिकः|कुटुम्बिकः
कुटुम्बिक, अस्, आ, अम्, taking care of a family or<BR>household; (अस्), m. the slave of a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बिन्|कुटुंबिन्
कुटुम्बिन्, ई, m. a householder, a paterfamilias;<BR>one who supports or takes care of a family; meta-<BR>phorically one who takes care of anything (especially<BR>at the end of a compound); a member of a family,<BR>any one belonging to a household; a peasant, a<BR>cultivator of the soil; (इनी), f. the wife of a house-<BR>holder and mother of a family, a matron; a large<BR>household, a large family; a small shrub used in<BR>medicine, a kind of moon-plant, = क्षीरिणी.<BR>—कु-<BR>टुम्बि-ता, f. or कुटुम्बि-त्व, अम्, n. family con-<BR>nection or union, living as one family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटेर
कुटेर कुटेर, अस्, m. a hut, a cottage; [cf.<BR>कुटीर.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्ट्
कुट्ट् कुट्ट्, cl. 10. P. कुट्टयति, अचुकुट्टत्,<BR>यितुम्, to cut, divide; to grind or pound;<BR>to multiply; to censure, abuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्ट|कुट्टः
कुट्ट, अस्, ई, अम्, (at the end of compounds) cut-<BR>ting, dividing, making small; grinding, pounding;<BR>(अस्), m. a multiplier such that a given dividend being<BR>multiplied by it and a given quantity added to (or<BR>subtracted from) the product, the sum (or difference)<BR>may be measured by a given divisor.<BR>—कुट्टप-<BR>रान्त or कुट्टापरान्त (˚ट-अप्˚), आस्, m. pl., N.<BR>of a people.<BR>—कुट्ट-प्रचरण and कुट्ट-प्रा-<BR>वरण, आस्, m. pl., N. of two nations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टक|कुट्टकः
कुट्टक, अस्, आ, अम्, what cuts or divides, what<BR>pounds or grinds; (अस्), m. a grinder or pulverizer, a<BR>multiplier, &c. [cf. कुट्ट]; a kingfisher.<BR>—कुट्टक-<BR>व्यवहार, अस्, m. or कुट्टकाध्याय (˚क-अध्˚),<BR>अस्, m. that branch or chapter of arithmetic which<BR>treats of the कुट्ट or कुट्टक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टन|कुट्टनं
