कुट्टन्ती
कुट्टन्ती, f. a kind of dagger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टाक
कुट्टाक, अस्, ई, अम्, what cuts or divides.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टित
कुट्टित, अस्, आ, अम्, cut, divided; pounded, flat-<BR>tened; (आ), f., scil. सिरा, unskilful opening of a vein,<BR>the latter being cut to pieces by repeated application<BR>of the knife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टिन्
