कुट्टमित|कुट्टमितं
कुट्टमित कुट्टमित, अम्, n. one of the ten<BR>blandishments of women, affected repulse of a lover's<BR>caresses; [cf. कुट्टुमित.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0234-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टार|कुट्टारं|कुट्टारः
