कुडव|कुडवः
कुडव कुडव, अस्, m. a measure of grain,<BR>wood, iron, &c., the fourth part of a Prastha, de-<BR>scribed by some as a vessel four fingers wide and as<BR>many deep and containing twelve Prakṛtis or hand-<BR>fuls; it is also said to contain 13(1/2) cubic Angulas;<BR>or to be a finger and a half deep, and three fingers<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0234-b" target="_blank">Page0234-b+ 68</a>]<BR>each in length and breadth; in medicine it is equal<BR>to two Prakṛtis or thirty-two Tolakas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0234-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

