कुणक|कुणकः
कुणक कुणक, अस्, m. a young animal just<BR>born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0234-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुणञ्जर|कुणञ्जरः
