कुण्ठ्|कुंठ्
कुण्ठ् कुण्ठ्, cl. 1. P. कुण्ठति, -ठितुम्,<BR>to be lame or mutilated, to be blunted or<BR>dulled; to be lazy or stupid; cl. 10. P. कुण्ठयति,<BR>यितुम्, to cover, conceal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0234-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्ठ|कुंठ|कुण्ठः
कुण्ठ, अस्, आ, अम्, blunt, dull; stupid; weak;<BR>indolent, lazy, slow; foolish; [cf. अ-कुण्ठ.]<BR>—कुण्-<BR>ठ-ता, f. bluntness, dulness, indolence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0234-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्ठक|कुंठक|कुंठकः|कुण्ठकः
