कुन्त|कुंत|कुंतः|कुन्तः
कुन्त कुन्त, अस्, m. a spear, a lance, a<BR>barbed dart [cf. Lat. contus; Gr. κοντός]; a small<BR>animal, an insect; a species of grain, Coix Barbata;<BR>passion; N. of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0236-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुन्तल|कुंतल|कुंतलः|कुन्तलः
