कुम्भीरक|कुंभीरक|कुंभीरकः|कुम्भीरकः
कुम्भीरक, अस्, m. a thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0238-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भील|कुंभील|कुंभीलः|कुम्भीलः
कुम्भील, अस्, m. a crocodile; [cf. कुम्भीर.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0238-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भरी
कुम्भरी कुम्भरी, f. an epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0238-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भला
