कुरङ्कर|कुरंकर|कुरंकरः|कुरङ्करः
कुरङ्कर कुरङ्कर or कुरङ्कुर, अस्, m. the<BR>Indian crane, Ardea Sibirica.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरङ्ग|कुरंग|कुरंगः|कुरङ्गः
कुरङ्ग कुरङ्ग, अस्, m. (said to be fr. 1. कॄ),<BR>a species of antelope, an antelope or deer in general;<BR>N. of a mountain; (ई), f. a female antelope.<BR>—कु-<BR>रङ्ग-नयना, f. a handsome woman (‘fawn-eyed’).<BR>—कुरङ्ग-नाभि, इस्, m. musk (formed in a bag<BR>attached to the belly of the deer above the navel).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरङ्गक|कुरंगकः|कुरङ्गकः
