कुरर|कुररः
कुरर कुरर, अस्, आ, m. f. (said to be fr. rt.<BR>3. कु), an osprey; also another species of eagle; (ई), f.<BR>a female osprey; a sheep, an ewe; (अस्), m., N. of a<BR>mountain.<BR>—कुरराङ्घ्रि (˚र-अङ्˚), इस्, m. a kind<BR>of mustard (देव-सर्षप).<BR>—कुररी-गण, अस्,<BR>m. a flight of ospreys.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरराव|कुररावं
कुरराव, अम्, n. a place abounding with ospreys.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरल|कुरलः
कुरल कुरल, अस्, m. an osprey [cf. कुरर];<BR>a curl, a lock of hair upon the forehead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरव|कुरवः
कुरव कु-रव, अस्, आ, अम् (see 1. कु), having<BR>a bad voice; (अस्), m. a bad or harsh sound; N. of a<BR>plant, = सितमन्दार; a red or a yellow kind of<BR>barleria.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरवक|कुरवकः
कुरवक, अस्, m. a crimson species of amaranth;<BR>a purple or a yellow sort of Jhiṇṭi or barleria; a<BR>species of rice or grain; (अम्), n. the blossom of the<BR>amaranth or of the barleria.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरस|कुरसः
कुरस कु-रस, अस्, आ, अम् (see 1. कु), having<BR>bad juice or flavour or essence; (अस्), m. spirituous or<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0239-b" target="_blank">Page0239-b+ 77</a>]<BR>vinous liquor; (आ), f. a wild creeping plant, a species<BR>of hieracium; [cf. गो-जिह्वा.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0239-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुराजन्
कुराजन् कु-राजन्, आ, m. (see 1. कु), a bad<BR>king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0239-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुराज्य
कु-राज्य, अम्, n. bad dominion, bad administration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0239-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुराल|कुरालः
