कुलाट|कुलाटः
कुलाट कुलाट, अस्, m. a kind of small fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाद्य
कुलाद्य कुलाद्य, अस्, m. (?), N. of a country<BR>or people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाभि|कुलाभिः
कुलाभि कुलाभि, इस्, m. a treasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाय|कुलायं|कुलायः
कुलाय कुलाय, अस्, अम्, m. n. (fr. कुल?), a<BR>woven texture, a web; the nest of a bird; a case or<BR>investing integument, a receptacle; the body as the<BR>dwelling-place of the soul; the kennel or resting-place<BR>of a dog &c.; a place, a spot in general.<BR>—कुलाय-<BR>निलाय, अस्, m. the act of sitting in a nest, hatching,<BR>brooding.<BR>—कुलायनिलायि-ता, f. the act or state of<BR>hatching, &c.<BR>—कुलाय-निलायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, sitting in<BR>a nest, brooding, hatching.<BR>—कुलाय-स्थ, अस्, m.<BR>‘nest-dweller,’ a bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाययत्
कुलाययत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत् (fr. nom. कुलायय), Ved.<BR>building nests or a resting-place, hiding one's self in<BR>a nest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलायिका
कुलायिका, f. a bird-cage, an aviary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलायिन्
कुलायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, Ved. forming a nest, shaped like<BR>a nest, homely; (इनी), f., N. of a liturgical service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0241-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाल|कुलालः
कुलाल कुलाल, अस्, m. (said to be fr. rt.<BR>कुल्), a potter; a wild cock, Phasianus Gallus; an<BR>owl; (ई), f. the wife of a potter; N. of a plant; a<BR>species of blue stone applied as a collyrium to the<BR>eyes (कुलत्थिका).<BR>—कुलाल-वत्, ind. like a potter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0241-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

