कौणप|कौणपः
कौणप कौणप, अस्, m. (fr. कुणप), ‘feed-<BR>ing upon corpses,’ a Rākṣasa or goblin; N. of a Nāga<BR>(these beings are supposed to eat human flesh).<BR>—कौणप-दन्त, अस्, m. an epithet of Bhīṣma,<BR>uncle of the Pāṇḍus.<BR>—कौणपाशन (˚प-अश्˚), अस्,<BR>m., N. of a Nāga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौणिन्द
