कौणेय
कौणेय कौणेय, अस्, m. (fr. कुणि?), Ved. a<BR>patronymic of Rajana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0257-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौण्डल
