खन्
खन् खन्, cl. 1. P. A. खनति, -ते, च-<BR>खान, चख्ने, खनिष्यति, -ते, अखा-<BR>नीत् and अखनीत्, अखनिष्ट, खनितुम्, to dig,<BR>dig up, delve, to turn up the soil, excavate, root up;<BR>to dig into the earth, bury: Caus. खानयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to cause to dig or dig up: Desid. चिखनिषति,<BR>-ते: Intens. चङ्खन्यते, चाखायते, चङ्खन्ति;<BR>[cf. Gr. χαίνω, χανῶ; Old Germ. ginêm, ginôm;<BR>Mod. Germ. gähne; Angl. Sax. cina, cinan; Lat.<BR>cuniculus, canalis.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0273-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खन
खन, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. digging; rooting up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0273-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खनक|खनकः
खनक, अस्, ई, अम्, digging, digging up, dividing;<BR>a digger, excavator; (अस्), m. a miner; a house-<BR>breaker, a thief; a rat; N. of a friend of Vidura.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0273-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खनत्
खनत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, digging, digging up, ex-<BR>cavating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0273-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खनन|खननं
खनन, अम्, n. the act of digging, excavating;<BR>digging into the earth, burying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0273-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खननीय
खननीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be digged, to be ex-<BR>cavated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0273-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खनि|खनिः
खनि, इस्, इस्, इ, Ved. digging or rooting up; (इस्<BR>or ई), f. a mine, especially of precious stones; a<BR>quarry, a cave.<BR>—खनि-नेत्र or खनी-नेत्र, अस्,<BR>m., N. of a prince with the epithet Karandhama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0273-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खनितृ
खनितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, a digger, delver, excavator,<BR>ditcher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0273-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खनित्र|खनित्रं
खनित्र, अम्, n. an instrument for digging, a<BR>spade, shovel, hoe, pickaxe; (अस्), m., N. of a prince.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0273-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खनित्रक|खनित्रकं
