खनित्रिम
खनित्रिम, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. produced by digging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0273-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खनित्वा
खनित्वा, ind. having dug.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0273-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खन्य
खन्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. to be digged or excavated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0273-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खात|खातं
खात, अस्, आ, अम्, dug, dug up, excavated; torn,<BR>rent; (अम्), n. digging a hole; an excavation; a<BR>ditch, fosse, moat, well; a cavern; a square or<BR>oblong pond; (आ), f. an artificial pond; [cf. देव-<BR>खात, &c.]<BR>—खात-भू, ऊस्, f. a moat, ditch.<BR>—खात-रूप-कार, अस्, m. a potter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0273-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

