खान्य
खान्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be digged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0273-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेय|खेयं
खेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be dug, to be excavated;<BR>(अम्), n. a ditch, a moat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0273-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खनपान
