खम्ब्
खम्ब् खम्ब्, cl. 1. P. खम्बति, -बितुम्, to<BR>go or move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर|खरं|खरः
खर खर, अस्, आ, अम्, hard, harsh, rough;<BR>sharp, pungent, acid (opposed to मृदु and श्ल-<BR>क्ष्ण); solid (opposed to द्रव, fluid); dense (as<BR>clouds); sharp, hot (as wind); hurtful, injurious;<BR>cutting (as a speech or word); sharp-edged; cruel;<BR>(अस्), m. a donkey, an ass, a mule; N. of several<BR>birds; an osprey, a heron, a crow; a thorny plant,<BR>a sort of prickly nightshade; a quadrangular mound<BR>of earth for receiving the sacrificial vessels; a Daitya<BR>or demon in general; epithet of the Asura Dhenuka;<BR>N. of a Rakṣas slain by Rāma, a younger brother<BR>of Rāvaṇa: N. of an attendant of the Sun (= Dhar-<BR>ma); N. of an attendant of Śiva; N. of a Rudra;<BR>(आ), f. a kind of grass, Andropogon Serratus; (ई), f.<BR>a she-ass.<BR>—खर-काष्ठिका, f. the plant Sida<BR>Cordifolia (बला).<BR>—खर-कुटी, f. a stable for<BR>asses, a donkey-stall (used as an abusive epithet); a<BR>barber's shop.<BR>—खर-केतु, उस्, m., N. of a<BR>Rakṣas.<BR>—खर-कोण or खर-क्वाण, अस्, m.<BR>the francoline partridge.<BR>—खर-कोमल, अस्, m.<BR>the month Jyeṣṭha (‘bracing yet mild’).<BR>—खर-<BR>गन्ध-निभा or खर-गन्धा, f. the plant<BR>Hedysarum Lagopodioides, = नाग-बला.<BR>—खर-<BR>गृह or खर-गेह, अम्, n. or खर-ग्रह, अस्,<BR>m. a stable for asses.<BR>—खर-घातन, अस्, m. the<BR>tree Mesua Ferrea, commonly Nageśar.<BR>—खर-<BR>च्छद, अस्, m., N. of several plants, a kind of<BR>reed or grass, Saccharum Cylindricum; another kind,<BR>commonly Okera; [cf. उलूक, इत्कट, कुन्दर.]<BR>—खर-ज्रु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. sharp or quick in<BR>motion.<BR>—खर-णस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, or खर-णस,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, sharp-nosed; (अस्), m., N. of a man.<BR>—खर-तर, अस्, आ, अम्, more sharp, very sharp.<BR>—खर-त्वच्, क्, f., N. of a plant, = अलम्बुषा.<BR>—खर-दण्ड, अम्, n. a lotus, Nymphæa Lotus.<BR>—खर-दला, f. opposite-leaved fig tree, Ficus<BR>Oppositifolia; [cf. उदुम्बर.]<BR>—खर-दूषण,<BR>अस्, m. the thorn-apple, Datura Metel.<BR>—खर-<BR>धार, अस्, आ, अम्, having a harsh edge or one full<BR>of notches like that of a saw.<BR>—खर-ध्वंसिन्, ई,<BR>m. destroyer of the demon Khara, an epithet of<BR>Rāma.<BR>—खर-नखर, अस्, m., N. of a lion.<BR>—खर-नराय, अस्, m., N. of a son of Śatānanda.<BR>—खर-नाद, अस्, m. the braying of an ass.<BR>—खर-नादिन्, ई, इनी, इ, braying like an ass; (ई),<BR>m., N. of a man; also of a Ṛṣi; (इनी), f. a kind<BR>of perfume, = रेणुका (‘causing a donkey to bray?’).<BR>—खर-नाल, अम्, n. a lotus.<BR>—खर-प, अस्,<BR>m., N. of a man; (आस्), m. pl. the descendants of<BR>this man.<BR>—खर-पत्त्र, अस्, m., N. of several<BR>plants, a kind of Ocimum (तुलसी) and Tectona<BR>Grandis; a kind of cane; also = हरिद्गर्भ and<BR>मरुवक (a kind of Ocimum); (ई), f., N. of two<BR>plants, Elephantopus Scaber (गोजिह्वा) and Ficus<BR>Oppositifolia (काकोदुम्बरिका).<BR>—खर-पत्त्र-<BR>क, अस्, m., N. of a plant, = तिलक — खर-पात्र,<BR>अम्, n. an iron pot or vessel.<BR>—खर-पादाढ्य<BR>(˚द-आढ्˚), अस्, m. the elephant or wood-apple,<BR>Feronia Elephantum; [cf. कपित्थ.]<BR>—खर-<BR>पाल, अस्, m. a wooden vessel; [cf. खर-पात्र.]<BR>—खर-पुष्प, अस्, m. a plant, commonly<BR>Marüa, a kind of Ocimum, see मरुवक; (आ or<BR>इका), f. a kind of Tulasi, Ocimum Gratissimum;<BR>also Varvara.<BR>—खर-प्रिय, अस्, m. a pigeon.<BR>—खर-मज्र, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. one whose<BR>strength is very intense.<BR>—खर-मञ्जरि, इस् or ई,<BR>f. the plant Achyranthes Aspera; [cf. अपामार्ग.]<BR>—खर-यान, अम्, n. a donkey-cart, any vehicle<BR>drawn by asses.<BR>—खर-रश्मि, इस्, m. the sun.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">Page0274-b+ 76</a>]<BR>—खर-रोमन् or खर-लोमन्, आ, m., N. of one<BR>of the chiefs of the Nāga or serpent-race inhabiting<BR>hell.<BR>—खर-वल्लिका, f., N. of a plant, commonly<BR>Gorakṣa Chākuliya, Hedysarum Lagopodioides;<BR>[cf. नाग-बला.]<BR>—खर-शब्द, अस्, m. an osprey;<BR>the braying of an ass.<BR>—खर-शाक, अस्, m. the plant<BR>Clerodendrum Siphonanthus, = भार्गी.<BR>—खर-<BR>शाल, अस्, आ, अम्, born or produced in a donkey-stall;<BR>(आ), f. a donkey-stable or stall.<BR>—खर-सोनि, इस्, m.<BR>or खर-सोन्द, अस्, m. or खर-सोल्ल, अस्, m. an<BR>iron vessel.<BR>—खर-स्कन्ध, अस्, m., N. of a tree,<BR>= प्रियाल; (आ), f. Phœnix Sylvestris, = खर्जूरी.<BR>—खर-स्वरा, f. wild jasmine, = वन-मल्-<BR>लिका.<BR>—खरांशु (˚र-अं˚), उस्, m. the sun.<BR>—खरा-गरी, f. a kind of grass, Andropogon<BR>Serratus.<BR>—खराण्डक (˚र-अण्˚), अस्, m., N. of<BR>one of Śiva's attendants.<BR>—खराब्दाङ्कुरक<BR>(˚र-अब्द-अङ्˚), अम्, n. lapis lazuli.<BR>—खराश्वा<BR>(˚र-अश्˚ ?), f. the plant Colosia Cristata, commonly<BR>वनयमानी, = अज-गन्धा, अज-मोदा, करवी.<BR>—खराह्वा (˚र-आह्˚), f., N. of a plant, = अज-<BR>मोदा.<BR>—खरिन्-धम or खरिन्-धय, अस्, आ,<BR>अम् (खरिन् = खरिम् for खरीम्), drinking ass's<BR>milk.<BR>—खरी-जङ्घ, अस्, m., N. of a man; (आस्),<BR>m. pl. the descendants of this man.<BR>—खरी-वृष,<BR>अस्, m. a jackass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खरिका
खरिका, f. powdered musk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खरटखरटाकृ
खरटखरटाकृ खरट-खरटा-कृ, cl. 8. P.<BR>-करोति, -कर्तुम्, to make the sound खरट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खरालिक|खरालिकः
खरालिक खरालिक, अस्, m. a barber (ग्रा-<BR>मणी); a razor-case; an iron arrow (in this sense<BR>also खरालक); a pillow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खरु|खरुः
खरु खरु, उस्, उस् or ऊस्, उ (said to be fr.<BR>rt. खन्), white; foolish, idiotic, a fool; harsh,<BR>cruel; desirous of improper or prohibited things;<BR>(उस्), m. a tooth; a horse; pride; love or Kāma,<BR>the deity of love; an epithet of Śiva; (उस्), f. a girl<BR>who chooses her own husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खरोस्ति
खरोस्ति खरोस्ति, इस्, m. f. (?), N. of a place;<BR>(a various reading has खरोष्टी.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्खोद
खर्खोद खर्खोद, अस् or अम्, m. or n. (?),<BR>a kind of magic.<BR>—खर्खोद-वेदिन्, ई, इनी, इ,<BR>skilled in the Kharkhoda art, a conjurer (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्ज्
खर्ज् खर्ज्, cl. 1. P. खर्जति, चखर्ज,<BR>खर्जितुम्, to creak (like a carriage-<BR>wheel); to worship, to treat with respect or courtesy;<BR>to pain, make uneasy; to cleanse, make clean; [cf.<BR>Hib. cairtim or cartaim, ‘to cleanse.’]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्गला
खर्गला, f., Ved. an owl or any similar night-bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्जिका|खर्ज्जिका
खर्जिका, f. a relish, anything to provoke drink-<BR>ing; [cf. खर्जु and खर्जूर.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्जु|खर्जुः|खर्ज्जुः
खर्जु, उस् or ऊस्, f. scratching, itching, itch,<BR>scab, cutaneous eruption; a worm, a kind of insect;<BR>the wild datura tree.<BR>—खर्जू-घ्न, अस्, m., N. of<BR>several plants, the thorn-apple; Calotropis Gigantea,<BR>Cassia Alata or Tora, = चक्र-मर्द.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्जुर|खर्जुरं|खर्ज्जुर|खर्ज्जुरं
खर्जुर, अम्, n. silver; [cf. खर्जूर.]<BR>—खर्-<BR>जुर-कर्ण, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्जूर|खर्जूरः|खर्ज्जूर|खर्ज्जूरं|खर्ज्जूरः
खर्जूर, अस्, m. the tree Phœnix Sylvestris, the<BR>date tree; a scorpion; N. of a man; (ई), f. the tree<BR>Phœnix Sylvestris; the wild date tree; (अम्), n. the<BR>fruit of the tree Phœnix Sylvestris; silver; yellow<BR>orpiment; (also खल.)<BR>—खर्जूर-रस, अस्, m.<BR>the juice or extract of the wild date or Tāḍi, used<BR>to leaven bread, and as an intoxicating liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्जूरक|खर्जूरकः
खर्जूरक, अस्, m. a scorpion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्द्
खर्द् खर्द्, cl. 1. P. खर्दति, &c., to bite,<BR>to sting, to sting venomously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्पर|खर्परः|खर्प्पर
खर्पर खर्पर, अस्, m. a thief; a rogue, a<BR>cheat; the skull; the half of a skull; a beggar's bowl<BR>or dish; an umbrella or parasol; (ई, अम्), f. n. a kind<BR>of collyrium or application to the eyes. See कर्पर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्परिका
खर्परिका, f. or खर्परीतुत्थ, अम्, n. or<BR>खर्परीरसक, अम्, n. a kind of collyrium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्पराल
खर्पराल खर्पराल, अस्, m., N. of a plant.<BR>See कन्दराल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्ब्
खर्ब् खर्ब्, cl. 1. P. खर्बति, &c., to go,<BR>move; to go towards; [cf. Old Germ.<BR>hwarb, hwarp, hwirbu, &c.; Goth. bi-hvairba,<BR>‘to go round.’]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्म|खर्म्म|खर्म्मः
खर्म खर्म, अम्, n. virility, manliness;<BR>wove silk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्व्
खर्व् खर्व्, cl. 1. P. खर्वति, &c., to be<BR>proud or haughty; [cf. गर्व्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्व|खर्वः|खर्व्व|खर्व्वः
खर्व खर्व or खर्ब, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt.<BR>खर्ब् ?), mutilated, maimed, crippled, injured, im-<BR>perfect; pressed down, low, dwarfish, short, little in<BR>size or stature; (अस्), m., N. of one of the nine<BR>Nidhis or treasures of Kuvera; the plant Trapa<BR>Bispinosa [cf. कुब्जक]; (अस्, अम्), m. n. a large<BR>number, either 10,000,000,000, or 37 cyphers pre-<BR>ceded by 1.<BR>—खर्व-वासिन्, ई, इनी, इ, being or<BR>abiding in any mutilated object.<BR>—खर्व-शाख,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, dwarfish, small, short.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्वक
खर्वक, अस्, इका, अम्, Ved. mutilated, im-<BR>perfect, not full (as the moon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्वट|खर्वटं|खर्वटः|खर्व्वट|खर्व्वटः
खर्वट खर्वट, अस्, अम्, m. n. the capital<BR>of a district of four hundred villages, a market or<BR>country town; a village at the foot of a mountain;<BR>(a various reading for कर्वट.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्वुरा|खर्व्वुरा
खर्वुरा खर्वुरा, f., N. of a plant, = तरदी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्वूज|खर्व्वूजं
खर्वूज खर्वूज, अम्, n. the water-melon<BR>(fr. the Pers. خربوزه kharbūza).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खल्
खल् खल्, cl. 1. P. खलति, चखाल, &c.,<BR>to move, shake; to gather.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खल|खलं|खलः
खल खल, अस्, अम्, m. n. a threshing-floor,<BR>a granary; earth, mould, or soil; place, site; sedi-<BR>ment, dregs, the deposit of oil &c.; a mill; contest,<BR>battle; (अस्, आ), m. f. a wicked or mischievous<BR>person; low, base, inferior, cruel, mischief-making;<BR>(अस्), m. the sun; the plant Xanthochymus Pictorius,<BR>see तमाल; the datura plant, thorn-apple; (आ), f.<BR>N. of a daughter of Raudrāśva.<BR>—खल-कुल, अस्,<BR>m. = कुलत्थ, Dolichos Uniflorus.<BR>—खल-ज, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, Ved. produced on a threshing-floor.<BR>—खल-<BR>ता, f. or खल-त्व, अम्, n. wickedness, villainy; filthi-<BR>ness.<BR>—खल-धान्य, अम्, n. a threshing-floor;<BR>(also खलधान, खलेधान्य, खलाधान.)<BR>—खल-पू, ऊस्, ऊस्, m. f. a sweeper, a cleaner, a<BR>Mehter or Ferash (originally ‘one who cleans a<BR>threshing-floor’).<BR>—खल-प्रीति, इस्, f. the friend-<BR>ship or favour of wicked or low persons.<BR>—खल-<BR>मूर्ति, इस्, m. quicksilver.<BR>—खल-संसर्ग, अस्,<BR>m. associating with bad company.<BR>—खलाधारा<BR>(˚ल-आध्˚), f. a kind of cockroach.<BR>—खले-धानी<BR>or खले-बाली, f. the post of a threshing-floor round<BR>which the oxen pass which tread out the grain.<BR>—खले-बुसम्, ind. at the time when the chaff<BR>is on the threshing-floor, at the threshing-time.<BR>—खले-यवम्, ind. at the time when barley is<BR>on the threshing-floor, at the barley threshing-time.<BR>—खले-वाली, f. the post of a threshing-floor; [cf.<BR>खले-धानी.]<BR>—खलोक्ति (˚ल-उक्˚), इस्, f. abuse,<BR>low or wicked language.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलि|खलिः
खलि, इस्, m. sediment of oil or oil-cake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलिन्
खलिन्, ई, इनी, इ, having sediment &c.; (ई), m. an<BR>epithet of Śiva; (इनस्), m. pl., N. of a class of Dāna-<BR>vas; (इनी), f. a multitude of threshing-floors; the plant<BR>Anthericum Tuberosum, = ताल-पर्णी, = ताल-मूली.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलिन|खलिनं|खलिनः
खलिन, अस्, आ, अम्, covered with sediment,<BR>covered with oil-dregs (?); (अस्, अम्), m. n. the bit<BR>of a bridle; see खलीन; [cf. Gr. χαλινός.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलीकृ
खली-कृ, cl. 8. P. A. -करोति, -कुरुते, -कर्तुम्,<BR>to reduce to sediment, to crush; to hurt, injure; to<BR>treat badly, scorn.<BR>—खली-कार, अस्, m. or खली-<BR>कृति, इस्, f. reducing to sediment; hurting, injuring;<BR>mischief, evil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलीन|खलीनं|खलीनः
खलीन, अस्, अम्, m. n. the bit of a bridle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खल्य
खल्य, अस्, आ, अम्, being on a threshing-floor, fit<BR>for one; fit for oil-cake &c.; (आ), f. a multitude of<BR>threshing-floors; N. of a woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खल्यका
खल्यका, f., N. of a woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0274-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलति|खलतिः
