खात्
खात् खात्, ind. (an onomatopoetic word),<BR>the sound made in clearing the throat; [cf. खाट्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0275-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

