खात्मन्
खात्मन् खात्मन्. See under 3. ख.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0275-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खाद्
खाद् खाद्, cl. 1. P. (ep. also A.) खादति,<BR>चखाद, खादिष्यति, अखादीत्, खा-<BR>दितुम्, to chew, bite, eat, devour, feed, prey upon;<BR>to hurt: Caus. खादयति, -यितुम्, to cause or make<BR>to eat or devour; to eat: Desid. चिखादिषति:<BR>Intens. चाखाद्यते, चाखात्ति; [cf. Scot. cuid,<BR>‘food;’ Hib. caithim, ‘to eat.’]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0275-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खाद|खादः
खाद, अस्, आ, अम्, eating, devouring, (at the end<BR>of compounds, e. g. अमित्र-खाद, वृत्र-खाद,<BR>q. v.); (अस्), m. chewing, eating; food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0275-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खादक|खादकः
खादक, अस्, इका, अम्, eating, consuming, de-<BR>vouring; an eater; a debtor; a borrower, one who<BR>borrows or uses; [cf. खातक.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0275-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खादतमोदता
खादत-मोदता, f. (fr. the two impv. खादत<BR>and मोदत), continual eating and being glad.<BR>—खादत-वामता, f. (fr. the two impv. खादत<BR>and वामत), continual eating and vomiting.<BR>—खा-<BR>दता-चमता or खादता-चामता, f. continual eat-<BR>ing and washing the mouth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0275-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खादन|खादनं|खादनः
