खादनीय
खादनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, eatable, edible, to be eaten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0275-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खादित|खादितं
