खादुक|खादुकः
खादुक, अस्, ई, अम्, mischievous, injurious, ma-<BR>lignant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0275-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खाद्य|खाद्यं
