खार|खारः
खार खार, अस्, or खारि, इस्, ई, m. f. a<BR>Khāri, a measure of grain = 16 Droṇas or about<BR>3 bushels; it is also reckoned at 1(1/2) Sūrpa or<BR>3 Droṇas; also at 46 Gauṇīs or 4096 Palas, or at<BR>4 Droṇas; (ई), f. a scar.<BR>—खारिम्-पच, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>cooking a Khāri by measure; (a vessel &c.) in<BR>which a Khāri may be cooked.<BR>—खारी-वाप, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, sown with a Khārī of grain (as a field &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0275-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खारिक|खारिकं
