खिट्
खिट् खिट्, cl. 1. P. खेटति, &c., to be<BR>terrified or frightened, to fear, dread; to<BR>terrify, scare, startle, alarm, surprise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0276-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

