खिद्
खिद् खिद्, cl. 6. P. खिन्दति (Ved. खि-<BR>दति), चिखेद, अखैत्सीत्, खेत्स्यति,<BR>खेत्तुम्, to strike, press, press down; cl. 7. or 4. A.<BR>खिन्त्ते or खिन्ते and खिद्यते, to be pressed down<BR>or depressed, to suffer pain or misery, to be distressed,<BR>to be wearied, to feel tired or exhausted: Caus. खे-<BR>दयति, -यितुम्, to press down, molest, disturb, make<BR>tired or exhausted: Desid. चिखित्सति, -ते: Intens. चे-<BR>खिद्यते, चेखेत्ति; [cf. Lith. zeidziu; Gr. κῆδος?].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0276-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खिदिर|खिदिरः
