खिद्वन्
खिद्वन्, आ, अरी, अ, Ved. pressing upon, oppressing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0276-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खिन्न|खिन्नः
