खेदन|खेदनं
खेदन, अम्, n. lassitude, exhaustion, pain, sor-<BR>row, affliction, poverty, distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0276-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेदयितव्य
खेदयितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be depressed, to be<BR>made distressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0276-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेदित
