खिल|खिलं|खिलः
खिल खिल, अस्, अम्, m. n. a piece of waste<BR>or uncultivated land situated between cultivated fields,<BR>a desert, bare soil, a vacant space, a space not filled<BR>up, a gap, that which serves to fill up a gap, a sup-<BR>plement (of a book &c.), an additional hymn appended<BR>to the regular collection; a compendium, a compi-<BR>lation (especially of hymns and prayers); remainder;<BR>emptiness, vacuity, vanity, anything vain, empty or<BR>fruitless; (अस्), m., N. of Brahmā, and of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0276-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

