खुर|खुरः
खुर खुर, अस्, m. (said to be fr. the last),<BR>a hoof, a horse's hoof, &c.; a sort of perfume, com-<BR>monly called Nakhi, apparently a dried shell-fish<BR>shaped like a hoof [cf. कोलदल]; a razor; the foot<BR>of a bedstead [cf. क्षुर].<BR>—खुर-क्षेप, अस्,<BR>m. a kick with a hoof, kicking.<BR>—खुर-णस्, आस्,<BR>आस्, अस्, or खुर-णस, अस्, आ, अम्, having a nose<BR>like a horse's hoof, flat-nosed.<BR>—खुर-पदवी, f.<BR>a horse's foot-marks.<BR>—खुराघात (˚र-आघ्˚) or<BR>खुराभिघात (˚र-अभ्˚), अस्, m. a kick, kicking<BR>(as of a horse).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0276-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

