गु
गु 1. गु (related to 1. गा), cl. 1. A. ग-<BR>वते, to go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गु
2. गु, (at the end of compounds) going; [cf. अध्रि-<BR>गु, वनर्-गु; also प्रियङ्-गु and शाचि-गु (?);<BR>cf. गू in अग्रे-गू.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गु
गु 3. गु, cl. 1. A., Ved. गवते, जुगुवे,<BR>गोष्यते, अगोष्ट, गोतुम्, (this verb seems<BR>only to occur in the reduplicated forms जोगुवे and<BR>जोगुवान), to speak articulately, to proclaim, to<BR>cause to sound: Caus. गावयति: Desid. जुगूषते:<BR>Intens. जोगूयते, जोगोति, to shout with joy; [cf.<BR>जोगू.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गु
