गुङ्गु
गुङ्गु गुङ्गु, उस्, m., N. of a man; (अवस्),<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0290-c" target="_blank">Page0290-c+ 76</a>]<BR>m. pl. the descendants of this man; (ऊ, ऊस्), f., Ved.<BR>(Sāy.) = कुहू, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0290-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुच्छ|गुच्छः|गुछ
गुच्छ गुच्छ, अस्, m. (assimilated form fr.<BR>गुत्स), a bundle, a bunch, a bunch of flowers, a<BR>cluster of blossoms, a clump (of grass &c.), a bunch<BR>of peacock's feathers, the plumage of a peacock; a<BR>pearl necklace of thirty-two or (according to others)<BR>of seventy strings [cf. अर्ध-गुच्छ]; (ई), f. a<BR>kind of Bonduc or Karañja.<BR>—गुच्छ-कणिश, अस्,<BR>m. a kind of corn, = रागिन्.<BR>—गुच्छ-करञ्ज, अस्,<BR>m. a kind of Karañja; [cf. गुच्छी.]<BR>—गुच्छ-<BR>दन्तिका, f. the plant Musa Sapientum, = कदली.<BR>—गुच्छ-पत्त्र, अस्, m. the palm tree; [cf. ताल.]<BR>—गुच्छ-पुष्प, अस्, m., N. of a plant, = सप्त-<BR>च्छद; (ई), f., N. of two plants, Grislea Tomentosa<BR>(धातकी), and another plant = शिमृडी.<BR>—गुच्छ-<BR>पुष्पक, अस्, m. two kinds of Karañja, the Rīṭhā-<BR>karañja and the Guccha-karañja.<BR>—गुच्छ-फल,<BR>अस्, m., N. of several plants, = रीठा-करञ्ज; an-<BR>other plant, Strychnos Potatorum [cf. कतक];<BR>another plant, = राजादनी; (आ), f., N. of several<BR>plants, Musa Sapientum, = कदली or the plantain;<BR>the vine; the plant Solanum Indicum (काक-माची);<BR>the plant Solanum Jacquini (अग्नि-दमनी); a kind<BR>of leguminous plant, = निष्पावी.<BR>—गुच्छ-बध्रा,<BR>f., N. of a plant, Guṇḍālā.<BR>—गुच्छ-मूलिका, f. N.<BR>of a plant, = गुण्डासिनी.<BR>—गुच्छार्ध (˚छ-अर्˚),<BR>अस्, m. a pearl necklace of twenty-four strings; a<BR>species of grass, Andropogon Schœnanthus.<BR>—गुच्छा-<BR>ह्व-कन्द (˚छ-आह्˚), अस्, m. a kind of esculent<BR>root, = गुलञ्च-कन्द.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0290-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुच्छक|गुच्छकं|गुच्छकः
गुच्छक, अस्, m. a bunch, bundle, cluster of<BR>blossoms, clump of grass, the plumage of a peacock,<BR>a bunch of peacock's feathers; a pearl necklace of<BR>thirty-two strings; a kind of Karañja, = रीठा-<BR>करञ्ज; (अम्), n. a kind of fragrant plant, =<BR>ग्रन्थि-पर्ण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0290-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुच्छाल|गुच्छालः
