गुटिका
गुटिका गुटिका, f. a pill, a bolus, any small<BR>globe or ball; a small pustule; the cocoon of the<BR>silk-worm; a pill; a pearl; [cf. गुडिका, गुलिका,<BR>गुली, गुड.]<BR>—गुटिकाञ्जन (˚का-अञ्˚), अम्, n.<BR>collyrium formed like a globe or ball.<BR>—गुटिका-<BR>मुख, अस्, ई, अम्, furnished with a rounded orifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0290-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुड्
