गुत्स|गुत्सः
गुत्स गुत्स, अस्, m. (said to be fr. गुध्), a<BR>bunch, a bundle, a cluster of blossoms, a nosegay; a<BR>clump of grass; a pearl necklace consisting of thirty-<BR>two strings; a plant or perfume, commonly Gan-<BR>thiāla, = ग्रन्थि-पर्ण; [cf. गुच्छ.]<BR>—गुत्सार्-<BR>ध (˚स-अर्˚), अस्, m. a necklace or garland of<BR>twenty-four strings; [cf. गुच्छार्ध.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0292-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुत्सक|गुत्सकः
