गोण्ड|गोंड|गोंडः|गोण्डः
गोण्ड गोण्ड, अस्, m. a fleshy navel; a per-<BR>son with a fleshy or prominent navel; a man of a<BR>low tribe, a mountaineer, especially inhabiting the<BR>eastern portion of the Vindhya range between the<BR>Narbadā and Kistna, giving name to the province<BR>of Gondvana.<BR>—गोण्ड-वन, अम्, n. the Goṇḍa<BR>forest, N. of a country; (also गोण्डवार.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0299-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोण्डकिरी
