गोदान
2. गोदान, अम्, n. the part of the head close to the<BR>right ear: (for 1. गो-दान see under गो.)<BR>—गोदान-<BR>विधि, इस्, m. or गोदान-मङ्गल, अम्, n. a ceremony<BR>performed by anointing that part of the head of a<BR>youth of sixteen or eighteen years, when he has attained<BR>the age of puberty, and shortly before marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

