गोधा
गोधा गो-धा, f. (fr. गो and rt. धा), a<BR>sinew; a chord; a leathern fence wound round the<BR>left arm to prevent injury from the bow-string; an<BR>Iguana, either the Gosamp or the alligator, commonly<BR>Gosapa.<BR>—गोधा-पदिका or गोधा-पदी, f. the<BR>plant Cissus Pedata.<BR>—गोधा-वीणाका, f. a kind of<BR>stringed instrument.<BR>—गोधा-स्कन्ध, अस्, m. a<BR>kind of Mimosa; [cf. वित्-खदिर.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोधाय
