गोधि|गोधिः
गोधि, इस्, m. the forehead; the Gangetic alligator;<BR>an Iguana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

