गोनाडीक
गोनाडीक गोनाडीक, अस्, m. a kind of plant;<BR>(other authorities have गोनाडीच.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोप|गोपः
गोप गो-प, अस्, m. (fr. गो and rt. पा), a<BR>cowherd, a herdsman, a milkman, considered as a<BR>man of mixed caste; the chief of a cow-pen or<BR>station; a protector, a guardian, a preserver, a<BR>cherisher, a helper, a friend or patron; the super-<BR>intendent of several villages, the head of a district;<BR>a king; the chief herdsman, i. e. Kṛṣṇa; N. of a<BR>Gandharva [cf. गो-पति]; N. of a Buddhist Arhat;<BR>N. of a mountain; myrrh, = गोप-रस; (आ), f.<BR>= गोपी, the plant Ichnocarpus Frutescens; N. of one<BR>of the wives of Śākya-muni; (ई), f. the wife of a<BR>cowherd, see below; [cf. गो-पा, अहि-गोप, इन्द्र-ग्˚,<BR>कुल-ग्˚, त्रिदश-ग्˚, सुरेन्द्र-ग्˚.]<BR>—गोप-कन्या,<BR>f. the daughter of a cowherd; a nymph of Vṛndā-<BR>vana; the plant Ichnocarpus Frutescens.<BR>—गोप-कर्-<BR>कटिका, f. = गोपाल-कर्कती.<BR>—गोप-घोण्टा, f., N.<BR>of a plant, = हस्तिकोलि, commonly शेयाकुल, a wild<BR>sort of jujube, Zizyphus Nepeca or Zizyphus Œnoplia.<BR>—गोप-जीविन्, ई, m., N. of a mixed caste.<BR>—गोप-<BR>ता, f. the office of a herdsman.<BR>—गोप-दत्त, अस्,<BR>m., N. of a Buddhist author.<BR>—गोप-दल, अस्, m.<BR>the betel-nut or areca tree.<BR>—गोप-बधू or गोप-<BR>वधू, ऊस्, f. a cowherd's wife; the plant Ichnocarpus<BR>Frutescens (शारिवा); [cf. गोप-कन्या.]<BR>—गोप-<BR>बधूटी, f. the youthful wife of a cowherd.<BR>—गोप-<BR>भद्र, अम्, n. the fibrous root of a water-lily<BR>(शालूक); (आ), f. the plant Gmelina Arborea, [cf.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-b" target="_blank">Page0300-b+ 74</a>]<BR>काश्मरी]; also गोप-भद्रिका.<BR>—गोप-रस, अस्,<BR>m. gum myrrh, myrrh; [cf. गो-प and रस.]<BR>—गोप-<BR>राष्ट्र, आस्, m. pl., N. of a people.<BR>—गो-परीणस्,<BR>आस्, आस्, अस्, Ved. abundantly furnished with cattle or<BR>milk.<BR>—गोप-वन, अस्, m., N. of a Ṛṣi of the<BR>family of Atri.<BR>—गोप-वल्ली, f. the plant Ichnocarpus<BR>Frutescens (अनन्ता); Sanseviera Zeylanica (मूर्वा).<BR>—गोप-वेश or गोप-वेष, अस्, आ, अम्, dressed<BR>as a herdsman.<BR>—गोपाटविक, अस्, m. a cowherd<BR>(fr. गोप, a herd, and आटविक, a forester?).<BR>—गो-<BR>पादित्य (˚प-आद्˚), अस्, m., N. of a king of Kaś-<BR>mīra; N. of a poet.<BR>—गोपाध्यक्ष (˚प-अध्˚),<BR>अस्, m. an overseer of herdsmen, the chief of herds-<BR>men.<BR>—गोपानसी (˚प-अन्˚), f. the wood of a<BR>thatch, a curved beam which supports it; the bam-<BR>boo frame-work on which it rests.<BR>—गोपेन्द्र (˚प-<BR>इन्˚), अस्, m. the chief of the herdsmen, an epithet<BR>of Kṛṣṇa or Viṣṇu.<BR>—गोपेश (˚प-ईश), अस्, m.<BR>a chief herdsman, the keeper or owner of kine; an<BR>epithet of Kṛṣṇa; also of Nanda, the foster-father<BR>of Kṛṣṇa; also of Śākya-muni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपक|गोपकः
गोपक, अस्, आ, अम्, one who guards or protects;<BR>(अस्), m. the superintendent of a district; myrrh;<BR>(इका), f. the wife of a cowherd, a cowherdess; a<BR>protectress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपा
गो-पा, आस्, m., Ved. a herdsman, a protector, a<BR>guardian; [cf. गो-प, देव-गोपा, वात-ग्˚, वायु-ग्˚,<BR>सह-ग्˚, सु-ग्˚, सोम-ग्˚.]<BR>—गोपा-जिह्व, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>Ved. one who has the tongue, i. e. the voice of a<BR>cowherd; (Sāy.) an epithet of Indra.<BR>—गोपा-वत्,<BR>आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. granting protection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपी
गोपी, f. a cowherd's wife (especially applied to<BR>the cowherdesses of Vṛndā-vana, the companions of<BR>Kṛṣṇa's juvenile sports, who are considered some-<BR>times as holy or celestial personages); a milkmaid;<BR>a protectress; nature, elementary nature; the plant<BR>Ichnocarpus Frutescens.<BR>—गोपी-चन्दन, अम्, n. a<BR>species of white clay said to be brought from<BR>Dvārakā and used by Viṣṇu's worshippers for<BR>smearing their face.<BR>—गोपी-चन्दनोपनिषद् (˚न-<BR>उप्˚), त्, f. title of an Upaniṣad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपन|गोपनं
गोपन गोपन, &c. See under rt. गुप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपालव
गोपालव गोपालव, आस्, m. pl., N. of a<BR>warrior-tribe; (for गोपालक?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपुटा
गोपुटा गोपुटा, f. large cardamoms; [cf.<BR>पुटिका.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोभिल
गोभिल गोभिल, अस्, m., N. of an author<BR>of certain Gṛhya-sūtras and of grammatical Sūtras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोभिलीय
गोभिलीय, अस्, आ, अम्, relating to or proceeding<BR>from Gobhila.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोमायु|गोमायुः
गोमायु गो-मायु. See under गो, p. 298.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोयीचन्द्र
गोयीचन्द्र गोयीचन्द्र, अस्, m., N. of a<BR>scholiast of the Saṅkṣipta-sāra; (for गोपी-चन्द्र?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोरट|गोरटः
गोरट गोरट, अस्, m. a kind of Acacia; [cf.<BR>दुष्खदिर.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोरण|गोरणं
गोरण गोरण, अम्, n. effort, exertion, =<BR>गुरण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोर्द|गोर्दः|गोर्द्द|गोर्द्दं
गोर्द गोर्द or गोर्ध, अम्, n. the brain;<BR>[cf. गोद and गोधि.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोल|गोलं|गोलः
गोल गोल, अस्, आ, अम्, m. f. n. (connected<BR>with गुड, q. v.), a ball, a celestial or terrestrial<BR>globe; a circle, anything round or globular, a sphere,<BR>= मण्डल [cf. गुड]; (अस्), m. the tree Vangueria<BR>Spinosa; myrrh; a widow's bastard [cf. कुण्ड];<BR>the conjunction of all the planets or the presence of<BR>several in one sign; N. of a son of Ākrīḍa; (आ), f.<BR>a wooden ball with which children play; a large<BR>globular water-jar; red arsenic; ink; a woman's<BR>female friend; a N. of the goddess Durgā; N. of a<BR>river, = गोला or गो-दावरी; [cf. गलगोलिन्.]<BR>—गोल-<BR>ग्राम, अस्, m., N. of a village situated on the<BR>Godāvarī; (the right reading may be गोला-ग्राम.)<BR>—गोल-यन्त्र, अम्, n. a kind of astronomical in-<BR>strument.<BR>—गोलाङ्क (गोल-अङ्˚), अस्, m., N. of a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">Page0300-c+ 66</a>]<BR>man.<BR>—गोलाध्याय (˚ल-अध्˚), अस्, m. title of a<BR>chapter of Bhāskara's Siddhānta-Śiromaṇi treating of<BR>the terrestrial and celestial globes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोलक|गोलकं|गोलकः
गोलक, अस्, m. a ball or globe; a wooden ball<BR>for playing with, anything globular, a sphere &c.; a<BR>species of pease; gum myrrh; a globular water-jar;<BR>a widow's bastard; the conjunction of all the planets<BR>or the presence of several in one sign; N. of a pupil<BR>of Veda-mitra; (अम्), n. = गो-लोक, the heaven of<BR>Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोलन्द
गोलन्द गोलन्द, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोलास|गोलासः
गोलास गोलास, अस्, m. a mushroom, a kind<BR>of fungus springing from cow-dung; [cf. गोमय-<BR>च्छत्त्रिका.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोव
गोव गोव, अस् or अम्, m. or n. (?), N. of a<BR>country; (also read कुव.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोवय
गोवय गोवय, nom. P. (a corruption fr.<BR>गोपय), गोवयति, -यितुम्, to keep back, to pre-<BR>vent from approaching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोवाल
गोवाल गोवाल, अस्, m., N. of a man; (per-<BR>haps a corruption fr. गो-पाल); [cf. also गोबाल.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोविचन्द्र
गोविचन्द्र गोविचन्द्र, अस्, m., N. of a<BR>prince; (the names of the other princes of the same<BR>dynasty ending in चन्द्र, this word may be a comp.<BR>fr. गोवि and चन्द्र, गोवि being probably contracted<BR>fr. गो and अवि.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोविन्द|गोविंद|गोविन्दः
गोविन्द गो-विन्द. See under गो, p. 299.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोशर्य|गोशर्य्य
गोशर्य गोशर्य, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोशे
गोशे गोशे, ind. a word belonging to one<BR>of the provincial dialects, according to some also a<BR>Sanskrit word; perhaps = गोसे (loc. of गोस), at<BR>day-break.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोषक
गोषक गोषक, अस्, m., N. of a Buddhist<BR>author.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोष्ट्
गोष्ट् गोष्ट्, cl. 1. A. गोष्टते, to assem-<BR>ble, to collect, to heap together; (pro-<BR>bably a nom. fr. गोष्ठ and more correctly spelt<BR>गोष्ठ्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोष्ठ|गोष्ठं|गोष्ठः
गोष्ठ गो-ष्ठ. See under गो, p. 299.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोस|गोसः
गोस गोस, अस्, m. gum myrrh, myrrh,<BR>= गोप-रस; the last watch of the night, early<BR>morning or day-break, = गो-सर्ग; [cf. गोशे.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोसगृह
गोसगृह गोस-गृह, अम्, n. (?) the inner<BR>part of a house, an inner or sleeping-room, a bed-<BR>chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोसशश|गोसशशः
गोसशश गोसशश, अस्, m. myrrh, = गोप-<BR>रस; [cf. also गोस and शश.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोसिल
गोसिल गोसिल, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोस्वलु
गोस्वलु गोस्वलु, उस्, m., N. of a pupil of<BR>Śākalya; [cf. गुहलु and गोसिल.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोह|गोहः
गोह गोह, अस्, m. (fr. rt. गुह्), Ved. a<BR>hiding-place, a lair; a secret place for hiding refuse<BR>or filth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोहन|गोहनं
गोहन, अस्, आ, अम्, covering, hiding; [cf. अव-<BR>द्य-गोहन.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0300-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोहिर|गोहिरं
