चेय
चेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be piled up, to be gathered<BR>or collected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0322-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चि
चि 2. चि, cl. 3. P., Ved. चिकेति, Impf.<BR>अचिकेत्, Impv. 2nd sing. चिकीहि, चिकाय; cl.<BR>5. P. A. चिनोति, चिनुते &c. like 1. चि, to observe, per-<BR>ceive; to fix the gaze upon; to be intent upon; to seek<BR>for, investigate; to make inquiries, search through.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0322-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

