चिकित, अस्, m., N. of a man; [cf. चेकित.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0323-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

