चित|चितः
चित चित. See p. 322, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्कनकन्थ
चित्कनकन्थ चित्कन-कन्थ, अम्, n., N. of<BR>a town; [cf. चिक्कण-कन्थ.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्त|चित्तं
चित्त चित्त. See p. 323, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्ति|चित्तिः
चित्ति 2. चित्ति, इस्, f., Ved. (according to<BR>some commentaries) crackling, whizzing; (according<BR>to others) a sacrificial act; [cf. चित्-कार.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्य|चित्यं|चित्यः
चित्य चित्य. See p. 322, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्र|चित्रं|चित्रः
चित्र चित्र. See p. 323, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिद्
चिद् चिद्, ind. [cf. 2. च and इद्], an enclitic<BR>particle, requiring in the Veda a preceding simple<BR>verb to retain its accent. In the Pada-pāṭha चिद् is<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-c" target="_blank">Page0325-c+ 79</a>]<BR>considered as an independent word (कश् चिद् &c.<BR>being always separated into two words). In later<BR>Sanskrit it is generally a particle affixed to interroga-<BR>tive pronouns to render them indefinite. The use<BR>of चिद् in Vedic Sanskrit is principally to lay stress or<BR>emphasis on a preceding word or to extend or limit<BR>the sense. Hence it is often translateable by ‘even,’<BR>‘indeed,’ ‘also,’ ‘at least,’ ‘just,’ ‘merely,’ &c. (e. g.<BR>देवाश् चिद्, the gods indeed; एकस्य चिद्, of one<BR>merely); or when preceded by a negative particle by<BR>‘not even’ (e. g. न देवाश् चिद्, not even the gods):<BR>but its force may often be expressed by merely laying<BR>an emphasis on the word by which it is preceded.<BR>Hence in Nirukta I. 4. it is said to be used पूजायाम्,<BR>i. e. for enhancing the force of a word. It is also<BR>stated by Yāska to be a particle of comparison<BR>(उपमार्थे). The following Vedic uses of चिद्<BR>may be noted; यच् चिद्, यथा चिद्, = when indeed,<BR>as indeed; चिद् — चिद् or चिद् — च or चिद् — उ, = as well<BR>as — as; both — and.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिद्
चिद् is often joined to interrogative pronouns and<BR>adverbs (see 2. क, कतम, कतर, कद्, किम्,<BR>कथम्, कदा, कुतस्, क्व, &c.) to render them<BR>indefinite; especially in classical Sanskrit, where the<BR>only other word after which it is found is जातु, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिदम्बर
चिदम्बर चिद्-अम्बर. See 5. चित्, p. 323.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्त्|चिंत्
चिन्त् चिन्त्, cl. 10. P. चिन्तयति, -यितुम्,<BR>(according to some also cl. 1. P. चिन्तति,<BR>&c.), to think, have a thought or idea, reflect, con-<BR>sider; to think about, reflect upon, direct the<BR>thoughts towards any person or thing (with acc.<BR>or dat. or loc., or प्रति with acc., e. g. अन्योन्यं<BR>चिन्तयतस्, they think of one another; सुतेभ्यस्<BR>or सुतेषु or सुतान् प्रति चिन्तयन्, thinking<BR>about one's sons); to mind, take notice of, regard,<BR>turn the attention to; to find out, investigate; to<BR>take into consideration, treat of, speak of; to have<BR>an opinion about, consider as, esteem; [cf. Goth.<BR>thagkja, ‘to think;’ Lat. censeo?].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्त
चिन्त, अस्, m. (?) thought; [cf. चिन्ता.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तक|चिंतक
चिन्तक, अस्, आ, अम्, thinking of, reflecting on,<BR>considering, studying, conversant, familiar with;<BR>(used at the end of compounds, e. g. दैव-चिन्तक,<BR>an astrologer; वंश-चिन्तक, a genealogist &c.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तन|चिंतन|चिंतनं
चिन्तन, अम्, n. thinking, thinking of, reflecting<BR>upon, anxious thought; (पूर्व-चिन्तन, the former<BR>manner of thinking.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तनीय
चिन्तनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be thought of or con-<BR>sidered; to be meditated on; to be attended to; to<BR>be investigated or comprehended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तयत्
चिन्तयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, reflecting, considering, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तयान
चिन्तयान, अस्, आ, अम्, reflecting, considering,<BR>meditating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तयितव्य
चिन्तयितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be considered, to be<BR>reflected on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तयित्वा
चिन्तयित्वा, ind. having thought or considered;<BR>having mused or reflected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्ता|चिंता
चिन्ता, f. thought, especially sad or sorrowful<BR>thought, care, anxiety; reflecting on, reflection, con-<BR>sideration, attention; recollection; N. of a woman.<BR>—चिन्ता-कर्मन्, अ, n. anxiety, troubled thoughts.<BR>—चिन्ता-कारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, considering, regarding.<BR>—चिन्ताकुल (˚ता-आक्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, disturbed in thought,<BR>distracted by any idea.<BR>—चिन्ता-पर, अस्, आ, अम्, lost<BR>in thought, thoughtful, anxious.<BR>—चिन्ता-मणि, इस्,<BR>m. a fabulous gem, supposed to yield its possessor all<BR>desires; the philosopher's stone; a common title of<BR>various text-books, treatises, and commentaries (e. g.<BR>अभिधान-चिन्तामणि, उपमान-च्˚, कृत्य-च्˚,<BR>जन्म-च्˚, मुहूर्त-च्˚); N. of Brahmā; N. of a<BR>Buddha; of an author.<BR>—चिन्तामणि-सारणिका or<BR>तिथि-सारणिका, f. title of a work on astrology by Daśa-<BR>bala.<BR>—चिन्ता-मय, अस्, ई, अम्, consisting of thought<BR>or intelligence, produced by thoughts.<BR>—चिन्ता-वत्,<BR>आन्, अती, अत्, thinking, thoughtful.<BR>—चिन्ता-वेश्मन्,<BR>अ, n. a council-house, council-room.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तित|चिंतित|चिन्तितं
चिन्तित, अस्, आ, अम्, thought, considered; reflect-<BR>ing, considering; (आ), f., N. of a woman; (अम्), n.<BR>thought, reflection, care, intention.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तिति|चिंतिति|चिंतितिः|चिन्तितिः
चिन्तिति, इस्, f. or चिन्तिया, f. thinking, consideration,<BR>reflection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्त्य|चिंत्य
चिन्त्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be considered or reflected;<BR>to be thought of or meditated upon; to be appre-<BR>hended or conceived; to be deliberated about; un-<BR>certain, questionable; (अम्), n. the necessity of<BR>thinking about anything.<BR>—चिन्त्य-द्योत, आस्, m.<BR>pl. a class of deities (whose brightness is only to be<BR>apprehended by the imagination).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्ति
चिन्ति चिन्ति, इस्, m., N. of a man (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तिडी|चिंतिडी
चिन्तिडी चिन्तिडी, f. the tamarind tree; (a<BR>wrong form for तिन्तिडी.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्तोक्ति
चिन्तोक्ति चिन्तोक्ति, इस्, f. midnight cry or<BR>alarm; (a wrong form for चित्रोक्ति.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्न|चिन्नः
चिन्न चिन्न, अस्, m. a kind of grain, Pani-<BR>cum Miliaceum; [cf. चीन.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्मय
चिन्मय चिन्मय. See 5. चित्, p. 323.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिन्वत्
चिन्वत् चिन्वत्. See p. 322, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिपट|चिपटः
चिपट चिपट, अस्, आ, अम्, flat-nosed; (अस्),<BR>m. rice or grain flattened; [cf. चिपिट and चिपुट.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिपिट|चिपिटः
चिपिट, अस्, आ, अम्, blunted, flattened, pressed flat,<BR>flat, flat-nosed; (अस्), m. a kind of poisonous insect;<BR>rice or grain flattened; (आ), f. a kind of grass; [cf.<BR>गुण्डासिनी.]<BR>—चिपिट-ग्रीव, अस्, आ, अम्, short-necked.<BR>—चिपिट-नास or चिपिट-नासिक, अस्, आ, अम्, flat-<BR>nosed; (आस्), m. pl., N. of a people in the north<BR>of Madhya-deśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिपिटक|चिपिटकः
चिपिटक, अस्, m. flattened rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिपिटिकावत्|चिपिटिकावन्त्
चिपिटिका-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having the appearance<BR>of flattened grains of rice (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिपुट|चिपुटः
चिपुट, अस्, m. flattened rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिप्प|चिप्पः
चिप्प चिप्प, अम्, n. a kind of disease of<BR>the finger-nail; [cf. चिप्य.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिप्पटजयापीड|चिप्पटजयापीडः
चिप्पटजयापीड चिप्पट-जयापीड, अस्, m.,<BR>N. of a king of Kaśmīra, (चिप्पट = चिपिट ?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिप्पिका
चिप्पिका चिप्पिका, f. a kind of bird (?);<BR>(a various reading for छिप्पिका.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिप्य
चिप्य चिप्य, अस्, m. a kind of worm [cf. कि-<BR>प्य]; (अम्), n. a disease of the finger-nail, whitlow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिबुक|चिबुकं
