चिमि|चिमिः
चिमि चिमि, इस्, m. a parrot [cf. चिरि]; a<BR>kind of plant, from the fibres of which coarse cloth<BR>and ropes are made, = पट्ट-वृक्ष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिमिक|चिमिकः
चिमिक, अस्, m. a parrot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिर|चिरं
चिर चिर, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. 1. चि, or perhaps<BR>rather fr. rt. चर्), long, lasting a long time, existing<BR>from ancient times, old; चिरं कालम्, during a<BR>long time; चिरात् कालात्, after a long time; (अम्),<BR>n. a long time, delay, putting off for too long a<BR>time (e. g. गमन-चिरम्, delay in going; किं<BR>चिरेण, wherefore delay ? कियच्-चिरेण, for how<BR>long a time ? अ-चिरात् or अ-चिरतस्, after no long time,<BR>soon, shortly; cf. अ-चिर). Any of the oblique cases<BR>sing. of चिर may be used adverbially, e. g. चिरम्<BR>or चिरेण or चिराय or चिरात् or चिरस्य or चिरे, =<BR>long, for a long time, after a long time, a long while<BR>ago, long since; at last, finally, too late. चिर is<BR>also used adverbially at the beginning of comp. as in<BR>some of the following examples; [cf. Hib. sir, ‘long.’]<BR>—चिर-कार, अस्, आ, अम्, or चिर-कारि, इस्, इस्, इ, or<BR>चिर-कारिक, अस्, आ, अम्, or चिर-कारिन्, ई, इणी, इ,<BR>working or acting slowly, dilatory, delaying.<BR>—चिर-<BR>कारि-ता, f. or चिरकारि-त्व, अम्, n. dilatoriness,<BR>slowness.<BR>—चिर-काल, अस्, m. a long period; चिर-<BR>कालम् or -लाय, for a long time.<BR>—चिरकाल-पालित,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, protected for a long time.<BR>—चिरकालिक or<BR>चिरकालीन, अस्, आ, अम्, of long standing, old, long-<BR>continued, chronic.<BR>—चिरकालोपार्जित (˚ल-उप्˚), अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, accumulated slowly or after a long time.<BR>—चिर-<BR>कीर्त्ति, इस्, m., N. of the founder of a religious sect.<BR>—चिर-क्रिय, अस्, आ, अम्, dilatory, slow, tedious.<BR>—चिर-गत, अस्, आ, अम्, long absent, long gone,<BR>gone a long while ago.<BR>—चिर-चेष्टित, अस्, आ,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-b" target="_blank">Page0326-b+ 77</a>]<BR>अम्, long sought for, of rare occurrence.<BR>—चिर-जात,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, born long ago, old; (त्वत्तश् चिरजा-<BR>तः or भवतश् चिरजातरः, older than thou.)<BR>—चिरजाम्बा, f., N. of the mother of Rudra-bhaṭṭa.<BR>—चिर-जीवक, अस्, m., N. of a tree, = जीवक.<BR>—चि-<BR>र-जीविन्, ई, इनी, इ, long-lived; an epithet of Mārkaṇ-<BR>ḍeya, of Aśvatthāman, of Bali, Vyāsa, Hanumat,<BR>Vibhīṣaṇa, Kṛpa, and Paraśu-rāma; (ई), m. a N. of<BR>Viṣṇu; a crow; two plants, = जीवक and शाल्मलि.<BR>—चिरञ्-जीव, अस्, आ, अम्, long-lived; an epithet of<BR>Kāma-deva; (अस्), m. and चिरञ्जीव-भट्टाचार्य,<BR>अस्, m., N. of several authors.<BR>—चिरञ्-जीविन्, ई, इनी,<BR>इ, long-lived; (ई), m. a N. of Viṣṇu; a crow; two<BR>plants, = जीवक and शाल्मलि.<BR>—चिर-ता, f. long du-<BR>ration.<BR>—चिर-दिवसम्, ind. for a long time.<BR>—चिर-<BR>निविष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, abiding long, anything which<BR>has rested for a long time.<BR>—चिर-पाकिन्, ई, इनी, इ,<BR>ripening late; (ई), m. the plant Feronia Elephantum;<BR>[cf. कपित्थ.]<BR>—चिर-पुष्प, अस्, आ, अम्, blossom-<BR>ing late; (अस्), m. the plant Mimusops Elengi; [cf.<BR>वकुल.]<BR>—चिर-प्रवासिन्, ई, इनी, इ, dwelling long<BR>abroad, a long absentee.<BR>—चिर-मित्र, अम्, n. an<BR>old friend; a crony.<BR>—चिर-मेहिन्, ई, m. an ass.<BR>—चिर-मोचन, अम्, n., N. of a Tīrtha.<BR>—चिर-<BR>रात्र, अम्, n. a period of many nights, a long time,<BR>a long period; चिर-रात्रम् or -त्राय, &c., for a long<BR>time, after a long time, at last, finally, = चिरम् above.<BR>—चिररात्रोषित (˚र-उष्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, having<BR>lodged for a long time.<BR>—चिर-रोग, अस्, m. a chronic<BR>disease.<BR>—चिर-लब्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, obtained after a<BR>long time (as a son in old age).<BR>—चिर-लोक-लोक,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, whose world is a long-existing world; an<BR>epithet of the manes.<BR>—चिर-विप्रोषित, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>long banished.<BR>—चिर-विल्व, अस्, m. the tree Pon-<BR>gamia Glabra; [cf. करञ्ज.]<BR>—चिर-वृत्त, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, happened long since.<BR>—चिर-सुप्त-बुद्धि,<BR>इस्, इस्, इ, one whose mind has been asleep a long<BR>time, long senseless or careless.<BR>—चिर-सूता or चिर-<BR>सूतिका, f. a cow that has borne many calves.<BR>—चिर-<BR>सेवक, अस्, m. an old servant.<BR>—चिर-ष, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, or चिर-स्थायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, or चिर-स्थित, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, long continuing or enduring, lasting, of long<BR>continuance, left for a long time.<BR>—चिरस्थायि-ता, f.<BR>long continuance, durability.<BR>—चिराद् (˚र-अद्), त्, त्, त्,<BR>eating for a long time; (त्), m. an epithet of Garuḍa.<BR>—चिरान्तक (˚र-अन्˚), अस्, m., N. of a son of<BR>Garuḍa.<BR>—चिरायुष (˚र-आय्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, bestow-<BR>ing long life.<BR>—चिरायुस् (˚र-आय्˚), उस्, उस्, उस्, long-<BR>lived; (उस्), m. a deity, a divinity.<BR>—चिरारोध<BR>(˚र-आर्˚), अस्, m. a long or protracted siege; blockade.<BR>—चिराश्रित (˚र-आश्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, long maintained<BR>or protected; an old dependant.<BR>—चिरोज्झित (˚र-<BR>उज्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, long since abandoned or left.<BR>—चि-<BR>रोत्थ (˚र-उत्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, existing a long time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरत्न|चिरत्नः
चिरत्न, अस्, ई, अम्, old, ancient, of long standing,<BR>long-lasting, long-enduring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरन्तन|चिरंतन|चिरन्तनः
चिरन्तन, अस्, ई, अम्, old, ancient, antiquated,<BR>of long standing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरय
चिरय, nom. P. A. चिरयति, -ते, to act slowly,<BR>delay, to be absent a long while.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिराय
चिराय, nom. P. A. चिरायति, -ते, to delay, be slow,<BR>be absent for a long time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरण्टी|चिरंटी
चिरण्टी चिरण्टी or चिरण्ठी, f. a woman<BR>married or single who continues to reside after ma-<BR>turity in her father's house; a young woman; [cf.<BR>चरटी, चरण्टी, चिरिण्टी.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरतिक्त|चिरतिक्तः
चिरतिक्त चिरतिक्त, अस्, m. a kind of gen-<BR>tian, Gentiana Cherayta, = किरात-तिक्त, (in Bengālī<BR>चिराता.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरम्भण|चिरम्भणः
चिरम्भण चिरम्भण, अस्, m. a kind of<BR>falcon or kite; [cf. चिल्ल.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिराटिका
चिराटिका चिराटिका, f. (fr. चिर ?), N. of a<BR>plant with white flowers, a kind of hogweed, Bœrhavia<BR>Erecta, = चटिका, commonly पाताडी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरातिक्त|चिरातिक्तः
चिरातिक्त चिरातिक्त, अस्, m. a sort of gen-<BR>tian, = चिरतिक्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरि|चिरिः
चिरि 1. चिरि, इस्, m. (perhaps fr. the sound<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">Page0326-c+ 70</a>]<BR>or imitative cry चि), a parrot; [cf. कीर and चिमि.]<BR>—चि-<BR>रि-विल्व, अस्, m., N. of a tree, (perhaps = चिर-विल्व.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरि|चिरिः
चिरि 2. चिरि, cl. 5. P. चिरिणोति, &c., to<BR>hurt, injure, wound or kill; [cf. जिरि.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरिका
चिरिका, f. a kind of weapon, = चिलिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरिण्टी|चिरिंटी
चिरिण्टी चिरिण्टी, f. = चिरण्टी above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरु|चिरुः
चिरु चिरु, उस्, m. the shoulder-joint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिर्भट
चिर्भट चिर्भट, अस् and ई, m. and f., Cucu-<BR>mis Utilissimus, = कर्कटी; also its fruit; [cf.<BR>चर्भट.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिर्भिट
चिर्भिट, अम्, आ and इका, n. f. a kind of gourd,<BR>different from the preceding; [cf. इन्द्र-चिर्भिटी,<BR>क्षुद्र-चिर्भिटा, क्षेत्र-च्˚, गज-च्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिल्
चिल् चिल्, cl. 6. P. चिलति, &c., to put on<BR>clothes; [cf. Hib. ceilim, ‘I conceal,<BR>hide, cover;’ caille, ‘a veil, a cowl;’ Lat. celare;<BR>Old Germ. hilu, helm, heliu, heli; Goth. hulja;<BR>Lat. oc-culo.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिलमीलिका
चिलमीलिका चिलमीलिका, f. a kind of neck-<BR>lace; a luminous flying insect, a fire-fly; lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिलिका
चिलिका चिलिका, f. a kind of weapon, =<BR>चिरिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिलिचिम|चिलिचिमः
चिलिचिम चिलिचिम, अस्, m. a kind of sprat,<BR>Clupea Cultrata, commonly वालिया-गडक (वालिया,<BR>Cyprinus Denticulatus, गडक, a kind of golden trout);<BR>according to some authorities, a kind of prawn. Other<BR>forms of this word are चिलिचिमि, चिलिचीम, चिलिचीमि,<BR>चिलिमीनक, चिलीचिम, चिलीचिमि, चिलीम, चेलिचीम.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिलिमिनिका
चिलिमिनिका चिलिमिनिका and चिलिमीलिका, a<BR>various reading for चिलमीलिका, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिल्ल्
चिल्ल् चिल्ल्, cl. 1. P. चिल्लति, &c., to become<BR>loose; to be slack or flaccid; to play,<BR>sport, act wantonly; to indicate one's meaning (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिल्ल|चिल्लः
चिल्ल, अस्, आ, अम्, blear-eyed [cf. चुल्ल and पिल्ल];<BR>(अस्), m. a bleared or sore eye; the Bengal kite,<BR>Falco Cheela; (ई), f., cf. चिल्लि; [cf. कुरु-चिल्ल.]<BR>—चिल्ल-भक्ष्या, f. a kind of vegetable perfume;<BR>see हट्ट-विलाशिनी.<BR>—चिल्लाभ (˚ल-आभा), अस्, m.<BR>a petty thief, a shop-lifter, a pickpocket, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिल्लक
चिल्लक, अस् or आ, m. or f. a particular animal;<BR>(आ), f. a cricket, = चीरिका and झिल्लिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिल्लि
चिल्लि, इस्, m. a species of bird of prey [cf. चिल्ल];<BR>(इस्), f. a kind of plant [cf. चिल्ली]; (ई), f. a cricket<BR>[cf. चिल्लका]; a kind of pot-herb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिल्लिका
चिल्लिका, f. a kind of pot-herb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिवि|चिविः
चिवि चिवि, इस्, m. = चिवुक, the chin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिविट|चिविटः
चिविट चिविट, अस्, m. = चिपिट, flattened<BR>grain, rice, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिविल्लिका
चिविल्लिका चिविल्लिका, f., N. of a small shrub,<BR>= क्षुद्र-घोली, मधु-माल-पत्त्रिका, रक्त-<BR>दला.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिवुक|चिवुकं|चिवुकः
चिवुक चिवुक or चिबुक, अम्, n. the chin<BR>[cf. चुबुक and छुबुक]; (अस्), m., N. of a tree,<BR>= मुचुकुन्द; (आस्), m. pl., N. of a people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिश्चा
चिश्चा चिश्चा, ind., Ved. an onomatopoetic<BR>word for a rattling sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिहणकन्थ
चिहणकन्थ चिहण-कन्थ, अम्, n., N. of a<BR>town.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिहुर
चिहुर चिहुर, आस्, m. pl. = चिकुर, the hair<BR>of the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिह्न|चिह्नं
चिह्न चिह्न, अम्, n. a mark, spot, stain,<BR>stamp, sign, badge, symbol, symptom; a banner, a<BR>standard, insignia; a sign of the zodiac; aim, direc-<BR>tion towards; [cf. स-चिह्न.]<BR>—चिह्न-कारिन्, ई,<BR>इणी, इ, making or leaving marks, marking, spotting;<BR>wounding, striking, killing; exciting fear, frightful,<BR>hideous.<BR>—चिह्न-धर, अस्, m. bearing the signs<BR>or insignia (of office).<BR>—चिह्न-धारिणी, f. the plant<BR>Echites Frutescens, = श्यामा-लता.<BR>—चिह्न-भूत,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, become a mark, formed into a mark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिह्नय
चिह्नय, nom. P. चिह्नयति, -यितुम्, to mark,<BR>sign, stamp, spot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिह्नित|चिह्नितः
चिह्नित, अस्, आ, अम्, marked, signed, spotted,<BR>stained, stamped, designated; known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिह्नीकृत
चिह्नी-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, marked, delineated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीक्
चीक् चीक्, cl. 1. and 10. P. चीकति and<BR>चीकयति, to endure, suffer, to be patient;<BR>to be impatient; to touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीचीकूची
चीचीकूची चीचीकूची, an onomatopoetic<BR>word for the chirping or warbling of birds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीडा
चीडा चीडा, f. a kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीण
चीण चीण, आस्, m. pl. (for चीन), N. of a<BR>country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीणक
चीणक चीणक, अस्, m. a kind of grain;<BR>[cf. चीन and चीनक.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीति
चीति चीति. See under 1. चि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीत्कार|चीत्कारः
चीत्कार चीत्-कार, अस्, m. crying, a cry, the<BR>braying of an ass, a noise.<BR>—चीत्कार-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>accompanied with a noise or cry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीन|चीनं|चीनः
चीन चीन, आस्, m. pl., N. of a people, the<BR>inhabitants of China, the Chinese; (अस्), m. a kind<BR>of deer; Panicum Miliaceum; a sort of cloth; a<BR>thread; (अम्), n. a banner (perhaps made of deer<BR>skin), a standard; a kind of bandage for the corners<BR>of the eyes; lead.<BR>—चीन-कर्पूर, अस्, m. a kind<BR>of camphor, also called तुषार, द्वीप-कर्पूरज.<BR>—चीन-ज, अम्, n. steel.<BR>—चीन-नी, ईस्, m. a peach<BR>tree.<BR>—चीन-पट्ट, अम्, n. lead.<BR>—चीन-पति, इस्,<BR>m., N. of a kingdom.<BR>—चीन-पिष्ट, अम्, n.<BR>minium or red lead; lead.<BR>—चीनपिष्ट-मय, अस्,<BR>ई, अम्, consisting of minium or representing it.<BR>—चीन-राज-पुत्र, अस्, m. a pear tree.<BR>—चीन-<BR>वङ्ग, अम्, n. lead or more probably tutenag.<BR>—चीनांशुक (˚न-अं˚), अम्, n. China cloth, silk,<BR>a silken cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीनक|चीनकः
चीनक, अस्, m. an inhabitant of China, Chinese;<BR>a kind of panic, Panicum Miliaceum; fennel, =<BR>कङ्गुनी; also = चीन-कर्पूर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीनाकर्कटी
चीनाकर्कटी चीनाकर्कटी, f. a kind of cu-<BR>cumber said to be found near Citra-kūṭa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीब्
चीब् चीब् = चीव्, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीभ्
चीभ् चीभ् (a various reading for बीभ्),<BR>cl. 1. A. चीभते, &c., to coax, commend,<BR>flatter; to boast, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीय्
चीय् चीय् (another form for चीव्), cl. 1. P.<BR>A. चीयति, -ते, &c., to take, receive, wear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीर|चीरं
चीर 1. चीर = चिर in the adv. अ-चीरम्,<BR>quick, soon, shortly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीर|चीरं
चीर 2. चीर, अम्, n. (said to be fr. rt. 1. चि),<BR>a strip, a long narrow piece of bark or rind; a strip of<BR>cloth, clothes, a rag, tatter, old and torn cloth; the<BR>dress of a Buddhist priest; a kind of garland, a<BR>necklace of pearls consisting of four strings; a stripe,<BR>stroke, line; a manner of writing with strokes or<BR>lines; lead; a crest.<BR>—चीर-पत्त्रिका, f. a kind of<BR>vegetable, = चञ्चु-शाक.<BR>—चीर-पर्ण, अस्, m. the<BR>tree Shorea Robusta, = शाल-वृक्ष.<BR>—चीर-भ-<BR>वन्ती, f. the elder sister of a wife.<BR>—चीर-वासस्,<BR>आस्, आस्, अस्, clothed in bark, dressed in rags or<BR>tatters; (आस्), m. an epithet of Śiva; N. of a Yakṣa;<BR>N. of a prince.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीरक|चीरकः
चीरक, अस्, m. a manner of writing. See above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीरित
चीरित, अस्, आ, अम्, having strips or stripes, ragged,<BR>tattered.<BR>—चीरित-च्छदा, f. a kind of vegetable;<BR>[cf. पालङ्क्य.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरिन्
चिरिन्, ई, इणी, इ, clothed in bark, clothed in rags<BR>and tatters.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीरल्लि|चीरल्लिः
चीरल्लि चीरल्लि, इस्, m. or f. (?) a kind of<BR>large fish; (also read चीरिल्लि and चीरील्लि.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीरि|चीरिः
चीरि चीरि, इस्, f. a veil or shade for cover-<BR>ing the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीरी
चीरी चीरी or चीरिका, f. a cricket; the hem<BR>of an under garment.<BR>—चीरी-वाक, अस्, m. a cricket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीरुक|चीरुकं
चीरुक चीरुक, अम्, n. a kind of fruit,<BR>commonly चेꣳउर; (आ), f. a cricket; [cf. चीरिका<BR>and चीरी.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीर्ण|चीर्णं|चीर्ण्ण
चीर्ण चीर्ण, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. चर्), conversant,<BR>versed, learned; split, divided; (अम्), n. conduct.<BR>—चीर्ण-पर्ण, अस्, m., N. of two trees, = निम्ब<BR>and खर्जूर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीलिका
चीलिका चीलिका, f. a cricket; also चील्लका;<BR>[cf. चीरी.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीव्
चीव् चीव्, cl. 1. P. A. चीवति, -ते, &c., to<BR>take; to wear, cover; cl. 10. P. चीव-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to shine; to speak; [cf. Hib. cib,<BR>‘the hand;’ Cambro-Brit. cipiaw, ‘to take;’ Gr.<BR>σκεῦος.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीवर|चीवरं
चीवर चीवर, अम्, n. (said to be fr. 1. चि),<BR>the dress of a Buddhist mendicant or of any mendi-<BR>cant.<BR>—चीवर-गोपक, अस्, m. a wardrobe-keeper,<BR>(a particular officer.)<BR>—चीवर-निवसन, आस्, m. pl.,<BR>N. of a people.<BR>—चीवर-भजक, अस्, m. a dis-<BR>tributer of garments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीवरय
चीवरय, nom. A. -यते, -यितुम्, to collect rags,<BR>put on a tattered garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीवरिन्
चीवरिन्, ई, m. a Buddhist or Jaina mendicant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुकोपयिषु
चुकोपयिषु चुकोपयिषु, उस्, उस्, उ (fr. Desid.<BR>of Caus. of rt. कुप्), wishing to make a person<BR>angry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुक्क्
चुक्क् चुक्क्, cl. 10. P. चुक्कयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to inflict or suffer pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुक्कस
चुक्कस चुक्कस, अस्, m. = बुक्कस, a Cāṇḍāla.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुक्कार|चुक्कारः
चुक्कार चुक्-कार, अस्, m. the roaring of a<BR>lion; (a various reading has बुक्कार.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुक्र|चुक्रं|चुक्रः
चुक्र चुक्र, अस्, अम्, m. n. (said to be fr.<BR>rt. चक्), vinegar made by the acetous fermentation<BR>of grain; acid seasoning; sourness; Indian sorrel,<BR>Rumex Vesicarius; (ई), f. = चाङ्गेरी, Oxalis Pusilla;<BR>(आ), f. the tamarind tree.<BR>—चुक्र-फल, अम्, n.<BR>the tamarind fruit.<BR>—चुक्र-वास्तूक, अम्, n. wood-<BR>sorrel.<BR>—चुक्र-वेधक, अम्, n. a kind of sour<BR>rice-gruel.<BR>—चुक्राम्ल (˚र-अम्˚), अम्, n. vinegar<BR>made by the acetous fermentation of grain; (आ), f.<BR>a kind of wood-sorrel, = अम्ललोणिका; a tamarind<BR>tree; a kind of sour rice-gruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुक्रक|चुक्रकं
चुक्रक, अम्, n. a kind of wood-sorrel, Rumex<BR>Vesicarius, commonly चुकापालङ्ग; (इका), f. wood-<BR>sorrel, = कुचाङ्गेरी; a kind of sour rice-gruel; [cf.<BR>अम्ल-चुक्रिका.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुक्रिमन्
चुक्रिमन्, आ, m. sourness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुक्षा
चुक्षा चुक्षा, f. washing; [cf. चोक्ष and<BR>चौक्ष.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुक्षोभयिषु
चुक्षोभयिषु चुक्षोभयिषु, उस्, उस्, उ (fr.<BR>Desid. of Caus. of rt. क्षुभ्), intending or wishing<BR>to cause to shake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुचि|चुचिः
चुचि चुचि, इस्, m. the female breast, bosom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुचु
चुचु चुचु, उस्, m. a kind of vegetable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुच्चू
चुच्चू, ऊस्, m. f. a kind of vegetable, = the preceding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुचुक|चुचुकं|चुचुकः
चुचुक चुचुक, अस्, अम्, m. n. the nipple<BR>of the breast, see चूचुक; (आस्), m. pl., N. of a<BR>people in Dakṣiṇā-patha; [cf. चुचुप.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुचूक|चुचूकं
चुचूक, अम्, n. a nipple; [cf. चूचुक.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुचुप
चुचुप चुचुप, आस्, m. pl., N. of a people;<BR>[cf. चुचुक.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुच्य्
चुच्य् चुच्य्, cl. 1. P. चुच्यति, &c., another<BR>form for शुच्य्, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुञ्चु|चुंचु|चुञ्चुः
चुञ्चु चुञ्चु, उस्, उस्, उ (considered as an<BR>affix at the end of certain comp.), known, cele-<BR>brated, renowned [cf. अक्षर-चुञ्चु, चार-च्˚,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">Page0327-c+ 71</a>]<BR>चञ्चु, चण]; (उस्), m. the musk-rat or shrew; a<BR>mixed caste, born of a Brāhman father by a Vaideha<BR>female, whose business is hunting; N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुञ्चुमायन
चुञ्चुमायन चुञ्चुमायन, अम्, n. irritation<BR>or itching (of a wound).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुञ्चुरी|चुंचुरी
चुञ्चुरी चुञ्चुरी, f. a game, a kind of hazard<BR>played with tamarind seeds instead of dice; also<BR>चुञ्चुलि and चुञ्चुली.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुञ्चुल
चुञ्चुल चुञ्चुल, अस्, m., N. of a man; (आस्),<BR>m. pl. his descendants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुट्
चुट् चुट्, cl. 6. 10. P. चुटति, चोटयति, &c.,<BR>to cut off, pierce, divide; cl. 1. and 10.<BR>P. चोटति and चोटयति, to wane, become small or<BR>low or shallow; [cf. चुट्ट्, चुण्ट्, छुट्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुट्ट्
चुट्ट् चुट्ट्, cl. 10. P. चुट्टयति, &c., to be-<BR>come small or low or shallow as a river &c.;<BR>[cf. पुट्ट्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुड्
चुड् चुड्, cl. 6. P. चुडति, &c., to conceal;<BR>[cf. बुड्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुड्ड्
चुड्ड् चुड्ड्, cl. 1. P. चुड्डति, &c., to dally,<BR>wanton, coquet, &c.; to hint one's mean-<BR>ing; to act (?); [cf. चुल्ल्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुण्
चुण् चुण्, cl. 6. P. चुणति, &c., to cut off,<BR>pierce, divide; [cf. Hib. guinim, ‘I<BR>wound, prick, sting;’ guinneach, ‘sharp-pointed;’<BR>gun-ta, ‘wounded.’]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुण्ट्|चुंट्
चुण्ट् चुण्ट् [cf. rt. चुट् and चुट्ट्], cl. 1. 10.<BR>P. चुण्टति, चुण्टयति, &c., to cut off,<BR>pierce, divide; cl. 1. P. चुण्टति, to become small.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुण्टा|चुंटा
चुण्टा and ई, f. a small well or reservoir near a<BR>well; [cf. चौण्ट्य, चूडक, चूतक.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुण्ठ्
चुण्ठ् चुण्ठ्, cl. 10. P. चुण्ठयति, &c.,<BR>to hurt, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुण्ड्|चुंड्
चुण्ड् चुण्ड् [cf. rt. चुट् and चुट्ट्], cl. 1. P.<BR>चुण्डति, &c., to become small; cl. 10. P.<BR>चुण्डयति, to cut off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुण्ढी
चुण्ढी, f. a small well. See चुण्टा above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुत्
चुत् 1. चुत्, a various reading for च्युत्;<BR>[cf. श्चुत्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुत्
चुत् 2. चुत्, ind. an interjection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुत|चुतः
चुत चुत, अस्, m. and चुति, इस्, f. the anus;<BR>[cf. चूत and च्युति.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुद्
चुद् चुद्, cl. 1. P. A., Ved. चोदति, -ते,<BR>अचोदीत्, &c., to impel, incite, animate; to<BR>offer quickly (as the Soma); to hasten: Caus. P.<BR>(rarely A.) चोदयति, -ते, -यितुम्, to urge on, drive,<BR>impel, incite, send, cause to move quickly, hasten,<BR>accelerate; to inspire, excite, animate; to direct (the<BR>eye) towards; to enjoin; to request, petition, ask,<BR>question, inquire after; to press or importune with<BR>a request; to help on, assist in the attainment<BR>of (with dat., e. g. अस्माञ् श्रिये चोदय, help us on<BR>to fortune); to bring or offer quickly; to fix, settle,<BR>direct; to be quick; [cf. Gr. σκεύδω, σπουδάζω:<BR>Lat. cudo; re-pudio.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोद|चोदः
चोद, अस्, m., Ved. an implement for driving<BR>horses, a goad or whip; (अस्, आ, अम्), animating,<BR>inspiring, promoting.<BR>—चोद-प्रवृद्ध, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, Ved. exalted by the inspiring (draught of Soma),<BR>an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदक|चोदकः
चोदक, अस्, आ, अम्, driving; (अस्), m. direction,<BR>invitation; (in grammar) = परि-ग्रह, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदन
चोदन, अस्, आ, अम्, driving, impelling; (अम्), n.<BR>the act of driving, inviting, invitation, order, rule,<BR>precept; (आ), f. sending, commanding, directing; cast-<BR>ing, throwing; enjoining, ordaining; a precept, sacred<BR>ordinance or commandment; (ई), f., N. of a plant,<BR>(a various reading for रोदनी); [cf. एक-चोदन.]<BR>—चोदना-गुड, अस्, m. a ball for playing with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदयत्
चोदयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, impelling, animating, in-<BR>spiring.<BR>—चोदयन्-मति (˚यत्-म˚), इस्, इस्, इ, Ved.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">Page0328-a+ 72</a>]<BR>inspiring, promoting piety or devotion; (Sāy.) whose<BR>mind is inspiring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदयितृ
चोदयितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, driving, impelling, ani-<BR>mating, promoting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदस्
चोदस्, अस्, n. = चोदन. See अ-चोदस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदित
चोदित, अस्, आ, अम्, impelled, urged; ordered,<BR>directed; thrown, cast; appointed; informed, ap-<BR>prised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदितृ
चोदितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, driving, impelling, animating,<BR>promoting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदिष्ठ
चोदिष्ठ, अस्, आ, अम् (superl. of preceding), Ved.<BR>impelling or animating much.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोद्य|चोद्यं|चोद्यः
चोद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be driven or impelled; to be<BR>sent, thrown or directed; to be mentioned or com-<BR>municated; (अम्), n. raising a question, objecting,<BR>asking a question; surprise, astonishment, wonder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोद्यमान
चोद्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being urged or driven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुनन्द
चुनन्द चुनन्द, अस्, m., N. of a Bhikṣu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुन्द्
चुन्द् चुन्द्. Cf. बुन्द्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुन्द
चुन्द चुन्द, अस्, m., N. of a pupil of Śākya-<BR>muni; (ई), f. a procuress, a bawd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुप्
चुप् 1. चुप्, cl. 1. P. चोपति, चुचोप, चोपि-<BR>ष्यति, चोपितुम्, to move, stir; to move<BR>slowly, creep or steal along; [cf. Lith. kopu; Germ.<BR>hüpfen; Eng. hop.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोपक
चोपक. Cf. गले-चोपक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोपन|चोपनं
चोपन, अस्, आ, अम्, moving, stirring, moving<BR>slowly; (अम्), n. moving, moving slowly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुप्
चुप् 2. चुप् (a various reading for छुप्),<BR>cl. 6. P. चुपति, to touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुप
चुप चुप, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुपुणीका
चुपुणीका चुपुणीका, f., Ved., N. of an<BR>इष्टका or sacrificial brick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुबुक|चुबुकः
चुबुक चुबुक, अम्, n. the chin; [cf. चिबुक<BR>and छुबुक.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुब्र|चुब्रं
चुब्र चुब्र, अम्, n. (fr. 1. चुम्ब् ?), the face,<BR>the mouth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुमुरि|चुमुरिः
चुमुरि चुमुरि, इस्, m., Ved., N. of a hostile<BR>demon whom Indra, to favour Dabhīti, sent to sleep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्ब्|चुंब्
चुम्ब् 1. चुम्ब्, cl. 1. P. चुम्बति, चुचुम्ब,<BR>चुम्बिष्यति, चुम्बितुम्, to kiss, touch<BR>with the mouth; touch softly or lightly, graze: Caus.<BR>P. चुम्बयति, -यितुम्, to cause to kiss; [cf. Goth.<BR>kukja; Hib. pogaim; Lith. bucioju; Lett. sz-<BR>kûpstit.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्ब|चुंब|चुंबः|चुम्बः
चुम्ब, अस्, आ, m. f. kissing, a kiss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्बक|चुंबक|चुंबकः|चुम्बकः
चुम्बक, अस्, इका, अम्, a kisser, one who kisses<BR>much; a lecher; knavish, roguish, a rogue, a cheat;<BR>one who has read much, a superficial scholar who<BR>knows parts in a variety of books; (अस्), m. a load-<BR>stone; the upper part or middle of a balance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्बत्
चुम्बत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, kissing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्बन|चुंबन|चुंबनं|चुम्बनं
चुम्बन, अम्, n. kissing, a kiss.<BR>—चुम्बन-<BR>दान, अम्, n. giving a kiss, kissing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्बित|चुंबित
चुम्बित, अस्, आ, अम्, kissed, touched softly or<BR>lightly.<BR>—चुम्बित-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, one who has<BR>kissed; kissing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्बिन्|चुंबिन्
चुम्बिन्, ई, इनी, इ, kissing; touching closely or<BR>softly, grazing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्ब्|चुंब्
चुम्ब् 2. चुम्ब्, cl. 10. P. चुम्बयति, &c.,<BR>to hurt, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुर्
चुर् चुर्, cl. 10. and (according to some)<BR>1. P. चोरयति, अचूचुरत् &c., चोरति &c.,<BR>to steal, rob; [cf. Gr. φωράω; Lat. furari; Hib.<BR>coire, ‘trespass, offence,’ &c.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुरण|चुरणं
चुरण, अम्, n. stealing, thieving, robbing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुरण्य
चुरण्य, nom. P. चुरण्यति, to thieve, steal, rob.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुरा
चुरा, f. stealing, theft; [cf. चौर.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोर|चोरः
चोर, अस्, m. a thief, a robber; N. of a plant, =<BR>कृष्ण-शटी; a kind of perfume, = चोरक; N. of a<BR>poet; (आ), f., N. of a plant, = चोर-पुष्पी; (ई), f. a<BR>female thief; [cf. चौर; cf. also Gr. φώρ.]<BR>—चोर-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">Page0328-b+ 76</a>]<BR>कण्टक, अस्, m. a kind of grass, the seeds of which<BR>stick in the clothes, commonly Chorkānta.<BR>—चोर-<BR>पुष्पिका or चोर-पुष्पी, f. the plant Chrysopogon<BR>Aciculatus.<BR>—चोर-स्नायु, उस्, m. a plant, = काक-<BR>नासा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोरक|चोरकः
चोरक, अस्, m. a thief; a kind of plant [cf. पृक्का<BR>and तस्कर]; a kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोरिका
चोरिका, f. = चौरिका, theft, robbery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोरित
चोरित, अम्, n. stealing, theft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोरितक|चोरितकं
चोरितक, अम्, n. thieving, petty theft or larceny;<BR>anything stolen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चौर|चौरः
चौर, अस्, ई, m. f. a thief, a robber, a pilferer; a<BR>dishonest or unfair dealer, a usurper, any one who<BR>usurps a position or a title dishonestly; one who<BR>steals or captivates the heart; (at the end of a comp.)<BR>anything bad of its kind; N. of a plant, = चोर-<BR>पुष्पिका, used for the preparation of a perfume; a<BR>kind of perfume.<BR>—चौर-कर्मन्, अ, n. theft,<BR>thievery.<BR>—चौर-गत, अस्, आ, अम्, stolen, robbed.<BR>—चौर-तस्, ind. from robbers, from theft.<BR>—चौ-<BR>र-ध्वज-बद्धक, अस्, m. a term applied to a<BR>notorious thief.<BR>—चौर-पञ्चाशिका, f. ‘the fifty<BR>stanzas of Caura,’ title of an erotic poem by a poet<BR>named Sundara.<BR>—चौर-पुष्पौषधि (˚प-<BR>ओष्˚), इस्, f. = चोर-पुष्पिका.<BR>—चौर-रूप, अस्, m.<BR>a clever thief.<BR>—चौर-रूपिन्, ई, इणी, इ, having the cha-<BR>racter of a thief.<BR>—चौरस्य-कुल, अम्, n. a gang of<BR>thieves.<BR>—चौर-हृत, अस्, आ, अम्, taken by robbery,<BR>stolen.<BR>—चौरांशा (˚र-अं˚), f., N. of a metre<BR>consisting of four lines of six syllables each.<BR>—चौरा-<BR>पहृत (˚र-अप्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, carried off, stolen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चौरादिक
चौरादिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. चुर्-आदि), belonging to<BR>the class of roots beginning with चुर्, i. e. the tenth<BR>class.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चौरिका
चौरिका, f. (fr. चोर or चौर), thievery, theft,<BR>robbing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चौरिकाक
चौरिकाक, अस्, m. ‘a thief of a crow;’ (perhaps a<BR>wrong form for चौर-काक ? or चौरि may be =<BR>चौरी = चौर्य ?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चौरी
चौरी, f. stealing, theft, = चौर्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चौरीभूत
चौरी-भूत, अस्, आ, अम्, one who has become a<BR>thief or the prey of thieves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चौर्य|चौर्यं|चौर्य्य|चौर्य्यं
चौर्य, अम्, n. theft, robbery, thievery; trickery.<BR>—चौर्य-रत, अम्, n. secret sexual enjoyment.<BR>—चौर्य-वृत्ति, इस्, f. the practice of theft or rob-<BR>bery.<BR>—चौर्यार्जित (˚य-अर्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, acquired<BR>by plunder or robbery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चौर्यक|चौर्यकं
चौर्यक, अम्, n. theft, stealing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुरी
चुरी चुरी, f. a small well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुल्
चुल् चुल्, cl. 10. P. चोलयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>raise, elevate; to rise, increase; to dip,<BR>dive into; [cf. बुल्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुलका
चुलका चुलका, f., N. of a river; (also read<BR>चुलुका.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुलुक|चुलुकं|चुलुकः
चुलुक चुलुक, अस्, m. deep mud or mire;<BR>a mouthful of water, the hand hollowed to hold<BR>water; a small vessel or pot, a gallipot &c.; N. of a<BR>man; (आ), f. = चुलका; (अम्), n. water in which<BR>pulse has been steeped; [cf. चलुक.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुलुकिन्
चुलुकिन्, ई, m. a porpoise, sea-hog, or similar<BR>animal; [cf. उलुपिन्, चुल्लकी, चुलुम्पिन्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुलुम्प्|चुलुंप्
चुलुम्प् चुलुम्प्, cl. 1. P. चुलुम्पति, &c.,<BR>to swing, rock; to cut (?), to dis-<BR>appear, to be lost (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुलुम्प|चुलुंप|चुलुंपः|चुलुम्पः
चुलुम्प, अस्, m. fondling or nursing children;<BR>(आ), f. a she-goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुलुम्पिन्
चुलुम्पिन् or चुलूपिन्, ई, m. = चुलुकिन्, a Gangetic<BR>porpoise, sea-hog, or similar animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुल्ल्
चुल्ल् चुल्ल्, cl. 1. P. चुल्लति, &c., to play,<BR>sport, dally, wanton, coquet; to con-<BR>jecture; manifest one's meaning (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुल्ल|चुल्लः
चुल्ल चुल्ल, अस्, आ, अम्, blear-eyed; (अस्), m.<BR>a blear eye; [cf. चिल्ल and पिल्ल.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुल्लक|चुल्लकः
चुल्लक चुल्लक, अस्, m. (for चुलुक), the<BR>palm of the hand hollowed as if to hold water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुल्लकी
चुल्लकी, f. a kind of water-pot; a porpoise, sea-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-c" target="_blank">Page0328-c+ 76</a>]<BR>hog [cf. चुलुकिन्]; N. of a family; a sort of tribe<BR>or caste (?); the opposite bank of a river (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुल्लि|चुल्लिः
चुल्लि चुल्लि, इस्, f. a fire-place, chimney.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुल्ली
चुल्ली, f. a fire-place, chimney; a funeral pile; a<BR>large apartment or hall composed of three wings or<BR>divisions, one looking north, another east, and the<BR>third west.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुश्च्यूषा
चुश्च्यूषा चुश्च्यूषा, f. (fr. चूष्), sucking,<BR>sucking out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुस्त|चुस्तं|चुस्तः
चुस्त चुस्त, अस्, अम्, m. n. the burnt ex-<BR>terior of roast meat; fried meat; chaff; rind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूचुक|चूचुकं
चूचुक चूचुक, अम्, n. (perhaps a redupli-<BR>cated form of rt. चूष् or fr. चूचु, imitative noise<BR>in sucking &c.), the nipple of the breast; (अस्, आ,<BR>अम्), stammering, a stammerer; [cf. चुचुक; cf.<BR>also Hib. cioch, ‘the breast,’ and Gr. θηλή, τίτθη,<BR>τιτθός; Germ. zitze in relation to rt. धे, ‘to drink,’<BR>and Lat. papilla in relation to rt. पा.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूड|चूडः
चूड चूड, अस्, m. a sort of knob or pro-<BR>tuberance on a sacrificial brick (Ved.); the ceremony<BR>of tonsure as performed on a child; N. of a man with<BR>the patronymic Bhāgavitti; (आ), f. the hair on the<BR>top of the head, a single lock or tuft of hair left on<BR>the crown of the head after the ceremony of tonsure,<BR>a top-knot; the ceremony of tonsure (see चूडा-<BR>करण); the crest of a cock or peacock; any crest,<BR>plume, diadem, &c.; the head; top, summit; an<BR>upper room, a room on the top of a house &c.; a<BR>kind of bracelet; a small well; a kind of metre; N.<BR>of a woman; [cf. चूल, चोड, चौल, उच्-चूड,<BR>ताम्र-चूड, पञ्च-चूडा; cf. also कूट and Hib.<BR>cuit, ‘the head.’]<BR>—चूडा-करण, अम्, n. ‘forming<BR>the crest,’ i. e. shaving the head all but one lock,<BR>considered as a religious and purificatory rite; it<BR>should be performed in the first or third year; [cf.<BR>चौल.]<BR>—चूडा-कर्ण, अस्, m., N. of a mendicant.<BR>—चूडा-कर्मन्, अ, n. the ceremony of forming<BR>the crest, the rite of tonsure; [cf. चूडा-करण.]<BR>—चूडा-पक्ष, अस्, m., N. of a man (?).<BR>—चूडा-<BR>प्रतिग्रह, अस्, m., N. of a Caitya.<BR>—चूडा-मणि,<BR>इस्, m. a jewel worn by men and women on the top<BR>of the head; a jewel worn in a crest or diadem;<BR>(often at the end of a comp.) the best or most ex-<BR>cellent of a class, ‘the gem’ (e. g. आचार्य-चक्र-<BR>चूडामणि, ‘the best of the whole circle of Ācāryas,’<BR>an epithet of Vopa-deva; पण्डित-चूडामणि, a<BR>chief among scholars); the seed of the Abrus Preca-<BR>torius [cf. गुञ्जा]; title of an astronomical work;<BR>title of a work on music.<BR>—चूडामणि-धर, अस्,<BR>m., N. of a serpent-demon.<BR>—चूडा-रत्न, अम्, n.<BR>a jewel worn by men and women on the top of the<BR>head; [cf. चूडा-मणि.]<BR>—चूडा-लक्षण, अम्, n.<BR>tonsure.<BR>—चूडा-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having a single<BR>lock of hair or tuft on the top of the head, crested,<BR>tufted.<BR>—चूडा-वन, अम्, n., N. of a mountain.<BR>—चूडावलम्बिन् (˚डा-अव्˚), ई, इनी, इ, hanging<BR>down or reclining on the crest or summit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडक|चूडकः
चूडक at the end of an adj. comp. = चूडा, ton-<BR>sure; (अस्), m. a well; [cf. चूडा, चुण्टा, चूतक.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडार
चूडार, अस्, आ, अम्, = चूडाल (?), having one lock<BR>of hair on the top of the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडारक
चूडारक, अस्, m., N. of a man; (आस्), m. pl. his<BR>descendants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडाल|चूडालं
चूडाल, अस्, आ, अम्, having a top-knot or single<BR>lock of hair on the crown of the head, crested; (आ),<BR>f. a kind of Cyperus, Kyllinga Monocephala, = उच्-<BR>चटा, = नागर-मुस्ता and श्वेत-गुञ्जा; (अम्), n.<BR>the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडिक
चूडिक, अस्, आ, अम्, having a lock or tuft of hair<BR>on the top of the head; (आ), f., N. of a metre; [cf.<BR>चूलिका.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडिन्
चूडिन्, ई, इनी, इ, having a top-knot or tuft of hair<BR>on the crown of the head, crested, tufted.<BR>—चूडि-<BR>कला, f., N. of a metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडाम्ल|चूडाम्लं
चूडाम्ल चूडाम्ल, अम्, n. vinegar prepared<BR>from fruits; [cf. चुक्राम्ल.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0328-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूण्
चूण् चूण्, cl. 10. P. चूणयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>contract; to close or shrink.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0329-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूत|चूतः
चूत चूत, अस्, m. the mango tree, Mangifera<BR>Indica; the anus; [cf. चुत.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0329-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूतक|चूतकः
