झाट|झाटः
झाट झाट. See under rt. झट्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झाटामला
