झाबुक
झाबुक झाबुक, अस्, m. the tree Tamarix<BR>Indica (?); [cf. झावुक.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झामक|झामकं
झामक झामक, अम्, n. a burnt or vitrified<BR>brick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झामर|झामरः
झामर झामर, अस्, m. a small whetstone,<BR>used chiefly by housewives for sharpening their spin-<BR>dles, needles, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झार्झर|झार्झरः
झार्झर झार्झर or झार्झरिक, अस्, m. (fr.<BR>झर्झर), a tabor-player, a drummer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झालरी
झालरी झालरी [cf. झलरी], a kind of drum<BR>or tabor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झाला
झाला झाला, f. = झला, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झालि|झालिः
झालि झालि, इस्, f. a sort of sour or unripe<BR>mango fried with salt, mustard, and Asa Fœtida.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झावु|झावुः
