झिङ्गी, f. a sort of cucumber, Luffa Acutangula.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

