झिल्लि|झिल्लिः
झिल्लि झिल्लि, इस्, f. a cricket; a kind of<BR>musical instrument; membrane or parchment; [cf.<BR>झिल्ली; cf. also Lat. gryllus; Germ. Grille.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झिल्लिका
झिल्लिका, f. a cricket; a cricket's cry; the light of<BR>sunshine, strong light, splendor; the dirt which<BR>comes from the body in rubbing it with perfumes;<BR>a cloth or rag used for applying colour, unguents,<BR>&c.; a kind of skin or membrane, parchment.<BR>—झिल्लिका-गण-नादित, अस्, आ, अम्, resounding<BR>with a multitude of crickets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झिल्ली
झिल्ली, f. a cricket; the wick of a lamp; a cloth<BR>or rag for applying unguents, colour, &c.; sunshine,<BR>light, lustre; rice burnt by cooking in a saucepan, &c.;<BR>a musical instrument, cymbals; parchment.<BR>—झिल्ली-<BR>कण्ठ, अस्, m. a domestic pigeon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झिल्लीक|झिल्लीकः
झिल्लीक, अस्, m. a cricket; (आ), f. a cricket; sun-<BR>shine; dirt taken off the body in rubbing it with<BR>perfumes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झीरिका
झीरिका and झीरुका, f. a cricket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झिल्लिन्
