झु|झुः
झु झु, cl. 1. A. झवते, &c., to go or<BR>move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झुण्ट|झुंट|झुंटः|झुण्टः
झुण्ट झुण्ट, अस्, m. a shrub, a bush.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झुमरि|झुमरिः
झुमरि झुमरि or झुमेरि, इस्, f. one of the<BR>Rāgiṇīs or modes of music personified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झूणि|झूणिः
झूणि झूणि, इस्, f. a kind of betel-nut; a<BR>voice or communication from heaven boding ill-luck,<BR>evil omen; a thicket &c. (= कठिन.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झूष्
झूष् झूष्, cl. 1. P. झूषति, to hurt,<BR>kill; (a various reading for यूष्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झॄ
झॄ झॄ (another form of rt. 1. जॄ), cl. 4. 9.<BR>P. झीर्यति, झृणाति, &c., to become old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झोड|झोडः
