झौलिक
झौलिक झौलिक, a small bag for betel &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झ्यु
झ्यु झ्यु, cl. 1. P. झ्यवति, &c., to go<BR>or move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ञ|ञः
ञ 1. ञ, the nasal belonging to the palatal<BR>class of letters. It only really occurs in conjunction<BR>with palatal consonants; and when preceding च्, छ्,<BR>has much the sound of न् in inch; when preceding<BR>ज्, झ्, much the sound of n in singe.<BR>—न-कार, अस्,<BR>m. the letter or sound ञ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ञ|ञः
ञ 2. ञ, अस्, m. a singer; any jingling or<BR>inarticulate sound; a heretic, an apostate; an ox; a<BR>N. of Śukra, regent of the planet Venus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ट|टं|टः
ट 1. ट, the eleventh consonant of the San-<BR>skṛt alphabet and first of the third class or cerebrals;<BR>it has much the sound of त् in true, but properly pro-<BR>nounced by keeping back the tip of the tongue and<BR>slightly turning it upwards.<BR>—ट-कार, अस्, m. the<BR>letter or sound ट्.<BR>—ट-वर्ग, अस्, m. the cerebral<BR>consonants collectively.<BR>—टवर्गीय, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>belonging to the cerebral class of consonants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ट|टं|टः
ट 2. ट, अस्, m. sound or an imitative<BR>sound like the twang of a bow-string &c.; a dwarf;<BR>a quarter, a fourth; (आ), f. the earth; an oath, con-<BR>firming an assertion by ordeal &c.; (अम्), n. a hol-<BR>lowed cocoa-nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टक्कदेश|टक्कदेशः
