टक्कदेशीय|टक्कदेशीयः
टक्कदेशीय, अस्, m. a kind of pot-herb, Cheno-<BR>podium Album; [cf. वास्तूक.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टक्कर|टक्करः
टक्कर टक्कर, अस्, m. the clapping of cym-<BR>bals or a drum (?), a blow, knock, rap (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टक्किबुद्ध
टक्किबुद्ध टक्किबुद्ध, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टक्व
टक्व टक्व, आस्, m. pl. = बाहीक; [cf. टक्क-<BR>देश.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टक्वर|टक्वरः
टक्वर टक्वर, अस्, m. an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टगर|टगरः
टगर टगर, अस्, आ, अम्, squint-eyed [cf.<BR>केकर and टेरक]; (अस्), m. borax; wanton play<BR>or sport; wandering of the mind, confusion, per-<BR>plexity; an object of sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्क्|टंक्
टङ्क् टङ्क्, cl. 10. 1. P. टङ्कयति, टङ्कति,<BR>to bind, tie; cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्क|टंक|टंकं|टंकः|टङ्कः
टङ्क, अस्, अम्, m. n. (according to some only<BR>m.; said to be fr. the preceding), a spade, hoe,<BR>hatchet, stone-cutter's chisel or similar instrument;<BR>a sword, scimitar, sacrificial hatchet or knife; a scab-<BR>bard, the sheath of a sword (only m.); a peak or<BR>crag shaped like the edge of a hatchet, the edge or<BR>declivity of a hill, slope; a chasm, cleft; anger, wrath;<BR>pride, arrogance; a weight (of silver) equal to four<BR>Māṣas or twenty-four Raktikās; the wood-apple<BR>or Feronia Elephantum, = नील-कपित्थ; the fruit<BR>of the wood-apple (n. only); borax; a stamped coin;<BR>(अस्, आ, अम्), m. f. n. the leg.<BR>—टङ्क-टीक, अस्, m.<BR>an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—टङ्क-पति, इस्, m. the master<BR>of the mint.<BR>—टङ्क-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having crags<BR>or declivities.<BR>—टङ्क-शाला, f. a mint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्कक|टंकक|टंककः|टङ्ककः
टङ्कक, अस्, m. a stamped coin especially of<BR>silver, silver money.<BR>—टङ्कक-पति, इस्, m. the<BR>master of a mint or superintendent of the silver coin.<BR>—टङ्कक-शाला, f. a mint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्कण|टंकण|टंकणं|टङ्कणः
टङ्कण टङ्कण, अस्, m. borax; (आस्), m. pl.,<BR>N. of a people in the north-east of Madhya-deśa;<BR>(अम्), n. binding, tying.<BR>—टङ्कण-क्षार, अस्,<BR>m. borax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0355-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्कानक|टङ्कानकः
टङ्कानक टङ्कानक, अस्, m. the mulberry,<BR>Morus Indica.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0356-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्कार|टंकार|टंकारः|टङ्कारः
टङ्कार टङ्-कार, अस्, m. (fr. टम्, imita-<BR>tive sound, and 1. कार), howling, a howl, a cry, a<BR>sound, a clang, the twang of a bow-string &c.; fame,<BR>notoriety; surprise, wonder, [cf. टाङ्-कार]; (ई), f.,<BR>N. of a shrub, commonly called Ṭekārī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0356-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्कारित
टङ्कारित, अम्, n. humming; (a various reading<BR>for झङ्कारित.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0356-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्ग|टंग|टंगं|टंगः|टङ्गः
टङ्ग टङ्ग, अस्, अम्, m. n. (another form of<BR>टङ्क above), a spade, a hoe; a sword, a peculiar<BR>kind of sword; a leg; (अस्), m. borax; a weight of<BR>four Māṣās.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0356-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टङ्गण|टंगण|टंगणं|टंगणः|टङ्गणः
