टाङ्क|टांकं
टाङ्क टाङ्क, अम्, n. a spirituous liquor pre-<BR>pared from the fruit of the Feronia Elephantum or a<BR>similar tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0356-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टाङ्कर|टांकर|टांकरः|टाङ्करः
