दिग्ध|दिग्धः
दिग्ध दिग्ध, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. 1. दिह्),<BR>smeared, anointed, plastered; soiled, polluted, defiled;<BR>(अस्), m. oil, ointment, unguent, oily substance; a<BR>name of fire; a poisoned arrow; a tale true or false.<BR>—दिग्ध-सह-शय, अस्, आ, अम्, lying in the<BR>midst of mud (?).<BR>—दिग्ध-हस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, having<BR>the hands smeared or soiled.<BR>—दिग्धाङ्ग (˚ध-<BR>अङ्˚), अस्, ई, अम्, having the limbs anointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0412-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिङ्क|दिङ्कः
