दिङ्नाग|दिङ्नागः
दिङ्नाग दिङ्-नाग, दिङ्-मण्डल, दिङ्-मा-<BR>तङ्ग. See under the compounds of 2. दिश्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0412-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिण्डि|दिंडि|दिंडिः|दिण्डिः
