दिरिपक|दिरिपकः
दिरिपक दिरिपक, अस्, अम्, m. or n. (?),<BR>a ball for playing with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0413-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिलीप|दिलीपः
दिलीप दिली-प, अस्, m. (said to be fr. दिली,<BR>a name for the ancient Hāstina-pura or modern<BR>Delhi, + प, a protector), N. of a king and ancestor<BR>of Rāma, son of Aṃśu-mat and father of Bhagī-<BR>ratha; [cf. दैलीपि.]<BR>—दिलीप-चरित, अम्, n., N.<BR>of the fifth chapter of the Pātāla-khaṇḍa or fourth<BR>part of the Padma-Purāṇa.<BR>—दिलीप-राज्, ट्, m. the<BR>king of Dilīpa.<BR>—दिलीप-वर-लाभ, अस्, m., N. of<BR>the sixth chapter of the Pātāla-khaṇḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0413-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिलीर|दिलीरं
