द्वैपारायणिक
द्वैपारायणिक द्वैपारायणिक, अस्, ई, अम्, one<BR>who performs the Pārāyaṇa twice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0446-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वैभाव्य
द्वैभाव्य द्वैभाव्य, अम्, n. double nature,<BR>division or separation into two.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0446-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वैमातुर|द्वैमातुरः
द्वैमातुर द्वैमातुर, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. द्वि-<BR>मातृ), having two mothers, i. e. a natural mother<BR>and a step-mother; having another mother, having<BR>two different mothers (as two brothers); (अस्), m.<BR>an epithet of Gaṇeśa [cf. द्विमातृ-ज]; of Jarā-<BR>sandha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0446-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वैमातृक|द्वैमातृकः
