द्वैयोग्य
द्वैयोग्य द्वैयोग्य, अम्, n. (fr. द्वि-योग),<BR>a combination of two.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0446-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वैरथ|द्वैरथं|द्वैरथः
द्वैरथ द्वैरथ, अम्, n. (fr. द्वि-रथ),<BR>‘chariot-duel,’ a single combat in chariots, single<BR>combat in general; (अस्, ई, अम्), relating to a single<BR>combat in chariots; (अस्), m. an adversary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0446-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वैराज्य|द्वैराज्यं
द्वैराज्य द्वैराज्य, अम्, n. (fr. द्वि-राजन्), a<BR>dominion divided between two princes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0446-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वैरात्रिक
