निष्कौशाम्बि|निष्कौशांबि
निष्कौशाम्बि निष्-कौशाम्बि, इस्, इस्, इ, one<BR>who has left Kauśāmbī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0507-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्रम्
निष्क्रम् निष्-क्रम् (निस्-क्रम्), cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-क्रामति, -क्रमते, -क्रमितुम् or -क्रामितुम्, to<BR>go out, come forth, go from home, depart; to make<BR>an exit from the stage: Caus. -क्रामयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>cause to go out or depart, to drive out, expel, to deliver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0507-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्रम|निष्क्रमः
निष्-क्रम, अस्, m. going out, coming forth;<BR>departing from (with abl.); exit; degradation, loss<BR>of caste, inferiority of tribe, family, &c.; any intel-<BR>lectual faculty (as intelligence, attention, comprehen-<BR>sion, &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0507-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्रमण|निष्क्रमणं
निष्-क्रमण, अम्, n. going forth or out; taking<BR>a child for the first time out of the house in the<BR>fourth month after birth to see the sun, (considered<BR>as an essential ceremony, Manu II. 34.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0507-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्रमणिका
निष्-क्रमणिका, f. the ceremony of taking a<BR>child out of the house for the first time in its<BR>fourth month to see the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0507-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्रमणित
निष्-क्रमणित, अस्, आ, अम्, a child taken out<BR>for the first time in the fourth month after birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0507-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्रम्य
निष्-क्रम्य, ind. having gone out, going forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0507-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्रान्त|निष्क्रान्तः
निष्-क्रान्त, अस्, आ, अम्, gone out, departed,<BR>come forth; (in dramatic language) exit, exeunt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0507-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्रय|निष्क्रयः
निष्क्रय निष्-क्रय. See निष्-क्री, p. 508.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0507-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्रिय|निष्क्रियं
निष्क्रिय निष्-क्रिय, अस्, आ, अम्, inactive;<BR>abstaining from ceremonial rites, not performing<BR>religious ceremonies; (अम्), n. a term for Brahma<BR>or the Supreme Spirit.<BR>—निष्क्रिय-ता, f. inactivity,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">Page0508-a+ 72</a>]<BR>idleness, negligence.<BR>—निष्क्रियात्म-ता (˚य-आत्˚),<BR>f. non-performance of appointed acts, habitual neglect<BR>of prescribed duties, inactivity, laziness, idleness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0507-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्री
निष्क्री निष्-क्री (निस्-क्री), cl. 9. P. A. -क्री-<BR>णाति, -णीते, -क्रेतुम्, P. to buy off, to redeem or<BR>ransom from (with abl.); A. to redeem or ransom<BR>one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्रय|निष्क्रयः
निष्-क्रय, अस्, m. redemption, ransom; reward;<BR>price, hire, wages; acquittance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्रयण|निष्क्रयणं
निष्-क्रयण, अस्, ई, अम्, redeeming, ransoming;<BR>(अम्), n. redemption, ransom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्रीति|निष्क्रीतिः
निष्-क्रीति, इस्, f., Ved. redeeming, redemption.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्रोध
निष्क्रोध निष्-क्रोध, अस्, आ, अम्, free from<BR>wrath, not angry, not angry with (with gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्लेश
निष्क्लेश निष्-क्लेश, अस्, आ, अम्, (with Bud-<BR>dhists) free from (ten) moral faults.<BR>—निष्क्लेश-<BR>लेश, अस्, आ, अम्, not suffering the least pain, quite<BR>happy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्वथ्
निष्क्वथ् निष्-क्वथ् (निस्-क्वथ्), Caus. -क्वा-<BR>थयति, -यितुम्, to boil down, thicken by boiling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्क्वाथ|निष्क्वाथः
निष्-क्वाथ, अस्, m. a decoction, broth, soup.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्खन्
निष्खन् निष्-खन् (निस्-खन्), cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-खनति, -ते, -खनितुम्, to dig out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्खिदम्
निष्खिदम् निष्-खिदम्, Ved. probably for<BR>नि-खिदम्, an inf. form of नि-खिद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्टक्वन्
निष्टक्वन् निष्-टक्वन्, आ, अरी, अ (fr. rt. तक्<BR>with निस्), Ved. escaping (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्टप्
निष्टप् निष्-टप् (निस्-तप्), cl. 1. P. -टपति,<BR>-टप्तुम्, to singe, scorch; to heat thoroughly,<BR>anneal, to purify by heat, free from impurities; to<BR>roast; to fry; to toast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्टपन|निष्टपनं
निष्-टपन, अम्, n. burning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्टप्त
निष्-टप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, burnished, made bright;<BR>well cooked, well dressed or done.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्टर्क्य
निष्टर्क्य निष्-टर्क्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. तर्क्<BR>with निस्), Ved. to be opened by unscrewing, to be<BR>loosened by untwisting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्टवैश्य
निष्टवैश्य निष्ट-वैश्य, अस्, m., N. of a<BR>man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्टानक|निष्टानकः
निष्टानक नि-ष्टानक, अस्, m. (fr. rt. स्तन्<BR>with नि = निस्), roar, murmur, murmuring, rustling;<BR>(अस्, आ, अम्), speaking loud; causing to cry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्टिग्री
निष्टिग्री निष्टिग्री, f., Ved., N. of the<BR>mother of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्टुर्
निष्टुर् निष्-टुर्, ऊर्, ऊर्, ऊर् (fr. rt. तॄ with<BR>निस्), Ved. one who has no conqueror, unconquered;<BR>(Sāy.) an overcomer of enemies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ट्य|निष्ट्यः
निष्ट्य निष्ट्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. निस्), Ved. ex-<BR>ternal, foreign, strange; exotic, coming from abroad;<BR>(अस्), m. a man of one of the outcast or barbarous<BR>tribes, a Cāṇḍāla, a Mleccha; (आ), f. a particular<BR>Nakṣatra also called Svātī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठ|निष्ठः
निष्ठ नि-ष्ठ, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. स्था with<BR>नि or in some senses with निस्), staying or being in<BR>or on, situated on, grounded on; depending on,<BR>resting on, referring to, relating to; intent on, de-<BR>voted to, attached to, practising; versed in, skilled<BR>in; believing in; (1. नि-ष्ठा), f. position, condition,<BR>state, stand-point, basis, foundation; devotion or<BR>attachment to, uniform practice or profession; ex-<BR>celling in, conversancy with, skill, eminence, excel-<BR>lence, perfection; believing in, faith; conclusion,<BR>end, termination, (sometimes at the end of adj. comp.,<BR>e. g. अपभ्रंश-निष्ठ, अस्, आ, अम्, ending in a<BR>fall); the end or catastrophe of a drama, conclusion<BR>of a fable, accomplishment, completion; culminating<BR>point; disappearance, destruction, death, fixed time<BR>of life; fixed or certain knowledge, ascertainment,<BR>certainty; a technical term for the past participle<BR>affixes त and तवत् (or with their indicatory letters<BR>क्त and क्तवतु); asking, begging; suffering,<BR>trouble, distress, anxiety.<BR>—निष्ठा-गत, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">Page0508-b+ 74</a>]<BR>gone to perfection, attaining perfection, (a term<BR>applied to a class of Buddhist deities.)<BR>—निष्ठान्त<BR>(˚ठा-अन्˚), अस्, m. end, conclusion.<BR>—निष्ठा-वत्,<BR>आन्, अती, अत्, possessed of complete knowledge, per-<BR>fect, complete, consummate, fulfilling all religious<BR>duties.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठा
2. नि-ष्ठा, आस्, आस्, अम् (नि for निस्), Ved. excel-<BR>ling, eminent, leading; staying or being in (=<BR>नि-ष्ठ); (आस्), m. a leader, guide; (Sāy.) station,<BR>position.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठान|निष्ठानं
नि-ष्ठान, अम्, n. sauce, condiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठानक
निष्ठानक, अस्, m., N. of a Nāga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठाव
नि-ष्ठाव, अस्, आ, अम् (नि for निस्), Ved. con-<BR>cluding, deciding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठित|निष्ठितं
नि-ष्ठित, अस्, आ, अम् (नि may be for निस्),<BR>staying in, being in or on; engaged in, attached to,<BR>devoted to; versed in, skilled in, conversant with;<BR>firm, fixed; certain, ascertained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठिव्
निष्ठिव् नि-ष्ठिव् or -ष्ठीव्, cl. 1. and 4. P.<BR>-ष्ठीवति, -ष्ठीव्यति, -ष्ठेवितुम्, to spit, spit<BR>out, eject from the mouth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठीव|निष्ठीवं|निष्ठीवः
नि-ष्ठीव, अस्, अम्, m. n. spitting, spitting out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठीवन|निष्ठीवनं
नि-ष्ठीवन or नि-ष्ठीवित, अम्, n. spitting,<BR>spitting out, ejecting anything from the mouth.<BR>—निष्ठीवन-शराव, अस्, अम्, m. n. a spitting-<BR>box, spittoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठेव|निष्ठेवं|निष्ठेवः
नि-ष्ठेव, अस्, आ, अम्, m. f. n. or निष्ठेवन,<BR>अम्, n. spitting, spitting out, ejecting anything from<BR>the mouth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठ्यूत|निष्ठ्यूतं
नि-ष्ठ्यूत, अस्, आ, अम्, spit out, ejected from<BR>the mouth, cast or thrown out; uttered; directed,<BR>despatched (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठ्यूति|निष्ठ्यूतिः
नि-ष्ठ्यूति, इस्, f. spitting, spitting out; (less<BR>correctly written नि-ष्ठूति.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठुर|निष्ठुरं
निष्ठुर नि-ष्ठुर, अस्, आ, अम् (said to be fr.<BR>rt. स्था), hard, rough, rugged; harsh, coarse, gruff,<BR>cruel, severe, austere; contumelious (as speech).<BR>—निष्ठुर-ता, f. or निष्ठुर-त्व, अम्, n.<BR>harshness of speech, coarseness, reviling, abuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठुरक
निष्ठुरक, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठुरिक
निष्ठुरिक, अस्, m., N. of a Nāga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठूरिन्
निष्ठूरिन्, ई, इणी, इ, rough, coarse; [cf. स्थूरिन्,<BR>स्थूल.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ठ्यूति|निष्ठ्यूतिः
निष्ठ्यूति नि-ष्ठ्यूति. See above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्ण
निष्ण नि-ष्ण, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. स्ना with<BR>नि), clever, skilful, experienced; [cf. नि-श्न, नदी-<BR>ष्ण.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्णात|निष्णातः
नि-ष्णात, अस्, आ, अम्, deeply versed in, skilful,<BR>clever, conversant, learned; perfect, superior; (in<BR>law) agreed upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पक्व|निष्पक्वं
निष्पक्व निष्-पक्व, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. पच्<BR>with निस्), decocted, infused, boiled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पङ्क|निष्पंक
निष्पङ्क निष्-पङ्क, अस्, आ, अम्, free from<BR>mud or filth, pure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पत्
निष्पत् निष्-पत्, cl. 1. P. -पतति, -पतितुम्,<BR>to fly out of (with abl.), rush out, jump out, hasten<BR>out, come forth, issue, depart; to fall out; to fly<BR>away; to spring from: Caus. -पातयति, &c., to<BR>cause to fall out or fly out; to ruin; to destroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पतत्
निष्-पतत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, issuing, going forth<BR>or out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पतन|निष्पतनं
निष्-पतन, अम्, n. going quickly forth, rushing<BR>out; issuing quickly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पतिष्णु
निष्-पतिष्णु, उस्, उस्, उ, rushing or running<BR>out, hastening out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पताक
निष्पताक निष्-पताक, अस्, आ, अम्, having<BR>no flag or banner.<BR>—निष्पताक-ध्वज, अस्, m. a<BR>flag-staff without a banner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पतिसुता
निष्पतिसुता निष्-पति-सुता, f. having no<BR>husband and no sons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पत्ति|निष्पत्तिः
निष्पत्ति निष्-पत्ति. See 2. निष्-पद्, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पत्त्र
निष्पत्त्र निष्-पत्त्र, अस्, आ, अम्, having no<BR>leaves, leafless; without feathers, unfeathered; [cf. अ-<BR>निष्पत्त्रम्]; (अस्, अम्), m. n. (?), the clove tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पत्त्रक
निष्-पत्त्रक, अस्, आ, अम्, leafless; (इका), f. the<BR>plant Capparis Aphylla (see करीर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पत्त्रय
निष्-पत्त्रय, Nom. P. -पत्त्रयति, &c., to<BR>deprive of leaves, make leafless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पत्त्राकृ
निष्पत्त्रा-कृ, cl. 8. P. A. -करोति, -कुरुते,<BR>-कर्तुम्, to pierce with an arrow so that the feathers<BR>come through on the other side.<BR>—निष्पत्त्रा-<BR>कृति, इस्, f. causing excessive bodily pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पद्
निष्पद् 1. निष्-पद् or निष्पाद्, -पात्, -पदी,<BR>पात्, footless, having no feet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पद
निष्-पद, अस्, आ, अम्, having no feet.<BR>—निष्-<BR>पद-यान, अम्, n. a vehicle moving without feet<BR>(as a ship &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पद्
निष्पद् 2. निष्-पद्, cl. 4. A. -पद्यते,<BR>-पत्तुम्, to come forth from, issue, spring from,<BR>spring up, arise, be produced, be accomplished, be<BR>brought about or effected; to be prepared; to become<BR>ripe, ripen: Caus. -पादयति, -यितुम्, to produce,<BR>bring about, accomplish, effect, perform; to make<BR>ripe, cause to ripen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पत्ति|निष्पत्तिः
निष्-पत्ति, इस्, f. going forth or out, birth, pro-<BR>duction; completion, conclusion, termination, con-<BR>summation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पद्
3. निष्-पद्, त्, f., Ved. excrement; (according to<BR>Sāy. = निर्-गच्छत्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पन्न|निष्पन्नः
निष्-पन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, gone forth or out,<BR>sprung up, arisen, born, descended, produced, brought<BR>about, effected, completed, concluded, accomplished,<BR>done, finished, ready.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पादक
निष्-पादक, अस्, इका, अम्, performing, accom-<BR>plishing, effective.<BR>—निष्पादक-त्व, अम्, n. effec-<BR>tiveness, power of achieving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पादन|निष्पादनं
निष्-पादन, अम्, n. doing, effecting, accom-<BR>plishing; concluding; producing, causing, engen-<BR>dering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पादित|निष्पादितं
निष्-पादित, अस्, आ, अम्, done, effected, made,<BR>produced, prepared, achieved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पाद्य|निष्पाद्यं
निष्-पाद्य or निष्-पादनीय or निष्-पादि-<BR>तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be effected or accomplished,<BR>capable of being performed, achievable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पाद्यमान
निष्-पाद्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being effected or<BR>done, being in the course of accomplishment or<BR>completion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पन्द|निष्पंद|निष्पन्दः
निष्पन्द नि-ष्पन्द, अस्, आ, अम् (नि for निस्<BR>+ स्पन्द), motionless, immovable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पराक्रम
निष्पराक्रम निष्-पराक्रम, अस्, आ, अम्, des-<BR>titute of power or prowess, powerless, weak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्परिकर
निष्परिकर निष्-परिकर, अस्, आ, अम्, with-<BR>out preparations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्परिग्रह|निष्परिग्रहः
निष्परिग्रह निष्-परिग्रह, अस्, आ, अम्, with-<BR>out property, having no property; (अस्), m. an<BR>ascetic without family or dependants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्परिच्छद
निष्परिच्छद निष्-परिच्छद, अस्, आ, अम्, hav-<BR>ing no retinue or train, without a court.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्परिदाह
निष्परिदाह निष्-परिदाह, अस्, आ, अम्, not<BR>liable to be burnt, incombustible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्परीक्ष
निष्परीक्ष निष्-परीक्ष, अस्, आ, अम्, not<BR>examining or testing accurately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्परीहार
निष्परीहार निष्-परीहार, अस्, आ, अम्, not<BR>avoiding; not observing caution; (अम्), ind. not so<BR>as to avoid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पर्यन्त|निष्पर्यंत
निष्पर्यन्त निष्-पर्यन्त, अस्, आ, अम्, having<BR>no limits, boundless, unbounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पवण
