निष्पा
निष्पा 1. निष्-पा (निस्-पा, see rt. 1. पा),<BR>cl. 1. 2. P. -पिबति or -पिवति, -पाति, -पातुम्, Ved.<BR>to drink out, drink up, drink from (with abl.), to<BR>empty by drinking, exhaust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पान
निष्-पान, अम्, n. drinking out, drinking up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पीत
निष्-पीत, अस्, आ, अम्, drunk up, dried up,<BR>sucked up, exhausted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पा
निष्पा 2. निष्-पा (निस्-पा, see rt. 3. पा),<BR>cl. 2. P. -पाति, -पातुम्, to defend from (with abl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0508-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पादक
निष्पादक निष्-पादक, &c. See under 2.<BR>निष्-पद्, p. 508, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0509-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पाप
निष्पाप निष्-पाप, अस्, आ, अम्, free from<BR>sin, sinless, guiltless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0509-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पार
निष्पार निष्-पार, अस्, आ, अम्, without boun-<BR>daries, boundless, unlimited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0509-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पालक
निष्पालक निष्-पालक, अस्, आ, अम्, without<BR>protector or guardian, unprotected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0509-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पिश्
निष्पिश् निष्-पिश् (निस्-पिश्), cl. 6. P. A.<BR>-पिंशति, -ते, -पेशितुम्, Ved. to tear the flesh of an<BR>animal from the skin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0509-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पिष्
निष्पिष् निष्-पिष् (निस्-पिष्), cl. 7. P. -पि-<BR>नष्टि, -पेष्टुम्, to grind, crush, pound, bruise,<BR>triturate; to rub, rub the hands; to gnash the teeth:<BR>Caus. -पेषयति, -यितुम्, to destroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0509-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पिष्ट|निष्पिष्टः
निष्-पिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, ground, pounded, pul-<BR>verized, bruised, crushed, reduced to dust or powder;<BR>beaten, oppressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0509-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पेष|निष्पेषः
निष्-पेष, अस्, m. or निष्-पेषण, अम्, n.<BR>rubbing together, grinding, pulverizing, bruising;<BR>striking, clashing, hitting or throwing against; the<BR>noise or sound produced by striking or clashing;<BR>[cf. नैष्पेषिक.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0509-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पीड
निष्पीड निष्-पीड, अस्, आ, अम्, pressed out ?<BR>(probably incorrect for निष्-पीत), sucked out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0509-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पीत
निष्पीत निष्-पीत. See 1. निष्-पा, p. 508.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0509-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

