पञ्चथु|पंचथु|पंचथुः|पञ्चथुः
पञ्चथु, उस्, m. time; the Koïl or Indian<BR>cuckoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0524-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

