परि-कल्पित, अस्, आ, अम्, settled, decided, agreed<BR>upon; made, invented; contrived, arranged; distri-<BR>buted, divided; provided with, furnished with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0538-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

