परि-क्रमत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, moving or wander-<BR>ing about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

