परिक्षव परि-क्षव, अस्, m. (fr. rt. क्षु<BR>with परि), Ved. (ill-omened) sneezing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिक्षा
परिक्षा परि-क्षा, f. (fr. rt. क्षै with<BR>परि?), clay, mud, dirt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिक्षाण
परि-क्षाण, अम्, n., Ved. that which is charred<BR>or burnt to a cinder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिक्षाम
परिक्षाम परि-क्षाम, अस्, आ, अम् (said to<BR>be fr. rt. क्षै with परि), excessively emaciated or<BR>wasted away, dried up, fallen away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिक्षि
परिक्षि परि-क्षि (see rt. 4. क्षि), cl. 5. 9.<BR>P. -क्षिणोति, -क्षिणाति, -क्षेतुम्, to destroy, put an<BR>end to: Pass. -क्षीयते, to waste away, decay, become<BR>exhausted; to be brought low; to become poor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिक्षय|परिक्षयः
परि-क्षय, अस्, m. disappearing, ceasing, failure,<BR>ruin; dissolution, decay, waste, destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिक्षीण
परि-क्षीण, अस्, आ, अम्, vanished, disappeared;<BR>quite decayed, wasted, emaciated, worn away; ex-<BR>hausted; brought low; entirely ruined; diminished,<BR>decreased; lost, destroyed; (in law) insolvent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिक्षित्
परिक्षित् परि-क्षित् or परी-क्षित् (see rt. 2.<BR>क्षि), Ved. spreading round or about, extending;<BR>(‘living about or among mankind’), an epithet of<BR>Agni; (औ), du. an epithet of heaven and earth; (त्),<BR>m., N. of an ancient king, a son of Abhi-manyu and<BR>father of Janam-ejaya; of a son of Kuru and father<BR>of another Janam-ejaya; of a son of A-vikṣit and<BR>brother of Janam-ejaya; of a king of A-yodhyā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिक्षिप्
परिक्षिप् परि-क्षिप्, cl. 6. P. A. -क्षिपति,<BR>-ते, -क्षेप्तुम्, to throw over or beyond; to put<BR>or lay or wind round; to throw about, surround,<BR>encircle, embrace; to overlay; to fetter; to throw<BR>or put into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिक्षिप्त|परिक्षिप्तं
परि-क्षिप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, thrown about, scattered,<BR>diffused; surrounded, encircled, intrenched; over-<BR>spread, overlaid; struck; left, abandoned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिक्षेप|परिक्षेपः
परि-क्षेप, अस्, m. throwing about, moving to<BR>and fro; scattering, spreading, diffusion; surround-<BR>ing, encircling, circumfluence; an encircling belt or<BR>boundary, that by which anything is surrounded;<BR>being surrounded; abandoning, leaving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिक्षेपक
परि-क्षेपक, अस्, आ, अम्, who or what scatters<BR>or disperses or surrounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिक्षेपिन्
परि-क्षेपिन्, ई, इणी, इ, who or what throws<BR>about, scatters, or distributes, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिक्षीव
परिक्षीव परि-क्षीव, अस्, आ, अम्, drunk,<BR>quite intoxicated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिखण्डय
परिखण्डय परि-खण्डय, Nom. P. -खण्-<BR>डयति, -यितुम्, to make small, humiliate, conquer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिखन्
परिखन् परि-खन्, cl. 1. P. A. -खनति,<BR>-ते, -खनितुम्, to dig round, dig up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिखा
परि-खा, f. a moat, ditch, trench or fosse<BR>round a town or fort; N. of a village in the North<BR>country.<BR>—परिखा-स्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, secure, im-<BR>pregnable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिखात|परिखातं
परि-खात, अस्, आ, अम्, dug round; (अस्), m. a<BR>furrow, rut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिखिद्
परिखिद् परि-खिद्, cl. 4. P. -खिद्यति,<BR>-खेत्तुम्, to be depressed, to feel uneasy or dis-<BR>turbed, to be afflicted: Caus. -खेदयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to trouble, afflict, injure, destroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिखिन्न
परि-खिन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, depressed, afflicted,<BR>exhausted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिखेद|परिखेदः
परि-खेद, अस्, m. lassitude, fatigue, sleepiness,<BR>exhaustion, being worn out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिख्या
परिख्या परि-ख्या, cl. 2. P. (in the non-<BR>conjugational tenses also A.) -ख्याति, -ख्यातुम्,<BR>to look round or about, look at, perceive (Ved.);<BR>to observe, regard, consider; to overlook, disregard<BR>(Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिख्यात|परिख्यातः
परि-ख्यात, अस्, आ, अम्, regarded as; called,<BR>named; celebrated, famous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिख्याति|परिख्यातिः
परि-ख्याति, इस्, f. reputation, fame, celebrity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगण
परिगण परि-गण, अस् or अम्, m. or n. (?),<BR>a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगणय
परिगणय परि-गणय, Nom. P. -गणयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to count over, reckon up completely, enu-<BR>merate one by one; to calculate, reckon, consider,<BR>reflect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगणन|परिगणनं
परि-गणन, अम्, n. or परि-गणना, f. com-<BR>plete or accurate enumeration, accurate calculation or<BR>statement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगणनीय
परि-गणनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be enumerated<BR>completely, to be stated accurately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगणित|परिगणितः
परि-गणित, अस्, आ, अम्, enumerated, calculated,<BR>reckoned; अ-परिगणित, अस्, आ, अम्, not counted,<BR>innumerable; अ-परिगणित-त्व, अम्, n. the state<BR>of not being enumerated, innumerableness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगण्य
परि-गण्य, अस्, आ, अम्, calculable, to be calculated<BR>or enumerated, to be stated with accuracy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगम्
परिगम् परि-गम्, cl. 1. P. -गच्छति, -गन्-<BR>तुम्, to go round, walk or step round; to wander<BR>over; to encircle, surround, embrace, inclose; to<BR>spread on all sides, extend everywhere, extend<BR>towards; to go away, depart, die; to come to or<BR>attain any state or condition (e. g. शान्तिम् परि-<BR>गम्, to become appeased): Caus. -गमयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to cause to go round, to pass or spend (time).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिग
परि-ग, अस्, आ, अम्, going round, surrounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगत|परिगतः
परि-गत, अस्, आ, अम्, gone round, encircled,<BR>surrounded, encompassed; diffused, spread; over-<BR>whelmed, distressed, overcome; filled, possessed of,<BR>affected by, afflicted with; known, understood; ob-<BR>tained, gained; performed; forgotten; obstructed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगम|परिगमः
परि-गम, अस्, m. or परि-गमन, अम्, n.<BR>going round, surrounding; spreading, extending;<BR>knowing, ascertaining; obtaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगमित
परि-गमित, अस्, आ, अम्, brought, conducted,<BR>driven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगर्ज्
परिगर्ज् परि-गर्ज्, cl. 1. P. -गर्जति, -गर्-<BR>जितुम्, to roar, cry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगर्वित
परिगर्वित परि-गर्वित, अस्, आ, अम्, very<BR>proud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगर्ह्
परिगर्ह् परि-गर्ह्, cl. 1. P. A., cl. 10. P.<BR>-गर्हति, -ते, -गर्हयति, -गर्हितुम्, -गर्हयितुम्,<BR>to blame greatly, censure, despise, abuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगर्हण|परिगर्हणं
परि-गर्हण, अम्, n. excessive blame, censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगल्
परिगल् परि-गल्, cl. 1. P. -गलति, -गलितुम्,<BR>to fall down or drop on all sides; to sink down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगलित
परि-गलित, अस्, आ, अम्, tumbled down; sunk;<BR>flowing, fluid; melted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगा
परिगा परि-गा, cl. 2. 3. P. -गाति, -जिगाति,<BR>गातुम्, to go round, go round in a circle; to spread<BR>everywhere or in all directions, permeate, pervade,<BR>overspread; to come near, approach, reach, come<BR>upon; to go out of the way; to disregard; to inves-<BR>tigate, ascertain, obtain knowledge of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगुणय
परिगुणय परि-गुणय, Nom. P. -गुण-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to repeat, reiterate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगुप्
परिगुप् परि-गुप्, cl. 1. P. -गोपायति, -गोप्-<BR>तुम्, to protect: Desid. A. -जुगुप्सते, to beware<BR>of, be on one's guard against (with abl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0539-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगै
परिगै परि-गै, cl. 1. P. -गायति, -गातुम्,<BR>to go about or walk round singing, to sing or cele-<BR>brate everywhere, proclaim to all the world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगीति
परि-गीति, इस्, f. a kind of metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिग्रह्
परिग्रह् परि-ग्रह् (Ved. परि-ग्रभ्), cl.<BR>9. P. A. -गृह्णाति, -णीते (Ved. -गृभ्णाति, -णीते),<BR>-ग्रहीतुम्, to take hold of, lay hold of on both<BR>sides; embrace, surround, encircle, enfold, envelop;<BR>fence round, hedge round; to wrap round, put<BR>round; to put on (as a dress or ornament), to<BR>dress; to seize, clutch, hold, grasp, catch, take or<BR>carry along with one; to support; to take possession<BR>of, master, overpower, overturn; to take (in war);<BR>to accept, receive; to conceive, comprehend; to<BR>take (food); to take upon one's self, undertake, un-<BR>dergo; to receive (hospitably or kindly); to take<BR>(a wife), marry; to take (by the hand), assist; to<BR>have regard to, conform to, follow, adopt; to surpass,<BR>excel; (in Ved. gram.) to enclose (इति) between a<BR>word twice repeated, (see under परि-ग्रह.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगृहीत
परि-गृहीत, अस्, आ, अम्, taken hold of on both<BR>sides, grasped, clutched; embraced, surrounded;<BR>taken, accepted; admitted, consented to, assented<BR>to; followed, obeyed; opposed, checked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगृहीति|परिगृहीतिः
परि-गृहीति, इस्, f., Ved. grasping, comprehension;<BR>summing up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगृहीतृ
परि-गृहीतृ, incorrect form for परि-ग्रहीतृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगृह्य
1. परि-गृह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be taken or<BR>accepted, to be regarded, &c.; (आ), f. a woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिगृह्य
2. परि-गृह्य, ind. having taken or seized; in<BR>company with, together with, along with, along;<BR>considering, regarding.<BR>—परिगृह्य-वत्, आन्, अती,<BR>अत्, Ved. containing the word परि-गृह्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिग्रह|परिग्रहः
परि-ग्रह, अस्, m. laying hold of, seizing,<BR>grasping; surrounding, encircling; embracing, span-<BR>ning; enclosing, fencing round (the Vedi or sacrificial<BR>altar by means of three lines or furrows); wrapping<BR>round, putting on (a dress &c.); assuming (a form or<BR>shape); comprehension; taking together, summing<BR>up, sum, totality; taking, accepting, receiving, ac-<BR>ceptance [cf. अ-परिग्रह]; anything received, a<BR>present; assenting to, assent; taking possession of,<BR>attaining, obtaining; possession, property (e. g. अर्-<BR>थ-प्˚, possession of wealth; प्राण-प्˚, possession<BR>of vital spirit or life; परिग्रहम् परि-त्यज्य,<BR>having given up all one's property); choosing,<BR>selecting; claiming, claim; admitting or receiving<BR>any one (into one's house), entertaining; an enter-<BR>tainer; taking the hand, assisting, assistance; taking a<BR>wife (lit. taking her by the hand), marrying, marriage;<BR>a wife; a husband; honouring, favouring; reverence,<BR>homage; grace, favour, patronage, (त्वत्-परिग्रहात्,<BR>by thy favour); apprehending, understanding, com-<BR>prehension, conception; undertaking, performing;<BR>subjugation, making subservient; dominion; chas-<BR>tising, punishing, punishment; connection, concern,<BR>relation; adherents, dependants, attendants, train,<BR>retinue, family, suite, the seraglio of a prince, house-<BR>hold; a house, an abode; taking away, removing;<BR>an eclipse of the sun; root, origin; a curse, im-<BR>precation, oath; the rear or reserve of an army,<BR>(various reading for प्रति-ग्रह); (in Ved. gram.)<BR>the double mention of a word both before and after<BR>इति; the form which precedes the word इति.<BR>—परि-<BR>ग्रह-त्व, अम्, n. state of a wife, condition of<BR>being a wife, marriage.<BR>—परिग्रह-द्वितीय, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, accompanied by one's wife or family.<BR>—प-<BR>रिग्रह-मय, अस्, ई, अम्, consisting of a family.<BR>—परिग्रह-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, possessed of wealth,<BR>having property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिग्रहक
परि-ग्रहक, अस्, आ, अम्, grasping, taking hold<BR>of; undertaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिग्रहण|परिग्रहणं
परि-ग्रहण, अम्, n. wrapping round, putting on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिग्रहिन्
परि-ग्रहिन्, ई, इणी, इ, possessing, attached to<BR>worldly possessions or property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिग्रहीतृ
परि-ग्रहीतृ, ता, त्री, तृ, taking hold of; one<BR>who assists, an assister, assisting; one who receives<BR>(another into his house), an adoptive father; (ता),<BR>m. a husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिग्राह|परिग्राहः
परि-ग्राह, अस्, m. the fencing round (of the<BR>Vedi or sacrificial altar with three lines or furrows;<BR>if of the northern altar, called उत्तर-परिग्राह;<BR>if of the eastern, पूर्व-परिग्राह).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिग्राह्य
परि-ग्राह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be treated kindly or<BR>hospitably, to be addressed with kind words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिग्लै
परिग्लै परि-ग्लै, cl. 1. P. (ep. also A.)<BR>-ग्लायति (-ते), -ग्लातुम्, to be wearied out, be<BR>exhausted; to feel repugnance to or aversion from<BR>(with dat.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिग्लान
परि-ग्लान, अस्, आ, अम्, wearied out, languid,<BR>exhausted; averse from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघ|परिघः
परिघ परि-घ, अस्, m. (fr. rt. हन् with<BR>परि), an iron beam or bar used for locking or<BR>shutting a gate [cf. अर्गल]; a bar, obstacle, hin-<BR>drance (figuratively); an iron bludgeon or stick<BR>studded with iron, an iron club; a child which<BR>assumes a peculiar cross-position in birth; a line of<BR>clouds crossing the sun at sun-rise or sun-set; the<BR>gate of a palace, of a town, of a house; (in astron.)<BR>N. of the nineteenth Yoga; killing, striking, de-<BR>stroying, a blow; a pitcher, water-jar; a glass<BR>pitcher; N. of one of Skanda's attendants; N. of a<BR>Cāṇḍāla; of a certain virtuous man; (औ), m. du.<BR>two birds flying one on each side of a traveller<BR>(regarded as an omen).<BR>—परिघ-प्रांशु-बाहु,<BR>उस्, m. one whose arm is as long as an iron beam.<BR>—परिघ-बाहु, उस्, m. one whose brawny arm<BR>resembles a knotty club.<BR>—परिघोपम (˚घ-<BR>उप्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, resembling an iron club.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघात|परिघातः
परि-घात, अस्, m. killing, striking; removing<BR>out of the way, getting rid of; a club, an iron<BR>bludgeon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघातन|परिघातनं|परिघातनः
परि-घातन, अम्, n. striking, hurting, killing;<BR>a club or bludgeon armed with iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघातिन्
परि-घातिन्, ई, इनी, इ, destroying, annihilating;<BR>setting at nought; transgressing (e. g. in नृपाज्ञा-<BR>परिघातिन्, transgressing the commands of a king).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघट्
परिघट् परि-घट्, Caus. P. -घाटयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to strike, sound; to cause to vibrate (as the<BR>strings of a musical instrument).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघट्ट्
परिघट्ट् परि-घट्ट्, cl. 10. P. -घट्टयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to stir round or about; to press or touch on<BR>all sides; to rub; to stir up; to open.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघट्टन|परिघट्टनं
परि-घट्टन, अम्, n. stirring round, stirring up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघट्टित
परि-घट्टित, अस्, आ, अम्, stirred about, touched<BR>or rubbed repeatedly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघर्घर
परिघर्घर परि-घर्घर (?), a low mur-<BR>muring sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघर्म्य|परिघर्म्यः
परिघर्म्य परि-घर्म्य, अस्, m. a vessel for<BR>preparing the hot sacrificial beverage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघात|परिघातः
परिघात परि-घात. See under परि-घ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघूर्ण्
परिघूर्ण् परि-घूर्ण्, cl. 1. P. A. -घूर्णति,<BR>-ते, -घूर्णितुम्, to whirl about, shake to and fro,<BR>flutter, tremble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघृष्
परिघृष् परि-घृष्, cl. 1. P. -घर्षति,<BR>-घर्षितुम्, to rub or pound to pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघृष्टिक
परि-घृष्टिक, अस्, आ, अम्, (perhaps) one who<BR>eats only what is pounded (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघोष|परिघोषः
परिघोष परि-घोष, अस्, m. (fr. rt. घुष्<BR>with परि), sound, noise; thunder; improper speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिघ्रा
परिघ्रा परि-घ्रा, cl. 1. A. -जिघ्रते, -घ्रा-<BR>तुम्, to kiss passionately, cover with kisses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिजिघ्रमाण
परि-जिघ्रमाण, अस्, आ, अम् (Mahā-bh. Strī-p.<BR>616), kissing passionately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचक्र
परिचक्र परि-चक्र, अस्, m., N. of a section<BR>of the Dvā-viṃśaty-avadānaka; (आ), f., N. of a town.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचक्ष्
परिचक्ष् परि-चक्ष्, cl. 2. A. -चष्टे<BR>(see rt. चक्ष्), to overlook, pass over, despise;<BR>to reject; to declare (guilty), report, proclaim; to<BR>speak of, mention, relate; to admit, own, acknow-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">Page0540-c+ 77</a>]<BR>ledge; to call, name; to address (with acc.); to<BR>answer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचक्षा
परि-चक्षा, f., Ved. rejection, disapproval, dis-<BR>approbation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचक्ष्य
परि-चक्ष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. to be despised or<BR>disapproved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचतुर्दश
परिचतुर्दश परि-चतुर्दश, अस्, m. or परि-<BR>चतुर्दशन्, अ, m. f. n. pl. fully fourteen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचपल
परिचपल परि-चपल, अस्, आ, अम्, always<BR>moving about, very volatile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचर्
परिचर् परि-चर्, cl. 1. P. (ep. also A.)<BR>-चरति (-ते), -चरितुम् (ep. -चर्तुम्), to move or<BR>walk about, roam about, go round (with acc.); to<BR>attend upon, attend to, wait upon, serve, honour<BR>(with acc.): Caus. P. -चारयति, -यितुम्, to sur-<BR>round; A. -चारयते, to beset; to be served or<BR>waited upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचर|परिचरः
परि-चर, अस्, आ, अम्, roaming about; moving,<BR>flowing; movable (as certain verses which may be<BR>put at the beginning, middle, or end of a hymn);<BR>an attendant, companion, servant, assistant; a guard,<BR>patrol, city watchman, body-guard; a commander-in-<BR>chief (?); attendance, homage, service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचरण|परिचरणः
परि-चरण, अस्, m. an assistant, a servant;<BR>(अम्), n. going about; serving, attending upon,<BR>attention to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचरणीय
परि-चरणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be served or<BR>attended on; belonging to attendance, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचरितव्य
परि-चरितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be attended on<BR>or served or worshipped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचरितृ
परि-चरितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who serves or<BR>attends upon, an attendant, servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचर्य
परि-चर्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be attended upon or<BR>served or honoured; (आ), f. waiting upon, attend-<BR>ance, service, dependance; devotion, veneration,<BR>adoration, worship.<BR>—परिचर्या-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>attended upon, waited upon, honoured, respected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचार|परिचारः
परि-चार, अस्, m. attendance, service, homage; a<BR>place for walking; an attendant, assistant, a servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचारक|परिचारकः
परि-चारक, अस्, इका, अम्, attending; (अस्), m.<BR>an assistant, a servant, attendant, guard; (इका), f. a<BR>female attendant, waiting-maid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचारण
परि-चारण, अम्, n. attending upon, attendance,<BR>serving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचारिक|परिचारिकः
परि-चारिक, अस्, m. an attendant, assistant, a<BR>servant; (आस्), m. pl. fried grain; (इका), f. a female<BR>attendant or servant, a waiting-maid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचारिन्
परि-चारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, going about in all directions,<BR>moving about, movable; attending on, serving, paying<BR>homage to; (ई), m. an attendant, a servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचार्य|परिचार्य्य|परिचार्य्यः
परि-चार्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be served or obeyed,<BR>to be worshipped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचर्तन
परिचर्तन परि-चर्तन. See परि-चृत्,<BR>p. 541, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचर्मण्य|परिचर्मण्यं
परिचर्मण्य परिचर्मण्य, अम्, n. (fr. परि-<BR>चर्मन्), a strip of leather.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचल्
परिचल् परि-चल्, cl. 1. P. -चलति, -चलितुम्,<BR>to move, stir: Caus. -चालयति, -यितुम्, to cause to<BR>move round, turn round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचि
परिचि 1. परि-चि, cl. 5. P. A. -चिनोति, -नुते,<BR>-चेतुम्, to pile up, heap up, accumulate; to collect;<BR>to augment, increase; to gather in, acquire, obtain;<BR>to fill with: Pass. -चीयते, to be increased or aug-<BR>mented, to grow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0540-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिचय|परिचयः
