परिज्ञा 1. परि-ज्ञा, cl. 9. P. A. -जानाति, -जा-<BR>नीते, -ज्ञातुम्, to notice, observe, perceive, recognise;<BR>to learn, become acquainted with, ascertain, make<BR>sure of, know thoroughly, know exactly or accurately,<BR>comprehend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्ञप्ति|परिज्ञप्तिः
परि-ज्ञप्ति, इस्, f. conversation, discourse; recog-<BR>nition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्ञा
2. परि-ज्ञा, f. knowledge, accurate ascertainment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्ञात
परि-ज्ञात, अस्, आ, अम्, thoroughly known, ascer-<BR>tained, learnt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्ञातृ
परि-ज्ञातृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who knows or per-<BR>ceives, an observer, knower; wise, intelligent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्ञान|परिज्ञानं
परि-ज्ञान, अम्, n. perception, thorough know-<BR>ledge, learning, complete acquaintance, ascertainment,<BR>experience, discrimination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्ञाय
परि-ज्ञाय, ind. having fully known or ascer-<BR>tained, having become aware of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्ञेय
परि-ज्ञेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be recognised or ascer-<BR>tained; comprehensible; (अ-परिज्ञेय, incompre-<BR>hensible.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्मन्
परिज्मन् परि-ज्मन्, आ, आ, अ (probably fr.<BR>rt. गम् with परि), Ved. running or walking or<BR>driving round (said of the sun, of the chariot of the<BR>Aśvins, and of the Aśvins themselves, but according<BR>to the commentator applied to the wind); (आ), m.<BR>the moon; fire; (अन्), ind. (Ved. loc. used as adv.),<BR>on all sides, round about, everywhere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्रि
परिज्रि परि-ज्रि, इस्, इस्, इ, Ved. running<BR>round, hastening about, spreading everywhere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्वन्
परिज्वन् परि-ज्वन्, आ, m. the moon; a sa-<BR>crificer; a servant; fire; [? cf. परि-ज्मन्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिडी
परिडी परि-डी, cl. 1. A. -डयते, -डीयते,<BR>-डयितुम्, to fly round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिडीन|परिडीनं
परि-डीन or परि-डीनक, अम्, n. the flight of<BR>a bird in circles, flying round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणम्
परिणम् परि-णम्, cl. 1. P. A. -णमति, -ते,<BR>-णन्तुम्, to stoop (as an elephant about to strike),<BR>bend down, bend aside; to change into, be trans-<BR>formed into (with inst.); to become ripe or mature,<BR>ripen; to be digested; to become old, grow old; to<BR>set (as the sun); to elapse (as time): Caus. -णम-<BR>यति or -णामयति, to make ripe, ripen, mature;<BR>to bring to an end, pass (as the night); to bend<BR>one's self down, stoop, bend to one side: Pass. of<BR>Caus. -णाम्यते, to become ripe, ripen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणत|परिणतं|परिणतः
परि-णत, अस्, आ, अम्, bent down, bowed down,<BR>curved, deflected; stooping; changed or transformed<BR>into (with inst.); ripened, ripe, mature; digested;<BR>full grown, advanced in age, perfected; set (as the<BR>sun); elapsed; (अस्), m. an elephant stooping to<BR>strike with his tusks or that gives a side blow with<BR>the tusks; (अम्), n. capital, wealth accumulated for<BR>the sake of profit (?).<BR>—परिणत-शरद्, त्, f. the<BR>latter part of the autumn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणति|परिणतिः
परि-णति, इस्, f. bending down, bowing; change,<BR>alteration, transformation, transmutation; the be-<BR>coming ripe, ripening, ripeness, maturity; conse-<BR>quence, result, issue, effect; end, close, the last stage<BR>or conclusion of anything; fulfilment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणमन|परिणमनं
परि-णमन, अम्, n. change, transformation,<BR>changing into (with inst.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणमयितृ
परि-णमयितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, causing to bend or<BR>bow, bending; causing to ripen, bringing to maturity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणाम|परिणामः
परि-णाम, अस्, m. change, alteration, transform-<BR>ation; alteration of food, digestion; result, conse-<BR>quence, issue, effect, event; end, close, termination,<BR>last stage or state, conclusion [cf. दुष्-प्˚]; advance<BR>in age, growing old; lapse (of time); a particular<BR>figure of speech by which the properties of any<BR>object are transferred to that with which it is com-<BR>pared; (ए), ind. finally, lastly, in the end, afterwards;<BR>at the close of life.<BR>—परिणाम-दर्शिन्, ई, इनी, इ,<BR>looking forward to the issue or consequences (of any<BR>act or event), prepared for a change, provident;<BR>prudent.<BR>—परिणाम-दृष्टि, इस्, f. foresight, pro-<BR>vidence.<BR>—परिणाम-निरोध, अस्, m. obstruction<BR>(of felicity caused) by human vicissitude, as birth,<BR>growth, death, &c.<BR>—परिणाम-पथ्य, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, suited to a future state or condition.<BR>—परि-<BR>णाम-शूल, अस्, m. pain resulting from the changes<BR>of the food in indigestion, violent and painful indi-<BR>gestion, flatulence with pain, colic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणामक
परि-णामक, अस्, इका, अम्, effecting a change,<BR>causing vicissitudes (as time).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणामिक
परिणामिक, अस्, आ, अम्, resulting from change,<BR>produced by alteration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणामिन्
परि-णामिन्, ई, इनी, इ, changing, altering, subject<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">Page0542-a+ 74</a>]<BR>to transformation, changeable.<BR>—परिणामि-त्व, अम्,<BR>n. liability to change, mutability.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणिनंसु
परि-णिनंसु, उस्, उस्, उ, about to stoop, about to<BR>make a side thrust (with the tusks, as an elephant).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणह्
परिणह् परि-णह्, cl. 4. P. A. -णह्यति,<BR>-ते, -णद्धुम्, to bind round, tie round, gird,<BR>wrap round; to encircle, span, embrace, surround.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणद्ध
परि-णद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, bound round, wrapped<BR>round; of great span or compass, broad, large.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणहन|परिणहनं
परि-णहन, अम्, n. binding round, girding on,<BR>wrapping round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणाह|परिणाहः
परि-णाह, अस्, m. compass, circumference, extent,<BR>width, breadth, circumference of a circle, periphery;<BR>(sometimes spelt परी-णाह, q. v.)<BR>—परिणाह-<BR>वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having a wide compass or circum-<BR>ference, round, large, big.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणाहिन्
परि-णाहिन्, ई, इनी, इ, having a wide compass or<BR>circumference, big, large; (at the end of a comp.)<BR>having the circumference of (e. g. मत्तेभ-कुम्-<BR>भ-प्˚, q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीणह्
परी-णह्, त्, f., Ved. encompassing, pervading,<BR>spreading over; a trunk or chest on a carriage; N.<BR>of a place on the Saras-vatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीणाह|परीणाहः
परी-णाह, अस्, m. = परि-णाह above; a piece<BR>of common land encircling a village or city; an<BR>epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणिंसक
परिणिंसक परि-णिंसक, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt.<BR>निंस् with परि), tasting, eating; kissing; an eater<BR>(= भक्षयितृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणिंसा
परिणिंसा, f. tasting, eating; kissing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणिधा
परिणिधा परि-णि-धा, cl. 3. P. A. -द-<BR>धाति, -धत्ते, -धातुम्, Ved. to place or lay<BR>round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणिनंसु
परिणिनंसु परि-णिनंसु. See above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणिमा
परिणिमा परि-णि-मा (rt. 2. or 4. मा?),<BR>cl. 3. A. -मिमीते, -मातुम्, see Scholiast on Pāṇ.<BR>VIII. 4, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणिमे
परिणिमे परि-णि-मे, cl. 1. A. -मयते,<BR>मातुम्, see Scholiast on Pāṇ. VIII. 4, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणिर्मा
परिणिर्मा परि-णिर्-मा (rt. 4. मा), cl. 2. P.,<BR>3. 4. A. -माति, -मिमीते, -मायते, -मातुम्, to<BR>mark off, to limit; to settle, determine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणिष्ठा
परिणिष्ठा परि-णिष्ठा, f. perfect skill or<BR>conversancy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणिहन्
परिणिहन् परि-णि-हन्, cl. 2. P. -हन्ति,<BR>-हन्तुम्, to strike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणिघ्नत्
परि-णिघ्नत्, अन्, अती, अत्, striking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणी
परिणी परि-णी, cl. 1. P. A. -णयति, -ते<BR>(anom. perf. in epic poetry, परीणयाम्-आस),<BR>-णेतुम्, to lead about, to lead or conduct round,<BR>bear or carry round; (especially) to lead a bride<BR>and bridegroom or a bride round the sacrificial fire<BR>(with two acc.); to marry, (said of a bridegroom); to<BR>lead forward; to trace out, discover, investigate:<BR>Caus. -णाययति, -यितुम्, to pass or spend (time).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणय|परिणयः
परि-णय, अस्, m. leading round, (especially)<BR>leading the bride round the sacred fire, marriage,<BR>(नव-परिणया, a newly married woman.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणयन|परिणयनं
परि-णयन, अम्, n. the act of leading round,<BR>(especially) leading round the sacred fire; marrying,<BR>marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणाय|परिणायः
परि-णाय, अस्, m. leading round; moving a<BR>piece at chess, draughts, &c.; a move (at chess).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणायक|परिणायकः
परि-णायक, अस्, m. a leader, guide, (अ-परि-<BR>णायक, being without a guide); a husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणीत
परि-णीत, अस्, आ, अम्, led round; married; (in<BR>Mahā-bh. Vana-p. 13739, probably) completed,<BR>finished, executed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणेतृ
परि-णेतृ, ता, m. ‘one who leads round,’ a<BR>husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिणेय
परि-णेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be led round; (आ), f. to<BR>be led round the fire (as a bride), to be married.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितकन
परितकन परि-तकन, अम्, n. (fr. rt. तक्<BR>with परि), running round or about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितक्म्य
परि-तक्म्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. causing anxiety or<BR>uneasiness, insecure, unsafe, perilous, dangerous; (आ),<BR>f. error; night, darkness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितड्
परितड् परि-तड्, cl. 10. P. -टादयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to touch, strike against, strike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितन्
परितन् परि-तन् (see rt. 3. तन्), cl. 5. P.<BR>A. -तनोति, -तनुते, -तनितुम्, Ved. to stretch round,<BR>clasp round, embrace, surround.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितत्नु
परि-तत्नु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. stretching round,<BR>embracing, clasping round, surrounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीतत्
परी-तत्, त्, त्, त्, spread all around, extended in<BR>every direction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितप्
परितप् परि-तप्, cl. 1. P. -तपति, -तप्तुम्,<BR>to burn or scorch all round, burn excessively, set on<BR>fire, kindle; to feel or suffer pain; to mortify the<BR>body, undergo penance, practise austerities: Pass.<BR>-तप्यते (rarely -तप्यति), to feel or suffer pain;<BR>to undergo penance, mortify the flesh: Caus. -ताप-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to scorch; to cause great pain, tor-<BR>ment, torture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितप्त
परि-तप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, surrounded with heat,<BR>heated, scorched, burnt; tormented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितप्ति|परितप्तिः
परि-तप्ति, इस्, f. great pain or sorrow, anguish,<BR>torture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिताप|परितापः
