परितम्
परितम् परि-तम्, cl. 4. P. -ताम्यति, -त-<BR>मितुम्, to gasp for breath, to be oppressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितर्क्
परितर्क् परि-तर्क्, cl. 10. P. (ep. also A.)<BR>-तर्कयति, -ते, -यितुम्, to think about, reflect about,<BR>ponder upon; to reflect, consider; to examine (judi-<BR>cially).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितर्कण|परितर्कणं
परि-तर्कण, अम्, n. consideration, reflection;<BR>pondering upon (with gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितर्कित
परि-तर्कित, अस्, आ, अम्, thought about; examined;<BR>(अ-परितर्कित, not examined, unexpected.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितर्ज्
परितर्ज् परि-तर्ज्, cl. 1. P. (ep. also A.)<BR>-तर्जति, -ते, &c., to threaten, menace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितस्
परितस् परि-तस्, ind. (fr. परि), around,<BR>round about, all around, on all sides, on every side, to<BR>all sides, everywhere, in every direction, from all parts;<BR>round (as a prep. with acc. or gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिताप|परितापः
