परितिक्त
परितिक्त परि-तिक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, extremely<BR>bitter; (अस्, अम्), m. or n. (?), Melia Azedarach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितुद्
परितुद् परि-तुद्, cl. 6. P. A. -तुदति, -ते,<BR>-तोत्तुम्, to trample down, stamp upon, pound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितुष्
परितुष् परि-तुष्, cl. 4. P. (ep. also A.)<BR>-तुष्यति, -ते, -तोष्टुम्, to be quite satisfied with<BR>(with gen. or loc.); to feel complete satisfaction, be<BR>much pleased, be very glad: Caus. -तोषयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to satisfy completely, to please much or gratify;<BR>to appease; to flatter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितुष्ट|परितुष्टः
परि-तुष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, completely satisfied,<BR>much pleased, delighted, very glad.<BR>—परितुष्टात्-<BR>मन् (˚ट-आत्˚), आ, आ, अ, contented in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितुष्टि|परितुष्टिः
