परितोष|परितोषः
परि-तोष (rarely परी-तोष), अस्, m. complete<BR>satisfaction, gratification, contentment, pleasure, de-<BR>light, glee; delight in (with loc. or gen., e. g. गुणिनि<BR>परितोषः, delight in a virtuous person).<BR>—परि-<BR>तोष-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, satisfied, contented, glad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितोषण
परि-तोषण, अस्, आ, अम्, satisfying, gratifying,<BR>who or what satisfies or makes content; (अम्), n.<BR>satisfying, satisfaction, gratification.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

