परि-तोषयितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who satisfies<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-c" target="_blank">Page0542-c+ 77</a>]<BR>completely, who or what gratifies, pleasing or making<BR>very glad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितोषिन्
परि-तोषिन्, ई, इणी, इ, completely satisfied, con-<BR>tented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परितृद्
