परितर्पित
परि-तर्पित, अस्, आ, अम्, satisfied completely,<BR>sated; refreshed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परित्यज्
परित्यज् परि-त्यज्, cl. 1. P. -त्यजति, -त्यक्-<BR>तुम्, to abandon, forsake, desert, leave, discard, dis-<BR>miss, repudiate, disown, reject; to quit (a place); to<BR>give up, give away, surrender, abdicate, renounce,<BR>resign; (with देहम्) to forsake the body, die;<BR>(with प्राणान्) to resign the breath, give up the<BR>ghost; (with नावम्) to disembark; to shake off<BR>(as sleep); to leave over, leave a remainder; to leave<BR>a space or interval; to let go; to leave out; to put<BR>aside, neglect, disregard: Pass. -त्यज्यते, to be de-<BR>prived of, bereft of (with inst.); to lose: Caus.<BR>-त्याजयति, -यितुम्, to deprive a person (acc.) of<BR>anything (acc.); to rob, take away anything from<BR>any one (with two acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परित्यक्त
परि-त्यक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, left, quitted, deserted,<BR>abandoned; bereft of, deprived of, robbed of (with<BR>inst.); left, wanting; let go; let fly or discharged<BR>(as an arrow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परित्यक्तृ
परि-त्यक्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who abandons or<BR>deserts, leaving, abandoning, a forsaker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परित्यज्
परि-त्यज्, क्, क्, क्, forsaking, deserting, aban-<BR>doning; giving up, resigning; a forsaker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

