परित्राण|परित्राणं
परि-त्राण, अम्, n. protecting, protection, pre-<BR>serving, rescuing, rescue, deliverance, preservation,<BR>defence, means of defence or protection; self-defence;<BR>abstaining from; the hair of the body (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परित्रात
परि-त्रात, अस्, आ, अम्, protected; rescued, saved,<BR>preserved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परित्रातव्य
परि-त्रातव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be rescued or pre-<BR>served, to be protected or defended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परित्रातृ
परि-त्रातृ, ता, त्री, तृ, a protector, defender,<BR>rescuer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परित्वर्
