परिदंशित
परिदंशित परि-दंशित, अस्, आ, अम्, com-<BR>pletely armed, covered with mail, armed cap-a-pie.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

