परिदग्ध
परि-दग्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, burnt, scorched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदहन|परिदहनं
परि-दहन, अम्, n. burning, scorching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदाह|परिदाहः
