परिदा
परिदा 1. परि-दा, cl. 3. P. A. -ददाति,<BR>-दत्ते, -दातुम्, to give, give away entirely, sur-<BR>render, deliver up; to intrust, deposit with (with<BR>gen., dat., or loc. of the person); to present; to<BR>lend: Caus. -दापयति, -यितुम्, to cause to be<BR>delivered or given up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदा
2. परि-दा, f., Ved. giving one's self up to the<BR>favour or protection of another; surrender; devotion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदान|परिदानं
परि-दान, अम्, n. devotion; barter, exchange;<BR>restitution of a deposit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदाय
परि-दाय, ind. having given up or surrendered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदायिन्
परि-दायिन्, ई, m. a father (or another relation)<BR>who marries his daughter or ward to a man whose<BR>elder brother is not yet married.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीत्त
1. परी-त्त, अस्, आ, अम् (for परि-दत्त), given,<BR>given up; entirely given away, delivered up. (For 2.<BR>परी-त्त see परि-दो, col. 2.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदा
परिदा 3. परि-दा. See परि-दो, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदिव्
परिदिव् परि-दिव् or परि-देव् (see rts. 1.<BR>दिव् and देव्), cl. 1. 10. P. -देवति, -देवयति (rarely<BR>A. -ते), -यितुम्, to wail, lament, cry; to bewail,<BR>bemoan, weep for (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदेव|परिदेवः
परि-देव, अस्, m. lamentation, wailing, crying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदेवक
परि-देवक, अस्, इका, अम्, lamenting, who or<BR>what laments or complains.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदेवन|परिदेवनं
परि-देवन, अम्, आ, n. f. lamentation, bewailing,<BR>complaint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदेवित|परिदेवितं
परि-देवित, अस्, आ, अम्, lamented, bewailed;<BR>plaintive, lamenting, miserable; (अम्), n. lamentation,<BR>wailing, complaint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदेविन्
परि-देविन्, ई, इनी, इ, lamenting, bewailing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिद्यून
परि-द्यून, अस्, आ, अम्, sorrowful, sad, miserable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदिश्
परिदिश् परि-दिश्, cl. 3. 6. P. -दिदेष्टि,<BR>-दिशति, -देष्टुम्, to announce, make known; to<BR>signify (the existence of anything).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदिष्ट
परि-दिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, made known, known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदिह्
परिदिह् परि-दिह्, cl. 2. P. A. -देग्धि,<BR>-दिग्धे, -देग्धुम्, Ved. to coat or cover over,<BR>smear over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदीन
परिदीन परि-दीन, अस्, आ, अम्, excessively<BR>dejected or downcast, much afflicted.<BR>—परिदीन-<BR>सत्त्व, अस्, आ, अम्, distressed in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदुर्बल
परिदुर्बल परि-दुर्बल, अस्, आ, अम्, ex-<BR>tremely weak or decrepit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदृश्
परिदृश् परि-दृश्, cl. 1. P. -पश्यति, -द्रष्-<BR>टुम्, to look at, see, view, look upon, behold, regard,<BR>perceive; to regard mentally, consider, investigate,<BR>search, find out; to know; to frequent: Pass.<BR>-दृश्यते, to be observed or perceived; to appear,<BR>become visible: Caus. -दर्शयति, -यितुम्, to show;<BR>to set forth, expound, explain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिद्रष्टृ
परि-द्रष्टृ, टा, ट्री, टृ, a spectator, looker<BR>on; perceiver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदॄ
परिदॄ परि-दॄ, cl. 9. P. A. -दृणाति, -णीते,<BR>&c., Ved. to rend or destroy on all sides: Pass.<BR>-दीर्यते, to peel or drop off on all sides, to become<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">Page0543-b+ 75</a>]<BR>dropsical (the skin swelling and appearing ready to<BR>drop off).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदर|परिदरः
परि-दर, अस्, m. a disease of the gums in which<BR>the skin peels off and bleeds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदीर्ण
परि-दीर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, rent on all sides.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदेव्
परिदेव् परि-देव्. See परि-दिव्, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिदो
परिदो परि-दो or 3. परि-दा, cl. 2. P. -दाति,<BR>दातुम्, to cut or clip round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीत्त
2. परी-त्त, अस्, आ, अम्, clipped or cut round,<BR>incomplete, limited, confined, &c.; see p. 552, col. 1.<BR>(For 1. परी-त्त see under 1. परि-दा, col. 1.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिद्यून
परिद्यून परि-द्यून. See परि-दिव्, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिद्रु
परिद्रु परि-द्रु, cl. 1. P. -द्रवति, -द्रोतुम्,<BR>Ved. to run round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिद्वीप
परिद्वीप परि-द्वीप, अस्, m., N. of one of<BR>the sons of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिद्वेषस्
परिद्वेषस् परि-द्वेषस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, Ved.<BR>hating, completely hostile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधर्षण|परिधर्षणं
परिधर्षण परि-धर्षण, अम्, n. (fr. rt.<BR>धृष् with परि), assault, attack, injury, abuse,<BR>ill-treatment, rough usage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधा
परिधा परि-धा, cl. 3. P. A. -दधाति,<BR>-धत्ते, -धातुम्, to lay or put round, place or set<BR>round; to put round one's self, wrap round, put on,<BR>put on (a garment), dress (without a following acc.);<BR>to clothe; to surround, envelop, encompass; to<BR>cast (the eyes) round, turn the glance upon; (Ved.)<BR>to conclude or close (the recitation of a hymn):<BR>Caus. -धापयति, -यितुम्, to cause to put or wrap<BR>round, cause to put on, clothe with (with inst.);<BR>clothe any one in (with two acc.): Desid. -धित्सते,<BR>&c., to be about to put on, to wish to clothe one's<BR>self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधान|परिधानं
परि-धान or परी-धान, अम्, n. putting<BR>round, laying round (Ved.); wrapping round; put-<BR>ting on (a garment), dressing, clothing; that which<BR>is put on, a garment, (especially) an under garment,<BR>clothes, vesture, (गगण-परिधान, stark naked;<BR>cf. दिग्-अम्बर); closing or concluding (the reci-<BR>tation of a hymn).<BR>—परिधान-वल्कल, अम्, n.<BR>bark for clothing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधानीय|परिधानीयं
परिधानीय, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. forming the close<BR>or conclusion; (आ), f., scil. ऋच्, a concluding or final<BR>verse; (अम्), n. an under garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधापन
परि-धापन, अम्, n. causing to put on (a<BR>garment).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधापनीय
परि-धापनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, relating to investi-<BR>ture or the causing any one to put on (a garment &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधाय|परिधायः
परि-धाय, अस्, m. train, retinue, attendants;<BR>the hinder parts, posteriors; a receptacle for water,<BR>reservoir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधायक|परिधायकः
परि-धायक, अस्, m. a hedge, fence, enclosure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधि|परिधिः
परि-धि, इस्, m. that by which anything is sur-<BR>rounded or enclosed (said of the ocean as surrounding<BR>the earth), a fence, hedge, wall; a misty halo or<BR>circle round the sun or moon; a circle or disk of<BR>light, a glory; the horizon; circumference, compass;<BR>the circumference of a circle; the periphery of a<BR>wheel; a circle surrounding the globe, a great<BR>circle; epicycle; a frame of wood laid round a<BR>sacrificial fire to keep it together, (commonly in<BR>three pieces, called मध्यम, दक्षिण, उत्तर);<BR>a covering; the branch of the tree to which the<BR>victim at a sacrifice is tied (?); N. of a man.<BR>—प-<BR>रिधि-स्थ, अस्, आ, अम्, situated on the horizon;<BR>(अस्), m. a number of sentinels posted in a circle;<BR>a guard, body-guard; an aide-de-camp, an officer<BR>attendant on a king or general.<BR>—परिधी-पति-<BR>खेचर, अस्, m. an epithet of Śiva. (perhaps ‘the<BR>bird presiding over the horizon,’ परिधी for प-<BR>रिधि?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधेय|परिधेयं
परि-धेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be put round, wear-<BR>able; (अम्), n. an under garment (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहित
परि-हित, अस्, आ, अम्, stationed round; placed<BR>round, invested, put on, clothed, covered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधारण|परिधारणं
परिधारण परि-धारण. See under परि-<BR>धृ below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधाव्
परिधाव् परि-धाव्, cl. 1. P. (rarely A.)<BR>-धावति, -ते, -धावितुम्, to flow or stream round,<BR>to run round or about; go about; (मृगयाम् परि-<BR>धाव्, to go or move about hunting, to hunt);<BR>to drive about; to stream through, run through;<BR>to run or move round anything (with acc.); to run<BR>towards or after, to pursue: Caus. -धावयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to surround, encompass, encircle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधाविन्
परि-धाविन्, ई, इनी, इ, running round; (ई), m.,<BR>N. of the 46th (or 20th) of the 60 years' cycle<BR>of Jupiter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधीर
परिधीर परि-धीर, अस्, आ, अम्, very deep<BR>(as a tone or sound).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधूपित
परिधूपित परि-धूपित, अस्, आ, अम्, richly<BR>perfumed or scented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधूसर
परिधूसर परि-धूसर, अस्, आ, अम्, quite grey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधृ
परिधृ परि-धृ, cl. 10. P. -धारयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to carry about; to support, bear, suffer,<BR>endure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधारण|परिधारणं
परि-धारण, अम्, n. carrying about, supporting,<BR>suffering, enduring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिधार्य
परि-धार्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be preserved or<BR>maintained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिध्वंस्
परिध्वंस् परि-ध्वंस्, cl. 1. A. -ध्वंसते,<BR>-ध्वंसितुम्, to fall to pieces, fall away, decay;<BR>to be destroyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिध्वंस|परिध्वंसः
परि-ध्वंस, अस्, m. distress, disaster, ruin,<BR>trouble, toil; failing, failure; injury, destruction;<BR>leaving one's caste, loss of caste, mixture of castes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिध्वंसिन्
परि-ध्वंसिन्, ई, इनी, इ, falling away, falling off;<BR>destroying, ruining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिध्वस्त
परि-ध्वस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, destroyed, ruined;<BR>covered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिनिन्दा
परिनिन्दा परि-निन्दा, f. strong censure,<BR>severe blame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिनिम्न
परिनिम्न परि-निम्न, अस्, आ, अम्, much de-<BR>pressed, deeply hollowed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिनिर्जि
परिनिर्जि परि-निर्-जि, cl. 1. P. A. -जयति,<BR>-ते, -जेतुम्, to conquer, overpower thoroughly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिनिर्वपण|परिनिर्वपणं
परिनिर्वपण परि-निर्वपण, अम्, n. (fr. rt.<BR>वप् with परि-निस्), distributing, dispensing, giving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिनिर्विवप्सा
परि-निर्विवप्सा, f. (fr. the Desid.), desire of<BR>giving, a disposition to distribute, liberality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिनिर्विवप्सु|परिनिर्व्विवप्सु
परि-निर्विवप्सु, उस्, उस्, उ, intending to give<BR>much, desirous of giving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिनिर्वाण
परिनिर्वाण परि-निर्वाण, अस्, आ, अम्, quite<BR>extinguished, quite brought to an end; (अम्), n. the<BR>final extinction of the individual; N. of a place<BR>where Buddha disappeared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिनिर्वृति
परिनिर्वृति परि-निर्वृति, इस्, f. final libera-<BR>tion; complete emancipation of the soul from the<BR>body and exemption from future transmigration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिनिश्चय
परिनिश्चय परि-निश्चय, अस्, m. fixed opinion<BR>or resolution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिनिषद्
परिनिषद् परि-नि-षद्, cl. 1. 6. P. (Ved.<BR>also A.) -षीदति, -षत्तुम्, to sit round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिनिष्ठा
परिनिष्ठा परि-निष्ठा (fr. rt. स्था with परि<BR>and नि or निस्, see नि-ष्ठ), extreme limit, highest<BR>point; complete accomplishment; complete know-<BR>ledge or acquaintance, familiarity with anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिनिष्ठित
परि-निष्ठित, अस्, आ, अम्, completely skilled in<BR>or acquainted with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिनैष्ठिक
परि-नैष्ठिक, अस्, ई, अम्, the highest, utmost,<BR>most perfect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिन्यस्
परिन्यस् परि-न्य्-अस्, cl. 4. P. -अस्यति, -असि-<BR>तुम्, to stretch out, extend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिन्यस्त
परि-न्यस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, stretched out, extended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिन्यास|परिन्यासः
परि-न्यास, अस्, m. completing the sense of a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">Page0544-a+ 73</a>]<BR>passage; (in dramatic language) alluding to the<BR>development of the so-called seed or origin of the<BR>dramatic plot, [cf. वीज.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपक्व
परिपक्व परि-पक्व, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. 2. पच्<BR>with परि), completely cooked or dressed; finally<BR>baked; completely burnt (as a brick); digested; quite<BR>ripe, mature; highly cultivated or educated, very<BR>knowing or shrewd; near death or decay, approaching<BR>the end, about to pass away, decaying.<BR>—परिपक्व-<BR>ता, f. the state of being completely cooked; diges-<BR>tion; full maturity, perfection; shrewdness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपाक|परिपाकः
परि-पाक, अस्, m. being completely cooked or<BR>dressed; digestion; ripening, maturity, perfection;<BR>the fruit or consequence of an action, consequence;<BR>cleverness, shrewdness, experience.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपाकिन्
परि-पाकिन्, ई, इनी, इ, ripening, bringing to matu-<BR>rity; cooking; digesting; (इनी), f. the plant Ipo-<BR>mœa Turpethum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपाचन
परि-पाचन, अस्, आ, अम्, or परि-पाचयितृ, ता,<BR>त्री, तृ, cooking, bringing to maturity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपठ्
परिपठ् परि-पठ्, cl. 1. P. -पठति, -प-<BR>ठितुम्, to enumerate completely, detail, describe,<BR>mention, name, represent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपाठ|परिपाठः
परि-पाठ, अस्, m. complete enumeration, de-<BR>tail; (एन), ind. in detail, completely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपाठक
परि-पाठक, अस्, आ, अम्, enumerating in detail,<BR>describing the contents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपण|परिपणं
परिपण परि-पण, अम्, n. (fr. rt. 2. पण्<BR>with परि), capital, principal, stock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपणित
परि-पणित, अस्, आ, अम्, pledged, plighted, agreed,<BR>promised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपत्
परिपत् परि-पत्, cl. 1. P. -पतति, -पतितुम्,<BR>to fly round or about, to run round or about, run in<BR>all directions; to leap down, fall, throw one's self<BR>upon, attack: Caus. -पातयति, -यितुम्, to cause to<BR>fall down, shoot down, shoot off, throw into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपतन|परिपतनं
परि-पतन, अम्, n. flying round or about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपति|परिपतिः
परिपति परि-पति, इस्, m., Ved. the lord of<BR>all around; (Sāy.) a protector; (according to Mahī-<BR>dhara) flying about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपद्
परिपद् परि-पद्, त्, f., Ved. a snare, trap;<BR>walking about; a creature, living being; (Sāy.) a<BR>bird (as flying about).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपदिन्
परिपदिन् परिपदिन्, ई, m. an enemy; (pro-<BR>bably only a wrong reading for परि-परिन्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपन्थक|परिपन्थकः
परिपन्थक परि-पन्थक, अस्, m. one who<BR>obstructs the way, an antagonist, opponent, adver-<BR>sary, enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपन्थम्
परि-पन्थम्, ind. by the way, in the way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपन्थय
परि-पन्थय, Nom. P. -पन्थयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to obstruct the way, oppose, resist (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपन्थिक
परि-पन्थिक, अस्, m. an adversary, enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपन्थिन्|परिपंथिन्
परि-पन्थिन्, ई, m. an antagonist, opponent,<BR>enemy; a robber, highwayman, bandit.<BR>—परि-<BR>पन्थि-त्व, अम्, n. obstructing the way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपर|परिपरः
परिपर परि-पर (probably fr. परि re-<BR>peated), a tortuous course, roundabout way; [cf.<BR>अ-परिपर.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपरिन्
परिपरिन् परि-परिन्, ई, m. (probably fr.<BR>परि-परि), Ved. an antagonist, opponent, adversary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपवन|परिपवनः
परिपवन परि-पवन. See परि-पू, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपशव्य
परिपशव्य परि-पशव्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. परि-<BR>पशु), Ved. relating to the victim at a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपा
परिपा 1. परि-पा, cl. 1. P. -पिबति, -पातुम्,<BR>to drink before and after any one (Ved.); to drink<BR>up, sip up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपान
परि-पान, अम्, n., Ved. a drink, beverage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपीत
परि-पीत, अस्, आ, अम्, drunk up, sipped up,<BR>drunk together with (anything).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपा
परिपा 2. परि-पा, cl. 2. P. -पाति, -पातुम्,<BR>to protect or defend on every side, to guard, main-<BR>tain: Caus. -पालयति, &c., to protect, guard,<BR>govern; to keep, maintain; to wait, expect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपाण
परि-पाण, अस्, अम्, m. n., Ved. protection, de-<BR>fence, covert.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपालक
परि-पालक, अस्, इका, अम् (fr. the Caus.), guard-<BR>ing, protecting, defending, maintaining, supporting,<BR>sustaining; taking care of one's property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपालन|परिपालनं
परि-पालन, अम्, n. protecting, cherishing, de-<BR>fending, maintaining, sustaining, keeping; protec-<BR>tion, nurture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपालयितृ
परि-पालयितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, a protector, defender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपालित
परि-पालित, अस्, आ, अम्, protected, cherished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपाल्य
परि-पाल्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be protected or de-<BR>fended, to be maintained or observed; to be governed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपिपालयिषा
परि-पिपालयिषा, f. (fr. the Desid. of Caus.),<BR>desire of protecting or maintaining or sustaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपाक|परिपाकः
परिपाक परि-पाक, परि-पाकिन्, परि-पा-<BR>चन. See परि-पक्व, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपाटल
परिपाटल परि-पाटल, अस्, आ, अम्, of a pale<BR>red colour, pale red.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपाटी
परिपाटी परि-पाटी, f. succession, order,<BR>method, arrangement; arithmetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपाठ|परिपाठः
परिपाठ परि-पाठ. See परि-पठ्, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपाण्डु
परिपाण्डु परि-पाण्डु, उस्, उस्, उ, very light<BR>or pale.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपाद
परिपाद परि-पाद. See Gaṇa to Pāṇ.<BR>VI. 2, 184.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपार्श्व
परिपार्श्व परि-पार्श्व, अस्, आ, अम्, being at<BR>or by one's side, at the side, near; [cf. पारिपार्-<BR>श्विक.]<BR>—परिपार्श्व-चर, अस्, ई, अम्, going at or<BR>by one's side.<BR>—परिपार्श्व-तस्, ind. at or by the<BR>side, at both sides of (with gen.).<BR>—परिपार्श्व-<BR>वर्तिन्, ई, इनी, इ, being at the side, standing at or<BR>close to one's side.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपिञ्जर
परिपिञ्जर परि-पिञ्जर, अस्, आ, अम्, of a<BR>brownish red colour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपिष्
परिपिष् परि-पिष्, cl. 7. P. -पिनष्टि,<BR>-पेष्टुम्, to crush, trample; to beat, strike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपिष्ट
परि-पिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, crushed, trampled down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपिष्टक|परिपिष्टकं
परि-पिष्टक, अम्, n. lead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपीड्
परिपीड् परि-पीड्, cl. 10. P. -पीडयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to press all round, press together, compress,<BR>squeeze; to hug, embrace; to torment greatly, tor-<BR>ture, harass, vex; (in augury) to cover, cover up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपीडन|परिपीडनं
परि-पीडन, अम्, n. squeezing or pressing out,<BR>expressing; injuring, prejudicing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपीडा
परि-पीडा, f. pressing; vexing, torturing, tor-<BR>menting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपीडित
परि-पीडित, अस्, आ, अम्, pressed; embraced;<BR>tormented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपीत
परिपीत परि-पीत. See 1. परि-पा, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपुच्छय
परिपुच्छय परि-पुच्छय, Nom. A. परि-<BR>पुच्छयते, &c., to wag the tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपुट्
परिपुट् परि-पुट्, Pass. -पुट्यते, &c., to<BR>peel off, lose the bark or skin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपुटन|परिपुटनं
परि-पुटन, अम्, n. removing the peel or bark,<BR>peeling, desquamation, peeling off; losing the bark<BR>or skin.<BR>—परिपुटन-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, peeling<BR>off, dropping off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपोट|परिपोटः
परि-पोट, अस्, m. or परि-पोटक, अस्, m. peeling<BR>off, a particular disease of the ear.<BR>—परिपोट-वत्,<BR>आन्, अती, अत्, peeling off, losing the skin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपोटन
परि-पोटन, अम्, n. peeling off, desquamation,<BR>losing the bark or skin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपुष्
परिपुष् परि-पुष्, cl. 10. P. -पोषयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to cause to be cherished, to nourish, sustain,<BR>foster.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपुष्ट
परि-पुष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, nourished, cherished;<BR>amply provided with, abounding in.<BR>—परिपुष्ट-<BR>ता, f. the being nourished or supported, receiving<BR>nourishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपोषक
परि-पोषक, अस्, आ, अम्, nourishing, confirming,<BR>encouraging, furthering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपोषण|परिपोषणं
परि-पोषण, अम्, n. the act of nourishing,<BR>furthering, promoting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपोषणीय
परि-पोषणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be nourished, to<BR>be promoted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपुष्करा
परिपुष्करा परि-पुष्करा, f. the plant Cu-<BR>cumis Maderaspattanus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपू
परिपू परि-पू, cl. 9. P. A. -पुनाति, -नीते,<BR>-पवितुम्, to purify completely, strain; to lustrate;<BR>to become completely purified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपवन|परिपवनः
परि-पवन, अम्, n. cleaning, winnowing corn;<BR>a winnowing-basket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपूत|परिपूतं
परि-पूत, अस्, आ, अम्, pure, purified; completely<BR>winnowed, threshed, freed from chaff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपूज्
परिपूज् परि-पूज्, cl. 10. P. -पूजयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to honour greatly, adore, worship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपूजन|परिपूजनं
परि-पूजन, अम्, n. or परि-पूजा, f. honouring<BR>highly, worshipping, adoring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपूजित
परि-पूजित, अस्, आ, अम्, much honoured, served,<BR>worshipped, adored.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपूर्ण
परिपूर्ण परि-पूर्ण. See परि-पॄ below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपॄ
परिपॄ परि-पॄ, Pass. -पूर्यते, &c., to fill<BR>(intransitively), become completely full: Caus. -पूर-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to fill completely (transitively), make<BR>full, fill out, completely cover, wholly occupy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपूरक
परि-पूरक, अस्, इका, अम्, filling, fulfilling; caus-<BR>ing fulness or prosperity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपूरण|परिपूरणं
परि-पूरण, अम्, n. the act of filling; perfecting,<BR>rendering complete.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपूर्ण
परि-पूर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, quite full, entire, com-<BR>plete, completely filled; fully satisfied, self-satisfied,<BR>content.<BR>—परिपूर्ण-चन्द्र-विमल-प्रभ, अस्,<BR>m. ‘having the spotless splendor of the full moon,’<BR>N. of a Sam-ādhi.<BR>—परिपूर्ण-ता, f. or परि-<BR>पूर्ण-त्व, अम्, n. completion, completeness, en-<BR>tireness, fulness; satiety or satisfaction.<BR>—परिपूर्ण-<BR>सहस्र-चन्द्र-वती, f. ‘possessing a thousand full<BR>moons,’ an epithet of Indra's wife.<BR>—परिपूर्णा-<BR>मृत-रश्मि (˚ण-अम्˚), इस्, m. ‘having rays filled<BR>with nectar,’ the moon.<BR>—परिपूर्णार्थ (˚ण-<BR>अर्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, full of meaning; (अम्), ind. with<BR>deep emotion, affectionately.<BR>—परिपूर्णेन्दु (˚ण-<BR>इन्˚), उस्, m. the full moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपूर्ति|परिपूर्तिः
परि-पूर्ति, इस्, f. fulness, completion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपेलव|परिपेलवं
परिपेलव परि-पेलव, अस्, आ, अम्, very fine<BR>or small, very delicate; (अम्), n. a fragrant grass,<BR>Cyperus Rotundus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपेल|परिपेलं
परि-पेल, अम्, n. = परि-पेलव, a fragrant grass,<BR>Cyperus Rotundus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपोट|परिपोटः
परिपोट परि-पोट. See परि-पुट्, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्रग्रह्
परिप्रग्रह् परि-प्र-ग्रह्, cl. 9. P. A. -गृह्-<BR>णाति, -णीते, -ग्रहीतुम्, Ved. to take round, to hand<BR>or pass round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्रछ्|परिप्रच्छ्
परिप्रछ् परि-प्रछ्, cl. 6. P. -पृच्छति,<BR>-प्रष्टुम्, to interrogate or ask any one about<BR>anything (with two acc. or with acc. of the thing<BR>and abl. of the person); to enquire about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपृच्छा
परि-पृच्छा, f. asking about, question, inquiry,<BR>asking for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपृच्छ्य
परि-पृच्छ्य, ind. having inquired about (with<BR>two acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्रश्न|परिप्रश्नः
परि-प्रश्न, अस्, m. question, interrogation, in-<BR>quiry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्रमुच्
परिप्रमुच् परि-प्र-मुच्, cl. 6. A. -मुञ्चते,<BR>-मोक्तुम्, Ved. to free one's self from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्राप्ति|परिप्राप्तिः
परिप्राप्ति परि-प्राप्ति, इस्, f. (fr. rt. आप् with<BR>परि and प्र), acquisition, obtaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्रेप्सु
परि-प्रेप्सु, उस्, उस्, उ (fr. the Desid.), wishing<BR>to reach, desirous of obtaining; wishing to defend;<BR>desiring, desirous, seeking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्रार्ध
परिप्रार्ध परि-प्रार्ध, अम्, n., Ved. prox-<BR>imity, nearness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्री
परिप्री परि-प्री, ईस्, ईस्, इ (fr. rt. प्री with<BR>परि), Ved. very dear or valued; (Sāy.) gratifying<BR>on all sides or in every way (= परितः प्रीण-<BR>यितृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्रुष्
परिप्रुष् परि-प्रुष्, ट्, ट्, ट्, Ved. sprinkling,<BR>splashing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्रे
परिप्रे परि-प्रे (fr. परि-प्र-इ), cl. 2. P.<BR>-प्रैति, -प्रैतुम्, Ved. to go round, flow round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्रेष्
परिप्रेष् परि-प्रेष् (परि-प्र-इष्, see rt.<BR>1. इष्), Caus. -प्रैषयति, -यितुम्, to send forth,<BR>dispatch, send away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्रेषण|परिप्रेषणं
परि-प्रेषण, अम्, n. sending forth or away;<BR>banishing, abandoning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्रेषित
परि-प्रेषित, अस्, आ, अम्, sent forth, sent away,<BR>dispatched; banished, abandoned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्रेष्य|परिप्रेष्यः
परि-प्रेष्य, अस्, m. a servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्लु
परिप्लु परि-प्लु, cl. 1. A. -प्लवते, -प्लोतुम्,<BR>to swim about, float about, bathe; to flood, inun-<BR>date; to overwhelm; to hover about, fly or soar<BR>through; to jump or spring about; to revolve, move<BR>in a circle; to move about, move restlessly; to go<BR>astray; to hasten forward: Caus. -प्लावयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to flood, inundate, bathe, water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्लव|परिप्लवं|परिप्लवः
परि-प्लव, अस्, आ, अम्, swimming about; swaying<BR>or moving to and fro, running about, vibrating,<BR>oscillating, undulating, waving, shaking, trembling,<BR>movable, unsteady, restless; (अस्), m. inundation;<BR>bathing, wetting, immersing; a ship, boat; oppres-<BR>sion, tyranny; N. of a prince, son of Sukhī-bala<BR>(Sukhī-vala, Sukhī-nala); (आ), f. a sort of spoon used<BR>at sacrifices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्लवमान
परि-प्लवमान, अस्, आ, अम्, swimming about,<BR>floating, moving to and fro.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्लाव्य
1. परि-प्लाव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, swimming about, floating<BR>around, running (as water).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्लाव्य
2. परि-प्लाव्य, ind. having flooded or inundated,<BR>having bathed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्लुत|परिप्लुतः
परि-प्लुत, अस्, आ, अम्, flooded, inundated; over-<BR>whelmed; wetted, bathed, immersed; (आ), f. spirituous<BR>liquor; (अम्), n. a spring or jump, skipping about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिबन्ध्|परिबंध्
परिबन्ध् परि-बन्ध्, cl. 9. A. -बध्नीते,<BR>-बन्द्धुम्, to bind together, connect, bind on, bind<BR>round one's self, put on (as a girdle); to encircle;<BR>to stop, interrupt: Caus. -बन्धयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>tie round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिबद्ध
परि-बद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, bound round, obstructed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिबाध्
परिबाध् 1. परि-बाध्, cl. 1. A. -बाधते,<BR>बाधितुम्, to ward off, keep off, to exclude, hinder,<BR>obstruct, drive away, (Ved. according to Sāy. =<BR>परितो हन्); to protect from or defend against<BR>(with abl., Ved.); to vex, disturb, annoy, molest,<BR>harass, importune, pain: Desid. A. -बिबाधिषते,<BR>Ved. to strive to keep or ward off or keep at a<BR>distance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिबाध्
2. परि-बाध्, त्, f., Ved. hindrance, obstruction,<BR>check; an obstructor, hinderer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिबाधा
परि-बाधा, f. trouble, vexation, worry, annoy-<BR>ance; fatigue, toil, hardship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिबृंह्
परिबृंह् परि-बृंह् or परि-बृह् (also written<BR>परि-वृंह् or परि-वृह्, q. v.), cl. 6. P. A. -बृं-<BR>हति or -बृहति, -बृंहते or -बृहते, -बर्हितुम्,<BR>Ved. to embrace, encircle, surround, encompass; to<BR>make strong or compact, fortify, strengthen; to in-<BR>crease: Caus. -बृंहयति, -यितुम्, to make strong,<BR>strengthen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिबर्ह|परिबर्हः
परि-बर्ह or परि-वर्ह, अस्, m. ‘that which<BR>surrounds or encompasses,’ ‘surroundings,’ retinue,<BR>train, attendants, dependants; royal insignia; furni-<BR>ture, attire, trim; the necessaries of life; wealth,<BR>property, substance.<BR>—परिबर्ह-वत् or परिवर्ह-<BR>वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having a suitable retinue, possessing<BR>a proper train of attendants, provided with suitable<BR>furniture, properly furnished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिबर्हण|परिबर्हणं
परि-बर्हण or परि-वर्हण, अम्, n. retinue,<BR>train; attire, trim; growth, aggrandizement; wor-<BR>ship, adoration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिबृंहण|परिबृंहणं
परि-बृंहण or परि-वृंहण, अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>augmenting, increasing, enlarging; (अम्), n. pros-<BR>perity, welfare; an additional work, appendix, sup-<BR>plement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिबृंहित
परि-बृंहित or परि-बृहित or परि-वृंहित<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">Page0545-b+ 75</a>]<BR>or परि-वृहित, अस्, आ, अम्, increased, augmented,<BR>grown, thriven; strengthened by, connected with,<BR>accompanied by, furnished with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिबृढ
परि-बृढ or परि-वृढ, अस्, आ, अम्, firm,<BR>fixed, dense, thick, solid, compact, ample, large; the<BR>lord of all around, a superior, proprietor, owner.<BR>—परिवृढ-तम, अम्, n., Ved., scil. ब्रह्म,<BR>the Supreme Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिब्रू
परिब्रू परि-ब्रू, cl. 2. P. -ब्रवीति, &c., Ved.<BR>to utter a spell or charm, lay under a spell, charm,<BR>enchant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभक्ष्
परिभक्ष् परि-भक्ष्, cl. 10. P. -भक्ष-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, Ved. to drink off, drink up; to eat<BR>up (what belongs to another), devour, consume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभक्षण
परि-भक्षण, अम्, n. eating up, consuming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभक्षित
परि-भक्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, drunk up, deprived<BR>of food (Ved.); devoured, consumed, gnawed; worn<BR>away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभग्न
परिभग्न परि-भग्न, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt.<BR>भञ्ज् with परि), broken, interrupted, disturbed,<BR>stopped.<BR>—परिभग्न-क्रम, अस्, आ, अम्, stopped<BR>in one's course, checked in one's progress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभङ्ग|परिभंग|परिभंगः|परिभङ्गः
परि-भङ्ग, अस्, m. breaking to pieces, shattering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभज्
परिभज् परि-भज्, cl. 1. P. -भजति, -भक्-<BR>तुम्, to divide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभज्य
परि-भज्य, ind. having divided.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभय
परिभय परि-भय, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 1. भी<BR>with परि), Ved. apprehension, fear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभर्त्स्
परिभर्त्स् परि-भर्त्स्, cl. 10. P. A. -भर्त्-<BR>सयति, -ते, -यितुम्, to threaten, menace, treat harshly,<BR>rate, scold, chide, reprimand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभर्त्सत्
परि-भर्त्सत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, threatening, chiding;<BR>mocking, deriding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभर्त्सन|परिभर्त्सनं
परि-भर्त्सन, अम्, n. threatening, menacing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभर्त्सित
परि-भर्त्सित, अस्, आ, अम्, threatened, chided.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभर्त्स्यमान
परि-भर्त्स्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being threatened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभाष्
परिभाष् परि-भाष्, cl. 1. A. -भाषते,<BR>-भाषितुम्, to speak to, address, admonish; to<BR>declare, teach, explain, interpret, define; to persuade,<BR>exhort, encourage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभाषण|परिभाषणं
परि-भाषण, अस्, आ, अम्, speaking much,<BR>declaring, explaining; (अम्), n. speaking, talking,<BR>addressing, conversing with, chatting, gossiping;<BR>speech, discourse; admonition, expression of censure<BR>or contempt, reproof, abuse; rule, precept; agree-<BR>ment (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभाषणीय
परि-भाषणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be addressed<BR>or spoken to; reprehensible, liable to censure; de-<BR>serving reproof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभाषा
परि-भाषा, f. speech; blame, censure, abuse;<BR>an explanation, definition; (in gram.) an explanatory<BR>Sūtra or rule mixed with the other rules of Pāṇini<BR>and teaching the method of applying them, (these<BR>Sūtras are a key to the system and are thought by<BR>some to have been interpolated in later times, but<BR>by others are ascribed to Pāṇini himself; there are<BR>other Paribhāṣas by unknown authors); any general<BR>definition applicable throughout; a table or list of<BR>abbreviations or signs used in any work; (in medi-<BR>cine) prognosis.<BR>—परिभाषा-प्रकरण, अम्, n.,<BR>N. of the second chapter of the Prauḍha-manoramā,<BR>q. v.<BR>—परिभाषेन्दु-शेखर (˚षा-इन्˚), अस्, m.,<BR>N. of a grammatical work by Nāgeśa-bhaṭṭa (= ना-<BR>गोजी-भट्ट).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभाषित
परि-भाषित, अस्, आ, अम्, explained, said; formed<BR>or used technically.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभाषिन्
परि-भाषिन्, ई, इणी, इ, speaking, explaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभास्
परिभास् परि-भास्, cl. 1. A. -भासते, -भा-<BR>सितुम्, to appear (Ved.): Caus. -भासयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to embellish, adorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभिद्
परिभिद् परि-भिद्, cl. 7. P. A. -भिनत्ति,<BR>-भिन्त्ते, -भेत्तुम्, to split asunder, cleave open,<BR>tear or dash to pieces, break through; to change,<BR>disfigure, deform.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभिन्न
परि-भिन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, split or cleft open,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">Page0545-c+ 79</a>]<BR>cracked, cut into small pieces; changed, disfigured,<BR>deformed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभुज्
परिभुज् 1. परि-भुज् (see rt. 1. भुज्), cl.<BR>6. P. -भुजति, -भोक्तुम्, Ved. to span, encompass,<BR>embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभुग्न
परि-भुग्न, अस्, आ, अम्, bowed, bent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभुज्
परिभुज् 2. परि-भुज् (see rt. 3. भुज्), cl.<BR>7. P. A. -भुनक्ति, -भुङ्क्ते, -भोक्तुम्, to eat<BR>up, eat, devour; to feed upon; to use, enjoy; to<BR>neglect to feed: Caus. -भोजयति, -यितुम्, Ved. to<BR>possess, enjoy, govern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभुक्त
परि-भुक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, eaten; enjoyed, possessed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभोक्तृ
परि-भोक्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, eating, enjoying, pos-<BR>sessing, an eater, enjoyer; one who lives at another's<BR>cost or uses another's property without his leave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभोग|परिभोगः
परि-भोग, अस्, m. enjoyment, especially sexual<BR>intercourse, possession, a means of enjoyment; living<BR>at another's cost, using another's property without his<BR>leave, illegal use of another's goods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभू
परिभू 1. परि-भू, cl. 1. P. -भवति, -भ-<BR>वितुम् (Ved. inf. -भ्वे), to be round or about any-<BR>thing, encompass, surround, embrace, enclose, contain<BR>(Ved.); to circle round, go or fly round (Ved.); to<BR>accompany (Ved.); to take care of (Ved.); to guide,<BR>govern (Ved.); to be superior, surpass, overcome,<BR>subdue, conquer; to pass round, pay no attention to,<BR>treat with contempt or disrespect, despise; to disgrace;<BR>to injure; to grieve; to disappear (= परा-भू,<BR>q. v.): Caus. -भावयति, -यितुम्, to cause to be<BR>surrounded or pervaded; to cause to be saturated or<BR>penetrated; to contain, include, comprehend; to<BR>conceive, think, reflect, meditate, know, recognise<BR>as; to make known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभव|परिभवः
परि-भव, अस्, m. or परि-भवन, अम्, n.<BR>contumely, insult, injury, humiliation, degradation,<BR>disrespect, contempt, disgrace; defeat, discomfiture.<BR>—परिभव-पद, अम्, n. an object or occasion<BR>of contempt, a disgraceful situation, disgrace.<BR>—परि-<BR>भव-विधि, इस्, m. contumelious or insulting action,<BR>humiliation.<BR>—परिभवास्पद (˚व-आस्˚), अम्, n. a<BR>position or situation of disgrace, object of contempt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभवनीय
परि-भवनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be injured or<BR>insulted, liable to be humiliated or despised or dis-<BR>graced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभविन्
परि-भविन्, ई, इनी, इ, injuring, humiliating, treat-<BR>ing with contumely or disrespect, ridiculing; suffering<BR>disrespect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभाव|परिभावः
परि-भाव, अस्, m. = परि-भव, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभावन|परिभावनं
परि-भावन, अम्, n. cohesion, union; (आ), f.<BR>thought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभावित
परि-भावित, अस्, आ, अम्, contained, included;<BR>penetrated; pervaded; conceived.<BR>—परिभावित-<BR>त्व, अम्, n. the state of being included, inclusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभाविन्
परि-भाविन्, ई, इनी, इ, treating with contempt,<BR>slighting, despising; putting to shame, mocking,<BR>insulting, outvying, surpassing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभावुक
परि-भावुक, अस्, ई, अम्, contemning, shaming,<BR>humbling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभाव्य
परि-भाव्य, ind. having caused to be surrounded;<BR>having reflected upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभू
2. परि-भू, ऊस्, ऊस्, उ, Ved. surrounding, embrac-<BR>ing, comprehending, pervading; overpowering; sur-<BR>passing; guiding, governing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभूत|परिभूतं
परि-भूत, अस्, आ, अम्, treated with contempt or<BR>disrespect, disregarded, despised; overpowered, con-<BR>quered.<BR>—परिभूत-गति-त्रय, अस्, आ, अम्, sur-<BR>passing three times the age of man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभूति|परिभूतिः
परि-भूति, इस्, इस्, इ, Ved. overcoming, over-<BR>powering; (इस्), f. superiority, superior power (Ved.);<BR>contempt, insult, contumely, humiliation, disrespect,<BR>injury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभूय
परि-भूय, ind. having treated with contempt,<BR>having disgraced or despised; shaming, outvying;<BR>experiencing disgrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभूष्
परिभूष् परि-भूष्, cl. 1. 10. P. -भूषति,<BR>-भूषयति, &c., to wait upon, serve, attend; to<BR>honour, revere; to take care of; to follow, observe;<BR>to furnish, equip, fit out, prepare; to decorate; to<BR>be beautiful, to shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभूषण|परिभूषणः
परि-भूषण, अस्, m., scil. सन्धि, peace ob-<BR>tained by the cession of the whole revenue of a land.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभूषित
परि-भूषित, अस्, आ, अम्, decorated, adorned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभृ
परिभृ परि-भृ, cl. 3. P. -बिभर्ति, -भर्-<BR>तुम्, Ved. to pass beyond (Sāy. = अति-क्रम्); to<BR>extend beyond, extend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभेदक
परिभेदक परि-भेदक, अस्, आ, अम्, breaking<BR>through.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभ्रंश्
परिभ्रंश् परि-भ्रंश्, cl. 4. P. A. -भ्रश्यति,<BR>-ते, -भ्रंशितुम्; cl. 1. A. -भ्रंशते, -भ्रं-<BR>शितुम्, to fall off, drop off; to fall, be cast down<BR>(metaphorically); to run away, escape; to vanish,<BR>disappear; to lose, be deprived of (with abl.); to<BR>neglect, omit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभ्रंश|परिभ्रंशः
परि-भ्रंश, अस्, m. falling from; escape,<BR>escaping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभ्रंशन|परिभ्रंशनं
परि-भ्रंशन, अम्, n. falling from; losing, loss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभ्रष्ट
परि-भ्रष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, fallen off, dropped off;<BR>fallen, cast down, degraded; escaped; vanished;<BR>deprived of, void or devoid of (with abl. or some-<BR>times inst.); lost; neglecting, omitting.<BR>—परि-<BR>भ्रष्ट-सुख, अस्, आ, अम्, fallen from happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभ्रज्ज्
परिभ्रज्ज् परि-भ्रज्ज्, cl. 6. P. -भृज्जति,<BR>-भ्रष्टुम्, -भर्ष्टुम्, to fry, roast: Caus. -भर्-<BR>जयति, -यितुम्, to fry, roast, parch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभृष्ट
परि-भृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, fried, roasted, parched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभ्रम्
परिभ्रम् परि-भ्रम्, cl. 1. 4. P. (ep. also A.)<BR>-भ्रमति (-ते), भ्रम्यति or भ्राम्यति, -भ्र-<BR>मितुम्, to walk round about, wander round, rove or<BR>roam about, ramble about, saunter; to fly round about,<BR>hover or flutter round; to wander through, rove or<BR>roam through, ramble through; to whirl round,<BR>wheel or circle round, revolve; to encircle, describe<BR>a circle round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभ्रम|परिभ्रमः
परि-भ्रम, अस्, आ, अम्, flying round or about<BR>[cf. खे-प्˚]; (अस्), m. wandering, going about;<BR>error; circumlocution, rambling discourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभ्रमण|परिभ्रमणं
परि-भ्रमण, अम्, n. turning round, revolving<BR>(as of wheels); circumference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभ्रमत्
परि-भ्रमत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, roaming or wander-<BR>ing about, roving about; turning or whirling round,<BR>revolving; describing circles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभ्रम्य
परि-भ्रम्य, ind. having roamed about, having<BR>gone to and fro.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभ्राम्यत्
परि-भ्राम्यत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, roaming about;<BR>flying or fluttering about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिभ्राज्
परिभ्राज् परि-भ्राज्, cl. 1. P. A. -भ्राजति,<BR>-ते, -भ्राजितुम्, to shed brilliance all around, become<BR>resplendent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमण्डल|परिमंडल|परिमण्डलं|परिमण्डलः
परिमण्डल परि-मण्डल, अस्, आ, अम्, round,<BR>circular, globular, spherical; (अस्), m., scil. मशक,<BR>a venomous species of gnat; (अम्), n. a circle, cir-<BR>cumference; a ball, globe, sphere, orb; orbit.<BR>—परि-<BR>मण्डल-ता, f. or परिमण्डल-त्व, अम्, n. round-<BR>ness, rotundity, circularity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमण्डलित
परि-मण्डलित, अस्, आ, अम्, rounded, made round<BR>or circular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमण्डित
परिमण्डित परि-मण्डित, अस्, आ, अम्, adorned<BR>or decorated all round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमन्
परिमन् परि-मन्, cl. 8. A. -मनुते, -म-<BR>नितुम्, Ved. to despise, contemn, slight, neglect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमन्त्र्
परिमन्त्र् परि-मन्त्र्, cl. 10. P. -मन्त्रयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to charm or consecrate with sacred texts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमन्त्रित
परि-मन्त्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, charmed, consecrated,<BR>enchanted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमन्थर|परिमंथर
परिमन्थर परि-मन्थर, अस्, आ, अम्, ex-<BR>tremely slow or tardy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमन्द|परिमंद
परिमन्द परि-मन्द, अस्, आ, अम्, very dull<BR>or faint; very slow; very tired; very little; (अम्),<BR>ind. very little, a little, not much.<BR>—परिमन्द-ता,<BR>f. fatigue, tiredness, tedium, ennui.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमन्यु
परिमन्यु परि-मन्यु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. wrath-<BR>ful, angry, jealous (Sāy. = कोप-परिवृत).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमर|परिमरः
परिमर परि-मर, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. (fr. rt.<BR>मृ with परि), decaying, becoming decrepit; ब्रह्-<BR>मणः परि-मरः, ‘destruction round the Brah-<BR>man, i. e. the magician’ (or, according to Colebrooke,<BR>‘around air’), a magical rite for the destruction of<BR>adversaries.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमर्द|परिमर्दः|परिमर्द्द
परिमर्द परि-मर्द, परि-मर्दन. See<BR>p. 547, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमल|परिमलः
परिमल परि-मल, अस्, m. (मल perhaps<BR>fr. a lost rt. मल्, to rub), fragrance, perfume,<BR>(especially arising from the trituration of fragrant<BR>substances); the pounding or trituration of perfumes;<BR>a fragrant substance; a fragrant scent diffused during<BR>coitus; copulation; a meeting of learned men; soil,<BR>stain, dirt; N. of a poet; of a work; of a commen-<BR>tary by Amara-candra on the Kāvya-kalpa-latā-vṛtti;<BR>of a commentary by Apyāya-dīkṣita on the Vedānta-<BR>kalpa-taru, (the complete title of which is Vedānta-<BR>kalpa-taru-parimala.)<BR>—परिमल-भृत्, त्, त्, त्, laden<BR>with perfumes, impregnated with sweet odours.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमलित
परि-मलित, अस्, आ, अम्, perfumed; soiled, de-<BR>spoiled of freshness or beauty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमा
परिमा परि-मा (see rt. 3. मा), cl. 2. P., 3.<BR>4. A. -माति, -मिमीते, -मायते, -मातुम्, to measure<BR>round or about; to mete out; to fulfil (a period or<BR>course); to measure, estimate, determine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमाण|परिमाणं
परि-माण, अम्, n. measuring, measure, duration,<BR>length of time; compass, weight, number, value<BR>(e. g. प्रतिग्रह-परिमाण, the value of a gift<BR>received).<BR>—परिमाण-तस्, ind. by measure; in<BR>weight.<BR>—परिमाण-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, capable of<BR>being measured, measurable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमाणक|परिमाणकं
परिमाणक, अम्, n. compass, weight, quantity,<BR>duration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमाणिन्
परि-माणिन्, ई, इनी, इ, having measure, measured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमाणीय
परि-माणीय or परि-मातव्य, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>measurable, fit to be measured; requiring to be<BR>ascertained as to quantity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमित|परिमितं
परि-मित, अस्, आ, अम्, measured, meted; circum-<BR>scribed, limited, adjusted; moderate, sparing; joined;<BR>regulated.<BR>—परिमित-कथ, अस्, आ, अम्, of measured<BR>discourse, seldom speaking, saying little.<BR>—परिमित-<BR>त्व, अम्, n. limitedness, moderation, limited con-<BR>dition.<BR>—परिमित-भुज्, क्, क्, क्, eating sparingly,<BR>abstemious.<BR>—परिमित-भोजन, अम्, n. moderation<BR>in eating, abstemiousness.<BR>—परिमिताभरण (˚त-<BR>आभ्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, moderately adorned.<BR>—परिमि-<BR>तायुस् (˚त-आय्˚), उस्, उस्, उ, short-lived.<BR>—परिमि-<BR>ताहार (˚त-आह्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, eating little food,<BR>eating moderately.<BR>—परिमितेच्छ-ता (˚त-इच्˚), f.<BR>moderation in desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमिति|परिमितिः
परि-मिति, इस्, f. measure, quantity, limitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमेय|परिमेयं
परि-मेय, अस्, आ, अम्, measurable, to be measured;<BR>calculable, capable of being counted, few; finite.<BR>—परिमेय-ता, f. measurableness, calculableness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमाथिन्
परिमाथिन् परि-माथिन्, ई, इनी, इ (rt. मथ्<BR>or मन्थ् with परि), torturing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमाद्
परिमाद् परि-माद्, त्, f. or परि-माद, अस्,<BR>m. (fr. rt. मद् with परि), Ved., N. of sixteen<BR>Sāmans which belong to the Mahā-vrata-stotra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमार्ग्
परिमार्ग् परि-मार्ग्, cl. 1. 10. P. -मार्गति,<BR>मार्गितुम्, -मार्गयति, -यितुम्, to seek or search<BR>about, search for, search through, seek, pursue, trace,<BR>track, hunt about, investigate, grasp after, seek to<BR>gain, ask for, beg for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमार्ग|परिमार्गः
1. परि-मार्ग, अस्, m. (for 2. see under परि-<BR>मृज्), searching or seeking about; searching for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमार्गण|परिमार्गणं
परि-मार्गण, अम्, n. tracing, tracking, search-<BR>ing, seeking or looking for, seeking out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमार्गितव्य
परि-मार्गितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be sought after.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमार्गिन्
परि-मार्गिन्, ई, इणी, इ, tracing, tracking, seeking<BR>for, going after, pursuing, hunting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमि
परिमि परि-मि (see rt. 1. मि), cl. 5. P. A.<BR>-मिनोति, -नुते, &c. Ved. to set or place round,<BR>lay round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमित्
परि-मित्, त्, f., Ved. the beam of a roof, a con-<BR>necting beam or rafter (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमिलन|परिमिलनं
परिमिलन परि-मिलन, अम्, n. touch, con-<BR>tact, combination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमिलित
परि-मिलित, अस्, आ, अम्, mixed or combined<BR>with, pervaded by (with inst.); filled, penetrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमिह्
परिमिह् परि-मिह्, cl. 1. P. -मेहति, -मे-<BR>ढुम्, Ved. to make water against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमीढ
परि-मीढ, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. sprinkled with urine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमेह
परि-मेह, अस्, m., Ved. a magical rite in which<BR>urine is sprinkled about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमुखम्
परिमुखम् परि-मुखम्, ind. round or<BR>about the face, round, about (any person, &c.; Pāṇ.<BR>IV. 4, 29).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमुच्
परिमुच् परि-मुच्, cl. 6. P. A. -मुञ्चति,<BR>-ते, -मोक्तुम्, to unloose, unfasten, set free, liberate;<BR>to let go, give up, get rid of; to discharge, emit:<BR>Pass. -मुच्यते, to loosen or free one's self; to let<BR>go, get rid of; to neglect (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमुक्त
परि-मुक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, released, liberated.<BR>—प-<BR>रिमुक्त-बन्धन, अस्, आ, अम्, released from bonds,<BR>unbound, unfettered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमुच्य
परि-मुच्य, ind. having released or liberated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमुष्
परिमुष् परि-मुष्, cl. 9. 6. P. -मुष्णाति,<BR>-मुषति, -मोषितुम्, to steal anything, rob, plunder<BR>(with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमोष|परिमोषः
परि-मोष, अस्, m. stealing, theft, robbing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमोषक
परि-मोषक, अस्, आ, अम्, stealing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमोषिन्
परि-मोषिन्, ई, इणी, इ, stealing; a thief, robber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमुह्
परिमुह् परि-मुह्, cl. 4. P. A. -मुह्यति,<BR>-ते, -मोहितुम्, -मोढुम्, -मोग्धुम्, to be bewil-<BR>dered or perplexed, to go astray, fail: Caus. A. -मो-<BR>हयते (Pāṇ. 1. 3, 89); P. (ep.) -मोहयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to bewilder, perplex; to fascinate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमुग्ध
परि-मुग्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, lovely yet simple,<BR>fascinating yet foolish.<BR>—परिमुग्ध-ता, f. grace-<BR>fulness or loveliness combined with simplicity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमूढ
परि-मूढ, अस्, आ, अम्, disturbed, perturbed,<BR>perplexed, bewildered, troubled.<BR>—परिमूढ-ता,<BR>f. bewilderment, perplexity, trouble, error.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमोहन|परिमोहनं
परि-मोहन, अम्, n. the act of bewildering,<BR>fascination, infatuation, beguiling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमोहित
परि-मोहित, अस्, आ, अम्, bewildered, deprived of<BR>consciousness or recollection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमोहिन्
परि-मोहिन्, ई, इनी, इ, perplexing, fascinating,<BR>bewitching; perplexed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमूर्णी
परिमूर्णी परि-मूर्णी, f. (perhaps fr. rt. मॄ<BR>with परि), Ved. worn out, decrepit (as a cow,<BR>according to the commentator = वृद्धा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृ
परिमृ परि-मृ, cl. 6. A. -म्रियते (Perf.<BR>P. -ममार), -मर्तुम्, Ved. to die (in numbers)<BR>round (any one).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृग्
परिमृग् परि-मृग्, cl. 10. A. -मृगयते,<BR>-यितुम्, to seek, search for, hunt about for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृग्यमाण
परि-मृग्यमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, being sought for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृज्
परिमृज् 1. परि-मृज्, cl. 2. P. -मार्ष्टि,<BR>मार्जितुम्, -मार्ष्टुम्, to wipe all round, wipe away,<BR>wash, wash away, rinse (the mouth), clean, cleanse,<BR>purify; to rub, polish; to wipe off, remove by rub-<BR>bing, efface, remove; to touch lightly, touch, stroke:<BR>Intens. -मर्मृज्यते, Ved. to sweep over; (Sāy.<BR>= तेजसा छद्, to cover with radiance.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमार्ग|परिमार्गः
2. परि-मार्ग, अस्, m. (for 1. see under परि-<BR>मार्ग्, col. 2), wiping off, cleaning; friction, touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमार्ग्य|परिमार्ग्यं
परि-मार्ग्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be cleaned or cleansed,<BR>to be rubbed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमार्ज|परिमार्जः
परि-मार्ज, अस्, आ, अम्, wiping off, cleaning,<BR>washing; stroking, rubbing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमार्जन|परिमार्जनं|परिमार्ज्जन
परि-मार्जन, अम्, n. wiping off, cleaning; a<BR>dish of honey and oil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृज्
2. परि-मृज्, ट्, ट्, ट्, or परि-मृज, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>wiping or washing off, cleaning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृज्य|परिमृज्यं
1. परि-मृज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be wiped, to be<BR>cleansed; to be touched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृज्य|परिमृज्यं
2. परि-मृज्य, ind. having wiped away, having<BR>washed the mouth; having polished; having stroked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृष्ट
1. परि-मृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, wiped away, washed,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">Page0547-a+ 74</a>]<BR>cleaned, purified; rubbed, stroked.<BR>—परिमृष्ट-<BR>परिच्छद, अस्, आ, अम्, trim, neat, spruce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृद्
परिमृद् परि-मृद्, cl. 9. P. -मृद्नाति, -मर्-<BR>दितुम्, to tread or trample down, crush, rub, grind;<BR>to wear down, wear out; to rub off, wipe away (as<BR>tears); to rub, stroke; cl. 1. P. -मर्दति, -मर्-<BR>दितुम्, to excel, surpass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमर्द|परिमर्दः|परिमर्द्द
परि-मर्द, अस्, m. crushing, grinding, wearing<BR>out; using up, consuming; destroying, destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमर्दन|परिमर्दनं|परिमर्द्दन
परि-मर्दन, अम्, n. rubbing, grinding; tram-<BR>pling, destroying; embracing, pressing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृदित
परि-मृदित, अस्, आ, अम्, trodden or trampled<BR>down; crushed, rubbed, ground; embraced, clasped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृद्नत्
परि-मृद्नत्, अन्, अती, अत्, trampling down,<BR>crushing; rubbing; wiping away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृश्
परिमृश् परि-मृश्, cl. 6. P. -मृशति, -मर्ष्-<BR>टुम्, -म्रष्टुम्, to touch, handle, stroke, caress;<BR>to grasp, seize; to examine, consider, reflect, ponder;<BR>to investigate, inquire into, question; to observe,<BR>discover: Intens. -मर्मर्ष्टि, Ved. to encompass,<BR>clasp, embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमर्श|परिमर्शः
परि-मर्श, अस्, m. friction; contact; consider-<BR>ation, reflection, examination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृश्य
परि-मृश्य, ind. having touched or handled;<BR>having grasped; having examined or pondered;<BR>having found or observed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृश्यमान
परि-मृश्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being touched;<BR>being fanned (by the wind).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृष्ट
2. परि-मृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, rubbed, touched;<BR>embraced, clasped; invested; spread; pervaded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृष्
परिमृष् परि-मृष्, cl. 4. P. -मृष्यति,<BR>-मर्षितुम्, to be angry or incensed against (with<BR>dat.); to envy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमर्ष|परिमर्षः
परि-मर्ष, अस्, m. envy, dislike, anger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमृष्यत्
परि-मृष्यत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, angry, incensed,<BR>envying; (according to a Scholiast = असूयत्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमोक्ष्
परिमोक्ष् परि-मोक्ष्, cl. 10. P. -मोक्ष-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to set free, liberate, let go, discharge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमोक्ष|परिमोक्षः
परि-मोक्ष, अस्, m. setting free, liberating; libe-<BR>ration, deliverance; escape; emptying, evacuation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमोक्षण|परिमोक्षणं
परि-मोक्षण, अम्, n. liberation, deliverance<BR>from (with gen.); untying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमोक्ष्य
परि-मोक्ष्य, ind. having let go or released.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमोटन
परिमोटन परि-मोटन, अम्, n. (fr. rt. मुट्<BR>with परि), Ved. snapping, cracking; (according to<BR>a Scholiast = चताचता-शब्द.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिम्लै
परिम्लै परि-म्लै, cl. 1. P. A. -म्लायति,<BR>-ते, -म्लातुम्, to fade or wither away; to wane; to<BR>disappear; to faint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिम्लान
परि-म्लान, अस्, आ, अम्, faded, withered, fainted,<BR>fainting; languid; waned; diminished, impaired;<BR>soiled, stained; (अम्), n. change of countenance by<BR>fear or grief; soil, stain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिम्लायिन्
परि-म्लायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, fading away; stained,<BR>spotted; (ई), m., scil. लिङ्ग-नाश, a kind of disease<BR>of the lens or pupil of the eye.<BR>—परिम्लायि-त्व,<BR>अम्, n. fading away, sinking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परियज्ञ|परियज्ञः
परियज्ञ परि-यज्ञ, अस्, m., Ved. a secon-<BR>dary or accompanying rite, one which precedes or<BR>follows another in any ritual; (अस्, आ, अम्), Ved.<BR>constituting an accompanying or secondary rite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परियत्त
परियत्त परि-यत्त, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. यत्<BR>with परि), Ved. surrounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परियम्
परियम् परि-यम्, cl. 1. P. -यच्छति, -यन्-<BR>तुम्, to restrain: Caus. -यमयति, -यितुम्, to serve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिया
