परिरक्षा
परि-रक्षा, f. protection, preservation, keeping,<BR>guarding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

