परिवर्मन्
परिवर्मन् परि-वर्मन्, आ, आ, अ, wearing a<BR>coat of mail, clad in mail, armed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्ह|परिवर्हः
परिवर्ह परि-वर्ह, परि-वर्हण. See<BR>परि-बर्ह, परि-बर्हण, p. 545, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवस्
परिवस् परि-वस् (see rt. 4. वस्), cl. 10. P.<BR>-वासयति, -यितुम्, Ved. to split, cut through.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवासन
परि-वासन, अम्, n., Ved. a shred, chip.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवसथ|परिवसथः
परिवसथ परि-वसथ, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 6.<BR>वस् with परि), a village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवास|परिवासः
परि-वास, अस्, m. abode, residence, stay, sojourn;<BR>[cf. काल-प्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवासित
परि-वासित, अस्, आ, अम्, respectfully attentive to<BR>superiors (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवह्
परिवह् परि-वह्, cl. 1. P. A. -वहति, -ते,<BR>-वोढुम्, to carry round, carry about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवह|परिवहः
परि-वह, अस्, m., N. of one of the seven winds;<BR>one of the seven tongues of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवाह|परिवाहः
परि-वाह, अस्, m. the overflowing of a tank, an<BR>inundation, overflow natural or artificial; a water-<BR>course or drain to carry off excess of water; [cf.<BR>परी-वाह.]<BR>—परिवाह-वत्, आन्, m. ‘having a<BR>channel,’ a tank, pool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवाहित
परि-वाहित, अस्, आ, अम्, drained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0547-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवाहिन्
परि-वाहिन्, ई, इणी, इ, overflowing, swimming<BR>with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवाप|परिवापः
परिवाप परि-वाप, अस्, m. (fr. rt. वप् with<BR>परि), fried grains of rice; coagulated or thick sour<BR>milk (= दधि, Ved.); furniture; a train, retinue;<BR>sowing; a reservoir, pool, pond, piece of water;<BR>shaving, shearing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवापण|परिवापणं
परि-वापण, अम्, n. shaving, shearing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवापित|परिवापितं
परि-वापित, अस्, आ, अम्, shaven, shorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवाप्य
परि-वाप्य or परी-वाप्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved.<BR>having or requiring or deserving fried grains of rice<BR>or thickened milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवार|परिवारः
परिवार परि-वार, परि-वारण. See under<BR>परि-वृ, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवासस्
परिवासस् परि-वासस्, अस्, n., Ved. (pro-<BR>bably) an upper garment; अङ्गिरसाम् अभिवासः-<BR>परिवाससी, N. of two Sāmans.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविंशत्
परिविंशत् परि-विंशत्, त्, f. quite twenty,<BR>full twenty, twenty at least.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविक्रयिन्
परिविक्रयिन् परि-विक्रयिन्, ई, इणी, इ (fr. rt.<BR>1. क्री with परि-वि), selling or trading in (with gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविक्षत
परिविक्षत परि-विक्षत, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt.<BR>क्षन् with परि-वि), sorely wounded, much hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविक्षोभ
परिविक्षोभ परि-विक्षोभ, अस्, m. (fr. rt.<BR>1. क्षुभ् with परि-वि), shaking violently, de-<BR>stroying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविचर्
परिविचर् परि-वि-चर्, cl. 1. P. -चरति,<BR>-चरितुम्, Ved. to stream forth in all directions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविद्
परिविद् परि-विद्, cl. 2. P. -वेत्ति, -वेद,<BR>-वेदितुम्, Ved. to know thoroughly, understand<BR>fully; cl. 6. P. A. -विन्दति, -ते, -वेदितुम्, -वेत्तुम्,<BR>to marry before an elder brother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविण्ण|परिविण्णः
परि-विण्ण or परि-वित्त or परि-वित्ति, इस्, m.<BR>an unmarried elder brother whose younger brother<BR>is married.<BR>—परिवित्ति-ता, f. the marrying of a<BR>younger brother before the elder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविन्दक|परिविंदक|परिविंदकः|परिविन्दकः
परि-विन्दक, अस्, m. a younger brother married<BR>before the elder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविन्दत्|परिविंदत्
परि-विन्दत्, अन्, m. an unmarried elder brother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविविदान|परिविविदानः
परि-विविदान, अस्, m., Ved. a married man<BR>whose elder brother is still unmarried.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेत्तृ
परि-वेत्तृ, ता, m. or परि-वेदक, अस्, m. a<BR>younger brother married before the elder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेद|परिवेदः
परि-वेद, अस्, m. complete or accurate knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदन|परिवेदनं
1. परि-वेदन, अम्, n. (for 2. see p. 549, col. 1),<BR>complete or accurate knowledge; discussion; anguish,<BR>pain, misery; the marrying of a younger brother<BR>before the elder; marriage; laying the fire on the<BR>sacrificial fire-place; gain, acquisition; (आ), f. shrewd-<BR>ness, wit; foresight, prudence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदनीया
परि-वेदनीया or परि-वेदिनी, f. the wife of a<BR>younger brother who has married before the elder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदिन्
परि-वेदिन्, ई, इनी, इ, knowing, shrewd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविद्ध|परिविद्धः
परिविद्ध परि-विद्ध, अस्, m. (perhaps fr.<BR>परि-व्यध्), an epithet of Kuvera; [cf. पर-<BR>विद्ध.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविश्
परिविश् परि-विश् (often confounded with<BR>परि-विष् below), Caus. -वेशयति, -यितुम्, to pro-<BR>vide; to offer, present, (probably for परि-विष्, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेशस्
परि-वेशस्, आस्, m., Ved. a neighbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविश्वस्
परिविश्वस् परि-वि-श्वस्, cl. 2. P. -श्वसिति,<BR>-श्वसितुम्, to confide completely, feel secure, be<BR>fearless: Caus. -श्वासयति, -यितुम्, to comfort,<BR>console.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्वस्त
परि-श्वस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, feeling secure, confident.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविष्
परिविष् परि-विष्, Caus. P. -वेषयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to surround; to present, offer, offer food;<BR>to wait on; (sometimes erroneously written परि-<BR>विश्, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविष्ट
परि-विष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, surrounded, enclosed;<BR>offered, presented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविष्टि
परि-विष्टि, इस्, f., Ved. service, attendance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेष|परिवेषः
परि-वेष, अस्, m. (sometimes wrongly spelt<BR>परि-वेश), preparation (of food); attendance, wait-<BR>ing at meals, distributing food, serving up meals; a<BR>circle, circlet, wreath, crown; the circumference of<BR>a circle; the disk of the sun or moon; a halo round<BR>the sun or moon; anything surrounding or protecting<BR>(e. g. कृताङ्गरक्षा-प्˚, surrounded by a body-<BR>guard); putting on, clothing, dressing.<BR>—परिवेष-<BR>वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having a halo, surrounded by a halo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेषक|परिवेषकः
परि-वेषक, अस्, m. (sometimes wrongly परि-<BR>वेशक), an attendant, waiter, one who serves up<BR>meals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेषण|परिवेषणं
परि-वेषण, अम्, n. attendance, waiting, serving<BR>up meals, distributing food; surrounding, enclosing;<BR>circumference; a halo round the sun or moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेषिन्
परि-वेषिन्, ई, इणी, इ, surrounded by a halo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेष्टव्य
परि-वेष्टव्य or परि-वेष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to<BR>be served up; to be offered or presented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेष्टृ
परि-वेष्टृ, टा, ट्री, टृ, a waiter; one who<BR>serves up meals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविष्णु
परिविष्णु परि-विष्णु, ind. = सर्वतो विष्-<BR>णुः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविहार|परिविहारः
परिविहार परि-विहार, अस्, m. walking or<BR>roaming about, walking for pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविह्वल
परिविह्वल परि-विह्वल, अस्, आ, अम्, ex-<BR>tremely agitated, bewildered, beside one's self.<BR>—प-<BR>रिविह्वल-ता, f. bewilderment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवी
परिवी परि-वी, परि-वीत. See under<BR>परि-व्ये, p. 549, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृ
परिवृ परि-वृ, cl. 5. 9. 1. P. A. -वृणोति,<BR>-णुते, -वृणाति, -णीते, -वरति, -ते, -वरितुम्, -व-<BR>रीतुम्, to surround, conceal: Caus. -वारयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to surround, cover, clothe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवार|परिवारः
परि-वार, अस्, m. (also spelt परी-वार), a cover,<BR>covering; surroundings, train, suite, retinue, attend-<BR>ants, dependants, subjects, followers; a sheath, scab-<BR>bard.<BR>—परिवार-ता, f. subjection, dependance.<BR>—प-<BR>रिवार-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having a great retinue.<BR>—परिवार-शोभिन्, ई, इनी, इ, rendered illustrious<BR>by a retinue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवारण
परि-वारण, अम्, n. a cover, covering, envelope;<BR>a train, retinue; keeping or warding off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवारित
परि-वारित, अस्, आ, अम्, encompassed, surrounded,<BR>encircled, enclosed, begirt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवार्य|परिवार्य्य
परि-वार्य, ind. having surrounded or encompassed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृत|परिवृतः
परि-वृत, अस्, आ, अम्, encompassed, surrounded,<BR>encircled, attended, invested; concealed; overspread,<BR>pervaded; entirely gained or received; known;<BR>(अम्), n., Ved. a covered place or shed enclosed<BR>with walls used as a place of sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृति|परिवृतिः
परि-वृति, इस्, f. surrounding, standing round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृंह्
परिवृंह् परि-वृंह् or परि-वृह्, also written<BR>परि-बृंह् or परि-बृह्, q. v., p. 545, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृंहण|परिवृंहणं
परि-वृंहण. See परि-बृंहण, p. 545.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृंहित
परि-वृंहित or परि-वृहित. See परि-बृं-<BR>हित, p. 545, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृढ|परिवृढः
परि-वृढ, अस्, m. a master, owner, &c. See<BR>परि-बृढ, p. 545, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्रढिमन्
परि-व्रढिमन्, आ, m. mastery, superiority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृज्
परिवृज् 1. परि-वृज्, cl. 7. 1. P. -वृणक्ति,<BR>-वर्जति, -वर्जितुम्, to leave, forsake, abandon,<BR>shun, avoid, quit, cease, leave off: Caus. -वर्जयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to avoid, shun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्ग|परिवर्गः
परि-वर्ग, अस्, m., Ved. shunning, avoiding,<BR>removing, discomfiting; अ-परिवर्गम्, ind. without<BR>omission, without intermission, completely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्ग्य
परि-वर्ग्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. to be avoided.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्जक
परि-वर्जक, अस्, आ, अम्, shunning, avoiding;<BR>giving up, resigning, abstaining from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्जन|परिवर्जनं|परिवर्ज्जनं
परि-वर्जन, अम्, n. avoiding, shunning, giving<BR>up, resigning, quitting; abstaining from; killing,<BR>slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्जनीय
परि-वर्जनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, avoidable, to be<BR>avoided.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्जित|परिवर्ज्जित
परि-वर्जित, अस्, आ, अम्, abandoned, shunned;<BR>deprived or devoid of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृक्त
परि-वृक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. avoided, disliked,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">Page0548-c+ 79</a>]<BR>despised; (आ and ई), f. ‘the disliked or despised one,’<BR>epithet of a wife lightly esteemed in comparison<BR>with the favourite wife (महिषी, वावाता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृज्
2. परि-वृज्, क्, f., Ved. avoiding, removing, (Sāy.<BR>= परितः स्व-स्थान-त्याग); purification, expi-<BR>ation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृत्
परिवृत् परि-वृत्, cl. 1. A. (also P. in Fut.,<BR>Cond., and Aor.), to turn round, roll or wheel<BR>round, revolve; to be whirled; to hasten to and<BR>fro, roam or wander about; to change (e. g. क्ष-<BR>णेन तत् परिवर्तते ऽन्यथा, that changes or turns<BR>out to be different in a moment); to interchange;<BR>to become, to be: Caus. -वर्तयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>exchange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्त|परिवर्तः|परिवर्त्त|परिवर्त्तः
परि-वर्त, अस्, m. revolving, revolution (of a<BR>planet &c.); a period or lapse or expiration of time,<BR>especially of a Yuga (e. g. लोकानाम् परिवर्ते, at<BR>the end of the world); a year; going or turning<BR>back, flight, retreat, desertion; transmigration, re-<BR>peated birth; change, exchange, barter (e. g. अन्न-<BR>परिवर्त, change of diet; समुद्र-परिवर्त,<BR>exchange of sealed goods); requital, return; a<BR>chapter, section, book, canto; an abode, spot, place;<BR>N. of one of the eight sons of Duḥ-saha (son of<BR>Mṛtyu); N. of a king of the tortoises or the<BR>tortoise incarnation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तक|परिवर्तकं|परिवर्त्तक
परि-वर्तक, अस्, आ, अम्, turning round, turning<BR>back; causing to turn round or flow back; causing<BR>to revolve; bringing to a close; requiting, exchanging;<BR>leaving off a thing begun for some other object;<BR>(अस्), m., N. of a son of Duḥ-saha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तन|परिवर्तनं|परिवर्त्तन|परिवर्त्तनं
परि-वर्तन, अस्, ई, अम्, causing to turn round;<BR>(ई), f. epithet of a particular magical art; (अम्), n.<BR>cutting, clipping (the hair, Ved.); (according to a<BR>Scholiast) = प्रेरण (Ved.); turning round, going<BR>round, turning back, returning; moving to and fro;<BR>whirling round, revolving; revolution, end of a<BR>period of time; inverting, taking or putting anything<BR>in a wrong direction; change, exchange, barter;<BR>requital, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तनीय
परि-वर्तनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be exchanged,<BR>capable of being exchanged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तिका|परिवर्त्तिका
परि-वर्तिका, f. contraction of the prepuce, phi-<BR>mosis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तित|परिवर्त्तित
परि-वर्तित, अस्, आ, अम्, turned round, revolved;<BR>returned, retreated; taken or put on in a wrong<BR>direction; exchanged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तिन्|परिवर्त्तिन्
परि-वर्तिन्, ई, इनी, इ, moving round, going<BR>round, revolving; circling, going in a circle, being<BR>constantly renewed, ever recurring; changing, passing<BR>into; being or remaining or staying in a place or<BR>near a person (e. g. सुग्रीव-परिवर्तिन्, being<BR>about, i. e. in attendance on Su-grīva); flying, re-<BR>treating; exchanging, requiting, recompensing; (इनी),<BR>f., scil. विष्टुति, a hymn arranged according to the<BR>recurring form abc, abc, abc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्त्मन्
परि-वर्त्मन्, आ, आ, अ, Ved. going or extending<BR>round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृत्त
परि-वृत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, revolved, gone round;<BR>turned back, retreated, retired, returned; exchanged,<BR>bartered; finished, ended; (अम्), n. an embrace.<BR>—परिवृत्तार्ध-मुख (˚त-अर्˚), अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>having the face half turned round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृत्ति|परिवृत्तिः
परि-वृत्ति, इस्, f. revolution, return; exchange,<BR>barter; end, termination; surrounding, encompassing;<BR>staying in a place, dwelling; contraction of the pre-<BR>puce, phimosis; (त्या), ind. alternately; (sometimes<BR>परि-वृत्ति is a wrong reading for परि-वित्ति, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृत्य
परि-वृत्य, ind. having turned round, having<BR>revolved; having retreated or retired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृध्
परिवृध् परि-वृध् [cf. परि-वृंह्], cl. 1.<BR>A. (also P. in Fut., Cond., and Aor.) -वर्धते,<BR>-वर्धितुम्, to grow, grow up, increase: Caus.<BR>-वर्धयति, -यितुम्, to increase, augment; to<BR>bring up, rear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्धन|परिवर्धनं
परि-वर्धन, अम्, n. increasing, augmenting,<BR>enlarging, multiplying; growing; rearing, breeding<BR>(as of cattle).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्धित
2. परि-वर्धित, अस्, आ, अम्, increased, augmented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0548-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृद्ध
परि-वृद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, grown, increased.<BR>—परिवृद्ध-ता, f. increase, extension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृद्धि|परिवृद्धिः
परि-वृद्धि, इस्, f. growth, increase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृस्ति
परिवृस्ति परि-वृस्ति, इस्, m. a wrong reading<BR>for परि-वित्ति, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदन|परिवेदनं
परिवेदन 2. परि-वेदन, अम्, n. (probably<BR>a various reading for परि-देवन), complaining,<BR>lamentation. (For 1. see p. 548, col. 1.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदित
परि-वेदित, अस्, आ, अम् (probably for परि-देवित),<BR>lamented; (अम्), n. lamentation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेष|परिवेषः
परिवेष परि-वेष. See p. 548, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेष्ट्
परिवेष्ट् परि-वेष्ट्, cl. 1. A. -वेष्टते,<BR>-वेष्टितुम्, to surround, encompass, encircle; to<BR>wrap up, cover, clothe: Caus. -वेष्टयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to surround; to wrap up, clothe; to embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेष्टन|परिवेष्टनं
परि-वेष्टन, अम्, n. surrounding, encompassing;<BR>circumference; a cover, covering; a ligature, bandage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेष्टित|परिवेष्टितं
परि-वेष्टित, अस्, आ, अम्, surrounded, encompassed,<BR>enclosed; beset, beleaguered; bound round, covered,<BR>veiled, swathed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेष्टितृ
परि-वेष्टितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, Ved. one who sur-<BR>rounds or encompasses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्यक्त
परिव्यक्त परि-व्यक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, very clear<BR>or distinct; (अम्), ind. very clearly or distinctly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्यध्
परिव्यध् परि-व्यध्, cl. 4. P. -विध्यति,<BR>-व्यद्धुम्, to hit, strike, smite, wound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्याध|परिव्याधः
परि-व्याध, अस्, m. a species of reed, Calamus<BR>Fasciculatus; a species of tree, Pterospermum Aceri-<BR>folium; N. of an ancient sage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्यय|परिव्ययः
परिव्यय परि-व्यय, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 5. इ with<BR>परि-वि), expense, cost; condiment, spices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्ये
परिव्ये परि-व्ये, cl. 1. P. A. -व्ययति, -ते,<BR>-व्यातुम्, to surround, invest, wrap round, veil, cover,<BR>put on, wrap one's self up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवी
परि-वी, ईस्, ईस्, इ, Ved. wound round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवीत
परि-वीत, अस्, आ, अम्, surrounded, encompassed,<BR>invested; overspread, pervaded; (अम्), n. the bow<BR>of Brahmā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवीय
परि-वीय, ind. wrapping round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्ययण
परि-व्ययण, अम्, n., Ved. winding round,<BR>covering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्ययणीय
परि-व्ययणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. relating to<BR>wrapping round or binding on (as a verse).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्रज्
परिव्रज् परि-व्रज्, cl. 1. P. -व्रजति, -व्र-<BR>जितुम्, to go or wander about, wander about as a<BR>mendicant, lead the life of a religious mendicant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्रज्य
परि-व्रज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be roamed about or<BR>walked for pleasure; (आ), f. strolling, wandering<BR>about from place to place; religious wandering,<BR>leading the life of a religious mendicant; ascetic<BR>devotion, religious austerity, abandonment of the<BR>world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्राज्
परि-व्राज्, ट्, or परि-व्राज, अस्, m. a vagrant,<BR>wandering man, ascetic of the fourth and last religious<BR>order, a mendicant devotee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्राजक|परिव्राजकः
परि-व्राजक, अस्, इका, m. f. a wandering religious<BR>mendicant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्राजि|परिव्राजिः
परि-व्राजि, इस्, f. a species of plant, Sphæranthus<BR>Mollis; [cf. तपो-धना, भिक्षु.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्राज्य
परि-व्राज्य, अम्, n. religious mendicancy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्रढिमन्
परिव्रढिमन् परि-व्रढिमन्. See under<BR>परि-वृंह्, p. 548, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशङ्क्|परिशंक्
परिशङ्क् परि-शङ्क्, cl. 1. A. -शङ्कते, -शङ्-<BR>कितुम्, to suspect of (with inst.); to distrust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशङ्कनीय|परिशङ्कनीयः
परि-शङ्कनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be doubted or<BR>distrusted; to be feared or apprehended; परिशङ्क-<BR>नीयम्, (used impersonally) distrust must be felt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशङ्किन्|परिशंकिन्
परि-शङ्किन्, ई, इनी, इ, fearing, apprehending,<BR>having apprehensions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशप्
परिशप् परि-शप्, cl. 1. 4. P. A. -शपति,<BR>-ते, -शप्यति, -ते, -शप्तुम्, to curse, execrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशाप
परि-शाप, अस्, m. cursing, reviling, anathema.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशम्
परिशम् परि-शम्, Caus. P. -शमयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to allay, quench; to destroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशमित
परि-शमित, अस्, आ, अम्, allayed, quenched; de-<BR>stroyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशाश्वत
परिशाश्वत परि-शाश्वत, अस्, ई, अम्, remain-<BR>ing or continuing for ever, perpetually the same.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशिष्
परिशिष् परि-शिष्, Caus. P. -शेषयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to leave over, leave (as a remainder); to leave<BR>(a place), quit; with न, to destroy (e. g. मेघ-<BR>नादस्य धनुर् न पर्य्-अशेषयत्, he did not<BR>suffer to remain, i. e. he destroyed the bow of<BR>Megha-nāda).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशिष्ट|परिशिष्टं
परि-शिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, left, remaining; finished;<BR>(अम्), n. a supplement, appendix.<BR>—परिशिष्ट-प्र-<BR>काश, अस्, m., N. of a work by Śrī-nātha-śarman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशेष|परिशेषः
परि-शेष, अस्, आ, अम्, left over, remaining<BR>(Ved.); (अस्, अम्), m. n. remnant, remains, re-<BR>mainder, residue, rest; sequel, supplement; conclu-<BR>sion, completion, termination; (एण), ind. with<BR>the residue or conclusion; to the very end, com-<BR>pletely, in full.<BR>—परिशेष-शास्त्र, अम्, n. a sup-<BR>plementary work, an appendix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशेषण|परिशेषणं
परि-शेषण, अम्, n. remainder, residue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशीलन|परिशीलनं
परिशीलन परि-शीलन, अम्, n. (fr. rt. शील्<BR>with परि), frequent touch or contact, intercourse,<BR>correspondence, constant occupation, fond pursuit of<BR>or attachment to (a subject), study.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुच्
परिशुच् परि-शुच्, cl. 1. P. (ep. also A.)<BR>-शोचति (-ते), -शोचितुम्, to be deeply grieved, mourn,<BR>lament, bewail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुध्
परिशुध् परि-शुध्, Caus. P. -शोधयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to clear, clean, purify completely; to solve,<BR>explain, clear up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुद्ध
परि-शुद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, completely cleansed,<BR>cleaned, purified; acquitted, discharged; cleared off,<BR>paid.<BR>—परिशुद्ध-भाव, अस्, m. cleansed; dis-<BR>charged, paid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुद्धि|परिशुद्धिः
परि-शुद्धि, इस्, f. complete purification, becom-<BR>ing perfectly clean; justification, acquittal, proving<BR>innocent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशोध|परिशोधः
परि-शोध, अस्, m. cleansing, purifying, correct-<BR>ing; discharging a debt or obligation, quittance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशोधन|परिशोधनं
परि-शोधन, अम्, n. purification; justification;<BR>paying, discharging a debt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुश्रूषा
परिशुश्रूषा परि-शुश्रूषा. See under प-<BR>रि-श्रु, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुष्
परिशुष् परि-शुष्, cl. 4. P. (ep. also A.)<BR>-शुष्यति (-ते), -शोष्टुम्, to be thoroughly dried up,<BR>become quite dry; to shrivel, wither; to pine, waste<BR>away; to be afflicted: Caus. -शोषयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to emaciate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुष्क|परिशुष्कं
परि-शुष्क, अस्, आ, अम्, perfectly dried up,<BR>thoroughly dried, completely dry or parched;<BR>withered, shriveled, shrunk (as a vein); hollow (as<BR>the cheeks); परिशुष्कम् मांसम्, meat fried in<BR>ghee, washed and spiced.<BR>—परिशुष्क-तालु, उस्,<BR>उस्, उ, having the palate dried up.<BR>—परिशुष्क-<BR>पलाश, अस्, आ, अम्, having withered foliage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुष्यत्
परि-शुष्यत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, drying up, evaporating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशोष|परिशोषः
परि-शोष, अस्, m. becoming completely dried<BR>up, dryness, desiccation, evaporation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशोषण
परि-शोषण, अस्, आ, अम्, drying up, parching;<BR>(अम्), n. drying, parching, emaciating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशोषिन्
परि-शोषिन्, ई, इणी, इ, drying up, shriveling up,<BR>becoming quite emaciated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशून्य
परिशून्य परि-शून्य, अस्, आ, अम्, quite empty,<BR>quite free from, totally devoid of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशृत|परिशृतः
परिशृत 1. परि-शृत, अस् or अम्, m. or n. (?),<BR>ardent spirits; [cf. परि-स्रुत्, परि-स्रुता.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशॄ
परिशॄ परि-शॄ, Pass. -शीर्यते, to be cleft<BR>or rent asunder, to be split.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रम|परिश्रमः
परिश्रम परि-श्रम, अस्, m. (fr. rt. श्रम्<BR>with परि), fatigue, distress; fatiguing occupation,<BR>labour, exertion, trouble, pain.<BR>—परिश्रमापह<BR>(˚म-अप्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, relieving weariness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रान्त|परिश्रान्तः
परि-श्रान्त, अस्, आ, अम्, thoroughly fatigued,<BR>worn out, exhausted, wearied; one who has per-<BR>formed acts of religious austerity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रान्ति|परिश्रांति|परिश्रांतिः|परिश्रान्तिः
परि-श्रान्ति, इस्, f. fatigue, exhaustion; labour,<BR>trouble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्राम|परिश्रामः
परि-श्राम, अस्, m. fatigue, a fatiguing occu-<BR>pation, exertion, toiling after.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रय|परिश्रयः
परिश्रय परि-श्रय, अस्, m. (fr. rt. श्रि with<BR>परि), an enclosure, fence (Ved.); a refuge, asylum;<BR>an assembly, meeting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रयण|परिश्रयणं
परि-श्रयण, अम्, n. encompassing, surrounding<BR>with a fence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रित्
परि-श्रित्, त्, f., Ved. ‘enclosure,’ epithet of certain<BR>small stones laid round the hearth and other parts of<BR>the altar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रित
2. परि-श्रित, अम्, n., Ved. = परि-वृतम्, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रु
परिश्रु परि-श्रु, cl. 5. P. -शृणोति, -श्रोतुम्,<BR>to hear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुश्रूषा
परि-शुश्रूषा, f. complete or implicit obedience.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रुत|परिश्रुतः
परि-श्रुत, अस्, आ, अम्, heard; (अस्), m., N. of<BR>one of the attendants of Skanda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्लिष्ट
परिश्लिष्ट परि-श्लिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt.<BR>श्लिष् with परि), embraced, clasped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्लेष|परिश्लेषः
परि-श्लेष, अस्, m. embracing, an embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषण्ड|परिषण्डः
परिषण्ड परि-षण्ड, a particular part of<BR>a house.<BR>—परिषण्ड-वारिक, a servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषद्
परिषद् 1. परि-षद् (परि-सद्), cl. 1. 6. P.<BR>-षीदति, -षत्तुम्, Ved. to sit round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषद्
2. परि-षद्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. surrounding, besetting;<BR>(त्), f. an assembly, meeting, audience, congregation,<BR>council.<BR>—परिषत्-त्व, अम्, n. the state of con-<BR>stituting a legal assembly; a legal assemblage of<BR>councillors.<BR>—परिषद्-वल, अस्, आ, अम्, surrounded<BR>by a council; convoking assemblies; (अस्), m. a mem-<BR>ber of an assembly, assessor, associate, spectator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषद|परिषदः
परि-षद, अस्, m. (a various reading for पारि-<BR>षद), one of an assembly or congregation, a<BR>councillor, assessor, a spectator at a play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषद्य|परिषद्यः
परि-षद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be sought after<BR>laboriously (Ved.); to be worshipped (Ved.); to be<BR>avoided (Ved.); (according to Mahī-dhara) belonging<BR>to an assembly; (according to Sāy. on Ṛg-veda<BR>VII. 4, 7, = पर्य्-आप्त), sufficient, adequate, com-<BR>petent; (अस्), m. a member of an assembly, assessor,<BR>hearer, spectator, guest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषद्वन्
परि-षद्वन्, आ, अरी, अ, Ved. surrounding, en-<BR>compassing, besetting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषह्
परिषह् परि-षह् (परि-सह्), cl. 1. A.<BR>-षहते, -षहितुम्, -षोढुम्, to sustain, bear<BR>up against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषिच्
परिषिच् परि-षिच् (परि-सिच्), cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-षिञ्चति, -ते, -षेक्तुम्, to sprinkle round, scatter<BR>about, diffuse: Caus. -षेचयति (ep. -षिञ्चयति),<BR>-यितुम्, to sprinkle round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषेक|परिषेकः
परि-षेक, अस्, m. sprinkling over, moistening;<BR>a bath, bathing apparatus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषेचक
परि-षेचक, अस्, आ, अम्, pouring over, sprinkling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषेचन|परिषेचनं
परि-षेचन, अम्, n. pouring over, sprinkling;<BR>water for watering tress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषीवण|परिषीवणं
परिषीवण परि-षीवण, अम्, n. (fr. rt. सिव्<BR>with परि), Ved. sewing round, winding round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषू
परिषू परि-षू (परि-सू, see rt. 2. सू), cl.<BR>6. P. -षुवति, -षवितुम्, Ved. to besiege, be-<BR>leaguer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषूत
परि-षूत, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. besieged, beleaguered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषूति|परिषूतिः
परि-षूति, इस्, f., Ved. oppression; (Sāy.) violence<BR>(= परितः प्रेरक उपद्रवः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषोडश
परिषोडश परि-षोडश, अस्, ई, अम्, full six-<BR>teen, quite sixteen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कन्द्|परिष्कंद्
परिष्कन्द् परि-ष्कन्द् or परि-स्कन्द्, cl. 1.<BR>P. -ष्कन्दति, -ष्कन्तुम्, to leap about, spring<BR>round or about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कण्ण|परिष्कण्णः
परि-ष्कण्ण or परि-ष्कन्न, अस्, m. a foster<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">Page0550-a+ 75</a>]<BR>or adopted child, one nourished by a stranger; the<BR>Koïl or Indian cuckoo (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0549-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कन्द|परिष्कंद|परिष्कन्दः
परि-ष्कन्द or परि-स्कन्द, अस्, m. a foster<BR>child, one nourished by a stranger; a servant; (औ),<BR>m. du. two servants running by the two sides of a<BR>carriage; (अम्), n. going round or about (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कन्दत्|परिष्कंदत्
परि-ष्कन्दत् or परि-स्कन्दत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्,<BR>leaping about, jumping round, going round or about;<BR>surrounding, circumambulating; wandering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कृ
परिष्कृ परि-ष्-कृ (परि-कृ with स् inserted,<BR>cf. परि-कृ, p. 538, col. 2), cl. 8. P. A. -करोति,<BR>-कुरुते, -कर्तुम्, Ved. to prepare, fit out, equip;<BR>to adorn, decorate; to polish, perfect; to cleanse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कर|परिष्करः
परि-ष्-कर, अस्, m. ornament, decoration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कार|परिष्कारः
परि-ष्-कार, अस्, m. surrounding (?); adorning,<BR>ornament, decoration, embellishment; finishing,<BR>polishing; cooking, dressing; cleansing, purification<BR>by essential rites, initiation; domestic utensils, furni-<BR>ture.<BR>—परिष्कार-चीवर, a kind of garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कृत|परिष्कृतः
परि-ष्-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, surrounded, encom-<BR>passed (?); prepared, equipped; adorned, decorated,<BR>embellished; highly finished, polished; cooked,<BR>dressed; cleansed, purified by initiatory rites.<BR>—प-<BR>रिष्कृत-भूमि, इस्, f. an altar or ground prepared<BR>for a sacrifice or for the victim and sacrificial utensils.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कृति|परिष्कृतिः
परि-ष्-कृति, इस्, f. finishing, polishing; cleansing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्क्रिया
परि-ष्-क्रिया, f. adorning, decorating; (अग्नि-प्˚<BR>is a various reading for अग्नि-परिक्रिया, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्टि|परिष्टिः
परिष्टि परि-ष्टि, इस्, f. (according to some<BR>fr. rt. 1. अस् with परि, but more probably fr. परि-<BR>ष्ठा below; cf. अभि-ष्टि, उप-स्ति), Ved. obstruc-<BR>tion, impediment; distress, dilemma; (Sāy.) searching<BR>all round, (as if fr. rt. 3. इष् with परि.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्टु
परिष्टु परि-ष्टु (परि-स्तु), cl. 2. P. -स्तौति,<BR>-स्तोतुम्, to praise, (Pāṇ. VIII. 3, 70.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्टवनीय
परि-ष्टवनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. intended for<BR>the Pari-ṣṭavana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्टुति
परि-ष्टुति, इस्, f. (fr. परि-स्तु), Ved. praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्टोम|परिष्टोमः
परि-ष्टोम, अस्, m. an elephant's coloured hous-<BR>ings; a coverlet; a cushion; [cf. परि-स्तोम.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्टुभ्
परिष्टुभ् परि-ष्टुभ्, प्, प्, प् (fr. rt. स्तुभ्<BR>with परि), Ved. uttering joyful cries or exulting on<BR>every side; (Sāy.) = स्तुतिभिर् युक्त, endowed or<BR>glorified with praises; (प्), f. exultation, acclamation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्टोभ
परि-ष्टोभ, अस्, m., Ved. embellishing a Sāman<BR>with the so-called Stobhas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्ठल|परिष्ठलं
परिष्ठल परि-ष्ठल, अम्, n. surrounding<BR>place or site.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्ठा
परिष्ठा परि-ष्ठा, आस्, आस्, अम्, Ved. ob-<BR>structing, hindering, an obstructor; (आस्), f. obstruc-<BR>tion, impediment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्यन्द|परिष्यंदः|परिष्यन्दः
परिष्यन्द परि-ष्यन्द or परि-स्यन्द, अस्,<BR>m. (fr. rt. स्यन्द् with परि), a stream, river; wet-<BR>ness, moisture; a sand-bank, island (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्यन्दिन्
परि-ष्यन्दिन् or परि-स्यन्दिन्, ई, इनी, इ, flow-<BR>ing, streaming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वञ्ज्|परिष्वंज्
परिष्वञ्ज् परि-ष्वञ्ज् (परि-स्वञ्ज्), cl. 1.<BR>A. -ष्वजते (rarely P. -ष्वजति), -ष्वङ्क्तुम्, to<BR>embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वक्त
परि-ष्वक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, embraced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वङ्ग|परिष्वंग|परिष्वंगः|परिष्वङ्गः
परि-ष्वङ्ग, अस्, m. embracing, an embrace;<BR>contact, touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वजन
परि-ष्वजन, अम्, n. embracing, an embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वजान
परि-ष्वजान, अस्, आ, अम्, embracing, (Rāmā-<BR>yaṇa II. 83, 10.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वज्य
1. परि-ष्वज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be embraced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वज्य
2. परि-ष्वज्य, ind. having embraced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वञ्जन|परिष्वंजनं
परि-ष्वञ्जन, अम्, n. embracing, an embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वञ्जल्य
परि-ष्वञ्जल्य, अस् or अम्, m. or n. (?), Ved. a<BR>particular domestic utensil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वञ्जीयस्
परि-ष्वञ्जीयस्, आन्, असी, अस्, Ved. clasping more<BR>firmly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वष्कित
परिष्वष्कित परि-ष्वष्कित, अम्, n. (fr. rt.<BR>ष्वष्क् with परि, probably) the act of leaping<BR>about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंलिह्
परिसंलिह् परि-सं-लिह्, cl. 2. P. A. -लेढि,<BR>-लीढे, -लेढुम्, to lick all round, lick over, lick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंवत्सर|परिसंवत्सरः
परिसंवत्सर परि-संवत्सर, अस्, m. a<BR>whole or full year; (आत्), ind. after the expiration<BR>of a whole year; (अस्, आ, अम्), a whole year old; one<BR>who has waited a whole year; (in medicine) chronic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंस्तु
परिसंस्तु परि-सं-स्तु, cl. 2. P. A. -स्तौति,<BR>-स्तवीति, -स्तुते, -स्तुवीते, -स्तोतुम्, to praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंस्तूयमान
परि-संस्तूयमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being praised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंस्थित
परिसंस्थित परि-सं-स्थित, अस्, आ, अम् (fr.<BR>rt. स्था with परि-सम्), standing together on every<BR>side.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंस्पृश्
परिसंस्पृश् परि-सं-स्पृश्, cl. 6. P. -स्पृ-<BR>शति, -स्प्रष्टुम्, -स्पर्ष्टुम्, to touch, stroke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंहा
परिसंहा परि-सं-हा, cl. 3. A. -जिहीते, -हा-<BR>तुम्, Ved. to lay aside, abandon (Sāy. = परि-त्यज्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंहृष्ट
परिसंहृष्ट परि-सं-हृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, very<BR>glad, greatly rejoiced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसख्य
परिसख्य परि-सख्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved.<BR>being on friendly terms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसङ्क्रीड्|परिसंक्रीड्
परिसङ्क्रीड् परि-सङ्-क्रीड्, cl. 1. P. -क्रीडति,<BR>-क्रीडितुम्, to play about, jest, amuse one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसङ्क्रीडत्
परि-सङ्क्रीडत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, playing about,<BR>indulging in amusements.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसङ्क्षिप्|परिसंक्षिप्
परिसङ्क्षिप् परि-सङ्-क्षिप्, cl. 6. P. A.<BR>-क्षिपति, -ते, -क्षेप्तुम्, to encompass, encircle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसङ्ख्या|परिसंख्या
परिसङ्ख्या 1. परि-सङ्-ख्या, cl. 2. P. -ख्या-<BR>ति, -ख्यातुम्, to count over, count up, reckon up,<BR>calculate, add together; to enumerate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0550-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसङ्ख्या|परिसंख्या
