परि-स्पन्दत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, trembling, quivering,<BR>tottering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्पन्दन|परिस्पन्दनं
परि-स्पन्दन, अम्, n. beating, throbbing, vibra-<BR>tion, moving about, motion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्पन्दमान|परिस्पन्दमानः
परि-स्पन्दमान, अस्, आ, अम्, throbbing, beat-<BR>ing; moving tremulously, gently agitated, shaking,<BR>trembling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्पर्धिन्
परिस्पर्धिन् परि-स्पर्धिन्, ई, इनी, इ (fr. rt.<BR>स्पर्ध् with परि), vying with, rivalling, emulating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्पृध्
परि-स्पृध्, त्, f., Ved. a rival.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्पृश्
परिस्पृश् परि-स्पृश्, cl. 6. P. -स्पृशति,<BR>-स्पर्ष्टुम्, -स्प्रष्टुम्, to touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्फुट
परिस्फुट परि-स्फुट, अस्, आ, अम्, very clear<BR>or manifest, quite evident or plain or distinct; fully<BR>developed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्फुर्
परिस्फुर् परि-स्फुर्, cl. 6. P. -स्फुरति,<BR>-स्फुरितुम्, to throb, quiver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्फुरण|परिस्फुरणं
परि-स्फुरण, अम्, n. quivering, glancing, shoot-<BR>ing; budding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्फुरत्
परि-स्फुरत्, अन्, अती or अन्ती, अत्, quivering; dart-<BR>ing, glancing, gleaming, moving quickly or suddenly;<BR>budding, expanding; bursting forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्फुरित
परि-स्फुरित, अस्, आ, अम्, quivering, glancing,<BR>gleaming; opened, expanded; shot, glanced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्मापन
परिस्मापन परि-स्मापन, अम्, n. (fr. Caus.<BR>of rt. स्मि with परि), causing wonder, surprising,<BR>outwitting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्यन्द|परिस्यंद|परिस्यंदः|परिस्यन्दः
परिस्यन्द परि-स्यन्द, अस्, m. (also परि-<BR>ष्यन्द, q. v.), flow, stream, river; oozing, drop-<BR>ping; train, retinue; decoration of the hair (=<BR>परि-स्पन्द).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्यन्दन
परि-स्यन्दन, अम्, n. dropping, flowing, oozing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रजिन्
परिस्रजिन् परि-स्रजिन्, ई, इनी, इ, Ved. wear-<BR>ing a garland.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रसा
परिस्रसा परि-स्रसा, f. (fr. rt. स्रंस् with<BR>परि), Ved. rubbish, lumber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रु
परिस्रु परि-स्रु, cl. 1. P. -स्रवति, -स्रोतुम्,<BR>to flow round, flow, stream, trickle; to ask (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रव|परिस्रवः
परि-स्रव, अस्, m. (erroneously written परि-<BR>श्रव), flowing, streaming, stream; a river, torrent;<BR>birth (of a child); gliding down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रवत्
परि-स्रवत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, flowing down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्राव|परिस्रावः
परि-स्राव, अस्, m. ‘flowing,’ N. of a morbid<BR>state ascribed to the overflowing of the moistures of<BR>the body; efflux, effluxion.<BR>—परिस्राव-कल्प, a<BR>kind of straining or filtering vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रावण|परिस्रावणं
परि-स्रावण, अम्, n. a straining or filtering vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्राविन्
परि-स्राविन्, ई, इणी, इ, flowing; (ई), m., scil.<BR>भगन्-दर, a form of fistula of the anus; (इ),<BR>n., scil. उदर, an incurable form of intumescence<BR>of the belly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रुत्
परि-स्रुत्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. streaming or flowing round<BR>or over, foaming, fermenting; (त्), f. a kind of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">Page0551-b+ 74</a>]<BR>intoxicating liquor prepared from herbs; dropping,<BR>flowing.<BR>—परिस्रुन्-मत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. possess-<BR>ing Pari-srut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रुत|परिस्रुतः
परि-स्रुत, अस्, आ, अम्, flowed, streamed round;<BR>trickled, oozed; (आ), f. a kind of intoxicating liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्वार
परिस्वार परि-स्वार, अस्, m., Ved. a par-<BR>ticular kind of singing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहत
परिहत परि-हत, अस्, आ, अम्, (fr. rt. हन्<BR>with परि), loosed, loosened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहरण|परिहरणं
परिहरण परि-हरण. See परि-हृ below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहव
परिहव परि-हव, अस्, m., Ved. (fr. rt. ह्वे<BR>with परि), crying or calling upon (?); invoking (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहस्
परिहस् परि-हस्, cl. 1. P. -हसति, -हसितुम्,<BR>to laugh at, ridicule, deride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहसित
परि-हसित, अस्, आ, अम्, laughed at, ridiculed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहास|परिहासः
परि-हास, अस्, m. jesting, joking, mirth, merri-<BR>ment, a jest, joke; laughter; laughing at, deriding,<BR>ridiculing.<BR>—परिहास-कथा, f. an amusing story.<BR>—परिहास-पुर, अम्, n., N. of a town.<BR>—परि-<BR>हास-वेदिन्, ई, m. a jester, a wag, wit.<BR>—परिहास-<BR>शील, अस्, आ, अम्, of a gay or joyous disposition.<BR>—परिहास-हरि, इस्, m., N. of a temple of Viṣṇu;<BR>[cf. परीहास-केशव.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहास्य
परि-हास्य, अस्, आ, अम्, laughable, ridiculous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहस्त|परिहस्तः
परिहस्त परि-हस्त, अस्, m., Ved. a ring<BR>for the hand, an amulet put round the hand to<BR>secure the birth of a child.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहा
परिहा परि-हा, Pass. -हीयते, to wane,<BR>fail, waste away, decrease; to be wanting; to want<BR>or be deficient in or be destitute of (with abl.); to<BR>be deprived of or excluded from (with abl.); to be<BR>abandoned; to be avoided or omitted; (in Mahā-bh.<BR>Sabhā-p. 1460 the form परि-हास्यति occurs, said<BR>to mean ‘will fail’): Caus. -हापयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>abandon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहाण|परिहाणं
परि-हाण, अम्, n., Ved. suffering loss, losing;<BR>coming short of, being deficient, diminution, decrease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहाणि|परिहाणिः
परि-हाणि, इस्, f. decrease, loss, deficiency.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहीण
परि-हीण, अस्, आ, अम्, waned, faded, wasted;<BR>deserted by; deprived of, destitute of; wanting,<BR>deficient in (with abl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहीयमान
परि-हीयमान, अस्, आ, अम्, wasting away, dimin-<BR>ishing, becoming emaciated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहाटक
परिहाटक परि-हाटक, अम्, n. a ring worn<BR>round the arm or leg, an armlet, anklet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहार|परिहारः
परिहार परि-हार. See परि-हृ below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहास|परिहासः
परिहास परि-हास. See परि-हस् above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहि
परिहि परि-हि, cl. 5. P. -हिनोति, -हेतुम्,<BR>Ved. to prepare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहित
परिहित परि-हित. See परि-धा, p. 543.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहृ
परिहृ परि-हृ, cl. 1. P. A. -हरति, -ते,<BR>-हर्तुम्, to avoid, shun, pass by; to abandon,<BR>desert, leave; to refute; to conceal; to embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहरण|परिहरणं
परि-हरण, अम्, n. moving, carrying or placing<BR>round or about (Ved.); avoiding; leaving, abandon-<BR>ing; seizing, taking; refuting, repelling; disap-<BR>pearing (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहरणीय
परि-हरणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be shunned or<BR>avoided, avoidable; to be taken away; to be repelled<BR>or refuted or confuted.<BR>—परिहरणीय-ता, f. avoid-<BR>ableness; disappearance, unattainableness; refuta-<BR>tion (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहरत्
परि-हरत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, shunning, avoiding,<BR>illuding; setting aside, taking away, humbling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहरमाण
परि-हरमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, leaving, quitting;<BR>taking, seizing; confuting; concealing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहर्तव्य|परिहर्त्तव्य
परि-हर्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be shunned or<BR>avoided, to be abstained from; to be taken away;<BR>to be confuted; (in Vedic grammar) to be constructed<BR>with the परि-हार, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहार|परिहारः
परि-हार, अस्, m. leading round; avoiding,<BR>shunning, leaving, deserting, abandoning, giving up,<BR>resigning; taking away, removing (e. g. विरोध-<BR>परिहार, removing a contradiction); repelling (a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">Page0551-c+ 79</a>]<BR>charge), confutation; seizing, keeping back; omit-<BR>ting, concealing; reserve, concealment; omitting to<BR>mention, leaving out; an extraordinary grant, ex-<BR>emption from taxes, granting privileges, immunity;<BR>bounty, largess; a circuit of common land round a<BR>village or town; (in grammar) the repetition of a<BR>word before and after इति (= परि-ग्रह, q. v.);<BR>contempt, disrespect; any objectionable thing or per-<BR>son; objection; remedying or atoning for any im-<BR>proper action.<BR>—परिहार-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, avoid-<BR>able.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहारक|परिहारकः
परि-हारक, अस्, इका, अम्, repelling, refuting;<BR>(अस् or अम्), m. or n. ? (a various reading has<BR>परि-हरक), an armlet; [cf. परि-हाटक.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहारिन्
परि-हारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, avoiding, shunning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहार्य|परिहार्यः|परिहार्य्य|परिहार्य्यः
परि-हार्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be shunned or avoided;<BR>to be left undone; to be escaped from; to be taken<BR>off or away; to be severed or separated; to be con-<BR>structed with the परि-हार; (अस्), m. a bracelet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहृत|परिहृतः
परि-हृत, अस्, आ, अम्, avoided, shunned; aban-<BR>doned, quitted; set aside, removed, rejected; taken<BR>away, repelled, refuted; taken, seized.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहृति|परिहृतिः
परि-हृति, इस्, f. shunning, avoiding, refuting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहृत्य
परि-हृत्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. to be avoided,<BR>avoidable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहृष्
परिहृष् परि-हृष्, Caus. P. -हर्षयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to delight or gladden greatly, cause to rejoice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहर्षण
परि-हर्षण, अस्, ई, अम्, greatly delighting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिह्रुत्
परिह्रुत् परि-ह्रुत्, त्, त्, त् (fr. rt. ह्वृ with<BR>परि), Ved. causing to fall, destroying, injuring,<BR>ruining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिह्वृत्
परि-ह्वृत्, त्, f., Ved. falling to the ground,<BR>falling down, ruined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिह्वृति
परि-ह्वृति, इस्, f., Ved. damage, injury, ruin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परी
परी परी (परि-इ, see rt. 5. इ), cl. 2. P.<BR>पर्य्-एति, -एतुम्, to go about, move in a circle, go<BR>or flow round, walk round, circumambulate, roam<BR>about; to encompass, encircle, include, grasp, span;<BR>to run against; to reach, attain to; (with or without<BR>मनसा) to perceive, ponder: Intens., Ved. परीयते,<BR>to revolve round, move round, move in a circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीत|परीतं
परीत, अस्, आ, अम्, encircling, surrounding; past,<BR>elapsed, expired; departed; surrounded, encompassed;<BR>filled; taken possession of, seized.<BR>—परीत-ता, f.<BR>the being surrounded or filled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीतिन्
परीतिन्, ई, इनी, इ (at the end of a comp.), =<BR>परीत, filled with, seized by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीत्य
परीत्य, ind. having passed round or circum-<BR>ambulated; having encompassed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीयमाण
परीयमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, being penetrated or<BR>pervaded by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यय|पर्ययः|पर्य्यय|पर्य्ययः
पर्य्-अय, अस्, m. revolution (of time), passing<BR>away, lapse, expiration (e. g. काल-पर्ययात्, after<BR>the lapse of a certain time); waste or loss (of time);<BR>change, mutation, alteration [cf. वास-प्˚]; inver-<BR>sion, irregular or inverted order, confusion; con-<BR>trariety, opposition; deviation from enjoined or<BR>customary observances, neglect of duty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ययण|पर्ययणं|पर्य्ययण|पर्य्ययणं
पर्य्-अयण, अम्, n. going round, walking round,<BR>circumambulating, roving about; anything wound<BR>round (an arrow or other object); a horse's saddle or<BR>housings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याय|पर्यायः|पर्य्याय|पर्य्यायः
पर्य्-आय, अस्, m. going or turning round, revolv-<BR>ing, winding round; revolution, passing away (of<BR>time), course, lapse, expiration; regular recurrence,<BR>repetition; succession, turn; regular order, arrange-<BR>ment, methodical disposition, method; a regularly<BR>recurring series or formula, especially in the Ati-rātra<BR>ceremony (Ved.); a strophe or clause of a hymn<BR>(Ved.); a convertible term, synonym; a list of<BR>synonyms; N. of a particular figure in rhetoric;<BR>way, manner, mode, method of proceeding (e. g.<BR>अनेन पर्यायेण, in this manner); property,<BR>quality, generic or specific character; opportunity,<BR>occasion; formation, creation, manufacture, prepara-<BR>tion, artificial production; comprehensiveness, ag-<BR>gregation; पर्यायेण, in succession, in turn, by<BR>turns, by rotation, successively, alternately, (opposed<BR>to युग-पत्.)<BR>—पर्याय-क्रम, अस्, m. order of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">Page0552-a+ 74</a>]<BR>succession, regular rotation or turn.<BR>—पर्याय-<BR>च्युत, अस्, आ, अम्, one who has lost his turn, su-<BR>perseded, supplanted.<BR>—पर्याय-रत्न-माला, f.<BR>‘pearl-string of synonyms,’ N. of a lexicon.<BR>—पर्-<BR>याय-वचन, अम्, n. a convertible term, synonym.<BR>—पर्याय-वाचक, अस्, आ, अम्, expressing a cor-<BR>responding notion.<BR>—पर्याय-वृत्ति, इस्, f. alternate<BR>course or action.<BR>—पर्याय-शब्द, अस्, m. a con-<BR>vertible term, synonym.<BR>—पर्याय-शयन, अम्,<BR>n. alternate sleeping and watching.<BR>—पर्याय-शस्,<BR>ind. by phrases or sentences, &c. (Ved.); periodically;<BR>in succession, by rotation, by turns, seriatim.<BR>—पर्-<BR>यायान्न (˚य-अन्˚), अम्, n. food intended for an-<BR>other, food that should have been given to some one<BR>else (as that of a Śūdra to a Brāhman).<BR>—पर्या-<BR>यार्णव (˚य-अर्˚), अस्, m. ‘ocean of synonyms,’ N.<BR>of a lexicon.<BR>—पर्यायोक्त (˚य-उक्˚), अम्, n., N.<BR>of a particular figure in rhetoric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0551-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यायिक
पर्यायिक, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. composed in strophes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यायिन्
पर्यायिन्, ई, इणी, इ, Ved. embracing, including;<BR>going round, encompassing (in a hostile manner);<BR>periodical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्ष्
परीक्ष् परीक्ष् (परि-ईक्ष्), cl. 1. A. -ईक्षते,<BR>-ईक्षितुम्, to look round, inspect carefully, examine,<BR>investigate, scrutinize; to observe, perceive: Caus.<BR>-ईक्षयति, -यितुम्, to cause to examine or inves-<BR>tigate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षक|परीक्षकः
परीक्षक, अस्, आ, अम्, trying, testing, examin-<BR>ing; (अस्), m. a prover, examiner, experimenter,<BR>investigator, judge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षण|परीक्षणं
परीक्षण, अम्, n. trying, testing, experiment,<BR>examination, putting to the test, trying, proving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षणीय
परीक्षणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be tried or investi-<BR>gated, fit to be brought to the test, to be submitted<BR>to ordeal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षा
परीक्षा, f. investigation, examination, test, trial,<BR>experiment, discrimination; trial by ordeal of various<BR>kinds; N. of a commentary on Piṅgala's Chandaḥ-<BR>śāstra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षित|परीक्षितः
1. परीक्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, carefully inspected, tried,<BR>examined, tested, proved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षितव्य
परीक्षितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be tried or tested,<BR>to be examined or proved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षिन्
परीक्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ, proving, testing, one who<BR>tries or examines, an examiner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्ष्य
परीक्ष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be tried or tested; to<BR>be examined or proved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षित्
परीक्षित् परी-क्षित्, त्, m. (connected with<BR>and frequently written परि-क्षित्), N. of a son of<BR>Abhi-manyu and father of Janam-ejaya; of a son of<BR>Kuru; of a son of An-aśvan and father of Bhīma-<BR>sena; of a king of A-yodhyā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षित|परीक्षितः
2. परी-क्षित, अस्, m. = परी-क्षित्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीज्या
परीज्या परीज्या (for परि-इज्या, fr. rt. यज्<BR>with परि), Ved. an accompanying or secondary<BR>rite (= परि-यज्ञ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीणस्
परीणस् परीणस्, आस्, m. (probably fr. rt.<BR>पॄ), Ved. plenty, abundance, wealth; (according to<BR>Sāy.) = परितो नद्ध; (असा), ind. = बहु, richly,<BR>abundantly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीणस
परीणस, अम्, n., Ved. plenty, abundance, wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीणह्
परीणह् परी-णह्. See परि-णह्, p. 542.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीणाह|परीणाहः
परी-णाह = परि-णाह, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीणाम|परीणामः
परीणाम परी-णाम = परि-णाम, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीणाय|परीणायः
परीणाय परी-णाय = परि-णाय, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीत|परीतं
परीत परीत, &c. See परी, p. 551, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीतत्
परीतत् परी-तत्. See परि-तन्, p. 542.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीताप
परीताप परी-ताप, परी-तोष, = परि-ताप,<BR>परि-तोष, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीति
परीति परीति = पुष्पाञ्जन, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीत्त
परीत्त 2. परी-त्त (fr. परि-दो, p. 543, col. 2,<BR>or identified by some with 1. परी-त्त, p. 543, col. 1),<BR>cut round, incomplete, limited, circumscribed, not<BR>too much, little.<BR>—परीत्त-शुभ, आस्, m. pl. (with<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">Page0552-b+ 66</a>]<BR>Buddhists) N. of the gods of the thirteenth order.<BR>—परीत्ताभ (˚त-आभ), आस्, m. pl. (with Bud-<BR>dhists) N. of the gods of the tenth order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीदाह|परीदाहः
परीदाह परी-दाह = परि-दाह, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीधान|परीधानं
परीधान परी-धान = परि-धान, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीधाविन्
परीधाविन् परी-धाविन्. See परि-धाविन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीध्य
परीध्य परीध्य, अस्, आ, अम्, (fr. rt. इन्ध्<BR>with परि), Ved. to be lighted or kindled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीपाक|परीपाकः
परीपाक परी-पाक = परि-पाक, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीप्सत्
परीप्सत् परीप्सत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत् (pres. part.<BR>of Desid. of rt. आप् with परि), wishing to obtain,<BR>striving to reach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीप्समान
परीप्समान, अस्, आ, अम्, = परीप्सत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीप्सा
परीप्सा, f. the desire of obtaining; the wish to<BR>save or maintain or preserve; haste, hurry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीप्सु
परीप्सु, उस्, उस्, उ, desirous of obtaining, wishing<BR>to save, desirous of maintaining or preserving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीभाव|परीभावः
परीभाव परी-भाव = परि-भाव, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीमन्
परीमन् परीमन्, आ or अ, m. or n.? (fr.<BR>rt. पॄ), Ved. bounty, plenty, plenteousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीमाण|परीमाणं
परीमाण परी-माण = परि-माण, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीयमाण
परीयमाण परीयमाण. See परी, p. 551.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीर|परीरं
परीर परीर, अम्, n. (said to be fr. rt.<BR>पॄ), fruit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीरण|परीरणं
परीरण परीरण, अस्, m. a tortoise; a<BR>stick or staff; = पट्ट-शाटक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीरम्भ|परीरंभ|परीरंभः|परीरम्भः
परीरम्भ परी-रम्भ, अस्, m. an embrace,<BR>&c. See परि-रम्भ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवर्त|परीवर्तः|परीवर्त्त|परीवर्त्तः
परीवर्त परी-वर्त, अस्, m. exchange, bar-<BR>ter, &c. See परि-वर्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवाद|परीवादः
परीवाद परी-वाद, अस्, m. reproof, censure,<BR>abuse, &c. See परि-वाद.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवार|परीवारः
परीवार परी-वार, अस्, m. retinue, depend-<BR>ants, family, &c. See परि-वार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवाह|परीवाहः
परीवाह परी-वाह, अस्, m. a drain, &c., see<BR>परि-वाह; a scabbard (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवेत्तृ
परीवेत्तृ परी-वेत्तृ = परि-वेत्तृ, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवेश|परीवेशः
परीवेश परी-वेश = परि-वेष, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीशास
परीशास परी-शास, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 1. शस्<BR>with परि), Ved. anything cut out, an excision;<BR>(औ), m. du. a kind of tongs used for raising a kettle<BR>from the fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीशेष|परीशेषः
परीशेष परी-शेष = परि-शेष, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीष्
परीष् परीष् [cf. rt. 3. इष्], cl. 6. P. -इच्-<BR>छति, -एषितुम्, -एष्टुम्, Ved. to seek or search<BR>about for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीष्टि|परीष्टिः
परीष्टि, इस्, f. investigation, research, inquiry,<BR>(especially philosophical); service, attendance, rever-<BR>ence, respect, homage, worship; willingness, readi-<BR>ness, inclination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीषेक
परीषेक परी-षेक = परि-षेक, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीसार|परीसारः
परीसार परी-सार, अस्, m. = परि-सार, q. v.;<BR>near approach (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीहार|परीहारः
परीहार परी-हार = परि-हार, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीहास|परीहासः
परीहास परी-हास = परि-हास, q. v.<BR>—प-<BR>रीहास-केशव, अस्, m., N. of a temple of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परु|परुः
परु परु, उस्, m. (said to be fr. rt. पॄ), a<BR>limb, member; a knot or joint in a reed; a moun-<BR>tain; the ocean; the sky, paradise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुशस्
परु-शस् or परुश्-शस्, Ved. limb by limb,<BR>member by member.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुष|परुषं
परुष, अस्, आ, अम्, (in the earlier language, f.<BR>परुष्णी), containing knots, knotted (Ved.); spotted,<BR>variegated, party-coloured; dirty; rough, rugged,<BR>uneven, shaggy; keen, piercing (as the wind);<BR>harsh, discordant; unkind, cruel, stern, hard, severe,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">Page0552-c+ 74</a>]<BR>abusive, contumelious; coarse, gross; churlish, cruel,<BR>unkind; (अस्), m. a reed (Ved.); an arrow (Ved.);<BR>= परूष, q. v.; (आ), f. a kind of riddle; (ष्णी),<BR>f., Ved. ‘much indented’ or ‘winding’ or ‘reedy,’<BR>N. of one of the rivers of the Pañjāb, in later times<BR>called Irā-vatī, and at the present day Rāvī; a<BR>cloud?; (अम्), n. harsh and contumelious speech,<BR>abuse; a species of Barleria with blue flowers; =<BR>परूष, q. v.; (आणि), n. pl. rough or harsh or<BR>stern words.<BR>—परुष-त्व, अम्, n. roughness,<BR>harshness.<BR>—परुष-वचन, अम्, n. harsh language,<BR>harsh or contumelious speech, reproach, abuse.<BR>—प-<BR>रुष-वाच्, क्, क्, क्, harsh-spoken; (क्), f. harsh or<BR>contumelious speech.<BR>—परुषाक्षर (˚ष-अक्˚),<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, ‘harsh-worded,’ harsh.<BR>—परुषाह्व<BR>(˚ष-आह्˚), अस्, m., Ved. a species of reed.<BR>—परुषी-<BR>कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, spotted, soiled, stained; treated<BR>roughly.<BR>—परुषेतर (˚ष-इत्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, other<BR>than rough, bright, light, beaming, mild.<BR>—परु-<BR>षोक्ति (˚ष-उक्˚), इस्, f. abusive or harsh language.<BR>—परुषोक्तिक, अस्, m. an abuser, one uttering<BR>harsh and scurrilous language.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुषित
परुषित, अस्, आ, अम्, treated roughly or harshly,<BR>subjected to rude treatment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुषिमन्
परुषिमन्, आ, m., Ved. a rough or shaggy<BR>appearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुष्य
परुष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. party-coloured, varie-<BR>gated, piebald.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुस्
परुस्, उस्, n., Ved. a knot or joint of a cane or<BR>reed; a member of the body, limb; a joint, junction;<BR>a part cut off, portion.<BR>—परुः-स्रंस, अस्, m., Ved.<BR>fracture of a joint or limb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परूष|परूषं
परूष or परूषक, अस्, m. Grewia Asiatica<BR>(from the berries of which a cooling beverage is pre-<BR>pared; Bengāli फलसा; Hindūstānī پهالسا ac-<BR>cording to others) Xylocarpus Granatum = Bengāli,<BR>परुष; (अम्), n. the fruit of this tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुच्छेप
परुच्छेप परु-च्छेप, अस्, m. (perhaps irre-<BR>gularly formed fr. परुस् + क्षेप), N. of a Ṛṣi,<BR>son of Divo-dāsa and author of the hymns Ṛg-<BR>veda I. 127 sqq.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुत्
परुत् परुत्, ind. (fr. पर + वत्?, occur-<BR>ring only in comp.), last year; [cf. Gr. πέρυσι, Dor.<BR>πέρυτι, πέρυτις: Old Germ. vert, vernent, vern,<BR>‘last year:’ Goth. fairni-s, ‘old;’ fairnyō yēr, ‘the<BR>old year.’]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुद्वार|परुद्वारः
परुद्वार परुद्वार or परुल, अस्, m. a<BR>horse; [cf. Lat. paraveredus.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुष|परुषं
परुष परुष. See under परु, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परे
परे परे (परा-इ, see rt. 5. इ), cl. 2, P.<BR>परैति, परैतुम्, to go away, run away; to go<BR>to, set out for, approach; to go to the other world,<BR>depart, die.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेत|परेतः
परेत, अस्, आ, अम्, departed, deceased, defunct,<BR>dead; (अस्), m. a kind of spectre; a ghost, spirit.<BR>—परेत-भूमि, इस्, f. ‘place of the departed,’ a<BR>cemetery.<BR>—परेत-राज्, ट्, m. ‘ruler of the dead,’<BR>an epithet of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेति|परेतिः
परेति, इस्, f., Ved. departure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेक्ष्
परेक्ष् परेक्ष् (परा-ईक्ष्), cl. 1. A. परे-<BR>क्षते, -षितुम्, Ved. to look at (anything at one's<BR>side).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेद्यवि
परेद्यवि परे-द्यवि, परे-द्युस्, परे-प्राण.<BR>See under पर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेप|परेपं
परेप परेप, अस्, आ, अम्, (fr. परा? + अप्),<BR>(any place) whence water has retired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेमन्
परेमन् परेमन्, Ved. (perhaps) = परीमन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेष्टु
परेष्टु परेष्टु, उस्, or परेष्टुका, f. a cow<BR>which has often calved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोंहु
परोंहु परो-ऽंहु. See under परस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्ष|परोक्षं|परोक्षः
परोक्ष परो-ऽक्ष, अस्, आ, अम्, (fr. परस् +<BR>४. अक्ष, opposed to प्रत्य्-अक्ष, q. v.), beyond<BR>the range of sight, out of sight, invisible, imper-<BR>ceptible, escaping observation; unknown, strange,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">Page0553-a+ 77</a>]<BR>unintelligible; absent, past; (अस्), m. an ascetic,<BR>religious hermit; N. of one of the sons of Anu; (आ),<BR>f. past or completed action (in grammar perhaps<BR>with वृत्ति); (अम्), n. invisibility, absence, secrecy;<BR>(in grammar) past time or tense. The acc., inst.,<BR>abl., and loc. cases of परोक्ष are used adverbially,<BR>as follow: (अम्), ind. out of sight, behind one's<BR>back, in the absence of, without the knowledge of<BR>(in the earlier language with inst., in the later with<BR>gen.); surreptitiously; (एण), ind., Ved. out of<BR>sight, secretly, mysteriously, surreptitiously; (आत्),<BR>ind., Ved. secretly, without the knowledge of (with<BR>inst.); (ए), ind. behind one's back, in the absence<BR>of, imperceptibly, surreptitiously; [cf. अ-परोक्ष.]<BR>—परोक्ष-कृता, f., Ved., scil. ऋक्, a hymn or<BR>verse in which a deity is spoken of in the third<BR>person, the first person being kept out of sight<BR>(e. g. ‘Indra rules over heaven and earth,’ &c.).<BR>—प-<BR>रोक्ष-जित्, त्, त्, त्, conquering invisibly, an unseen<BR>conqueror.<BR>—परोक्ष-ता, f. or परोक्ष-त्व, अम्,<BR>n. the being beyond the sphere of observation, ob-<BR>scurity, invisibility, imperceptibility; keeping one's<BR>self as the first person out of sight, speaking of one's<BR>self in the third person (Ved.).<BR>—परोक्ष-भोग,<BR>अस्, m. enjoyment or possession of anything in the<BR>absence of the proprietor.<BR>—परोक्ष-मन्मथ,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, inexperienced in love, a stranger to love.<BR>—परोक्ष-वृत्ति, इस्, इस्, इ, whose life is unseen,<BR>living out of sight; formed out of sight or unseen,<BR>formed in obscurity; (इस्), f. an unseen life.<BR>—प-<BR>रोक्षार्थ (˚ष-अर्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, having an<BR>unseen meaning, secret, recondite; (अम्), n. an<BR>absent or invisible object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0552-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोगव्यूति
परो-गव्यूति, ind. (fr. परस् + ग्˚), Ved. beyond<BR>or outside the pasture land; (Sāy.) = क्रोश-द्वयाद्<BR>देशात् परस्तात्, further than a Gavyūti, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोबाहु
परो-बाहु, ind. (fr. परस् + ब्˚), Ved. beyond<BR>the arm or reach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोमात्र
परो-मात्र, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. परस् + म्˚), Ved.<BR>immense, huge, vast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोरजस्
परो-रजस्, आस्, आस्, अस् (fr. परस् + र्˚), Ved.<BR>being beyond the dust or above the world (Ved.);<BR>untouched by passion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोलक्ष
परो-लक्ष, अस्, आ, अम्, (fr. परस् + ल्˚), over a<BR>lakh, more than 100, 000.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोवरम्
परो-ऽवरम् (fr. परस् + अव्˚), ind., Ved. from<BR>top to bottom; from hand to hand; in succession,<BR>one after another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोवरीण|परोवरीणः
परो-ऽवरीण, अस्, आ, अम्, (fr. परस् + अव्˚), having<BR>both superior and inferior, prior and subsequent, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोवरीयस्
परो-वरीयस्, आन्, असी, अस् (fr. परस् + व्˚), Ved.<BR>broader on the outside or at the top; better than<BR>good, most excellent of all; (अस्), n. the highest<BR>happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोष्णिह्
परोष्णिह् (fr. परस् + उष्˚), क्, f. a kind of<BR>metre (consisting of 8 + 8 + 12 syllables).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्त
परोक्त परोक्त, परोच्य. See परा-वच्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोष्णी
परोष्णी परोष्णी, f. a cockroach, (some-<BR>times wrongly written परोष्टी); N. of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्क
पर्क पर्क in मधु-प्˚, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्कट|पर्कटः
पर्कट पर्कट, अस्, m. a heron [cf. वकोट];<BR>(अम्), n. regret, anxiety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्कटिन्|पर्क्कटिन्
पर्कटिन्, ई, m. or पर्कटी, f. the waved-leaved<BR>fig-tree, Ficus Infectoria; a fresh betel-nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्जनी|पर्ज्जनी
पर्जनी पर्जनी. See col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्जन्य|पर्जन्यः|पर्ज्जन्य|पर्ज्जन्यः
पर्जन्य पर्जन्य, अस्, m. (perhaps fr. स्फुर्ज्<BR>for original स्पर्ज्; but said to be fr. rt. पृष्;<BR>sometimes wrongly written पर्यन्य), a rain-cloud,<BR>thunder-cloud, cloud; the muttering of clouds or<BR>distant thunder; rain; Rain personified; the rain-<BR>god, thunderer and fertilizer, i. e. Indra; N. of one<BR>of the twelve Ādityas; of a Deva-gandharva; of<BR>one of the seven Ṛṣis in several Manv-antaras; of<BR>a Prajā-pati and father of Hiraṇya-roman; (आ), f. =<BR>पर्जनी, col. 2.<BR>—पर्जन्य-क्रन्द्य, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>Ved. muttering like a rain-cloud or like Parjanya.<BR>—पर्जन्य-जिन्वित, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. animated by<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-b" target="_blank">Page0553-b+ 80</a>]<BR>Parjanya; (Sāy.) = पर्जन्येन प्रीत, agreeable to<BR>Parjanya.<BR>—पर्जन्य-नाथ, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. having<BR>Parjanya as protector or patron.<BR>—पर्जन्य-पत्नी,<BR>f., Ved. having Parjanya for a husband, wedded to<BR>Parjanya (said of the earth).<BR>—पर्जन्य-रेतस्, आस्,<BR>आस्, अस्, Ved. generated or growing in the showers or<BR>in the rainy season, (said of a reed or arrow; Sāy.<BR>= पर्जन्यो रेतो यस्याः.)<BR>—पर्जन्य-वृद्ध,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. nourished by Parjanya (as the<BR>Soma).<BR>—पर्जन्य-सूक्त, अम्, n., N. of a hymn<BR>contained in the Mantra-saṃhitā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्जनी|पर्ज्जनी
पर्जनी, f. the plant Cucumis Aromatica or Cu-<BR>cumis Xanthorrhiza.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ण्
पर्ण् पर्ण् (more properly regarded as<BR>a Nom. fr. पर्ण below), cl. 10. P.<BR>पर्णयति, -यितुम्, to be green or verdant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ण|पर्णं|पर्णः
पर्ण, अम्, n. (said to be fr. rt. पॄ), a pinion,<BR>feather, wing; the feather of an arrow; a leaf (re-<BR>garded as the plumage of a tree); the Pān or betel<BR>leaf; (अस्), m. Butea Frondosa (a beautiful sacred<BR>tree with leaves from eight to sixteen inches in length,<BR>of the wood of which particular sacrificial vessels<BR>are made, in later times generally called पलाश);<BR>N. of a man; of a teacher; of a place; (ई), f. an<BR>aquatic plant, Pistia Stratiotes; the leaf of the Asa<BR>Fœtida (?); [cf. अच्छिन्न-प्˚, अश्व-प्˚, उत्तान-प्˚,<BR>&c.; cf. probably Gr. Πάρνης, Παρνασός,<BR>Παρνασσός; perhaps Lat. penna, if not fr. rt. पत्,<BR>q. v., frons; Old Germ. farn; Angl. Sax. fearn.]<BR>—पर्ण-कार, अस्, m. = वार-जीवी (commonly वा-<BR>rui), a vender of betel leaves.<BR>—पर्ण-कुटिका, f.<BR>or पर्ण-कुटी, f. a hut made of leaves.<BR>—पर्ण-<BR>कृच्छ्र, अस्, m. ‘leaf-penance,’ living for a time<BR>upon an infusion of leaves and Kuśa grass as a religious<BR>observance.<BR>—पर्ण-खण्ड, अस्, m. a tree without<BR>apparent blossoms; a tree in general.<BR>—पर्ण-चीर-<BR>पट, अस्, आ, अम्, clad in a garment made of strips<BR>of leaves; an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—पर्ण-चोरक, अस्,<BR>m. a kind of perfume; [cf. चोरक.]<BR>—पर्ण-धि,<BR>इस्, m., Ved. the part of an arrow to which the<BR>feathers are fastened.<BR>—पर्ण-ध्वस्, त्, त्, त्, causing<BR>the falling of leaves.<BR>—पर्ण-नर, अस्, m. ‘man<BR>of leaves,’ an effigy stuffed with leaves or the figure<BR>of a man made of leaves and burnt in place of a lost<BR>corpse.<BR>—पर्ण-नाल, अस्, m. a leaf-stalk, petiole.<BR>—पर्ण-प्रात्यिक, N. of a locality (perhaps in-<BR>correctly for पर्ण-प्रासिक).<BR>—पर्ण-भेदिनी, f.<BR>the Priyaṅgu tree.<BR>—पर्ण-भोजन, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>feeding upon leaves; (अस्), m. any animal eating<BR>leaves, a goat.<BR>—पर्ण-मणि, इस्, m., Ved. a kind<BR>of magical instrument (made of the wood of the<BR>Parṇa tree ?).<BR>—पर्ण-मय, अस्, ई, अम्, Ved. made<BR>of the wood of the Butea Frondosa.<BR>—पर्ण-<BR>माचाल, अस्, m. the plant Averrhoa Carambola (=<BR>कर्मरङ्ग).<BR>—पर्ण-मुच्, ट्, ट्, ट्, causing leaves<BR>to fall (as the wind).<BR>—पर्ण-मृग, अस्, m. ‘leaf-<BR>animal,’ any wild animal lodging in the boughs of<BR>trees (as a monkey, sloth, squirrel, &c.).<BR>—पर्ण-<BR>रुह्, ट्, ट्, ट्, causing the leaves to grow (as the<BR>wind).<BR>—पर्ण-लता, f. the betel plant.<BR>—पर्ण-<BR>वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, abounding in leaves, leafy.<BR>—पर्ण-<BR>वल्क, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR>—पर्ण-वल्ली, f. Butea<BR>Frondosa (= पलाशी-लता).<BR>—पर्ण-वाद्य, अम्,<BR>n. ‘leaf-music,’ sounds produced by blowing into a<BR>leaf.<BR>—पर्ण-वी, ईस्, ईस्, इ, Ved. ‘wing-borne,’<BR>carried by wings.<BR>—पर्ण-वीटिका, f. the Areca nut<BR>cut in pieces, sprinkled with spices, and rolled up<BR>in betel leaves.<BR>—पर्ण-शद or पर्ण-शाद, अस्,<BR>m., Ved. the falling of leaves.<BR>—पर्ण-शद्य, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, Ved. relating to the falling of leaves.<BR>—पर्-<BR>ण-शय्या, f. a couch of leaves, leafy couch.<BR>—पर्ण-<BR>शर, अस्, m., Ved. a leaf-stalk, petiole; the stalk of<BR>a Parṇa leaf.<BR>—पर्ण-शवर, आस्, m., N. of a<BR>people, (Śavaras living upon leaves.)<BR>—पर्ण-शाला,<BR>f. ‘leaf-hut,’ an arbour or hut made of leaves and<BR>grass, hermitage; N. of a great settlement of<BR>Brāhmans between the Yamunā and Gaṅgā in<BR>Madhya-deśa.<BR>—पर्णशालाग्र (˚ला-अग्˚), अस्, m.,<BR>N. of a mountain in Bhadrāśva.<BR>—पर्ण-शुष्, ट्,<BR>ट्, ट्, drying or shriveling the leaves (as the wind).<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">Page0553-c+ 76</a>]<BR>—पर्ण-संस्तर, अस्, आ, अम्, having leaves for<BR>a bed, sleeping on leaves.<BR>—पर्ण-सन्तर, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, having leaves for a bed, sleeping on leaves.<BR>—पर्णाढक (˚ण-आढ्˚), अस्, m., N. of a man;<BR>(आस्), m. pl., N. of his descendants.<BR>—पर्णाद<BR>(˚ण-अद), अस्, आ, अम्, feeding upon leaves; (अस्),<BR>m., N. of an ancient sage; of a Brāhman.<BR>—पर्णा-<BR>शन (˚ण-अश्˚), अम्, n. feeding on leaves; (अस्), m.<BR>a cloud.<BR>—पर्णासि (˚ण-असि), इस्, m. a species of<BR>basil with small leaves, Ocymum Sanctum.<BR>—पर्-<BR>णाहार (˚ण-आह्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, feeding upon leaves.<BR>—पर्णोटज (˚ण-उट्˚), अम्, n. ‘leaf-hut,’ an an-<BR>chorite's hut or cottage, a hermitage.<BR>—पर्णोत्स<BR>(˚ण-उत्˚), अस्, m., N. of a village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णक
पर्णक, अस्, m., Ved. (according to Mahī-dhara)<BR>= भिल्ल, q. v.; N. of a man; (आस्), m. pl., N. of<BR>his descendants; (इका), f. a kind of vegetable; N. of<BR>an Apsaras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णय
पर्णय, अस्, m., Ved., N. of an enemy (according<BR>to Sāy. an Asura) slain by Indra.<BR>—पर्णय-घ्न,<BR>अम्, n., Ved. the slaying of Parṇaya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णल
पर्णल, अस्, आ, अम्, abounding in leaves, full of<BR>leaves, leafy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णसि|पर्णसिः
पर्णसि, इस्, m. (said to be fr. rt. पॄ), a house<BR>upon or by the water; a summer-house (?); a lotus;<BR>a vegetable; adorning, decoration, toilet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णाश
पर्णाश or पर्णास, अस्, m. a species of plant, a<BR>kind of basil with small leaves, Ocymum Sanctum;<BR>(आ), f., N. of various rivers; [cf. पूर्णाशा.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णिक
पर्णिक, अस्, आ, अम्, selling or dealing in Parṇī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णिन्
पर्णिन्, ई, इनी, इ, winged, plumed; leafy, having<BR>leaves, leaved; (ई), m. a tree; Butea Frondosa;<BR>(इनी), f. a species of plant; N. of an Apsaras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णिल
पर्णिल, अस्, आ, अम्, abounding in leaves, leafy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ण्य
पर्ण्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. relating to leaves, leafy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णाल|पर्णालः
पर्णाल पर्णाल, अस्, m. a boat; a spade<BR>or hoe; single combat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्तृ
पर्तृ पर्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ (fr. rt. 1. पृ), Ved.<BR>a protector; protection, means of defence, (Sāy. =<BR>पालन-साधनम्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्द्
पर्द् पर्द्, cl. 1. A. पर्दते, &c., to break<BR>wind, fart; [cf. Gr. πέρδ-ω, πέρδ-ο-μαι,<BR>ἔ-παρδ-ο-ν, πέ-πορδ-α, πορδ-ή, πέρδ-ιξ; Lat. pêd-o,<BR>pêd-or, pôdex; Old Germ. firz-u; Bohem. prd-u;<BR>Lith. perd-z-u, pérs-ti, pī1rd-i-s.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्द|पर्दः|पर्द्द|पर्द्दः
पर्द, अस्, m. a fart; a quantity of hair, thick hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्दन|पर्द्दन|पर्द्दनं
पर्दन, अम्, n. breaking wind, a fart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्प्
पर्प् पर्प् (a doubtful rt.; by some re-<BR>garded as a Sautra rt.; cf. Uṇādi-s. IV. 81),<BR>cl. 1. P. पर्पति, &c., to go or move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्प|पर्पं|पर्पः
पर्प, अम्, n. (said to be fr. rt. 1. पृ), a wheel-<BR>chair, a chair in which a cripple is moved about;<BR>young grass; a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्पट|पर्पटः
पर्पट, अस्, m. a species of medicinal plant with<BR>bitter leaves (= भेषजान्तर, तिक्ता क्षेत्र-पर्-<BR>पटी, apparently the Oldenlandia Biflora); a kind of<BR>thin cake, = चर्पटी; (ई), f. a kind of fragrant<BR>earth or a red aluminous earth (apparently a sort of<BR>Bol, brought from Surāt or Su-rāṣṭra); a sort of<BR>fragrant substance or perfume (= कृष्णा, चक्र-<BR>वर्तिनी, जतुका, commonly called पपरी); a thin<BR>crisp cake made of any pulse.<BR>—पर्पट-द्रुम<BR>or पर्पटी-द्रुम, अस्, m. bdellium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्पटक
पर्पटक, अस्, m. a species of medicinal plant<BR>with bitter leaves, (probably) Oldenlandia Biflora.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्पिक|पर्पिकः|पर्प्पिक
पर्पिक, अस्, ई, m. f. a cripple who moves about<BR>by the aid of a chair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्परी
पर्परी पर्परी, f. a braid of hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्परीक|पर्परीकः
पर्परीक पर्परीक, अस्, m. (said to be fr.<BR>rt. पॄ with reduplication), the sun; fire; a tank,<BR>reservoir, piece of water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्फरीक
पर्फरीक पर्फरीक, अस्, m., Ved. one who<BR>tears to pieces or fills, (Sāy. = शत्रूणं विदार-<BR>यितृ or धनादि-दानेन पूरयितृ.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ब्
पर्ब् पर्ब्, cl. 1. P. पर्बति, &c., to go<BR>or move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0553-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्माडि
पर्माडि पर्माडि, इस्, m., N. of a prince of<BR>Karṇāṭa, (also called Parmāṇḍi.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यक्
पर्यक् पर्य्-अक्. See 2. पर्य्-अञ्च् below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यगु
पर्यगु पर्य्-अगु in comp. with पारम-<BR>हंस्य, Bhāgavata-Purāṇa IV. 21, 40; according to<BR>a Scholiast = परितो न गच्छन्ति गावो यस्मात्, but<BR>variously taken, see पारमहंस्य-परि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यग्नि|पर्यग्निः
पर्यग्नि पर्य्-अग्नि, इस्, m., Ved. circumam-<BR>bient fire; a torch carried round the sacrificial<BR>animal; the ceremony of carrying fire round the<BR>sacrificial animal; पर्यग्नि कृ, to carry fire round<BR>any one (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यग्निकृत|पर्य्यग्निकृत
पर्यग्नि-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. encircled with<BR>fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यग्निक्रियमाण
पर्यग्नि-क्रियमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. being<BR>encircled with fire; (ए), loc. during the encircling<BR>with fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यङ्क|पर्यंक|पर्यंकः|पर्यङ्कः|पर्य्यङ्क|पर्य्यङ्कः
पर्यङ्क पर्य्-अङ्क. See under 1. पर्य्-अञ्च्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यङ्ख्
पर्यङ्ख् पर्य्-अङ्ख्, cl. 10. P. A. -अङ्खयति,<BR>-ते, -यितुम्, Ved. to surround, clasp or encircle round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यङ्ग्य
पर्यङ्ग्य पर्यङ्ग्य, अस्, आ, अम्, (fr. परि +<BR>अङ्ग), Ved. being about or at the side.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यञ्च्
पर्यञ्च् 1. पर्य्-अञ्च् or पर्य्-अच्, cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-अञ्चति, -ते, -अञ्चितुम्, Ved. to turn round, revolve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यङ्क|पर्यंक|पर्यंकः|पर्यङ्कः|पर्य्यङ्क|पर्य्यङ्कः
पर्य्-अङ्क, अस्, m. (fr. परि + अङ्क or perhaps<BR>directly fr. 1. पर्य्-अञ्च् above; also spelt पल्य्-अङ्क),<BR>a bed, couch, sofa; a litter, palanquin; a cloth thrown<BR>over the back, loins and knees while seated on the<BR>hams in the Oriental manner; sitting upon the hams<BR>(a particular posture especially practised by ascetics in<BR>meditation); N. of a mountain (son of Vindhya).<BR>—पर्यङ्क-ग्रन्थि-बन्ध, अस्, m. or -˚बन्-<BR>धन, अम्, n. the bending of the legs in sitting on<BR>the hams.<BR>—पर्यङ्क-बन्ध, अस्, m. sitting in<BR>the Paryaṅka posture (= वीरासन).<BR>—पर्यङ्क-<BR>बन्धन, अम्, n. binding a cloth round the back,<BR>loins and knees while squatting on the hams.<BR>—पर्य्-<BR>अङ्क-भोगिन्, ई, m. ‘couch-serpent,’ a kind of ser-<BR>pent.<BR>—पर्यङ्क-स्थ, अस्, आ, अम्, sitting on a sofa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यञ्च्
2. पर्य्-अञ्च्, apparently only used in acc. sing.<BR>neut. पर्य्-अक्, ind. round about, all round, in every<BR>direction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यट्
पर्यट् पर्य्-अट्, cl. 1. P. A. -अटति, -ते, -अटि-<BR>तुम्, to roam or wander about, rove about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यट
पर्य्-अट, आस्, m. pl., N. of a people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यटन|पर्यटनं|पर्य्यटन|पर्य्यटनं
पर्य्-अटन, अम्, n. wandering about, peregrina-<BR>tion, roaming through.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यटित|पर्यटितं
पर्य्-अटित, अम्, n. wandering about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यनुबन्ध
पर्यनुबन्ध पर्य्-अनुबन्ध, अस्, m. binding<BR>round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यनुयोग|पर्यनुयोगः|पर्य्यनुयोग|पर्य्यनुयोगः
पर्यनुयोग पर्य्-अनुयोग, अस्, m. asking,<BR>inquiring, question; blame, censure, reproach; con-<BR>testing, disputing (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यन्त|पर्यंत|पर्यन्तः|पर्य्यन्त|पर्य्यन्तः
पर्यन्त पर्य्-अन्त, अस्, m. an encircling<BR>boundary, circuit, circumference; limit, edge, skirt,<BR>border, verge, extremity; end, termination, close<BR>(e. g. काल-पर्यन्त, the end or close of an ap-<BR>pointed time; पर्यन्तात् पर्यन्तम्, from one<BR>end to the other); (अस्, आ, अम्), bounded, sur-<BR>rounded by a boundary; extending in all directions;<BR>(often at the end of comps., e. g. क्षुर-पर्य्-<BR>अन्तं चक्रम्, a discus with edges like a razor's;<BR>समुद्र-पर्यन्ता पृथिवी, the ocean-bounded<BR>earth or the earth extending to the ocean.)<BR>—पर्य्-<BR>अन्त-देश, अस्, m. a neighbouring or adjacent dis-<BR>trict.<BR>—पर्यन्त-पर्यन्तम्, ind. to the end of,<BR>as far as.<BR>—पर्यन्त-पर्वत, अस्, m. an adjoining<BR>hill.<BR>—पर्यन्त-भू, ऊस्, f. ground contiguous to<BR>the skirts of a river or mountain.<BR>—पर्यन्त-स्थ,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, limitative, confining, adjoining, neighbour-<BR>ing.<BR>—पर्यन्त-स्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, bounding, con-<BR>fining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यन्तिका|पर्यंतिका|पर्य्यन्तिका
पर्यन्तिका, f. loss of all good qualities, depravity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यन्य|पर्य्यन्य|पर्य्यन्यः
पर्यन्य पर्यन्य, incorrectly for पर्जन्य,<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यन्विष्
