पर्यय|पर्ययः|पर्य्यय|पर्य्ययः
पर्यय पर्य्-अय, पर्य्-अयण. See under<BR>परी, p. 551, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यर्षण
पर्यर्षण पर्य्-अर्षण. See under 2. पर्य्-<BR>ऋष्, p. 555, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवकॄ
पर्यवकॄ पर्य्-अव-कॄ, cl. 6. P. -किरति, -क-<BR>रितुम्, -करीतुम्, to scatter round or about, shed<BR>over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवच्छिद्
पर्यवच्छिद् पर्य्-अव-च्छिद् (˚छिद्), cl. 7. P.<BR>A. -च्छिनत्ति, -च्छिन्त्ते, -च्छेत्तुम्, Ved. to cut off<BR>on both sides or all round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवदात|पर्य्यवदात
पर्यवदात पर्य्-अवदात, अस्, आ, अम्, (fr. rt.<BR>दै or 7. दा with पर्य्-अव), perfectly clean or<BR>pure; [cf. 7. दा, अव-दात.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवदो
पर्यवदो पर्य्-अव-दो or पर्य्-अवदा (see rt.<BR>3. दा), cl. 2. 4. P. -दाति, -द्यति, -दातुम्, Ved. to<BR>cut off or slice all round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवधारण
पर्यवधारण पर्य्-अवधारण, अम्, n. pre-<BR>cise determination, refining, subtilizing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवरोध|पर्यवरोधः
पर्यवरोध पर्य्-अवरोध, अस्, m. (fr. rt.<BR>रुध् with पर्य्-अव), obstruction, hindrance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवशेष|पर्यवशेषः
पर्यवशेष पर्य्-अवशेष, अस्, m. end, ter-<BR>mination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवशेषित
पर्य्-अवशेषित, अस्, आ, अम्, regarded as the end<BR>of all (i. e. God).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवष्टम्भ्|पर्यवष्टंभ्
पर्यवष्टम्भ् पर्य्-अव-ष्टम्भ्, cl. 5. 9. P., 1.<BR>A. -ष्टभ्नोति, -नाति, -ष्टम्भते, -ष्टम्भितुम्,<BR>to surround; to surround with a view to obstruct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवष्टब्ध|पर्य्यवष्टब्ध
पर्य्-अवष्टब्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, surrounded, in-<BR>vested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवष्टम्भन|पर्यवष्टंभनं|पर्य्यवष्टम्भन
पर्य्-अवष्टम्भन, अम्, n. surrounding, in-<BR>vesting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवसो
पर्यवसो पर्य्-अव-सो, cl. 4. P. -स्यति, -सा-<BR>तुम्, to finish, complete, conclude; to endeavour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवसान|पर्यवसानं|पर्य्यवसान
पर्य्-अवसान, अम्, n. end, termination, con-<BR>clusion, issue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवसानिक
पर्यवसानिक, अस्, आ, अम्, coming to a close,<BR>drawing to an end or conclusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवसायिन्
पर्य्-अवसायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, closing or ending with<BR>(often in comps.).<BR>—पर्यवसायि-त्व, अम्, n. ter-<BR>mination, close.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवसित|पर्य्यवसित
पर्य्-अवसित, अस्, आ, अम्, finished, completed,<BR>ended, terminated, concluded; perished, lost; re-<BR>solved; लोकान्तरम् पर्य्-अवसितः, gone to another<BR>world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवस्कन्द|पर्यवस्कन्दः
पर्यवस्कन्द पर्य्-अवस्कन्द, अस्, m. jumping<BR>or leaping down (from a carriage).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवस्था|पर्य्यवस्था
पर्यवस्था 1. पर्य्-अव-स्था, cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-तिष्ठति, -ते, -स्थातुम्, to be present or exist<BR>everywhere; to rely upon: Caus. -स्थापयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to raise, rouse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवस्था|पर्य्यवस्था
