पर्यवस्थातृ|पर्य्यवस्थातृ
पर्य्-अवस्थातृ, ता, त्री, तृ, opposing, obstruct-<BR>ing, opposed to or against; (ता), m. an antagonist,<BR>opponent, adversary, enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवस्थित|पर्य्यवस्थित
पर्य्-अवस्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, opposed to, siding<BR>with an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवे
पर्यवे पर्य्-अवे (पर्य्-अव-इ, see rt. 5. इ),<BR>cl. 2. P. -अवैति, -अवैतुम्, Ved. to turn round,<BR>turn in the right direction; to pass, elapse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0554-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवेक्ष्
