पर्यास पर्य्-आस, पर्य्-आसन. See under<BR>2. पर्य्-अस्, p. 554, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0555-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याहार|पर्याहारः|पर्य्याहार
पर्याहार पर्य्-आहार, अस्, m. a yoke worn<BR>across the shoulders in carrying a load; conveying,<BR>taking; a load; storing hay or grain; a ewer,<BR>pitcher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0555-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युक
पर्युक पर्युक, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0555-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युक्ष्
पर्युक्ष् पर्य्-उक्ष्, cl. 6. P. -उक्षति, -उक्षि-<BR>तुम्, Ved. to sprinkle round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0555-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

