पर्युत्सुक|पर्य्युत्सुक
पर्युत्सुक पर्य्-उत्सुक, अस्, आ, अम्, afficted,<BR>sad, sorrowful, regretting; eagerly desirous, longing<BR>for (with dat.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0555-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युदञ्चन|पर्युदंचन|पर्युदंचनं|पर्य्युदञ्चन|पर्य्युदञ्चनं
पर्युदञ्चन पर्य्-उदञ्चन, अम्, n. debt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0555-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युदयम्
पर्युदयम् पर्य्-उदयम्, ind., Ved. about<BR>sunrise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0555-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युदस्
