पर्युद्भृत
पर्युद्भृत पर्य्-उद्भृत, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved.<BR>brought out, extracted; constructed, framed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0555-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युद्विज्
