पर्युपस्थित
पर्य्-उपस्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, drawing nigh, immi-<BR>nent, impending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0555-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपस्पृश्
