पर्युपास्
पर्युपास् पर्य्-उपास् (पर्य्-उप-आस्), cl. 2. A.<BR>-आस्ते, -आसितुम्, to sit round, surround, encompass,<BR>encircle; to sit on or upon; to live around; to be<BR>present at, partake of; to approach as an attendant<BR>or worshipper, show reverence, worship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0555-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपासक
पर्य्-उपासक, अस्, आ, अम्, worshipping, honouring,<BR>a worshipper, one who honours or respects.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0555-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपासन|पर्युपासनं|पर्य्युपासन
पर्य्-उपासन, अम्, n. encamping or sitting<BR>round; friendliness, amiability, courtesy; honour,<BR>service, worship; joining in or concurrence with any<BR>act of reverence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0555-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपासितृ
