पारीक्षित|पारीक्षितः
पारीक्षित, अस्, ई, अम्, relating to or treating of<BR>Parī-kṣit, derived from Parī-kṣit; (अस्), m. a<BR>patronymic of Janam-ejaya; N. of a sovereign to<BR>whom the Bhāgavata-Purāṇa or life of Kṛṣṇa is<BR>supposed to have been addressed; N. of the successor<BR>of the preceding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0568-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

