पिचिण्ड, अस्, m. the belly or abdomen; a parti-<BR>cular part of an animal.<BR>—पिचिण्ड-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>big-bellied, corpulent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0571-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिचिण्डिका|पिचिंडिका
पिचिण्डिका, f. the calf of the leg; the instep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0571-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिचिण्डिल|पिचिंडिल|पिचिण्डिलः
पिचिण्डिल, अस्, आ, अम्, big-bellied, corpulent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0571-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिचु|पिचुः
पिचु पिचु, उस्, m. cotton; a sort of grain;<BR>the plant Vangueria Spinosa; a Karṣa or weight of<BR>two Tolas; a kind of leprosy; N. of an Asura;<BR>Bhairava or one of the eight faces of Bhairava.<BR>—पिचु-तूल, अम्, n. cotton.<BR>—पिचु-मन्द or<BR>पिचु-मर्द, अस्, m. the Nimb tree, Azadirachta<BR>Indica.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0571-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिचव्य|पिचव्यः
