पिचुक|पिचुकः
पिचुक, अस्, m. the plant Vangueria Spinosa; a<BR>species of tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0571-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिचुल|पिचुलः
