पिच्चट|पिच्चटं|पिच्चटः
पिच्चट पिच्चट, अस्, आ, अम्, pressed flat,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0572-a" target="_blank">Page0572-a+ 76</a>]<BR>a substance pressed flat, cake [cf. तिल-प्˚]; (अस्), m.<BR>inflammation of the eyes, ophthalmia; tin, lead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0571-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिच्चित
पिच्चित, अस्, आ, अम्, pressed flat, squeezed; [cf.<BR>चिपिट.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0572-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिच्चा
पिच्चा पिच्चा, f. a collection or string of<BR>sixteen pearls weighing a Dharaṇa; [cf. पिक्का.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0572-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिच्चिट
