पीतिन्
2. पीतिन्, ई, m. a horse. (For 1. पीतिन् see p. 577,<BR>col. 2.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0578-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पीथि|पीथिः
पीथि, इस्, m. a horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0578-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पीतु|पीतुः
पीतु पीतु, उस्, m. (said to be fr. rt. 1. पा,<BR>but perhaps fr. rt. पिव्), the sun; fire; the chief<BR>elephant of a herd.<BR>—पीतु-दारु, उस्, m. = देव-<BR>दारु, q. v.; (according to others) = खदिर, a tree<BR>related to the Uḍumbara; (अम्), n. the resin of this<BR>tree; [cf. पूतु-दारु; Gr. πί-τυ-ς, πίσσα for πι-<BR>κ-ια; Lat. pī-nu-s, pix; Lith. pī1ki-s, ‘pitch.’]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0578-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पीथ|पीथं|पीथः
3. पीथ, अस्, m. the sun; fire; time. (For 1.<BR>and 2. पीथ see p. 577, col. 2, and above.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0578-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

