प्रगदित
प्रगदित प्र-गदित, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. गद्<BR>with प्र), spoken, speaking, beginning to speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगाद्य
प्र-गाद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, see Scholiast on Pāṇ. III.<BR>1, 100.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगम्
प्रगम् प्र-गम्, cl. 1. P. (ep. also A.) -गच्-<BR>छति (-ते), -गन्तुम्, to go forward, advance, pro-<BR>ceed; to set out towards, start for; to stride towards,<BR>go to; to reach, attain (Sāy. = प्राप्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग
प्र-ग, अस्, आ, अम्, going before or in advance,<BR>preceding; (ए), ind. early in the morning, at dawn,<BR>at day-break (‘when the sun goes forth?’).<BR>—प्रगे-<BR>तन, अस्, ई, अम्, relating or belonging to the morn-<BR>ing, to be performed in the morning, matutinal.<BR>—प्रगे-निश, अस्, आ, अम्, ‘one to whom it is night<BR>early in the morning,’ i. e. one who is asleep early<BR>in the morning.<BR>—प्रगे-शय, अस्, आ, अम्, sleeping<BR>early in the morning, asleep at day-break.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगत
प्र-गत, अस्, आ, अम्, gone forward, gone forth,<BR>started; separate, apart; gone with difficulty.<BR>—प्र-<BR>गत-जानु, उस्, उस्, उ, or प्रगत-जानुक, अस्, ई,<BR>अम्, having the knees far apart, bandy-legged, bow-<BR>legged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगम|प्रगमः
प्र-गम, अस्, m. the first manifestation of affec-<BR>tion in conversation, first advance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगमन|प्रगमनं
प्र-गमन, अम्, n. progress, advance; going<BR>apart; the first manifestation of affection in the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">Page0605-b+ 76</a>]<BR>course of conversation; difficult progress (?); dis-<BR>puting (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगमनीय
प्र-गमनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, see Scholiast on Pāṇ.<BR>VIII. 4, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगामन्
प्र-गामन्, walk, gait, step; [cf. पृथु-प्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगामिन्
प्र-गामिन्, ई, इनी, इ, setting out, being about<BR>to depart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगयण
प्रगयण प्र-गयण, अम्, n. a various read-<BR>ing for प्र-गमन, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगर्ज्
प्रगर्ज् प्र-गर्ज्, cl. 1. P. -गर्जति, -गर्जितुम्,<BR>to roar; to begin to thunder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगर्जन|प्रगर्जनं
प्र-गर्जन, अम्, n. roaring, roar; [cf. सिंह-प्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगर्जित
प्र-गर्जित, अम्, n. a roar, noise, din.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगर्धिन्
प्रगर्धिन् प्र-गर्धिन्, ई, इनी, इ (fr. rt. गृध्<BR>with प्र), Ved. pressing onwards, pressing forwards;<BR>eager (Sāy. = प्रकर्षेणाभिकाङ्क्षन्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगल्भ्
