प्रगाण
1. प्र-गाण, अम्, n. (for 2. see under प्र-गै,<BR>col. 3), access, approach; [cf. पृथु-प्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगाह्
