प्रगाहन
प्र-गाहन, अम्, n., Ved. dipping or plunging<BR>into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगुण|प्रगुणः
प्रगुण प्र-गुण, अस्, आ, अम्, having excel-<BR>lent qualities, being in a good state or condition, being<BR>in the right state or order, straight; honest, upright.<BR>—प्रगुणी-कृ, cl. 8. P. A. -करोति, -कुरुते, -कर्-<BR>तुम्, to make straight, put in order, arrange, place in<BR>rank and file, array; to spread, make smooth or even.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

