प्रगुणय
प्रगुणय, Nom. P. प्रगुणयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>make straight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

