प्र-गुणिन्, ई, इनी, इ, straightened, made smooth<BR>or even, smoothed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

