प्र-गुण्य, अस्, आ, अम्, having excellent qualities,<BR>excellent; more, exceeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगुप्
प्रगुप् प्र-गुप्, cl. 1. P. -गोपयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to seek to protect, to guard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगोपन|प्रगोपनं
प्र-गोपन, अम्, n. protection, preservation,<BR>salvation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगुर्
प्रगुर् प्र-गुर्, cl. 6. P. -गुरति, -गुरितुम्,<BR>Ved. to cry aloud, exclaim loudly; to make great<BR>efforts, make strenuous exertions (Sāy. = अत्यर्थम्<BR>उद्युज्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगॄ
प्रगॄ प्र-गॄ (see rt. 1. गॄ), cl. 9. P. A.<BR>-गृणाति, -गृणीते, -गरितुम्, -गरीतुम्, to announce,<BR>praise, extol, celebrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगे
प्रगे प्र-गे. See under प्र-गम्, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगै
प्रगै प्र-गै, cl. 1. P. -गायति, -गातुम्, to<BR>begin to sing, sing of, sing, celebrate; to sound,<BR>resound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगाण
2. प्र-गाण, अम्, n. (for 1. see under प्र-गा,<BR>col. 2), singing, song.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगातृ
प्र-गातृ, ता, त्री, तृ, a singer, excellent singer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगाथ|प्रगाथः
प्र-गाथ, अस्, m. a strophe, a combination of<BR>two verses (viz. of a Bṛhatī or Kakubh followed<BR>by a Sato-bṛhatī which by an intermixture of the<BR>several Pādas is changed into a triplet); (अस्), m.,<BR>N. of a man with the patronymics Kāṇva and<BR>Ghaura, the author of the hymns Ṛg-veda VIII. 1,<BR>2, 10, 48, 51-54; (आस्), m. pl. an epithet of the<BR>hymns of the eighth Maṇḍala of the Ṛg-veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगायिन्
प्र-गायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, singing, beginning to sing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगीत
प्र-गीत, अस्, आ, अम्, sung; one who has begun<BR>to sing, singing; resonant with singing, vocal;<BR>(अम्), n. song; a sing-song or drawling recitation<BR>(regarded as a fault).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगीति
प्र-गीति, इस्, f. a kind of metre, containing 30 +<BR>29 syllabic instants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रथन|प्रग्रथनं
प्रग्रथन प्र-ग्रथन, अम्, n. the act of<BR>connecting or stringing together, intertwining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रस्
प्रग्रस् प्र-ग्रस्, cl. 1. P. A. -ग्रसति, -ते,<BR>-ग्रसितुम्, to eat up, devour, swallow, swallow up;<BR>to eclipse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रह्
प्रग्रह् प्र-ग्रह्, cl. 9. P. A. -गृह्णाति,<BR>गृह्णीते, -ग्रहीतुम्, to hold forth, hold out, stretch<BR>forth; to offer; to seize, grasp, clutch, take hold of,<BR>take; to receive, accept; to draw up, stop; to draw<BR>towards one's self, unite with; to give a friendly<BR>reception to, act in a friendly manner towards,<BR>favour; to keep separate or isolated (as words &c.<BR>not subjected to the rules of Sandhi): Caus. -ग्रा-<BR>हयति, -यितुम्, to receive, accept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगृहीत
प्र-गृहीत, अस्, आ, अम्, held in front, held out;<BR>received, accepted, admitted; pronounced separately<BR>without observing the usual rules of Sandhi [cf. 1. प्र-<BR>गृह्य]; collected, strung together (?).<BR>—प्रगृहीत-<BR>पद, अस्, m., scil. सन्धि, a suspension of Sandhi<BR>in which the vowels remain unaltered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगृह्य|प्रगृह्यं
1. प्र-गृह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be taken or accepted,<BR>to be admitted; (in grammar) to be taken or pro-<BR>nounced separately, not subject to the rules of Sandhi<BR>or euphony (as the final ई, ऊ, and ए of the dual<BR>terminations whether of nouns, pronouns, or verbs,<BR>e. g. कवी एतौ, ‘these two poets;’ बन्धू एतौ,<BR>‘these two relations’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगृह्य|प्रगृह्यं
2. प्र-गृह्य, ind. having taken or grasped, car-<BR>rying away with; with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगृह्यमाण
प्र-गृह्यमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, being taken or<BR>seized.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रह|प्रग्रहः
प्र-ग्रह, अस्, m. holding in front, holding<BR>forth, holding out, stretching forth; taking, taking<BR>or laying hold of, grasping, clutching, seizing (e. g.<BR>अङ्ग-प्˚, the seizing of the limbs [by a demon],<BR>pain in the limbs); the seizing or grasping of the<BR>sun or moon, beginning of an eclipse [cf. ग्रह];<BR>kind or friendly reception, kindness, favour; a rein,<BR>bridle, rope or halter for horses, lash, thong, whip,<BR>scourge; the cord or string suspending a balance; a<BR>guide, leader, ruler; a ray of light; a prisoner,<BR>captive, either man or beast in confinement; bind-<BR>ing; taming, breaking (a horse); the arm; a species<BR>of plant, Cassia Fistula; (in grammar) a vowel not<BR>subject to the rules of Sandhi; epithet of a particular<BR>sacrificial rite (more fully written प्रग्रह-होम);<BR>an epithet of Viṣṇu or Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—प्रग्रह-वत्,<BR>आन्, अती, अत्, (at the end of a comp.) having seized,<BR>holding; giving a friendly reception, receiving kindly,<BR>obliging, kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रहण|प्रग्रहणं
प्र-ग्रहण, अम्, n. taking, seizing, holding,<BR>assuming; shutting up, confining; the seizure of<BR>sun and moon, i. e. the commencement of an eclipse;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">Page0606-a+ 74</a>]<BR>offering; a rein, bridle; a check, restraint; the being<BR>a leader or guide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0605-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्राह|प्रग्राहः
प्र-ग्राह, अस्, m. seizing, taking, taking up,<BR>bearing, carrying; a rein; the string of a balance.<BR>—प्रग्राह-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having the string of<BR>a balance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रीव|प्रग्रीवः
प्रग्रीव प्र-ग्रीव, अस्, अम्, m. n. a window,<BR>lattice, balcony (‘projecting like a neck,’ cf. ग्रीवा);<BR>a summer-house, pleasure-house; a building on the<BR>top of a palace, a painted turret; a wooden balus-<BR>trade or fence round a building; a stable; the top<BR>of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्लै
प्रग्लै प्र-ग्लै, cl. 1. P. -ग्लायति, -ग्लातुम्,<BR>to fade or wither away: Caus. -ग्लापयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to cause to fade or wither away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्ल
प्र-ग्ल, अस्, आ, अम्, wearied, fatigued, exhausted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघट्
प्रघट् प्र-घट्, cl. 1. A. -घटते, -घटितुम्,<BR>to exert one's self, to apply or devote one's self to;<BR>to begin, commence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघटक|प्रघटकः
प्र-घटक, a precept, rule, doctrine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघटा
प्र-घटा, f. (perhaps) the rudiments or first<BR>elements of a science.<BR>—प्रघटा-विद्, त्, m. ‘know-<BR>ing the rudiments,’ a general reader but not a pro-<BR>found one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघट्टक|प्रघट्टकः
प्रघट्टक प्र-घट्टक, अस् or अम् (fr. rt. घट्ट्<BR>with प्र), a precept, rule, doctrine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघण|प्रघणः
प्रघण प्र-घण, अस्, m. (fr. rt. हन् with<BR>प्र), a porch before the door of a house, a terrace be-<BR>fore a house; an iron mace or crowbar; a copper pot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघन|प्रघनः
प्र-घन, अस्, m. a covered terrace before a<BR>house; a species of bean, Phaseolus Mungo (a wrong<BR>reading for प्रथन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघाण|प्रघाणः
प्र-घाण, अस्, m. a covered terrace or small<BR>portico before the door of a house; an iron mace or<BR>hand-spike; a copper pot; the trunk of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघात|प्रघातः
प्र-घात, अस्, m. a combat, battle; the edging<BR>of a garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघान|प्रघानः
प्र-घान, अस्, m. a covered terrace before the<BR>door of a house, porch, portico.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघस|प्रघसः
प्रघस प्र-घस, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. घस्<BR>with प्र), voracious; an epithet of false gods;<BR>(अस्), m., N. of a Rakṣas; N. of a monkey fol-<BR>lower of Rāma; a Daitya, demon; eating much,<BR>voracity; (आ), f., N. of one of the Mātṛs attending<BR>on Skanda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघासिन्
प्र-घासिन्, ई, इनी, इ, or प्र-घास्य, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, Ved. voracious (an epithet of the Maruts, ac-<BR>cording to Mahī-dhara = पुरोडाश-भक्षण-<BR>शील).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघुण|प्रघुणः
प्रघुण प्रघुण, अस्, m. a guest, visitor; (a<BR>wrong form for प्राघुण.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघुष्
प्रघुष् प्र-घुष्, cl. 1. P. -घोषति, -घो-<BR>षितुम्, to sound forth, sound: Caus. -घोषयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to cause to sound forth, cause to announce<BR>aloud, proclaim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघोषक|प्रघोषकः
प्र-घोषक, अस्, m. sound, noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघोषिन्
प्र-घोषिन्, ई, m., Ved. ‘roaring,’ an epithet of<BR>one of the nine classes of the Maruts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघूर्ण|प्रघूर्णः
प्रघूर्ण प्र-घूर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, turning round<BR>or rolling violently; wandering, roaming; (अस्), m.<BR>a guest, a visitor (in this sense a wrong form for<BR>प्राघूर्णक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघृष्
प्रघृष् प्र-घृष्, cl. 1. P. -घर्षति, -घर्-<BR>षितुम्, to rub to pieces; to rub into, anoint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघृष्ट
प्र-घृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, rubbed in, embrocated,<BR>anointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचकित
प्रचकित प्र-चकित, अस्, आ, अम्, trembling,<BR>shuddering, terrified, startled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचक्र|प्रचक्रं
प्रचक्र प्र-चक्र, अम्, n. an army in motion;<BR>a foraging army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचक्ष्
प्रचक्ष् प्र-चक्ष्, cl. 2. A. -चष्टे, -चष्-<BR>टुम्, to tell, relate, recount, inform; to suppose,<BR>consider as, regard as, deem; to call, name: Caus.<BR>-चक्षयति, -यितुम्, Ved. to irradiate, illumine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचक्षण
प्र-चक्षण, see Gaṇa Gotrādi to Pāṇ. VIII.<BR>1, 27, 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचक्षस्
प्र-चक्षस्, आस्, m. the regent of the planet<BR>Jupiter, Bṛhas-pati.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचण्ड|प्रचंड|प्रचण्डः
प्रचण्ड प्र-चण्ड, अस्, आ, अम्, excessively<BR>violent, vehement, impetuous, passionate, furious,<BR>enraged, wrathful; very hot or burning; intolerable,<BR>insupportable; terrible, terrific; bold, confident, pre-<BR>suming; (अस्), m. a species of oleander with white<BR>flowers; N. of a Dānava; of a goblin; of a son of<BR>Vatsa-prī and Su-nanda; (आ), f. a species of Dūrvā<BR>with white flowers; a form or Śakti of Durgā.<BR>—प्रचण्ड-घोण, अस्, आ, अम्, large-nosed, hav-<BR>ing a large or prominent nose.<BR>—प्रचण्ड-ता, f.<BR>violence, vehemence; boldness.<BR>—प्रचण्ड-पाण्-<BR>डव, अम्, n. ‘the wrathful sons of Pāṇḍu,’ N. of<BR>a comedy by Rāja-śekhara (= बाल-भारत).<BR>—प्रचण्ड-मूर्ति, इस्, f. ‘oleander-formed,’ a<BR>species of tree, Tapia Cratæva.<BR>—प्रचण्ड-वर्-<BR>मन्, आ, m., N. of a prince (a younger brother of<BR>Caṇḍa-varman).<BR>—प्रचण्ड-सूर्य, अस्, आ, अम्, hav-<BR>ing a hot or burning sun<BR>—प्रचण्ड-सेन, अस्, m.<BR>‘having a formidable army,’ N. of a prince of Tāmra-<BR>liptikā.<BR>—प्रचण्डातप (˚ड-आत्˚), अस्, m. fierce<BR>or stifling heat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचत्
प्रचत् प्र-चत्, Caus. A. -चातयते, -यितुम्,<BR>Ved. to drive away, frighten or scare away; (ac-<BR>cording to Sāy.) to destroy utterly, consume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचता
प्र-चता, ind., Ved. secretly, in secret, clandestinely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचय|प्रचयः
प्रचय प्र-चय, &c. See under प्र-चि, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचर्
प्रचर् प्र-चर्, cl. 1. P. (ep. also A.) -च-<BR>रति (-ते), -चरितुम्, to come forth, issue forth,<BR>appear; to proceed towards, arrive at, reach, attain;<BR>to visit; to roam, wander; to circulate, become<BR>current (as a story); to undertake, perform, discharge<BR>(especially sacred functions, with inst. of the object<BR>or of the means employed); to proceed, behave,<BR>act in a particular manner (e. g. भृत्य-वत् प्र-<BR>चर्, to act like a servant); to treat (e. g. मिथ्या<BR>प्र-चर्, to treat wrongly or unskilfully); to be<BR>busied about, to be occupied or engaged in (with loc.);<BR>to do, perform, fulfil, practise; to succeed, thrive,<BR>prosper: Caus. -चारयति, -यितुम्, to allow to roam,<BR>cause to graze, turn out to graze; to make public.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचर|प्रचरः
प्र-चर, अस्, m. a road, way, path; usage, cus-<BR>tom, currency; going well or widely; N. of a people<BR>(in this sense also read प्रच्चर, प्रस्तर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचरण|प्रचरणं
प्र-चरण, अम्, n. going, proceeding; circu-<BR>lating, being current; proceeding with, beginning,<BR>undertaking; employing, using; (ई), f., Ved., scil.<BR>स्रुच्, a wooden ladle employed for want of a better<BR>at a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचरणीय
प्र-चरणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. to be used, being<BR>in actual use.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचरत्
प्र-चरत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, going forth, going well<BR>or quickly, going widely, being current, circulating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचरित
प्र-चरित, अस्, आ, अम्, gone, going; pursued,<BR>practised (as a profession).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचरितव्य
प्र-चरितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be proceeded with<BR>or undertaken, to be performed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचार|प्रचारः
प्र-चार, अस्, m. coming forth, going forth, ap-<BR>pearing, becoming manifest, showing one's self;<BR>being in actual use, currency; appearance, manifesta-<BR>tion; proceeding, taking place, being used or ap-<BR>plied; going, wandering; conduct, behaviour; pre-<BR>valence, currency, custom, usage; a play-ground, place<BR>of exercise; pasture ground, pasture, pasturage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचारित
प्र-चारित, अस्, आ, अम्, allowed to wander or<BR>roam about; made public or manifest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचारिन्
प्र-चारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, coming forth, appearing,<BR>manifesting one's self; going about, wandering; pro-<BR>ceeding with, behaving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचल्
प्रचल् प्र-चल्, cl. 1. P. -चलति, -चलितुम्,<BR>to be set in motion, shake, quake, totter, tremble;<BR>to move forth, move on, advance; to start up, spring<BR>up; to start, set out, set forth, depart; to become<BR>troubled or confused, to be perplexed or bewildered,<BR>to be excited; to swerve, deviate from (with abl.):<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">Page0606-c+ 78</a>]<BR>Caus. -चलयति, -यितुम्, to set in motion, move,<BR>jog, wag; -चालयति, -यितुम्, to cause to shake or<BR>tremble; to stir up, stir round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचल|प्रचलः
प्र-चल, अस्, आ, अम्, being in motion, trembling,<BR>shaking; going well or widely; current, circulating,<BR>customary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलक
प्र-चलक, अस्, m. a venomous species of reptile;<BR>[cf. प्र-चलाक.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलकिन्
प्रचलकिन्. See प्रचलाकिन् below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलत्
प्र-चलत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, moving, trembling, shak-<BR>ing; going or proceeding far; circulating, being cur-<BR>rent or customary; prevailing, being recognised (as<BR>authority or law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलन|प्रचलनं
प्र-चलन, अम्, n. trembling, shaking, rocking,<BR>swaying, tottering; retiring, retreating, fleeing, flight;<BR>moving to and fro; going well or widely; circu-<BR>lating, being current or customary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलाक|प्रचलाकः
प्र-चलाक, अस्, m. shooting with arrows, archery;<BR>a peacock's tail; a snake; another poisonous animal;<BR>(आ), f., Ved. a violent shower of rain, a sudden fall<BR>of rain in torrents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलाकिन्
प्रचलाकिन्, ई, m. a peacock; a snake; (also<BR>spelt प्रचलकिन्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलाय
प्रचलाय, Nom. P. प्रचलायति, -यितुम्, to<BR>move to and fro, to nod the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलायित|प्रचलायितं
प्रचलायित, अस्, आ, अम्, rolling about, tossing,<BR>tumbling, rolled or tossed about (as in a ship);<BR>nodding the head (while asleep in a sitting posture);<BR>(अम्), n. nodding the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलित
प्र-चलित, अस्, आ, अम्, set in motion, moved,<BR>shaken; swinging to and fro; rolling (as the eye);<BR>gone far or wide, wandering, roving; having set out<BR>or moved forwards, having proceeded; current, cus-<BR>tomary, circulating; prevailing, recognised, received<BR>(as authority or law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचालक
प्र-चालक, अस्, इका, अम्, (at the end of a comp.)<BR>causing to tremble, trembling with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचालन|प्रचालनं
प्र-चालन, अम्, n. stirring, stir; making a<BR>noise (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचषाल
प्रचषाल प्र-चषाल, अम्, n. a particular<BR>ornament on a sacrificial post.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचाय|प्रचायः
प्रचाय प्र-चाय. See under प्र-चि below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचाल|प्रचालः
प्रचाल प्र-चाल, अस्, m. the neck of the<BR>Vīṇā or Indian lute; (a wrong reading for प्र-बाल.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचि
प्रचि प्र-चि, cl. 5. P. A. -चिनोति, -चिनुते,<BR>-चेतुम्, to collect, gather, pluck; to cut down, cut<BR>to pieces; to increase, augment, enhance: Pass.<BR>-चीयते, to be gathered or collected; to grow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचय|प्रचयः
प्र-चय, अस्, m. collecting, gathering (as fruit<BR>or flowers, but especially by means of a stick or<BR>other implement); a heap, quantity, number; slight<BR>union or aggregation; the neutral accentless tone<BR>(also called एक-श्रुति); the common increase or<BR>difference of the terms in a progression (in algebra).<BR>—प्रचय-स्वर, अस्, m. (in Ved. gram.) ‘the<BR>most usual tone,’ the accentless or neutral tone<BR>neither raised nor depressed (= प्र-चय, प्र-चित,<BR>प्रचित-स्वर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचयन|प्रचयनं
प्र-चयन, अम्, n. gathering, collecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचाय|प्रचायः
प्र-चाय, अस्, m. or प्र-चायिका, f. gathering<BR>(with the hand), plucking, collecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचित
प्र-चित, अस्, आ, अम्, gathered, collected, plucked;<BR>accumulated, amassed; covered, filled; accentless or<BR>An-udātta, = प्र-चय; (अस्), m. a kind of Daṇḍaka<BR>metre (also called प्रचितक).<BR>—प्रचित-स्वर =<BR>प्रचय-स्वर, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचिन्वत्|प्रचिन्वन्त्
प्र-चिन्वत्, अन्, अती, अत्, gathering, collecting,<BR>plucking; (अन्), m., N. of a son of Janam-ejaya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचिकीर्षु
प्रचिकीर्षु प्र-चिकीर्षु. See p. 603, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचित्
प्रचित् प्र-चित्, cl. 3. P. A. -चिकेत्ति, -चि-<BR>कित्ते, -चेतितुम्, Ved. to know; to make known,<BR>announce, proclaim; to become visible or percep-<BR>tible, appear: Caus. P. -चेतयति, -यितुम्, to make<BR>known, cause to appear; to observe, notice, remark,<BR>perceive; (A.) to appear: Desid. -चिकित्सति, to show,<BR>point out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचिकित
प्र-चिकित, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. familiar or conver-<BR>sant with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0606-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचेतस्
प्र-चेतस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, attentive, observant, con-<BR>versant or familiar with, clever, wise, intelligent<BR>(mostly Ved. as an epithet of the gods and especially<BR>of Agni and the Ādityas); happy, delighted; (आस्),<BR>m. an epithet of Varuṇa regent of the waters; N. of<BR>a Prajā-pati (an ancient sage and law-giver, Manu<BR>1. 35); of a prince (son of Duduha); of a son of<BR>Dur-yāman; of a son of Dur-mada; (असस्), m. pl.<BR>the ten sons of Prācīna-barhis by a daughter of<BR>Varuṇa (they are the progenitors of Dakṣa; in this<BR>sense also written प्र-चेतस).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचेतुन
प्र-चेतुन, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. affording a wide<BR>view or prospect; (Sāy.) = प्रकर्षेण फल-<BR>भोग-ज्ञापक, notifying in a high degree the<BR>experience of results (of actions).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचिन्त्
प्रचिन्त् प्र-चिन्त्, cl. 10. P. -चिन्तयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to think upon, reflect, muse, meditate, con-<BR>sider; to find out, devise, contrive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचिन्त्य
1. प्र-चिन्त्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be reflected or medi-<BR>tated upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचिन्त्य
2. प्र-चिन्त्य, ind. having reflected or considered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचीबल
प्रचीबल प्रचीबल, अस् or अम्, m. or n. (?),<BR>a species of plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचीर
प्रचीर प्र-चीर, अस्, m., N. of a son of<BR>Vatsa-prī and Su-nandā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुद्
प्रचुद् प्र-चुद्, cl. 1. P. A. -चोदति, -ते,<BR>-चोदितुम्, to drive on, drive, impel (Ved.): Caus.<BR>-चोदयति, -यितुम्, to set in rapid motion, push on,<BR>drive on, drive, impel, urge on; to excite, animate,<BR>inspire, inflame; to request, ask, solicit, importune;<BR>to decree, determine, settle; to announce, make<BR>known, proclaim; to hasten, make haste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोद|प्रचोदः
प्र-चोद, अस्, m. instigating, inciting, exciting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोदक
प्र-चोदक, अस्, इका, अम्, instigating; (इका), f.<BR>‘inflamer,’ epithet of the four daughters of Ni-yojikā<BR>daughter of the demon Duḥ-saha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोदन|प्रचोदनं
प्र-चोदन, अम्, n. instigating, inciting, excit-<BR>ing; directing, enjoining, prescribing, ordering, an<BR>order; a rule or law; saying; sending; (ई), f. the<BR>plant Solanum Jacquini.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोदित|प्रचोदितः
प्र-चोदित, अस्, आ, अम्, driven on, impelled,<BR>instigated, incited; decreed, determined; announced,<BR>proclaimed; prescribed, commanded, directed (Manu<BR>II. 191); sent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोदिन्
प्र-चोदिन्, ई, इनी, इ, driving forward, urging;<BR>(इनी), f. prickly nightshade, Solanum Jacquini.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुर|प्रचुरं|प्रचुरः
प्रचुर प्रचुर, अस्, आ, अम्, much, many,<BR>abundant (opposed to अल्प); plenteous, plentiful,<BR>frequent; abounding in, filled with, replete with (in<BR>comp., e. g. वृक्ष-प्˚, abounding in trees).<BR>—प्र-<BR>चुर-ता, f. or प्रचुर-त्व, अम्, n. abundance,<BR>plentifulness, plenty; multitude, numerousness; the<BR>state of being full of, abounding in.<BR>—प्रचुर-<BR>नित्य-धनागम (˚न-आग्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, receiving<BR>many and constant supplies of money.<BR>—प्रचुर-<BR>परिभव, अस्, m. frequent humiliation.<BR>—प्रचुर-<BR>पुरुष, अस्, आ, अम्, abounding with men, populous,<BR>numerous; (अस्), m. a thief; [cf. चौर.]<BR>—प्र-<BR>चुर-रत्न-धनागम (˚न-आग्˚), अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>having a large income of gems and money.<BR>—प्र-<BR>चुर-लोम, अस्, आ, अम्, having too much hair.<BR>—प्रचुरी-करण, अम्, n. making abundant or<BR>plentiful; adding to, augmenting, increasing.<BR>—प्र-<BR>चुरी-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, made abundant or plentiful;<BR>added to, augmented, increased.<BR>—प्रचुरी-भवत्,<BR>अन्, अन्ती, अत्, becoming abundant or plentiful, in-<BR>creasing.<BR>—प्रचुरी-भू, cl. 1. P. -भवति, -भवि-<BR>तुम्, to become abundant or plentiful, to increase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचूर्ण्
प्रचूर्ण् प्र-चूर्ण्, cl. 10. P. -चूर्णयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to crush, grind to dust, reduce to powder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचृत्
प्रचृत् प्र-चृत्, cl. 6. P. -चृतति, -चर्तितुम्,<BR>Ved. to loose, loosen, untie.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचेतस्
प्रचेतस् प्र-चेतस्. See above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचेतृ
प्रचेतृ प्र-चेतृ, ता, m. a charioteer; (a<BR>wrong form for प्र-वेतृ.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचेल|प्रचेलं
प्रचेल प्र-चेल, अम्, n. (fr. rt. चेल् with<BR>प्र?), yellow sandal-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचेलक|प्रचेलकः
प्र-चेलक, अस्, m. a horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचेलुक
प्रचेलुक प्रचेलुक, अस्, m. a cook; (a wrong<BR>form for पचेलुक, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोद|प्रचोदः
प्रचोद प्र-चोद, &c. See प्र-चुद्, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छद्
प्रच्छद् 1. प्र-च्छद् (प्र-छद्), cl. 10. P.<BR>(ep. also A.) -छादयति (-ते), -यितुम्, to cover<BR>over, cover, envelop, wrap up; to hide, conceal, dis-<BR>guise, keep secret; to obscure, darken, cloud; to<BR>be in the way, be an obstacle; to cover or clothe<BR>one's self with (with inst.), put on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छद्
2. प्र-च्छद्, त्, f., Ved. a cover, covering; (ac-<BR>cording to Mahī-dhara = अन्न.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छद|प्रच्छदः|प्रछद
प्र-च्छद, अस्, m. a cover, coverlet, wrapper,<BR>blanket.<BR>—प्रच्छद-पट, अस्, m. ‘enveloping<BR>cloth,’ a cover, wrapper (either of a person or thing,<BR>as a cloak, veil, sheet, curtain, &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छन्न|प्रच्छन्नं
प्र-च्छन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, covered, enveloped;<BR>concealed, secreted, hidden; clothed, clad; private,<BR>secret, unavowed, disguised; (अम्), n. a private door<BR>inside a house, private door in general; a lattice, a<BR>loop-hole; (अम्), ind. secretly, covertly.<BR>—प्र-<BR>च्छन्न-चारक, अस्, इका, अम्, acting fraudulently.<BR>—प्रच्छन्न-तस्कर, अस्, m. a secret or unseen<BR>thief.<BR>—प्रच्छन्न-वञ्चक, अस्, m. a secret or<BR>concealed rogue or rascal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छन्नीभू
प्रच्छन्नी-भू, cl. 1. P. -भवति, -भवितुम्,<BR>to hide or conceal one's self.<BR>—प्रच्छन्नी-भूय,<BR>ind. being hidden, having become concealed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छादक|प्रच्छादकः
प्र-च्छादक, अस्, इका, अम्, concealing, covering<BR>(at the end of a comp., e. g. तमः-प्रच्छादक,<BR>‘enveloping in darkness,’ an epithet of a demon);<BR>(अस्), m. the song of a wife deserted by her husband<BR>(sung with the accompaniment of a lute and con-<BR>taining a covert description of her sorrows).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छादन|प्रच्छादनं
प्र-च्छादन, अस्, ई, अम्, concealing, hiding;<BR>(अम्), n. covering, concealing, concealment; an upper<BR>or outer garment.<BR>—प्रच्छादन-पट, अस्, m.<BR>‘enveloping-cloth,’ a cover, coverlet, wrapper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छादित|प्रच्छादितं
प्र-च्छादित, अस्, आ, अम्, covered, enveloped;<BR>concealed, hidden; clothed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छाद्य
1. प्र-च्छाद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be covered; to be<BR>hidden or concealed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छाद्य
2. प्र-च्छाद्य, ind. having covered; having<BR>obscured or darkened; having hidden or concealed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छन|प्रच्छनं
प्रच्छन प्रच्छन. See rt. प्रछ्, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छयित्वा
प्रच्छयित्वा प्र-च्छयित्वा, प्र-च्छान, प्र-<BR>च्छित. See under प्र-च्छो below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छाय|प्रच्छायं
प्रच्छाय प्र-च्छाय, अम्, n. a shadowy place,<BR>dense shadow, shade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छिद्
प्रच्छिद् 1. प्र-च्छिद् (प्र-छिद्), cl. 7. P. A.<BR>-छिनत्ति, -छिन्त्ते, -छेत्तुम्, to cut off, rend away;<BR>to cut to pieces, cut through, pierce, split, cleave; to<BR>take away, withdraw: Caus. -च्छेदयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to cause to cut off, to order to be lopped off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छिद्
2. प्र-च्छिद्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. cutting off, cutting to<BR>pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छेद
प्र-च्छेद, अस्, m., Ved. a cutting, slip, strip;<BR>(according to a Scholiast a piece of grass, such as a<BR>portion of the root, &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छेदन
प्र-च्छेदन, अम्, n., Ved. dividing into small<BR>pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छेद्य
प्र-च्छेद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be cut to pieces;<BR>[cf. अ-प्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छृद्
प्रच्छृद् प्र-च्छृद् (प्र-छृद्), Caus. P.<BR>-च्छर्दयति, -यितुम्, to vomit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छर्दन|प्रच्छर्दनं|प्रच्छर्द्दन
प्र-च्छर्दन, अम्, n. vomiting; emitting,<BR>exhaling; an emetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छर्दिका|प्रच्छर्द्दिका
प्र-च्छर्दिका, f. vomiting, sickness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छो
प्रच्छो प्र-च्छो (प्र-छो), cl. 4. P. -च्छ्यति,<BR>-च्छातुम्, to bleed by making incisions in the skin,<BR>cup, lance, scarify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छयित्वा
प्र-च्छयित्वा, ind. (?), having made an incision,<BR>having lanced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छान|प्रच्छानं
प्र-च्छान, अम्, n. scarifying; making sore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छित
प्र-च्छित, अस्, आ, अम्, cut, lanced, scarified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्यु
प्रच्यु प्र-च्यु, cl. 1. A. -च्यवते, -च्योतुम्,<BR>to move, proceed, move away, go away, depart; to<BR>forsake, transgress; to be displaced or ejected, be<BR>deprived of, lose (with abl.); to come forth, flow<BR>out, stream forth; to fall down, drop, stumble; to<BR>set in motion, drive, impel: Caus. -च्यावयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to move, shake; to eject, displace, remove,<BR>expel, dispel; to divert (from an opinion &c.); to<BR>cause to fall down or fall out, cause to fall, ruin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्यव|प्रच्यवः
प्र-च्यव, अस्, m. advancement, improvement;<BR>withdrawal; fall, ruin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्यवन|प्रच्यवनं
प्र-च्यवन, अम्, n. going away, departing,<BR>retreating, withdrawing; being deprived of, loss<BR>(with abl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्यावन|प्रच्यावनं
प्र-च्यावन, अम्, n. means of removing or<BR>diminishing, a sedative; causing to desist from or<BR>give up, diverting from (with abl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्यावुक
प्र-च्यावुक, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. transitory, fragile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्युत
प्र-च्युत, अस्, आ, अम्, fallen from, strayed, de-<BR>viated; ejected, displaced, degraded; banished, ex-<BR>pelled; routed, put to flight, retreated.<BR>—प्रच्युत-<BR>त्व, अम्, n. deviation; the being routed or put to<BR>flight, retreat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्युति|प्रच्युतिः
प्र-च्युति, इस्, f. going away, withdrawing, de-<BR>parting; deprivation, loss; the becoming frail or<BR>fragile (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रछ्|प्रच्छ्
प्रछ् प्रछ्, cl. 6. P. (in poetry also A.)<BR>पृच्छति (-ते), पप्रच्छ (Ved. प-<BR>पृक्षे), प्रष्टा, प्रक्ष्यति, अप्राक्षीत् (Ved.<BR>अप्राट्), Cond. अप्रक्ष्यत् (anomalous 2nd sing.<BR>अप्राक्ष्यस्), प्रष्टुम्, to ask, question, interro-<BR>gate, inquire of, ascertain, learn by inquiry; to ask<BR>or interrogate any one (acc.) about anything (with<BR>acc. or loc. or with प्रति or अधि-कृत्य); to seek,<BR>seek for; to entreat, supplicate, solicit, importune<BR>(Ved.): Caus. प्रच्छयति, -यितुम्, Aor. अप-<BR>प्रच्छत्: Desid. पिपृच्छिषति: Intens. परी-<BR>पृच्छ्यते; [cf. Zend pĕrĕs, ‘to inquire;’ frāś,<BR>‘a question:’ Lat. prec-ari, prex, proc-u-s, procax,<BR>probably posco for prosco and rogo for progo, pos-<BR>tulare, perhaps suf-frag-ari, flag-it-are: Goth.<BR>frah, fraihna, frag-an, fraihn-an: Angl. Sax.<BR>fregnan: Mod. Germ. Frage: Russ. pros'u, ‘I<BR>ask, pray:’ Lith. pers'u, ‘I woo;’ pras'au, ‘I ask,<BR>pray:’ Hib. fiafrach, ‘inquisitive;’ fiafraighe, ‘a<BR>question;’ fiafruighim, ‘I inquire, ask;’ perhaps<BR>friscim, ‘I hope,’ and friscart, ‘an answer.’]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रच्छन|प्रच्छनं
प्रच्छन, अम्, आ, n. f. asking, inquiring, a<BR>question, inquiry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज|प्रजः
प्रज प्र-ज. See under प्र-जन् below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजङ्घ
प्रजङ्घ प्र-जङ्घ, अस्, m., N. of a monkey;<BR>of a Rākṣasa; (आ), f. a particular portion of the<BR>lower part of the thigh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजन्
प्रजन् प्र-जन्, cl. 4. A. -जायते, -जनितुम्,<BR>to be born, be produced, come into existence, spring<BR>up; to become an embryo; to be born again; to<BR>propagate offspring (with inst.), beget, generate,<BR>cause to conceive; to bring forth, be delivered of,<BR>bear: Caus. -जनयति, -यितुम्, to cause any one<BR>(acc.) to propagate offspring (inst., Ved., Sāy. =<BR>प्रोद्भूतं कृ); to cause to be born; to beget,<BR>generate; to bring forth, bear; to produce, cause,<BR>occasion: Desid. -जिजनिषते, to wish to be born:<BR>Desid. of Caus. -जिजनयिषति, to wish to cause to<BR>be conceived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज|प्रजः
प्र-ज, अस्, आ, अम्, bringing forth, bearing (in<BR>अ-प्˚, q. v.); (अस्), m. a husband; (आ), f. progeny,<BR>offspring, brood, children and children's children,<BR>posterity, descendants, race, family; a creature,<BR>created being; man, mankind, people, subjects;<BR>seed, semen; birth, generation, propagation.<BR>—प्र-<BR>जा-कर, अस्, m. a symbolical expression for ‘a<BR>sword;’ (perhaps an error for प्रज्ञा-कर.)<BR>—प्रजा-काम, अस्, आ, अम्, desirous of offspring,<BR>wishing for children.<BR>—प्रजा-कार, अस्, m. the<BR>maker of created beings, author of creation.<BR>—प्र-<BR>जा-घ्न, अस्, ई, अम्, Ved. killing offspring, destroying<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-a" target="_blank">Page0608-a+ 81</a>]<BR>progeny.<BR>—प्रजा-चन्द्र, अस्, m. ‘a moon to his<BR>subjects,’ epithet of a prince.<BR>—प्रजा-तन्तु, उस्, m.<BR>a line of descendants, a race.<BR>—प्रजा-द, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, granting offspring; removing barrenness (as a<BR>medicine &c.); (आ), f. a species of shrub (= गर्-<BR>भ-दात्री).<BR>—प्रजा-दान, अम्, n. ‘people's gift,’<BR>silver.<BR>—प्रजा-द्वार, अम्, n. ‘a gate or means of<BR>obtaining progeny,’ epithet of the sun.<BR>—प्रजा-<BR>धर्म, अस्, m. the duty of children or of subjects.<BR>—प्रजाध्यक्ष (˚जा-अध्˚), अस्, m. ‘the super-<BR>intendent or leader of created beings,’ an epithet<BR>of the sun; of Kardama; of Dakṣa; [cf. प्रजा-<BR>पति.]<BR>—प्रजा-नाथ, अस्, m. ‘protector or lord of<BR>created beings,’ an epithet of Brahmā; of Manu; of<BR>Dakṣa; a protector of subjects, a king, prince.<BR>—प्रजा-निषेक, अस्, m. ‘infusion of offspring,’<BR>impregnation; the infused germ itself, offspring.<BR>—प्रजान्तक (˚जा-अन्˚), अस्, m. the god of death.<BR>—प्रजा-प, अस्, m. ‘protector of subjects,’ a king,<BR>prince.<BR>—प्रजा-पति, इस्, m. ‘lord of creatures,’ an<BR>epithet in the Veda originally applied to Savitṛ,<BR>Soma, Tvaṣṭṛ, Hiraṇya-garbha, Indra, and Agni,<BR>afterwards the name of a separate god presiding<BR>over procreation [cf. Manu XII. 121] and the be-<BR>stower of progeny and cattle, sometimes invoked<BR>as the ‘Creator’ and sometimes invoked only as<BR>one of the thirty-three deities, (in more recent hymns<BR>and Brāhmaṇas sometimes identified with the uni-<BR>verse, and described like Brahma as the original<BR>self-existent Being or source out of which the uni-<BR>verse was evolved); an epithet of the ten lords of<BR>created beings first created by Brahmā (according to<BR>Manu I. 34; their names are Marīci, Atri, Aṅgiras,<BR>Pulastya, Pulaha, Kratu, Vasiṣṭha, Pra-cetas or<BR>Dakṣa, Bhṛgu, and Nārada; some authorities make<BR>these Prajā-patis only seven in number, counting<BR>only the first seven in the above list, others reduce<BR>them to the last three, viz. Dakṣa, Bhṛgu, and<BR>Nārada); an epithet of Śiva; ‘lord of the people,’<BR>a king, sovereign, prince; a daughter's husband, son-<BR>in-law; a creator, procreator, father (as generator); a<BR>kind of insect; the fifth (or thirty-ninth) year in a<BR>sixty years' cycle of Jupiter; a particular star, ò Aurigæ;<BR>(in astrol.) = 2. काल-नर, q. v.; the sun; fire;<BR>N. of a man; of a Ṛṣi; (ई), f., N. of Śākya-<BR>muni's aunt and nurse with the patronymic Gautamī<BR>(the first woman who assented to the doctrines of<BR>Buddha; cf. महा-प्रजापती, महा-प्रजावती).<BR>—प्रजापति-गृहीत, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. created by<BR>Prajā-pati (according to Mahī-dhara = प्रजापति-<BR>सृष्ट).<BR>—प्रजापति-पति, इस्, m. ‘lord of the<BR>lords of created beings,’ an epithet of Dakṣa.<BR>—प्र-<BR>जापति-भक्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. eaten by Prajā-<BR>pati.<BR>—प्रजापति-यज्ञ, अस्, m. ‘the sacrifice per-<BR>formed to Prajā-pati (as the deity presiding over<BR>procreation of offspring),’ the procreation of children<BR>enjoined by law.<BR>—प्रजापति-लोक, अस्, m. the<BR>world of Prajā-pati situated between the sphere of<BR>Brahmā and that of the Gandharvas.<BR>—प्रजापति-<BR>शर्मन्, आ, m., N. of a man.<BR>—प्रजापति-सृष्ट,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, created by Prajā-pati.<BR>—प्रजापति-<BR>हृदय, अम्, n., Ved. ‘Prajāpati's heart,’ N. of a<BR>Sāman (also called प्रजापतेर् हृदयम्).<BR>—प्र-<BR>जापत्य, an incorrect form for प्राजापत्य, q. v.<BR>—प्रजा-पाल or प्रजा-पालक, अस्, m. ‘protector<BR>of created beings,’ an epithet of Kṛṣṇa; a protector<BR>of subjects, a king, sovereign; N. of a prince.<BR>—प्रजा-पालन, अम्, n. the protection of subjects.<BR>—प्रजा-पालि, इस्, m. an epithet of Śiva; [cf. गो-<BR>पालि.]<BR>—प्रजापाल्य, अम्, n. the office of protector<BR>of the people, royal office.<BR>—प्रजामृतत्व (˚जा-<BR>अम्˚), अम्, n., Ved. perpetuity of posterity.<BR>—प्र-<BR>जार्थम् or प्रजार्थे (˚जा-अर्˚), ind. for the sake of<BR>offspring.<BR>—प्रजा-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, accompanied by<BR>progeny, having offspring or children, abounding in<BR>progeny, prolific; pregnant; having subjects; (अती),<BR>f. a brother's wife; the wife of an elder brother; a<BR>mother, matron; N. of a tutelary deity of the Su-<BR>mantus; of the wife of Priya-vrata.<BR>—प्रजा-विद्, त्,<BR>त्, त्, or प्रजा-सनि, इस्, इस्, इ, Ved. bestowing or<BR>granting progeny.<BR>—प्रजा-वृद्धि, इस्, f. increase<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">Page0608-b+ 76</a>]<BR>of progeny.<BR>—प्रजा-सृज्, ट्, m. ‘the creator of<BR>beings,’ an epithet of Brahmā; of Kaśyapa.<BR>—प्रजा-<BR>हित, अस्, आ, अम्, favourable to or good for children<BR>or subjects, kind or useful to children or subjects;<BR>(अम्), n. water.<BR>—प्रजेप्सु (˚जा-ईप्˚), उस्, उस्, उ,<BR>wishing to obtain offspring, desirous of progeny.<BR>—प्रजेश (˚जा-ईश), अस्, m. ‘lord of created beings,’<BR>an epithet of the god presiding over the procreation<BR>of offspring; ‘lord of the people,’ a prince, king,<BR>sovereign.<BR>—प्रजेश्वर (˚जा-ईश्˚), अस्, m. ‘lord of<BR>the people,’ a sovereign, king.<BR>—प्रजोत्पत्ति (˚जा-<BR>उत्˚), इस्, f. or प्रजोत्पादन (˚जा-उत्˚), अम्, n. the<BR>raising up of progeny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0607-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजज्ञि
1. प्र-जज्ञि, इस्, इस्, इ, able to beget (in अ-प्˚,<BR>q. v.; for 2. प्र-जज्ञि see under 1. प्र-ज्ञा, col. 3).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजन|प्रजनः
प्र-जन, अस्, अम्, m. n. (usually m.), begetting,<BR>generating, impregnating, generation; impregnation<BR>or pregnancy of cattle; bearing, bringing forth;<BR>(अस्), m. one who begets, a generator, impregnator,<BR>progenitor.<BR>—प्रजनार्थम् (˚न-अर्˚), ind. for the<BR>sake of procreation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजनन|प्रजननं
प्र-जनन, अस्, ई, अम्, begetting, generating,<BR>generative, procreative, vigorous (according to Mahī-<BR>dhara = प्रजोत्पादक); (अम्), n. the act of gene-<BR>ration, procreation, propagation, conception in the<BR>womb; the act of bringing forth, delivery, birth;<BR>production; generative energy, procreative power,<BR>semen; the generative organ, penis, vulva; off-<BR>spring, children; = प्र-गम; = प्र-गत.<BR>—प्र-<BR>जनन-कुशल, अस्, आ, अम्, skilled in midwifery.<BR>—प्रजनन-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. possessing<BR>generative power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजनयितृ
प्र-जनयितृ, ता, m., Ved. a generator, begetter,<BR>progenitor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजनिका
प्र-जनिका, f. a mother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजनिष्णु
प्र-जनिष्णु, उस्, उस्, उ, generative, procreative,<BR>prolific, productive, generating, producing; being<BR>born or produced; growing or standing (as corn).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजनिष्यमाणा
प्र-जनिष्यमाणा, f. about to bring forth, being<BR>near the time of delivery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजनुक|प्रजनुकः
प्र-जनुक, अस्, m. the body; (perhaps an in-<BR>correct form.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजनू
प्र-जनू, ऊस्, f., Ved. the vulva, pudenda muli-<BR>ebria.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजस्
प्र-जस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, = प्र-ज (at the end of a<BR>comp.; cf. दुष्-प्˚, बहु-प्˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजात
प्र-जात, अस्, आ, अम्, born, produced; impreg-<BR>nating; (आ), f. a woman who has borne a child.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजाति|प्रजातिः
प्र-जाति, इस्, f. generating, generation, procreation,<BR>propagation, production; bringing forth, delivery,<BR>travail, labour; generative power; (इस्), m., N. of a<BR>prince.<BR>—प्रजाति-मत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. containing<BR>words relating to generation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजायिनी
प्र-जायिनी, f. being about to bring forth; bearing,<BR>bringing forth, a mother (at the end of comps., e. g.<BR>अभिरूप-प्रजायिनी, bearing handsome children;<BR>cf. वीर-प्˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजिजनिषमाण
प्र-जिजनिषमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. wishing to<BR>be born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजप्
प्रजप् प्र-जप्, cl. 1. P. -जपति, -जपितुम्,<BR>to recite in a low tone, whisper, mutter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजय
प्रजय प्र-जय. See under प्र-जि, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजल्प्
प्रजल्प् प्र-जल्प्, cl. 1. P. -जल्पति, -जल्पि-<BR>तुम्, to prattle, gossip, chatter; to speak, talk; to<BR>communicate, proclaim, announce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजल्प|प्रजल्पः
प्र-जल्प, अस्, m. prattle, gossip, heedless or<BR>frivolous words (especially such as used in greeting<BR>a lover).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजल्पन|प्रजल्पनं
प्र-जल्पन, अम्, n. talking, speaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजल्पित
प्र-जल्पित, अस्, आ, अम्, talked, chattered; one who<BR>has begun to talk; (अम्), n. spoken words, talk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजव|प्रजवः
प्रजव प्र-जव. See under प्र-जू, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजागृ
प्रजागृ प्र-जागृ, cl. 2. P. -जागर्ति, -जागरि-<BR>तुम्, to watch, keep watch, watch over (with loc.);<BR>to lie in wait for (with gen.): Caus. -जागरयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to wake (trans.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजागर|प्रजागरः
प्र-जागर, अस्, आ, अम्, one who wakes, waking,<BR>an epithet of Viṣṇu; (अस्), m. a guardian; the act<BR>of waking or watching, lying awake at night, sleep-<BR>lessness, being awake, being roused, awaking; taking<BR>care; (आ), f., N. of an Apsaras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजागरण
प्र-जागरण, अम्, n. being awake, sleeplessness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजानि
प्रजानि प्र-जानि, इस्, m., N. of a prince;<BR>(a various reading for प्र-जाति.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजि
प्रजि प्र-जि, cl. 1. P. -जयति, -जेतुम्, to<BR>win, conquer, overpower, subdue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजय
प्र-जय, अस्, m., Ved. victory, conquest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजित्
प्र-जित्, त्, त्, त्, conquering, defeating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजित
प्रजित प्रजित, अस्, आ, अम्, impelled, urged<BR>on; (probably a wrong form for प्राजित fr. rt. अज्<BR>with प्र.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजिन|प्रजिनः
प्रजिन प्रजिन, अस्, m. wind, air; (also<BR>read प्रजीन.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजिन्व्
प्रजिन्व् प्र-जिन्व्, cl. 1. P. -जिन्वति, -जिन्वि-<BR>तुम्, Ved. to refresh, animate; to promote, help,<BR>assist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजिहीर्षु
प्रजिहीर्षु प्र-जिहीर्षु, उस्, उस्, उ (fr. Desid.<BR>of rt. हृ with प्र), being about to strike or hit,<BR>wishing to strike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजीवन|प्रजीवनं
प्रजीवन प्र-जीवन, अम्, n. (fr. rt. जीव् with<BR>प्र), livelihood, subsistence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजीविन्
प्र-जीविन्, ई, m., N. of a minister of Megha-varṇa<BR>the king of the crows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजुष्ट
प्रजुष्ट प्र-जुष्ट, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. जुष्<BR>with प्र), strongly attached to, devoted to, intent<BR>on (= प्र-सक्त, Manu II. 96).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजू
प्रजू प्र-जू, cl. 1. P. A. -जवति, -ते, &c., to<BR>hasten forwards; to set in rapid motion, push or<BR>drive on; to urge on, incite: Caus. -जावयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to set in rapid motion, let fly, dart, shoot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजव|प्रजवः
प्र-जव, अस्, m., Ved. haste, rapidity; (अम्),<BR>ind. hastily, rapidly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजवित
प्र-जवित, अस्, आ, अम्, driven on, impelled; in-<BR>cited, urged on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजविन्
प्र-जविन्, ई, इनी, इ, hastening, rapid, swift, speedy;<BR>(ई), m. a runner, courier, express.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजृम्भ्
प्रजृम्भ् प्र-जृम्भ्, cl. 1. A. -जृम्भते,<BR>जृम्भितुम्, to begin to yawn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजॄ
प्रजॄ प्र-जॄ, cl. 4. P. -जीर्यति, -जरितुम्,<BR>-जरीतुम्, to be digested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्जटिक
प्रज्जटिक प्रज्जटिक, अस् or अम्, m. or n. (?),<BR>a kind of Prākṛt metre (= Prākṛt पज्जलिआ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्जि
प्रज्जि प्रज्जि, इस्, m., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञ|प्रज्ञः
प्रज्ञ 1. प्र-ज्ञ, अस्, आ, अम्, = प्र-ज्ञु, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञा
प्रज्ञा 1. प्र-ज्ञा, cl. 9. P. A. -जानाति, -जा-<BR>नीते, -ज्ञातुम्, to know, understand (especially said<BR>of knowing a way or mode of action); to distinguish,<BR>discern, discriminate; to know of, know about, be<BR>acquainted with; to become aware of, to find out,<BR>discover: Caus. -ज्ञपयति, -ज्ञापयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to show or point out (the way); to discover, betray;<BR>to summon, invite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रजज्ञि
2. प्र-जज्ञि, इस्, इस्, इ (for 1. see col. 2), Ved.<BR>conversant with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञ|प्रज्ञः
2. प्र-ज्ञ, अस्, आ, अम्, wise, intelligent, learned;<BR>(at the end of a comp.) knowing, conversant with;<BR>(आ), f. a clever or sensible woman; intelligence, un-<BR>derstanding, intellect, wisdom, knowledge; discern-<BR>ment, discrimination, judgment; device, design, de-<BR>termination; Wisdom personified as the goddess of<BR>arts and eloquence, Sarasvatī; (with Buddhists) the<BR>energy of the Ādi-buddha.<BR>—प्रज्ञ-ता, f., Ved.<BR>knowledge.<BR>—प्रज्ञा-कर, अस्, m., N. of the author<BR>of a commentary on the Nalodaya.<BR>—प्रज्ञा-काय,<BR>अस्, m. an epithet of Mañju-śrī a Buddhist saint.<BR>—प्रज्ञा-कूट, अस्, m., N. of a Bodhi-sattva.<BR>—प्रज्ञा-गुप्त-शरीर, अस्, आ, अम्, having the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">Page0609-a+ 77</a>]<BR>body protected by understanding.<BR>—प्रज्ञा-चक्षुस्,<BR>उस्, उस्, उस्, ‘mind-eyed,’ ‘having the understanding<BR>or wisdom as the only eyes,’ blind; (उस्), m. an<BR>epithet of the blind king Dhṛta-rāṣṭra.<BR>—प्रज्ञा-<BR>ढ्य (˚ञा-आढ्˚), अस्, m. ‘rich in wisdom,’ N. of a<BR>man.<BR>—प्रज्ञादित्य (˚ञा-आद्˚), अस्, m. ‘sun of<BR>wisdom,’ N. of a man.<BR>—प्रज्ञा-पारमिता, f. (with<BR>Buddhists) one of the six perfections, perfection in<BR>wisdom, (the other five are दान-प्˚, शील-प्˚, क्षान्-<BR>ति-प्˚, वीर्य-प्˚, and ध्यान-प्˚); N. of a Buddhist<BR>work.<BR>—प्रज्ञा-मय, अस्, ई, अम्, made or consist-<BR>ing of wisdom.<BR>—प्रज्ञा-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, possessing<BR>wisdom, wise, knowing, intelligent.<BR>—प्रज्ञा-वर्-<BR>मन्, आ, m. ‘having wisdom for armour,’ N. of a<BR>man.<BR>—प्रज्ञा-वाद, अस्, m. a wise speech, wise<BR>saying.<BR>—प्रज्ञा-वृद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, old in wisdom<BR>or knowledge.<BR>—प्रज्ञा-सहाय, अस्, आ, अम्, ‘hav-<BR>ing wisdom for a companion,’ wise, intelligent.<BR>—प्रज्ञा-हीन, अस्, आ, अम्, destitute of wisdom,<BR>ignorant, silly, unwise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0608-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञप्ति|प्रज्ञप्तिः
प्र-ज्ञप्ति, इस्, f. teaching, informing, doctrine,<BR>communication; an appointment, agreement, en-<BR>gagement; (with Jainas) a particular magical art per-<BR>sonified as one of the Vidyā-devīs (also प्र-ज्ञप्ती).<BR>—प्रज्ञप्ति-कौशिक, अस्, m., N. of a teacher<BR>acquainted with the magical art called Pra-jñapti.<BR>—प्रज्ञप्ति-वादिन्, इनस्, m. pl., N. of a Buddhist<BR>sect.<BR>—प्रज्ञप्ति-शास्त्र, अम्, n., N. of a Buddhist<BR>work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञात
प्र-ज्ञात, अस्, आ, अम्, known, understood; dis-<BR>tinguished, discriminated, discerned, discernible, dis-<BR>tinct, clear; renowned, famous, notorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञाति
प्र-ज्ञाति, इस्, f., Ved. knowing the way (to any<BR>place), knowing the right way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञातृ
प्र-ज्ञातृ, ता, त्री, तृ, Ved. one who knows the<BR>right way, a skilful guide, conductor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञात्र
प्र-ज्ञात्र, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. in अ-प्˚, losing or<BR>missing the way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञान|प्रज्ञानं
प्र-ज्ञान, अस्, आ or ई, अम्, prudent, wise, clever,<BR>learned; easily known (Ved.); (अम्), n. knowledge,<BR>knowing one's duty, wisdom, intelligence; discrimina-<BR>tion; a mark, sign, token, memorial.<BR>—प्रज्ञान-<BR>सन्तति, इस्, f. a train of thought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञापित
प्र-ज्ञापित, अस्, आ, अम्, betrayed, disclosed, dis-<BR>covered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञाल
प्रज्ञाल, अस्, आ, अम्, wise, prudent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञिन्
प्रज्ञिन्, ई, इनी, इ, wise, prudent; (ई), m. a wise<BR>or learned man, sage, scholar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञिल
प्रज्ञिल, अस्, आ, अम्, wise, prudent, clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्ञु|प्रज्ञुः
प्रज्ञु प्र-ज्ञु, उस्, उस्, उ, having the knees<BR>far apart, bandy-legged, bow-legged; (also written<BR>प्र-ज्ञ.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्वल्
प्रज्वल् प्र-ज्वल्, cl. 1. P. (ep. also A.)<BR>-ज्वलति (-ते), -ज्वलितुम्, to catch fire, begin to burn<BR>or blaze, be in flames, flame, blaze up; to blaze<BR>brightly, shine, gleam; to be inflamed or incensed,<BR>become wrathful, to be kindled (e. g. तेषां क्रो-<BR>धः प्रजज्वाल, their wrath was kindled): Caus.<BR>-ज्वलयति, -ज्वालयति, -यितुम्, to set on fire, light,<BR>kindle, inflame; (with Buddhists) to explain, illus-<BR>trate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्वलन|प्रज्वलनं
प्र-ज्वलन, अम्, n. blazing up, flaming, burn-<BR>ing, taking fire, kindling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्वलनीय
प्र-ज्वलनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be set on fire,<BR>inflammable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्वलित|प्रज्वलितः
प्र-ज्वलित, अस्, आ, अम्, being in flames, flaming,<BR>burning, blazing, shining, bright, radiant; blazed<BR>forth, burnt; (अम्), n. flaming up, blazing, burning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्वालित
प्र-ज्वालित, अस्, आ, अम्, lighted, kindled, set on<BR>fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्वार|प्रज्वारः
प्रज्वार प्र-ज्वार, अस्, m. (fr. rt. ज्वर् with<BR>प्र), the heat of fever (sometimes personified).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रडी
प्रडी प्र-डी, cl. 1. 4. A. -डयते, -डीयते,<BR>-डयितुम्, to fly forward, fly away, fly up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रडीन|प्रडीनं
प्र-डीन, अम्, n. flying rapidly, flying in every<BR>direction; taking flight, beginning to fly; the act of<BR>flying; flying forward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रण|प्रणः
प्रण प्रण, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. 1. प्र), ancient,<BR>old (see Vārttika 3. to Pāṇ. V. 4, 30).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणख|प्रणखः
प्रणख प्र-णख, अस् or अम्, m. or n. (?),<BR>the point of the nails.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणद्
प्रणद् प्र-णद्, cl. 1. P. -णदति, -णदितुम्,<BR>to resound, begin to sound, begin to roar or cry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणदन|प्रणदनं
प्र-णदन, अम्, n. sounding, sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणदित
प्र-णदित, अस्, आ, अम्, sounded, sounding;<BR>buzzing, humming (as a bee).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणाद|प्रणादः
प्र-णाद, अस्, m. a loud sound, clangour, noise,<BR>shout, cry; any loud noise, especially one expressing<BR>approbation or delight, huzza; neighing, braying,<BR>bray; roar, roaring; a cry for help; a low sound<BR>expressive of great pleasure, a murmur or sigh of<BR>rapture; a disease of the ear, a noise or buzzing in<BR>the ear from thickening of the membranes &c.; N.<BR>of a Cakra-vartin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणादक
प्र-णादक, अस्, इका, अम्, see Scholiast on Pāṇ.<BR>VIII. 4, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणपात्
प्रणपात् प्र-णपात्, त्, m., Ved. a great-<BR>grandson; [cf. Lat. pro-nepo-(t)-s.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणभ्
प्रणभ् प्र-णभ्, cl. 1. A. -णभते, &c.,<BR>Ved. to burst, split, cleave (intrans.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणम्
प्रणम् प्र-णम्, cl. 1. P. A. -णमति, -ते,<BR>-णन्तुम्, to bend or bow down before, make obei-<BR>sance to (with dat., gen., loc., or acc.): Caus. -णम-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to cause any one (acc.) to bow before<BR>another (dat.); to bend, incline; to do anything<BR>reverentially.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणत|प्रणतः
प्र-णत, अस्, आ, अम्, bent forwards, crooked;<BR>bowed, bowing to (with gen. or acc.); bending,<BR>stooping, stooped; inclined; humble; skilful, clever.<BR>—प्रणत-शिरस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, having the head or<BR>top bent down or bowed; inclined, stooping.<BR>—प्र-<BR>णताशेष-सामन्त (˚त-अश्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, one<BR>before whom all (his) neighbours bow, receiving<BR>homage from all the neighbouring princes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणतवत्
प्र-णतवत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having bent, bowed,<BR>bowing, bent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणति|प्रणतिः
प्र-णति, इस्, f. bending, bowing, inclination,<BR>salutation, reverence, obeisance, courtesy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणमत्
प्र-णमत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, bowing to, saluting<BR>with reverence or respect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणमित
प्र-णमित, अस्, आ, अम्, bending, bowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणम्य
प्र-णम्य, ind. having bowed, having done<BR>homage or made obeisance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणाम|प्रणामः
प्र-णाम, अस्, m. bending, bowing, a bow;<BR>respectful or reverential salutation, prostration, obei-<BR>sance (especially to a Brāhman or to a deity).<BR>—प्र-<BR>णामाञ्जलि (˚म-अञ्˚), इस्, m. reverential salutation<BR>with the hands opened and hollowed.<BR>—प्रणामा-<BR>दर (˚म-आद्˚), अस्, m. reverential salutation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणामिन्
प्र-णामिन्, ई, इनी, इ, bending, bowing before, sa-<BR>luting, honouring, worshipping, prostrating one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणय|प्रणयः
प्रणय प्र-णय. See 1. प्र-णी, p. 610, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणव|प्रणवः
प्रणव प्र-णव. See प्र-णु, p. 610, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणश्
प्रणश् 1. प्र-णश् (see rt. 1. नश्), cl. 1. P.<BR>A. -णशति, -ते, &c., Ved. to reach, attain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणश्
प्रणश् 2. प्र-णश् (see rt. 2. नश्), cl. 1. 4. P.<BR>-णशति, -णश्यति, -णशितुम्, -नंष्टुम्, -नष्-<BR>टुम् (the न् of the rt. is not changed to ण् when श्<BR>passes into ष् or is otherwise changed, e. g. प्र-<BR>नष्ट, प्र-नङ्क्ष्यति), to be lost, disappear,<BR>vanish; to escape: Caus. -णाशयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>cause to disappear or perish; to allow to be lost,<BR>i. e. to leave unrewarded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणश्यत्
प्र-णश्यत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, perishing, falling away;<BR>endeavouring to escape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणाश|प्रणाशः
प्र-णाश, अस्, m. vanishing, disappearance, cessa-<BR>tion, loss [cf. लब्ध-प्˚]; death, destruction, per-<BR>dition, decay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणाशन|प्रणाशनं
प्र-णाशन, अस्, ई, अम्, (at end of comps.) causing<BR>to disappear or cease, removing, destroying, annihilat-<BR>ing; (अम्), n. destroying, destruction, annihilation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणाशिन्
प्र-णाशिन्, ई, इनी, इ, causing to disappear or cease,<BR>removing, destroying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनष्ट|प्रनष्टः
प्र-नष्ट, अस्, आ, अम् (often incorrectly written<BR>प्र-णष्ट), lost, disappeared, vanished, not to be<BR>seen; departed, escaped; perished, destroyed, ruined,<BR>decayed, annihilated.<BR>—प्रनष्ट-ज्ञानिक, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, ‘whose knowledge is destroyed,’ without know-<BR>ledge.<BR>—प्रनष्ट-विनय, अस्, आ, अम्, ‘whose<BR>politeness has vanished,’ lost to propriety, uncivil,<BR>uncomplaisant, rude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणस
प्रणस प्र-णस, अस्, आ, अम्, having a pro-<BR>minent nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणाडी
प्रणाडी प्र-णाडी, f., Ved. a channel from<BR>a pond, a water-course, waste-pipe, drain; interven-<BR>tion, interposition; (ड्या), ind. mediately, indirectly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणाल|प्रणालः
प्र-णाल, अस्, ई, m. f. or प्र-णालिका, f. a channel<BR>from a pond, gutter, drain, water-course; प्रणा-<BR>लिकया, through a particular channel, through the<BR>medium of, mediately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिंसित
प्रणिंसित प्र-णिंसित or प्र-निंसित, अस्, आ,<BR>अम् (fr. rt. निंस् with प्र), kissed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिंसितव्य
प्र-णिंसितव्य or प्र-निंसितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>to be kissed, what may or ought to be kissed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिगद्
प्रणिगद् प्र-णि-गद्, cl. 1. P. -गदति, -ग-<BR>दितुम्, to begin to address.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिघ्नत्
प्रणिघ्नत् प्र-णिघ्नत्. See प्र-णि-हन्,<BR>p. 610, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिज्
प्रणिज् प्र-णिज्, cl. 3. P. A. -णेनेक्ति, -णे-<BR>निक्ते, -णेक्तुम्, Ved. to wash away, cleanse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणेजन|प्रणेजनं
प्र-णेजन, अस्, ई, अम्, washing away, wiping<BR>away; (अम्), n. washing away, wiping away, bathing;<BR>water for washing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिज्ञा
प्रणिज्ञा प्र-णि-ज्ञा, cl. 9. P. A. -जानाति,<BR>जानीते, -ज्ञातुम्, to consider, recollect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिधा
प्रणिधा प्र-णि-धा, cl. 3. P. A. -दधाति,<BR>-धत्ते, -धातुम्, to set in front, place in advance,<BR>cause to precede; to lay down, deposit; to lay on,<BR>impose, apply; to place in, lay in, bring into, infix,<BR>enchase; to include, inclose; to stretch out, stretch forth<BR>(the hand); to touch; to turn or direct (the eyes or<BR>thoughts) upon; (with मनस्) to concentrate the<BR>thoughts upon, give the whole attention to; to re-<BR>solve; to think; to send out or employ (a spy or<BR>emissary), spy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिधान|प्रणिधानं
प्र-णिधान, अम्, n. laying on, imposing, ap-<BR>plying, employing, application, employment, use;<BR>access, entrance; respectful conduct or behaviour<BR>towards, attention paid to (with loc.); profound re-<BR>ligious meditation; great effort, stress, energy; (with<BR>Buddhists) prayer, entreaty, supplication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिधि|प्रणिधिः
प्र-णिधि, इस्, m. observing, scrutinizing, spying<BR>out; sending out (spies or emissaries); a spy, secret<BR>agent, emissary; an attendant, a follower; care,<BR>attention; asking, solicitation, request; N. of a son<BR>of Bṛhad-ratha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिधेय|प्रणिधेयं
प्र-णिधेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be applied or injected<BR>(as a clyster); to be sent out (as a spy); (अम्), n.<BR>employing; sending out (of emissaries).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिहित|प्रणिहितं
प्र-णिहित, अस्, आ, अम्, laid on, applied, imposed;<BR>deposited; outstretched, stretched forth; delivered,<BR>entrusted, consigned; having the attention fixed,<BR>having the thoughts concentrated on one point,<BR>intent (= सम्-आहित); resolved, determined, de-<BR>cided; prudent, advised, careful, wary, cautious;<BR>discovered by spies, spied out; obtained, attained,<BR>received, acquired; acknowledged, previously agreed<BR>to or admitted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिध्यै
प्रणिध्यै प्र-णि-ध्यै, cl. 1. P. -ध्यायति,<BR>-ध्यातुम्, to give the attention to (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिनद्
प्रणिनद् प्र-णि-नद्, cl. 1. P. -नदति, -न-<BR>दितुम्, to sound loudly, thunder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिनदत्
प्र-णिनदत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, sounding deep or<BR>like thunder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिनाद|प्रणिनादः
प्र-णिनाद, अस्, m. a deep sound, that of thunder<BR>or the like.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिन्द्
प्रणिन्द् प्र-णिन्द् or प्र-निन्द्, cl. 1. P.<BR>-णिन्दति, -णिन्दितुम्, to blame, censure, upbraid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0609-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिन्दन
प्र-णिन्दन or प्र-निन्दन, अम्, n. censuring,<BR>upbraiding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिन्द्य
प्र-णिन्द्य or प्र-निन्द्य, ind. having censured<BR>or upbraided.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिपत्
प्रणिपत् प्र-णि-पत्, cl. 1. P. -पतति, -पति-<BR>तुम्, to throw one's self down before, fall prostrate<BR>before, bow down before, bow respectfully to (with<BR>acc. and sometimes with dat. or loc.): Caus. -पात-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to cause to bow down, induce or cause<BR>to fall prostrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिपतन|प्रणिपतनं
प्र-णिपतन, अम्, n. falling down before, throw-<BR>ing one's self down at any one's feet, prostration;<BR>bowing or doing homage to, saluting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिपतित
प्र-णिपतित, अस्, आ, अम्, bowed down in reverence,<BR>saluting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिपत्य
प्र-णिपत्य, ind. having bowed down or in<BR>reverence, having saluted respectfully, having done<BR>homage to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिपात|प्रणिपातः
प्र-णिपात, अस्, m. falling at any one's feet, pros-<BR>tration, humble submission to (with gen.); saluta-<BR>tion, reverence, obeisance.<BR>—प्रणिपात-पुरः-<BR>सरम्, ind. preceded by prostration, with an obei-<BR>sance.<BR>—प्रणिपात-प्रतीकार, अस्, आ, अम्, having<BR>submission for a remedy, counteracted by submission.<BR>—प्रणिपात-रस, अस्, m. ‘taking pleasure in sub-<BR>mission,’ a magical formula pronounced over weapons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिपातिन्
प्र-णिपातिन्, ई, इनी, इ, throwing one's self down<BR>or falling at the feet of, submitting, submissive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिमा
प्रणिमा 1. प्र-णि-मा, cl. 3. A. -मिमीते,<BR>मातुम् (fr. rt. 2. मा), see Scholiast on Pāṇ. VIII.<BR>4, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिमा
प्रणिमा 2. प्र-णि-मा, cl. 2. P., 3. A. -माति,<BR>-मिमीते, -मातुम् (fr. rt. 4. मा), see Scholiast on<BR>Pāṇ. VIII. 4, 17, Vopa-deva VIII. 22, IX. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिमि
प्रणिमि प्र-णि-मि, cl. 5. P. A. -मिनोति,<BR>-मिनुते, &c., see Vopa-deva XXVI. 212.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिया
प्रणिया प्र-णि-या, cl. 2. P. -याति, -यातुम्,<BR>to advance, proceed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिशम्
प्रणिशम् प्र-णि-शम्, cl. 4. P. -शाम्यति,<BR>-शमितुम्, to become calm, be pacified or appeased;<BR>to hear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिहन्
प्रणिहन् प्र-णि-हन्, cl. 2. P. -हन्ति, -हन्-<BR>तुम्, to slay, to kill (with gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिघ्नत्
प्र-णिघ्नत्, अन्, अती, अत्, preparing or threatening<BR>to strike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिहित|प्रणिहितं
प्रणिहित प्र-णिहित. See under प्र-णि-<BR>धा, p. 609, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणी
प्रणी 1. प्र-णी, cl. 1. P. A. -णयति, -ते,<BR>-णेतुम्, to lead forwards, advance, conduct, promote;<BR>to bring forwards, show, display; to bring; to offer,<BR>present; to direct or turn (the eyes) towards; (in<BR>liturgical language) to convey the sacrificial fire or<BR>water or Soma to its place at the altar; to bring<BR>into, reduce to (e. g. वशम् प्र-णी, to reduce to<BR>submission); to bring to pass, effect, accomplish,<BR>perform, execute, complete, finish; to apply; to<BR>manifest affection, show love or affection, love; to<BR>establish, institute, promulgate, teach; to write, com-<BR>pose; to cast, shoot, discharge; to do away with,<BR>remove, dispel; (with दण्डम्) to carry the rod, inflict<BR>punishment; (A.) to draw in (the breath): Desid.<BR>-णिनीषति, to desire to lead, wish to conduct (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणय|प्रणयः
प्र-णय, अस्, m. a leader (Scholiast on Pāṇ. III.<BR>1, 142); leading, conduct, guidance; confidence,<BR>familiarity, trust, intimacy; friendly acquaintance,<BR>confidential relationship, friendly or fond regard,<BR>friendship, affection, love, fondness, favour, kindness;<BR>wish, desire, longing; affectionate solicitation, re-<BR>quest, asking, begging; reverence, obeisance; final<BR>emancipation or beatitude; (एण), ind. confidentially,<BR>candidly; of one's own accord; without ceremony;<BR>(आत्), ind. candidly, openly, frankly.<BR>—प्रणय-<BR>कलह, अस्, m. a lovers' quarrel, mere wanton<BR>quarrelsomeness.<BR>—प्रणय-कुपित, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>according to a Scholiast = प्रेमातिशयेन कुपित,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-b" target="_blank">Page0610-b+ 81</a>]<BR>angry through excess of affection.<BR>—प्रणय-कोप,<BR>अस्, m. the (feigned) anger of a coquette towards her<BR>lover, anger indulged for the sake of the pleasure of<BR>being pacified.<BR>—प्रणय-प्रकर्ष, अस्, m. excess<BR>of affection, unwonted or extraordinary attachment.<BR>—प्रणय-भङ्ग, अस्, m. a breach of confidence<BR>or friendship, faithlessness.<BR>—प्रणय-मान, अस्,<BR>m. ‘love-pride,’ the arrogance of love, lovers'<BR>quarrels.<BR>—प्रणय-वचन, अम्, n. a declaration<BR>of love or affection (according to a Scholiast = प्रेम-<BR>कथन).<BR>—प्रणय-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, possessing<BR>candour, acting frankly or openly, free from con-<BR>straint, unceremonious, frank, open, confident; pos-<BR>sessing affection, attached to, feeling an attraction<BR>towards, loving.<BR>—प्रणय-विमुख, अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>averse from acquaintance, disinclined to friendship.<BR>—प्रणय-विहति, इस्, f. refusal of a request, denial,<BR>refusal, non-compliance.<BR>—प्रणय-स्पृश्, क्, क्, क्,<BR>exciting affection, affectionate.<BR>—प्रणयापराध<BR>(˚य-अप्˚), अस्, m. an offence against (mutual) affec-<BR>tion or confidence.<BR>—प्रणयापहारिन् (˚य-अप्˚),<BR>ई, इणी, इ, taking with confidence, taking without shy-<BR>ness or constraint.<BR>—प्रणयी-भू, cl. 1. P. -भवति,<BR>-भवितुम्, to become attached, to become affec-<BR>tionate.<BR>—प्रणयोन्मुख (˚य-उन्˚), अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>intending or about to make a declaration of love.<BR>—प्रणयोपेत (˚य-उप्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, possessing<BR>candour, frank, open, candid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणयत्
प्र-णयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, leading forwards, con-<BR>ducting; dispensing; decreeing, awarding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणयन|प्रणयनं
प्र-णयन, अम्, n. bringing forwards, conduct-<BR>ing; conveying, bringing, fetching [cf. अग्नि-षोम-<BR>प्˚]; carrying out, executing, performing, practising;<BR>bringing forward, adducing; composing, writing;<BR>that in which anything is brought [cf. प्रणीता-प्˚];<BR>dispensing, distributing; decreeing, awarding, sen-<BR>tencing; (with दण्डस्य or दण्ड-प्˚) carrying<BR>the rod, inflicting punishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणयनीय
प्रणयनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, used in bringing or<BR>fetching (as wood employed in carrying the sacred<BR>fire; cf. अग्नि-प्˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणयिन्
प्र-णयिन्, ई, इनी, इ, feeling attracted towards,<BR>attached to, affectionate, loving, kind; liking, wish-<BR>ing or longing for, desirous of; beloved, dear; inti-<BR>mate, familiar; (ई), m. a friend, favourite; a lover,<BR>husband; a petitioner; a humble servant; (इनी), f. a<BR>female friend; a mistress, wife.<BR>—प्रणयि-क्रिया, f.<BR>the act of a lover or affectionate person.<BR>—प्रणयि-<BR>जन, अस्, m. a friendly person, a friend; a number<BR>of friends, friendly circle.<BR>—प्रणयि-ता, f. desire or<BR>longing for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणायक|प्रणायकः
प्र-णायक, अस्, m. a leader or commander (of<BR>an army), guide, chief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणाय्य|प्रणाय्यः
प्र-णाय्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be regarded with affec-<BR>tion, dear, beloved; blameless, upright, straight-<BR>forward; devoid of passion or desire (?) ; disap-<BR>proved, disagreeing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणिनीषेण्य
प्र-णिनीषेण्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. appointed to<BR>lead or begin, appointed to be a commencement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणी
2. प्र-णी, ईस्, m., Ved. a leader, conductor; (ईस्),<BR>f. (according to Sāy.) = प्रणीयमाना स्तुतिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणीत|प्रणीतं|प्रणीतः
प्र-णीत, अस्, आ, अम्, led forwards, advanced,<BR>promoted; brought; offered, presented, delivered,<BR>given; directed; conveyed (to the altar, as fire or<BR>water or Soma); brought into, reduced to; effected,<BR>accomplished, performed, executed, completed, finish-<BR>ed; made, done, constructed; prepared, dressed (as<BR>food), cooked; established, instituted, taught, said,<BR>declared; written, composed, compiled; thrown,<BR>cast, shot, discharged, sent; set aside, removed, dis-<BR>pelled, (exposed as a child?); beloved, dear [cf.<BR>मनः-प्˚]; inflicted, decreed, sentenced, awarded;<BR>entered, approached; (अस्), m. fire consecrated by<BR>prayers or mystical formulas; (आ), f. a vessel used at<BR>sacrifices, a sort of cup; N. of a river; (आस्), f. pl.,<BR>scil. आपस्, water fetched on the morning of a festi-<BR>val for sacrificial uses, holy water.<BR>—प्रणीता-प्रण-<BR>यन, अम्, n., Ved. the vessel in which holy water<BR>is fetched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणीति|प्रणीतिः
प्र-णीति, इस्, f., Ved. conduct, leading, guidance;<BR>leading away; favour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणीय
प्र-णीय, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. to be led on, see Pāṇ.<BR>III. 1, 123.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणेतव्य
प्र-णेतव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be led or guided; to be<BR>accomplished or executed, to be used or applied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणेतृ
प्र-णेतृ, ता, m. a leader, guide; a maker,<BR>framer, creator; an author, promulgator of a doctrine,<BR>teacher; a performer or one who plays a musical<BR>instrument.<BR>—प्रणेतृ-मत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. con-<BR>taining the notion of leading.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणेनी
प्र-णेनी, ईस्, ईस्, इ, Ved. leading or guiding con-<BR>stantly or repeatedly; (Sāy. = प्रकर्षेण नेता.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणेय|प्रणेयः
प्र-णेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be guided or led, ductile,<BR>docile, submissive, obedient, tamable, yielding; to be<BR>executed or accomplished; to be fixed or settled;<BR>agreeable (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणु
प्रणु प्र-णु, cl. 2. 6. P. and Ved. 1. A.<BR>-णौति, -णुवति, -णवते, -णवितुम्, -णुवितुम्, to<BR>roar, bellow, low; to resound, reverberate; to make<BR>a humming or droning sound, to utter the sacred<BR>syllable ॐ; to praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणव|प्रणवः
प्र-णव, अस्, m. the mystical or sacred syllable<BR>ॐ (Manu II. 74); a small kind of drum or tabor<BR>(= पणव).<BR>—प्रणवोपनिषद् (˚व-उप्˚), त्, f.,<BR>N. of an Upaniṣad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणवक|प्रणवकः
प्र-णवक, अस्, m. (at the end of comps.) the<BR>mystical or sacred syllable ॐ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणुत|प्रणुतं
प्र-णुत, अस्, आ, अम्, praised, celebrated, lauded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणुद्
प्रणुद् 1. प्र-णुद्, cl. 6. P. A. -णुदति, -ते,<BR>-णोत्तुम्, to push or thrust forward, press forward,<BR>push on; to drive away, send away, repel, dispel;<BR>to scare or frighten away; to set in motion, drive;<BR>to stir: Caus. -णोदयति, -यितुम्, to push or thrust<BR>away; to move, excite; to press any one to do any-<BR>thing; to request any one for anything (with two<BR>acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणुत्त
प्र-णुत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, pushed away, driven away,<BR>repelled; frightened or scared away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणुद्
2. प्र-णुद्, त्, त्, त्, driving away, frightening or<BR>scaring away; forcing away, removing; directing,<BR>enjoining, who or what commands or enjoins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणुद
प्र-णुद, अस्, आ, अम्, driving away, frightening<BR>away; forcing away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणुदत्
प्र-णुदत्, अन्, अती or अन्ती, अत्, driving away,<BR>dispelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणुदित
प्र-णुदित, अस्, आ, अम्, driven away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणुन्न
प्र-णुन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, pushed or thrust away,<BR>driven away; frightened or scared away; set in<BR>motion, driven; sent, dispatched; shaking, trem-<BR>bling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणोत्तव्य
प्र-णोत्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be pushed or moved<BR>forwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणोद|प्रणोदः
प्र-णोद, अस्, m. driving, guiding (horses &c.);<BR>directing, ordering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणोदित
प्र-णोदित, अस्, आ, अम्, set in motion, agitated;<BR>driven, guided; directed, ordered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रणोद्य
प्र-णोद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be driven away, to be<BR>sent or turned away; to be frightened away; to be<BR>removed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतक्वन्
प्रतक्वन् प्र-तक्वन्, आ, अरी, अ (fr. rt. तक्<BR>with प्र), Ved. moving onwards; steep, precipitous<BR>(? according to Mahī-dhara = प्रदक्षिणं गच्-<BR>छन्त्य् ऋत्विजो यत्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतक्ष्
प्रतक्ष् प्र-तक्ष्, cl. 1. P. -तक्षति, -तक्-<BR>षितुम्, -तष्टुम्, Ved. to build, make, produce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतङ्कम्
प्रतङ्कम् प्र-तङ्कम्, ind. (fr. rt. तङ्क् with<BR>प्र), Ved. having glided or crept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतड्
प्रतड् प्र-तड्, cl. 10. P. -ताडयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to strike down, knock down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतत
प्रतत प्र-तत. See under प्र-तन्, p. 611.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रततामह|प्रततामहः
प्रततामह प्र-ततामह, अस्, m., Ved. a<BR>great-grandfather.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतद्वसु
प्रतद्वसु प्रतद्-वसु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. ‘laden<BR>with wealth,’ an epithet of the horses of Indra<BR>(according to the Nirukta = प्राप्त-वसु; Sāy. =<BR>विस्तीर्ण-धन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0610-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतन्
प्रतन् प्र-तन् [cf. rt. 3. तन्], cl. 8. P. A.<BR>-तनोति, -तनुते, -तनितुम्, to spread, extend; to<BR>spread over, cover, fill; to stretch out, unfold, spread<BR>abroad, disperse, diffuse; to carry off; to show, dis-<BR>play, reveal, manifest; to begin to perform, begin<BR>(a sacrifice); to execute, perform, accomplish: Pass.<BR>-तन्यते, -तायते, to spread or extend from, proceed<BR>from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतत
प्र-तत, अस्, आ, अम्, spread; spread over, covered,<BR>filled; stretched out, spread abroad, diffused; (अम्),<BR>ind. continuously, unintermittingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतति|प्रततिः
प्र-तति, इस्, f. spreading, expansion, extension;<BR>(इस् or ई), f. a creeping plant, creeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतान|प्रतानः
प्र-तान, अस्, m. a shoot, tendril; a plant with<BR>tendrils; a low spreading creeper, creeping plant,<BR>creeper, climber; branching out, ramification (both<BR>literal and metaphorical); ‘a branch or tendril,’ epithet<BR>of a section of a work entitled Kāvya-kalpa-latā-<BR>parimala; a kind of disease, tetanus, epilepsy; N. of<BR>a man; (आस्), m. pl., N. of his descendants.<BR>—प्र-<BR>तान-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having shoots or tendrils;<BR>ramified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतानिन्
प्र-तानिन्, ई, इनी, इ, spreading, extending; having<BR>shoots or tendrils; (इनी), f. a spreading creeper,<BR>climbing plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतन|प्रतनः
प्रतन प्रतन, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. 1. प्र), an-<BR>cient, old; [cf. प्रत्न.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतनु
प्रतनु प्र-तनु, उस्, उस् or वी, उ, very thin<BR>or fine, delicate, minute; slender, emaciated; small,<BR>narrow; insignificant, indifferent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतनुक
प्र-तनुक, अस्, आ, अम्, very fine or delicate;<BR>(अम्), ind. very delicately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतप्
प्रतप् प्र-तप्, cl. 1. P. -तपति, -तप्तुम्,<BR>to give forth heat, radiate heat, be hot, burn, glow;<BR>to warm, to heat, to shine upon; to bake, roast; to<BR>anneal metals; to kindle, light, illumine; to feel<BR>pain, suffer; to mortify the flesh, perform penance;<BR>to pain with heat, torment, torture, harass: Pass.<BR>-तप्यते, to feel pain, suffer pain: Caus. -तापयति,<BR>-यितुम् (anomalous 3rd sing. 1st Fut. प्र-तापिता,<BR>Mahā-bh. Karṇa-p. 1971), to make warm or hot,<BR>warm, heat; to set on fire, set in flames, irradiate,<BR>illuminate; to destroy with heat, pain by heat, tor-<BR>ment, harass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतपत्|प्रतपन्त्
प्र-तपत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, burning; (अन्), m. the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतपन|प्रतपनं
प्र-तपन, अम्, n. making warm, warming;<BR>प्रतपने कृ, to put near the fire, make warm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतप्त
प्र-तप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, heated; hot, ardent;<BR>annealed; pained, tormented, tortured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रताप|प्रतापः
प्र-ताप, अस्, m. glowing heat, heat, warmth;<BR>splendor, brilliancy, glory, majesty, dignity, the pos-<BR>session of rank and power, superiority; ardour, zeal,<BR>spirit, vigour, power, efficacy, energy; courage,<BR>prowess, valour; the plant Calotropis Gigantea (=<BR>अर्क); N. of a man.<BR>—प्रताप-चन्द्र, अस्, m.,<BR>N. of an author.<BR>—प्रताप-धवल, अस्, m., N.<BR>of a prince.<BR>—प्रताप-पाल, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR>—प्रताप-पुर, अम्, n., N. of a city.<BR>—प्रताप-<BR>मार्तण्ड, अस्, m., N. of a work.<BR>—प्रताप-<BR>मुकुट, अस्, m., N. of a prince.<BR>—प्रताप-रुद्र,<BR>अस्, m., N. of a prince of the Kākatīyas (celebrated in<BR>a work by Vidyā-nātha on rhetoric and in the drama<BR>called Pratāparudrīya or Pratāpa-rudra; he was born<BR>in Bhoja-purī; Pratāpa-rudra is also described as a<BR>king of Vijaya-nagara).<BR>—प्रताप-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>full of splendor, endowed with majesty, majestic,<BR>glorious, mighty, powerful; dignified; (आन्), m., N.<BR>of an attendant of Skanda; an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—प्रताप-शील, अस्, m., N. of a prince (= शीला-<BR>दित्य).<BR>—प्रतापादित्य (˚प-आद्˚), अस्, m., N. and<BR>epithet of various princes.<BR>—प्रतापालङ्कार (˚प-<BR>अल्˚), अस्, m., N. of a medical work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतापन|प्रतापनं|प्रतापनः
प्र-तापन, अस्, ई, अम्, making hot, paining,<BR>distressing, tormenting; (अस्), m. a particular hell;<BR>(अम्), n. warming, heating; burning, consuming;<BR>inflicting pain or punishment, paining, distressing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतापस|प्रतापसः
प्र-तापस, अस्, m. a species of gigantic Asclepias<BR>with white flowers, Calotropis Gigantea Alba.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतापिन्
प्र-तापिन्, ई, इनी, इ, hot, burning, scorching,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">Page0611-b+ 75</a>]<BR>singeing; splendid, shining; paining, distressing,<BR>harassing; majestic, dignified, powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतम्
प्रतम् प्र-तम्, cl. 4. P. -ताम्यति, -तमितुम्,<BR>to lose the breath, become breathless, be stupefied<BR>or stunned; to become exhausted, feel exhausted,<BR>faint, perish; to be beside one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतमक|प्रतमकः
प्र-तमक, अस्, m. a particular form of asthma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रताम्
प्र-ताम्, न्, न्, न्, desiring?; being afflicted?;<BR>(आन्), ind. see Gaṇa Svar-ādi to Pāṇ. I. 1, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतमाम्
प्रतमाम् प्र-तमाम्, ind. (fr. 1. प्र), Ved.<BR>especially, in particular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतरम्
प्र-तरम्, ind., Ved. further; more, more espe-<BR>cially, more exceedingly; principally, pre-eminently;<BR>(Sāy. = प्रकृष्टतरम्, अतिशयेन.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतर|प्रतरः
प्रतर प्र-तर. See under प्र-तॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतर्क्
प्रतर्क् प्र-तर्क्, cl. 10. P. -तर्कयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to form a clear view or notion; to gather, con-<BR>clude; to search, investigate; to regard as, take for,<BR>deem, suppose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतर्क|प्रतर्कः
प्र-तर्क, अस्, m. conclusion, supposition, con-<BR>jecture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतर्कण|प्रतर्कणं
प्र-तर्कण, अम्, n. judging, reasoning, discus-<BR>sing, discussion; doubt; logic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतर्क्य
प्र-तर्क्य, अस्, आ, अम्, conceivable, compre-<BR>hensible, imaginable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतर्दन|प्रतर्दनः|प्रतर्द्दन
प्रतर्दन प्र-तर्दन, अस्, m. (fr. rt. तृद्<BR>with प्र), N. of a king of Kāśī (a son of Divo-dāsa<BR>and author of the hymn Ṛg-veda IX. 96); N. of a<BR>Rākṣasa; of a class of divinities under Manu Auttama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतल|प्रतलं|प्रतलः
प्रतल प्र-तल, अस्, m. the open hand with<BR>the fingers extended; (अम्), n. one of the divisions<BR>of the lower regions; [cf. पाताल.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतवस्
प्रतवस् प्र-तवस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, Ved. mighty,<BR>powerful, active; (Sāy. = प्रकृष्ट-बलोपेत.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रताम्र
प्रताम्र प्र-ताम्र, अस्, आ, अम्, excessively<BR>red, very red.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतार|प्रतारः
प्रतार प्र-तार, प्र-तारक, प्र-तारण,<BR>प्र-तारणीय. See under प्र-तॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रति
प्रति 1. प्रति (an indeclinable particle and<BR>prefix to verbs and their derivative nouns; some-<BR>times प्रती in composition), towards, in the direc-<BR>tion of, to, unto, near to; against, in opposition to,<BR>counter; back, back again, again, in return; down<BR>upon, upon, on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रति
प्रति is also prefixed to nouns not immediately<BR>connected with verbs, to express equality, likeness,<BR>resemblance, or comparison; [cf. प्रति-चक्र,<BR>प्रति-चन्द्र.]<BR>(As a separable preposition with acc. and usu-<BR>ally but not invariably following its substantive),<BR>towards, to, unto, in the direction of (e. g. शब्दम्<BR>प्रति, in the direction of the sound, towards the<BR>place whence the sound came); down upon, upon;<BR>against, in opposition to, counter (e. g. यायाद् रिपुम्<BR>प्रति, he should march against the enemy; पाहि<BR>नस् त्वम् प्रति रीषतः, defend thou us against<BR>the enemy); over against, opposite, contra; in the<BR>presence of, before; in comparison with, in propor-<BR>tion to, on a par with (e. g. त्वं सहस्राणि प्रति,<BR>thou art on a par with, i. e. equivalent to, thousands);<BR>in the vicinity of, near, beside, by, at, on (e. g.<BR>गङ्गाम् प्रति, at or on the Ganges; आयोधनम्<BR>प्रति, on the field of battle); on the side of, in<BR>favour of; (distributively) in each, at or in every,<BR>according to each, severally (e. g. यज्ञम् प्रति, at<BR>every sacrifice; वर्षम् प्रति, every year, annually;<BR>in this sense प्रति is frequently used at the beginning<BR>of adv. comps., cf. प्रति-क्षणम्, प्रति-गृहम्);<BR>about, at the time of, during (e. g. फाल्गुनम्<BR>मासम् प्रति, about the month Phālguna; चिरम्<BR>प्रति, for a long time); in relation to, with refer-<BR>ence to, with regard to (e. g. धर्मम् प्रति,<BR>with regard to justice); concerning; on account of;<BR>according to (e. g. माम् प्रति, according to me,<BR>i. e. in my opinion), in conformity with, in pursuance<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">Page0611-c+ 72</a>]<BR>of; a little (at the end of a comp., e. g. सूप-<BR>प्रति, a little broth, see Pāṇ. II. 1, 9).<BR>(As a separable preposition, with abl.), on a par<BR>with, on an equality with (also with adverbs ending<BR>with the affix तस्, e. g. नारायणतः प्रति, on an<BR>equality with Nārāyaṇa); in return for, as compen-<BR>sation for (e. g. उक्षा कपोतात् प्रति, an ox in<BR>return for a dove); in the place of, in lieu of,<BR>instead of.<BR>Native lexicographers explain the senses of प्रति<BR>by the following Sanskrit words: प्र-धान, क्षेप,<BR>निश्-चय, व्य्-आवृत्ति, प्र-शस्ति, वि-रोध, सम्-<BR>आधि: [cf. Zend paiti: Old Pers. pati-sh, ‘against:’<BR>Gr. προ-τί, πα-τί, πρός for πρότ, πρόσ-θε-(ν): Lat.<BR>red- as in red-dere, red-ire; re- as in re-ferre;<BR>prœ for prai; por, pol, pos for port in the forms<BR>por-rigo, pol-liceor, pol-lus, pos-sides: Old Slav.<BR>proti: Lith. prësz, ‘against:’ Bohem. proti: Hib.<BR>frith, frioth, as in frithbeart, ‘I object, oppose;’<BR>frithbuille, ‘a back-stroke;’ frithshearc, ‘a return<BR>of love, mutual regard;’ frithcuirim, ‘I oppose,<BR>obstruct;’ frithbharamhuil, ‘a paradox^1.’]<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Dr. Sampada Savardekar on 20210422. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रति
प्रति 2. प्रति, इस्, m., N. of a son of Kuśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक|प्रतिकः
प्रतिक प्रतिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. 1. प्रति), worth<BR>a Kārṣāpaṇa or sixteen Paṇas of Kowries.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकञ्चुक|प्रतिकंचुक|प्रतिकञ्चुकः
प्रतिकञ्चुक प्रति-कञ्चुक, अस्, m. an ad-<BR>versary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकण्ठम्|प्रतिकंठम्
प्रतिकण्ठम् प्रति-कण्ठम्, ind. singly, se-<BR>verally, one by one (lit. so that each is seized by the<BR>throat).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकम्प्
प्रतिकम्प् प्रति-कम्प्, Caus. P. -कम्प-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to shake, cause to tremble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर|प्रतिकरः
प्रतिकर प्रति-कर, &c. See under प्रति-<BR>कृ, p. 612, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर्कश
प्रतिकर्कश प्रति-कर्कश, अस्, आ, अम्, equally<BR>hard, of the same hardness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर्ष|प्रतिकर्षः
प्रतिकर्ष प्रति-कर्ष, अस्, m. (fr. rt. कृष्<BR>with प्र), drawing together, aggregation; antici-<BR>pating that which occurs later.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकृष्ट|प्रतिकृष्टं
प्रति-कृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, ploughed back again,<BR>twice ploughed; thrust back, repulsed, rejected,<BR>despised; inferior, low, vile; put out of sight,<BR>hidden, concealed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकल्प्य
प्रतिकल्प्य प्रति-कल्प्य. See under प्रति-<BR>कॢप्, p. 612, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकश
प्रतिकश प्रति-कश, अस्, आ, अम्, (probably)<BR>not obeying the whip.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकाङ्क्ष्
प्रतिकाङ्क्ष् प्रति-काङ्क्ष्, cl. 1. P. (ep. also<BR>A.) -काङ्क्षति (-ते), -काङ्क्षितुम्, to wish for,<BR>long for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकाङ्क्षिन्
प्रति-काङ्क्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ, longing for, desirous<BR>of, desiring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकामम्
प्रतिकामम् प्रति-कामम्, ind., Ved. accord-<BR>ing to wish or desire, at will.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकामिन्
प्रति-कामिन्, ई, इनी, इ, Ved. contrary to desire,<BR>contrary to taste, disagreeable, distasteful; (इनी), f. a<BR>female rival.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकाम्य
प्रति-काम्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. being according<BR>to wish or liking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकाय|प्रतिकायः
प्रतिकाय प्रति-काय, अस्, m. an effigy,<BR>image, likeness, picture; the effigy of a man for<BR>archers to practise at; a target, butt, mark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकार|प्रतिकारः
प्रतिकार प्रति-कार, &c. See under प्रति-<BR>कृ, p. 612, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकाश्
प्रतिकाश् प्रति-काश्, Intens. -चाकशीति, Ved.<BR>to see, behold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकाश|प्रतिकाशः
प्रति-काश, अस्, m. (or प्रती-काश, q. v.), reflec-<BR>tion; look, appearance; (at the end of comps.) hav-<BR>ing the appearance of, looking like, similar, resem-<BR>bling, like (e. g. चन्द्र-प्रतिकाश, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>like the moon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकास|प्रतिकासः
प्रति-कास, wrongly spelt for प्रति-काश above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0611-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकितव|प्रतिकितवः
प्रतिकितव प्रति-कितव, अस्, m. an adver-<BR>sary at play, an opponent in a game<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकुञ्चित|प्रतिकुंचित
प्रतिकुञ्चित प्रति-कुञ्चित, अस्, आ, अम्, bent,<BR>curved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकुञ्जर|प्रतिकुंजर|प्रतिकुञ्जरः
प्रतिकुञ्जर प्रति-कुञ्जर, अस्, m. a hostile<BR>elephant; [cf. प्रति-गज, प्रति-द्विरद, प्रति-<BR>नाग.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूज्
प्रतिकूज् प्रति-कूज्, cl. 1. P. -कूजति, -कू-<BR>जितुम्, to coo or warble in return, answer by an<BR>inarticulate sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूप|प्रतिकूपः
प्रतिकूप प्रति-कूप, अस्, m. a moat, ditch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूल|प्रतिकूलं
प्रतिकूल प्रति-कूल, अस्, आ, अम्, ‘against<BR>the bank’ (opposed to अनु-कूल, q. v.), against the<BR>stream or current, contrary, adverse, opposed, oppo-<BR>site; cross-grained, cross, inverted, reverse; contradic-<BR>tory; disastrous, inauspicious; disagreeable, unpleasant,<BR>ungracious, perverse, stubborn, contumacious, rebel-<BR>lious; प्रतिकूलेषु स्थित, standing among the re-<BR>fractory, offering opposition (according to Kullūka =<BR>आज्ञा-व्याघात-कारिन्); (अम्, एन), ind. contrary,<BR>contrarily, contrary to nature, in inverted order, in-<BR>versely.<BR>—प्रतिकूल-कारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, or प्रतिकूल-<BR>कृत्, त्, त्, त्, opposing, offering opposition to (with<BR>gen.).<BR>—प्रतिकूल-तस्, ind. in contradiction or con-<BR>travention to; प्रतिकूलतो वृत्, to be in contradiction<BR>to.<BR>—प्रतिकूल-ता, f. or प्रतिकूल-त्व, अम्, n.<BR>adverseness, opposition, hostility; perverseness, con-<BR>tumacy.<BR>—प्रतिकूल-दर्शन, अस्, आ, अम्, looking<BR>cross or awry, having an ungracious aspect.<BR>—प्रति-<BR>कूल-दैव-ता, f. hostility of fate.<BR>—प्रतिकूल-प्र-<BR>वर्तिन्, ई, इनी, इ, taking an adverse course; caus-<BR>ing unpleasantness.<BR>—प्रतिकूल-भाषिन्, ई, इणी, इ,<BR>speaking against, contravening, contradicting.<BR>—प्र-<BR>तिकूल-वचन, अम्, n. refractory speech, contradic-<BR>tion; disagreeable speech.<BR>—प्रतिकूल-वत्, आन्, अती,<BR>अत्, refractory, contumacious.<BR>—प्रतिकूल-वर्तिन्,<BR>ई, इनी, इ, being adverse to, disturbing, troubling.<BR>—प्रतिकूल-वाद, अस्, m. speaking contradictorily,<BR>contradiction.<BR>—प्रतिकूल-वादिन्, ई, इनी, इ, speaking<BR>contradictorily, contradictory, contradicting, opposing.<BR>—प्रतिकूल-वृत्ति, इस्, इस्, इ, being in a state of<BR>opposition, opposing.<BR>—प्रतिकूल-शब्द, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>having a disagreeable sound, having a discordant note<BR>(Kumāra-s. I. 46).<BR>—प्रतिकूलाचरित (˚ल-आच्˚), अम्,<BR>n. offensive or hostile action, injurious conduct.<BR>—प्र-<BR>तिकूलोक्त (˚ल-उक्˚), अम्, n. contradiction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूलय
प्रतिकूलय, Nom. P. प्रतिकूलयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to oppose, offer opposition to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकृ
प्रतिकृ प्रति-कृ, cl. 8. P. A. -करोति, -कु-<BR>रुते, -कर्तुम्, to do or make (anything as a defence)<BR>against (Ved.); to return, repay, recompense, re-<BR>quite, retaliate (with acc. of the thing, and gen.,<BR>dat., or loc. of the person); to act in opposition to,<BR>counteract (with acc. or gen.); to treat or attend<BR>to (as a physician), cure; to repair, mend, restore:<BR>Caus. A. -कारयते, -यितुम्, to cause to be repeated:<BR>Desid. -चिकीर्षति, to wish to requite, seek to retaliate<BR>or take vengeance upon (with loc. or acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर|प्रतिकरः
प्रति-कर, अस्, ई, अम्, acting against, counter-<BR>acting; (अस्), m. requital, compensation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकरणीय
प्रति-करणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be counteracted,<BR>to be prevented, remediable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर्तव्य
प्रति-कर्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be requited or re-<BR>turned, to be paid or discharged (as a debt); to be<BR>counteracted or counterworked, to be frustrated; to<BR>be treated or attended (by a physician).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर्तृ
प्रति-कर्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, a requiter, recompenser;<BR>an opponent, adversary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर्मन्|प्रतिकर्म्मन्
प्रति-कर्मन्, अ, n. requital, retaliation; redress,<BR>remedy; counteraction, counterworking; opposing,<BR>opposition; dress, decoration, toilet, personal embel-<BR>lishment; (अ), ind. at each celebration or perform-<BR>ance; in every work; अ-प्रतिकर्मन्, आ, आ, अ,<BR>(either) whose deeds are unmatched, (or) not offer-<BR>ing opposition; obedient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकार|प्रतिकारः
प्रति-कार, अस्, m. (or प्रती-कार, q. v.), ren-<BR>dering back, requital, reward, retaliation, retribution,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">Page0612-b+ 74</a>]<BR>revenge; counteraction, application of an antidote or<BR>remedy, obviating, preventing, remedying, preven-<BR>tion, remedy; opposition; help against, help, allevi-<BR>ation; a kind of treaty or alliance concluded with<BR>the hope that one party will requite the services<BR>rendered by the other.<BR>—प्रतिकार-कर्मन्, अ, n.<BR>the making of amends.<BR>—प्रतिकार-ज्ञ, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, knowing what remedy should be applied.<BR>—प्र-<BR>तिकार-विधान, अम्, n. the application of a remedy,<BR>medical treatment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकारिन्
प्रति-कारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, counteracting, obviating,<BR>opposing; अ-प्रतिकारिन्, one who uses no remedies,<BR>one who does not allow himself to be attended by<BR>a physician.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकार्य
प्रति-कार्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be retaliated or re-<BR>venged; (अम्), n. retribution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकृत
प्रति-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, rendered back, returned,<BR>repaid, recompensed, requited, retaliated; opposed,<BR>counteracted, remedied; (अम्), n. recompense, re-<BR>quital; resistance, opposition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकृति|प्रतिकृतिः
प्रति-कृति, इस्, f. resistance, defence; retaliation,<BR>return, revenge; a reflected image, reflection, a<BR>shadow; an effigy, figure, image, statue, picture;<BR>a substitute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकृत्य
प्रति-कृत्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be counteracted or<BR>remedied, remediable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रिया
प्रति-क्रिया, f. requital, retaliation, revenge; a re-<BR>turn for kindness received, recompense; opposition;<BR>counteracting, remedying; (medical) attendance;<BR>embellishment, decoration; defence, protection; a<BR>fence; succour, help, care.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकृष्ट|प्रतिकृष्टं
प्रतिकृष्ट प्रति-कृष्ट. See प्रति-कर्ष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकॄ
प्रतिकॄ प्रति-कॄ, cl. 6. P. A. -किरति, -ते,<BR>-करितुम्, -करीतुम्, to scatter towards; [cf. प्रति-<BR>स्-कॄ.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकॢप्
प्रतिकॢप् प्रति-कॢप्, cl. 4. A. -कल्पते,<BR>-कल्पितुम्, -कल्प्तुम्, Ved. to be at the service<BR>of (with acc.); to receive hospitably: Caus. -कल्-<BR>पयति, -यितुम्, to regulate, arrange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकल्प्य
प्रति-कल्प्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be arranged or<BR>prepared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकोप|प्रतिकोपः
प्रतिकोप प्रति-कोप, अस्, m. anger against<BR>(any one), wrath; vexation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रम्
प्रतिक्रम् प्रति-क्रम्, cl. 1. P. A. -क्रामति,<BR>-क्रमते, -क्रमितुम्, to come back, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रम|प्रतिक्रमः
प्रति-क्रम, अस्, m. reversed or inverted order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रमण|प्रतिक्रमणं
प्रति-क्रमण, अम्, n. (Ved.) stepping towards;<BR>(with Buddhists) confessing, making confession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रुध्
प्रतिक्रुध् प्रति-क्रुध्, cl. 4. P. -क्रुध्यति,<BR>-क्रोद्धुम्, to be angry with any one (acc.) in<BR>return (Manu VI. 48).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रोध|प्रतिक्रोधः
प्रति-क्रोध, अस्, m. anger in return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रुष्ट
प्रतिक्रुष्ट प्रति-क्रुष्ट, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt.<BR>क्रुश् with प्रति), miserable, poor (said of a kind<BR>of soil).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रोश
प्रति-क्रोश, अस्, m., Ved. crying out to, hallooing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रूर
प्रतिक्रूर प्रति-क्रूर, अस्, आ, अम्, cruel or<BR>harsh in return, returning harshness for harshness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षणम्
प्रतिक्षणम् प्रति-क्षणम्, ind. at every<BR>moment, every moment, momentarily, every in-<BR>stant; constantly, continually.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षत्र
प्रतिक्षत्र प्रति-क्षत्र, अस्, m., N. of a<BR>descendant of Atri, author of the hymn Ṛg-veda V.<BR>46; of a son of An-enas; of a son of Kṣatra-vṛddha;<BR>of a son of Śamin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षय|प्रतिक्षयः
प्रतिक्षय प्रति-क्षय, अस्, m. a guard, at-<BR>tendant (‘protecting from injury or loss’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षि
प्रतिक्षि प्रति-क्षि (see rt. 2. क्षि), cl. 2. 6.<BR>P. -क्षेति, -क्षियति, -क्षेतुम्, Ved. to settle near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षिप्
प्रतिक्षिप् प्रति-क्षिप्, cl. 6. P. -क्षिपति,<BR>-क्षेप्तुम्, to throw or cast into; to push against,<BR>hurt; to revile, ridicule, reject.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षिप्त|प्रतिक्षिप्तः
प्रति-क्षिप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, thrown into; turned<BR>away, rejected, dismissed; sent, dispatched; repelled,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">Page0612-c+ 69</a>]<BR>opposed, resisted; abused, reviled; calumniated,<BR>falsely accused; (अम्), n. medicine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षिप्य
प्रति-क्षिप्य, ind. having thrown into, having<BR>thrown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षेप|प्रतिक्षेपः
प्रति-क्षेप, अस्, m. contradicting, contradiction;<BR>opposing, controverting, contravening; contest, con-<BR>testing; not acknowledging, rejecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षेपण|प्रतिक्षेपणं
