प्रतिख्याति|प्रतिख्यातिः
प्रति-ख्याति, इस्, f. renown; (also read प्र-<BR>विख्याति.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगज|प्रतिगजः
प्रतिगज प्रति-गज, अस्, m. a hostile ele-<BR>phant, elephant standing opposite; [cf. प्रति-कुञ्-<BR>जर.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगद्
प्रतिगद् प्रति-गद्, cl. 1. P. -गदति, -गदि-<BR>तुम्, to speak in return, answer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगम्
प्रतिगम् प्रति-गम्, cl. 1. P. -गच्छति, -गन्-<BR>तुम्, to go or advance towards, go to meet; to go<BR>back, return, go home.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगत|प्रतिगतं
प्रति-गत, अस्, आ, अम्, flying backwards and for-<BR>wards, wheeling in flight; lost from the memory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगमन|प्रतिगमनं
प्रति-गमन, अम्, n. going back, returning,<BR>return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगर|प्रतिगरः
प्रतिगर प्रति-गर. See प्रति-गॄ below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगर्ज्
