प्रतिगर्जत्|प्रतिगर्ज्जत्
प्रति-गर्जत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, roaring against; mur-<BR>muring against, rebelling; reverberating, echoing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगर्जना
प्रति-गर्जना, f. roaring against, answering roar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

