प्रतिगा
प्रतिगा प्रति-गा, cl. 3. P. -जिगाति, -गातुम्,<BR>to go back, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगात्रम्
प्रतिगात्रम् प्रति-गात्रम्, ind. in every limb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगाह्
प्रतिगाह् प्रति-गाह्, cl. 1. A. -गाहते, -गा-<BR>हितुम्, -गाढुम्, to penetrate, enter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगिरि|प्रतिगिरिः
प्रतिगिरि प्रति-गिरि, इस्, m. an opposite<BR>mountain; an inferior mountain or anything like a<BR>mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगीर्य
प्रतिगीर्य प्रति-गीर्य. See प्रति-गॄ below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगु
प्रतिगु प्रति-गु, Caus. P. -गावयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, Ved. to proclaim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगुप्त
प्रतिगुप्त प्रति-गुप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, guarded,<BR>protected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगुप्य
प्रति-गुप्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be guarded or pro-<BR>tected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगृध्
प्रतिगृध् प्रति-गृध्, cl. 4. P. -गृध्यति,<BR>-गर्धितुम्, to be greedy or eager for (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगृहम्
प्रतिगृहम् प्रति-गृहम्, ind. in every house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगृहीत
प्रतिगृहीत प्रति-गृहीत. See under प्रति-<BR>ग्रह्, p. 613, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगॄ
प्रतिगॄ प्रति-गॄ, cl. 9. P. A. -गृणाति, -गृ-<BR>णीते, -गरितुम्, -गरीतुम्, to invoke, salute (Ved.);<BR>to answer or make responses in recitation or singing<BR>(Ved.); to agree with any one (with dat.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगर|प्रतिगरः
