प्रतिगरितृ
प्रति-गरितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, Ved. one who ejaculates<BR>or utters a response.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगीर्य
प्रति-गीर्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. to be answered with<BR>a response in singing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0612-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगेहम्
प्रतिगेहम् प्रति-गेहम्, ind. in every house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्रह्
प्रतिग्रह् प्रति-ग्रह्, cl. 9. P. A. -गृह्णाति,<BR>गृह्णीते, -ग्रहीतुम् (an irreg. 2nd sing. Impv.<BR>प्रति-गृह्ण is used in Rāmāyaṇa III. 9, 27), to<BR>take hold of, grasp, seize; to eclipse; to take up,<BR>collect, admit; to take, eat, drink; to take posses-<BR>sion of, occupy; to take away, deprive of; to receive,<BR>accept (शिरसा प्रति-ग्रह्, to accept anything and<BR>place it on the head as a mark of respect); to<BR>receive an enemy, attack, assault, assail; to receive<BR>a friend, give a friendly reception to, welcome; to<BR>take as a wife, choose for a husband, wed, marry;<BR>to hear, hear with pleasure; to accept what is said<BR>as a good omen; to express assent, approve, attend,<BR>pay attention to: Caus. -ग्राहयति, -यितुम्, to cause<BR>to accept, give, present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगृहीत
प्रति-गृहीत, अस्, आ, अम्, taken hold of; taken,<BR>accepted, received; assented to, admitted; taken as<BR>a wife, married.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगृहीतव्य
प्रति-गृहीतव्य, a wrong form for प्रति-ग्र-<BR>हीतव्य, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगृहीतृ
प्रति-गृहीतृ, a wrong form for प्रति-ग्र-<BR>हीतृ, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगृह्य
1. प्रति-गृह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be accepted,<BR>acceptable; one from whom anything may be ac-<BR>cepted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगृह्य
2. प्रति-गृह्य, ind. having taken or received;<BR>bringing up the rear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्रह|प्रतिग्रहः
प्रति-ग्रह, अस्, m. receiving, accepting, accept-<BR>ance, receiving a donation; the right of accepting<BR>gifts (as the peculiar prerogative of Brāhmans); one<BR>who receives, a receiver; a gift, present; a proper<BR>donation or fit present to a Brāhman at suitable<BR>periods; receiving kindly, friendly reception; taking<BR>a wife, marrying; favour, grace; hearing, hearken-<BR>ing, listening; the reserve of an army, a detach-<BR>ment posted with the general four hundred yards in<BR>the rear of the line; a spitting-pot, spittoon; the<BR>sun near the moon's node; = क्रिया-कार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्रहण|प्रतिग्रहणं
प्रति-ग्रहण, अस्, ई, अम्, receiving, accepting;<BR>(अम्), n. receiving, reception, receiving presents;<BR>receiving a bride, marrying; a vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्रहणीय
प्रति-ग्रहणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be taken or<BR>accepted, acceptable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्रहिन्
प्रति-ग्रहिन्, ई, इणी, इ, one who receives, a<BR>receiver (opposed to दातृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्रहीतव्य
प्रति-ग्रहीतव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be taken or<BR>accepted, allowed to be taken or received; to be<BR>received (in a friendly manner), to be welcomed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्रहीतृ
प्रति-ग्रहीतृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who receives or<BR>accepts, a receiver; one who takes in marriage, one<BR>who marries.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्राह|प्रतिग्राहः
प्रति-ग्राह, अस्, m. receiving, accepting gifts; a<BR>spitting-pot, spittoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्राहक
प्रति-ग्राहक, अस्, इका, अम्, receiving gifts or<BR>presents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्राहिन्
प्रति-ग्राहिन्, ई, इणी, इ, one who accepts, re-<BR>ceiving presents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्राह्य
1. प्रति-ग्राह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be taken or ac-<BR>cepted, acceptable, admissible; one from whom<BR>anything may be received.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्राह्य
2. प्रति-ग्राह्य, ind. having caused to accept,<BR>having offered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्रामम्
प्रतिग्रामम् प्रति-ग्रामम्, ind. in every<BR>village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिघ|प्रतिघः
प्रतिघ प्रति-घ, अस्, m. (fr. प्रति-हन्),<BR>resistance, opposing, opposition; mutual beating,<BR>striking back again, fighting, combat; anger, wrath,<BR>rage, passion; an enemy; fainting; (अस्, आ, अम्),<BR>inimical, adverse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिघात|प्रतिघातः
प्रति-घात, अस्, m. (or प्रती-घात, q. v.), ward-<BR>ing off a blow, keeping back, repulse; hinderance,<BR>opposition, resistance; reaction; preventing, prohi-<BR>biting; a blow in return; rebound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिघातक
प्रति-घातक, अस्, इका, अम्, disturbing, inter-<BR>rupting, troubling; (at the end of an adj. comp.) =<BR>प्रति-घात.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिघातन|प्रतिघातनं
प्रति-घातन, अम्, n. warding off, repulsing;<BR>killing, slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिघातिन्
प्रति-घातिन्, ई, इनी, इ, keeping off, repelling,<BR>repulsing; troubling, encroaching, injuring; hostile,<BR>opposed to; reacting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिघ्न|प्रतिघ्नं
प्रति-घ्न, अम्, n. the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिघ्नत्
प्रति-घ्नत्, अन्, अती, अत्, opposing, impeding;<BR>destructive; hostile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिघोषिन्
प्रतिघोषिन् प्रति-घोषिन्, ई, इणी, इ (fr. rt.<BR>घुष् with प्रति), Ved. roaring against, sounding<BR>against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिचक्र
प्रतिचक्र प्रति-चक्र, अम्, n. a discus that<BR>will bear comparison with others, a discus which is<BR>a match for any other; (perhaps) a corresponding<BR>or subordinate wheel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिचक्ष्
