प्रतिचारित
प्रति-चारित, अस्, आ, अम्, circulated, proclaimed,<BR>published.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिचरणम्
प्रतिचरणम् प्रति-चरणम्, ind. in every<BR>school or branch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

