प्रतिचिकीर्षु
प्रति-चिकीर्षु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing to requite,<BR>desirous of retaliating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिचिति
प्रतिचिति प्रति-चिति, ind., Ved. in every<BR>layer or pile, in each layer or course (of faggots,<BR>bricks, &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

