प्रतिचिन्तनीय
प्रति-चिन्तनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be reflected upon<BR>anew, to be thought over again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

