प्रतिचोदित
प्रति-चोदित, अस्, आ, अम्, impelled, one who has<BR>pushed against or assailed (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

