प्रतिच्छन्न|प्रतिछन्न
प्रति-च्छन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, covered over, covered,<BR>overlaid, clotted, enveloped; obscured; hidden, con-<BR>cealed, disguised; beset, enclosed, hemmed in; fur-<BR>nished with, provided with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

