प्रतिच्छन्द प्रति-च्छन्द, अस्, m. a reflected<BR>image, likeness, any image, picture, statue; a sub-<BR>stitute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

