प्रतिजन
प्रतिजन प्रति-जन, अस्, m., Ved. an ad-<BR>versary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजन्य
प्रतिजन्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. adverse, opposed to,<BR>hostile; (Sāy. प्रतिजन्यानि = hostile people.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजप्
प्रतिजप् प्रति-जप्, cl. 1. P. -जपति, -जपि-<BR>तुम्, Ved. to mutter in response.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

