प्रतिजल्प् प्रति-जल्प्, cl. 1. P. -जल्पति, -जल्-<BR>पितुम्, to answer, reply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजल्प|प्रतिजल्पः
प्रति-जल्प, अस्, m. an answer, reply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजल्पक|प्रतिजल्पकः
प्रति-जल्पक, अस्, m. a reply expressing assent,<BR>respectful concurrence; a polite but evasive answer (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजागृ
प्रतिजागृ प्रति-जागृ, cl. 2. P. -जागर्ति,<BR>जागरितुम्, Ved. to watch beside (another).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजागर|प्रतिजागरः
प्रति-जागर, अस्, m. vigilance, watchfulness,<BR>attention.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजागरण|प्रतिजागरणं
प्रति-जागरण, अम्, n. watching, guarding,<BR>attending to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजागरणक
प्रति-जागरणक, अस्, or अम्, m. or n. (?), a<BR>district.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजि
प्रतिजि प्रति-जि, cl. 1. P. -जयति, -जेतुम्,<BR>Ved. to conquer, defeat (at play): Desid. -जिगीषति,<BR>to wish to conquer or defeat, to attack, assault, assail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजिह्वा
प्रतिजिह्वा प्रति-जिह्वा or प्रति-जिह्विका, f.<BR>the uvula or soft palate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजीवन|प्रतिजीवनं
प्रतिजीवन प्रति-जीवन, अम्, n. (fr. rt. जीव्<BR>with प्रति), returning to life, resuscitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजुष्
प्रतिजुष् प्रति-जुष्, cl. 6. A. -जुषते, -जो-<BR>षितुम्, Ved. to be kind, act tenderly towards; to<BR>receive with pleasure, delight in, be gratified by:<BR>Caus. -जोषयति, -यितुम्, to coax, caress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजूतिवर्पस्
प्रतिजूतिवर्पस् प्रतिजूति-वर्पस्, आस्, आस्, अस्,<BR>Ved. victorious over enemies (Sāy. = प्रतिपक्षा-<BR>भिभवन-शील-तेजो-युक्त).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजॄ
प्रतिजॄ प्रति-जॄ, cl. 1. A. -जरते, -जरितुम्,<BR>-जरीतुम्, Ved. to roar (as fire) in the direction of<BR>(Sāy. = अभि-वृध्, to increase); to call out to,<BR>salute (Sāy. = स्तु, to praise).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिज्ञा
प्रतिज्ञा 1. प्रति-ज्ञा, cl. 9. A. (ep. also P.)<BR>-जानीते, -जानाति, -ज्ञातुम्, to admit, own, acknow-<BR>ledge, recognise, allow, take in good part; to ap-<BR>prove, consent; to promise (with gen., dat., or loc.<BR>of the person, and acc. or dat. of the thing); to<BR>maintain, uphold, assert, affirm, allege; to bring<BR>forward or introduce (a topic); to perceive, observe,<BR>learn, discern, become aware of; (A.) to confirm,<BR>assent, answer in the affirmative; to propose; (P. A.)<BR>to remember with regret, remember sorrowfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिज्ञा
2. प्रति-ज्ञा, f. admission, acknowledgment; as-<BR>sent; a solemn declaration, agreement, engagement,<BR>promise, vow; a statement, assertion, affirmation,<BR>declaration, allegation; (in logic) a proposition, the<BR>assertion to be proved, the first member or अवयव<BR>of the five-membered Nyāya syllogism (in the usual<BR>standing example = ‘this hill is fiery’); (in law) a<BR>plaint, complaint, indictment; (अया), ind. by ex-<BR>press rule; in the manner laid down.<BR>—प्रतिज्ञान्-<BR>तर (˚ज्ञा-अन्˚), अम्, n. (in logic) a subsequent<BR>proposition on failure of the first.<BR>—प्रतिज्ञा-<BR>पत्त्र or प्रतिज्ञा-पत्त्रक, अम्, n. a promissory<BR>note, a written contract, bond.<BR>—प्रतिज्ञा-परि-<BR>शिष्ट, अम्, n., N. of a treatise by Kātyāyana.<BR>—प्रतिज्ञा-भङ्ग, अस्, m. the breaking or breach<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">Page0614-a+ 72</a>]<BR>of a promise.<BR>—प्रतिज्ञाभङ्ग-भीरु, उस्, उस्, उ,<BR>fearful or apprehensive of breaking a promise.<BR>—प्र-<BR>तिज्ञा-विरोध, अस्, m. acting contrary to promise<BR>or agreement; denial of a logical proposition.<BR>—प्र-<BR>तिज्ञा-विवाहित, अस्, आ, अम्, promised in marriage,<BR>betrothed.<BR>—प्रतिज्ञा-सन्न्यास, अस्, m. breaking<BR>a promise; abandonment of the original proposition<BR>(in logic).<BR>—प्रतिज्ञा-हानि, इस्, f. giving up the pro-<BR>position or argument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0613-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिज्ञात|प्रतिज्ञातं
प्रति-ज्ञात, अस्, आ, अम्, asserted, propounded,<BR>declared, stated, proposed, deposed, alleged; admitted,<BR>acknowledged; promised, agreed; agreeable, desira-<BR>ble; (अम्), n. anything promised, a promise.<BR>—प्र-<BR>तिज्ञातार्थ (˚त-अर्˚), अस्, m. a statement, averment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिज्ञातव्य
प्रति-ज्ञातव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be assented to, to<BR>be promised, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिज्ञाति
प्रति-ज्ञाति, इस्, f. a wrong form for प्रति-प्र-<BR>ज्ञाति, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिज्ञान|प्रतिज्ञानं
प्रति-ज्ञान, अम्, n. admission, assent, agreement,<BR>engagement, promise; asserting, assertion; bringing<BR>forward or introducing (a topic).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिज्ञापित
प्रति-ज्ञापित, अस्, आ, अम्, betrayed; (a various<BR>reading for प्र-ज्ञापित.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिज्ञाय
प्रति-ज्ञाय, ind. having admitted or acknow-<BR>ledged; having promised; having maintained or<BR>asserted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिज्ञेय|प्रतिज्ञेयः
प्रति-ज्ञेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be promised or assented<BR>to; (अस्), m. the reciter or pronouncer of a pane-<BR>gyric, a proclaimer of rank and titles, herald, bard,<BR>panegyrist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिज्वल्
प्रतिज्वल् प्रति-ज्वल्, cl. 1. P. -ज्वलति, -ज्व-<BR>लितुम्, to flame, blaze, shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतितड्
प्रतितड् प्रति-तड्, cl. 10. P. -ताडयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to strike in return, strike again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतितत्त्वसिद्धान्त
प्रतितत्त्वसिद्धान्त प्रति-तत्त्व-सिद्धान्त, अस्,<BR>m. a conclusion adopted by each disputant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतितन्त्रम्|प्रतितंत्रम्
प्रतितन्त्रम् प्रति-तन्त्रम्, ind. according to<BR>each Tantra, according to each opinion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतितप्
प्रतितप् प्रति-तप्, cl. 1. P. -तपति, -तप्तुम्,<BR>to throw out heat towards; to heat, warm, foment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतितर|प्रतितरः
प्रतितर प्रति-तर, अस्, m. (fr. rt. तॄ with<BR>प्रति), a sailor, oarsman, ferryman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतितराम्
प्रतितराम् प्रति-तराम्, ind. (compar. fr. 1.<BR>प्रति), Ved. with rt. भू, to become shorter or<BR>more contracted; (according to a Scholiast = अत्यन्-<BR>तम् प्रतिकूल.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतितरु
प्रतितरु प्रति-तरु, ind. at each tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिताल|प्रतितालः
प्रतिताल प्रति-ताल or प्रति-तालक, अस्, m.<BR>(in music) a particular time, a kind of air or melody;<BR>(ई), f. the key of a door or padlock, an instrument<BR>to open a door.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतितूणी
प्रतितूणी प्रति-तूणी, f. a modification of<BR>the nervous disease called Tūṇī; [cf. प्र-तूणी.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतित्र्यहम्
प्रतित्र्यहम् प्रति-त्र्यहम्, ind. for three<BR>days at a time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिथि
प्रतिथि प्र-तिथि, इस्, m., N. of a teacher<BR>with the epithet Deva-ratha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदण्ड
प्रतिदण्ड प्रति-दण्ड, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. re-<BR>fractory, disobedient, obstinate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदर्श
प्रतिदर्श प्रति-दर्श. See प्रति-दृश्, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदह्
प्रतिदह् प्रति-दह्, cl. 1. P. -दहति, -दग्-<BR>धुम्, Ved. to burn towards, encounter with flames,<BR>consume (Sāy. = सर्वथा भस्मी-कृ): Pass. -दह्-<BR>यते, to be burnt or consumed by fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदा
प्रतिदा प्रति-दा, cl. 3. P. A. -ददाति, -दत्ते,<BR>दातुम्, to give in return, give as a reward, give<BR>back, return, restore; to retort; to give: Caus.<BR>-दापयति, -यितुम्, to cause to be given back,<BR>cause to be restored.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदत्त
प्रति-दत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, given back. See प्रती-त्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदातव्य
प्रति-दातव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be given back, to<BR>be restored.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदान|प्रतिदानं
प्रति-दान, अम्, n. giving back, restoring (a<BR>deposit), restitution, restoration; returning, a gift<BR>in return; exchange, barter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदेय|प्रतिदेयं
प्रति-देय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be given back or<BR>returned, to be given as an equivalent; (अम्), n. a<BR>pledge, pawn; an article purchased and given back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदारण|प्रतिदारणं
प्रतिदारण प्रति-दारण, अम्, n. (fr. rt. दॄ<BR>with प्रति), battle, fighting, fierce conflict.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदिनम्
प्रतिदिनम् प्रति-दिनम्, ind. day by day,<BR>daily, every day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदिवन्
प्रतिदिवन् प्रति-दिवन्, आ, m. (fr. rt. 2. दिव्<BR>with प्रति), the sun; a day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदीवन्
प्रति-दीवन्, आ, m. an adversary at play (Ved.);<BR>the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदिवसम्
प्रतिदिवसम् प्रति-दिवसम्, ind. day after<BR>day, daily, day by day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदिश्
प्रतिदिश् प्रति-दिश्, Caus. P. -देशयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to point towards, point out; to enjoin, teach;<BR>to direct; to confess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदिशम्
प्रति-दिशम्, ind. (fr. प्रति + २. दिश्), in every di-<BR>rection, from every quarter; everywhere, all around.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदेशम्
प्रति-देशम्, ind. (fr. प्रति + देश), in every re-<BR>gion, in each district or country, in every country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदुह्
प्रतिदुह् प्रति-दुह्, धुक् (gender doubtful;<BR>inst. -दुहा or -धुषा, gen. -दुहस् or -धुषस्),<BR>Ved. fresh milk, milk still warm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदूत|प्रतिदूतः
प्रतिदूत प्रति-दूत, अस्, m. a messenger or<BR>ambassador sent in return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदूषित
प्रतिदूषित प्रति-दूषित, अस्, आ, अम्, defiled,<BR>rendered unclean, contaminated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदृश्
प्रतिदृश् प्रति-दृश्, cl. 1. P. -पश्यति,<BR>-द्रष्टुम्, to look at, behold; to become aware<BR>of, experience, know; A. -पश्यते or Pass. -दृश्-<BR>यते, to come in sight, become visible or perceptible,<BR>appear: Caus. -दर्शयति, -यितुम्, to cause to see,<BR>to show; to teach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदर्श
प्रति-दर्श, अस्, m., Ved. looking at, viewing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदर्शन|प्रतिदर्शनं
प्रति-दर्शन, अम्, n. seeing, perceiving; (at<BR>the end of comps.) appearance, look.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदृशम्
प्रति-दृशम्, ind. (fr. प्रति + २. दृश्), in every<BR>eye, for every eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदृष्ट
प्रति-दृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, beheld; become<BR>visible, come in sight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदेवतम्
प्रतिदेवतम् प्रति-देवतम्, ind., Ved. for<BR>every deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदेवता
प्रति-देवता, f., Ved. a corresponding deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदैवतम्
प्रति-दैवतम्, ind. for every deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदेहम्
प्रतिदेहम् प्रति-देहम्, ind. in each body,<BR>in every body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदोषम्
प्रतिदोषम् प्रति-दोषम्, ind., Ved. in the<BR>evening, in the dark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिद्रु
प्रतिद्रु प्रति-द्रु, cl. 1. P. -द्रवति, -द्रो-<BR>तुम्, to run towards, run to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिद्रुह्
प्रतिद्रुह् 1. प्रति-द्रुह्, cl. 4. P. -द्रुह्यति,<BR>-द्रोहितुम्, -द्रोग्धुम्, -द्रोढुम्, to injure in<BR>return, retaliate an injury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिद्रुह्
2. प्रति-द्रुह्, ध्रुक्, क्, क्, or ध्रुट्, ट्, ट्, seeking<BR>to injure in return, wishing to retaliate an injury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिद्वन्द्व|प्रतिद्वंद्व|प्रतिद्वन्द्वः
प्रतिद्वन्द्व प्रति-द्वन्द्व, अस्, m. an oppo-<BR>nent, antagonist, adversary, rival; an enemy, foe;<BR>(अम्), n. opposition, hostility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिद्वन्द्विन्|प्रतिद्वंद्विन्
प्रति-द्वन्द्विन्, ई, m. an opponent, adversary,<BR>rival; (ई, इनी, इ), hostile, opposed; (at the end of<BR>a comp.) rivalling, vying with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिद्वारम्
प्रतिद्वारम् प्रति-द्वारम्, ind. at every gate,<BR>at each door.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिद्विरद
प्रतिद्विरद प्रति-द्विरद, अस्, m. an opposite<BR>elephant, a hostile elephant; [cf. प्रति-कुञ्जर.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिधर्तृ|प्रतिधर्त्तृ
प्रतिधर्तृ प्रति-धर्तृ. See under प्रति-<BR>धृ, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिधा
प्रतिधा 1. प्रति-धा, cl. 3. P. A. -दधाति,<BR>-धत्ते, -धातुम् (mostly Ved.), to place on, place<BR>within; to put back; to replace, restore, give back<BR>to (with loc. or dat.); to fix (an arrow on the bow-<BR>string); to put to the lips (in drinking, Ṛg-veda<BR>IV. 27, 5); to set (the foot) upon; to offer, pre-<BR>sent; to use, employ; (A.) to begin, commence; to<BR>draw near, come on (said of the night).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिधा
2. प्रति-धा, f., Ved. putting to the lips (in<BR>drinking); a draught.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिधान|प्रतिधानं
प्रति-धान, अम्, n. putting on; adopting pre-<BR>cautions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिधि|प्रतिधिः
प्रति-धि, इस्, m., Ved. a particular part of a<BR>chariot, pieces of wood fastened across the pole;<BR>(according to Mahī-dhara) = अन्न.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिधाव्
प्रतिधाव् प्रति-धाव्, cl. 1. P. A. -धावति,<BR>-ते, -धावितुम्, to run back; to rush upon, assail,<BR>attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिधावन|प्रतिधावनं
प्रति-धावन, अम्, n. running against, rushing<BR>upon, assailing, attacking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिधुर|प्रतिधुरः
प्रतिधुर प्रति-धुर, अस्, m. a horse har-<BR>nessed by the side of another, one horse of a pair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिधृ
प्रतिधृ प्रति-धृ, cl. 10. P. -धारयति,<BR>-यितुम्, Ved. to keep back, stop, check; to keep<BR>erect, support.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिधर्तृ|प्रतिधर्त्तृ
प्रति-धर्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, Ved. one who keeps<BR>back or stops, one who checks; (according to Mahī-<BR>dhara = निर्-आकर्तृ.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिधृष्
प्रतिधृष् प्रति-धृष्, cl. 1. 5. P. -धर्-<BR>षति, -धृष्णोति, -धर्षितुम् (Ved. -धृषे),<BR>to be bold against, brave, defy; to withstand, resist;<BR>to sustain, endure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिधृष्य
प्रति-धृष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. to be braved<BR>or defied, to be withstood or resisted, resistible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिध्यै
प्रतिध्यै प्रति-ध्यै, cl. 1. P. -ध्यायति,<BR>-ध्यातुम्, to think upon, hit upon an idea, devise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिध्यात
प्रति-ध्यात, अस्, आ, अम्, thought upon, medi-<BR>tated on, devised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिध्वनि|प्रतिध्वनिः
प्रतिध्वनि प्रति-ध्वनि, इस्, m. or प्रति-<BR>ध्वान, अस्, अम्, m. n. echo, reverberated sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिध्वस्त
प्रतिध्वस्त प्रति-ध्वस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, cast<BR>down, downcast; forsaken (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनद्
प्रतिनद् प्रति-नद्, cl. 1. P. -नदति, -नदि-<BR>तुम्, to sound back, repeat or re-echo a sound; to<BR>answer with a cry or with a shout: Caus. -नादयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to cause to resound, make resonant, fill with<BR>repeated roaring, fill with cries; to cry aloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनाद|प्रतिनादः
प्रति-नाद, अस्, m. echo, resonance, reverberation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनादित
प्रति-नादित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to resound,<BR>resonant, resounding, echoing, echoed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिनद|प्रतिनिनदः
प्रति-निनद, अस्, m. an echo, a reverberation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनन्द्|प्रतिनंद्
प्रतिनन्द् प्रति-नन्द्, cl. 1. P. -नन्दति,<BR>-नन्दितुम्, to greet cheerfully, accept or receive<BR>gladly, take thankfully (Manu II. 54); to greet in<BR>return, return a salute, salute, bid welcome, bid<BR>farewell; to address kindly, express gratification,<BR>display affection or devotion; to favour; (with न),<BR>to decline, refuse: Caus. -नन्दयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>gladden, delight, gratify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनन्दन|प्रतिनंदन|प्रतिनंदनं
प्रति-नन्दन, अम्, n. greeting, salutation (Ved.);<BR>thankful acceptance; the act of returning thanks at<BR>meals, thanksgiving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनप्तृ
प्रतिनप्तृ प्रति-नप्तृ, ता, m. a great grand-<BR>son, a son's grandson; [cf. प्र-णपात्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनम्
प्रतिनम् प्रति-नम्, cl. 1. P. -नमति, -नन्-<BR>तुम्, Ved. to bow or incline towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनमस्कार
प्रति-नमस्कार, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. returning a<BR>salutation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनर्द्
प्रतिनर्द् प्रति-नर्द्, cl. 1. P. -नर्दति, -नर्-<BR>दितुम्, to utter sounds or cries against; to greet or<BR>hail with cries; to roar after (prey or food).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनव|प्रतिनवं
प्रतिनव प्रति-नव, अस्, आ, अम्, new, young,<BR>fresh, recent; blown, budded.<BR>—प्रतिनव-जवा, f.<BR>a fresh or newly opened China rose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0614-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनाग
प्रतिनाग प्रति-नाग, अस्, m. an elephant<BR>standing opposite, a hostile elephant; [cf. प्रति-<BR>कुञ्जर.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनाडी
प्रतिनाडी प्रति-नाडी, f. a branch vein.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनाद|प्रतिनादः
प्रतिनाद प्रति-नाद. See प्रति-नद्, p. 614.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनामन्
प्रतिनामन् प्रति-नामन्, आ, म्नी, अ, Ved.<BR>having corresponding names, related by name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनायक|प्रतिनायकः
प्रतिनायक प्रति-नायक. See col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनाह|प्रतिनाहः
प्रतिनाह प्रति-नाह. See प्रती-नाह.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिक्षिप्
प्रतिनिक्षिप् प्रति-नि-क्षिप्, cl. 6. P. A.<BR>-क्षिपति, -ते, -क्षेप्तुम्, to put down again, de-<BR>posit again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिगद्
प्रतिनिगद् प्रति-नि-गद्, cl. 1. P. -गदति,<BR>-गदितुम्, Ved. to speak to, address.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिग्रह्
प्रतिनिग्रह् प्रति-नि-ग्रह्, cl. 9. P. A. -गृह्-<BR>णाति, -गृह्णीते, -ग्रहीतुम्, Ved. to take up (liquids<BR>with a ladle or other vessel), ladle out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिधा
प्रतिनिधा प्रति-नि-धा, cl. 3. P. A. -द-<BR>धाति, -धत्ते, -धातुम्, to put in the place of<BR>another, substitute; to set aside, slight, disregard; to<BR>command, order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिधाय
प्रति-निधाय, ind. having placed in, having<BR>implanted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिधि|प्रतिनिधिः
प्रति-निधि, इस्, m. substitution; a substitute, re-<BR>presentative, proxy, deputy, vicegerent; a surety;<BR>a resemblance of a real form, an image, likeness,<BR>statue, picture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिन्द्
प्रतिनिन्द् प्रति-निन्द्, cl. 1. P. -निन्दति, -निन्-<BR>दितुम्, to inveigh against, abuse, blame, censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिपात|प्रतिनिपातः
प्रतिनिपात प्रति-निपात, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 2.<BR>पत् with प्रति-नि), falling down, alighting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनियत
प्रतिनियत प्रति-नियत, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. यम्),<BR>settled, predestined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनियम|प्रतिनियमः
प्रति-नियम, अस्, m. a general rule, general<BR>prevalence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिर्जि
प्रतिनिर्जि प्रति-निर्-जि, cl. 1. P. -जयति,<BR>-जेतुम्, to prevail against, overcome, vanquish; to<BR>rescind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिर्जित
प्रति-निर्जित, अस्, आ, अम्, prevailed against, van-<BR>quished; rescinded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिर्दिश्
प्रतिनिर्दिश् प्रति-निर्-दिश्, cl. 6. P. -दिशति,<BR>-देष्टुम्, to point back, refer back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिर्देश
प्रति-निर्देश, अस्, m., Ved. pointing or referring<BR>back to (with gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिर्देशक
प्रति-निर्देशक, अस्, इका, अम्, (at the end of a<BR>comp.) pointing back, referring back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिर्यत्
प्रतिनिर्यत् प्रति-निर्-यत्, Caus. P. -यात-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to give back, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिर्यातन|प्रतिनिर्यातनं
प्रति-निर्यातन, अम्, n. giving back, returning;<BR>rewarding, retaliation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिवारण
प्रतिनिवारण प्रति-निवारण, अम्, n. (fr. rt.<BR>वृ with प्रति-नि), keeping off, warding off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिवासन
प्रतिनिवासन प्रति-निवासन, अम्, n. (fr. rt.<BR>5. वस् with प्रति-नि), a kind of garment (with<BR>Buddhists).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिविष्ट
प्रतिनिविष्ट प्रति-निविष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, har-<BR>dened, obstinate, obdurate.<BR>—प्रतिनिविष्ट-मूर्ख,<BR>अस्, m. an obstinate fool, confirmed blockhead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिवृत्
प्रतिनिवृत् प्रति-नि-वृत्, cl. 1. A. -वर्तते,<BR>-वर्तितुम्, to turn back or round, turn away from;<BR>to return; to run away, take flight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिवर्तन|प्रतिनिवर्तनं|प्रतिनिवर्त्तन
प्रति-निवर्तन, अम्, n. turning back, turning<BR>away from; returning, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिवृत्त
प्रति-निवृत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, turned away from,<BR>desisted from, leaving, withdrawn from; come back,<BR>returned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिशम्
प्रतिनिशम् प्रति-निशम्, ind. every night,<BR>nightly, by night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिष्पू
प्रतिनिष्पू प्रति-निष्-पू (-निस्-पू), cl. 9. P.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">Page0615-b+ 73</a>]<BR>A. -पुनाति, -पुनीते, -पवितुम्, Ved. to cleanse or<BR>winnow close at hand (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनी
प्रतिनी प्रति-नी, cl. 1. P. A. -नयति, -ते,<BR>-नेतुम्, to lead back; to lead to, bring towards; to<BR>put into, mix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनायक|प्रतिनायकः
प्रति-नायक, अस्, m. ‘counter hero,’ the adver-<BR>sary of the hero of a play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनुद्
प्रतिनुद् प्रति-नुद्, cl. 6. P. A. -नुदति, -ते,<BR>-नोत्तुम्, to thrust back, repel, repulse, ward off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनोद|प्रतिनोदः
प्रति-नोद, अस्, m. thrusting back, repelling,<BR>repulse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनृत्
प्रतिनृत् प्रति-नृत्, cl. 4. P. -नृत्यति, -नर्-<BR>तितुम्, to dance before (in token of contempt), to<BR>mock in turn by dancing before (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिन्यस्
प्रतिन्यस् प्रति-न्य्-अस्, cl. 4. P. -अस्यति, -असि-<BR>तुम्, to place apart or lay down separately (for<BR>different persons), deposit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिन्यायम्
प्रतिन्यायम् प्रति-न्यायम्, ind., Ved. in<BR>inverted order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिन्यूङ्ख
प्रतिन्यूङ्ख प्रति-न्यूङ्ख, अस्, m., Ved. a cor-<BR>responding insertion of the vowel ओ; [cf. न्यूङ्ख.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप|प्रतिपः
प्रतिप प्रतिप, अस्, m., N. of a king of the<BR>lunar race the father of Śāntanu and grandfather of<BR>Bhīṣma; (more correctly spelt प्रतीप, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपक्ष|प्रतिपक्षः
प्रतिपक्ष प्रति-पक्ष, अस्, m. the opposite<BR>side or party, opposite faction, opposition, hostility;<BR>an adversary, enemy, foe, opponent, rival; a respond-<BR>ent, defendant; N. of a prince; (also read प्रति-<BR>क्षत्र.)<BR>—प्रतिपक्ष-ता, f. or प्रतिपक्ष-<BR>त्व, अम्, n. opposition, enmity; obstacle.<BR>—प्रति-<BR>पक्ष-वादित्व, अम्, n. contradictory or deceitful<BR>conversation, double dealing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपक्षित
प्रतिपक्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, containing a contra-<BR>diction; nullified by a contradictory premiss (one of<BR>the five kinds of fallacious middle terms).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपक्षिन्
प्रतिपक्षिन्, ई, m. an opponent, adversary.<BR>—प्रतिपक्षि-ता, f. self-contradiction, the being<BR>self-contradictory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपण
प्रतिपण प्रति-पण, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 2. पण्<BR>with प्रति), barter, exchange (Ved.); (fr. प्रति +<BR>पण), the stake of an adversary at play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपत्
प्रतिपत् प्रति-पत्, cl. 1. P. -पतति, -पति-<BR>तुम्, to fly or hasten towards, hasten to meet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपथम्
प्रतिपथम् प्रति-पथम्, ind. along the<BR>road, by the way; straightway (?).<BR>—प्रतिपथ-<BR>गति, इस्, इस्, इ, going on the road, wending the way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपथिक
प्रतिपथिक, अस्, आ, अम्, going along the road,<BR>wending the way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपद्
प्रतिपद् 1. प्रति-पद्, cl. 4. A. -पद्यते,<BR>-पत्तुम्, to set foot on, step upon, step up to; to<BR>light upon, meet with, find; to go towards, approach,<BR>betake one's self to, resort to, take refuge with; to<BR>go into, enter; to arrive at, reach, attain; to gain,<BR>get, obtain, share, partake of; to receive back, re-<BR>gain, reobtain, recover; to go back, return; to walk,<BR>roam, wander, go; to perceive, observe, become<BR>aware of, become conscious of; to find out, discover;<BR>to obtain a knowledge of, become acquainted with,<BR>learn; to comprehend, understand, know; to regard<BR>as, consider, deem; to affirm, admit; to answer<BR>affirmatively, express assent, comply with, consent,<BR>agree, promise; to permit, allow; to avow, acknow-<BR>ledge; to begin to speak, begin to answer, commence<BR>a reply; to apply one's self to, perform, practise,<BR>observe, fulfil, accomplish; to do anything to any one<BR>(with loc. or gen.), undertake anything against, pro-<BR>ceed against; to act towards; to take place, occur,<BR>transpire; to give, give up, restore, return; उत्तरम्<BR>प्रति-पद्, to give an answer: Caus. -पादयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to cause to go back, bring back, lead back;<BR>to convey or transport to (a place); to cause to<BR>attain, cause to share in, cause to partake of; to<BR>give to (with loc., dat., or gen.), deliver over, present,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-c" target="_blank">Page0615-c+ 81</a>]<BR>bestow; to communicate, impart, teach; to declare,<BR>represent, assert; to establish, substantiate, prove;<BR>to explain, expound, make clear; to consider, regard<BR>as, deem; to appoint to, install in (with loc.); to<BR>procure; to prepare; to effect, cause: Desid. of Caus.<BR>-पिपादयिषति, to wish or intend to explain or<BR>analyze.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपत्तव्य
प्रति-पत्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be obtained, to be<BR>received; to be assumed or supposed, to be stated;<BR>to be given (as an answer); to be begun; to be<BR>done or performed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपत्ति|प्रतिपत्तिः
प्रति-पत्ति, इस्, f. gaining, getting, obtaining,<BR>acquirement, gain; becoming aware of, perception,<BR>observation, ascertainment, determination, knowledge;<BR>intelligence, intellect; assertion, affirmation, state-<BR>ment, opinion; acknowledgment, admitting, admis-<BR>sion, assent; undertaking, beginning, commence-<BR>ment; doing, acting, action, proceeding; worldly<BR>action; mode of acting, procedure; method, means;<BR>use, application; giving, imparting, bestowing, pre-<BR>sentation; causing; elevation, exaltation, promotion,<BR>preferment; acquirement of rank or dignity, repu-<BR>tation, fame, renown; honouring, worshipping,<BR>honour, respectful behaviour; inspiring trust or con-<BR>fidence; resoluteness, boldness, assurance, reliance,<BR>confidence; comprehending, including, conclusion;<BR>conviction, proof; misleading, deceiving (?); a rite<BR>from which no advantage is expected (?).<BR>—प्रति-<BR>पत्ति-कर्मन्, अ, n., Ved. a concluding rite or<BR>ceremony.<BR>—प्रतिपत्ति-दक्ष, अस्, आ, अम्, know-<BR>ing how to act, knowing what is to be done.<BR>—प्र-<BR>तिपत्ति-दर्शिन्, ई, इनी, इ, showing what ought to be<BR>done.<BR>—प्रतिपत्ति-निष्ठुर, अस्, आ, अम्, hard to<BR>understand, difficult to be understood.<BR>—प्रतिपत्ति-<BR>पटह, अस्, m. a kind of kettle-drum, the state drum<BR>allowed only to chiefs of a certain rank; [cf. प्रति-<BR>पत्-तूर्य below.]<BR>—प्रतिपत्ति-पराङ्मुख, अस्,<BR>ई, अम्, averse from compliance, obstinate, unyielding.<BR>—प्रतिपत्ति-प्रदान, अम्, n. the giving of pre-<BR>ferment, conferring promotion.<BR>—प्रतिपत्ति-भेद,<BR>अस्, m. diversity of views, difference of opinions.<BR>—प्रतिपत्ति-मत्, आन्, अती, अत्, possessing appro-<BR>priate knowledge, knowing what is to be done; in-<BR>telligent; active, prompt; celebrated, high in rank.<BR>—प्रतिपत्ति-विशारद, अस्, आ, अम्, knowing how<BR>to act, knowing what is to be done, expert, clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपत्तृ
प्रति-पत्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who maintains or<BR>asserts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपद्
2. प्रति-पद्, त्, f. access, ingress, entrance, way;<BR>beginning, commencement; an introductory verse<BR>or stanza; the first day of a lunar fortnight, the first<BR>day of the moon's increase or wane (especially of<BR>the former, cf. प्रति-पदा); understanding, intel-<BR>ligence, intellect; rank, consequence; a kettle-drum.<BR>—प्रतिपत्-तूर्य, अम्, n. a kind of kettle-drum;<BR>[cf. प्रतिपत्ति-पटह.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपद
प्रति-पद, अम्, n., N. of an Upāṅga; (आ or ई),<BR>f. the first day of a lunar fortnight, the first day of<BR>the moon's increase or wane (especially of the<BR>former, cf. 2. प्रति-पद्); (अम्), ind. (fr. प्रति<BR>+ पद), see p. 616, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपन्न|प्रतिपन्नं
प्रति-पन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, come up to, approached,<BR>reached, obtained, gained; overcome, conquered,<BR>subdued; done, effected, accomplished; undertaken;<BR>answered, replied; offered, promised, engaged; as-<BR>sented to, agreed to, accepted, admitted; known,<BR>understood, ascertained, determined; convicted,<BR>proved, demonstrated; conversant or familiar with;<BR>acting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपन्नक
प्रतिपन्नक, अस्, m. ‘arrived at an aim,’ (with<BR>Buddhists) a collective epithet of the four orders of<BR>Āryas, viz. the Śrota-āpanna, Sakṛd-āgāmin, An-<BR>āgāmin, and Arhat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपादक|प्रतिपादकः
प्रति-पादक, अस्, इका, अम्, causing to obtain,<BR>giving, granting, bestowing, presenting to (with<BR>loc.); stating, establishing, supporting, demonstrating,<BR>communicating, treating of, speaking about; explain-<BR>ing, explanatory, illustrating, teaching; productive,<BR>effective, efficient, accomplishing; advancing, for-<BR>warding, furthering, promoting; (अस् or अम्), m.<BR>or n. (?), a receptacle for hair.<BR>—प्रतिपादक-त्व,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">Page0616-a+ 76</a>]<BR>अम्, n. the state or condition of one who explains,<BR>explaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0615-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपादन|प्रतिपादनं
प्रति-पादन, अम्, n. causing to come back,<BR>bringing back; causing to reach or attain, causing<BR>to obtain; imparting, giving, presenting, donation,<BR>gift; giving back, returning, restoring; appointing;<BR>producing, exciting, causing; accomplishing, effect-<BR>ing; action, worldly conduct; repeated action, prac-<BR>tice; treating of, discussing, rendering clear or intel-<BR>ligible, expounding, explaining, teaching, declaring,<BR>affirming, declaration; establishing, proving, substan-<BR>tiating; beginning, commencement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपादनीय
प्रति-पादनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be given, to be<BR>given in marriage; to be accomplished; to be dis-<BR>cussed, to be treated of or expounded; to be esta-<BR>blished or proved, to be maintained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपादम्
प्रति-पादम्, ind. (fr. प्रति + पाद), in every<BR>Pāda, in each quarter or fourth part of a verse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपादयितृ
प्रति-पादयितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who discusses<BR>or expounds, a teacher, instructor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपादित
प्रति-पादित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to attain; given,<BR>delivered, presented; caused, produced; declared,<BR>represented, stated, asserted, proved, maintained;<BR>explained, expounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपादुक
प्रति-पादुक, अस्, ई, अम्, determining, ascertain-<BR>ing; making manifest or clear; causing, effecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपाद्य
प्रति-पाद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be treated of or dis-<BR>cussed, to be explained or expounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपित्सा
प्रति-पित्सा, f. desire of obtaining, longing for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपित्सु
प्रति-पित्सु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing to obtain, striv-<BR>ing for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपिपादयिषु
प्रति-पिपादयिषु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing to explain,<BR>about to treat of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपदम्
प्रतिपदम् प्रति-पदम्, ind. at every step,<BR>on every occasion; at every place, everywhere; in<BR>every word; verbally, expressly, especially.<BR>—प्रति-<BR>पद-त्व, अम्, n., Ved. advancing step by step.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपराणी
प्रतिपराणी प्रति-परा-णी, cl. 1. P. A. -ण-<BR>यति, -ते, -णेतुम्, Ved. to lead back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपरी
प्रतिपरी प्रति-परी (-परि-इ, see rt. 5. इ),<BR>cl. 2. P. -पर्य्-एति, -एतुम्, Ved. to go round in a<BR>reverse direction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपरे
प्रतिपरे प्रति-परे (-परा-इ, see rt. 5. इ),<BR>cl. 2. P. -परैति, -परैतुम्, Ved. to return again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपर्णशिफा
प्रतिपर्णशिफा प्रति-पर्ण-शिफा, f. the plant<BR>Anthericum Tuberosum (= द्रवन्ती).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपर्व
प्रतिपर्व प्रति-पर्व, ind., Ved. at each<BR>Parvan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपल्लव|प्रतिपल्लवः
प्रतिपल्लव प्रति-पल्लव, अस्, m. an opposite<BR>branch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपा
प्रतिपा प्रति-पा (see Caus. of rt. 3. पा),<BR>Caus. P. -पालयति, -यितुम्, to protect, defend; to<BR>cherish, nourish, foster, rear, patronize; to observe,<BR>keep, maintain; to wait, wait for, expect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपालक|प्रतिपालकः
प्रति-पालक, अस्, इका, अम्, protecting, defending,<BR>preserving, cherishing; (अस्), m. a protector, guardian,<BR>a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपालन|प्रतिपालनं
प्रति-पालन, अम्, n. protecting, guarding, de-<BR>fending, cherishing; keeping up, observing, follow-<BR>ing, practising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपालनीय
प्रति-पालनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be protected or<BR>cherished; to be observed or followed; to be<BR>awaited, to be waited for, to be watched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपालयितव्य
प्रति-पालयितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be protected<BR>or guarded; to be awaited, to be waited for, to be<BR>watched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपालित
प्रति-पालित, अस्, आ, अम्, protected, cherished;<BR>practised, followed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपालिन्
प्रति-पालिन्, ई, इनी, इ, protecting, guarding,<BR>screening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपाल्य|प्रतिपाल्यं
प्रति-पाल्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be protected or che-<BR>rished; to be awaited, to be waited for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपाण|प्रतिपाणः
प्रतिपाण प्रति-पाण, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. 2.<BR>पण् with प्रति), ready to exchange, bartering<BR>(Ved.); (अस्), m. a stake, gage, the thing played for;<BR>a counter-pledge, anything staked against another<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">Page0616-b+ 71</a>]<BR>thing; a counter-stake, counter-game; [cf. प्रति-<BR>पण.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपात्रम्
प्रतिपात्रम् प्रति-पात्रम्, ind. (in dramatic<BR>language) in each part, in each character, by every<BR>actor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपादपम्
प्रतिपादपम् प्रति-पादपम्, ind. in every<BR>tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपादम्
प्रतिपादम् प्रति-पादम्, प्रति-पादित. See<BR>col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपान|प्रतिपानं
प्रतिपान प्रति-पान, अम्, n. water for<BR>drinking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपाप
प्रतिपाप प्रति-पाप, अस्, आ, अम्, wicked or<BR>evil in return, recompensing evil for evil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपित्सा
प्रतिपित्सा प्रति-पित्सा, प्रति-पित्सु, प्रति-<BR>पिपादयिषु. See col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपिष्
प्रतिपिष् प्रति-पिष्, cl. 7. P. -पिनष्टि,<BR>-पेष्टुम्, to rub one thing against another, rub<BR>together; to rub one's self against; to bruise, grind,<BR>crush, destroy in turn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपीड्
प्रतिपीड् प्रति-पीड्, Caus. P. -पीडयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to press, press hard, oppress, harass, distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपीडन|प्रतिपीडनं
प्रति-पीडन, अम्, n. oppressing, harassing, mo-<BR>lesting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपीय्
प्रतिपीय् प्रति-पीय् (see rt. 2. पीय्), cl. 1. P.<BR>-पीयति, -पीयितुम्, Ved. to revile, abuse, treat with<BR>contempt or disrespect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपुरुष|प्रतिपुरुषः
प्रतिपुरुष प्रति-पुरुष or प्रति-पूरुष,<BR>अस्, m. ‘a counter-person,’ a corresponding or similar<BR>man; a companion, assistant; a deputy, substitute;<BR>an effigy, the effigy of a man which thieves push<BR>into the interior of a house before entering it them-<BR>selves; (अम्), ind. man by man, every man, for<BR>each man; for each soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपुष्यम्
प्रतिपुष्यम् प्रति-पुष्यम्, ind., Ved. at<BR>each time of the moon's entrance into the asterism<BR>Puṣya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपुस्तक
प्रतिपुस्तक प्रति-पुस्तक, अम्, n. a copy of<BR>an original manuscript, a copy in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपूज्
प्रतिपूज् प्रति-पूज्, cl. 10. P. -पूजयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to show respect towards, honour; to salute<BR>respectfully, salute in turn, return a salutation, honour;<BR>to praise, commend, approve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपूजक
प्रति-पूजक, अस्, इका, अम्, doing homage,<BR>honouring; (अस्), m. one who does homage, a<BR>reverer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपूजन|प्रतिपूजनं
प्रति-पूजन, अम्, n. or प्रति-पूजा, f. doing<BR>homage, showing respect, honouring; exchange of<BR>civilities, mutual obeisance or reverence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपूजित
प्रति-पूजित, अस्, आ, अम्, honoured, respected,<BR>treated with reverence or respect; exchanged as<BR>civilities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपूज्य
2. प्रति-पूज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be treated with<BR>respect, to be honoured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपूज्य
2. प्रति-पूज्य, ind. having done homage to,<BR>having exchanged respectful salutations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपूरुष|प्रतिपूरुषः
प्रतिपूरुष प्रति-पूरुष. See प्रति-पु-<BR>रुष above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपूर्वाह्णम्
प्रतिपूर्वाह्णम् प्रति-पूर्वाह्णम्, ind. every<BR>forenoon, every morning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपॄ
प्रतिपॄ प्रति-पॄ, Caus. P. -पूरयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to fill up, fill, make full; to fill with, to sate,<BR>satiate, satisfy, content.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपूरण|प्रतिपूरणं
प्रति-पूरण, अम्, n. filling up, filling; injecting<BR>a fluid or other substance, pouring a fluid over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपूरित
प्रति-पूरित, अस्, आ, अम्, filled up, filled; satisfied,<BR>contented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपूर्ण
प्रति-पूर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, filled with, full, full of;<BR>satisfied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रग्रह्
प्रतिप्रग्रह् प्रति-प्र-ग्रह्, cl. 9. P. A. -गृह्-<BR>णाति, -गृह्णीते, -ग्रहीतुम्, to take up or receive<BR>again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रछ्
प्रतिप्रछ् प्रति-प्रछ्, cl. 6. P. -पृच्छति,<BR>-प्रष्टुम्, to ask, question, interrogate, inquire of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रश्न|प्रतिप्रश्नः
प्रति-प्रश्न, अस्, m. a question asked in return;<BR>an answer; (Ved.) an umpire (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रज्ञा
प्रतिप्रज्ञा प्रति-प्र-ज्ञा, cl. 9. P. A. -जानाति,<BR>-जानीते, -ज्ञातुम्, Ved. to seek out or find again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रज्ञाति
प्रति-प्रज्ञाति, इस्, f., Ved. distinguishing; recog-<BR>nition, acknowledgment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रणवम्
प्रतिप्रणवम् प्रति-प्रणवम्, ind. at every<BR>repetition of the sacred syllable ॐ.<BR>—प्रतिप्रणव-<BR>संयुक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, accompanied each time with<BR>the syllable ॐ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रणाम|प्रतिप्रणामः
प्रतिप्रणाम प्रति-प्रणाम, अस्, m. (fr. rt.<BR>नम् with प्रति-प्र), a bow or obeisance in return,<BR>saluting in turn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रति
प्रतिप्रति प्रति-प्रति, इस्, इनी, इ, Ved. being<BR>a counterpart, counter-balancing; being a match for,<BR>equal to (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रतीकम्
प्रतिप्रतीकम् प्रति-प्रतीकम्, ind., Ved. at<BR>each beginning, at every commencement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रदा
प्रतिप्रदा प्रति-प्र-दा, cl. 3. P. A. -ददाति,<BR>-दत्ते, -दातुम्, to give back again; to give up,<BR>deliver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रत्त
प्रति-प्रत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. given up, delivered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रदान|प्रतिप्रदानं
प्रति-प्रदान, अम्, n. giving back, returning,<BR>restoring; giving in marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रब्रू
प्रतिप्रब्रू प्रति-प्र-ब्रू, cl. 2. P. -ब्रवीति,<BR>&c., Ved. to speak to in return, address in reply,<BR>reply, answer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रभ
प्रतिप्रभ प्रति-प्रभ, अस्, m., N. of a de-<BR>scendant of Atri, author of the hymn Ṛg-veda V.<BR>49; (आ), f. reflection, reflected light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रभातम्
प्रति-प्रभातम्, ind. every morning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रयम्
प्रतिप्रयम् प्रति-प्र-यम्, cl. 1. P. -यच्छति,<BR>-यन्तुम्, to give back, return, restore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रयवण
प्रतिप्रयवण प्रति-प्रयवण, अम्, n. (fr. rt.<BR>यु with प्रति-प्र), repeated mixture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रया
प्रतिप्रया प्रति-प्र-या, cl. 2. P. -याति, -या-<BR>तुम्, to go back, come back, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रयाण|प्रतिप्रयाणं
प्रति-प्रयाण, अम्, n. going back, return, retreat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रश्न|प्रतिप्रश्नः
प्रतिप्रश्न प्रति-प्रश्न. See under प्रति-<BR>प्रछ् above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रसव|प्रतिप्रसवः
प्रतिप्रसव प्रति-प्रसव, अस्, m. a counter-<BR>order, countermand, suspension of a general prohi-<BR>bition in a particular case, license for an act which<BR>under other circumstances is forbidden; the laying<BR>down of excepted cases; contrary effect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रसूत|प्रतिप्रसूतः
प्रति-प्रसूत, अस्, आ, अम्, re-enjoined after having<BR>been forbidden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रस्थातृ
प्रतिप्रस्थातृ प्रति-प्रस्थातृ, ता, m. (fr. rt.<BR>स्था with प्रति-प्र), Ved., N. of a priest who<BR>assists the Adhvaryu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रस्थान|प्रतिप्रस्थानं
प्रति-प्रस्थान, अम्, n. the office of the Prati-<BR>prasthātṛ; N. of a particular Soma-graha (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रास्थानिक
प्रतिप्रास्थानिक, अस्, ई, अम्, relating to the work<BR>or office of the Prati-prasthātṛ; प्रतिप्रास्थानिकं<BR>कर्म, the office of the Prati-prasthātṛ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रहार|प्रतिप्रहारः
प्रतिप्रहार प्रति-प्रहार, अस्, m. (fr. rt. हृ<BR>with प्रति-प्र), a counter-blow, returning a blow<BR>or stroke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रह्वे
प्रतिप्रह्वे प्रति-प्र-ह्वे, cl. 1. P. A. -ह्व-<BR>यति, -ते, -ह्वातुम्, Ved. to invite to (a sacrifice),<BR>invoke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्राकार|प्रतिप्राकारः
प्रतिप्राकार प्रति-प्राकार, अस्, m. an outer<BR>wall or rampart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्राश्
प्रतिप्राश् प्रति-प्राश्, ट्, ट्, ट्, Ved. consuming<BR>another's food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रास्
प्रतिप्रास् प्रति-प्रास् (-प्र-अस्; see rt. 2. अस्),<BR>cl. 4. P. -प्रास्यति, -प्रासितुम्, to throw or cast upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0616-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रिय
प्रतिप्रिय प्रति-प्रिय, अम्, n. kindness in<BR>turn, service in return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रैष
प्रतिप्रैष प्रति-प्रैष, अस्, m., Ved. a cry<BR>or call in return, direction given in return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्लवन|प्रतिप्लवनं
प्रतिप्लवन प्रति-प्लवन, अम्, n. (fr. rt. प्लु<BR>with प्रति), jumping back, leaping back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिफल्
प्रतिफल् प्रति-फल्, cl. 1. P. -फलति, -फ-<BR>लितुम्, to bound against, rebound; to shine back,<BR>be reflected; to requite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिफल|प्रतिफलं|प्रतिफलः
प्रति-फल, अस्, m. or प्रति-फलन, अम्, n.<BR>a reflection, reflected image, image, shadow; return,<BR>reward, remuneration, requital, retaliation, retribution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिफलित|प्रतिफलितं
प्रति-फलित, अस्, आ, अम्, reflected, shadowed,<BR>represented; requited, returned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिफुल्लक|प्रतिफुल्लकः
प्रतिफुल्लक प्रति-फुल्लक, अस्, आ, अम्, flower-<BR>ing, in blossom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबन्ध्|प्रतिबंध्
प्रतिबन्ध् प्रति-बन्ध्, cl. 9. P. A. -बध्-<BR>नाति, -बध्नीते, -बन्द्धुम्, to bind to, make<BR>fast, moor; to set, enchase; to fix, direct; to shut<BR>out, exclude, preclude, cut off; to keep off, keep at<BR>a distance; to obstruct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबद्ध|प्रतिबद्धः
प्रति-बद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, bound to, tied to,<BR>bound, tied, moored; attached, hanging to; con-<BR>nected with, subject, dependant; furnished with,<BR>possessing; set, enchased, inlaid, bestudded; fixed,<BR>directed; excluded, cut off; hindered, impeded, ob-<BR>structed, opposed, precluded, prevented; disappointed,<BR>thwarted, crossed, vexed; kept off, kept at a dis-<BR>tance; tangled, entangled, involved, hard to loose;<BR>(in philosophy) that which is always connected and<BR>implied, as fire is implied in smoke.<BR>—प्रतिबद्ध-<BR>प्रसर, अस्, आ, अम्, hindered or blunted in its course<BR>(as a thunderbolt).<BR>—प्रतिबद्ध-राग, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>pervaded by passion or having passion in harmonious<BR>connection (with gesture).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबधक
प्रति-बधक, अस्, m. an opposer, injurer (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबध्य|प्रतिबध्यः
प्रति-बध्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be bound or tied<BR>to; to be hindered or obstructed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबन्ध|प्रतिबंध|प्रतिबंधः|प्रतिबन्धः
प्रति-बन्ध, अस्, m. binding or tying to; con-<BR>nection, conjunction; investment, blockade, beleaguer-<BR>ing, siege; blocking up, obstacle, hinderance, impedi-<BR>ment; resistance; cessation; disappointment.<BR>—प्र-<BR>तिबन्ध-कारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, creating obstacles, hin-<BR>dering, preventing.<BR>—प्रतिबन्ध-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>beset with obstacles, in which obstacles are met with,<BR>difficult to attain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबन्धक|प्रतिबंधक|प्रतिबन्धकः
प्रति-बन्धक, अस्, इका, अम्, binding or tying<BR>to; obstructing, obstructive, hindering, impeding,<BR>being an obstacle; resisting; (अस्), m. a branch,<BR>shoot; N. of a prince; (at the end of a comp.) an<BR>obstacle, impediment, hinderance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबन्धन|प्रतिबंधन|प्रतिबंधनं
प्रति-बन्धन, अम्, n. binding or tying to,<BR>binding, confinement; obstructing, impeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबन्धि|प्रतिबंधिः|प्रतिबन्धिः
प्रति-बन्धि, इस्, m. a contradiction, objection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबन्धिन्|प्रतिबंधिन्
प्रति-बन्धिन्, ई, इनी, इ, binding or tying to;<BR>encountering obstacles, impeded, interrupted; (at the<BR>end of a comp.) hindering, obstructing.<BR>—प्रतिबन्-<BR>धि-ता, f. the being an obstacle, obstructiveness, im-<BR>peding, checking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबन्धु|प्रतिबंधु|प्रतिबन्धुः
प्रतिबन्धु प्रति-बन्धु, उस्, m. an equal in<BR>rank or station.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबल|प्रतिबलः
प्रतिबल प्रति-बल, अस्, आ, अम्, having equal<BR>strength or power, of equal strength, equally matched,<BR>a match for (with gen. or at the end of a comp.,<BR>e. g. अस्त्र-प्˚, equal in arms); able, adequate,<BR>powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबाणि
प्रतिबाणि प्रति-बाणि, इस्, इ, f. n. an answer;<BR>(इस्, इस्, इ), improper, unseemly, unsuitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबाध्
प्रतिबाध् प्रति-बाध्, cl. 1. A. -बाधते,<BR>बाधितुम्, to beat back, repel, ward off, to keep<BR>off, combat; to restrain, check; to pain, torment,<BR>torture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबाधक
प्रति-बाधक, अस्, इका, अम्, thrusting back, re-<BR>jecting, repelling; opposing, obstructing, withstanding,<BR>precluding, preventing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबाधन|प्रतिबाधनं
प्रति-बाधन, अम्, n. beating back, repelling,<BR>rejecting, keeping off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबाधिन्
प्रति-बाधिन्, ई, इनी, इ, opposing; (ई), m. an<BR>opponent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबाहु
प्रतिबाहु प्रति-बाहु, उस्, m. a particular part<BR>of the arm; N. of one of the sons of Śvaphalka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबिम्ब|प्रतिबिंब|प्रतिबिम्बः
प्रतिबिम्ब प्रति-बिम्ब = प्रति-विम्ब, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबीज
प्रतिबीज प्रति-बीज, अम्, n. bad or rotten<BR>seed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबुध्
प्रतिबुध् प्रति-बुध्, cl. 4. A. -बुध्यते,<BR>-बोधितुम्, to awaken, awake, wake; to perceive,<BR>observe, remark, learn: Caus. -बोधयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to awaken; to instruct, inform, admonish; to com-<BR>mission, charge, order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबुद्ध
प्रति-बुद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, awakened, awake<BR>(Manu I. 74); illuminated, enlightened; recognised,<BR>observed; known, celebrated; exalted, rendered<BR>prosperous or great.<BR>—प्रतिबुद्ध-वस्तु, उस्, उस्,<BR>उ, understanding the real nature of things.<BR>—प्रति-<BR>बुद्धात्मन् (˚ध-आत्˚), आ, आ, अ, having the mind<BR>roused or awakened, awake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबुद्धक
प्रति-बुद्धक, अस्, आ, अम्, in अ-प्˚, not recog-<BR>nised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबुद्धि|प्रतिबुद्धिः
प्रति-बुद्धि, इस्, f. awakening; hostile disposition<BR>or purpose (= शत्रु-बुद्धि).<BR>—प्रतिबुद्धि-मत्,<BR>आन्, अती, अत्, having hostile intentions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबोध|प्रतिबोधः
प्रति-बोध, अस्, m. awaking, waking; percep-<BR>tion, knowledge; instructing, instruction; admonish-<BR>ing; N. of a man.<BR>—प्रतिबोध-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>endowed with knowledge or reason, possessed of<BR>understanding.<BR>—प्रतिबोधी-पुत्र (?), अस्, m., N.<BR>of a teacher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबोधक|प्रतिबोधकः
प्रति-बोधक, अस्, इका, अम्, awakening; admon-<BR>ishing, instructing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबोधन
प्रति-बोधन, अस्, ई, अम्, awakening [cf. दुः-<BR>स्वप्न-प्˚]; refreshing; (अम्), n. awaking, awaken-<BR>ing; instructing, instruction, explanation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबोधित
प्रति-बोधित, अस्, आ, अम्, awakened; instructed,<BR>taught.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबोधिन्
प्रति-बोधिन्, ई, इनी, इ, awaking, about to awake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिब्रू
प्रतिब्रू प्रति-ब्रू, cl. 2. P. A. -ब्रवीति,<BR>-ब्रूते, -वक्तुम्, to answer (with acc. of the person<BR>or two acc.); (A.) to contradict, deny, refuse; to<BR>resist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभक्ष्
प्रतिभक्ष् प्रति-भक्ष्, cl. 10. P. -भक्ष-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, Ved. to eat separately, eat alone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभज्
प्रतिभज् प्रति-भज्, cl. 1. P. A. -भजति,<BR>-ते, -भक्तुम्, to receive back as a part or share; to<BR>fall again to one's share; to return to (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभाग|प्रतिभागः
प्रति-भाग, अस्, m. division; a share, portion,<BR>small daily present of fruit, flowers, vegetables, &c.<BR>offered to a Rājā or prince (Manu VIII. 307);<BR>(अम्), ind. for every portion or degree.<BR>—प्रति-<BR>भाग-शस्, ind. according to particular divisions or<BR>classification; in divisions or classes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभञ्ज्
प्रतिभञ्ज् प्रति-भञ्ज्, cl. 7. P. -भनक्ति,<BR>-भङ्क्तुम्, Ved. to fracture, break in pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभट|प्रतिभटः
प्रतिभट प्रति-भट, अस्, आ, अम्, vying with,<BR>rivalling, emulating.<BR>—प्रतिभट-ता, f. emulous-<BR>ness, emulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभण्
प्रतिभण् प्रति-भण्, cl. 1. P. -भणति, -भ-<BR>णितुम्, to speak in reply, answer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभणित
प्रति-भणित, अस्, आ, अम्, answered, replied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभय|प्रतिभयं
प्रतिभय प्रति-भय, अस्, आ, अम्, exciting<BR>fear, formidable, terrible, terrific, horrific, fearful,<BR>frightful; dangerous; (अम्), n. anything formidable<BR>or dangerous, fear, danger; (अम्), ind. formidably,<BR>frightfully.<BR>—प्रतिभयङ्-कर, अस्, ई, अम्, causing<BR>fear.<BR>—प्रतिभयाकार (˚य-आक्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, hav-<BR>ing a formidable aspect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभा
प्रतिभा 1. प्रति-भा, cl. 2. P. -भाति, -भा-<BR>तुम्, to shine upon (with acc.); to appear, seem<BR>(e. g. इति प्रतिभाति मे मनः, so it seems to my<BR>mind); to come in sight, present one's self, offer<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">Page0617-c+ 76</a>]<BR>one's self to (with gen. or acc.); to appear clear to the<BR>mind, flash upon the thoughts, come into the mind,<BR>occur to (e. g. नोत्तरम् प्रतिभाति मे, no answer<BR>occurs to me); to fall to the lot of, come into the<BR>possession of (with gen. or acc.); to seem fit, appear<BR>good, please (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभा
2. प्रति-भा, f. an image; look, appearance,<BR>manifestation; light, splendor [cf. निष्-प्रतिभ];<BR>reflected light; a flashing thought, bright idea, bril-<BR>liant conception; understanding, intelligence, intel-<BR>lect (especially as opening or expanding); genius,<BR>wit, ingenuity; audacity, boldness, impudence, confi-<BR>dence; pleasingness, suitableness; (अस्, आ, अम्), clear,<BR>bright; intelligent, clever (?).<BR>—प्रतिभान्वित<BR>(˚भा-अन्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, endowed with or acquiring<BR>knowledge or experience, intelligent; confident,<BR>proud, audacious, bold.<BR>—प्रतिभा-मुख, अस्, ई,<BR>अम्, ‘bold-faced,’ arrogant, bold, confident.<BR>—प्रति-<BR>भा-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, bright, luminous; knowing,<BR>shrewd; confident, bold; (आन्), m. the sun; the<BR>moon; fire.<BR>—प्रतिभा-विलास, अस्, m., N. of a<BR>philosophical work (also called Vedārtha-pradīpa and<BR>Vedārtha-candra).<BR>—प्रतिभा-हानि, इस्, f. privation<BR>of light, dulness, darkness; loss or absence of know-<BR>ledge, want of sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभान|प्रतिभानं
प्रति-भान, अम्, n. light, splendor, brilliancy;<BR>intelligence, understanding; brilliance of conception;<BR>confidence, boldness, audacity.<BR>—प्रतिभान-कूट,<BR>अस्, m., N. of a Bodhi-sattva.<BR>—प्रतिभान-वत्,<BR>आन्, अती, अत्, bright, brilliant, luminous, splendid;<BR>intelligent, acute, shrewd; endowed with presence<BR>of mind, bold, prompt, audacious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभानु
प्रति-भानु, उस्, m., N. of a descendant of Atri,<BR>author of the hymn Ṛg-veda V. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभाव|प्रतिभावः
प्रतिभाव प्रति-भाव. See under 1. प्रति-<BR>भू below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभाष्
प्रतिभाष् प्रति-भाष्, cl. 1. A. -भाषते,<BR>-भाषितुम्, to address in turn, answer; to address,<BR>speak to (with acc.); to tell, relate; to call, name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभाषा
प्रति-भाषा, f. an answer, reply, rejoinder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभास्
प्रतिभास् प्रति-भास्, cl. 1. A. -भासते,<BR>-भासितुम्, to appear, become clear or evident,<BR>manifest or reveal one's self; to reflect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभास|प्रतिभासः
प्रति-भास, अस्, m. appearance, look, similitude;<BR>appearing or occurring to the mind; illusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभासन|प्रतिभासनं
प्रति-भासन, अम्, n. appearing, appearance,<BR>look, semblance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभिद्
प्रतिभिद् प्रति-भिद्, cl. 7. P. A. -भिनत्ति,<BR>-भिन्त्ते, -भेत्तुम्, to pierce through, pierce, pene-<BR>trate; to disclose, betray; to express displeasure,<BR>reproach, censure; to disown, reject, part from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभिद्य
प्रति-भिद्य, ind. having pierced or penetrated;<BR>having betrayed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभिन्न
प्रति-भिन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, pierced through, pierced;<BR>separated, divided; in immediate contact, closely con-<BR>nected with (with inst.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभेद|प्रतिभेदः
प्रति-भेद, अस्, m. splitting, cleaving, dividing;<BR>discovery, betrayal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभेदन|प्रतिभेदनं
प्रति-भेदन, अम्, n. piercing, penetrating;<BR>splitting, cleaving, cutting; separating, dividing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभुज्
प्रतिभुज् प्रति-भुज्, cl. 7. P. -भुनक्ति,<BR>-भोक्तुम्, to enjoy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभोग|प्रतिभोगः
प्रति-भोग, अस्, m. enjoyment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभू
प्रतिभू 1. प्रति-भू, cl. 1. P. -भवति,<BR>-भवितुम्, to be equal to or on a par with (with<BR>acc.): Caus. -भावयति, -यितुम्, to observe, con-<BR>sider, become acquainted with: Pass. of Caus. -भा-<BR>व्यते, to be considered or regarded as.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभाव|प्रतिभावः
प्रति-भाव, अस्, m. corresponding character or<BR>disposition.<BR>—प्रतिभाव-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having<BR>corresponding or congenial characters, social.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभू
2. प्रति-भू, ऊस्, m. a surety, security, bail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभूष्
प्रतिभूष् प्रति-भूष्, cl. 1. P. -भूषति,<BR>-भूषितुम्, Ved. to make ready, prepare, fit out,<BR>equip; to adorn; to serve, wait upon; to honour,<BR>worship; to accord, accede, acquiesce, comply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0617-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभृ
प्रतिभृ प्रति-भृ, cl. 1. 3. P. A. -भरति,<BR>-ते, -बिभर्ति, -बिभृते, -भर्तुम्, Ved. to carry<BR>towards, offer, present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभृत
प्रति-भृत, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. offered, presented<BR>(as Soma).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमङ्गलवार
प्रतिमङ्गलवार प्रतिमङ्गल-वार, आस्, m.<BR>pl. (probably) every festive day, all festivals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमण्ठक
प्रतिमण्ठक प्रति-मण्ठक, a particular<BR>term in music (= मण्ठक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमण्ड्
प्रतिमण्ड् प्रति-मण्ड्, cl. 1. P. -मण्डति,<BR>-मण्डितुम्, to decorate, adorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमण्डित
प्रति-मण्डित, अस्, आ, अम्, decorated, adorned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमण्डल|प्रतिमंडल
प्रतिमण्डल प्रति-मण्डल, अम्, n. a se-<BR>condary disk (of the sun &c.); an eccentric orbit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमत्स्य
प्रतिमत्स्य प्रतिमत्स्य, आस्, m. pl., N. of a<BR>people; (also read प्रतिमास्य.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमन्
प्रतिमन् प्रति-मन्, cl. 8. A. -मनुते, -म-<BR>नितुम्, to reply, rejoin (Ved.); to compare with<BR>(Ved.): Caus. -मानयति, -यितुम्, to honour, hold<BR>in honour; to applaud; to consider, regard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमन्त्र्
प्रतिमन्त्र् प्रति-मन्त्र्, cl. 10. P. -मन्त्र-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to call out or reply to (Ved.); to<BR>consecrate with sacred texts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमन्त्रण
प्रति-मन्त्रण, अम्, n., Ved. an answer, reply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमन्त्रम्
प्रति-मन्त्रम्, ind., Ved. with or at every for-<BR>mula or verse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमन्त्रित
प्रति-मन्त्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, consecrated with<BR>sacred texts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमन्दिरम्|प्रतिमंदिरम्
प्रतिमन्दिरम् प्रति-मन्दिरम्, ind. in every<BR>house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमन्यूय
प्रतिमन्यूय प्रति-मन्यूय (fr. प्रति + मन्-<BR>यु), Nom. A. प्रतिमन्यूयते, &c., to manifest<BR>resentment towards, pour out one's fury upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमर्श|प्रतिमर्शः
प्रतिमर्श प्रति-मर्श, अस्, m. (fr. rt. मृश्<BR>with प्रति), a kind of powder used as a sternutatory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमल्ल|प्रतिमल्लः
प्रतिमल्ल प्रति-मल्ल, अस्, m. an opponent<BR>in wrestling or boxing, antagonist; a rival.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमा
प्रतिमा 1. प्रति-मा, cl. 2. P., 3. 4. A. -माति,<BR>-मिमीते, -मायते, -मातुम्, to imitate, copy (Ved.);<BR>to compare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमा
2. प्रति-मा, आस्, m. a creator, maker, framer<BR>(Ved.); (आ), f. an image, likeness, resemblance<BR>(frequently at the end of comps. in the sense of<BR>‘like, similar, resembling, equal to,’ e. g. अमर-प्˚,<BR>like an immortal), picture, figure, idol; a symbol;<BR>a reflection; measure, extent; the part of an ele-<BR>phant's head between the tusks; a metre consist-<BR>ing of twelve syllables.<BR>—प्रतिम-ता (?), f. or<BR>प्रतिम-त्व (?), अम्, n. reflection, image, shadow.<BR>—प्रतिमा-गत, अस्, आ, अम्, ‘gone to a statue,’<BR>present in an idol (as a deity).<BR>—प्रतिमा-चन्द्र,<BR>अस्, m. ‘reflection-moon,’ the reflected moon, image<BR>of the moon.<BR>—प्रतिमा-परिचारक, अस्, m. an<BR>attendant upon an idol (= देवल, q. v.).<BR>—प्रतिमा-<BR>विशेष, अस्, m. a sort of image, a kind of figure or<BR>character.<BR>—प्रतिमा-शशाङ्क, अस्, or प्रतिमेन्दु<BR>(˚मा-इन्˚), उस्, m. ‘reflection-moon,’ the reflected<BR>moon, image of the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमातव्य
प्रति-मातव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, comparable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमान|प्रतिमानं
प्रति-मान, अम्, n. a counterpart, match, well-<BR>matched opponent, adversary (Ved.); a model, pat-<BR>tern; an image, picture; an idol; similarity, likeness,<BR>resemblance, similitude; a weight; the part of an<BR>elephant's head between the tusks; (अस्, आ, अम्, at<BR>the end of a comp.) like, resembling.<BR>—प्रतिमान-<BR>भाग, अस्, m. the part of an elephant's head between<BR>the tusks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमित
प्रति-मित, अस्, आ, अम्, imitated, copied; com-<BR>pared; reflected, mirrored.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमेय
प्रति-मेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be likened or com-<BR>pared, comparable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमाया
प्रतिमाया प्रति-माया, f. illusion or magical<BR>power applied in return, counter-spell, counter-charm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमार्गक|प्रतिमार्गकः|प्रतिमार्ग्गक
प्रतिमार्गक प्रति-मार्गक, अस्, m. the city<BR>of Hari-ścandra (said to hover in the air).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमार्गम्
प्रति-मार्गम्, ind. the way back, back, back-<BR>wards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमाला
प्रतिमाला प्रति-माला, f. an exercise ana-<BR>logous to capping verses, reciting verse for verse as a<BR>trial of memory or skill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमासम्
प्रतिमासम् प्रति-मासम्, ind. every month,<BR>month by month, monthly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमास्य
प्रतिमास्य प्रतिमास्य, आस्, m. pl., N. of a<BR>people; [cf. प्रतिमत्स्य.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमित्
प्रतिमित् प्रति-मित्, त्, f., Ved. (fr. rt. मि<BR>with प्रति), a prop, stay, support.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमित्र
प्रतिमित्र प्रति-मित्र, (probably) अम्, n. ‘a<BR>counterfeit friend,’ an adversary, enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमिह्
प्रतिमिह् प्रति-मिह्, cl. 1. P. -मेहति, -मे-<BR>ढुम्, to make water in the direction of (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमीव्
प्रतिमीव् प्रति-मीव्, cl. 1. P. -मीवति, -मी-<BR>वितुम्, Ved. to push or press back; to close by<BR>pressing, shut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमुकुलम्
प्रतिमुकुलम् प्रति-मुकुलम्, ind. in or upon<BR>every bud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमुख
प्रतिमुख प्रति-मुख, अस्, आ, अम्, standing<BR>before the face, facing; near at hand, present; (अम्),<BR>n. (in dramatic language) a secondary plot or inci-<BR>dent calculated either to hasten or retard the catas-<BR>trophe; (अम्), ind. towards; in front, in the presence<BR>of, before.<BR>—प्रतिमुखागत (˚ख-आग्˚), अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, come against or into collision; come before or in<BR>front of.<BR>—प्रतिमुखाङ्ग (˚ख-अङ्˚), अम्, n. (in<BR>dramatic language) progressive narration of events.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमुच्
प्रतिमुच् प्रति-मुच्, cl. 6. P. A. -मुञ्चति,<BR>-ते, -मोक्तुम्, to put on, place on, fix on, append;<BR>to put on (clothes); to put on one's self (A.), dress<BR>one's self (A.); to assume a form; to fasten, tie up,<BR>bind, attach; to let go, set free, release, liberate; to<BR>give up, resign; to return, restore; to pay, liquidate<BR>or discharge (a debt); to fling, hurl: Pass. -मुच्यते,<BR>to be freed or released from (with abl.): Caus. or<BR>cl. 10. P. -मोचयति, -यितुम्, to set free, release,<BR>liberate; to rescue, save, deliver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमुक्त|प्रतिमुक्तः
प्रति-मुक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, put on, applied;<BR>fastened, tied, bound; clothed, armed, accoutred;<BR>released, liberated; loosed or liberated repeatedly;<BR>returned, restored; flung, hurled; thrown at one<BR>another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमोचन|प्रतिमोचनं
प्रति-मोचन, अम्, n. loosening, loosing; libera-<BR>tion, release.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमोचित
प्रति-मोचित, अस्, आ, अम्, released, liberated;<BR>rescued, saved, delivered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमुद्
प्रतिमुद् प्रति-मुद्, cl. 1. A. -मोदते, -मो-<BR>दितुम्, to rejoice at, welcome with joy, welcome<BR>with acclamation; to be glad to see: Caus. -मोद-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, Ved. to gladden, make cheerful, cheer:<BR>Desid. of Caus. -मुमोदयिषति, Ved. to wish to<BR>make cheerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमुद्रा
प्रतिमुद्रा प्रति-मुद्रा, f. a counter-seal;<BR>the impression of a seal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमुह्
प्रतिमुह् प्रति-मुह्, Caus. P. -मोहयति,<BR>-यितुम्, Ved. to bewilder greatly, perplex, confound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमुहुस्
प्रति-मुहुस्, ind. again and again, repeatedly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमोहयत्
प्रति-मोहयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, Ved. bewildering,<BR>confounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमुहूर्तम्|प्रतिमुहूर्त्तम्
प्रतिमुहूर्तम् प्रति-मुहूर्तम्, ind. every mo-<BR>ment, constantly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमूर्ति|प्रतिमूर्तिः|प्रतिमूर्त्ति
प्रतिमूर्ति प्रति-मूर्ति, इस्, f. a corresponding<BR>form, the counterpart of any real form, an image,<BR>resemblance, likeness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमूषिका
प्रतिमूषिका प्रति-मूषिका, f. a species of rat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमेय
प्रतिमेय प्रति-मेय. See 1. प्रति-मा, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमोक्ष|प्रतिमोक्षः
प्रतिमोक्ष प्रति-मोक्ष, अस्, m. liberation,<BR>deliverance; (with Buddhists) emancipation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमोक्षण|प्रतिमोक्षणं
प्रति-मोक्षण, अम्, n. liberation, deliverance;<BR>emancipation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियत्
प्रतियत् प्रति-यत्, Caus. or cl. 10. P.<BR>-यातयति, -यितुम्, to retaliate, requite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियत्न|प्रतियत्नः
प्रति-यत्न, अस्, m. care bestowed upon anything,<BR>exertion for anything, effort, endeavour; a making<BR>or preparing, elaboration; making complete or per-<BR>fect; acquiring a new virtue or quality; acting well<BR>or properly; comprehension; taking prisoner, mak-<BR>ing captive; desire, wish; making an effort against,<BR>opposition, counteraction, resistance; retaliating, re-<BR>crimination, revenge; (अस्, आ, अम्), exerting one's<BR>self for, troubling about; making effort or exertion,<BR>strenuous, diligent, active, vigorous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियातन|प्रतियातनं
प्रति-यातन, अम्, n. requital, retaliation; (आ), f.<BR>the counterpart or resemblance of a real form, a<BR>picture, image, statue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियम्
प्रतियम् प्रति-यम्, cl. 1. P. -यच्छति,<BR>-यन्तुम्, Ved. to grant, present, bestow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिया
प्रतिया प्रति-या, cl. 2. P. -याति, -यातुम्,<BR>to go back, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियात
प्रति-यात, अस्, आ, अम्, gone against, opposed,<BR>resisted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियान|प्रतियानं
प्रति-यान, अम्, n. going back, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियायिन्
प्रति-यायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, going towards, meeting;<BR>going against, attacking, assailing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियुध्
प्रतियुध् प्रति-युध्, cl. 4. A. -युध्यते,<BR>-योद्धुम्, to fight with, fight against, oppose:<BR>Caus. P. -योधयति, -यितुम्, to fight against, oppose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियुद्ध|प्रतियुद्धं
प्रति-युद्ध, अम्, n. fighting against, battle<BR>in return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियोद्धव्य
प्रति-योद्धव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be attacked in<BR>return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियोद्धृ
प्रति-योद्धृ, धा, ध्री, धृ, an antagonist,<BR>adversary, a well-matched opponent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियोध|प्रतियोधः
प्रति-योध, अस्, m. an antagonist, opponent,<BR>adversary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियोधन|प्रतियोधनं
प्रति-योधन, अम्, n. fighting against, assailing<BR>in turn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियोधिन्
प्रति-योधिन्, ई, m. an antagonist, adversary, well-<BR>matched opponent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियूथप|प्रतियूथपः
प्रतियूथप प्रति-यूथप, अस्, m. the leader<BR>of a hostile herd (of elephants).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियोग|प्रतियोगः
प्रतियोग प्रति-योग, अस्, m. (fr. rt. युज्<BR>with प्रति), opposition, resistance, enmity; contro-<BR>versy, contradiction; an antidote, remedy; co-opera-<BR>tion, association; the being a counterpart of anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियोगिक
प्रतियोगिक, अस्, आ, अम्, antithetical, related to,<BR>relative, correlative.<BR>—प्रतियोगिक-त्व, अम्, n.<BR>relativeness, relativity, correlativeness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियोगिन्
प्रति-योगिन्, ई, इनी, इ, opposing, counteracting,<BR>impeding; related to, corresponding to; co-operating<BR>with; equally matched; (ई), m. an opponent, enemy,<BR>antagonist, rival; any object dependant upon another<BR>and not existing without it; a partner, associate,<BR>coadjutor; a counterpart, match.<BR>—प्रतियोगि-ज्ञान-<BR>कारणता-वाद, अस्, m., N. of a Nyāya work.<BR>—प्रतियोगि-ता, f. or प्रतियोगि-त्व, अम्, n. op-<BR>position; dependant existence; the state of being a<BR>match or counterpart, existence as a counterpart,<BR>equality in power; mutual co-operation, partnership.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियोजयितव्य
प्रति-योजयितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be fitted with<BR>strings, requiring to be stringed (as a musical instru-<BR>ment).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियोनि
प्रतियोनि प्रति-योनि, ind., Ved. according<BR>to source or origin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिर
प्रतिर प्र-तिर, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. प्र-तॄ), Ved.<BR>promoting, advancing; granting victory; (according<BR>to Sāy.) प्रतिरम् आयुः = जठरे चिरकालावस्-<BR>थानम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरम्
प्र-तिरम् (probably an ind. past part. fr. प्र-<BR>तॄ), Ved. having crossed (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0618-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरक्ष्
प्रतिरक्ष् प्रति-रक्ष्, cl. 1. P. -रक्षति,<BR>-रक्षितुम्, Ved. to preserve, guard, protect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरक्षण|प्रतिरक्षणं
प्रति-रक्षण, अम्, n. preserving, preservation,<BR>protection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरक्षा
प्रति-रक्षा, f. safety, preservation.<BR>—प्रतिरक्-<BR>षार्थम् (˚षा-अर्˚), ind. for the sake of saving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरथ|प्रतिरथः
प्रतिरथ प्रति-रथ, अस्, m. an opposite<BR>fighter in a war-chariot, an adversary in war, an-<BR>tagonist; N. of a descendant of Atri, author of the<BR>hymn Ṛg-veda V. 47; N. of a son of Mati-nāra<BR>and father of Kaṇva; N. of a son of Vajra and<BR>father of Su-cāru.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरम्भ|प्रतिरंभ|प्रतिरंभः|प्रतिरम्भः
प्रतिरम्भ प्रति-रम्भ, अस्, m. passion, rage,<BR>violent or passionate abuse (= प्रति-लम्भ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरव|प्रतिरवः
प्रतिरव प्रति-रव, अस्, m. (fr. rt. रु with<BR>प्रति), crying or calling out to; quarrelling; echo;<BR>(probably) = उप-रव, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरुरूषु
प्रति-रुरूषु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing to speak or tell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिराज|प्रतिराजः
प्रतिराज प्रति-राज, अस्, or प्रति-राजन्, आ,<BR>m. a hostile king, royal adversary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरात्रम्
प्रतिरात्रम् प्रति-रात्रम्, ind. each night,<BR>every night, nightly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिराध
प्रतिराध प्रति-राध or प्रती-राध, अस्, m.<BR>(fr. rt. राध् with प्रति), Ved. ‘obstacle, hinderance,’<BR>N. of the verses Atharva-veda XX. 135, 1-3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरुच्
प्रतिरुच् प्रति-रुच्, Caus. P. -रोचयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to choose again; to resolve, decide upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरुध्
प्रतिरुध् प्रति-रुध्, cl. 7. P. A. -रुणद्धि,<BR>-रुन्द्धे, -रोद्धुम्, to check, hinder, obstruct;<BR>to besiege, blockade; to stop, interrupt; to render<BR>imperfect, impair; to disable; to abuse, blame, ac-<BR>cuse unjustly; to hide, conceal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरुद्ध
प्रति-रुद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, impeded, hindered,<BR>obstructed; stopped, interrupted; opposed; rendered<BR>imperfect, impaired; disabled; invested, blockaded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरुध्य
प्रति-रुध्य, ind. having accused unjustly (Manu<BR>XI. 88).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरोद्धृ
प्रति-रोद्धृ, धा, ध्री, धृ, withstanding,<BR>opposing, resisting; a hinderer, preventer, opposer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरोध|प्रतिरोधः
प्रति-रोध, अस्, m. opposition, impediment, ob-<BR>struction, hinderance, stoppage; an opponent; con-<BR>cealing, hiding; siege, blockade; theft, robbery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरोधक|प्रतिरोधकः
प्रति-रोधक, अस्, आ, अम्, obstructing, opposing,<BR>hindering, stopping; besieging; (अस्), m. a robber,<BR>thief; an opponent; an obstacle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरोधन|प्रतिरोधनं
प्रति-रोधन, अम्, n. obstructing, opposing,<BR>hindering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरोधिन्
प्रति-रोधिन्, ई, इनी, इ, obstructive, hindering, im-<BR>peding, opposing, controverting; besieging; (ई), m.<BR>a thief, robber; an opponent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरुरूषु
प्रतिरुरूषु प्रति-रुरूषु. See under प्रति-<BR>रव above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरुह्
प्रतिरुह् प्रति-रुह्, Caus. P. -रोपयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to place back, restore, re-establish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरूप|प्रतिरूपं
प्रतिरूप प्रति-रूप, अस्, आ, अम्, like a<BR>model, similar, corresponding, suitable, proper, fit;<BR>beautiful; (अम्, आ), n. f. the counterpart of any real<BR>form, an image, resemblance, representation, likeness,<BR>picture; (अस्), m., N. of a Dānava; (आ), f., N. of a<BR>daughter of Meru.<BR>—प्रतिरूप-चर्य, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>Ved. exemplary in conduct, worthy of imitation.<BR>—प्रतिरूप-धृक् (see धृक्, p. 459, col. 1),<BR>offering a model for imitation, being a pattern or<BR>model.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरूपक|प्रतिरूपकं
प्रतिरूपक, अम्, n. an image, a picture; a<BR>forged edict; (अस्, इका, अम्), similar, resembling,<BR>corresponding, having the appearance of anything<BR>(generally at the end of a comp.; cf. सप्तमी-प्˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरूप्य
प्रतिरूप्य, अम्, n. ‘similarity of form,’ in अ-प्र-<BR>तिरूप्य, incomparableness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरौद्रकर्मन्
प्रतिरौद्रकर्मन् प्रति-रौद्र-कर्मन्, आ, आ,<BR>अ, acting cruelly against others.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलक्षण
प्रतिलक्षण प्रति-लक्षण, अम्, n. ‘a coun-<BR>ter-mark,’ mark, sign, token.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलभ्
प्रतिलभ् प्रति-लभ्, cl. 1. A. -लभते, -लब्-<BR>धुम्, to receive back, recover; to obtain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलभ्य
प्रति-लभ्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be received or ob-<BR>tained, obtainable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलम्भ|प्रतिलंभः|प्रतिलम्भः
प्रति-लम्भ, अस्, m. receiving, taking, obtain-<BR>ing, getting; censure, reviling, abuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलम्भित
प्रति-लम्भित, अम्, n. obtaining, getting; cen-<BR>sure, reviling, abuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलाभ|प्रतिलाभः
प्रति-लाभ, अस्, m. receiving back, receiving,<BR>taking, obtaining, getting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलिङ्गम्
प्रतिलिङ्गम् प्रति-लिङ्गम्, ind. at every<BR>Liṅga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलिपि|प्रतिलिपिः
प्रतिलिपि प्रति-लिपि, इस्, f. a copy, tran-<BR>script, a written reply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलोम|प्रतिलोमः
प्रतिलोम प्रति-लोम, अस्, आ, अम्, against the<BR>hair or grain (opposed to अनु-लोम), contrary to<BR>the natural course or order, reverse, inverted; dis-<BR>agreeable, unpleasant; hostile; low, vile, base, de-<BR>praved; left, not right; contrary to caste (where the<BR>mother is of a higher caste than the father); (अम्),<BR>n. any disagreeable or injurious act; (अस्), m., N. of<BR>a man; (आस्), m. pl., N. of the descendants of<BR>Prati-loma; (अम्), ind. against the hair, against the<BR>grain, in reversed or inverted order.<BR>—प्रतिलोम-ज,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, born in the inverse order of the classes<BR>(as of a Kṣatriya father and Brāhmaṇī mother, or of<BR>a Vaiśya father and Kṣatriyā or Brāhmaṇī mother,<BR>in which cases the wife is of a higher caste than the<BR>husband; cf. Manu X. 16).<BR>—प्रतिलोम-तस्, ind.<BR>against the grain, invertedly, in inverted order or<BR>series; on account of the inversion of the order of<BR>the castes.<BR>—प्रतिलोमानुलोम-तस् (˚म-अन्˚), ind.<BR>in an unfriendly and friendly manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलोमक
प्रतिलोमक, अस्, आ, अम्, against the hair or<BR>grain, reverse, inverted; (अम्), n. inverted order,<BR>perversion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवच्
प्रतिवच् प्रति-वच्, cl. 2. P. -वक्ति, -वक्-<BR>तुम्, to say anything in reply to (with two acc.);<BR>to point out, indicate, denounce (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवक्तव्य
प्रति-वक्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be answered or<BR>replied to, to be given (as an answer), answerable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवचन|प्रतिवचनं
प्रति-वचन, अम्, n. a dependant or final clause<BR>in a sentence; an answer, reply, rejoinder; an echo.<BR>—प्रतिवचनी-कृ, cl. 8. P. A. -करोति, -कुरुते,<BR>-कर्तुम्, to make reply, to answer.<BR>—प्रतिवचनी-<BR>कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, replied to, answered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवचस्
प्रति-वचस्, अस्, n. an answer, reply; an echo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवाक्य|प्रतिवाक्यं
प्रति-वाक्य, अस्, आ, अम्, admitting or requiring<BR>an answer, answerable; (अम्), n. a reply, answer;<BR>(अम्), ind. in every sentence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवाच्
प्रति-वाच्, क्, f. an answer, reply; calling or crying<BR>out to; barking in return (as a dog, Mahā-bh.<BR>Udyoga-p. 2651).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवत्|प्रतिवन्त्
प्रतिवत् प्रति-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. con-<BR>taining the word प्रति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवत्सर
प्रतिवत्सर प्रति-वत्सर, अस्, m. a year;<BR>(अम्), ind. every year, year by year, yearly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवद्
प्रतिवद् प्रति-वद्, cl. 1. P. -वदति, -वदि-<BR>तुम्, to answer; to repeat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवाद|प्रतिवादः
प्रति-वाद, अस्, m. an answer, reply, rejoinder;<BR>rejection, refusal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवादिन्
प्रति-वादिन्, ई, इनी, इ, answering, replying, re-<BR>joining, responding; contradicting, disobedient; (ई),<BR>m. an opponent; a defendant, respondent.<BR>—प्र-<BR>तिवादि-ता, f. the state or situation of a respondent or<BR>defendant at law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवनम्
प्रतिवनम् प्रति-वनम्, ind. in every wood<BR>or forest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवप्
प्रतिवप् प्रति-वप्, cl. 1. P. -वपति, -वप्-<BR>तुम्, to insert (jewels &c.), inlay, stud, adorn, orna-<BR>ment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवाप|प्रतिवापः
प्रति-वाप, अस्, m. addition of substances to<BR>medicines either during or after decoction (= प्रती-<BR>वाप).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवर्णिक
प्रतिवर्णिक प्रति-वर्णिक, अस्, आ, अम्, having<BR>a corresponding colour, similar, corresponding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवर्तन|प्रतिवर्तनं
प्रतिवर्तन प्रति-वर्तन. See under प्रति-<BR>वृत्, p. 620, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवर्त्मन्
प्रतिवर्त्मन् प्रति-वर्त्मन्. See under<BR>प्रति-वृत्, p. 620, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवर्धिन्
प्रतिवर्धिन् प्रति-वर्धिन्, ई, इनी, इ, grown<BR>strong enough for, being a match for, superior to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवर्षम्
प्रतिवर्षम् प्रति-वर्षम्, ind. every year,<BR>year by year, yearly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवस्
प्रतिवस् 1. प्रति-वस् (see rt. 5. वस्), Caus.<BR>P. -वासयति, -यितुम्, to dress, clothe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवस्
प्रतिवस् 2. प्रति-वस् (see rt. 6. वस्), cl. 1.<BR>P. -वसति, -वस्तुम्, to dwell near, live at; to<BR>live, dwell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवसति
प्रति-वसति, ind. in every habitation, on every<BR>house, house by house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवसथ|प्रतिवसथः
प्रति-वसथ, अस्, m. a settlement, village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवस्तु
प्रति-वस्तु, उ, n. (fr. प्रति + वस्तु), a counter-<BR>part, an equivalent; anything given in return; any-<BR>thing contrasted with another, a parallel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवासिन्
प्रति-वासिन्, ई, इनी, इ, dwelling near, neighbouring,<BR>a neighbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवहन|प्रतिवहनं
प्रतिवहन प्रति-वहन, अम्, n. leading<BR>back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवाह
प्रति-वाह, अस्, m., N. of a son of Śva-<BR>phalka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवोढव्य
प्रति-वोढव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be carried home.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवह्निप्रदक्षिणम्
प्रतिवह्निप्रदक्षिणम् प्रति-वह्नि-प्रदक्षि-<BR>णम्, ind. at each perambulation from left to right<BR>of the sacred fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवाणि|प्रतिवाणिः
प्रतिवाणि प्रति-वाणि, इस्, f. an answer, reply,<BR>rejoinder (see प्रति-बाणि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवात|प्रतिवातः
प्रतिवात प्रति-वात, अस्, m. a contrary<BR>wind; (अम्), ind. against the wind, to leeward; (ए),<BR>ind. on the lee side.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवार|प्रतिवारः
प्रतिवार प्रति-वार, प्रति-वारण, &c.<BR>See under प्रति-वृ, p. 620, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवार्त्ता|प्रतिवार्ता
प्रतिवार्त्ता प्रति-वार्त्ता. See प्रति-वृत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवाश
प्रतिवाश प्रति-वाश, अस्, ई, अम्, howling<BR>against; अ-प्˚, not contradicting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवासरम्
प्रतिवासरम् प्रति-वासरम्, ind. every day,<BR>day by day, daily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवासिन्
प्रतिवासिन् प्रति-वासिन्. See above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवासुदेव
प्रतिवासुदेव प्रति-वासुदेव, अस्, m. ‘oppo-<BR>nent of a Vāsudeva,’ (with Jainas) N. of nine beings<BR>at enmity with Vāsudeva (= विष्णु-द्विष्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविघात|प्रतिविघातः
प्रतिविघात प्रति-विघात, अस्, m. (fr. rt.<BR>हन् with वि), striking back, warding off, defence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविज्ञा
प्रतिविज्ञा प्रति-वि-ज्ञा, cl. 9. P. A. -जानाति,<BR>जानीते, -ज्ञातुम्, to behave wisely or prudently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविटपम्
प्रतिविटपम् प्रति-विटपम्, ind. in every<BR>bough, to every branch, branch by branch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविद्
प्रतिविद् प्रति-विद्, cl. 2. P. -वेत्ति, -वेद,<BR>-वेदितुम्, to acknowledge, receive; cl. 6. P. A.<BR>-विन्दति, -ते, -वेदितुम्, -वेत्तुम्, to obtain, get,<BR>receive: Caus. -वेदयति, -यितुम्, to make known,<BR>report, announce, relate; to deliver, give.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवेदम्
प्रति-वेदम्, ind. at or for every Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवेदयत्
प्रति-वेदयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, making known,<BR>announcing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवेदशाखम्
प्रति-वेद-शाखम्, ind. for every branch or<BR>school of the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविधा
प्रतिविधा प्रति-वि-धा, cl. 3. P. A. -द-<BR>धाति, -धत्ते, -धातुम्, to place or dispose in<BR>order, arrange, prepare, make ready, fit out, equip;<BR>to dispatch; to counteract, counterwork, frustrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0619-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविधातव्य
प्रति-विधातव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be arranged;<BR>to be used or employed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविधान|प्रतिविधानं
प्रति-विधान, अम्, n. arrangement, array; ar-<BR>rangement against, prevention; counteracting, coun-<BR>terworking, counteraction, taking measures against;<BR>a subsidiary or substituted ceremony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविधि|प्रतिविधिः
प्रति-विधि, इस्, m. a means of counteracting,<BR>an act or ordinance designed to counterwork or<BR>counteract, remedy; retaliation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविधेय
प्रति-विधेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be performed or<BR>done in any special case; to be counteracted or<BR>remedied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविहित
प्रति-विहित, अस्, आ, अम्, arranged, arrayed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविन्ध्य
प्रतिविन्ध्य प्रति-विन्ध्य, अस्, m., N. of a<BR>king who ruled over a particular part of the Vindhya<BR>mountains; of a son of Yudhi-ṣṭhira.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविपरी
प्रतिविपरी प्रति-वि-परी (-परि-इ), cl. 2. P.<BR>-पर्य्-एति, -एतुम्, to turn back again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविभज्
प्रतिविभज् प्रति-वि-भज्, cl. 1. P. A. -भ-<BR>जति, -ते, -भक्तुम्, Ved. to distribute severally,<BR>apportion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविभाग|प्रतिविभागः
प्रति-विभाग, अस्, m. division, distribution, ap-<BR>portionment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविम्ब|प्रतिविंब|प्रतिविम्बं|प्रतिविम्बः
प्रतिविम्ब प्रति-विम्ब, अम्, अस्, n. m. the<BR>disk (of the sun or moon) reflected (in water), a<BR>reflection, reflected image, mirrored form; a resem-<BR>blance or counterpart of real forms, a picture, image,<BR>shadow; epithet of the chapters of the Kāvya-pra-<BR>kāśādarśa.<BR>—प्रतिविम्ब-वर्तिन्, ई, इनी, इ, being<BR>reflected or mirrored.<BR>—प्रतिविम्बात (˚ब-अत)?,<BR>अस्, m. a mirror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविम्बन
प्रति-विम्बन, अम्, n. the being reflected; re-<BR>flection; comparing together, comparison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविम्बय
प्रतिविम्बय, Nom. P. प्रतिविम्बयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to reflect, mirror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविम्बित
प्रतिविम्बित, अस्, आ, अम्, reflected, mirrored.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविरति
प्रतिविरति प्रति-विरति, इस्, f. (fr. rt. रम्<BR>with प्रति), desisting from anything (with abl.),<BR>leaving off; (इ), ind. at every pause, at each cessa-<BR>tion or disappearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविशिष्ट
प्रतिविशिष्ट प्रति-विशिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, most<BR>excellent; (with abl.) more excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविशेष|प्रतिविशेषः
प्रति-विशेष, अस्, m. peculiarity, a peculiar cir-<BR>cumstance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविश्व
प्रतिविश्व प्रति-विश्व, अस्, आ, अम्, every<BR>single one, one and all.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविष
प्रतिविष प्रति-विष, अम्, n. ‘counter-<BR>poison,’ an antidote; (आ), f. a birch tree (commonly<BR>called Ataich or Atis Betula).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविषय
प्रतिविषय प्रति-विषय, आस्, m. pl. the<BR>several objects of sense; (अम्), ind. in relation to<BR>each single object of sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविष्णु
प्रतिविष्णु प्रति-विष्णु, ind. at every (image<BR>of) Viṣṇu; towards Viṣṇu, in place of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविष्णुक|प्रतिविष्णुकः
प्रतिविष्णुक, अस्, m. a species of tree (=<BR>मुचुकुन्द).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविहाय
प्रतिविहाय प्रति-विहाय, ind. (fr. rt. हा<BR>with प्रति and वि), having quitted, having aban-<BR>doned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवीक्ष्
प्रतिवीक्ष् प्रति-वीक्ष् (-वि-ईक्ष्), cl. 1. A.<BR>-वीक्षते, -वीक्षितुम्, to look upon; to observe,<BR>perceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवीक्षण
प्रति-वीक्षण, अम्, n. looking upon, returning<BR>a look.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवीक्षणीय
प्रति-वीक्षणीय or प्रति-वीक्ष्य, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>to be looked upon; to be observed or perceived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवीर|प्रतिवीरः
प्रतिवीर प्रति-वीर, अस्, m. a well-matched<BR>opponent, antagonist.<BR>—प्रतिवीर-ता, f. the being<BR>a well-matched opponent, antagonism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवीर्य
प्रति-वीर्य, अम्, n. sufficient strength or power<BR>for resistance, the being equal to or a match for;<BR>अ-प्रतिवीर्य, unequalled, matchless, irresistible;<BR>अप्रतिवीर्यारम्भ, one who has not sufficient<BR>strength to undertake anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवृ
प्रतिवृ प्रति-वृ, Caus. or cl. 10. P. -वार-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to keep or ward off, keep back, repel;<BR>to oppose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवार|प्रतिवारः
प्रति-वार, अस्, m. keeping or warding off, de-<BR>fence; अ-प्˚, not to be warded off, irresistible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवारण|प्रतिवारणं|प्रतिवारणः
प्रति-वारण, अस्, ई, अम्, keeping or warding off<BR>[cf. वारण-प्˚]; (अस्), m. a hostile elephant; scil.<BR>दैत्य, a Daitya in the form of an elephant; (अम्),<BR>n. keeping back, keeping or warding off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवार्य
प्रति-वार्य, अस्, आ, अम्, in अ-प्˚, not to be kept<BR>back, not to be impeded, not to be warded off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवृत्
प्रतिवृत् प्रति-वृत्, cl. 1. A. -वर्तते, -वर्-<BR>तितुम्, to approach; to accrue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवर्तन|प्रतिवर्तनं
प्रति-वर्तन, अम्, n. turning back, returning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवर्त्मन्
प्रति-वर्त्मन्, आ, आ, अ, Ved. taking an opposite<BR>road or course.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवार्त्ता|प्रतिवार्ता
प्रति-वार्त्ता, f. account, intelligence, information.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवृत्ति
प्रति-वृत्ति, ind. (in Ved. gram.) according to the<BR>modulation (of the voice).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवृष्
प्रतिवृष् प्रति-वृष्, cl. 1. P. -वर्षति,<BR>-वर्षितुम्, to rain or shower upon (with arrows),<BR>to shoot; to assail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवृष|प्रतिवृषः
प्रति-वृष, अस्, m. a hostile bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवेलम्
प्रतिवेलम् प्रति-वेलम्, ind. on every oc-<BR>casion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवेश|प्रतिवेशः
प्रतिवेश प्रति-वेश, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. विश्<BR>with प्रति), neighbouring; auxiliary; (अस्), m. a<BR>neighbour; the residence of a neighbour, neighbour-<BR>ing house, neighbourhood; [cf. प्रती-वेश.]<BR>—प्र-<BR>तिवेश-तस्, ind., Ved. from the neighbourhood.<BR>—प्रतिवेश-वासिन्, ई, इनी, इ, living in the neigh-<BR>bourhood, neighbouring; (ई, इनी), m. f. a neighbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवेशिन्
प्रतिवेशिन्, ई, इनी, इ, neighbouring, a neighbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवेश्मन्
प्रति-वेश्मन्, अ, n. a neighbour's house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवेश्य|प्रतिवेश्यः
प्रतिवेश्य, अस्, m. a neighbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवेष्टित
प्रतिवेष्टित प्रति-वेष्टित, अस्, आ, अम्, rolled<BR>back, reverted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवैर
प्रतिवैर प्रति-वैर, अम्, n. requital of hos-<BR>tilities, revenge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवोढव्य
प्रतिवोढव्य प्रति-वोढव्य. See under<BR>प्रति-वहन, p. 619, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिव्यध्
प्रतिव्यध् प्रति-व्यध्, cl. 4. P. -विध्यति,<BR>-व्यद्धुम्, to hit, wound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिव्यूह्
प्रतिव्यूह् प्रति-व्य्-ऊह् (-वि-ऊह्; see rt. 1. ऊह्),<BR>cl. 1. P. A. -ऊहति, -ते, -ऊहितुम्, to draw out in<BR>opposite battle-array.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिव्यूढ
प्रति-व्यूढ, अस्, आ, अम्, drawn out in array<BR>against; broad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिव्यूह|प्रतिव्यूहः
प्रति-व्यूह, अस्, m. drawing out an army in<BR>opposite battle-array, arraying an army against an<BR>enemy; a multitude; N. of a prince (in this sense<BR>a various reading for प्रति-व्योमन्, q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिव्योम
प्रतिव्योम प्रति-व्योम, अस्, or प्रति-व्योमन्,<BR>आ, m., N. of a prince.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिव्रज्
प्रतिव्रज् प्रति-व्रज्, cl. 1. P. -व्रजति, -व्र-<BR>जितुम्, to go towards, go near, approach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशङ्कनीय
प्रतिशङ्कनीय प्रति-शङ्कनीय, अस्, आ, अम्<BR>(fr. rt. शङ्क् with प्रति), to be doubted about or<BR>feared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशङ्का
प्रति-शङ्का, f. fear or anxiety on account of<BR>(with loc.); constant fear or doubt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशत्रु
प्रतिशत्रु प्रति-शत्रु, उस्, m., Ved. an ad-<BR>versary, opponent, enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशब्द|प्रतिशब्दः
प्रतिशब्द प्रति-शब्द, अस्, m. echo, reso-<BR>nance, reverberation; a roar.<BR>—प्रतिशब्द-ग, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, going after a sound, going in the direction<BR>of a sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशम|प्रतिशमः
प्रतिशम प्रति-शम, अस्, m. (fr. rt. शम्<BR>with प्रति), deliverance, cessation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशर
प्रतिशर प्रति-शर, अस्, m. (fr. rt. शॄ with<BR>प्रति), Ved. breaking to pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशशिन्
प्रतिशशिन् प्रति-शशिन्, ई, m. a mock moon,<BR>paraselene.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशाखम्
प्रतिशाखम् प्रति-शाखम्, ind. for every<BR>branch or school (of the Veda); (आ), f. a side branch,<BR>side shoot.<BR>—प्रतिशाखा-नाडी, f. a branch vein.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशाप|प्रतिशापः
प्रतिशाप प्रति-शाप, अस्, m. a curse in<BR>return, retorted imprecation, curse for curse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशासन|प्रतिशासनं
प्रतिशासन प्रति-शासन, अम्, n. (fr. rt. शास्),<BR>giving orders, ordering, commissioning; sending a<BR>servant on a message, ordering or dispatching an<BR>inferior after calling him to attend; a counter-order,<BR>rival command or authority; अ-प्रतिशासन, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, without rival authority, completely under sub-<BR>jection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशास्ति|प्रतिशास्तिः
प्रति-शास्ति, इस्, f. sending on a message, ordering or<BR>dispatching an inferior after calling him to attend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशिष्ट|प्रतिशिष्टं
प्रति-शिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, sent, ordered, dis-<BR>patched; celebrated, famous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशी
प्रतिशी प्रति-शी, cl. 2. A. -शेते, -शयितुम्,<BR>to lie down opposite to (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशीवन्
प्रति-शीवन्, आ, अरी, अ, Ved. serving as a couch<BR>or resting-place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशीन
प्रतिशीन प्रति-शीन, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. श्यै<BR>with प्रति), melted, fluid, dropping, oozing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिश्या
प्रति-श्या, f. or प्रति-श्याय, अस्, m. a cold,<BR>catarrh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशुक्रम्
प्रतिशुक्रम् प्रति-शुक्रम्, ind. towards the<BR>planet Venus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशुष्
प्रतिशुष् प्रति-शुष्, cl. 4. P. -शुष्यति,<BR>-शोष्टुम्, to be dried up, become dry; to perish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिश्या
प्रतिश्या प्रति-श्या. See above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिश्रय|प्रतिश्रयः
प्रतिश्रय प्रति-श्रय, अस्, m. (fr. rt. श्रि with<BR>प्रति), refuge, help, assistance; a place of refuge,<BR>shelter, asylum, an alms-house; a place where food<BR>&c. is given away; a house, dwelling; a receptacle;<BR>a place of sacrifice, the room or building where the<BR>sacrifice is performed; an assembly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिश्रु
प्रतिश्रु प्रति-श्रु, cl. 5. P. -शृणोति, -श्रो-<BR>तुम्, to promise (with dat. or gen. of the person and<BR>acc. of the thing).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिश्रव|प्रतिश्रवः
प्रति-श्रव, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. overhearing, dis-<BR>covering by listening; (अस्), m. promise, agreement,<BR>assent; (according to Mahī-dhara) = प्रति-शब्द.<BR>—प्रतिश्रवान्त (˚व-अन्˚), अस्, m. the expiration<BR>of a promise, i. e. lapse of a promised period.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिश्रवण|प्रतिश्रवणं
प्रति-श्रवण, अम्, n. hearkening to, listening<BR>to (with attention and obedience); assenting to,<BR>agreeing, promising; a promise; maintaining; a<BR>particular part of the ear.<BR>—प्रतिश्रवण-पूर्व,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, preceded by a promise, promised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिश्रवस्
प्रति-श्रवस्, आस्, m., N. of a son of Bhīma-sena.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिश्रुत्
प्रति-श्रुत्, त्, f. an echo, resonance, reverberation;<BR>a promise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिश्रुत|प्रतिश्रुतः
प्रति-श्रुत, अस्, आ, अम्, promised, assented,<BR>agreed, accepted; (अम्), n. a promise, assent; an<BR>engagement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिश्रुति|प्रतिश्रुतिः
प्रति-श्रुति, इस्, f., Ved. an echo, repeated sound,<BR>resonance, reverberation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिश्रुत्का
प्रतिश्रुत्का, f., Ved. = प्रति-श्रुत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिश्रोतृ
प्रति-श्रोतृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who promises or<BR>assents, a promiser.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिश्लोकम्
प्रतिश्लोकम् प्रति-श्लोकम्, ind. at every<BR>Śloka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिषिच्य
प्रतिषिच्य प्रति-षिच्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. सिच्<BR>with प्रति), Ved. to be besprinkled or moistened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिषेक
प्रति-षेक, अस्, m., Ved. besprinkling, moist-<BR>ening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिषिध्
प्रतिषिध् प्रति-षिध् (-सिध्), cl. 1. P. -षे-<BR>धति, -षेधितुम्, -षेद्धुम्, to keep off, ward<BR>off; to restrain; to hinder; to interdict, prohibit,<BR>forbid, disallow: Caus. -षेधयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>keep off, keep back, ward off; to restrain; to pro-<BR>hibit, interdict.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0620-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिषिद्ध|प्रतिषिद्धः
प्रति-षिद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, forbidden, prohibited;<BR>refused, denied, disallowed; contradicted.<BR>—प्रति-<BR>षिद्ध-सेवन, अम्, n. doing what is prohibited.<BR>—प्रतिषिद्ध-सेविन्, ई, इनी, इ, following or doing<BR>what is forbidden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिषेद्धव्य
प्रति-षेद्धव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be warded off,<BR>to be kept back; to be prohibited or forbidden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिषेद्धृ
प्रति-षेद्धृ, धा, ध्री, धृ, one who wards<BR>off or keeps back; hindering, a hinderer; prohibiting,<BR>prohibitive, a prohibitor, forbidding; resisting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिषेध|प्रतिषेधः
प्रति-षेध, अस्, m. keeping or warding off,<BR>keeping back, expulsion (of a disease &c.); forbid-<BR>ding, prohibition; denial, refusal, disallowal; nega-<BR>tion, contradiction; a negative particle; an exception;<BR>enforcing a prohibition, reminding of a prohibition.<BR>—प्रतिषेधाक्षर (˚ध-अक्˚), अम्, n. ‘words<BR>of denial,’ a negative answer.<BR>—प्रतिषेधोक्ति<BR>(˚ध-उक्˚), इस्, f. expression of denial or refusal,<BR>expression of prohibition or contradiction.<BR>—प्रति-<BR>षेधोपमा (˚ध-उप्˚), f. a negative comparison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिषेधक|प्रतिषेधकः
प्रति-षेधक, अस्, इका, अम्, prohibiting, prohi-<BR>bitive, interdicting, preventive; denying, negative;<BR>contradicting; excepting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिषेधन|प्रतिषेधनं
प्रति-षेधन, अस्, ई, अम्, keeping or warding<BR>off; (अम्), n. the act of keeping or warding off,<BR>keeping back, expulsion; preventing, prohibiting,<BR>inhibition, refusal, refutation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिषेधनीय
प्रति-षेधनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be kept back;<BR>to be hindered or prevented; to be prohibited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्कश|प्रतिष्कशः
प्रतिष्कश प्रति-ष्-कश, अस्, m. (fr. rt. कश्<BR>with प्रति), a messenger; a secret emissary, spy;<BR>a whip, a leather thong; [cf. कशा.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्क|प्रतिष्कः
प्रति-ष्क, अस्, m. a messenger, an emissary, spy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्कष|प्रतिष्कषः
प्रति-ष्कष, अस्, m. a whip, a leather thong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्कस|प्रतिष्कसः
प्रति-ष्कस, अस्, m. a messenger, an emissary,<BR>spy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्कु
प्रतिष्कु प्रति-ष्कु (प्रति-स्कु), cl. 5. P.<BR>-ष्कुनोति, -ष्कोतुम्, to cover in return (with<BR>arrows &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्टब्ध
प्रतिष्टब्ध प्रति-ष्टब्ध, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt.<BR>स्तम्भ् with प्रति), obstructed, impeded, stopped,<BR>withstood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्टम्भ|प्रतिष्टंभ|प्रतिष्टंभः|प्रतिष्टम्भः
प्रति-ष्टम्भ, अस्, m. obstruction, impediment,<BR>obstacle, opposition, resistance, hinderance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्टुति
प्रतिष्टुति प्रति-ष्टुति, इस्, f. (fr. rt. स्तु with<BR>प्रति), Ved. a song of praise, praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्टोतृ
प्रति-ष्टोतृ, ता, त्री, तृ, Ved. one who rivals<BR>in praising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्टुभ्
प्रतिष्टुभ् प्रति-ष्टुभ्, cl. 1. A. -ष्टोभते,<BR>-ष्टोभितुम्, Ved. to praise severally, glorify indi-<BR>vidually; (Sāy. = प्रत्येकं स्तु.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्ठा
प्रतिष्ठा प्रति-ष्ठा (प्रति-स्था), cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-तिष्ठति, -ते, -ष्ठातुम्, to stand firmly, stand or<BR>rest upon, to be supported; to depend upon; to<BR>stay: Caus. P. -ष्ठापयति, -यितुम्, to place<BR>firmly, to set up, erect; to place; to place with,<BR>consign to (with loc.); to offer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्ठ|प्रतिष्ठः
प्रति-ष्ठ, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. standing firmly;<BR>resisting; famous; (अस्), m., N. of the father of<BR>Su-pārśva who was the seventh Arhat of the present<BR>Ava-sarpiṇī; (आ), f. standing still, resting, remaining<BR>in, staying, standing, fixing; a resting-place, site,<BR>ground, base, foundation; a prop, stay; fixity, con-<BR>stitution, strength; the state of rest, quiet, tranquillity,<BR>comfort; the foot (regarded as the basis on which<BR>men and animals stand); a halting-place, dwelling-<BR>place, house, home, residence; the earth; a limit,<BR>boundary; a receptacle; a high or honourable posi-<BR>tion, high authority, pre-eminence; celebrity, fame,<BR>notoriety; the accession (of a king to the throne);<BR>installation, inauguration, the consecration of a monu-<BR>ment or image in honour of a deity or the setting<BR>up of an idol; the performance or institution of any<BR>rites (e. g. the endowment of a temple, portioning a<BR>daughter, completion of a vow, or any ceremonies<BR>for obtaining supernatural and magical powers); ac-<BR>complishment, completion in general; a metre of<BR>four lines of four syllables each; a variety of the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">Page0621-b+ 76</a>]<BR>Gāyatrī metre consisting of three lines of eight,<BR>seven, and six syllables respectively; a mystical<BR>designation of the letter आ; N. of one of the<BR>Mātṛs attending upon Skanda; प्रजापतेः प्र-<BR>तिष्ठा or प्रतिष्ठा-सामन्, N. of a Sāman;<BR>(आ), ind., Ved. (perhaps) on the spot.<BR>—प्रतिष्ठा-<BR>काम, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. desirous of a firm basis;<BR>wishing for a home or residence; wishing for emi-<BR>nence or distinction.<BR>—प्रतिष्ठा-तिलक, N. of a<BR>work by Rāma-candra (on the erection of the images<BR>of the twenty-four Jaina Tīrthaṅ-karas).<BR>—प्रति-<BR>ष्ठा-त्व, अम्, n. the being a ground or basis,<BR>being a foundation.<BR>—प्रतिष्ठान्वित (˚ठा-अन्˚),<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, possessed of fame, renowned, illustrious,<BR>celebrated.<BR>—प्रतिष्ठा-मयूख, अस्, m., N. of<BR>the ninth section of the Bhāskara.<BR>—प्रतिष्ठा-<BR>वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having a foundation or support.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्ठातृ
प्रति-ष्ठातृ, ता, m. epithet of a particular<BR>priest (also called प्रति-प्रस्थातृ, q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्ठान|प्रतिष्ठानं
प्रति-ष्ठान, अम्, n. resting or standing firmly,<BR>being firmly stationed; a standing-place, ground,<BR>foundation; the foundation of a city; site, situation;<BR>a leg, foot; N. of a town at the confluence of the<BR>Gaṅgā and Yamunā on the left bank of the Gaṅgā<BR>opposite to Allahabad, the capital of the early kings<BR>of the lunar dynasty; N. of a town on the Go-<BR>dāvarī, the capital of Śāli-vāhana; (औ), m. du. the<BR>constellation Proṣṭha-pada.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्ठापन|प्रतिष्ठापनं
प्रति-ष्ठापन, अम्, n. fixing, placing, locating;<BR>erecting or consecrating the image of a deity, instal-<BR>lation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्ठापम्
प्रति-ष्ठापम्, ind., Ved. having fixed or placed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्ठापयितव्य
प्रति-ष्ठापयितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be placed<BR>or established.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्ठापयितृ
प्रति-ष्ठापयितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who erects<BR>or fixes; one who founds, a founder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्ठापित
प्रति-ष्ठापित, अस्, आ, अम्, set up, erected,<BR>placed, located; fixed, appointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्ठाप्य
प्रति-ष्ठाप्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be placed or<BR>located or fixed; to be consigned or made over to<BR>(with loc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्ठि
प्रति-ष्ठि, इस्, f., Ved. resistance; (Sāy.) =<BR>आश्रय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्ठित|प्रतिष्ठितः
प्रति-ष्ठित, अस्, आ, अम्, set up, erected; esta-<BR>blished, fixed, infixed; comprised, included; placed,<BR>situated; staying; established in life, married; por-<BR>tioned, endowed; consecrated, inaugurated, installed;<BR>completed, finished, effected; applied, applicable;<BR>experienced, conversant with; famous, celebrated,<BR>renowned, illustrious; prized, valued; secured, ac-<BR>quired.<BR>—प्रतिष्ठित-सन्तान, अस्, आ, अम्, one<BR>who has progeny or offspring secured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्ठिति|प्रतिष्ठितिः
प्रति-ष्ठिति, इस्, f., Ved. standing firmly, re-<BR>maining firm or fixed; a station.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्ठासु
प्रतिष्ठासु प्र-तिष्ठासु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing<BR>to remain, &c. See प्र-स्था.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्णात
प्रतिष्णात प्रति-ष्णात, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt.<BR>स्ना), pure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिष्णिका
प्रतिष्णिका, f., see Gaṇa to Pāṇ. VIII. 3, 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्नात
प्रति-स्नात, अस्, आ, अम्, bathed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंयोद्धृ
प्रतिसंयोद्धृ प्रति-संयोद्धृ, धा, m. an<BR>adversary in war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंलयन
प्रतिसंलयन प्रति-संलयन, अम्, n. (fr.<BR>rt. ली with प्रति-सम्), complete absorption.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंवत्सरम्
प्रतिसंवत्सरम् प्रति-संवत्सरम्, ind. every<BR>year, year by year, yearly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंविद्
प्रतिसंविद् प्रति-संविद्, त्, f. (fr. rt. विद्<BR>with प्रति-सम्), an accurate understanding of the<BR>particulars of anything.<BR>—प्रतिसंवित्-प्राप्त, अस्,<BR>m., N. of a Bodhi-sattva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंवेदक
प्रति-संवेदक, अस्, आ, अम्, giving detailed<BR>information, informing about the particulars of any-<BR>thing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंवेदिन्
प्रति-संवेदिन्, ई, इनी, इ, enjoying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंसर्ग
प्रतिसंसर्ग प्रति-संसर्ग, अस्, m. = प्रति-<BR>सर्ग, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंस्कृ
प्रतिसंस्कृ प्रति-संस्-कृ (-सम्-कृ), cl. 8.<BR>P. A. -करोति, -कुरुते, -कर्तुम्, to mend, repair;<BR>to re-establish, restore; to unite one thing with<BR>another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंस्थान|प्रतिसंस्थानं
प्रतिसंस्थान प्रति-संस्थान, अम्, n. (fr. rt.<BR>स्था with प्रति), settling in, entering into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंहृ
प्रतिसंहृ प्रति-सं-हृ, cl. 1. P. A. -हरति,<BR>-ते, -हर्तुम्, to draw back, withdraw, drag back; to<BR>place back, replace (an arrow in the quiver); to retract;<BR>to change: Caus. -हारयति, -यितुम्, to retract.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंहार|प्रतिसंहारः
प्रति-संहार, अस्, m. taking back, drawing in,<BR>withdrawing; compression, diminution; comprehen-<BR>sion; retracting; giving up, yielding, resigning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंहृत
प्रति-संहृत, अस्, आ, अम्, comprehended, in-<BR>cluded; compressed, reduced in bulk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसञ्जिहीर्षु
प्रति-सञ्जिहीर्षु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing to with-<BR>draw from, wishing to be freed from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंहृष्
प्रतिसंहृष् प्रति-सं-हृष्, cl. 4. P. -हृष्-<BR>यति, -हर्षितुम्, to be glad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसङ्काश|प्रतिसंकाश|प्रतिसंकाशः
प्रतिसङ्काश प्रति-सङ्काश, अस्, m. a similar<BR>appearance, resemblance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसङ्क्रम्|प्रतिसंक्रम्
प्रतिसङ्क्रम् प्रति-सङ्-क्रम् (-सम्-क्रम्), cl.<BR>1. P. A. -क्रामति, -क्रमते, -क्रमितुम्, to go<BR>back again, return; to cease moving on, come to an<BR>end, cease: Caus. -क्रामयति, -यितुम्, to cause to<BR>go back or return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसङ्क्रम|प्रतिसंक्रम|प्रतिसंक्रमः
प्रति-सङ्क्रम, अस्, m. reabsorption, disso-<BR>lution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसङ्क्रुध्
प्रतिसङ्क्रुध् प्रति-सङ्-क्रुध् (-सम्-क्रुध्),<BR>cl. 4. P. -क्रुध्यति, -क्रोद्धुम्, to be angry with<BR>(with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसङ्क्रुद्ध|प्रतिसंक्रुद्ध
प्रति-सङ्क्रुद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, angry with, wroth<BR>against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसङ्ख्या|प्रतिसंख्या
प्रतिसङ्ख्या 1. प्रति-सङ्-ख्या (-सम्-ख्या),<BR>cl. 2. P. -ख्याति, -ख्यातुम्, Ved. to count or reckon<BR>up, count, number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसङ्ख्या|प्रतिसंख्या
2. प्रति-सङ्ख्या, f. consciousness.<BR>—प्रतिसङ्-<BR>ख्या-निरोध, अस्, m. (with Buddhists) conscious<BR>cessation of existence; wilful destruction of any<BR>existent thing (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसङ्गक्षिका|प्रतिसंगक्षिका
प्रतिसङ्गक्षिका प्रति-सङ्गक्षिका, f. a cloak<BR>to keep off the dust (worn by Buddhist mendicants).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसङ्गिन्|प्रतिसंगिन्
प्रतिसङ्गिन् प्रति-सङ्गिन्, ई, इनी, इ (fr. rt.<BR>सञ्ज् with प्रति), cleaving or clinging to, adhering;<BR>अ-प्रतिसङ्गिन्, not meeting with any obstacle,<BR>irresistible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसङ्ग्रह्|प्रतिसंग्रह्
प्रतिसङ्ग्रह् प्रति-सङ्-ग्रह् (-सम्-ग्रह्), cl.<BR>9. P. A. -गृह्णाति, -गृह्णीते, -ग्रहीतुम्, to re-<BR>ceive, accept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसञ्चर्|प्रतिसंचर्
प्रतिसञ्चर् प्रति-सञ्-चर् (-सम्-चर्), cl. 1.<BR>P. A. -चरति, -ते, -चरितुम्, to come together,<BR>come towards, meet with, meet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसञ्चर|प्रतिसंचर|प्रतिसंचरः
प्रति-सञ्चर, अस्, m. going or moving back-<BR>wards; reabsorption or resolution (back again into<BR>Prakṛti); that into which anything is reabsorbed<BR>or resolved; a place of resort, haunt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसञ्जन्
प्रतिसञ्जन् प्रति-सञ्-जन् (-सम्-जन्), cl. 4.<BR>A. -जायते, -जनितुम्, to be born again, to be born<BR>or produced; to spring up, arise, appear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसञ्जीव्
प्रतिसञ्जीव् प्रति-सञ्-जीव् (-सम्-जीव्), cl. 1.<BR>P. (ep. also A.) -जीवति (-ते), -जीवितुम्, to come to<BR>life again, return to life, revive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसञ्ज्ञा|प्रतिसंज्ञा
प्रतिसञ्ज्ञा प्रति-सञ्-ज्ञा (-सम्-ज्ञा), cl. 9.<BR>P. A. -जानाति, -जानीते, -ज्ञातुम्, Ved. to be friendly<BR>towards, to be kindly disposed towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसदृक्ष
प्रतिसदृक्ष प्रति-सदृक्ष, अस्, ई, अम्, or<BR>प्रति-सदृश्, क्, क्, क्, Ved. similar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसन्दिश्|प्रतिसंदिश्
प्रतिसन्दिश् प्रति-सन्-दिश् (-सम्-दिश्), cl. 6.<BR>P. -दिशति, -देष्टुम्, to give an errand or commis-<BR>sion in return; to send back a message to (with<BR>gen.); to order, command.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0621-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसन्देश|प्रतिसंदेश|प्रतिसंदेशः
प्रति-सन्देश, अस्, m. a message given in return,<BR>tidings in return, an answer to a message.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसन्धा|प्रतिसंधा
प्रतिसन्धा प्रति-सन्-धा (-सम्-धा), cl. 3.<BR>P. A. -दधाति, -धत्ते, -धातुम्, to put together<BR>again, readjust; to put on, fasten; to aim at, direct<BR>against; to give back, replace, restore; to grasp men-<BR>tally, conceive, comprehend, understand; (A.) to com-<BR>pose one's self; to fit an arrow to the bow-string.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंहित
प्रति-संहित, अस्, आ, अम्, aimed at, directed against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसन्धान|प्रतिसंधान|प्रतिसंधानं
प्रति-सन्धान, अम्, n. putting together again,<BR>joining together; a juncture, the period of transition<BR>between two ages; a remedy; self-command, sup-<BR>pression of feeling; praise, panegyric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसन्धि|प्रतिसंधि|प्रतिसंधिः
प्रति-सन्धि, इस्, m. reunion; entering into the<BR>womb [cf. भव-प्˚]; a juncture, the period of<BR>transition between two ages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसन्धेय|प्रतिसंधेय
प्रति-सन्धेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be opposed, re-<BR>sistible; अ-प्रतिसन्धेय, irresistible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसान्धानिक|प्रतिसांधानिक|प्रतिसांधानिकः|प्रतिसान्धानिकः
प्रतिसान्धानिक, अस्, m. (fr. प्रति-सन्धान),<BR>a bard, a panegyrist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसम
प्रतिसम प्रति-सम, अस्, आ, अम्, equal to,<BR>a match for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसमन्तम्
प्रतिसमन्तम् प्रति-समन्तम्, ind., Ved. on<BR>every side, everywhere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसमादिश्
प्रतिसमादिश् प्रति-सम्-आ-दिश्, cl. 6. P. -दि-<BR>शति, -देष्टुम्, to return an answer, reply, answer;<BR>to direct in return; to order, command.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसमादिष्ट
प्रति-समादिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, enjoined, directed,<BR>ordered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसमाधा
प्रतिसमाधा प्रति-सम्-आ-धा, cl. 3. P. A.<BR>-दधाति, -धत्ते, -धातुम्, to put back again,<BR>replace, affix again; to rearrange, readjust; to re-<BR>dress, remedy; to fit an arrow to the bow-string.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसमाधान|प्रतिसमाधानं
प्रति-समाधान, अम्, n. cure, remedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसमास्
प्रतिसमास् प्रति-सम्-आस् (see rt. 4. आस्), cl.<BR>2. A. -आस्ते, -आसितुम्, to be a match for, cope with;<BR>to withstand, resist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसमासन|प्रतिसमासनं
प्रति-समासन, अम्, n. the being a match for,<BR>coping with (with gen.); withstanding, resisting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसमिन्ध्
प्रतिसमिन्ध् प्रति-सम्-इन्ध्, cl. 7. A. -इन्द्-<BR>धे, -इन्धितुम्, to kindle again, rekindle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसमीक्षण
प्रतिसमीक्षण प्रति-समीक्षण, अम्, n. (fr.<BR>rt. ईक्ष् with प्रति-सम्), looking at again, return-<BR>ing a glance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसमुच्
प्रतिसमुच् प्रति-सम्-उच् (?) , cl. 4. A. -उच्यते,<BR>उचितुम्, Ved. to deserve, be worthy of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसम्बुध्
प्रतिसम्बुध् प्रति-सम्-बुध्, cl. 1. P. A., 4.<BR>A. -बोधति, -ते, -बुध्यते, -बोधितुम्, to become<BR>conscious again, recover consciousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसम्बुद्ध|प्रतिसंबुद्ध
प्रति-सम्बुद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, become conscious<BR>again, restored to consciousness, recovered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसम्भू|प्रतिसंभू
प्रतिसम्भू प्रति-सम्-भू, cl. 1. P. -भवति,<BR>-भवितुम्, to apply or give one's self to (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसर|प्रतिसरः
प्रतिसर प्रति-सर. See प्रति-सृ, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसर्ग|प्रतिसर्गः
प्रतिसर्ग प्रति-सर्ग, अस्, m. (fr. rt. सृज्<BR>with प्रति), continued creation out of primitive<BR>matter; secondary creation or the creation of the<BR>world by the agency of Brahmā and other divinities<BR>regarded as the agents of one supreme being; disso-<BR>lution; the portion of a Purāṇa which treats of the<BR>destruction and renovation of the world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसर्गम्
प्रति-सर्गम्, ind. in every creation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसृष्ट|प्रतिसृष्टः
प्रति-सृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, sent, dispatched; given;<BR>celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसव्य|प्रतिसव्यं
प्रतिसव्य प्रति-सव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, in inverted<BR>order, inverted, reverse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसह्
प्रतिसह् प्रति-सह्, cl. 1. A. -सहते, -सहि-<BR>तुम्, -सोढुम्, to sustain, uphold, support.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसान्धानिक|प्रतिसांधानिक|प्रतिसांधानिकः|प्रतिसान्धानिकः
प्रतिसान्धानिक प्रतिसान्धानिक. See under<BR>प्रति-सन्-धा above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसाम
प्रतिसाम प्रति-साम, अस्, आ, अम्, (probably)<BR>unkind, unfriendly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसामन्त|प्रतिसामन्तः
प्रतिसामन्त प्रति-सामन्त, अस्, m. ‘an ad-<BR>verse neighbour,’ an enemy, adversary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसायम्
प्रतिसायम् प्रति-सायम्, ind. towards even-<BR>ing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसीरा
प्रतिसीरा प्रति-सीरा, f. a curtain, a screen<BR>or wall of cloth, an outer tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसूर्य|प्रतिसूर्यः|प्रतिसूर्य्य|प्रतिसूर्य्यः
प्रतिसूर्य प्रति-सूर्य, अस्, m. a mock sun,<BR>parhelion; a kind of lizard, a chameleon (which lies<BR>or basks in the sun); (अम्), ind. opposite to the<BR>sun, in the sun.<BR>—प्रतिसूर्य-शयानक, अस्, m.<BR>‘lying or basking in the sun,’ a kind of lizard, a<BR>chameleon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसूर्यक|प्रतिसूर्यकः|प्रतिसूर्य्यक|प्रतिसूर्य्यकः
प्रति-सूर्यक, अस्, m. = प्रति-सूर्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसृ
प्रतिसृ प्रति-सृ, cl. 1. P. -सरति, -सर्तुम्,<BR>to go towards, go back, [only used in Caus.]: Caus.<BR>P. -सारयति, -यितुम्, to cause to go back; to<BR>remove, replace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसर|प्रतिसरः
प्रति-सर, अस्, आ, अम्, going towards; dependent,<BR>subject; (अस्, अम्), m. n. a cord or ribbon used<BR>as an amulet worn round the neck or wrist at nup-<BR>tials &c.; an ornament, adorning; a watch, guard,<BR>ward; the junction of an elephant's frontal sinuses (?);<BR>(अस्), m. a follower, servant; a bracelet; a wreath,<BR>garland; a form of magic or incantation; the rear<BR>of an army; day-break; cicatrizing or healing (as a<BR>sore); (आ), f. a female servant; a thread, fillet, ribbon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसरण|प्रतिसरणं
प्रति-सरण, अम्, n. leaning on, resting upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसर्य|प्रतिसर्य्य
प्रति-सर्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. (according to Mahī-<BR>dhara) present in the cord used as an amulet, present<BR>at an incantation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसारण|प्रतिसारणं
प्रति-सारण, अम्, n. dressing or anointing the<BR>edges of a wound; an instrument used for anointing<BR>a wound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसारणीय
प्रति-सारणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be dressed or<BR>anointed (as a wound).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसारित
प्रति-सारित, अस्, आ, अम्, repelled, repulsed; re-<BR>moved; dressed (as a wound).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसारिन्
प्रति-सारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, going round, going from<BR>one to another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसृष्ट|प्रतिसृष्टः
प्रतिसृष्ट प्रति-सृष्ट. See प्रति-सर्ग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसेना
प्रतिसेना प्रति-सेना, f. an opposing or hos-<BR>tile army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसोमा
प्रतिसोमा प्रति-सोमा, f. a kind of plant<BR>(= महिष-वल्ली).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्कन्ध
प्रतिस्कन्ध प्रति-स्कन्ध, अस्, m. every<BR>shoulder; N. of an attendant of Skanda; (अम्), ind.<BR>upon the shoulders.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्कॄ
प्रतिस्कॄ प्रति-स्-कॄ (प्रति-कॄ with स् in-<BR>serted), cl. 6. P. A. -किरति, -ते, -करितुम्, -करीतुम्,<BR>to hurt, injure; [cf. प्रति-कॄ.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्कीर्ण
प्रति-स्-कीर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, hurt, injured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्तब्ध
प्रतिस्तब्ध प्रति-स्तब्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, stopped,<BR>restrained; stupefied; propped up, stayed, supported;<BR>[cf. प्रति-ष्टब्ध.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्त्री
प्रतिस्त्री प्रति-स्त्री, ईस्, ईस्, इ, Ved. lying on<BR>a woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्थानम्
प्रतिस्थानम् प्रति-स्थानम्, ind. in every<BR>place, everywhere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्नात
प्रतिस्नात प्रति-स्नात, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. स्ना<BR>with प्रति), bathed, washed; [cf. प्रति-ष्णात.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्नेह|प्रतिस्नेहः
प्रतिस्नेह प्रति-स्नेह, अस्, m. love in return,<BR>requital of love, mutual love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्पन्दन|प्रतिस्पंदन|प्रतिस्पंदनं
प्रतिस्पन्दन प्रति-स्पन्दन, अम्, n. (fr. rt.<BR>स्पन्द् with प्रति), throbbing, vibration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्पर्धा
प्रतिस्पर्धा प्रति-स्पर्धा, f. (fr. rt. स्पर्ध्<BR>with प्रति), emulation, rivalry, the wish or effort to<BR>excel or overcome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्पर्धिन्
प्रति-स्पर्धिन्, ई, इनी, इ, emulous, a rival, en-<BR>vious; refractory, rebellious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्पश
प्रतिस्पश प्रति-स्पश, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. 1. पश्<BR>with प्रति), Ved. spying, watching, lying in wait.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्पशान
प्रति-स्पशान, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. = प्रति-स्पश.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्मृ
प्रतिस्मृ प्रति-स्मृ, cl. 1. P. -स्मरति, -स्मर्-<BR>तुम्, to remember again, recall to memory, remem-<BR>ber, recollect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्मृति|प्रतिस्मृतिः
प्रति-स्मृति, इस्, f. recollection; epithet of a par-<BR>ticular kind of magic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्याय
प्रतिस्याय प्रति-स्याय, a wrong form for<BR>प्रति-श्याय, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्रोतस्
प्रतिस्रोतस् प्रति-स्रोतस्, ind. against the<BR>stream, up the stream; (sometimes wrongly spelt<BR>प्रति-श्रोतस्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्वर|प्रतिस्वरः
प्रतिस्वर प्रति-स्वर, अस्, m. a reverberated<BR>sound, echo, reverberation; a focus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहन्
प्रतिहन् प्रति-हन्, cl. 2. P. -हन्ति, -हन्तुम्,<BR>to strike in return, strike back, ward off, keep off; to<BR>drive back, repel; to remove; to oppose, resist; to<BR>prevent; to disown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहत|प्रतिहतः
प्रति-हत, अस्, आ, अम्, struck in return, struck<BR>back, beaten back, knocked back, hurt, killed;<BR>repulsed, repelled; opposed, obstructed; averted;<BR>reflected; fallen, overthrown; hated, disliked; dis-<BR>appointed; sent, dispatched; tied, bound.<BR>—प्रति-<BR>हत-धी, ईस्, ईस्, इ, hostile-minded, having hostile<BR>intentions.<BR>—प्रतिहत-मति, इस्, इस्, इ, adverse-<BR>minded, averse from, hating, disliking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहति|प्रतिहतिः
प्रति-हति, इस्, f. beating back, beating again;<BR>repulse, recoil, rebound; disappointment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहनन|प्रतिहननं
प्रति-हनन, अम्, n. striking back, hitting again,<BR>striking in return, returning a blow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहन्तव्य
प्रति-हन्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be opposed or<BR>resisted, opposable, resistible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहन्तृ
प्रति-हन्तृ, ता, m. one who strikes in return, a<BR>revenger, avenger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहन्यमान
प्रति-हन्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being struck back<BR>or hit again; being foiled or disappointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहरण|प्रतिहरणं
प्रतिहरण प्रति-हरण, अम्, n. (fr. rt. हृ<BR>with प्रति), throwing back, striking back, repelling<BR>(Ved.); avoiding, shunning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहर्तृ|प्रतिहर्त्तृ
प्रति-हर्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who draws back,<BR>drawing in, absorbing; dissolving, destroying; one<BR>who keeps or wards off, an averter; epithet of one<BR>of the sixteen priests, the assistant of the Ud-gātṛ<BR>[cf. ऋत्व्-इज्, प्रति-हार]; N. of a prince, son of<BR>Prati-hāra or of Pratīha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहार|प्रतिहारः
प्रति-हार, अस्, m. striking against, striking back,<BR>pushing or thrusting back; (in grammar) the hard<BR>contact of the tongue with the edge of the teeth in<BR>the pronunciation of the dental letters; an epithet of<BR>particular syllables in the Sāma hymns with which<BR>the Prati-hartṛ begins to join in the singing (gene-<BR>rally at the beginning of the last Pada of a verse);<BR>N. of a particular magical formula; (that which<BR>keeps back) a door, gate; a door-keeper, porter; a<BR>juggler; juggling, trick, disguise; N. of a prince,<BR>son of Parameṣṭhin; N. of a particular form of<BR>alliance; (ई), f. a female door-keeper, portress; (औ),<BR>m. du. two door-keepers, i. e. two statues at the<BR>entrance of a temple; (in several of the above senses<BR>this word is also spelt प्रती-हार.)<BR>—प्रतिहार-प,<BR>अस्, m. a door-keeper, porter.<BR>—प्रतिहार-भूमि,<BR>इस्, f. ‘door-place,’ a threshold.<BR>—प्रतिहार-रक्षी,<BR>f. a female door-keeper, portress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहारक|प्रतिहारकः
प्रति-हारक, अस्, m. a juggler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहारण|प्रतिहारणं
प्रति-हारण, अम्, n. entrance, permission to<BR>enter a door.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहार्य|प्रतिहार्यं
प्रति-हार्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be pushed or thrust<BR>back, to be repelled, resistible; (अम्), n. juggling,<BR>jugglery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहर्य्
प्रतिहर्य् प्रति-हर्य्, cl. 1. P. -हर्यति, -हर्-<BR>यितुम्, Ved. to desire, love (Sāy. = कम् or प्रत्य्-<BR>एकं कम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहर्षण
प्रतिहर्षण प्रति-हर्षण, अम्, n. (fr. rt.<BR>हृष् with प्रति), causing joy in return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहस्त|प्रतिहस्तः
प्रतिहस्त प्रति-हस्त or प्रति-हस्तक, अस्,<BR>m. a deputy, substitute, proxy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0622-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहस्तिन्
प्रति-हस्तिन्, ई, m. the keeper of a house of<BR>ill fame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहस्ति
प्रतिहस्ति प्रति-हस्ति, ind. towards the ele-<BR>phants, in the direction of the elephants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहास|प्रतिहासः
प्रतिहास प्रति-हास or प्रती-हास, अस्, m.<BR>(fr. rt. हस् with प्रति), returning a laugh, laughing<BR>with or at; fragrant oleander, Nerium Odorum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहिंस्
प्रतिहिंस् प्रति-हिंस्, cl. 7. 1. P. -हिनस्ति,<BR>-हिंसति, -हिंसितुम्, to injure in return, retaliate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहिंसा
प्रति-हिंसा, f. retaliation, revenge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहिंसित|प्रतिहिंसितं
प्रति-हिंसित, अस्, आ, अम्, injured in return or by<BR>way of revenge; (अम्), n. requital of an injury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहित
प्रतिहित प्रति-हित, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. प्रति-<BR>धा), put close to, placed in, fitted to (the bow-string<BR>as an arrow).<BR>—प्रतिहितेषु (˚त-इषु), उस्, उस्, उ,<BR>one who has fitted an arrow to (the bow-string).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहितायिन्
प्रतिहितायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, Ved. one who has fitted<BR>an arrow to (the bow-string; cf. आततायिन्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहिति
प्रति-हिति, इस्, f. fitting an arrow to (the bow-<BR>string).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहृदयम्
प्रतिहृदयम् प्रति-हृदयम्, ind. in every<BR>heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिह्रास
प्रतिह्रास प्रति-ह्रास, अस्, m. (rt. ह्रस्), Ved.<BR>shortening, abbreviation, abridgment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिह्वर
प्रतिह्वर प्रति-ह्वर, अस्, m., Ved. the rising<BR>slope or vault (of the sky), a sloping side; (Sāy.<BR>प्रतिह्वरे = समीपे.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रती
प्रती प्रती (प्रति-इ; see rt. 5. इ), cl. 2. P.<BR>प्रत्य्-एति, -एतुम्, to go towards, come towards, go to;<BR>to go back, come back, return; to approach, turn to,<BR>betake one's self to; to fall to the lot or share of;<BR>to reach, attain; to observe, learn exactly, convince<BR>one's self (of the truth of anything); to be con-<BR>vinced, become certain of, give credence to, believe:<BR>Pass. प्रतीयते, to be observed or recognised; to<BR>follow from anything (as a necessary result); to be<BR>proved, turn out to be true: Caus. प्रत्य्-आययति,<BR>-यितुम्, to cause to go towards; to convince (any<BR>one of the truth of anything), produce confidence,<BR>cause to believe; to cause to think of or observe,<BR>bring to mind; to show anything in its true light,<BR>make clear, prove; to cause to recognise or acknow-<BR>ledge: Desid. प्रतीषिषति, to wish or try to<BR>understand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीत|प्रतीतः
प्रतीत, अस्, आ, अम्, set forth, started, gone away;<BR>gone by, gone, past; acknowledged, proved, esta-<BR>blished, true; believed, trusted; experienced, known,<BR>well-known, famous, celebrated, renowned; called,<BR>(श्याम इति प्रतीतः, known by the name of Ś.);<BR>convinced (of the truth of anything), having a firm<BR>conviction; firmly resolved, fully determined; trusting,<BR>believing; satisfied, glad, pleased, delighted; respect-<BR>ful; clever, wise; (अस्), m. a divinity enumerated<BR>among the Viśve Devāḥ.<BR>—प्रतीत-सेन, अस्, m., N.<BR>of a prince.<BR>—प्रतीताक्षरा (˚त-अक्˚), f. ‘having<BR>trustworthy expressions,’ N. of a commentary on the<BR>Mitākṣarā.<BR>—प्रतीतार्थ (˚त-अर्˚), अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>having a recognised or acknowledged meaning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीति|प्रतीतिः
प्रतीति, इस्, f. going towards, approaching, drawing<BR>near; clear apprehension or insight into anything,<BR>definite perception, clear notion, distinct conception;<BR>complete understanding or ascertainment, knowledge,<BR>experience; conviction; faith, belief; trust, credit;<BR>fame, notoriety; respect; delight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीयमान
प्रतीयमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being trusted or be-<BR>lieved, admitted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीयिवस्
प्रतीयिवस्, वान्, -युषी, वत्, one who has come<BR>back, returned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यय|प्रत्ययः
प्रत्य्-अय, अस्, m. belief, firm conviction, trust,<BR>faith, reliance, assurance, confidence (प्रत्ययं<BR>गम्, to acquire confidence, repose confidence in;<BR>अस्त्य् अत्र प्रत्ययो मम, that is my conviction;<BR>कः प्रत्ययो ऽत्र, what assurance is there of<BR>that?); certainty, ascertainment; knowledge, expe-<BR>rience; apprehension, understanding, intellect (in the<BR>Sāṅkhya phil. = बुद्धि); acceptation, idea, notion,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">Page0623-b+ 78</a>]<BR>conception; ground, motive; (with Buddhists) a co-<BR>operating cause, the concurrent occasion of an event as<BR>distinguished from its proximate cause; an instrument,<BR>means of agency; an assistant, associate; celebrity,<BR>fame; analysis (?); definition (?); (in Ved. gram.) a<BR>subsequent or following letter; (according to native lexi-<BR>cographers) an oath, ordeal; a dependent, a subject;<BR>usage, custom, practice; religious contemplation; a<BR>householder who keeps a sacred fire; a hole.<BR>—प्र-<BR>त्यय-कारक, अस्, इका, अम्, producing assurance,<BR>awakening confidence.<BR>—प्रत्यय-कारिन्, ई, इणी, इ,<BR>causing confidence; (इणी), f. ‘producing assurance,’<BR>a seal, signet.<BR>—प्रत्यय-त्व, अम्, n. the being a<BR>cause, causality.<BR>—प्रत्यय-सर्ग, अस्, m. (in the<BR>Sāṅkhya phil.) the intellectual creation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्ययन
प्रत्य्-अयन, see Gaṇa Gotrādi to Pāṇ. VIII. 1,<BR>27, 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्ययिक
प्रत्ययिक, अस्, आ, अम्, (at the end of a comp.)<BR>resting or depending upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्ययित|प्रत्ययितः
प्रत्य्-अयित, अस्, आ, अम्, confided in, relied upon,<BR>trusted, trusty, confidential.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्ययिन्
प्रत्ययिन्, ई, इनी, इ, deserving trust or confi-<BR>dence, trustworthy; having faith in, trusting, be-<BR>lieving, relying upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याय|प्रत्यायः
प्रत्य्-आय, अस्, m. revenue, tax, toll, tribute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यायक
प्रत्य्-आयक, अस्, इका, अम्, producing assurance,<BR>proving, making intelligible or clear, explaining,<BR>elucidating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यायन|प्रत्यायनं
2. प्रत्य्-आयन, अम्, n. (for 2. see under प्रत्य्-ए),<BR>leading home (a wife), marrying (?); (अम्, आ), n. f.<BR>producing assurance, proving, demonstrating, making<BR>clear or intelligible, analyzing, explaining, expounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यायित|प्रत्यायितः
प्रत्य्-आयित, अस्, m. a confidential agent, com-<BR>missioned servant, commissioner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यायितव्य
प्रत्य्-आयितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be proved, to be<BR>made clear or intelligible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्येतव्य
प्रत्य्-एतव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be acknowledged or<BR>admitted; to be relied on or believed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्येतृ
प्रत्य्-एतृ, ता, त्री, तृ, believing, trusting, having<BR>confidence, a believer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक|प्रतीकः
प्रतीक प्रतीक. See under प्रत्य्-अञ्च्,<BR>p. 625, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीकार|प्रतीकारः
प्रतीकार प्रती-कार, अस्, m. = प्रति-कार,<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीकार्य
प्रती-कार्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be retaliated upon,<BR>to be made an object of revenge, fit to be revenged;<BR>to be opposed or resisted, opposable, resistible; to<BR>be prevented or remedied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीकाश|प्रतीकाशः
प्रतीकाश प्रती-काश (also wrongly spelt<BR>प्रती-कास)= प्रति-काश, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्ष्
प्रतीक्ष् प्रतीक्ष् (प्रति-ईक्ष्), cl. 1. A.<BR>-ईक्षते, -ईक्षितुम्, to look towards, look at, ob-<BR>serve; to look forward to, look out for, expect; to<BR>wait, await, wait for; to look at with indifference,<BR>wink at, bear with, tolerate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्ष
प्रतीक्ष, अस्, आ, अम्, looking forward to, ex-<BR>pecting, expectant, waiting for; having regard to,<BR>paying attention to; (आ), f. looking to, looking at,<BR>regard, consideration, attention, respect; waiting for,<BR>expectation, hope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्षक
प्रतीक्षक, अस्, आ, अम्, looking at; looking<BR>forward to, looking out for, expecting, waiting for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्षण
प्रतीक्षण, अम्, n. looking to, looking at,<BR>observing, considering, referring to; respecting, re-<BR>spect or regard for; expecting, waiting for; observ-<BR>ing, preserving, fulfilment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्षणीय
प्रतीक्षणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be looked at, to<BR>be had in view, to be considered or regarded; to be<BR>looked out for, to be waited for or expected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्षम्
प्रतीक्षम्, ind. having expected (at the end<BR>of comps.; cf. शरत्-प्˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्षित
प्रतीक्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, looked for, looked out<BR>for, waited for, expected, hoped; contemplated, con-<BR>sidered, regarded; respected, honoured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्षिन्
प्रतीक्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ, looking or waiting for, ex-<BR>pecting, awaiting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्ष्य|प्रतीक्ष्यः
1. प्रतीक्ष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be looked at, to be<BR>considered or regarded, worthy of consideration;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">Page0623-c+ 74</a>]<BR>respectable, venerable; to be looked forward to or<BR>expected, to be waited for; to be upheld or main-<BR>tained, to be fulfilled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्ष्य|प्रतीक्ष्यः
2. प्रतीक्ष्य, ind. having looked at, having con-<BR>sidered, having expected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक्ष्यमाण
प्रतीक्ष्यमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, being looked at,<BR>being an object of observation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीघात|प्रतीघातः
प्रतीघात प्रती-घात, अस्, आ, अम्, warding<BR>off, parrying (= प्रति-घात, q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीघातिन्
प्रती-घातिन्, ई, इनी, इ, presenting obstacles, hin-<BR>dering; अ-प्रतीघातिन्, unhindered, unimpeded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीची
प्रतीची प्रतीची, प्रतीचीन, &c. See under<BR>प्रत्य्-अञ्च्, p. 625, cols. 1, 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीच्छक|प्रतीच्छकः
प्रतीच्छक प्रतीच्छक. See 1. प्रतीष्, p. 624.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीड्
प्रतीड् प्रतीड् (प्रति-ईड्), cl. 2. A. -ईट्टे,<BR>ईडितुम्, Ved. to praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीत|प्रतीतः
प्रतीत प्रतीत, &c. See under प्रती, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीतोद
प्रतीतोद प्रती-तोद, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 1. तुद्<BR>with प्रति), a term applied to particular initial forms<BR>of Padas in hymns.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीत्त
प्रतीत्त प्रती-त्त, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. प्रति-दा, q. v.),<BR>given back, in अ-प्˚, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीदर्श
प्रतीदर्श प्रती-दर्श, अस्, m. (fr. प्रति-दृश्;<BR>cf. प्रति-दर्श), Ved., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीनाह|प्रतीनाहः
प्रतीनाह प्रती-नाह, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 1. नह्<BR>with प्रति), Ved. obstruction [cf. कर्ण-प्˚, नासा-<BR>प्˚]; a flag, banner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीन्धक|प्रतींधक|प्रतींधकः|प्रतीन्धकः
प्रतीन्धक प्रतीन्धक, अस्, m. (fr. rt. इन्ध्<BR>with प्रति), N. of a prince of Videha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीन्व्
प्रतीन्व् प्रतीन्व् (प्रति-इन्व्), cl. 1. P. -इन्वति,<BR>-इन्वितुम्, Ved. to promote, advance; to present,<BR>offer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीप|प्रतीपं|प्रतीपः
प्रतीप प्रतीप, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. प्रति + अप्;<BR>cf. अनूप, द्वीप, समीप), ‘against the stream,’<BR>‘against the grain,’ going in an opposite direction,<BR>adverse, contrary, opposite, opposed, contradictory,<BR>reverse; inverted, disordered, out of order; dis-<BR>pleasing, offensive, disagreeable; resisting, perverse,<BR>refractory, disobedient, cross, obstinate; impeding,<BR>hindering; meeting, encountering; backward, retro-<BR>grade, going back; turned away, averted; (अस्), m.,<BR>N. of a prince the father of Śāntanu and grand-<BR>father of Bhīṣma; (अम्), n. inverse comparison as<BR>a figure of speech (e. g. ‘the lotus resembles thine<BR>eyes,’ or ‘the moon resembles thy face,’ instead of the<BR>usual comparison — ‘thine eyes resemble the lotus,’<BR>‘thy face resembles the moon;’ five forms are enu-<BR>merated); N. of a grammatical work; (अम्), ind.<BR>against the stream, backwards; against; in inverted<BR>order; [cf. Russ. protiv, ‘against;’ protivnüi, ‘con-<BR>trary.’]<BR>—प्रतीप-ग, अस्, आ, अम्, going against, flow-<BR>ing backwards.<BR>—प्रतीप-गति, इस्, f. or प्रतीप-ग-<BR>मन, अम्, n. a retrograde movement.<BR>—प्रतीप-<BR>गामिन्, ई, इनी, इ, going against, acting in contravention<BR>to.<BR>—प्रतीप-तरण, अम्, n. sailing against the<BR>stream, crossing over (against) the stream.<BR>—प्रतीप-<BR>दर्शिनी, f. ‘looking in an opposite direction,’ ‘turning<BR>away the face,’ a woman; (also spelt प्रतीप-दर्-<BR>शनी.)<BR>—प्रतीप-वचन, अम्, n. contradicting, con-<BR>tradiction; a perverse or evasive manner, speaking to<BR>a third person without answering a previous speaker.<BR>—प्रतीपाश्व (˚प-अश्˚), अस्, m., N. of a prince;<BR>(also read प्रतीकाश्व, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीपक
प्रतीपक, अस्, आ, अम्, opposed to, hindering,<BR>hostile; (अस्), m., N. of a prince.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीपय
प्रतीपय, Nom. P. प्रतीपयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>oppose one's self to, to be against or hostile to (with<BR>loc.); to cause to turn back, cause to return, to<BR>bring back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीपाय
प्रतीपाय, Nom. A. प्रतीपायते, -यितुम्, to<BR>oppose one's self to, to be against a person (with<BR>gen.); to be unfavourable to, dislike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीपिन्
प्रतीपिन्, ई, इनी, इ, unfavourable, to, unkind<BR>towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0623-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीबोध
प्रतीबोध प्रती-बोध, अस्, m. (fr. प्रति-<BR>बुध्), Ved. watchfulness, vigilance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीमान
प्रतीमान प्रती-मान, अम्, n. a measure of<BR>capacity (= प्रति-मान, q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीयमान
प्रतीयमान प्रतीयमान. See प्रती, p. 623.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीर्
प्रतीर् प्रतीर् (प्रति-ईर्), Caus. P. -ईरयति,<BR>-यितुम्, Ved. to put on, fix on (Sāy. = प्रति-धा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीर|प्रतीरं
प्रतीर प्र-तीर, अस्, m., N. of one of the<BR>sons of Manu Bhautya; (अम्), n. a shore, bank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीराध
प्रतीराध प्रती-राध = प्रति-राध, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीवर्त
प्रतीवर्त प्रती-वर्त, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. प्रति-<BR>वृत्), Ved. circular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीवाप|प्रतीवापः
प्रतीवाप प्रती-वाप, अस्, m. (fr. प्रति-वप्),<BR>inserting (as an ingredient); adding to (especially<BR>in mixing medicines); throwing into; calcining or<BR>fluxing metals; an epidemic disease, pestilence,<BR>plague.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीवाह
प्रतीवाह प्रती-वाह, अस्, m. (fr. rt. वह् with<BR>प्रति), Ved. harnessed or yoked at the side (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीवी
प्रतीवी प्रती-वी, ईस्, ईस्, इ, Ved. receiving,<BR>accepting with pleasure; (ईस्), m. f. acceptance;<BR>(Sāy.) = यज्ञ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीवेश|प्रतीवेशः
प्रतीवेश प्रती-वेश, अस्, m. = प्रति-वेश,<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीवेशिन्
प्रती-वेशिन्, ई, इनी, इ, = प्रति-वेशिन्, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीष्
प्रतीष् 1. प्रतीष् (प्रति-इष्; see rt. 3. इष्),<BR>cl. 6. P. प्रतीच्छति, प्रत्य्-एषितुम्, प्रत्य्-एष्टुम्,<BR>to strive after, seek (Ved.); to receive; to receive<BR>(a command), follow, attend to, observe, obey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीच्छक|प्रतीच्छकः
प्रतीच्छक, अस्, m. one who receives, a receiver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीष्य
प्रतीष्य, ind., Ved. striving after, seeking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीष्
प्रतीष् 2. प्रतीष् (प्रति-ईष्, see rt. ईष्),<BR>cl. 1. A. प्रतीषते, प्रतीषितुम्, to stretch out<BR>towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीह
प्रतीह प्रतीह, अस्, m. (fr. rt. ईह् with प्रति),<BR>N. of a prince, a son of Parameṣṭhin; (also read<BR>प्रति-हार.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीहार|प्रतीहारः
प्रतीहार प्रती-हार, अस्, m. = प्रति-हार,<BR>q. v.<BR>—प्रतीहार-ता, f. or प्रतीहार-त्व, अम्, n.<BR>the office of porter, duty of gate-keeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीहास|प्रतीहासः
प्रतीहास प्रती-हास, अस्, m. fragrant ole-<BR>ander, Nerium Odorum (= प्रति-हास).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतुद्
प्रतुद् प्र-तुद्, cl. 6. P. A. -तुदति, -ते,<BR>-तोत्तुम्, to strike at, strike, cut, pierce: Caus. -तो-<BR>दयति, -यितुम्, to pierce; to push on, instigate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतुद|प्रतुदः
प्र-तुद, अस्, m. ‘pecker,’ epithet of a class<BR>of birds (including the falcon, hawk, owl, parrot,<BR>crow, raven, peacock, &c.); an instrument for<BR>pricking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतोद|प्रतोदः
प्र-तोद, अस्, m. a goad; a long whip; an in-<BR>strument of torment; अङ्गिरसाम् प्रतोदः and<BR>कश्यपस्य प्रतोदः, N. of two Sāmans.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतोदिन्
प्र-तोदिन्, ई, इनी, इ, striking; piercing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतुष्
प्रतुष् प्र-तुष्, cl. 4. P. -तुष्यति, -तोष्टुम्,<BR>to delight in, take pleasure in (with inst.): Caus. P.<BR>-तोषयति, -यितुम्, to give pleasure, gratify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतुष्टि|प्रतुष्टिः
प्र-तुष्टि, इस्, f. gratifying, satisfying, satisfaction.<BR>—प्रतुष्टि-द, अस्, आ, अम्, giving satisfaction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतोष|प्रतोषः
प्र-तोष, अस्, m. ‘gratification,’ N. of one of the<BR>twelve sons of Manu Svāyambhuva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतुष्टुषु
प्रतुष्टुषु प्र-तुष्टुषु. See under प्र-स्तु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतूणी
प्रतूणी प्र-तूणी, f. a kind of nervous<BR>disease (in which pain is felt to extend itself from<BR>the rectum and organs of generation towards the<BR>bowels; in the disease called तूणी the pain takes an<BR>opposite direction, whence perhaps प्र-तूणी is an<BR>incorrect form for प्रति-तूणी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतूर्ण
प्रतूर्ण प्र-तूर्ण, प्र-तूर्त, &c. See under<BR>प्र-त्वर्, p. 629, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतृद्
प्रतृद् 1. प्र-तृद्, cl. 7. P. A. -तृणत्ति,<BR>तृन्त्ते, -तर्दितुम्, Ved. to thrust through with a<BR>spit, spit, pierce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतृद्
2. प्र-तृद्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. splitting up, piercing; (त्),<BR>m. an expression substituted for the name of Tṛtsu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतृप्
प्रतृप् प्र-तृप्, Caus. P. -तर्पयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to satisfy, sate, satiate; to refresh, invigorate,<BR>strengthen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतॄ
प्रतॄ प्र-तॄ, cl. 1. P. (ep. also A.), 6. P.<BR>-तरति (-ते), -तिरति, -तरितुम्, -तरीतुम्, to cross<BR>over, pass over, be ferried across; to come for-<BR>wards, advance, thrive, prosper (Ved.); to lead for-<BR>wards, lead, conduct; to promote, further, cause to<BR>thrive or prosper; to augment, aggrandize, enhance,<BR>raise, elevate; to lengthen, prolong, extend (fre-<BR>quently with आयुस्, in the sense of ‘prolonging<BR>life’); (A. with आयुस्), to live longer: Caus. -तार-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to lengthen, spread, extend; to mis-<BR>lead, misguide, cheat, deceive; to lead astray, seduce;<BR>to induce, persuade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतार|प्रतारः
प्र-तार, अस्, m. ferrying over or across, carrying<BR>over; crossing over; deception, deceit, fraud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतारक|प्रतारकः
प्र-तारक, अस्, इका, अम्, deceiving, deceitful,<BR>cheating, imposing upon, insidious, perfidious; a<BR>deceiver, cheat, impostor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतारण|प्रतारणं
प्र-तारण, अम्, n. ferrying over or across, car-<BR>rying over, crossing over; deceiving, cheating, over-<BR>reaching, deception, deceit, fraud, trick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतारणीय
प्र-तारणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be deceived or mis-<BR>led, to be cheated (= वञ्चनीय), deceivable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतारित|प्रतारितः
प्र-तारित, अस्, आ, अम्, deceived, misled, cheated,<BR>imposed upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतोद|प्रतोदः
प्रतोद प्र-तोद. See under प्र-तुद्, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतोली
प्रतोली प्र-तोली, f. a broad way, high<BR>street, principal road through a town or village; a<BR>kind of bandage applied to the neck and to the penis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतोलिका
प्र-तोलिका, f. an upper room (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतोलीक
प्रतोलीक, अस्, आ, अम्, (at the end of a comp.)<BR>having a high street.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्त|प्रत्तं
प्रत्त प्र-त्त, &c. See under प्र-दा, p. 630.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्न|प्रत्नः
प्रत्न प्रत्न, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. 1. प्र), former,<BR>preceding, anterior; old, primeval, ancient; hitherto<BR>prevalent, traditional, customary; (अम्), n. a kind<BR>of metre.<BR>—प्रत्न-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. containing<BR>the word प्रत्न; (वत्), ind. as formerly, in the<BR>usual manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्नथा
प्रत्न-था, ind., Ved. as formerly, as of old, in<BR>the usual manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यंशु
प्रत्यंशु प्रत्य्-अंशु, उस्, m., see Scholiast to<BR>Pāṇ. VI. 2, 193.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्
प्रत्यक् प्रत्यक्. See under प्रत्य्-अञ्च्, p. 625,<BR>col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्ष|प्रत्यक्षं
प्रत्यक्ष प्रत्य्-अक्ष, अस्, आ, अम्, perceptible<BR>to the eye, being present before the eyes, in sight,<BR>perceptible, sensible, cognizable by any of the organs<BR>of sense (opposed to परोऽक्ष, q. v.); clear, dis-<BR>tinct, evident, undoubted, express, explicit, actual,<BR>real; corporeal; immediate; having before the eyes,<BR>keeping in view, discerning; (अम्), n. perceptibility,<BR>ocular evidence, clearness, distinctness, explicitness;<BR>superintendence; (in philosophy) apprehension by the<BR>senses, sensation, perception, intuition; (in rhetoric)<BR>a kind of style descriptive of impressions derived from<BR>the senses; (अम्, आत्, एण), ind. before the eyes, in<BR>the sight of; with direct personal knowledge, dis-<BR>tinctly, clearly; in the face of, in the presence of,<BR>before; publicly; immediately, directly, explicitly,<BR>really; literally; personally; at first sight, at sight;<BR>(ए), ind. in the sight of, before the eyes of.<BR>—प्रत्य्-<BR>अक्ष-कृता, f., Ved., scil. ऋक्, a hymn or verse in<BR>which a deity is addressed directly or in the second<BR>person (e. g. O Indra, thou &c.).<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-<BR>खण्ड, अस्, अम्, m. n., N. of the first part of the<BR>Tattva-cintā-maṇi a Nyāya work by Gaṅgeśa.<BR>—प्र-<BR>त्यक्ष-ज्ञान, अम्, n. knowledge obtained by per-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-c" target="_blank">Page0624-c+ 78</a>]<BR>ception.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-तमाम् or प्रत्यक्ष-त-<BR>मात्, ind., Ved. most perceptibly; most directly; most<BR>evidently.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-तस्, ind. before the eyes,<BR>in presence of, visibly, perceptibly, (प्रत्यक्षतः<BR>श्रुतम्, heard perceptibly or with the ears); evi-<BR>dently, clearly, plainly.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-ता, f. or प्र-<BR>त्यक्ष-त्व, अम्, n. visibility, perceptibility, per-<BR>ception by the senses, ocular demonstration; the<BR>standing face to face; explicitness; addressing in<BR>the second person (Ved.); प्रत्यक्षतया, visibly.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-दर्शन, अम्, n. seeing with one's<BR>own eyes, witnessing or seeing in person; the power<BR>of discerning the godhead present (in the sacrifice);<BR>(अस्), m. an eye-witness, witness.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-<BR>दर्शिन्, ई, इनी, इ, seeing with one's own eyes, one who<BR>has seen with his own eyes, an eye-witness.<BR>—प्रत्य्-<BR>अक्ष-दर्शिवस्, आन्, m. one who has seen anything<BR>with his own eyes, an eye-witness; seeing anything<BR>clearly as if before the eyes.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-दृश्, क्,<BR>क्, क्, seeing distinctly, one who sees anything clearly<BR>as if before the eyes.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-दृश्य, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, to be seen with the eyes, visible, per-<BR>ceptible.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-दृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, seen<BR>with the eyes.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-परीक्षण, अम्, n.<BR>real observation or examination.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-<BR>प्रमा, f. correct or certain knowledge obtained<BR>through the senses.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-प्रमाण, अम्, n.<BR>ocular or visible proof, the evidence of the senses;<BR>an organ or faculty of perception.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-<BR>फल, अम्, n. a visible consequence.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-<BR>बृहती, f., Ved. a real or original Bṛhatī, an<BR>evident Bṛhatī.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-भक्ष, अस्, m.,<BR>Ved. real or actual eating.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-भूत, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, become visible, manifested.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-<BR>भोग, अस्, m. enjoyment or use of anything in the<BR>presence of or with the knowledge of the owner.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-वादिन्, ई, इनी, इ, ‘asserting percep-<BR>tion by the senses,’ one who admits of no other<BR>evidence than perception by the senses; (ई), m. a<BR>Buddhist.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-विहित, अस्, आ, अम्, expressly<BR>enjoined.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-वृत्ति, इस्, इस्, इ, having a<BR>form which is visible to the eye; composed clearly<BR>or intelligibly.<BR>—प्रत्यक्ष-सिद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>determined by the evidence of the senses.<BR>—प्रत्य्-<BR>अक्षी-करण, अम्, n. looking at, viewing; making<BR>manifest or apparent.<BR>—प्रत्यक्षी-कृ, cl. 8. P. A.<BR>-करोति, -कुरुते, -कर्तुम्, to make visible or evident;<BR>to inspect, look at with one's own eyes, see.<BR>—प्रत्य्-<BR>अक्षी-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, seen with the eyes; made<BR>present or visible; manifested, displayed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षय
प्रत्यक्षय, Nom. P. प्रत्यक्षयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to make visible or perceptible, manifest, display.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षिन्
प्रत्यक्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ, seeing or perceiving with<BR>one's own eyes, perceiving by the senses, witnessing<BR>in person; (ई), m. an eye-witness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षरम्
प्रत्यक्षरम् प्रत्य्-अक्षरम्, ind. at each syl-<BR>lable, syllable by syllable, letter by letter, literally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यग्नि
प्रत्यग्नि प्रत्य्-अग्नि, ind. towards the fire;<BR>at or near or in every fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यग्र|प्रत्यग्रः
प्रत्यग्र प्रत्य्-अग्र, अस्, आ, अम्, fresh, recent,<BR>new, young; repeated, reiterated; pure (अस्),<BR>m., N. of a son of Vasu Upari-cara and prince<BR>of the Cedis.<BR>—प्रत्यग्र-क्षरत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्,<BR>fresh-flowing, flowing freshly.<BR>—प्रत्यग्र-गन्धा,<BR>f. a species of shrub, Rhinacanthus Communis.<BR>—प्रत्यग्र-ता, f. or प्रत्यग्र-त्व, अम्, n. new-<BR>ness, freshness.<BR>—प्रत्यग्र-प्रसवा, f. recently<BR>delivered, having lately brought forth.<BR>—प्रत्यग्र-<BR>वयस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, young in age, youthful, young;<BR>(अस्), n. youth.<BR>—प्रत्यग्र-शोधित, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>recently purified, pure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यग्रह
प्रत्यग्रह प्रत्यग्रह, अस्, m., N. of a son<BR>of Vasu and king of the Cedis (= प्रत्य्-अग्र;<BR>probably a contracted form for प्रत्यग्-ग्रह).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यङ्क
प्रत्यङ्क प्रत्य्-अङ्क, अस्, आ, अम्, recently<BR>marked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यङ्ग|प्रत्यंग|प्रत्यङ्गं
प्रत्यङ्ग प्रत्य्-अङ्ग, अम्, n. a minor or se-<BR>condary member of the body (as the forehead, nose,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-a" target="_blank">Page0625-a+ 79</a>]<BR>chin, fingers, ears, &c.; the six aṅgas or chief mem-<BR>bers being the trunk, head, arms, and legs); a<BR>division, section, part, subdivision (of a science &c.);<BR>a weapon; (अस्), m., N. of a prince; (अम्), ind. on<BR>every part or member of the body, on every limb,<BR>on the limbs severally; for every part or subdivision<BR>(of a sacrifice &c.); in each base (in grammar).<BR>—प्रत्यङ्ग-दक्षिणा, f. a fee for each part (of<BR>a sacrifice).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0624-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यङ्गिरस्
प्रत्यङ्गिरस् प्रत्य्-अङ्गिरस्, आस्, m., N. of a<BR>mythical personage (who like Aṅgiras married a<BR>number of the daughters of Dakṣa).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यङ्गिरस
प्रत्य्-अङ्गिरस, अस्, m., N. of a mythical per-<BR>sonage regarded as the father of certain Ṛcas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यङ्गिरा
प्रत्य्-अङ्गिरा, f. a form of Durgā, one of the<BR>goddesses of the Tāntrikas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यजिर
प्रत्यजिर प्रत्य्-अजिर, अम्, n., see Gaṇa<BR>Aṃśv-ādi to Pāṇ. VI. 2, 193.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यञ्च्|प्रत्यंच्
प्रत्यञ्च् प्रत्य्-अञ्च्, प्रत्यङ्, प्रतीची (accord-<BR>ing to Vopa-deva IV. 12. also प्रत्यञ्ची), प्रत्यक्<BR>(fr. rt. 1. अञ्च् with प्रति), turned towards, directed<BR>towards, proceeding to (with acc.); being behind,<BR>coming from behind; subsequent, following (in time<BR>or place); turning the back upon, turning back,<BR>turning away, turned away, averted, taking an oppo-<BR>site direction; western, occidental, westerly, west,<BR>turned or directed towards the west, to the west of<BR>(with abl.); turned inwards, inner, interior; equal<BR>to, a match for; uniform, unmixed (?); (प्रतीची),<BR>f. (with or without दिश्), the western quarter, the<BR>west; (प्रत्यक्), ind. backwards, back, in an opposite<BR>direction; behind; against; to the west, westwards,<BR>to the west of (with abl.); in the interior, inwardly;<BR>in former times.<BR>—प्रतीचीश, अस्, m. ‘lord of the<BR>west,’ an epithet of Varuṇa.<BR>—प्रत्यक्-चेतन, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, one whose thoughts are turned inwards or<BR>upon himself; rightly intelligent.<BR>—प्रत्यक्-तत्त्व-<BR>दीपिका, f., N. of a work confuting the Nyāya philo-<BR>sophy upon the basis of the Vedānta.<BR>—प्रत्यक्-<BR>तत्त्व-विवेक, अस्, m., N. of a philosophical work.<BR>—प्रत्यक्-त्व, अम्, n. backward direction, direc-<BR>tion towards one's self.<BR>—प्रत्यक्-पर्णी, f. a species<BR>of plant, Achyranthes Aspera (= अपामार्ग); the<BR>plant Anthericum Tuberosum (= द्रवन्ती).<BR>—प्र-<BR>त्यक्-पुष्पी, f. a species of plant, Achyranthes<BR>Aspera; (according to Vārttika I. to Pāṇ. IV. 1, 64.<BR>the correct form would be प्रत्यक्-पुष्पा.)<BR>—प्र-<BR>त्यक्-शिरस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, having the head turned<BR>towards the west.<BR>—प्रत्यक्-श्रेणी, f., N. of various<BR>plants, Anthericum Tuberosum; Croton Polyandrum<BR>or Croton Tiglium; Salvinia Cucullata (commonly<BR>called इन्दुरकानी दन्ती).<BR>—प्रत्यक्-स्रोतस्, आस्,<BR>आस्, अस्, flowing towards the west; (often wrongly<BR>spelt प्रत्यक्-श्रोतस्.)<BR>—प्रत्यग्-अक्ष, अम्, n.<BR>an inner organ, internal faculty; (अस्, आ, अम्), having<BR>inner organs.<BR>—प्रत्यगक्ष-ज, अस्, आ, अम्, dis-<BR>cerned by the internal faculties, visible to the eye<BR>of the soul.<BR>—प्रत्यग्-आत्म-त्व, अम्, n. universal<BR>permeation of spirit.<BR>—प्रत्यग्-आत्मन्, आ, m. the<BR>individual soul.<BR>—प्रत्यग्-आनन्द, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>inwardly rejoicing, internally joyful.<BR>—प्रत्यग्-आशा-<BR>पति, इस्, m. ‘lord of the western quarter,’ an epithet<BR>of Varuṇa.<BR>—प्रत्यग्-उदक्, ind. towards the north-<BR>west.<BR>—प्रत्यग्-दक्षिणतस्, ind. towards the<BR>south-west.<BR>—प्रत्यग्-दक्षिणा, ind., Ved. towards<BR>the south-west.<BR>—प्रत्यग्-दृश्, क्, f. an inward<BR>glance, glance directed inwards.<BR>—प्रत्यग्-धामन्,<BR>आ, आ, अ, radiant within, internally illuminated.<BR>—प्र-<BR>त्यग्-रथ, आस्, m. pl., N. of a warrior-tribe (also<BR>called अहि-च्छत्त्र; cf. प्रात्यग्रथि).<BR>—प्रत्यङ्-<BR>मुख, अस्, ई, अम्, having the face turned away,<BR>having the face averted, facing the west.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीक|प्रतीकः
प्रतीक, अस्, आ, अम्, turned towards, directed<BR>towards; adverse, contrary; inverted, reversed, in-<BR>verse, contrary to the natural order or condition;<BR>(अम्), n. an outer or upper part, exterior, surface<BR>(Ved.); outward form or shape, look, appearance<BR>(Ved.; cf. घृत-प्˚, चारु-प्˚, त्वेष-प्˚); an<BR>image, symbol; the face; the front; the mouth;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">Page0625-b+ 72</a>]<BR>the first part (of a verse), first word; (अस्), m. a<BR>part, portion, particular point or item; a limb, mem-<BR>ber; N. of a son of Vasu and father of Ogha-vat;<BR>[cf. अनूक, अपाक, अभीक.]<BR>—प्रतीक-वत्, आन्,<BR>m., Ved. ‘having a face or mouth,’ an epithet of<BR>Agni.<BR>—प्रतीकाश्व (˚क-अश्˚), अस्, m., N. of a<BR>prince.<BR>—प्रतीकोपासन (˚क-उप्˚), अम्, n. image<BR>worship, the service of idols.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीचीन|प्रतीचीनं
प्रतीचीन, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. going or coming<BR>towards, turned or directed towards; turned away<BR>from, turning the back upon, turning back; being<BR>behind, coming from behind; turning westward,<BR>situated towards the west, western, westerly; follow-<BR>ing, subsequent, future; (अम्), ind. back to one's<BR>self; backwards, behind.<BR>—प्रतीचीन-फल, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, Ved. having the fruit turned backwards.<BR>—प्रतीचीनेड (˚न-इडा), अम्, n., Ved., with का-<BR>शीतम्, N. of various Sāmans.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीच्य|प्रतीच्यः
प्रतीच्य, अस्, आ, अम्, being or living in the west,<BR>western, westerly; (आ), f., N. of the wife of Pu-<BR>lastya; (अम्), n. a designation of anything remote<BR>or concealed (Naighaṇṭuka III. 25).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यञ्चित|प्रत्यंचित
प्रत्य्-अञ्चित, अस्, आ, अम्, honoured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यञ्ज्
प्रत्यञ्ज् प्रत्य्-अञ्ज्, cl. 7. P. -अनक्ति, -अञ्जितुम्,<BR>अङ्क्तुम्, Ved. to smear over, besmear; to decorate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यञ्जन
प्रत्य्-अञ्जन, अम्, n. smearing over, smearing,<BR>anointing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यदन
प्रत्यदन प्रत्य्-अदन, अम्, n. (fr. rt. अद्),<BR>eating; food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यधी
प्रत्यधी प्रत्य्-अधी (प्रति-अधि-इ), cl. 2. P.<BR>-अध्य्-एति, -एतुम्, to read through or study severally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनन्तर|प्रत्यनंतर
प्रत्यनन्तर प्रत्य्-अनन्तर, अस्, आ, अम्, being<BR>in the immediate neighbourhood (of a person or<BR>thing), closely connected with, immediately follow-<BR>ing; standing nearest (as an heir); (अम्), ind.<BR>immediately after (with abl.); next in succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनिलम्
प्रत्यनिलम् प्रत्य्-अनिलम्, ind. against the<BR>wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनीक|प्रत्यनीकः
प्रत्यनीक प्रत्य्-अनीक, अस्, आ, अम्, hostile,<BR>opposed, opposite; withstanding, resisting; (अस्),<BR>m. an enemy; (अम्), n. a hostile army; hostility,<BR>enmity, a hostile relation, hostile position; injuring<BR>the relatives of an enemy who cannot be injured<BR>himself; injuring one who cannot retaliate (?).<BR>—प्र-<BR>त्यनीक-त्व, अम्, n. the state of an enemy, hostility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनुज्ञा
प्रत्यनुज्ञा प्रत्य्-अनु-ज्ञा, cl. 9. P. A. -जानाति,<BR>जानीते, -ज्ञातुम्, to disallow, refuse, reject; to spurn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनुतप्
प्रत्यनुतप् प्रत्य्-अनु-तप्, Pass. -तप्यते,<BR>&c., to feel subsequent remorse, repent, regret.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनुनी
प्रत्यनुनी प्रत्य्-अनु-नी, cl. 1. P. A. -नयति,<BR>-ते, -नेतुम्, to bring to submission, induce to yield;<BR>to declare against, protest against; to disagree; to<BR>deny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनुभू
प्रत्यनुभू प्रत्य्-अनु-भू, cl. 1. P. -भवति,<BR>-भवितुम्, to enjoy singly or severally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनुमान
प्रत्यनुमान प्रत्य्-अनुमान, अम्, n. a con-<BR>trary deduction, opposite conclusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यन्त|प्रत्यंत|प्रत्यन्तः
प्रत्यन्त प्रत्य्-अन्त, अस्, आ, अम्, bordering on,<BR>bordering, adjacent or contiguous to, skirting; (अस्),<BR>m. a border, frontier; a bordering country, i. e. a<BR>country occupied by barbarians, the country of the<BR>Mlecchas or savages; (आस्), m. pl. barbarous tribes;<BR>(आत्), ind., Ved. to the end.<BR>—प्रत्यन्त-देश, अस्, m.<BR>a neighbouring country, a country bordering upon<BR>another.<BR>—प्रत्यन्त-पर्वत, अस्, m. an adjacent<BR>hill, a small hill near a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यपकार|प्रत्यपकारः
प्रत्यपकार प्रत्य्-अपकार, अस्, m. offending<BR>or injuring in return, retaliation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यब्दम्
प्रत्यब्दम् प्रत्य्-अब्दम्, ind. every year,<BR>year by year, yearly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिघृ
प्रत्यभिघृ प्रत्य्-अभि-घृ, Caus. P. -घार-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, Ved. to sprinkle over repeatedly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिघारण
प्रत्य्-अभिघारण, अम्, n., Ved. sprinkling<BR>over afresh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिचर्
प्रत्यभिचर् प्रत्य्-अभि-चर्, cl. 1. P. -चरति,<BR>-चरितुम्, Ved. to use spells or charms against,<BR>employ incantations against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिचरण
प्रत्य्-अभिचरण, अस्, ई, अम्, Ved. using spells<BR>or charms against, employing incantations against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिज्ञा
प्रत्यभिज्ञा 1. प्रत्य्-अभि-ज्ञा, cl. 9. P. A.<BR>-जानाति, -जानीते, -ज्ञातुम्, to recognise again; to<BR>come to one's self, recover one's consciousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिज्ञा
2. प्रत्य्-अभिज्ञा, f. recognising again, recogni-<BR>tion; N. of a philosophical work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिज्ञात
प्रत्य्-अभिज्ञात, अस्, आ, अम्, recognised again,<BR>recognised, known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिज्ञान|प्रत्यभिज्ञानं
प्रत्य्-अभिज्ञान, अम्, n. recognising again, re-<BR>cognising, recognition, knowing; a token of recog-<BR>nition (which a messenger brings back to prove that<BR>he has duly accomplished his mission).<BR>—प्रत्यभि-<BR>ज्ञान-रत्न, अम्, n. jewel of recognition, a jewel<BR>given as a token of recognition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिज्ञाय
प्रत्य्-अभिज्ञाय, ind. having recognised again,<BR>having recognised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिधा
प्रत्यभिधा प्रत्य्-अभि-धा, cl. 3. P. A. -द-<BR>धाति, -धत्ते, -धातुम्, to place back, bring or<BR>draw back, reabsorb; to reply, answer; to give con-<BR>sent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिधाव्
प्रत्यभिधाव् प्रत्य्-अभि-धाव्, cl. 1. P. -धा-<BR>वति, -धावितुम्, to run or hasten towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिनन्द्
प्रत्यभिनन्द् प्रत्य्-अभि-नन्द्, cl. 1. P. -नन्-<BR>दति, -नन्दितुम्, to greet or salute in return, return<BR>a salutation; to bid welcome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिनन्दिन्
प्रत्य्-अभिनन्दिन्, ई, इनी, इ, receiving or accept-<BR>ing with thanks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिप्रस्था
प्रत्यभिप्रस्था प्रत्य्-अभि-प्र-स्था, cl. 1. A.<BR>-तिष्ठते, -स्थातुम्, to set out towards, set out for,<BR>depart; to march towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिभाषिन्
प्रत्यभिभाषिन् प्रत्य्-अभिभाषिन्, ई, इणी, इ,<BR>speaking to, addressing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिभूत
प्रत्यभिभूत प्रत्य्-अभिभूत, अस्, आ, अम्, over-<BR>powered, overcome, conquered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिमिथ्
प्रत्यभिमिथ् प्रत्य्-अभि-मिथ्, cl. 1. 6. P.<BR>-मेथति, -मिथति, &c., Ved. to answer scornfully<BR>or abusively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिमेथन
प्रत्य्-अभिमेथन, अम्, n., Ved. a scornful reply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिमृश्
प्रत्यभिमृश् प्रत्य्-अभि-मृश्, cl. 6. P. -मृ-<BR>शति, -मर्ष्टुम्, -म्रष्टुम्, to stroke over, stroke<BR>down, touch; to lay hold of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिमर्श
प्रत्य्-अभिमर्श, अस्, m. or प्रत्य्-अभिमर्-<BR>शन, अम्, n., Ved. rubbing, touching (with the<BR>hand).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभियुक्त
प्रत्यभियुक्त प्रत्य्-अभियुक्त, अस्, आ, अम् (fr.<BR>rt. युज् with प्रत्य्-अभि), accused in return, charged<BR>by a counter plaint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभियोग|प्रत्यभियोगः
प्रत्य्-अभियोग, अस्, m. a counter plaint or charge,<BR>a counter accusation, an accusation brought against<BR>the accuser or plaintiff, recrimination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिवद्
प्रत्यभिवद् प्रत्य्-अभि-वद्, Caus. A. -वाद-<BR>यते, -यितुम्, to return a salute, greet in return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिवाद|प्रत्यभिवादः
प्रत्य्-अभिवाद, अस्, m. returning a salutation or<BR>greeting; acknowledging a benediction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिवादक
प्रत्य्-अभिवादक, अस्, इका, अम्, returning a<BR>salutation or greeting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिवादन|प्रत्यभिवादनं
प्रत्य्-अभिवादन, अम्, n. returning a salutation<BR>or greeting (Manu II. 126).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिवादयितृ
प्रत्य्-अभिवादयितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who re-<BR>turns a salutation or greeting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभिस्कन्दन|प्रत्यभिस्कंदन|प्रत्यभिस्कंदनं
प्रत्यभिस्कन्दन प्रत्य्-अभिस्कन्दन, अम्, n. a<BR>counter plaint or charge, an accusation brought against<BR>the accuser or plaintiff; [cf. प्रत्य्-अभियोग.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभ्यनुज्ञा
प्रत्यभ्यनुज्ञा 1. प्रत्य्-अभ्य्-अनु-ज्ञा, cl. 9. P.<BR>A. -जानाति, -जानीते, -ज्ञातुम्, to dismiss any one<BR>when taking leave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0625-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभ्यनुज्ञा
2. प्रत्य्-अभ्यनुज्ञा, f., Ved. leave, permission.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यभ्यनुज्ञात
प्रत्य्-अभ्यनुज्ञात, अस्, आ, अम्, dismissed on<BR>taking leave, allowed to depart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यमित्र|प्रत्यमित्रः
प्रत्यमित्र प्रत्य्-अमित्र, अस्, आ, अम्, opposed<BR>as an enemy, hostile; (अस्), m. an enemy, oppo-<BR>nent, adversary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यय|प्रत्ययः
प्रत्यय प्रत्य्-अय, &c. See प्रती, p. 623.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्ययनस्त्व
प्रत्ययनस्त्व प्रत्ययनस्त्व, अम्, n., Ved.<BR>obtaining again, reobtaining, recovery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यरा
प्रत्यरा प्रत्य्-अरा, f., Ved. an intermediate<BR>spoke of a wheel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यरि|प्रत्यरिः
प्रत्यरि प्रत्य्-अरि, इस्, m. a well-matched<BR>opponent, equally powerful enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्क|प्रत्यर्कः
प्रत्यर्क प्रत्य्-अर्क, अस्, m. a mock sun,<BR>parhelion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्च्
प्रत्यर्च् प्रत्य्-अर्च्, cl. 1. P. -अर्चति, -अर्चितुम्,<BR>to shine towards, shine upon (Ved.): Caus. -अर्च-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to return a salutation (with acc.); to<BR>salute one by one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्चन
प्रत्य्-अर्चन, अम्, n. returning a salutation or<BR>obeisance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्थ्
प्रत्यर्थ् प्रत्य्-अर्थ्, cl. 10. P. -अर्थयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to seek (any one) as an opponent, challenge<BR>(to combat).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्थ
प्रत्य्-अर्थ, अस्, आ, अम्, useful, expedient; (अम्),<BR>n. a reply, answer, counter representation; opposi-<BR>tion, hostility; (अम्), ind. at every object, in every<BR>case.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्थक|प्रत्यर्थकः
प्रत्यर्थक, अस्, m. an opponent, adversary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्थिक|प्रत्यर्थिकः
प्रत्यर्थिक, अस्, आ, अम्, = प्रत्य्-अर्थिन्, an<BR>opponent (at the end of a comp.; cf. बहु-प्˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्थिन्
प्रत्य्-अर्थिन्, ई, इनी, इ, hostile, inimical; opposing,<BR>contradicting, rejecting; emulating; (ई), m. an<BR>enemy, opponent, adversary, rival; (in law) a de-<BR>fendant.<BR>—प्रत्यर्थि-ता, f. or प्रत्यर्थि-त्व,<BR>अम्, n. the state of a defendant at law.<BR>—प्रत्य्-<BR>अर्थ्य्-आवेदन, अम्, n. (in a lawsuit) the verbal<BR>information or deposition of the defendant which<BR>is written down by the officers of the court.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्द्
प्रत्यर्द् प्रत्य्-अर्द्, Caus. P. A. -अर्दयति,<BR>-ते, -यितुम्, to oppress or press hard in return,<BR>assault in return, return an attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्धि
प्रत्यर्धि प्रत्य्-अर्धि, इस्, इस्, इ (connected<BR>with अर्ध), Ved. possessing half of (with gen.)?;<BR>having equal claims, equal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्पण|प्रत्यर्पणं
प्रत्यर्पण प्रत्य्-अर्पण, प्रत्य्-अर्पणीय. See<BR>under प्रत्य्-ऋ, p. 629, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्ष
प्रत्यर्ष प्रत्य्-अर्ष, अस्, m. (rt. ऋष्), Ved.<BR>(perhaps) the slope or side (of a hill).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्हम्
प्रत्यर्हम् प्रत्य्-अर्हम् in यथा-प्˚, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवकर्शन
प्रत्यवकर्शन प्रत्य्-अवकर्शन, अस्, ई, अम्<BR>(fr. rt. कृश् with प्रत्य्-अव), bringing down or<BR>reducing to insignificance, baffling, annihilating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवगम्
प्रत्यवगम् प्रत्य्-अव-गम्, cl. 1. P. -गच्-<BR>छति, -गन्तुम्, to know one by one, recognise<BR>severally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवग्रह्
प्रत्यवग्रह् प्रत्य्-अव-ग्रह्, cl. 9. P. A. -गृह्-<BR>णाति, -गृह्णीते, -ग्रहीतुम्, to draw back, withdraw,<BR>resume, retract, revoke, recall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवधा
प्रत्यवधा प्रत्य्-अव-धा, cl. 3. P. A. -द-<BR>धाति, -धत्ते, -धातुम्, Ved. to apply again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवनेजन
प्रत्यवनेजन प्रत्य्-अवनेजन, अम्, n., Ved.<BR>washing off again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवभुज्
प्रत्यवभुज् प्रत्य्-अव-भुज् (see rt. 1. भुज्),<BR>cl. 6. P. -भुजति, -भोक्तुम्, to bend back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवमर्श|प्रत्यवमर्शः
प्रत्यवमर्श प्रत्य्-अवमर्श, अस्, m. inner<BR>contemplation, profound meditation; counsel, advice,<BR>injunction; a counter conclusion; recollection [cf.<BR>स्मृति-प्˚]; (sometimes less correctly spelt प्रत्य्-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">Page0626-b+ 74</a>]<BR>अवमर्ष.)<BR>—प्रत्यवमर्श-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>absorbed in thought or reflection, meditative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवमर्शन
प्रत्य्-अवमर्शन, अम्, n. contemplation, re-<BR>flection, pondering (according to a Scholiast = युक्-<BR>तायुक्त-विचार).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवमृष्
प्रत्यवमृष् प्रत्य्-अव-मृष्, cl. 4. 1. P. A.<BR>-मृष्यति, -ते, -मर्षति, -ते, -मर्षितुम्, to<BR>endure reluctantly, suffer beyond endurance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवयवम्
प्रत्यवयवम् प्रत्य्-अवयवम्, ind. in every<BR>part or particular, in detail.<BR>—प्रत्यवयव-वर्-<BR>णन, अम्, आ, n. f. a detailed or minute description,<BR>description of every part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवर
प्रत्यवर प्रत्य्-अवर, अस्, आ, अम्, lower, more<BR>insignificant, less honoured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवरुह्
प्रत्यवरुह् प्रत्य्-अव-रुह्, Caus. P. -रोप-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to cause to descend from, bring down<BR>from; to deprive of (with abl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवरूढि
प्रत्य्-अवरूढि, इस्, f., Ved. descending towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवरोपित
प्रत्य्-अवरोपित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to descend<BR>from; deprived, bereft of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवरोह
प्रत्य्-अवरोह, अस्, m., Ved. descending towards;<BR>a descending series.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवरोहण
प्रत्य्-अवरोहण, अम्, n., Ved. descending<BR>towards; N. of a particular Gṛhya festival in the<BR>month Mārgaśīrṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवरोहणीय
प्रत्य्-अवरोहणीय, अस्, m., Ved. a particular<BR>Ekāha sacrifice forming part of the Vājapeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवरोहिन्
प्रत्य्-अवरोहिन्, ई, इणी, इ, Ved. descending, mov-<BR>ing downwards; moving or rising from a seat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवरोधन|प्रत्यवरोधनं
प्रत्यवरोधन प्रत्य्-अवरोधन, अम्, n. ob-<BR>struction, interruption.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवसान|प्रत्यवसानं
प्रत्यवसान प्रत्य्-अवसान, अम्, n. (fr. rt. सो<BR>with प्रत्य्-अव), consuming, consumption, eating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवसित|प्रत्यवसितं
प्रत्य्-अवसित, अस्, आ, अम्, consumed, eaten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवस्कन्द|प्रत्यवस्कंद|प्रत्यवस्कंदः|प्रत्यवस्कन्दः
प्रत्यवस्कन्द प्रत्य्-अवस्कन्द, अस्, m. or प्र-<BR>त्य्-अवस्कन्दन, अम्, n. a special plea at law,<BR>admitting a fact but qualifying or explaining it so<BR>as not to allow it to be matter of accusation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवस्था
प्रत्यवस्था 1. प्रत्य्-अव-स्था, cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-तिष्ठति, -ते, -स्थातुम्, to stand alone or sepa-<BR>rately; to attain to again, reattain, recover: Caus.<BR>-स्थापयति, -यितुम्, to cause to stand firm; (with<BR>आत्मानम्) to collect one's self, recover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवस्था
2. प्रत्य्-अवस्था, f. = पर्य्-अवस्था, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवस्थातृ
प्रत्य्-अवस्थातृ, ता, m. an opponent, adversary,<BR>enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवस्थान|प्रत्यवस्थानं
प्रत्य्-अवस्थान, अम्, n. removal, setting aside;<BR>former state or place, status quo; opposition, hostility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवस्थित
प्रत्य्-अवस्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, standing separately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवहृ
प्रत्यवहृ प्रत्य्-अव-हृ, Caus. P. -हारयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to cause to take away; to suspend, interrupt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवहार|प्रत्यवहारः
प्रत्य्-अवहार, अस्, m. drawing back, withdraw-<BR>ing, withdrawal; dissolution, reabsorption.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवाप्
प्रत्यवाप् प्रत्य्-अवाप् (प्रति-अव-आप्), cl. 5. P.<BR>-आप्नोति, -आप्तुम्, to obtain back, reobtain, recover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवे
प्रत्यवे प्रत्य्-अवे (प्रति-अव-इ), cl. 2. P.<BR>-अवैति, -अवैतुम्, Ved. to go down towards, reach<BR>in going downwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवाय|प्रत्यवायः
प्रत्य्-अवाय, अस्, m. decrease, diminution, pri-<BR>vation, detriment, harm; reverse, opposite course,<BR>contrary course or proceeding, contrariety, opposition<BR>(Manu IV. 245); annoyance, disagreeableness; dis-<BR>appointment, disarrangement; offence, sin, sinfulness;<BR>disappearance of anything that exists; non-production<BR>of what does not exist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवेक्ष्
प्रत्यवेक्ष् प्रत्य्-अवेक्ष् (प्रति-अव-ईक्ष्), cl.<BR>1. A. -अवेक्षते, -अवेक्षितुम्, to look towards,<BR>look at; to view, inspect, look after; to regard,<BR>have regard for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवेक्षण|प्रत्यवेक्षणं
प्रत्य्-अवेक्षण, अम्, n. or प्रत्य्-अवेक्षा, f.<BR>looking at, looking after, taking care of, care about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवेक्ष्य
प्रत्य्-अवेक्ष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be looked at, to<BR>be regarded or considered, to be taken care of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यश्मन्
प्रत्यश्मन् प्रत्य्-अश्मन्, आ, m. red chalk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यष्ठीला
प्रत्यष्ठीला प्रत्य्-अष्ठीला, f. a kind of<BR>nervous disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यस्
प्रत्यस् 1. प्रत्य्-अस् (see rt. 1. अस्), cl. 2. P.<BR>-अस्ति, Ved. to be equal to, to be a match for; to<BR>rival, emulate, vie with; (according to Sāy. = प्रति-<BR>निधिर् अस्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यस्
प्रत्यस् 2. प्रत्य्-अस् (see rt. 2. अस्), cl. 4. P.<BR>-अस्यति, -असितुम्, to throw towards, throw down; to<BR>turn over, turn round; to throw off, put away, let go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यस्त्र
प्रत्य्-अस्त्र, अम्, n. a missile hurled in return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यस्तगमन
प्रत्यस्तगमन प्रत्य्-अस्तगमन, अम्, n., Ved.<BR>the setting (of the sun).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यस्तमय|प्रत्यस्तमयः
प्रत्य्-अस्तमय, अस्, m. the setting (of the sun);<BR>cessation, end, destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यह्
प्रत्यह् प्रत्य्-अह्, a defective verb only used<BR>in the Perf. -आह, to say anything in the presence of<BR>(with acc.); to relate anything (acc.) to any one<BR>(acc.); to reply, answer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यहम्
प्रत्यहम् प्रत्य्-अहम्, ind. day by day, every<BR>day, daily; in the morning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याकल्
प्रत्याकल् प्रत्य्-आ-कल्, cl. 10. P. -कलयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to enumerate; to reproach, accuse, con-<BR>demn (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याकलित
प्रत्य्-आकलित, अस्, आ, अम्, enumerated; inter-<BR>posed; introduced (as a step in legal process).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याकाङ्क्ष्
प्रत्याकाङ्क्ष् प्रत्य्-आ-काङ्क्ष्, cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-काङ्क्षति, -ते, -काङ्क्षितुम्, to be eagerly de-<BR>sirous of, long for, expect, wait for, watch for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याकार|प्रत्याकारः
प्रत्याकार प्रत्य्-आकार, अस्, m. a scabbard,<BR>sword-sheath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याक्रुश्
प्रत्याक्रुश् प्रत्य्-आ-क्रुश्, cl. 1. P. -क्रोशति,<BR>-क्रोष्टुम्, to shout in return; to revile or execrate<BR>in turn, revile again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याक्षेपक
प्रत्याक्षेपक प्रत्य्-आक्षेपक, अस्, इका, अम्,<BR>reviling in turn, reviling, jeering, deriding, derisive,<BR>treating scornfully.<BR>—प्रत्याक्षेप-त्व, अम्, n. de-<BR>risiveness, abusiveness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याख्या
प्रत्याख्या प्रत्य्-आ-ख्या, cl. 2. P. -ख्याति,<BR>-ख्यातुम्, to proclaim one by one (Ved.); to de-<BR>cline, refuse, reject, disallow; to deny; to interdict; to<BR>excel, surpass, outvie; to counteract (by remedies).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याख्यात|प्रत्याख्यातः
प्रत्य्-आख्यात, अस्, आ, अम्, informed, apprised;<BR>denied, disallowed, refused; discouraged, prohibited,<BR>forbidden; removed, set aside; celebrated, notorious.<BR>—प्रत्याख्यात-त्व, अम्, n. the being rejected or<BR>refused; rejection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याख्यातृ
प्रत्य्-आख्यातृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who refuses or<BR>denies, a refuser, denier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याख्यान|प्रत्याख्यानं
प्रत्य्-आख्यान, अम्, n. refusal, denial, disallow-<BR>ance; rejection, repulse; refutation; not admitting,<BR>not accepting as true; disregard; reproach; N. of<BR>one of the fourteen Pūrvas or most ancient writings<BR>of the Jainas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याख्यायम्
प्रत्य्-आख्यायम्, ind., Ved. having refuted or<BR>rejected, having denied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याख्यायिन्
प्रत्य्-आख्यायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, Ved. rejecting, refuting<BR>(in अ-प्˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याख्येय
प्रत्य्-आख्येय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be declined or<BR>refused; to be rejected or repulsed; to be refuted or<BR>denied; not to be cured, incurable.<BR>—प्रत्याख्येय-<BR>ता, f. the being rejected; incurableness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यागम्
प्रत्यागम् प्रत्य्-आ-गम्, cl. 1. P. -गच्छति,<BR>-गन्तुम्, to come back, come again, return; to<BR>come to one's self, recover consciousness, revive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यागत
प्रत्य्-आगत, अस्, आ, अम्, come back, come again,<BR>returned; arrived at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यागति|प्रत्यागतिः
प्रत्य्-आगति, इस्, f. coming back, coming again,<BR>return, coming home again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यागम|प्रत्यागमः
प्रत्य्-आगम, अस्, m. coming back, coming again,<BR>return; arrival.<BR>—प्रत्यागमावधि (˚म-अव्˚),<BR>ind. till (my) return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यागमन|प्रत्यागमनं
प्रत्य्-आगमन, अम्, n. coming back, coming<BR>again, return, coming home again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0626-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यागार
प्रत्यागार प्रत्य्-आगार (?), अस्, m. former<BR>place or state.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यागॄ
प्रत्यागॄ प्रत्य्-आ-गॄ (see rt. 1. गॄ), cl. 9. P.<BR>A. -गृणाति, -गृणीते, -गरितुम्, -गरीतुम्, Ved.<BR>to speak to in return, answer, respond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याघात|प्रत्याघातः
प्रत्याघात प्रत्य्-आघात, अस्, m. (fr. प्रत्य्-<BR>आ-हन्, q. v.), counter-stroke, reaction, repulse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याचक्ष्
प्रत्याचक्ष् प्रत्य्-आ-चक्ष्, cl. 2. A. -चष्टे,<BR>-चष्टुम्, to refuse, decline, reject; to repulse; to<BR>answer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याचार|प्रत्याचारः
प्रत्याचार प्रत्य्-आचार, अस्, m. suitable be-<BR>haviour, conformable conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यातन्
प्रत्यातन् प्रत्य्-आ-तन्, cl. 8. P. A. -तनोति,<BR>-तनुते, -तनितुम्, Ved. to extend in the direction<BR>of (with acc.); to bend (a bow) against (with acc.);<BR>to shine upon, irradiate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याताप
प्रत्याताप प्रत्य्-आताप, अस्, m., Ved. a sunny<BR>place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यात्म
प्रत्यात्म प्रत्य्-आत्म, अस्, आ, अम्, every single,<BR>each several; (अम्), ind. singly, severally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यात्मक
प्रत्यात्मक, अस्, इका, अम्, belonging to one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यात्म्य
प्रत्यात्म्य, अम्, n. similarity with or resem-<BR>blance to one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यादर्श
प्रत्यादर्श प्रत्य्-आदर्श, अस्, m. an image (?) ;<BR>(perhaps only a wrong reading for प्रत्य्-आदेश, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यादा
प्रत्यादा प्रत्य्-आ-दा, cl. 3. A. -दत्ते, -दातुम्,<BR>to receive back, get back; to take back, recall, revoke,<BR>rescind; to draw forth from; to repeat (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यादान|प्रत्यादानं
प्रत्य्-आदान, अम्, n. taking back anything given,<BR>receiving back, resumption, reobtaining; repeating,<BR>repetition (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यादित्सु
प्रत्य्-आदित्सु, उस्, उस्, उ (fr. the Desid.), desirous of<BR>retaking, intending to reobtain, wishing to obtain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यादेय
प्रत्य्-आदेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be received back;<BR>to be received, to be accepted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यादित्य|प्रत्यादित्यः
प्रत्यादित्य प्रत्य्-आदित्य, अस्, m. a mock sun,<BR>parhelion; (at the beginning of a comp.) towards<BR>the sun (e. g. प्रत्यादित्य-गुद, one whose hinder<BR>parts are towards the sun).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यादिश्
प्रत्यादिश् प्रत्य्-आ-दिश्, cl. 6. P. -दिशति,<BR>-देष्टुम्, to enjoin upon, direct, prescribe, advise,<BR>recommend; to warn, caution; to report anything<BR>to (with acc.), report again; to summon; to coun-<BR>termand; to reject, repel, repulse, deny, dismiss; to<BR>decline, refuse; to conquer, overcome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यादिष्ट|प्रत्यादिष्टः
प्रत्य्-आदिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, prescribed, recom-<BR>mended; informed, apprised; declared; warned,<BR>cautioned; rejected, repulsed; conquered, overcome;<BR>removed, set aside.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यादेश|प्रत्यादेशः
प्रत्य्-आदेश, अस्, m. order, command; informa-<BR>tion, apprising, informing, annunciation, declaration;<BR>warning, caution, supernatural warning; rejection,<BR>disallowance, refusal, denial; reproach; putting to<BR>shame, any one who puts another to shame, the<BR>shamer of another; obscuring, rendering obscure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यादेष्टृ
प्रत्य्-आदेष्टृ, टा, ट्री, टृ, one who warns or<BR>cautions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यादृ
प्रत्यादृ प्रत्य्-आ-दृ, cl. 6. A. -द्रियते, -दर्-<BR>तुम्, Ved. to show respect to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याद्रु
प्रत्याद्रु प्रत्य्-आ-द्रु, cl. 1. P. -द्रवति, -द्रो-<BR>तुम्, to run against, rush upon, assail (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याधान
प्रत्याधान प्रत्य्-आधान, अम्, n., Ved. a<BR>place where anything is deposited or laid up, a<BR>repository.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याध्मान|प्रत्याध्मानः
प्रत्याध्मान प्रत्य्-आध्मान, अम्, n. a parti-<BR>cular nervous disease, a kind of tympanites or wind-<BR>dropsy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यानह्
प्रत्यानह् प्रत्य्-आ-नह्, cl. 4. P. A. -नह्यति,<BR>-ते, -नद्धुम्, to put upon, cover with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यानी
प्रत्यानी प्रत्य्-आ-नी, cl. 1. P. A. -नयति, -ते,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">Page0627-b+ 71</a>]<BR>नेतुम्, to lead or bring back, regain; to pour<BR>again (Ved.); to fill up again: Desid. A. -निनीषते,<BR>to wish to bring back, try to rearrange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यानयन|प्रत्यानयनं
प्रत्य्-आनयन, अम्, n. leading back, bringing<BR>back again, giving back again, recovery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यानिनीषु
प्रत्य्-आनिनीषु, उस्, उस्, उ, desirous of bringing<BR>back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यानीत
प्रत्य्-आनीत, अस्, आ, अम्, led back, brought back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यानेय
प्रत्य्-आनेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be brought back; to<BR>be repaired, to be made good.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यापद्
प्रत्यापद् प्रत्य्-आ-पद्, cl. 4. A. -पद्यते,<BR>-पत्तुम्, to go back, return back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यापत्ति|प्रत्यापत्तिः
प्रत्य्-आपत्ति, इस्, f. return, going round again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यापन्न
प्रत्य्-आपन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, restored, regained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यापीड
प्रत्यापीड प्रत्य्-आपीड, अस्, m. a kind of<BR>metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याप्लवन
प्रत्याप्लवन प्रत्य्-आप्लवन, अम्, n. springing<BR>or leaping back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याब्रू
प्रत्याब्रू प्रत्य्-आ-ब्रू, cl. 2. P. -ब्रवीति, &c.,<BR>to reply to, answer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याभू
प्रत्याभू प्रत्य्-आ-भू, cl. 1. P. -भवति, -भ-<BR>वितुम्, Ved. to be at hand, be at one's command.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याम्ना
प्रत्याम्ना प्रत्य्-आ-म्ना, cl. 1. P. -मनति,<BR>-म्नातुम्, Ved. to recite or repeat after any one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याम्नातव्य
प्रत्य्-आम्नातव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be rejected, to<BR>be considered invalid or not binding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याम्नान
प्रत्य्-आम्नान, अम्, n., Ved. contrary determina-<BR>tion, altered purpose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याम्नाय|प्रत्याम्नायः
प्रत्य्-आम्नाय, अस्, m. contrary or altered deter-<BR>mination; the conclusion or fifth member of a com-<BR>plete syllogism, the repetition of the first member<BR>(= नि-गमन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याय|प्रत्यायः
प्रत्याय प्रत्य्-आय, अस्, m. (fr. प्रती, q. v.),<BR>‘what comes in as revenue,’ toll, tax, tribute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यायक
प्रत्य्-आयक, अस्, इका, अम्, making intelligible,<BR>explaining, making clear, &c. See under प्रती.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यायन|प्रत्यायनं
1. प्रत्य्-आयन, अम्, n. leading home (a wife),<BR>marrying; setting (of the sun); (अम्, आ), n. f. making<BR>intelligible, analysing, explaining, explanation; prov-<BR>ing, &c. See under प्रती.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यायित|प्रत्यायितः
प्रत्य्-आयित, अस्, m., Ved. a confidential agent,<BR>&c. See under प्रती.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यायितव्य
प्रत्य्-आयितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be made clear, to<BR>be proved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्येतव्य
प्रत्य्-एतव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be admitted or ac-<BR>knowledged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यायन|प्रत्यायनं
प्रत्यायन 2. प्रत्य्-आयन. See प्रत्य्-ए, p. 629.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याया
प्रत्याया प्रत्य्-आ-या, cl. 2. P. -याति, -यातुम्,<BR>to go towards (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यारम्भ|प्रत्यारंभ|प्रत्यारम्भः
प्रत्यारम्भ प्रत्य्-आरम्भ, अस्, m. beginning<BR>again, recommencement, second beginning; prohi-<BR>bition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यार्द्रा
प्रत्यार्द्रा प्रत्य्-आर्द्रा, f., see Gaṇa Aṃśv-<BR>ādi to Pāṇ. VI. 2, 193.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यार्धपुर
प्रत्यार्धपुर प्रत्य्-आर्धपुर, see Gaṇa Aṃśv-<BR>ādi to Pāṇ. VI. 2, 193.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यालिङ्ग्
प्रत्यालिङ्ग् प्रत्य्-आ-लिङ्ग्, cl. 1. P. -लिङ्गति,<BR>-लिङ्गितुम्, to embrace in return, return an embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यालीढ|प्रत्यालीढं
प्रत्यालीढ प्रत्य्-आलीढ, अस्, आ, अम्, eaten;<BR>extended towards the left; (अम्), n. an attitude in shoot-<BR>ing, the left foot advanced and right drawn back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यावृत्
प्रत्यावृत् प्रत्य्-आ-वृत्, cl. 1. A. -वर्तते,<BR>-वर्तितुम्, to come back, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यावर्तन|प्रत्यावर्तनं|प्रत्यावर्त्तन
प्रत्य्-आवर्तन, अम्, n. coming back, returning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यावृत्त
प्रत्य्-आवृत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, come back, returned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यावृत्य
प्रत्य्-आवृत्य, ind. having come back, having<BR>returned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याशा
प्रत्याशा प्रत्य्-आशा, f. confidence, reliance,<BR>trust, hope, expectation, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याशिन्
प्रत्य्-आशिन्, ई, इनी, इ, hoping, expecting, trusting,<BR>relying upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याश्रय
प्रत्याश्रय प्रत्य्-आश्रय, अस्, m. a shelter,<BR>refuge, dwelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याश्राव
प्रत्याश्राव प्रत्य्-आश्राव, अस्, m. or प्रत्य्-<BR>आश्रावण, अम्, n., Ved. an ejaculatory response,<BR>a particular sacrificial formula.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याश्वस्
प्रत्याश्वस् प्रत्य्-आ-श्वस्, cl. 2. P. -श्वसिति,<BR>-श्वसितुम्, to breathe again, respire, take courage<BR>again, take heart again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याश्वस्त
प्रत्य्-आश्वस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, refreshed, revived,<BR>reanimated; recollected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याश्वास|प्रत्याश्वासः
प्रत्य्-आश्वास, अस्, m. breathing again, respiration,<BR>recovery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याश्वासन|प्रत्याश्वासनं
प्रत्य्-आश्वासन, अम्, n. consolation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यास्
प्रत्यास् प्रत्य्-आस्, cl. 2. A. -आस्ते, -आसितुम्,<BR>Ved. to sit down opposite to or in the direction of<BR>(with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यासङ्कलित|प्रत्यासंकलित
प्रत्यासङ्कलित प्रत्य्-आसङ्कलित, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>added to; ascertained, determined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यासङ्ग|प्रत्यासङ्गः
प्रत्यासङ्ग प्रत्य्-आसङ्ग, अस्, m., Ved. com-<BR>bination, connection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यासद्
प्रत्यासद् प्रत्य्-आ-सद्, cl. 1. 6. P. -सीदति,<BR>-सत्तुम्, to be near or close at hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यासत्ति|प्रत्यासत्तिः
प्रत्य्-आसत्ति, इस्, f. immediate proximity (in space,<BR>time, &c.); close contact; analogy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यासन्न|प्रत्यासन्नः
प्रत्य्-आसन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, near at hand, close by,<BR>near, proximate, contiguous; imminent.<BR>—प्रत्य्-<BR>आसन्न-ता, f. proximity, contiguity.<BR>—प्रत्यासन्न-<BR>मृत्यु, उस्, उस्, उ, one whose death is imminent,<BR>at the point of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यासर|प्रत्यासरः
प्रत्यासर प्रत्य्-आसर = प्रत्य्-आसार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यासार|प्रत्यासारः
प्रत्यासार प्रत्य्-आसार, अस्, m. the rear of<BR>an army; a form of array (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यास्तार
प्रत्यास्तार प्रत्य्-आस्तार, अस्, m. the carpet<BR>of a Buddhist Bhikṣu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यास्वर
प्रत्यास्वर प्रत्य्-आस्वर, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt.<BR>स्वृ with प्रत्य्-आ), Ved. reflecting (light).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याहन्
प्रत्याहन् प्रत्य्-आ-हन्, cl. 2. P. -हन्ति (Perf.<BR>A. -जघ्ने), -हन्तुम्, to drive back, keep off,<BR>ward off, parry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याहत
प्रत्य्-आहत, अस्, आ, अम्, driven back, repelled,<BR>repulsed, resisted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याहार|प्रत्याहारः
प्रत्याहार प्रत्य्-आहार. See below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याहृ
प्रत्याहृ प्रत्य्-आ-हृ, cl. 1. P. A. -हरति,<BR>-ते, -हर्तुम्, to take back again, draw back, with-<BR>draw, recover; to utter (a speech); to cry; to report.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याहरण|प्रत्याहरणं
प्रत्य्-आहरण, अम्, n. bringing back; taking<BR>back, recovery; drawing back, keeping back, with-<BR>holding; withdrawing the senses from external ob-<BR>jects, restraining the organs of sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याहरणीय
प्रत्य्-आहरणीय or प्रत्य्-आहर्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>to be taken back, resumable; to be withheld; to be<BR>restrained or controlled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याहरत्
प्रत्य्-आहरत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, drawing back, with-<BR>drawing; altering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याहार|प्रत्याहारः
प्रत्य्-आहार, अस्, m. drawing back (troops from<BR>a battle), marching back, retreat; withholding; with-<BR>drawing the senses from external objects, restraint of<BR>the organs of sense, abstraction; the reabsorption or<BR>dissolution of the world; (in grammar) the compre-<BR>hension of a series of letters or affixes into one<BR>syllable effected by combining the first member of<BR>the series without its indicatory letter or letters with<BR>the indicatory final consonant of the last member, a<BR>group or class of letters so combined (for the concise<BR>expression of grammatical rules; thus the Praty-<BR>āhāra अच् is the technical term for the letters अ, इ, उ,<BR>ऋ, ऌ, ए, ओ, ऐ, औ, or all the vowels, and the<BR>Praty-āhāra हल् is the term for all the consonants);<BR>compendium, abridgment; substitution (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याहार्य
प्रत्य्-आहार्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be taken back; to be<BR>withheld or withdrawn; to be received; to be learned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याहृत
प्रत्य्-आहृत, अस्, आ, अम्, resumed; restrained;<BR>withheld.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0627-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याहृत्य
प्रत्य्-आहृत्य, ind. having drawn back, having<BR>recovered or taken back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युक्त
प्रत्युक्त प्रत्य्-उक्त, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. प्रति-वच्),<BR>said in return, replied, answered; (अम्), n. an answer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युक्ति|प्रत्युक्तिः
प्रत्य्-उक्ति, इस्, f. a reply, answer, rejoinder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युच्चर्
प्रत्युच्चर् प्रत्य्-उच्-चर् (प्रति-उद्-चर्), Caus.<BR>P. -चारयति, -यितुम्, to rouse up, excite, urge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युच्चार|प्रत्युच्चारः
प्रत्य्-उच्चार, अस्, m. or प्रत्य्-उच्चारण, अम्,<BR>n. repeating, repetition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युच्चार्य
प्रत्य्-उच्चार्य, ind. having roused, having ex-<BR>cited or urged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युज्जीव्
प्रत्युज्जीव् प्रत्य्-उज्-जीव् (प्रति-उद्-जीव्), cl. 1.<BR>P. -जीवति, -जीवितुम्, to return to life, revive: Caus.<BR>-जीवयति, -यितुम्, to restore to life, revivify, resus-<BR>citate, reanimate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युज्जीवन|प्रत्युज्जीवनं
प्रत्य्-उज्जीवन, अम्, n. coming to life again,<BR>reviving; restoring to life, revivifying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युत
प्रत्युत प्रत्य्-उत, ind. on the contrary,<BR>rather, aye, even; on the other hand, otherwise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युत्कर्ष
प्रत्युत्कर्ष प्रत्य्-उत्कर्ष, अस्, m. enhancing,<BR>overcharging raising prices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युत्क्रम|प्रत्युत्क्रमः
प्रत्युत्क्रम प्रत्य्-उत्क्रम, अस्, m. or प्रत्य्-<BR>उत्क्रमण, अम्, n. or प्रत्य्-उत्क्रान्ति, इस्, f. un-<BR>dertaking; an act or effort made for a certain purpose<BR>or tending to a main object; the first step or measure<BR>in any business; setting out to assail an enemy;<BR>declaration of war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युत्तब्धि
प्रत्युत्तब्धि प्रत्य्-उत्तब्धि, इस्, f. (fr. rt. स्तम्भ्<BR>with प्रति-उद्), Ved. upholding, propping up, stay-<BR>ing, supporting, fixing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युत्तम्भ
प्रत्य्-उत्तम्भ, अस्, m. = प्रत्य्-उत्तब्धि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युत्तर|प्रत्युत्तरं
प्रत्युत्तर प्रत्य्-उत्तर, अम्, n. a reply to an<BR>answer, rejoinder, answer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युत्तॄ
प्रत्युत्तॄ प्रत्य्-उत्-तॄ (प्रति-उद्-तॄ), cl. 1. P.<BR>-तरति, -तरितुम्, -तरीतुम्, to emerge (from the<BR>water); to betake one's self to (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युत्था
प्रत्युत्था प्रत्य्-उत्-था (प्रति-उद्-स्था), cl. 1.<BR>P. A. -तिष्ठति, -ते, -थातुम्, to rise up before,<BR>rise to salute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युत्थान|प्रत्युत्थानं
प्रत्य्-उत्थान, अम्, n. rising from a seat as a<BR>mark of respect, rising to welcome a visitor, respectful<BR>reception (Manu II. 210); making preparations for,<BR>undertaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युत्थायिन्
प्रत्य्-उत्थायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, Ved. rising again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युत्थित
प्रत्य्-उत्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, risen to meet or to<BR>encounter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युत्थेय
प्रत्य्-उत्थेय, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. to be honoured<BR>or saluted by rising from the seat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युत्पन्न|प्रत्युत्पन्नः
प्रत्युत्पन्न प्रत्य्-उत्पन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, existing<BR>at the present moment, present; prompt, ready; re-<BR>produced, regenerated; (in arithmetic) produced by<BR>multiplication, multiplied; (अम्), n. multiplication;<BR>the product of a sum in multiplication.<BR>—प्रत्युत्-<BR>पन्न-जाति, इस्, f. (in arithmetic) assimilation of<BR>fractional increase.<BR>—प्रत्युत्पन्न-मति, इस्, इस्, इ,<BR>ready-minded, having presence of mind or a prompt<BR>understanding; quick, subtle, sharp; confident, bold,<BR>arrogant.<BR>—प्रत्युत्पन्नमति-त्व, अम्, n. presence<BR>of mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युदाहृ
प्रत्युदाहृ प्रत्य्-उद्-आ-हृ (प्रति-), cl. 1. P.<BR>A. -हरति, -ते, -हर्तुम्, to speak in return, reply,<BR>answer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युदाहरण|प्रत्युदाहरणं
प्रत्य्-उदाहरण, अम्, n. a contrary example,<BR>instance to the contrary, counter example or illustra-<BR>tion; [cf. उद्-आहरण.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युदाहृत
प्रत्य्-उदाहृत, अस्, आ, अम्, called, named.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युदि
प्रत्युदि प्रत्य्-उद्-इ (प्रति-), cl. 2. P. -एति,<BR>-एतुम्, to rise and go towards, to go out towards;<BR>to ascend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युदीक्ष्
प्रत्युदीक्ष् प्रत्य्-उद्-ईक्ष् (प्रति-), cl. 1. A.<BR>-ईक्षते, -ईक्षितुम्, to look up at, look at, perceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्गम्
प्रत्युद्गम् प्रत्य्-उद्-गम्, cl. 1. P. (ep. also<BR>A.) -गच्छति (-ते), -गन्तुम्, to go out towards,<BR>advance towards, go forth against, go out to meet<BR>(a friend or an enemy).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्गत
प्रत्य्-उद्गत, अस्, आ, अम्, gone out towards;<BR>gone forth against; met; risen as from a seat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्गति|प्रत्युद्गतिः
प्रत्य्-उद्गति, इस्, f. or प्रत्य्-उद्गम, अस्, m.<BR>or प्रत्य्-उद्गमन, अम्, n. going forth towards,<BR>going out to meet (especially to meet a guest);<BR>rising from a seat as a mark of respect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्गमनीय|प्रत्युद्गमनीयं
प्रत्य्-उद्गमनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be met re-<BR>spectfully; to be worshipped or reverenced; fit or<BR>suitable for the respectful salutation of a guest; (अम्),<BR>n. a clean suit of clothes or pair of garments, the<BR>upper and lower garments as worn at meals, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्गा
प्रत्युद्गा प्रत्य्-उद्-गा, cl. 3. P. -जिगाति, &c.,<BR>Ved. to rise before or opposite to (as the sun).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्गार
प्रत्युद्गार प्रत्य्-उद्गार, अस्, m. a kind of<BR>nervous disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्गै
प्रत्युद्गै प्रत्य्-उद्-गै, cl. 1. P. -गायति, -गा-<BR>तुम्, Ved. to answer by singing, sing a response.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्ग्रह्
प्रत्युद्ग्रह् प्रत्य्-उद्-ग्रह्, cl. 9. P. A. -गृह्-<BR>णाति, -गृह्णीते, -ग्रहीतुम्, Ved. to set aside, dismiss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्घात
प्रत्युद्घात प्रत्य्-उद्घात, probably an error<BR>for प्रत्य्-उद्यात, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्धृ
प्रत्युद्धृ प्रत्य्-उद्-धृ (-उद्-हृ), cl. 1. P. -ह-<BR>रति, -हर्तुम्, to raise or lift up again, extricate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्धरण|प्रत्युद्धरणं
प्रत्य्-उद्धरण, अम्, n. raising up again; re-<BR>covering, reobtaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्धृत
प्रत्य्-उद्धृत, अस्, आ, अम्, recovered, reobtained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्यम|प्रत्युद्यमः
प्रत्युद्यम प्रत्य्-उद्यम, अस्, m. counter-<BR>balance, counterpoise, equipoise; (अस्, आ, अम्), coun-<BR>terbalancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्यमिन्
प्रत्य्-उद्यमिन् or प्रत्य्-उद्यामिन्, ई, इनी, इ,<BR>Ved. maintaining an equipoise, counterbalancing;<BR>resisting, refractory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्या
प्रत्युद्या प्रत्य्-उद्-या, cl. 2. P. -याति, -यातुम्,<BR>to rise up and go towards or against, rise to meet;<BR>to go out to meet, go to meet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्यात
प्रत्य्-उद्यात, अस्, आ, अम्, met, saluted, welcomed,<BR>received (as a guest); encountered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्यातृ
प्रत्य्-उद्यातृ, ता, त्री, तृ, going forth against,<BR>attacking, an assailant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युद्व्रज्
प्रत्युद्व्रज् प्रत्य्-उद्-व्रज्, cl. 1. P. -व्रजति,<BR>-व्रजितुम्, to go towards, go out to meet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युन्नमन|प्रत्युन्नमनं
प्रत्युन्नमन प्रत्य्-उन्नमन, अम्, n. rising<BR>again, springing up again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युन्मिष्
प्रत्युन्मिष् प्रत्य्-उन्-मिष् (प्रति-उद्-मिष्),<BR>cl. 6. P. -मिषति, -मेषितुम्, ‘to open the eyes<BR>upon,’ to rise or shine forth upon (as the sun); to<BR>break forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपकृ
प्रत्युपकृ प्रत्य्-उप-कृ, cl. 8. A. -कुरुते,<BR>-कर्तुम्, to do a service in return, return a friendly<BR>office, requite a favour; to repay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपकार|प्रत्युपकारः
प्रत्य्-उपकार, अस्, m. requital of aid or assist-<BR>ance, mutual assistance; returning a service or favour,<BR>return of a kindness, gratitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपकारिन्
प्रत्य्-उपकारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, requiting a favour,<BR>returning a kindness, grateful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपक्रिया
प्रत्य्-उपक्रिया, f. requital of a favour, return of<BR>a service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपगम्
प्रत्युपगम् प्रत्य्-उप-गम्, cl. 1. P. -गच्-<BR>छति, -गन्तुम्, to come near, approach, meet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपगत
प्रत्य्-उपगत, अस्, आ, अम्, come near to, ap-<BR>proached, met.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपदिश्
