प्रत्युपदिष्ट
प्रत्य्-उपदिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, advised or cautioned<BR>in return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपदेश|प्रत्युपदेशः
प्रत्य्-उपदेश, अस्, m. teaching or instructing in<BR>return, advice or admonition in return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपद्रु
प्रत्युपद्रु प्रत्य्-उप-द्रु, cl. 1. P. -द्रवति,<BR>-द्रोतुम्, to rush against, fall upon, assail (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपधा
प्रत्युपधा प्रत्य्-उप-धा, cl. 3. P. A. -द-<BR>धाति, -धत्ते, -धातुम्, Ved. to put or place upon,<BR>cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपपन्न
प्रत्युपपन्न प्रत्य्-उपपन्न, प्रत्युपपन्-<BR>न-मति, = प्रत्य्-उत्पन्न, प्रत्युत्पन्न-मति,<BR>q. q. v. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपभुज्
प्रत्युपभुज् प्रत्य्-उप-भुज्, cl. 7. A. -भुङ्क्ते,<BR>-भोक्तुम्, to eat up, consume, eat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपभोग
प्रत्य्-उपभोग, अस्, m. enjoyment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपमान|प्रत्युपमानं
प्रत्युपमान प्रत्य्-उपमान, अम्, n. the coun-<BR>terpart of a likeness or resemblance, copy, model,<BR>pattern; a counter comparison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपया
प्रत्युपया प्रत्य्-उप-या, cl. 2. P. -याति, -या-<BR>तुम्, to go again towards, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपलब्ध
प्रत्युपलब्ध प्रत्य्-उपलब्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, gained<BR>back, regained.<BR>—प्रत्युपलब्ध-चेतस्, आस्, आस्,<BR>अस्, recovering the senses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपविश्
प्रत्युपविश् प्रत्य्-उप-विश्, cl. 6. P. -विशति,<BR>-वेष्टुम्, to sit down opposite to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपवेश|प्रत्युपवेशः
प्रत्य्-उपवेश, अस्, m. or प्रत्य्-उपवेशन, अम्,<BR>n. surrounding or besetting any one in order to<BR>bring him to compliance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपस्थान|प्रत्युपस्थानं
प्रत्युपस्थान प्रत्य्-उपस्थान, अम्, n. prox-<BR>imity, vicinity, neighbourhood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपस्पर्शन
प्रत्युपस्पर्शन प्रत्य्-उपस्पर्शन, अम्, n.,<BR>Ved. rinsing or washing again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपहव
प्रत्युपहव प्रत्य्-उपहव, अस्, m., Ved. a<BR>response to an invitatory formula or the repetition<BR>of an invitatory ejaculation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपहार|प्रत्युपहारः
प्रत्युपहार प्रत्य्-उपहार, अस्, m. placing<BR>again in any one's hands, giving back, restitution;<BR>(अस्, आ, अम्), handing back, restoring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपाकरण
प्रत्युपाकरण प्रत्य्-उपाकरण, अम्, n., Ved.<BR>recommencing the reading (of the Veda), resumption<BR>of study (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपाधा
प्रत्युपाधा प्रत्य्-उपा-धा (प्रति-उप-आ-धा),<BR>cl. 3. P. A. -दधाति, -धत्ते, -धातुम्, to attain<BR>to again, regain, recover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपे
प्रत्युपे प्रत्य्-उपे (प्रति-उप-इ), cl. 2. P.<BR>-उपैति, -उपैतुम्, Ved. to approach again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युपेय
प्रत्य्-उपेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be met; to be dealt<BR>with or treated in turn, to be requited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युप्त
प्रत्युप्त प्रत्य्-उप्त, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. प्रति-वप्),<BR>inserted, set, inlaid, studded; sown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युरस
प्रत्युरस प्रत्य्-उरस, अम्, n. = प्रतिगतम्<BR>उरः; (अम्), ind. against the breast, upon the breast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युलूक|प्रत्युलूकः
प्रत्युलूक प्रत्य्-उलूक, अस्, m. a bird resem-<BR>bling an owl; (according to a Scholiast) a hostile<BR>owl, or a crow regarded as the enemy of the owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युलूकक
प्रत्युलूकक, अस्, m. a bird resembling an owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युष्
प्रत्युष् प्रत्य्-उष्, cl. 1. P. -ओषति, -ओषितुम्,<BR>Ved. to singe, scorch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युष्ट
प्रत्य्-उष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. burnt or consumed<BR>one by one, (according to Mahī-dhara = प्रत्येकं<BR>दग्ध.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युष्य
प्रत्य्-उष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. to be singed or<BR>scorched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युष|प्रत्युषः
प्रत्युष प्रत्य्-उष, अस्, m. or प्रत्य्-उषस्,<BR>अस्, n. morning twilight, early morning, day-break,<BR>dawn; the morning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यूष|प्रत्यूषं|प्रत्यूषः
प्रत्य्-ऊष, अस्, अम्, m. n. morning twilight,<BR>day-break, dawn, morning; (अस्), m. one of the<BR>eight demigods called Vasus; the sun; N. of a man;<BR>(आस्), m. pl., N. of his descendants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यूषस्
प्रत्य्-ऊषस्, अस्, n. morning twilight, day-break,<BR>dawn, morning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यूर्ध्वम्
प्रत्यूर्ध्वम् प्रत्य्-ऊर्ध्वम्, ind. on the upper<BR>side of, above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0628-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यूह्
प्रत्यूह् प्रत्य्-ऊह्, cl. 1. P. A. -ऊहति, -ते,<BR>-ऊहितुम्, to push back; to keep off, ward off; to<BR>reject, refuse; to strip, strip off; to outstrip, surpass,<BR>excel; to interrupt; to disturb; to offer up, present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यूह|प्रत्यूहः
प्रत्य्-ऊह, अस्, m. an obstacle, impediment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यूहन
प्रत्य्-ऊहन, अम्, n., Ved. interruption; leaving<BR>off, discontinuance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यृ
प्रत्यृ प्रत्य्-ऋ, Caus. P. -अर्पयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to cause to go towards, throw towards; to fasten,<BR>fix, put on; to cause to go back, render up, deliver<BR>back, give back, restore, return; to give again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्पण|प्रत्यर्पणं
प्रत्य्-अर्पण, अम्, n. giving back, restoring,<BR>delivering back, returning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्पणीय
प्रत्य्-अर्पणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be given back,<BR>to be returned or restored, to be delivered back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्पित|प्रत्यर्पितं
प्रत्य्-अर्पित, अस्, आ, अम्, fastened, fixed, put on;<BR>delivered back, restored, returned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यृत
प्रत्य्-ऋत, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. inserted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यृचम्
प्रत्यृचम् प्रत्य्-ऋचम्, ind., Ved. at each<BR>verse, in each verse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्ये
प्रत्ये प्रत्य्-ए (प्रति-आ-इ), cl. 2. P. -ऐति,<BR>-ऐतुम्, to come back, return to (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यायन|प्रत्यायनं
2. प्रत्य्-आयन, अम्, n. (for 1. see under प्रती,<BR>p. 623), setting (of the sun).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्येत्य
प्रत्य्-एत्य, ind. having come back, having re-<BR>turned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्येक|प्रत्येकं
प्रत्येक प्रत्य्-एक, अस्, आ, अम्, each one, each<BR>single one, every one; (अम्), ind. one by one, one<BR>at a time, singly, severally; for every single one.<BR>—प्रत्येक-बुद्ध, अस्, m. a Buddha who lives<BR>in seclusion and obtains emancipation for himself<BR>only (as opposed to those Buddhas who liberate<BR>others also).<BR>—प्रत्येकबुद्ध-त्व, अम्, n. the<BR>state of a Pratyeka Buddha.<BR>—प्रत्येक-शस्, ind.<BR>one by one, singly, severally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्येतव्य
प्रत्येतव्य प्रत्य्-एतव्य. See under प्रत्य्-<BR>आय, p. 627, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्येनस्
प्रत्येनस् प्रत्य्-एनस्, आस्, m., Ved. an officer<BR>of justice, punisher of criminals; a surety, the heir<BR>nearest of kin who is responsible for the debts of a<BR>deceased person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्रस्
प्रत्रस् प्र-त्रस्, cl. 1. 4. P. -त्रसति, -त्रस्-<BR>यति, -त्रसितुम्, to flee in terror: Caus. -त्रासयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to frighten or scare away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्रास
प्र-त्रास, अस्, m., Ved. trembling, fear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्वक्षस्
प्रत्वक्षस् प्र-त्वक्षस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, Ved.<BR>active, strong, vigorous; epithet of the Maruts and<BR>Indra; (Sāy.) = शत्रु-घातिन्, destroying the enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्वर्
प्रत्वर् प्र-त्वर्, cl. 1. A. -त्वरते, -त्वरि-<BR>तुम्, to hasten forwards, hasten, speed, make haste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतूर्ण
प्र-तूर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, quick, fleet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतूर्त|प्रतूर्त्त
प्र-तूर्त, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. hastening, speeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतूर्तक
प्रतूर्तक, अस्, आ, अम्, containing the word प्र-<BR>तूर्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतूर्ति
प्र-तूर्ति, इस्, f., Ved. rapid or violent motion,<BR>undulatory motion, haste, speed; (Sāy.) = प्रकृष्ट-<BR>हिंसन, excessive violence; (इस्, इस्, इ), hastening,<BR>rapid, violent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथ्
प्रथ् 1. प्रथ्, cl. 1. P. A. प्रथति, -ते,<BR>पप्राथ, पप्रथे, प्रथिष्यते, अ-<BR>प्रथिष्ट, प्रथितुम्, (P.) to spread, extend<BR>(trans.), prolong (Ved.); (P. A.) to spread, stretch,<BR>extend (intrans.); (A.) to become larger or wider,<BR>increase; to be spread abroad (said of fame, of a<BR>name, of a speech or rumour); to become well<BR>known, become famous or celebrated; to come to<BR>light, appear, arise; to occur (to the mind): Caus.<BR>P. A. प्रथयति, -ते, -यितुम्, Aor. अपप्रथत्, to<BR>spread, stretch, extend (trans.); to increase, augment,<BR>enhance, aggrandize; to spread abroad, proclaim,<BR>celebrate; to bring to light; to unfold, disclose, reveal,<BR>display, show, manifest, evince, to shine upon, give<BR>light to (with acc., Ṛg-veda III. 14, 4); (A.) to<BR>stretch, extend, increase (intrans., Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथ
प्रथ, अस्, m. (said to be the) N. of the author<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">Page0629-b+ 80</a>]<BR>of Ṛg-veda X. 181, 1; (आ), f. spreading out; fame,<BR>celebrity, notoriety (e. g. पृथु-प्रथ, far-famed).<BR>—प्रथापह (˚था-अप्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, destroying<BR>fame, destructive to celebrity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथन|प्रथनं
प्रथन, अस्, m. the plant Phaseolus Mungo<BR>[cf. प्र-घन]; (अम्), n. spreading, extension;<BR>scattering; throwing, projecting; a place where any-<BR>thing is spread; displaying, showing; celebrating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथयत्|प्रथयन्त्
1. प्रथयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, spreading out, ex-<BR>tending; bringing to light, displaying, making mani-<BR>fest; seeing, beholding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथयितृ
प्रथयितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who spreads or<BR>extends; one who proclaims, a proclaimer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथस्
प्रथस्, अस्, n., Ved. width, extension.<BR>—प्र-<BR>थस्-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. wide, spacious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथित|प्रथितः
प्रथित, अस्, आ, अम्, stretched, spread; scattered;<BR>extended, increased; made known, published, openly<BR>announced, declared; famed, famous, celebrated, re-<BR>nowned; disclosed, shown, manifested, evinced; in-<BR>tent upon, engaged in, occupied by, devoted to;<BR>(अस्), m., N. of one of the sons of Manu Svārociṣa.<BR>—प्रथित-त्व, अम्, n. the being known or famous,<BR>celebrity.<BR>—प्रथित-विदिशा-लक्षण, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>renowned under the title of Vidiśā.<BR>—प्रथितानुराग<BR>(˚त-अन्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, manifesting or evincing affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथिति|प्रथितिः
प्रथिति, इस्, f. celebrity, notoriety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथिमन्
प्रथिमन्, आ, m. extension, width, breadth,<BR>greatness, magnitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथिमिन्
प्रथिमिन्, ई, इनी, इ, having size or magnitude,<BR>large, great; (इनी), f., see Scholiast on Pāṇ. V.<BR>2, 137.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथिवी
प्रथिवी, f. the earth; (probably an incorrect<BR>form for पृथिवी.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथिष्ठ|प्रथिष्ठः
प्रथिष्ठ, अस्, आ, अम् (superl. of पृथु),<BR>broadest, widest, largest, very large or great, most<BR>extended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथीयस्
प्रथीयस्, आन्, असी, अस् (compar. of पृथु),<BR>larger, broader, wider, more extended, very large.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथु|प्रथुः
प्रथु, उस्, उस्, उ, = पृथु, wide, wide spread;<BR>an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथुक|प्रथुकः
प्रथुक, अस्, m. = पृथुक, the young of any<BR>animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथ्
प्रथ् 2. प्रथ् or पृथ्, cl. 10. P. प्राथ-<BR>यति or पर्थयति, -यितुम्, to throw,<BR>cast; to extend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राथयत्
2. प्राथयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, throwing, casting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथम|प्रथमः
प्रथम प्रथम, अस्, आ, अम् (connected with<BR>1. प्र; said to be fr. rt. 1. प्रथ्, Uṇādi-s. V. 68;<BR>declined as a pronominal in Atharva-veda VI. 18, 1;<BR>according to Pāṇ. I. 1, 33, the declension follows<BR>शिव except in the nom. pl. m. which may option-<BR>ally be प्रथमे or प्रथमास्), foremost, first,<BR>the first in a series (= आदि, पूर्व); earliest, most<BR>ancient, primary, original; preceding, previous, prior,<BR>earlier, former (sometimes translatable adverbially,<BR>e. g. प्रथमो निवृत्तः, returned first; प्रथमे<BR>प्रेषिता दूताः, messengers sent previously); first,<BR>chief, principal, most excellent, most eminent or<BR>distinguished, matchless, incomparable; (अस्), m.,<BR>scil. वर्ण, the first consonant of a Varga, a hard<BR>letter (= वर्ग-प्˚); scil. पुरुष, the first (= in<BR>European grammars the third) person, a termination<BR>of the first (or according to European grammars<BR>third) person; scil. स्वर, the first tone (in gram-<BR>mar); (आ), f., scil. विभक्ति, the first or nominative<BR>case, a termination of the first or nominative case;<BR>(ए), f. du., scil. विभक्ती, the first two cases, the<BR>terminations of the first two cases; (अम्), ind. first,<BR>firstly, at first, for the first time (opposed to चर-<BR>मम्); just, newly, recently; at once, immediately;<BR>before (with gen., e. g. शक्तेः प्रथमम्, before<BR>strength, i. e. before the forces were ready, Raghu-v.<BR>IV. 24); (आत्), ind. firstly, for the first time; प्र-<BR>थमम् — अनन्तरम्, first — afterwards; प्रथ-<BR>मम् — ततस्, first — next; प्रथमम् — पश्चात्,<BR>first — afterwards; [cf. Gr. πρῶ-το-ς; Lat. primus;<BR>Goth. fru-ma; Lith. pī1r-ma-s.]<BR>—प्रथम-क-<BR>थित, अस्, आ, अम्, aforesaid, before-mentioned,<BR>afore-mentioned.<BR>—प्रथम-कल्प, अस्, m. a<BR>primary or principal rule.<BR>—प्रथम-कल्पित,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-c" target="_blank">Page0629-c+ 79</a>]<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, placed first, first in rank or importance,<BR>having precedence.<BR>—प्रथम-कुसुम, अस् or<BR>अम्, m. or n. (?), white marjoram.<BR>—प्रथम-<BR>गर्भ, अस्, m., Ved. first pregnancy or con-<BR>finement; a first litter; (अस्, आ, अम्), pregnant<BR>for the first time.<BR>—प्रथम-ग्रन्थ, अस्, m.,<BR>N. of a poem by Jagaj-jīvana-dāsa.<BR>—प्रथम-<BR>च्छद्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. covering first, (Sāy. = प्रथ-<BR>मम् आच्छादयितृ); typical, figurative.<BR>—प्र-<BR>थम-ज, अस्, आ, अम्, or प्रथम-जा, आस्, आस्, अम्,<BR>firstborn, a firstling; original, primary; being the<BR>issue of the first (i. e. first-mentioned marriage).<BR>—प्रथम-जात, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. firstborn.<BR>—प्रथम-तस्, ind. first, at first, firstly, in the<BR>first place; previously; forthwith, straightway, im-<BR>mediately; before, in preference to (with gen.).<BR>—प्रथम-दर्शन, अम्, n. first sight; (ए), ind.<BR>at first sight.<BR>—प्रथम-दिवस, अस्, m. a first<BR>day, principal day.<BR>—प्रथम-दुग्ध, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, Ved. just milked.<BR>—प्रथम-परिगृहीत,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, formerly married.<BR>—प्रथम-पुरुष,<BR>अस्, m. the first (= in European grammars the third)<BR>person in the verb, a termination of the first (or ac-<BR>cording to European grammars third) person.<BR>—प्र-<BR>थम-भाज्, क्, क्, क्, Ved. one to whom the first<BR>share is due; (Sāy. = उत्पत्ति-काल एव विभक्तृ,<BR>dividing or distinguishing beings at the time of crea-<BR>tion.)<BR>—प्रथम-मङ्गल, अस्, आ, अम्, highly<BR>auspicious.<BR>—प्रथम-यज्ञ, अस्, m., Ved. the first<BR>sacrifice.<BR>—प्रथम-यौवन, अम्, n. early youth,<BR>early age.<BR>—प्रथम-रात्र, अस्, m., Ved. the<BR>beginning of night.<BR>—प्रथम-वयस्, अस्, n.<BR>earliest age, youth.<BR>—प्रथम-वयसिन्, ई, इनी, इ,<BR>Ved. being in early youth, young.<BR>—प्रथम-<BR>वास्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. worn formerly (as a gar-<BR>ment).<BR>—प्रथम-वित्ता, f., Ved. a first wife.<BR>—प्रथम-विरह, अस्, m. first separation; (ए),<BR>ind. immediately after separation.<BR>—प्रथम-<BR>वृत्तान्त, अस्, m. former circumstances, earlier his-<BR>tory, antecedents.<BR>—प्रथम-वैयाकरण, अस्,<BR>m. a beginner in grammar; a distinguished or first-<BR>rate grammarian.<BR>—प्रथम-श्रवस्, आस्, आस्, अस्,<BR>Ved. having a distinguished reputation; (Sāy. =<BR>अतिशयितं धनं यशो वा यस्य.)<BR>—प्रथम-<BR>सङ्गम, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR>—प्रथम-सा-<BR>हस, अस्, m. the first or lowest degree of punishment<BR>or fine.<BR>—प्रथम-सुकृत, अम्, n. a former<BR>service or kindness.<BR>—प्रथम-स्थान, अम्, n.,<BR>Ved. the first or lowest scale (in pronunciation, low<BR>but audible).<BR>—प्रथम-स्वर, अम्, n., N. of a<BR>Sāman.<BR>—प्रथमागामिन् (˚म-आग्˚), ई, इनी, इ,<BR>occurring first, first mentioned.<BR>—प्रथमादेश<BR>(˚म-आद्˚), अस्, m. placing (a word) at the beginning<BR>of a sentence.<BR>—प्रथमाभितप्त (˚म-अभ्˚),<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, first scorched or scalded (with tears).<BR>—प्रथमार्ध (˚म-अर्˚), अस् or अम्, m. or<BR>n. (?), the first half.<BR>—प्रथमावर-त्व (˚म-<BR>अव्˚), अम्, n. the being the first and the last.<BR>—प्र-<BR>थमास्तमित (˚म-अस्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. just set<BR>(said of the sun).<BR>—प्रथमेतर (˚म-इत्˚), अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, ‘other than first,’ the second.<BR>—प्रथमोत्-<BR>पन्न (˚म-उत्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, produced first, first-<BR>born.<BR>—प्रथमोदित (˚म-उद्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, first<BR>uttered, uttered previously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथमक
प्रथमक, अस्, आ, अम्, first, foremost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रथयितृ
प्रथयितृ प्रथयितृ, प्रथस्, &c. See<BR>under rt. 1. प्रथ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद|प्रदः
प्रद प्र-द, &c. See प्र-दा, p. 630, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदक्षिण|प्रदक्षिणं|प्रदक्षिणः
प्रदक्षिण प्र-दक्षिण, अस्, आ, अम्, moving<BR>to the right, standing or placed on the right; auspi-<BR>cious, favourable, of good omen; respectful, reve-<BR>rential; (अस्, आ, अम्), m. f. n. turning the right side<BR>towards (any one), reverential salutation by circum-<BR>ambulation from left to right so that the right side<BR>is towards the person saluted; (अम्), ind. from left<BR>to right, towards the right side, so that the right<BR>side is turned towards a person or object (as a sign<BR>of respect, e. g. पूज्यः प्रदक्षिणम्, to be<BR>honoured by keeping the right side towards him);<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">Page0630-a+ 75</a>]<BR>प्रदक्षिणं कृ or प्र-कृ, to pass on the right,<BR>turn the right side towards (in token of respect);<BR>towards the south, in a southern direction [from the<BR>east, Manu III. 87]; (एण), ind. from left to right;<BR>towards the south; अ-प्रदक्षिणम्, ‘not towards<BR>the right,’ towards the left.<BR>—प्रदक्षिण-क्रिया,<BR>f. turning the right side towards (any one), showing<BR>respect.<BR>—प्रदक्षिण-पट्टिका, f. a yard, a<BR>court-yard.<BR>—प्रदक्षिण-प्रक्रमण, अम्, n.<BR>proceeding with the right side towards (anything).<BR>—प्रदक्षिणार्चिस् (˚ण-अर्˚), इस्, इस्, इस्, having<BR>flames turned towards the right, flaming towards the<BR>right.<BR>—प्रदक्षिणावर्त (˚ण-आव्˚), अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>turned towards the right.<BR>—प्रदक्षिणावृत्क<BR>(˚ण-आव्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, turned towards the right,<BR>having (any one or anything) on the right.<BR>—प्र-<BR>दक्षिणी-कृ, cl. 8. P. A. -करोति, -कुरुते, to turn<BR>the right side towards (with acc.); to go round from<BR>left to right.<BR>—प्रदक्षिणी-कृत्य, ind. having<BR>gone round from left to right.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0629-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदक्षिणय
प्रदक्षिणय, Nom. P. प्रदक्षिणयति,<BR>यितुम्, to go round from left to right.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदक्षिणित्
प्रदक्षिणित्, ind., Ved. = प्र-दक्षिणम्, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदग्ध
प्रदग्ध प्र-दग्ध, &c. See प्र-दह् below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदत्त|प्रदत्तं
प्रदत्त प्र-दत्त, &c. See col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदम्
प्रदम् प्र-दम्, Caus. P. A. -दमयति, -ते,<BR>-यितुम्, to subdue, conquer, overpower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदान्त
प्र-दान्त, आस्, m. pl., N. of a school.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदाम्
प्र-दाम्, -दान्, m. one who tames or subdues;<BR>[cf. Pāṇ. VIII. 2, 64.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदर|प्रदरः
प्रदर प्र-दर. See प्र-दॄ, p. 631, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदर्प|प्रदर्पः
प्रदर्प प्र-दर्प, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 3. दृप् with<BR>प्र), pride, arrogance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदृपित
प्र-दृपित in अ-प्˚, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदृप्त
प्र-दृप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, proud, haughty, conceited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदृप्ति|प्रदृप्तिः
प्र-दृप्ति, इस्, f. haughtiness, arrogance, madness;<BR>(Sāy. = अनर्थ-हेतुः प्रदर्पः.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदर्श|प्रदर्शः
प्रदर्श प्र-दर्श, &c. See प्र-दृश्, p. 631.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदल|प्रदलः
प्रदल प्र-दल, अस्, m. an arrow (= प्र-<BR>दर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदव|प्रदवः
प्रदव प्र-दव, प्र-दव्य, प्र-दाव्य. See<BR>प्र-दु, col. 3, and p. 631, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदस्
प्रदस् प्र-दस्, cl. 4. P. -दस्यति, -दसितुम्,<BR>to dry up, become dry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदह्
प्रदह् प्र-दह्, cl. 1. P. -दहति, -दग्धुम्,<BR>to burn, consume, destroy: Pass. -दह्यते, to take<BR>fire, be consumed by fire, be burnt, burn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदग्ध
प्र-दग्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, burnt, consumed, de-<BR>stroyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदग्धव्य
प्र-दग्धव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be burnt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदाह|प्रदाहः
प्र-दाह, अस्, m., Ved. burning, destroying by fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदा
प्रदा प्र-दा (see rt. 1. दा), cl. 3. P. (rarely<BR>in the earlier language A.) -ददाति (-दत्ते), -दातुम्,<BR>to give away, give to, give; to give up, deliver; to<BR>offer, present, grant; to give a daughter in marriage;<BR>to sell (with inst. of the price); to restore; to put in,<BR>place in; (with ऋणम्) to pay, discharge a debt;<BR>(with विद्याम्) to communicate or impart know-<BR>ledge; (with प्रतिवचः) to give an answer; (with<BR>युद्धम्) to give battle; (with द्वन्द्व-युद्-<BR>धम्) to engage in single combat; (with प्र-<BR>वृत्तिम्) to give information of an event; (with<BR>हुताशनम्) to set fire to: Pass. -दीयते, to be<BR>given away, to be given: Caus. -दापयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to cause to give, compel to give back or to repay; to<BR>cause to put or place in: Desid. -दित्सते, to wish to<BR>give in marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्त|प्रत्तं
प्र-त्त, अस्, आ, अम् (for प्र-दत्त), given away,<BR>given, offered, presented; given in marriage, be-<BR>trothed, married.<BR>—प्रत्त-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, one who<BR>has given or presented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्ति
प्र-त्ति, इस्, f. (for प्र-दत्ति), Ved. giving away,<BR>giving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद|प्रदः
प्र-द, अस्, आ, अम्, giving away, giving, a giver,<BR>bestower, yielding, presenting, granting, bestowing,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">Page0630-b+ 78</a>]<BR>conferring (generally at the end of a comp.; cf.<BR>बहु-प्˚, प्राण-प्˚, रुचि-प्˚, शाप-प्˚, सस्य-प्˚);<BR>liberal, bountiful; (आ), f. a gift.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदत्त|प्रदत्तं
प्र-दत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, given away, given, offered,<BR>presented, bestowed, granted; given in marriage;<BR>(अस्), m., N. of a Gandharva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रददि
प्र-ददि, इस्, इस्, इ, Ved. liberal, bountiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदातव्य
प्र-दातव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be given away, to be<BR>given; to be given back; to be given in marriage;<BR>to be placed in or put into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदातृ
प्र-दातृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who gives or bestows,<BR>giving, liberal; a giver, donor; one who gives a<BR>daughter away in marriage; ‘the giver,’ an epithet<BR>of Indra; N. of a divinity enumerated among the<BR>Viśve Devāḥ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदान|प्रदानं
1. प्र-दान, अम्, n. (for 2. प्र-दान see below),<BR>giving, offering, presenting, bestowing, granting [cf.<BR>पाणि-प्˚, वर-प्˚]; an oblation (especially one made<BR>by fire); the words or sacred texts recited during<BR>an oblation by fire (for प्रदान-मन्त्र); impart-<BR>ing, communicating, teaching [cf. वेद-प्˚, and see<BR>Manu II. 171]; giving away in marriage; applying<BR>(a clyster); a gift, present.<BR>—प्रदान-कृपण,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, mean or niggardly in making presents.<BR>—प्रदान-पूर्वम्, ind. with a present.<BR>—प्र-<BR>दान-रुचि, इस्, f. ‘delighting in giving,’ N. of a<BR>man.<BR>—प्रदान-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, giving, liberal.<BR>—प्रदान-शूर, अस्, m., lit. a hero in giving,<BR>i. e. an excessively liberal man [cf. दान-शूर,<BR>दान-वीर]; N. of a Bodhi-sattva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदानक|प्रदानकं
प्रदानक, अम्, n. an offering, oblation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदानिक
प्रदानिक, अस्, आ, अम्, (at the end of a comp.)<BR>relating to giving or offering; [cf. दत्ताप्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदापयितृ
प्र-दापयितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who causes to<BR>give; (Ved.) one who gives, a giver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदाप्य
प्र-दाप्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be caused to give, to<BR>be compelled to pay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदाय|प्रदायं
प्र-दाय, अम्, n. a present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदायक
प्र-दायक, अस्, इका, अम्, giving, granting, pre-<BR>senting, bestowing.<BR>—प्रदायक-त्व, अम्, n. the<BR>being a giver, giving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदायिन्
प्र-दायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, giving away, giving, a giver,<BR>granting, presenting.<BR>—प्रदायि-त्व, अम्, n. the<BR>being a giver, giving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदि|प्रदिः
प्र-दि, इस्, m. a gift, present (Schol. on Pāṇ. III.<BR>3, 92).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदित्सु
प्र-दित्सु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing or intending to<BR>give (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदेय|प्रदेयः
प्र-देय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be given or granted, to<BR>be offered or awarded to (in these senses sometimes<BR>compounded with a word denoting the recipient,<BR>cf. राज-प्˚, शिष्य-प्˚); to be imparted, to be taught<BR>or instructed; to be given in marriage, marriageable;<BR>(अस्), m. a present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदान|प्रदानं
प्रदान 2. प्र-दान, अम्, n. (fr. rt. 3. दा<BR>with प्र), a goad. (For. 1. प्र-दान see above.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदान्त
प्रदान्त प्र-दान्त, &c. See प्र-दम्, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदिग्ध|प्रदिग्धं
प्रदिग्ध प्र-दिग्ध. See प्र-दिह्, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदिव्
प्रदिव् प्र-दिव्, -द्यौस्, f., Ved. the third<BR>or highest heaven (in which the Pitṛs are said to<BR>dwell); the fifth of the seven heavens; (according to<BR>Sāy.) = पुराण, existing from olden times, ancient;<BR>प्र-दिवस्, ind. from the remotest or earliest times,<BR>from of old, long since, always, constantly, ever; अनु<BR>प्रदिवः, as of old, as formerly; (प्र-दिवि), ind.<BR>at all times, always, constantly, ever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदिश्
प्रदिश् 1. प्र-दिश्, cl. 6. P. -दिशति, -देष्टुम्,<BR>to point out, show; to signify, announce, declare,<BR>communicate, make known; to direct; to appoint,<BR>ordain, prescribe, instruct; to urge on, incite; to<BR>assign; cl. 4. P. -दिश्यति, &c., to grant: Caus.<BR>-देशयति, -यितुम्, to urge on, incite: Intens.<BR>-देदेष्टि, to animate (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदिश्
2. प्र-दिश्, क्, f. pointing to, pointing out; direc-<BR>tion, order, command, instruction; a direction, quarter,<BR>region of the sky (of which from four to seven are<BR>enumerated in the Veda; पित्र्या प्रदिश्, the region<BR>of the Pitṛs, i. e. the south; प्रदिशो गतम्, gone<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">Page0630-c+ 77</a>]<BR>towards all quarters of the heavens); an intermediate<BR>point of the compass or half quarter, as north-east,<BR>south-west, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदिश्यमान
प्र-दिश्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being pointed out,<BR>being urged on or incited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदिष्ट
प्र-दिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, pointed out, announced,<BR>declared; directed, ordained, appointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदेश|प्रदेशः
प्र-देश, अस्, m. pointing out, showing; direc-<BR>tion, decision, determination; appealing to a pre-<BR>cedent; an example (in grammar &c.); a place,<BR>(प्रदेशेषु, in various places), spot, region; a<BR>country, district, foreign country; a wall; a short<BR>span measured from the tip of the thumb to that of<BR>the forefinger.<BR>—प्रदेश-कारिन्, ई, m. epithet of a<BR>kind of ascetic.<BR>—प्रदेश-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, possess-<BR>ing or occupying a place.<BR>—प्रदेश-शास्त्र, अम्, n. a<BR>book containing examples (in grammar).<BR>—प्रदेश-<BR>स्थ, अस्, आ, अम्, being or situated in a district.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदेशन|प्रदेशनं
प्र-देशन, अम्, n. a gift, present, bribe; an<BR>offering, anything given to the gods, to superiors,<BR>or friends; (ई), f. the index finger, forefinger; the<BR>corresponding toe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदेशित
प्र-देशित, अस्, आ, अम्, urged, directed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदेशिनी
प्र-देशिनी, f. the index finger, forefinger; the<BR>corresponding toe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदेष्टृ
प्र-देष्टृ, टा, m. one who pronounces judg-<BR>ment, a judge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदिह्
प्रदिह् प्र-दिह्, cl. 2. P. -देग्धि, -देग्धुम्,<BR>to smear over, besmear, smear, daub, anoint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदिग्ध|प्रदिग्धं
प्र-दिग्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, smeared over, besmeared,<BR>daubed, bedaubed, anointed, overspread; (अम्), n.,<BR>scil. मांस, a kind of dish prepared with meat;<BR>(अस्), m. a kind of sauce or gravy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदेह|प्रदेहः
प्र-देह, अस्, m. a plaster, a thick or viscid<BR>ointment; applying a plaster, unction; solid food<BR>(perhaps inspissated juice and the like).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदीदी
प्रदीदी प्र-दीदी = प्र-दीधी below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदीधी
प्रदीधी प्र-दीधी (see rt. 1. दीधी), cl. 2. A.<BR>-दीधीते, &c., Ved. to shine forth, shine brilliantly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदीध्यान
प्र-दीध्यान, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. shining forth,<BR>shining brilliantly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदीप्
प्रदीप् प्र-दीप्, cl. 4. A. -दीप्यते, -दीपितुम्,<BR>to flame forth, blaze, burst into flames: Caus. -दीप-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to set on fire, set fire to, light, kindle,<BR>inflame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदीप|प्रदीपः
प्र-दीप, अस्, m. a light, a lamp, lantern; that<BR>which illuminates or illustrates, an enlightener; (often<BR>at the end of a comp., e. g. कुल-प्˚, ‘the light of<BR>a family;’ especially in titles of explanatory works,<BR>cf. महाभाष्य-प्˚.)<BR>—प्रदीप-मञ्जरी, f., N.<BR>of a commentary by Rāmeśvara on the Amara-<BR>koṣa.<BR>—प्रदीप-शरण-ध्वज, अस्, m., N. of<BR>a Mahoraga-rāja.<BR>—प्रदीप-साह, अस्, m. (साह<BR>= شاه), N. of a prince.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदीपक
प्रदीपक, अस्, इका, m. f. a small lamp, a lamp;<BR>(अस्, इका, अम्), illuminating, illustrating, clearing up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदीपन|प्रदीपनः
प्र-दीपन, अस्, ई, अम्, inflaming, illuminating;<BR>stimulating, exciting; (अम्), n. the act of kindling,<BR>inflaming, igniting, exciting, &c.; (अस्), m. a sort of<BR>mineral poison (of a red colour and caustic in its action).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदीपाय
प्रदीपाय, Nom. A. प्रदीपायते, -यितुम्, to re-<BR>present a lamp, to act as a lamp, act the part of a lamp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदीपीय
प्रदीपीय or प्रदीप्य. See Gaṇa to Pāṇ. V.<BR>1, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदीप्त
प्र-दीप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, kindled, inflamed, lighted<BR>up, illuminated; blazing, burning, shining; excited,<BR>stimulated; clear, shrill (opposed to पूर्ण, as a<BR>term of augury?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदीप्ति|प्रदीप्तिः
प्र-दीप्ति, इस्, f. light, lustre, splendor, brilliancy.<BR>—प्रदीप्ति-मत्, आन्, अती, अत्, bright, radiant, lu-<BR>minous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदीर्घ
प्रदीर्घ प्र-दीर्घ, अस्, आ, अम्, exceedingly<BR>long.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदु
प्रदु प्र-दु, cl. 4. A. -दूयते, -दोतुम्, to<BR>be consumed by fire; cl. 5. P. -दुनोति, &c., to<BR>distress, pain, torment, torture; to press hard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदव|प्रदवः
प्र-दव, अस्, आ, अम्, burning, inflaming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0630-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदव्य|प्रदव्यः
प्र-दव्य or प्र-दाव्य, अस्, m., Ved., scil.<BR>अग्नि, a forest fire (= दावाग्नि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदुष्
प्रदुष् प्र-दुष्, cl. 4. P. -दुष्यति, -दोष्टुम्,<BR>to become worse, deteriorate; to be defiled or pol-<BR>luted; to do amiss, act improperly, fall (morally);<BR>to commit an offence against (with acc.): Caus.<BR>-दूषयति, -यितुम्, to spoil, deprave, corrupt; to<BR>defile, pollute, contaminate, vitiate, damage; to speak<BR>ill of, abuse, blame, censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदुष्ट
प्र-दुष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, corrupt, wicked, bad,<BR>wrong, sinful; licentious, wanton, infamous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदूषण|प्रदूषणं
प्र-दूषण, अस्, ई, अम्, corrupting, spoiling;<BR>defiling, contaminating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदूषित
प्र-दूषित, अस्, आ, अम्, corrupted, spoilt; de-<BR>praved, vitiated; defiled, polluted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदोष|प्रदोषः
प्र-दोष, अस्, आ, अम्, corrupt, bad, wicked;<BR>(अस्), m. defect, fault, offence, sin, transgression,<BR>guilt; a disordered condition (of the body or of the<BR>state), mutiny, insurrection, rebellion; the first part<BR>of the night, evening twilight, evening, nightfall;<BR>Evening personified (and associated with Niśitha and<BR>Vyuṣṭa as a son of Doṣā); (अम्), ind., Ved. in<BR>the evening, in the dark.<BR>—प्रदोष-काल, अस्, m.<BR>evening tide.<BR>—प्रदोष-तिमिर, अम्, n. evening<BR>darkness, the dusk of early night.<BR>—प्रदोष-पूजा-<BR>विधि, इस्, m. and प्रदोष-शिव-पूजा, f., N. of<BR>two works.<BR>—प्रदोष-रमणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, plea-<BR>sant or delightful in the evenings.<BR>—प्रदोषागम<BR>(˚ष-आग्˚), अस्, m. the coming on of evening, nightfall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदोषक|प्रदोषकः
प्रदोषक, अस्, आ, अम्, born in the evening;<BR>(according to a Scholiast) a proper N.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदुह्
प्रदुह् 1. प्र-दुह्, cl. 2. P. A. -दोग्धि, -दुग्-<BR>धे, -दोग्धुम्, to milk; to yield milk or any<BR>desired object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदुह्
2. प्र-दुह्, -धुक्, क्, क्, milking, milking well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदोह|प्रदोहः
प्र-दोह, अस्, m. milking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदोहन
प्र-दोहन, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदृप्ति|प्रदृप्तिः
प्रदृप्ति प्र-दृप्ति. See प्र-दर्प, p. 630.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदृश्
प्रदृश् प्र-दृश्, cl. 1. P. -पश्यति, -द्रष्-<BR>टुम्, to look forward, see in front, foresee; to see,<BR>behold, view; to perceive, observe, discern, distin-<BR>guish, learn; to look at, look upon; to regard,<BR>judge; to have a view or opinion; to be intelligent:<BR>Pass. -दृश्यते, to become visible, to be seen or<BR>observed; to look, appear: Caus. -दर्शयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to foreshow, show forth, bring to light, make<BR>visible, display, exhibit; to describe; to make clear,<BR>explain, teach: Desid. -दिदृक्षति, to wish to see.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदर्श|प्रदर्शः
प्र-दर्श, अस्, m. looking, look, appearance;<BR>direction, injunction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदर्शक|प्रदर्शकः
प्र-दर्शक, अस्, इका, अम्, foreshowing, fore-<BR>telling, presaging; a prophet; showing, exhibiting,<BR>displaying; presenting; proclaiming, announcing;<BR>propounding, teaching, instructing; a teacher, in-<BR>structor, expounder; a doctrine, principle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदर्शन|प्रदर्शनं
प्र-दर्शन, अम्, n. foreshowing, prophesying;<BR>look, appearance, aspect, (often at the end of comps.,<BR>e. g. घोर-प्˚, of terrible aspect); showing, pointing<BR>out, manifesting, displaying, bringing to light, indi-<BR>cating; explaining, specifying, teaching; an example;<BR>(आस्), m. pl. a class of deities under Manu Auttami.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदर्शित|प्रदर्शितः
प्र-दर्शित, अस्, आ, अम्, foreshown, prophesied;<BR>shown forth, shown, brought to light, manifested,<BR>exhibited, evinced; made known, signified; rendered<BR>clear, taught; mentioned, declared, specified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदर्शिन्
प्र-दर्शिन्, ई, इनी, इ, seeing, viewing; pointing<BR>out, showing, indicating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदर्श्य
प्र-दर्श्य, ind. having exhibited or shown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपश्यत्
प्र-पश्यत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, foreseeing, looking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदॄ
प्रदॄ प्र-दॄ, cl. 9. P. -दृणाति, -दरितुम्,<BR>-दरीतुम्, to break or tear to pieces (Ved.): Pass.<BR>-दीर्यते, to cleave asunder, split open (intrans.);<BR>to be dispersed or scattered: Caus. -दारयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to split, cleave, tear asunder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदर|प्रदरः
प्र-दर, अस्, m. splitting, rending, tearing; a<BR>fracture, breach, crack, crevice, cleft in the earth; the<BR>dispersion of an army; a particular disease of women,<BR>mænorrhagia; an arrow; (आस्), m. pl., N. of a people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदेश|प्रदेशः
प्रदेश प्र-देश. See p. 630, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रदोष|प्रदोषः
प्रदोष प्र-दोष. See col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्यु
प्रद्यु प्र-द्यु, उ, n. (fr. प्र + 3. द्यु or 3.<BR>दिव्), good works leading to heaven, works securing<BR>heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्युत्
प्रद्युत् प्र-द्युत्, cl. 1. A. -द्योतते, -द्योति-<BR>तुम्, to begin to shine or to be brilliant: Caus. -द्यो-<BR>तयति, -यितुम्, to irradiate, illumine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्युतित
प्र-द्युतित, अस्, आ, अम्, beginning to shine or<BR>to be brilliant; illuminated, irradiated, lighted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्योत|प्रद्योतः
प्र-द्योत, अस्, m. illumining, irradiating; splen-<BR>dor, lustre, light; a ray of light; N. of a Yakṣa;<BR>of a king of Magadha and founder of a dynasty; of<BR>a king of Ujjayinī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्योतन|प्रद्योतनं|प्रद्योतनः
प्र-द्योतन, अस्, m. the sun; N. of a prince of<BR>Ujjayinī; (अम्), n. blazing, shining, light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्योतित
प्र-द्योतित, अस्, आ, अम्, = प्र-द्युतित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्योतिन्
प्र-द्योतिन्, ई, इनी, इ, illumining, irradiating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्युम्न|प्रद्युम्नः
प्रद्युम्न प्र-द्युम्न, अस्, m. (fr. प्र +<BR>द्युम्न, see p. 438, col. 1), ‘the pre-eminently<BR>mighty one,’ an epithet of Kāma-deva the god of<BR>love, or of that deity in another birth (regarded as a<BR>son of Kṛṣṇa and Rukmiṇī, or as a son of Saṅkar-<BR>ṣaṇa and then identified with Sanat-kumāra); N. of<BR>a son of Manu and Naḍvalā; of an astronomer; of<BR>a mountain (?); of a river.<BR>—प्रद्युम्न-पुर,<BR>अम्, n. ‘Pradyumna's city,’ N. of a town on the<BR>Candra-bhāgā or Chenab.<BR>—प्रद्युम्न-विजय, अस्,<BR>m. ‘Pradyumna's victory (over Vajra-nābha),’ N. of a<BR>drama by Śaṅkara-dīkṣita.<BR>—प्रद्युम्नागमन<BR>(˚न-आग्˚), अम्, n. the arrival of Pradyumna.<BR>—प्र-<BR>द्युम्नागमनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, treating of the<BR>arrival of Pradyumna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्रव|प्रद्रवः
प्रद्रव प्र-द्रव, प्र-द्राव. See below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्राणक
प्रद्राणक प्र-द्राणक, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. 2.<BR>द्रा with प्र), sorely distressed, very needy or<BR>indigent, very poor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्रु
प्रद्रु प्र-द्रु, cl. 1. P. -द्रवति, -द्रोतुम्,<BR>to run forwards, run away, flee, escape, escape to<BR>(with acc.); to hasten, hasten away, go away; to<BR>hasten towards, rush against; to fall upon, assail;<BR>to attain: Caus. -द्रावयति, -यितुम्, to cause to<BR>run away, put to flight, rout.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्रव|प्रद्रवः
प्र-द्रव, अस्, आ, अम्, fluid, liquid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्राव|प्रद्रावः
प्र-द्राव, अस्, m. running away, running, flight,<BR>retreat, escape; going, going quickly or well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्राविन्
प्र-द्राविन्, ई, इणी, इ, runaway, fugitive; one who<BR>retreats or flies, retreating, flying, going.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्रुह्
प्रद्रुह् प्र-द्रुह्, -ध्रुक्, क्, क्, one who<BR>hurts or injures, trying to hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्रेक्
प्रद्रेक् प्र-द्रेक्, cl. 1. A. -द्रेकते, -द्रेकि-<BR>तुम्, to shout out; to neigh, to roar, bellow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्वार्
प्रद्वार् प्र-द्वार्, f. or प्र-द्वार, अम्, n. a<BR>place before a door or gate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्विष्
प्रद्विष् 1. प्र-द्विष्, cl. 2. P. A. -द्वेष्टि,<BR>-द्विष्टे, -द्वेष्टुम्, to feel dislike or repugnance<BR>for, dislike, hate; to show one's hatred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्विष्
2. प्र-द्विष्, ट्, ट्, ट्, feeling dislike or repugnance<BR>for, disliking, hating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्विषत्
प्र-द्विषत्, अन्, अती, अत्, feeling dislike or re-<BR>pugnance for, hating, hostile, an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्वेष|प्रद्वेषः
प्र-द्वेष, अस्, m. dislike, repugnance, aversion,<BR>disinclination, hatred, hostility; (ई), f., N. of the<BR>wife of Dīrgha-tamas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्वेषण|प्रद्वेषणं
प्र-द्वेषण, अम्, n. hating, hatred, hostility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रद्वेष्टृ
प्र-द्वेष्टृ, टा, ट्री, टृ, one who dislikes or<BR>hates, a disliker, hater.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रध
प्रध प्र-ध. See under प्र-धा, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधन|प्रधनं
प्रधन प्र-धन, अम्, n. spoil taken in<BR>battle, a prize gained by a victor; a contest, conflict,<BR>combat, fight, war, battle [cf. धन]; tearing,<BR>rending, destruction, destroying; (अस्), m., N. of a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-c" target="_blank">Page0631-c+ 79</a>]<BR>man; (आस्), m. pl., N. of his descendants.<BR>—प्र-<BR>धनोत्तम (˚न-उत्˚), अम्, n. ‘best of battles,’ a<BR>great battle or contest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधन्य
प्रधन्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. forming or consti-<BR>tuting the spoil or booty (as cattle).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधमन|प्रधमनं
प्रधमन प्र-धमन. See under 1. प्र-<BR>ध्मा, p. 632, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधर्ष|प्रधर्षः
प्रधर्ष प्र-धर्ष, &c. See under प्र-<BR>धृष्, p. 632, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधा
प्रधा प्र-धा, cl. 3. P. A. -दधाति, -धत्ते,<BR>-धातुम्, to place or set before, offer; to give up,<BR>deliver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रध
प्र-ध, अस्, आ, अम्, holding, having; (आ), f.,<BR>see Scholiast on Pāṇ. VI. 4, 64; N. of a daughter<BR>of Dakṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधान|प्रधानं|प्रधानः
प्र-धान, अस्, आ, अम्, chief, main, principal,<BR>capital (city); pre-eminent, most eminent, most ex-<BR>cellent, best; prevalent, predominant, preponderant,<BR>principally or pre-eminently inherent; (अम्), n. a chief<BR>or principal thing, chief object, the most important<BR>thing, the head, chief, (often at the end of a comp.,<BR>e. g. इन्द्र-प्रधान, having Indra as the chief<BR>object; cf. धर्म-प्˚, विनय-प्˚, यथा-प्रधा-<BR>नम्); (in Sāṅkhya phil.) = प्रकृति, ‘the Ori-<BR>ginant,’ primary or original matter or rather the<BR>primary germ out of which all material appearances<BR>are evolved, the first evolver or source of the material<BR>world (hence in a general acceptation ‘nature’ or<BR>rather ‘matter’ as opposed to पुरुष or ‘spirit’);<BR>the Supreme Spirit, the Supreme Deity; intellect, un-<BR>derstanding; (in grammar) the principal member of a<BR>compound (opposed to the उप-सर्जन or secondary<BR>member by which the primary member is qualified);<BR>(अस्, अम्), m. n. the first companion or attendant of<BR>a king, his minister or counsellor, his eunuch or con-<BR>fidant; a courtier, a noble; an elephant-driver; (अस्),<BR>m., N. of an ancient king.<BR>—प्रधान-कर्मन्,<BR>अ, n. or प्रधान-कार्य, अम्, n. chief or principal<BR>action; the principal mode of treatment (in medi-<BR>cine).<BR>—प्रधान-तम, अस्, आ, अम्, the most<BR>excellent or distinguished, most important, chiefest.<BR>—प्रधान-तर, अस्, आ, अम्, more excellent,<BR>better.<BR>—प्रधान-तस्, ind. according to eminence<BR>or superiority.<BR>—प्रधान-ता, f. pre-eminence,<BR>excellence, superiority, supremacy, prevalence; the<BR>being Pra-dhāna, q. v., (in Mahā-bh. Vana-p. 173<BR>= जगत्-कारणता; cf. शरीर-प्˚.)<BR>—प्रधान-<BR>त्व, अम्, n. pre-eminence, superiority, excellence;<BR>(in Sāṅkhya phil.) the being Pra-dhāna, q. v.<BR>—प्रधान-धातु, उस्, m. the chief element or<BR>ingredient of the body, semen virile.<BR>—प्रधान-<BR>पुरुष, अस्, m. a chief person, most distinguished<BR>personage; an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—प्रधान-पुरु-<BR>षातीत (˚ष-अत्˚), अस्, m. transcending Pradhāna<BR>and Puruṣa (matter and spirit); an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—प्रधान-भाज्, क्, क्, क्, receiving the chief share,<BR>presiding over; the most excellent or distinguished.<BR>—प्रधान-मन्त्रिन्, ई, m. a prime minister.<BR>—प्रधान-मित्र, अम्, n. a chief friend.<BR>—प्र-<BR>धान-वासस्, असी, n. du. two principal garments, best<BR>clothes.<BR>—प्रधान-वृष्टि, इस्, f. very copious rain,<BR>heaviest rain.<BR>—प्रधान-शिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, taught<BR>or laid down as of primary importance; [cf. अन्वा-<BR>चय-शिष्ट.]<BR>—प्रधान-सेवा, f. chief or prin-<BR>cipal service.<BR>—प्रधानाङ्ग (˚न-अङ्˚), अम्, n. a<BR>chief member, the chief member of the body; most<BR>eminent person in a state; principal branch of a<BR>science, &c.<BR>—प्रधानात्मन् (˚न-आत्˚), आ, m. the<BR>highest personal principle, the chief soul, an epithet<BR>of Viṣṇu; one with crude nature or Viśva-bhāvana.<BR>—प्रधानाध्यक्ष (˚न-अध्˚), अस्, m. a chief<BR>superintendent.<BR>—प्रधानाध्यक्ष-ता (˚न-<BR>अध्˚), f. the office of chief superintendent.<BR>—प्र-<BR>धानामात्य (˚न-अम्˚), अस्, m. a prime minister.<BR>—प्रधानोत्तम (˚न-उत्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, best of<BR>the eminent, eminent, illustrious; warlike, brave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधानक
प्रधानक, अम्, n. (in Sāṅkhya phil.) primary or<BR>original matter (= प्र-धान, अ-व्यक्त, q. q. v. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधान्य
प्रधान्य, a wrong reading for प्राधान्य, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0631-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधि|प्रधिः
प्र-धि, इस्, m. that which is placed round the<BR>nave of a wheel, the circumference or periphery of<BR>a wheel; a well.<BR>—प्रधि-मण्डल, अम्, n. the<BR>circumference of a wheel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधाव्
प्रधाव् 1. प्र-धाव्, cl. 1. P. A. -धावति,<BR>-ते, -धावितुम्, to run forwards, run forth, run away;<BR>to set out, start; to become diffused, spread; to<BR>pervade, permeate: Caus. P. -धावयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to drive away, drive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधावित
प्र-धावित, अस्, आ, अम्, run forwards, run away;<BR>set out, started.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधाव्
प्रधाव् 2. प्र-धाव्, cl. 1. P. A. -धावति,<BR>-ते, -धावितुम्, to wash; to rub off: Caus. -धाव-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to cause to wash; to wash.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधावन|प्रधावनः
प्र-धावन, अम्, n. rubbing or washing off;<BR>(अस्), m. air, wind (regarded as a ‘purifier,’ cf. प-<BR>वन; or perhaps fr. 1. प्र-धाव्, regarded as a<BR>‘runner’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधि|प्रधिः
प्रधि प्र-धि. See above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधी
प्रधी प्र-धी, ईस्, f. great intelligence; (ईस्, ईस्,<BR>इ), of superior intelligence, pre-eminently intelligent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधूपित
प्रधूपित प्र-धूपित, अस्, आ, अम्, fumigated,<BR>perfumed; heated, burnt; lighted, inflamed; afflicted;<BR>excited; (आ), f. a woman in trouble or affliction;<BR>the quarter to which the sun is proceeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधृ
प्रधृ प्र-धृ, Caus. -धारयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>direct towards, place or fix upon; (with मनस्)<BR>to set the mind upon anything (dat.), resolve, deter-<BR>mine; to bear in mind, keep in remembrance; to<BR>reflect, consider; to chastise, punish, inflict a punish-<BR>ment or penalty on any one (with loc.; cf. दण्डं<BR>धृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधारण
प्र-धारण, अस्, ई, अम्, keeping, preserving,<BR>protecting [cf. पाद-प्˚]; (आ), f. (probably) a parti-<BR>cular high order of intelligence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधृष्
प्रधृष् प्र-धृष्, cl. 1. 5. P. -धर्षति,<BR>-धृष्णोति, -धर्षितुम्, to be bold against, assail<BR>with courage or daring; to lay hands on, hurt,<BR>injure, harass; to overpower, overcome: Caus.<BR>-धर्षयति, -यितुम्, to attack, assault, assail; to<BR>hurt, injure; to overcome; to violate (a woman);<BR>to destroy, lay waste, devastate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधर्ष|प्रधर्षः
प्र-धर्ष, अस्, m. attacking, assaulting, assail-<BR>ing; [cf. दुष्-प्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधर्षक
प्र-धर्षक, अस्, इका, अम्, attacking, assailing;<BR>molesting, troubling, harassing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधर्षण|प्रधर्षणं
प्र-धर्षण, अस्, ई, अम्, attacking, assailing;<BR>molesting, troubling, harassing; (अम्, आ), n. f. attack-<BR>ing, assailing, an attack, assault; ill treatment, molesta-<BR>tion; केश-प्रधर्षण, dragging by the hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधर्षणीय
प्र-धर्षणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be assailed or<BR>attacked, assailable, open to attack, exposed to injury<BR>or ill treatment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधर्षित
प्र-धर्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, attacked, assailed;<BR>hurt, injured; haughty, arrogant.<BR>—प्रधर्षित-<BR>वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, arrogant, proud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधृष्ट
प्र-धृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, treated with contumely;<BR>proud, arrogant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधृष्टि
प्र-धृष्टि, इस्, f., Ved. overpowering, subju-<BR>gation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधृष्य
प्र-धृष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be hurt or injured,<BR>violable; [cf. दुष्-प्˚, सु-प्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रध्मा
प्रध्मा 1. प्र-ध्मा, cl. 1. P. -धमति,<BR>-ध्मातुम्, to blow before or in front, blow forth,<BR>blow away, destroy; to blow into (with acc.): Pass.<BR>-ध्मायते, to be blown or tossed about, wander<BR>about: Caus. P. A. -ध्मापयति, -ते, -यितुम्, to<BR>blow into, blow (a conch shell).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रधमन|प्रधमनं
प्र-धमन, अम्, n. blowing in, blowing into<BR>(the nose, as powder &c.); a sternutatory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रध्मा
2. प्र-ध्मा, आस्, आस्, अम्, blowing violently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रध्मापन|प्रध्मापनं
प्र-ध्मापन, अम्, n. (in medicine) a remedy<BR>for assisting respiration in any obstruction of the<BR>air-passages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रध्मापित
प्र-ध्मापित, अस्, आ, अम्, blown into, blown<BR>(as a conch shell).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रध्यै
प्रध्यै प्र-ध्यै, cl. 1. P. A. -ध्यायति, -ते,<BR>-ध्यातुम्, to meditate upon, reflect upon, think of<BR>(with acc. or with प्रति); to reflect, consider; to<BR>excogitate, devise, hit upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रध्यान|प्रध्यानं
प्र-ध्यान, अम्, n. reflecting, reflection, think-<BR>ing, thought; deep thought, subtile speculation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रध्वंस्
प्रध्वंस् प्र-ध्वंस्, cl. 1. P. -ध्वंसति,<BR>-ध्वंसितुम्, to fall to pieces, fall in ruins, be de-<BR>stroyed, perish: Caus. -ध्वंसयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>cause to fall, destroy, cause to perish; to scatter,<BR>sprinkle (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रध्वंस|प्रध्वंसः
प्र-ध्वंस, अस्, m. utter destruction, annihila-<BR>tion; loss.<BR>—प्रध्वंस-त्व, अम्, n. a state of<BR>destruction, ruin.<BR>—प्रध्वंसाभाव (˚स-अभ्˚),<BR>अस्, m. non-existence in consequence of annihilation,<BR>ceasing to exist, complete extinction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रध्वंसन|प्रध्वंसनः
प्र-ध्वंसन, अस्, ई, अम्, destroying, annihi-<BR>lating; (अस्), m., Ved. one who destroys or anni-<BR>hilates, a destroyer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रध्वंसिन्
प्र-ध्वंसिन्, ई, इनी, इ, passing, transitory, perish-<BR>able; destroying, annihilating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रध्वस्त
प्र-ध्वस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, fallen to pieces, disap-<BR>peared, perished, destroyed, annihilated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रध्वन्
प्रध्वन् प्र-ध्वन्, cl. 1. P. -ध्वनति, -ध्व-<BR>नितुम्, to sound forth, resound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रध्वनयत्
प्र-ध्वनयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, causing to sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनक्ष्
प्रनक्ष् प्र-नक्ष्, cl. 1. P. A. -नक्षति,<BR>-ते, -नक्षितुम्, Ved. to draw near, approach; (Sāy.)<BR>= सर्वतो व्याप्, to be everywhere present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनर्द्
प्रनर्द् प्र-नर्द्, cl. 1. P. -नर्दति, -नर्दि-<BR>तुम्, see Scholiast on Pāṇ. VIII. 4, 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनष्ट|प्रनष्टः
प्रनष्ट प्र-नष्ट. See under 2. प्र-णश्,<BR>p. 609.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनायक
प्रनायक प्र-नायक, अस्, आ, अम्, one whose<BR>leader is away, whose rulers are abroad; destitute of<BR>a guide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनाल|प्रनालः
प्रनाल प्र-नाल, प्र-नाली = प्र-णाल, प्र-<BR>णाली, p. 609, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनाशिन्
प्रनाशिन् प्र-नाशिन्, incorrectly for प्र-<BR>णाशिन्, p. 609, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनिंसित
प्रनिंसित प्र-निंसित, प्र-निंसितव्य = प्र-<BR>णिंसित, प्र-णिंसितव्य, p. 609, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनिक्षण
प्रनिक्षण प्र-निक्षण = प्र-णिक्षण, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनिघातन|प्रनिघातनं
प्रनिघातन प्र-निघातन, अम्, n. (fr. Caus.<BR>of rt. हन् with प्र-नि), killing, slaughter, murder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनिन्दन
प्रनिन्दन प्र-निन्दन = प्र-णिन्दन, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनिभिद्
प्रनिभिद् प्र-नि-भिद्, cl. 7. P. -भिनत्ति,<BR>-भेत्तुम्, see Scholiast on Pāṇ. VIII. 4, 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनिरक्ष्
प्रनिरक्ष् प्र-नि-रक्ष्, cl. 1. P. -रक्षति,<BR>-रक्षितुम्, to protect, defend, maintain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनीड
प्रनीड प्र-नीड, अस्, आ, अम्, flown from the<BR>nest, having left a nest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनुद्
प्रनुद् प्र-नुद्, incorrectly for प्र-णुद्, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनृत्
प्रनृत् प्र-नृत्, cl. 4. P. -नृत्यति, -नर्तितुम्,<BR>to dance forwards, begin to dance, dance; to gesti-<BR>culate as in dancing (in token of derision).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनर्तित|प्रनर्त्तित
प्र-नर्तित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to dance forwards,<BR>set in motion, shaken, agitated; dandled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनृत्त
प्र-नृत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, one who has begun to<BR>dance, dancing; (अम्), n. a dance; (also incorrectly<BR>written प्र-नृत्य.)<BR>—प्रनृत्त-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>having danced forward, having begun to dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रनृत्यत्
प्र-नृत्यत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, dancing forward,<BR>beginning to dance, dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपक्ष|प्रपक्षः
प्रपक्ष प्र-पक्ष, अस्, m. the extremity of<BR>a wing (of an army drawn out in the form of a<BR>bird); (अस्, आ, अम्), forming the extremity of a wing<BR>(in an army so arranged).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपच्
प्रपच् प्र-पच्, cl. 1. P. A. -पचति, -ते, -पक्-<BR>तुम्, to begin to cook; to be accustomed to cook.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपक्व
प्र-पक्व, अस्, आ, अम्, (in medicine) inflamed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपाक|प्रपाकः
प्र-पाक, अस्, m. ripening (of a boil &c.); in-<BR>flammation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपञ्च|प्रपंच|प्रपंचः|प्रपञ्चः
प्रपञ्च प्र-पञ्च, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 1. पच् or<BR>पञ्च् with प्र), spreading out, development, dif-<BR>fusion, display, amplification, expansion; expanse, ex-<BR>tent; (in philosophy) the expansion of the universe,<BR>the world as the scene of manifold action, the visible<BR>world or universe; prolixity, diffuseness, copiousness<BR>(in style or composition); heap, abundance, quantity;<BR>manifoldness, diversity; phenomenon, appearance;<BR>illusion, delusion, deceit, trick, fraud, error; reci-<BR>procal false praise; reverse, opposition, reversion,<BR>inversion; analysis; (in grammar) the repetition of<BR>an obscure rule in a clearer form; a joke, jest (?);<BR>(as an enclitic after a finite verb) see Gaṇa Gotrādi<BR>to Pāṇ. VIII. 1, 27, 57; प्रपञ्चेन or प्रपञ्च-<BR>तस्, ind. diffusely, in detail.<BR>—प्रपञ्च-निर्माण,<BR>अम्, n. the creation of the visible world.<BR>—प्रपञ्च-<BR>बुद्धि, इस्, इस्, इ, deceitful-minded, artful, cunning;<BR>(इस्), m., N. of a man.<BR>—प्रपञ्च-वचन, अम्,<BR>n. a diffuse or prolix discourse.<BR>—प्रपञ्च-विवेक<BR>and प्रपञ्च-सार, अस्, m., N. of two works.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपञ्चक|प्रपंचक
प्र-पञ्चक, अस्, इका, अम्, developing, displaying;<BR>explaining, copiously expounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपञ्चन|प्रपंचन|प्रपंचनं
प्र-पञ्चन, अम्, n. development, display, diffu-<BR>sion; copious explanation or exposition, explication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपञ्चय
प्रपञ्चय, Nom. P. प्रपञ्चयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to develop, amplify; to display, explain in detail,<BR>analyze; to dwell upon a note (in music); to cause<BR>to appear in a false light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपञ्चित|प्रपंचित|प्रपञ्चितं
प्रपञ्चित, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. the Nom.), amplified,<BR>expanded, extended, diffused; declared fully, ex-<BR>plained, expatiated upon, treated at length; caused<BR>to appear in a false light; mistaken, erring; tricked,<BR>deceived, beguiled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपठ्
प्रपठ् प्र-पठ्, cl. 1. P. -पठति, -पठितुम्,<BR>to recite aloud: Caus. -पाठयति, -यितुम्, to teach,<BR>lecture, expound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपाठक|प्रपाठकः
प्र-पाठक, अस्, m. a lesson, lecture, a division,<BR>chapter or subdivision of a book (sometimes read<BR>प्र-पाठ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपण|प्रपणः
प्रपण प्र-पण, अस्, m., Ved. (fr. rt. 2. पण्<BR>with प्र), exchange, barter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपत्
प्रपत् प्र-पत्, cl. 1. P. -पतति, -पतितुम्,<BR>to fly forwards, fly along, fly forth, fly away; to<BR>hasten forwards, hasten away; to fly down, rush or<BR>dart down; to fall down, fall; to fall into; to come<BR>to; to fall from, be deprived of, lose (with abl.):<BR>Caus. -पातयति, -यितुम्, to cause to fly away, put<BR>to flight; to chase, pursue: Desid. -पिपतिषति,<BR>Ved. to wish to hurry away: Intens. -पापतीति, Ved.<BR>to shoot forth; (Sāy.) = पुनः पुनः पत्, to fall<BR>again and again, descend repeatedly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपतन|प्रपतनं
प्र-पतन, अम्, n. flying forwards, flying forth,<BR>flying away; falling, falling down or into, precipi-<BR>tating one's self from; alighting; dying, death,<BR>destruction; a steep rock, precipice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपतित
प्र-पतित, अस्, आ, अम्, flown forwards, flown<BR>away, flown; fallen, come down; decayed, dead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपात|प्रपातः
प्र-पात, अस्, m. a particular mode of flying;<BR>starting off, hastening away, going away, departure;<BR>springing forth, sudden attack, facing an enemy;<BR>falling down or into, a fall; precipitating one's self<BR>down from a rock; falling out, (दन्त-केश-प्रपात,<BR>the falling out or loss of the teeth and hair); discharge,<BR>emission, flux [cf. वीर्य-प्˚]; a steep rock, cliff,<BR>precipice; a steep bank or shore; a cascade, water-<BR>fall.<BR>—प्रपाताभिमुख (˚त-अभ्˚), अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>inclined to precipitate one's self from a rock.<BR>—प्रपाताम्बु (˚त-अम्˚), उ, n. falling water,<BR>water falling from a rock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपातन|प्रपातनं
प्र-पातन, अम्, n. the causing to fall, throwing<BR>down, throwing on the ground; अक्ष-प्रपातन,<BR>throwing dice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपातिन्
प्र-पातिन्, ई, m. a precipitous mountain, moun-<BR>tain, rock, cliff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपित्सु
प्र-पित्सु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing or intending to de-<BR>scend or alight, wishing to fall or throw one's self down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0632-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपथ|प्रपथः
प्रपथ प्र-पथ, अस्, m., Ved. a long way<BR>or journey, a journey to a distant place; a remote<BR>place; a broad road or street; (अस्, आ, अम्), loose,<BR>relaxed, languid, enervated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपथिन्
प्रपथिन्, ई, इनी, इ, Ved. roaming on distant<BR>paths (Sāy. = प्रकृष्ट-मार्ग); (ई), m., N. of a<BR>man (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपथ्य
प्रपथ्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. being in the streets<BR>or on the road (Mahī-dhara = बहु-सेवितो मार्गस्<BR>तत्र भवः, being in a much frequented road); an<BR>epithet of Pūṣan, the tutelary deity of travellers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपाथ|प्रपाथः
प्रपाथ, अस्, m. a road, way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपद्
प्रपद् 1. प्र-पद्, cl. 4. A. -पद्यते, -पत्-<BR>तुम्, to go forwards, set out for, betake one's self<BR>to, resort to; to attain to, arrive at, reach; to take<BR>refuge with, flee to for safety, fly to for succour; to<BR>enter upon, enter into, set foot on; to come to a par-<BR>ticular state, arrive at a condition; to become (with<BR>adv. ending in सात्, e. g. सर्प-सात् प्रपद्, to become<BR>a serpent); to attain, obtain, gain, partake of, share<BR>in; to perceive; to come on, draw near, approach,<BR>appear (said of periods of time); to be going on, to<BR>proceed; to take effect, prosper; to deal with, act<BR>towards, behave towards; to allow, admit, assent, agree<BR>to; to throw one's self down, fall down (at another's<BR>feet); to fall upon, attack, assault, assail (Ved.);<BR>अध्वानम् प्रपद्, to set forth on the way, begin<BR>a journey; जिन-शाशनम् प्रपद्, to embrace the<BR>doctrines of Jina: Caus. P. A. -पादयति, -ते, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to cause to enter, introduce: Desid. P. A.<BR>-पित्सति, -ते, to wish to enter; to desire to obtain;<BR>to be going to undertake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपद्
2. प्र-पद्, त्, f., Ved. a way; N. of particular sacred<BR>texts; (fr. प्र + 3. पद्), the fore part of the foot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपद|प्रपदं
प्र-पद, अम्, n. (fr. प्र + पद), the fore part<BR>of the foot; the point of the foot, tip of the toes;<BR>(ऐस्), ind. on tiptoe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपदन|प्रपदनं
प्र-पदन, अम्, n. entering, entrance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपदम्
प्रपदम्, ind. a term applied to a particular mode<BR>of recitation (in which the Vedic verses are divided,<BR>without reference to the sense and construction, into<BR>parts of an equal number of syllables, and between<BR>these parts particular formulas inserted containing the<BR>word प्र-पद्ये).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपदीन
प्रपदीन, अस्, आ, अम्, relating to the fore part<BR>of the foot; extending to it, (wrongly for आप्रप-<BR>दीन, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपन्न|प्रपन्नः
प्र-पन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, arriving at, reaching;<BR>seeking, adhering to; one who seeks for protection<BR>or takes refuge, a suppliant; attained, obtained; pos-<BR>sessed of, furnished with, provided with; promised,<BR>assented to; effecting, producing; poor, distressed.<BR>—प्रपन्न-पाल, अस्, m. ‘the protector of sup-<BR>pliants or of those who seek protection,’ an epithet<BR>of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—प्रपन्नामृत (˚न-अम्˚), अम्, n.<BR>‘nectar for suppliants,’ N. of a work.<BR>—प्रपन्-<BR>नार्ति-हर (˚न-आर्˚), अस्, ई, अम्, relieving or re-<BR>liever of the distress of suppliants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपाद|प्रपादः
प्र-पाद, अस्, m., Ved. premature delivery, mis-<BR>carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपादुक
प्र-पादुक, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. going off, coming<BR>forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपित्सु
प्र-पित्सु, उस्, उस्, उ, desirous of attaining, de-<BR>sirous of entering upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपन्न|प्रपन्नः
प्रपन्न प्र-पन्न. See above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपन्नाड|प्रपन्नाडः
प्रपन्नाड प्रपन्नाड, अस्, m. = प्रपुन्नाड.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपर्ण
प्रपर्ण प्र-पर्ण, अस्, m. a fallen leaf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपलाय
प्रपलाय प्र-पलाय, cl. 1. A. -पलायते,<BR>-यितुम्, to run away, flee away, escape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपलायन|प्रपलायनं
प्र-पलायन, अम्, n. running away, flight, rout.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपलायित
प्र-पलायित, अस्, आ, अम्, run away; routed,<BR>defeated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपलायिन्
प्र-पलायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, running away, flying,<BR>escaping; a fugitive, one who deserts his cause.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपवण
प्रपवण प्र-पवण or प्र-पवन, अम्, n.<BR>(rt. 1. पू), purifying, straining (Soma juice).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपवणीय
प्र-पवणीय or प्र-पवनीय, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>to be cleansed or purified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपश्यत्
प्रपश्यत् प्र-पश्यत्. See प्र-दृश्, p. 631.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपा
प्रपा 1. प्र-पा (see rt. 1. पा), cl. 1. P.<BR>-पिबति (Ved. -पाति), -पातुम्, to begin to drink,<BR>drink, quaff, sip; (with चक्षुषा) to drink in<BR>with the eyes, feast the eyes upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपा
2. प्र-पा, f. (according to the usual rule the nom.<BR>sing. would be प्र-पास्), a place for watering cattle,<BR>a shed on the road-side for accommodating travellers<BR>with water, place where water is distributed, cistern,<BR>(according to Kullūka = पानीय-दान-गृह); a<BR>draught; a supply of water.<BR>—प्रपा-पूरण, अम्,<BR>n. filling a place for watering cattle, furnishing a<BR>cistern with water.<BR>—प्रपापूरणीय, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>serving to fill a cistern.<BR>—प्रपा-वन, अम्, n.<BR>‘cistern-grove,’ a pleasure-garden, a cool grove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपाणीय
प्र-पाणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be drunk, drinkable,<BR>potable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपान|प्रपानं
प्र-पान, अम्, n. drinking, sipping; the under part<BR>of a horse's upper lip (which he uses in drinking).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपानक|प्रपानकं
प्रपानक, अम्, n. (probably) a draught, beverage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपायिन्
1. प्र-पायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, drinking, one who drinks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपा
प्रपा 3. प्र-पा (see rt. 3. पा), cl. 2. P.<BR>-पाति, -पातुम्, to protect, defend from (with abl.):<BR>Caus. -पालयति, -यितुम्, to guard, screen, defend,<BR>protect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपायिन्
2. प्र-पायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, protecting (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपालन|प्रपालनं
प्र-पालन, अम्, n. guarding, protecting, pro-<BR>tection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपालिन्
प्र-पालिन्, ई, इनी, इ, guarding, protecting; (ई),<BR>m. an epithet of Bala-rāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपाक|प्रपाकः
प्रपाक प्र-पाक. See प्र-पच्, p. 632.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपाठक|प्रपाठकः
प्रपाठक प्र-पाठक. See प्र-पठ्, p. 632.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपाणि|प्रपाणिः
प्रपाणि प्र-पाणि, इस्, m. the flat or palm of<BR>the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपाण्डु
प्रपाण्डु प्र-पाण्डु, उस्, उस्, उ, very white,<BR>of a dazzling white colour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपाण्डुर
प्र-पाण्डुर, अस्, आ, अम्, = प्र-पाण्डु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपादिक|प्रपादिकः
प्रपादिक प्रपादिक, अस्, m. a peacock;<BR>(also read प्रपादीक.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपादुक
प्रपादुक प्र-पादुक. See under 1. प्र-पद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपितामह|प्रपितामहः
प्रपितामह प्र-पितामह, अस्, m. a paternal<BR>great-grandfather; an epithet of Kṛṣṇa (regarded<BR>as great-grandfather of the three worlds); an epithet<BR>of Brahmā; (ई), f. a paternal great-grandmother;<BR>(आस्), m. pl. great-grandfathers, ancestors in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपितृव्य|प्रपितृव्यः
प्र-पितृव्य, अस्, m. a paternal grand-uncle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपित्व
प्रपित्व प्र-पित्व, अम्, n., Ved. going<BR>towards, going to meet, meeting with, encountering<BR>(Sāy. = सङ्ग्राम, combat); the coming on or ap-<BR>proach of day, day-break (Sāy. = प्र-क्रम); [cf.<BR>अप-पित्व, अभि-पित्व.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपित्सु
प्रपित्सु प्र-पित्सु. See under 1. प्र-पद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपिन्व्
प्रपिन्व् प्र-पिन्व्, cl. 1. P. A. -पिन्वति,<BR>-ते, -पिन्वितुम्, Ved. to swell, be full of, be rich,<BR>flow over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपिष्
प्रपिष् प्र-पिष्, cl. 7. P. -पिनष्टि, -पेष्-<BR>टुम्, to crush, pound: Caus. -पेषयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to pound, grind or crush to pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपिष्ट
प्र-पिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, pounded, ground or crushed<BR>to pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपीड्
प्रपीड् प्र-पीड्, Caus. -पीडयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>press hard, press, squeeze; to check, suppress; to<BR>oppress, molest, injure, pain, torment, torture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपीडन|प्रपीडनं
प्र-पीडन, अम्, n. pressing, squeezing; (in<BR>medicine) an astringent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपीडित
प्र-पीडित, अस्, आ, अम्, pressed, oppressed; pained,<BR>tortured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपीत
प्रपीत प्र-पीत, प्र-पीन. See col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपुत्र|प्रपुत्रः
प्रपुत्र प्र-पुत्र, अस्, m. a grandson, de-<BR>scendant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपुनाट|प्रपुनाटः
प्रपुनाट प्रपुनाट, or प्रपुनाड, or प्र-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">Page0633-c+ 72</a>]<BR>पुन्नड, or प्रपुन्नाट, or प्रपुन्नाड, or<BR>प्रपुन्नाल, अस्, m. a species of tree, Cassia Tora;<BR>the ringworm shrub, Cassia Alata.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपुष्
प्रपुष् प्र-पुष्, cl. 4. 9. P. -पुष्यति,<BR>-पुष्णाति, -पोषितुम्, to nourish, feed, support,<BR>maintain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपुष्पित
प्रपुष्पित प्र-पुष्पित, अस्, आ, अम्, flowering,<BR>in blossom, blooming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपूज्
प्रपूज् प्र-पूज्, cl. 10. P. -पूजयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to show respect or honour to, praise, esteem, honour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपृ
प्रपृ प्र-पृ (see rt. 1. पृ), Caus. P. -पा-<BR>रयति, -यितुम्, Ved. to carry across, bring over,<BR>transport, ferry over; to bring out of, to deliver<BR>from (with abl.), rescue, protect (Sāy. = पालयति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपृच्
प्रपृच् प्र-पृच्, cl. 7. P. -पृणक्ति, -पर्चि-<BR>तुम्, Ved. to come in contact with (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपृथक्
प्रपृथक् प्र-पृथक्, ind., Ved. singly, one<BR>by one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपृष्ठ
प्रपृष्ठ प्र-पृष्ठ, अस्, आ, अम्, having a<BR>prominent or protuberant back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपॄ
प्रपॄ प्र-पॄ, cl. 9. P. -पृणाति, -परितुम्,<BR>-परीतुम्, to fill up, complete: Pass. -पूर्यते, to<BR>be filled, become full, become satiated; to be com-<BR>pleted, be fulfilled: Caus. -पूरयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>fill up, complete; to make rich, enrich.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपूरक
प्र-पूरक, अस्, इका, अम्, filling up, fulfilling,<BR>satisfying, satiating; (इका), f. the plant Solanum<BR>Jacquini.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपूरण|प्रपूरणं
प्र-पूरण, अस्, ई, अम्, filling, fulfilling, satisfying;<BR>(अम्), n. the act of filling up, filling; injecting, injec-<BR>tion, inserting; affixing, attaching to; satiating, satis-<BR>fying; (with धनुषः) bending a bow, i. e. the<BR>drawing or filling out of a bow-string for the purpose<BR>of shooting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपूरित
प्र-पूरित, अस्, आ, अम्, filled up, completed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपौण्डरीक|प्रपौण्डरीकं|प्रपौण्डरीकः
प्रपौण्डरीक प्रपौण्डरीक, अम्, n. a small<BR>herbaceous plant (= पौण्डरीक, commonly पुण्-<BR>डरिया, used as a remedy for ulcers and bad eyes<BR>and as a perfume); = स्थल-पद्म, Hibiscus Mu-<BR>tabilis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपौत्र|प्रपौत्रः
प्रपौत्र प्र-पौत्र or प्र-पौत्रक, अस्, m.<BR>the son of a son's son, a great-grandson; (ई), f. the<BR>daughter of a son's son, a great-granddaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रप्यै
प्रप्यै प्र-प्यै, cl. 1. A. -प्यायते, -प्यायि-<BR>तुम्, -प्यातुम्, to swell out, swell up, be distended:<BR>Caus. -प्याययति, -यितुम्, to cause to swell out,<BR>swell, distend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रपीत
प्र-पीत or प्र-पीन, अस्, आ, अम्, swollen out,<BR>swollen up, distended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रप्यात
प्र-प्यात or प्र-प्यान, अस्, आ, अम्, swollen<BR>out, distended, fat, bulky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रप्यायन|प्रप्यायनं
प्र-प्यायन, अम्, n. causing to swell out,<BR>swelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रप्यायनीय
प्र-प्यायनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be caused to swell<BR>out, to be swollen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रप्याययितृ
प्र-प्याययितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, Ved. causing to<BR>swell out, distending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रप्रोथ
प्रप्रोथ प्र-प्रोथ, अस्, or अम्, m. or n. (?),<BR>Ved. a particular plant (sometimes used as a substi-<BR>tute for the Soma plant).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रप्लु
प्रप्लु प्र-प्लु, cl. 1. A. -प्लवते, -प्लोतुम्,<BR>Ved. to swim towards, to float or sail away: Caus.<BR>-प्लावयति, -यितुम्, to cause to float or sail away;<BR>to pour water upon, wash or flood with water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रप्लावन
प्र-प्लावन, अम्, n., Ved. flooding with water,<BR>extinguishing (a fire) with water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रप्लुत
प्र-प्लुत, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. dipped in water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रफर्वी
प्रफर्वी प्रफर्वी, f., Ved. a wanton or<BR>lascivious girl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रफुल्त
प्रफुल्त प्र-फुल्त, अस्, आ, अम्, blown, blos-<BR>somed, blooming (= प्र-फुल्ल, Scholiast on Pāṇ.<BR>VII. 4, 89).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0633-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रफुल्ति|प्रफुल्तिः
प्र-फुल्ति, इस्, f. blooming, blossoming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रफुल्ल|प्रफुल्लः
प्र-फुल्ल, अस्, आ, अम्, blooming forth, blooming,<BR>blossoming, flowering, blossomed, blown (as a flower),<BR>covered with blossoms; expanded like a blown<BR>flower; shining; smiling; glad, gay, cheerful, pleased.<BR>—प्रफुल्ल-नयन or प्रफुल्ल-नेत्र, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, having full or sparkling eyes, having eyes ex-<BR>panded with joy.<BR>—प्रफुल्ल-वदन, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>having the face expanded with joy, having a cheerful<BR>or smiling countenance, looking gay or happy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबन्ध्|प्रबंध्
प्रबन्ध् प्र-बन्ध्, cl. 9. P. -बध्नाति,<BR>-बन्द्धुम्, to bind on, bind, fasten, connect; to<BR>suppress, check, stop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबद्ध
प्र-बद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, bound on, bound, fas-<BR>tened, fettered; connected; suppressed, checked,<BR>stopped.<BR>—प्रबद्ध-मूत्र, अस्, आ, अम्, suffering<BR>from retention of urine or ischury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबन्द्धृ|प्रबंद्धृ
प्र-बन्द्धृ, धा, m. one who connects toge-<BR>ther, an author.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबन्ध|प्रबंध|प्रबंधः|प्रबन्धः
प्र-बन्ध, अस्, m. a connection, a bond, tie,<BR>(गर्भ-नाडी-प्रबन्ध, the umbilical cord); an<BR>uninterrupted connection, continuous series; uninter-<BR>ruptedness, continuance, continuous application or<BR>action; a continued discourse or narration, connected<BR>discussion or narrative; a composition, any literary<BR>composition, especially a poetical production.<BR>—प्र-<BR>बन्ध-कल्पना, f. a feigned story, a work of<BR>imagination (whether founded on fact or not).<BR>—प्र-<BR>बन्ध-वर्ष, अस्, m. incessant rain, rain without<BR>intermission.<BR>—प्रबन्धाध्याय (˚ध-अध्˚),<BR>अस्, m., N. of the fourth chapter of the Saṅgīta-<BR>darpaṇa; of the fourth book of the Saṅgīta-ratnākara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबन्धन|प्रबंधन|प्रबंधनं
प्र-बन्धन, अम्, n. connection, bond, tie;<BR>[cf. सन्धि-प्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबभ्र|प्रबभ्रः
प्रबभ्र प्र-बभ्र, अस्, m. an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबर्ह
प्रबर्ह प्र-बर्ह or प्र-वर्ह, अस्, आ, अम्<BR>(fr. rt. बृह् or वृह् with प्र), the best, most<BR>excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबल|प्रबलः
प्रबल 1. प्र-बल, अस्, आ, अम् (see बल),<BR>prevailing, predominant; strong, powerful, mighty,<BR>great; violent (as pain); important, significant;<BR>abounding with; dangerous, pernicious; (अस्), m.,<BR>N. of an attendant of Viṣṇu; of a Daitya; a sprout,<BR>shoot (= प्र-बाल); (आ), f. a kind of plant (=<BR>प्र-सारिणी); (अम्), ind. strongly, exceedingly,<BR>much.<BR>—प्रबल-ता, f. or प्रबल-त्व, अम्, n.<BR>strength, power, might, mightiness, validity.<BR>—प्र-<BR>बल-तोय, अस्, आ, अम्, abounding in water.<BR>—प्र-<BR>बल-रुदित, अम्, n. strong crying, excessive weeping.<BR>—प्रबल-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, strong, mighty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबल|प्रबलः
2. प्रबल, Nom. P. प्रबलति, &c., to become<BR>strong or powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबाल|प्रबालं|प्रबालः
प्र-बाल, अस्, अम्, m. n. (sometimes spelt प्र-<BR>वाल), a young shoot, sprout, new leaf or branch;<BR>coral (in this sense also written प्र-वाड); the<BR>neck of the Indian lute; (अस्), m. an animal; a<BR>pupil; a kind of vegetable; [cf. प्रबालिक.]<BR>—प्र-<BR>बाल-पद्म, अम्, n. a red lotus-flower.<BR>—प्रबाल-<BR>फल, अम्, n. red sandal-wood.<BR>—प्रबाल-भस्मन्,<BR>अ, n. calx or ashes of coral (used medicinally).<BR>—प्र-<BR>बाल-मणि-शृङ्ग, अस्, आ, अम्, having horns of<BR>coral and gems.<BR>—प्रबाल-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having<BR>new leaves or shoots.<BR>—प्रबालाश्मन्तक (˚ल-<BR>अश्˚), (probably) coral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबालक
प्रबालक, अस्, m., N. of a Yakṣa; (इका), f.,<BR>N. of a female.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबालिक|प्रबालिकः
प्रबालिक, अस्, m. a kind of vegetable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबली
प्रबली प्रबली, f. a class, division of a<BR>community, (supposed to be used in this sense in a<BR>particular inscription.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबह्लिका
प्रबह्लिका प्रबह्लिका = प्रवह्लिका or प्र-<BR>वल्हिका, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबाध्
प्रबाध् प्र-बाध्, cl. 1. A. -बाधते, -बा-<BR>धितुम्, to press forwards, drive; to press hard upon,<BR>pain, torment, oppress, disquiet, vex, annoy; to<BR>throw down, destroy, demolish, abolish, unmake;<BR>to press back, drive back, repel, repulse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबाधक
प्र-बाधक, अस्, इका, अम्, pressing back, keeping<BR>off, keeping back, keeping at a distance; refusing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबाधन|प्रबाधनं
प्र-बाधन, अम्, n. pressing hard upon, op-<BR>pressing, tormenting, paining; keeping off, keeping<BR>back, keeping at a distance; refusing, denying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबाधमान
प्र-बाधमान, अस्, आ, अम्, pressing hard upon,<BR>tormenting, afflicting, paining; keeping off, keeping<BR>back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबाधित
प्र-बाधित, अस्, आ, अम्, pressed forwards, driven;<BR>oppressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबाबधान
प्र-बाबधान, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. the Intens.), Ved.<BR>hastening on before, overtaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबाल|प्रबालं|प्रबालः
प्रबाल प्र-बाल. See under 1. प्र-बल,<BR>col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबाहु|प्रबाहुः
प्रबाहु प्र-बाहु, उस्, m. the fore-arm;<BR>‘long-armed,’ N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबाहुक|प्रबाहुकं
प्रबाहुक, अस्, m. ‘long-armed,’ N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबाहुक्
प्रबाहुक् प्र-बाहुक्, ind., Ved. in an even<BR>line, in an equal series, on an equal height, on a<BR>level; at the same time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबाहुकम्
प्र-बाहुकम्, ind. at the same time; on high.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबुध्
प्रबुध् 1. प्र-बुध्, cl. 4. A. -बुध्यते,<BR>-बोधितुम्, to wake up, wake, awaken (intrans.);<BR>to bloom, blossom; cl. 1. P. -बोधति, to wake up,<BR>wake, awake (trans.); to become sensible or aware of,<BR>perceive, observe, regard: Caus. -बोधयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to wake up, wake, awaken (trans.); to make sen-<BR>sible, cause to know, inform, admonish; to try to<BR>convince, persuade; to instruct, teach (with two acc.);<BR>to explain; to cause to expand or bloom; to stimu-<BR>late (by gentle friction).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबुद्ध|प्रबुद्धः
प्र-बुद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, awakened, wakened,<BR>awake, roused; enlivened, lively; clear-sighted, clever,<BR>wise, learned; expanded, blown, in bloom; unfolded,<BR>developed; beginning to take effect (as a spell); (अस्),<BR>m., N. of a teacher.<BR>—प्रबुद्ध-ता, f. intelli-<BR>gence, wisdom (opposed to जड-ता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबुध्
2. प्र-बुध्, भुत्, त्, त्, Ved. attentive, watching<BR>for; (त्), f. awaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबुध|प्रबुधः
प्र-बुध, अस्, m. a great sage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबोध|प्रबोधः
प्र-बोध, अस्, m. awaking (either from sleep or<BR>from ignorance); awakening, becoming conscious,<BR>consciousness; blowing (as of a flower); vigilance,<BR>watchfulness, wakefulness, activity; intellect, under-<BR>standing, knowledge, wisdom, intelligence; explain-<BR>ing; consoling, consolation; reviving the fragrance<BR>of a perfume which has lost its scent.<BR>—प्रबोध-<BR>चन्द्र, अस्, m. the moon of knowledge, i. e. Know-<BR>ledge personified and compared to the moon.<BR>—प्र-<BR>बोध-चन्द्रिका, f. ‘moonlight of knowledge,’ N.<BR>of a grammar by Vaijana.<BR>—प्रबोध-चन्द्रोदय<BR>(˚र-उद्˚), अस्, m. ‘rise of the moon of knowledge,’<BR>Intelligence personified and compared to the risen<BR>moon; N. of a celebrated philosophical drama.<BR>—प्र-<BR>बोध-प्रकाश, अस्, m., N. of a grammar.<BR>—प्र-<BR>बोध-सिद्धि, इस्, f., N. of a work.<BR>—प्रबोध-<BR>सुधाकर, अस्, m., N. of a Vedānta work.<BR>—प्र-<BR>बोधोत्सव (˚ध-उत्˚), अस्, m. ‘waking-festival,’<BR>a festival observed from the tenth to the day of full<BR>moon of the month Kārttika; see प्र-बोधिनी.<BR>—प्रबोधोदय (˚ध-उद्˚), अस्, m. ‘the rise of<BR>knowledge,’ N. of a work; [cf. प्रबोध-चन्द्रो-<BR>दय.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबोधक|प्रबोधकः
प्र-बोधक, अस्, इका, अम्, one who awakens;<BR>intelligible (at the end of comps., cf. सुख-प्˚);<BR>(अस्), m. a minstrel whose duty is to wake the king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबोधन|प्रबोधनं
प्र-बोधन, अस्, ई, अम्, awakening, exciting,<BR>arousing; (अस्), m., N. of a Buddha; (ई), f. the<BR>eleventh day in the light half of the month Kārttika<BR>celebrated as a festival in commemoration of the wak-<BR>ing of Viṣṇu; the plant Alhagi Maurorum (= दुर्-<BR>आलभा); (अम्), n. waking, awaking (e. g. कल्य-<BR>प्रबोधन, waking at day-break); awakening,<BR>arousing, exciting, reviving; knowledge, understand-<BR>ing; instructing, informing, explaining; reviving the<BR>fragrance of a perfume which has lost its scent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबोधित
प्र-बोधित, अस्, आ, अम्, awakened, wakened,<BR>awake, aroused, roused; taught, instructed, informed,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-c" target="_blank">Page0634-c+ 77</a>]<BR>admonished; convinced, persuaded; (आ), f. a kind of<BR>metre, four times ˘˘¯˘¯˘˘˘¯˘¯˘¯.<BR>—प्र-<BR>बोधित-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, one who has awaked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबोधिन्
प्र-बोधिन्, ई, इनी, इ, waking, awaking; (इनी), f.<BR>the eleventh day in the light half of the month Kārt-<BR>tika celebrated as a festival in commemoration of the<BR>waking of Viṣṇu; [cf. प्र-बोधनी.]<BR>—प्रबोधि-<BR>ता, f. the being (early) awake, waking betimes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रबोध्य
