प्रभङ्ग|प्रभंगः|प्रभङ्गः
प्र-भङ्ग, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. breaking, crushing;<BR>(अस्), m. breaking, crushing, destroying, destruction,<BR>complete defeat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0634-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

