प्रमुक्ति|प्रमुक्तिः
प्रमुक्ति प्र-मुक्ति. See प्र-मुच् below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमुख|प्रमुखं|प्रमुखः
प्रमुख प्र-मुख, अस्, आ, अम्, turning the<BR>face towards (with acc.), facing; first, foremost,<BR>chief, principal, most excellent; (at the end of a<BR>comp.) having as chief, headed by, led by, preceded<BR>by, accompanied with [cf. प्रीति-प्˚, वशिष्ठ-प्˚];<BR>honourable, respectable; (अस्), m. a chief, respect-<BR>able man, sage; a heap, multitude; a tree used in<BR>dyeing, Rottleria Tinctoria; (अम्), n. the mouth;<BR>commencement, beginning (of a chapter); time<BR>being, the present, the same time; (ए), ind. before<BR>the face of, in the presence of, in front of, before,<BR>opposite to (with gen.); प्रमुखे कृ, to cause to<BR>go before or precede.<BR>—प्रमुख-तस्, ind. at the<BR>head of, in front of, before the face of, before, oppo-<BR>site to (with gen.); before all others, first, in the<BR>first place.<BR>—प्रमुख-ता, f. or प्रमुख-त्व,<BR>अम्, n. superiority, predominance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमुग्ध
प्रमुग्ध प्र-मुग्ध. See प्र-मुह्, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमुच्
प्रमुच् प्र-मुच्, cl. 6. P. A. -मुञ्चति, -ते,<BR>-मोक्तुम्, to let loose, loosen, loose, untie, unbind,<BR>undo; to set free, let go, liberate, release; to forsake,<BR>desert, abandon; to give up, resign, renounce; to<BR>shake off; to discharge, emit, throw out, vomit, shed;<BR>to hurl, fling, cast, throw, shoot, send; to utter;<BR>to throw or put on (as a garland &c.); to remove,<BR>expel, drive away, banish: Pass. -मुच्यते, to be<BR>loosened, become loose or detached; to leave off,<BR>cease (with abl.); to free one's self from, rid one's<BR>self of (with abl.): Caus. -मोचयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>loosen, untie; to set free, liberate: Desid. -मुमु-<BR>क्षति, to wish to give up, be about to resign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमुक्त
प्र-मुक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, loosened, untied; set<BR>free, released, liberated; given up, resigned, re-<BR>nounced; hurled, cast, shot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमुक्ति|प्रमुक्तिः
प्र-मुक्ति, इस्, f., Ved. setting free, liberation;<BR>N. of particular sacred texts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमुच
प्र-मुच, अस्, or प्र-मुचु, उस्, m., N. of a<BR>Ṛṣi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोक्तव्य
प्र-मोक्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be liberated, to be<BR>set free.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोचन|प्रमोचनं
प्र-मोचन, अस्, ई, अम्, liberating, setting free;<BR>(ई), f. a species of cucumber; (अम्), n. the act of<BR>liberating, setting free; discharging, emitting, shed-<BR>ding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमुद्
प्रमुद् 1. प्र-मुद्, cl. 1. A. -मोदते, -मो-<BR>दितुम्, to become joyful, rejoice greatly, exult, be<BR>delighted: Caus. -मोदयति, -यितुम्, to make glad,<BR>delight, exhilarate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमुद्
2. प्र-मुद्, त्, त्, त्, pleased, happy; (त्), f., Ved.<BR>gladness, delight, pleasure; sensual pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमुदित|प्रमुदितः
प्र-मुदित, अस्, आ, अम्, delighted, pleased, happy,<BR>glad, content; (आ), f. (with Buddhists) N. of one of<BR>the ten Bhūmis; (अम्), n. epithet of one of the<BR>eight perfections in the Sāṅkhya philosophy.<BR>—प्र-<BR>मुदित-प्रलम्ब-सुनयन, अस्, m., N. of a<BR>Gandharva-rāja.<BR>—प्रमुदित-वदना, f., N. of a<BR>metre, four times ˘˘˘˘˘˘¯, ˘¯¯˘¯.<BR>—प्र-<BR>मुदित-हृदय, अस्, आ, अम्, having the heart de-<BR>lighted, delighted in heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोद|प्रमोदः
प्र-मोद, अस्, m. excessive joy, delight, pleasure,<BR>gladness, happiness; one of the eight perfections in<BR>the Sāṅkhya philosophy; Pleasure personified as a<BR>child of Brahmā; a strong perfume; N. of a being<BR>attendant upon Skanda; of a Nāga; of a man; of<BR>the fourth year in a sixty years’ cycle of Jupiter.<BR>—प्रमोद-नृत्य, अम्, n. joyous dancing, a<BR>joyful dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोदक
प्र-मोदक, अस्, m. a kind of grain (= षष्-<BR>टिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोदन|प्रमोदनं|प्रमोदनः
प्र-मोदन, अस्, ई, अम्, making glad, gladdening,<BR>exhilarating; an epithet of Viṣṇu; (अम्), n. making<BR>glad, gladdening; gladness, joyousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोदमान
प्र-मोदमान, अम्, n. ‘rejoicing,’ epithet of<BR>one of the eight perfections in the Sāṅkhya phi-<BR>losophy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोदित|प्रमोदितः
प्र-मोदित, अस्, आ, अम्, delighted, rejoiced,<BR>pleased, happy; (अस्), m. an epithet of Kuvera;<BR>(अम्), n. epithet of one of the eight perfections in<BR>the Sāṅkhya philosophy; [cf. प्र-मोदमान<BR>above.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोदिन्
प्रमोदिन्, ई, इनी, इ, causing excessive joy, de-<BR>lighting, making happy, gladdening; delighted,<BR>happy; (इनी), f., N. of a plant (= जिङ्गिनी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमुर्छ्
प्रमुर्छ् प्र-मुर्छ्, cl. 1. P. -मूर्छति, -मूर्-<BR>छितुम्, Ved. to become thick or solid, congeal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमुष्
प्रमुष् प्र-मुष्, cl. 9. P. -मुष्णाति, -मो-<BR>षितुम्, to steal away, carry off, rob, pilfer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमुषित
प्र-मुषित, अस्, आ, अम्, stolen away, carried<BR>off; distracted, beside one's self; (आ), f. a kind of<BR>riddle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमुह्
प्रमुह् प्र-मुह्, cl. 4. P. -मुह्यति, -मोग्-<BR>धुम्, -मोढुम्, to become bewildered or infatu-<BR>ated; to faint, swoon: Caus. -मोहयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to bewilder, infatuate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमुग्ध
प्र-मुग्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, fainting, unconscious;<BR>very charming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमूढ
प्र-मूढ, अस्, आ, अम्, bewildered, infatuated,<BR>deceived; foolish, stupid, a fool.<BR>—प्रमूढ-<BR>सञ्ज्ञ, अस्, आ, अम्, having the mind perplexed,<BR>bewildered, infatuated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोह|प्रमोहः
प्र-मोह, अस्, m. bewilderment, infatuation, fas-<BR>cination; insensibility, stupefaction, stupor, fainting<BR>away.<BR>—प्रमोह-चित्त, अस्, आ, अम्, bewildered in<BR>mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोहन
प्र-मोहन, अस्, ई, अम्, infatuating the mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोहित
प्र-मोहित, अस्, आ, अम्, bewildered, infatuated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोहिन्
प्रमोहिन्, ई, इनी, इ, bewildering, infatuating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

