प्रमार्जन|प्रमार्जनं
प्र-मार्जन, अम्, n. the act of rubbing off,<BR>wiping off; अश्रु-प्रमार्जन, the wiping away or<BR>drying of tears, consoling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

