प्रमर्दक
प्र-मर्दक, अस्, आ, अम्, crushing down, crush-<BR>ing, destroying; N. of a demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

