प्र-म्लान, अस्, आ, अम्, faded away, withered<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-a" target="_blank">Page0639-a+ 77</a>]<BR>away, faded, withered; soiled, dirty.<BR>—प्रम्लान-<BR>वदन, अस्, आ, अम्, having the face dried up or<BR>soiled (with weeping &c.).<BR>—प्रम्लान-शरीर, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, withered in body, having an exhausted frame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0638-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयक्ष
प्रयक्ष प्र-यक्ष, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. यक्ष्<BR>with प्र), Ved. praiseworthy, laudable; (Sāy. =<BR>पूज्य.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयच्छत्|प्रयछत्
प्रयच्छत् प्र-यच्छत्. See col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयज्
प्रयज् 1. प्र-यज्, cl. 1. P. A. -यजति, -ते,<BR>-यष्टुम्, Ved. to sacrifice to, offer sacrifices,<BR>worship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयज्
2. प्र-यज्, क्, f., Ved. an offering, oblation; [cf.<BR>पृक्ष-प्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयज्यु
प्र-यज्यु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. to be worshipped or<BR>honoured (Sāy. = प्रकर्षेण पूज्यः); striving<BR>forwards, pressing onwards, rushing on (? cf. इयक्ष्;<BR>especially used as an epithet of the Maruts and of<BR>Vāyu, but also said of Indra and Agni).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयाग|प्रयागः
प्र-याग, अस्, m. a sacrifice, an oblation; the<BR>place of sacrifice ἐξοχήν, a celebrated place of<BR>pilgrimage (now called Allahabad) at the confluence<BR>of the Gaṅgā and Yamunā with the supposed sub-<BR>terranean Sarasvatī (cf. त्रि-वेणी; प्रयाग in com-<BR>position is applied to four other sacred places situated<BR>at the confluence of two rivers, viz. Deva-p˚, Rudra-<BR>p˚, Karṇa-p˚, and Nanda-p˚, in the Himālaya moun-<BR>tains); a horse [cf. प्र-योग]; a N. of Indra [cf.<BR>प्रयाग-भय]; N. of a man (in this sense also<BR>प्रयागक); (आस्), m. pl. the inhabitants of Pra-<BR>yāga.<BR>—प्रयाग-भय, अस्, m. ‘fearing sacrifice,’<BR>an epithet of Indra (who is liable to be dethroned<BR>by the performance of a hundred Aśva-medhas or<BR>horse sacrifices).<BR>—प्रयाग-सेतु, उस्, m., N. of a<BR>work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयाज|प्रयाजः
प्र-याज, अस्, m., Ved., N. of particular sacri-<BR>ficial texts or invocations and of the Ājya oblations<BR>or libations at which they are employed (they form<BR>part of the Prāyaṇīya or introductory ceremony in a<BR>Soma sacrifice and are generally five in number, viz.<BR>Samidh, Tanū-napāt, Iḍā, Barhis, Svāhā-kāra; at<BR>animal sacrifices their number is eleven, correspond-<BR>ing to the eleven Āpris, cf. आ-प्री); a principal<BR>ceremony or sacrifice.<BR>—प्रयाज-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>Ved. accompanied with Prayājas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयत्
प्रयत् प्र-यत्, cl. 1. A. -यतते, -यतितुम्,<BR>to strive, endeavour, make effort; to apply one's<BR>self to (with loc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयतितव्य
प्र-यतितव्य or प्र-यत्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to<BR>be striven or endeavoured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयत्न|प्रयत्नः
प्र-यत्न, अस्, m. persevering effort, continued<BR>exertion or endeavour, exertion bestowed on anything<BR>(with the object in the loc., or as the first member<BR>of a comp.; cf. कृत-प्˚); activity of will; activity,<BR>action, act; great care, caution, care; difficulty; (in<BR>philosophy) active effort of three kinds, viz. engaging<BR>in any act, prosecuting it, and completing it; (in<BR>grammar) effort in uttering, effort or movement of<BR>the mouth or breath in the production of articulate<BR>utterance, mode of articulation, (also आस्य-प्र-<BR>यत्न; distinguished into आभ्यन्तर-प्˚, inter-<BR>nal effort, and वाह्य-प्˚, external effort); प्रयत्-<BR>नेन, प्रयत्नात्, प्रयत्नैस्, प्रयत्न-तस्, ind.<BR>with especial effort, with particular care or pains,<BR>diligently, carefully, earnestly, zealously, with all one's<BR>might; particularly, especially; with difficulty, hardly,<BR>scarcely.<BR>—प्रयत्न-प्रेक्षणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to<BR>be seen with an effort, hardly visible.<BR>—प्रयत्न-<BR>मुक्तासन, अस्, आ, अम्, quitting a seat with difficulty,<BR>rising with difficulty from a seat.<BR>—प्रयत्न-वत्, आन्,<BR>अती, अत्, one who endeavours or makes effort, one<BR>who directs his whole attention and care towards<BR>anything, assiduous, enterprising, persevering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयम्
प्रयम् प्र-यम्, cl. 1. P. -यच्छति, -यन्तुम्,<BR>to hold out towards, offer; to present, bestow, grant,<BR>give (with dat., loc., or gen. of the person and acc.<BR>of the thing; in Ṛg-veda VII. 75, 2, with acc. of<BR>the person and dat. of the thing); to give in mar-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">Page0639-b+ 79</a>]<BR>riage; to give up, deliver, restore, return; to pay,<BR>discharge (a debt); to restrain, check, control.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयच्छत्|प्रयछत्
प्र-यच्छत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, presenting, giving,<BR>bestowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयत|प्रयतः
प्र-यत, अस्, आ, अम्, restrained, well governed,<BR>self-subdued, keeping the organs of sense under con-<BR>trol; submissive; careful, prudent; zealous, intent<BR>(on devotion); pure; (अस्), m. a holy or pious<BR>person, one purified by austerity and mortification.<BR>—प्रयत-त्व, अम्, n. self-control, purity, holiness.<BR>—प्रयत-दक्षिण, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. one who<BR>has made presents (to the priests officiating at a sa-<BR>crifice; Sāy. = येन ऋत्विग्भ्यो दक्षिणा दत्ताः).<BR>—प्रयत-परिग्रह-द्वितीय, अस्, m. accompa-<BR>nied by a pious or chaste wife.<BR>—प्रयतात्मन्<BR>(˚त-आत्˚), आ, आ, अ, restrained in mind, pious-minded,<BR>devout in spirit, pious, ascetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयति|प्रयतिः
प्र-यति, इस्, f., Ved. offering, presenting; a gift,<BR>oblation; effort, exertion, endeavour; will, intention.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयन्तृ
प्र-यन्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, Ved. one who offers or<BR>presents, a giver, bringer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयाम|प्रयामः
प्र-याम, अस्, m. checking, restraining; dearth,<BR>scarcity, dearness; competition of buyers in conse-<BR>quence of scarcity; length (either of space or time).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयाम्य
प्र-याम्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be checked or con-<BR>trolled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयस्
प्रयस् 1. प्र-यस्, cl. 4. 1. P. -यस्यति, -य-<BR>सति, -यसितुम्, to endeavour, labour, strive after<BR>(with dat.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयास|प्रयासः
प्र-यास, अस्, m. effort, exertion, labour, pains,<BR>endeavour; प्रयासेन, with effort, diligently; अ-<BR>प्रयासेन, without any exertion, without effort or<BR>difficulty.<BR>—प्रयास-भाज्, क्, क्, क्, capable of exer-<BR>tion or fatigue, active, energetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयस्
प्रयस् 2. प्रयस्, अस्, n. (fr. rt. 1. प्री), Ved.<BR>pleasure, enjoyment, delight; an object of enjoy-<BR>ment, delicate or dainty food, refreshing draught or<BR>beverage; a sacrifice; प्रयांसि नदीनाम्, the re-<BR>freshing waters of rivers (Sāy. = नदीनाम् प्रीणयि-<BR>त्रीणि जलानि); (आस्, आस्, अस्), valuable, precious (?).<BR>—प्रयस्-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. having or bestow-<BR>ing pleasant food, offering refreshing food (Sāy. =<BR>हविर्-लक्षणान्न-वत्); (अत्), n., N. of a Sā-<BR>man; प्रयस्वन्तो ऽत्रयः, N. of the authors of<BR>the hymn Ṛg-veda V. 20.<BR>—१. प्रयो-ग, अस्, आ,<BR>अम् (for 2. प्र-योग see p. 640, col. 1), Ved.<BR>coming to a meal; (अस्), m., N. of a Ṛṣi with<BR>the patronymic Bhārgava, author of the hymn Ṛg-<BR>veda VIII. 91.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयस्त|प्रयस्तं
प्रयस्त, अस्, आ, अम् (probably connected with 2.<BR>प्रयस्), seasoned, dressed with sauces and condiments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रया
प्रया 1. प्र-या, cl. 2. P. -याति, -यातुम्, to<BR>go forwards, proceed onwards, advance, progress; to<BR>go forth, go away, depart: Caus. -यापयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to cause to proceed: Desid. -यियासति, to wish<BR>to advance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रया
2. प्र-या, आस्, f. (or m. ?), Ved. rushing upon,<BR>assailing, an attack, assault; (Sāy.) an attacking or<BR>assailing force.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयाण|प्रयाणं
प्र-याण, अम्, n. setting out, departing, setting<BR>forth, starting (on a journey); going forth, going to<BR>a distance, journey, march; the march of an army,<BR>attack, invasion; going, motion, progress; departure,<BR>death [cf. प्राण-प्˚]; beginning, commencement;<BR>the hind part or haunch of a horse or other animal,<BR>the crupper (?) ; the back of a horse, the rider's seat.<BR>—प्रयाण-काल, अस्, m. time of departure, death.<BR>—प्रयाण-पुरी, f., N. of a town.<BR>—प्रयाण-<BR>भङ्ग, अस्, m. the breaking or suspending of a<BR>journey, a halt.<BR>—प्रयाणार्ह (˚ण-अर्˚), अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, worthy of death, deserving death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयाणक|प्रयाणकं
प्रयाणक, अम्, n. a journey, march; going,<BR>motion; अ-प्रयाणक, the suspension of a journey,<BR>halting, a halt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयाणीय
प्र-याणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be gone forward or<BR>advanced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयात|प्रयातः
प्र-यात, अस्, आ, अम्, gone towards, advanced;<BR>gone away, gone to a distance, gone, removed,<BR>departed; deceased, dead; (अस्), m. an invasion,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">Page0639-c+ 77</a>]<BR>attack; a steep rock, precipice; (wrongly for प्र-<BR>पात.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयातव्य
प्र-यातव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be gone forward or<BR>advanced, to be marched or proceeded; to be attacked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयातृ
प्र-यातृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who goes forward,<BR>going, able to go or fly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयापण|प्रयापणं
प्र-यापण or प्र-यापन, अम्, n. causing to<BR>go forwards, sending; expelling, driving away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयापणीय
प्र-यापणीय or प्र-यापनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be<BR>caused to go forwards, to be sent away, to be sent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयापित
प्र-यापित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to go forwards,<BR>driven or sent away, made to go or pass away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयापिन्
प्र-यापिन्, ई, इणी or इनी, इ, causing to go for-<BR>wards, sending forwards, causing to go, sending,<BR>sending away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयाप्य
प्र-याप्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be caused to go for-<BR>wards, to be sent away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयाप्यमाण
प्र-याप्यमाण or प्र-याप्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>being caused to go forwards, being sent or made<BR>to go, being caused to pass away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयामन्
प्र-यामन्, अ, n., Ved. going forwards, setting<BR>out (Sāy. = प्र-गमन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयायिन्
प्र-यायिन्, ई, इणी, इ, going forwards, advancing,<BR>marching, going, driving, riding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयास्यत्
प्र-यास्यत्, अन्, अती, or अन्ती, अत्, about to go<BR>forwards, about to go or depart, going.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयियासत्
प्र-यियासत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, wishing to go forth,<BR>desirous of setting out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयियु
प्र-यियु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. used for driving (as a horse).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयाग|प्रयागः
प्रयाग प्र-याग. See 1. प्र-यज्, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयाच्
प्रयाच् प्र-याच्, cl. 1. P. A. -याचति, -ते,<BR>याचितुम्, to ask for, beg, solicit, request.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयाचक
प्र-याचक, अस्, इका, अम्, asking, requesting,<BR>begging, imploring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयाचन|प्रयाचनं
प्र-याचन, अम्, n. asking, requesting, begging,<BR>imploring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयाज|प्रयाजः
प्रयाज प्र-याज. See 1. प्र-यज्, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयाण|प्रयाणं
प्रयाण प्र-याण, &c. See 1. प्र-या, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयास|प्रयासः
प्रयास प्र-यास. See 1. प्र-यस्, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयु
प्रयु प्र-यु, cl. 2. P., 9. P. A. -यौति, -यु-<BR>नाति, -युनीते, -यवितुम्, to disjoin, sever, separate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुत|प्रयुतं
प्र-युत, अस्, आ, अम्, joined, combined, united;<BR>disjoined, separated; (अस्), m., N. of a Deva-gan-<BR>dharva; (अम्), n. a million.<BR>—प्रयुतेश्वर-तीर्थ<BR>(˚त-ईश्˚), अम्, n., N. of a place of pilgrimage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुति
प्र-युति, इस्, f., Ved. separation from, absence;<BR>thoughtlessness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोतृ
प्र-योतृ, ता, त्री, तृ, Ved. one who disjoins or<BR>separates, severing, separating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुज्
प्रयुज् 1. प्र-युज्, cl. 7. A. -युङ्क्ते, -योक्-<BR>तुम्, to join to, harness, yoke; to make use of, use,<BR>employ; to apply; to bestow, grant, give, lend; to<BR>impose, inflict on (with loc. or gen. of the person);<BR>to put in front; to appoint, invest (in an office),<BR>install; to instigate, impel, direct towards; to cast,<BR>hurl, throw (a missile); to conduct; to perform,<BR>practise; to befit, become, be fitting or appropriate:<BR>Caus. -योजयति, -यितुम्, to use, employ; exact<BR>(interest, Manu III. 112); to perform, practise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुक्त|प्रयुक्तं
प्र-युक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, joined to, harnessed, yoked;<BR>used, employed; applied; inflicted upon; appointed,<BR>nominated; associated or connected with; endowed<BR>with, possessing (as an attribute &c.); resulting from,<BR>consequent on, produced by, arising from, occasioned<BR>by; compact, closely united; abstracted, lost in<BR>meditation; lent (as money); asleep?; (अम्), n. a<BR>cause.<BR>—प्रयुक्त-संस्कार, अस्, आ, अम्, to which<BR>polish has been applied, polished (as a gem).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुक्ति|प्रयुक्तिः
प्र-युक्ति, इस्, f. use, employment, application;<BR>activity, inclination; impulse, instigation, incitement;<BR>cause, motive, main object or end, occasion, conse-<BR>quence, result.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुग
प्र-युग, अम्, n. regarded as the original form<BR>of प्रüग, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुज्
2. प्र-युज्, क्, क्, क्, joining, connected with (literally<BR>or figuratively, as a cause, motive, &c.); (क्), f.,<BR>Ved. a team of horses; impulse, motive, cause;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-a" target="_blank">Page0640-a+ 81</a>]<BR>acquiring, acquisition; प्रयुजां हवींषि or प्र-<BR>युग्-घवींषि, Ved., N. of twelve oblations, one of<BR>which is to be offered in each month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0639-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुज्य
प्र-युज्य, ind. having used or employed; having<BR>applied; having connected; having acted or behaved<BR>to or towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुज्यमान
प्र-युज्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being used or em-<BR>ployed, being applied, &c.; being united or con-<BR>nected with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुञ्जान
प्र-युञ्जान, अस्, आ, अम्, joining, adding; em-<BR>ploying, using; appointing, deputing; performing,<BR>doing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोक्तव्य
प्र-योक्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be used or employed;<BR>to be applied, applicable, suitable; to be exhibited<BR>or represented (as a drama); to be hurled or thrown<BR>(as a missile); to be uttered or pronounced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोक्तृ
प्र-योक्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who employs or<BR>applies, one who makes use of, one who uses, using,<BR>employing; one who performs or directs, an exe-<BR>cuter; one who stirs up or excites; an instigator;<BR>the agent of an action; lending, a money-lender;<BR>one who exhibits or represents (a drama); one who<BR>shoots or sends (an arrow); one who recites, a reciter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोग|प्रयोगः
2. प्र-योग, अस्, m. (for. 1. प्रयो-ग see under<BR>2. प्रयस्), joining together, combination, connec-<BR>tion; adding, addition; application, employment;<BR>reducing to practice, use, usage, practice [cf. भूरि-<BR>प्˚, सम्यक्-प्˚]; ceremonial form, course of pro-<BR>ceeding; act, action, effort; (in gram.) a form com-<BR>monly employed, form usually occurring, usual form;<BR>a general precept; employment of drugs; application<BR>of charms or magic, magic, magical rites; offering,<BR>presenting; employment of money, investment,<BR>lending money on usury; principal, loan bearing<BR>interest, profits of usury or trade; appointing, ap-<BR>pointment; hurling, throwing, casting, sending (a<BR>missile); undertaking, beginning, commencement;<BR>a design, device, plan, contrivance; means, instru-<BR>ment; exhibition (of a dance), performance, repre-<BR>sentation (of a drama); recitation, delivery; a for-<BR>mula to be recited, sacred text, authority; fascinating,<BR>subduing (?); cause, motive, occasion, object; con-<BR>sequence, result; an example, comparison; a horse<BR>[cf. प्र-याग]; प्रयोगैस्, ind. by use of means.<BR>—प्रयोग-तस्, ind. by the use of, through the em-<BR>ployment of; in consequence of; according to; in<BR>action, actually.<BR>—प्रयोग-दीप, अस्, m., N. of a<BR>work.<BR>—प्रयोग-निपुण, अस्, आ, अम्, skilful in<BR>practice, practically experienced.<BR>—प्रयोग-पद्-<BR>धति, इस्, f., N. of a work by Śiva-rāma on ritual.<BR>—प्रयोग-पारिजात, अस्, m. and प्रयोग-मुक्ता-<BR>वली, f., N. of two works.<BR>—प्रयोग-वृत्ति, इस्, f.,<BR>N. of a commentary by Varadādhīśa-yajvan.<BR>—प्र-<BR>योग-वैजयन्ती, f., N. of a commentary by Mahā-<BR>deva on the Hiraṇya-keśi-kalpa-sūtra.<BR>—प्रयोग-<BR>सार, अस्, m., N. of a section of the Saṃskāra-tattva.<BR>—प्रयोगातिशय (˚ग-अत्˚), अस्, m. (in dramatic<BR>language) ‘excess in representation,’ bringing a cha-<BR>racter on the stage the moment that his name is<BR>pronounced.<BR>—प्रयोगार्थ (˚ग-अर्˚), अस्, m. an<BR>act tending to a main object?; (अस्, आ, अम्), having<BR>the sense of प्र-योग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोगिन्
प्र-योगिन्, ई, इणी, इ, being employed or used,<BR>usual; having some object in view, striving for an<BR>object, calculated for a particular purpose; using,<BR>applying; causing, stimulating.<BR>—प्रयोगि-त्व, अम्,<BR>n. the being used or employed, usefulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोगीय
प्रयोगीय, अस्, आ, अम्, treating of the application<BR>(of medicines &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोग्य|प्रयोग्यः
प्र-योग्य, अस्, m., Ved. an animal harnessed to<BR>a carriage, an animal used for draught.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोजक|प्रयोजकः
प्र-योजक, अस्, इका, अम्, occasioning, effecting,<BR>conducing to, causing or inducing any act, leading<BR>to anything; instigating, occasioning, prompting,<BR>arousing, stimulating, exciting; an original instigator;<BR>deputing, appointing; (अस्), m. a founder or insti-<BR>tutor (of any ceremony); a law-giver, legislator; an<BR>author, composer; a money-lender, creditor.<BR>—प्र-<BR>योजक-कर्तृत्व, अम्, n. acting as an instigator or<BR>promoter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोजन|प्रयोजनं
प्र-योजन, अम्, n. application, employment,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">Page0640-b+ 74</a>]<BR>use, use of (with inst., e. g. तरुणा किम् प्रयोज-<BR>नम्, what is the use of the tree? मम न किञ्चिद्<BR>अर्थेन प्रयोजनम्, to me there is no use in<BR>money, money is of no use to me); need of, neces-<BR>sity for (with inst.); cause, occasion, motive, origin;<BR>purpose, object, aim, intention, design; profit, in-<BR>terest; means of attaining (Manu VII. 100); प्र-<BR>योजनेन, ind. with a particular motive or inten-<BR>tion; केन प्रयोजनेन, from what cause?<BR>from what motive?<BR>—प्रयोजन-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>having a particular use or aim or purpose, done with<BR>a particular aim or design, selfish; serving for a par-<BR>ticular purpose, serviceable; having a cause, caused,<BR>produced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोजयत्
प्र-योजयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, combining; behaving<BR>to, acting towards; showing, displaying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोज्य|प्रयोज्यं|प्रयोज्यः
प्र-योज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be used or employed,<BR>to be practised; to be occasioned or produced; to<BR>be set to work; to be appointed or directed; to be<BR>thrown, to be cast (as a missile); (अस्), m. a servant,<BR>slave; (अम्), n. capital, principal, (properly, that<BR>which is put out to interest.)<BR>—प्रयोज्य-त्व, अम्,<BR>n. the state of being used or employed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुत|प्रयुतं
प्रयुत प्र-युत. See under प्र-यु, p. 639.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुध्
प्रयुध् 1. प्र-युध्, Desid. A. -युयुत्सते,<BR>to wish to fight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुत्सु|प्रयुत्सुः
प्र-युत्सु, उस्, m. a warrior; a ram; an ascetic;<BR>air, wind; a N. of Indra; (for प्र-युयुत्सु.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुद्ध|प्रयुद्धं
प्र-युद्ध, अम्, n. war, battle.<BR>—प्रयुद्धार्-<BR>थ (˚ध-अर्˚), अस्, m. war, battle, going to war or<BR>battle (= प्रत्य्-उत्क्रम); (अस्, आ, अम्), having the<BR>sense of प्र-युद्ध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयुध्
2. प्र-युध्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. attacking, assailing<BR>(Sāy. = प्र-योद्धृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोद्धृ
प्र-योद्धृ, धा, ध्री, धृ, one who fights,<BR>a combatant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोक्तृ
प्रयोक्तृ प्र-योक्तृ, 2. प्र-योग. See col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रयोतृ
प्रयोतृ प्र-योतृ. See under प्र-यु, p. 639.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रय्यमेध
प्रय्यमेध प्रय्यमेध, a patronymic from<BR>Priya-medha, = प्रैय्यमेध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररक्ष्
प्ररक्ष् प्र-रक्ष्, cl. 1. P. -रक्षति, -रक्-<BR>षितुम्, to protect against, protect, defend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररक्ष
प्र-रक्ष, अस्, आ, अम्, one from whom any one<BR>is protected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररक्षण|प्ररक्षणं
प्र-रक्षण, अम्, n. protecting, protection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररक्षित
प्र-रक्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, protected against, pro-<BR>tected, defended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररथम्
प्ररथम् प्र-रथम्, ind., see Gaṇa Tish-<BR>ṭhadgv-ādi to Pāṇ. II. 1, 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररम्
प्ररम् प्र-रम्, Caus. P. -रमयति, -यितुम्,<BR>Ved. to delight or gladden greatly, exhilarate; to<BR>excite, arouse (?) .<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रराधस्
प्रराधस् प्र-राधस्, आस्, m. (fr. rt. राध्<BR>with प्र), N. of a descendant of Aṅgiras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रराध्य
प्र-राध्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be satisfied or made<BR>content.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररिच्
प्ररिच् प्र-रिच्, Pass. -रिच्यते, to excel,<BR>surpass, be superior to (with abl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररिक्वन्
प्र-रिक्वन्, आ, अरी, अ, Ved. reaching beyond,<BR>surpassing, excelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररेक
प्र-रेक, अस्, m., Ved. abundance, plenty, afflu-<BR>ence; (Sāy.) = दान, bounty, liberality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररेचन
प्र-रेचन, अम्, n., Ved. superabundance, super-<BR>fluity (Sāy. = प्रकर्षेणाधिकं धनम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररुच्
प्ररुच् प्र-रुच्, cl. 1. A. -रोचते, -रोचितुम्,<BR>to shine forth, shine, be brilliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररोचन
प्र-रोचन, अस्, ई, अम्, exciting or inciting to<BR>love (as a spell), seducing; (अम्), n. stimulating,<BR>exciting; seduction; illustration, explanation; (अम्,<BR>आ), n. f. praising an author in the prologue of a<BR>drama, favourable description of that which is to<BR>follow in a play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररुज्
प्ररुज् प्र-रुज्, cl. 6. P. -रुजति, -रोक्तुम्,<BR>Ved. to break down, break (Sāy. = प्र-भञ्ज्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररुज
प्र-रुज, अस्, m., N. of a mythical being con-<BR>quered by Garuḍa; N. of a Rākṣasa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररुद्
प्ररुद् प्र-रुद्, cl. 2. P. -रोदिति, -रोदितुम्,<BR>to burst into tears, begin to weep, weep, cry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररुदित
प्र-रुदित, अस्, आ, अम्, beginning to weep,<BR>wept, weeping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररुध्
प्ररुध् प्र-रुध्, cl. 7. P. A. -रुणद्धि,<BR>-रुन्द्धे, -रोद्धुम्, to keep back, hold back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररुह्
प्ररुह् 1. प्र-रुह्, cl. 1. P. -रोहति, -रोढुम्,<BR>to grow up, shoot forth, shoot up, grow; to heal up<BR>(as a wound).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररुह्
2. प्र-रुह्, ट्, ट्, ट्, shooting forth, growing up<BR>like a plant; (ट्), f., Ved. a shoot, a new branch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररूढ|प्ररूढः
प्र-रूढ, अस्, आ, अम्, grown up, full-grown;<BR>grown, increased; growing or proceeding from a<BR>root, rooted, fastened; born, produced.<BR>—प्ररूढ-<BR>केश, अस्, आ, अम्, ‘long-haired,’ one whose hair has<BR>grown long, having long hair.<BR>—प्ररूढ-शालि, इस्,<BR>m. full-grown rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररूढि|प्ररूढिः
प्र-रूढि, इस्, f. growing up, growth, increase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररोधन
प्र-रोधन, अम्, n., Ved. rising, ascending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररोह|प्ररोहः
प्र-रोह, अस्, m. growing or shooting forth [cf.<BR>दृढ-प्˚]; germinating, germination, sprouting,<BR>budding; a bud, shoot, sprout, twig, spray, sprig; a<BR>shoot of light [cf. प्रभा-प्˚]; a new leaf or branch;<BR>an excrescence.<BR>—प्ररोह-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, pos-<BR>sessing vegetation, covered with vegetation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररोहण|प्ररोहणं
प्र-रोहण, अम्, n. growing or shooting forth,<BR>growing, growth; germinating, germination, bud-<BR>ding, sprouting; a bud, twig, spray, shoot, sprig.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररोहिन्
प्र-रोहिन्, ई, इणी, इ, growing or shooting up,<BR>growing, propagated (Manu I. 46).<BR>—प्ररोहि-<BR>शाखिन्, ई, m. a tree whose branches grow again,<BR>(perhaps rather) a tree still growing or still alive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ररेज्
प्ररेज् प्र-रेज्, cl. 1. A. -रेजते, &c., Ved. to<BR>tremble at (with acc.; Sāy. = प्रकर्षेण कम्प्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रर्क्षीय
प्रर्क्षीय प्रर्क्षीय (fr. 1. प्र + ऋक्ष),<BR>Nom. P. प्रर्क्षीयति, &c., see Vopa-deva II. 4;<BR>(also प्रार्क्षीय.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रर्षभीय
प्रर्षभीय प्रर्षभीय (fr. 1. प्र + ऋष-<BR>भ), Nom. P. प्रर्षभीयति, &c., see Scholiast<BR>on Pāṇ. VI. 1, 92; (also प्रार्षभीय.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलप्
प्रलप् प्र-लप्, cl. 1. P. -लपति, -लपितुम्,<BR>to speak forth, speak; to prattle, prate, talk idly or<BR>incoherently, jabber, chatter; to cry, lament, bewail;<BR>to call upon, invoke: Caus. -लापयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>cause or incite to speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलपत्
प्र-लपत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, speaking, talking; call-<BR>ing upon, invoking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलपन|प्रलपनं
प्र-लपन, अम्, n. prattling, prating; speaking,<BR>talking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलपित|प्रलपितः
प्र-लपित, अस्, आ, अम्, spoken forth, declared,<BR>spoken, uttered, said.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलाप|प्रलापः
प्र-लाप, अस्, m. talk, talking, conversation, dis-<BR>course; talking in an unmeaning or childish manner,<BR>incoherent or delirious speech, prattling, prattle,<BR>prate, chattering; आर्त-प्रलाप, ‘the utterance or<BR>cry of one in pain,’ lamentation, wailing.<BR>—प्रलाप-<BR>वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, speaking confusedly.<BR>—प्रलाप-<BR>हन्, आ, m. a kind of collyrium.<BR>—प्रलापैक-<BR>मय (˚प-एक्˚), अस्, ई, अम्, ‘consisting of lamen-<BR>tation only,’ doing nothing but lament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलापन
प्र-लापन, अम्, n. causing or teaching to speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलापिन्
प्र-लापिन्, ई, इनी, इ, talking much or unmean-<BR>ingly, chattering, a prater; speaking to, conversing<BR>with; lamenting, wailing.<BR>—प्रलापि-ता, f. amorous<BR>conversation, loving prattle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलभ्
प्रलभ् प्र-लभ्, cl. 1. A. -लभते (ep. also<BR>-लम्भते), -लब्धुम्, to overreach, cheat, deceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलब्ध
प्र-लब्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, overreached, cheated,<BR>deceived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलब्धव्य
प्र-लब्धव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be cheated or<BR>deceived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलम्भ|प्रलंभ|प्रलंभः|प्रलम्भः
प्र-लम्भ, अस्, m. receiving, obtaining, attain-<BR>ing, gaining; overreaching, cheating, deceiving, fool-<BR>ing, fraud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0640-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलम्भन|प्रलंभनं
प्र-लम्भन, अम्, n. deceiving, cheating, fool-<BR>ing, fraud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलम्ब|प्रलंब|प्रलम्बः
प्रलम्ब प्र-लम्ब, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. लम्ब्<BR>with प्र), hanging down, depending, pendulous<BR>(generally in comps., cf. प्रलम्ब-केश below);<BR>prominent; slow, dilatory; (अस्), m. hanging on or<BR>from, depending; a branch; a shoot of the vine-palm;<BR>a garland of flowers worn round the neck; a kind of<BR>necklace of pearls; a cucumber; the female breast; N.<BR>of a Daitya slain by Bala-rāma; N. of a mountainous<BR>district; tin?; (आ), f., N. of a Rākṣasī.<BR>—प्र-<BR>लम्ब-केश, अस्, आ, अम्, one whose hair hangs down.<BR>—प्रलम्ब-घ्न, अस्, or प्रलम्ब-हन्, आ, m.<BR>‘the slayer of the Daitya Pralamba,’ epithet of Bala-<BR>rāma (also of Kṛṣṇa?).<BR>—प्रलम्ब-भिद्, त्, or<BR>प्रलम्ब-मथन, अस्, m. ‘the cleaver or crusher<BR>of Pralamba,’ epithet of Bala-rāma (also of Kṛṣṇa?).<BR>—प्रलम्बाण्ड (˚ब-अण्˚), अस्, m. a man with<BR>hanging testicles.<BR>—प्रलम्बोज्ज्वल-चारु-घोण<BR>(˚ब-उज्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, having a prominent, bright,<BR>and handsome nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलम्बक|प्रलंबक
प्र-लम्बक, अस्, m. fragrant Rohisha grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलम्बन|प्रलंबन|प्रलंबनं
प्र-लम्बन, अम्, n. hanging down, depending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलम्बित|प्रलंबित|प्रलम्बितः
प्र-लम्बित, अस्, आ, अम्, suspended, hanging<BR>down, pendulous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलम्बिन्
प्र-लम्बिन्, ई, इनी, इ, hanging down, depending;<BR>त्रि-प्रलम्बिन्, having three pendent limbs or mem-<BR>bers of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलम्बीकृ|प्रलंबीकृ
प्रलम्बी-कृ, cl. 8. P. A. -करोति, -कुरुते,<BR>-कर्तुम्, to make to hang down, suspend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलम्भ|प्रलंभ|प्रलंभः|प्रलम्भः
