प्रलय|प्रलयः
प्रलय प्र-लय, &c. See प्र-ली below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रललाट
प्रललाट प्र-ललाट, अस्, आ, अम्, having a<BR>prominent forehead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलव|प्रलवः
प्रलव प्र-लव, अस्, m. (fr. rt. लू with प्र),<BR>a part cut off, a chip, fragment (as of a reed &c.);<BR>the sheath of a leaf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलवन
प्र-लवन, अम्, n., Ved. cutting off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलवितृ
प्र-लवितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who cuts off, cut-<BR>ting off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलवित्र|प्रलवित्रं
प्र-लवित्र, अम्, n. an instrument for cutting off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलून
प्र-लून, अस्, आ, अम्, cut off; (अस्), m. a kind<BR>of insect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलिख्
प्रलिख् प्र-लिख्, cl. 6. P. -लिखति, -लेखि-<BR>तुम्, to draw lines along (the ground); to scratch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलिप
प्रलिप प्र-लिप, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. लिप् with<BR>प्र), one who smears or plasters, smearing, plas-<BR>tering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलेप|प्रलेपः
प्र-लेप, अस्, m. an unguent, ointment, plaster,<BR>salve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलेपक|प्रलेपकः
प्र-लेपक, अस्, इका, अम्, anointing, smearing,<BR>plastering; (अस्), m. a plasterer, an anointer; a par-<BR>ticular marine substance, lime made of calcined<BR>shells (?); a hectic or slow fever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलेपन
प्र-लेपन, अम्, n. the act of anointing or<BR>smearing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलेप्य
प्र-लेप्य, अस्, m. clean or well-trimmed hair;<BR>(perhaps incorrectly for a form प्र-लेभ्य.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रली
प्रली प्र-ली, cl. 4. A. -लीयते, -लेतुम्, -ला-<BR>तुम्, to become dissolved or reabsorbed, dissolve,<BR>melt away; to disappear, vanish; to die, perish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलय|प्रलयः
प्र-लय, अस्, m. dissolution, destruction, annihi-<BR>lation, reabsorption; the destruction of the whole<BR>world at the end of a Kalpa or period of 432, 000, 000<BR>years [cf. कल्प]; any extensive destruction or de-<BR>vastation; death, dying; fainting, syncope, loss of<BR>sense or consciousness; an epithet of the mystic<BR>syllable ॐ.<BR>—प्रलय-काल, अस्, m. the period of<BR>the destruction of the world at the end of a Kalpa,<BR>the time of universal destruction.<BR>—प्रलय-जल-<BR>धर-ध्वान, अस्, m. the rumbling or muttering<BR>of clouds at the dissolution of the world.<BR>—प्रलय-<BR>ता, f. or प्रलय-त्व, अम्, n. dissolution.<BR>—प्र-<BR>लय-दहन, अम्, n. the fire at the destruction of<BR>the world.<BR>—प्रलय-स्थिति-सर्ग, आस्, m. pl. de-<BR>struction, preservation, and creation (of the world).<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">Page0641-b+ 75</a>]<BR>—प्रलयोदय (˚य-उद्˚), औ, m. du. dissolution<BR>and creation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलयन
प्र-लयन, अम्, n., Ved. a place of rest or<BR>repose, a bed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलीन
प्र-लीन, अस्, आ, अम्, dissolved, melted away; de-<BR>stroyed, annihilated; unconscious, insensible.<BR>—प्र-<BR>लीन-ता, f. or प्रलीन-त्व, अम्, n. dissolution, de-<BR>struction, annihilation, the end of the universe;<BR>unconsciousness, loss of sense, fainting.<BR>—प्रलीन-<BR>भूपाल, अस्, आ, अम्, whose monarchs have been<BR>destroyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलुठ्
प्रलुठ् प्र-लुठ्, cl. 1. P. -लोठति, -लोठितुम्,<BR>to roll forwards, roll along the ground, roll round,<BR>turn round; to be agitated, heave, toss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलोठन|प्रलोठनं
प्र-लोठन, अम्, n. rolling forwards, rolling on<BR>the ground; heaving, tossing (as of the ocean).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलोठित
प्र-लोठित, अस्, आ, अम्, rolling forwards, rolling;<BR>heaving, tossing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलुप्
प्रलुप् प्र-लुप्, Pass. -लुप्यते, to be in-<BR>terrupted; to be destroyed; to be violated; to be<BR>disturbed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलुभ्
प्रलुभ् प्र-लुभ्, cl. 4. P. A. -लुभ्यति, -ते,<BR>-लोब्धुम्, to be lustful, follow one's lusts, lust after;<BR>to pollute (through lust); to allure, entice, seduce:<BR>Caus. -लोभयति, -यितुम्, to cause to lust, allure,<BR>entice, seduce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलोभ|प्रलोभः
प्र-लोभ, अस्, m. allurement, seduction; desire,<BR>covetousness, cupidity, greediness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलोभक
प्र-लोभक, अस्, m. ‘allurer,’ N. of a jackal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलोभन|प्रलोभनं
प्र-लोभन, अस्, ई, अम्, causing to lust after,<BR>alluring, seducing; (अम्), n. seducing, attracting,<BR>attraction; allurement, inducement; that which<BR>allures, a lure, bait; (ई), f. gravel, sand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलोभित
प्र-लोभित, अस्, आ, अम्, allured, enticed, seduced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलोभिन्
प्र-लोभिन्, ई, इनी, इ, lusting after, desiring;<BR>alluring, seducing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलोभ्य
प्र-लोभ्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be lusted after or<BR>desired, desirable, attractive, alluring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलून
प्रलून प्र-लून. See under प्र-लव, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलेह|प्रलेहः
प्रलेह प्र-लेह, अस्, m. (fr. rt. लिह् with प्र),<BR>a kind of broth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलेहन
प्र-लेहन, अम्, n. the act of licking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलोल
प्रलोल प्र-लोल, अस्, आ, अम्, being in violent<BR>motion, agitated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रलोलुप
प्रलोलुप प्र-लोलुप, अस्, m., N. of Kunti<BR>(a descendant of Garuḍa).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रल्कारीय
प्रल्कारीय प्रल्कारीय, Nom. (fr. प्र + ऌ-<BR>कार), प्रल्कारीयति, -यितुम्, see Scholiast on Pāṇ.<BR>VI. 1, 92; (also प्राल्कारीय.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव
प्रव प्रव, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. प्रु), Ved.<BR>fluttering, hovering; (Sāy.) = गच्छत्.<BR>—प्रव-ग,<BR>अस्, m. = प्लव-ग, a monkey.<BR>—प्रवङ्-ग, अस्,<BR>m. = प्लवङ्-ग, a monkey; (आस्), m. pl., N. of<BR>a people.<BR>—प्रवङ्-गम, अस्, m. = प्लवङ्-गम,<BR>a monkey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवक
प्रवक, अस्, आ, अम्, going, one who goes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवच्
प्रवच् प्र-वच्, cl. 2. P. -वक्ति, -वक्तुम्, to<BR>speak forth, begin to speak, declare, announce, relate,<BR>tell (with acc. of the thing and gen. or dat. of the<BR>person); to speak to, address; to speak, say; to<BR>explain; to recite; to celebrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवक्तव्य
प्र-वक्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be declared or<BR>announced; to be imparted or taught; to be ex-<BR>pounded or explained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवक्तृ
प्र-वक्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who speaks or de-<BR>clares, one who announces or informs, a speaker,<BR>declarer, announcer, informer; a propounder, teacher,<BR>expounder (Manu VII. 20); a fine speaker, good<BR>orator, eloquent man.<BR>—प्रवक्तृ-त्व, अम्, n. the<BR>being an expounder or teacher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवचन|प्रवचनं|प्रवचनः
प्र-वचन, अम्, n. speaking, talking; declara-<BR>tion, announcement, proclamation; recitation, oral<BR>instruction, teaching, expounding, exposition, inter-<BR>pretation [cf. साङ्ख्य-प्रवचन-भाष्य]; ex-<BR>cellent speech or language, eloquence; an expression,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-c" target="_blank">Page0641-c+ 79</a>]<BR>term; a system of doctrines propounded in a treatise<BR>or dissertation; sacred writings, especially the Brāh-<BR>maṇas; the fundamental doctrine of Buddhists; the<BR>sacred writings of the Jainas; प्र-वचन is also<BR>said to be used as an enclitic after a simple verb, see<BR>Gaṇa Gotrādi to Pāṇ. VIII. 1, 27.<BR>—प्रवचन-<BR>पटु, उस्, उस्, उ, skilled in speaking, eloquent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवचनीय|प्रवचनीयः
प्र-वचनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be declared; to be<BR>taught or propounded; to be well or elegantly<BR>spoken; a good speaker; a propounder, teacher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाक|प्रवाकः
प्र-वाक, अस्, m. proclaiming, announcing, a pro-<BR>claimer, announcer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाच्
प्र-वाच्, क्, क्, क्, eloquent, oratorical, speaking,<BR>a speaker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाचक|प्रवाचकः
प्र-वाचक, अस्, इका, अम्, declaratory, explana-<BR>tory; speaking well, eloquent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाचन|प्रवाचनं
प्र-वाचन, अम्, n. a proclamation, promulgation;<BR>a designation; द्वि-प्रवाचन, having a twofold<BR>designation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाच्य|प्रवाच्यं
प्र-वाच्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be proclaimed aloud;<BR>praiseworthy, glorious (Ved., Sāy. = प्रकर्षेण<BR>वक्तव्य); to be spoken to or addressed; (अम्),<BR>n. a literary production.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवट|प्रवटः
प्रवट प्र-वट, अस्, m. (fr. rt. वट् with प्र),<BR>wheat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवण|प्रवणः
प्रवण प्रवण, अम्, n. (probably fr. 1. प्र;<BR>but according to Pāṇ. VIII. 4, 5, said to be fr. 1.<BR>प्र + वन, a forest), the side of a hill, a declivity,<BR>steep descent, precipice, an abyss, depth, (in the<BR>earlier language used only in loc. sing.; Sāy. =<BR>निम्न-प्रदेश); (अस्), m. a place where four<BR>roads meet; (ए), ind. in a precipitous course, pre-<BR>cipitously, precipitately, suddenly, hurriedly, hastily;<BR>(अस्, आ, अम्), declining, bent, bowed, sloping down,<BR>shelving, flowing down (often in comps., e. g. निम्न-<BR>प्˚, flowing downwards; cf. उदक्-प्˚, दक्षिणा-प्˚);<BR>precipitous, inclining downwards, steep, abrupt;<BR>curved, crooked; inclining, inclined to, directed<BR>towards, disposed to, tending to [cf. वञ्चन-प्˚];<BR>ready, willing; applying one's self to, devoted to,<BR>attached or adhering to, addicted, prone [cf. वि-<BR>षय-प्˚]; filled with, possessed of, endowed with;<BR>generous; humble, modest; waning or fading away,<BR>wasted, decayed, disappeared.<BR>—प्रवण-ता, f. pre-<BR>cipitousness, inclination, proclivity, propensity, pro-<BR>pension, attachment, devotion.<BR>—प्रवण-प्रहर्-<BR>ष, अस्, आ, अम्, one whose joy has faded away, whose<BR>happiness has disappeared.<BR>—प्रवण-वत्, आन्, अती,<BR>अत्, having a steep descent or declivity, having a<BR>downward course, downward, precipitous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवणाय
प्रवणाय, Nom. P. प्रवणायति, -यितुम्, to<BR>feel inclined or disposed towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवणायित
प्रवणायित, अम्, n. inclination, propensity, bias.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवत्|प्रवन्त्
प्रवत्, त्, f. (fr. 1. प्र), Ved. the side of a moun-<BR>tain, a declivity, precipice; an elevation, height, the<BR>heavenly height; a sloping path, easy course, rapid pro-<BR>gress; प्रवतो नपात्, ‘son of the heavenly height,’<BR>an epithet of lightning; प्रवतस्, pl. the heavenly<BR>heights (sometimes said to be three, sometimes<BR>seven in number; Sāy. = आपस्); flowing down<BR>declivities (said of rivers; Sāy. = प्रवण-देशे गच्-<BR>छत्); (आन्, अती, अत्), directed forwards or towards;<BR>containing the syllable प्र or पृ; (in the preceding<BR>adj. senses fr. 1. प्र + वत्); प्रवता or प्रवद्भिः,<BR>ind. down hill, downwards (Sāy. = प्रवणवता<BR>मार्गेण); precipitately, rapidly, swiftly.<BR>—प्रवत्-<BR>वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. having a downward course, de-<BR>scending; precipitous, headlong, rapid; affording a<BR>downward path, suited for rapid motion; hilly.<BR>—प्र-<BR>वद्-भार्गव, N. of a Sāman.<BR>—प्रवद्-यामन्,<BR>आ, m., Ved. having a downward path, rapid in its<BR>course (as a chariot; Sāy. = शीघ्र-गामिन्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवत्स्यत्
प्रवत्स्यत् प्र-वत्स्यत्. See 2. प्र-वस्, p. 642.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवद्
प्रवद् प्र-वद्, cl. 1. P. A. -वदति, -ते,<BR>-वदितुम्, to speak forth, speak out, pronounce,<BR>utter; to proclaim, declare; to speak to, address; to<BR>say, speak, tell; to converse with; to explain: Caus.<BR>-वादयति, -यितुम्, to cause to speak or sound forth,<BR>to play (a musical instrument).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0641-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवद
प्र-वद, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. sounding forth, sound-<BR>ing (as a drum).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवदत्
प्र-वदत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, speaking forth, speaking<BR>to or with, conversing, addressing; speaking much<BR>or well; arguing, a disputant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवदन|प्रवदनं
प्र-वदन, अम्, n., Ved. a proclamation, an-<BR>nouncement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवदितृ
प्र-वदितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, Ved. one who speaks<BR>forth or speaks out, speaking out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाद|प्रवादः
प्र-वाद, अस्, m. speaking forth, uttering a word<BR>or sound; expressing, naming, mentioning; declar-<BR>ing, declaration [cf. वेद-प्˚]; discourse, conversa-<BR>tion; a saying, popular talk, rumour, report; spread-<BR>ing a report, (द्यूत-प्˚, report of gambling); a<BR>fable, myth; mutual defiance, the conversation of<BR>antagonists prior to combat; litigious language; (in<BR>Ved. gram.) a base or crude form (opposed to a<BR>word with a case termination &c.); (आ), f., Ved. in<BR>गन्ध-प्रवादास्, f. pl. all that is called perfume (?) .<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवादक
प्र-वादक, अस्, इका, अम्, causing to sound forth,<BR>playing on (a musical instrument).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवादिन्
प्र-वादिन्, ई, इनी, इ, giving forth a sound, uttering<BR>a cry; speaking, speaking of, reporting; (in Ved.<BR>gram.) being in the crude form.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाद्य
प्र-वाद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be said or spoken; to<BR>be proclaimed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवध्य
प्रवध्य प्र-वध्य, ind. (fr. rt. वध् with<BR>प्र), having killed or slain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवन्द्
प्रवन्द् प्र-वन्द्, cl. 1. A. -वन्दते, -वन्-<BR>दितुम्, Ved. to praise highly, extol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवप्
प्रवप् प्र-वप्, cl. 1. P. A. -वपति, -ते,<BR>-वप्तुम्, to scatter forth, scatter, strew; to throw,<BR>cast, shoot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवप
प्र-वप, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. प्र + वपा), having<BR>much fat, very fat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवपण|प्रवपणं
प्र-वपण, अम्, n., Ved. scattering forth, sow-<BR>ing; shaving off (of the beard &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवापयितृ
प्र-वापयितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, Ved. one who scatters<BR>forth or pours out, scattering forth, pouring out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवापिन्
प्र-वापिन्, ई, इणी, इ, one who sows seed, sowing,<BR>a sower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवयण|प्रवयणं
प्रवयण 1. प्र-वयण, अम्, n. (fr. rt. वी =<BR>rt. अज्; for 2. see under प्र-वे, p. 645, col. 1),<BR>a goad; [cf. प्राजन.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवयणीय
प्र-वयणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be driven forwards (?) .<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवय्या
प्रवय्या, f., Ved. (a cow) to be driven on with<BR>a goad (?) .<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवयस्
प्रवयस् प्र-वयस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, (Ved.) strong,<BR>vigorous, in the prime of life; advanced in age, aged,<BR>ancient; (Sāy.) = प्रवृद्धान्न or पुरातन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर|प्रवरं|प्रवरः
प्रवर प्र-वर. See प्र-वृ, p. 644, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्ग|प्रवर्गः
प्रवर्ग प्र-वर्ग, प्र-वर्ग्य, प्र-वर्जन.<BR>See under प्र-वृज्, p. 644, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्त|प्रवर्तः|प्रवर्त्त
प्रवर्त प्र-वर्त, &c. See 1. प्र-वृत्, p. 644.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्धक
प्रवर्धक प्र-वर्धक, प्र-वर्धन. See<BR>under प्र-वृध्, p. 644, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्ष|प्रवर्षः
प्रवर्ष प्र-वर्ष, प्र-वर्षण, प्र-वर्-<BR>षिन्. See under प्र-वृष्, p. 645, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्ह|प्रवर्हः
प्रवर्ह प्र-वर्ह. See प्र-वृह्, p. 645, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवलाकिन्
प्रवलाकिन् प्रवलाकिन्, ई, m. a peacock;<BR>a snake; (incorrectly for प्रचलाकिन्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवल्ह
प्रवल्ह प्र-वल्ह, अस्, m., Ved. a riddle,<BR>enigma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवल्हिका
प्रवल्हिका, f., Ved. a riddle, enigma; N. of the<BR>formulas Atharva-veda XX. 133; [cf. प्रवह्लिका.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवस्
प्रवस् 1. प्र-वस् (see rt. 5. वस्), cl. 2. A.<BR>-वस्ते, -वसितुम्, to put on (clothes), to dress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवस्
प्रवस् 2. प्र-वस् (see rt. 6. वस्), cl. 1. P.<BR>-वसति, -वस्तुम्, to live afar off, dwell abroad; to<BR>order to live abroad, banish to (with loc.): Caus.<BR>-वासयति, -यितुम्, to cause to live afar off, order to<BR>dwell abroad, banish, exile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवत्स्यत्
प्र-वत्स्यत्, अन्, अती, or अन्ती, अत्, about to dwell<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">Page0642-b+ 80</a>]<BR>abroad.<BR>—प्रवत्स्यत्-पतिका, f. the wife of a man<BR>who intends to make a journey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवसत्
प्र-वसत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, dwelling or residing<BR>abroad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवसथ
प्र-वसथ, अम्, n., Ved. going abroad, de-<BR>parting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवसन|प्रवसनं
प्र-वसन, अम्, n. going abroad, setting out on a<BR>journey, departing; sojourning in a foreign country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवस्तव्य
प्र-वस्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. to be gone abroad,<BR>to be departed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवास|प्रवासः
प्र-वास, अस्, m. sojourning abroad, foreign resi-<BR>dence, being away from home, being abroad; a tem-<BR>porary sojourn; (in astronomy) heliacal setting of<BR>the planets; प्रवासं गम्, to go abroad.<BR>—प्र-<BR>वास-गत, अस्, आ, अम्, gone abroad, gone away from<BR>home.<BR>—प्रवास-पर, अस्, आ, अम्, addicted to<BR>living abroad or away from home.<BR>—प्रवास-स्थ<BR>or प्रवास-स्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, dwelling abroad, being<BR>absent from home.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवासत्
प्र-वासत् (?) , अन्, अन्ती, अत् (see प्र-वसत् above),<BR>dwelling abroad, being absent from home.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवासन|प्रवासनं
प्र-वासन, अम्, n. causing to live abroad, send-<BR>ing away from home, exile, banishment; dwelling<BR>abroad, sojourning, lodging; killing, slaying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवासित
प्र-वासित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to dwell abroad,<BR>banished, exiled, expatriated, expelled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवासिन्
प्र-वासिन्, ई, इनी, इ, dwelling or residing abroad,<BR>being or living away from home; being on a journey,<BR>a traveller, sojourner; परलोक-नव-प्रवासिन्,<BR>one who has lately set out for the next world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवास्य
प्र-वास्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be caused to live abroad,<BR>to be sent into exile, to be banished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवसु
प्रवसु प्र-वसु, उस्, m., N. of a son of<BR>Īlina.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवह्
प्रवह् प्र-वह्, cl. 1. P. -वहति, -वोढुम्,<BR>to carry forwards, drag onwards, draw; to carry forth,<BR>carry off; to breathe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवह|प्रवहः
प्र-वह, अस्, आ, अम्, bearing forwards, carrying<BR>off, bearing away; (अस्), m. ‘bearing forwards,’ N. of<BR>one of the seven winds said to cause the motion of<BR>the planets; wind, air; N. of one of the seven<BR>tongues of Fire; a reservoir into which water is<BR>carried off [cf. वर्षाम्बु-प्˚]; flowing or stream-<BR>ing forth; going forth, going from a town; [cf.<BR>प्र-वाह below.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवहण|प्रवहणं
प्र-वहण, अम्, n. a covered carriage, a litter<BR>or carriage for women; a ship; (अस्), m., N. of a<BR>Dānava.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवहत्
प्र-वहत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, carrying forwards, bear-<BR>ing; breathing; receiving, enjoying (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाह|प्रवाहः
प्र-वाह, अस्, m. a stream, current, flow, flux,<BR>course; running water; continuous flow or passage;<BR>unbroken succession, continuity; flowing or streaming<BR>forth [cf. प्र-वह above]; course or direction<BR>towards; anything moving onwards like a current,<BR>current of human affairs &c., course of action, active<BR>life, occupation; a pond; N. of one of the attendants<BR>of Skanda; a beautiful or swift horse; (ई), f. sand.<BR>—प्रवाहे-मूत्रित, अम्, n. ‘making water in a<BR>river,’ a metaphorical expression for a useless action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाहक|प्रवाहकः
प्र-वाहक, अस्, इका, अम्, carrying forwards, car-<BR>rying off, bearing or carrying well; (अस्), m. a<BR>Rākṣasa, an imp, goblin; (इका), f. a sudden desire<BR>to evacuate, diarrhœa; (आ), ind. = प्र-बाहुक्, q. v.,<BR>see Gaṇa Svar-ādi to Pāṇ. I. 1, 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाहण
प्र-वाहण, अस्, ई, अम्, carrying off, carrying<BR>away (Ved.); (अस्), m., N. of a man (Ved.); (ई), f.<BR>the sphincter muscle which ejects the feces from the<BR>rectum; (अम्), n. driving forth; evacuation by stool<BR>(especially if from sudden desire).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाहणेय
प्रवाहणेय, अस्, or प्रवाहणेयि, इस्, m. a<BR>patronymic from Pravāhaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाहणेयक
प्रवाहणेयक, अस्, इका, अम्, see Scholiast on<BR>Pāṇ. VII. 3, 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाहिन्
प्र-वाहिन्, ई, इणी, or इनी, इ, carrying forwards,<BR>drawing; carrying off, carrying away (said of a river);<BR>flowing, streaming [cf. लोक-प्˚]; (इणी or इनी), f. a<BR>region abounding in streams (?) .<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाह्य
प्रवाह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. fluviatic, fluvial;<BR>(Mahī-dhara = स्रोतसि भवः.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवोढृ
प्र-वोढृ, -ढा, -ढ्री, -ढृ, or Ved. प्र-<BR>वोऌहृ, carrying off, bearing away, one who carries<BR>off or bears away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवह्लि|प्रवह्लिः
प्रवह्लि प्र-वह्लि, इस्, or प्र-वह्ली, or प्र-<BR>वह्लिका, f. a riddle, enigma, conundrum, charade;<BR>[cf. प्र-वल्ह, प्रवल्हिका.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवा
प्रवा 1. प्र-वा, cl. 2. P. -वाति, -वातुम्, to<BR>blow forth, blow violently, blow; to smell, yield a<BR>scent: Caus. -वापयति, -यितुम्, to dry up, dry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवा
2. प्र-वा (आस्?), f., Ved. blowing, blowing away,<BR>(प्र-वा उप-वा, blowing to and fro); N. of a<BR>daughter of Dakṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवात
प्र-वात, अस्, आ, अम्, blown forwards, agitated by<BR>the wind; (अम्), n. a current or draught of air; an<BR>airy place; windy or stormy weather.<BR>—प्रवात-<BR>शयन, अम्, n. a bed placed in the middle of a<BR>current of air.<BR>—प्रवात-सार, अस्, m., N. of a<BR>Buddha; (also read प्रवाट-सागर, i. e. प्रवाड-<BR>सागर.)<BR>—प्रवाते-ज, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. growing in<BR>an airy place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाय्य
प्र-वाय्य, अम्, n., Ved. (perhaps) fleetness,<BR>rapidity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाक|प्रवाकः
प्रवाक प्र-वाक, प्र-वाच्, &c. See p. 641,<BR>col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0642-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाड
