प्रविध्वस्त
प्रविध्वस्त प्र-विध्वस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, thrown<BR>away; tossed about, agitated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

