प्रविभज्
प्रविभज् प्र-वि-भज्, cl. 1. P. A. -भजति,<BR>-ते, -भक्तुम्, to part asunder, sever, sunder, sepa-<BR>rate; to divide, distribute, apportion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविभक्त
प्र-विभक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, parted asunder, severed,<BR>sundered, separated; divided, distributed, partitioned,<BR>apportioned, shared; variously situated.<BR>—प्रवि-<BR>भक्त-रश्मि, इस्, इस्, इ, having the rays distributed,<BR>distributing rays.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविभज्य
प्र-विभज्य, ind. having parted asunder, having<BR>separated; having divided or apportioned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविभाग|प्रविभागः
प्र-विभाग, अस्, m. parting asunder, division,<BR>separation, distribution, classification; a part, portion.<BR>—प्रविभाग-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having subdivisions,<BR>subdivided.<BR>—प्रविभाग-शस्, ind. according to<BR>the several portions or divisions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविभिन्न
प्रविभिन्न प्र-विभिन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, broken<BR>or torn off, wounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविभुज्
प्रविभुज् प्र-वि-भुज्, cl. 6. P. -भुजति,<BR>-भोक्तुम्, to bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविमुच्
प्रविमुच् प्र-वि-मुच्, cl. 6. P. A. -मुञ्चति,<BR>-ते, -मोक्तुम्, to set free, release, liberate; to lay<BR>aside, relinquish, resign, abandon: Pass. -मुच्यते,<BR>to be freed from, be rid of (with abl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविमृश्
प्रविमृश् प्र-वि-मृश्, cl. 6. P. -मृशति,<BR>-मर्ष्टुम्, -म्रष्टुम्, to think upon, meditate,<BR>ponder, reflect, deliberate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविमृश्य
प्र-विमृश्य, ind. having thought upon, having<BR>pondered or considered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविर|प्रविरः
प्रविर प्रविर, अस्, m. a species of fragrant<BR>wood, yellow sandal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविरल
प्रविरल प्र-विरल, अस्, आ, अम्, separated by<BR>a considerable interval, separate, isolated, few, very<BR>rare, very scanty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविलम्बिन्
प्रविलम्बिन् प्र-विलम्बिन्, ई, इनी, इ (fr. rt.<BR>लम्ब् with प्र-वि), hanging forwards, projecting,<BR>prominent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविलय|प्रविलयः
प्रविलय प्र-विलय. See प्र-वि-ली below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविलसेन
प्रविलसेन प्रविल-सेन, अस्, m. (प्रविल<BR>probably fr. प्र + विल with सेना), N. of a prince.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविलापिन्
प्रविलापिन् प्र-विलापिन्, ई, इनी, इ (fr. rt. लप्<BR>with प्र-वि), grieving, sorrowing, lamenting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविली
प्रविली प्र-वि-ली, cl. 4. A. -लीयते, -लेतुम्,<BR>लातुम्, to become dissolved, melt away; to vanish<BR>away, disappear, fade away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविलय|प्रविलयः
प्र-विलय, अस्, m. becoming dissolved, melting<BR>away; complete dissolution or absorption.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविलुप्त
प्रविलुप्त प्र-विलुप्त, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. लुप्<BR>with प्र-वि), cut away, removed, lost, fallen or<BR>rubbed off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविलोक्
प्रविलोक् प्र-वि-लोक्, cl. 10. P. -लोकयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to look forwards, look about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविलोकयत्
प्र-विलोकयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, looking forwards,<BR>looking about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविवा
प्रविवा प्र-वि-वा, cl. 2. P. -वाति, -वातुम्,<BR>Ved. to blow asunder, disperse, scatter; (Sāy.) =<BR>नितरां गमय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविवाद|प्रविवादः
प्रविवाद प्र-विवाद (?) , अस्, m. altercation,<BR>dispute (= वि-वाद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविविक्त
प्रविविक्त प्र-विविक्त, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. विच्<BR>with प्र-वि), separated, detached; solitary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविवेक|प्रविवेकः
प्र-विवेक, अस्, m. probably = वि-वेक, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविव्राजयिषु
प्रविव्राजयिषु प्र-विव्राजयिषु. See under<BR>प्र-व्रज्, p. 645, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविश्
प्रविश् प्र-विश्, cl. 6. P. (ep. also A.) -वि-<BR>शति (-ते), -वेष्टुम्, to enter into, enter, come<BR>into, go into; to enter upon, begin, commence; to<BR>appear: Caus. -वेशयति, -यितुम्, to cause to enter<BR>into, allow to enter, bring into, introduce to (with<BR>double acc.); to lead into (one's home), lead (home,<BR>as a wife); to lay up, store up: Desid. -विविक्षति,<BR>to wish to enter into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविविक्षु
प्र-विविक्षु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing to enter into,<BR>being about to go into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविशत्
प्र-विशत्, अन्, अती, or अन्ती, अत्, entering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविश्य
प्र-विश्य, ind. having entered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविष्ट|प्रविष्टः
प्र-विष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, entered into, entered,<BR>gone into, come into; entered upon, engaged in,<BR>occupied with, begun, commenced; (आ), f., N. of<BR>the mother of Paippalādi and Kauśika.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविष्टक|प्रविष्टकं
प्रविष्टक, अम्, n. entering a room; entrance<BR>on the stage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेश|प्रवेशः
प्र-वेश, अस्, m. entering into, entering, entrance,<BR>ingress, penetrating, penetration; the entrance or door<BR>of a house, &c.; the entrance of the sun into a sign of<BR>the zodiac; entrance on the stage; coming on, setting<BR>in (of night); going into, being contained in; income,<BR>revenue; intentness on an object, engaging closely in<BR>a pursuit or purpose; the syringe of a clyster-pipe;<BR>प्रवेशं कृ, to make one's entrance, enter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेशक|प्रवेशकः
प्र-वेशक, अस्, इका, अम्, going into, entering,<BR>penetrating, one who enters; (at the end of comps.)<BR>= प्र-वेश; (अस्), m. an interlude or introductory<BR>scene acted by inferior characters for the purpose of<BR>acquainting the audience with any events supposed<BR>to have occurred between the two acts, a knowledge<BR>of which is requisite for the understanding of what<BR>follows; (according to Kāṭavema in the opening<BR>scene in Śakuntalā, Act 2, the object of the Praveśaka,<BR>as of the Vi-ṣkambha, q. v., is to connect or bind<BR>together the story of the drama and the subdivisions<BR>of the plot by concisely alluding to what has hap-<BR>pened in the intervals of the acts, or what is likely<BR>to happen at the end.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेशन|प्रवेशनं
प्र-वेशन, अम्, n. entering into, entering, en-<BR>trance, going into; sexual intercourse; an entrance<BR>to a house, principal door or gate; conducting into,<BR>leading into, introducing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेशनीय
प्र-वेशनीय, to be entered, to be introduced,<BR>&c. (See also Gaṇa Anupravacanādi to Pāṇ. V.<BR>1, 111.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेशयितव्य
प्र-वेशयितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be made to enter,<BR>to be led or conducted into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेशित
प्र-वेशित, अस्, आ, अम्, made to go in, caused to<BR>enter, introduced, brought in, sent in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेशिन्
प्र-वेशिन्, ई, इनी, इ, entering; (at the end of an<BR>adj. comp.) having an entrance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेश्य
1. प्र-वेश्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be entered; to be<BR>pervaded; to be played (as a musical instrument);<BR>to be led or conducted into, to be brought into; to<BR>be placed in or upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेश्य
2. प्र-वेश्य, ind. having caused to enter into, hav-<BR>ing sent or thrown in, having sent or thrown into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेष्टव्य
प्र-वेष्टव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be entered; to be<BR>penetrated or pervaded; to be caused or allowed to<BR>enter, to be admitted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेष्टृ
प्र-वेष्टृ, टा, ट्री, टृ, one who enters or goes<BR>into, entering, going in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविश्लेष|प्रविश्लेषः
प्रविश्लेष प्र-विश्लेष, अस्, m. separation,<BR>parting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविषण्ण
प्रविषण्ण प्र-विषण्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, dejected,<BR>sad, spiritless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविषा
प्रविषा प्र-विषा, f. a birch tree; [cf.<BR>उप-विषा, प्रति-विषा.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0643-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविष्ट|प्रविष्टः
प्रविष्ट प्र-विष्ट, प्रविष्टक. See under<BR>प्र-विश्, p. 643, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविस्तर|प्रविस्तरः
प्रविस्तर प्र-विस्तर or प्र-विस्तार, अस्, m.<BR>circumference, compass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवी
प्रवी प्र-वी, cl. 2. P. -वेति, -वेतुम्, Ved. to<BR>desire, love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवीण|प्रवीणः
प्रवीण प्र-वीण, अस्, आ, अम् [cf. वीणा],<BR>skilful, clever, proficient, conversant with, skilled<BR>in, versed in, an adept; (अस्), m., N. of a son of<BR>the fourteenth Manu.<BR>—प्रवीण-ता, f. or प्रवीण-<BR>त्व, अम्, n. skill, proficiency.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवीर|प्रवीरः
प्रवीर प्र-वीर, अस्, आ, अम्, heroic, strong,<BR>powerful; best, most excellent; (अस्), m. a hero,<BR>warrior, chief, prince, a person of rank or distinction;<BR>N. of a son of Pūru; of a son of Pra-cinvat and<BR>grandson of Pūru; of a son of Dharma-netra; of a<BR>son of Hary-aśva; of a son of the fourteenth Manu;<BR>of a Caṇḍāla; (आस्), m. pl., N. of the descendants<BR>of Pravīra (son of Pūru).<BR>—प्रवीर-बाहु, उस्, m.<BR>‘strong-armed,’ N. of a Rākṣasa.<BR>—प्रवीर-वर,<BR>अस्, m. ‘best of heroes,’ N. of an Asura.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृ
प्रवृ प्र-वृ, cl. 5. 9. P. A. -वृणोति, -वृ-<BR>णुते, -वृणाति, -वृणीते, -वरितुम्, -वरीतुम्, to<BR>choose out, choose, select; to cover; to put on (a<BR>garment); to keep off, ward off (Ved.): Caus. -व-<BR>रयति, -यितुम्, to ask for, prefer; -वारयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to cover; to defend; to present (?) .<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर|प्रवरं|प्रवरः
प्र-वर, अस्, m. a call, summons (especially of<BR>a Brāhman to priestly functions); an invocation ad-<BR>dressed by a Brāhman at the consecration of his own<BR>fire to Agni Havya-vāhana (in such invocations Agni<BR>is invited to bear the oblations to the gods as he<BR>did for the sacrificer's ancestors, and the names of<BR>the first four or five of these ancestors, who are<BR>most nearly connected with the ancient Ṛṣis, must<BR>then be added to each invocation of Agni, thus<BR>Gotama invokes Agni Āṅgirasa, Agni Āyāsya, Agni<BR>Gautama, &c.); a line of ancestors (so named in<BR>the preceding invocation to Agni); one of the forty-<BR>nine Gotras, as opposed to the eight original Gotras;<BR>a member of a line of ancestors, an ancestor; a<BR>Muni who contributes to the credit of a particular<BR>Gotra or family; family, race, lineage, kindred;<BR>offspring, descendants; a covering, cover, screen; an<BR>upper garment; a black variety of Phaseolus Mungo,<BR>Oppuntia Dillenii; N. of a messenger of the gods<BR>and friend of Indra; of a Dānava; (आ), f., N. of<BR>a river which falls into the Go-dāvarī near Tokā,<BR>and is celebrated for the sweetness of its water;<BR>(अम्), n. aloe wood; a particular high number; (अस्,<BR>आ, अम्), most excellent, chief, principal, best [cf.<BR>शङ्ख-प्˚]; prominent, distinguished, exalted, emi-<BR>nent; better, greater (e. g. ततः प्रवरः, better<BR>or greater than that); eldest (e. g. पुत्र-प्रवर,<BR>the eldest son; in some of the preceding adj. senses<BR>perhaps fr. प्र + वर).<BR>—प्रवर-दीपिका, f., N.<BR>of a work.<BR>—प्रवर-धातु, उस्, m., Ved. a<BR>precious metal.<BR>—प्रवर-भूपति, इस्, m. = प्र-<BR>वर-सेन.<BR>—प्रवर-मञ्जरी, f., N. of a work by<BR>Puruṣottama.<BR>—प्रवर-मूर्धज, अस्, m. excellent<BR>hair (of the head).<BR>—प्रवर-ललित, अम्, n. a kind<BR>of metre, four times ˘¯¯¯¯¯˘˘˘˘˘¯¯˘¯¯.<BR>—प्रवर-वाहन, औ, m. du. ‘having the best<BR>of horses,’ an epithet of the Aśvins.<BR>—प्रवर-<BR>सेन, अस्, m., N. of two princes of Kaśmīra, one of<BR>whom is also called Śreṣṭha-sena.<BR>—प्रवरा-<BR>ध्याय (˚र-अध्˚), अस्, m. ‘book of ancestral<BR>lines,’ N. of the eleventh of the eighteen Pari-śiṣṭas<BR>belonging to the White Yajur-veda.<BR>—प्रवरेश<BR>(˚र-ईश), अस्, m. a distinguished nobleman (?); =<BR>प्रवर-सेन.<BR>—प्रवरेश्वर (˚र-ईश्˚), अस्, m.,<BR>N. of a temple built by Pravara-sena.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवरण|प्रवरणं
प्र-वरण, अम्, n. a call, summons, invocation,<BR>(अति-प्रवरण, excessive invocation, invoking in<BR>too great a number); (with Buddhists) the festivities<BR>at the end of the rainy season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवार|प्रवारः
प्र-वार, अस्, m. a covering, cover, clothing,<BR>woollen cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवारक|प्रवारकः
प्र-वारक, अस्, m. (with Buddhists) the festi-<BR>vities at the end of the rainy season; (अम्), n. a<BR>covering, cover, clothing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवारण|प्रवारणं
प्र-वारण, अम्, n. priority of choice; satis-<BR>fying, granting what is desired; prohibition, objec-<BR>tion, opposition; (with Buddhists) the festivities at<BR>the end of the rainy season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवार्य
प्र-वार्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be satisfied, to be<BR>gratified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृत
प्र-वृत, अस्, आ, अम्, chosen out, chosen, selected.<BR>—प्रवृत-होम, अस्, m. or प्रवृताहुति (˚त-<BR>आह्˚), इस्, f., Ved. ‘election-sacrifice,’ a sacrifice offered<BR>at the election of a priest.<BR>—प्रवृतहोमीय, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, Ved. relating to a sacrifice offered at the<BR>election of a priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृज्
प्रवृज् प्र-वृज्, cl. 2. A. -वृक्ते, -वर्जितुम्,<BR>Ved. to purify; (Sāy.) = प्रकर्षेण छिद्, to cut<BR>or strew in abundance; = प्र-भृ, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्ग|प्रवर्गः
प्र-वर्ग, अस्, m. sacrificial fire (= महा-वीर);<BR>an excellent assemblage [cf. दास-प्˚]; (perhaps a<BR>wrong reading for प्र-वर्ग्य.)<BR>—प्रवर्गावर्त-<BR>भूषण (˚ग-आव्˚), अस्, m. an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्ग्य|प्रवर्ग्यः
प्र-वर्ग्य, अस्, m. a ceremony introductory to<BR>the Soma sacrifice, pouring fresh milk into a heated<BR>vessel (called महा-वीर or घर्म), or according<BR>to others into boiling ghee (Sāy. = तप्ते घृते<BR>पयः-प्रक्षेपः).<BR>—प्रवर्ग्य-वत्, आन्, अती,<BR>अत्, Ved. connected with the Pravargya ceremony.<BR>—प्रवर्ग्याभरण-भूषण (˚य-आभ्˚), अस्,<BR>m. an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्जन|प्रवर्जनं
प्र-वर्जन, अम्, n. the performance of the<BR>Pravargya ceremony, pouring fresh milk into a heated<BR>vessel or into boiling ghee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृज्य
प्र-वृज्य = प्र-वर्ग्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृञ्जन
प्र-वृञ्जन, अम्, n. = प्र-वर्जन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृञ्जनीय
प्रवृञ्जनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. used at the Pra-<BR>vargya ceremony (said of the महा-वीर, q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृत्
प्रवृत् 1. प्र-वृत्, cl. 1. A. (also P. in Fut.,<BR>Cond., and Aor.) -वर्तते, -वर्तितुम्, to go or roll<BR>forwards, roll on, flow onwards, proceed, make<BR>progress, go on well; to come forth, come into<BR>being, arise, be produced; to become, exist; to<BR>happen, take place, come to pass; to begin, com-<BR>mence (with acc. or inf.); to engage in, enter upon,<BR>be occupied in (with loc.); to behave, conduct one's<BR>self; to hold good: Caus. -वर्तयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>cause to proceed; to cause to flow onwards; to set<BR>in motion or action, instigate, urge, excite; to throw,<BR>cast; to produce, create; to devise, invent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्त|प्रवर्तः|प्रवर्त्त
प्र-वर्त, अस्, m. engaging in, undertaking; ex-<BR>citement, stimulus; (Ved.) a round ornament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्तक|प्रवर्तकः|प्रवर्त्तक|प्रवर्त्तकः
प्र-वर्तक, अस्, इका, अम्, setting in motion or<BR>action, setting on foot; advancing, promoting, forward-<BR>ing; producing, causing, effecting, inducing, inciting,<BR>prompting, instigating, stimulating, urging; (अस्), m.<BR>the original instigator of any act, originator, author,<BR>principal, founder; an arbiter, judge; (अम्), n. (in<BR>dramatic language) the entrance of a character on<BR>the stage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्तन|प्रवर्तनं|प्रवर्त्तन|प्रवर्त्तनं
प्र-वर्तन, अम्, n. rolling forwards, revolving,<BR>rolling on, flowing forwards, going or moving for-<BR>wards, coming forth, walking, roaming, wandering;<BR>activity, action, acting; applying one's self to, en-<BR>gaging in, occupying one's self in, having dealings<BR>with (with loc. or inst.); beginning, commencing;<BR>behaviour, conduct, procedure, mode of living; hap-<BR>pening, coming to pass, coming to light, appearing;<BR>bringing forward, presenting (Ved.); pushing for-<BR>ward, setting on foot, setting up, establishing, insti-<BR>tuting, erecting [cf. महायन्त्र-प्˚]; instigating<BR>to action; inciting, prompting, stimulating; directing,<BR>superintending; employing, employment; exhorta-<BR>tion; informing; (आ), f. inciting or stimulating to<BR>action; ordering, the sense of the imperative or of<BR>the precative tense (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्तनीय
प्र-वर्तनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be set in motion,<BR>to be instigated; to be used or employed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्तमान|प्रवर्त्तमान
प्र-वर्तमान, अस्, आ, अम्, moving on, rolling<BR>on, proceeding, going forth; engaging in, practising,<BR>being occupied with, doing; being used or employed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्तमानक
प्रवर्तमानक, अस्, m., Ved. a diminutive of<BR>the preceding; (Sāy.) = अति-शीघ्रम् अभि-गच्छत्,<BR>going forth hastily, hastening forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्तयितृ
प्र-वर्तयितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who sets in<BR>motion or action, exciting activity, instigating to<BR>action; establishing, erecting, a builder, founder;<BR>applying or inflicting, one who applies or inflicts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्तित|प्रवर्त्तित|प्रवर्त्तितः
प्र-वर्तित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to roll on or for-<BR>wards, caused to turn, going round, revolving; set<BR>in motion, set on foot; set up, established; stimu-<BR>lated, excited, incited, instigated; lighted, kindled;<BR>caused, made, rendered; informed, apprized; made<BR>pure (= पवित्री-कृत, Manu XI. 196).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्तितव्य
प्र-वर्तितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be proceeded, to<BR>be acted, to be practised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्तितृ
प्र-वर्तितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who causes or<BR>effects; one who establishes or determines.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्तिन्
प्र-वर्तिन्, ई, इनी, इ, moving forwards, proceeding,<BR>advancing, moving, flowing; coming forth, flowing<BR>forth, streaming; being active; causing to flow;<BR>setting in motion or action, causing, effecting, pro-<BR>ducing; spreading, introducing; using, employing;<BR>अ-प्रवर्तिन्, ई, इनी, इ, immovable, unchangeable,<BR>unalterable, invariable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्त्य
प्र-वर्त्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be excited to activity,<BR>to be instigated or stimulated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृत्
2. प्र-वृत्, त्, f., Ved. = प्र-वृत्ति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृत्त|प्रवृत्तः
प्र-वृत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, proceeded, going to, bound<BR>for, (कुत्र प्रवृत्तो ऽसि, where are you going?);<BR>settled, fixed, determined; done; begun, commenced;<BR>beginning; engaged in, occupied with, entered or<BR>embarked upon; undertaking, doing, acting; unim-<BR>peded, undisputed (as dominion); round; (अस्), m.<BR>a round ornament; [cf. प्र-वर्त.]<BR>—प्रवृत्त-<BR>कर्मन्, अ, n. any act leading to a future birth.<BR>—प्रवृत्त-चक्र, अस्, आ, अम्, ‘whose wheels roll<BR>on unimpeded,’ having universal dominion.<BR>—प्र-<BR>वृत्तचक्र-ता, f. unimpeded or universal dominion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृत्तक|प्रवृत्तकं
प्रवृत्तक, अम्, n. the entrance of a character<BR>on the stage (= प्र-वर्तक); a kind of metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृत्ति|प्रवृत्तिः
प्र-वृत्ति, इस्, f. continuous flow onwards, pro-<BR>gress, advance, advancement; success; coming forth,<BR>appearing, appearance, manifestation; rise, source,<BR>origin, beginning; activity, effort, employment, oc-<BR>cupation; active life (as opposed to नि-वृत्ति, q. v.,<BR>and to contemplative devotion, and defined as con-<BR>sisting of the wish to act, knowledge of the means,<BR>and accomplishment of the object); giving or apply-<BR>ing one's self to, devoting one's self to (with loc.);<BR>course or tendency towards, addiction to, inclination<BR>or predilection for; application, use, employment;<BR>continued application, perseverance; practice, conduct,<BR>behaviour; currency, continuance, continuity, pre-<BR>valence, permanence, endurance; the applicableness<BR>or validity of a rule; fate, lot, destiny; news, tidings,<BR>intelligence [cf. दुष्-प्˚]; cognition, (विषयवती<BR>प्रवृत्तिः, a sensuous immediate cognition); the<BR>juice that exudes from the temples of an elephant in<BR>rut; N. of Avantī or Oujein or any holy place; (in<BR>arithmetic) the multiplier.<BR>—प्रवृत्ति-ज्ञ, अस्, m.<BR>‘knowing the news,’ an emissary, agent, spy.<BR>—प्र-<BR>वृत्ति-निमित्त, अम्, n. the reason for the use of<BR>any term in the particular significations which it<BR>bears.<BR>—प्रवृत्ति-पराङ्मुख, अस्, ई, अम्, dis-<BR>inclined to give tidings.<BR>—प्रवृत्ति-मार्ग, अस्, m.<BR>active or worldly life, occupancy about the business<BR>and pleasures of the world or with the rites and<BR>works of religion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृध्
प्रवृध् प्र-वृध्, cl. 1. A. -वर्धते, -वर्-<BR>धितुम्, to grow up, grow, increase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्धक
प्र-वर्धक, अस्, इका, अम्, causing to grow,<BR>increasing, enhancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्धन|प्रवर्द्धनं|प्रवर्धनं
प्र-वर्धन, अस्, ई, अम्, who or what causes to<BR>grow or increase; (अम्), n. augmenting, increase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृद्ध|प्रवृद्धः
प्र-वृद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, grown up, full grown;<BR>increased, expanded, enlarged, diffused, spread abroad,<BR>dispersed; large; swollen (as a river); full, deep (as<BR>a sigh); haughty, arrogant; violent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृद्धि|प्रवृद्धिः
प्र-वृद्धि, इस्, f. growth, increase [cf. सस्य-प्˚,<BR>श्मश्रु-प्˚]; rising, rise, (अर्घस्य प्˚, rising of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">Page0645-a+ 72</a>]<BR>the price of anything); prosperity, increasing welfare,<BR>rising in rank or reputation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0644-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृश्च्य
प्रवृश्च्य प्र-वृश्च्य. See प्र-व्रश्च्, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृष्
प्रवृष् प्र-वृष्, cl. 1. P. -वर्षति, -वर्-<BR>षितुम्, to begin to rain, rain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्ष|प्रवर्षः
प्र-वर्ष, अस्, m. raining fast, rain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्षण|प्रवर्षणं
प्र-वर्षण, अम्, n. raining, causing to rain;<BR>the first rain; N. of the twenty-third Adhyāya of<BR>the Bṛhat-saṃhitā of Varāha-mihira.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्षिन्
प्र-वर्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ, raining, causing to rain,<BR>showering, discharging; ऊर्ध्व-प्रवर्षिन्, ‘rain-<BR>ing upwards,’ offering sacrifices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृह्
प्रवृह् प्र-वृह्, cl. 6. P. A. -वृहति, -ते,<BR>-वर्हितुम्, -वर्ढुम्, Ved. to tear forth, tear away,<BR>tear off, tear out; to draw out, extract; to rescue;<BR>to tear to pieces, destroy; (Sāy.) = प्र-क्षिप्, to<BR>hurl, fling; (A.) to draw towards one's self, attract.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवर्ह|प्रवर्हः
प्र-वर्ह, अस्, आ, अम्, chief, principal, first.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवे
प्रवे प्र-वे, cl. 1. P. A. -वयति, -ते, -वातुम्,<BR>to sew lengthwise [cf. प्रोत]; to pierce, transfix;<BR>to infix, impale.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवयण|प्रवयणं
2. प्र-वयण, अम्, n. (for 1. see p. 642, col. 1),<BR>the upper part of a piece of woven cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाण|प्रवाणं
प्र-वाण, अम्, n. the edging or trimming of a<BR>piece of woven cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवाणि|प्रवाणिः
प्र-वाणि, इस् or ई, f. a weaver's shuttle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेक|प्रवेकः
प्रवेक प्र-वेक, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. विच् with<BR>प्र), choicest, most excellent, best, principal, chief;<BR>(at the end of a comp., cf. मणि-प्˚.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेग|प्रवेगः
प्रवेग प्र-वेग, अस्, m. great speed, rapi-<BR>dity; [cf. शर-प्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेगित
प्रवेगित, अस्, आ, अम्, moving swiftly, rapid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेट|प्रवेटः
प्रवेट प्र-वेट, अस्, m. barley; [cf. प्र-वट,<BR>प्रावट.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेणि|प्रवेणिः
प्रवेणि प्र-वेणि, इस् or ई, f. a braid of hair,<BR>the hair twisted and unadorned (as worn by widows<BR>and by wives in the absence of their husbands); a<BR>piece of coloured woollen cloth (used instead of a<BR>saddle); the housings of an elephant; (ई), f., N. of<BR>a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेतृ
प्रवेतृ प्र-वेतृ, ता, m. (fr. rt. वी with प्र),<BR>a charioteer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेय
प्र-वेय, अस्, आ, अम्, see Scholiast on Pāṇ. VI.<BR>1, 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेद
प्रवेद प्र-वेद, &c. See 1. प्र-विद्, p. 643.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेप्
प्रवेप् प्र-वेप्, cl. 1. A. -वेपते, -वेपितुम्,<BR>to tremble: Caus. -वेपयति, -यितुम्, to cause to<BR>tremble, shake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेप|प्रवेपः
प्र-वेप, अस्, m. trembling, quivering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेपक|प्रवेपकः
प्रवेपक, अस्, m. trembling, shivering, shud-<BR>dering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेपथु|प्रवेपथुः
प्र-वेपथु, उस्, m. = प्रवेपक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेपन|प्रवेपनं
प्र-वेपन, अस्, m., N. of a serpent-demon;<BR>(अम्), n. trembling, tremulous motion, shaking,<BR>agitation; (also wrongly spelt प्र-वेपण.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेपनिन्
प्रवेपनिन्, ई, इनी, इ, Ved. ‘causing (his enemies)<BR>to tremble,’ an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेपनीय
प्र-वेपनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, see Scholiast on Pāṇ.<BR>VIII. 4, 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेपिन्
प्र-वेपिन्, ई, इनी, इ, trembling, shaking, tottering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेरित
प्रवेरित प्रवेरित, अस्, आ, अम् (probably for<BR>प्रावेरित fr. rt. ईर् with प्र-अव, but said by some<BR>to be fr. प्र-आ-ईरित), thrown about, cast or hurled<BR>hither and thither (= इतस्ततः पातित, Mahā-bh.<BR>Svargārohaṇa-p. 47).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेल|प्रवेलः
प्रवेल प्रवेल, अस्, m. a yellow variety of<BR>kidney-bean, Phaseolus Mungo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेश|प्रवेशः
प्रवेश प्र-वेश, &c. See प्र-विश्, p. 643.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेष्ट्
प्रवेष्ट् प्र-वेष्ट्, cl. 1. A. -वेष्टते, -वेष्टि-<BR>तुम्, to cover over, cover, surround.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेष्ट|प्रवेष्टः
प्र-वेष्ट, अस्, m. an arm; the fore-arm or<BR>wrist [cf. प्र-कोष्ठ]; the fleshy part of the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">Page0645-b+ 74</a>]<BR>back of an elephant on which the rider sits; an<BR>elephant's housings; an elephant's gums.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेष्टित
प्र-वेष्टित, अस्, आ, अम्, covered over, covered,<BR>surrounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेष्टक
प्रवेष्टक प्रवेष्टक, a various reading for<BR>प्रविष्टक, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवेष्टव्य
प्रवेष्टव्य प्र-वेष्टव्य, प्र-वेष्टृ. See<BR>under प्र-विश्, p. 643, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवोढृ
प्रवोढृ प्र-वोढृ. See p. 642, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्यक्त|प्रव्यक्तं
प्रव्यक्त प्र-व्यक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, evident, ap-<BR>parent, manifest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्यक्ति|प्रव्यक्तिः
प्र-व्यक्ति, इस्, f. appearance, manifestation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्यथ्
प्रव्यथ् प्र-व्यथ्, cl. 1. A. -व्यथते, -व्य-<BR>थितुम्, to be afflicted or distressed; to be frightened,<BR>fear, tremble at (with gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्यथित
प्र-व्यथित, अस्, आ, अम्, distressed, pained;<BR>agitated, trembling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्यध्
प्रव्यध् प्र-व्यध्, cl. 4. P. -विध्यति, -व्यद्-<BR>धुम्, to throw away, cast down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविद्ध
प्र-विद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, thrown away, cast away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्याध
प्र-व्याध, अस्, m., Ved. a bow-shot, the dis-<BR>tance of the flight of an arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्याहृ
प्रव्याहृ प्र-व्य्-आ-हृ, cl. 1. P. A. -हरति,<BR>-ते, -हर्तुम्, to declare beforehand, foretell, predict;<BR>to howl, yell, roar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्याहार|प्रव्याहारः
प्र-व्याहार, अस्, m. (= प्रकृष्टोक्ति), pro-<BR>longation or continuation of discourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्रज्
प्रव्रज् प्र-व्रज्, cl. 1. P. -व्रजति, -व्रजितुम्,<BR>to go forth, set out, travel forth, go abroad, go into<BR>exile: Caus. -व्राजयति, -यितुम्, to send into exile,<BR>banish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रविव्राजयिषु
प्र-विव्राजयिषु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing to send<BR>into exile, desirous of banishing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्रजत्
प्र-व्रजत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, going forth, travelling<BR>abroad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्रजन|प्रव्रजनं
प्र-व्रजन, अम्, n. going abroad, migrating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्रजिका
प्र-व्रजिका, a wrong reading for प्र-व्रजिता or<BR>प्र-व्राजिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्रजित|प्रव्रजितः
प्र-व्रजित, अस्, आ, अम्, gone forth, gone away,<BR>gone abroad, gone into exile; (अस्), m. a religious<BR>mendicant, a mendicant or ascetic; the pupil or<BR>attendant of a Jaina or Buddhist mendicant; (आ), f.<BR>a female ascetic or devotee; spikenard, Nardostachys<BR>Jatamansi; N. of another plant, = मुण्डीरी; (अम्),<BR>n. the life of a religious mendicant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्रज्या
प्र-व्रज्या, f. going abroad, migration, emigra-<BR>tion; roaming, travelling, wandering about, espe-<BR>cially as a religious mendicant (in a dress not<BR>authorized by the Veda, Manu V. 89); the order<BR>of a religious mendicant; retirement into solitude.<BR>—प्रव्रज्यावसित (˚या-अव्˚), अस्, m. a religious<BR>mendicant who renounces his order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्राज्
प्र-व्राज्, ट्, m. a religious mendicant; [cf. परि-<BR>व्राज्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्राज
प्र-व्राज, अस्, m., Ved. the bed of a river (Sāy.<BR>= अत्यन्त-निम्नो देशो नद्याः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्राजक|प्रव्राजकः
प्र-व्राजक, अस्, m. a religious mendicant; (इका),<BR>f. a female ascetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्राजन|प्रव्राजनं
प्र-व्राजन, अम्, n. banishing, banishment, exile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्राजिन्
प्र-व्राजिन्, ई, m., Ved. a religious mendicant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्राज्य
प्र-व्राज्य, ind. having sent into exile, having<BR>banished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्रश्च्
प्रव्रश्च् प्र-व्रश्च्, cl. 6. P. -वृश्चति, -व्रश्चि-<BR>तुम्, -व्रष्टुम्, to tear to pieces, lacerate, wound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवृश्च्य
प्र-वृश्च्य, ind. having lacerated, having wounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्रश्चन|प्रव्रश्चनः
प्र-व्रश्चन in इध्म-प्रव्रश्चन, अस्, m. an<BR>instrument for cutting fuel, a knife for cutting wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्रस्क
प्र-व्रस्क, अस्, m., Ved. a cut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रव्लय
प्रव्लय प्र-व्लय, अस्, m. (fr. rt. व्ली with<BR>प्र), Ved. sinking down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशँय्युवाक
प्रशँय्युवाक प्रशंय्यु-वाक, अस्, m., see<BR>Vārttika 1. to Pāṇ. II. 4, 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशंस्
प्रशंस् प्र-शंस्, cl. 1. P. -शंसति, -शंसि-<BR>तुम् (anomalous 3rd sing. Pot. प्र-शंसीयात्), to<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">Page0645-c+ 79</a>]<BR>praise forth, praise, eulogize, laud, extol, commend,<BR>recommend; to approve; to esteem, value; to de-<BR>clare; (with न) to disapprove, blame, censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशंसक
प्र-शंसक, अस्, इका, अम्, praising, commending,<BR>eulogizing, laudatory, flattering; a praiser.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशंसन|प्रशंसनं
प्र-शंसन, अम्, n. praising, eulogizing; (some-<BR>times incorrectly spelt प्र-शंशन.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशंसनीय
प्र-शंसनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be praised, praise-<BR>worthy, laudable, commendable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशंसा
प्र-शंसा, f. praise, commendation, panegyric,<BR>eulogy, applause, flattery; fame, reputation, glory<BR>[cf. स्त्री-प्˚]; अप्रस्तुत-प्रशंसा, indirect de-<BR>scription, a description of anything implied by the<BR>description of a similar or contrary object; (some-<BR>times incorrectly spelt प्र-शंशा.)<BR>—प्रशंसा-<BR>मुखर, अस्, आ, अम्, loud with praise, praising<BR>loudly.<BR>—प्रशंसामुखरानन (˚र-आन्˚), अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, ‘one whose mouth is loud with praise,’<BR>speaking loudly in praise (of anything).<BR>—प्रशंसो-<BR>पमा (˚सा-उप्˚), f. laudatory comparison, comparing<BR>to anything superior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशंसित
प्र-शंसित, अस्, आ, अम्, praised, commended,<BR>eulogized, extolled, applauded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशंसितव्य
प्र-शंसितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be praised or<BR>commended, praiseworthy, laudable, commendable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशंसिन्
प्र-शंसिन्, ई, इनी, इ, praising, commending,<BR>eulogizing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशंस्तव्य
प्र-शंस्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be praised, praise-<BR>worthy, laudable; [cf. प्र-शस्तव्य.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशंस्य
प्र-शंस्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be praised, com-<BR>mendable, praiseworthy, laudable; preferable, better;<BR>[cf. 1. प्र-शस्य.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशस्त|प्रशस्तं
प्र-शस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, praised, commended;<BR>eulogized, extolled; laudable, commendable, admir-<BR>able, excellent, good, best; happy; well; right;<BR>(अस्), m., N. of a man; (आ), f., N. of a river.<BR>—प्रशस्त-कर, अस्, m., N. of an author (per-<BR>haps the writer of a work entitled Pra-śasta).<BR>—प्र-<BR>शस्त-कलश, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR>—प्रशस्त-<BR>ता, f. or प्रशस्त-त्व, अम्, n. excellence, goodness.<BR>—प्रशस्त-पाद, अस्, m., N. of an author.<BR>—प्र-<BR>शस्ताद्रि (˚त-अद्˚), इस्, m., N. of a mountain to<BR>the west of Madhya-deśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशस्तव्य
प्र-शस्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be praised, praise-<BR>worthy; [cf. प्र-शंस्तव्य.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशस्ति|प्रशस्तिः
प्र-शस्ति, इस्, f. praise, eulogy, fame; glorification,<BR>benediction; excellence, eminence; instruction, con-<BR>duct, guidance; an edict (?) ; प्रशस्तिं धा, to bestow<BR>praise upon, speak highly of, value highly (with loc.).<BR>—प्रशस्ति-कृत्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. bestowing praise, prais-<BR>ing.<BR>—प्रशस्ति-प्रकाशिका, f., N. of a work.<BR>—प्र-<BR>शस्ति-रत्नावली, f., N. of a poem by Viśva-nātha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशस्य|प्रशस्यः
1. प्र-शस्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be praised or com-<BR>mended, praiseworthy, laudable, commendable; ex-<BR>cellent, eminent, distinguished; to be called happy,<BR>to be congratulated; [cf. प्र-शंस्य.]<BR>—प्रशस्य-<BR>ता, f. excellence, eminence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशस्य|प्रशस्यः
2. प्र-शस्य, ind. having praised or recommended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशक
प्रशक प्र-शक. See under प्र-शाख.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशद्
प्रशद् प्र-शद्, Caus. P. -शातयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to cause to fall down, break off, pluck, gather.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशत्त्वन्
प्र-शत्त्वन्, आ, m. the ocean; (अरी), f. a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशम्
प्रशम् प्र-शम्, cl. 4. P. -शाम्यति, -शमि-<BR>तुम्, to become calm or tranquil, to be still or<BR>unmoved; to be appeased or pacified, be soothed;<BR>to be laid or made to settle down (as dust); to be<BR>restrained; to become extinguished; to cease; to<BR>fade away: Caus. -शमयति, -यितुम्, to tranquillize,<BR>make calm or tranquil, pacify, soothe, appease; to<BR>extinguish, quench, allay; to kill, destroy; -शाम-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to make subject, make obedient,<BR>subdue, conquer, tranquillize.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशम|प्रशमः
प्र-शम, अस्, m. becoming calm or tranquil,<BR>rest, quiet, quiescence, calmness, tranquillity, peace,<BR>composure (e. g. प्रशमम् उपैहि, go to com-<BR>posure, i. e. compose yourself); assuagement, ap-<BR>peasement, tranquillizing, removing; becoming ex-<BR>tinguished, extinction (of flames &c.), abatement;<BR>N. of a son of Ānaka-dundubhi and Śānti-devā;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">Page0646-a+ 77</a>]<BR>(ई), f., N. of an Apsaras.<BR>—प्रशमङ्-कर, अस्, ई,<BR>अम्, causing the cessation of.<BR>—प्रशम-स्थित, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, being in a state of quiescence.<BR>—प्रशमायन<BR>(˚म-अय्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, walking in tranquillity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0645-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशमन|प्रशमनं
प्र-शमन, अस्, ई, अम्, tranquillizing, pacifying,<BR>calming; suppressing, curing, healing; (अम्), n.<BR>reposing, repose, quiescence; tranquillizing, pacifying,<BR>calming; mitigating, assuaging, allaying, composing;<BR>soothing (fever &c.); curing, healing; extinguish-<BR>ing, quenching, suppressing; abatement, cessation;<BR>killing, destroying, slaughter; (scil. अस्त्रम्), N. of<BR>a magic weapon; bestowing aptly or fitly (Manu<BR>VII. 56, = सत्-पात्रे प्रतिपादनम्); securing,<BR>keeping safe; लब्धस्य प्रशमनम्, the se-<BR>curing of what has been acquired or bestowing it<BR>on fit objects; [cf. लब्ध-प्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशमय्य
प्र-शमय्य, ind. having appeased or tranquil-<BR>lized.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशमित
प्र-शमित, अस्, आ, अम्, tranquillized, appeased,<BR>relieved; quelled, quenched, allayed.<BR>—प्रशमितो-<BR>पद्रव (˚त-उप्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, having all calamities<BR>or hinderances quelled (= प्रशान्त-बाध).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशम्यमान
प्र-शम्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being tranquillized<BR>or pacified, being appeased; being flattered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशान्
प्र-शान्, ind., see Gaṇa Svar-ādi to Pāṇ. I. 1,<BR>37; [cf. प्र-शाम्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशान्त|प्रशांत|प्रशान्तः
प्र-शान्त, अस्, आ, अम्, tranquillized, composed,<BR>quieted, calmed, calm; tamed; subdued; abated,<BR>ended, ceased, discontinued (as active effort); dead,<BR>deceased; relieved; (अस्), m., N. of a divinity.<BR>—प्रशान्त-काम, अस्, आ, अम्, one whose desires<BR>are calmed, content.<BR>—प्रशान्त-चारित्र-मति, इस्,<BR>m., N. of a Bodhi-sattva.<BR>—प्रशान्त-चारिन्, इणस्,<BR>m. pl. walking tranquilly, (perhaps) an epithet of a<BR>class of deities.<BR>—प्रशान्त-चेष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, one<BR>whose efforts have ceased, resting.<BR>—प्रशान्त-ता, f.<BR>tranquillity (of mind).<BR>—प्रशान्त-बाध, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, having all calamities or hinderances quelled (=<BR>प्रशमितोपद्रव).<BR>—प्रशान्तात्मन् (˚त-आत्˚),<BR>आ, आ, अ, ‘tranquil-souled,’ composed in mind, peace-<BR>ful, calm.<BR>—प्रशान्तोर्ज (˚त-ऊर्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, one<BR>whose strength has ceased, weakened, prostrated.<BR>—प्रशान्तौजस् (˚त-ओज्˚), आस्, आस्, अस्, = प्रशान्-<BR>तोर्ज above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशान्तक
प्रशान्तक, अस्, आ, अम्, = प्र-शान्त above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशान्ति|प्रशांति|प्रशांतिः|प्रशान्तिः
प्र-शान्ति, इस्, f. becoming calm or tranquil, tran-<BR>quillization, tranquillity of mind, calm, quiet, pacifi-<BR>cation, composure; ceasing, cessation, rest; allaying,<BR>quenching, extinguishing, extinction.<BR>—प्रशान्ति-<BR>दूती, f. the harbinger of rest, forerunner of repose,<BR>an epithet of old age.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशाम्
प्र-शाम्, न्, न्, न्, tranquil, quiet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशाम|प्रशामः
प्र-शाम, अस्, m. tranquillity, quiescence; paci-<BR>fying; laying, suppressing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशर्ध
प्रशर्ध प्र-शर्ध, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. शृध्<BR>with प्र), Ved. valiant (said of Indra; Sāy. = प्र-<BR>कर्षेणाभिभविता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशल|प्रशलः
प्रशल प्रशल, a various reading for प्र-<BR>सल, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशस्
प्रशस् प्र-शस्, अस्, f. (fr. rt. शस् with प्र),<BR>Ved. a hatchet, axe, knife; (according to others) =<BR>प्र-शस्त, प्रशस्त-च्छेदन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशस्त|प्रशस्तं
प्रशस्त प्र-शस्त, &c. See p. 645, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशाख
प्रशाख प्र-शाख, अस्, आ, अम्, having great<BR>branches (as a tree); an epithet of the fifth stage in<BR>the formation of an embryo (in which the hands<BR>and feet are formed, in this sense also written प्र-<BR>शक); (आ), f. a branch, small branch or twig;<BR>(probably) the extremities of the body.<BR>—प्रशाख-<BR>वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having many branches.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशाखिका
प्रशाखिका, f. a branch; a small branch or twig.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशान्त|प्रशांत|प्रशान्तः
प्रशान्त प्र-शान्त, &c. See above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशास्
प्रशास् प्र-शास्, cl. 2. P. -शास्ति, -शासितुम्,<BR>to rule over, reign over, rule, reign, govern, com-<BR>mand, enjoin; to teach, instruct; to chastise, punish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशासन|प्रशासनं
प्र-शासन, अम्, n. governing, ruling; dominion,<BR>government; enjoining, enacting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशासित
प्र-शासित, अस्, आ, अम्, ruled over, reigned over,<BR>governed, ruled; enjoined, enacted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशासितृ
प्र-शासितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, governing, ruling, a<BR>governor, ruler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशास्तृ
प्र-शास्तृ, ता, m. ‘director,’ title of a priest also<BR>called Maitrāvaruṇa, the first assistant of the Hotṛ<BR>(Ved.); a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशास्त्र
प्र-शास्त्र, अम्, n., Ved. the office of Praśāstṛ;<BR>the Soma vessel of the Praśāstṛ; (Sāy.) = प्रशास्तुर्<BR>यागः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशिष्ट
प्र-शिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, ruled over, reigned,<BR>governed, commanded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशिष्टि|प्रशिष्टिः
प्र-शिष्टि, इस्, f., Ved. injunction, command, order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशिस्
प्र-शिस्, ईस्, f., Ved. injunction, command, order;<BR>[cf. 1. आ-शिस्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशिथिल
प्रशिथिल प्र-शिथिल, अस्, आ, अम्, very loose,<BR>relaxed, lax.<BR>—प्रशिथिली-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, rendered<BR>very loose, greatly loosened.<BR>—प्रशिथिली-भूत, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, become loose or lax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशिष
प्रशिष प्रशिष, अस्, m., N. of a man;<BR>(आस्), m. pl., N. of his descendants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशिष्य|प्रशिष्यः
प्रशिष्य प्र-शिष्य, अस्, m. the disciple of<BR>a disciple, scholar of a scholar, pupil of a pupil.<BR>—प्रशिष्य-त्व, अम्, n. the being the disciple of<BR>a disciple, the condition of a pupil's pupil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशुक्रीय
प्रशुक्रीय प्रशुक्रीय, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. be-<BR>ginning with the words प्र शुक्रा (said of the<BR>hymn Ṛg-veda VII. 34, 1).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशुद्धि|प्रशुद्धिः
प्रशुद्धि प्र-शुद्धि, इस्, f. (fr. rt. शुध् with<BR>प्र), purity, clearness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशुम्भ्
प्रशुम्भ् प्र-शुम्भ्, cl. 6. A. -शुम्भते,<BR>-शुम्भितुम्, Ved. to decorate or adorn one's self<BR>highly; (Sāy.) = प्रकर्षेण स्वकीयम् अङ्गम्<BR>अलङ्-कृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशुश्रुक
प्रशुश्रुक प्र-शुश्रुक, अस्, m., N. of a prince<BR>(a son of Maru; cf. प्र-सुश्रुत).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशोचन
प्रशोचन प्र-शोचन, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. शुच्<BR>with प्र), Ved. burning on, continuing to burn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशोष|प्रशोषः
प्रशोष प्र-शोष, अस्, m. (rt. शुष्), drying<BR>up, becoming dry, exsiccating, aridity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रशोषण
प्र-शोषण, अस्, m. ‘drying up,’ epithet of a<BR>kind of phantom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्चुत्
प्रश्चुत् प्र-श्चुत् or प्र-श्च्युत्, cl. 1. A. -श्चो-<BR>तति, -श्च्योतति, -श्चोतितुम्, -श्च्योतितुम्, to pour forth,<BR>shed, distil, sprinkle; to drip, fall in drops.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्चोतत्
प्र-श्चोतत् or प्र-श्च्योतत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, pouring<BR>forth, sprinkling; dripping, falling in drops.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्न|प्रश्नः
प्रश्न 1. प्रश्न, अस्, m. basket-work, a<BR>plaited basket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्न|प्रश्नः
प्रश्न 2. प्रश्न, अस्, m. (fr. rt. प्रछ्), a<BR>question, demand, inquiry, interrogation, query [cf.<BR>कुशुल-प्˚]; judicial inquiry or examination [cf.<BR>साक्षि-प्˚]; a controverted question, point at issue,<BR>subject of inquiry, controversy, (प्रश्नम् प्र-ब्रू,<BR>to decide a controverted point; प्रश्नम् इ, to lay<BR>a question before any one (acc.) for decision; प्रश्-<BR>नस् तव पितरि, the point at issue is before thy<BR>father, i. e. it is submitted to him to decide); a<BR>problem for calculation; inquiry into the future (in<BR>astrology; cf. दिव्य-प्˚, देव-प्˚, दैव-प्˚); a par-<BR>ticular number of verses of the Veda repeated from<BR>memory by a pupil to his Guru, a task, lesson, repeti-<BR>tion; a term applied to short sections in various works.<BR>—प्रश्न-कोष्ठी, f., N. of a work on divination.<BR>—प्रश्न-दूती, f. a riddle, enigma, perplexing or<BR>enigmatical question.<BR>—प्रश्न-विवाक, अस्, m., Ved.<BR>one who decides controversies, an arbitrator.<BR>—प्रश्-<BR>न-विवाद, अस्, m. a controverted question, contro-<BR>versy.<BR>—प्रश्न-वैष्णव, अम्, n., N. of an<BR>astrological work.<BR>—प्रश्न-व्याकरण, अम्, n.,<BR>N. of the tenth of the twelve sacred books of the<BR>Jainas.<BR>—प्रश्नार्णव (˚न-अर्˚), अस्, m. ‘ocean of<BR>questions,’ N. of a work on astrology (= वैष्णव-<BR>शास्त्र).<BR>—प्रश्नोत्तर (˚न-उत्˚), अस् or अम्, m. or<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">Page0646-c+ 75</a>]<BR>n. (?), a particular Śabdālaṅkāra or figure of speech.<BR>—प्रश्नोत्तर-मणि-माला or प्रश्नोत्तर-माला,<BR>f., N. of a work.<BR>—प्रश्नोत्तर-रत्न-माला, f.,<BR>N. of a work.<BR>—प्रश्नोपनिषद् (˚न-उप्˚), त्, f.,<BR>N. of an Upaniṣad (consisting of six questions and<BR>six answers).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्नय
प्रश्नय, Nom. P. प्रश्नयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>inquire after, ask about (with two acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्निन्
प्रश्निन्, ई, m., Ved. an inquirer, one who inquires<BR>into the future (Mahī-dhara = शकुनादि-प्रष्टृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रष्टव्य
प्रष्टव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be asked or questioned<BR>about (with acc.); deserving to be consulted; proper<BR>to be inquired into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रष्टृ
प्रष्टृ, टा, ट्री, टृ, asking, demanding, an asker,<BR>inquirer, questioner, interrogator, querist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्नि
प्रश्नि प्रश्नि, अयस्, m. pl., N. of a race of<BR>Ṛṣis; (incorrectly for पृश्नि, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्नी
प्रश्नी, f. incorrectly for पृश्नी, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्रथ|प्रश्रथः
प्रश्रथ प्र-श्रथ, अस्, m. or प्र-श्रन्थन,<BR>अम्, n. (fr. rt. श्रन्थ् with प्र), laxity, relaxation,<BR>flaccidity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्रब्धि|प्रश्रब्धिः
प्रश्रब्धि प्र-श्रब्धि, इस्, f. (fr. rt. श्रम्भ्<BR>with प्र), trust, confidence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्रय|प्रश्रयः
प्रश्रय प्र-श्रय, अस्, m. (fr. rt. श्रि with<BR>प्र), respectful demeanour, affection, regard, solicit-<BR>ation, affection, respect, courtesy, civility, modesty;<BR>Modesty personified as a son of Dharma and Hrī.<BR>—प्रश्रय-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, = प्रश्रयिन् below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्रयण|प्रश्रयणं
प्र-श्रयण, अम्, n. respectful demeanour, civi-<BR>lity, modesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्रयिन्
प्रश्रयिन्, ई, इणी, इ, behaving respectfully, cour-<BR>teous, civil; modest.<BR>—प्रश्रयि-ता, f. respectful<BR>demeanour, courtesy, civility, modesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्रित|प्रश्रितः
प्र-श्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, modest, humble, well-<BR>behaved; (अस्), m., N. of a son of Ānaka-dundubhi<BR>and Śānti-devā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्रवण
प्रश्रवण प्र-श्रवण, an incorrect form<BR>for प्र-स्रवण, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्रवस्
प्रश्रवस् प्र-श्रवस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, Ved. ‘loud-<BR>sounding,’ an epithet of the Maruts; (Sāy.) = प्र-<BR>कृष्टान्न, having or bestowing excellent food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्लथ|प्रश्लथः
प्रश्लथ प्र-श्लथ, अस्, आ, अम्, very loose,<BR>greatly relaxed, languid, flaccid; unnerved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्लित
प्रश्लित प्र-श्लित, अस्, m. (for प्र-श्रित), a<BR>term applied to the rule of Sandhi according to<BR>which अस् before a soft letter is changed into ओ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्लिष्ट|प्रश्लिष्टः
प्रश्लिष्ट प्र-श्लिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. श्लिष्<BR>with प्र), twisted, entwined; (अस्), m. a term<BR>applied to the Sandhi of the vowel अ with a following<BR>vowel and of other vowels with homogeneous vowels;<BR>also to the vowel resulting from this Sandhi and of<BR>the accent with which such a vowel is pronounced;<BR>(अस्), m., N. of a man (?) .<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्लेष|प्रश्लेषः
प्र-श्लेष, अस्, m. close contact, pressing against;<BR>euphonic coalition of vowels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्वसितव्य
प्रश्वसितव्य प्र-श्वसितव्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr.<BR>rt. श्वस् with प्र), Ved. to be caused to recover<BR>the breath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रश्वास|प्रश्वासः
प्र-श्वास, अस्, m. breathing in, inhaling, breath,<BR>respiration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रष्टव्य
प्रष्टव्य प्रष्टव्य, प्रष्टृ. See above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रष्टि|प्रष्टिः
प्रष्टि प्रष्टि, इस्, m. (connected with<BR>पृष्टि, q. v.), Ved. a horse harnessed at the side,<BR>a side-horse or one harnessed outside the shafts by<BR>the side of the other yoke-horses [cf. दक्षिणा-प्˚];<BR>(perhaps) a horse in front of those harnessed to the<BR>yoke or to the chariot-pole [cf. अधि-प्रष्टि-युग];<BR>(according to Sāy.) = वाहन-त्रय-मध्य-वर्ती<BR>युग-विशेषः, a sort of yoke in the middle of<BR>three horses; a bystander, companion (Sāy. = पार्श्व-<BR>स्थ).<BR>—प्रष्टि-मत्, आन्, अती, अत्, Ved. having<BR>side-horses (as a chariot).<BR>—प्रष्टि-वाहन, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, or प्रष्टि-वाहिन्, ई, इनी, इ, Ved. (a chariot)<BR>drawn by side-horses (and thus having at least three<BR>horses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0646-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रष्ठ|प्रष्ठः
प्रष्ठ प्र-ष्ठ, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. स्था with<BR>प्र), standing in front, preceding, prior; chief, prin-<BR>cipal, best [cf. रथ-प्˚]; a leader, conductor; (अस्),<BR>m. a species of plant; (ई), f. the wife of a leader or<BR>chief.<BR>—प्रष्ठ-वाह्, ट्, m. a young bull or steer<BR>training for the plough; प्रष्ठौही, f. a cow for<BR>the first time with calf; [cf. पष्ठ-वाह्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रष्ठिवाहिन्
प्रष्ठिवाहिन् प्रष्ठि-वाहिन्, a wrong read-<BR>ing for प्रष्टि-वाहिन्, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रष्णवैष्णव
प्रष्णवैष्णव प्रष्ण-वैष्णव, an incorrect<BR>form for प्रश्न-वैष्णव, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्
प्रस् प्रस्, cl. 1. A. प्रसते, प्रसितुम्, to<BR>extend, expand, spread, diffuse; to bring<BR>forth young.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसक्त|प्रसक्तं
प्रसक्त प्र-सक्त, प्र-सक्ति. See under<BR>प्र-सञ्ज् below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसक्षिन्
प्रसक्षिन् प्र-सक्षिन्. See p. 648, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसङ्ख्या|प्रसंख्या
प्रसङ्ख्या 1. प्र-सङ्-ख्या, cl. 2. P. -ख्याति,<BR>-ख्यातुम्, to count or reckon up, number, enume-<BR>rate, calculate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसङ्ख्या|प्रसंख्या
2. प्र-सङ्ख्या, f. total number, sum; reflection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसङ्ख्यान|प्रसंख्यानः
प्र-सङ्ख्यान, अस्, आ, अम्, meditating (? as an<BR>epithet of an order of ascetics); (अस्), m. payment,<BR>liquidation; a sum of money; (अम्), n. enumerat-<BR>ing, enumeration; reflection, meditation; reputation,<BR>renown.<BR>—प्रसङ्ख्यान-पर, अस्, आ, अम्, en-<BR>grossed or absorbed in meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसङ्ग|प्रसंग|प्रसंगः|प्रसङ्गः
प्रसङ्ग प्र-सङ्ग. See below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसङ्घ|प्रसंघ|प्रसंघः|प्रसङ्घः
प्रसङ्घ प्र-सङ्घ, अस्, m. a great multitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसञ्चक्ष्|प्रसंचक्ष्
प्रसञ्चक्ष् प्र-सञ्-चक्ष्, cl. 2. A. -चष्टे, &c.<BR>(see rt. चक्ष्), to reckon up, recount, enumerate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसञ्ज्|प्रसंज्
प्रसञ्ज् प्र-सञ्ज्, cl. 1. P. -सजति, -सङ्क्तुम्,<BR>to become attached to, feel affection for: Pass. -सज्-<BR>यते, to cleave to, adhere or cling to, become fixed<BR>upon or attached to, become strongly addicted to<BR>(with loc.); to be relevant or applicable, to apply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसक्त|प्रसक्तं
प्र-सक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, attached to, in contact<BR>with, united to, connected with; cleaving to, adher-<BR>ing to, fixed upon (with loc.); devoted to; accom-<BR>panying; engaged in, applied to, used, employed;<BR>attained, obtained, gained; continual, constant, eter-<BR>nal; opened, expanded; (अम्), ind. continually, in-<BR>cessantly, eternally, ever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसक्तव्य
प्र-सक्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be attached to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसक्ति|प्रसक्तिः
प्र-सक्ति, इस्, f. adherence or attachment to, ad-<BR>hesion, devotion to, addiction to, engagedness, the<BR>being occupied with; bearing upon, applicability,<BR>application (especially of a rule in grammar; अति-<BR>प्रसक्ति, too wide applicability; प्रसक्तिम् प्र-या,<BR>to become attached); connection, union, association;<BR>inference, conclusion, deduction; a topic or subject<BR>of conversation; occurrence of a possibility; perse-<BR>verance, energy; acquiring, acquisition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसङ्ग|प्रसंग|प्रसंगः|प्रसङ्गः
प्र-सङ्ग, अस्, m. adherence or attachment to,<BR>devotion to, devotedness; addiction to [cf. सुरत-<BR>प्˚]; occupation [cf. विरत-प्˚, विरुद्ध-प्˚]; con-<BR>nection, union, association, intercourse [cf. स्त्री-प्˚];<BR>illicit intercourse; connected reasoning or argument;<BR>connected language or style; subject, topic, the case<BR>as stated; occurrence of a possibility, contingency,<BR>case, event (e. g. एचः प्लुत-प्रसङ्गे, in the event<BR>of a diphthong being prolated); conjuncture, occa-<BR>sion, circumstances, time; introduction, insertion;<BR>mention of parents; conjoint result (?); revealing a<BR>secret (?); second or subsidiary incident (?); N. of a Bud-<BR>dhist school; of a man; प्रसङ्गेन or प्रसङ्गात्,<BR>ind. through connection with or relation to; with all<BR>the heart, heartily, earnestly; on the occasion of,<BR>in consequence of, on account of, because of (lit.<BR>from its happening); when the occasion presents<BR>itself, occasionally, incidentally; in the course of<BR>(e. g. कथा-प्रसङ्गेन, in course of conversation).<BR>—प्रसङ्ग-तस्, ind. out of attachment to or<BR>respect for; = प्रसङ्गेन, प्रसङ्गात्.<BR>—प्र-<BR>सङ्ग-निवारण, अम्, n. the prevention of (similar)<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-b" target="_blank">Page0647-b+ 80</a>]<BR>cases, obviation of (like future) contingencies.<BR>—प्र-<BR>सङ्ग-रत्नावली, f., N. of a work.<BR>—प्रसङ्ग-<BR>वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, occasional, incidental, casual.<BR>—प्र-<BR>सङ्ग-वशात्, ind. according to the time, as occasion<BR>may demand, by the force of circumstances.<BR>—प्र-<BR>सङ्ग-विनिवृत्ति, इस्, f. the non-recurrence of a case.<BR>—प्रसङ्ग-सम, अस्, m. a particular Jāti [q. v.]<BR>in logic.<BR>—प्रसङ्गाभरण (˚ग-आभ्˚), अम्, n.,<BR>N. of a modern poetical anthology.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसङ्गिन्|प्रसंगिन्
प्रसङ्गिन्, ई, इनी, इ, attached to, devoted to;<BR>dependent on, contingent, additional; occasional,<BR>incidental; secondary, subordinate, non-essential.<BR>—प्रसङ्गि-ता, f. attachment, addiction to, con-<BR>nection, intercourse with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसज्य
प्र-सज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be attached to, to be<BR>connected with; applicable.<BR>—प्रसज्य-प्रतिषे-<BR>ध, अस्, m. a particular kind of negation, negation<BR>of a possible case (distinguished from पर्य्-उदास,<BR>q. v.), a simple prohibition of the particular matter<BR>specified without enjoining what is different.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसञ्जन|प्रसंजन|प्रसंजनं
प्र-सञ्जन, अम्, n. the act of attaching or con-<BR>necting, combining, uniting; applying, employing,<BR>bringing into use, bringing to bear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसद्
प्रसद् प्र-सद्, cl. 1. 6. P. -सीदति, -सत्तुम्,<BR>to settle down, become clear, become placid or<BR>tranquil, become calm, be calm, be soothed; to be<BR>content or satisfied; to be glad; to be gracious<BR>or propitious, to be favourable, favour (with gen.);<BR>to vouchsafe, be pleased to (with inf.): Caus. -सा-<BR>दयति, -यितुम्, to render calm, soothe, appease,<BR>propitiate; to beg pardon of (with acc.); (A.) to<BR>cause to be gracious, pray for grace or favour: Pass.<BR>of Caus. -साद्यते, to be rendered calm, to be<BR>soothed or appeased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसत्ति|प्रसत्तिः
प्र-सत्ति, इस्, f. transparency, brightness, clearness,<BR>cleanness, purity; complacency, graciousness, favour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसन्न|प्रसन्नः
प्र-सन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, settled down, tranquil;<BR>clear, bright, pellucid, limpid, pure, clean; soothed,<BR>propitiated, pleased, delighted; gracious, propitious,<BR>kind, kindly disposed towards, favourable, compla-<BR>cent; true; (अस्), m., N. of a prince; (आ), f. pro-<BR>pitiating, pleasing; spirituous or vinous liquor.<BR>—प्र-<BR>सन्न-कल्प, अस्, आ, अम्, almost quiet, tolerably<BR>calm.<BR>—प्रसन्न-ता, f. or प्रसन्न-त्व, अम्, n.<BR>brightness, pellucidness, clearness, purity; favour,<BR>kindness, propitiousness, good humour.<BR>—प्रसन्न-<BR>पाद, अस्, or अम्, m. or n. (?) , N. of a work by<BR>Dharma-kīrtti.<BR>—प्रसन्न-मुख, अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>‘placid-countenanced,’ having a pleased or approv-<BR>ing countenance, agreeable-looking, looking pleased,<BR>smiling.<BR>—प्रसन्न-राघव, अम्, n., N. of a<BR>drama by Jaya-deva.<BR>—प्रसन्न-वेङ्कटेश्वर-<BR>माहात्म्य (˚ट-ईश्˚), अम्, n., N. of a legend in the<BR>Bhaviṣyottara-Purāṇa.<BR>—प्रसन्न-सलिल, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, having clear or limpid water.<BR>—प्रसन्नात्मन्<BR>(˚न-आत्˚), आ, आ, अ, gracious-minded, propitious.<BR>—प्रसन्नेरा (˚न-ईरा), f. spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसाद|प्रसादः
1. प्र-साद, अस्, m. clearness, brightness, pellucid-<BR>ness, transparentness, limpidness, purity, cleanness<BR>[cf. अम्बु-प्˚]; clearness of style, perspicuity; calm-<BR>ness, tranquillity, absence of excitement, repose,<BR>composure; serenity of disposition, good humour,<BR>good temper; graciousness, propitiousness, favour,<BR>kindness, kind behaviour [cf. दुष्-प्˚, दृक्-प्˚];<BR>approbation; Kindness personified as a son of Dharma<BR>and Maitrī; a propitiatory offering or gift, food<BR>offered to a god (= प्रसाद-द्रव्य, प्रसादान्न);<BR>the remnants of food presented to an idol or left by<BR>a spiritual teacher (both of which any one may<BR>freely appropriate to his own use); free gift, gratuity;<BR>well-being, welfare; N. of a commentary on the<BR>Prakriyā-kaumudī; प्रसादात्, abl. c. through the<BR>kindness of, by the favour of.<BR>—प्रसाद-दान,<BR>अम्, n. a propitiatory gift, a gift in token of favour,<BR>gift of food by a superior.<BR>—प्रसाद-पट्ट, अस्,<BR>m. a turban of honour (worn as a token of royal<BR>favour).<BR>—प्रसाद-पराङ्मुख, अस्, ई, अम्, not<BR>caring for any one's favour; withdrawing favour<BR>from any one (with gen.).<BR>—प्रसाद-पात्र, अम्,<BR>n. an object of favour.<BR>—प्रसाद-पुरग, अस्, आ,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">Page0647-c+ 77</a>]<BR>अम्, inclined to favour, favourably inclined.<BR>—प्र-<BR>साद-प्रतिलब्ध, अस्, m., N. of a demon.<BR>—प्र-<BR>साद-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, pleased, delighted; gracious,<BR>favourable.<BR>—प्रसाद-वित्तक, अस्, आ, अम् (perhaps<BR>an incorrect form for प्रसाद-वित्तम), best ac-<BR>quainted with the favour (of another), preferred to<BR>all others.<BR>—प्रसाद-स्थ, अस्, आ, अम्, abiding in<BR>serenity, kind, propitious; happy.<BR>—प्रसादान्तर<BR>(˚द-अन्˚), अम्, n. another (mark of) favour.<BR>—प्र-<BR>सादी-कृ, cl. 8. P. A. -करोति, -कुरुते, -कर्तुम्, to<BR>bestow as a mark of favour, bestow graciously, present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसाद|प्रसादः
2. प्रसाद, Nom. P. प्रसादति, प्रसादितुम्, to<BR>be clear or bright.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसादक
प्र-सादक, अस्, इका, अम्, clearing, purifying,<BR>rendering clear or pellucid; gladdening, cheering,<BR>exhilarating; propitiating, courting favour, wishing<BR>to win any one's favour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसादन|प्रसादनं|प्रसादनः
प्र-सादन, अस्, ई, अम्, rendering clear, purifying<BR>[cf. अम्बु-प्˚, तोय-प्˚]; calming, tranquillizing;<BR>soothing, cheering, gratifying; (अस्), m. a royal<BR>tent; (आ), f. service, worship; (अम्), n. cleaning,<BR>freeing from soil or impurities; the act of calming,<BR>tranquillizing, composing, soothing (e. g. नेत्र-प्˚,<BR>administering soothing remedies to the eyes); cheer-<BR>ing, gratifying [cf. श्रुति-प्˚]; rendering gracious,<BR>propitiating, pleasing, (त्वत्-प्रसादनात्, for the sake<BR>of propitiating thee); boiled rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसादनीय
प्र-सादनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be rendered gracious,<BR>to be propitiated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसादयत्
प्र-सादयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, causing to be gracious,<BR>propitiating, gratifying, pleasing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसादयितव्य
प्र-सादयितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be rendered<BR>gracious, to be propitiated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसादित
प्र-सादित, अस्, आ, अम्, purified, cleansed; pleased,<BR>conciliated, propitiated, appeased, reconciled; wor-<BR>shipped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसादिन्
प्र-सादिन्, ई, इनी, इ, calming, tranquillizing,<BR>soothing, cheering, gladdening; showing favour,<BR>treating with kindness; clear, serene, bright.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसाद्य
प्र-साद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be rendered gracious,<BR>to be propitiated, to be conciliated, placable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसेदिवस्
प्र-सेदिवस्, वान्, दुषी, वत्, one who has be-<BR>come pleased or propitiated, favourable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसन्धा|प्रसंधा
