प्रसन्धि|प्रसंधि
प्र-सन्धि, इस्, m., N. of a son of Manu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

