प्रसमीक्षण|प्रसमीक्षणं
प्र-समीक्षण, अम्, n. considering, deliberat-<BR>ing, discussing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसमीक्षा
प्र-समीक्षा, f. deliberation, judgment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसमीक्षित
प्र-समीक्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, looked at, looked<BR>upon, observed; reflected upon, considered; regarded<BR>as, declared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसमीक्ष्य
1. प्र-समीक्ष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be considered<BR>or weighed or discussed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसमीक्ष्य
2. प्र-समीक्ष्य, ind. having looked at; having<BR>reflected upon, having considered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसमीडित
प्रसमीडित प्र-समीडित, अस्, आ, अम्, praised,<BR>celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसयन|प्रसयनं
प्रसयन प्र-सयन, अम्, n. (fr. rt. सि with<BR>प्र), binding, fastening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसित|प्रसितं
प्र-सित, अस्, आ, अम्, bound to, bound, fastened;<BR>adhering to or engaged in, diligent, attentive,<BR>zealous; attached or devoted to, engrossed by;<BR>(अम्), n. pus, matter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसिति|प्रसितिः
1. प्र-सिति, इस्, f. (for 2. see p. 648, col. 2), a<BR>ligament, binding, tie, fetter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसर|प्रसरः
प्रसर प्र-सर, &c. See प्र-सृ, p. 649.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसर्ग|प्रसर्गः
प्रसर्ग प्र-सर्ग, प्र-सर्जन. See under<BR>प्र-सृज्, p. 649, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0647-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसर्प|प्रसर्पः
प्रसर्प प्र-सर्प, &c. See प्र-सृप्, p. 649.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसल|प्रसलः
प्रसल प्रसल, अस्, m. the cold season,<BR>winter (= हेमन्त; also read प्रशल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसलवि
प्रसलवि प्र-सलवि, ind., Ved. towards<BR>the right side, (opposed to अप-सलवि; also incor-<BR>rectly written प्रसवि.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसव|प्रसवः
