प्रसव्य|प्रसव्यं
प्रसव्य प्र-सव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, turned towards<BR>the left, (opposed to प्र-दक्षिण); contrary,<BR>reverse, reverted, inverted; favourable; (अम्), ind.<BR>towards the left, to the left side.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसह्
प्रसह् 1. प्र-सह्, cl. 1. A. -सहते, -सहि-<BR>तुम्, -सोढुम्, to bear up against, be able to with-<BR>stand, sustain, endure; to overpower, conquer, de-<BR>feat; to make an effort; to be able (with inf.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसक्षिन्
प्र-सक्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ, Ved. overpowering, de-<BR>feating, victorious (Sāy. = शत्रूणाम् प्रसहन-<BR>शीलः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसभम्
प्र-सभम्, ind. (an ind. past part. of a form<BR>सभ् = सह्, cf. 2. प्र-सह्य), by force, forcibly,<BR>violently; importunately; exceedingly, much; N. of<BR>a variety of the Triṣṭubh metre.<BR>—प्रसभ-द-<BR>मन, अम्, n. forcible taming (of wild animals;<BR>according to a Scholiast = बलात्कारेण मर्दनम्).<BR>—प्रसभ-हरण, अम्, n. carrying off by force,<BR>violent seizure.<BR>—प्रसभोद्धृत (˚भ-उद्˚), अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, torn up by force, forcibly uprooted.<BR>—प्र-<BR>सभोद्धृतारि (˚त-अरि), इस्, इस्, इ, one who has<BR>forcibly uprooted his enemies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसह्
2. प्र-सह् or प्र-साह्, -साट्, m. (acc. प्र-साहम्),<BR>overpowering; an epithet of Indra, (Sāy. = शत्रूणाम्<BR>अभिभविता, the overcomer of foes); force, violence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसह|प्रसहः
प्र-सह, अस्, आ, अम्, bearing up against, with-<BR>standing; (अस्), m. a beast or bird of prey; endur-<BR>ance, resistance (in दुष्-प्˚, q. v.); (आ), f. a kind<BR>of Solanum (= वृहतिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसहन|प्रसहनः
प्र-सहन, अस्, m. a beast or bird of prey;<BR>(अम्), n. withstanding, resisting; overcoming, de-<BR>feating; defeat; bearing, enduring; embracing, an<BR>embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसह्य
1. प्र-सह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be resisted, to be<BR>conquered or defeated; अ-प्रसह्य, not to be<BR>resisted, irresistible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसह्य
2. प्र-सह्य, ind. having withstood, having sus-<BR>tained; having overpowered or conquered; forcibly,<BR>violently, by violence, by force; exceedingly.<BR>—प्र-<BR>सह्य-कारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, acting violently, violent in<BR>action.<BR>—प्रसह्य-चौर, अस्, m. ‘a violent thief,’<BR>a robber, plunderer.<BR>—प्रसह्य-हरण, अम्, n.<BR>taking away by force, robbing, plundering; [cf. प्र-<BR>सभ-हरण.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसह्वन्
प्र-सह्वन्, आ, अरी, अ, Ved. overpowering, defeat-<BR>ing; an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसाह्
प्र-साह्. See 2. प्र-सह् above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसाह|प्रसाहः
प्र-साह, अस्, m. overpowering, defeating; con-<BR>trolling one's self; अ-प्रसाह, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. com-<BR>pletely master of one's self, not subject to passion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसातिका
प्रसातिका प्रसातिका, f. a kind of rice with<BR>small grains (= अणु-व्रीहि; cf. प्र-साधिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसाद|प्रसादः
प्रसाद प्र-साद, &c. See प्र-सद्, p. 647.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसाध्
प्रसाध् प्र-साध्, Caus. P. -साधयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to accomplish, effect; to promote, advance,<BR>further; to make one's own, acquire, (according to<BR>Kullūka on Manu VII. 103 = आत्मसात्-कृ); to<BR>subdue; to dress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसाधक|प्रसाधकः
प्र-साधक, अस्, इका, अम्, accomplishing, per-<BR>fecting, one who accomplishes or perfects; cleansing,<BR>purifying; decorating, adorning, ornamenting; (अस्),<BR>m. an attendant who dresses his master, a valet de<BR>chambre; (इका), f. a female attendant who dresses<BR>her mistress, lady's maid; wild rice; [cf. प्रसा-<BR>तिका.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसाधन|प्रसाधनं|प्रसाधनः
प्र-साधन, अस्, ई, अम्, accomplishing, effecting;<BR>one who accomplishes or effects (Ved.); (अस्), m. a<BR>comb; (ई), f. a drug, commonly called सिद्धि; a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">Page0648-b+ 76</a>]<BR>comb, (केश-प्˚, a comb for the hair); (अम्), n.<BR>bringing about, accomplishing, effecting; arranging;<BR>setting in order; decorating, decoration, embellish-<BR>ment, ornament, dress, toilet; a comb.<BR>—प्रसा-<BR>धन-विधि, इस्, m. a mode of decoration or em-<BR>bellishment.<BR>—प्रसाधन-विशेष, अस्, m. the<BR>highest decoration, most excellent ornament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसाधित|प्रसाधितः
प्र-साधित, अस्, आ, अम्, accomplished, finished,<BR>completed, done; proved; ornamented, decorated.<BR>—प्रसाधिताङ्ग (˚त-अङ्˚), अस्, ई, अम्, having<BR>the limbs ornamented or decorated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसाध्य
प्र-साध्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be accomplished or<BR>effected, practicable; to be destroyed; to be defeated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसार|प्रसारः
प्रसार प्र-सार, &c. See प्र-सृ, p. 649.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसाह|प्रसाहः
प्रसाह प्र-साह. See 1. प्र-सह्, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसिच्
प्रसिच् प्र-सिच्, Pass. -सिच्यते, to be poured<BR>out or flow forth, to be scattered; to be lost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसेक|प्रसेकः
प्र-सेक, अस्, m. flowing forth, flowing, dropping,<BR>oozing; sprinkling, wetting; emission, discharge;<BR>running or watering of the mouth or nose, flow of<BR>saliva in vomiting, vomiting, sickness, nausea; the<BR>bowl of a spoon or ladle.<BR>—प्रसेक-ता, f. flow of<BR>saliva in nausea or vomiting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसेकिन्
प्रसेकिन्, ई, इनी, इ, discharging a fluid; suffering<BR>from morbid flow of saliva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसित|प्रसितं
प्रसित प्र-सित. See प्र-सयन, p. 647.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसिति|प्रसितिः
प्रसिति 2. प्र-सिति, इस्, f. (fr. rt. सो with<BR>प्र; for 1. see प्र-सयन, p. 647), Ved. a track,<BR>path, course (as of fire &c.); an attack, assault; a<BR>throw, cast, shot; stretch, reach, extent, compass;<BR>duration, series, succession (e. g. दीर्घाम् अनु प्र-<BR>सितिम्, in long succession); dominion, power, autho-<BR>rity, influence; (Sāy.) = ज्वाला, a flame; = बन्धन,<BR>confinement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसिध्
प्रसिध् प्र-सिध्, cl. 4. P. -सिध्यति, -सेद्-<BR>धुम्, to be accomplished or effected, to succeed; to<BR>be gained or obtained; to be established; to be made<BR>known or certified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसिद्ध|प्रसिद्धः
प्र-सिद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, well known, notorious,<BR>renowned, famous, celebrated; adorned, ornamented.<BR>—प्रसिद्ध-क्षत्रिय-प्राय, अस्, आ, अम्, con-<BR>sisting for the most part of renowned Kṣatriyas.<BR>—प्रसिद्ध-ता, f. or प्रसिद्ध-त्व, अम्, n.<BR>celebrity, the being well known, notoriety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसिद्धक
प्रसिद्धक, अस्, m., N. of a prince descended<BR>from Janaka (a son of Maru and father of Kṛtti-<BR>ratha).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसिद्धि|प्रसिद्धिः
प्र-सिद्धि, इस्, f. accomplishment, success, attain-<BR>ment; the being generally known or admitted,<BR>celebrity, fame, notoriety; ornament, decoration.<BR>—प्रसिद्धि-मत्, आन्, अती, अत्, generally known,<BR>notorious, famous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसीदिका
प्रसीदिका प्रसीदिका, f. a small garden;<BR>(also read प्रसेदिका, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसु
प्रसु 1. प्र-सु, cl. 5. P. A. -सुनोति, -सुनुते,<BR>-सोतुम्, Ved. to press or squeeze out Soma juice,<BR>extract the juice of the Soma plant (Sāy. = सोमा-<BR>भिषवं कृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसव|प्रसवः
1. प्र-सव, अस्, m. (for 2. see under 2. प्र-सु<BR>below), Ved. pressing out Soma juice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसुत्
प्र-सुत्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. flowing forth (as Soma from<BR>the Soma press).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसुन्वत्
प्र-सुन्वत्, अन्, अती, अत्, Ved. squeezing out or<BR>extracting Soma juice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसुव
प्र-सुव, अस्, m., Ved. pressing out Soma juice,<BR>extraction of the juice of the Soma plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसु
प्रसु 2. प्र-सु (sometimes written प्र-सू),<BR>cl. 1. P., 2. 4. A. -सवति, -सूते, -सूयते (properly a<BR>kind of reflexive passive form), -सोतुम्, -सवितुम्, to<BR>procreate, beget, generate, engender; to bring forth,<BR>be delivered of, bear: Pass. -सूयते (ep. also P. -ति),<BR>to be begotten by (with abl.); to be brought forth<BR>by, be born of (with loc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसव|प्रसवः
2. प्र-सव, अस्, m. (for 3. see under 2. प्र-सू,<BR>p. 649), procreating, generating, procreation, genera-<BR>tion; the production of young, bringing forth or bearing<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-c" target="_blank">Page0648-c+ 79</a>]<BR>young, childbirth, parturition, delivery, travail, labour;<BR>conception; birthplace, source, origin; offspring,<BR>young, progeny, posterity, (अन्तः-प्˚, containing<BR>offspring, pregnant; किसलय-प्˚, the offspring of a<BR>twig, a young shoot); a flower, blossom [cf. कनक-<BR>प्˚, पीत-प्˚]; fruit.<BR>—प्रसव-गृह, अम्, n. a lying-<BR>in chamber.<BR>—प्रसव-धर्मिन्, ई, इणी, इ, charac-<BR>terized by production, productive, prolific.<BR>—प्र-<BR>सव-बन्धन, अम्, n. the foot-stalk of a leaf or<BR>flower, the leaf-stalk or peduncle.<BR>—प्रसव-वि-<BR>कार, अस्, m., Ved. a prodigy happening at the<BR>birth of a child.<BR>—प्रसव-वेदना, f. the pangs of<BR>childbirth, throes.<BR>—प्रसव-स्थली, f. ‘birthplace,’<BR>a mother.<BR>—प्रसव-स्थान, अम्, n. a receptacle for<BR>young, a nest.<BR>—प्रसवोत्थान (˚व-उत्˚), अम्, n.,<BR>N. of the seventeenth Pari-śiṣṭa of the Yajur-veda.<BR>—प्रसवोन्मुख (˚व-उन्˚), ई, f. expecting child-<BR>birth, about to be delivered (according to Malli-<BR>nātha = आसन्न-प्रसवा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसवक|प्रसवकः
