प्रसवत्
प्र-सवत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, bringing forth, bearing;<BR>(अन्ती), f. a woman in labour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0648-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसवन|प्रसवनं
