प्रसू
प्रसू 2. प्र-सू, cl. 6. P. -सुवति, -सवितुम्,<BR>Ved. to urge forwards, incite, excite, animate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसव|प्रसवः
3. प्र-सव, अस्, m. (for 1. and 2. see under 1.<BR>and 2. प्र-सु, p. 648), Ved. urging forwards, setting<BR>in motion, being set in motion; a current, course,<BR>stream; rousing up, excitement, animation; order-<BR>ing, enjoining; furtherance, assistance, help; pursuit,<BR>acquisition; one who urges on or excites.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसवितृ
2. प्र-सवितृ, ता, त्री, तृ (for 1. see p. 648,<BR>col. 3), Ved. urging forwards, setting in motion, ex-<BR>citing, animating; (Sāy. = प्रकर्षेणाभिज्ञातृ.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसविन्
2. प्र-सविन्, ई, इनी, इ (for 1. see under 2. प्र-<BR>सु, p. 648), urging forwards, exciting (?) .<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

