2. प्र-सार्य, ind. having stretched forth, having<BR>put forth, having held out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसृत|प्रसृतं|प्रसृतः
प्र-सृत, अस्, आ, अम्, gone forwards, gone;<BR>stretched out, stretched, extended; diffused, spread<BR>abroad, dispersed; lengthened, long; swift, quick;<BR>modest, humble; attached to, engaged in, appointed;<BR>(अस्), m. the palm of the hand stretched out and hol-<BR>lowed as if to hold liquids; a handful (as a measure,<BR>= two Palas); (आ), f. the leg; (अम्), n. a measure<BR>equal to two Palas; (प्र-सृत is sometimes incor-<BR>rectly written for प्र-श्रित and even for प्र-सित,<BR>q. q. v. v.)<BR>—प्रसृत-ज, आस्, m. pl. an epithet of<BR>a particular class of sons (Mahā-bh. Anuśāsana-p.<BR>2615).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसृति|प्रसृतिः
प्र-सृति, इस्, f. progress, advance; streaming,<BR>flowing; the palm of the hand hollowed, a handful;<BR>a measure equal to two Palas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसृमर
प्र-सृमर, अस्, आ, अम्, flowing forth, dropping,<BR>distilling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसृज्
प्रसृज् प्र-सृज्, cl. 6. P. -सृजति, -स्रष्टुम्,<BR>to pour away; to lay aside, dismiss; to quit, leave,<BR>abandon; to hurt, injure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसर्ग|प्रसर्गः
प्र-सर्ग, अस्, m., Ved. pouring forth, flowing<BR>forth, efflux (Sāy. = वर्षण); emission, discharge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसर्जन
प्र-सर्जन, अस्, ई, अम्, Ved. (perhaps) throwing<BR>or casting forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसृष्ट
प्र-सृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, poured away, laid aside,<BR>dismissed; hurt, injured; (आ), f. (probably) a par-<BR>ticular movement in fighting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसृप्
प्रसृप् प्र-सृप्, cl. 1. P. -सर्पति, -सर्प्तुम्,<BR>-स्रप्तुम्, to creep or crawl forth, creep on; to go<BR>on, proceed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसर्प|प्रसर्पः
प्र-सर्प, अस्, m. going to the part of the<BR>sacrificial enclosure called the Sadas; (अम्), n., N.<BR>of a Sāman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसर्पक
प्र-सर्पक, अस्, m., Ved. an assistant who is<BR>under the superintendance of the Ṛtvij at a sacrifice<BR>or a mere spectator at a sacrifice (so designated<BR>from entering the part of the sacrificial enclosure<BR>called Sadas; cf. प्र-सृप्त); an uninvited guest,<BR>an intruder (?) .<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसर्पण|प्रसर्पणं
प्र-सर्पण, अम्, n. going forwards, progressing,<BR>entering (with loc.); entering the part of the sacri-<BR>ficial ground called Sadas; refuge, shelter (Ved.;<BR>Sāy. = प्रकर्षेण सर्पण-साधनम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसर्पत्
प्र-सर्पत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, advancing, proceeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसर्पिन्
प्र-सर्पिन्, ई, इणी, इ, creeping or crawling forth,<BR>gliding away; coming forth, issuing; going to the<BR>part of the sacrificial enclosure called Sadas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसृप्त
प्र-सृप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, crept or crawled forth,<BR>crept away, come forth; entered into the part of the<BR>sacrificial ground called Sadas; (अस्), m. = प्र-सर्-<BR>पक, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसृमर
प्रसृमर प्र-सृमर. See above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसृष्ट
प्रसृष्ट प्र-सृष्ट. See प्र-सृज् above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसेक|प्रसेकः
प्रसेक प्र-सेक, प्रसेकिन्. See under<BR>प्र-सिच्, p. 648, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसेदिका
प्रसेदिका प्रसेदिका, f. a various reading<BR>for प्रसीदिका, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसेदिवस्
प्रसेदिवस् प्र-सेदिवस्. See p. 647, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसेन
प्रसेन प्र-सेन, अस्, m., N. of a prince (a<BR>son of Nighna or Nimna); N. of a king of Ujjayinī<BR>succeeded by Vikramārka or Vikramāditya.<BR>—प्र-<BR>सेन-जित्, त्, m., N. of several princes, especially of a<BR>sovereign of Śrāvastī contemporary with Śākya-muni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसेव|प्रसेवः
प्रसेव प्र-सेव, अस्, m. (fr. rt. सिव् with प्र),<BR>a sack, a leathern bottle; a small instrument of wood<BR>covered with leather and placed under the neck of<BR>an Indian lute to render the sound deeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसेवक|प्रसेवकः
प्रसेवक, अस्, m. a sack [cf. चर्म-प्˚]; a<BR>particular part of a lute (= प्र-सेव); a crooked<BR>piece of wood at the end of a lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्कण्व|प्रस्कण्वः
प्रस्कण्व प्र-स्-कण्व, अस्, m., N. of a Vedic<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">Page0649-c+ 77</a>]<BR>Ṛṣi with the patronymic Kāṇva (according to the<BR>Bhāgavata-Purāṇa, a grandson of Kaṇva), author of<BR>the hymns Ṛg-veda I. 44-50, IX. 95, Vālakhilya<BR>3, 2, and 6, 8; (आस्), m. pl., N. of the descendants<BR>of Praskaṇva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्कन्द्|प्रस्कंद्
प्रस्कन्द् प्र-स्कन्द्, cl. 1. P. -स्कन्दति, -स्कन्-<BR>तुम्, to spring forward, spring forth; to spring down,<BR>leap down, alight: Caus. -स्कन्दयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>overleap, spring over, leap across, cross (a river).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्कन्दत्
प्र-स्कन्दत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, springing forward,<BR>springing forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्कन्दन|प्रस्कंदन|प्रस्कंदनं|प्रस्कन्दनं|प्रस्कन्दनः
प्र-स्कन्दन, अस्, m. an epithet of Śiva (‘emit-<BR>ting semen?’); (अम्), n. the act of leaping over, spring-<BR>ing across; evacuation by stool, diarrhœa, dysentery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्कन्दिका|प्रस्कंदिका
प्र-स्कन्दिका, f. diarrhœa, dysentery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्कन्दिन्
प्र-स्कन्दिन्, ई, m., N. of a man possessed of<BR>extraordinary strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्कन्द्य
प्र-स्कन्द्य, ind. having sprung forwards, having<BR>leaped down, having quickly alighted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्कन्न|प्रस्कन्नः
प्र-स्कन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, sprung forward, sprung<BR>forth; dropped, fallen; defeated in battle; (अस्), m.<BR>a transgressor, sinner; one who has violated the<BR>usages of his caste or order, an outcast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्कुन्द|प्रस्कुंद|प्रस्कुंदः|प्रस्कुन्दः
प्रस्कुन्द प्र-स्कुन्द, अस्, m. an altar or ele-<BR>vated floor of a circular shape (= चक्राकारा वेदिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्खल्
प्रस्खल् प्र-स्खल्, cl. 1. P. -स्खलति, -स्ख-<BR>लितुम्, to stagger forwards, stagger, reel, totter, tumble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्खलत्
प्र-स्खलत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, staggering forwards,<BR>reeling, tumbling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्खलन|प्रस्खलनं
प्र-स्खलन, अम्, n. the act of staggering,<BR>stumbling, tumbling, falling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तर|प्रस्तरः
प्रस्तर प्र-स्तर, अस्, m. (fr. rt. स्तृ with<BR>प्र), anything strewed about, a couch of leaves and<BR>flowers; a bed or couch in general; a flat surface,<BR>flat top, level, a plain [cf. प्रासाद-प्˚]; a stone,<BR>rock; a precious stone, gem, jewel; a paragraph,<BR>section of a work; (in prosody) a tabular represen-<BR>tation of the long and short vowels of a metre (?) ;<BR>musical notation (?) .<BR>—प्रस्तर-घटनोपकरण<BR>(˚न-उप्˚), अम्, n. an instrument for breaking or<BR>splitting stones.<BR>—प्रस्तरे-ष्ठ, अस्, आ, अम् (rt.<BR>स्था), Ved. being on a couch or bed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तरण|प्रस्तरणं
प्र-स्तरण, अस्, आ, m. f. a couch, bed; a seat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तरिणी
प्र-स्तरिणी, f. a species of small shrub (= गो-<BR>लोमिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तार|प्रस्तारः
प्र-स्तार, अस्, m. strewing about, spreading out,<BR>scattering, spreading, covering with; a process in pre-<BR>paring minerals; a bed made with blossoms and leaves;<BR>a bed or couch in general; a flower-bed; a jungle, a<BR>thicket or wood overgrown with grass; a flat surface,<BR>level, plain; a representation or enumeration of all<BR>the possible combinations of certain given numbers<BR>(see Colebrooke's Algebra, p. 125); N. of a prince<BR>(a son of Ud-gītha; in this sense incorrectly for प्र-<BR>स्ताव).<BR>—प्रस्तार-पङ्क्ति, इस्, f. a kind of metre<BR>consisting of 12 + 12 + 8 + 8 syllables.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तारिन्
प्र-स्तारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, extending, spreading; (scil.<BR>अर्मन्) a particular disease of the white of the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तिर|प्रस्तिरः
प्र-स्तिर, अस्, m. a bed or couch made of flowers<BR>and leaves (= प्र-स्तर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तीर्ण
प्र-स्तीर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, thrust forward, protruded (as<BR>the tip of the tongue in pronouncing the dentals).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तृत|प्रस्तृतः
प्र-स्तृत, अस्, आ, अम्, spread out, spread, ex-<BR>tended; disappeared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तीत|प्रस्तीतः
प्रस्तीत प्र-स्तीत or प्र-स्तीम, अस्, आ, अम्<BR>(fr. rt. स्त्यै with प्र), crowded together, clustering,<BR>swarming; sounded, making a noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तु
प्रस्तु प्र-स्तु, cl. 2. P. A. -स्तौति, -स्तवीति,<BR>-स्तुते, -स्तुवीते, -स्तोतुम्, to praise before (anything<BR>else), praise first, praise; to begin, commence; to<BR>speak, say, report, relate, propound: Caus. -स्ताव-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to begin, commence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतुष्टुषु
प्र-तुष्टुषु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing to begin,<BR>desirous of commencing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तव|प्रस्तवः
प्र-स्तव, अस्, m. a hymn of praise; = प्र-स्ताव,<BR>a favourable moment, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्ताव|प्रस्तावः
प्र-स्ताव, अस्, m. an introductory eulogy, intro-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">Page0650-a+ 78</a>]<BR>duction; the prelude or introductory words of a<BR>Sāman (sung by the Pra-stotṛ, Ved.); the prologue<BR>of a drama (= प्र-स्तावना); beginning, commenc-<BR>ing, commencement; introducing a topic, mention-<BR>ing, mention; the occasion of a conversation, a<BR>subject, topic; occasion, opportunity, time, season;<BR>convenience, (तव प्रस्तावेन, at your conveni-<BR>ence); N. of a prince (a son of Ud-gītha); =<BR>हेला, q. v.; (ए), ind. on a suitable occasion, oppor-<BR>tunely; (एन), ind. on the occasion of, occasionally,<BR>opportunely; suitably.<BR>—प्रस्ताव-चिन्तामणि, इस्,<BR>m., N. of a work.<BR>—प्रस्ताव-तस्, ind. on the<BR>occasion of; कथा-प्˚, in course of conversation.<BR>—प्रस्ताव-यज्ञ, अस्, m. ‘the sacrifice to a topic<BR>of discussion,’ a conversation to which each inter-<BR>locutor contributes his share (and therefore compared<BR>with a sacrifice at which each person present offers a<BR>contribution).<BR>—प्रस्ताव-रत्नाकर, अस्, m., N. of<BR>a work.<BR>—प्रस्ताव-सदृश, अस्, ई, अम्, suited to<BR>the occasion, appropriate, seasonable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0649-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तावना
प्र-स्तावना, f. causing to be praised; causing to<BR>mention or to speak of; sounding forth; introduc-<BR>tion, commencement, preface, exordium; a dramatic<BR>prologue, an introductory dialogue usually spoken by<BR>the manager and one of the actors, the scene be-<BR>tween the prayer and the beginning of the first act<BR>(of which several varieties are enumerated, viz. the<BR>Udghāṭyaka, Kathodghāṭa, Prayogātiśaya, Pra-var-<BR>taka, and Ava-lagita).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तावयत्
प्र-स्तावयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, beginning, com-<BR>mencing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तावित
प्र-स्तावित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to be told or<BR>related; mentioned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्ताव्य
प्र-स्ताव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. to be preluded or<BR>introduced with a Pra-stāva (as a Sāman).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तुत|प्रस्तुतः
प्र-स्तुत, अस्, आ, अम्, praised, eulogized, pane-<BR>gyrised; proposed, propounded, declared, under dis-<BR>cussion, revealed; said; expected, desired; ready,<BR>prepared; accomplished, done; happened, come to<BR>pass; made or consisting of; approached, proximate;<BR>done with effort or energy; (अम्), n. that which is<BR>propounded, any object under discussion, a proposi-<BR>tion.<BR>—प्रस्तुत-यज्ञ, अस्, आ, अम्, prepared for a<BR>sacrifice.<BR>—प्रस्तुताङ्कुर (˚त-अङ्˚), अस्, m. a<BR>kind of metaphorical expression, allusion by the<BR>mention of any passing circumstance to something<BR>latent in the hearer's mind (as, for instance, if a girl<BR>walking in a garden with an inconstant lover were<BR>to ask a bee, Why go to the thorny plantain when<BR>you can have the jasmine flower?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तुति|प्रस्तुतिः
प्र-स्तुति, इस्, f., Ved. praise, eulogium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तुत्य
प्र-स्तुत्य, ind. having told or related, having<BR>rehearsed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तोतृ
प्र-स्तोतृ, ता, m., Ved. the Ud-gātṛ's assistant<BR>who sings the Pra-stāva (q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तोत्रीय
प्रस्तोत्रीय, अस्, आ, अम्, relating to the Pra-stotṛ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तूत
प्रस्तूत प्र-स्तूत, अस्, m., N. of a class of<BR>deities under Manu Cākṣuṣa; (an incorrect form<BR>for प्र-भूत or प्र-सूत.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तोक
प्रस्तोक प्र-स्तोक, अस्, m., Ved., N. of a<BR>son of Sṛñjaya; कुत्सस्य प्रस्तोकः, N. of a<BR>Sāman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्तोभ|प्रस्तोभः
प्रस्तोभ प्र-स्तोभ, अस्, m. (fr. rt. स्तुभ्<BR>with प्र), allusion to, reference to (with gen.);<BR>रयेर् आङ्गिरसस्य प्रस्तोभः, N. of a Sāman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थल
प्रस्थल प्र-स्थल, आस्, m. pl., N. of a people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्था
प्रस्था प्र-स्था, cl. 1. A. (ep. also P.)<BR>-तिष्ठते (-ति), -स्थातुम्, to set out, depart; to<BR>proceed, advance, march towards (with acc. or dat.<BR>or with प्रति); (P., Ved.) to place before, set before,<BR>deposit: Caus. -स्थापयति, -यितुम्, to cause to set<BR>forth, cause to depart, induce to retire; to send<BR>forth, send out, dispatch, send away, dismiss; to<BR>send into exile, banish; to urge forwards, push on:<BR>Desid. -तिष्ठासति, -ते, to wish to advance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थ|प्रस्थः
प्र-स्थ, अस्, आ, अम्, going on a march or<BR>journey, going to, visiting, abiding in [cf. वन-प्˚];<BR>stable, firm, solid; expanding, spread; (अस्, अम्),<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">Page0650-b+ 79</a>]<BR>m. n. table-land on the top of a mountain; a level<BR>expanse, (at the end of names of towns and villages,<BR>cf. इन्द्र-प्˚, ओषधि-प्˚, करीर-प्˚; see Pāṇ. IV.<BR>2, 110); a particular weight and measure of capacity<BR>(= 32 Palas = (1/4) of an Āḍhaka; or = 16 Palas = 4<BR>Kuḍavas = (1/4) of an Āḍhaka; or = 2 Śarāvas; or =<BR>6 Palas; or = (1/16) of a Droṇa); a Prastha of anything<BR>or anything measuring a Prastha, (according to the<BR>Su-śruta a man should never lose more than a<BR>Prastha of blood in being bled); (अस्), m., N. of a<BR>man.<BR>—प्रस्थ-पुष्प, अस्, m. ‘flowering on the<BR>mountain-top,’ a species of plant, a variety of Tulasī<BR>or basil with small leaves.<BR>—प्रस्थम्-पच, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, cooking a Prastha (said of a cooking utensil<BR>capable of containing one Prastha).<BR>—प्रस्था-वत्,<BR>आन्, अती, अत्, hastening away, rapid, (according to<BR>Mahī-dhara = उत्कृष्ट-जवोपेत); (अती), f., N. of<BR>a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थान|प्रस्थानं
प्र-स्थान, अम्, n. going forth, setting forth,<BR>procession, proceeding, departing; marching forth,<BR>a march, the march of an army or of an assailant;<BR>sending away, dispatching; departing this life, dying<BR>[cf. महा-प्˚]; a way to attain (any object), course,<BR>method, system; a sect; an inferior kind of drama the<BR>characters of which are slaves and outcasts.<BR>—प्र-<BR>स्थान-भेद, अस्, m., N. of a work by Madhu-<BR>sūdana-sarasvatī.<BR>—प्रस्थान-वत्, ind. as in setting<BR>forth, as on a departure.<BR>—प्रस्थान-विकल-गति<BR>or प्रस्थान-विक्लव-गति, इस्, इस्, इ, one whose<BR>step falters in walking.<BR>—प्रस्थान-विघ्न, अम्,<BR>n. an obstacle to proceeding or to sending (anything);<BR>non-attendance at a festival, impeding its taking place.<BR>—प्रस्थानविघ्न-कृत्, त्, त्, त्, causing an impe-<BR>diment to proceeding or to dispatching (anything).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थानिक
प्रस्थानिक, belonging or relating to a de-<BR>parture, to a course, sect, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थानीय
प्रस्थानीय, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. belonging or re-<BR>lating to a departure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थापन|प्रस्थापनं
प्र-स्थापन, अम्, n. causing to depart, sending<BR>away, dismissing, dispatching, (दिशः प्रस्थाप-<BR>नम्, sending into all quarters of the world); using,<BR>employing, (ध्वनि-प्˚, employing a metaphor);<BR>appointment to an embassy; carrying off cattle; (आ),<BR>f. sending away, dispatching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थापनीय
प्र-स्थापनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be sent away,<BR>proper to be sent or dispatched; to be carried or<BR>driven off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थापित|प्रस्थापितः
प्र-स्थापित, अस्, आ, अम्, made to depart, sent<BR>away, dismissed, sent, dispatched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थाप्य
1. प्र-स्थाप्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be sent away, to<BR>be dispatched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थाप्य
2. प्र-स्थाप्य, ind. having sent forth, having<BR>dispatched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थायिन्
प्र-स्थायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, setting forth, starting,<BR>departing; preparing to go or depart; travelling,<BR>marching, going.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थावन्
प्र-स्थावन्, आ, अरी, अ, Ved. hastening away,<BR>rapid (an epithet of the Maruts, Sāy. = गमन-<BR>शील).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थिक
प्रस्थिक, at the end of adjectives derived from<BR>comps. ending in प्रस्थ, cf. आर्धप्रस्थिक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थिका
प्रस्थिका, f. a species of plant (= अम्ब-ष्ठा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थित
प्र-स्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, set forth, set out, departed,<BR>gone; an epithet of particular Soma vessels (Ved.).<BR>—प्रस्थित-याज्या, f., Ved. a particular Yājyā re-<BR>cited during the oblation offered with the Soma<BR>vessels called प्र-स्थित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थिति|प्रस्थितिः
प्र-स्थिति, इस्, f. setting forth, going forth, going<BR>away; a march, journey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्थेय
प्र-स्थेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be set forth or departed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्न|प्रस्नः
प्रस्न प्र-स्न, अस्, m. (fr. rt. स्ना with प्र),<BR>a bath, vessel for bathing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्नातृ
प्र-स्नातृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who bathes, a bather.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्नेय
प्र-स्नेय, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. to be bathed in,<BR>suitable for bathing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्नव|प्रस्नवः
प्रस्नव प्र-स्नव, प्र-स्नाविन्. See under<BR>प्र-स्नु, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्निग्ध
प्रस्निग्ध प्र-स्निग्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, very fatty<BR>or greasy, very oily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्नु
प्रस्नु प्र-स्नु, cl. 2. P. A. -स्नौति, -स्नुते,<BR>-स्नवितुम्, to pour forth, flow, distil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्नव|प्रस्नवः
प्र-स्नव, अस्, m. dropping, a stream; pouring<BR>forth, flowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्नाविन्
प्र-स्नाविन्, ई, इनी, इ, Ved. pouring forth, dropping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्नुत
प्र-स्नुत, अस्, आ, अम्, poured forth; dropping.<BR>—प्रस्नुत-स्तनी, f. having breasts that distil milk<BR>(through excess of maternal love).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्नुषा
प्रस्नुषा प्र-स्नुषा, f. the wife of a grandson.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्पन्दन|प्रस्पंदन|प्रस्पंदनं
प्रस्पन्दन प्र-स्पन्दन, अम्, n. (fr. rt. स्पन्द्<BR>with प्र), palpitating, quivering, trembling, vibrating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्फुट्
प्रस्फुट् प्र-स्फुट्, Caus. or cl. 10. P.<BR>-स्फोटयति, -यितुम्, to cleave through, transfix,<BR>cleave, split, pierce; to expand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्फुट|प्रस्फुटः
प्र-स्फुट, अस्, आ, अम्, cleft open, expanded,<BR>blown; manifest, clear, plain, apparent, evident;<BR>divulged, published, spread abroad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्फोटक
प्र-स्फोटक, अस्, m., N. of a Nāga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्फोटन|प्रस्फोटनं
प्र-स्फोटन, अम्, n. splitting, falling asunder;<BR>expanding, budding, opening, blooming; ripening;<BR>causing to blow or bloom; making evident or mani-<BR>fest, revealing; striking, beating; threshing or win-<BR>nowing corn; a winnowing basket; wiping away,<BR>rubbing out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्फुर्
प्रस्फुर् प्र-स्फुर्, cl. 6. P. -स्फुरति, -स्फु-<BR>रितुम्, to become tremulous, quiver, palpitate,<BR>vibrate, throb, pulsate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्फुरमाण
प्र-स्फुरमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, trembling, quiver-<BR>ing, palpitating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्फुरित
प्र-स्फुरित, अस्, आ, अम्, become tremulous,<BR>quivering, vibrating.<BR>—प्रस्फुरिताधर (˚त-<BR>अध्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, one whose lower lip quivers,<BR>with quivering nether lip.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्मृति|प्रस्मृतिः
प्रस्मृति प्र-स्मृति, इस्, f. (fr. rt. स्मृ with<BR>प्र), forgetting, forgetfulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्यन्द्|प्रस्यंद्
प्रस्यन्द् प्र-स्यन्द्, cl. 1. A. -स्यन्दते,<BR>-स्यन्दितुम्, to flow forth, flow away; to move<BR>rapidly, dart, fly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्यन्द|प्रस्यंद|प्रस्यंदः|प्रस्यन्दः
प्र-स्यन्द, अस्, m. flowing forth, trickling out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्यन्दन|प्रस्यंदन|प्रस्यंदनं
प्र-स्यन्दन, अम्, n. trickling forth, exudation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्यन्दमान
प्र-स्यन्दमान, अस्, आ, अम्, moving rapidly,<BR>darting, flying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्यन्दिन्
प्र-स्यन्दिन्, ई, इनी, इ, flowing forth, trickling<BR>down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्रंस
प्रस्रंस प्र-स्रंस, अस्, m. (fr. rt. स्रंस् with<BR>प्र), Ved. falling down, falling asunder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्रंसिन्
प्र-स्रंसिन्, ई, इनी, इ, letting fall, dropping; (scil.<BR>योनि) giving birth to the fetus before the time,<BR>miscarrying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्रु
प्रस्रु प्र-स्रु, cl. 1. P. -स्रवति, -स्रोतुम्,<BR>to flow forth; to let flow, pour out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्रव|प्रस्रवः
प्र-स्रव, अस्, m. flowing forth, gushing forth,<BR>oozing out, dropping; that which flows forth, a flow,<BR>stream; milk flowing from the breast or udder;<BR>urine; the overflowing scum of boiling rice; (आस्),<BR>m. pl. falling tears, tears gushing forth.<BR>—प्रस्रव-<BR>युक्त or प्रस्रव-संयुक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, connected<BR>with a stream, flowing in a stream, falling in drops,<BR>trickling; flowing with milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्रवण|प्रस्रवणं|प्रस्रवणः
प्र-स्रवण, अम्, n. (often incorrectly written<BR>प्र-श्रवण), flowing forth, gushing out, oozing<BR>out, trickling, dripping, leaking; dripping or fall of<BR>water, a cascade, cataract; a fountain, spring, well;<BR>a spout, the projecting mouth of a vessel (out of<BR>which any fluid is poured); streaming forth of the<BR>milk from the breast or udder; a pool of water<BR>formed by mountain streams; washing away of<BR>rocks &c. by the dripping of water; sweat, perspi-<BR>ration; voiding urine; N. of a place where the<BR>Sarasvatī takes its rise, (also प्लाक्षम् प्रस्रव-<BR>णम्); (अस्), m., N. of a man; of a range of moun-<BR>tains on the confines of Malaya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्रविन्
प्र-स्रविन्, ई, इणी, इ, pouring forth; yielding<BR>milk; rich in milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्राव|प्रस्रावः
प्र-स्राव, अस्, m. flowing, dropping; urine;<BR>the overflowing scum of boiling rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0650-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्रुत
प्र-स्रुत, अस्, आ, अम्, flowed forth, oozed out,<BR>dropped, issued.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्रुति|प्रस्रुतिः
प्र-स्रुति, इस्, f. flowing forth, oozing out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्वन्
प्रस्वन् प्र-स्वन्, cl. 1. P. -स्वनति, -स्वनि-<BR>तुम्, Ved. to sound loudly, resound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्वन|प्रस्वनः
प्र-स्वन, अस्, m. sound, noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्वनित
प्र-स्वनित, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. loud-sounding,<BR>resounding, resonant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्वान|प्रस्वानः
प्र-स्वान, अस्, m. a loud noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्वप्
प्रस्वप् प्र-स्वप्, cl. 2. P. -स्वपिति, -स्वप्-<BR>तुम्, to fall asleep, go to sleep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसुप्
प्र-सुप्, प्, प्, प्, Ved. sleeping, asleep, slumber-<BR>ing; (Sāy. = शत्रूणां हन्तृ.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसुप्त
प्र-सुप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, fallen into deep or sound<BR>sleep, fast asleep, asleep, sleeping, slumbering.<BR>—प्र-<BR>सुप्त-ता, f. sleepiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसुप्ति|प्रसुप्तिः
प्र-सुप्ति, इस्, f. sleepiness, somnolence; paralysis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्वाप|प्रस्वापः
प्र-स्वाप, अस्, m. falling asleep, sleep; a dream;<BR>(अस्, आ, अम्), causing sleep, sending to sleep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्वापक
प्र-स्वापक, अस्, इका, अम्, causing to fall asleep;<BR>causing to die, slaying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्वापन|प्रस्वापनं
प्र-स्वापन, अस्, ई, अम्, causing sleep, sending<BR>to sleep; (अम्), n. the act of sending to sleep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्वापिनी
प्र-स्वापिनी, f. ‘sending to sleep,’ N. of a<BR>daughter of Sattrājit and wife of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्वादस्
प्रस्वादस् प्र-स्वादस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, Ved. agree-<BR>able, pleasant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्वार|प्रस्वारः
प्रस्वार प्र-स्वार, अस्, m. (fr. rt. स्वृ with<BR>प्र), Ved. an epithet of the sacred syllable ॐ<BR>repeated by the religious teacher at the beginning of<BR>a lesson.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्विन्न
प्रस्विन्न प्र-स्विन्न, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. स्विद्<BR>with प्र), covered with perspiration, sweated,<BR>heated, perspired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्वेद|प्रस्वेदः
प्र-स्वेद, अस्, m. great or excessive perspiration,<BR>sweat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्वेदित
प्र-स्वेदित, अस्, आ, अम्, sweated, heated, perspired,<BR>perspiring, sweating; causing perspiration, hot.<BR>—प्रस्वेदित-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, suffering or pro-<BR>ducing perspiration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्वेदिन्
प्र-स्वेदिन्, ई, इनी, इ, covered with perspiration,<BR>sweating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहणेमि|प्रहणेमिः
प्रहणेमि प्रह-णेमि or प्रह-नेमि, इस्, m.<BR>the moon (incorrect forms for ग्रह-नेमि, q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहन्
प्रहन् 1. प्र-हन्, cl. 2. P. -हन्ति, -हन्तुम्,<BR>to kill, slay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहणन|प्रहणनं
प्र-हणन, अम्, n. killing, slaying (Scholiast<BR>on Pāṇ. VIII. 4, 22).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहत|प्रहतं
प्र-हत, अस्, आ, अम्, struck, beaten (as a drum),<BR>smitten, wounded, killed; repelled, repulsed, over-<BR>come, defeated; spread, expanded; contiguous,<BR>bounding, limitating; conversant with the principles<BR>of science; learned, accomplished.<BR>—प्रहत-मु-<BR>रज, अस्, आ, अम्, having drums beaten, sounding<BR>with the beating of drums.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहन्
2. प्र-हन् in अ-प्रहन्, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहन्तव्य
प्र-हन्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be killed or slain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहन्तृ
प्र-हन्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, striking down, slaying,<BR>a slayer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहर|प्रहरः
प्रहर प्र-हर, &c. See प्र-हृ, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहर्ष|प्रहर्षः
प्रहर्ष प्र-हर्ष, &c. See प्र-हृष्, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहस्
प्रहस् प्र-हस्, cl. 1. P. -हसति, -हसितुम्,<BR>to break out into laughter, laugh heartily, laugh at,<BR>laugh; to mock, deride, ridicule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहस
प्र-हस, अस्, m., N. of a Rākṣasa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहसत्|प्रहसन्त्
प्र-हसत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, laughing heartily, laugh-<BR>ing, smiling; (अन्ती), f. Arabian jasmine (= यूथी,<BR>वासन्ती); a large chafing-dish or fire-pan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहसन|प्रहसनं
प्र-हसन, अम्, n. laughing loudly, violent or<BR>hearty laughter, laughing, mirth, merriment; laugh-<BR>ing at, mocking, deriding, ridicule, irony, mockery;<BR>sarcasm, satire (as a branch of rhetorical composi-<BR>tion); a kind of comedy, a farce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहसित
प्र-हसित, अस्, आ, अम्, laughing, cheerful; (अम्),<BR>n. laughter, mirth.<BR>—प्रहसित-नेत्र, अस्, m.<BR>‘laughing-eyed,’ N. of a Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहसित्वा
प्र-हसित्वा, ind. an anomalous form for प्र-<BR>हस्य below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहस्य
प्र-हस्य, ind. having smiled or laughed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहास|प्रहासः
प्र-हास, अस्, m. loud laughter, violent or hearty<BR>laughter, laughing, laughter; ridicule, mocking, de-<BR>rision; satire, irony; an actor, a dancer; N. of Śiva;<BR>of an attendant of Śiva; of a son of Varuṇa; of a<BR>Nāga; of a place of pilgrimage (= सोम-तीर्थ);<BR>भरद्-वाजस्य प्रहासम्, N. of a Sāman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहासक|प्रहासकः
प्र-हासक, अस्, m. one who causes laughter or<BR>merriment, a jester.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहासित
प्र-हासित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to laugh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहासिन्
प्र-हासिन्, ई, इनी, इ, laughing aloud, causing<BR>laughter, diverting, joking, jesting; satirical; (ई),<BR>m. the buffoon of a drama (= वि-दूषक, q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहस्त|प्रहस्तः
प्रहस्त प्र-हस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, having long<BR>hands; (अस्), m. the open hand with the fingers<BR>extended; N. of a Rākṣasa; of a companion of<BR>Sūrya-prabha (see Kathā-sarit-s. XLIV. 25).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहस्तक
प्रहस्तक, अस्, आ, अम्, scil. तृच, an epithet of<BR>the verses Ṛg-veda VIII. 86, 13 — 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहा
प्रहा 1. प्र-हा, cl. 3. P. -जहाति, -हातुम्,<BR>to forsake, desert, leave, quit, abandon; to depart<BR>from; to throw, cast, fling: Pass. -हीयते, to be for-<BR>saken or relinquished, to be neglected; to fail, be<BR>lost, perish, disappear, vanish; to cease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहा
2. प्र-हा, f., Ved. a good throw at dice, gain,<BR>winnings; an advantage; (Sāy. = प्र-हन्तृ, a<BR>smiter, as if fr. 1. प्र-हन्.<BR>—प्रहा-वत्, आन्, अती,<BR>अत्, Ved. acquiring gain, gaining; (Sāy. = प्रह-<BR>रण-वत्, dealing blows, smiting.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहाण|प्रहाणं
प्र-हाण, अम्, n. relinquishing, abandoning,<BR>omitting, avoiding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहाणि|प्रहाणिः
प्र-हाणि, इस्, f. relinquishing, abandoning; want,<BR>deficiency.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहापण
प्र-हापण, अम्, n. driving away, forced aban-<BR>donment or departure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहीण|प्रहीणः
प्र-हीण, अस्, आ, अम्, left, abandoned; (अस्), m.<BR>removal, loss, waste, destruction.<BR>—प्रहीण-जीवित,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, one who has abandoned life, dead, slain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहार|प्रहारः
प्रहार प्र-हार. See प्र-हृ, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहि|प्रहिः
प्रहि 1. प्र-हि, cl. 5. P. -हिणोति, -हेतुम्, to<BR>send forth, dispatch, send to (with dat. or gen. or<BR>acc. of the person and acc. of the thing); to shoot<BR>(an arrow from a bow), send, cast, throw, discharge;<BR>(Ved.) to rouse up, urge on (?); to propitiate (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहाय्य|प्रहाय्यः
प्र-हाय्य, अस्, m., Ved. ‘one who is to be sent,’<BR>a messenger; [cf. प्र-हेय.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहित|प्रहितं
1. प्र-हित, अस्, आ, अम् (for 2. see below), sent<BR>forth, sent, dispatched; shot, discharged (as an arrow<BR>from a bow); appointed, commissioned [cf. अ-प्˚];<BR>गौरीवितेः प्रहितः, N. of a Sāman; (अम्), n.<BR>sauce, gravy, condiment.<BR>—प्रहितन्-गम, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, Ved. going on an errand or mission.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहेति
प्र-हेति, इस्, m. a missile weapon (Ved., according<BR>to Mahī-dhara = प्रकृष्टम् आयुधम्); N. of a<BR>king of the Rākṣasas; N. of an Asura.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहेतृ
प्र-हेतृ, ता, m. one who sends forth; one who<BR>excites or impels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहेय
प्र-हेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be sent away or dis-<BR>patched, serving as a messenger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहि|प्रहिः
प्रहि 2. प्रहि, इस्, m. (said to be fr. प्र-<BR>हृ), a well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहित|प्रहितं
प्रहित 2. प्र-हित, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. प्र-धा,<BR>p. 631, col. 3; for 1. see above), put forth, placed;<BR>stretched out, extended; suitable, appropriate;<BR>learned (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहिम
प्रहिम प्र-हिम, see Scholiast on Pāṇ.<BR>VIII. 4, 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहीण|प्रहीणः
प्रहीण प्र-हीण. See 1. प्र-हा above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहुत|प्रहुतं|प्रहुतः
प्रहुत प्र-हुत, अस्, m. (fr. rt. हु with प्र),<BR>sacrificial food offered to all created beings; (अम्),<BR>n. an offering of food to all created beings (= भूत-<BR>यज्ञ, Manu III. 74).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहुति|प्रहुतिः
प्र-हुति, इस्, f., Ved. an oblation, sacrifice; (Sāy.<BR>= प्रकृष्टाहुतिः, an excellent oblation.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहोष
प्र-होष, अस्, m., Ved. an oblation, sacrifice (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहोषिन्
प्रहोषिन्, ई, इणी, इ, Ved. offering oblations or<BR>sacrifices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहृ
प्रहृ प्र-हृ, cl. 1. P. A. -हरति, -ते, -हर्-<BR>तुम्, to strike at, strike, beat; to wound, hurt,<BR>injure; to attack, assail, assault; to cast, throw,<BR>fling, hurl (with dat. or acc.); to seize upon; (with<BR>पादेन) to kick; (Ved.) to offer, present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहर|प्रहरः
प्र-हर, अस्, m. a particular division of time<BR>(comprising about three hours, = 6 or 7 Nāḍikas; so<BR>called from its lapse being announced by beating a<BR>gong); the eighth part of a day, a watch [cf. अर्ध-<BR>प्˚]; a subdivision of Śrī-vasanta-rāja's work entitled<BR>Śākuna.<BR>—प्रहर-कुटुवी, f. a species of plant<BR>(= कुटुम्बिनी).<BR>—प्रहर-विरति, इस्, f. the end of<BR>a watch; (औ), ind. at the end of the (morning)<BR>watch, at nine o'clock in the forenoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहरक|प्रहरकः
प्रहरक, अस्, m. striking the hours; a watch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहरण|प्रहरणं
प्र-हरण, अम्, n. striking, beating; casting,<BR>throwing; attacking, assailing, assaulting; fighting,<BR>war, battle; repelling, removing, expelling; a<BR>weapon, (कृत-प्रहरण, practised in the use of<BR>arms, cf. कृतास्त्र); the box of a carriage; a<BR>covered car, litter, small covered pleasure-car, (in<BR>this sense incorrectly for प्र-वहण, q. v.); (अस्),<BR>m., N. of a son of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—प्रहरण-कलिका or<BR>प्रहरण-कलिता, f. a kind of metre, four times<BR>˘˘˘˘˘˘¯˘˘˘˘˘˘¯.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहरणिय
प्र-हरणिय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be attacked or<BR>assailed, assailable; to be fought with; to be expelled<BR>or removed; (अम्), n. a weapon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहरिन्
प्रहरिन्, ई, m. ‘one who announces the hours<BR>by striking a bell, beating a gong, &c.,’ a watchman,<BR>sentry; a bellman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहरिष्यत्
प्र-हरिष्यत्, अन्, अती or अन्ती, अत्, intending to<BR>strike; wishing to take.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहर्तव्य
प्र-हर्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be struck; to be<BR>attacked or assailed, assailable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहर्तृ|प्रहर्त्तृ
प्र-हर्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, striking, a striker; one<BR>who beats; fighting, a fighter, assailant, combatant,<BR>champion; one who shoots, a shooter, archer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहार|प्रहारः
प्र-हार, अस्, m. striking, hitting; a stroke,<BR>blow, slap, knock, thump [cf. तल-प्˚, मुष्टि-प्˚];<BR>a kick [cf. पाद-प्˚]; a cut, thrust [cf. खड्ग-प्˚];<BR>killing, wounding; pecking; shooting, hitting (with<BR>a missile), a shot, hit.<BR>—प्रहार-करण, अम्, n.<BR>dealing blows, beating. -प्रहार-वर्मन्, आ, m.,<BR>N. of a prince of Mithilā.<BR>—प्रहार-वल्ली, f. =<BR>चर्म-कशा, मांस-रोहिणी.<BR>—प्रहारार्त (˚र-<BR>आर्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, bruised or wounded by a blow,<BR>hurt by a blow; (अम्), n. chronic and acute pain<BR>from a wound or hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहारण|प्रहारणं
प्र-हारण, अम्, n. a desirable gift; (a various<BR>reading for प्र-वारण, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहारिन्
प्र-हारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, striking, smiting, beating;<BR>attacking, assailing [cf. रन्ध्र-प्˚]; killing; fight-<BR>ing, a warrior, champion, hero.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहारुक
प्र-हारुक, अस्, ई, अम्, Ved. carrying off, tearing<BR>away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहार्य
प्र-हार्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be beaten, deserving<BR>to be beaten; to be taken away, to be removed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहृत
प्र-हृत, अस्, आ, अम्, struck, beaten, smitten;<BR>seized; (अम्), n. a stroke, blow, striking, killing;<BR>(अस्), m., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहृष्
प्रहृष् प्र-हृष्, cl. 4. P. -हृष्यति, -हर्-<BR>षितुम्, to rejoice beforehand, be glad in anticipation,<BR>anticipate pleasure; to be very glad, rejoice exceed-<BR>ingly, exult: Caus. -हर्षयति, -यितुम्, to cause to<BR>be glad, gladden, cheer, inspirit, encourage, delight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहर्ष|प्रहर्षः
प्र-हर्ष, अस्, m. extreme joy, hilarity, mirth,<BR>gladness, delight, rapture, exultation, thrill; erection<BR>of the male organ, priapism; प्रहर्षं कृ, to<BR>take pleasure or delight in (with loc.)<BR>—प्रहर्ष-<BR>वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, delighted, glad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहर्षण|प्रहर्षणं|प्रहर्षणः
प्र-हर्षण, अस्, ई, अम्, causing erection of the<BR>hair of the body, causing a thrill of joy; making<BR>glad, gladdening; delighting; delighted, happy;<BR>(अस्), m. the planet Mercury or its ruler [cf. प्र-<BR>हर्षुल]; (ई), f. turmeric, (a various reading<BR>for प्र-हर्षिणी); a kind of metre, four times<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">Page0652-a+ 76</a>]<BR>¯¯¯, ˘˘˘˘¯˘¯˘¯¯; (अम्), n. joy, delight;<BR>the act of making glad or rejoicing; the attainment<BR>of a desired object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0651-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहर्षित
प्र-हर्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, greatly delighted, de-<BR>lighted, very happy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहर्षिन्
प्र-हर्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ, causing gladness, gladden-<BR>ing; (इणी), f. turmeric [cf. प्र-हर्षणी]; a kind<BR>of metre, = प्र-हर्षणी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहर्षुल|प्रहर्षुलः
प्र-हर्षुल, अस्, m. the planet Mercury; [cf.<BR>प्र-हर्षण.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहृष्ट
प्र-हृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, exceedingly pleased,<BR>overjoyed, rejoiced, delighted, happy, joyful, glad.<BR>—प्रहृष्ट-मनस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, delighted at<BR>heart, rejoiced in mind, exceedingly glad.<BR>—प्र-<BR>हृष्ट-रूप, अस्, आ, अम्, of pleasing form; erect<BR>in form.<BR>—प्रहृष्ट-रोमन्, आ, m. ‘having brist-<BR>ling hair,’ N. of an Asura.<BR>—प्रहृष्टात्मन् (˚ट-<BR>आत्˚), आ, आ, अ, delighted in soul, rejoiced in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहृष्टक|प्रहृष्टकः
प्रहृष्टक, अस्, m. a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहेणक|प्रहेणकं
प्रहेणक प्र-हेणक, अम्, n. a kind of<BR>pastry; victuals or sweetmeats distributed at festivals;<BR>[cf. प्र-हेलक.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहेति
प्रहेति प्र-हेति, &c. See 1. प्र-हि, p. 651.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहेलक|प्रहेलकं|प्रहेलकः
प्रहेलक प्र-हेलक, अम्, n. (fr. rt. हिल् with<BR>प्र), a riddle, enigma; a kind of pastry; sweet-<BR>meats &c. distributed at festivals (= प्र-हेणक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहेला
प्र-हेला, f. playful dalliance, loose or free be-<BR>haviour; प्रहेलया, sportively, freely, without con-<BR>striant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहेलि|प्रहेलिः
प्र-हेलि, इस्, or प्रहेलिका, f. an enigma, riddle,<BR>puzzling or enigmatical question.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रहोष
प्रहोष प्र-होष, प्रहोषिन्. See p. 651,<BR>col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्राद|प्रह्रादः
प्रह्राद प्र-ह्राद, अस्, m. (fr. rt. ह्राद् with<BR>प्र), N. of the chief of the Asuras with the patro-<BR>nymic Kāyādhava (the father of Vi-rocana); N. of<BR>a son of Hiraṇya-kaśipu (he was an enemy of Indra<BR>and friend of Viṣṇu; cf. प्र-ह्लाद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्रादि
प्रह्रादि, अयस्, m. pl. the attendants of the<BR>Asura Pra-hrāda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्रास|प्रह्रासः
प्रह्रास प्र-ह्रास, अस्, m. (fr. rt. ह्रस् with<BR>प्र), shortening, decrease; languishing, fading away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्लाद्
प्रह्लाद् प्र-ह्लाद्, cl. 1. A. -ह्लादते, -ह्लादि-<BR>तुम्, to be delighted: Caus. -ह्लादयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to cause to rejoice, gladden, delight, exhilarate; to<BR>extinguish (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्लत्ति|प्रह्लत्तिः
प्र-ह्लत्ति, इस्, f. pleasure, happiness, joy; (less<BR>correctly for प्र-ह्लन्नि.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्लन्न|प्रह्लन्नः
प्र-ह्लन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, pleased, glad, happy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्लन्नि|प्रह्लन्निः
प्र-ह्लन्नि, इस्, f. pleasure, delight, happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्लाद|प्रह्लादः
प्र-ह्लाद, अस्, m. joyful excitement, pleasure,<BR>joy, happiness; sound, noise; N. of a pious Daitya<BR>(son of Hiraṇya-kaśipu; he was remarkable for his<BR>devotion to Viṣṇu, and was on this account perse-<BR>cuted by his father; he was made king of the<BR>Daityas by Viṣṇu, and was regent of one of the<BR>divisions of Pātāla, cf. प्र-ह्राद and see Viṣṇu-<BR>Purāṇa I. 17); N. of a Nāga; of a Prajā-pati;<BR>(आस्), m. pl., N. of a people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्लादक
प्र-ह्लादक, अस्, इका, अम्, causing joy or pleasure,<BR>refreshing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्लादन
प्र-ह्लादन, अस्, ई, अम्, causing joy or pleasure;<BR>(अस्), m., N. of a poet; (अम्), n. the act of causing<BR>joy or pleasure, refreshing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्लादयत्
प्र-ह्लादयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, causing to rejoice,<BR>gladdening, delighting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्लादित
प्र-ह्लादित, अस्, आ, अम्, rejoiced, delighted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्लादिन्
प्र-ह्लादिन्, ई, इनी, इ, causing joy, delighting;<BR>refreshing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्व|प्रह्वः
प्रह्व प्र-ह्व, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. ह्वृ with<BR>प्र), bent forwards, inclined, sloping, slanting;<BR>bent, bowed, stooping; bowing humbly, humble,<BR>modest; inclined towards, intent upon, devoted to,<BR>attached to, engrossed by, engaged in; (ई), f., N.<BR>of a Śakti.<BR>—प्रह्वाञ्जलि (˚व-अञ्˚), इस्, इस्, इ,<BR>stooping or bowing with the palms of the hands<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">Page0652-b+ 72</a>]<BR>joined and put to the forehead in token of respect.<BR>—प्रह्वी-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, bent forwards, bowed,<BR>bent; subjected, conquered, won.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्वण
प्र-ह्वण, अम्, n. bowing down in reverence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्वाण
प्र-ह्वाण, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. bent forwards, bent,<BR>bowed, stooping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्वल्
प्रह्वल् प्र-ह्वल्, cl. 1. P. -ह्वलति, -लितुम्,<BR>to stagger forwards, quake, tremble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्वलीका
प्रह्वलीका प्र-ह्वलीका, f. an incorrect form<BR>for प्र-वल्हिका, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्वे
प्रह्वे प्र-ह्वे, cl. 1. P. A. -ह्वयति, -ते,<BR>-ह्वातुम्, to call to, call upon, call, summon, invoke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रह्वाय|प्रह्वायः
प्र-ह्वाय, अस्, m. calling, summoning, invoking,<BR>invocation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रा
प्रा 1. प्रा [cf. rt. पॄ], cl. 2. P. प्राति,<BR>पप्रौ, प्रास्यति, अप्रासीत् (Ved. अप्रास्),<BR>प्रायात् or प्रेयात्, प्रातुम्, Ved. to fill: Pass. प्रा-<BR>यते, to be filled or full.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रा
2. प्रा, आस्, आस्, अम्, Ved. filling (at the end of<BR>comps.; cf. अन्तरिक्ष-प्रा, क्रतु-प्रा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राण|प्राणः
1. प्राण, अस्, आ, अम् (for 2. see under 1. प्राण्,<BR>p. 654, col. 3), filled, full, replete.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रात|प्रातं|प्रातः
प्रात, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. filled, full (Sāy. = पूर्ण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राति|प्रातिः
प्राति, इस्, f. filling; the span of the thumb and<BR>forefinger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रांशु|प्रांशुः
प्रांशु प्रांशु (प्र-अं˚), उस्, उस्, उ, high,<BR>tall, lofty, of great stature; long; (उस्), m., N. of<BR>a son of Manu Vaivasvata; of a son of Vatsa-prī<BR>(or Vatsa-prīti).<BR>—प्रांशु-ता, f. height, loftiness.<BR>—प्रांशु-लभ्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be obtained or<BR>reached (only) by a tall person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राक्
प्राक् प्राक्. See p. 653, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकट्य|प्राकट्यं
प्राकट्य प्राकट्य, अम्, n. publicity, mani-<BR>festation, notoriety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकर
प्राकर प्राकर, अस्, m., N. of a son of<BR>Dyuti-mat; (अम्), n., N. of the Varṣa called after<BR>Prākara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकरणिक
प्राकरणिक प्राकरणिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. प्र-<BR>करण), appertaining to the subject of discussion,<BR>belonging to a chapter, belonging to a class or genus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकर्ष
प्राकर्ष प्राकर्ष, अम्, n. (fr. प्र-कर्ष),<BR>N. of a Sāman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकर्षिक
प्राकर्षिक, अस्, ई, अम्, deserving preference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकषिक|प्राकषिकः
प्राकषिक प्राकषिक, अस्, m. (said to be<BR>fr. rt. कष् with प्र-आ), a dancer employed by a<BR>woman, one supported by another's wife; a catamite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकाम्य|प्राकाम्यं
प्राकाम्य प्राकाम्य, अम्, n. (fr. प्र-काम),<BR>freedom of will; wilfulness, following or obeying<BR>one's own will or inclination; irresistible will or fiat<BR>(one of the eight attributes of Śiva).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकार|प्राकारः
प्राकार प्रा-कार, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 1. कॄ and<BR>प्रा for प्र), an encircling wall, enclosure, fence,<BR>rampart (especially a surrounding wall elevated on<BR>a mound of earth).<BR>—प्राकार-कर्ण, अस्, m. ‘wall-<BR>ear,’ N. of a minister of the owl-king Ari-mardana.<BR>—प्राकार-भञ्जन, अस्, ई, अम्, breaking down<BR>ramparts.<BR>—प्राकारमर्दि, इस्, m. a patronymic<BR>from Prākāra-mardin.<BR>—प्राकार-मर्दिन्, ई, m.<BR>‘rampart-crusher,’ N. of a man.<BR>—प्राकार-स्थ, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, standing on a wall, stationed on a rampart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकारीय
प्राकारीय, अस्, आ, अम्, fit for a wall, of or be-<BR>longing to a wall; enclosed by a wall, walled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकारुक
प्राकारुक, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. 1. कॄ with प्र-आ?),<BR>Ved. scattering about (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकाश|प्राकाशः
प्राकाश प्राकाश, अस्, m. (fr. प्र-काश), Ved.<BR>a metallic mirror; (according to some commentators)<BR>a kind of ornament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकाश्य|प्राकाश्यं
प्राकाश्य, अम्, n. the being evident or manifest,<BR>publicity; celebrity, fame, renown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकृ
प्राकृ प्रा-कृ (प्र-आ-कृ), cl. 8. P. A. -क-<BR>रोति, -कुरुते, -कर्तुम्, Ved. to drive away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकृत|प्राकृतः
प्राकृत प्राकृत, अस्, आ or ई, अम् (fr. प्र-कृति),<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-c" target="_blank">Page0652-c+ 76</a>]<BR>original, natural, not artificial, essential, unchanged,<BR>unaltered, unmodified; normal, ordinary, usual, com-<BR>mon, uncultivated, unrefined, provincial, plebeian,<BR>vulgar; vernacular; (in the Sāṅkhya phil.) belong-<BR>ing to or derived from Prakṛti or the original ele-<BR>ment; (in astronomy) an epithet of one of the<BR>seven divisions of the planetary courses, (according<BR>to Parāśara comprising the Nakṣatras Svāti, Bha-<BR>raṇī, Rohiṇī, and Kṛttikā); प्राकृतो लयः or<BR>प्रलयः or प्रति-सञ्चरः, resolution or reabsorp-<BR>tion into Prakṛti or the original element, the disso-<BR>lution of the universe; (अस्), m. a low man, a man<BR>following a degraded profession; (अम्), n. any pro-<BR>vincial or vernacular dialect akin to Sanskrit, espe-<BR>cially spoken by the female characters and the<BR>inferior personages of plays.<BR>—प्राकृत-काम-<BR>धेनु, उस्, f., N. of a Prākṛt grammar.<BR>—प्राकृत-<BR>चन्द्रिका, f., N. of a Prākṛt grammar by Vara-ruci<BR>(= प्राकृत-प्रकाश); also of one by Vāmanā-<BR>cārya.<BR>—प्राकृत-ज्वर, अस्, m. common or usual<BR>fever (occurring from affections of the wind in the rainy<BR>season, of the bile in the autumn, and of the phlegm<BR>in the spring).<BR>—प्राकृत-त्व, अम्, n. original or<BR>natural state or condition.<BR>—प्राकृत-दीपिका, f., N.<BR>of a commentary on the Saṅkṣipta-sāra.<BR>—प्रा-<BR>कृत-पाद, अस्, m., N. of a Prākṛt grammar by<BR>Nārāyaṇa.<BR>—प्राकृत-पिङ्गल, अस् or अम्, m. or<BR>n. (?), Piṅgala's work on Prākṛt metres.<BR>—प्रा-<BR>कृत-प्रकाश, अस्, m., N. of a Prākṛt grammar<BR>by Vara-ruci (= प्राकृत-चन्द्रिका).<BR>—प्राकृत-<BR>प्रलय, अस्, m. the total dissolution of the world.<BR>—प्राकृत-भाषिन्, ई, इणी, इ, talking or speaking<BR>Prākṛt.<BR>—प्राकृत-मनोरमा, f., N. of Bhā-<BR>maha's commentary on the Prākṛta-prakāśa; (also<BR>called Mano-ramā.)<BR>—प्राकृत-मानुष, अस्, m.<BR>a common or ordinary man.<BR>—प्राकृत-मित्र, अम्,<BR>n. a natural friend or ally, a sovereign whose king-<BR>dom is separated by that of another from the country<BR>with which he is allied; [cf. प्राकृतारि, प्राकृतो-<BR>दासीन.]<BR>—प्राकृत-लक्षण, अम्, n., N. of a<BR>work ascribed to Pāṇini.<BR>—प्राकृत-लङ्केश्वर<BR>(˚का-ईश्˚), अस्, m. (?), N. of a Prākṛt grammar.<BR>—प्रा-<BR>कृत-शासन, अम्, n. a manual of the Prākṛt dia-<BR>lects.<BR>—प्राकृत-सर्वस्व, अम्, n., N. of a Prākṛt<BR>grammar by Mārkaṇḍeya-kavīndra.<BR>—प्राकृतारि<BR>(˚त-अरि), इस्, m. a natural enemy, a sovereign of an<BR>adjacent country (whose dominions intercept those of<BR>the Prākṛta-mitra, q. v.).<BR>—प्राकृतोदासीन (˚त-<BR>उद्˚), अस्, m. a natural neutral, a sovereign whose<BR>dominions are situated beyond those of the natural<BR>ally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकृतायन
प्राकृतायन, अस्, m. a patronymic from Pra-<BR>kṛta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राकृतिक|प्राकृतिकः
प्राकृतिक, अस्, ई, अम्, belonging or relating to<BR>Pra-kṛti or the original element, material, natural,<BR>illusory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राक्कर्मन्
प्राक्कर्मन् प्राक्-कर्मन्, &c. See p. 653.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राक्रियाकौमुद
प्राक्रियाकौमुद प्राक्रियाकौमुद, अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>belonging or relating to the Prakriyā-kaumudī, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राक्षालन
प्राक्षालन प्राक्षालन, an incorrect form<BR>for प्र-क्षालन, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राखर्य|प्राखर्यं|प्राखर्य्य|प्राखर्य्यं
प्राखर्य प्राखर्य, अम्, n. (fr. प्र-खर),<BR>sharpness; pungency; ardour; wickedness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रागद्य
प्रागद्य प्रागद्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. प्र-गदिन्),<BR>see Pāṇ. IV. 2, 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रागपम्
प्रागपम् प्राग्-अपम्, &c. See under प्राञ्च्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रागल्भ्य|प्रागल्भ्यं
प्रागल्भ्य प्रागल्भ्य, अम्, n. (fr. प्र-गल्-<BR>भ), boldness, confidence; resoluteness, determina-<BR>tion; pride, arrogance, effrontery; pomp, parade,<BR>rank; proficiency.<BR>—प्रागल्भ्य-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>possessed of confidence, bold; vain, proud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रागहि
प्रागहि प्रागहि, इस्, m., Ved., N. of a<BR>teacher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रागहीय
प्रागहीय, अस्, आ, अम्, belonging or referring to<BR>Prāgahi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रागाथ
प्रागाथ प्रागाथ, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. प्र-गाथ),<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0653-a" target="_blank">Page0653-a+ 68</a>]<BR>belonging to the Pragāthas, i. e. to the eighth<BR>Maṇḍala of the Ṛg-veda; (अस्), m. a patronymic<BR>of Kali; of Bharga; of Haryata.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0652-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रागाथिक
प्रागाथिक, अस्, आ, अम्, belonging to the eighth<BR>Maṇḍala of the Ṛg-veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0653-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रागार|प्रागारः
प्रागार प्रागार, अस् or अम्, m. or n. (?), a<BR>building, a house; a principal building (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0653-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रागाह्निक
प्रागाह्निक प्रागाह्निक. See under प्राञ्च्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0653-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राग्र|प्राग्रं
प्राग्र प्राग्र (प्र-अग्˚), अम्, n. the highest<BR>point, summit.<BR>—प्राग्र-सर, अस्, आ or ई, अम्, going<BR>at the head, foremost, first, best.<BR>—प्राग्र-हर, अस्,<BR>ई, अम्, taking the best share, chief, principal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0653-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राग्र्य|प्राग्र्यं
प्राग्र्य, अस्, आ, अम्, chief, principal, most excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0653-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राग्राट|प्राग्राटं|प्राग्राटः
प्राग्राट प्राग्राट, अम्, n. thin coagulated<BR>milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0653-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राघर्मसद्
प्राघर्मसद् प्राघर्म-सद्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. abid-<BR>ing in a region of light; (Sāy. = प्रकर्षेण<BR>दीप्त-स्थाने वर्तमानः.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0653-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राघात|प्राघातः
प्राघात प्राघात, अस्, m. war, battle; (in-<BR>correctly for प्र-घात.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0653-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राघार|प्राघारः
प्राघार प्राघार, अस्, m. (fr. rt. घृ with<BR>प्र), dropping, oozing, trickling out, aspersion or<BR>pouring out of any oily substance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0653-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राघुण|प्राघुणः
प्राघुण प्राघुण, अस्, m. a guest, a visitor,<BR>one demanding hospitality; [cf. प्राहुण.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0653-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राघुणक|प्राघुणकः
प्राघुणक or प्राघुणिक, अस्, m. = प्राघुण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0653-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राघूर्णक|प्राघूर्णकः
प्राघूर्णक or प्राघूर्णिक, अस्, m. various<BR>forms for प्राघुणक, प्राघुणिक above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0653-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राङ्ग|प्रांग|प्रांगं|प्राङ्गः
प्राङ्ग प्राङ्ग, अस्, m. a small kind of drum<BR>or tabor (= पणव).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0653-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राङ्गण|प्रांगण|प्रांगणं|प्राङ्गणं
