फाट्
फाट् फाट्, ind. an interjection of calling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0670-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फाटकी
फाटकी फाटकी, f. alum (= स्फाटी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0670-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फाणि|फाणिः
फाणि फाणि, इस्, f. (fr. rt. फण्), unrefined<BR>sugar, molasses; flour or meal mixed with curds (=<BR>करम्भ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0670-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फाणित|फाणितं
फाणित, अम्, n. (fr. Caus. of rt. फण्), the in-<BR>spissated juice of the sugar-cane, raw sugar; the<BR>inspissated juice of other plants; [cf. Arab. فانيذ<BR>Pers. پانيد medieval Lat. penidium.]<BR>—फा-<BR>णिती-भूत, अस्, आ, अम्, inspissated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0670-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फाण्ट|फांट|फाण्टं|फाण्टः
फाण्ट, अस्, आ, अम् (a contraction of फाणित),<BR>obtained by straining or filtering, readily or easily<BR>prepared, anything made by an easy process (as a<BR>decoction &c.); (अस्), m. an infusion, decoction,<BR>pounded medicinal substances mixed with four parts<BR>of hot water and filtered; (अम्), n. the first particles<BR>of butter that are produced by churning.<BR>—फाण्टा-<BR>हृत (˚ट-आह्˚), अस्, m., N. of a man; a patronymic<BR>from Phāṇṭāhṛti; (आस्), m. pl. the pupils of Phāṇ-<BR>ṭāhṛti.<BR>—फाण्टाहृतायन, अस्, m. a patronymic<BR>from Phāṇṭāhṛti.<BR>—फाण्टाहृति, इस्, m., N. of a<BR>man; see Pāṇ. IV. 1, 150.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0670-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फाण्टक|फांटकः|फाण्टकः
फाण्टक, अस्, m. an infusion, decoction (=<BR>फाण्ट).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0670-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फाण्ड|फांडं
फाण्ड, अम्, n. the belly (= फण्ड).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0670-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फाण्डिन्
फाण्डिन्, ई, m., N. of a serpent-demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0670-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फारि
फारि फारि, Ved. (Sāy.) = आयुध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0670-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फारिव
फारिव, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. (Sāy.) = आयुध-वत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0670-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फाल|फालं|फालः
फाल फाल. See col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0670-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फालखेला
फालखेला फालखेला, f. a quail; (also<BR>read फणिखेल, फलखेल or फलखेला.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0670-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फालित
फालित फालित, perhaps for फाणित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0670-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फालीकरण
