फाल्गुन|फाल्गुनः
फाल्गुन फाल्गुन, &c. See col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0670-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फि|फिः
