बलूल|बलूलः
बलूल, अस्, आ, अम्, powerful, strong, mighty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0676-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बल्य|बल्यं|बल्यः
बल्य, अस्, आ, अम्, powerful, strong, vigorous;<BR>strengthening, giving strength; (अस्), m. a Buddhist<BR>mendicant; (आ), f., N. of various plants, अति-बला,<BR>अश्व-गन्धा, प्र-सारिणी; (अम्), n. semen virile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0676-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलक्ष|बलक्षः
