बलखिन्
बलखिन् बलखिन्, ई, इनी, इ, coming from<BR>Balkh; [cf. तुरकिन्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

