बलङ्ग बलङ्ग and बलष and बलहष,<BR>N. of places.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलभ
बलभ बलभ, अस्, m. a poisonous insect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलाक|बलाकः
बलाक बलाक, अस्, आ, m. f. (more usually<BR>f.; said to be fr. rt. वल्, cf. वलाक), a crane, a kind<BR>of edible crane; (अस्), m., N. of a pupil of Śāka-<BR>pūrṇi; of a pupil of Jātūkarṇya; of a hunter; of a<BR>son of Pūru and grandson of Jahnu [cf. बलाकाश्व];<BR>of a son of Vatsa-prī; of a Rākṣasa; (आ), f. a mistress<BR>or loved woman; N. of a woman.<BR>—बलाका-कौशिक,<BR>अस्, m., N. of a preceptor.<BR>—बलाका-पङ्क्ति-हासिन्,<BR>ई, इनी, इ, smiling with rows of cranes.<BR>—बलाकाश्व<BR>(˚क-अश्˚), अस्, m., N. of a descendant of Jahnu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलाकिका
बलाकिका, f. a species of small crane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलाकिन्
बलाकिन्, ई, इनी, इ, abounding in cranes; (ई), m.,<BR>N. of one of the hundred sons of Dhṛta-rāṣṭra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलाङ्गक|बलांगक|बलाङ्गकः
बलाङ्गक बलाङ्गक, अस्, m. the spring<BR>season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलाञ्चिता|बलांचिता
बलाञ्चिता बलाञ्चिता, f. the lute of Rāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलात्कार|बलात्कारः
