बलासुर
बलासुर बलासुर, अस्, m., N. of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0676-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलाहक|बलाहकः
