मङ्खक, अस्, m., N. of a man (in Rāja-taraṅ-<BR>giṇī VIII. 3455).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0728-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्खना
