मष्
मष् मष् (connected with rt. 1. मुष्),<BR>cl. 1. P. मषति, मषितुम्, to kill,<BR>hurt, injure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0752-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मषराण
