मष्क्
मष्क् मष्क्. See rt. मस्क्, p. 753.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0752-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मष्णार
मष्णार मष्णार, N. of a tract of country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0752-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मष्मषा
मष्मषा मष्मषा, ind. (an onomatopo-<BR>etic word, also read मस्मसा).<BR>—मष्मषा-कृ,<BR>Ved. to reduce to dust, grind to powder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0752-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्
