मुरु
मुरु मुरु, उस्, m., N. of a country; N. of<BR>a Daitya slain by Kṛṣṇa [cf. मुर]; (said to be)<BR>a species of plant (in explanation of मौर्वी); a kind<BR>of iron.<BR>—मुरु-देश, अस्, m., N. of a country; [cf.<BR>मरु-देश.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0785-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

