लम्भ|लंभ|लंभः|लम्भः
लम्भ लम्भ, लम्भन, &c. See col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0862-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लय्
