लौमकीय (fr. लोमक), see Gaṇa Kṛśāśvādi<BR>to Pāṇ. IV. 2, 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0875-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौमन्य
लौमन्य (fr. लोमन्), see Gaṇa Saṅkāśādi to<BR>Pāṇ. IV. 2, 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0875-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौमशीय
लौमशीय (fr. लोमश), see Gaṇa Kṛśāśvādi<BR>to Pāṇ. IV. 2, 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0875-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौमहर्षणक
लौमहर्षणक, अस्, इका, अम्, composed by<BR>Loma-harṣaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0875-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौमहर्षणि
लौमहर्षणि, इस्, m. a patronymic from Loma-<BR>harṣaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0875-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौमायन
लौमायन (fr. लोमन्), see Gaṇa Pakṣādi to<BR>Pāṇ. IV. 2, 80; (आस्), m. pl. of the following.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0875-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

