लौमायन्य, अस्, m. a patronymic from Loman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0875-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौमि
लौमि, इस्, m. a patronymic from Loman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0875-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौलाह
