वक्रातप, आस्, m. pl., N. of a people, (also read<BR>चक्राति.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0876-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

