वक्रित
वक्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, curved, crooked, bent; entering<BR>on an apparently retrograde course (said of a planet).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0876-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्रिन्
वक्रिन्, ई, इणी, इ, crooked; retrograding, moving<BR>backwards (said of Mars and other planets); dis-<BR>honest, fraudulent; (ई), m. a Jaina or Bauddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0876-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्रिम
वक्रिम, अस्, आ, अम्, bent, curved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0876-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

