वल्क्
वल्क् वल्क्, cl. 10. P. वल्कयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0894-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्क|वल्कं|वल्कः
