विकृश्
विकृश् वि-कृश्, Caus. -कर्शयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>make thin, emaciate, attenuate; to distort, deform.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकृष्
विकृष् वि-कृष्, cl. 1. P. -कर्षति, cl. 6. P.<BR>A. -कृषति, -ते, -कर्ष्टुम् or -क्रष्टुम्, to draw<BR>asunder, tear asunder, drag apart, draw across, drag hither<BR>and thither, draw different ways, drag to and fro, drag<BR>excessively, drag along, drag after, draw away, draw<BR>out, pull out, extend, draw away from; to withdraw,<BR>deprive of, withhold, keep back; to destroy; to pull or<BR>drag or draw (in general); to draw a furrow, plough<BR>(cl. 6); to draw (a bow-string, cl. 1), bend (a bow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकर्ष|विकर्षः
वि-कर्ष, अस्, m. dragging or drawing asunder,<BR>pulling apart, pulling out; an arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकर्षण|विकर्षणं|विकर्षणः
वि-कर्षण, अस्, m. ‘the distractor,’ one of the<BR>five arrows of Kāmadeva; (अम्), n. the act of draw-<BR>ing asunder, pulling, drawing, dragging; the drawing<BR>(of a bow); the act of dragging or throwing across,<BR>a cross throw (in wrestling &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकर्षत्
वि-कर्षत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, dragging asunder or across.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकृष्ट|विकृष्टः
वि-कृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, dragged asunder, drawn<BR>asunder or apart; analyzed; dragged hither and<BR>thither; dragged excessively; drawn towards, attracted,<BR>dragged, drawn, pulled, drawn (as a bow-string); drawn<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">Page0910-c+ 79</a>]<BR>out, extended, protracted, long; sounded, making a<BR>noise (= शब्दायमान).<BR>—विकृष्ट-काल, अस्, m.<BR>a long period, (विकृष्ट-कालैस्, ind. for a long<BR>time or extended period.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकृष्य
वि-कृष्य, ind. having drawn or dragged asunder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकृष्यमाण
वि-कृष्यमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, being dragged asunder,<BR>being dragged or pulled about hither and thither.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकॄ
विकॄ वि-कॄ, cl. 6. P. -किरति, -करितुम् or<BR>-करीतुम्, to scatter in different directions, throw<BR>about, sprinkle, toss about, disperse; to spread about,<BR>expand, extend; to dissolve; to scatter over, over-<BR>whelm, cover, fill with; to tear asunder, split, rend;<BR>to revile; to contaminate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकिर|विकिरः
वि-किर, अस्, m. scattering, tearing, one who scat-<BR>ters or tears, a bird, a scattered portion or fallen<BR>fragment, anything dropped; a well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकिरण|विकिरणं|विकिरणः
वि-किरण, अम्, n. (according to Śabda-k. वि-<BR>कीरण), the act of scattering, throwing or spreading<BR>about, dispersing, tearing; spreading abroad; know-<BR>ledge, fame; (अस्), m. gigantic swallow wort, Calo-<BR>tropis Gigantea (= अर्क).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकिरत्
वि-किरत्, अन्, अती or अन्ती, अत्, scattering about,<BR>sprinkling, throwing in different directions, covering<BR>(with arrows &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकीर्ण|विकीर्णः
वि-कीर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, scattered or spread about,<BR>extended, diffused; celebrated, famous.<BR>—विकीर्ण-<BR>केश or विकीर्ण-मूर्धज, अस्, आ, अम्, having<BR>dishevelled hair.<BR>—विकीर्ण-रोमन्, अ, n. or विकीर्ण-<BR>सञ्ज्ञ, अम्, n. a sort of perfume (= स्थौणेय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकीर्य|विकीर्य्य
वि-कीर्य, ind. having scattered about, having<BR>spread in different directions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकीर्यमाण|विकीर्य्यमाण
वि-कीर्यमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, being scattered, being<BR>tossed about, being agitated, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकॢप्
विकॢप् वि-कॢप्, cl. 1. A. -कल्पते, -कल्पि-<BR>तुम्, to change or alternate with (with inst.); to be<BR>doubtful or questionable, be subject to doubt or alter-<BR>native, be optional or not decided: Caus. P. -कल्प-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to prepare or arrange or dispose differ-<BR>ently; to prescribe variously; to make, compose,<BR>form; to change or exchange with anything; to<BR>divide (Ved.); to weigh alternatives, admit anything<BR>as doubtful or optional; to choose one out of two<BR>alternatives (Ved.); to doubt, consider as doubtful,<BR>be doubtful about, consider with distrust; to consider<BR>possible, conjecture, presume; to reflect upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकल्प|विकल्पः
वि-कल्प, अस्, m. alternation, alternative, option;<BR>distinction; uncertainty, ambiguity; indecision, doubt,<BR>hesitation; error, mistake, ignorance; (in rhetoric)<BR>antithesis of opposites; (in grammar) admission of<BR>an option or alternative, the allowing a rule to be<BR>observed or not at pleasure; (आस्), m. pl., N. of a<BR>people, (also read विकल्य.)<BR>—विकल्प-जाल, a snare-<BR>like dilemma from which there is no escape.<BR>—विकल्-<BR>पोपहार (˚प-उप्˚), अस्, m. an optional offering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकल्पक
वि-कल्पक, at the end of an adj. comp. = वि-<BR>कल्प; [cf. निर्-व्˚, स-व्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकल्पन|विकल्पनं
वि-कल्पन, अम्, n. the giving or allowing an<BR>option or alternative, admitting of doubt or uncer-<BR>tainty; indecision; inconsideration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकल्पयत्
वि-कल्पयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, preparing or disposing<BR>differently, composing; exchanging with; weighing<BR>alternatives, deliberating, doubting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकल्पित
वि-कल्पित, अस्, आ, अम्, made optional, held to be<BR>optional; (in grammar) optionally enforced, applied<BR>or not at pleasure, (अ-विकल्पित, not subject to<BR>doubt, undoubted.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकल्पिन्
वि-कल्पिन्, ई, इनी, इ, possessing doubt or indecision,<BR>possessing an illusion, (नीलाशोक-विकल्पि-केश-नि-<BR>करः, having a mass of hair possessing the illusion<BR>of the dark Aśoka.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकेश
विकेश 1. वि-केश, अस्, ई, अम्, having loose or<BR>dishevelled hair; (ई), f. a woman with loose hair; a<BR>small braid or tress of hair first tied up separately and<BR>then collected into the Veṇī or larger braid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकेश
2. वि-केश, अस्, ई, अम्, hairless, without hair, bald;<BR>(अस्), m., N. of a Muni; (ई), f. a woman without<BR>hair; N. of the wife of Śiva manifested in the form<BR>of Mahī or the Earth (one of his eight Tanus or<BR>visible forms).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0910-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकेशिका
वि-केशिका, f. a piece of rag smeared with ghee or<BR>other substances and applied as a dressing to a sore,<BR>a kind of pledget.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकोक|विकोकः
विकोक वि-कोक, अस्, m. [cf. कोक], N. of an<BR>Asura (son of Vṛka and killed by Kalki).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकोष|विकोषः
विकोष वि-कोष or वि-कोश, अस्, आ, अम्, with-<BR>out a case or covering, without a husk, unsheathed<BR>(as a sword &c.), uncovered, denuded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकौतुक
विकौतुक वि-कौतुक, अस्, ई, अम्, having no<BR>desire or curiosity, incurious, indifferent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्क|विक्कः
विक्क विक्क, अस्, m. a young elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्त
विक्त विक्त. See under rt. विच्, p. 913, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रन्दित
विक्रन्दित वि-क्रन्दित, अस्, आ, अम् (see rt.<BR>क्रन्द्), crying or calling out, complaint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रम्
विक्रम् वि-क्रम्, cl. 1. P. A. -क्रामति, -क्र-<BR>मते, -क्रमितुम्, to step beyond, go beyond, pass<BR>beyond, to step on, go on, walk on, step aside, move<BR>or go aside, move away; to step or move apart (P.),<BR>become divided; to step over, stride over, step<BR>through, stride or stalk through, go through; to ad-<BR>vance, proceed, walk, pass, go; to attack, fight against,<BR>show valour or prowess (P.); to rise to or towards:<BR>Caus. P. -क्रमयति, -यितुम्, to cause to step or<BR>stride over or through.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रम|विक्रमः
वि-क्रम, अस्, m. stepping or going beyond, step-<BR>ping or striding over; a step, stride, pace [cf. त्रि-व्˚];<BR>going, proceeding, walking; overpowering, overcom-<BR>ing; heroism, prowess, heroic valour, great power or<BR>strength; strength in general, (विक्रमं कृ, to dis-<BR>play prowess, use one's strength); N. of a king, (see<BR>विक्रमादित्य); N. of Viṣṇu; of a city; of the forty-<BR>eighth year of Jupiter's cycle.<BR>—विक्रम-कर्मन्, अ,<BR>n. an act of prowess, feat of valour.<BR>—विक्रम-केश-<BR>रिन्, ई, m. ‘valour-lion,’ N. of king Vikramāditya.<BR>—विक्रम-चरित or विक्रम-चरित्र, अम्, n.<BR>‘Vikrama's acts,’ N. of thirty-two stories (describ-<BR>ing the acts of Vikramāditya).<BR>—विक्रम-बाहु,<BR>उस्, m., N. of a king.<BR>—विक्रम-सिंह or विक्रम-<BR>सेन, अस्, m., N. of king Vikramāditya.<BR>—विक्रम-<BR>हीन, अस्, आ, अम्, destitute of valour, wanting in<BR>courage.<BR>—विक्रमादित्य (˚म-आद्˚), अस्, m. ‘valour-<BR>sun,’ N. of a celebrated Hindū king (of Ujjayinī or<BR>Oujein and founder of the era called Saṃvat [see<BR>संवत्], which begins 57 B. C.; he is said to have<BR>driven out the Śakas or Scythians and to have esta-<BR>blished his dominion over almost the whole of<BR>Northern India; he was one of the wisest of Hindū<BR>kings and a great patron of literature; nine cele-<BR>brated men of letters flourished at his court [see<BR>नव-रत्न], and innumerable legends are related<BR>of him [cf. विक्रम-चरित, सिंहासन-द्वात्रिंशत्-<BR>पुत्रिका-वार्त्ता] all teeming with exaggerations and<BR>absurdities; according to some he fell in a battle<BR>with his rival Śāli-vāhana, king of the south country<BR>or Deccan, and the legendary date given for his death<BR>is Kali Yuga 3044; there are, however, other kings<BR>called Vikramāditya, and the name has been applied<BR>to king Bhoja and even to Śāli-vāhana).<BR>—विक्र-<BR>मादित्य-कोष, N. of a work.<BR>—विक्रमार्क<BR>(˚म-अर्˚), अस्, m., N. of king Vikramāditya.<BR>—वि-<BR>क्रमार्जित (˚म-अर्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, acquired or con-<BR>quered by valour.<BR>—विक्रमोर्वशी (˚म-उर्˚), f.<BR>‘valour-[won] Urvaśī,’ N. of one of the three cele-<BR>brated dramas of Kālidāsa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रमण|विक्रमणं
वि-क्रमण, अस्, m., Ved. a step, pace, stride;<BR>the stride of Viṣṇu, (see त्रि-विक्रम.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रमणीय
वि-क्रमणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be stepped on, to<BR>be overcome or overpowered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रममाण
वि-क्रममाण, अस्, आ, अम्, stepping or passing<BR>beyond, traversing, proceeding; striding along, taking<BR>giant steps; displaying strength, overpowering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रमिन्
विक्रमिन्, ई, इणी, इ, displaying valour or prowess,<BR>powerful, courageous, strong; chivalrous, gallant, ag-<BR>gressive; (ई), m. a hero; a lion; N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रान्त|विक्रांत|विक्रान्तं|विक्रान्तः
वि-क्रान्त, अस्, आ, अम्, stepped or passed beyond;<BR>valiant, mighty, victorious, overcoming; (अस्), m. a<BR>hero, warrior; a lion; N. of a Prajā-pati; (अम्), n.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">Page0911-b+ 75</a>]<BR>a step, stride; valour, prowess, military achievement;<BR>the jewel called वैक्रान्त.<BR>—विक्रान्त-गति, इस्, m.<BR>a man with a portly gait.<BR>—विक्रान्त-भीम, N.<BR>of a drama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रान्ति|विक्रांति|विक्रांतिः|विक्रान्तिः
वि-क्रान्ति, इस्, f. stepping on, striding; a horse's<BR>canter or gallop; heroism, valour, power, prowess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रान्तृ|विक्रांतृ
वि-क्रान्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, displaying prowess, valiant;<BR>victorious; (ता), m. a hero, victor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रामत्
वि-क्रामत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, stepping beyond or<BR>aside, striding on, passing beyond; stalking; dis-<BR>playing valour or strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचक्रमाण
वि-चक्रमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. striding, traversing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रय|विक्रयं|विक्रयः
विक्रय वि-क्रय. See below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रस्र|विक्रस्रः
विक्रस्र वि-क्रस्र = वि-कुस्र, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रान्ति|विक्रांति|विक्रांतिः|विक्रान्तिः
विक्रान्ति वि-क्रान्ति. See above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रिया
विक्रिया वि-क्रिया. See p. 910, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्री
विक्री वि-क्री, cl. 9. A. -क्रीणीते, -क्रेतुम्, to<BR>buy and sell, barter, trade (Ved.); to sell, vend; to<BR>sell or exchange for (with inst., e. g. गवां सह-<BR>स्रेण विक्रीणे, I sell for a thousand cows): Desid. A.<BR>-चिक्रीषते, to wish to sell, to desire to sell or ex-<BR>change for (with inst.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रय|विक्रयं|विक्रयः
वि-क्रय, अस्, m. sale, selling, vending.<BR>—विक्र-<BR>य-पत्त्र, अम्, n. a bill of sale.<BR>—विक्रयानुशय<BR>(˚य-अन्˚), अस्, m. rescission of sale.<BR>—विक्रयार्थम्<BR>(˚य-अर्˚), ind. for sale.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रयण|विक्रयणं
वि-क्रयण, अम्, n. the act of selling, vending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रयिक|विक्रयिकः
विक्रयिक, अस्, आ, अम्, one who sells, selling;<BR>(अस्), m. a vender, salesman, dealer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रयिन्
विक्रयिन्, ई, m. a seller, vender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रायक|विक्रायकः
वि-क्रायक or वि-क्रायिक, अस्, m. a vender, seller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रीत|विक्रीतः
वि-क्रीत, अस्, आ, अम्, sold; (अस्), m., N. of a<BR>Prajā-pati; (अम्), n. sale.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रीय
वि-क्रीय, ind. having sold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रेतृ
वि-क्रेतृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who sells, a vender,<BR>seller, selling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रेय|विक्रेयं
वि-क्रेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be sold, saleable, vendible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रीड्
विक्रीड् वि-क्रीड्, cl. 1. P. -क्रीडति, -क्रीडितुम्,<BR>to play with, to make a plaything of (with acc.); to<BR>sport.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रीडित
वि-क्रीडित, अस्, आ, अम्, played with, played; (अम्),<BR>n. play, sport.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रुश्
विक्रुश् वि-क्रुश्, cl. 1. P. -क्रोशति, -क्रोष्टुम्,<BR>to cry out, exclaim; to raise a cry; to sound; to<BR>invoke any one (acc.); to revile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रुश्य
वि-क्रुश्य, ind. having screamed, bawling, crying out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रुष्ट|विक्रुष्टं
वि-क्रुष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, called out, cried out, ex-<BR>claimed; harsh, abusive, cruel, unkind (as speech);<BR>(अम्), n. a cry of alarm or for help; abuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रोशत्
वि-क्रोशत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, crying out, bawling,<BR>screaming, shrieking; reviling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रोशन|विक्रोशनं
वि-क्रोशन, अम्, n. the act of calling out; abas-<BR>ing, reviling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रोशमान
वि-क्रोशमान, अस्, आ, अम्, crying aloud, screaming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रोष्टृ
वि-क्रोष्टृ, टा, ट्री, टृ, one who calls or cries<BR>out, calling out; a reviler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्लम्
विक्लम् वि-क्लम्, cl. 1. 4. P. -क्लामति, -क्लाम्-<BR>यति, -क्लमितुम्, to become faint or weak or weary;<BR>to be dispirited or dejected, lose heart, despond,<BR>despair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्लान्त
वि-क्लान्त, अस्, आ, अम्, dispirited, fatigued, wearied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्लव्
विक्लव् वि-क्लव्, cl. 1. A. -क्लवते, -क्लवितुम्,<BR>to become agitated or confused, to feel alarm, fear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्लव|विक्लवः
वि-क्लव, अस्, आ, अम् (according to some fr. rt.<BR>क्लु with वि), overcome with fear or agitation, con-<BR>fused, agitated, bewildered, confounded; excited,<BR>alarmed; disgusted.<BR>—विक्लव-ता, f. or विक्लव-त्व,<BR>अम्, n. agitation, confusion; alarm, fear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्लिद्
विक्लिद् वि-क्लिद्, cl. 4. P. -क्लिद्यति, &c., to<BR>become very wet or moist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्लिन्न|विक्लिन्नः
वि-क्लिन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, very wet or moist,<BR>thoroughly wetted; decayed, shrivelled, withered;<BR>old.<BR>—विक्लिन्न-हृदय, अस्, आ, अम्, ‘moist-hearted,’<BR>tender-hearted, one whose heart is easily moved<BR>with pity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्लेद|विक्लेदः
वि-क्लेद, अस्, m. moistening or wetting thoroughly,<BR>dissolution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्लिष्ट
विक्लिष्ट वि-क्लिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम् (see rt. क्लिश्),<BR>excessively afflicted or distressed, much hurt or in-<BR>jured, destroyed; (अम्), n. a fault in pronunciation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्लेश|विक्लेशः
वि-क्लेश, अस्, m. ‘indistinctness,’ an incorrect pro-<BR>nunciation of the dentals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षणम्
विक्षणम् वि-क्षणम्, ind. momentarily,<BR>for a moment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षन्
विक्षन् वि-क्षन् or वि-क्षण्, cl. 8. P. -क्ष-<BR>णोति, -क्षणितुम्, to wound or hurt severely, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षत|विक्षतः
वि-क्षत, अस्, आ, अम्, excessively wounded or hurt,<BR>torn asunder, struck about; (अम्), n. wounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षर्
विक्षर् वि-क्षर्, cl. 1. P. -क्षरति, -क्ष-<BR>रितुम्, to flow away, flow into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षल्
विक्षल् वि-क्षल्, cl. 10. P. -क्षालयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to wash off, wash away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षालित
वि-क्षालित, अस्, आ, अम्, washed off; bathed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षाव|विक्षावः
विक्षाव वि-क्षाव, अस्, m. (see rt. क्षु),<BR>sneezing, cough; a sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षि
विक्षि वि-क्षि, Caus. -क्षययति, -क्षप-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, Ved. to waste, destroy completely, ruin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षीण
वि-क्षीण, अस्, आ, अम्, completely destroyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षीणक|विक्षीणकः
वि-क्षीणक, अस्, m. a destroyer; N. of the chief<BR>of a class of demigods attendant on Śiva (described<BR>as the ministers of destruction by pestilential diseases<BR>&c.); a meeting or assembly of the gods; a place<BR>prohibited to eaters of meat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षिप्
विक्षिप् वि-क्षिप्, cl. 6. P. A. -क्षिपति, -ते,<BR>-क्षेप्तुम्, to throw apart or asunder, throw hither<BR>and thither; to throw away or about, send hither and<BR>thither, disperse, scatter, distribute; to extend, stretch<BR>out; to let loose a bow-string, to shoot off; to cast,<BR>throw; to cast off or aside, discard; to reject, refute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षिपत्
वि-क्षिपत्, अन्, अती or अन्ती, अत्, throwing apart,<BR>throwing away, throwing about, tossing; scattering;<BR>agitating; pulling, twitching, twanging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षिप्त|विक्षिप्तः
वि-क्षिप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, thrown apart or asunder,<BR>thrown about, cast; scattered, dispersed; discarded;<BR>sent, dispatched; agitated, bewildered, perplexed;<BR>refuted, falsified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षिप्य
वि-क्षिप्य, ind. having thrown apart or aside,<BR>having cast off or discarded; having stretched out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षिप्यमाण
वि-क्षिप्यमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, being thrown or<BR>hurled off, being thrown out, being foiled, disgraced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षेप|विक्षेपः
वि-क्षेप, अस्, m. the act of throwing apart or<BR>asunder, (चरण-व्˚, throwing asunder of the feet,<BR>striding with the legs apart); throwing away, cast-<BR>ing, throwing, projection (see विक्षेप-शक्ति);<BR>sending, dispatching; scattering; confusion, per-<BR>plexity, alarm, fear; looking about vaguely or wildly;<BR>refuting an argument; celestial or polar latitude.<BR>—विक्षेप-ध्रुव, अस्, m. (in astronomy) the<BR>greatest inclination of a planet's orbit.<BR>—विक्षेप-<BR>शक्ति, इस्, f. the power of Māyā, the projective power<BR>of ignorance (according to the Vedānta phil.) or that<BR>power of projection which raises up on the soul en-<BR>veloped by it the appearance of an external world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षेपण|विक्षेपणं
वि-क्षेपण, अम्, n. the act of throwing asunder<BR>or away, throwing; scattering, dispersing; sending,<BR>dispatching; confusion proceeding from error.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षीर|विक्षीरः
विक्षीर वि-क्षीर, अस्, m. the tree Calotro-<BR>pis Gigantea.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षुद्
विक्षुद् वि-क्षुद्, cl. 7. P. A. -क्षुणत्ति,<BR>-क्षुन्त्ते, -क्षोत्तुम्, to pound to pieces, bruise,<BR>crush, comminute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षुण्ण
वि-क्षुण्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, pounded or ground to<BR>pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षुध्
विक्षुध् वि-क्षुध्, cl. 4. P. -क्षुध्यति,<BR>-क्षोद्धुम्, to be hungry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षुभ्
विक्षुभ् वि-क्षुभ्, cl. 1. A., 4. 9. P.<BR>-क्षोभते, -क्षुभ्यति, -क्षुभ्नाति, -क्षोभि-<BR>तुम्, to be shaken about or agitated or tossed about,<BR>to become greatly disturbed or moved, to be dis-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">Page0912-a+ 72</a>]<BR>ordered; to confuse, disturb (cl. 9): Caus. -क्षोभ-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to cause to move or shake, agitate, excite,<BR>disturb, confuse, throw into disorder (as an army).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0911-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षोभ|विक्षोभः
वि-क्षोभ, अस्, m. shaking, agitating, agitation,<BR>confusion, conflict, struggle, trepidation, alarm, panic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षोभित
वि-क्षोभित, अस्, आ, अम्, shaken about, agitated,<BR>tossed about, scattered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षोभ्य
वि-क्षोभ्य, ind. having agitated or disturbed,<BR>disturbing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विख|विखः
विख विख, अस्, आ, अम्, noseless; [cf. विखु,<BR>विख्य, विख्र, विख्रु, विग्र.]<BR>—विख-नस्, आस्,<BR>m. epithet of Brahmā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विखण्ड्
विखण्ड् वि-खण्ड्, cl. 10. P. -खण्डयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to break into fragments, break up, cut. or<BR>divide into pieces; to cleave or tear asunder, dis-<BR>member; to scatter, disturb, trouble; to interrupt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विखण्डित|विखंडित
वि-खण्डित, अस्, आ, अम्, broken up, cut into<BR>pieces, divided; torn apart or asunder, cleft in two;<BR>refuted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विखन्
विखन् वि-खन्, cl. 1. P. A. -खनति, -ते,<BR>-खनितुम्, to dig up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विखानस|विखानसः
