विखासा
विखासा विखासा, f. the tongue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विखिद्
विखिद् वि-खिद्, cl. 6. P. -खिन्दति, -खेत्-<BR>तुम्, Ved. to strike or tear asunder, rend apart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विखु|विखुः
विखु विखु, उस्, उस्, उ, noseless; [cf. विख.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विख्य|विख्यः
