विखुर|विखुरः
विखुर वि-खुर, अस्, m. ‘hoofless,’ a goblin,<BR>demon, Rākṣasa; a thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विख्या
विख्या वि-ख्या, cl. 2. P. -ख्याति, -ख्यातुम्,<BR>to look about, look at, view, see; to shine; to make<BR>visible, illuminate; to celebrate; to call, name:<BR>Caus. -ख्यापयति, -यितुम्, to make visible; to<BR>make known, communicate, announce, declare, pro-<BR>claim, promulgate, publish abroad, celebrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विख्यात|विख्यातः
वि-ख्यात, अस्, आ, अम्, generally known, notorious,<BR>renowned, famous, celebrated; known as, called,<BR>named; avowed, confessed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विख्याति|विख्यातिः
वि-ख्याति, इस्, f. fame, celebrity, notoriety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विख्यापन|विख्यापनं
वि-ख्यापन, अम्, n. making known, declaring,<BR>announcing, publishing; explanation, exposition;<BR>avowing, acknowledging, confessing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विख्र|विख्रः
विख्र विख्र, अस्, आ, अम्, noseless; [cf.<BR>विख.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विख्रु|विख्रुः
विख्रु, उस्, उस्, उ, = विख्र, noseless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगण्
