विगणय्य
वि-गणय्य, ind. having reckoned; having de-<BR>liberated or weighed; not having considered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगणित
वि-गणित, अस्, आ, अम्, reckoned, calculated; con-<BR>sidered, weighed; reckoned off, discharged (as a<BR>debt).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगद्
विगद् वि-गद्, cl. 1. P. -गदति, -गदितुम्,<BR>to talk about, speak about, repeat, spread a report.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगद
वि-गद, Ved. talking or sounding variously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगदित
वि-गदित, अस्, आ, अम्, talked about, spoken about,<BR>spread abroad (as a report).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

