विगाह्
विगाह् वि-गाह्, cl. 1. A. -गाहते, -गाहितुम्,<BR>गाढुम्, to plunge or dive into (with acc. or loc.),<BR>bathe in; to agitate or stir about, disturb; to enter<BR>into or engage upon; to enter, penetrate, advance<BR>into, pervade; to come on, set in (as a season, the<BR>night, &c.): Pass. -गाह्यते, to be plunged into or<BR>penetrated, to be entered into or engaged upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगाढ|विगाढः
