वि-गाह्य, ind. having plunged into, having bathed,<BR>having entered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगाह्यमान
वि-गाह्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being plunged into,<BR>being agitated, being entered or penetrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगुण|विगुणः
