विगूढ|विगूढः
विगूढ वि-गूढ, अस्, आ, अम् (see rt. 1. गुह्),<BR>concealed, hidden; blamed, reproached, censured.<BR>—विगूढ-चारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, proceeding or acting<BR>secretly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगै
विगै वि-गै, cl. 1. P. -गायति, -गातुम्, to<BR>sing variously, sing discordantly or badly; to decry,<BR>abuse, reproach, blame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगान|विगानं
वि-गान, अम्, n. singing discordantly, defamation,<BR>ill report, detraction, scandal; censure, reproach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगीत
वि-गीत, अस्, आ, अम्, sung or said variously; badly<BR>sung; decried, abused, reproached; contradicted,<BR>contradictory, inconsistent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

