विग्रथित
वि-ग्रथित, अस्, आ, अम्, connected; containing<BR>knots; having tubercles; clotted; bound up, hin-<BR>dered, obstructed, impeded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विग्रह्
विग्रह् वि-ग्रह् (see rt. ग्रह्), cl. 9. P. A.<BR>-गृह्णाति, -गृह्णीते (Ved. -गृभ्णाति, -गृभ्णीते),<BR>-ग्रहीतुम्, to stretch out or apart, spread out; to hold<BR>apart, keep separate, distribute into parts, divide, dis-<BR>solve, resolve, separate (anything into its constituent<BR>elements), isolate; to quarrel, fight, war, wage war,<BR>wage war against (with acc.); to assault, seize, lay<BR>hold of, take up; to receive in a friendly manner,<BR>welcome; to perceive, observe: Caus. -ग्राहयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to cause to fight, cause to wage war against:<BR>Desid. -जिघृक्षति, to wish to fight against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगृहीत
वि-गृहीत, अस्, आ, अम्, stretched out or apart,<BR>separated, divided, dissolved; isolated; opposed;<BR>encountered (as in fight), warred against; obstructed;<BR>seized, taken up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगृह्य
वि-गृह्य, ind. having stretched out or apart,<BR>having warred against or contended with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगृह्यमाण
वि-गृह्यमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, being warred upon<BR>or contended with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विग्रह|विग्रहः
वि-ग्रह, अस्, m. stretching out or apart, extension,<BR>expansion; shape, form, figure; the body; (in gram-<BR>mar) separation, resolution, analysis, resolution of a<BR>compound word into its constituent parts, the separa-<BR>tion or analysis of any word capable of separation,<BR>(such words are Kṛdantas, Taddhitas, all Samāsas<BR>or compound words, Ekaśeṣas, and all derivative<BR>verbs like desideratives &c.; the only words incapable<BR>of resolution being the simple verb, the singular of the<BR>noun, and a few indeclinables not derived from roots;<BR>all compounds being called नित्य or ‘fixed,’ when<BR>their meaning cannot be ascertained through an<BR>analysis of their component parts; cf. जमद्-अग्नि);<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">Page0913-a+ 77</a>]<BR>a division, part, portion; (अस्, अम्), m. n. opposi-<BR>tion, encounter, quarrel, combat, strife, war, battle;<BR>conflict (of the planets); disfavour.<BR>—विग्रह-पर,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, intent on war, engaged in fighting.<BR>—वि-<BR>ग्रह-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having form or figure, em-<BR>bodied, incarnate; having a handsome form or shape,<BR>fine, beautiful.<BR>—विग्रहावर (˚ह-अव्˚), अम्, n.<BR>‘the posterior of the body,’ the back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0912-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विग्राह्य
1. वि-ग्राह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be warred upon or<BR>contended with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विग्राह्य
2. वि-ग्राह्य, ind. having caused to wage war or<BR>fight with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजिग्राहयिषु
वि-जिग्राहयिषु, उस्, उस्, उ (fr. Desid. of Caus.),<BR>wishing to cause to fight or wage war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजिघृक्षु
वि-जिघृक्षु, उस्, उस्, उ (fr. Desid.), wishing to<BR>make war or fight with, determined to encounter or<BR>oppose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विग्रीव
विग्रीव वि-ग्रीव, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. having the<BR>neck or head cut off, decapitated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विग्लै
विग्लै वि-ग्लै, Caus. -ग्लापयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>make distressed, afflict, grieve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघट्
विघट् वि-घट् [cf. वि-घट्ट् below], cl. 1. A.<BR>-घटते, -घटितुम्, to become separate, crumble<BR>away, fly apart, burst, disperse; to be broken or<BR>interrupted; to be destroyed: Caus. -घटयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to tear apart, separate, disperse; to remove,<BR>displace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघटन|विघटनं
वि-घटन, अम्, n. breaking up, destruction,<BR>ruin, misfortune.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघटिका
वि-घटिका, f. a particular measure of time, the<BR>sixtieth part of a Ghaṭikā or Gharī, equal to twenty-<BR>four seconds (= पल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघटित
वि-घटित, अस्, आ, अम्, separated, divided, severed;<BR>[cf. वि-घट्टित.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघट्ट्
विघट्ट् वि-घट्ट्, cl. 1. A., 10. P. -घट्टते,<BR>-घट्टयति, -घट्टितुम्, -घट्टयितुम्, to strike<BR>or force asunder, break asunder, burst open, open (a<BR>door &c.); to separate, disperse; to strike, shake,<BR>rub against, touch; to break (an agreement), violate,<BR>betray.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघट्टन|विघट्टनं
वि-घट्टन, अम्, आ, n. f. striking asunder, forc-<BR>ing apart; opening, separating, undoing, untying;<BR>striking, rubbing, friction; hurting, offending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघट्टित|विघट्टितं
वि-घट्टित, अस्, आ, अम्, struck apart, severed,<BR>dispersed, opened, disclosed, untied, undone; struck,<BR>rubbed, touched; excessively shaken, churned; hurt,<BR>offended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघट्टिन्
वि-घट्टिन्, ई, इनी, इ, striking apart, striking,<BR>touching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघन|विघनः
विघन 1. वि-घन, अस्, आ, अम्, cloudless,<BR>destitute of clouds.<BR>—विघनेन्दु (˚न-इन्˚), उस्, m.<BR>a cloudless moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघन|विघनः
विघन 2. वि-घन, अस्, m. (fr. वि-हन्), an<BR>implement for striking, a mallet, hammer; one who<BR>destroys or overpowers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघनिन्
वि-घनिन्, ई, इनी, इ, Ved. slaying, killing; (ई),<BR>m. one who slays, a slayer, destroyer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघात|विघातः
वि-घात, अस्, m. destruction, killing; a blow;<BR>opposition, prohibition, prevention, impediment,<BR>obstacle; abandoning.<BR>—विघात-सिद्धि, इस्, f. the<BR>settling or removal of obstacles or impediments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघातिन्
वि-घातिन्, ई, इनी, इ, slaying, killing, wounding,<BR>destroying; removing; opposing, impeding, pre-<BR>venting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्न|विघ्नः
वि-घ्न, अस्, m. (occasionally also अम्, n.), obstacle,<BR>impediment, hindrance, obstruction, interruption, pre-<BR>vention, opposition; any difficulty or trouble; the Ca-<BR>ronda or Carissa Carondas.<BR>—विघ्न-कर, अस्, ई,<BR>अम्, causing any obstacle or interruption, opposing,<BR>impeding, obstructing.<BR>—विघ्न-कर्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ,<BR>causing obstacles.<BR>—विघ्न-कारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, causing<BR>obstacles, impeding, obstructing; fearful, formidable,<BR>terrible.<BR>—विघ्न-ध्वंस, अस्, m. the removal of<BR>obstacles.<BR>—विघ्न-नायक, अस्, m. ‘obstacle-chief,’<BR>an epithet of Gaṇeśa, (this deity being supposed<BR>capable of causing or removing difficulties and being<BR>therefore worshipped at the commencement of any<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">Page0913-b+ 75</a>]<BR>undertaking.)<BR>—विघ्न-नाशक, अस्, आ, अम्, who or<BR>what removes obstacles or difficulties; (अस्), m. an<BR>epithet of Gaṇeśa.<BR>—विघ्न-नाशन, अम्, n. the<BR>destruction or removal of obstacles; (अस्), m. an<BR>epithet of Gaṇeśa.<BR>—विघ्न-प्रतिक्रिया, f. the<BR>counteraction or removal of an impediment.<BR>—वि-<BR>घ्न-राज, अस्, m. ‘obstacle-king,’ epithet of Gaṇeśa.<BR>—विघ्न-लेश, अस्, m. a slight obstacle or impedi-<BR>ment.<BR>—विघ्न-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, having obstacles,<BR>obstructed by difficulties or impediments.<BR>—विघ्न-<BR>विघात, अस्, m. the removal of obstacles.<BR>—विघ्न-<BR>विनायक, अस्, m. ‘obstacle-remover,’ epithet of Ga-<BR>ṇeśa.<BR>—विघ्न-सिद्धि, इस्, f. the settling or removal<BR>of obstacles.<BR>—विघ्न-हन्तृ, ता, m. a remover or<BR>destroyer of obstacles.<BR>—विघ्न-हारिन्, ई, इणी, इ,<BR>removing obstacles; (ई), m. an epithet of Gaṇeśa.<BR>—विघ्नेश or विघ्नेशान or विघ्नेश्वर (˚न-<BR>ईश्˚), अस्, m. ‘obstacle-lord,’ epithet of Gaṇeśa.<BR>—वि-<BR>घ्नेश-वाहन, अस्, m. the vehicle of Gaṇeśa, a rat.<BR>—विघ्नेशान-कान्ता (˚न-ईश्˚), f. ‘loved by Ga-<BR>ṇeśa,’ a kind of white Dūrvā grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्नक
विघ्नक (at the end of comps.) = वि-घ्न,<BR>preventing, hindering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्नय
विघ्नय, Nom. P. विघ्नयति, -यितुम्, to im-<BR>pede, check, obstruct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्नित|विघ्नितः
विघ्नित, अस्, आ, अम्, impeded, stopped, prevented,<BR>obstructed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघस|विघसं|विघसः
विघस वि-घस, अस्, m. (see rt. घस्), the<BR>residue of an oblation of food (offered to the gods,<BR>to the Manes, to a guest, or to a spiritual preceptor);<BR>food in general; (अम्), n. bee's-wax.<BR>—विघसाश<BR>(˚स-आश), अस्, or विघसाशिन्, ई, m. one who eats<BR>the remains of an offering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघात|विघातः
विघात वि-घात, &c. See col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघुष्
विघुष् वि-घुष्, cl. 1. P. -घोषति, -घो-<BR>षितुम्, to cry or proclaim aloud; to sound, re-<BR>sound; to fill with noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघुष्ट
वि-घुष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, cried out, proclaimed<BR>loudly, cried; made to resound, resounding, reso-<BR>nant, vocal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघुष्य
वि-घुष्य, ind. having proclaimed aloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघोषण
वि-घोषण, अम्, n. the act of proclaiming aloud,<BR>proclamation, crying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघूर्ण्
विघूर्ण् वि-घूर्ण्, cl. 1. P. A. -घूर्णति, -ते,<BR>-घूर्णितुम्, to roll about, whirl about, shake about,<BR>be agitated; to roll (the eyes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघूर्णत्
वि-घूर्णत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, rolling about, shaking;<BR>rolling (the eyes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघूर्णित
वि-घूर्णित, अस्, आ, अम्, rolled or shaken about;<BR>rolled (as the eyes); rolling, shaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघृत
विघृत वि-घृत, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. destitute<BR>of moisture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघृष्ट
विघृष्ट वि-घृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, excessively<BR>rubbed or ground; rubbed; sore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्न|विघ्नः
विघ्न वि-घ्न. See col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्रा
विघ्रा वि-घ्रा, cl. 1. P. -जिघ्रति, -घ्रातुम्,<BR>to smell or scent out, find out by smelling, perceive,<BR>discover; to smell at, smell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विङ्ख|विंख|विंखः|विङ्खः
विङ्ख विङ्ख, अस्, m. a horse's hoof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विच्
विच् विच्, cl. 7. 3. P. A. विनक्ति (1st<BR>sing. विनच्मि, 2nd sing. विनक्षि, 3rd<BR>pl. विञ्चन्ति), विङ्क्ते, वेवेक्ति (3rd du. विविक्तस्,<BR>Ṛg-veda VIII. 12, 24), वेविक्ते (?), विवेच, विविचे,<BR>वेक्ष्यति, -ते, अविचत्, अवैक्षीत्, अविक्त, वेक्तुम्,<BR>to divide, separate, sever; to remove from, deprive<BR>of (with inst.); to discriminate, discern, judge: Pass.<BR>विच्यते, Aor. अवेचि: Caus. वेचयति, Aor. अवीविचत्:<BR>Desid. विविक्षति; [cf. Gr. εἴκω, (perhaps also)<BR>ἑκάς, ἴχ-ν-ος; Lat. vito for vic-(i)-to, (according<BR>to some also) vinco, vicis, invicem, vicissim; Old<BR>Germ. wichan, (perhaps also) wehsal; Angl. Sax.<BR>wican, wrixl.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्त
विक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, separated; empty, (probably for<BR>रिक्त, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचकिल|विचकिलः
विचकिल वि-चकिल, अस्, m. a kind of jas-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-c" target="_blank">Page0913-c+ 78</a>]<BR>mine; another flowering plant (Artemisia, commonly<BR>called Dona); a particular shrub, Vangueria Spinosa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचक्ष्
विचक्ष् वि-चक्ष्, cl. 2. A. -चष्टे, -चष्टुम्,<BR>to appear, shine (Ved.); to see distinctly, view, look<BR>at (Ved.); to perceive, descry, observe (Ved.); to<BR>make manifest (Ved.); to tell, declare, proclaim,<BR>announce: Caus. -चक्षयति, -यितुम्, to cause to<BR>see distinctly, make clear (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचक्षण|विचक्षणः
वि-चक्षण, अस्, आ, अम्, clear-seeing, far-sighted,<BR>all-seeing, discerning, circumspect, knowing, clever,<BR>wise, sensible; able, proficient, skilful, (कार्य-व्˚,<BR>clever or skilful in managing affairs); (अस्), m. a<BR>learned Brāhman, Paṇḍit, a holy teacher; (आ), f. a<BR>sort of sun-flower (= नाग-दन्ती).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचक्षस्
वि-चक्षस्, आस्, m. a teacher, preceptor, spiritual<BR>instructor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचक्षुस्
विचक्षुस् वि-चक्षुस्, उस्, उस्, उस्, eyeless, des-<BR>titute of sight, blind; perplexed, sad; (उस्), m. a<BR>proper N.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचतुर
विचतुर वि-चतुर, अस्, आ, अम्, see Vopa-deva<BR>VI. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचय|विचयः
विचय वि-चय, &c. See p. 914, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचर्
विचर् वि-चर्, cl. 1. P. -चरति, -चरितुम्, to<BR>move or spread in different directions (Ved.); to go<BR>or move about, wander, roam, rove, ramble about;<BR>to go or gad about wantonly (Manu IX. 20), wander<BR>from the right path; to go or walk through, run<BR>through, pass through, pervade; to march against,<BR>attack; to run out, come to an end; to go about<BR>with, associate or have intercourse with (with inst.);<BR>to proceed, act; to conduct one's self, behave, live;<BR>to make, do, perform, accomplish; to go badly, fail:<BR>Caus. -चारयति, -यितुम्, to cause to go or roam<BR>about; to cause to wander from the right path, se-<BR>duce; to reflect, consider, deliberate, ponder, excogi-<BR>tate; to examine, investigate, ascertain; to doubt,<BR>be doubtful, hesitate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचरत्|विचरन्त्
वि-चरत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, wandering, roaming, going<BR>about; marching; acting, making, performing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचरित|विचरितं
वि-चरित, अस्, आ, अम्, gone or roamed about, &c.;<BR>(अम्), n. roaming, roving about, wandering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचार|विचारः
वि-चार, अस्, m. deliberation, discussion, consider-<BR>ation, reflection, investigation, examination, trial,<BR>disputation, dispute; the exercise of judgment or<BR>reason, discriminating, distinguishing, judging, dis-<BR>crimination, judgment, selection, decision, determin-<BR>ation; doubt, hesitation; prudence.<BR>—विचार-कर्तृ,<BR>ता, m. one who makes investigation, a judge, investi-<BR>gator.<BR>—विचार-चिन्तामणि, N. of a work on gram-<BR>mar.<BR>—विचार-ज्ञ, अस्, आ, अम्, knowing how to<BR>discriminate or judge, able to decide on the merits<BR>of a case, a judge.<BR>—विचार-भू, ऊस्, f. a place for<BR>discussion, any place for deliberation or judicial in-<BR>vestigation, a tribunal; the judgment-seat of Yama<BR>(judge of the dead).<BR>—विचार-मूढ, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>foolish or mistaken in judgment.<BR>—विचार-शास्त्र,<BR>अम्, n., N. of a work.<BR>—विचार-शील, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>disposed to deliberation or reflection, considerate,<BR>deliberative, reflective, thoughtful.<BR>—विचार-स्थल,<BR>अम्, n. a place for discussion or investigation, tribunal;<BR>a logical disputation.<BR>—विचारार्थ-समागम (˚र-<BR>अर्˚), अस्, m. assembling for the sake of trial or judg-<BR>ment, an assembly for investigation or discussion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारक|विचारकः
वि-चारक, अस्, m. an investigator, discriminator,<BR>judge.<BR>—विचारक-ता, f. or विचारक-त्व, अम्, n.<BR>investigation, deliberation, discussion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारण|विचारणं
वि-चारण, अम्, आ, n. f. deliberation, considera-<BR>tion, examination, discussion, investigation, the exer-<BR>cise of judgment; hesitation, doubt; (आ), f. the<BR>Mīmāṃsā system of philosophy, (see मीमांसा.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारणीय|विचारणीयं
