विचारित|विचारितः
वि-चारित, अस्, आ, अम्, deliberated about, considered,<BR>examined, inquired into, discussed, judged; decided,<BR>determined; (अम्), n. deliberation, discussion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारिन्
वि-चारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, moving about, wandering;<BR>wanton, dissolute, lascivious; deliberating, judging<BR>discussing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0913-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचार्य|विचार्य्य|विचार्य्यं
1. वि-चार्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be deliberated, to be<BR>weighed or discussed, &c.; questionable, doubtful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

