विचल्
विचल् वि-चल्, cl. 1. P. -चलति, -चलितुम्, to<BR>move about, move to and fro, shake, waver, totter,<BR>tremble; to move or go away, depart from, swerve<BR>or deviate from (with abl.), go astray; to fall off<BR>or down; to be agitated or troubled: Caus. -चाल-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to cause to move about, shake, wave,<BR>cause to tremble, make unsteady, trouble; to cause<BR>to go away or depart from, cause to turn off or swerve<BR>from, detach from, lead away from; to excite, stir<BR>up; to destroy, rescind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचल|विचलः
वि-चल, अस्, आ, अम्, moving about, shaking,<BR>wavering, tottering, unsteady, unfixed; conceited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचलत्
