विचयिष्ठ
वि-चयिष्ठ, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. removing most<BR>effectually, effacing, (Sāy. = अति-शयेन नाशक.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचि|विचिः
2. वि-चि, इस्, m. f. a wave (= वीची, q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

