विचि|विचिः
विचि 3. वि-चि (see rt. 2. चि; cf. वि-चित्), cl.<BR>5. P. A. (Ved. also cl. 3. P.) -चिनोति, -चिनुते, -चि-<BR>केति, -चेतुम्, to discern, distinguish, make anything<BR>discernible or clear, cause to appear; to search<BR>through, investigate, inspect, examine; to search for,<BR>look for, long for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

