विचयन|विचयनं
वि-चयन, अम्, n. the act of searching for, search,<BR>research, seeking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित
