विचिन्वान
वि-चिन्वान, अस्, आ, अम्, searching for, searching,<BR>considering, deliberating, thinking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेय
वि-चेय, अस्, आ, अम्, discernible, distinguishable;<BR>to be searched for.<BR>—विचेय-तारक, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">Page0914-b+ 77</a>]<BR>having stars which have to be searched for, i. e.<BR>separated by long intervals (= विरल-नक्षत्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्
