विचिकित्सा
वि-चिकित्सा, f. doubt, uncertainty; error, mistake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्त
वि-चित्त, अस्, आ, अम्, perceived, observed, perceiv-<BR>able, manifest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्र|विचित्रं|विचित्रः
विचित्र वि-चित्र, अस्, आ, अम्, variegated,<BR>diversified, speckled, spotted, party-coloured, various,<BR>varied, motley; painted, coloured; handsome, beauti-<BR>ful; wonderful, surprising; (आ), f. a white deer; (अम्),<BR>n. a variegated colour, party-colour; surprise; speech<BR>implying apparently the reverse of the meaning in-<BR>tended.<BR>—विचित्र-चरित्र, अस्, आ, अम्, behaving in<BR>a wonderful manner.<BR>—विचित्र-चीनांशुक, अम्, n.<BR>variegated China cloth; shot or watered China silk.<BR>—विचित्र-ता, f. or विचित्र-त्व, अम्, n. variegation,<BR>variety of colour, &c., spottedness; variety, diversity;<BR>wonderfulness, wonder.<BR>—विचित्र-देह, अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>having a variegated or painted body; elegantly<BR>formed; (अस्), m. a cloud.<BR>—विचित्र-रूप, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, having various forms or diversified aspects,<BR>various, diverse.<BR>—विचित्र-वीर्य, अस्, m., N. of a<BR>celebrated king of the lunar race (descended in<BR>regular line from Soma, Purūravas, Puru, Dushyanta,<BR>Bharata, Kuru, and lastly Śāntanu, who was his<BR>father, his mother being Satyavatī; the latter before<BR>her marriage with Śāntanu had borne a son, named<BR>Vyāsa, to the sage Parāśara, which son, when his<BR>half-brother Vicitra-vīrya died childless, married his<BR>two widows and by them became the father of<BR>Dhṛta-rāṣṭra and Pāṇḍu).<BR>—विचित्रवीर्य-सू, ऊस्,<BR>f. epithet of Satyavatī (mother of Vicitra-vīrya by<BR>Śāntanu and of Vyāsa by Parāśara).<BR>—विचित्राङ्ग<BR>(˚र-अङ्˚), अस्, ई, अम्, having variegated or beautiful<BR>limbs, having a spotted body, well-formed, elegant,<BR>handsome; (अस्), m. a peacock; a tiger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्रक|विचित्रकः
विचित्रक, अस्, आ, अम्, wonderful, surprising; (अस्),<BR>m. the birch tree; (अम्), n. wonder, astonishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्रित|विचित्रितः
वि-चित्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, variegated, spotted, coloured,<BR>painted; wonderful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिन्त्|विचिंत्
विचिन्त् वि-चिन्त्, cl. 10. P. -चिन्तयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to perceive, discern, observe (Ved.); to think<BR>of, reflect or muse upon (with acc.); to consider,<BR>ponder, regard, care for; to find out, devise, investi-<BR>gate; to imagine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिन्तयत्
वि-चिन्तयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, thinking about, brood-<BR>ing over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिन्तित
वि-चिन्तित, अस्, आ, अम्, thought of, meditated on,<BR>considered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिन्त्य
1. वि-चिन्त्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be thought about or<BR>imagined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

