2. वि-चिन्त्य, ind. having thought or reflected upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिन्त्यमान
वि-चिन्त्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being thought of or<BR>considered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचीर्ण
विचीर्ण वि-चीर्ण. See col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचुम्ब्
विचुम्ब् वि-चुम्ब्, cl. 1. P. -चुम्बति, -चुम्बि-<BR>तुम्, to kiss, kiss warmly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचूर्ण्
विचूर्ण् वि-चूर्ण्, cl. 10. P. -चूर्णयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to grind, pound, pulverize, crush to pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचूर्णित
वि-चूर्णित, अस्, आ, अम्, crushed or dashed to<BR>pieces, shattered, smashed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचृत्
विचृत् वि-चृत्, cl. 6. P. -चृतति, -चर्तितुम्,<BR>Ved. to untie, detach, disconnect, loosen, open, spread<BR>out, (according to Sāy. on Ṛg-veda I. 67, 4. वि-<BR>चृतन्ति = स्तुतीर् ग्रथ्नन्ति, they string together<BR>or compose praises.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचृतौ
वि-चृतौ, m. du. ‘two releasers,’ N. of two stars<BR>the rising of which promotes relief from disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचृत्त
वि-चृत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. opened, spread, (Sāy.<BR>= प्रसारित.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेतन
विचेतन वि-चेतन, अस्, आ, अम्, senseless,<BR>unconscious, lifeless, inanimate, dead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेतस्
वि-चेतस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, senseless, mindless, ignorant,<BR>stupid; sad, perplexed, unhappy; wise (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेष्ट्
विचेष्ट् वि-चेष्ट्, cl. 1. P. A. -चेष्टति, -ते,<BR>-चेष्टितुम्, to move the limbs about, writhe, wallow,<BR>struggle, stretch, sprawl; to exert one's self; to bestir<BR>one's self, strive, be active, act; to struggle or act against<BR>(with loc.); to conduct or behave one's self: Caus.<BR>-चेष्टयति, -यितुम्, to set in motion, rouse to action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

