विचेष्टमान
वि-चेष्टमान, अस्, आ, अम्, struggling, writhing,<BR>striving, exerting one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेष्टयत्
वि-चेष्टयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, setting in motion,<BR>rousing to action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

