वि-चेष्टा, f. movement, effort, exertion, conduct,<BR>behaviour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेष्टित|विचेष्टितः
वि-चेष्टित, अस्, आ, अम्, struggled, striven, tried,<BR>endeavoured, acted, exerted, done; investigated, in-<BR>quired into; acted badly, done foolishly, misdone,<BR>ill-judged; = 2. वि-गत; (अम्), n. exertion, enter-<BR>prise, effort, undertaking; action, act; gesture; sen-<BR>sation (e. g. अनङ्ग-विचेष्टितम्, a thrilling sensa-<BR>tion or movement produced by love); evil or malicious<BR>act, machination, trickery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

