विच्छद्
विच्छद् 2. वि-च्छद् (see rt. 3. छद्), cl. 10.<BR>P. A. or Caus. -छन्दयति, -ते, -यितुम्, to render<BR>or return homage (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

