विच्छर्दक|विच्छर्दकः|विच्छर्द्दक|विच्छर्द्दकः|विछर्द्दक
विच्छर्दक वि-च्छर्दक, अस्, m. (= वि-च्छन्-<BR>दक above), a large building, temple, palace; [cf.<BR>2. छर्दिस्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विच्छर्दन|विच्छर्दनं|विच्छर्द्दन|विछर्द्दन
विच्छर्दन वि-च्छर्दन, अम्, n. (said to be<BR>fr. rt. छृद् with वि), the act of vomiting, ejecting,<BR>disregarding; wasting (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विच्छर्दित|विच्छर्द्दित|विछर्द्दित
वि-च्छर्दित, अस्, आ, अम्, vomited, ejected; disre-<BR>garded, neglected; diminished, impaired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विच्छाय|विच्छायं|विच्छायः|विछाय
विच्छाय 2. वि-च्छाय, अस्, आ, अम् (for 1. see<BR>p. 909, col. 1), destitute of shadow, shadowless; (अस्),<BR>m. a jewel, gem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0914-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

