विदाहिन्
वि-दाहिन्, ई, इनी, इ, burning, hot; pungent, acrid;<BR>(इ), n. any substance that causes inflammation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0919-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदा
