विदत्त
वि-दत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, given out, distributed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0919-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदा
विदा 2. वि-दा (= वि-दो, see rt. 3. दा), cl.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0920-a" target="_blank">Page0920-a+ 71</a>]<BR>2. 4. P. -दाति, -द्यति, -दातुम्, to cut up, cut in pieces,<BR>bruise, pound; to destroy; to be destroyed, perish<BR>(Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0919-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदा
