वि-दून, अस्, आ, अम्, distressed, agitated, afflicted,<BR>pained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0920-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदूयत्
वि-दूयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, being distressed or afflicted;<BR>agitated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0920-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदुर|विदुरः
