विदूर|विदूरः
विदूर वि-दूर, अस्, आ, अम्, very far, remote;<BR>(अस्), m., N. of a city and mountain whence the lapis<BR>lazuli is brought.<BR>—विदूर-ग, अस्, आ, अम्, going far<BR>or wide, spreading.<BR>—विदूर-ज, अम्, n. ‘produced<BR>in Vidūra,’ the lapis lazuli; [cf. वैदूर्य.]<BR>—वि-<BR>दूर-तस्, ind. from afar, from a distance; far.<BR>—वि-<BR>दूर-भूमि, इस्, f., N. of a country (= वि-दूर).<BR>—विदूराद्रि (˚र-अद्˚), इस्, m., N. of a mountain<BR>(said to be in Ceylon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0920-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदूरथ|विदूरथः
