विदृश्
विदृश् वि-दृश्, cl. 1. P. -पश्यति, -द्रष्टुम्,<BR>to see through, see clearly, see: Pass. -दृश्यते, to<BR>be clearly visible, become apparent, appear: Caus.<BR>-दर्शयति, -यितुम्, to cause to see, show; to teach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0920-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदर्शिन्
वि-दर्शिन्, ई, इनी, इ, seeing clearly, seeing through,<BR>penetrating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0920-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदॄ
विदॄ वि-दॄ, cl. 9. P. -दृणाति, -दरितुम्,<BR>-दरीतुम्, to tear asunder or to pieces, rend asunder,<BR>split open: Pass. -दीर्यते, to be torn or rent asunder,<BR>to burst open; to be torn with grief or anguish:<BR>Caus. -दारयति, -यितुम्, to cause to burst asunder;<BR>to rend, tear in pieces, crush; to tear open, open; to<BR>saw in pieces; to break or burst through; to tear up,<BR>rip up: Intens., Ved. -दर्दरीति, to tear or split in<BR>pieces, rend asunder, crush.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0920-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

