विदार|विदारः
वि-दार, अस्, m. tearing asunder, rending; cutting;<BR>war, battle; an inundation, overflow, the rising of a<BR>river or pond above its banks; (ई), f. the plant He-<BR>dysarum Gangeticum (= शाल-पर्णी); the climbing<BR>plant Ipomœa Paniculata; a swelling in the groin,<BR>bubo, &c.<BR>—विदारी-गन्धा, f. the plant Hedysarum<BR>Gangeticum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0920-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदारक|विदारकं|विदारकः
वि-दारक, अस्, m. a render, tearer, divider; a<BR>tree or rock in the middle of a stream dividing its<BR>course; a hole or pit for water sunk in the bed of a<BR>dry river, &c.; (इका), f. the plant Hedysarum Gan-<BR>geticum; a swelling in the groin, bubo; (अम्), n.<BR>alkaline earth (= वज्र-क्षार).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0920-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

