विदारित
वि-दारित, अस्, आ, अम्, torn asunder, rent, split,<BR>broken open.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0920-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदारिन्
