विदेश|विदेशः
विदेश वि-देश, अस्, m. another country,<BR>foreign country, abroad; any place away from home.<BR>—विदेश-ग, अस्, आ, अम्, going abroad or to a foreign<BR>country.<BR>—विदेश-गत, अस्, आ, अम्, gone abroad.<BR>—विदेश-गमन, अम्, n. the act of going abroad,<BR>travelling in foreign lands.<BR>—विदेश-ज, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>born or produced in a foreign country, foreign, exotic,<BR>a foreigner.<BR>—विदेश-स्थ, अस्, आ, अम्, remaining<BR>abroad, living in foreign lands or in a distant country.<BR>—विदेशस्थाशौच (˚थ-अश्˚), अम्, n. impurity<BR>resulting from living abroad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0920-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

