विनिध्वस्त
वि-निध्वस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, destroyed, ruined, struck<BR>down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0923-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनिन्द्
विनिन्द् वि-निन्द्, cl. 1. P. -निन्दति (ep. also<BR>A. -ते), -निन्दितुम्, to reproach, revile, abuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0923-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनिपट्
विनिपट् वि-नि-पट्, cl. 10. P. -पाटयति, &c.,<BR>to split open, split up, cleave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0923-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनिपाट्य
वि-निपाट्य, ind. having split open, having severed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0923-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनिपत्
