वि-निपातित, अस्, आ, अम्, thrown down; killed,<BR>destroyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0923-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनिपात्य
वि-निपात्य, ind. having killed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0923-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

