वि-नियोक्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be appointed, to<BR>be employed in, to be applied to; to be enjoined or<BR>commanded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0924-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनियोग|विनियोगः
