विशुष्क
वि-शुष्क, अस्, आ, अम्, completely dried up, very<BR>dry; withered; thirsty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

