वि-शीर्यमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, being shattered or de-<BR>stroyed or wasted; wasting away, decaying, perishing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विशोक|विशोकः
विशोक वि-शोक, अस्, आ, अम्, freed from grief,<BR>free from sorrow, happy; (अस्), m., N. of a Muni;<BR>the Aśoka tree; (आ), f. exemption from grief, (one<BR>of the original properties of man.)<BR>—विशोक-कोट,<BR>N. of a mountain.<BR>—विशोक-देव, अस्, m. a proper<BR>N.<BR>—विशोक-पर्वन्, अ, n., N. of a section of the<BR>Mahā-bhārata.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्चकद्र|विश्चकद्रः
विश्चकद्र विश्-चकद्र, अस्, m. (said to be fr.<BR>वि-स् for वि + चकद्र, cf. विश्व-कद्रु), Ved. (ac-<BR>cording to some) a low man who deals in dogs, a<BR>dog-dealer, (according to others) a dog (regarded as<BR>a despicable animal).<BR>—विश्चकद्राकर्ष (˚र-<BR>आक्˚), अस्, m. (according to some) one who drags about<BR>or chastises the above, (see Nirukta II. 3.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्न|विश्नः
विश्न विश्न, अस्, m. (fr. rt. विछ्, Pāṇ. VI.<BR>4, 19), lustre, splendor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्पला
विश्पला विश्पला, f. a proper N.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रण्
विश्रण् वि-श्रण्, cl. 10. P. -श्रणयति, -श्रा-<BR>णयति, -यितुम्, to give away, distribute, present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रणन|विश्रणनं
वि-श्रणन, अम्, n. the act of giving away, dis-<BR>tribution, gift, donation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्राणन|विश्राणनं
वि-श्राणन, अम्, n. = वि-श्रणन above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्राणित
वि-श्राणित, अस्, आ, अम्, given away, distributed,<BR>bestowed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्राण्य
वि-श्राण्य, ind. having given or bestowed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रथ्
विश्रथ् वि-श्रथ् (connected with वि-श्लथ्,<BR>q. v.), cl. 10. P. -श्रथयति, -यितुम्, Ved. to<BR>loosen, relax, untie, release; to become loose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रम्
विश्रम् वि-श्रम्, cl. 4. P. -श्राम्यति (ep.<BR>even cl. 1. -श्रमति), -श्रमितुम्, to cease from<BR>labour or toil, rest, repose; to cease: Pass. -श्रम्-<BR>यते, Aor. व्य्-अश्रमि or व्य्-अश्रामि: Caus. -श्र-<BR>मयति (ep. -श्रामय), -यितुम्, to cause to rest,<BR>make to cease from toil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रम|विश्रमः
वि-श्रम, अस्, m. rest, repose, quiet; cessation<BR>from labour or fatigue, remission of work, relaxation;<BR>N. of a scribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रमित
वि-श्रमित, अस्, आ, अम्, made to rest; completely<BR>wearied, exhausted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रम्य
वि-श्रम्य, ind. having rested, having reposed,<BR>&c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रान्त|विश्रांत|विश्रान्तः
वि-श्रान्त, अस्, आ, अम्, rested, reposed, reposing;<BR>ceased, ceasing, desisting from; calm, composed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रान्ति|विश्रांति|विश्रांतिः|विश्रान्तिः
वि-श्रान्ति, इस्, f. rest, repose, cessation from toil or<BR>occupation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्राम|विश्रामः
वि-श्राम, अस्, m. rest, repose, cessation from toil<BR>or occupation; pause, stop, cessation; tranquillity,<BR>composure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रम्भ्|विश्रंभ्
विश्रम्भ् वि-श्रम्भ् (also written वि-स्रम्भ्),<BR>cl. 1. A. -श्रम्भते, -श्रम्भितुम्, to entrust,<BR>confide, be confident.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रब्ध|विश्रब्धः
वि-श्रब्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, entrusted, trusted, con-<BR>fided, confided in, confided to; trusty, trustworthy,<BR>confidential; confiding, confident, fearless; firm,<BR>quiet, steady; reposed, rested, tranquil, patient,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-c" target="_blank">Page0943-c+ 76</a>]<BR>meek, lowly-minded, not lofty; excessive, exceeding,<BR>much; (अम्), n. confidingly, trustfully, without<BR>fear, without hesitation, quietly.<BR>—विश्रब्ध-ता, f.<BR>or विश्रब्ध-त्व, अम्, n. trustiness; trustworthiness.<BR>—विश्रब्ध-नवोढा, f. a confiding bride, (one of<BR>the several classes into which brides are divided.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रम्भ|विश्रंभ|विश्रंभः|विश्रम्भः
वि-श्रम्भ, अस्, m. trust, confidence; rest; the<BR>relaxing of the organs of utterance, lowering or sink-<BR>ing of the voice (applied to the An-udātta accent in<BR>grammar); affection, affectionate inquiry; playful or<BR>amorous quarrel, festive or sportive tumult; killing.<BR>—विश्रम्भालाप (˚भ-आल्˚), अस्, m. confidential<BR>talk, affectionate conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रम्भिन्|विश्रंभिन्
वि-श्रम्भिन्, ई, इणी, इ, trusting, confiding, con-<BR>fiding in; trusty, faithful, trustworthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रवस्
विश्रवस् वि-श्रवस्, वि-श्राव. See below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्राणित
