विश्रि|विश्रिः
विश्रि 1. वि-श्रि, इस्, m. death (according to<BR>Śabda-k.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रि|विश्रिः
विश्रि 2. वि-श्रि, cl. 1. P. A. -श्रयति, -श्र-<BR>यते, -श्रयितुम्, Ved. to be opened, be set open (A.);<BR>to be diffused, diffuse, spread out, expand (A.); to<BR>devote one's self to, serve, enjoy (A.); to open,<BR>spread out, spread over (P.); to have recourse to,<BR>approach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रय|विश्रयः
वि-श्रय, अस्, m. the having recourse to, depend-<BR>ance upon, abode, asylum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रयमाण
वि-श्रयमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. diffusing, spread-<BR>ing, serving, enjoying, (Sāy. = नि-षेवमाण.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रयिन्
वि-श्रयिन्, ई, इणी, इ, having recourse to, living or<BR>dwelling in; depending on, serving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रु
विश्रु 1. वि-श्रु, Pass. -श्रूयते, to be heard<BR>in various places; to be heard of far and wide, to be<BR>celebrated: Caus. -श्रावयति, -यितुम्, to cause to<BR>be heard everywhere, cause to be heard, narrate;<BR>to cause to resound; to call out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रवस्
वि-श्रवस्, आस्, m., N. of the father of Kuvera and<BR>of Rāvaṇa; (according to the Rāmāyaṇa, Viśravas was<BR>son of the sage Pulastya, who was the son of Brahmā;<BR>cf. वैश्रवण.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्राव|विश्रावः
