विश्राव्य
वि-श्राव्य, ind. having caused to be heard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रुत|विश्रुतः
1. वि-श्रुत, अस्, आ, अम्, heard of far and wide,<BR>noted, renowned, celebrated, famous, notorious, well<BR>known; pleased, delighted, happy.<BR>—विश्रुत-वत्,<BR>आन्, m., N. of a king.<BR>—विश्रुताभिजन (˚त-अभ्˚),<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, of a renowned family, of noted birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=0943-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रुति|विश्रुतिः
