षण्ड|षंड|षंडः|षण्डः
षण्ड षण्ड, अस्, m. (according to Uṇādi-s.<BR>I. 113. fr. rt. 1. सन्; cf. शण्ड, शण्ढ), a bull; a<BR>eunuch, (fourteen or even twenty classes are enume-<BR>rated by some writers); a multitude, collection,<BR>quantity, group, heap; a wood, thicket; N. of one<BR>of Viṣṇu's guards or attendants, (also written शण्ड,<BR>q. v.); (अस्, अम्), m. n. a flock (of goats &c.); a<BR>quantity of lotuses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1032-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षण्डक|षंडक|षंडकः|षण्डकः
षण्डक, अस्, m. a eunuch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1032-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षण्डाली|षंडाली
षण्डाली, f. a wanton woman; a pond, pool; a<BR>particular measure of oil (commonly called Chatāk).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1032-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षण्डिक
षण्डिक, अस्, m. a proper N.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1032-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षण्ढ|षंढ|षंढः|षण्ढः
षण्ढ, अस्, m. a eunuch.<BR>—षण्ढ-तिल, अस्,<BR>m. barren sesamum.<BR>—षण्ढ-त्व, अम्, n. the<BR>being a eunuch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1032-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

