षलाग्रु षलाग्रु, N. of a place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1032-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षष्
षष् षष्, षट्, m. f. n. pl. (thought by some<BR>to be for an original स्वक्ष्, by others for क्षष्; षष्<BR>becomes षट् before hard letters, षड् before soft, षो<BR>before ड्, and षण् before nasals), six, (the following<BR>words are used as symbolical expressions for the number<BR>six, अङ्ग, दर्शन, तर्क, गुण, रस, ऋतु, वज्र-<BR>कोण, कार्त्तिकेय-मुख); [cf. Zend kṣvas;<BR>Gr. ἕξ, ϝέξ; Lat. sex; Angl. Sax. seox, sex, six;<BR>Old Germ. sehs for sihs; Goth. saihs for sihs;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1032-c" target="_blank">Page1032-c+ 81</a>]<BR>Lith. szeszi, f. szezios; Slav. sesti, sesty; Cambro-<BR>Brit. chwech; Armor. chuech; Hib. se, ‘six.’]<BR>—षट्-कर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, six-eared; heard by six<BR>ears (i. e. by a third, instead of by the speaker and<BR>person addressed only), told to more than one listener;<BR>(अस्), m. a sort of lute.<BR>—षट्-कर्मन्, अ, n. the<BR>six acts or duties enjoined on Brāhmans collectively,<BR>(viz. teaching the Vedas, holy study, offering sacri-<BR>fices, conducting them for others, giving and accept-<BR>ing gifts); six acts allowable to a Brāhman for sub-<BR>sistence, (viz. gleaning, accepting gifts, asking alms,<BR>agriculture, trade, tending cattle, or, according to<BR>some, lending money at interest); six acts belonging<BR>to the practice of Yoga, (viz., according to Śabda-k.,<BR>धौति, वस्ति, नेति, नौलिकी, त्राटक, कपाल-<BR>भाति, these consist of suppressions of the breath<BR>and self-mortifications of various kinds; other<BR>authorities write the words with different termi-<BR>nations, e. g. धौती, वस्ती, नौलिक, &c.); six<BR>acts that may be performed by means of magical<BR>texts, (viz. killing, infatuating, enthralling, expelling,<BR>exciting animosity, and the stopping or privation of<BR>any faculty; these are taught in the Tantras); (आ),<BR>m. a Brāhman skilled in the above six acts; an<BR>adept in the Tantra magical rites.<BR>—षट्-कारक-<BR>प्रतिच्छन्दक, अस्, m., N. of a grammatical work<BR>on the use of the six cases.<BR>—षट्-कूटा, f. a form of<BR>Bhairavī.<BR>—षट्-कोण, अम्, n. a six-angled figure,<BR>hexagon; the thunderbolt of Indra; (अस्, आ, अम्),<BR>hexangular.<BR>—षट्-खेटक, N. of a town.<BR>—षट्-<BR>चक्र, अम्, n. the six mystical circles of the<BR>body, (see चक्र.)<BR>—षट्चत्वारिंश, अस्, ई,<BR>अम्, 46th.<BR>—षट्-चत्वारिंशत्, त्, f., 46.<BR>—षट्-<BR>चरण, अस्, आ, अम्, six-footed, having six feet;<BR>(अस्), m. a bee; a louse; a locust.<BR>—षट्-तिल-<BR>दान, अम्, n. a particular ceremony on the twelfth<BR>day of the month Māgha.<BR>—षट्तिलिन्, ई, इनी, इ,<BR>one who on certain festivals performs six acts<BR>with Tila or sesamum, (so called, according to<BR>Śabda-k., when he is तिलोद्वर्तिन्, तिल-स्नायिन्,<BR>तिल-होमिन्, तिल-प्रद, तिल-भुज्, तिल-वापिन्.)<BR>—षट्त्रिंश, अस्, ई, अम्, 36th.<BR>—षट्-त्रिंशत्,<BR>त्, f., 36; N. of a work on law.<BR>—षट्त्रिंशद्-<BR>आब्दिक, अस्, ई, अम्, lasting 36 years.<BR>—षट्त्रिं-<BR>शद्-दीपिका, f., N. of a work.<BR>—षट्त्रिंशन्-<BR>मत, a collection of the opinions of 36 Munis (held<BR>to be authors of as many law-books, viz. Manu,<BR>Viṣṇu, Yama, Dakṣa, Aṅgiras, Atri, Vṛhaspati,<BR>Āpastamba, Uśanas, Kātyāyana, Parāśara, Vasiṣṭha,<BR>Vyāsa, Saṃvarta, Hārīta, Gotama, Pracetas, Śaṅkha,<BR>Likhita, Yājñavalkya, Kāśyapa, Śātātapa, Lomaśa,<BR>Jamad-agni, Prajāpati, Viśvā-mitra, Paiṭhīnasi, Bau-<BR>dhāyana, Pitāmaha, Chāgaleya, Jābāla, Marīci, Cya-<BR>vana, Bhṛgu, Ṛṣya-śṛṅga, Nārada.)<BR>—षट्पञ्-<BR>चाश, अस्, ई, अम्, 56th.<BR>—षट्-पञ्चाशत्, त्, f.,<BR>56.<BR>—षट्पञ्चाशत्-तम, अस्, ई, अम्, 56th.<BR>—षट्-पञ्चाशिका, N. of a work by Pṛthu-<BR>yaśas.<BR>—षट्-पद, अस्, आ, अम्, six-footed, contain-<BR>ing six Padas or divisions; (अस्), m. a bee; a verse<BR>consisting of six Padas or divisions; (अस्, ई), m. f.<BR>a louse; (ई), f. a female bee.<BR>—षट्पद-ज्य, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, ‘having bees for a string,’ epithet of Kāma-<BR>deva's bow (the string of which is supposed to con-<BR>sist of bees).<BR>—षट्पद-प्रिय, अस्, m. ‘beloved<BR>by bees,’ a kind of tree (= नाग-केशर).<BR>—षट्-<BR>पदातिथि (˚द-अत्˚), इस्, m. ‘having bees as guests,’<BR>the Mango tree; the Campaka tree.<BR>—षट्पदा-<BR>नन्द-वर्धन (˚द-आन्˚), अस्, m. ‘increasing<BR>the joy of bees,’ the Kiṅkirāta tree.<BR>—षट्पदाली<BR>(˚द-आली), f. a line of bees.<BR>—षट्-पदिका, f. a<BR>kind of metre.<BR>—षट्-प्रज्ञ, अस्, m. ‘six-knower,’<BR>one who is wise on six subjects, a sage (i. e. one<BR>acquainted with the four objects of human existence,<BR>viz. virtue, wealth, pleasure, and final emancipation,<BR>and with the nature of the world, and of divine<BR>truth); a dissolute or lustful man.<BR>—षट्-प्रश्नो-<BR>पनिषद्, त्, f. = प्रश्नोपनिषद्, q. v.<BR>—षट्-<BR>शत, अम्, n., 106; 600.<BR>—षट्-शास्त्रिन्, ई,<BR>m. one who has studied the six Śāstras or six<BR>systems of philosophy.<BR>—षट्षष्ट, अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>66th.<BR>—षट्-षष्टि, इस्, f., 66.<BR>—षट्सप्तत,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1033-a" target="_blank">Page1033-a+ 81</a>]<BR>अस्, ई, अम्, 76th.<BR>—षट्-सप्तति, इस्, f., 76.<BR>—षड्-अक्षर, अस्, आ, अम्, consisting of six<BR>syllables.<BR>—षड्-अक्षीण, अस्, m. ‘six-eyed,’ a<BR>fish.<BR>—षड्-अङ्ग, अम्, n. six parts of the body<BR>collectively, (viz. the two arms, two legs, head, and<BR>waist); the six limbs or works auxiliary to the Veda,<BR>(see वेदाङ्ग); any set of six articles; (अस्), m. a<BR>small kind of Go-kṣura plant; (अस्, आ, अम्), six-<BR>limbed; having six parts or ingredients.<BR>—षड्-<BR>अङ्ग-जित्, त्, त्, त्, subduing the six members; (त्), m.<BR>epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>—षडङ्ग-पानीय, अम्, n. an<BR>infusion or decoction of six drugs.<BR>—षड्-अङ्घ्रि,<BR>इस्, m. ‘having six feet,’ a bee.<BR>—षड्-अधिक,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, exceeded by six.<BR>—षडधिक-द-<BR>शन्, अ, m. f. n. pl. ten + six, i. e. sixteen.<BR>—षड्-<BR>अधिकदश-नाडी-चक्र, अम्, n. the circle of the<BR>16 tubular vessels, (the heart.)<BR>—षड्-अभिज्ञ, अस्,<BR>m. ‘knowing six sciences,’ a Buddha or Buddhist<BR>deified sage.<BR>—षडशीत, अस्, ई, अम्, 86th.<BR>—षड्-<BR>अशीति, इस्, f., 86; N. of a work; the sun's en-<BR>trance into the four signs, Pisces, Gemini, Virgo,<BR>and Sagittarius.<BR>—षडशीति-चक्र, अम्, n. a<BR>mystical circle shaped like a man for telling good<BR>or bad luck when the sun is in the above signs.<BR>—षड्-अष्टक, अम्, n. (in astronomy) a parti-<BR>cular Yoga, q. v.<BR>—षड्-अह, अस्, m. a period of<BR>six days.<BR>—षड्-आनन, अस्, m. ‘six-faced,’ epithet<BR>of Kārttikeya.<BR>—षड्-आम्नाय, अस्, m. the sixfold<BR>Tantra (fabled to have proceeded from the mouth of<BR>Śiva directed towards six quarters, east, south, west,<BR>north, up and down).<BR>—षड्-आयतन, अम्, n. the<BR>seats of the six organs (or senses).<BR>—षड्-आवलि, इस्, f.<BR>any row of six objects, (applied to a set of six Śatakas<BR>in verse, of which the Sūrya-śataka is one.)<BR>—षड्-<BR>ऊषण, अम्, n. six spices collectively, or long pepper,<BR>black pepper, dried ginger, the root of long pepper,<BR>plumbago, and Cavi; [cf. पञ्च-कोल.]<BR>—षड्-<BR>ऋतु, अवस्, m. pl. the six seasons, (see ऋतु.)<BR>—षड्-गत, अस्, आ, अम्, arrived at the sixth, (a<BR>term applied to the sixth power of numbers.)<BR>—षड्-<BR>गया, f. the sixfold Gayā, (thus explained in the<BR>Vāyu-Purāṇa quoted by Śabda-k., गया गजो गया-<BR>दित्यो गायत्री च गदाधरः गया गयासुरश्<BR>चैव षड्-गया मुक्ति-दायिका.)<BR>—षड्-गव,<BR>अम्, n. a yoke of six oxen, (sometimes compounded<BR>with the names of other animals to denote a yoke of<BR>six, e. g. अश्व-षड्गवम्, six horses; cf. हस्ति-<BR>ष्˚.)<BR>—षड्-गुण, अस्, आ, अम्, sixfold, six times;<BR>(अम्), n. an assemblage of six qualities or properties;<BR>the six acts or measures to be practised by a king in<BR>his military capacity, (viz. सन्धि, peace; विग्रह,<BR>war; यान, marching; आसन, sitting encamped;<BR>द्वैधी-भाव, dividing his forces; संश्रय,<BR>seeking the protection of a more powerful king.)<BR>—षड्-गुरु-भाष्य, अम्, n., N. of a work.<BR>—षड्-गुरु-शिष्य, अस्, m., N. of the author of<BR>the Sarvānukramaṇī-vṛtti.<BR>—षड्-ग्रन्थ, अस्, m.<BR>a variety of the Cæsalpinia Bonducella; (आ), f. orris<BR>root (= वचा); white orris root; other plants, =<BR>शटी; = महा-करञ्ज; (ई), f. orris root.<BR>—षड्-<BR>ग्रन्थि, इस्, इस्, इ, six-knotted, having six joints;<BR>(इ), n. the root of long pepper.<BR>—षड्ग्रन्थिका,<BR>f. zedoary, Curcuma Zerumbet.<BR>—षड्-ज, अस्, m.<BR>‘six-born, produced from six,’ epithet of the first or,<BR>according to some, of the fourth of the seven Svaras<BR>or primary notes of music, (so called because it is<BR>supposed to be produced by six organs, viz. tongue,<BR>teeth, palate, nose, throat, and chest; the other six<BR>Svaras are Ṛṣabha, Gāndhāra, Madhyama, Pañ-<BR>cama, Dhaivata, and Niṣāda, of which Niṣāda and<BR>Gāndhāra are referred to the Udātta, Ṛṣabha and<BR>Dhaivata to the An-udātta, while Ṣaḍ-ja and the<BR>other two are referred to the Svarita accent; the<BR>sound of the Ṣaḍ-ja is said to resemble the note of<BR>peacocks.)<BR>—षड्-दर्शन, अस्, m. a man who is<BR>versed in the six systems of philosophy, (see दर्-<BR>शन.)<BR>—षड्-दशन, अस्, आ, अम्, having six teeth.<BR>—षड्-दुर्ग, अम्, n. a collection of six forts<BR>(i. e. six kinds of forts, as follow, धन्व-दुर्ग,<BR>मही-द्˚, गिरि-द्˚, मनुष्य-द्˚, मृद्-द्˚, वन-<BR>द्˚).<BR>—षड्-धा, ind. in six ways; [cf. षो-ढा.]<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1033-b" target="_blank">Page1033-b+ 81</a>]<BR>—षड्-भाग, अस्, m. a sixth part, a sixth.<BR>—षड्-<BR>भाग-भाज्, क्, क्, क्, possessing or entitled to a sixth<BR>part.<BR>—षड्-भुज, अस्, आ, अम्, six-armed, six-sided;<BR>(अस्), m. a hexagon; (आ), f. epithet of Durgā; the<BR>water-melon.<BR>—षड्-रस, आस्, m. pl. the six<BR>flavours or tastes, (see रस); (अस्, आ, अम्), having<BR>the six Rasas or flavours.<BR>—षड्-रात्र, अम्, n. ‘six<BR>nights,’ a period of six days.<BR>—षड्-रेखा, f. ‘hav-<BR>ing six lines,’ a water-melon.<BR>—षड्-लवण, अम्,<BR>n. six kinds of salt; [cf. पञ्च-लवण.]<BR>—षड्-<BR>वक्त्र, अस्, m. ‘six-faced,’ epithet of Kārttikeya.<BR>—षड्-वर्ग, अस्, m. a class or aggregate of<BR>six things (e. g. of the six faults, desire, wrath,<BR>covetousness, bewilderment, pride, and envy).<BR>—षड्वर्ग-वश्य, अस्, आ, अम्, subject to the<BR>above six faults.<BR>—षड्विंश, अस्, ई, अम्, 26th.<BR>—षड्-विंशति, इस्, f., 26.<BR>—षड्विंश-ब्राह्-<BR>मण, अम्, n., N. of a Brāhmaṇa belonging to<BR>the Sāma-veda.<BR>—षड्-विध, अस्, आ, अम्, sixfold,<BR>of six sorts or kinds.<BR>—षड्-विन्दु, उस्, m. ‘having<BR>six spots,’ epithet of Viṣṇu; a kind of insect; a<BR>sort of medicinal oil.<BR>—षण्णवत, अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>96th.<BR>—षण्-णवति, इस्, f., 96.<BR>—षण्-णाडी-<BR>चक्र, अम्, n. (in astrology) a particular circular<BR>diagram (composed of six Nakṣatras, under which<BR>a birthday or other great event may take place).<BR>—षण्-णाभि, इस्, इस्, इ, having six navels; six-<BR>naved, (a wheel) having six naves or centres.<BR>—षण्-मात्र, अस्, ई, अम्, containing six Mātras.<BR>—षण्-मास, अस्, m. a period of six months, half<BR>a year.<BR>—षण्मास-निचय, अस्, m. a collection (of<BR>food sufficient) for six months.<BR>—षण्मासाभ्यन्-<BR>तरे (˚स-अभ्˚), ind. within the space of six months.<BR>—षण्मासिक, अस्, आ, अम्, happening every six<BR>months, half yearly.<BR>—षण्मास्य, six months old,<BR>of six months standing; [cf. षाण्मास्य.]<BR>—षण्-<BR>मुख, अस्, ई, अम्, having six faces; (अस्), m. epi-<BR>thet of Kārttikeya; (आ), f. a water-melon.<BR>—षऌ-<BR>अक्षर, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. = षड्-अक्षर.<BR>—षऌ-<BR>अर, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. having six spokes.<BR>—षो-डत्,<BR>अन्, m. a young ox with six teeth.<BR>—षो-डन्त, अस्,<BR>m. one who has six teeth.<BR>—षोडश, अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>16th, the 16th; (ई), f. one of the twelve forms of<BR>Durgā called Mahā-vidyā.<BR>—षोडशक, अस्, आ or<BR>ई (?) or इका, अम्, 16, consisting of 16, of 16 kinds,<BR>(षोडशकः कच्छ-पुटः, a box with 16 com-<BR>partments.)<BR>—षोडश-कल, अस्, आ, अम्, having 16<BR>parts, sixteenfold (e. g. षोडश-कलः पुरुषः,<BR>the sixteenfold spirit); (आस्), f. pl. the 16 digits of<BR>the moon (named thus, 1. A-mṛtā; 2. Māna-dā;<BR>3. Pūṣā: 4. Tuṣṭi; 5. Puṣṭi; 6. Rati; 7. Dhṛti;<BR>8. Śaśinī; 9. Candrikā; 10. Kānti; 11. Jyotsnā;<BR>12. Śrī; 13. Prīti; 14. Aṅga-dā; 15. Pūrṇā;<BR>16. Pūrṇāmṛtā).<BR>—षोडशकल-विद्या, f. the<BR>science of the sixteenfold (spirit or soul).<BR>—षोडश-<BR>दल, अस्, आ, अम्, having 16 petals (as a lotus).<BR>—षोडश-दान, अम्, n. the aggregate of 16 kinds<BR>of gifts to be given at a Śrāddha, &c., (these are<BR>said to be ‘room, a seat, water, clothes, a lamp, food,<BR>betel, a parasol, perfumes, a garland, fruit, a bed,<BR>shoes, cows, gold, and silver.’)<BR>—षोडश-धा, ind.<BR>in 16 ways, in 16 parts or divisions.<BR>—षो-डशन्,<BR>अ, m. f. n. pl., 16.<BR>—षोडश-पक्ष-शायिन्, ई, इनी,<BR>इ, lying torpid during 16 half months of the year<BR>(said of a frog).<BR>—षोडश-भुजा, f. ‘the sixteen-<BR>armed,’ epithet of a form of Durgā (represented<BR>with 16 hands).<BR>—षोडश-मातृका, आस्, f. pl. the<BR>16 divine mothers, (see मातृ.)<BR>—षोडश-राजिक,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, treating of or relating to 16 kings.<BR>—षोडशर्तु-निशा (˚श-ऋत्˚), f. any night out of<BR>16 from the commencement of menstruation.<BR>—षो-<BR>डशर्त्विक्-क्रतु (˚श-ऋत्˚), उस्, m. a grand sacrifice<BR>to be performed by 16 priests, (see ऋत्व्-इज्.)<BR>—षो-<BR>डशांश (˚श-अं˚), अस्, m. a 16th part.<BR>—षोडशांशु<BR>(˚श-अं˚), उस्, उस्, उ, having 16 rays; (उस्), m.<BR>sixteen-rayed, the planet Venus.<BR>—षोडशाक्षर<BR>(˚श-अक्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, having 16 letters or syllables.<BR>—षोडशाङ्ग (˚श-अङ्˚), अस्, आ or ई, अम्, having<BR>16 parts or ingredients; (अस्), m. a particular per-<BR>fume (said to be composed of गुग्गुलु, सरल,<BR>दारु, पत्त्र, मलय-ज, ह्रीवेर, अगुरु, कुष्-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1033-c" target="_blank">Page1033-c+ 81</a>]<BR>ठ, गुड, सर्ज-रस, घन, हरीतकी, नखी,<BR>लाक्षा, जटामांसी, शैल-ज, q. q. v. v.).<BR>—षोड-<BR>शाङ्गुलक (˚श-अङ्˚), अस्, ई, अम्, of 16 fingers'<BR>breadth.<BR>—षोडशाङ्घ्रि (˚श-अङ्˚), इस्, इस्, इ, hav-<BR>ing 16 feet; (इस्), m. a crab.<BR>—षोडशार (˚श-अर),<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, having 16 spokes or radii; having 16<BR>petals; (अम्), n. a kind of lotus; [cf. षोडश-<BR>दल.]<BR>—षोडशार्चिस् (˚श-अर्˚), इस्, इस्, इस्, having<BR>16 rays, sixteen-rayed; (इस्), m. the planet Venus.<BR>—षोडशावर्त (˚श-आव्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, having 16<BR>twists; (अस्), m. a conch-shell.<BR>—षोडशिकाम्र<BR>(˚का-आम्˚?), अम्, n. (according to Śabda-k.) a kind<BR>of measure (= पल-परिमाण).<BR>—षोडशि-ग्रह,<BR>अस्, m. a libation made at the Ṣoḍaśin ceremony.<BR>—षोडशिन्, ई, m. one of the modifications of the<BR>Agni-ṣṭoma or Soma ceremony, (others being called<BR>Ukthya, Ati-rātra, Vāja-peya, &c.); a particular<BR>kind of Soma vessel.<BR>—षोडशि-मत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>having the above ceremony.<BR>—षोडशि-शस्त्र, अम्,<BR>n. a hymn or liturgical formula recited during the<BR>above ceremony.<BR>—षोडशोपचार (˚श-उप्˚), अस्,<BR>m. 16 ways of doing homage, (thus enumerated,<BR>आसन, स्वागत, पाद्य, अर्घ, आचमनीय, म-<BR>धुपर्क, आचमन, स्नान, वसन, आभरण,<BR>सुगन्धि, सुमनस्, धूप, दीप, नैवेद्य,<BR>वन्दन, q. q. v. v.)<BR>—षो-ऌअशन्, Ved. = षो-ड-<BR>शन्.<BR>—षोऌअशाक्षर, Ved. = षोडशाक्षर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1032-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष|षः
3. ष at the end of a comp. = षष् (e. g. पञ्च-<BR>ष, q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1033-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षट्क|षट्कः
षट्क, अस्, आ, अम्, having six, sixfold, six; (अम्),<BR>n. an aggregate of six.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1033-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षष्ट
षष्ट, अस्, ई, अम्, 60th, (but only in comps.<BR>after another numeral, e. g. एक-षष्ट, one and<BR>sixtieth or sixty-first; cf. द्वि-ष्˚, द्वा-ष्˚, त्रि-ष्˚,<BR>&c.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1033-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षष्टि|षष्टिः
षष्टि, इस्, f., 60.<BR>—षष्टि-तम, अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>60th, (this is the only form of this ordinal allowed<BR>except in comps. after another numeral, cf. षष्ट<BR>above.)<BR>—षष्टि-धा, ind. in 60 ways.<BR>—षष्टि-<BR>पथ, 60 paths, (thought by some to apply to<BR>the first 60 Adhyāyas of the Śatapatha-Brāhmaṇa.)<BR>—षष्टि-भाग, अस्, m. epithet of Śiva.<BR>—षष्टि-<BR>मत्त, अस्, m. an elephant who has reached the age<BR>of 60 years (or is in rut at that period; this is<BR>supposed to end the first half of his life, cf. षष्टि-<BR>हायन).<BR>—षष्टि-योजनी, f. a journey or extent<BR>of 60 Yojanas.<BR>—षष्टि-लता, f. a kind of plant<BR>(= भ्रमर-मारी).<BR>—षष्टि-वर्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ,<BR>having 60 years, 60 years old.<BR>—षष्टि-संवत्-<BR>सर, अस्, m. a period of 60 years or the 60th year<BR>(from birth &c.).<BR>—षष्टि-हायन, अस्, m. a period<BR>of 60 years or the 60th year (from birth &c.); (अस्,<BR>आ, अम्), 60 years old; (अस्), m. an elephant; a kind<BR>of rice, (see षष्टिक.)<BR>—षष्ट्य्-अधिक, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, exceeded by 60.<BR>—षष्ट्य्-अधिक-शत, अम्,<BR>n., 160.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1033-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षष्टिक|षष्टिकः
षष्टिक, अस्, आ, अम्, bought with 60; (अस्, आ),<BR>m. f. a kind of rice of quick growth (ripening in<BR>about 60 days).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1033-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षष्टिक्य|षष्टिक्यं
षष्टिक्य, अस्, आ, अम्, (a field &c.) fit for sowing<BR>with the above rice; (अम्), n. a field sown with this<BR>rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1033-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षष्ठ|षष्ठः
षष्ठ, अस्, ई, अम्, sixth, the sixth; (अस्), m.,<BR>scil. अक्षर, the sixth letter, i. e. the vowel ई (in<BR>the Ṛg-veda Prātiśākhya); (ई), f. the sixth day of a<BR>lunar fortnight; a particular Tithi when rites are per-<BR>formed to the sixth lunar digit; the sixth or genitive<BR>case; an epithet of Durgā in the form Kātyāyanī or<BR>of one of the 16 divine mothers; [cf. Zend kṣtva<BR>for kṣvasta; Gr. ἕκτος; Lat. sextus; Goth. sach-<BR>sta(n); Angl. Sax. sixta; Lith. szeszta-s; Slav.<BR>ses-ty; Hib. seiseadh.]<BR>—षष्ठादि (˚ठ-आदि),<BR>इस्, इस्, इ, beginning with the sixth letter, i. e. with the<BR>vowel ई (in Vedic grammar).<BR>—षष्ठान्न (˚ठ-<BR>अन्˚), अम्, n. the sixth meal.<BR>—षष्ठान्न-काल<BR>or षष्ठान्न-कालक, अम्, n. taking food at<BR>the sixth period, i. e. once in three days as an<BR>act of penance, (also written षष्ठालु-कालक.)<BR>—षष्ठान्नकाल-ता, f. eating only at the time<BR>of the sixth meal, i. e. once in three days or on<BR>the evening of every third day.<BR>—षष्ठी-जाय,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">Page1034-a+ 68</a>]<BR>अस्, m. one who has a sixth wife.<BR>—षष्ठी-तत्पु-<BR>रुष or षष्ठी-समास, अस्, m. a Tat-puruṣa<BR>compound of which the first member is a genitive<BR>case.<BR>—षष्ठी-पूजन, अम्, n. or षष्ठी-पूजा,<BR>f. worship of the goddess Ṣaṣṭhī (especially per-<BR>formed by a woman on the sixth day after delivery).<BR>—षष्ठी-व्रत, अम्, n. a religious observance<BR>kept on the sixth day of one of the halves of a<BR>month.<BR>—षष्ठ्य्-आदि-कल्प-बोधन, अम्, n. a<BR>festival in honour of Durgā on the sixth day of the<BR>month Āśvina (when she is supposed to be awakened).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1033-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षष्ठक|षष्ठकः
षष्ठक, अस्, आ or ई (?) or इका, अम्, sixth, the<BR>sixth; (इका), f., N. of one of the divine mothers,<BR>(see षष्ठी.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षष्ठिन्
षष्ठिन्, ई, इनी, इ, having a sixth, having or<BR>being the sixth (year &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षोढा
षो-ढा, ind. in six ways, sixfold.<BR>—षोढा-<BR>न्यास, अस्, m. 16 ways of disposing magical texts<BR>on the body (as practised by the Tāntrikas).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षह्
षह् षह् = rt. 1. सह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षहसान
षहसान, अस्, आ, अम्, patient; (अस्), m. a pea-<BR>cock; sacrifice (= सहसान, q. v.; according to<BR>Śabda-k. written षहसानु).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षाच्
षाच् षाच् for साच्, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षाट्
षाट् षाट्, ind. a vocative particle or inter-<BR>jection of calling (according to some).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षाट्कौशिक
षाट्कौशिक षाट्कौशिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. षट्-<BR>कोश), enveloped in six sheathes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षाट्पौरुषिक
षाट्पौरुषिक षाट्पौरुषिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr.<BR>षष् + पुरुष), relating or belonging to six<BR>generations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षाडव|षाडवः
षाडव षाडव, अम्, n. (fr. षष्), senti-<BR>ment, passion; singing, music; a particular kind of<BR>Rāga; [cf. षड्-ज.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षाड्गुण्य|षाड्गुण्यं
षाड्गुण्य षाड्गुण्य, अम्, n. (fr. षड्-गुण),<BR>the aggregate of six qualities; six properties; six<BR>measures or acts of royal policy, (see षड्-गुण);<BR>six articles (of any kind); multiplication of anything<BR>by six.<BR>—षाड्गुण्य-प्रयोग, अस्, m. the applica-<BR>tion or practice of the above six measures.<BR>—षाड्-<BR>गुण्य-संयुत, अस्, आ, अम्, connected or accom-<BR>panied with the six qualities or measures, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षाण्मातुर|षाण्मातुरः
षाण्मातुर षाण्मातुर, अस्, m. (fr. षष् + मा-<BR>तृ), ‘having six mothers,’ epithet of Kārttikeya, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षाण्मासिक
षाण्मासिक षाण्मासिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. षण्-<BR>मास), six-monthly, half-yearly, six months old, of<BR>six months standing, lasting six months.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षाण्मास्य
षाण्मास्य, &c. = षाण्मासिक; [cf. षण्मा-<BR>स्य.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षात्वणत्विक|षात्वणत्विकः
षात्वणत्विक षात्वणत्विक, अस्, ई, अम्, (fr.<BR>षत्व-णत्व), relating to the substitution of ष्<BR>for स् and ण् for न्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षामिल
षामिल षामिल, N. of a place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षाष्ठ|षाष्ठः
षाष्ठ षाष्ठ, अस्, ई, अम्, (fr. षष्ठ),<BR>sixth, the sixth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षाष्ठिक
षाष्ठिक, अस्, ई, अम्, belonging to the sixth,<BR>taught or explained in the sixth book of Pāṇini,<BR>(similarly आष्टमिक, taught in the eighth book.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षिट्
षिट् षिट् = rt. सिट्, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षिड्ग|षिड्गः
षिड्ग, अस्, m. a profligate man, libertine, lecher;<BR>an inconstant lover, gallant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षु|षुः
षु 1. षु = rt. 4. सु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षु|षुः
2. षु, उस्, m. child-bearing, parturition, delivery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षू
षू, ऊस्, f. (= 4. सू, q. v.), child-bearing, delivery,<BR>birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षुक्क्
षुक्क् षुक्क् = rt. ष्वस्क्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षुराजिम
षुराजिम षुराजिम, N. of a place; [cf.<BR>षराजिम.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षुराशाण
षुराशाण, N. of a place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षोडशन्
षोडशन् षो-डशन्, &c. See p. 1033, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षोढा
षो-ढा. See col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षोळशन्
षोळशन् षो-ऌअशन्. See p. 1033, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्टम्भ्
ष्टम्भ् ष्टम्भ्. See rt. स्तम्भ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ट्युम|ष्ट्युमः
ष्ट्युम ष्ट्युम, अस्, m. (according to some)<BR>the moon; light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ट्यै
ष्ट्यै ष्ट्यै. See rt. स्त्यै.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठा
ष्ठा ष्ठा. See rt. स्था.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठिव्
ष्ठिव् ष्ठिव् or ष्ठीव्, cl. 1. 4. P. ष्ठी-<BR>वति or ष्ठीव्यति, टिष्ठेव or तिष्-<BR>ठेव, ष्ठेविष्यति, अष्ठेवीत्, ष्ठेवितुम्, to<BR>spit, spit out, eject saliva from the mouth; to sputter:<BR>Pass. ष्ठीव्यते, Aor. अष्ठेवि: Caus. ष्ठेव-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, Aor. अटिष्ठिवत् or अतिष्ठिवत्:<BR>Desid. टिष्ठेविषति or तिष्ठेविषति, टुष्ठ्यू-<BR>षति or तुष्ठ्यूषति: Intens. टेष्ठीव्यते or<BR>तेष्ठीव्यते; [cf. probably Gr. σίαλον, σίαλος,<BR>στυγέω, στύξ, σπῖλος, σπιλόω, ψύττω, πτύω,<BR>ἐπιφθύζω; Lat. spuo; Goth. speivan; Angl. Sax.<BR>spiwan; Old Germ. spīchilla.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठीवन|ष्ठीवनं
ष्ठीवन, अम्, n. the act of spitting, ejecting<BR>saliva; saliva, spittle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठीव्यमान
ष्ठीव्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being spit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठेव
ष्ठेव, अस्, m. spitting, sputtering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठेवन|ष्ठेवनं
ष्ठेवन, अम्, n. = ष्ठीवन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठेवितव्य
ष्ठेवितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be spit or spit out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठेवितृ
ष्ठेवितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who spits, spitting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठेवित्वा
ष्ठेवित्वा, ind. having spit, having ejected saliva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठेविन्
ष्ठेविन्, ई, इनी, इ, spitting, ejecting from the<BR>mouth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठेव्य
ष्ठेव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be spit, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठ्यूत
ष्ठ्यूत, अस्, आ, अम्, spit, ejected (as saliva).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठ्यूति
ष्ठ्यूति, इस्, f. spitting, sputtering out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठ्यूत्वा
ष्ठ्यूत्वा, ind. having spit or spit out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्वक्क्
ष्वक्क् ष्वक्क् = rt. ष्वस्क्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्वस्क्
ष्वस्क् ष्वस्क् or ष्वष्क् (also written<BR>ष्वक्क्, षुक्क्, स्वस्क्), cl. 1. A. ष्व-<BR>स्कते, ष्वष्कते, &c., to go, (in Naigh. II. 14.<BR>ष्वःकति, or according to another reading ष्वष्-<BR>कति, and षष्कति are enumerated among the<BR>गति-कर्माणः.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स|सं|सः
स 1. स, the thirty-second consonant of<BR>the Nāgarī alphabet and last of the three sibilants;<BR>it belongs to the dental class and in sound corres-<BR>ponds to स् in सिन्.<BR>—स-कार, अस्, m. the letter or<BR>sound स्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स|सं|सः
स 2. स, (in prosody) an anapest or foot<BR>consisting of two short syllables followed by a long<BR>one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स|सं|सः
स 3. स, अस्, m. a snake; air, wind; a<BR>bird; an abbreviated term for the musical note<BR>षड्-ज; Śiva; Viṣṇu; (आ), f. the goddess Lak-<BR>ṣmī; (अम्), n. knowledge; meditation; a carriage<BR>road; a fence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स|सं|सः
स 4. स, the actual base for the nom. case<BR>masc. of the third personal pronoun तद्, q. v., (Ved.<BR>loc. सस्मिन्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स|सं|सः
स 5. स, ind. a prefix substituted for सह<BR>or सम् or सम, and when combined with nouns to<BR>form compound adjectives and adverbs yielding the<BR>senses ‘with,’ ‘together with,’ ‘along with,’ ‘having,’<BR>‘accompanied by,’ ‘possessing,’ ‘same,’ ‘similar,’ or<BR>translateable by the English adverbial affix ‘ly’<BR>(e. g. स-कोप, having anger, angry; स-कोपम्,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-c" target="_blank">Page1034-c+ 77</a>]<BR>with anger, angrily; स-भार्य, accompanied by a<BR>wife; साग्नि, along with fire; सोपधि, fraudu-<BR>lently; स-धर्मन्, having similar duties); [cf.<BR>Lith. sa in sa-darbininkas, ‘a fellow-worker;’ sa-<BR>karawis, ‘a fellow-soldier:’ Gr. σα in σαφής (cf.<BR>φάος, φῶς); ἀ in some compounds, as in ἄλοχος,<BR>ἄκοιτις, ἀκοίτης, ἀδελφός (= सोदर).]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सं|स|सः
सं सं, ind. See सम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संय|संयः
संय सं-य. See under सं-यम् below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयज्
संयज् सं-यज्, cl. 1. P. A. -यजति, -ते,<BR>-यष्टुम्, to worship together, offer sacrifices at<BR>the same time; to sacrifice, worship, adore, honour;<BR>to consecrate, dedicate: Caus. -याजयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to cause to sacrifice together; (in Vedic ritual) to<BR>perform the Patnī-saṃyājas, repeat the Saṃ-yāja<BR>Mantras; to perform a sacrifice for another, act as<BR>sacrificing priest for any one (acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयाज
सं-याज, अस्, m. a sacrifice, (see पत्नी-स्˚.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयाज्य
सं-याज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be made or allowed to<BR>sacrifice, &c., (अ-संयाज्य, one with whom nobody<BR>is allowed to sacrifice); (अम्), n. sacrificing [cf.<BR>अयाज्य-स्˚]; (आ), f., N. of the Yājyā and Anu-<BR>vākyā Mantras (as required in the Sviṣṭa-kṛt<BR>ceremony).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समिष्ट
सम्-इष्ट. See s. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयत्|संयन्त्
संयत् 1. सं-यत्, cl. 1. A. (Ved. also P.)<BR>-यतते (-ति), to unite, join (P. Ved., but according<BR>to Sāy. on Ṛg-veda VI. 67, 3. संयतथस् =<BR>संयच्छथस्); to form or be formed in rows; to<BR>unite, meet together, agree, coincide, coalesce, join<BR>with; to encounter, quarrel, dispute, contend (e. g.<BR>देवासुराः समयतन्त, the gods and Asuras con-<BR>tended).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयत्त
सं-यत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, prepared, ready, entirely<BR>devoted to, taking great care, being on guard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयन्त्रित
संयन्त्रित सं-यन्त्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, fastened<BR>with bands, held in, stopped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयम्
संयम् सं-यम्, cl. 1. P. -यच्छति (some-<BR>times also A. -ते), &c., -यन्तुम्, to hold together,<BR>hold in, hold fast; to restrain thoroughly or com-<BR>pletely, check, guide, control, govern, have power<BR>over; to guide or drive horses; to keep down,<BR>suppress (passions, feelings, &c.), subdue; to bind or<BR>fasten together, tie up; to put together, heap up;<BR>to shut up, close; to keep or maintain in order;<BR>to constrain; to make a present, present with, give<BR>to (A. with inst. of person when the action is illicit;<BR>P. with dat. when the action is usual, see Pāṇ. I.<BR>3, 55): Pass. -यम्यते, to be restrained or kept<BR>in check, &c.: Caus. -यमयति, &c., to cause to<BR>restrain, &c.; to subdue, overcome; to fasten to-<BR>gether, bind up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संय|संयः
सं-य, अस्, m. a skeleton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयत्|संयन्त्
2. सं-यत्, त्, त्, त् (also to be connected with rt.<BR>2. यत्), Ved. making efforts, zealous, eager; strong,<BR>plentiful, abundant; (त्), m. f. contest, conflict, war,<BR>battle (= सङ्ग्राम, Naigh. II. 17).<BR>—संयद्-<BR>वर, अस्, m. ‘chief in battle,’ a king, prince, chief;<BR>[cf. सम्पद्वर.]<BR>—संयद्-वीर, अस्, आ, अम्, ex-<BR>plained by Sāy. on Ṛg-veda II. 4, 8. संयतो वीरा<BR>यस्मिन् तादृश, perhaps an epithet of ‘food’ as<BR>‘supporting strong heroes.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयत|संयतः
सं-यत, अस्, आ, अम्, held together, held in;<BR>well or completely restrained, checked, controlled,<BR>fettered, confined, governed, guided, driven; kept<BR>down, suppressed, subdued; bound together, bound;<BR>fastened up, tied up; imprisoned; restricted, limited,<BR>kept in order, arranged; = उद्यत, prepared, ready<BR>(with inf.); (अस्), m. one who restrains or controls<BR>himself, an ascetic; epithet of Śiva.<BR>—संयत-<BR>चेतस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, one whose mind is restrained,<BR>controlled in mind.<BR>—संयत-प्राण, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>one whose breath is suppressed or whose organs are<BR>restrained.<BR>—शंयत-मानस, अस्, आ, अम्, having<BR>the mind completely controlled.<BR>—संयत-वत्, आन्,<BR>अती, अत्, one who has restrained or controlled (his<BR>passions, feelings, &c.).<BR>—संयत-वस्त्र, अस्, आ,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">Page1035-a+ 78</a>]<BR>अम्, one whose dress is fastened.<BR>—संयत-वाच्,<BR>क्, क्, क्, restrained in speech, taciturn, silent.<BR>—सं-<BR>यताक्ष (˚त-अक्˚), अस्, ई, अम्, one whose eyes are<BR>restrained or closed.<BR>—संयताञ्जलि (˚त-अञ्˚), इस्,<BR>इस्, इ, one whose hands are joined together (for en-<BR>treaty or salutation, = बद्धाञ्जलि).<BR>—संयतात्-<BR>मन् (˚त-आत्˚), आ, आ, अ, one whose mind is restrained<BR>or subdued, having a well regulated spirit, self-con-<BR>trolled.<BR>—संयताहार (˚त-आह्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, one<BR>whose food is restrained, temperate in eating.<BR>—सं-<BR>यतेन्द्रिय (˚त-इन्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, one whose senses<BR>or passions are restrained, controlled in feelings.<BR>—संयतोपस्कर (˚त-उप्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, one<BR>whose house-furniture is kept in order, having a<BR>well regulated house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1034-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयत्वर|संयत्वरः
संयत्वर, अस्, m. (according to Śabda-k.) =<BR>वाग्-यत; = जन्तु-समूह.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयन्तृ|संयंतृ
सं-यन्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who restrains or keeps<BR>in check, restraining, controlling, &c., a restrainer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयम|संयमः
सं-यम, अस्, m. restraint, check, control, for-<BR>bearance, abstinence; N. of the last three stages of<BR>the Yoga system; a religious vow; any religious act<BR>on the day preceding a vow or course of penance;<BR>avoiding infliction of pain on others, humanity, com-<BR>passionateness.<BR>—संयम-पुण्य-तीर्थ, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, having restraint for a holy place of pilgrimage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयमक|संयमकः
सं-यमक, अस्, आ or इका, अम्, restraining,<BR>checking, curbing; who or what restrains, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयमत्
सं-यमत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, restraining, subduing,<BR>curbing, who or what restrains, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयमन|संयमनं|संयमनः
सं-यमन, अस्, m. one who restrains, a ruler;<BR>(अम्), n. the act of restraining, checking; binding,<BR>confinement; drawing in; holding, detaining; for-<BR>bearance, self-denial, control; a religious vow or<BR>obligation; a cluster or square of four houses; (ई),<BR>f., N. of the city or residence of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयमित|संयमितः
सं-यमित, अस्, आ, अम्, restrained, checked,<BR>controlled, regulated; bound, confined, fettered,<BR>held, detained; assembled, collected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयमिन्
सं-यमिन्, ई, इनी, इ, who or what restrains or<BR>subdues, restraining, checking, curbing, abstaining;<BR>(ई), m. one who subdues or controls his passions, an<BR>ascetic, saint, sage, hermit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयम्य
सं-यम्य, ind. having restrained or controlled;<BR>having bound together or fastened up; having<BR>fastened or closed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयम्यमान
सं-यम्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being held to-<BR>gether or restrained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयाम|संयामः
सं-याम, अस्, m. restraint, check, control, for-<BR>bearance; abstaining from giving pain to others,<BR>humanity.<BR>—संयाम-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, possessed<BR>of restraint, forbearing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयस्
संयस् सं-यस्, cl. 4. 1. P. -यस्यति, -य-<BR>सति, &c., to make effort, &c., (see rt. यस्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयास
सं-यास, अस्, m. making effort, exertion, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संया
संया सं-या, cl. 2. P. -याति, -यातुम्, to go<BR>or proceed together, go, wander, travel; to come<BR>together, assemble, meet; to meet together (hos-<BR>tilely), come to blows, fight; to go to, enter, pene-<BR>trate; to go to any state or condition (e. g. एकतां<BR>संया, ‘to go to oneness, become one’); to go<BR>towards, be directed towards, aim at; to come.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयात
सं-यात, अस्, आ, अम्, gone or proceeded to-<BR>gether, travelled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयात्रा
सं-यात्रा, f. travelling, voyaging by sea (to<BR>another country).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयान|संयानं|संयानः
सं-यान, अस्, m. a mould; (अम्), n. going toge-<BR>ther, going along with, accompanying; proceeding, tra-<BR>velling, departure; the carrying out of a dead body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयाच्
संयाच् सं-याच्, cl. 1. A. -याचते, -याचितुम्,<BR>to ask, beg, request, implore, solicit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयाम|संयामः
संयाम सं-याम. See above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयु
संयु सं-यु, cl. 2. P., 9. P. A. -यौति, -यु-<BR>नाति, -युनीते, (for Ved. forms see under rt. 2. यु),<BR>-यवितुम्, to attach to one's self, lay hold of, attack,<BR>consume (Ved.); to attach to, share with, bestow<BR>on (Ved.); to join or connect together, mix, mingle,<BR>combine, unite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयवन
सं-यवन, अम्, n. = सञ्-जवन, a square of<BR>four houses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयाव|संयावः
सं-याव, अस्, m. a sort of cake (of wheaten<BR>flour fried with ghee and milk and made up into<BR>an oblong form with sugar and spices).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुत|संयुतः
सं-युत, अस्, आ, अम्, joined together, connected,<BR>joined, attached, mixed with, blended, heaped to-<BR>gether; endowed or furnished with; consisting of<BR>(with inst.); relating to, implying, (प्रैष्य-स्˚, [a<BR>name] implying service.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुयूषु
सं-युयूषु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing to join together,<BR>wishing to unite, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुज्
संयुज् 1. सं-युज्, cl. 7. P. A. -युनक्ति,<BR>-युङ्क्ते, &c., -योक्तुम्, to join or attach together,<BR>connect, combine, unite; to endow with; to form<BR>an alliance, league together; to place in, fix in or<BR>on, set in (with loc.), direct towards: Pass. -युज्-<BR>यते, to be joined together, be united, &c.: Caus.<BR>-योजयति, -ते, -यितुम्, to cause to join together;<BR>to bring together, unite, connect, mix together; to<BR>yoke, harness; to prepare, equip (an army); to<BR>fasten or fix on, put on (with loc.), direct towards;<BR>to shoot, discharge (a missile &c.); to use, employ;<BR>to place in, appoint to (an office); to prepare, equip<BR>(an army &c.); to furnish or supply with, endow<BR>with, provide with, present with; to give over to,<BR>entrust with (with acc. and gen.); to bring about, per-<BR>form, accomplish; to be absorbed, meditate (A.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुक्त|संयुक्तः
सं-युक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, conjoined, joined with,<BR>connected, attached; mixed, blended; accompanied<BR>or attended by; endowed or furnished with, pos-<BR>sessed of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुग|संयुगः
सं-युग, अस्, m. conjunction, union, mixture;<BR>conflict, contest, war, battle, (in Naigh. II. 17. सं-<BR>युगे [loc. c.] is enumerated among the सङ्ग्राम-<BR>नामानि.)<BR>—संयुग-गोष्पद, अम्, n. a contest<BR>in a cow's footstep, i. e. an insignificant struggle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुज्
2. सं-युज्, क्, क्, क्, joined together, united, con-<BR>nected, associated with; possessed of or endowed<BR>with good qualities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुज्य
सं-युज्य, ind. having joined together, becom-<BR>ing united.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोग|संयोगः
सं-योग, अस्, m. conjunction, connection, junc-<BR>tion, adherence, intimate union, close connection,<BR>association, living together; a kind of alliance or<BR>peace made between two kings for a common object;<BR>(in phil.) simple conjunction or connection; conjunc-<BR>tion (as one of the twenty-four Guṇas of the Nyāya);<BR>a particular relation, (see under सम्-बन्ध); ad-<BR>herence, possession; (in gram.) a conjunct conso-<BR>nant; (in astron.) conjunction of two heavenly<BR>bodies; endowment with; annexation, addition, ac-<BR>cession; epithet of Śiva.<BR>—संयोग-पृथक्त्व,<BR>अम्, n. (in phil.) separateness or severalty of con-<BR>junction, (a term applied to express the distinction<BR>between what is optional and non-optional in an<BR>action.)<BR>—संयोग-विरुद्ध, अम्, n. any eatables<BR>which cause disease by being mixed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोगित|संयोगितः
सं-योगित, अस्, आ, अम्, joined together, con-<BR>nected, annexed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोगिन्
सं-योगिन्, ई, इनी, इ, having union or connection,<BR>conjoined, associated; joining, connecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोजक
सं-योजक, अस्, इका, अम्, joining together, con-<BR>necting, uniting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोजन|संयोजनं
सं-योजन, अम्, n. the act of joining or uniting<BR>together, conjunction; copulation, coition; (प्रहि-<BR>तोः? संयोजनम्, N. of a Sāman.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोजित|संयोजितः
सं-योजित, अस्, आ, अम्, conjoined, attached, an-<BR>nexed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोज्य
सं-योज्य, ind. having joined together or united;<BR>having enjoined or directed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुध्
संयुध् सं-युध्, cl. 4. A. -युध्यते, -योद्-<BR>धुम्, to fight together, fight with, combat, oppose:<BR>Caus. -योधयति, -यितुम्, to cause to fight together,<BR>bring into conflict or collision; to fight together,<BR>encounter: Desid. -युयुत्सति, to desire to fight, be<BR>eager for battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुप्
संयुप् सं-युप्, cl. 4. P. -युप्यति, &c.,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">Page1035-c+ 77</a>]<BR>Ved. to efface: Caus. -योपयति, -यितुम्, to efface,<BR>obliterate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोपयत्
सं-योपयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, Ved. obliterating,<BR>effacing; smoothing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरक्ष्
संरक्ष् सं-रक्ष्, cl. 1. P. -रक्षति, -रक्-<BR>षितुम्, to guard, watch, take care of, protect, de-<BR>fend, preserve, save; to keep off, ward off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरक्ष|संरक्षः
सं-रक्ष, अस्, m. protection, care, preservation,<BR>ward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरक्षण|संरक्षणं
सं-रक्षण, अम्, n. the act of protecting,<BR>guarding, preserving, taking care of, charge, custody,<BR>protection; saving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरक्षित
सं-रक्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, protected, preserved,<BR>taken care of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरक्षितव्य
सं-रक्षितव्य or सं-रक्षणीय, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>to be preserved or guarded or taken care of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरक्ष्य
1. सं-रक्ष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, = सं-रक्षितव्य<BR>above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरक्ष्य
2. सं-रक्ष्य, ind. having guarded or protected,<BR>&c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरक्ष्यमाण
सं-रक्ष्यमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, being protected<BR>or preserved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरञ्ज्|संरंज्
संरञ्ज् सं-रञ्ज्, cl. 1. 4. P. A. -रजति, -ते,<BR>-रज्यति, -ते, -रङ्क्तुम्, to be dyed or coloured,<BR>become red; to be affected with any passion: Caus.<BR>-रञ्जयति, -ते, -यितुम्, to colour, dye, redden; to<BR>please, gratify, charm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरक्त
सं-रक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, coloured, red; impas-<BR>sioned; inflamed, angry, enamoured, charmed;<BR>charming, beautiful.<BR>—संरक्त-लोचन, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>red-eyed, having the eyes reddened (with fury).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरञ्जयत्
सं-रञ्जयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, colouring, dyeing;<BR>pleasing, gratifying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरञ्जित
सं-रञ्जित, अस्, आ, अम्, coloured, dyed, reddened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संराग|संरागः
सं-राग, अस्, m. colouring; affection, passion;<BR>anger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरभ्
संरभ् सं-रभ्, cl. 1. A. -रभते, -रब्-<BR>धुम्, to seize or take hold of together (Ved.),<BR>take hold of mutually; to become possessed of, (Sāy.<BR>संरभेमहि = सङ्गच्छेमहि, Ṛg-veda I. 53,<BR>4, 5); to become roused or incensed or angry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरब्ध
सं-रब्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, seized, held, taken hold<BR>of (Ved.); closely joined or connected, hand in hand;<BR>excited, aroused, exasperated, inflamed, agitated;<BR>incensed, enraged, furious, angry; increased, aug-<BR>mented; swelled, swelling; overwhelmed.<BR>—सं-<BR>रब्ध-नेत्र, अस्, आ, अम्, having inflamed or angry<BR>eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरभ्य
सं-रभ्य, ind. having become angry, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरम्भ|संरंभ|संरंभः|संरम्भः
सं-रम्भ, अस्, m. taking hold of, beginning<BR>[cf. आ-रम्भ]; energy, zeal, impetuosity, impetu-<BR>ous onset, turbulence; agitation, flurry, rage, wrath,<BR>fury, anger; pride, arrogance; swelling with heat<BR>and inflammation.<BR>—संरम्भ-ताम्र, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>red with fury.<BR>—संरम्भ-परुष, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>harsh from rage, impetuously harsh or rough.<BR>—सं-<BR>रम्भ-रस, अस्, आ, अम्, feeling great wrath or<BR>resentment.<BR>—संरम्भ-वेग, अस्, m. the violence<BR>or impetuosity of wrath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरम्भमाण
सं-रम्भमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, being aroused or<BR>excited, being incensed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरम्भिन्|संरंभिन्
संरम्भिन्, ई, इणी, इ, agitated, exasperated, flur-<BR>ried; wrathful, furious, angry; proud.<BR>—संरम्-<BR>भि-ता, f. or संरम्भि-त्व, अम्, n. agitation;<BR>wrath, fury; pride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरम्
संरम् सं-रम्, cl. 1. A. -रमते, -रन्तुम्,<BR>to be delighted, find pleasure in (with loc.), rejoice<BR>greatly; to have carnal pleasure or sexual intercourse<BR>with, dally with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरा
संरा सं-रा, cl. 2. P. -राति, &c., Ved. to<BR>give liberally, bestow, grant, confer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरराण
सं-रराण, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. bestowing, grant-<BR>ing, liberal, (Sāy. = सं-रममाण); sharing, di-<BR>viding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संराज्
संराज् 1. सं-राज्, cl. 1. P. A. -राजति, -ते,<BR>राजितुम्, to reign universally, reign as a paramount<BR>sovereign, reign over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1035-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंराज्
2. शं-राज्, ट्, m. (properly written with म् by Pāṇ.<BR>VIII. 3, 25). See सम्-राज् s. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संराजत्
सं-राजत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, reigning universally;<BR>(अन्), m. a sovereign lord (= सम्-राज्, and written<BR>with म् in Ṛg-veda I. 27, 1).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संराध्
संराध् सं-राध्, cl. 4. P. A. -राध्यति, -ते,<BR>&c. (see rt. राध्, p. 842), to be accomplished or<BR>perfected; to be acquired or brought into possession:<BR>Caus. -राधयति, -यितुम्, to bring into harmony;<BR>to agree together, agree about or upon (with loc.);<BR>to conciliate, propitiate, appease, satisfy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संराद्ध
सं-राद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, accomplished, acquired,<BR>participated in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संराधन|संराधनं
सं-राधन, अम्, n. the act of propitiating or<BR>appeasing, conciliation, propitiation, pleasing by wor-<BR>ship; the act of accomplishing or perfecting; perfect<BR>meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संराधयत्|संराधयन्त्
सं-राधयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, bringing into har-<BR>mony; agreeing with, being in unison with; con-<BR>ciliating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संराधित
सं-राधित, अस्, आ, अम्, propitiated, appeased,<BR>pleased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संराध्य
सं-राध्य, ind. having propitiated, having<BR>gratified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संराव|संरावः
संराव सं-राव. See below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरिह्
संरिह् सं-रिह्, a Vedic form of सं-लिह्,<BR>q. v., (see also rt. रिह्, p. 847.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरिहाण|संरिहाणं
सं-रिहाण, अस्, आ, अम्, affectionately licking,<BR>caressing (said of a cow licking its calf).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरी
संरी सं-री, cl. 9. P. A. -रिणाति, -रिणीते,<BR>&c. (see rts. 1. रि, 1. री), Ved. to bring together,<BR>restore, set free, liberate; to wash, purify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरु
संरु सं-रु, cl. 2. P. -रौति, -रवीति, &c.,<BR>to cry or clamour together, shout, roar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संराव|संरावः
सं-राव, अस्, m. clamour, uproar, tumult, sound,<BR>noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संराविन्
सं-राविन्, ई, इणी, इ, shouting together, making<BR>an uproar, clamouring, roaring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरुच्
संरुच् सं-रुच्, cl. 1. A. -रोचते, -रोचितुम्,<BR>to shine together or at the same time, shine along<BR>with, shine in rivalry; to shine, beam, glitter:<BR>Caus. -रोचयति, -यितुम्, to find or take pleasure in<BR>(with acc.); to like, love, approve, choose, select.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरुज्
संरुज् सं-रुज्, cl. 6. P. -रुजति, &c., to<BR>break entirely, break to pieces, shatter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरुग्ण
सं-रुग्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, broken to pieces, shattered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरुध्
संरुध् सं-रुध्, cl. 7. P. A. -रुणद्धि,<BR>-रुन्द्धे, -रोद्धुम्, to stop completely, check,<BR>obstruct, hinder, keep back, restrain; to hold fast,<BR>fetter; to stop up, block up, stuff up, stuff, fill; to<BR>close up, shut up, besiege, invest, confine; to cover<BR>over, cover up, conceal; to keep from, withhold, re-<BR>frain, refuse: Caus. -रोधयति, -यितुम्, to cause<BR>to stop, obstruct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरुद्ध
सं-रुद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, completely stopped,<BR>checked, impeded, opposed, attacked; stopped up,<BR>blocked up, stuffed, filled; shut up, confined, be-<BR>sieged, invested; covered over, concealed, obscured;<BR>stopped or blocked up, filled; withheld, refused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरुध्य
सं-रुध्य, ind. having completely obstructed,<BR>having blocked up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरोध|संरोधः
सं-रोध, अस्, m. complete obstruction or op-<BR>position, impediment, hindrance, stop, prevention,<BR>check, curb; bond, fetter; throwing, sending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरोध्य
सं-रोध्य, ind. having completely obstructed<BR>or stopped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरुष्
संरुष् सं-रुष्, cl. 1. P. -रोषति, &c., to<BR>annoy, displease, make angry: Caus. -रोषयति,<BR>&c., to enrage, irritate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरुषित
सं-रुषित, अस्, आ, अम्, enraged, angry, irritated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरोष्यमाण
सं-रोष्यमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, being enraged,<BR>being irritated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरुह्
संरुह् सं-रुह्, cl. 1. P. -रोहति, -रोढुम्,<BR>to grow together; to grow over, be cicatrized, heal;<BR>to grow up, grow, increase, break forth, appear:<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">Page1036-b+ 75</a>]<BR>Caus. -रोपयति, -यितुम्, to cause to grow together<BR>or grow over or cicatrize; to heal; to cause to grow,<BR>plant, set, sow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरूढ|संरूढः
सं-रूढ, अस्, आ, अम्, grown together, grown<BR>over, cicatrized, healed; grown, sprouted, budded,<BR>blossomed; burst forth, appeared; growing fast or<BR>firmly, taking firm root; confident, bold (= प्रौ-<BR>ढ).<BR>—संरूढ-व्रण, अस्, आ, अम्, having a<BR>healed or cicatrized wound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरोपित
सं-रोपित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to grow, planted,<BR>sown, impregnated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरोहत्
सं-रोहत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, growing up, breaking<BR>or bursting forth, appearing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरूष्
संरूष् सं-रूष्, cl. 10. or Caus. -रूषयति,<BR>-रोषयति (?), &c., to spread over, smear, cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरूषित
सं-रूषित or सं-रोषित, अस्, आ, अम्, spread<BR>over, covered, besmeared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरेज्
संरेज् सं-रेज्, cl. 1. A. -रेजते, &c., Ved.<BR>to shake, quake, tremble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलक्ष्
संलक्ष् सं-लक्ष्, cl. 10. P. A. -लक्षयति,<BR>-ते, -यितुम्, to mark distinctly, distinguish, charac-<BR>terize; to observe, see, perceive, feel; to hear, learn,<BR>understand; to test, prove, try: Pass. -लक्ष्यते, to<BR>be distinguished; to be observed, &c.; to appear,<BR>seem; to be tested or proved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलक्षण|संलक्षणं
सं-लक्षण, अम्, n. the act of marking, dis-<BR>tinguishing, characterizing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलक्षित
सं-लक्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, distinctly marked,<BR>distinguished, characterized; observed, recognised,<BR>known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलक्ष्य
1. सं-लक्ष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be marked, dis-<BR>tinguishable, to be observed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलक्ष्य
2. सं-लक्ष्य, ind. having observed or per-<BR>ceived, having heard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलग्
संलग् सं-लग्, cl. 1. P. -लगति, &c., to<BR>adhere or stick together: Caus. -लागयति, &c., to<BR>put or place firmly upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलग्न|संलग्नः
सं-लग्न, अस्, आ, अम्, closely attached, stuck<BR>together, joined together, united with, adhering,<BR>adherent, sticking in, fallen into; come to close<BR>contact, come to blows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलङ्घ्
संलङ्घ् सं-लङ्घ्, cl. 1. P. A. -लङ्घति,<BR>-ते, &c., to leap over or beyond, pass by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलङ्घित
सं-लङ्घित, अस्, आ, अम्, passed by, gone by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलज्ज्
संलज्ज् सं-लज्ज्, cl. 6. A. -लज्जते, &c., to<BR>be ashamed, become embarrassed, blush.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलज्जमान
सं-लज्जमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being ashamed or<BR>embarrassed, blushing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलप्
संलप् सं-लप्, cl. 1. P. -लपति, &c., to<BR>talk together, chat, converse; to address, call, name:<BR>Pass. -लप्यते, to be spoken of, be called or named:<BR>Caus. -लापयति, -यितुम्, to cause to converse, ad-<BR>dress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलाप|संलापः
सं-लाप, अस्, m. talking together, familiar or<BR>friendly conversation, confabulation, chat, discourse;<BR>(in the drama) a kind of dialogue (having an occult<BR>meaning).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलापक|संलापकः
सं-लापक, अम्, n. a species of minor drama<BR>(said to be of a controversial kind).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलापित
सं-लापित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to converse, ad-<BR>dressed, spoken with, conversed; discoursing, con-<BR>versing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलापिन्
सं-लापिन्, ई, इनी, इ, conversing together in a<BR>friendly way, chatting; discoursing; one who con-<BR>verses or discourses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलभ्
संलभ् सं-लभ्, cl. 1. A. -लभते, &c.,<BR>-लब्धुम्, to seize one another, lay hold of mutu-<BR>ally; to take, obtain, receive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलब्ध
सं-लब्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, taken hold of; obtained,<BR>received.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलिप्सु
सं-लिप्सु, उस्, उस्, उ, desirous of seizing or taking<BR>hold of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलय|संलयः
संलय सं-लय. See सं-ली, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलल्
संलल् सं-लल्, Caus. -लालयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>cause to sport or dally together; to caress, fondle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलालित
सं-लालित, अस्, आ, अम्, caressed, fondled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलिख्
संलिख् सं-लिख्, cl. 6. P. -लिखति, -लिखि-<BR>तुम् or -लेखितुम्, to scratch, scarify, lance, make<BR>an incision; to write, engrave, inscribe; to touch,<BR>strike, play upon (a musical instrument).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलिखित
सं-लिखित, अस्, आ, अम्, scratched, &c., (used in<BR>Atharva-veda VII. 50, 5. to express some action<BR>practised in gambling.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलिह्
संलिह् सं-लिह्, cl. 2. P. A. -लेढि, -लीढे,<BR>-लेढुम्, to lick up, lick; to devour, enjoy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलिहत्
सं-लिहत्, अन्, अती, अत्, licking up, licking, de-<BR>vouring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलिहान
सं-लिहान, अस्, आ, अम्, licking up, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलीढ
सं-लीढ, अस्, आ, अम्, licked up, licked, enjoyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संली
संली सं-ली, cl. 4. A. -लीयते, -लेतुम् or<BR>-लातुम्, to cling to, stick close to, cleave to; to<BR>enter, go into; to lie down, cower, hide, be con-<BR>cealed; to melt away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलय|संलयः
सं-लय, अस्, m. lying down, sleep, sleepiness;<BR>melting away, dissolution (= प्र-लय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलयन|संलयनं
सं-लयन, अम्, n. the act of clinging or adher-<BR>ing to; lying down, &c.; dissolution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलीन
सं-लीन, अस्, आ, अम्, stuck close to, clung to,<BR>clinging to, staying in; joined together; hidden,<BR>concealed, cowered, cowering down; contracted.<BR>—संलीन-कर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, having ears inclined<BR>or hanging down.<BR>—संलीन-मानस, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>drooping or depressed in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलीय
सं-लीय, ind. having clung or stuck to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलीयमान
सं-लीयमान, अस्, आ, अम्, lying or cowering<BR>down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलुड्
संलुड् सं-लुड्, cl. 1. P. -लोडति, &c., to<BR>agitate, stir about, disturb: Caus. -लोडयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to stir about, move to and fro; to disarrange, con-<BR>found, disturb, throw into disorder or confusion:<BR>Pass. of Caus. -लोड्यते, to be agitated, be thrown<BR>into disorder; to be ruined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलोडन|संलोडनं
सं-लोडन, अम्, n. the act of agitating, disturb-<BR>ing, confusing; (अस्, ई, अम्), one who disturbs, &c.,<BR>a disturber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलोडित
सं-लोडित, अस्, आ, अम्, agitated, confounded, dis-<BR>ordered, perplexed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलोड्यमान
सं-लोड्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being thrown into<BR>disorder or confusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलुप्
संलुप् सं-लुप्, cl. 6. P. A., 4. P. -लुम्पति,<BR>-ते, -लुप्यति, &c., -लोप्तुम्, to break in pieces,<BR>destroy; to drag, tear, tear away: Caus. -लोपयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to cause to perish, destroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलुभ्
संलुभ् सं-लुभ् (in some senses apparently<BR>connected with सं-लुप्), cl. 4. P. -लुभ्यति, &c.,<BR>to be perplexed or disturbed, fall into confusion:<BR>Caus. -लोभयति, &c., to allure, entice, seduce; to<BR>disturb, disarrange, put in confusion (Ved.); to cause<BR>to disappear, efface, obliterate (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलुल्
संलुल् सं-लुल्, cl. 1. P. -लोलति, &c., to<BR>roll or stir about; to agitate, disturb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलुलित
सं-लुलित, अस्, आ, अम्, agitated, disordered, dis-<BR>arranged; mixed up with; besmeared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलोक्
संलोक् सं-लोक्, cl. 1. A. -लोकते, &c., to<BR>look together, look at one another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवंह्
संवंह् सं-वंह्. See सम्-बंह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवच्
संवच् सं-वच्, cl. 2. P. (in the non-con-<BR>jugational tenses also A., see rt. वच्), -वक्ति, &c., to<BR>proclaim, announce, publish, communicate; to speak,<BR>say; to speak to, address; to remonstrate or expostu-<BR>late with; to converse, talk with (A.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाच्य
सं-वाच्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be conversed with, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुक्त
सम्-उक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, spoken to, addressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवत्|संवन्त्
संवत् सं-वत्, f. (probably connected with<BR>2. सं-वस्), Ved. a region, (Sāy. = संविभाग-<BR>वत्, i. e. दिश्, Ṛg-veda I. 191, 15); an assemblage<BR>or host of people (come together for battle, &c.,<BR>Sāy. संवतः = सङ्गताञ् शत्रून्, Ṛg-veda V.<BR>15, 3; in Naigh. II. 17. संवतः is enumerated<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">Page1037-a+ 77</a>]<BR>among the सङ्ग्राम-नामानि); (त्), ind. (probably<BR>a contraction of सं-वत्सर below), a year; a<BR>year of Vikramāditya's era (commencing B. C. 57,<BR>as opposed to a year of the era of Śāli-vāhana, com-<BR>monly called Śaka or Śāka, q. v.); [cf. Gr. ἔτος,<BR>ἐνιαυτός.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवत्सर|संवत्सरः
सं-वत्सर, अस्, m. (according to Uṇādi-s. III. 72.<BR>fr. 2. सं-वस्, ‘to dwell with,’ because the seasons are<BR>supposed to abide in the year; वस् becomes वत् before<BR>affix सर, cf. rt. 6. वस्), a full year, year, (in the<BR>Purāṇas Saṃvatsara is personified as presiding over<BR>the seasons); a year of Vikramāditya's era, (see<BR>सं-वत् above); the first year in a cycle of five<BR>years; epithet of Śiva.<BR>—संवत्सर-कर, अस्, m.<BR>‘year-causer,’ epithet of Śiva.<BR>—संवत्सर-तम,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, completing a full year, yearly; [cf.<BR>मास-तम.]<BR>—संवत्सर-निरोध, अस्, m. im-<BR>prisonment for a year.<BR>—संवत्सर-प्रदीप, अस्,<BR>m., N. of a work.<BR>—संवत्सर-भ्रमि, इस्, इस्, इ,<BR>year-revolving, completing a revolution in a year<BR>(said of the sun).<BR>—संवत्सर-रय, अस्, m. a<BR>year's course.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवद्
संवद् सं-वद्, cl. 1. P. A. -वदति, -ते,<BR>-वदितुम्, to speak together, speak with, converse<BR>with (with inst.); to speak about, discourse upon<BR>(with loc.); to speak, speak to, address; to speak<BR>of as, designate, call, name; to sound together (said<BR>of musical instruments; P., Ved.); to agree, accord,<BR>consent: Caus. -वादयति, -ते, -यितुम्, to cause to<BR>converse with, cause a conversation about (with loc.);<BR>to cause to speak together, cause to agree; to agree<BR>upon, accord; to state accurately, give a true account<BR>of, declare; to invite or call upon to speak; to cause<BR>to sound, play (a musical instrument).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवदन|संवदनं
सं-वदन, अम्, n. the act of speaking together,<BR>conversing; communication of intelligence; con-<BR>sideration, examination, = आलोचन; (अम्, आ), n. f.<BR>subduing by charms (such as mystical gems, drugs,<BR>&c.), overpowering by magic, (probably for सं-<BR>वनन, q. v.); a charm, amulet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवदितव्य
सं-वदितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be spoken with,<BR>to be addressed, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाद|संवादः
सं-वाद, अस्, m. speaking together, conversation,<BR>colloquy, dialogue; discussing, discussion; commu-<BR>nication of intelligence, report, information, news;<BR>assent, concurrence; agreement, conformity, corres-<BR>pondence, sameness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवादन
सं-वादन, अम्, n. the act of causing to con-<BR>verse, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवादयत्
सं-वादयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, causing to converse<BR>or agree; agreeing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवादित
सं-वादित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to speak with,<BR>made to converse; agreed with or upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाद्य
सं-वाद्य, ind. having declared truly, having<BR>stated accurately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदित|समुदितः
1. सम्-उदित, अस्, आ, अम्, (for 2. see under सम्-<BR>उद्-इ), spoken with, conversed; spoken to, addressed,<BR>accosted; agreed upon, (यथा-समुदितम्, accord-<BR>ing to agreement); consented, settled, customary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्य
सम्-उद्य, ind. having spoken together; having<BR>concluded or agreed upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवन्
संवन् सं-वन्, Caus. -वनयति, &c., (in<BR>Atharva-veda VI. 9, 3. सं-वानयन्तु occurs),<BR>Ved. to cause to like or love, make well-disposed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवनन|संवननं
सं-वनन, अस्, आ or ई, अम्, subduing by charms,<BR>adorable, (Sāy. = स्तोतृभिः सम्यक् सम्भज-<BR>नीय); (अम्, आ), n. f. causing mutual fondness; sub-<BR>duing by magical drugs or charms [cf. सं-वदन];<BR>charming, fascination; means of securing love, a<BR>charm; fondness, love; (अस्), m., N. of an Āṅgirasa<BR>(author of the hymn Ṛg-veda X. 191).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवन्द्
संवन्द् सं-वन्द्, cl. 1. A. -वन्दते, -वन्-<BR>दितुम्, to salute respectfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवप्
संवप् सं-वप्, cl. 1. P. A. -वपति, -ते,<BR>-वप्तुम्, to throw together, mix, pour in, put in;<BR>to scatter, sow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर|संवरं|संवरः
संवर सं-वर. See under सं-वृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्ग|संवर्गः
संवर्ग सं-वर्ग. See under 1. सं-वृज्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्ण्
संवर्ण् सं-वर्ण्, cl. 10. P. -वर्णयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to communicate, relate, narrate, tell; to praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्त|संवर्तः|संवर्त्त|संवर्त्तः
संवर्त सं-वर्त, &c. See under सं-वृत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्धक|संवर्द्धकः
संवर्धक सं-वर्धक, &c. See under सं-<BR>वृध्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्मय
संवर्मय संवर्मय (fr. वर्मन् with सम्),<BR>Nom. P. A. संवर्मयति, -ते, -यितुम्, to put on<BR>armour, arm one's self fully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्मित|संवर्म्मित
संवर्मित, अस्, आ, अम्, fully armed, completely<BR>mailed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्षण
संवर्षण सं-वर्षण. See under सं-<BR>वृष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवल|संवलं|संवलः
संवल संवल. See सम्बल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवलित|संवलितः
संवलित सं-वलित, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. वल्<BR>with सम्), met together, mixed, mingled; con-<BR>nected or associated with; united; encompassed,<BR>surrounded; possessed of; broken, diversified (=<BR>चूर्णित, Kirāt. VI. 4, Schol.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवल्गित
संवल्गित सं-वल्गित, अस्, आ, अम्, overrun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संववृत्वस्
संववृत्वस् सं-ववृत्वस्, आन्, उषी, अत् (fr.<BR>rt. 1. वृत् with सम्, but apparently connected with<BR>rt. वृ), one who has enveloped, enveloping, (ac-<BR>cording to Sāy. on Ṛg-veda V. 31, 3. सं-ववृत्वत्<BR>= संवरण-शीलम्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवस्
संवस् 1. सं-वस् (see rt. 5. वस्), cl. 2. A.<BR>-वस्ते, -वसितुम्, to wear (clothes), be clad in, be<BR>dressed with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवस्त्रय
सं-वस्त्रय (fr. सम् + वस्त्र), Nom. P. -वस्-<BR>त्रयति, -यितुम्, to put on clothes, dress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवस्त्र्य
सं-वस्त्र्य, ind. having put on clothes, having<BR>dressed in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवस्
संवस् 2. सं-वस् (see rt. 6. वस्), cl. 1. P.<BR>A. -वसति, -ते, -वस्तुम्, to dwell together, live<BR>with, to have intercourse or dealings with (some-<BR>times with acc. of person); to cohabit with (with<BR>acc.); to stay, abide, dwell; to spend, pass (time):<BR>Caus. -वासयति, -यितुम्, to cause to dwell together,<BR>bring together; to furnish with lodging, lodge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवसत्
सं-वसत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, dwelling together, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवसथ|संवसथः
सं-वसथ, अस्, m. a place where people live<BR>together, village, inhabited place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवसन
सं-वसन, अम्, n. residing together, dwelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवसान
सं-वसान, अस्, आ, अम्, dwelling with, residing<BR>amongst.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवसु
सं-वसु, उस्, m., Ved. one who dwells along<BR>with, living with, (Sāy. सं-वसुः = संवसति,<BR>Ṛg-veda VIII. 39, 7.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवास|संवासः
सं-वास, अस्, m. dwelling along with, cohabita-<BR>tion, domestic intercourse; a dwelling, residence,<BR>house; an open space for meeting or recreation<BR>(either within or without a town, = सन्-निवेश);<BR>association, company, society.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुषित
सम्-उषित, अस्, आ, अम्, dwelt or lived together,<BR>stayed with; passed, spent (as time).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवह्
संवह् सं-वह् [cf. सम्-ऊह्], cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-वहति, -ते, -वोढुम्, to bear or carry together,<BR>convey together; to carry or bear along, take along,<BR>draw, drag, bear away; to convey; to bring near;<BR>to take a wife, marry; to carry the hand along the<BR>body, rub down, press together, shampoo, stroke,<BR>soothe; to manifest, display, express: Pass. -उह्यते,<BR>to be carried by, ride on (with inst.): Caus. -वाह-<BR>यति, -ते, -यितुम्, to cause to be carried together;<BR>to bring together, assemble, collect; to drive (a car-<BR>riage &c.), guide, conduct, lead, lead or conduct to<BR>(one's home), take a wife, marry; to carry the hand<BR>along the body, stroke, shampoo: Pass. of Caus.<BR>-वाह्यते, to be carried away, be driven along, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवह|संवहः
सं-वह, अस्, m. bearing or carrying along; N.<BR>of the wind of the third of the seven Mārgas or paths<BR>of the sky, (viz. that which impels the moon; the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">Page1037-c+ 73</a>]<BR>other six are called आ-वह, प्र-व्˚, उद्-व्˚, वि-व्˚,<BR>परि-व्˚, नि-व्˚, the Saṃ-vaha coming above the<BR>Ud-vaha wind.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाह|संवाहः
सं-वाह, अस्, m. bearing or carrying along,<BR>pressing together; rubbing the body, shampooing;<BR>an attendant employed to rub and shampoo the<BR>body; N. of one of the winds, (see सं-वह<BR>above.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाहक|संवाहकः
सं-वाहक, अस्, m. an attendant who rubs and<BR>shampooes the limbs, a shampooer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाहन|संवाहनं
सं-वाहन, अम्, n. rubbing the person, sham-<BR>pooing; bearing (a burden), carrying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाह्य
सं-वाह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be brought together;<BR>to be borne or carried along; to be rubbed, to be<BR>shampooed; (अस्), m., scil. अग्नि, a kind of sacrificial<BR>fire; [cf. 1. सम्-ऊह्य.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुह्य
सम्-उह्य, ind. having brought together, having<BR>arranged or put in order; [cf. 2. सम्-ऊह्य.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुह्यमान
सम्-उह्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being borne or<BR>carried along; being carried by, riding on (with<BR>inst.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूढ|समूढः
1. सम्-ऊढ, अस्, आ, अम् (for 2. see under सम्-<BR>ऊह्), borne or conveyed together, carried or borne<BR>along, borne away; led, conducted; married.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवा
संवा सं-वा, cl. 2. P. -वाति, -वातुम्, to<BR>blow at the same time, blow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवात्
सं-वात्, आन्, आती or आन्ती, आत्, blowing together,<BR>blowing (as wind).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाञ्छ्
संवाञ्छ् सं-वाञ्छ्, cl. 1. P. -वाञ्छति,<BR>वाञ्छितुम्, to long for, wish, desire, be eager for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाटिका
संवाटिका संवाटिका, f. the aquatic plant<BR>Trapa Bispinosa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवार|संवारः
संवार सं-वार. See p. 1038, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाश्
संवाश् सं-वाश्, cl. 4. A. -वाश्यते (Ved.<BR>and ep. also P. -वाश्यति, and cl. 1. P. A. -वाशति,<BR>-ते), -वाशितुम्, to roar or cry at the same time,<BR>bellow or low together, bleat: Caus. -वाशयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to cause to cry or low together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवावशान
सं-वावशान, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. roaring at the<BR>same time, bellowing together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवासित
संवासित सं-वासित, अस्, आ, अम्, made fra-<BR>grant, perfumed; made fetid, having an offensive<BR>smell (said of the breath).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाह्
संवाह् सं-वाह् [cf. सं-वह्, to which the<BR>forms and senses given to this verb are perhaps<BR>more properly referred], cl. 1. A. -वाहते, &c. (see<BR>rt. 1. वाह्), to rub together, shampoo, knead (the<BR>limbs), stroke: Caus. -वाहयति, &c., to rub to-<BR>gether, shampoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाह|संवाहः
सं-वाह, सं-वाहन. See above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविच्
संविच् सं-विच्, cl. 3. P. -वेवेक्ति, &c., Ved.<BR>to keep entirely separate or distinct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविक्त|संविक्तं
सं-विक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, entirely separated or dis-<BR>tinct; (अम्), n. that which is separated or individual-<BR>ized.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविचि
संविचि सं-वि-चि, cl. 5. P. A. -चिनोति, -चिनुते,<BR>-चेतुम्, to separate entirely, keep quite apart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविचेतव्य
सं-विचेतव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be entirely sepa-<BR>rated, to be kept quite apart; to be removed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविचिन्त्
संविचिन्त् सं-वि-चिन्त्, cl. 10. P. -चिन्तयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to consider fully, meditate or reflect upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविज्
संविज् सं-विज्, cl. 7. P., 6. A. -विनक्ति,<BR>-विजते, &c., -विजितुम्, to tremble violently, shake, be<BR>agitated; to start with fear, start up, run away: Caus.<BR>-वेजयति, -यितुम्, to startle, frighten, terrify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविग्न
सं-विग्न, अस्, आ, अम्, agitated, flurried, startled,<BR>alarmed, frightened, terrified, distracted.<BR>—सं-<BR>विग्न-मानस, अस्, आ, अम्, agitated or distracted<BR>in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवेग|संवेगः
सं-वेग, अस्, m. agitation, flurry; excessive im-<BR>petus or impetuosity, vehemence, haste proceeding<BR>from terror; hurry, haste, speed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविज्ञा
संविज्ञा सं-वि-ज्ञा, cl. 9. P. A. -जानाति,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-a" target="_blank">Page1038-a+ 78</a>]<BR>जानीते, -ज्ञातुम्, to recommend, advise (with gen.<BR>of person): Caus. -ज्ञापयति, -ज्ञपयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to make known; to recite, repeat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1037-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविज्ञात
