संवितर्क्
संवितर्क् सं-वि-तर्क्, cl. 10. P. -तर्कयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to deliberate about, reflect upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविद्
संविद् 1. सं-विद्, cl. 2. P. A. (see Vārtt.<BR>to Pāṇ. I. 3, 29), -वेत्ति, -वित्ते (3rd pl. -विदते or<BR>-विद्रते), &c., to know together, know thoroughly,<BR>know, recognise; to investigate, explore, examine;<BR>to perceive, feel, taste; to come to an understanding,<BR>agree together; to admonish, advise, teach; to<BR>meditate; cl. 6. P. A. -विन्दति, -ते, &c., to find,<BR>meet with, obtain, acquire, gain; to meet together<BR>(with inst.): Pass. -विद्यते, to be found or ob-<BR>tained; to be, exist: Caus. -वेदयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>cause to know or perceive, &c.; to make known,<BR>inform, announce, instruct; to know, perceive, ob-<BR>serve, recognise: Pass. of Caus. -वेद्यते, to be<BR>informed, &c.; to be perceived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवित्ति|संवित्तिः
सं-वित्ति, इस्, f. perception, ascertainment, know-<BR>ledge, consciousness, feeling; intellect, understanding;<BR>recognition, recollection; mutual reconciliation, ac-<BR>commodation of disputes, harmony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविद्
2. सं-विद्, त्, f. knowledge, intellect, understand-<BR>ing; = महत् (in philosophy); a mutual understand-<BR>ing, agreement, contract, covenant, engagement;<BR>consent, assent, promise; prescribed custom, esta-<BR>blished usage; an alliance, marriage (Ved.); a watch-<BR>word, war-cry; war, battle; a name, appellation;<BR>a sign, signal; participation, sympathy; pleasing,<BR>delighting (= तोषण); meditation (= समाधि);<BR>hemp.<BR>—संविद्-व्यतिक्रम, अस्, m. breach of<BR>promise, violation of contract.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविदान
सं-विदान, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. being found with<BR>or together with; connected, united; agreeing with,<BR>harmonious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविदित|संविदितः
सं-विदित, अस्, आ, अम्, known, recognised, under-<BR>stood; well-known; explored; agreed upon, assented<BR>to; admonished, advised; (अम्), n. agreement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविद्वस्
सं-विद्वस्, आन्, m. one who has known or knows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवेद|संवेदः
सं-वेद, अस्, m. perception, consciousness, know-<BR>ledge, understanding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवेदन|संवेदनं
