संवेदित
सं-वेदित, अस्, आ, अम्, made known, informed,<BR>instructed, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवेद्य
सं-वेद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be known or under-<BR>stood; to be made known; (अस्), m. the junction of<BR>two rivers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवेविदान
