संविधा
संविधा 1. सं-वि-धा, cl. 3. P. A. -दधाति,<BR>-धत्ते, -धातुम्, to dispose, arrange, fix, settle;<BR>to direct, order; to carry on, perform, accomplish,<BR>conduct, manage, do, act, render, make, attend to,<BR>mind; to use, employ; to set, lay, place, put, (मा-<BR>नसं सं-विधा, to keep the mind fixed or<BR>composed): Pass. -धीयते, to be arranged or fixed;<BR>to be performed, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविधा
2. सं-विधा, f. arrangement, plan, preparation;<BR>mode of life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविधातव्य
