संविभज्य
सं-विभज्य, ind. having divided or distributed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

