संविमृश्य
सं-विमृश्य, ind. having reflected or considered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविराज्
संविराज् सं-वि-राज्, cl. 1. P. A. -राजति,<BR>-ते, &c., to shine forth, be very illustrious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविलङ्घ्
संविलङ्घ् सं-वि-लङ्घ्, cl. 10. P. or Caus.<BR>-लङ्घयति, -यितुम्, to leap over, pass by, trans-<BR>gress, neglect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविवृध्
