संविहस्
संविहस् सं-वि-हस्, cl. 1. P. -हसति, &c.,<BR>to laugh at, laugh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1038-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवीक्ष्
