सङ्कर्षण|संकर्षण|संकर्षणं|सङ्कर्षणं|संकर्षणः|सङ्कर्षणः
सङ्कर्षण सङ्-कर्षण. See under सङ्-<BR>कृष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कल्|संकल्
सङ्कल् 1. सङ्-कल् (सम्-कल्, see rt. 2. कल्),<BR>cl. 10. P. -कालयति, -यितुम्, to drive together, drive<BR>to; to drive away, put to flight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कला|संकला
सङ्-कला, ind. (doubtful), killing, slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कल्|संकल्
सङ्कल् 2. सङ्-कल् (सम्-कल्, see rt. 3. कल्),<BR>cl. 10. P. -कलयति, -यितुम्, to heap together, pile<BR>up, accumulate; to grasp, lay hold of; to consider,<BR>deem, regard as.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कल|संकल|संकलः|सङ्कलः
सङ्-कल, अस्, m. collection, accumulation, quan-<BR>tity; addition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कलन|संकलन|संकलनं|सङ्कलनं
सङ्-कलन, अम्, आ, n. f. the act of heaping toge-<BR>ther; contact, junction, collision, intermixture; blend-<BR>ing, twining; (अम्), n. addition (in arithmetic).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कलित|संकलित|सङ्कलितः
सङ्-कलित, अस्, आ, अम्, heaped together, piled up,<BR>collected, brought together, blended, intermixed,<BR>arranged; added; laid hold of, grasped; (आ), f. (in<BR>arithmetical progression) the first sum; (अम्), n.<BR>addition (in arithmetic).<BR>—सङ्-कलितैक्य (˚ता-<BR>ऐक्˚), अम्, n. the sum of the sums or terms (of an<BR>arithmetical progression).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कल्प|संकल्प|संकल्पः|सङ्कल्पः
सङ्कल्प सङ्-कल्प, &c. See under सङ्-<BR>कॢप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कसुक|संकसुक
सङ्कसुक सङ्-कसुक, अस्, आ, अम् (according<BR>to Uṇādi-s. II. 29. fr. rt. कस् with सम्), going or<BR>moving about unsteadily, unsteady, inconstant, fickle,<BR>changeable; uncertain, doubtful; weak, feeble; bad,<BR>wicked; (अस्), m., N. of the author of the hymn<BR>Ṛg-veda X. 18 (having the patronymic Yāmāyana).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्काश्|संकाश्
सङ्काश् सङ्-काश् (सम्-काश्), cl. 1. A. -काशते,<BR>काशितुम्, to appear together, appear in sight, become<BR>visible: Caus. -काशयति, -यितुम्, to cause to ap-<BR>pear; to look at, see, contemplate, behold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्काश|संकाश|संकाशः|सङ्काशः
सङ्-काश, अस्, m. appearance; presence; vicinity,<BR>(गृह-सङ्काशे, in the neighbourhood of the house,<BR>near the house); (अस्, आ, अम्), like, similar (at the<BR>end of comps., e. g. मृत्यु-सङ्काश, death-like;<BR>गज-स्˚, resembling elephants); near, close at hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्काश्य|संकाश्य
सङ्-काश्य, N. of a kingdom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्किल|संकिल|संकिलः|सङ्किलः
सङ्किल सङ्किल, अस्, m. (said to be fr. rt.<BR>किल् with सम्), a burning torch, fire-brand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कीर्ण|संकीर्ण|सङ्कीर्णं|संकीर्णः|सङ्कीर्णः
