सङ्कीर्तन|संकीर्तनं|सङ्कीर्त्तन|सङ्कीर्त्तनं
सङ्कीर्तन सङ्-कीर्तन. See under सङ्-कॄत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कु
सङ्कु सङ्कु, उस्, m. (doubtful), a hole.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कुच्|संकुच्
सङ्कुच् सङ्-कुच् (सम्-कुच्), cl. 6. 1. P. -कु-<BR>चति, -कोचति, -कोचितुम्, to shrink, become con-<BR>tracted, contract, shrivel up; to close, shut (as a flower);<BR>to contract, compress: Pass. -कुच्यते, to be con-<BR>tracted, be closed: Caus. -कोचयति, -यितुम्, to con-<BR>tract, narrow, make smaller, lessen; to close up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कुचित|संकुचित|सङ्कुचितं
सङ्-कुचित, अस्, आ, अम्, contracted, narrowed,<BR>shriveled up, shrunk, wrinkled, (अ-सङ्कुचित, not<BR>wrinkled); closed, shut, unblown (as a flower);<BR>crouching, cowering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कोच|संकोच|सङ्कोचं|संकोचः|सङ्कोचः
सङ्-कोच, अस्, m. contracting, shriveling up, con-<BR>traction, shrinking; terror, fear; compression, abridge-<BR>ment, narrowness, diminution; shutting up, closing;<BR>binding, tying; a sort of skate fish; (अम्), n. saffron.<BR>—सङ्कोच-पिशुन, अम्, n. ‘manifesting contrac-<BR>tion,’ saffron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कोचन|संकोचन|संकोचनं
सङ्-कोचन, अम्, n. the act of contracting or<BR>shrinking, contraction, causing to shrink or close;<BR>astringing; (अस्, ई, अम्), contracting, shrinking;<BR>astringent; (ई), f. the sensitive plant (= लज्जालु).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कोचयत्
सङ्-कोचयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, contracting, causing<BR>to shrink or close, narrowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कोचिन्|संकोचिन्
सङ्-कोचिन्, ई, इनी, इ, shrinking, contracting, shrivel-<BR>ing up; closing; astringent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कोच्य
सङ्-कोच्य, ind. having contracted or compressed,<BR>&c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कुप्|संकुप्
सङ्कुप् सङ्-कुप् (सम्-कुप्), cl. 4. P. A. -कुप्-<BR>यति, -ते, -कोपितुम्, to become angry or enraged;<BR>to be agitated or excited: Caus. -कोपयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to make angry, enrage, provoke, excite; to become<BR>agitated or excited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कुपित|संकुपित
सङ्-कुपित, अस्, आ, अम्, enraged, aroused, excited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कोपयत्
सङ्-कोपयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, making angry, en-<BR>raging, exciting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कुल|संकुल|सङ्कुलं
सङ्कुल सङ्कुल, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. कुल् with<BR>सम्; probably connected with सङ्-कर fr. सङ्-<BR>कॄ), crowded together, thronged, mixed together,<BR>commingled, confused, perplexed, disordered, incon-<BR>sistent; filled with, full of; (अस्), m., N. of a poet;<BR>(अम्), n. a crowd, throng, mob; a flock, collection;<BR>a confused fight, battle, war, mêlée; inconsistent or<BR>contradictory speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कूज्
सङ्कूज् सङ्-कूज् (सम्-कूज्), cl. 1. P. -कूजति,<BR>&c., to cry aloud, utter inarticulate sounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कूजित|संकूजित|संकूजितं
सङ्-कूजित, अस्, आ, अम्, cried aloud; (अम्), n. the<BR>cry of the Cakra-vāka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कृ|संकृ
सङ्कृ सङ्-कृ (सम्-कृ), cl. 8. P. A. -करोति,<BR>-कुरुते, -कर्तुम्, = सं-स्-कृ, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कृति|संकृति
सङ्-कृति, इस्, f. a kind of metre (consisting of four<BR>lines of twenty-four syllables each); (इस्), m. a proper<BR>N.; (अयस्), m. pl., N. of a class of ancient Ṛṣis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कृत्|संकृत्
सङ्कृत् सङ्-कृत् (सम्-कृत्), cl. 6. P. -कृन्-<BR>तति, -कर्तितुम्, to cut to pieces, cut up; to cut<BR>through, cut, pierce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कृत्त|संकृत्त
सङ्-कृत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, cut to pieces, cut through,<BR>pierced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कृत्य
सङ्-कृत्य, ind. having cut to pieces, having<BR>cut up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कृष्|संकृष्
सङ्कृष् सङ्-कृष् (सम्-कृष्), cl. 1. P. -कर्-<BR>षति, -कर्ष्टुम्, -क्रष्टुम्, to draw together,<BR>contract; to lace together, tighten; to draw away,<BR>withdraw; to drag away with, drag along, carry off,<BR>take away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कर्षण|संकर्षण|संकर्षणं|सङ्कर्षणं|संकर्षणः|सङ्कर्षणः
सङ्-कर्षण, अम्, n. the act of drawing together,<BR>contracting; shortening; attracting, drawing; mak-<BR>ing rows, ploughing, &c.; (अस्), m., N. of the first-<BR>born offspring of Viṣṇu, (Mahā-bh. Śānti-p. 7527);<BR>epithet of Bala-deva or Bala-rāma (elder brother of<BR>Kṛṣṇa, and so called because withdrawn from the<BR>womb of Devakī and transferred to that of Rohiṇī);<BR>a proper N.<BR>—सङ्कर्षण-काण्ड, N. of a work<BR>ascribed to Jaimini.<BR>—सङ्कर्षणेश्वर-तीर्थ<BR>(˚ण-ईश्˚), अम्, n., N. of a Tīrtha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कर्षत्
सङ्-कर्षत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, drawing together,<BR>contracting; drawing away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कर्षिन्|संकर्षिन्
सङ्-कर्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ, drawing together, con-<BR>tracting, shortening, (काल-सङ्कर्षिन्, shortening<BR>the time; कालसङ्कर्षिणी विद्या, epithet of a<BR>particular magical incantation.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कृष्ट|संकृष्ट
सङ्-कृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, drawn together, con-<BR>tracted (as two sounds), drawn near to one another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कॄ|संकॄ
सङ्कॄ सङ्-कॄ (सम्-कॄ), cl. 6. P. -किरति, -क-<BR>रितुम्, -करीतुम्, to pour together, mix together,<BR>commingle; to confuse; to scatter about, diffuse; to<BR>pour out, bestow liberally or abundantly (Ved.); to<BR>make full, fill: Pass. -कीर्यते, to be poured toge-<BR>ther, be intermingled or mixed; to be confused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कर|संकर|संकरः|सङ्करः
सङ्-कर, अस्, m. mixing together, intermixture,<BR>blending, confusing, confounding, confusion, irregular<BR>mixture, unlawful intermarriage, mixture of caste,<BR>a mixed caste or race (proceeding from the union of<BR>a man with a woman of a higher caste or from the<BR>promiscuous intercourse of the four tribes, and again<BR>from the indiscriminate cohabitation of their descend-<BR>ants amongst each other; cf. योनि-सङ्कर); the<BR>union or mixing together of two figures in the same<BR>passage (in rhetoric); dust, sweepings [cf. अव-कर,<BR>p. 88]; the crackling of flame.<BR>—सङ्कर-ज, अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, born from a mixed marriage.<BR>—सङ्करी-<BR>करण, अम्, n. the act of mixing together, con-<BR>fusing; confusion; causing mixture or loss of caste.<BR>—सङ्करी-कृ, cl. 8. P. A. -करोति, -कुरुते, -कर्-<BR>तुम्, to mix together confusedly, cause confusion.<BR>—सङ्करी-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, confused, blended or<BR>mixed confusedly; outcast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्करिन्
सङ्करिन्, ई, इणी, इ, confusing, confused, inter-<BR>mingled, produced by or resulting from illegal<BR>mixture of castes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कार|संकार|संकारः|सङ्कारः
सङ्-कार, अस्, m. dust, sweepings; the crackling<BR>of flame; (ई), f. a girl recently deflowered, a new<BR>bride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कीर्ण|संकीर्ण|सङ्कीर्णं|संकीर्णः|सङ्कीर्णः
सङ्-कीर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, poured together, mixed<BR>together, intermingled, confused, miscellaneous,<BR>crowded, closely packed; indistinct; scattered, strewed,<BR>spread, diffused; sprinkled (with exuding juice, as a<BR>rutting elephant); of mixed caste, of impure origin,<BR>born from a mixed marriage, impure, polluted, adul-<BR>terated; contracted, narrow; (अस्), m. a man of<BR>mixed caste, an outcast; a mixed note or mode (in<BR>music); an elephant possessing certain characteristic<BR>marks or one in rut; (आ), f. a kind of riddle or<BR>enigma.<BR>—सङ्कीर्ण-चारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, wandering<BR>about confusedly, going to various places.<BR>—सङ्-<BR>कीर्ण-जाति, इस्, इस्, इ, or सङ्कीर्ण-योनि, इस्, इस्, इ,<BR>of mixed birth or caste, impure through illegal<BR>intermarriage, of a mongrel breed, mule.<BR>—सङ्-<BR>कीर्ण-युद्ध, अम्, n. a mixed or confused fight,<BR>mêlée.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कृत्|संकृत्
सङ्कृत् सङ्-कृत् (सम्-कॄत्), cl. 10. P. -कीर्त-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to mention or relate fully, recite; to<BR>proclaim, announce; to celebrate or praise or com-<BR>mend greatly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कीर्तन|संकीर्तनं|सङ्कीर्त्तन|सङ्कीर्त्तनं
सङ्-कीर्तन, अम्, आ, n. f. the act of reciting or<BR>proclaiming at full; greatly praising or celebrating,<BR>extolling, lauding, honouring, glorification.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कीर्तयत्
सङ्-कीर्तयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, mentioning or de-<BR>scribing fully, proclaiming; celebrating or praising<BR>greatly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कीर्तित|संकीर्तित|सङ्कीर्त्तित|सङ्कीर्त्तितः
सङ्-कीर्तित, अस्, आ, अम्, mentioned fully; cele-<BR>brated, praised, renowned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कीर्त्ति|सङ्कीर्ति
सङ्-कीर्त्ति, इस्, m., N. of a Vaiśya (said to have<BR>been the author of certain Vedic hymns).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1045-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कीर्त्य
सङ्-कीर्त्य, ind. having mentioned, having cele-<BR>brated, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कीर्त्यमान
सङ्-कीर्त्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being proclaimed<BR>or celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कॢप्|संकॢप्
सङ्कॢप् सङ्-कॢप् (सम्-कॢप्), cl. 1. A. -कल्-<BR>पते, -कल्पितुम्, -कल्प्तुम्, to will, wish for, long<BR>for, be desirous of: Caus. -कल्पयति, -ते, -यितुम्,<BR>to form or arrange or connect together; to create,<BR>make, effect, furnish, provide; to will, purpose, re-<BR>solve, determine, wish for, desire, intend, aim at,<BR>strive after; to appoint, settle, fix, allot, assign, des-<BR>tine; to consecrate, dedicate; to perform obsequies;<BR>to form an idea in the mind, imagine, fancy; to<BR>think about, weigh, ponder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कल्प|संकल्प|संकल्पः|सङ्कल्पः
सङ्-कल्प, अस्, m. will, volition, strength of will,<BR>purpose, mental resolve or determination, resolution,<BR>vow; power of will; wish, desire; idea formed in<BR>the mind, thought, imagination, fancy, contrivance;<BR>consideration, reflection; mind, soul, heart; idea or<BR>expectation of advantage from any voluntary act;<BR>a solemn vow to perform a ritual observance, decla-<BR>ration of purpose; a declaration repeated by a widow<BR>who burns herself with her deceased husband; N. of<BR>a Prajā-pati; (आ), f., N. of a daughter of Dakṣa and<BR>wife of Dharma.<BR>—सङ्कल्प-कुल्मल, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>Ved. having desire for its shaft (said of an arrow).<BR>—सङ्कल्प-ज, अस्, आ, अम्, produced from self-<BR>determined will or desire, proceeding from idea of<BR>advantage; (अस्), m. ‘mind-born, heart-born,’ epi-<BR>thet of Kāma (god of love).<BR>—सङ्कल्प-जन्मन्,<BR>आ, or सङ्कल्प-भव, अस्, or सङ्कल्प-योनि, इस्,<BR>m. epithet of Kāma (god of love).<BR>—सङ्कल्प-<BR>रूप, अस्, आ, अम्, formed or consisting of will, of<BR>the nature of mental resolve, conformable to the will<BR>or purpose.<BR>—सङ्कल्प-सम्भव, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>produced from will or desire, arising out of an idea<BR>or desire of advantage; (अस्), m. ‘mind-born,’ epi-<BR>thet of Kāma.<BR>—सङ्कल्प-सिद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>perfected by mental resolve or will, having super-<BR>natural powers by the exercise of a strong will.<BR>—सङ्कल्पात्मक (˚प-आत्˚), अस्, इका, अम्, con-<BR>sisting of will or volition, of the nature of mental<BR>resolve; willing, resolving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कल्पक|संकल्पक
सङ्कल्पक, अस्, आ or इका, अम्, purposing, deter-<BR>mining, reflecting, pondering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कल्पनीय|संकल्पनीय
सङ्-कल्पनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be willed or wished<BR>or desired; to be purposed or intended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कल्पयत्
सङ्-कल्पयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, wishing or striving<BR>for; reflecting, considering, weighing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कल्पित|संकल्पित
सङ्-कल्पित, अस्, आ, अम्, wished for, desired,<BR>aimed at, striven after, intended, purposed, deter-<BR>mined, resolved on; conceived, imagined, thought,<BR>fancied, contrived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कल्प्य
सङ्-कल्प्य, ind. having resolved on, having<BR>wished for or desired; having consecrated, having<BR>performed funeral rites.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कॢप्त|संकॢप्त
सङ्कॢप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, desired, wished; con-<BR>trived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कॢप्ति|संकॢप्ति|संकॢप्तिः
सङ्कॢप्ति, इस्, f. will, resolve; fancy; contrivance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्केत|संकेत|संकेतः|सङ्केतः
सङ्केत सङ्-केत, अस्, m. (fr. rt. कित् = 4. चित्<BR>with सम्), any indicatory sign or gesture, intimation,<BR>hint, allusion, innuendo, sign, mark, token, symbol<BR>(in general); gesticulation; a short explanatory rule<BR>(teaching the application of grammatical Sūtras, =<BR>शैली); agreement, convention; engagement, ap-<BR>pointment, assignation (with a lover); condition,<BR>provision.<BR>—सङ्केत-निकेतन, अम्, n. a house or<BR>place appointed for meeting (a lover &c.), place of<BR>assignation, rendezvous.<BR>—सङ्केत-पद्धति, इस्, f.,<BR>N. of a work.<BR>—सङ्केत-भूमि, इस्, f. a place of<BR>assignation.<BR>—सङ्केत-शिक्षा, f., N. of a work.<BR>—सङ्केत-स्तव, अस्, m., N. of a hymn.<BR>—सङ्-<BR>केत-स्थान, अम्, n. place of assignation, appointed<BR>place; a sign, intimation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्केतक|संकेतकः
सङ्केतक, अस्, m. an agreement, convention,<BR>appointment; a rendezvous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्केतन|संकेतन|संकेतनं
सङ्केतन, अम्, n. the act of agreeing together,<BR>appointment; a rendezvous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्केतय|संकेतय
सङ्केतय, Nom. P. सङ्केतयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-b" target="_blank">Page1046-b+ 79</a>]<BR>agree upon, appoint (a time &c.); to invite, call;<BR>to counsel, advise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्केतित|संकेतित
सङ्केतित, अस्, आ, अम्, agreed upon; invited;<BR>[cf. अ-स्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्क्रन्द्|संक्रन्द्
सङ्क्रन्द् सङ्-क्रन्द् (सम्-क्रन्द्), cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-क्रन्दति, -ते, -क्रन्दितुम्, to cry or scream toge-<BR>ther: Caus. -क्रन्दयति, -यितुम्, to cry out toge-<BR>ther, call together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्क्रन्दन|संक्रन्दन|संक्रंदन|संक्रंदनः|संक्रन्दनः|सङ्क्रन्दनः
सङ्-क्रन्दन, अस्, m., Ved. ‘whose cries are<BR>terrible,’ epithet of Indra, (Sāy. = पर-भय-हेतुर्<BR>ध्वनिर् यस्य सः.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्क्रम्|संक्रम्
सङ्क्रम् सङ्-क्रम् (सम्-क्रम्), cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-क्रामति, -क्रमते, -क्रमितुम्, to come together,<BR>go along with, meet together, meet; to go near,<BR>approach; to be present at, attend; to go or pass<BR>through, traverse; to go or pass over, pass into (with<BR>loc. or acc.); to enter a constellation (said of the<BR>sun); to be transferred; to overstep, surmount:<BR>Caus. -क्रामयति, -क्रमयति, -ते, -यितुम्, to<BR>cause to go over or pass into, transfer, transport;<BR>to lead or conduct through or towards, convey; to<BR>consign, deliver over; to take possession of; to agree<BR>to help one another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्क्रम|संक्रम|संक्रमः|सङ्क्रमः
सङ्-क्रम, अस्, m. going or coming together,<BR>concurrence; going or passing through, passage from<BR>one point to another, traversing, transit, transition,<BR>progress, transfer; the passage of a planetary body<BR>through the zodiacal signs; going, moving, travelling;<BR>(अस्, अम्), m. n. difficult passage or progress, making<BR>one's way over difficult ground (as over rocks or<BR>torrents or inaccessible passes); the means of effecting<BR>a difficult passage, a causeway, bridge; a means of<BR>attaining any object.<BR>—सङ्क्रमी-कृ, cl. 8. P. -क-<BR>रोति, -कर्तुम्, to use as a vehicle or means of transit<BR>or means of attaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्क्रमण|संक्रमण|संक्रमणं|सङ्क्रमणं
सङ्-क्रमण, अम्, n. the act of going along<BR>with, concurrence; the act of going or passing<BR>through, transition, proceeding, progress; passage;<BR>the sun's passage from one sign of the zodiac to<BR>another; the day on which the sun's progress to the<BR>north of the equator or summer solstice begins;<BR>(in algebra) concurrence, (said to be a general desig-<BR>nation of a certain class of problems.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्क्रमय्य
सङ्-क्रमय्य, ind. having transferred, having<BR>made to pass or proceed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्क्रमित|संक्रमित
सङ्-क्रमित, अस्, आ, अम्, conducted, led, trans-<BR>ported, transferred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्क्रमितृ|संक्रमितृ
सङ्-क्रमितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, who or what passes from<BR>one place to another, passing, proceeding, going.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्क्रान्त|संक्रांत|संक्रान्त|सङ्क्रान्तः
सङ्-क्रान्त, अस्, आ, अम्, gone or come together,<BR>met together, passed through or into, entered into,<BR>gone from one point to another, transferred; trans-<BR>ferred to a picture, depicted, imaged; (in astronomy)<BR>having a Saṅkrānti, (अ-सङ्क्रान्त, [a month] which<BR>has no Saṅkrānti.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्क्रान्ति|संक्रान्ति|संक्रांति|संक्रांतिः|संक्रान्तिः|सङ्क्रान्तिः
सङ्-क्रान्ति, इस्, f. going or meeting together,<BR>union; going from one place to another, proceeding,<BR>procession, passage, proceeding from one condition<BR>of life to another; passage of the sun or planetary<BR>bodies from one sign into another, (कूट-स्˚, the<BR>sun's entrance into another zodiacal sign after mid-<BR>night); transferring to a picture, image, reflection.<BR>—सङ्क्रान्ति-चक्र, अम्, n. an astrological diagram<BR>marked with the Nakṣatras and used for foretelling<BR>good or bad fortune.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्क्राम|संक्राम|संक्रामः|सङ्क्रामः
सङ्-क्राम, अस्, m. difficult progress or passage;<BR>a bridge (= सङ्-क्रम, q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्क्रामत्
सङ्-क्रामत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, transporting, trans-<BR>ferring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1046-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

