सङ्-गत्वा (anom. ind. part.), having come toge-<BR>ther, having met, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1047-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गथ|संगथ
सङ्-गथ, Ved. coming together, encountering,<BR>conflict, (in Naigh. II. 17. enumerated among the<BR>सङ्ग्राम-नामानि); flowing together, confluence,<BR>(Sāy. = सङ्-गमन); (आ), f. confluence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1047-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गम|संगम|संगमः|सङ्गमः
