सङ्गमन|संगमनं|संगमनः
सङ्-गमन, अम्, n. the act of coming together,<BR>meeting; going with; intercourse, union; (अस्, ई,<BR>अम्), uniting, bestowing; any person or thing form-<BR>ing a point of union; (अस्), m., N. of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1047-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गमनीय
सङ्गमनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be met or brought<BR>together, relating to union or congress, causing re-<BR>union.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1047-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गमय्य
सङ्-गमय्य, ind. having united, having joined,<BR>having delivered over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1047-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गमित|संगमित
सङ्-गमित, अस्, आ, अम्, brought together, con-<BR>nected, united, delivered over.<BR>—सङ्गमित-वत्,<BR>आन्, अती, अत्, one who has brought together or united.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1047-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गम्य
सङ्-गम्य, ind. having met, having come toge-<BR>ther, having become united, having had sexual inter-<BR>course with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1047-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

