सङ्गृभित सङ्-गृभित, सङ्-गृहीत, &c.<BR>See under सङ्-ग्रह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गॄ|संगॄ
सङ्गॄ^1 1. सङ्-गॄ (सम्-गॄ, see rt. 1. गॄ), cl.<BR>9. P. A., 6. A. -गृणाति, -गृणीते, -गिरते, &c., to<BR>speak about or praise together; to agree together,<BR>agree with (with inst.), assent, promise; to recognise,<BR>acknowledge; to agree in calling or naming (A.).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Dr. Dhaval Patel on 20170912. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/410.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गर|संगर|सङ्गरं|संगरः|सङ्गरः
1. सङ्-गर, अस्, m. agreeing together, agree-<BR>ment, assent; promise; a bargain, transaction of sale;<BR>knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गिर्|संगिर्
सङ्-गिर्, ईर्, f., Ved. a song of praise, hymn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गिरमाण
सङ्-गिरमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, agreeing, assenting<BR>to; promising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गीर्ण|संगीर्ण|सङ्गीर्णं
सङ्-गीर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, agreed, assented to, pro-<BR>mised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गृ
सङ्गृ 2. सङ्-गॄ, (सम्-गॄ, see rt. 2. गॄ), cl.<BR>6. 9. P. -गिरति, -गृणाति, &c., to swallow up, de-<BR>vour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गर|संगर|सङ्गरं|संगरः|सङ्गरः
2. सङ्-गर, अस्, m. swallowing up, devouring,<BR>misfortune, calamity; conflict, war, battle; poison;<BR>(अम्), n. the fruit of the Śamī tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गीर्य
सङ्-गीर्य, ind. having swallowed up or devoured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गै|संगै
सङ्गै सङ्-गै (सम्-गै), cl. 1. P. -गायति,<BR>गातुम्, to sing together, sing in chorus, chant; to<BR>celebrate by singing together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गीत|संगीत|सङ्गीतं
सङ्-गीत, अस्, आ, अम्, sung together, sung in<BR>chorus or harmony; (अम्), n. a song sung by many<BR>voices, chorus; singing accompanied by music and<BR>dancing, symphony; a concert; the art of singing<BR>with music and dancing.<BR>—सङ्गीत-कौमुदी, f.,<BR>N. of a work on harmony.<BR>—सङ्गीत-गीति, इस्, इस्, इ,<BR>one who sings a song, a singer.<BR>—सङ्गीत-दर्पण,<BR>‘mirror of harmony,’ N. of a work on music by<BR>Dāmodara.<BR>—सङ्गीत-नारायण, अस्, m., N. of a<BR>work on symphony by Nārāyaṇa.<BR>—सङ्गीत-रत्न-<BR>माला, f., N. of a work on harmony by Mammaṭa.<BR>—सङ्गीत-रत्नाकर (˚न-आक्˚), अस्, m. ‘jewel-<BR>mine of singing,’ N. of a musical work by Śārṅga-<BR>deva.<BR>—सङ्गीतरत्नाकर-कला-निधि, इस्, m., N.<BR>of a commentary on the Saṅgīta-ratnākara.<BR>—सङ्-<BR>गीत-व्यापृत, अस्, आ, अम्, engaged in singing and<BR>music.<BR>—सङ्गीत-शास्त्र, अम्, n. the science of singing<BR>combined with music and dancing; any work on the<BR>above subject.<BR>—सङ्गीत-सार and सङ्गीतार्णव<BR>(˚त-अर्˚), अस्, m., N. of two works.<BR>—सङ्गीतार्थ<BR>(˚त-अर्˚), अस्, m. the apparatus or materials for a<BR>concert; the subject of a musical performance.<BR>—सङ्-<BR>गीतावसान (˚त-अव्˚), अम्, n. the close of a concert.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गीतक|संगीतकं
सङ्गीतक, अम्, n. a concert, symphony, public<BR>entertainment consisting of songs combined with<BR>dancing and music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गीति|संगीति|संगीतिः|सङ्गीतिः
सङ्-गीति, इस्, f. singing together, a concert, sym-<BR>phony, harmony, the art of singing combined with<BR>music and dancing; conversation, discourse; a species<BR>of metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गीयमान|संगीयमान
सङ्-गीयमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being sung together,<BR>being chanted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गोपन|संगोपन|सङ्गोपनं
सङ्गोपन सङ्-गोपन. See under सङ्-गुप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्रथ्
सङ्ग्रथ् सङ्-ग्रथ् (सम्-ग्रथ्). See rt.<BR>1. ग्रथ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्रथित|संग्रथित
सङ्-ग्रथित, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. strung or tied<BR>together, knotted together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्रस्|संग्रस्
सङ्ग्रस् सङ्-ग्रस् (सम्-ग्रस्), cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-ग्रसति, -ते, -ग्रसितुम्, to swallow up, devour,<BR>consume: Pass. -ग्रस्यते, &c., to be devoured,<BR>consumed, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्रह्|संग्रह्
सङ्ग्रह् सङ्-ग्रह् or सङ्-ग्रभ् (सम्-ग्˚, see<BR>rt. ग्रह्, p. 302), cl. 9. P. A. -गृह्णाति, -गृह्णीते<BR>(Ved. generally -गृभ्णाति, -गृभ्णीते), -ग्रहीतुम्,<BR>to seize or hold together, grasp, gripe, clench, take<BR>or lay hold of, snatch; to apprehend, conceive, un-<BR>derstand; to take, receive, accept, receive kindly or<BR>hospitably, attend to, listen to, encourage, support,<BR>favour, protect; to carry off; to seize on, attack (as<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">Page1048-b+ 78</a>]<BR>an illness); to gather together, assemble, collect,<BR>compile; to include, comprehend, contain; to draw<BR>together, contract, make narrow or smaller, abridge;<BR>to draw together a bow (in order to unstring it); to<BR>hold in, restrain, check, govern; to keep together,<BR>close, shut (as the mouth); to concentrate (the<BR>mind); to constrain, force; to take in marriage,<BR>marry; to mention, name: Caus. -ग्राहयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to cause to take hold of or receive, cause any<BR>one to accept (with two acc.): Desid. -जिघृक्षति,<BR>to wish to take hold of, &c., to desire to collect; to<BR>wish to take in marriage, desire to marry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गृभित|संगृभित
सङ्-गृभित, अस्, आ, अम्, grasped, griped, con-<BR>centrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गृभ्या
सङ्-गृभ्या, ind., Ved. (for सङ्-गृभ्य) =<BR>सङ्-गृह्य below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गृहीत|संगृहीत
सङ्-गृहीत, अस्, आ, अम्, grasped, seized, caught;<BR>taken, received, accepted, admitted, received kindly;<BR>collected, gathered, comprised, contracted, abridged;<BR>held in, restrained, governed.<BR>—सङ्गृहीत-राष्ट्र,<BR>अस्, m. (a king) who has a well governed kingdom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गृह्णत्
सङ्-गृह्णत्, अन्, अती, अत्, seizing, laying hold of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्गृह्य
सङ्-गृह्य, ind. having seized, having carried off,<BR>having restrained; having constrained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्रह|संग्रह|संग्रहः|सङ्ग्रहः
सङ्-ग्रह, अस्, m. seizing, grasping, clench-<BR>ing (the fist), grasp, grip, taking hold of, taking;<BR>reception, admission, assent; guarding, protecting,<BR>protection, favouring, supporting, encouraging, pro-<BR>pitiating, receiving kindly, entertaining, entertain-<BR>ment; bringing together, conjunction, collection,<BR>conglomeration, compilation; agglomeration (a par-<BR>ticular kind of संयोग or conjunction in phil.);<BR>comprehension; sum, amount, totality; abridge-<BR>ment, epitome, summary; a catalogue, list; restrain-<BR>ing, confining, controlling, governing; effort, exertion;<BR>a store-room, place where anything is kept; mention,<BR>mentioning; greatness, elevation, loftiness; velocity;<BR>epithet of Śiva; N. of several works; [cf. धनञ्-<BR>जय-स्˚, स्मृति-स्˚.]<BR>—सङ्ग्रह-कार, अस्, m. the<BR>composer or author of the Saṅgraha.<BR>—सङ्ग्रह-<BR>श्लोक, अस्, m. a verse recapitulating what has been<BR>explained before (in prose intermixed with Sūtras).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्रहण|संग्रहण|संग्रहणं
सङ्-ग्रहण, अम्, n. the act of taking hold of,<BR>seizing, grasping, accepting, receiving, admitting,<BR>supporting, encouraging, hoping; embracing car-<BR>nally, intercourse with a female, (see स्त्री-स्˚);<BR>adultery; bringing or gathering together, compiling,<BR>collecting, mixing, blending; inlaying, enchasing;<BR>(ई), f. diarrhœa, dysentery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्रहणीय|संग्रहणीय
सङ्-ग्रहणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be seized, &c.;<BR>to be collected; to be drawn together or contracted;<BR>to be restrained, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्रहीतृ|संग्रहीतृ
सङ्-ग्रहीतृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who restrains, &c.;<BR>(ता), m. a driver, charioteer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्राह|संग्राह|संग्राहः|सङ्ग्राहः
सङ्-ग्राह, अस्, m. forcible seizure or grasp, laying<BR>hold of; clenching the fist; the fist; the handle of<BR>a shield.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्राहक|संग्राहक|संग्राहकः
सङ्-ग्राहक, अस्, m. a gatherer, collector, com-<BR>piler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्राहित|संग्राहित
सङ्-ग्राहित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to be taken hold<BR>of or received, imparted, bestowed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्राहिन्|संग्राहिन्
सङ्-ग्राहिन्, ई, इणी, इ, seizing, grasping, holding;<BR>collecting, contracting, &c.; (ई), m. the Kuṭa-ja tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्राह्य|संग्राह्य
सङ्-ग्राह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be laid hold of or<BR>seized; to be collected; to be received.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्राम्
सङ्ग्राम् सङ्ग्राम् (rather to be regarded<BR>as a Nom. fr. सङ्ग्राम below), cl.<BR>10. A. सङ्ग्रामयते (also P. -ति), -यितुम्, Aor.<BR>अससङ्ग्रामत, to make war, fight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्राम|संग्राम|संग्रामः|सङ्ग्रामः
सङ्ग्राम, अस्, m. war, battle, fighting; a proper<BR>N.<BR>—सङ्ग्राम-जित्, त्, त्, त्, conquering in battle;<BR>(त्), m., N. of a son of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—सङ्ग्राम-प-<BR>टह, अस्, m. a large military drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घ|संघ|संघः|सङ्घः
सङ्घ सङ्-घ. See under सं-हन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घट्|संघट्
सङ्घट् सङ्-घट् (सम्-घट्), cl. 1. A. -घ-<BR>टते, -घटितुम्, to assemble together, meet: Caus.<BR>-घटयति, -घाटयति, -यितुम्, to cause to assem-<BR>ble, collect; to join together, fasten together; to strike<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">Page1048-c+ 76</a>]<BR>(a musical instrument), sound [cf. सङ्-घट्ट्]: In-<BR>tens. -जाघटीति, to be well fitted or adapted for<BR>anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घटित|संघटित
सङ्-घटित, अस्, आ, अम्, collected, assembled;<BR>struck, sounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घट्य
सङ्-घट्य, ind. having joined or united toge-<BR>ther, having assembled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घाटिका|संघाटिका
सङ्घाटिका, f. a pair, couple; a bawd, procuress;<BR>the aquatic plant Trapa Bispinosa (= जल-कण्टक);<BR>smell (= घ्राण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घाटी
सङ्घाटी, f. in भिक्षु-सङ्घाटी, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घट्ट्|संघट्ट्
सङ्घट्ट् सङ्-घट्ट् (सम्-घट्ट्), cl. 1. A.<BR>-घट्टते, -घट्टितुम्, to rub together, crush to<BR>pieces, bruise: Caus. -घट्टयति, -यितुम्, to cause<BR>to rub against (with inst.); to strike against, touch;<BR>to bring together, collect, assemble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घट्ट|संघट्ट|संघट्टः|सङ्घट्टः
सङ्-घट्ट, अस्, m. rubbing together, friction;<BR>clashing together, collision, shock, clash, encounter,<BR>conflict; meeting, joining together, cohesion, rivalry,<BR>(अ-सङ्घट्ट-सुखम्, without any rival to one's<BR>happiness, Raghu-v. XIV. 86); embracing; (आ), f. a<BR>large creeper (= लता).<BR>—सङ्घट्ट-चक्र, अम्, n.<BR>a particular astrological diagram intended as a guide<BR>for determining the proper season for war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घट्टन|संघट्टन|संघट्टनं|सङ्घट्टनं
सङ्-घट्टन, अम्, आ, n. f. rubbing together,<BR>friction; collision; close contact, cleaving or adhering<BR>to; the intertwining of wrestlers; the embrace of<BR>lovers; contact, cohesion, union, junction; collecting,<BR>meeting, encountering, occurrence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घट्टयत्
सङ्-घट्टयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, causing to rub<BR>against, rubbing together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घट्टय्य
सङ्-घट्टय्य, ind. having brought together,<BR>having collected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घट्टित|संघट्टित
सङ्-घट्टित, अस्, आ, अम्, struck against, touched;<BR>assembled, collected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घाणक|संघाणकं|संघाणकः
सङ्घाणक सङ्घाणक, अस्, अम्, m. n. = सिं-<BR>हाणक, the mucus of the nose; [cf. सङ्-घात.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घात|संघात|संघातः|सङ्घातः
सङ्घात सङ्-घात. See under सं-हन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घात्य|संघात्य|संघात्यः
सङ्घात्य, a kind of dramatic performance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घुष्|संघुष्
सङ्घुष् सङ्-घुष् (सम्-घुष्), cl. 1. P.<BR>-घोषति, -घोषितुम्, to sound together, resound,<BR>sound; to proclaim aloud, cry (in offering for sale);<BR>to fill with cries, make resonant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घुषित|संघुषित|सङ्घुषितं
सङ्-घुषित, अस्, आ, अम्, sounded, proclaimed<BR>aloud; resonant, resounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घुष्ट|संघुष्ट|सङ्घुष्टं|संघुष्टः
सङ्-घुष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, sounded, proclaimed;<BR>resonant, resounding; offered for sale; (अस्), m.<BR>sound, noise, cry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घृष्|संघृष्
सङ्घृष् सङ्-घृष्, cl. 1. P. -घर्षति,<BR>-घर्षितुम्, to rub together, grind together, tritu-<BR>rate; to rub against another (with सह and inst.),<BR>contend with, vie with: Pass. -घृष्यते (ep. also<BR>P. -ति), to rub against each other (sometimes with<BR>परस्परम्), come into collision, contend for<BR>superiority, vie with each other.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घर्ष|संघर्ष|संघर्षः|सङ्घर्षः
सङ्-घर्ष, अस्, m. rubbing together, grinding,<BR>trituration, friction; collision, mutual attrition, rivalry,<BR>emulation, vying or contending for superiority (=<BR>परस्पर-स्पर्धा); envy; going gently, gliding,<BR>flowing (= सं-सर्प).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घर्षिन्
सङ्-घर्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ, rubbing together, vying<BR>with one another, emulating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घृष्ट|संघृष्ट
सङ्-घृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, rubbed with, rubbed<BR>together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घृष्यत्
सङ्-घृष्यत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, rubbing together,<BR>coming into collision.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्घ्रा|संघ्रा
सङ्घ्रा सङ्-घ्रा (सम्-घ्रा), cl. 1. P. A.<BR>Ved. -जिघ्रति, -ते, -घ्रातुम्, Ved. to smell at one<BR>another (as animals), be on intimate or familiar<BR>terms, be closely connected: Caus. -घ्रापयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to bring into close connection or intimacy,<BR>make intimate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सच्
सच् सच् (closely connected and by some<BR>identified with rt. सश्च्, q. v., cf. rt. सप्),<BR>cl. 1. A., 3. P. सचते (sometimes also P. सचति),<BR>सिषक्ति (Ved., Pot. 1st pl. सक्षीमहि = सङ्गच्-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">Page1049-a+ 79</a>]<BR>छेमहि, Impv. 2nd sing. सक्ष्वा for सक्ष्व),<BR>सक्तुम् (Ved. Inf. सचध्यै), Ved. to follow,<BR>pursue, seek after, attend on, become attached to<BR>(sometimes with inst.); to love, like; to celebrate,<BR>honour, worship, serve, obey, be obedient to (with acc.<BR>or gen.); to favour, assist, aid; to be associated with,<BR>(त्वं सचसे पुरन्ध्या, thou art associated with<BR>devotion, Ṛg-veda II. 1, 3); to go towards, go to,<BR>(in Naigh. II. 14. सचति and सक्षति are enume-<BR>rated among the गति-कर्माणः); to attain, obtain,<BR>acquire, gain, accomplish; [cf. Gr. ἕπ-ω, ἕ-σπ-ο-ν,<BR>ἕπ-ο-μαι, ἑ-σπ-ό-μην, ἑπ-έ-της, ὅπ-λο-ν, ὁπλότερος,<BR>ἑκάς: Lat. sequ-o-r, sec-u-ndu-s, ad-sec-la,<BR>sec-to-r, pedis-sequa, soc-iu-s, sec-us, sacer: Lith.<BR>sek-u, ‘I follow:’ Hib. seichim, ‘I follow, pursue;’<BR>seicin, ‘pursuit.’]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1048-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्म
सक्म, अस्, m. = सचन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्म्य
सक्म्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. to be followed; to be<BR>liked, agreeable; to be honoured, (Sāy. = सम्भ-<BR>जनार्ह); (अम्), n. (according to some) the agree-<BR>able produce (of the cow, i. e. milk).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचथ
सचथ, Ved. companionship, assistance, (Sāy.<BR>सचथाय = सचनाय, i. e. याग-सहाय-कर-<BR>णाय, for giving assistance at the sacrifice.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचथ्य
सचथ्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. = सचनीय, to be fol-<BR>lowed or served, to be honoured, worthy of honour,<BR>(Sāy. = सेवार्ह; in Ṛg-veda V. 50, 2. सचथ्य<BR>is made a substantive and interpreted by काम, i. e.<BR>any desirable thing.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचन|सचनं
सचन, अम्, आ, n. f., Ved. the act of honouring,<BR>favouring, assisting; honour, service; (अस्, आ, अम्),<BR>to be honoured or served (= सेव्य).<BR>—सचनस्-<BR>तम, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. to be excessively followed or<BR>honoured.<BR>—सचना-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, possessing<BR>honour, honoured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचनस्यमान
सचनस्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. desiring attach-<BR>ment or union, (Sāy. = सम्पर्कम् इच्छत्, Ṛg-<BR>veda X. 4, 3.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचनीय
सचनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be followed, to be<BR>honoured or served.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचमान
सचमान, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. following, pursuing,<BR>seeking after, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचा
सचा (thought by some to be fr. साञ्च्, i. e. स +<BR>अञ्च्, ‘going with,’ cf. साचि; but more probably an<BR>inst. of a form सच्), ind., Ved. along with, at the same<BR>time with, together with, with (= 2. सह, but some-<BR>times used with loc. and even with gen. and dat.; Sāy.<BR>often interprets this word by सहाय, ‘an associate,<BR>helper,’ evidently connecting it with rt. सच्); with<BR>the assistance of.<BR>—सचा-भू, ऊस्, ऊस्, उ, Ved. being<BR>along with, united with, associated with, an associate,<BR>(Sāy. = सह वर्तमान.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचान
सचान, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. following, pursuing, &c.;<BR>being associated with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचि|सचिः
सचि, इस्, m. an associate, friend [cf. सखि]; con-<BR>nection, intimacy, friendship; (इस्), f. the wife of<BR>Indra, (also written शचि.)<BR>—सचि-विद्, त्, त्, त्, Ved.<BR>knowing or appreciating friendship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचिव|सचिवः
सचिव, अस्, m. an associate, companion, friend;<BR>a counsellor, minister; the dark thorn-apple; (आ),<BR>f., see Vopa-deva VI. 13.<BR>—सचिव-ता, f. the position<BR>or rank of a minister.<BR>—सचिवामय (˚व-आम्˚),<BR>अस्, m. the disease Vi-sarpa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सची
सची, f. the wife of Indra, (also written शची,<BR>q. v.)<BR>—सची-नन्दन, अस्, m. ‘Sacī's delight,’ epi-<BR>thet of Jayanta (son of Sacī and Indra).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचकित
सचकित स-चकित, अस्, आ, अम्, trembling,<BR>timorous, timid, startled; (अम्), ind. tremblingly, with<BR>alarm, timidly, timorously, in a startled manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचक्र
सचक्र स-चक्र, अस्, आ, अम्, having a circle<BR>or discus; (अम्), ind. together with a wheel or<BR>discus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचक्षुस्
सचक्षुस् स-चक्षुस्, उस्, उस्, उस्, having eyes,<BR>seeing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचक्षुष
स-चक्षुष, अस्, आ, अम्, having eyes, seeing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचनस्
सचनस् स-चनस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, Ved. having<BR>the same food, (Sāy. = समानान्न, Ṛg-veda I.<BR>127, 11); (according to some) being in company<BR>with, accompanied by; [cf. सचन.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचरणलाक्षाराग
सचरणलाक्षाराग स-चरण-लाक्षा-राग,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, having the colour of feet-lac, i. e. lac used<BR>for (dyeing) the feet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचराचर
सचराचर स-चराचर (˚र-अच्˚), अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>comprehending all moving and motionless creatures,<BR>comprising animate and inanimate, having all things,<BR>universal; (अम्), n. the universe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचल
सचल स-चल, अस्, आ, अम्, having moving<BR>things; moving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचारु
सचारु स-चारु, उस्, -र्वी, उ, very beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचित्र
सचित्र स-चित्र, अस्, आ, अम्, having pictures,<BR>painted, variegated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचिल्लक|सचिल्लकः
सचिल्लक स-चिल्लक, अस्, आ, अम्, having sore<BR>eyes, blear-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचेतन
सचेतन स-चेतन, अस्, आ, अम्, having con-<BR>sciousness, conscious, sentient, sensible, animate,<BR>rational; having feeling; recovering sense or con-<BR>sciousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचेतस्
स-चेतस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, conscious, reflective, intelli-<BR>gent; having the same mind, unanimous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचेल
सचेल स-चेल, अस्, आ, अम्, having clothes,<BR>clothed, dressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचेष्ट|सचेष्टः
सचेष्ट स-चेष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, making effort<BR>or exertion, active; (अस्), m. the mango tree, Man-<BR>gifera Indica.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सच्चरित
सच्चरित सच्-चरित. See under सत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सच्चारा
सच्चारा सच्चारा, f. turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सच्चिदंश
सच्चिदंश सच्-चिद्-अंश, सच्-चिद्-आनन्द, &c.<BR>See under सत्, p. 1052.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सच्छिद्र
सच्छिद्र स-च्छिद्र (स-छ्˚), अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>having defects, faulty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सच्छूद्र
सच्छूद्र सच्-छूद्र. See under सत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सच्छेद
सच्छेद स-च्छेद (स-छ्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, having<BR>cuttings or divisions, having interruptions, interrupted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजन|सजनः
सजन स-जन, अस्, आ, अम्, having men or<BR>living beings; (अस्), m. a man of the same family,<BR>kinsman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजनपद
स-जनपद, अस्, आ, अम्, having the same<BR>country; a fellow-countryman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजनामात्य
स-जनामात्य (˚न-अम्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, accompa-<BR>nied by men and ministers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजनीय
सजनीय, अम्, n., N. of an ancient hymn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजन्य
सजन्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. belonging to kinsmen<BR>or relations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजम्बाल|सजंबाल|सजम्बालः
सजम्बाल स-जम्बाल, अस्, आ, अम्, having<BR>mud, muddy, clayey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजल
सजल स-जल, अस्, आ, अम्, possessing or<BR>containing water, watery, wet, humid.<BR>—सजल-<BR>त्व, अम्, n. wateriness.<BR>—सजल-नयन, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, watery-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजात|सजातः
सजात स-जात, अस्, आ, अम्, born together,<BR>born at the same time; (अस्), m., Ved. a brother.<BR>—सजात-वनि, इस्, इस्, इ, Ved. loving one's brethren,<BR>attached to relations or kindred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजाति|सजातिः
स-जाति, इस्, इस्, इ, of the same sort or kind or<BR>species, of the same class or tribe or caste; (इस्), m.<BR>the son of a man and woman of the same caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजातीय|सजातीयः
स-जातीय, अस्, आ, अम्, of the same kind or species;<BR>like, similar; of the same class or tribe, descended<BR>from parents of the same caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजात्य|सजात्यं
सजात्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. being of the same race<BR>or family, a kinsman, relation; (अम्), n., Ved.<BR>brotherhood, relationship; kinsfolk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजार
सजार स-जार, अस्, आ, अम्, accompanied by<BR>a lover, together with a paramour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजित्वन्
सजित्वन् स-जित्वन्, आ, &c., Ved. conquer-<BR>ing common enemies (Sāy. = समान-शत्रु-जय-<BR>शील, समान-जेतृ), conquering together, victorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजिष्णु
सजिष्णु स-जिष्णु, उस्, उस्, उ, accompanied<BR>by Arjuna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजीव
सजीव स-जीव, अस्, आ, अम्, having life, alive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजुष्
सजुष् स-जुष् or स-जुस्, ऊस्, ऊस्, ऊस् (fr. rt.<BR>1. जुष् with स), having fondness or friendship,<BR>loving, serving, attached to; associated together;<BR>an associate, companion; (ऊस्), ind. (thought by<BR>some to be for an original सजूःषु, Visarga being<BR>dropped), with, together with (with inst.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजोष
स-जोष, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. rejoicing together, pleased<BR>together, associated through fondness, united.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजोषस्
स-जोषस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, Ved. associated together,<BR>united with (with inst.), united in love or as com-<BR>panions, loving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्ज्
सज्ज् 1. सज्ज् (also written सञ्च्, सञ्ज्),<BR>cl. 1. P. A. सज्जति, -ते, &c., to go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्ज्
सज्ज् 2. सज्ज् or सज्, cl. 1. P. सज्जति, स-<BR>जति, &c. = rt. 2. सञ्ज्, to cling, adhere;<BR>to fasten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्ज|सज्जः
सज्ज, अस्, आ, अम्, covered, clothed, dressed;<BR>accoutred, trimmed; ornamented, decorated, pre-<BR>pared, made ready; armed, fortified; (आ), f. dress;<BR>decoration; apparatus, equipment, equipage, harness,<BR>armour, mail.<BR>—सज्ज-कर्मन्, अ, n. the work of<BR>fitting or fastening on, making ready, dressing, pre-<BR>paration.<BR>—सज्ज-ता, f. the being prepared or made<BR>ready, readiness.<BR>—सज्जी-करण, अम्, n. the act of<BR>equipping, arraying, preparing, decorating, arming.<BR>—सज्जी-कृ, cl. 8. P. A. -करोति, -कुरुते, -कर्तुम्,<BR>to equip, make ready, prepare, array; to decorate,<BR>arm.<BR>—सज्जी-कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, arrayed; prepared;<BR>decorated, armed.<BR>—सज्जी-भू, cl. 1. P. -भवति,<BR>-भवितुम्, to become equipped or accoutred or<BR>decorated; to be prepared or made ready.<BR>—सज्जी-<BR>भूत, अस्, आ, अम्, equipped; prepared, made ready;<BR>decorated.<BR>—सज्जी-भूय, ind. having become pre-<BR>pared or decorated, in full decoration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्जन|सज्जनं|सज्जनः
1. सज्जन, अस्, आ, अम्, fastening on clothes, dress-<BR>ing, preparing, putting on armour, arming; (अम्),<BR>n. the act of preparing or making ready; a guard,<BR>sentry, picket; a ferry, Ghāt; (आ), f. the act of<BR>dressing; dress, decoration, equipment, accoutre-<BR>ment, caparisoning an elephant, arming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्जमान
सज्जमान, अस्, आ, अम्, dressing, making ready,<BR>preparing, arming; hesitating (in speech).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्जित|सज्जितः
सज्जित, अस्, आ, अम्, dressed; decorated, orna-<BR>mented; made ready, equipped, accoutred, armed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्जन|सज्जनं|सज्जनः
सज्जन 2. सज्-जन. See under सत्, p. 1052.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्य
सज्य स-ज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, having a bow-string,<BR>strung (as a bow).<BR>—सज्य-सायक, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>having arrows on the string (said of a bow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्योतिस्
सज्योतिस् स-ज्योतिस्, इस्, इस्, इस्, having the<BR>same light, having a common light; (इस्), n. the<BR>time during which the sun or the stars give light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्योत्स्ना
स-ज्योत्स्ना, f. ‘having moonlight,’ scil. रात्रि, a<BR>moonlight night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्च्
सञ्च् सञ्च्, cl. 1. P. सञ्चति, &c. = rts.<BR>1. सञ्ज्, 1. सज्ज्, to go, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्च|संच|संचः|सञ्चः
सञ्च सञ्च, अस्, m. (perhaps fr. सञ्-चय),<BR>a collection of leaves for writing, (according to Śab-<BR>da-k. पुस्तक-लेखनार्थ-पत्त्र-चय = साञ्च् in<BR>Bengālī.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चक्
सञ्चक् सञ्-चक् (सम्-चक्). See rt. चक्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चकित|संचकित
सञ्-चकित, अस्, आ, अम्, greatly startled, trembling,<BR>fearful, afraid; [cf. प्र-चकित.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चक|संचकः
सञ्चक सञ्चक (?), a stamp; a disc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चकान|संचकान
सञ्चकान सञ्-चकान. See under सङ्-कङ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चक्ष्|संचक्ष्
सञ्चक्ष् 1. सञ्-चक्ष् (सम्-च्˚; cf. rt. ख्या),<BR>cl. 2. A. -चष्टे, -चष्टुम्, to look at, observe,<BR>notice, consider, contemplate, survey, examine, re-<BR>flect upon; to enumerate; to report or relate fully;<BR>to avoid, shun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चक्ष्|संचक्ष्
2. सञ्-चक्ष्, f., Ved. appearance, sight, (Sāy. सञ्-<BR>चक्षि = सन्दर्शने सति, Ṛg-veda VI. 14, 4.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1049-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चक्षाण
सञ्-चक्षाण, अस्, आ, अम्, beholding at the same<BR>time, observing, surveying, examining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चक्ष्य
सञ्-चक्ष्य, ind. having observed, having re-<BR>flected on, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चत्|संचत्
सञ्चत् सञ्-चत्, त्, m. (in Uṇādi-s. II. 85.<BR>said to be fr. rt. 1. चि, the final of the rt. being<BR>dropped, and स् being generally inserted after सम्,<BR>see सञ्श्-चत्), cheating, deceit, juggling; a cheat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चय|संचय|संचयः|सञ्चयः
सञ्चय सञ्-चय, &c. See under 1. सञ्-चि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चर्|संचर्
सञ्चर् सञ्-चर् (सम्-च्˚; cf. सङ्-क्रम्), cl.<BR>1. P. A. -चरति, -ते, -चरितुम्, to go or come toge-<BR>ther, meet, join; to go or walk about, move about,<BR>roam, wander, graze; to go through, pass through,<BR>pervade, roam through; to go towards, come to,<BR>arrive at, reach, attain; to go over to, pass over to,<BR>enter; to stay, remain, live in the practice of (with<BR>loc.); to practise (with acc.): Caus. -चारयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to cause to come together, make to meet,<BR>bring into contact; to cause to go or put in motion,<BR>move, lead about; to cause to pass through; to cause<BR>to go towards, convey, deliver over to, transmit,<BR>communicate; to turn out to graze.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चर|संचर|संचरः|सञ्चरः
सञ्-चर, अस्, m. [cf. सङ्-क्रम], going or<BR>passing through, passage, transit; a way, road, route,<BR>course, entrance, gate, doorway; difficult passage or<BR>progress, travelling by inaccessible routes, any narrow<BR>road or difficult pass, a defile, a bridge over a torrent,<BR>&c.; emanation, development (in phil.); the body;<BR>killing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चरण|संचरणं
सञ्-चरण, अस्, ई, अम्, going together, meeting,<BR>converging; (अम्), n. the act of going together;<BR>passing through, travelling, going, motion, setting<BR>in motion, use.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चरत्|संचरन्त्
सञ्-चरत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, walking or wandering<BR>about; passing through.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चरमाण
सञ्-चरमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, going about, roaming;<BR>passing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चरेण्य|संचरेण्य
सञ्-चरेण्य, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. moving, movable,<BR>unsteady, changeable; (अम्), n. fickleness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चार|संचार|संचारः|सञ्चारः
सञ्-चार, अस्, m. passing through, passage, pro-<BR>gress, transition, course, a passage, way, road, door-<BR>way, entrance; the passage or entrance of the sun<BR>into a new sign; difficult progress; difficulty, distress;<BR>setting in motion; impelling, inciting, conveying,<BR>leading, guiding; transmission, communication of<BR>disease, contagion; a gem supposed to be in the<BR>head of a serpent.<BR>—सञ्चार-जीविन्, ई, इनी, इ, living<BR>with difficulty or by going to others for aid, distressed,<BR>calamitous, indigent.<BR>—सञ्चार-पूत, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>purified by the course or passage (of anything).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चारक|संचारक|संचारकः
सञ्-चारक, अस्, इका, अम्, conveying, transmitting,<BR>communicating, leading; (अस्), m. a leader, guide,<BR>messenger; an instigator; an orator; (इका), f. a<BR>female messenger, go-between; a procuress; a pair,<BR>brace; odour, smell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चारण|संचारण|संचारणं
सञ्-चारण, अम्, n. the act of setting in motion,<BR>moving; impelling, instigating; conveying, leading,<BR>guiding, transmission.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चारिका|संचारिका
सञ्-चारिका, f. See सञ्-चारक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चारित|संचारित
सञ्-चारित, अस्, आ, अम्, caused to come together,<BR>made to meet, brought into contact; caused to go,<BR>set in motion, moved, impelled, driven, worked;<BR>led, conducted, conveyed, guided; transmitted, com-<BR>municated (as disease).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चारिन्|संचारिन्
सञ्-चारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, going together, meeting;<BR>moving about, going, moving, roaming, wandering,<BR>passing through, passing; changeable, fickle, unsteady,<BR>not permanent, transitory (= व्य्-अभिचारिन् and ap-<BR>plied to a class of Bhāvas which are the reverse of<BR>स्थायिन्); passing with difficulty; difficult to be<BR>passed, inaccessible; setting in motion, impelling;<BR>acting on, influencing; transmitted, hereditary (as<BR>disease); contagious; (ई), m. a particular Bhāva,<BR>(see above); air, wind; incense, perfume; (इणी),<BR>f. a kind of scandent shrub (= हंस-पदी).<BR>—सञ्-<BR>चारि-भाव, अस्, m. a transitory Bhāva or feeling<BR>(= व्यभिचारि-भाव); a concomitant feeling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चार्य|संचार्य
सञ्-चार्य, ind. having caused to go or move,<BR>having conducted or conveyed or led.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चल्|संचल्
सञ्चल् सञ्-चल् (सम्-च्˚), cl. 1. P. -चलति,<BR>-चलितुम्, to move about, shake, move to and fro,<BR>waver, oscillate, quiver, tremble; to move away,<BR>move off, move on, depart; to start or jump up:<BR>Caus. -चालयति, -यितुम्, to cause to move about<BR>or tremble, put in motion, agitate; to push away,<BR>move or drive away, remove, expel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चल|संचल
सञ्-चल, अस्, आ, अम्, moving about, trembling,<BR>quivering.<BR>—सञ्चल-नाडि, इस्, f. ‘quivering tube,’<BR>an artery, vein, pulse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चलन|संचलन|संचलनं|सञ्चलनं
सञ्-चलन, अम्, आ, n. f. moving about, agitation,<BR>trembling, shaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चालन
सञ्चालन, अम्, n. the act of causing to move<BR>about, shaking, agitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चालयत्
सञ्-चालयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, causing to shake,<BR>agitating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चाली|संचाली
सञ्-चाली, f. the shrub Guñjā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चाल्य
सञ्-चाल्य, ind. having moved or thrust away,<BR>having ejected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चान|संचानः|सञ्चानः
सञ्चान सञ्चान, अस्, m. (according to some)<BR>a kind of bird, species of hawk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चि|संचि
सञ्चि 1. सञ्-चि (सम्-चि; see rt. 1. चि), cl. 5.<BR>P. A. -चिनोति, -चिनुते, -चेतुम्, to pile together, pile<BR>up, heap up, accumulate, collect, gather together,<BR>assemble; to arrange in order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चय|संचय|संचयः|सञ्चयः
