सञ्चयन|संचयन|संचयनं|सञ्चयनं
सञ्-चयन, अम्, n. the act of piling together,<BR>heaping up, putting together, collecting, gathering;<BR>collecting the ashes or bones of a body lately burnt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चयनीय|संचयनीय
