सञ्-चयित्वा (anom. ind. part.), having collected<BR>or accumulated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

