सञ्चेतयमान
सञ्-चेतयमान, अस्, आ, अम्, observing, being<BR>aware of, perceiving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चित्रा|संचित्रा
