सञ्चिन्तयत्
सञ्-चिन्तयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, thinking of, medi-<BR>tating upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

