सञ्चिन्तित|संचिंतित|संचिन्तित
सञ्-चिन्तित, अस्, आ, अम्, thought about, delibe-<BR>rated, weighed; designed, intended (for an office);<BR>appointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1050-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चिन्तितवत्|संचिन्तितवत्
