सञ्-जल्पत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, conversing, speaking;<BR>chattering, babbling; talking boldly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्जल्पमान
सञ्-जल्पमान, अस्, आ, अम्, speaking together,<BR>conversing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1051-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्जल्पित|संजल्पित
सञ्-जल्पित, अस्, आ, अम्, spoken together, spoken,<BR>uttered; (अम्), n. spoken words, talk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्जवन|संजवन|संजवनं|सञ्जवनं
