सञ्जित्|संजित्
सञ्-जित्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. completely conquering, win-<BR>ning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्जित|संजित
सञ्-जित, अस्, आ, अम्, entirely conquered, com-<BR>pletely overcome, vanquished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्जिति|संजिति
सञ्-जिति, इस्, f. complete victory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्जिहान|संजिहान
सञ्जिहान सञ्-जिहान. See under सं-हा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्जीव्|संजीव्
सञ्जीव् सञ्-जीव् (सम्-ज्˚), cl. 1. P. -जीवति<BR>(ep. also A. -ते), -जीवितुम्, to live with or together;<BR>to live, exist, live by any business or occupation<BR>(with inst.); to revive, be restored to life: Caus.<BR>-जीवयति, -यितुम्, to cause to live, make alive,<BR>vivify, bring to life, revive, re-animate, animate,<BR>enliven; to maintain, nourish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्जिजीवयिषु|संजिजीवयिषु
