सञ्जीवन|संजीवन|संजीवनं|सञ्जीवनं
सञ्-जीवन, अम्, n. the act of living together;<BR>bringing to life, animating, re-animating, life-restor-<BR>ing; a cluster of four houses, a quadrangle [cf. सञ्-<BR>जवन]; a particular hell, (one of the twenty-one<BR>kinds mentioned in Manu IV. 89); (ई), f. making<BR>alive, causing life; epithet of food; a kind of elixir;<BR>N. of Malli-nātha's commentaries on the Kumāra-<BR>sambhava, Megha-dūta, and Raghu-vaṃśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

