सञ्जीव्य
सञ्-जीव्य, ind. having lived together; having lived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

