सञ्जूर्व्|संजूर्व्
सञ्जूर्व् सञ्-जूर्व् (सम्-ज्˚; connected with<BR>सञ्-ज्वर्), cl. 1. P. -जूर्वति, -जूर्वितुम्, Ved. to<BR>burn up, consume (by fire).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्जृम्भ्|संजृम्भ्
सञ्जृम्भ् सञ्-जृम्भ् (सम्-ज्˚), cl. 1. A. -जृम्-<BR>भते, -जृम्भितुम्, to gape open, be unfolded,<BR>become displayed, appear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्जॄ|संजॄ
सञ्जॄ सञ्-जॄ (सम्-जॄ, see rt. 3. जॄ; cf. rt.<BR>1. गृ), cl. 1. A. -जरते, &c., Ved. to sound forth<BR>praise, to extol, (Sāy. सञ्जरेत = सम्वर्धयतु,<BR>Ṛg-veda IV. 3, 15; सञ्जरताम् = स्तौतु, Ṛg-<BR>veda IV. 4, 8.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1051-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

