सञ्-ज्ञक, अस्, इका, अम्, having a name, called,<BR>named (often at the end of comps.; cf. रवि-स्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1051-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्ज्ञपत्
