सञ्ज्वर्|संज्वर्
सञ्ज्वर् सञ्-ज्वर् (सम्-ज्˚; cf. सञ्-जूर्व्, सञ्-<BR>ज्वल्), cl. 1. P. -ज्वरति, -ज्वरितुम्, to be in great<BR>fever or heat, be greatly depressed or grieved, be<BR>afflicted or sorrowful, grieve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1052-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्ज्वर|संज्वर|संज्वरः|सञ्ज्वरः
सञ्-ज्वर, अस्, m. great heat or fever; heat, the<BR>heat of fire, burning, scorching, a burn; the heat of<BR>anger, indignation.<BR>—सञ्ज्वर-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्,<BR>full of heat or fever, hot.<BR>—सञ्ज्वरातुर (˚र-आत्˚),<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, afflicted or affected with fever, fevered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1052-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

