सन्तर्जित|संतर्जित|सन्तर्ज्जित
सन्-तर्जित, अस्, आ, अम्, threatened, abused,<BR>scolded, reproved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्तर्ज्य
सन्तर्ज्य, ind. having threatened, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्तर्पण|संतर्पण|संतर्पणं|सन्तर्पणं
