सन्तेजयत्
सन्-तेजयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, stirring up, arousing,<BR>exciting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

