सन्तुद्यमान
सन्-तुद्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being goaded or stung.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्तुल्|संतुल्
सन्तुल् सन्-तुल् (सम्-तुल्), cl. 10. P. -तोलयति,<BR>-तुलयति, -यितुम्, to weigh one thing against<BR>another, balance together, compare by measure; to<BR>weigh or balance in the mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्तुष्|संतुष्
