सन्तोषित|संतोषित
सन्-तोषित, अस्, आ, अम्, satisfied, gratified, con-<BR>soled, comforted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्तोष्टव्य|संतोष्टव्य
सन्-तोष्टव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be satisfied, to be<BR>gratified or pleased, consolable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्तोष्य|संतोष्य
सन्-तोष्य, ind. having gratified or pleased, hav-<BR>ing propitiated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

