सन्तर्पण|संतर्पण|संतर्पणं|सन्तर्पणं
सन्-तर्पण, अम्, n. the act of satisfying, satiat-<BR>ing; gratifying, delighting; a particular luscious<BR>dish (consisting of a mixture of grapes, pomegranates,<BR>dates, plantains, sugar, flour, and ghee).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्तर्पित|संतर्पित
सन्-तर्पित, अस्, आ, अम्, satisfied, satiated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्तर्प्य|संतर्प्य
सन्-तर्प्य, ind. having satisfied or satiated one's<BR>self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्तॄ|संतॄ
सन्तॄ सन्-तॄ (सम्-त्˚), cl. 1. P. -तरति (ep.<BR>also A. -ते, Ved. also cl. 6. -तिरति), -तरितुम्, -तरी-<BR>तुम्, to cross over, pass over, travel over; pass through,<BR>swim through; to pass or cross over towards, reach,<BR>attain; to surpass, overcome; to escape from (with<BR>abl.), be saved; to bring safely over, save, rescue:<BR>Caus. -तारयति, -यितुम्, to cause to pass over, bring<BR>over, bring safely over, rescue, save: Pass. of Caus.<BR>-तार्यते, to be brought over, to be rescued or saved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्तरण|संतरण|संतरणं
सन्-तरण, अम्, n. the act of crossing over,<BR>swimming over or through.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्तरत्
सन्-तरत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, crossing over, passing<BR>over, swimming over or through.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्तरमाण
सन्-तरमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, passing over, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्तरुत्र|संतरुत्र
