सन्त्वरयत्
सन्-त्वरयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, causing to hurry,<BR>hastening, urging on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्त्वरित|संत्वरित
सन्-त्वरित, अस्, आ, अम्, hurried, hastening; (अम्),<BR>ind. in a hurry, in great haste, quickly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्दंश्|संदंश्
