सन्दस्|संदस्
सन्दस् सन्-दस् (सम्-दस्), cl. 4. P. -दस्यति,<BR>-दसितुम्, Ved. (perhaps) to go out or be extinguished<BR>(as fire).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्ददस्वस्|संददस्वस्
सन्-ददस्वस्, आन्, m., Ved. becoming extinguished<BR>(according to some); giving liberally, (Sāy. = सम्-<BR>यक् प्रयच्छत्, Ṛg-veda II. 2, 6; cf. सन्-दद्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1058-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

