समभिकीर्त्य
सम्-अभिकीर्त्य, ind. having related, having nar-<BR>rated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

