समभिक्रुद्ध सम्-अभिक्रुद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>greatly enraged, angry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

