समभिगच्छत्
सम्-अभिगच्छत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, going up to<BR>together, approaching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

