सम्-अभिच्छन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, completely covered<BR>over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिजन्
समभिजन् सम्-अभि-जन्, cl. 4. A. -जायते,<BR>-जनितुम्, to be produced or spring up together,<BR>spring up, arise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

