समभित्यक्त
सम्-अभित्यक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, wholly given up,<BR>completely abandoned, renounced; risked.<BR>—सम्-<BR>अभित्यक्त-जीवित, अस्, आ, अम्, one who has quite<BR>renounced his life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

