समभिद्रुत्य
सम्-अभिद्रुत्य, ind. having hastened towards,<BR>having rushed full upon, having assailed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

