समभिधाव्
समभिधाव् सम्-अभि-धाव्, cl. 1. P. A. -धा-<BR>वति, -ते, -धावितुम्, to run hastily up to or towards,<BR>rush full upon; assail; to fly towards, dart at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

