समभिनन्दित
सम्-अभिनन्दित, अस्, आ, अम्, rejoiced with, con-<BR>gratulated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

