समभियाच् सम्-अभि-याच्, cl. 1. P. A. -या-<BR>चति, -ते, &c., to ask earnestly, implore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिरुह्
समभिरुह् सम्-अभि-रुह्, cl. 1. P. -रोहति,<BR>&c., to grow up together, ascend: Caus. -रोहयति,<BR>&c., to cause to grow up, cause to ascend, place or<BR>impose on (as a burden &c.): Pass. of Caus. -रोप्-<BR>यते, to be placed or imposed on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिलष्
समभिलष् सम्-अभि-लष्, cl. 1. P. A. -ल-<BR>षति, -ते, &c., to long for, be eager for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिलषत्
सम्-अभिलषत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, longing for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिवद्
समभिवद् सम्-अभि-वद्, Caus. -वादयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to address or salute respectfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिवाद्य
सम्-अभिवाद्य, ind. having saluted reverentially.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिवध्
समभिवध् सम्-अभि-वध् (defective, see rt.<BR>वध्), to strike at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिवाञ्छ्
समभिवाञ्छ् सम्-अभि-वाञ्छ्, cl. 1. P. -वाञ्-<BR>छति, &c., to long for, be eager for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिवीक्ष्
समभिवीक्ष् सम्-अभि-वीक्ष् (-वि-ईक्ष्), cl. 1.<BR>A. -वीक्षते, -वीक्षितुम्, to perceive, become<BR>aware of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिवृत्
समभिवृत् सम्-अभि-वृत्, cl. 1. A. -वर्तते,<BR>-वर्तितुम्, to go towards, approach, advance towards,<BR>come on; to attack, assail; to turn back, return,<BR>recur; to remain, continue; to pass by, pass away,<BR>pass over; to depart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिवृध्
समभिवृध् सम्-अभि-वृध्, cl. 1. A. -वर्-<BR>धते, &c., to grow up, increase: Caus. -वर्ध-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to make larger, enlarge, increase,<BR>augment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिवृष्
समभिवृष् सम्-अभि-वृष्, cl. 1. P. -वर्षति,<BR>&c., to rain down upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिव्याहृ
समभिव्याहृ सम्-अभि-व्य्-आ-हृ, cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-हरति, -ते, -हर्तुम्, to mention together; to bring<BR>together, associate together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिव्याहार|समभिव्याहारः
सम्-अभिव्याहार, अस्, m. (in rhetoric) mention-<BR>ing together; proximity to or association with a<BR>word whose meaning is well understood (= प्रसिद्-<BR>धार्थकस्य शब्दस्य सन्निधिः); bringing to-<BR>gether, association, company.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिव्याहारिन्
सम्-अभिव्याहारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, mentioning toge-<BR>ther; accompanying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिव्याहृत|समभिव्याहृतः
सम्-अभिव्याहृत, अस्, आ, अम्, mentioned or<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">Page1069-c+ 71</a>]<BR>spoken of together; associated (= सहित), accom-<BR>panied by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिष्टु
समभिष्टु सम्-अभि-ष्टु (-अभि-स्तु), cl. 2. P.<BR>A. -ष्टौति, -ष्टुते, &c., to praise, extol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिष्टुत्य
सम्-अभिष्टुत्य, ind. having praised, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिसंवृ
समभिसंवृ सम्-अभि-सं-वृ. See rt. वृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिसंवृत
सम्-अभिसंवृत, अस्, आ, अम्, entirely sur-<BR>rounded, encompassed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिसन्धा|समभिसंधा
समभिसन्धा सम्-अभि-सन्-धा (-सम्-धा),<BR>cl. 3. P. A. -दधाति, -धत्ते, -धातुम्, to place<BR>or put into; to aim at, strive after, determine on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिसन्धाय
सम्-अभिसन्धाय, ind. having aimed at or<BR>resolved on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिसृ
समभिसृ सम्-अभि-सृ, cl. 1. P. -सरति, &c.,<BR>to go towards, approach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिसरण|समभिसरणं
सम्-अभिसरण, अम्, n. the act of going towards<BR>or against, approaching, seeking, wishing or endeavour-<BR>ing to gain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिसृत्य
सम्-अभि-सृत्य, ind. having gone towards, hav-<BR>ing advanced, having attacked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिहृ
समभिहृ सम्-अभि-हृ, cl. 1. P. A. -हरति,<BR>-ते, &c., to seize upon or take together; to seize,<BR>take, take out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिहरण
सम्-अभिहरण, अम्, n. the act of seizing upon,<BR>taking, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिहार|समभिहारः
सम्-अभिहार, अस्, m. seizing or taking together;<BR>repetition, reiteration, (क्रिया-समभिहारेण, by a<BR>repetition of acts, by repeated acts); excess, surplus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिहृत्य
सम्-अभिहृत्य, ind. having taken out, having<BR>picked out or selected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभी
समभी सम्-अभी (-अभि-इ), cl. 2. P. -अभ्येति,<BR>&c., to go towards, come near, approach; to follow,<BR>attend, wait upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्यतिक्रम्
समभ्यतिक्रम् सम्-अभ्य्-अति-क्रम्, cl. 1. P.<BR>-क्रामति, -क्रमितुम्, to come upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्यर्च्
समभ्यर्च् सम्-अभ्य्-अर्च् (-अभि-), cl. 1. P.<BR>-अर्चति, &c., to pay great honour to, worship,<BR>greet, salute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्यर्चन|समभ्यर्चनं|समभ्यर्च्चन
सम्-अभ्यर्चन, अम्, n. the act of paying great<BR>honour to, worshipping, reverencing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्यर्चित|समभ्यर्च्चित
सम्-अभ्यर्चित, अस्, आ, अम्, greatly honoured,<BR>worshipped, saluted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्यर्च्य
सम्-अभ्यर्च्य, ind. having paid honour to, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्यर्थ्
समभ्यर्थ् सम्-अभ्य्-अर्थ्, cl. 10. A. -अर्थ-<BR>यते, &c., to petition, solicit, request.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्यर्थयितृ
सम्-अभ्यर्थयितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, a petitioner;<BR>seeking, petitioning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्यवे
समभ्यवे सम्-अभ्य्-अवे (-अभि-अव-इ), cl. 2.<BR>P. -अवैति, &c., to go together, meet, assemble; to<BR>come to an agreement with (with inst.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्यागम्
समभ्यागम् सम्-अभ्य्-आ-गम् (-अभि-आ-), cl.<BR>1. P. -गच्छति, -गन्तुम्, to come to, approach,<BR>arrive; to return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्यागत
सम्-अभ्यागत, अस्, आ, अम्, come to, approached;<BR>come back, returned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्यागा
समभ्यागा सम्-अभ्य्-आ-गा (-अभि-आ-), cl. 3.<BR>P. -जिगाति, -गातुम्, to come to, come near, approach;<BR>to come upon, assail, attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्यादा
समभ्यादा सम्-अभ्य्-आ-दा, cl. 3. A. -दत्ते,<BR>दातुम्, to comprehend, perceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्याददान
सम्-अभ्याददान, अस्, आ, अम्, comprehending,<BR>perceiving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्यानी
समभ्यानी सम्-अभ्य्-आ-नी, cl. 1. P. A. -न-<BR>यति, -ते, -नेतुम्, to lead near to or towards; to<BR>introduce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्याहार|समभ्याहारः
समभ्याहार सम्-अभ्याहार, अस्, m. bringing<BR>together, association, accompaniment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्युन्नम्
समभ्युन्नम् सम्-अभ्य्-उन्-नम् (-अभि-उद्-), cl.<BR>1. P. -नमति, -नन्तुम्, to ascend, rise up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्युन्नत
सम्-अभ्युन्नत, अस्, आ, अम्, ascended, risen,<BR>rising up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1069-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्युपगमन
समभ्युपगमन सम्-अभ्युपगमन, अम्, n.<BR>the act of approaching or going near; following.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्युपे
समभ्युपे सम्-अभ्य्-उपे (-उप-इ), cl. 2. P.<BR>-उपैति, &c., to go very near, approach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्युपेय
सम्-अभ्युपेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be gone to or<BR>approached; to be followed; (अम्), n. the being<BR>followed by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्ये
समभ्ये सम्-अभ्य्-ए (-अभि-आ-इ), cl. 2. P.<BR>-अभ्यैति, &c., to come up to, approach, go near<BR>to (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्येत्य
सम्-अभ्येत्य, ind. having come up, having<BR>approached.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समम्
समम् 1. समम्, ind. with, together with.<BR>(See under सम.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समम्
समम् 2. सम्-अम्, cl. 1. A. -अमते, &c., Ved.<BR>to go earnestly towards, solicit eagerly; to go together,<BR>ally or connect one's self; to fix or settle firmly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समममान
सम्-अममान, अस्, आ, अम्, connecting or allying<BR>one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समय|समयः
समय सम्-अय, सम्-आय, &c. See under<BR>1. सम्-इ, p. 1076.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर|समरं|समरः
समर सम्-अर, सम्-अराण, &c. See under<BR>सम्-ऋ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्च्
समर्च् सम्-अर्च् [cf. सम्-ऋच्], cl. 1. P. or<BR>Caus. -अर्चति, &c., or -अर्चयति, &c., to honour,<BR>worship, adore; to adorn, decorate (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्चन|समर्चनं|समर्च्चन
सम्-अर्चन, अम्, n. the act of honouring, wor-<BR>shipping, adoration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्चित|समर्च्चित
सम्-अर्चित, अस्, आ, अम्, honoured, worshipped,<BR>adored.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्ण|समर्ण्ण
समर्ण सम्-अर्ण. See सम्-अर्द्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थ्
समर्थ् सम्-अर्थ् (in some senses to be re-<BR>garded as a Nom. fr. सम्-अर्थ below), cl. 10. P.<BR>A. -अर्थयति, -ते (more usually A.), -यितुम्, to<BR>make fit or ready, prepare; to make capable, main-<BR>tain, enforce, exert (e. g. यत्नं समर्थय,<BR>make great exertions, exert effort); to establish, sup-<BR>port, provide, bestow (Ved., Sāy. समर्थयस्व<BR>= सङ्गमय = देहि); to judge of the fitness or<BR>propriety of anything, deliberate upon, take into<BR>consideration, reflect or think upon, decide on, deter-<BR>mine, resolve; to judge, consider, regard, think,<BR>imagine, suppose, hold; to suppose, imply, suggest<BR>(a possibility &c.); to approve; to expect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थ|समर्थः
सम्-अर्थ, अस्, आ, अम्, having a similar or suitable<BR>aim or object, having proper aim or force, very forcible<BR>or adequate, well adapted (to any purpose), well<BR>suited, fit, suitable, proper, regular; capable, compe-<BR>tent, adequate; very strong or powerful, able; having<BR>the same sense or meaning, having one sense (=<BR>तुल्यार्थ, एकार्थ); having the same construction,<BR>being in apposition (said of words); having meaning<BR>or significance, full of meaning, coherent, significant,<BR>intelligible; made fit or proper, prepared, allowed;<BR>(अस्), m. a word which has force or meaning, signi-<BR>ficant word; the construction or coherence of words<BR>together in a significant sentence.<BR>—समर्थ-ता,<BR>f. or समर्थ-त्व, अम्, n. forcibleness, adequacy,<BR>capability, ability, strength, force, power; sameness<BR>of meaning, oneness of meaning or sense, force or<BR>signification (of words), sense, meaning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थक|समर्थकं
समर्थक, अम्, n. aloe wood, Amyris Agallocha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थन|समर्थनं
सम्-अर्थन, अम्, आ, n. f. the act of making<BR>capable, giving force or strength, establishing, main-<BR>taining, supporting, corroborating, corroboration; de-<BR>liberation, determination, determining or deciding<BR>on the propriety of anything, judging, considering,<BR>supposing, imagining, inferring; adequacy, capability,<BR>energy, force, potency, efficacy, ability, perseverance;<BR>attempting difficulties or impossibilities; reconciling<BR>differences, reconciliation, allaying disputes; object-<BR>ing, objection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थनीय
सम्-अर्थनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be maintained or<BR>established; to be determined or considered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थयत्
सम्-अर्थयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, maintaining, regard-<BR>ing, considering, reflecting on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थित
सम्-अर्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, maintained, established;<BR>taken into consideration, considered, judged, regarded,<BR>held; resolved, determined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थितवत्
समर्थित-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, one who has judged<BR>or considered, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थ्य
सम्-अर्थ्य, ind. having deliberated, having con-<BR>sidered, having determined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्द्
समर्द् सम्-अर्द्, Caus. P. -अर्दयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to pain greatly, distress, wound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्ण|समर्ण्ण
सम्-अर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, asked, solicited; pained,<BR>wounded, plagued.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्धक|समर्द्धकः
समर्धक सम्-अर्धक. See under सम्-ऋध्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्पण|समर्पणं|समर्प्पण
समर्पण सम्-अर्पण. See under सम्-ऋ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्य
समर्य समर्य. See under सम्-ऋ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्याद|समर्यादः|समर्य्याद|समर्य्यादः
समर्याद स-मर्याद, अस्, आ, अम्, bounded,<BR>limited; near, proximate; keeping within bounds or<BR>in the right course, correct in conduct; respectful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्ह्
समर्ह् सम्-अर्ह्, Caus. -अर्हयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>show honour to, honour, pay respect to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समल|समलं
समल स-मल, अस्, आ, अम्, having dirt,<BR>dirty, foul, filthy, muddy, impure; sinful; (अम्), n.<BR>excrement, feculent matter, ordure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समलङ्कृत|समलंकृत
समलङ्कृत सम्-अलङ्कृत, अस्, आ, अम्, highly<BR>decorated, well adorned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समलङ्कृत्य
सम्-अलङ्कृत्य, ind. having completely adorned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समव्
समव् सम्-अव्, cl. 1. P. -अवति, -अवितुम्, to<BR>satisfy, satiate; to protect, maintain, (Sāy. सम्-<BR>आवतम् = सम्यग् अरक्षतम्, Ṛg-veda I. 112,<BR>18.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवकार|समवकारः
समवकार सम्-अवकार, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 1. कृ<BR>with अव and सम्), a species of Rūpaka or drama<BR>(described as a representation of mutual combats and<BR>heroic action in three acts).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवकॄ
समवकॄ सम्-अव-कॄ, cl. 6. P. -किरति, -क-<BR>रितुम्, -करीतुम्, to scatter completely over, cover<BR>entirely, overwhelm with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवक्षिप्
समवक्षिप् सम्-अव-क्षिप्, cl. 6. P. A.<BR>-क्षिपति, -ते, -क्षेप्तुम्, to cast or thrust away,<BR>repel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवगम्
समवगम् सम्-अव-गम्, cl. 1. P. -गच्छति,<BR>-गन्तुम्, to perceive or understand thoroughly,<BR>become thoroughly acquainted with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवगुह्
समवगुह् सम्-अव-गुह्, cl. 1. A. -गूहते,<BR>गूहितुम्, -गोढुम्, to crouch down, cower; (ac-<BR>cording to a Scholiast = देहं सङ्-कुच्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवच्छद्
समवच्छद् सम्-अव-च्छद् (-छद्), cl. 10. P.<BR>-च्छादयति, -यितुम्, to cover completely over, con-<BR>ceal, obscure: Pass. -च्छाद्यते, to be covered over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवच्छन्न
सम्-अवच्छन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, covered all over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवच्छाद्य
सम्-अवच्छाद्य, ind. having covered completely<BR>over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवतॄ
समवतॄ सम्-अव-तॄ, cl. 1. P. -तरति, &c.,<BR>to descend: Caus. -तारयति, -यितुम्, to cause to<BR>descend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवतार|समवतारः
सम्-अवतार, अस्, m. descent; a descent into a<BR>river or sacred bathing-place, a Tīrtha or place of<BR>pilgrimage, (Kirāt. V. 7.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवदा
समवदा सम्-अव-दा or सम्-अव-दो (see<BR>rts. 3. दा, दो), cl. 2. P. -दाति, -दातुम्, to cut up in<BR>pieces, divide, distribute; to gather together, collect<BR>the pieces, to put together piece by piece.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवत्त
सम्-अवत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, cut up, divided into pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवदाय
सम्-अवदाय, ind. having cut up or distributed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवदिश्
समवदिश् सम्-अव-दिश्, cl. 6. P. -दिशति,<BR>-देष्टुम्, to point or refer to, to explain with refer-<BR>ence to (anything).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवद्रु
समवद्रु सम्-अव-द्रु, cl. 1. P. A. -द्रवति,<BR>-ते, -द्रोतुम्, to run away together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवधान|समवधानं
समवधान सम्-अवधान, अम्, n. great<BR>attention; preparation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवनत
समवनत सम्-अवनत, अस्, आ, अम्, (fr. rt. नम्<BR>with अव and सम्), completely bent down, bowed,<BR>bending down, stooping (to drink water &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवनी
समवनी सम्-अव-नी, cl. 1. P. A. -नयति,<BR>-ते, -नेतुम्, to lead together, unite; to pour in<BR>together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवनीय
सम्-अवनीय, ind. having poured together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवप्लु
समवप्लु सम्-अव-प्लु, cl. 1. A. -प्लवते,<BR>-प्लोतुम्, to leap or jump down from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवप्लुत
सम्-अवप्लुत, अस्, आ, अम्, lept down, jumped off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवबुध्
समवबुध् सम्-अव-बुध्, cl. 4. A. -बुध्यते,<BR>-बोधितुम्, to perceive clearly, understand fully,<BR>know.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवमृश्
समवमृश् सम्-अव-मृश्, cl. 6. P. -मृशति,<BR>&c., to lay hold of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवरुध्
