समवरुद्ध
सम्-अवरुद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, shut up, enclosed;<BR>obtained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवलम्ब्
समवलम्ब् सम्-अव-लम्ब्, cl. 1. A. -लम्बते,<BR>&c., to lay hold of; to support.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवलम्ब्य
सम्-अवलम्ब्य, ind. having taken hold of, hav-<BR>ing supported.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवली
समवली सम्-अव-ली, cl. 4. A. -लीयते, &c.,<BR>to be dissolved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1070-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवलोक्
