समुत्कृष्य
सम्-उत्कृष्य, ind. having drawn up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्कॄ
