समुत्तेजित
सम्-उत्तेजित, अस्, आ, अम्, greatly excited or in-<BR>flamed, incited, excited, irritated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्तॄ
