समुत्तीर्ण
सम्-उत्तीर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, come forth from;<BR>escaped from; passed through, crossed, landed, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्तीर्य
सम्-उत्तीर्य, ind. having passed out of or come<BR>forth from, having passed through, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्त्रस्
