समुत्त्रस्त
सम्-उत्त्रस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, thoroughly frightened,<BR>greatly alarmed or terrified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्था
समुत्था सम्-उत्-था (-उद्-स्था), cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-तिष्ठति, -ते, -थातुम्, to rise up together, rise<BR>up, arise; to return to life: Caus. -थापयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to raise up together, raise up, elevate, erect;<BR>to re-animate, revive, restore to life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्थ|समुत्थः
सम्-उत्थ, अस्, आ, अम्, rising up, risen; arising,<BR>arisen or produced from; occurring, occasioned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्थान|समुत्थानं
सम्-उत्थान, अम्, n. the act of rising up toge-<BR>ther, rising up, rising; recovering from sickness or<BR>injury, perfect cure, healing of a wound or sore;<BR>increase, increment, advance, growth; performance<BR>of work, active occupation, effort, industry, (सम्-<BR>भूय समुत्थान, the performance of work or<BR>engaging in business after uniting with others,<BR>co-operation, partnership); indication or symptom<BR>of disease.<BR>—समुत्थान-व्यय, अस्, m. the ex-<BR>pense of recovery or cure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्थाप्य
सम्-उत्थाप्य, ind. having raised up, having<BR>made or helped to stand up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्थाय
सम्-उत्थाय, ind. having risen up, having arisen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्थित|समुत्थितः
सम्-उत्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, risen up together, started<BR>up, risen, raised; recovered, cured, healed; swollen<BR>up; increased; arisen, produced; derived, obtained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पट्
समुत्पट् सम्-उत्-पट् (-उद्-प्˚), cl. 10. P.<BR>-पाटयति, -यितुम्, to tear completely out, tear out<BR>by the roots, root up, tear off; to draw out; to tear<BR>away, detach, sever; to expel, dethrone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पाट|समुत्पाटः
सम्-उत्पाट, अस्, m. tearing completely out or<BR>away, rooting up, eradication; tearing away from,<BR>severing, detaching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पाटित
सम्-उत्पाटित, अस्, आ, अम्, torn up by the roots;<BR>torn completely away, severed, detached.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पाट्य
सम्-उत्पाट्य, ind. having torn completely out or<BR>away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पत्
समुत्पत् सम्-उत्-पत् (-उद्-प्˚), cl. 1. P. -प-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-c" target="_blank">Page1078-c+ 74</a>]<BR>तति, -पतितुम्, to fly up together, fly upwards,<BR>jump up, start up, spring up, rise, ascend, arise, be<BR>produced; to rush out of, gush out; rush forth,<BR>break forth; to fly away, depart, disappear; to rush<BR>upon, attack, assail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पतत्
सम्-उत्पतत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, flying up together,<BR>flying upwards, ascending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पतन|समुत्पतनं
सम्-उत्पतन, अम्, n. the act of flying up toge-<BR>ther, flying upwards, going upwards, ascending;<BR>making effort, energy, exertion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पतित
सम्-उत्पतित, अस्, आ, अम्, flown up together,<BR>flown upwards, ascended, sprung up, springing up-<BR>wards; flown away, gone, departed, disappeared;<BR>exerted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पत्य
सम्-उत्पत्य, ind. having flown upwards; having<BR>flown away; having gushed out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पिपतिषु
सम्-उत्पिपतिषु, उस्, उस्, उ (fr. the Desid.),<BR>about to start up or spring up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पद्
समुत्पद् सम्-उत्-पद् (-उद्-प्˚), cl. 4. A. -पद्-<BR>यते, -पत्तुम्, to spring up together; to spring up,<BR>arise, come forth; to be brought forth or born or<BR>produced, happen, come to pass, occur, take place;<BR>to present one's self: Caus. -पादयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>cause to arise, produce, effect, cause.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पत्ति|समुत्पत्तिः
सम्-उत्पत्ति, इस्, f. arising together, arising, pro-<BR>duction, birth, orgin; formation, occurrence, inci-<BR>dence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पन्न|समुत्पन्नः
सम्-उत्पन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, sprung up together,<BR>arisen, produced, born, effected, excited; occurred,<BR>happened, occurring, taking place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पादन|समुत्पादनं
सम्-उत्पादन, अम्, n. the act of bringing forth,<BR>producing; effecting, fabricating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पादित
सम्-उत्पादित, अस्, आ, अम्, brought forth, pro-<BR>duced, effected, caused, formed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पिञ्ज|समुत्पिंज|समुत्पिञ्जः
समुत्पिञ्ज सम्-उत्पिञ्ज, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt.<BR>पिञ्ज् with उद् and सम्), excessively confused or con-<BR>founded, bewildered, disturbed, overcome; (अस्), m.<BR>an army in great disorder; complete confusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1078-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

