समुद्बध्य
सम्-उद्बध्य, ind. having bound up firmly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

