समुद्बुध् सम्-उद्-बुध्, Caus. -बोधयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to rouse up thoroughly, awaken, animate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्बोध
सम्-उद्बोध, अस्, m. thorough rousing up,<BR>awakening, exciting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्भू
