समुद्यत
सम्-उद्यत, अस्, आ, अम्, lifted up; ready or eager<BR>for action, prepared for, ready for (with inf. or dat.<BR>or loc. or with अर्थम् or प्रति); about to do<BR>anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्यम|समुद्यमः
