समुद्रिक्त
सम्-उद्रिक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, abundantly furnished<BR>with (with inst.), abounding in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्वस्
समुद्वस् सम्-उद्-वस्, Caus. -वासयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to cause to be moved away, expel or remove<BR>from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्वह्
समुद्वह् सम्-उद्-वह्, cl. 1. P. A. -वहति,<BR>-ते, -वोढुम्, to bear up, raise or lift up; to bear<BR>out, lift out, carry out, carry forth; to bear, carry,<BR>possess; to display, exhibit; to lead away, marry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्वह|समुद्वहः
सम्-उद्वह, अस्, आ, अम्, bearing up, lifting up,<BR>who or what lifts up; moving up and down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्वहत्
