समुन्नदत्
सम्-उन्नदत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, crying or roaring out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुन्नम्
