समुन्नम्य
सम्-उन्नम्य, ind. having raised up or elevated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुन्नाम्य
सम्-उन्नाम्य, ind. having raised completely up,<BR>&c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुन्नह्
