समुन्नद्ध|समुन्नद्धः
सम्-उन्नद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, tied up, bound up;<BR>raised up, elevated, exalted; swollen, pressed up or<BR>out; full, excessive; puffed up (with pride), proud,<BR>conceited, arrogant, overbearing; supreme; untied,<BR>unfettered, liberated, loosened; produced, born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुन्नी
