समुन्नयत्
सम्-उन्नयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, raising or lifting up,<BR>causing to obtain eminence; attaining, gaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुन्नीत
