समुन्नेय
सम्-उन्नेय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be brought out, to<BR>be deduced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

