समुन्मज्ज्य
सम्-उन्मज्ज्य, ind. having bathed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

