समुन्मिषत्
सम्-उन्मिषत्, अन्, अती or अन्ती, अत्, rising up,<BR>springing up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

