समुन्मूल्य
सम्-उन्मूल्य, ind. having completely eradicated,<BR>having utterly exterminated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

