समुपचित
सम्-उपचित, अस्, आ, अम्, collected, heaped, accu-<BR>mulated.<BR>—समुपचित-जल, अस्, आ, अम्, having<BR>accumulated waters (as the ocean).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपजन्
