समुपजनित
सम्-उपजनित, अस्, आ, अम्, generated, produced,<BR>caused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपजात
सम्-उपजात, अस्, आ, अम्, engendered, arisen,<BR>produced, caused; aroused.<BR>—समुपजात-कोप,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, one whose anger is roused, provoked or<BR>moved to anger.<BR>—समुपजाताभिनिवेशम् (˚त-<BR>अभ्˚), ind. after having formed a determined reso-<BR>lution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

