समुपद्रुत
सम्-उपद्रुत, अस्, आ, अम्, assailed, attacked,<BR>overrun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

