सम्-उपदधत्, अत्, अती, अत्, constructing, creating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपधाव्
समुपधाव् सम्-उप-धाव्, cl. 1. P. A. -धा-<BR>वति, -ते, -धावितुम्, to run up to together, run<BR>near, rush towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपनी
समुपनी सम्-उप-नी, cl. 1. P. A. -नयति,<BR>-ते, -नेतुम्, to lead up to together, bring or draw<BR>near to, lead to; to bring about, cause; to take<BR>away, carry off or away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपनयत्
सम्-उपनयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, leading to, bring-<BR>ing about, causing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपनीत
सम्-उपनीत, अस्, आ, अम्, brought to, led to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपन्यस्
