समुपन्यस्त
सम्-उपन्यस्त, अस्, आ, अम्, fully stated or proved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपपद्
समुपपद् सम्-उप-पद्, cl. 4. A. -पद्यते,<BR>-पत्तुम्, to come to pass, take place, be brought<BR>about or accomplished, be produced: Caus. -पाद-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to bring about, make ready, prepare,<BR>accomplish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपपादित
सम्-उपपादित, अस्, आ, अम्, brought about, made<BR>ready, prepared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपप्लु
समुपप्लु सम्-उप-प्लु. See rt. प्लु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपप्लुत
सम्-उपप्लुत, अस्, आ, अम्, completely over-<BR>whelmed or beset, assailed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपभुज्
समुपभुज् सम्-उप-भुज्, cl. 7. A. -भुङ्क्ते,<BR>-भोक्तुम्, to enjoy sexually, have sexual union with<BR>(with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपभुज्य
सम्-उपभुज्य, ind. having enjoyed, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपभोग|समुपभोगः
सम्-उपभोग, अस्, m. cohabitation, sexual union.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपया
समुपया सम्-उप-या, cl. 2. P. -याति, -यातुम्,<BR>to go up to or approach together (with acc.); to<BR>betake one's self to; to go to any state or condition,<BR>(see rt. 1. या.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपयात
सम्-उपयात, अस्, आ, अम्, gone up to, approached,<BR>&c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपयुज्
समुपयुज् सम्-उप-युज्, cl. 7. P. A. -यु-<BR>नक्ति, -युङ्क्ते, -योक्तुम्, to appropriate entirely to<BR>one's self, make complete use of, consume: Caus.<BR>-योजयति, &c., to make complete use of, consume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपयुक्त
सम्-उपयुक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, completely used up<BR>or consumed, eaten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपयुक्तवत्
सम्-उपयुक्तवत्, आन्, अती, अत्, one who has<BR>consumed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपयोषम्
समुपयोषम् सम्-उपयोषम्, ind. = सम्-<BR>उपजोषम्, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपरुज्
समुपरुज् सम्-उप-रुज्, cl. 6. P. -रुजति,<BR>&c., to break or cut up; to press hardly upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपरुध्
समुपरुध् सम्-उप-रुध्, cl. 7. P. A. -रु-<BR>णद्धि, -रुन्द्धे, &c., to hinder greatly, disturb,<BR>obstruct: Pass. -रुध्यते, to be hindered or inter-<BR>rupted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपलक्ष्
समुपलक्ष् सम्-उप-लक्ष्, cl. 10. P. A.<BR>-लक्षयति, -ते, -यितुम्, to look at attentively,<BR>observe carefully; to see fully, perceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपलभ्
समुपलभ् सम्-उप-लभ्, cl. 1. A. -लभते<BR>(ep. also P. -लभति), -लब्धुम्, to take or receive<BR>fully, obtain, acquire; to acquire by experience,<BR>learn, perceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपवस्
समुपवस् सम्-उप-वस्, cl. 1. P. -वसति,<BR>-वस्तुम्, to abide wholly in, engage in, devote one's<BR>self to; to abide in a state of abstinence, fast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपोषित
सम्-उपोषित, अस्, आ, अम्, engaged in, devoted<BR>to; fasting, abstaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपवह्
समुपवह् सम्-उप-वह्, cl. 1. P. A. -वहति,<BR>-ते, -वोढुम्, to bear or carry along with; to flow<BR>with, stream: Pass. -उपोह्यते, to be borne near,<BR>approach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपोढ
1. सम्-उपोढ, अस्, आ, अम् (for 2. see under सम्-<BR>उपोह्), borne or carried along; borne upwards, gone<BR>upwards, risen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपविश्
समुपविश् सम्-उप-विश्, cl. 6. P. -विशति,<BR>-वेष्टुम्, to sit down together, sit down on, take a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">Page1081-c+ 72</a>]<BR>seat; to sit down near; to lie down upon (with<BR>acc.), rest upon; to encamp: Caus. -वेशयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to cause to sit down, ask to be seated; to<BR>cause to encamp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपविश्य
सम्-उपविश्य, ind. having sat down together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपविष्ट
सम्-उपविष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, seated together,<BR>seated, sat down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपवेश|समुपवेशः
सम्-उपवेश, अस्, m. sitting down together;<BR>asking to sit down or rest, entertaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपवेशन|समुपवेशनं
सम्-उपवेशन, अम्, n. the act of causing to sit<BR>down; a habitation, building.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपवेशित
सम्-उपवेशित, अस्, आ, अम्, made to sit down,<BR>made to lie down, asked to sit down or rest, received<BR>hospitably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपवृंह्
समुपवृंह् सम्-उप-वृंह्, Caus. -वृंहयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to cause to increase, augment, strengthen;<BR>to complete.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपवृत्
समुपवृत् सम्-उप-वृत्, cl. 1. A. -वर्तते,<BR>&c., to go together towards, proceed together; to<BR>behave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपश्रु
समुपश्रु सम्-उप-श्रु, cl. 5. P. -शृणोति,<BR>-श्रोतुम्, to listen to attentively, hear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपसंहृ
समुपसंहृ सम्-उप-सं-हृ, cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-हरति, -ते, &c., to withhold entirely, restrain, stop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपसृप्
समुपसृप् सम्-उप-सृप्, cl. 1. P. -सर्पति,<BR>-सर्प्तुम्, -स्रप्तुम्, to creep up together towards,<BR>creep up to, go to, go towards, approach; to attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपसर्पत्
सम्-उपसर्पत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, creeping or crawl-<BR>ing near, approaching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपसेव्
समुपसेव् सम्-उप-सेव्, cl. 1. A. -सेवते,<BR>-सेवितुम्, to make use of together; to use, enjoy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपस्था
समुपस्था 1. सम्-उप-स्था, cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-तिष्ठति, -ते, -स्थातुम्, to stand together in close<BR>proximity, come near, go to or towards, approach,<BR>attack (with acc.); to occur, arise, befall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपस्था
2. सम्-उपस्था, f. standing near, approximation,<BR>proximity; happening, befalling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपस्थान|समुपस्थानं
सम्-उपस्थान, अम्, n. approximation, approach;<BR>nearness; happening, occurring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपस्थित
सम्-उपस्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, standing near, brought<BR>near to, approximated, impending; imminent; attained,<BR>acquired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपस्थिति|समुपस्थितिः
सम्-उपस्थिति, इस्, f. = सम्-उपस्थान above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपस्पृश्
समुपस्पृश् सम्-उप-स्पृश्, cl. 6. P. -स्पृ-<BR>शति, &c., to touch (water) for ablution, use for<BR>ablution; to sip water; to bathe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपहृ
समुपहृ सम्-उप-हृ, cl. 1. P. A. -हरति,<BR>-ते, -हर्तुम्, to bring towards, offer; to perform<BR>(a sacrifice).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपाकृ
समुपाकृ सम्-उपा-कृ (-उप-आ-), cl. 8. P. A.<BR>-करोति, -कुरुते, -कर्तुम्, to satisfy, pay off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपाक्रम्
समुपाक्रम् सम्-उपा-क्रम् (-उप-आ-), cl. 1.<BR>P. A. -क्रामति, -क्रमते, -क्रमितुम्, to go up<BR>to together, to approach, attain to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपाक्रान्त
सम्-उपाक्रान्त, अस्, आ, अम्, approached, attained<BR>to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपागम्
समुपागम् सम्-उपा-गम् (-उप-आ-), cl. 1. P.<BR>-गच्छति, -गन्तुम्, to go up to together, go near<BR>to, go towards, approach, meet; to come upon,<BR>incur; to occur, befall; to undergo, go to any state<BR>or condition, (see rt. गम्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपागत
सम्-उपागत, अस्, आ, अम्, gone near to, approached,<BR>come together, assembled, met; come upon, incurred;<BR>occurred, happening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपाघ्रा
समुपाघ्रा सम्-उपा-घ्रा (-उप-आ-), cl. 1. P.<BR>-जिघ्रति, -घ्रातुम्, to smell at; to kiss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपाघ्राय
सम्-उपाघ्राय, ind. having kissed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपाचर्
समुपाचर् सम्-उपा-चर् (-उप-आ-), cl. 1. P.<BR>-चरति, -चरितुम्, to attend, wait on, treat (medi-<BR>cally); to practise; to be intent upon anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपादा
समुपादा सम्-उपा-दा (-उप-आ-), cl. 3. P. A.<BR>-ददाति, -दत्ते, -दातुम्, to give or deliver over (P.);<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">Page1082-a+ 73</a>]<BR>to gain, receive, acquire (A.); to take away from,<BR>deprive of (A.); to collect, heap together (A.); to<BR>assume, put on (A.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपात्त
सम्-उपात्त, अस्, आ, अम्, acquired; taken away;<BR>collected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपादाय
सम्-उपादाय, ind. having delivered over; having<BR>acquired; having assumed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपानी
समुपानी सम्-उपा-नी (-उप-आ-), cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-नयति, -ते, -नेतुम्, to conduct or lead together<BR>towards, bring together, gather together, assemble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपानीत
सम्-उपानीत, अस्, आ, अम्, brought together,<BR>gathered together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपाया
समुपाया सम्-उपा-या (-उप-आ-), cl. 2. P.<BR>-याति, -यातुम्, to go up to together, go towards,<BR>come up to, approach, arrive at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपायात
सम्-उपायात, अस्, आ, अम्, come near, approached,<BR>arrived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपायुज्
समुपायुज् सम्-उपा-युज् (-उप-आ-), See rt.<BR>1. युज्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपायुक्त
सम्-उपायुक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, furnished with, pos-<BR>sessed of, surrounded by, full of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपारभ्
समुपारभ् सम्-उपा-रभ् (-उप-आ-, see आ-<BR>रभ्), cl. 1. A. -रभते, &c., to begin together,<BR>commence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपारब्ध
सम्-उपारब्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, begun, commenced,<BR>undertaken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपारुज्
समुपारुज् सम्-उपा-रुज् (-उप-आ-), = सम्-<BR>उप-रुज्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपारुह्
समुपारुह् सम्-उपा-रुह् (-उप-आ-), cl. 1. P.<BR>-रोहति, &c., to mount up, ascend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपारूढ
सम्-उपारूढ, अस्, आ, अम्, mounted upon,<BR>ascended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपार्ज्
समुपार्ज् सम्-उपार्ज् (-उप-अर्ज्), cl. 1. 10. P.<BR>-उपार्जति, -उपार्जयति, &c., to bring together,<BR>cause to be brought together or prepared; to gain<BR>or acquire together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपार्जन|समुपार्जनं
सम्-उपार्जन, अम्, n. the act of gaining or<BR>acquiring together, simultaneous acquisition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपार्जित
सम्-उपार्जित, अस्, आ, अम्, brought together,<BR>prepared; acquired, gained; stored up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपाविश्
समुपाविश् सम्-उपा-विश् (-उप-आ-), cl. 6. P.<BR>-विशति, -वेष्टुम्, to enter upon together, under-<BR>take, begin, commence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपाश्
समुपाश् सम्-उपाश् (-उप-अश्), cl. 9. P.<BR>-उपाश्नाति, &c., to taste fully or completely, enjoy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपाश्रि
समुपाश्रि सम्-उपा-श्रि (-उप-आ-), cl. 1. P.<BR>A. -श्रयति, -ते, -श्रयितुम्, to have recourse to<BR>together, resort to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपाश्रित
सम्-उपाश्रित, अस्, आ, अम्, resorted to, having<BR>recourse to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपास्
समुपास् सम्-उपास् (-उप-आस्), cl. 2. A.<BR>-उपास्ते, &c., to sit near together or near each other;<BR>to engage in or devote one's self to anything toge-<BR>ther, practise in common; to serve or honour to-<BR>gether.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपासीन
सम्-उपासीन, अस्, आ, अम्, sitting near together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपास्था
समुपास्था सम्-उपा-स्था (-उप-आ-), cl. 1.<BR>P. A. -तिष्ठति, -ते, &c., to stand near to; to<BR>practise, observe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपे
समुपे सम्-उपे (-उप-इ, see rt. 5. इ), cl. 2.<BR>P. -उपैति, &c., to come together, assemble, meet;<BR>to go towards, go near to, approach, assail, attack; to<BR>reach; to fall to the share, come into the possession<BR>of; to go to any state or condition, undergo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपेत
सम्-उपेत, अस्, आ, अम्, come together, assembled,<BR>gone near to, approached, resorted to, visited; arrived<BR>at; furnished with, possessed of, endowed with; in-<BR>habited by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपेत्य
सम्-उपेत्य, ind. having gone near to, having<BR>approached.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपेयिवस्
सम्-उपेयिवस्, आन्, -युषी, अत्, one who has gone<BR>near or approached; going, proceeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपेक्ष्
समुपेक्ष् सम्-उपेक्ष् (-उप-ईक्ष्), cl. 1. A.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">Page1082-b+ 71</a>]<BR>-उपेक्षते (sometimes also P. -ति), -उपेक्षितुम्,<BR>to look completely over or beyond, take no notice<BR>of, overlook, disregard, neglect, abandon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपोपविश्
समुपोपविश् सम्-उपोप-विश् (-उप-उप-).<BR>See rt. 1. विश्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपोपविष्ट
सम्-उपोपविष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, seated together,<BR>sitting down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपोष्
समुपोष् सम्-उपोष् (-उप-उष्), cl. 1. P.<BR>-उपोषति, &c., to burn together, consume together,<BR>to burn up completely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपोह्
समुपोह् सम्-उपोह् (-उप-ऊह्, see rt. 1. ऊह्),<BR>cl. 1. P. A. -उपोहति, -ते, &c., to bring near to,<BR>draw towards; to bring into contact with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपोढ
2. सम्-उपोढ, अस्, आ, अम् (equally referrible to<BR>सम्-उप-वह्), brought near, presented, close at<BR>hand; suppressed, restrained; begun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुब्ज्
समुब्ज् सम्-उब्ज्, cl. 6. P. -उब्जति, -उब्जितुम्,<BR>to cover over, close up; to press together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुब्जित
सम्-उब्जित, अस्, आ, अम्, covered over, closed up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुभ्
समुभ् सम्-उभ्, cl. 9. 7. P. -उभ्नाति, -उनप्ति<BR>(Impf. -उनप्), &c., Ved. to confine, shut up, cover<BR>up, close up; to strike down, injure, mutilate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुब्ध
सम्-उब्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, confined, covered up;<BR>injured; contracted, shrunk together, (Sāy. = सङ्-<BR>कुचित.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुल्लङ्घ्
समुल्लङ्घ् सम्-उल्-लङ्घ्, cl. 10. P. -लङ्घ-<BR>यति, &c., to leap beyond, violate, transgress,<BR>neglect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुल्लम्ब्
समुल्लम्ब् सम्-उल्-लम्ब् (-उद्-लम्ब्). See rt.<BR>लम्ब्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुल्लम्बित
सम्-उल्लम्बित, अस्, आ, अम्, quite erect, upright;<BR>(according to some) hanging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुल्लस्
समुल्लस् सम्-उल्-लस् (-उद्-लस्), cl. 1. P. -ल-<BR>सति, -लसितुम्, to shine forth brightly, gleam, glitter;<BR>to break forth, appear; to jump or dance about,<BR>sport, be wanton: Caus. -लासयति, -यितुम्, to cause<BR>to jump or sport, exhilarate, make glad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुल्लसत्
सम्-उल्लसत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, shining very brightly,<BR>brilliant; dancing about, sporting, playing, wan-<BR>toning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुल्लसित
सम्-उल्लसित, अस्, आ, अम्, shining forth, gleaming,<BR>brilliant, beautiful; sportive, sporting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुल्लास|समुल्लासः
सम्-उल्लास, अस्, m. excessive brilliance; sporting,<BR>exhilaration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुल्लिख्
समुल्लिख् सम्-उल्-लिख् (-उद्-लिख्), cl. 6. P.<BR>-लिखति, &c., to scratch up, tear up, dig up, furrow,<BR>scarify; to rub against, graze; to write down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुल्लिखत्
सम्-उल्लिखत्, अन्, अती, or अन्ती, अत्, scratching up,<BR>tearing up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुल्लुप्
समुल्लुप् सम्-उल्-लुप्, cl. 6. P. A. -लुम्पति,<BR>-ते, &c., Ved. to seize upon, lay hold of, pick up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुल्लुप्य
सम्-उल्लुप्य, ind. having seized upon, having<BR>caught hold of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुष्
समुष् सम्-उष्, cl. 1. P. -ओषति, &c., to<BR>burn up or consume by fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुह्य
समुह्य सम्-उह्य, सम्-उह्यमान. See under<BR>सं-वह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूढ|समूढः
समूढ 2. सम्-ऊढ. See col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूर|समूरः
समूर समूर, अस्, m. a kind of deer, (see<BR>below.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूरु|समूरुः
समूरु, उस्, m. a kind of deer (the skin of<BR>which may be used as a student's seat, &c.; accord-<BR>ing to some it has a white mane).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूरुक
समूरुक, अस्, m. = समूरु above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूल|समूलं
समूल स-मूल, अस्, आ, अम्, having a root,<BR>along with the root; (अम्), ind. by the roots, with<BR>the roots, completely.<BR>—समूल-काषम्, ind. strik-<BR>ing or shaking (the ground) to its very foundations.<BR>—समूल-घातम्, ind. having destroyed by the<BR>roots, having utterly exterminated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूह्
समूह् सम्-ऊह् (see rt. 1. ऊह्; cf. सं-वह्),<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">Page1082-c+ 79</a>]<BR>cl. 1. P. A. -ऊहति, -ते, -ऊहितुम्, to bring together,<BR>gather together, collect, unite; to bring or place<BR>back in right order: Caus. -ऊहयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>cause to be brought together, bring together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूढ|समूढः
2. सम्-ऊढ, अस्, आ, अम्, (in some senses equally<BR>referrible to सं-वह्, see 1. सम्-ऊढ, p. 1037,<BR>col. 3), brought together, collected; heaped up,<BR>accumulated, assembled; associated, accompanying;<BR>enveloped; produced quickly; crooked, bent; tamed,<BR>tranquillised; purified, cleansed.<BR>—समूढ-च्छन्-<BR>दस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, having the metres restored to their<BR>proper order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूह|समूहः
सम्-ऊह, अस्, m. a collection, assemblage, aggre-<BR>gation, aggregate, accumulation, heap, number, mul-<BR>titude, quantity.<BR>—समूह-कार्य, अम्, n. the<BR>business or affairs of a community.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूहत्
सम्-ऊहत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, bringing together, col-<BR>lecting, gathering; contracting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूहन|समूहनं
सम्-ऊहन, अम्, n. the act of bringing together,<BR>collection; plenty; (ई), f. a broom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूह्य|समूह्यः
1. सम्-ऊह्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be brought together<BR>or assembled or collected; (अस्), m., scil. अग्नि, a<BR>kind of sacrificial fire (to be brought or carried by<BR>the priest); a place prepared for the reception of a<BR>sacrificial fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूह्य|समूह्यः
2. सम्-ऊह्य, ind. having brought together or<BR>collected or assembled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समृ
समृ सम्-ऋ or सम्-ॠ, cl. 1. 9. P. -ऋच्छति,<BR>ऋणाति (Ved. also cl. 3. 5. P. -इयर्ति, -ऋणोति, -ऋण्-<BR>वति, in some forms also A.), &c., to go or come<BR>together, meet together, meet, be united, run toge-<BR>ther; to come into collision or conflict; to bring<BR>together, construct: Caus. -अर्पयति, -ते, -यितुम्,<BR>to throw at, hurl at (with acc.), strike, hit; to fix or<BR>place in or on, put on, put down, deposit; to deliver<BR>completely over, hand over, consign, commit; to<BR>place back, give back, restore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर|समरं|समरः
सम्-अर, अस्, अम्, m. n. coming together in a<BR>hostile manner, conflict, combat, struggle, strife, war,<BR>battle [cf. समर्य]; (अस्), m. a proper N.<BR>—सम्-<BR>अर-कन्द, N. of a district.<BR>—समरञ्-जय, अस्,<BR>m. a proper N.<BR>—समर-मर्दन, अस्, m. ‘de-<BR>stroying in battle,’ epithet of Śiva.<BR>—समर-मूर्-<BR>धन्, आ, m. the front or van of battle.<BR>—समर-<BR>वर्मन्, आ, m. a proper N.<BR>—समर-विजयिन्, ई,<BR>इनी, इ, victorious in battle.<BR>—समर-सिंह, अस्, m.<BR>a proper N.<BR>—समर-स्वामिन्, ई, m. a particular<BR>statue or idol erected by Samara-varman.<BR>—सम-<BR>रार्णव (˚र-अर्˚), अस्, m. the ocean of war.<BR>—स-<BR>मरोचित (˚र-उच्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, fit for war.<BR>—स-<BR>मरोद्देश (˚र-उद्˚), अस्, m. a battle-field, place<BR>of combat.<BR>—समरोद्यत (˚र-उद्˚), अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>prepared for conflict, ready for combat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समरण
सम्-अरण, अम्, n., Ved. coming together, ap-<BR>proach; conflict, fighting, combat; (in Naigh. II. 17.<BR>enumerated among the सङ्ग्राम-नामानि.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समराण
सम्-अराण, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. coming together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्पण|समर्पणं|समर्प्पण
सम्-अर्पण, अम्, n. (fr. the Caus.), the act of<BR>delivering or handing completely over, consigning,<BR>presenting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्पणीय|समर्प्पणीय
सम्-अर्पणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be delivered or<BR>presented, to be made over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्पयत्
सम्-अर्पयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, placing in or on;<BR>depositing, delivering over, consigning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्पयितव्य
सम्-अर्पयितव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, = सम्-अर्पणीय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्पित|समर्प्पित
सम्-अर्पित, अस्, आ, अम्, placed or fixed in or on,<BR>deposited, resting on, delivered, made over, con-<BR>signed, committed; appointed; put together.<BR>—सम्-<BR>अर्पित-वत्, आन्, अती, अत्, one who has consigned or<BR>delivered over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्प्य
सम्-अर्प्य, अस्, आ, अम्, = सम्-अर्पणीय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्य
1. समर्य, अस्, अम्, m. n. [cf. सम्-अर; the<BR>Pada text, however, divides into स-मर्य], Ved.<BR>conflict, battle, war, (in Naigh. II. 17. enumerated<BR>among the सङ्ग्राम-नामानि); sacrifice, (Sāy. =<BR>यज्ञ, Ṛg-veda VII. 23, 1.)<BR>—समर्य-जित्, त्, त्, त्,<BR>Ved. conquering in war, victorious in battle.<BR>—सम्-<BR>अर्य-राज्य, अम्, n. the dominion of fighting, war,<BR>battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्य
2. समर्य, Nom. P. समर्यति, &c., to desire<BR>battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्यत्
समर्यत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, Ved. desiring battle,<BR>intent on conflict.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाराण
सम्-आराण, अस्, आ, अम् (perf. part. A.), having<BR>come together, flowing together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समीर्ण
सम्-ईर्ण, referred to सम्-ॠ by Scholiast on<BR>Pāṇ. VII. 1, 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समृत
सम्-ऋत, अस्, आ, अम्, come together, met; come<BR>into collision, clashing together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समृति
सम्-ऋति, इस्, f., Ved. coming together, meeting to-<BR>gether, contact, (Sāy. = सङ्गम); conflict, fighting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समृच्
समृच् सम्-ऋच् [cf. सम्-अर्च्], cl. 6. P. -ऋ-<BR>चति, &c., to praise, extol, adore, honour, (सम्-<BR>आनृचे, he has been lauded; but according to Sāy. =<BR>सम्यक् पूजितवान्, he has well honoured, or स्था-<BR>पितवान्, he has established, Ṛg-veda 1. 160, 4.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समृञ्ज्
समृञ्ज् सम्-ऋञ्ज्, cl. 6. P. A. -ऋञ्जति, -ते,<BR>&c., to strive together or unite together for any<BR>object (with loc.); to promote well or together,<BR>(Sāy. = सम्यक् प्रसाधयति, Ṛg-veda 1. 6, 9.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समृध्
समृध् 1. सम्-ऋध्, cl. 4. 5. P. -ऋध्यति,<BR>-ऋध्नोति, &c., to succeed well, be very successful,<BR>prosper, flourish, increase or grow greatly: Pass.<BR>-ऋध्यते, to be completely successful, be fulfilled or<BR>accomplished, succeed, prosper; to share in abun-<BR>dantly, be fully furnished with (with inst.): Caus.<BR>-अर्धयति, -यितुम्, to cause to succeed or prosper;<BR>to cause to be fulfilled; to cause to be abundantly<BR>furnished with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्धक|समर्द्धकः
सम्-अर्धक, अस्, आ, अम्, causing to prosper,<BR>&c., granting a blessing or boon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समृद्ध|समृद्धः
सम्-ऋद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, very prosperous, thriv-<BR>ing, flourishing, happy, fortunate; full-grown, in-<BR>creased, grown, accelerated; fully furnished with,<BR>abundantly endowed with, rich in, rich, wealthy;<BR>completed, full, complete, entire.<BR>—समृद्ध-<BR>यशस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, rich in fame, renowned, famous.<BR>—समृद्ध-वेग, अस्, आ, अम्, increasing in speed,<BR>excessively swift.<BR>—समृद्धार्थ (˚ध-अर्˚), अस्,<BR>आ, अम्, having increased substance or wealth, increas-<BR>ing in resources.<BR>—समृद्धी-कृ, cl. 8. P. -क-<BR>रोति, &c., to make prosperous or wealthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समृद्धि|समृद्धिः
सम्-ऋद्धि, इस्, f. great prosperity or success,<BR>exuberance, profusion; thriving increase, gain, hap-<BR>piness, good fortune, well-being, wealth; power,<BR>supremacy, sway.<BR>—समृद्धि-समय, अस्, m. a<BR>season of great prosperity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समृद्धिन्
समृद्धिन्, ई, इनी, इ, prosperous, happy, blessed;<BR>possessing abundance of (at the end of a comp.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समृध्
2. सम्-ऋध्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. very prosperous, (Sāy.<BR>= सम्-ऋद्ध, Ṛg-veda VI. 2, 10.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समृष्
समृष् सम्-ऋष्, cl. 1. P. -अर्षति, &c. (see<BR>rt. 1. ऋष्), Ved. to come together, unite with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समे
समे सम्-ए (-आ-इ, see rt. 5. इ), cl. 2. P.<BR>-ऐति, &c., to come together, approach together,<BR>meet or assemble together, unite together, meet at<BR>or in (with acc. or loc.); to come together with<BR>(with inst.); to go to, enter, go through, march<BR>across (with acc.); to come into competition or<BR>rivalry with, cope with; to join or lead together<BR>(with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समेत|समेतः
सम्-एत, अस्, आ, अम्, come together, met together,<BR>assembled, joined or united together, collected, asso-<BR>ciated, agreed, covenanted; encountered, come to<BR>close quarters, come into collision; conjoined, con-<BR>comitant, connected or united with, furnished with,<BR>possessed of, having; come near, approached, ap-<BR>proximated, near.<BR>—समेत-माय, अस्, आ, अम्, fur-<BR>nished with or possessing illusions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समेत्य
सम्-एत्य, ind. having come together, having<BR>assembled or met together, having held a meeting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समेयिवस्
सम्-एयिवस्, आन्, -युषी, अत्, one who has come<BR>together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समेघलेख
समेघलेख स-मेघ-लेख, अस्, आ, अम्, hav-<BR>ing streaks of cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समेज्
समेज् सम्-एज् cl. 1. P. -एजति, &c., to rise<BR>or move upwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समेडी
समेडी समेडी, f., N. of one of the Mātṛs<BR>attending on Skanda; [cf. भेडि.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समेद्धृ
समेद्धृ सम्-एद्धृ. See under सम्-इन्ध्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समेध्
समेध् सम्-एध्, cl. 1. A. -एधते, -एधितुम्,<BR>to prosper greatly, thrive, increase: Caus. -एधयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to cause to prosper or succeed, cause to<BR>increase or swell; to strengthen, make happy or<BR>fortunate^1.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Dr. Sampada Savardekar on 20210422. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समेधित|समेधितः
सम्-एधित, अस्, आ, अम्, greatly increased or<BR>augmented, made to prosper or thrive, strengthened,<BR>strong; united.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समेध
समेध स-मेध, अस्, आ, अम्, along with the<BR>sacrifice, having the essence of sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समोकस्
समोकस् सम्-ओकस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, living or<BR>dwelling together, furnished or surrounded with<BR>(with inst., Sāy. = समान-निवास or सम्-अवेत,<BR>Ṛg-veda 1. 64, 10.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समोदक|समोदकं
समोदक समोदक. See under सम.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समोपे
समोपे सम्-ओपे (सम्-आ-उप-इ). See rt. 5. इ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समोपेत
सम्-ओपेत, अस्, आ, अम्, fully furnished or endowed<BR>with, possessed of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समोह
समोह समोह [cf. सम्-मोह under सम्-<BR>मुह्], enumerated among the सङ्ग्राम-नामानि<BR>in Naigh. II. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समौलिरत्न
समौलिरत्न स-मौलि-रत्न, अस्, आ, अम्, with<BR>a crown-jewel, having a crest-jewel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प|संपः|सम्पः
सम्प सम्प, अस्, m. (probably fr. सम्-पत्),<BR>descending, falling, alighting; (आ), f. lightning;<BR>[cf. शम्पा.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पच्
सम्पच् सम्-पच्, Caus. -पाचयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to cook or mature together; to ripen thoroughly,<BR>bake or cook thoroughly, burn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पक्व|संपक्व
सम्-पक्व, अस्, आ, अम्, thoroughly matured or<BR>ripened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पाक|संपाक|संपाकः|सम्पाकः
सम्-पाक, अस्, m. cooking or ripening thoroughly,<BR>maturing; the tree Cassia Fistula [cf. शम्-पाक];<BR>(अस्, आ, अम्), reasoning well, a reasoner, logician;<BR>subtle, cunning, impudent; lustful, lewd; small,<BR>little, low.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पठ्|संपठ्
सम्पठ् सम्-पठ्, cl. 1. P. -पठति, &c.,<BR>to read through, peruse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पाठ्य|संपाठ्य
सम्-पाठ्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be caused to be read,<BR>(अ-सम्पाठ्य, one with whom no one is allowed<BR>to read.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पत्|संपत्
सम्पत् सम्-पत्, cl. 1. P. -पतति, -पतितुम्,<BR>to fly together, run or rush together, meet or come<BR>together, flow together; to meet at (with acc.);<BR>to unite with (with inst.); to fall together, meet<BR>together in hostile encounter; to fly to, hasten<BR>towards, flock to, go to, attain; to rush towards,<BR>assail, attack; to fall in with; to fly down, fall<BR>down, alight on; to go or roam about; to come to<BR>pass, happen: Caus. -पातयति, -यितुम्, to cause<BR>to fly or fall, cause to fly down, throw down, hurl<BR>down, cast, throw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पतत्
सम्-पतत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, flying together, hasten-<BR>ing together; falling or flying down, alighting,<BR>arriving; going backwards and forwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पतित
सम्-पतित, अस्, आ, अम्, flying or falling together,<BR>coming to pass, happening, fallen or met together;<BR>come to pass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पात|संपात|संपातः|सम्पातः
सम्-पात, अस्, m. falling together, concurrence,<BR>falling against each other, meeting together, en-<BR>countering; butting together; general fall; falling<BR>down, descending, coming down, alighting (as a<BR>bird); a peculiar mode of flight (of birds); the<BR>flight of an arrow; that which falls or settles to<BR>the bottom, the residue (of an offering); anything<BR>thrown in or added as an ingredient; going, moving,<BR>removing; N. of the son of Garuḍa; (औ), m. du.,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">Page1083-c+ 77</a>]<BR>N. of two Vedic hymns.<BR>—सम्पात-वत्, आन्, अती,<BR>अत्, containing ingredients.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पाति|संपाति|संपातिः|सम्पातिः
सम्-पाति, इस्, m., N. of a fabulous bird (the eldest<BR>son of Garuḍa and elder brother of Jaṭāyu); a proper<BR>N., (also written सं-याति.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पातिक|संपातिक|संपातिकः|सम्पातिकः
सम्पातिक, अस्, m. a fabulous bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पातिन्
सम्-पातिन्, ई, इनी, इ, falling together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पत्नी|संपत्नी
सम्पत्नी सम्-पत्नी, f. (a woman) together<BR>with her husband, (see पत्नी.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पद्|संपद्
सम्पद् 1. सम्-पद्, cl. 4. A. -पद्यते, -पत्-<BR>तुम्, to fall or happen well, turn out well, succeed,<BR>be prosperous, be accomplished; be completed or<BR>fulfilled, to become full or complete (as a number),<BR>amount to; to become (e. g. स्वेदोद्भेदो विभूषा<BR>सम्पेदे, the bursting out of drops of perspiration<BR>became an ornament, Kirāt. VII. 5), be produced,<BR>be born, be brought forth, arise; to fall together,<BR>come together, meet with, unite with (with inst.);<BR>to fall into any one's possession; to attain to, obtain,<BR>acquire; to enter into, be absorbed in (with loc. or<BR>acc.): Caus. -पादयति, -यितुम्, to cause to succeed,<BR>cause to arise, cause to become, bring about, produce,<BR>effect, accomplish complete, cause to procure, obtain,<BR>make ready, prepare; to turn or transform into; to<BR>furnish or provide with, endow with; to cause to<BR>be occupied with; to attain, obtain; to be agreed,<BR>agree upon (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पत्ति|संपत्ति|संपत्तिः|सम्पत्तिः
सम्-पत्ति, इस्, f. prosperity, success, increase of<BR>wealth, &c., completion, fulfilment, perfection, excel-<BR>lence; a suitable state or condition; a sort of medi-<BR>cinal root.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पद्|संपद्
2. सम्-पद्, त्, f. success, prosperity, good fortune;<BR>luck, fate; increase of wealth or happiness, advance-<BR>ment of any kind, advantage, benefit, blessing; a<BR>treasure; a necklace of pearls; decoration, adorn-<BR>ment; accomplishment, perfection, completion; ex-<BR>cellence; correctness, right method; excess, abun-<BR>dance.<BR>—सम्पद्-वसु, उस्, m., N. of one of the<BR>seven principal rays of the sun (supposed to supply<BR>heat to the planet Mars).<BR>—सम्पद्-विनिमय, अस्,<BR>m. an interchange of benefit or advantage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पद्यमान
सम्-पद्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being accomplished,<BR>being brought about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पद्वर|संपद्वर|संपद्वरः|सम्पद्वरः
सम्पद्वर, अस्, m. a king, prince.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पन्न|संपन्न|संपन्नः|सम्पन्नः
सम्-पन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, fallen or turned out well,<BR>successful, prosperous, fortunate, thriving, happy;<BR>accomplished, effected, completed, finished, com-<BR>plete, perfect; perfectly acquainted or conversant<BR>with; full grown, mature; right, correct; procured,<BR>acquired, obtained; possessed of, endowed with; of<BR>perfect or correct flavour; (अस्), m. epithet of Śiva;<BR>(अम्), n. a delicacy.<BR>—सम्पन्न-तम, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, most complete or perfect.<BR>—सम्पन्न-रूप,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, complete, perfect; dainty, delicate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पन्नक|संपन्नक
सम्पन्नक, अस्, आ, अम्, = सम्-पन्न above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पाद|संपाद|संपादः
सम्-पाद, अस्, m. accomplishment, completion,<BR>acquisition, obtaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पादक|संपादक|सम्पादकः
सम्-पादक, अस्, इका, अम्, bringing about, effect-<BR>ing, effective of, accomplishing, fulfilling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पादन|संपादन|संपादनं|सम्पादनं
सम्-पादन, अस्, ई, अम्, effective of, procuring,<BR>gaining: (अम्), n. the act of bringing about, accom-<BR>plishing, effecting, making; preparing, clearing<BR>(ground &c.); gaining, acquiring, reaching, attaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पादनीय|संपादनीय
सम्-पादनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be brought about<BR>or effected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पादयत्
सम्-पादयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, accomplishing, effect-<BR>ing, perfecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पादयितृ|संपादयितृ
सम्-पादयितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who accom-<BR>plishes or effects.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पादित|संपादित|सम्पादितः
सम्-पादित, अस्, आ, अम्, brought about, accom-<BR>plished, effected; attained, obtained, gained, gotten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पाद्य|संपाद्य
सम्-पाद्य, ind. having procured, effected, or<BR>obtained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पद|संपद|सम्पदं
सम्पद सम्-पद, अम्, n. standing with the<BR>feet together or even (= समम् पद-युगम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिकॄत्
सम्परिकॄत् सम्-परि-कॄत्, cl. 10. P. -कीर्त-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to enumerate fully, particularise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1083-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिकीर्तित
सम्-परिकीर्तित, अस्, आ, अम्, fully enumerated,<BR>related in detail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिक्रम्|संपरिक्रम्
सम्परिक्रम् सम्-परि-क्रम्, cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-क्रामति, -क्रमते, &c., to go or walk round, to<BR>visit in succession, go the round of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिक्रम्य
सम्-परिक्रम्य, ind. having walked round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिख्या|संपरिख्या
सम्परिख्या सम्-परि-ख्या, cl. 2. P. -ख्याति,<BR>&c., to communicate completely, relate in full, de-<BR>clare at length.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिग्रह्|संपरिग्रह्
सम्परिग्रह् सम्-परि-ग्रह्, cl. 9. P. A.<BR>-गृह्णाति, -गृह्णीते, &c., to accept fully, receive;<BR>to receive in a friendly manner; to embrace; to<BR>accomplish, perform, complete; to take in or under-<BR>stand thoroughly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिगृह्य
सम्-परिगृह्य, ind. having accepted; having<BR>completed, having thoroughly understood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिचर्|संपरिचर्
सम्परिचर् सम्-परि-चर्, cl. 1. P. -चरति,<BR>-चरितुम्, to wait upon, attend on, serve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिचिन्त्
सम्परिचिन्त् सम्-परि-चिन्त्, cl. 10. P. -चिन्-<BR>तयति, -यितुम्, to think out, excogitate, invent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिचिन्तित|संपरिचिन्तित
सम्-परिचिन्तित, अस्, आ, अम्, thought out, devised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परितुष्
सम्परितुष् सम्-परि-तुष्, cl. 4. P. -तुष्-<BR>यति, -तोष्टुम्, to feel quite satisfied or content:<BR>Caus. -तोषयति, -यितुम्, to satisfy completely,<BR>appease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परितोषित
सम्-परितोषित, अस्, आ, अम्, fully satisfied, quite<BR>appeased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परित्यज्|संपरित्यज्
सम्परित्यज् सम्-परि-त्यज्, cl. 1. P. -त्य-<BR>जति, -त्यक्तुम्, to abandon completely, desert,<BR>leave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परित्यक्त
सम्-परित्यक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, abandoned, given up.<BR>—सम्परित्यक्त-जीवित, अस्, आ, अम्, (a battle &c.)<BR>in which life is risked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परित्यज्य
सम्-परित्यज्य, ind. having completely aban-<BR>doned, having abandoned everything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिदह्|संपरिदह्
सम्परिदह् सम्-परि-दह्, Pass. -दह्यते<BR>(also P. -ति), to be entirely burnt or consumed by<BR>fire, be consumed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिपॄ
सम्परिपॄ सम्-परि-पॄ. See rt. पॄ, p. 596.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिपूर्ण|संपरिपूर्ण
सम्-परिपूर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, quite filled, fully<BR>satisfied; completely accomplished, perfected.<BR>—सम्-<BR>परिपूर्ण-विद्य, अस्, आ, अम्, well filled with<BR>knowledge, perfect in knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिप्लु
सम्परिप्लु सम्-परि-प्लु, cl. 1. A. -प्लवते,<BR>&c., to flow quite over, overflow completely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिप्लुत|संपरिप्लुत
सम्-परिप्लुत, अस्, आ, अम्, completely overflowed,<BR>deluged; overwhelmed (with misfortune &c.), greatly<BR>distressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिभू|संपरिभू
सम्परिभू सम्-परि-भू, cl. 1. P. -भवति,<BR>&c., to despise or contemn utterly: Pass. -भूयते,<BR>to be despised, &c.: Caus. -भावयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>fix firmly, hold well together, control.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिभ्रंश्
