सम्परिभ्रष्ट|संपरिभ्रष्ट
सम्-परिभ्रष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, fallen away from,<BR>entirely deprived of (with abl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिमुद्|संपरिमुद्
सम्परिमुद् सम्-परि-मुद्, cl. 1. A. -मोदते,<BR>&c., to rejoice greatly, exult.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिरक्ष्|संपरिरक्ष्
सम्परिरक्ष् सम्-परि-रक्ष्, cl. 1. P. -रक्-<BR>षति, -रक्षितुम्, to keep complete guard over,<BR>protect, defend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिरभ्|संपरिरभ्
सम्परिरभ् सम्-परि-रभ्, cl. 1. A. -रभते,<BR>&c., to take well hold of; to clasp or embrace mutually.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिरभ्य
सम्-परिरभ्य, ind. having mutually embraced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिवृ|संपरिवृ
