सम्परिवारित
सम्-परिवारित, अस्, आ, अम्, entirely surrounded<BR>or encompassed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिवार्य
सम्-परिवार्य, ind. having encircled or encom-<BR>passed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिवृत
सम्-परिवृत, अस्, आ, अम् (Ved. also सम्-परी-<BR>वृत), completely surrounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिवृज्|संपरिवृज्
सम्परिवृज् सम्-परि-वृज्, Caus. -वर्जयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to shun or avoid utterly, forsake, abandon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिवृत्|संपरिवृत्
सम्परिवृत् सम्-परि-वृत्, cl. 1. A. -वर्तते,<BR>&c., to turn completely round, roll round, revolve;<BR>to exist; to turn back, return; to turn back from,<BR>desist from (with abl.): Caus. -वर्तयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to cause to turn round, lead round, lead about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिवर्त्य
सम्-परिवर्त्य, ind. having made to turn round,<BR>having led round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिशोषण|संपरिशोषण
सम्परिशोषण सम्-परिशोषण, अम्, n. (fr.<BR>rt. शुष् with परि and सम्), becoming completely<BR>dried up, withering up, emaciation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिष्वञ्ज्|संपरिष्वञ्ज्
