सम्परिष्वक्त
सम्-परिष्वक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, mutually embraced,<BR>closely embraced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिष्वज्य
सम्-परिष्वज्य, ind. having mutually embraced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परिहृष्|संपरिहृष्
सम्परिहृष् सम्-परि-हृष्, Caus. -हर्ष-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to make completely happy, delight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परे|संपरे
सम्परे सम्-परे (-परा-इ, see rt. 5. इ), cl.<BR>2. P. -परैति, &c., to come together (in conflict);<BR>to go away, go beyond (especially to another world<BR>or future state).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पराय|संपराय|संपरायः|सम्परायः
सम्-पराय, अस्, m. meeting together in strife<BR>or encounter, conflict, contention, war, battle;<BR>calamity, adversity; the other world, a future state,<BR>futurity, future time; a son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परायक|संपरायक|संपरायकं|सम्परायकं
सम्परायक, अम्, n. conflict, encounter, war,<BR>battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्परायिक|संपरायिक|संपरायिकं|सम्परायिकं
सम्परायिक, अम्, n. = सम्परायक above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पर्क|संपर्क|संपर्कः|सम्पर्कः
सम्पर्क सम्-पर्क. See under सम्-पृच्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पर्याप्
