सम्पर्याप्य
सम्-पर्याप्य, ind. having taken hold of simul-<BR>taneously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पलाय्
