सम्पश्यमान
सम्पश्यमान सम्-पश्यमान. See under<BR>1. सन्-दृश्, p. 1059, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पा|संपा
सम्पा सम्-पा, cl. 1. P. A. -पिबति, -ते, &c.<BR>(see rt. 1. पा), to drink together: Caus. -पाययति,<BR>-यितुम्, to cause to drink together, make to drink.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पाय
सम्-पाय, ind. having drunk together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पीति|संपीति|संपीतिः|सम्पीतिः
सम्-पीति, इस्, f. drinking in company, compo-<BR>tation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पाक|संपाक|संपाकः|सम्पाकः
सम्पाक सम्-पाक. See सम्-पच्, p. 1083.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पाट|संपाट|संपाटः|सम्पाटः
सम्पाट सम्-पाट, अस्, m. (fr. rt. पट् with<BR>सम्), a spindle; the intersection of the prolonged<BR>side of a triangle by a perpendicular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पात|संपात|संपातः|सम्पातः
सम्पात सम्-पात, सम्-पाति. See सम्-पत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पाद|संपाद|संपादः
सम्पाद सम्-पाद, सम्-पादन, &c. See<BR>p. 1083, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पार|संपार
सम्पार सम्पार, अस्, m. a proper N.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पारण|संपारण
सम्पारण सम्-पारण. See सम्-पॄ, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पिण्ड्
सम्पिण्ड् सम्-पिण्ड्, cl. 10. P. -पिण्डयति, &c.,<BR>to heap together; to clench.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पिण्डित|संपिंडित|संपिण्डित
सम्-पिण्डित, अस्, आ, अम्, heaped together; con-<BR>tracted.<BR>—सम्पिण्डिताङ्गुलि (˚त-अङ्˚), इस्, इस्, इ,<BR>having the fingers clenched or closed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पिष्|संपिष्
सम्पिष् सम्-पिष्, cl. 7. P. -पिनष्टि (Impf.<BR>सम्-अपिनट्, Ved. सम्-पिणक्), -पेष्टुम्, to grind<BR>or rub together, pound or crush to pieces, bruise,<BR>crush (Soma &c.); to shatter, destroy, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पिष्ट
सम्-पिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, crushed or broken to<BR>pieces, pounded, bruised, shattered, destroyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पेषण|संपेषण|संपेषणं
सम्-पेषण, अम्, n. the act of grinding toge-<BR>ther, pounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पीड्|संपीड्
सम्पीड् सम्-पीड्, cl. 10. P. -पीडयति, -यि-<BR>तुम्, to compress, press or squeeze together, oppress,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">Page1084-c+ 75</a>]<BR>press, force; to pinch, pain, torture, vex, harass.<BR>disturb; to obscure, eclipse; to reckon up, calculate<BR>together, compute, sum up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पीड|संपीड|संपीडः
सम्-पीड, अस्, m. pressing or squeezing together,<BR>pain, torture; harassing, agitating, disturbing; send-<BR>ing, directing; (आ), f. torment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पीडन|संपीडन|संपीडनं|सम्पीडनं
सम्-पीडन, अम्, n. compression, pressing toge-<BR>ther, squeezing; pinching, paining, castigation, punish-<BR>ment; stirring together, agitating; sending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पीडयत्
सम्-पीडयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, compressing; squeez-<BR>ing, tormenting, paining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पीडित|संपीडित
सम्-पीडित, अस्, आ, अम्, pressed together, squeezed;<BR>pained, tortured, punished; agitated; sent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पीड्य
सम्-पीड्य, ind. having pressed together, having<BR>tormented; having restrained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पीति|संपीति|संपीतिः|सम्पीतिः
सम्पीति सम्-पीति. See under सम्-पा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पुट|संपुट|संपुटः|सम्पुटः
सम्पुट सम्-पुट, अस्, m. (fr. rt. पुट् with<BR>सम्), a covered box, casket; the Kuruvaka flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पुटक|संपुटक|सम्पुटकः
सम्पुटक, अस्, m. a box, casket; (इका), f. a<BR>box filled with ornaments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पुष्|संपुष्
सम्पुष् सम्-पुष्, cl. 9. P. -पुष्णाति, -पो-<BR>षितुम्, to become thoroughly nourished, increase,<BR>grow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पोष्य
सम्-पोष्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be well nourished or<BR>supported.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पू
सम्पू सम्-पू, cl. 9. P. A. -पुनाति, -पुनीते,<BR>&c., to cleanse thoroughly, purify: Caus. -पावयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to make clean, cleanse, purify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पूय
सम्-पूय, ind. having cleansed, having purified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पूज्|संपूज्
सम्पूज् सम्-पूज्, cl. 10. P. -पूजयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to honour greatly, esteem or value highly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पूजन|संपूजन|संपूजनं
सम्-पूजन, अम्, n. the act of treating with great<BR>respect, honouring, reverence, esteem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पूजनीय
