सम्पूजित|संपूजित
सम्-पूजित, अस्, आ, अम्, greatly honoured, highly<BR>respected or valued, revered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पूज्य|संपूज्य
1. सम्-पूज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be honoured, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पूज्य|संपूज्य
2. सम्-पूज्य, ind. having honoured, honouring,<BR>worshipping, paying respect to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पृ
सम्पृ सम्-पृ, Caus. -पारयति, -यितुम्,<BR>Ved. to bring over to the further side, bring to an<BR>end, accomplish, perform.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पृच्|संपृच्
सम्पृच् सम्-पृच्, cl. 7. P. -पृणक्ति (also<BR>apparently cl. 3. in some Vedic forms, e. g. सम्-<BR>पिपृग्धि, -पिपृक्त, &c.), cl. 2. A. -पृक्ते or<BR>-पृङ्क्ते, &c. (see rt. 1. पृच्), to mix together,<BR>commingle, bring into contact, connect, unite; to<BR>be mixed together, be united, be in contact, be<BR>connected (A.); to fill up, fill, complete; to fill or<BR>satiate with, present with; to be filled or satiated<BR>with, be presented with (A.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पर्क|संपर्क|संपर्कः|सम्पर्कः
सम्-पर्क, अस्, m. mixing together, mixture,<BR>commingling, conjunction, union; contact, touch;<BR>bodily contact, sexual union or connection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पर्किन्|सम्पर्क्किन्
सम्पर्किन्, ई, इणी, इ, blended together, mixed;<BR>united with, connected; in contact with, touching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पर्कीय|संपर्कीय|सम्पर्कीयः|सम्पर्क्कीय
सम्पर्कीय, अस्, आ, अम्, relating to contact or<BR>connection; liable to come in contact.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पृक्त|संपृक्त|सम्पृक्तः
सम्-पृक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, mixed together, blended,<BR>combined, conjoined, united, connected, related; in<BR>contact with, touching, in close contact; interspersed,<BR>inlaid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पृञ्चान
सम्-पृञ्चान, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. being mixed or<BR>mingled with, associated with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पॄ|संपॄ
