सम्पारण|संपारण
सम्-पारण, अस्, ई, अम्, Ved. (equally referrible<BR>to सम्-पृ above), completing, filling, adequate,<BR>(Sāy. = इच्छायाः सम्यक् पूरक, Ṛg-veda III.<BR>45, 4.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पूरयत्
सम्-पूरयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, causing to be full,<BR>filling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पूरित
सम्-पूरित, अस्, आ, अम्, filled quite full, filled with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पूर्ण|संपूर्ण|सम्पूर्णं|सम्पूर्णः
सम्-पूर्ण, अस्, आ, अम्, completely filled or full,<BR>replete; full (as the moon); complete, finished;<BR>whole, entire; (अस्), m. any mode of music in which<BR>all the notes of the gamut are employed; (आ), f.<BR>a particular एकादशी, q. v.; (अम्), n. ether, the<BR>etherial element or atmosphere.<BR>—सम्पूर्ण-काम,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, filled with desire.<BR>—सम्पूर्ण-तर,<BR>अस्, आ, अम्, more filled, very full.<BR>—सम्पूर्ण-ता,<BR>f. or सम्पूर्ण-त्व, अम्, n. complete fulness, per-<BR>fection, completeness.<BR>—सम्पूर्ण-विद्य, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, replete with knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रकम्प्|संप्रकम्प्
