सम्-प्रकाशित, अस्, आ, अम्, made manifest, dis-<BR>played, discovered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

