सम्प्रचरत्
सम्-प्रचरत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, advancing, going on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रचि|संप्रचि
