सम्-पृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, asked or inquired about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रश्न|संप्रश्न|संप्रश्नः
सम्-प्रश्न, अस्, m. asking or inquiring about,<BR>full inquiry; courteous inquiry; any question or<BR>inquiry; a refuge, asylum (Ved., Sāy. = परमे-<BR>श्वर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रजन्|संप्रजन्
सम्प्रजन् सम्-प्र-जन्, cl. 4. A. -जायते, &c.,<BR>to be produced, spring up, arise, come into existence;<BR>to exist, be; to be born again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रजात
सम्-प्रजात, अस्, आ, अम्, produced, arisen; (आ),<BR>f. a cow which has calved; [cf. प्र-जाता.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रज्ञा|संप्रज्ञा
सम्प्रज्ञा सम्-प्र-ज्ञा, cl. 9. P. A. -जानाति,<BR>जानीते, &c., to distinguish, discern, recognise, know<BR>accurately or perfectly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रज्ञात|संप्रज्ञातः
सम्-प्रज्ञात, अस्, आ, अम्, distinguished, dis-<BR>cerned; known accurately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रज्वल्|संप्रज्वल्
सम्प्रज्वल् सम्-प्र-ज्वल्, cl. 1. P. -ज्वलति,<BR>&c., to flame or blaze up, catch fire, burn: Caus.<BR>-ज्वालयति, -यितुम्, to light up, kindle, ignite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रज्वलत्
सम्-प्रज्वलत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, flaming up, burning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रज्वलित
सम्-प्रज्वलित, अस्, आ, अम्, lighted, kindled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रज्वाल्य
सम्-प्रज्वाल्य, ind. having lighted or kindled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रणद्|संप्रणद्
सम्प्रणद् सम्-प्र-णद् (-नद्), cl. 1. P. -ण-<BR>दति, &c., to cry out, cry: Caus. -णादयति, -यितुम्,<BR>to cause to resound, fill with clamour or noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रणादित
सम्-प्रणादित, अस्, आ, अम्, made to resound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रणम्|संप्रणम्
सम्प्रणम् सम्-प्र-णम् (-नम्), cl. 1. P.<BR>-णमति, -णन्तुम्, to bow down or bend one's<BR>self before (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रणम्य
सम्-प्रणम्य, ind. having bowed down before.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रणर्द्
सम्प्रणर्द् सम्-प्र-णर्द् (-नर्द्). See rt.<BR>नर्द्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रणर्दित|सम्प्रणर्द्दित
सम्-प्रणर्दित, अस्, आ, अम्, roared out, bel-<BR>lowed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रणश्|संप्रणश्
सम्प्रणश् सम्-प्र-णश् (-नश्), cl. 4. P.<BR>-णश्यति, &c., to be entirely lost, vanish; to dis-<BR>appear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रनष्ट
सम्-प्रनष्ट, अस्, आ, अम् (incorrectly सम्-<BR>प्रणष्ट), entirely vanished, disappeared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रणिधा|संप्रणिधा
सम्प्रणिधा सम्-प्र-णि-धा (-नि-धा), cl. 3.<BR>P. A. -दधाति, -धत्ते, -धातुम्, to put down on<BR>one side, leave behind, leave unnoticed, disregard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रणिधाय
सम्-प्रणिधाय, ind. having put aside, having<BR>disregarded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रणी|संप्रणी
सम्प्रणी सम्-प्र-णी (-नी), cl. 1. P. A.<BR>-णयति, -ते, -णेतुम्, to bring together, collect,<BR>raise (taxes &c.); to put together, compose; (with<BR>दण्डम्) to apply the rod, inflict punishment,<BR>administer chastisement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रणीत|संप्रणीत
सम्-प्रणीत, अस्, आ, अम्, brought together,<BR>brought, conveyed; composed (as poetry &c.), in-<BR>flicted (as punishment).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रणेतृ|संप्रणेतृ
सम्-प्रणेतृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who guides or leads,<BR>guiding, leading, &c.; (ता), m. a ruler, judge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रणुद्|संप्रणुद्
सम्प्रणुद् सम्-प्र-णुद् (-नुद्), cl. 6. P. A.<BR>-णुदति, -ते, -णोत्तुम्, to drive or press forward,<BR>urge on, to drive away from, remove or move away<BR>from (with abl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रणुदित
सम्-प्रणुदित, अस्, आ, अम्, driven or urged on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतप्
सम्प्रतप् सम्-प्र-तप्. See rt. 2. तप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतप्त
सम्-प्रतप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, excessively heated;<BR>greatly pained, tortured; suffering pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतापन|संप्रतापन|संप्रतापनं
सम्-प्रतापन, अम्, n. the act of heating or<BR>burning; inflicting great pain or torture, afflicting;<BR>N. of one of the twenty-one hells, (Manu IV. 89.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतर्क्
सम्प्रतर्क् सम्-प्र-तर्क्, cl. 10. P. -तर्क-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to form a clear conclusion or conjec-<BR>ture; to consider as, think, regard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतर्क्य
सम्-प्रतर्क्य, ind. having considered or re-<BR>garded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रति|संप्रति|सम्प्रतिः
सम्प्रति 1. सम्-प्रति, ind. now, at this<BR>time, at present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रति|संप्रति|सम्प्रतिः
सम्प्रति 2. सम्-प्रति, इस्, m., N. of a par-<BR>ticular Arhat of the past Utsarpiṇī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिग्रह्|संप्रतिग्रह्
सम्प्रतिग्रह् सम्-प्रति-ग्रह्, cl. 9. P. A.<BR>-गृह्णाति, -गृह्णीते, -ग्रहीतुम्, to receive hos-<BR>pitably, treat kindly, welcome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिज्ञा|संप्रतिज्ञा
सम्प्रतिज्ञा सम्-प्रति-ज्ञा, cl. 9. P. A. -जा-<BR>नाति, -जानीते, -ज्ञातुम्, to recognise fully, assent to,<BR>promise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिज्ञात
सम्-प्रतिज्ञात, अस्, आ, अम्, fully recognised or<BR>assented to, promised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिनन्द्
सम्प्रतिनन्द् सम्-प्रति-नन्द्, cl. 1. P. -नन्-<BR>दति, &c., to greet or welcome gladly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिनन्दित|संप्रतिनन्दित
सम्-प्रतिनन्दित, अस्, आ, अम्, greeted joyfully,<BR>welcomed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिपद्|संप्रतिपद्
सम्प्रतिपद् सम्-प्रति-पद्, cl. 4. A. -पद्-<BR>यते, -पत्तुम्, to go towards together; to go near<BR>to, approach, arrive at (with acc.); to addict one's<BR>self to; to attain to, reach; obtain, receive; to<BR>receive back, recover; to come to pass, arise; to be<BR>fully agreed about, agree upon, assent to; to consider<BR>as, regard; to bring about, perform, accomplish:<BR>Caus. -पादयति, -यितुम्, to cause to go towards or<BR>come to, cause to receive, bestow, grant, give over to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिपत्ति|संप्रतिपत्ति|संप्रतिपत्तिः|सम्प्रतिपत्तिः
सम्-प्रतिपत्ति, इस्, f. approach, arrival, presence,<BR>attaining to, obtaining, acquirement, gain; going<BR>against, assault; arising, occurring; agreement, con-<BR>currence, acknowledgment, admission, confession,<BR>assent, affirmation; co-operation; bringing about,<BR>performing, effecting; (in law) a particular kind of<BR>reply or defence, confession or admission of a fact<BR>[cf. प्रत्य्-अवस्कन्द]; (इस्, इस्, इ), agreed toge-<BR>ther, consentient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिपद्य
सम्-प्रतिपद्य, ind. having gone towards or<BR>approached, having attained to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिपन्न|संप्रतिपन्न
सम्-प्रतिपन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, gone near, come<BR>up to, approached, attained, reached, gained, arrived;<BR>agreed, concurred; recognised, acknowledged, assented<BR>to; brought about, performed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिपादन|संप्रतिपादन|संप्रतिपादनं
सम्-प्रतिपादन, अम्, n. the act of causing to<BR>receive, delivering or giving over to, granting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिपादित
सम्-प्रतिपादित, अस्, आ, अम्, delivered over,<BR>bestowed, given.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिपूज्
सम्प्रतिपूज् सम्-प्रति-पूज्, cl. 10. P. -पूज-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to honour greatly, revere, respect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिपूजित|संप्रतिपूजित
सम्-प्रतिपूजित, अस्, आ, अम्, greatly honoured,<BR>much respected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिपूज्य
सम्-प्रतिपूज्य, ind. having honoured greatly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1085-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिबुध्|संप्रतिबुध्
सम्प्रतिबुध् सम्-प्रति-बुध्, Caus. -बोध-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to rouse up or awaken thoroughly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिभा|संप्रतिभा
सम्प्रतिभा सम्-प्रति-भा, cl. 2. P. -भाति,<BR>&c., to shine out fully, be conspicuous, appear, seem;<BR>to appear clearly, be fully understood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिभाष्|संप्रतिभाष्
सम्प्रतिभाष् सम्-प्रति-भाष्, cl. 1. A. -भा-<BR>षते, -भाषितुम्, to speak to in return, answer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिमुच्
सम्प्रतिमुच् सम्-प्रति-मुच्, cl. 6. P. A.<BR>-मुञ्चति, -ते, &c., to bind firmly, fetter, bind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिमुक्त|संप्रतिमुक्त
सम्-प्रतिमुक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, firmly or completely<BR>bound, fastened, bound; [cf. प्रति-मुक्त.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिरोधक|संप्रतिरोधक|संप्रतिरोधकं|सम्प्रतिरोधकं|संप्रतिरोधकः
सम्प्रतिरोधक सम्-प्रतिरोधक, अम्, n. (fr.<BR>rt. 2. रुध् with प्रति and सम्), complete restraint,<BR>confinement, imprisonment, obstruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिलक्ष्
सम्प्रतिलक्ष् सम्-प्रति-लक्ष्, cl. 10. P. A.<BR>-लक्षयति, -ते, to perceive fully, see clearly: Pass.<BR>-लक्ष्यते, to be seen clearly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिविद्|संप्रतिविद्
सम्प्रतिविद् सम्-प्रति-विद्, Caus. -वेदयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to cause to be fully known, publish, pro-<BR>claim, announce, report, tell, relate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिश्रु|संप्रतिश्रु
सम्प्रतिश्रु सम्-प्रति-श्रु, cl. 5. P. -शृणोति,<BR>&c., to hear fully, listen attentively to, assent, promise:<BR>Caus. -श्रावयति, -यितुम्, to make to promise or<BR>repeat a promise, remind of a promise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिश्राव्य
सम्-प्रतिश्राव्य, ind. having reminded of a<BR>promise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिश्रुत्य
सम्-प्रतिश्रुत्य, ind. having promised or as-<BR>sented, having agreed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिष्ठा|संप्रतिष्ठा
सम्प्रतिष्ठा सम्-प्रति-ष्ठा (-स्था), cl. 1. P.<BR>A. -तिष्ठति, -ते, -ष्ठातुम्, to stand firmly on (with<BR>loc.), rest on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतिष्ठित|संप्रतिष्ठित
सम्-प्रतिष्ठित, अस्, आ, अम्, standing firmly on,<BR>resting, on, depending on; established, fixed, settled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रती|संप्रती
सम्प्रती सम्-प्रती (-प्रति-इ), cl. 2. P. -प्र-<BR>त्येति, &c., to go towards, arrive at, come to a firm<BR>conviction, believe firmly in, trust in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतीत|संप्रतीत
सम्-प्रतीत, अस्, आ, अम्, come back again, re-<BR>turned; firmly believed or believing; fully convinced;<BR>proved, approved, admitted, thoroughly ascertained,<BR>well known, renowned; respectful, compliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतीति|संप्रतीति|संप्रतीतिः|सम्प्रतीतिः
सम्-प्रतीति, इस्, f. complete belief or trust, full<BR>knowledge or ascertainment, notoriety, fame; respect,<BR>compliance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रत्यय|संप्रत्यय|संप्रत्ययः
सम्-प्रत्यय, अस्, m. firm conviction, perfect<BR>faith or belief, entire conviction or trust; agreement,<BR>appointment; [cf. यथा-स्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतीक्ष्|संप्रतीक्ष्
सम्प्रतीक्ष् सम्-प्रतीक्ष् (-प्रति-ईक्ष्), cl. 1.<BR>A. -प्रतीक्षते, &c., to look out for, wait for,<BR>await, expect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतीक्षा|संप्रतीक्षा
सम्-प्रतीक्षा, f. looking out for, waiting for,<BR>expecting, awaiting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतीक्ष्य|संप्रतीक्ष्य
सम्-प्रतीक्ष्य, ind. having waited for, expecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतीष्
सम्प्रतीष् सम्-प्रतीष् (-प्रति-इष्), cl. 6. P.<BR>-प्रतीच्छति, &c., to wish together with, assent to,<BR>agree, promise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रतुष्|संप्रतुष्
सम्प्रतुष् सम्-प्र-तुष्, cl. 4. P. -तुष्यति,<BR>&c., to be or become quite satisfied, be contented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रत्ति|संप्रत्ति|संप्रत्तिः
सम्प्रत्ति सम्-प्रत्ति. See under सम्-प्र-<BR>दा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रत्यय|संप्रत्यय|संप्रत्ययः
सम्प्रत्यय सम्-प्रत्यय. See सम्-प्रती.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रत्यागम्
सम्प्रत्यागम् सम्-प्रत्य्-आ-गम् (-प्रति-आ-),<BR>cl. 1. P. -गच्छति, -गन्तुम्, to come back to,<BR>return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रत्यागत|संप्रत्यागत
सम्-प्रत्यागत, अस्, आ, अम्, come back, returned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदह्|संप्रदह्
सम्प्रदह् सम्-प्र-दह्, cl. 1. P. -दहति,<BR>-दग्धुम्, to burn quite up, consume, destroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदा|संप्रदा
सम्प्रदा सम्-प्र-दा, cl. 3. P. A. -ददाति,<BR>-दत्ते, -दातुम्, to give completely up or deliver<BR>wholly over to (any one); to give, impart, grant;<BR>to bequeath, transmit, hand down by tradition; to<BR>give in marriage: Caus. -दापयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">Page1086-b+ 76</a>]<BR>cause to give over or transmit: Desid. -दित्सति,<BR>to wish to give over to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रत्ति|संप्रत्ति|संप्रत्तिः
सम्-प्रत्ति, इस्, f. (for सम्-प्रदत्ति), giving<BR>entirely up, delivering over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदत्त
सम्-प्रदत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, given over to, given<BR>up to, imparted, communicated, transmitted, handed<BR>down; given in marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदातव्य|संप्रदातव्य
सम्-प्रदातव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be given or deli-<BR>vered over or transmitted; to be handed down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदातृ
सम्-प्रदातृ, ता, m. one who gives or delivers<BR>over or hands down, a giver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदान|संप्रदान|संप्रदानं|सम्प्रदानं
सम्-प्रदान, अम्, n. the act of giving or handing<BR>over completely; gift, donation, bestowal; bestowing<BR>in marriage; (in grammar) one of the six Kārakas,<BR>the idea expressed by the dative case, the recipient<BR>to which the agent causes anything to be given,<BR>(see कारक.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदानीय|संप्रदानीय|संप्रदानीयं
सम्-प्रदानीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be given or<BR>delivered over; (अम्), n. a gift, donation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदाय|संप्रदाय|संप्रदायः|सम्प्रदायः
1. सम्-प्रदाय, ind. having given up to; having<BR>handed down, having transmitted (to posterity).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदाय|संप्रदाय|संप्रदायः|सम्प्रदायः
2. सम्-प्रदाय, अस्, m. tradition, established<BR>doctrine transmitted from one teacher to another,<BR>traditional belief or usage; any peculiar or schisma-<BR>tical system of religious teaching, schism; custom,<BR>usage.<BR>—सम्प्रदाय-प्रद्योतक, अस्, m. a re-<BR>vealer of the tradition of the Veda.<BR>—सम्प्रदाय-<BR>प्राप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, obtained through tradition.<BR>—सम्प्रदाय-विद्, त्, m. one versed in traditional<BR>doctrines or usages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदायिन्|संप्रदायिन्
सम्प्रदायिन्, ई, इनी, इ, a holder of any tra-<BR>ditional doctrine, a member of some sect, (e. g.<BR>certain sects of the Vaiṣṇavas are called Śrī-sampra-<BR>dāyins, Rudra-sampradāyins, Brahma-sampradāyins,<BR>&c.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदिश्|संप्रदिश्
सम्प्रदिश् सम्-प्र-दिश्, cl. 6. P. -दिशति,<BR>-देष्टुम्, to point out or indicate fully, prescribe,<BR>announce, appoint, designate; to instruct, teach;<BR>Pass. -दिश्यते, to be indicated or designated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदिष्ट
सम्-प्रदिष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, clearly or particularly<BR>pointed out, prescribed, designated, particularized.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदीप्|संप्रदीप्
सम्प्रदीप् सम्-प्र-दीप्, cl. 4. A. -दीप्यते,<BR>&c., to flame or blaze forth; to burst into flame,<BR>shine very brightly: Caus. -दीपयति, -यितुम्, to<BR>set fire to, inflame, ignite, kindle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदीपित
सम्-प्रदीपित, अस्, आ, अम्, set fire to, ignited,<BR>inflamed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदीप्त|संप्रदीप्त
सम्-प्रदीप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, flaming or blazing<BR>up, shining very brightly, brilliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदुष्|संप्रदुष्
सम्प्रदुष् सम्-प्र-दुष्, cl. 4. P. -दुष्यति,<BR>&c., to become thoroughly bad, become quite cor-<BR>rupt, deteriorate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदुष्ट
सम्-प्रदुष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, wholly corrupted,<BR>quite defiled or polluted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदृश्|संप्रदृश्
सम्प्रदृश् सम्-प्र-दृश्, cl. 1. P. -पश्यति,<BR>-द्रष्टुम्, to look well at, observe, regard, con-<BR>sider, perceive, know, judge: Pass. -दृश्यते, to be<BR>clearly seen or observed, appear: Caus. -दर्शयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to cause to see, show, indicate, exhibit,<BR>manifest; to declare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदर्शित
सम्-प्रदर्शित, अस्, आ, अम्, shown, exhibited,<BR>manifested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रदर्श्य
सम्-प्रदर्श्य, ind. having shown or exhibited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रद्रु|संप्रद्रु
सम्प्रद्रु सम्-प्र-द्रु, cl. 1. P. -द्रवति,<BR>&c., to run away together, run quite off, escape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रद्रुत
सम्-प्रद्रुत, अस्, आ, अम्, run away, escaped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रधान|संप्रधानं
सम्प्रधान सम्-प्रधान, अम्, n. (fr. rt.<BR>1. धा with प्र and सम्), consideration, ascertain-<BR>ment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रधाव्|संप्रधाव्
सम्प्रधाव् सम्-प्र-धाव्, cl. 1. P. A. -धा-<BR>वति, -ते, -धावितुम्, to run quite away, hurry off,<BR>escape; to run up to, run towards, hasten towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रधावत्
सम्-प्रधावत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, running away,<BR>escaping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रधृ|संप्रधृ
सम्प्रधृ सम्-प्र-धृ, Caus. or cl. 10. P.<BR>-धारयति, -यितुम्, to fix upon, direct towards;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-c" target="_blank">Page1086-c+ 72</a>]<BR>to deliver over to; to fix the mind or thoughts<BR>steadily upon; to reflect, consider, deliberate or<BR>think about, determine, resolve, settle: Pass. -धार्-<BR>यते, to be fixed upon or determined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रधारण|संप्रधारण|संप्रधारणं
सम्-प्रधारण, अम्, आ, n. f. determination,<BR>deliberation, deciding on the propriety or impro-<BR>priety of anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रधारित
सम्-प्रधारित, अस्, आ, अम्, fixed or determined<BR>upon, deliberated about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रधार्य|संप्रधार्य
सम्-प्रधार्य, ind. having fixed or determined<BR>or resolved; having delivered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रधृष्|संप्रधृष्
सम्प्रधृष् सम्-प्र-धृष्, Caus. -धर्ष-<BR>यति, -यितुम्, to offer violence to, outrage, insult,<BR>violate, hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रध्यै
सम्प्रध्यै सम्-प्र-ध्यै, cl. 1. P. -ध्यायति,<BR>&c., to reflect or meditate deeply about, ponder or<BR>think well over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रनृत्
सम्प्रनृत् सम्-प्र-नृत्, cl. 4. P. -नृत्यति,<BR>&c., to begin to dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रनृत्त|संप्रनृत्त
सम्-प्रनृत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, beginning to dance<BR>or move about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रपच्
सम्प्रपच् सम्-प्र-पच्, Pass. -पच्यते, to<BR>become quite ripe or mature; to come to a head<BR>(as a boil &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रपद्|संप्रपद्
