सम्प्रपद|संप्रपद|सम्प्रपदं|संप्रपदः
सम्-प्रपद, अम्, n. wandering about, roaming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रपन्न|संप्रपन्न
सम्-प्रपन्न, अस्, आ, अम्, entered, fallen into;<BR>arrived at; endowed with, filled with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रबाध्|संप्रबाध्
