सम्प्रबुद्ध|संप्रबुद्ध
सम्-प्रबुद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, roused up, awak-<BR>ened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रबोधित|संप्रबोधित
सम्-प्रबोधित, अस्, आ, अम्, roused up, awakened;<BR>convinced, persuaded; consulted or deliberated about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

