सम्प्रभग्न|संप्रभग्न
सम्-प्रभग्न, अस्, आ, अम्, entirely broken to<BR>pieces, broken up, dispersed, defeated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रभा|संप्रभा
