सम्-प्रमथ्य, ind. having agitated; having<BR>violated; violently, by force.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1086-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रमद्
