सम्-प्रमुषित, अस्, आ, अम्, carried quite away,<BR>abstracted, distracted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रमोष|संप्रमोष|संप्रमोषः
सम्-प्रमोष, अस्, m. carrying off, abstraction,<BR>loss (= नाश).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रमुह्|संप्रमुह्
सम्प्रमुह् सम्-प्र-मुह्, cl. 4. P. A. -मुह्-<BR>यति, -ते, &c., to become completely stupefied or<BR>embarrassed, be perplexed or unconscious: Caus.<BR>-मोहयति, -यितुम्, to perplex completely, confuse,<BR>embarrass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रमूढ
सम्-प्रमूढ, अस्, आ, अम्, utterly bewildered,<BR>confused, perplexed, embarrassed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रमोह|संप्रमोह|संप्रमोहः
सम्-प्रमोह, अस्, m. utter bewilderment, em-<BR>barrassment, infatuation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रमृद्
