सम्प्रमृद्य|संप्रमृद्य
सम्-प्रमृद्य, ind. having crushed or com-<BR>pletely destroyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रमोक्ष्
सम्प्रमोक्ष् सम्-प्र-मोक्ष्, cl. 10. P. A.<BR>-मोक्षयति, -ते, -यितुम्, to make free, clear away;<BR>to clear a way for one's self (A.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रमोद|संप्रमोद|संप्रमोदः
सम्प्रमोद सम्-प्रमोद, अस्, m. excessive<BR>joy or delight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रयत्
सम्प्रयत् 1. सम्-प्र-यत् (for 2. सम्-प्रयत्<BR>see under सम्-प्रे), cl. 1. A. -यतते, &c., to<BR>strive eagerly for, exert one's self about, be intent<BR>upon (with dat.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रयम्|संप्रयम्
