सम्प्रया|संप्रया
सम्प्रया सम्-प्र-या, cl. 2. P. -याति, -यातुम्,<BR>to proceed or set off together; to go forwards or<BR>advance towards, move on; to go together to any<BR>state or condition, (see rt. 1. या); to make use of<BR>(with inst.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रयाण|संप्रयाण|संप्रयाणं
सम्-प्रयाण, अम्, n. proceeding together to-<BR>wards, setting out, departure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रयात
सम्-प्रयात, अस्, आ, अम्, gone forth together,<BR>setting out in a company, gone forward, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रयाच्|संप्रयाच्
सम्प्रयाच् सम्-प्र-याच्, cl. 1. P. A. -याचति,<BR>-ते, &c., to ask for together, solicit, beg, request.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रयुज्|संप्रयुज्
सम्प्रयुज् सम्-प्र-युज्, cl. 7. P. A. -युनक्ति,<BR>-युङ्क्ते, -योक्तुम्, to yoke or join together, har-<BR>ness; to attach, connect; to apply, employ, make<BR>use of; to perform, execute; to instigate, incite,<BR>induce: Caus. -योजयति, -यितुम्, to join together,<BR>connect; to equip, prepare; to employ, use: Pass.<BR>-युज्यते, to be joined together or connected or<BR>attached; to be united sexually; to be employed<BR>about; to be implicated in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रयुक्त|संप्रयुक्त
सम्-प्रयुक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, yoked or joined toge-<BR>ther, joined or united or connected with; reached;<BR>dependent on, resulting from; mixed, mingled,<BR>holding intercourse with, mutually acquainted; sexu-<BR>ally united; meeting or encountering one another<BR>in a hostile manner; occupied with, engaged upon,<BR>intent on, addicted to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रयुज्य
सम्-प्रयुज्य, ind. having employed, having<BR>instigated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रयोग|संप्रयोग|संप्रयोगः|सम्प्रयोगः
सम्-प्रयोग, अस्, m. joining together, conjunc-<BR>tion, union, connection, association, relation, depend-<BR>ance; mutual intercourse; sexual union, coition;<BR>mutual proportion, connected series or arrangement,<BR>order; application, employment; magic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रयोगिन्|संप्रयोगिन्
सम्प्रयोगिन्, ई, इनी, इ, yoking or joining toge-<BR>ther; addicted to sexual intercourse, wanton; (ई), m.<BR>a joiner, uniter, any one who effects a union or<BR>connection; a libertine; a conjuror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रयोजित
सम्-प्रयोजित, अस्, आ, अम्, joined together, con-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">Page1087-b+ 73</a>]<BR>nected; well suited for anything, adapted, suitable;<BR>employed, used; produced, brought forward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रयुध्|संप्रयुध्
सम्प्रयुध् सम्-प्र-युध्, cl. 4. A. -युध्यते,<BR>&c., to begin to fight together, commence a war;<BR>to fight, make war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रयुद्ध
सम्-प्रयुद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, engaged in war,<BR>fighting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्ररुच्|संप्ररुच्
सम्प्ररुच् सम्-प्र-रुच्, cl. 1. A. -रोचते,<BR>&c., to appear very bright or beautiful, appear good;<BR>to please.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्ररुध्|संप्ररुध्
सम्प्ररुध् सम्-प्र-रुध्, Pass. -रुध्यते,<BR>to be completely debarred from, be deprived of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्ररुष्
सम्प्ररुष् सम्-प्र-रुष्. See rt. 1. रुष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्ररुष्ट|संप्ररुष्ट
सम्-प्ररुष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, greatly enraged or<BR>irritated, furious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रली|संप्रली
