सम्प्रलीन
सम्-प्रलीन, अस्, आ, अम्, wholly dissolved or<BR>melted away, absorbed in, disappeared, vanished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रलुप्|संप्रलुप्
सम्प्रलुप् सम्-प्र-लुप्, Pass. -लुप्यते, to be<BR>forcibly deprived of; to be violated or injured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रलुभ्|संप्रलुभ्
सम्प्रलुभ् सम्-प्र-लुभ्, Caus. -लोभयति,<BR>-ते, -यितुम्, to allure or entice away, try to seduce<BR>or deceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रलोभ्य
सम्-प्रलोभ्य, ind. having allured away or<BR>seduced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रवच्|संप्रवच्
सम्प्रवच् सम्-प्र-वच्, cl. 2. P. -वक्ति, &c.,<BR>to explain or declare together; to relate at full or<BR>comprehensively, declare, communicate, announce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रोक्त|संप्रोक्त
सम्-प्रोक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, spoken to, addressed;<BR>declared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रवद्|संप्रवद्
सम्प्रवद् सम्-प्र-वद्, cl. 1. P. A. -वदति,<BR>-ते, &c., to speak forth together, speak out, pro-<BR>nounce aloud; to utter cries together, sing together;<BR>to talk or converse together (A.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रवदन|संप्रवदनं
सम्-प्रवदन, अम्, n. talking together, con-<BR>versation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रवदमान
सम्-प्रवदमान, अस्, आ, अम्, talking or con-<BR>versing together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रविचर्|संप्रविचर्
सम्प्रविचर् सम्-प्र-वि-चर्, Caus. -चारयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to examine or consider carefully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रविश्|संप्रविश्
सम्प्रविश् सम्-प्र-विश्, cl. 6. P. -विशति (ep.<BR>also A. -ते), &c., to enter into together; to enter<BR>entirely or completely into; to have intercourse<BR>with; to be sexually united with: Caus. -वेशयति,<BR>-यितुम्, to cause to enter, introduce, lead into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रविश्य
सम्-प्रविश्य, ind. having entered together;<BR>having completely entered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रविष्ट
सम्-प्रविष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, entered together;<BR>completely entered; gone into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रवेश|संप्रवेशः
सम्-प्रवेश, अस्, m. entering into together;<BR>complete entrance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रवेशित
सम्-प्रवेशित, अस्, आ, अम्, made to enter, intro-<BR>duced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रवेश्य
सम्-प्रवेश्य, ind. having caused to enter, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रविहृत्य|संप्रविहृत्य
