सम्प्रवृत्त|संप्रवृत्त
सम्-प्रवृत्त, अस्, आ, अम्, gone forwards, pro-<BR>ceeded, set off; arisen, come to pass; begun, com-<BR>menced; near at hand; passed by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रवृत्ति|संप्रवृत्ति
सम्-प्रवृत्ति, इस्, f. proceeding, setting forward,<BR>undertaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रवृध्|संप्रवृध्
सम्प्रवृध् सम्-प्र-वृध्, cl. 1. A. -वर्धते,<BR>&c., to grow well up, attain full growth, grow, in-<BR>crease: Caus. -वर्धयति, -यितुम्, to cause to<BR>grow or increase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रवृद्ध
सम्-प्रवृद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, full grown, increased,<BR>increasing, well advanced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रवृष्
