सम्प्रवृष्ट|संप्रवृष्ट|संप्रवृष्टं
सम्-प्रवृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, begun to rain;<BR>(अम्), n. that which has been completely rained, a<BR>whole rain-fall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रवे
सम्प्रवे सम्-प्र-वे, cl. 1. P. A. -वयति,<BR>-ते, &c., to interweave, sew or string together; to<BR>compose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रवेप्|संप्रवेप्
सम्प्रवेप् सम्-प्र-वेप्, cl. 1. A. -वेपते,<BR>&c., to tremble violently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रव्यथ्
