सम्प्रसाध्य|संप्रसाध्य
सम्-प्रसाध्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be accomplished<BR>or effected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रसारण|संप्रसारण|संप्रसारणं|सम्प्रसारणं
सम्प्रसारण सम्-प्रसारण, अम्, n. (see प्र-<BR>सारण), mutual moving or changing about; the<BR>mutual interchange or substitution of the vowels इ, उ,<BR>ऋ, ऌ, and their corresponding semivowels य्, व्,<BR>र्, ल्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

