सम्प्रस्थान|संप्रस्थान|संप्रस्थानं
सम्-प्रस्थान, अम्, n. the act of setting out<BR>together, setting out on a journey, departure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रस्थित
सम्-प्रस्थित, अस्, आ, अम्, set out together, set<BR>out on a journey, departed; standing forward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रस्पृश्
