सम्प्रहस्य
सम्-प्रहस्य, ind. having laughed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रहास|संप्रहास|संप्रहासः
सम्-प्रहास, अस्, m. laughter, joy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रहृ|संप्रहृ
सम्प्रहृ सम्-प्र-हृ, cl. 1. P. A. -हरति,<BR>-ते, -हर्तुम्, to strike at mutually, come to blows,<BR>fight together; to strike, wound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1087-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रहार|संप्रहार|संप्रहारः|सम्प्रहारः
