सम्प्रहर्ष|संप्रहर्ष
सम्-प्रहर्ष, अस्, m. great joy, thrill of de-<BR>light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1088-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रहर्षित
सम्-प्रहर्षित, अस्, आ, अम्, much pleased,<BR>greatly delighted; thrilled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1088-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्रहृष्ट|संप्रहृष्ट
सम्-प्रहृष्ट, अस्, आ, अम्, excessively rejoiced,<BR>rejoicing, joyful; erect, bristling (as the hair of the<BR>body), thrilling.<BR>—सम्प्रहृष्ट-तनूरुह, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, having the hairs of the body bristling with<BR>delight.<BR>—सम्प्रहृष्ट-मनस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, over-<BR>joyed in heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1088-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्प्राद्रु
