सव्यभिचार|सव्यभिचारः
सव्यभिचार स-व्यभिचार, अस्, m. an alleged<BR>reason which goes astray, i. e. a reason or argument<BR>that is incompatible with the conclusion drawn from<BR>it; an allegation that proves too much (one of the<BR>Hetv-ābhāsas, q. v.), a too general middle term (as<BR>‘fire’ to prove smoke).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सव्याज
