सव्यापार
सव्यापार स-व्यापार, अस्, आ, अम्, having<BR>employment, employed, occupied, busily engaged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1098-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

