सहस्रतय, अस्, ई, अम्, a thousandfold; (अम्),<BR>n. a thousand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

