सहास
सहास स-हास, अस्, आ, अम्, with laughter or<BR>derision, laughing, smiling; (अम्), ind. derisively,<BR>scornfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

