साखेय|साखेयः
साखेय साखेय, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. सखि), relat-<BR>ing to a friend, friendly, amicable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1102-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

