साश्र
साश्र 2. साश्र (स-अश्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, tearful,<BR>weeping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साश्रु
साश्रु (स-अश्˚), उस्, उस्, उ, accompanied by tears,<BR>tearful, shedding tears.<BR>—साश्रु-नयन, अस्, आ, अम्,<BR>having the eyes filled with tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साश्रुधी
साश्रुधी साश्रुधी, f. a wife's or husband's<BR>mother, a mother-in-law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साश्व
साश्व साश्व (स-अश्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, possessing<BR>horses, with horses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

साष्टाङ्गम्|साष्टांगम्
साष्टाङ्गम् साष्टाङ्गम् (स-अष्˚), ind. with<BR>eight limbs or members (viz. the hands, breast, fore-<BR>head, knees, and feet); with humble prostration of<BR>the body (i. e. touching the earth with the eight<BR>members; cf. अष्टाङ्ग).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

