सासद्यमान
सासद्यमान सासद्यमान. See p. 1055,<BR>col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1112-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

