सुच्छत्त्र
सुच्छत्त्र सु-च्छत्त्र, &c. See p. 1119, col. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1127-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुट्
सुट् सुट्, (in grammar) a Pratyāhāra used<BR>as a technical expression for the first five inflections<BR>(i. e. nom. sing. du. pl., acc. sing. du., also called सर्-<BR>वनाम-स्थान, q. v., for masc. and fem. nouns).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1127-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

