सुषि|सुषिः
सुषि, इस्, f. (for शुषि, q. v.), drying; a hole,<BR>cavity; a tube, pipe; (इस्), m. an opening, aperture;<BR>[cf. देव-स्˚.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषिर|सुषिरं
सुषिर, अस्, आ, अम्, (for शुषिर, q. v.), full of<BR>holes, perforated, hollow, &c.; having spaces; slow<BR>in articulation, = विलम्बित; (आ), f., Ved. an abyss;<BR>(अम्), n. a hole, cavity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषिलीका
