सुस्मूर्षमाण
सुस्मूर्षमाण सुस्मूर्षमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, (fr.<BR>Desid. of rt. स्मृ), wishing or trying to recollect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुह्
सुह् सुह् [cf. rts. 3. 1. सह्], cl. 4. P. सु-<BR>ह्यति, सुषोह, सोहितुम्, to satisfy, make<BR>glad, gladden; to be glad, rejoice; to bear, endure,<BR>sustain, support.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुहणमुख
सुहणमुख सुहणमुख, N. of a place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1130-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुहृद्
