सोत्प्रास सोत्प्रास (स-उत्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, having<BR>excess, excessive; exaggerated, exaggerating ironic-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1136-b" target="_blank">Page1136-b+ 68</a>]<BR>ally; (अस्), m. violent laughter; (अस्, अम्), m. n.<BR>ironical exaggeration, sarcasm, flattering speech, sneer-<BR>ing praise and covert censure.<BR>—सोत्प्रास-हसित,<BR>अम्, n. sarcastic laughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

