सोपान|सोपानं
सोपान सोपान, अम्, n. (perhaps contracted<BR>from स + उपायन), stairs, steps, a staircase, a<BR>ladder.<BR>—सोपान-त्व, अम्, n. the state or condition<BR>of stairs, the uses of a staircase.<BR>—सोपान-परम्-<BR>परा, f. a line of steps, flight of steps.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1136-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

