स्वरेणु|स्वरेणुः
स्वरेणु स्वरेणु, उस्, f. (etymology doubt-<BR>ful), N. of a wife of the Sun (= 2. सञ्-ज्ञा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1160-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

