हाल|हालः
हाल हाल, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 1. हल् or fr. हल),<BR>a plough; N. of Bala-rāma (as bearing a weapon<BR>shaped like a ploughshare, see हल-धर); N. of<BR>Śālivāhana; of a king; (आ), f. spirituous liquor,<BR>wine, the spirituous juice of the palm; (ई), f. a<BR>wife's younger sister.<BR>—हाल-भृत्, m. epithet of<BR>Bala-rāma (= हल-भृत्).<BR>—हालास्य-माहात्म्य<BR>(˚ल-आस्˚), अम्, n., N. of a part of the Skanda-Purāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1170-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हालहल|हालहलं
हालहल, अम्, n. (= हलाहल, q. v.), a sort of<BR>deadly poison (produced at the churning of the<BR>ocean by the gods and demons); any poison or<BR>venom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1170-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

