हाहाल|हाहालं
हाहाल, अम्, n. the above poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1170-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

