हिज्जल|हिज्जलः
हिज्जल, अस्, m. the Hijjal tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1171-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिञ्जीर|हिंजीर|हिंजीरः|हिञ्जीरः
