हिण्ड्|हिंड्
हिण्ड् हिण्ड्, cl. 1. A. हिण्डते, जिहिण्डे,<BR>हिण्डितुम्, to go, move, wander or roam<BR>about [cf. आ-हिण्ड्]; to disregard, slight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1172-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिण्डन|हिंडन|हिंडनं|हिण्डनं
हिण्डन, अम्, n. wandering, roaming; sexual<BR>intercourse; writing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1172-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिण्डिक|हिंडिकः|हिण्डिकः
