अनुपा
2. अनु-पा; add — to cherish; to watch, bide one's<BR>time, wait for, expect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

