अनुप्रवचनीय
अनु-प्रवचनीय, अस्, आ, अम्, relating to or re-<BR>quisite for the learning of the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रवण
अनु-प्रवण, अस्, आ, अम्, corresponding with,<BR>adequate to (at the end of a comp.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रशमन
