अनुबध्नत्
अनु-बध्नत्, अन्, अती, अत्, following, seeking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुबन्ध|अनुबंधः|अनुबन्धः
