अनुवाक्य
अनु-वाक्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be recited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवादित
अनु-वादित, अस्, आ, अम्, translated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुवासरम्
अनु-वासरम्, ind. day by day, every day, daily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुविम्ब
अनु-विम्ब, अम्, n. a corresponding image or<BR>picture, counterpart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुषत्य
अनु-षत्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. 3. अनु + सत्य), Ved.<BR>following the truth, an observer of truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

