अनुसर्तव्य
अनु-सर्तव्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be followed or pur-<BR>sued.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसानु
