अन्नीयत्
अन्नीयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, desiring food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

