अन्वक्
अन्वक्; add — behind, from behind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपज्य
अप-ज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, loosened from the bow-string.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपज्वर
