अपतुषार
अप-तुषार, अस्, आ, अम्, free from frost or mist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपतुषारता
अपतुषार-ता, f. absence of mist, departure of<BR>frost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपनिद्र
अप-निद्र; add — wide awake, expanded, bloom-<BR>ing (said of a flower, see निद्रा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपनिधि
अप-निधि, इस्, इस्, इ, treasureless, poor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1181-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

