अपहस्तय
अप-हस्तय; add — to drive away (with the back<BR>of the hand).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

