अपावृत्तक
अपा-वृत्तक, अस्, आ, अम्, running away, fugitive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिधान|अपिधानं
अपि-धान; add — a bolt, bar, lock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपिवत्|अपिवन्त्
