अपोब्ध
अपोब्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, bound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अपोम्भन
अपोम्भन, अम्, n. binding, a bond, fetter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अप्रातिरूप्य
अ-प्रातिरूप्य, अम्, n. dissimilarity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्ज|अब्जः
2. अब्ज, Nom. P. अब्जति, &c., to become a lotus<BR>flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिक्षत्तृ
अभि-क्षत्तृ; add — one who carves food, a host.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिगृध्न
अभि-गृध्न, अस्, आ, अम्, eagerly desiring, greedy<BR>for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिदेवन
अभि-देवन, अम्, n. a gambling-table, dice-table.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिपाल
अभि-पाल, अस्, m. a protector, watcher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिपालन
अभि-पालन, अम्, n. protection, watching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिप्रधर्षण
