अभिमुखय
अभि-मुखय, Nom. P. -मुखयति, &c., to<BR>face, encounter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

