अमत-परार्थ-ता, f. the having an unaccept-<BR>able second meaning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमानुष|अमानुषः
अ-मानुष; add — (अस्, आ, अम्), destitute of men.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अमिनत्|अमिनन्त्
