अमूदृक्ष
अमू-दृक्ष; for ‘आ’ read ई.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बरीषक|अम्बरीषकः
