अर्मक
अर्मक, doubtful and probably to be erased, B. R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वन्|अर्व्वन्
