अर्वाक्तन
अर्वाक्तन, अस्, आ or ई, अम्, being on this side,<BR>not reaching to the other side.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

