अवद्यत्
अव-द्यत्, अन्, अती, अत्, breaking off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवन|अवनं
अवन; add — (अस्, ई, अम्), protecting, sheltering,<BR>a protector.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

