अ-व्युत्पन्न; add — underived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशङ्क्य
अ-शङ्क्य, अस्, आ, अम्, not to be feared or doubted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशनिन्
अशनिन्, ई, इनी, इ, having a thunderbolt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लोन
अ-श्लोन; read अ-श्लोण [cf. श्लोण, श्रोण].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वषङ्गव
अश्व-षङ्गव; correct thus — अश्व-षड्गव.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वसुक्ति
अश्व-सुक्ति; read — अश्व-सुक्तिन्, ई, m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टि|अष्टिः
2. अष्टि; for ‘rt. 1. अस्’ read rt. 1. अश्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अष्टि|अष्टिः
3. अष्टि, इस्, f. (fr. rt. 2. अस्), seed (= अष्ठि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असक्त
अ-सक्त; add — uninterrupted; (अम्), ind. un-<BR>interruptedly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असश्चिवस्
अ-सश्चिवस्; for ‘अस्’ read अत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असार|असारं|असारः
अ-सार; under (अम्), n. add — chaff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

असिऋद्धित
असि-ऋद्धित, अस्, आ, अम्, increased or extended<BR>by the sword (= खड्ग-बलेन ऋद्धिम् प्रापित).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्थिदन्तमय
अस्थि-दन्त-मय, अस्, ई, अम्, made of bone or<BR>of ivory, (Manu V. 121.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अस्राम
अ-स्राम; add — not withered (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अहङ्करण|अहंकरण
अहङ्-करण, अम्, n. = अहङ्-कार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अहन्
अहन्; for ‘and अहस्’ read — अहर्, which is the<BR>proper form of the Nominative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अहर्दल
अहर्-दल, mid-day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अहस्त्रियाम
अहस्-त्रियाम, अम्, n. day and night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आकेकर
आ-केकर, अस्, ई, अम्, slightly looking askance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आङ्गारिक|आङ्गारिकः
आङ्गारिक, अस्, m. one having to do with charcoal,<BR>a charcoal-burner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आचर्
आ-चर्; add — to examine (a witness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आञ्जन|आंजन|आञ्जनः
आञ्जन; add — (अस्, ई, अम्), having the colour of<BR>ointment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आडम्बर|आडंबरः|आडम्बरः
आडम्बर; add — noise, din; bombastical lan-<BR>guage; tumult, confusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आत्मसन्तान|आत्मसंतान
आत्म-सन्तान, अस्, m. ‘own offspring,’ a son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आद
2. आद or आदक, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. अद्), eating<BR>(at the end of comps.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आदाय|आदायः
1. आदाय to be erased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आदारबिम्बी
आदार-बिम्बी to be erased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आदीपक
आ-दीपक, अस्, m. one who sets fire to anything,<BR>an incendiary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आधिदैविक|आधिदैविकं
आधिदैविक; add — proceeding from the influence<BR>of the atmosphere or planets, proceeding from divine<BR>or supernatural agencies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आधीन
आधीन = अधीन, depending on (with loc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आध्यात्मिक|आध्यात्मिकं
आध्यात्मिक; add — proceeding from bodily or<BR>mental causes within one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आपरपक्षीय
आपरपक्षीय (fr. अपर-पक्ष), belonging<BR>or relating to the second half of a month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आप्तोर्याम|आप्तोर्यामः
आप्तोर्-याम, अस्, m. = अप्तोर्-याम, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आप्वन्
आप्वन् to be erased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आप्सरस
आप्सरस, अस्, ई, अम्, coming from an Apsaras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आफलक|आफलकः
आ-फलक, a fence made of planks, palisade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आब्दम्
आब्दम् (आ-अब्˚), ind. for a whole year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आभरित
आ-भरित, अस्, आ, अम्, ornamented, adorned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आमिष|आमिषं
आमिष; add — prey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आमिषता
आमिष-ता, f. the being a prey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आमृश्
आ-मृश्; add — Pass. मृश्यते, to be devoured or<BR>eaten (= भक्ष्यते, Raghu-v. V. 9).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरत
आ-रत; add — (अम्), n. a kind of coitus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरेचिन्
आ-रेचिन्, ई, इनी, इ, emptying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आरोध
आ-रोध, अस्, m. a siege, blockade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्जविन्
आर्जविन्, ई, इनी, इ (fr. आर्जव), having honesty,<BR>upright, honest, straightforward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आर्जीक|आर्जीकः
आर्जीक; ‘milk’ to be erased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवर्जन|आवर्जनं
आ-वर्जन, अम्, n. victory, conquest (= जय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविग्न|आविग्नः
आ-विग्न; add — अस्, आ, अम् (fr. आ-विज्), terrified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आविर्मण्डल
आविर्-मण्डल, अस्, आ, अम्, manifesting the form<BR>of a circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आवेध
आ-वेध, अस्, m. (fr. आ-व्यध्), shaking about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशिर्
आशिर्; for ‘ईस्’ read ईर्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशिष्ठ
आशिष्ठ, अस्, आ, अम् (superl. of आशु), quickest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आशीयस्
आशीयस्, आन्, असी, अस् (compar. of आशु), quicker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आष्टमिक
आष्टमिक, अस्, ई, अम्, taught in the eighth book<BR>(of Pāṇini).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आसंसृतेः
आ-संसृतेः, ind. till the end of the world, as long<BR>as the course of this world lasts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आसिधार|आसिधारं
आसिधार, अम्, n. (fr. असि-धारा), scil. व्रतम्, a<BR>vow as difficult as standing on the edge of a sword.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आसुर|आसुरं|आसुरः
आसुर; under (ई), f. add — an epithet of बुद्धि<BR>in the Sāṅkhya philosophy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आहङ्कारिक|आहंकारिक
आहङ्कारिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. अहङ्-कार), belong-<BR>ing or relating to Ahaṅkāra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इक्षुशाकट|इक्षुशाकटं
इक्षु-शाकट; for ‘kind’ read field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इडा
इडा; add — N. of a particular artery on the left<BR>side of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दीवर|इंदीवर|इंदीवरं|इन्दीवरं
इन्दी-वर; add — (अस्), m. a bee [cf. इन्दिन्-<BR>दिर].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्द्रगोप|इन्द्रगोपः
इन्द्र-गोप; to (अस्), m. add — a fire-fly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्द्रपुत्रा
इन्द्र-पुत्रा; correct thus — ‘having Indra for a<BR>son,’ i. e. the mother of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्द्रमह|इन्द्रमहः
इन्द्र-मह; add — (according to a commentator)<BR>a feast in honour of Indra [cf. मह].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इभ्यतिल्वल
इभ्य-तिल्वल; read इभ्य-तिल्विल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इर्वारुक|इर्वारुकः
इर्वारुक to be erased, B. R. [cf. मृगेर्वारुक].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईक्ष
ईक्ष, अस्, आ, अम्, looking [cf. तिर्यग्-ईक्ष]; an<BR>opening, hole, mesh, (in क्षुद्रेक्ष, having small<BR>meshes.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईङ्खन
ईङ्खन, अम्, n. shaking about, swinging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईयिवस्
ईयिवस्; for ‘अस्’ read अत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईर|ईरः
ईर, अस्, m. the wind.<BR>—ईर-ज or ईर-पुत्र, अस्,<BR>m. ‘son of the wind,’ Hanu-mat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ईरण|ईरणः
ईरण; add — (अम्), n. the act of publishing, pro-<BR>claiming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1182-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छोथ
