ऋद्धित, अस्, आ, अम्, made to prosper, prospered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकताल|एकतालः
एक-ताल, अस्, आ, अम्, having a single palm tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडी
एडी, f. a female sheep, ewe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणाङ्क
एणाङ्क (एण-अङ्˚), अस्, m. ‘deer-marked,’ the<BR>moon.<BR>—एणाङ्क-मणि, इस्, m. the moon-gem [cf.<BR>चन्द्र-कान्त].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐकगुण्य
ऐकगुण्य, अम्, n. (fr. एक-गुण), the value of a<BR>single unit, simple unity (opposed to द्वैगुण्य).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐदम्पर्य|ऐदंपर्य|ऐदंपर्यं
ऐदम्पर्य, अम्, n. (fr. इदम् + पर), ‘the<BR>state of being devoted to this alone,’ main or only<BR>object, chief end.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐन्द्रनील
ऐन्द्रनील, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. इन्द्र-नील), made of<BR>sapphire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐश्य
ऐश्य, अम्, n. (fr. ईश), supremacy, power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओत्सूर्यम्
ओत्सूर्यम् (आ-उत्˚), ind. until the sun rises.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओष्ठजाह
ओष्ठ-जाह; for ‘ear’ read lips.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

और्मिलेय
और्मिलेय, अस्, m. a metronymic from Ūrmilā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

और्वर
और्वर, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. उर्वरा), belonging to<BR>the earth, coming from the ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कट्फल|कट्फलः
कट्-फल. See under कटु, p. 196, col. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्ट|कंट
कण्ट. See under कण्टक; (these words are<BR>thought by some to be for original कर्न्त, कर्न्-<BR>तक, fr. rt. 2. कृत्, to cut.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमण्डलु|कमंडलु|कमंडलुः|कमण्डलुः
कमण्डलु; in Ved. a form कमण्डलू, ऊस्, f.<BR>is allowed, (Pāṇ. IV. 1, 71.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलनाभ
कमल-नाभ, अस्, m. ‘lotus-naveled,’ epithet of<BR>Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णस्रोतस्|कर्ण्णस्रोतस्
कर्ण-स्रोतस्, अस्, n. ‘ear-flow,’ the wax of the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलहत्
कलहत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत् (fr. a Nom. कलह), quar-<BR>reling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कवयितृ
कवयितृ = कवि, (Kumāra-s. II. 17, Malli-nātha.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कस्तीर|कस्तीरं
कस्तीर; said to be connected with rt. 1. कास् for<BR>काश्, to shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काणभुज
काणभुज, अस्, ई, अम्, composed by Kaṇa-bhuj,<BR>i. e. Kaṇāda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काद्रव
काद्रव, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. कद्रु), dark-yellow, of<BR>a reddish-brown colour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कानिष्ठ्य
कानिष्ठ्य, अम्, n. (fr. कनिष्ठ), the place<BR>or position of the youngest (opposed to ज्यैष्ठ्य),<BR>juniority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामतात
काम-तात, अस्, m. epithet of Śiva [cf. काम-<BR>पाल].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कामाख्या
कामाख्या; add — a district in Assam sacred to<BR>Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कायदण्ड|कायदण्डः
काय-दण्ड, अस्, m. command over the body,<BR>control of the actions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कारु|कारुः
कारु; for ‘(अस्)’ read (उस्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालपूग
काल-पूग; transfer under 2. काल, and correct<BR>thus — a quantity or length of time, a long time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काष्ठलोष्टमय
काष्ठ-लोष्ट-मय, अस्, ई, अम्, made of wood<BR>and clay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किञ्चन्य|किंचन्य
किञ्चन्य, अम्, n. (fr. किञ्चन, ‘something’),<BR>possession, property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किन्ता|किंता
किन्-ता, f. ‘the state of whom?’ any despicable<BR>state or condition, contemptibleness; किन्तया, with<BR>meanness, contemptibly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किन्देव|किंदेव|किन्देवः
किन्-देव, अस्, m. a demi-god [cf. किन्-नर].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किम्प्रभु|किंप्रभु|किम्प्रभुः
किम्-प्रभु, उस्, m. a bad master.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किम्भृत्य|किंभृत्य
किम्-भृत्य, अस्, m. a bad servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किम्मन्त्रिन्|किंमन्त्रिन्
किम्-मन्त्रिन्, ई, m. a bad minister.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किरीट|किरीटं|किरीटः
किरीट; add — (अस्), m. a merchant, trader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्षिज|कुक्षिजः
कुक्षि-ज, अस्, m. a son, (Raghu-v. XV. 15.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतन्त्री|कुतंत्री
कु-तन्त्री, ईस् or ई, f. a tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुल|कुलं|कुलः
कुल, अम्, n.; add — (with Śāktas), epithet of<BR>Śakti and of the rites observed in her worship [cf.<BR>कौल].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलधर्म|कुलधर्मः|कुलधर्म्म|कुलधर्म्मः
कुल-धर्म; add — the observances of the<BR>Kaulas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलमार्ग|कुलमार्गः
कुल-मार्ग; add — the doctrine of the Kaulas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलवर्त्मन्
कुल-वर्त्मन्, अ, n. the doctrine of the Kaulas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुविद्
कुविद्, ind. where? where at all? (Sāy.) often,<BR>frequently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूर्चल
कूर्चल, अस्, आ, अम्, having a beard, bearded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृतार्थयत्
कृतार्थयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, making successful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कृमिज|कृमिजं
कृमि-ज, अम्, n.; add — silk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केलिकिल|केलिकिलः
केलि-किल; add — (अस्, आ, अम्), wanton, arrogant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैमुतिकन्याय
कैमुतिक-न्याय, अस्, m. the rule of ‘how much<BR>more’ or a fortiori.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोटि|कोटिः
कोटि, इस्, f. a point or side in an argument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौल्य|कौल्यः
कौल्य; add — (अम्), n. noble origin, good family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कौशिक|कौशिकः
1. कौशिक; add — (अम्), n. a silk garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्नोपन
क्नोपन, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. Caus. of rt. क्नूय्), wet-<BR>ting, moistening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रकच|क्रकचः
क्रकच; under ‘अस्, m.’ add — a particular musical<BR>instrument; N. of a hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्राणा
क्राणा, ind. (according to B. R. inst. of क्राण,<BR>‘desire, eagerness,’ and probably from a form क्रा<BR>= rt. 1. कृ), Ved. willingly, gladly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरखर्जूर|क्षीरखर्ज्जूर
क्षीर-खर्जूर, क्षीरिका; for ‘Datura’ read<BR>Date.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रसंहिता
क्षेत्र-संहिता, f. any work on geometry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपाय
क्षेपाय, Nom. A. क्षेपायते, &c., to revile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपायमाण
क्षेपायमाण, अस्, आ, अम्, abusing, reviling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्वेलन
क्ष्वेलन, अम्, n. the act of playing, sport, jest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्ष्वेलि
क्ष्वेलि, इस्, f. sport, jest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डकाव्य|खंडकाव्य
खण्ड-काव्य, अम्, n.; add — a partial or minor<BR>poem (i. e. one not on any heroic or sacred subject,<BR>and having only one topic).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खर्जु|खर्जुः|खर्ज्जुः
खर्जु; for ‘datura’ read date.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलखलाय
खलखलाय, Nom. A. खलखलायते, to act<BR>knavishly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलाय
खलाय, Nom. A. खलायते, to act roguishly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोरक|खोरकः
खोरक, अस्, m. a disease of the foot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गजिन्
गजिन्, ई, इनी, इ, riding on an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गती
गती, f. = गति, going, (in Rāmāyaṇa VII. 31, 41.<BR>explained by the commentator as a Vedic lengthen-<BR>ing of the final.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गत्वर|गत्वरः
गत्वर; for ‘आ’ read ई.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदि|गदिः
गदि, इस्, f. speaking, speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गमक|गमकः
गमक; add — making clear or intelligible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरुड|गरुडः
गरुड; Aruṇa is the elder (not ‘younger’)<BR>brother, and Garuḍāgraja should be translated ‘elder<BR>brother of Garuḍa.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवाशिर
गवाशिर; the base should rather be गवाशिर्,<BR>Nom. case masc. fem. गवाशीर्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाल|गालः
गाल; add — (अस्, ई, अम्), produced in or from<BR>the throat, guttural.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणयोग
गुण-योग, अस्, m. the application of the secondary<BR>sense of a word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणवृत्ति|गुणवृत्तिः
गुण-वृत्ति; for ‘essential’ read unessential:<BR>add — the secondary force of a word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणाय
गुणाय, Nom. A. गुणायते, &c., to appear like<BR>virtues, become merits or good qualities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणिन्
गुणिन्; add — having a string or cord.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुप्
2. गुप्; add — cl. 1. P. गोपायति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुमत्|गुरुमन्त्
गुरु-मत्; add — (अती), f. a pregnant woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुर्वर्थ|गुर्वर्थः|गुर्व्वर्थ
गुर्व्-अर्थ, अस्, m.; add — one who seeks to pro-<BR>vide a maintenance for his Guru.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृष्टि|गृष्टिः
गृष्टि; under ‘इस्, m.’ add — a proper N.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोचर्या
गो-चर्या, f. seeking pasturage or food like a cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोचारिन्
गो-चारिन्; add — one who seeks his nourishment<BR>like a cow, seeking food with the mouth, (see<BR>मृग-चारिन्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपाय
गोपाय, Nom. A. गोपायते, to act like a herds-<BR>man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोयज्ञ|गोयज्ञः
गो-यज्ञ; add — a sacrifice in honour of a cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गौण्य|गौण्यं
गौण्य; add — the being a merit, excellence;<BR>(अस्), m. merit, excellence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रस्
1. ग्रस्; add — to neglect, (according to Kullūka<BR>on Manu VIII. 43. ग्रसेत् = उपेक्षेत.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामटिका
ग्रामटिका, f. (fr. ग्राम), a wretched village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घटोत्कच|घटोत्कचः
घटोत्कच means ‘bald as a jar.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घण्ट|घंट|घण्टः
घण्ट; probably for हन्त्र as दण्ड for<BR>दन्त्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रतुण्ड|चक्रतुण्डः
चक्र-तुण्ड, अस्, m. a kind of fish (= नल-<BR>मीन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चख्वस्
चख्वस्, आन्, m. an abbreviated perf. part., (accord-<BR>ing to Sāy. on Ṛg-veda II. 14, 4. either fr. rt. चक्ष्<BR>or rt. खन्, perhaps ‘one who has displayed,’ ‘dis-<BR>playing;’ according to B. R. perhaps ‘stretching out.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरितगुणत्व
चरितगुण-त्व; add — the attainment of some<BR>peculiar quality or use.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चार्य
2. चार्य, अम्, n. (fr. चर or चार), spying out,<BR>espionage, information brought by spies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिच्चिक
चिच्चिक, अस्, m. (onomatopoetic), Ved. a kind of<BR>bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिररात्र|चिररात्रं
चिर-रात्र, (according to Halāyudha I. 108) अस्, m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडय
चूडय, Nom. P. चूडयति, &c., to make any-<BR>thing (acc.) into a Cūḍā or top-knot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूलिका
चूलिका, f.; add — the hinting of a matter or event<BR>by those behind the curtain (in the drama).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चैलेय
चैलेय, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. चेल), made of cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोरायित
चोरायित, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. a Nom. चोराय), acted<BR>like a thief, playing the thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छन्न|छन्नं|छन्नः
छन्न; add — (अम्), n. a covering; the trap-<BR>pings (of an elephant).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छलितराम
छलित-राम; for ‘अस्, m.’ read अम्, n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जडय
जडय, Nom. P. जडयति, &c., to make apa-<BR>thetic, make motionless or lifeless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जडात्मक
जडात्मक, अस्, आ, अम्, or जडात्मन् (˚ड-आत्˚),<BR>आ, आ, अ, insensible, void of sensation, calm, placid,<BR>cool (said of the moon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जनि|जनिः
जनि or जनी; add — cf. Gr. γυνή<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जलशर्करा
जल-शर्करा, f. ‘water-gravel,’ hail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाती
जाती, f. a kind of jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जालन्धर|जालंधर|जालंधरः|जालन्धरः
जालन्धर, अस्, m. = जलन्-धर, N. of an<BR>Asura.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जृभ्
जृभ् or जृम्भ्; add — to unbend or unstring a<BR>bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1183-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्योतिर्मिलिन्
ज्योतिर्मिलिन्, probably for ज्योतिर्मीलिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वर्
ज्वर्; add — connected with rt. ज्वल्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलत्|ज्वलन्त्
ज्वलत्; add — (अन्), m. fire, flame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

झषकेतन|झषकेतनः
झष-केतन; add — the sea.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टिका
टिका, in स्वर्ग-ग्राम-टिका-विलुण्ठन, to be<BR>erased, (see ग्रामटिका, p. 1183.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटाघात|तटाघातः
तटाघात (˚ट-आघ्˚), अस्, m. = वप्र-क्रीडा,<BR>the butting of elephants against banks, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तन्
3. तन्; add — to manifest, display, exhibit, show,<BR>put forth (energy &c.), make.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तनुमध्य
तनु-मध्य, अम्, n. middle of body, waist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तपर्लोक
तपर्-लोक = तपो-लोक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तमोगु|तमोगुः
तमो-गु to be erased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुणय
तरुणय, Nom. P. तरुणयति, to make fresh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलवारण|तलवारणं
तल-वारण = तल-त्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्यत्
ताम्यत्; add — becoming distressed, becoming<BR>attenuated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावत्|तावन्त्
तावत्; add — just a little.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यक्स्रोतस्|तिर्य्यक्स्रोतस्
तिर्यक्-स्रोतस्; for ‘hurrying’ read having.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलित
तुलित; add — lifted up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यकुल्य
तुल्यकुल्य, अस्, आ, अम्, belonging to the same<BR>family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृणावर्त|तृणावर्तः|तृणावर्त्त
तृणावर्त; add — N. of a demon killed by the<BR>infant Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्ट
तृष्ट, to be connected with rt. 1. तृष्; add<BR> — (originally) dry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोकाय
तोकाय, Nom. P. तोकायति, to be like a new-born<BR>child.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौरङ्गिक|तौरंगिक|तौरङ्गिकः
तौरङ्गिक, अस्, m. a horseman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्याजन
त्याजन, अम्, n. the act of abandonment, renun-<BR>ciation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिसरक
त्रि-सरक, अम्, n. the aggregate of three spi-<BR>rituous liquors; drinking spirituous liquors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्ड|दंड|दंडं|दंडः|दण्डः
दण्ड; add — probably for original दन्त्र,<BR>‘the instrument of restraining.’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डवाचिके
दण्ड-वाचिके, n. du. in पारुष्ये दण्ड-वाचिके,<BR>the two kinds of assault, i. e. blows and abuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ददाश्वस्
ददाश्वस्; for ‘वस्’ read वत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ददिवस्
ददिवस्; for ‘वस्’ read वत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ददृशिवस्
ददृशिवस्; for ‘वस्’ read वत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दन्ध्वन|दन्ध्वनः
दन्ध्वन, अस्, m. (fr. Intens. of rt. 2. ध्वन्),<BR>‘sounding very much,’ a kind of reed or cane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दरीमन्
दरीमन् (fr. rt. दॄ), Ved. destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दार|दारः
दार; the meaning ‘a ploughed field’ to be<BR>erased; the words printed एकके दारे in Manu IX.<BR>38. should be एक-केदारे, (see केदार.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दालन|दालनं
दालन; for ‘अम्, n.’ read अस्, m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाश्वस्
दाश्वस्; for ‘वस्’ read वत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुग्धबन्धक|दुग्धबन्धकः
दुग्ध-बन्धक; correct thus — अस्, m. the<BR>pledging of milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुराधि|दुराधिः
दुर्-आधि; add — (इस्), m. anxious thought, dis-<BR>tress of mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुरुपसद
दुर्-उपसद, अस्, आ, अम्, difficult of approach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दौर्हृदिनी
दौर्हृदिनी, f. = दौहृदिनी, a pregnant woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्य|द्रव्यं
द्रव्य; add — (one of the Padārthas or categories<BR>in grammar), a word which is the name of a single<BR>object as distinguished from a Jāti or class.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रौपदेय|द्रौपदेयः
द्रौपदेय; for ‘patronymic’ read metro-<BR>nymic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वैरूप्य
द्वैरूप्य, अम्, n. (fr. द्वि-रूप), duality of<BR>form, double appearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धनुःकाण्ड|धनुःकांड
धनुः-काण्ड, धनुः-खण्ड; these would<BR>be better written धनुष्-काण्ड, धनुष्-खण्ड,<BR>(see Pāṇ. VIII. 3, 45.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धुन
धुन; add — (अम्), n. one million billions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ध्वन्
2. ध्वन्; add — Pass. ध्वन्यते, to be implied<BR>or signified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नक्षत्र|नक्षत्रं
नक्षत्र; the order of the Nakṣatras is<BR>differently given, but the following is the most<BR>usual: 1. Aśvinī; 2. Bharaṇī; 3. Kṛttikā; 4. Ro-<BR>hiṇī; 5. Mṛga-śiras; 6. Ārdrā; 7. Punar-vasū;<BR>8. Puṣya; 9. Āśleṣā; 10. Maghā; 11. Pūrva-<BR>Phalgunī; 12. Uttara-Phalgunī; 13. Hasta; 14.<BR>Citrā; 15. Svātī; 16. Viśākhā; 17. Anurādhā;<BR>18. Jyeṣṭhā; 19. Mūla; 20. Pūrvāṣāḍhā; 21.<BR>Uttarāṣāḍhā; 22. Abhijit; 23. Śravaṇa; 24. Śra-<BR>viṣṭhā or Dhaniṣṭhā; 25. Śata-bhiṣaj; 26. Pūrva-<BR>Bhādrapadā; 27. Uttara-Bhādrapadā; 28. Revatī:<BR>sometimes the twenty-second, Abhijit, is omitted, a<BR>sidereal revolution of the moon being accomplished<BR>in little more than twenty-seven days.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर|नरं|नरः
नर; in col. 2, line 3, read, the waters are<BR>called Nārā or Nārāḥ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्तक|नर्तकः|नर्त्तक|नर्त्तकः
नर्तक; add — अम्, n. a kind of mythical<BR>weapon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्मगर्भ|नर्मगर्भः|नर्म्मगर्भ
नर्म-गर्भ; add — the action of the amorous<BR>hero in concealment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नलोपख्यान
नलोपख्यान; read नलोपाख्यान.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नार|नारं|नारः
नार; add — proceeding from Nara or the su-<BR>preme Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निकाष|निकाषः
निकाष = निकष, the touchstone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निगुप्
नि-गुप्, cl. 1. P. -गोपायति, -गोपितुम्, to conceal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमेषण
नि-मेषण; add — (अम्), n. the closing of the<BR>eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरयिन्
निरयिन्, ई, m. an inhabitant of hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराक्रन्द|निराक्रन्दः
निर्-आक्रन्द; add — having no friend or pro-<BR>tector, affording no refuge or protection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरायति
निर्-आयति, इस्, इस्, इ, one who has no future, one<BR>whose end is at hand, soon to be destroyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरोष्ठ्य
निर्-ओष्ठ्य, अम्, n. a verse containing no labial<BR>letter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मार्ष्टि
निर्-मार्ष्टि, इस्, f., N. of the wife of Duḥsaha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निलायन
नि-लायन, अम्, n. the act of hiding one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निषेव
नि-षेव; add — (अस्), m. honouring, honour,<BR>worship, respect, esteem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निष्पात|निष्पातः
निष्पात, अस्, m. rapid stroke or dash.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निस्तक्ष्
निस्-तक्ष्; add — to carve out; to cut up, wound<BR>(by insults &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निस्तप्
निस्-तप्, cl. 1. P. -तपति, &c., to melt gold &c.<BR>repeatedly, (स् is changed to ष्, unless repeated action<BR>is intended, see निष्-टप्.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निस्व
नि-स्व, अस्, आ, अम्, without soul or spirit, spiritless,<BR>weak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीथ|नीथः
नीथ; after ‘subterfuge’ insert (अम्), n. a hymn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीराग
नी-राग, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. निस् + राग), without<BR>colour, colourless; without feeling or emotion, emo-<BR>tionless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नु|नुः
4. नु; add — (Ved. cl. 1. A. नवते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुत्ति|नुत्तिः
नुत्ति, इस्, f. (fr. rt. 1. नुद्), repelling, removal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नैहार
नैहार, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. नी-हार), produced by<BR>fog or mist or dew; misty, dewy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

न्येज्
न्य्-एज्, cl. 1. A. -एजते, &c., to tremble, quake<BR>with fear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पङ्कय
पङ्कय, Nom. P. पङ्कयति, -यितुम्, to make<BR>muddy, bemire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पणयितृ
पणयितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who buys, a purchaser.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर|परं|परः
पर; (at the end of comps.) sometimes to be<BR>translated by ‘another word, another equivalent ex-<BR>pression,’ e. g. जीव-शब्दो महत्-परः, the word<BR>जीव is an equivalent expression or another word for<BR>महत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पराङ्गना
पराङ्गना (˚र-अङ्˚), f. the wife of another, a<BR>wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परामर्शक
परा-मर्शक referring to something (before<BR>mentioned).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परासेध|परासेधः
परा-सेध, अस्, m. (fr. rt. 2. सिध् with पर;<BR>cf. 2. सेध), restraint, confinement, imprisonment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिखण्डन
परि-खण्डन, अम्, n. annihilating, humiliating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिज्वल्
परि-ज्वल्, cl. 1. P. -ज्वलति, &c., to shine very<BR>brightly, glow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमण्डलता
परिमण्डल-ता, whirling about or round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिमण्डलित
परिमण्डलित, अस्, आ, अम्, whirled round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिलोलित
परिलोलित, अस्, आ, अम्, shaken about, tossed about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवास|परिवासः
2. परि-वास, अस्, m. fragrance, perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशान्त्व्
परि-शान्त्व्, cl. 10. P. A. -शान्त्वयति, -ते, &c.,<BR>to console, comfort, soothe, conciliate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषिक्त
परि-षिक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, sprinkled about, diffused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहृ
परि-हृ; add — to take away, remove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीप्सु
परीप्सु; add — desirous of ascertaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ष|पर्षः
2. पर्ष, अस्, आ, अम्, = परुष, keen, piercing<BR>(said of the wind).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारमार्थ्य
पारमार्थ्य, अम्, n. (fr. परमार्थ), the<BR>complete truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृमात्रर्थ
पितृ-मात्रर्थ (˚तृ-अर्˚), अस्, m. one who seeks<BR>to provide a maintenance for his father and mother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृसद्मन्
पितृ-सद्मन्, अ, n. the abode of the Pitṛs, a<BR>cemetery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिशङ्गित
पिशङ्गित, अस्, आ, अम्, made brown or red, em-<BR>browned, reddened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पीडाभाज्
पीडा-भाज्; possessing marks of pressure or wavy<BR>indentations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पीयूषभानु|पीयूषभानुः
पीयूष-भानु, उस्, m. the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुनर्बाल्य
पुनर्-बाल्य, अम्, n. second childhood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूतन|पूतनः
पूतन, अस्, m. a kind of evil spirit; [cf. पूतना.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णमुख
पूर्ण-मुख; add — a kind of bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्विन्
पूर्विन्; add — (ई), m. a particular Jaina saint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथूकृ
पृथू-कृ, cl. 8. P. -करोति, &c., to expand, ex-<BR>tend, enlarge, spread out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैतामहसिद्धान्त
पैतामह-सिद्धान्त. See सिद्धान्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रहिन्
प्र-ग्रहिन्, ई, इणी, इ, taking the reins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघोष|प्रघोषः
प्र-घोष, अस्, m. noise, din, clamour; N. of<BR>a son of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रज्वाला
प्र-ज्वाला, f. a flame, blazing up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतप|प्रतपः
प्र-तप, अस्, m. heat, the heat of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतपत्र
प्रतप-त्र, अम्, n. ‘protecting from heat,’ a<BR>parasol, umbrella.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतर|प्रतरः
प्र-तर, अस्, आ, अम्, crossing over, going across<BR>by boat [cf. दुष्-प्˚, सु-प्˚]; epithet of the joints<BR>in the vertebral column.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतरण
प्र-तरण, अस्, ई, अम्, crossing over; bringing<BR>forward, carrying on, furthering, promoting, increas-<BR>ing; (अम्), n. the act of crossing over, passing over<BR>by boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतरीतृ
प्र-तरीतृ, ता, त्री, तृ, Ved. one who causes<BR>progress, bringing on, advancing, lengthening, a<BR>promoter, furtherer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतितर्ज्
प्रति-तर्ज्, cl. 1. P. -तर्जति, &c., to menace,<BR>threaten, scold at; to challenge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदन्तिन्
प्रति-दन्तिन् = प्रति-नाग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनदि
प्रति-नदि, ind. at every stream.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपादपम्
प्रति-पादपम्, ind. at every tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिश्रित
प्रति-श्रित, अम्, n. a protected place, shelter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्रोतम्
प्रति-स्रोतम्, ind. = प्रति-स्रोतस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यय|प्रत्ययः
प्रत्य्-अय, अस्, m.; add — a grammatical affix or<BR>any suffix to roots forming derivatives.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्ययलोप
प्रत्यय-लोप, अस्, m. elision of a grammatical<BR>affix or suffix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्ययस्वर
प्रत्यय-स्वर, अस्, m. ‘suffix accent,’ an accent<BR>on a suffix or affix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यावृत्ति|प्रत्यावृत्तिः
प्रत्य्-आवृत्ति, इस्, f. turning back, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याह्वय|प्रत्याह्वयः
प्रत्य्-आह्वय, अस्, m. ‘calling in reply,’ an echo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रभावन|प्रभावनः
प्र-भावन; add — (fr. the Caus.), causing to<BR>come forth, creating; causing to prosper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमा
1. प्र-मा; the प्र of the Nāgarī type has<BR>broken off in the printing of part of the impression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमाणकोटि|प्रमाणकोटिः
प्रमाण-कोटि, इस्, f. the point in an argument<BR>which is regarded as actual proof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमृड
प्र-मृड, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. मृड् with प्र),<BR>favourable, gracious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रमोष|प्रमोषः
प्र-मोष, अस्, m. carrying off, plundering,<BR>robbery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रवीविविक्षु
प्र-वीविविक्षु, उस्, उस्, उ, intending to pervade<BR>or embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रसक्त|प्रसक्तं
प्र-सक्त; add — occurred, happened, taken place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राञ्च्|प्रांच्
प्राञ्च्; the meaning is ‘worshipping’ when the<BR>nasal is retained throughout (e. g. inst. sing. du.<BR>प्राञ्चा, प्राङ्भ्याम्, Gram. 176. c).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फिट्सूत्र
फिट्-सूत्र, अम्, n., N. of certain Sūtras on accent<BR>by Śāntanava.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बास्तिक
बास्तिक, अम्, n. a quantity or herd of goats.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाह्वट
बाह्वट, अस्, m., N. of an author.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बुक्कमहीपति
बुक्क-महीपति; for ‘भूपात’ read भूपति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मधुवन|मधुवनं|मधुवनः
मधु-वन; after ‘cuckoo’ insert (अम्), n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मध्यन्दिन|मध्यंदिन|मध्यन्दिनः
मध्यन्-दिन; for ‘Puṣpa-pārṇa’ read पुष्-<BR>पार्ण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मन्त्रकुशुल
मन्त्र-कुशुल; read मन्त्र-कुशल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मयूरचित्रक
मयूर-चित्रक; for ‘Varāha-Brāhmaṇa’ read<BR>Varāha-mihira's Vṛhat-saṃhitā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महल्लिका
महल्लिका, f. a female attendant in the women's<BR>apartments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाक्षौहिणी
महाक्षौहिणी (˚हा-अक्˚), f. a thousand million<BR>billions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाधुन
महा-धुन, ten million billions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाहाहा
महा-हाहा, a hundred thousand billions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मास|मासं|मासः
मास; for ‘सूर्य-मासा’ read सूर्या-मासा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मिताक्षरासिद्धान्तसङ्ग्रह
मिताक्षरा-सिद्धान्त-सङ्ग्रह; transfer ‘(अस्,<BR>आ, अम्), speaking with caution &c.,’ to मितार्थ-<BR>भाषिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृज्
1. मृज्; add — also cl. 1. 3rd sing. मार्जति, 2nd<BR>sing. Impv. A. मार्जस्व.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावत्|यावन्त्
यावत्; add — इति यावत्, such is the meaning,<BR>just so far is the sense, (an expression used by com-<BR>mentators.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1184-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गद|रङ्गदः
रङ्ग-द; for ‘paint’ read substance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रागिन्
रागिन्; for ‘Ragiṇīs’ read Rāgiṇīs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचित|रुचितं
रुचित; add — (अम्), n. an exclamation used at a<BR>Śrāddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोरुदत्
रोरुदत्; the nom. case sing. masc. ought rather<BR>to be like that of the 3rd cl., in which case it must<BR>be रोरुदत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वटुक|वटुकः
वटुक; for ‘form’ read youthful manifestation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्स|वत्सं|वत्सः
वत्स; add — according to some, properly ‘a<BR>yearling;’ [cf. सं-वत्, सं-वत्सर.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सर|वत्सरः
वत्सर; according to Uṇādi-s. III. 71. fr. rt.<BR>6. वस्, to abide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ग|वर्गः|वर्ग्ग
वर्ग; after य-वर्ग, ‘the semivowels,’ add —<BR>श-वर्ग, the sibilants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षधर|वर्षधरः
वर्ष-धर or वर्ष-प, अस्, or वर्ष-<BR>पति, इस्, or वर्ष-भुज्, क्, m. the ruler of a<BR>Varṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षाहू
वर्षा-हू, ऊस्, f., Ved. ‘calling out or croaking<BR>in the rains,’ a frog (= वर्षा-भू).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षु
वर्षु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. sprouting in the rains.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ष्टृ
वर्ष्टृ, टा, ट्री, टृ, Ved. one who rains, pouring<BR>down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ष्मन्
वर्ष्मन्; add — (आ), m., Ved. height, the<BR>highest; the highest point, crown of the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल|वलं|वलः
वल; to अस्, m., Ved. add — (according to B. R.)<BR>a cave, hollow; a covering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलक
वलक, अस्, m. a covering, cover; (अम्), n. a<BR>procession, B. R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलभिका
वलभिका, f. a particular poisonous insect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलयिन्
वलयिन्; add — (ई, इनी, इ), having a bracelet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्गुलिका
वल्गुलिका; add — a box, chest; a kind of bat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्गुली
वल्गुली, f. a kind of bat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वशितृ
वशितृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who has a strong will,<BR>independent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वशिमन्
वशिमन्, आ, m. the supernatural power of bringing<BR>everything under one's own will.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वष्टि
वष्टि, इस्, इस्, इ (fr. rt. वश्), Ved. wishing for,<BR>loving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसतिद्रुम
वसति-द्रुम, अस्, m. a tree suitable for lodging<BR>under.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसन्ततिलक|वसंततिलक|वसन्ततिलकं|वसन्ततिलकः
वसन्त-तिलक; for ‘अस्, अम्, m. n.’ read अम्, आ,<BR>n. f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसवान
वसवान, अस्, m. (fr. वसु), Ved. an owner or<BR>holder of property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसाति
वसाति, अयस्, m. pl., N. of a people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वसातीय
वसातीय, belonging to the Vasātis; (अस्), m. a<BR>king of the Vasātis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तु
वस्तु, उस्, f., Ved. the becoming light or bright,<BR>dawning, dawn, early morning, (in these senses rather<BR>to be derived fr. rt. 3. वस्, to shine.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्नय
वस्नय, Nom. P. वस्नयति, &c., Ved. to<BR>expose for sale (B. R.); to desire wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्नयत्
वस्नयत्, अन्, अन्ती, अत्, Ved. desiring riches,<BR>(Sāy. = धनम् इच्छत्, Ṛg-veda VI. 47, 21.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वह्यशीवन्
वह्य-शीवन्, आ, अरी, अ, or वह्ये-शय, अस्, आ,<BR>अम्, Ved. lying in a palanquin; reclining on a couch;<BR>[cf. तल्प-शीवन्.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वा
3. वा, (according to B. R.) a Vedic form of rt.<BR>1. वन् (generally found in the desideratives विवासति,<BR>विवासते, &c., and usually with preposition आ prefixed;<BR>cf. आ-वा, p. 131), to wish to conciliate or win, (2. वात,<BR>p. 902, may be referred to this rt.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाचंयमत्व
वाचंयम-त्व, अम्, n. taciturnity, silence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाज|वाजं|वाजः
वाज; add — a race, struggle for a prize; a prize<BR>or reward of a race, reward of a contest; anything<BR>gained or won, reward, prize (in general); a race-<BR>horse (especially one driven in the chariots of military<BR>heroes and gods; in the preceding senses Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाणीवाद|वाणीवादः
वाणी-वाद, अस्, आ, अम्, uttering words, talking,<BR>talkative; (अस्), m. a kind of bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातथुडा
वात-थुडा; correct thus — वात-हुडा, f.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातरेचक|वातरेचकः
वात-रेचक, अस्, m. a gust of wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातस्कन्ध|वातस्कन्धः
वात-स्कन्ध, अस्, m. one of the regions of the<BR>wind (of which there are seven); N. of a Ṛṣi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाताय
वाताय, Nom. A. वातायते, -यितुम्, to resemble<BR>the wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातायमान
वातायमान, अस्, आ, अम्, resembling the wind,<BR>quick as the wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातिक|वातिकः
वातिक; add — uttering windy or empty words;<BR>(अस्), m. a flatterer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादितव्य
वादितव्य, अम्, n. instrumental music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाद्य|वाद्यं|वाद्यः
वाद्य; add — (अस्, आ, अम्), to be played on, to<BR>be sounded; (अम्), n. a musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाध्र्यश्व
वाध्र्यश्व, अस्, m. (fr. वध्र्य्-अश्व), a patro-<BR>nymic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वापिका
वापिका, f. an oblong tank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वामनक
वामनक, अस्, आ, अम्, = वामन, dwarfish, a<BR>dwarf; (अस्), m. epithet of a man born under a par-<BR>ticular constellation; N. of a mountain; (इका), f.,<BR>N. of one of the Mātṛs attending on Skanda; (अम्),<BR>n. the form of a dwarf; N. of a place of pilgrimage<BR>(called after Viṣṇu in his dwarf-incarnation).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वायुस्कन्ध|वायुस्कन्धः
वायु-स्कन्ध, अस्, m. one of the regions of the<BR>wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वार|वारं|वारः
1. वार; add — (आ), f. a harlot, prostitute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारणशाला
वारण-शाला, f. a place for keeping elephants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारीय
वारीय, Nom. A. वारीयते, &c., to be like water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारुणि|वारुणिः
वारुणि; add — (इस्), f. spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वार्योकस्|वार्य्योकस्
वार्य्-ओकस्, आस्, आस्, अस्, living in the water pro-<BR>bably (आस्), f. a leech [cf. जलौकस्].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वार्षल
वार्षल, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. वृषल), proper for a<BR>Śūdra; (अम्), n. the occupation of a Śūdra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वार्षिक्य
वार्षिक्य, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. वार्षिक), yearly,<BR>annual; (अम्), n. the rainy season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाल|वालः
वाल; add — (probably only a later form of<BR>2. वार).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासवि|वासविः
वासवि, इस्, m. (fr. वासव), ‘son of Indra,’ Ar-<BR>juna; the ape Bālin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासवेय|वासवेयः
वासवेय, अस्, m. (fr. वासवी), a metronymic of<BR>Vyāsa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासिष्ठसिद्धान्त
वासिष्ठ-सिद्धान्त; see सिद्धान्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तवा
वास्तवा, perhaps for वासुरा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तुविधान
वास्तु-विधान, अम्, n. house-building.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्न
वाह्न, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. वह्नि), relating to fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंश|विंशः
विंश; add — accompanied or increased by twenty;<BR>consisting of twenty parts; (अम्), n. twenty, a score.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकल्पक
वि-कल्पक; add — अस्, m. one who divides or<BR>distributes; one who prepares or arranges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकार|विकारः
2. वि-कार, अस्, m. the syllable वि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकुत्सा
वि-कुत्सा, f. violent abuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्रीड|विक्रीडः
वि-क्रीड, अस्, m. a play-ground; (आ), f. play,<BR>sport, jest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्लव|विक्लवः
वि-क्लव; add — (अम्), n. confusion, perplexity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्लवित
वि-क्लवित, अम्, n. a desponding speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक्षर
वि-क्षर, अस्, आ, अम्, flowing away, pouring out;<BR>(अस्), m. the flowing away; N. of Viṣṇu; of an<BR>Asura.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विगाम
वि-गाम; in regard to the Vedic passage correct<BR>thus — वि-गामन्, अ, n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विग्रह|विग्रहः
2. वि-ग्रह, अस्, आ, अम्, free from eclipse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचर
वि-चर, अस्, आ, अम्, moving away from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारक|विचारकः
वि-चारक; add — a spy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचालन
वि-चालन, अस्, ई, अम्, causing to go away, ruining,<BR>destroying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिकित्सित
वि-चिकित्सित, अस्, आ, अम्, doubted about, questioned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिन्तन
वि-चिन्तन, अम्, n. thinking about; discernment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिन्ता
वि-चिन्ता, f. thought, regard, care, anxiety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचूलिन्
वि-चूलिन्, ई, इनी, इ, having no top-knot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचृत्
वि-चृत्, त्, f., Ved. loosing, releasing, B. R., (Sāy.<BR>= विमुक्त.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विच्चिक
विच्चिक, अस्, m. a particular bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजय|विजयः
वि-जय; add — (अस्, आ, अम्), conquering, victorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजेष
वि-जेष, अस्, m., Ved. victory, conquest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विजेषकृत्
विजेष-कृत्, त्, त्, त्, Ved. causing victory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विज्य
वि-ज्य, अस्, आ, अम्, unstrung; [cf. स-ज्य.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विडम्ब्य
वि-डम्ब्य, अम्, n. an object of derision.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विण्मूत्र
विण्-मूत्र, अम्, n. (i. e. 3. विष् + मूत्र), feces<BR>and urine, (sometimes also ए, neut. du.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वित्रिष्णा
वि-त्रिष्णा, f. freedom from desire, absence of<BR>longing; excessive desire, violent longing for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदिशा
वि-दिशा; add — intermediate point of the compass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विदीपक|विदीपकः
वि-दीपक, अस्, m. a light, lamp, lantern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्याव्रत
विद्या-व्रत, अम्, n. divine knowledge and reli-<BR>gious vows; a particular religious observance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्याव्रतस्नात
विद्या-व्रत-स्नात, अस्, m. (a Brāhman) who has<BR>completed his course of Vedic study and his religious<BR>observances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्योत
वि-द्योत, अस्, आ, अम्, glittering, gleaming, spark-<BR>ling; (अस्), m. glitter, gleam; a proper N.; (आ), f.,<BR>N. of an Apsaras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्रुम|विद्रुमः
वि-द्रुम; add — in the first sense properly masc.,<BR>though given neut. in the native lexicons, B. R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्वल
विद्वल, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. clever, cunning, artful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विध्
3. विध् (fr. rt. व्यध्), piercing, penetrating (at<BR>the end of comps., cf. हृदय-व्˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विध्
4. विध्, cl. 1. A. विन्धते, &c., Ved. to be<BR>deprived of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विधुर|विधुरं|विधुरः
विधुर; according to B. R. fr. rt. 4. विध् above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विधुर|विधुरं|विधुरः
वि-धुर, अस्, आ, अम्, without a pole or axle-peg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विधूम
वि-धूम, अस्, आ, अम्, free from smoke or vapour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विधूम्र
वि-धूम्र, अस्, आ, अम्, quite grey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनिनीषु
वि-निनीषु, उस्, उस्, उ, desirous of ruling or<BR>governing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनिन्द
वि-निन्द, अस्, आ, अम्, censuring; (आ), f. abuse,<BR>slander.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनिबर्हण
वि-निबर्हण, अस्, ई, अम्, or वि-निबर्हिन्, ई, इणी,<BR>इ, throwing down, dashing to pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनिर्बाहु
वि-निर्बाहु, उस्, m. a particular kind of fighting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनिर्मुक्ति|विनिर्मुक्तिः
वि-निर्मुक्ति, इस्, f. freedom from, deliverance from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनिर्मोक्ष|विनिर्मोक्षः
वि-निर्मोक्ष, अस्, m. freedom from; exclusion<BR>from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनिवर्तन
वि-निवर्तन, अम्, n. the act of turning back,<BR>returning, return home; the coming to an end,<BR>cessation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विनेत्र
वि-नेत्र, अस्, m. an instructor, preceptor, teacher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विपरिभ्रंश
वि-परिभ्रंश, अस्, m. complete failure, mis-<BR>carriage; loss, ruin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विपर्यक्
वि-पर्यक्, ind. inversely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विपिन|विपिनं
विपिन; add — (अस्, आ, अम्), thick, dense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विपिनाय
विपिनाय, Nom. A. विपिनायते, &c., to resemble<BR>a wood, turn into a forest, be counted for a forest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विपीडम्
वि-पीडम्, ind. without injury, mercifully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विपुलय
विपुलय, Nom. P. विपुलयति, to extend, enlarge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विप्रकर्ष|विप्रकर्षः
वि-प्रकर्ष; add — dragging away, carrying<BR>off, removal; distant removal; a long interval (of<BR>time); difference, distinction, contrast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विप्रणाश
वि-प्रणाश, अस्, m. complete loss, total disap-<BR>pearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विप्रतीप
वि-प्रतीप, अस्, आ, अम्, quite contrary or opposite,<BR>obstinate, wilful, stubborn, hostile, unfriendly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विप्रत्यय|विप्रत्ययः
वि-प्रत्यय, अस्, m. want of confidence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विप्रमाथिन्
वि-प्रमाथिन्, ई, इनी, इ, crushing or trampling to<BR>pieces, destroying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विप्रमोक्ष
वि-प्रमोक्ष, अस्, m. the being free from, free-<BR>dom or release from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विप्रमोक्षण
वि-प्रमोक्षण, अम्, n. the act of liberating<BR>one's self from, liberation from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विप्रलाप|विप्रलापः
2. वि-प्रलाप, अस्, आ, अम्, free from talk or dispute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विप्रवाद|विप्रवादः
वि-प्रवाद, अस्, m. varying statement, disagree-<BR>ment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विप्रहाण
वि-प्रहाण, अम्, n. entire disappearance, total<BR>loss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विप्रेक्षण
वि-प्रेक्षण, अम्, n. the act of looking round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विप्लव|विप्लवः
2. वि-प्लव, अस्, आ, अम्, not having a vessel,<BR>without a ship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विबुभूषा
वि-बुभूषा, f. wish to manifest one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विबुभूषु
वि-बुभूषु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing to appear or<BR>manifest one's self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभञ्जनु
वि-भञ्जनु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. breaking to pieces,<BR>crushing, destroying, (Sāy. = विशेषेण भञ्जक,<BR>Ṛg-veda IV. 17, 13.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभानु
वि-भानु, उस्, उस्, उ, Ved. shining forth, shining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभाव|विभावः
2. वि-भाव, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. 2. वि-भा), Ved.<BR>shining forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभास
वि-भास, अस्, m., N. of one of the seven suns;<BR>of a deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभीषा
वि-भीषा, f. desire of frightening, wish to alarm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभूमन्
वि-भूमन्, आ, m. (perhaps) ‘appearing in many<BR>forms,’ epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विभूरसि|विभूरसिः
विभूर्-असि, इस्, m. ‘thou art mighty,’ a form of<BR>fire, B. R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमन्यु
वि-मन्यु; add — (उस्), m. excessive desire, eager-<BR>ness (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमलय
विमलय, Nom. P. विमलयति, &c., to make<BR>pure or clean, purify, cleanse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमान|विमानं|विमानः
1. वि-मान; add — (अस्, आ, अम्), without honour,<BR>dishonoured, disgraced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमृध्
वि-मृध्, त्, m., Ved. an enemy, (according to<BR>Sāy. वि-मृधः = सङ्ग्राम-कारी, Ṛg-veda X.<BR>152, 2.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमृश|विमृशः
वि-मृश, अस्, m. consideration, reflection, exa-<BR>mination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमोक
वि-मोक, अस्, m., Ved. unloosing, releasing, libe-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">Page1186-a+ 52</a>]<BR>ration, ending, completion; freedom from, release<BR>from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1185-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विमोह
वि-मोह, अस्, m. infatuation, bewilderment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरात्र|विरात्रः
वि-रात्र, the passing away of night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरावण
वि-रावण, अस्, ई, अम्, raising a cry or clamour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरुज्
2. वि-रुज्, क्, f. violent pain, severe sickness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरूक्ष
वि-रूक्ष, अस्, आ, अम्, rough, harsh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विरेचक|विरेचकः
वि-रेचक, अस्, इका, अम्, purgative, cathartic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विलापन
1. वि-लापन, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. the Caus. of वि-लप्),<BR>causing to bewail; (अम्), n. the act of causing to<BR>lament; lamentation; (अस्), m. a proper N.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विलापन
2. वि-लापन, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. the Caus. of वि-ली),<BR>causing to be dissolved, melting, &c.; causing to dis-<BR>appear, destroying; (अम्), n. dissolution, death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विवर्षिषु
विवर्षिषु, उस्, उस्, उ (fr. the Desid. of rt. वृष्),<BR>inclined or disposed to rain, about to rain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विवह|विवहः
वि-वह; add — N. of one of the seven winds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विवारयिषु
विवारयिषु, उस्, उस्, उ (fr. Desid. of Caus. of rt.<BR>वृ), wishing to keep back, desirous of restraining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विवित्सा
विवित्सा, f. (fr. the Desid. of rt. 1. विद्), the wish<BR>to know or understand, desire of knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विवित्सु
विवित्सु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing to know, desiring<BR>knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विशकल
वि-शकल, अस्, आ, अम्, broken to pieces, reduced<BR>to shreds and fragments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विशकलीकृ
विशकली-कृ, cl. 8. P. -करोति, &c., to reduce to<BR>fragments, break to pieces, shatter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विशङ्क्य
वि-शङ्क्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be suspected, suspicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विशन
विशन, अम्, n. the act of entering, entrance;<BR>penetration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विशोषिन्
वि-शोषिन्, ई, इणी, इ, drying up, becoming dry;<BR>drying, making dry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्रमण|विश्रमणः
वि-श्रमण, अम्, n. the act of reposing or taking<BR>rest after fatigue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषयवासिन्
विषय-वासिन्; add — one who dwells in any<BR>region or country, an inhabitant of a province.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषूचीन
विषूचीन, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. विष्व्-अञ्च्), going on<BR>all sides, all-pervading, extending everywhere, going<BR>asunder, (opposed to समीचीन, q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंसर्पिन्
वि-संसर्पिन्, ई, इणी, इ, moving about, becoming<BR>spread about or diffused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसञ्चारिन्|विसंचारिन्
वि-सञ्चारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, wandering about in all<BR>directions, straying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसदृश्
वि-सदृश्, क्, क्, क्, or वि-सदृश, अस्, ई, अम्,<BR>unlike, dissimilar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्गिन्
वि-सर्गिन्, ई, इणी, इ, creating, producing; distri-<BR>buting, bestowing, giving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्मन्
वि-सर्मन्, आ, आ, अ (fr. वि-सृ), Ved. flowing<BR>away, transitory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फोट|विस्फोटः
वि-स्फोट; add — crashing, crash.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फोटन
वि-स्फोटन, अम्, n. a loud noise or crash.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फोटिका
वि-स्फोटिका, f. a pustule, boil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मारक
वि-स्मारक, अस्, इका, अम्, causing to forget.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मारण
वि-स्मारण, अस्, ई, अम्, causing to forget.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रव|विस्रवः
वि-स्रव, अस्, m. a stream, flood, flow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहर्तृ|विहर्त्तृ
वि-हर्तृ; add — one who amuses himself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहर्ष|विहर्षः
2. वि-हर्ष, अस्, आ, अम्, joyless, mournful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहव्य
वि-हव्य; add — to be invoked or invited, (in this<BR>sense fr. हु = rt. ह्वे.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहिंसता
विहिंस-ता, f. injury, hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहिंसन
वि-हिंसन, अम्, n. the act of injuring, injury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहिंसा
वि-हिंसा, f. injury, hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहिंस्र
वि-हिंस्र, अस्, आ, अम्, injurious, noxious, hurtful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीरिण|वीरिणं
वीरिण, अस्, अम्, m. n. the grass Andropogon<BR>Muricatus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीळय
वीऌअय; correct — also P. A. वीऌअयति, -ते, to<BR>make firm or strong, be strong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृत्तवत्|वृत्तवन्त्
वृत्त-वत्; add — round; having suitable occu-<BR>pation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्ध|वृद्धं|वृद्धः
वृद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, cut off, (see 1. वृद्धि.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृधीक
वृधीक, अस्, m., Ved. an increaser, prosperer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेणविन्
वेणविन्, ई, इनी, इ (fr. वेणु), having a flute or<BR>pipe (said of Śiva).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेणीसंहार|वेणीसंहारः
वेणी-संहार; add — ‘hair-binding,’ (the name<BR>of the Drama, though connected by some with the<BR>seizing and unloosing of Draupadī's hair by Duḥśā-<BR>sana, rather refers to its being bound together again<BR>after the punishment of Duḥśāsana.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेद|वेदः
वेद; add — an expression for the number four.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदना
वेदना, f. pain, &c., (this may also be अम्, n.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेदस्
वेदस्; under अस्, n. add — knowledge; (वेदास्,<BR>nom. m. although given by some authorities is pro-<BR>bably only nom. pl. of वेद.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेप|वेपः
वेप, अस्, ई, अम्, swinging, moving, oscillating<BR>(Ved.); (अस्), m. trembling, quivering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदूर्य|वैदूर्य्य|वैदूर्य्यं
वैदूर्य = वैदूर्य, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतथ्य|वैतथ्यं
वैतथ्य, अम्, n. (fr. वि-तथ), falsehood, un-<BR>truth, untruthfulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतस्तिक
वैतस्तिक, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. वि-तस्ति), measuring a<BR>span.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैत्तपाल्य
वैत्तपाल्य (fr. वित्त-पाल), relating to Vitta-<BR>pāla or Kuvera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्रुम
वैद्रुम, अस्, ई, अम् (fr. वि-द्रुम), made of<BR>coral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैनत्य
वैनत्य, अम्, n. (fr. वि-नत), submissiveness,<BR>modesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैनायक
वैनायक, अस्, ई, अम्, belonging to Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैयासिकीय
वैयासिकीय, composed by Vyāsa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैसादृश्य
वैसादृश्य, अम्, n. (fr. वि-सदृश), dissimilarity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकृत
व्य्-आकृत, अस्, आ, अम्, developed, unfolded, ex-<BR>panded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यानशि
व्य्-आनशि; add — according to B. R. fr. rt. 1. नश्<BR>with आ and वि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यालम्ब|व्यालंब|व्यालंबः|व्यालम्बः
