व्यालम्बिन्
व्य्-आलम्बिन्, ई, इनी, इ, hanging down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावृत्सु
व्य्-आवृत्सु, उस्, उस्, उ, wishing to separate one's<BR>self from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याशा
व्य्-आशा, f. an intermediate quarter of the compass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युद
व्य्-उद or व्य्-उदक, अस्, आ, अम्, devoid of water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युद्ग्रन्थन
व्य्-उद्ग्रन्थन, अम्, n. the act of winding or<BR>intertwining in various ways.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युन्मिश्र
व्य्-उन्मिश्र, अस्, आ, अम्, intermixed, commingled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युपकार
व्य्-उपकार, अस्, m. making good, fulfilling, per-<BR>formance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यूक
व्यूक, आस्, m. pl., N. of a people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यैलब
व्य्-ऐलब, Ved. making various sounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योदन
व्य्-ओदन, Ved. having various kinds of grain or<BR>food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्र
व्र; in Ṛg-veda I. 124, 8. व्राः is referred by<BR>B. R. to a form व्र fr. rt. वृ, meaning ‘a collec-<BR>tion, multitude;’ see व्रा, p. 984, col. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्रजभाषा
व्रज-भाषा, f. the Braj dialect (spoken around<BR>Agra and Mathurā).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्रण्य
व्रण्य, अस्, आ, अम्, good or suitable for wounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्रतस्नात
व्रत-स्नात = व्रत-स्नातक, see स्नातक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्रतस्नान
व्रत-स्नान, अम्, n. the due performance of<BR>vowed observances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्रतादेश|व्रतादेशः
व्रतादेश; add — enjoining a religious observance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्रश्च्
व्रश्च्, व्रट्, ट्, ट्, cutting, cutting off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्रस्क
व्रस्क, अस्, आ, अम् (at the end of comps.), cutting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्राधत्
व्राधत्; according to B. R. fr. a rt. व्राध्, to<BR>excite, incite, provoke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्लग्
व्लग् or व्लङ्ग्, a Vedic rt., according to Sāy.<BR>meaning ‘to go,’ &c.; used with prep. अभि, (in<BR>Ṛg-veda I. 133, 1, 2. अभि-व्लग्य = अभितो गत्वा<BR>or अभितः प्राप्य, having approached or come<BR>near, having laid hold of; according to B. R. per-<BR>haps ‘having strangled.’)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शितसूक
शित-सूक; read शित-शूक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुद्धमुख
शुद्ध-मुख, अस्, m. a well-trained horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौनःशेप
शौनःशेप, अस्, ई, अम्, relating to Śunaḥ-śepa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वेता
श्वेता; add — alum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थानक
संस्थानक, अस्, m., N. of the Śakāra in the<BR>Mṛcchakaṭi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्कर|संकर|संकरः|सङ्करः
सङ्कर; add — contamination, pollution; any<BR>contaminated object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सङ्ग्रह|संग्रह|संग्रहः|सङ्ग्रहः
सङ्ग्रह, N. of a grammatical work by Vyāḍi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समनग
समनग; = विद्युत्, lightning, (according to<BR>Sāy. on Ṛg-veda I. 124, 8.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सर्वानुदात्त
सर्वानुदात्त (˚व-अन्˚), अस्, आ, अम्, a word<BR>which has neither Udātta nor Svarita accent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहस्रबाहु|सहस्रबाहुः
सहस्र-बाहु; add — N. of Arjuna Kārtavīrya,<BR>(Raghu-v. VI. 38.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुष्वाप
सु-ष्वाप = सु-षुप्ति, p. 1125.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोमाश्रय|सोमाश्रयः
सोमाश्रय (˚म-आश्˚), अस्, m., N. of Rudra or<BR>Śiva (as bearing or supporting the moon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MW72&page=1186-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=mw72" target="_blank">Correction</a>

